{"media_id": 3386525093099233863, "shortcode": "C7_WqEtIGJH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C7_WqEtIGJH/", "taken_at": "2024-06-09T09:32:56", "caption": "the original xx\n\nReminder - you can wear whatever you want, especially on your wedding day!✨\n____\n#weddingdress #partywedding #bachelorette #weddingpics", "owner_username": "aisleglam", "owner_id": "54545204238", "likes": 433304, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0002_C7_WqEtIGJH\\C7_WqEtIGJH_20240609_093256.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17926190009955683, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-02T14:00:49", "owner": "kiryu_chan3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970493586651600, "text": "Main character syndrome fo sho!! Poor husband", "created_at": "2024-10-01T11:16:00", "owner": "bu.rns184", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927310944952840, "text": "the irony of being in the streets saying that", "created_at": "2024-10-01T05:35:11", "owner": "bog__n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18311704465090965, "text": "Just marry naked then", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:12:52", "owner": "goodgoof7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071122474596037, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-27T01:49:14", "owner": "misainthespace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065970787716766, "text": "That’s just lingerie…", "created_at": "2024-09-26T02:30:50", "owner": "pilldiiet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140222296350222, "text": "How lucky shes on the right place already", "created_at": "2024-09-24T11:10:02", "owner": "drazenlord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046423249811358, "text": "Top🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-23T20:24:45", "owner": "silvia_aldrovandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010843520376297, "text": "It’s the opposite", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:42:21", "owner": "jaliscoguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199933750292276, "text": "Looks sick!", "created_at": "2024-09-21T17:09:54", "owner": "neilsharks_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914527194897953, "text": "What is all this", "created_at": "2024-09-18T13:43:06", "owner": "reality.check111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18458621035022326, "text": "Yet no husband in sight😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T12:37:52", "owner": "procrastronaut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032922053230391, "text": "Couldn't agree more", "created_at": "2024-09-18T09:16:51", "owner": "f_dinansyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954322161714587, "text": "“Look at me look at me look at me !”", "created_at": "2024-09-18T05:24:23", "owner": "hehahahaslqoqwo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197993005292188, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-18T00:55:25", "owner": "aylarosie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041186843067156, "text": "🚩🚩🚩", "created_at": "2024-09-16T12:22:32", "owner": "nadhiiir_prv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977652981756400, "text": "What would they do without social media", "created_at": "2024-09-15T22:38:56", "owner": "imalreadyknowin2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042674981306073, "text": "Please hide my comment, but why do you want to he like that, I'm genuinely curious I wouldn't be comfortable if my girl did it, I think if you answer this it might change the way I think.", "created_at": "2024-09-14T04:26:28", "owner": "jacksonvictor286", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010257803342267, "text": "Where’s the husband in the wedding video lol she’s looking for clout with her wedding she will look for clout in her divorce", "created_at": "2024-09-12T17:31:13", "owner": "caucasboma", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041477285067644, "text": "That driver claps for her...... that's wholesome 😭🩷", "created_at": "2024-09-10T14:01:54", "owner": "_div_1912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875412175090419, "text": "The two aren't directly correlated but that's not a wedding dress", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:52:27", "owner": "thrifted.ambition", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004775504463668, "text": "😭✨pwettttyyyyy", "created_at": "2024-09-10T06:08:38", "owner": "poiyoiyoiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026286260460512, "text": "The guy who clapped from the car😂😭❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-10T06:08:09", "owner": "poiyoiyoiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885775135036956, "text": "Prenup", "created_at": "2024-09-09T18:06:39", "owner": "philip_panousis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035264621160395, "text": "Lmfaoo i found that dress on the streets", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:41:24", "owner": "dexter.monreal.gr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045475018797583, "text": "Lmaoo who said that. Y'all just too priveleged", "created_at": "2024-09-09T03:59:32", "owner": "tzebe_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18019805162453071, "text": "Attention seeker, she belongs to the streets", "created_at": "2024-09-09T00:06:38", "owner": "lopez_delatorre", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18265472557221718, "text": "☕️", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:42:46", "owner": "ccblax15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033075617186875, "text": "Its actually the opposite🤓", "created_at": "2024-09-08T18:56:25", "owner": "toxic._.turner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075175066557359, "text": "what an amazing woman ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-08T10:20:55", "owner": "yuxxelis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017160938602964, "text": "شوهرت کو پس", "created_at": "2024-09-08T04:34:24", "owner": "elaqery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977153943751090, "text": "Is that the Eiffel Tower just nonchalantly in the background??", "created_at": "2024-09-08T01:12:56", "owner": "katherine._.taveras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150537229326267, "text": "Thats the dress after the wedding", "created_at": "2024-09-07T16:11:11", "owner": "nally_boomin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066166873611317, "text": "I mean, you look beautiful babe. I don’t know about the caption though.", "created_at": "2024-09-07T03:21:51", "owner": "nastylssjic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029989517335832, "text": "The dress is really beautiful 😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-04T13:41:25", "owner": "palak6125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982092648709045, "text": "Meanwhile Indian brides 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T13:40:59", "owner": "palak6125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058302406680968, "text": "She already not with her husband on the street 😭💀", "created_at": "2024-09-04T12:34:12", "owner": "timhung17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038671499042660, "text": "Not true", "created_at": "2024-09-04T11:56:24", "owner": "bradleyholbrooks06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876883381141082, "text": "Thats not wedding dress", "created_at": "2024-09-04T11:45:18", "owner": "laurasia.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878819737067325, "text": "she's already on the streets.", "created_at": "2024-09-04T11:34:06", "owner": "sen.zi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003498518471847, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2024-09-04T11:14:04", "owner": "giangio642", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336805948125633, "text": "That's a wedding dress???", "created_at": "2024-09-04T10:23:40", "owner": "shut.up.ya.stonks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084520939453607, "text": "Notice how shes stumbling onto the streets?", "created_at": "2024-09-04T10:05:34", "owner": "sataio05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18243835936283860, "text": "That's not a dress 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T08:51:31", "owner": "channauxaxel", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18018231728247140, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-04T08:32:36", "owner": "gadir.abdullah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025926332519912, "text": "Longer then the night ?", "created_at": "2024-09-04T08:18:13", "owner": "anjul_557", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036316265117625, "text": "You mean number of marriages", "created_at": "2024-09-04T07:28:12", "owner": "deagle_117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987503598557252, "text": "Nude means forever 🤔", "created_at": "2024-09-04T07:27:49", "owner": "fishcaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054866851795790, "text": "It's the other way around", "created_at": "2024-09-04T06:39:39", "owner": "ghost_on_the_block", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987933705554948, "text": "People hating but maybe it was a lot cheaper to make", "created_at": "2024-09-04T05:57:46", "owner": "emirsaidov15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035881127120476, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T05:48:57", "owner": "beavertails_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138330325351876, "text": "Said nobody ever", "created_at": "2024-09-04T04:48:44", "owner": "yyuketsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882243490051104, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2024-09-04T04:37:38", "owner": "nxb405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104662861424964, "text": "The higher the heels the higher the wedding budget 😂☺️😘", "created_at": "2024-09-04T04:26:11", "owner": "thesemdor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892804120071935, "text": "Said no one ever", "created_at": "2024-09-04T03:59:19", "owner": "roman_zadorozhnyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325333093148884, "text": "Google Indian wedding dress and divorce rate , this hypothesis will be rejected", "created_at": "2024-09-04T03:18:00", "owner": "nitishkumarnitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074649034487693, "text": "No", "created_at": "2024-09-04T03:14:38", "owner": "ionic._.icey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038088245113105, "text": "Okay I have to say it she says this while standing on the streets 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T02:59:04", "owner": "dravemsimons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977190918754116, "text": "🚩", "created_at": "2024-09-04T02:55:22", "owner": "matthewbrov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044607400801069, "text": "U mean “the shorter the dress the shorter the marriage”. Maybe “the shorter the dress, the longer the cheat list”", "created_at": "2024-09-04T02:18:48", "owner": "marquel_k671", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056208934693106, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2024-09-04T01:18:44", "owner": "gemznyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900283890962232, "text": "Literal lingerie and you call it a damn wedding dress", "created_at": "2024-09-04T01:18:23", "owner": "oto_otavio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052989598827488, "text": "✨✨✨✨✨ looks amazing. So all the haters can just keep doing what they do best", "created_at": "2024-09-04T01:17:00", "owner": "j_7wander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023455802374382, "text": "Ahhh don't think soo.", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:59:51", "owner": "nitinyadavv70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060525037660770, "text": "The skimpier the dress the more for the streets", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:44:20", "owner": "lilrafq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060890992639643, "text": "All that money down the drain when you could've went and explored the world", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:42:01", "owner": "an.najeem1256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878897446067124, "text": "no?", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:37:53", "owner": "nikstonss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070288069574878, "text": "No, you are gone faster", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:23:40", "owner": "eryk_b2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848169436287222, "text": "\"The bluer the car, the tastier the pancakes.\" See? We can all string meaningless words together.", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:10:05", "owner": "steeltoefeelstho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047710003751472, "text": "take it off now", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:07:17", "owner": "marcel.labutay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922911819958553, "text": "The comment section didn't understand the vibe, you look brilliant!", "created_at": "2024-09-03T23:33:09", "owner": "katietheduck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037837073108836, "text": "😍 🖼️", "created_at": "2024-09-03T23:20:16", "owner": "mattkampe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070527400562775, "text": "I think everyone is just jealous that they cant look as good as she does in that dress. 10/10", "created_at": "2024-09-03T23:01:09", "owner": "spinechiller.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045398854788260, "text": "Good luck my man. Good luck.", "created_at": "2024-09-03T22:38:57", "owner": "gopal_c137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045601585770683, "text": "Dare I say the opposite is most likely true", "created_at": "2024-09-03T22:22:14", "owner": "dutchduke201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030261743209642, "text": "Said no one ever 🤣 the shorter the dress the shorter the marriage. “Let’s put it all on display for the world” great foundation for a marriage 🙄", "created_at": "2024-09-03T21:58:23", "owner": "the_cardboard_broadcast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866761270193171, "text": "I couldn’t tell you were a bride", "created_at": "2024-09-03T21:43:56", "owner": "celiawork2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012229112552960, "text": "Said who?", "created_at": "2024-09-03T21:21:21", "owner": "seandemark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106237909424217, "text": "Hell nah, shorter the dress shorter the marriage, no stripper dress' bro 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-03T21:13:47", "owner": "yo.dudechase", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061654549724132, "text": "I hope he got a prenup.", "created_at": "2024-09-03T20:14:25", "owner": "brandonl273", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031366037247057, "text": "Dis the girl dat end up with 47 last names", "created_at": "2024-09-03T20:01:20", "owner": "linam_2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008434292378446, "text": "Literally dancing on the street 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-03T19:17:23", "owner": "alex_harris7214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871422364169223, "text": "The shorter the dress, at a certain point, there is no marriage", "created_at": "2024-09-03T18:34:39", "owner": "amer_kachkach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098944858443115, "text": "yk its bad when one of the suggested emojies that come up are a red flag💀💀", "created_at": "2024-09-03T17:44:22", "owner": "joshm_tthews", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18055336366784588, "text": "Class and modesty are two of the most attractive qualities a wife can have. Chose wisely..", "created_at": "2024-09-03T15:40:09", "owner": "lizalavoltamusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017752961259120, "text": "💀This generation", "created_at": "2024-09-03T15:20:10", "owner": "winchell_trades", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017242607272834, "text": "Explains why your husband isn't in the wedding photos...", "created_at": "2024-09-03T12:59:00", "owner": "zanie_iaciu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042862474829569, "text": "Did you not notice the men in the background enjoying the show? Idk, but if it was me, I wouldn't appreciate that.", "created_at": "2024-09-03T12:01:46", "owner": "dgroeneveld9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020520314421720, "text": "Needed attention by the masses wouldn't be a good start. We know what's going to happen", "created_at": "2024-09-03T11:51:12", "owner": "drurylanemuffinman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005422907436662, "text": "Cap", "created_at": "2024-09-03T11:17:29", "owner": "ghimiresanjog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859847674232309, "text": "Feeling lucky coz I'll never be husband to a women like you😭✨", "created_at": "2024-09-03T08:10:55", "owner": "im.alikhan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939209346896257, "text": "Only fans marriage", "created_at": "2024-09-03T08:08:26", "owner": "panda_soumyadip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905746530988983, "text": "Not wearing a dress for forever marriage😂", "created_at": "2024-09-03T07:16:38", "owner": "phoebemontealto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456647536043600, "text": "photos actually go hard", "created_at": "2024-09-03T06:45:26", "owner": "nkowashere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859149763235720, "text": "The shorter the dress 🌚 the happy the neighbor 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-03T06:44:42", "owner": "ruzyu_fay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991354203526593, "text": "🚩🚩🚩🚩", "created_at": "2024-09-03T06:33:11", "owner": "ha.a.ze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068547943580201, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-03T06:23:48", "owner": "_.manav22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038765249498336, "text": "Why did I think she ran away from the wedding got drunk and wore the nightgown outside?", "created_at": "2024-09-03T06:06:22", "owner": "sthomasacaac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041256109988725, "text": "Western women really do got it backwards.", "created_at": "2024-09-03T05:26:09", "owner": "shadowfax2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009046430357901, "text": "Poor husband lmao 🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-03T03:37:50", "owner": "itallo.moulin", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["weddingdress", "partywedding", "bachelorette", "weddingpics"]},
{"media_id": 3447545961747189620, "shortcode": "C_YJMlMxg90", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_YJMlMxg90/", "taken_at": "2024-09-01T14:05:35", "caption": "Want to earn a million in 2024?\nHere are the top 5 promising remote business ideas:\n\n1. Freelancing and Consulting:\n- Content writing\n- Copywriting\n- Graphic design\n- Branding services\n\n2. E-commerce and Dropshipping:\n- Start an online store\n- Sell products without holding inventory\n\n3. Online Coaching and Courses:\n- Share your expertise\n- Create and sell courses\n\n4. Digital Marketing and Social Media Management:\n- SEO\n- Content marketing\n- Paid advertising\n- Social media management\n\n5. Virtual Assistance and Remote Administrative Services:\n- Support businesses remotely\n- Manage emails, appointments, customer inquiries, and bookkeeping", "owner_username": "edgeablereels", "owner_id": "67067184780", "likes": 33819, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0003_C_YJMlMxg90\\C_YJMlMxg90_20240901_140535.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17885156991039158, "text": "Smash that follow button if you haven’t already 😼", "created_at": "2024-09-04T01:39:38", "owner": "edgeablereels", "likes": 67}, {"id": 17959832939814537, "text": "No views?😢😂", "created_at": "2024-09-28T14:40:56", "owner": "xojiberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320296477153013, "text": "I have the 15💀", "created_at": "2024-09-20T07:00:06", "owner": "m4riaa.27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855355489222468, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2024-09-19T05:02:36", "owner": "inoyanae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081365704463030, "text": "Naaa this has to stop 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-14T22:45:39", "owner": "urboii_klein", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17881057611104325, "text": "The Apple is rotting.", "created_at": "2024-09-12T22:16:07", "owner": "ayoub_niama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958613007816346, "text": "😂😂😂samsung is the best 👌", "created_at": "2024-09-11T13:58:11", "owner": "saadounaness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275781565170412, "text": "😂😭", "created_at": "2024-09-11T08:24:56", "owner": "ghandour.hesham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082301935509417, "text": "I'm starting to believe that most iPhone users are NPCs 🤦", "created_at": "2024-09-10T06:03:57", "owner": "traumadollx_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115092805393535, "text": "New design? Action button already on my old Nokia phone", "created_at": "2024-09-10T02:03:18", "owner": "alep_ua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096006283460553, "text": "16 is teased and yeah they got an all new design again 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-09T22:38:33", "owner": "_sayankaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915917655978712, "text": "All new? New floor well over ten years ago", "created_at": "2024-09-09T18:24:01", "owner": "ironsights_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036135344484089, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:05:27", "owner": "xx9xawatar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18454573720054738, "text": "Iphone users will literally buy anything if it has an apple logo stuck on it", "created_at": "2024-09-08T10:17:07", "owner": "a.c.1254", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096992110407529, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T09:13:35", "owner": "migstaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061140778641995, "text": "The color is not the same ☝️🤓", "created_at": "2024-09-07T18:29:46", "owner": "felix18341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914180154993382, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-06T15:06:07", "owner": "marcuszr5004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052124155853570, "text": "Okay. Now say, did the samsung design change? No.", "created_at": "2024-09-06T12:50:42", "owner": "sarapuumrc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036996155319514, "text": "didn't they really say?", "created_at": "2024-09-06T10:28:26", "owner": "erik_9.8007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039578099119410, "text": "Let's face it iPhones have not changed since the X", "created_at": "2024-09-06T10:24:59", "owner": "privetimvictor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069158038600500, "text": "@faheemabb347 @shahzaib_ali_noonari", "created_at": "2024-09-06T03:55:44", "owner": "musu.bhai771", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889089403085683, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-05T17:04:54", "owner": "matijapodgrajsek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862007365220841, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-05T16:45:50", "owner": "itz__dabeer", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17969894618757833, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-05T16:21:24", "owner": "_.a.fsal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042290953995337, "text": "Before: 📱\nAfter: 📱", "created_at": "2024-09-05T15:18:02", "owner": "kedplocal123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006136988634948, "text": "Idk this beef between android and Iphone like have any phone you want If you are happy with ur phone this is so childish", "created_at": "2024-09-05T15:16:26", "owner": "filip_646ano45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040961803999910, "text": "She meant titanium based design🗿", "created_at": "2024-09-05T14:35:10", "owner": "ajp._.01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864067417213905, "text": "I was buying a iPhone 15 when it came but instead at same price I bought a gaming pc I'm loving it", "created_at": "2024-09-05T13:00:05", "owner": "thunderbird_5786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070419709603210, "text": "\"All new design\"🤓", "created_at": "2024-09-05T11:50:11", "owner": "elia.romano5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938635356862145, "text": "I have  13 and it looks identical 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-05T10:35:06", "owner": "jemand_offline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294716698204413, "text": "i just flipped my iphone 13 couldn’t tell the difference", "created_at": "2024-09-05T09:20:14", "owner": "rick.mb0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112235914370378, "text": "biggest joke😭", "created_at": "2024-09-04T23:55:56", "owner": "chamath_dinu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056767486738719, "text": "Old new design🗣️🔥‼️", "created_at": "2024-09-04T22:02:16", "owner": "ni.eru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036911203933750, "text": "60hz", "created_at": "2024-09-04T20:59:29", "owner": "kianfloppa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101760922433320, "text": "Google can just play this clip for their new Google phone.", "created_at": "2024-09-04T19:51:26", "owner": "senalweerasekara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047012467939961, "text": "Honestly that was funny", "created_at": "2024-09-04T19:11:56", "owner": "esc.eric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034105304472780, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T17:00:41", "owner": "_unus01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070387819515373, "text": "Who's is the script writer 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T14:15:35", "owner": "ig_strom_aravind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299925070162864, "text": "🍼", "created_at": "2024-09-04T13:41:08", "owner": "rui_ribeiro01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136446892349202, "text": "Bro think changin color is new design💀", "created_at": "2024-09-04T13:02:40", "owner": "car_spotter_italy", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17974486349759375, "text": "Samsung does the same", "created_at": "2024-09-04T12:35:21", "owner": "thatsmithguy_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052559947677262, "text": "*Apple and samsung", "created_at": "2024-09-04T11:24:59", "owner": "iam_chillman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018844754395944, "text": "avg iphone users: 😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-09-04T09:27:42", "owner": "nape_r1ggerson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047366128746556, "text": "@apple", "created_at": "2024-09-04T08:00:02", "owner": "chinmae.ojha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090243973467231, "text": "Before vs before", "created_at": "2024-09-04T07:37:59", "owner": "top4ik_ace", "likes": 312}, {"id": 18107949112411299, "text": "What new?", "created_at": "2024-09-04T07:26:28", "owner": "takadadana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041920136004778, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T07:08:04", "owner": "dr.m0w0e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075485689528353, "text": "Why the heck are there in A warehouse.", "created_at": "2024-09-04T06:26:23", "owner": "whoisphilythepapri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986101974708183, "text": "I swear if I hear the same apple sheep say your hating on apple because u can't afford it when I have a 1000+ Samsung and say there's something new💀💀", "created_at": "2024-09-04T06:08:36", "owner": "su.compa.jorge", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020734709587613, "text": "No 💩", "created_at": "2024-09-04T05:26:20", "owner": "debjit_moon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948537315738864, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T05:01:26", "owner": "gerson_mario24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020068436437815, "text": "“All design”I guess I have the iPhone 15 hell my 13 looks like the 15💀", "created_at": "2024-09-04T04:51:47", "owner": "sheyanna_ault", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022138118384904, "text": "Iphone 14* ( 15 got matte finish + Dynamic Island) . 👍", "created_at": "2024-09-04T03:33:42", "owner": "harman_s0ii", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18253112527271938, "text": "New one comes out 2-3 weeks it’s September", "created_at": "2024-09-04T03:09:56", "owner": "bananaman500000", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17924912021843362, "text": "Imagine buying Apple products. 🤡", "created_at": "2024-09-04T01:17:26", "owner": "marcel.ghs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064417309614391, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-04T00:19:57", "owner": "muhammadfozil_6660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109919872409543, "text": "Bmw", "created_at": "2024-09-03T22:50:52", "owner": "kcfor_tune", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036435148916915, "text": "@ted.washere 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-03T20:30:45", "owner": "thatuglybuddy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853873636220855, "text": "you can tell the difference clearly in person though", "created_at": "2024-09-03T19:32:34", "owner": "thatboytanay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18259347124247852, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2024-09-03T16:24:09", "owner": "wills.wrld999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054321127806963, "text": "And someone would still buy it 😭😭", "created_at": "2024-09-03T16:08:59", "owner": "glades_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931647030808732, "text": "@mohmd._lasin", "created_at": "2024-09-03T15:52:23", "owner": "sarjeedvengoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019775327524154, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-03T14:59:12", "owner": "thefirstj9", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18098097304453480, "text": "Random gc?(like)", "created_at": "2024-09-03T13:58:17", "owner": "__medusa__19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935705883912883, "text": "Not even new design , ALL new design", "created_at": "2024-09-03T13:14:12", "owner": "trip1n.mhyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069231385602950, "text": "You won’t believe Porsche was doing this the whole time and nobody is mad about it", "created_at": "2024-09-03T12:42:20", "owner": "elmehdi_fit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043948180945580, "text": "tremor*", "created_at": "2024-09-03T11:53:15", "owner": "_joelaran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138558337346387, "text": "“You can now customize where you can put your app”☠️☠️☠️☠️", "created_at": "2024-09-03T10:53:35", "owner": "lian.auff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063895060620349, "text": "you are", "created_at": "2024-09-03T10:18:28", "owner": "axsxpxtxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011754581555064, "text": "I mean they deserve some credit they finally did something with they’re phones😭", "created_at": "2024-09-03T07:54:31", "owner": "thatcarguydaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161512309310890, "text": "If u don't have an iphone, u are not a real........?", "created_at": "2024-09-03T04:02:49", "owner": "sovonkumarkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006426272418184, "text": "iPhone 15 has the segments best camera", "created_at": "2024-09-03T03:15:26", "owner": "sophisticated.__soul.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430080457068470, "text": "Who falls for this??", "created_at": "2024-09-03T02:44:31", "owner": "nik_crxr", "likes": 382}, {"id": 18051401716705831, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-03T02:25:39", "owner": "amit_redx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18222076057304541, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-03T02:21:18", "owner": "i._hate.sand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964579368663273, "text": "it’s not just about looks there are differences, I have a 13, my mom and brother both have 14 and my dad has 15, my little sister has 12, we’ve compared all our phones there are differences, maybe not completely new look, but there are differences especially the device from the inside", "created_at": "2024-09-03T01:31:48", "owner": "ljubavljy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984777312706519, "text": "@aliberti386", "created_at": "2024-09-03T01:14:53", "owner": "nichmor123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059180917728765, "text": "what do you guys expect from a phone nowadays?? You want an oval shaped phone", "created_at": "2024-09-03T01:10:59", "owner": "ricardoo.lmaoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023518403125476, "text": "What are they supposed to call it though? It got usb c, Dynamic Island, a frosted glass back and also edges were rounded off. So of course, it is new.", "created_at": "2024-09-03T01:10:10", "owner": "ralsei.fluffy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896511013060054, "text": "How else would you design a rectangle of 50% screen, and cameras?", "created_at": "2024-09-03T00:39:31", "owner": "dingo233322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984146277720388, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-03T00:22:04", "owner": "asifis4984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938104353783224, "text": "“All new design” 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-02T22:39:10", "owner": "shiny.sh_", "likes": 3753}, {"id": 18036540842112856, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-02T20:41:55", "owner": "freakyskibidifartsniffer67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973271697760339, "text": "Buddy that’s literally an iPhone 13", "created_at": "2024-09-02T20:38:02", "owner": "kaiju_origami_", "likes": 880}, {"id": 18038167313115428, "text": "s23 ultra is same as 24 ultra lol", "created_at": "2024-09-02T20:04:36", "owner": "jambrusicdavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094783159455541, "text": "@ishhhxa.25 🤡", "created_at": "2024-09-02T19:45:46", "owner": "tirthh.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085838857493858, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-02T18:46:22", "owner": "israel_dimasjr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17878027257069570, "text": "New design. 15 years ago", "created_at": "2024-09-02T18:14:20", "owner": "nathan_rods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066978835607912, "text": "Same with Samsung that's sad bro", "cre