{"media_id": 3325322028636940581, "shortcode": "C4l6sRIr6kl", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C4l6sRIr6kl/", "taken_at": "2024-03-16T22:50:34", "caption": "Cambia tu iPhone 📱 \n⚡️ transfiere tu información de forma rápida \n🔋Equipos como nuevos con altos niveles de batería \n🔔Promociones semanales en referencias seleccionadas \n💻Recibimos tus equipos como parte de pago \n•\n•\n•\n#barranquillla #bogota #bucaramanga #riohacha #ibague #sincelejo #tunja #boyaca #soacha #tenjo #cundinamarca #puertocolombia #cucuta #cartagena #santamarta #fusagasuga #reelsinstagram #reels #tendencia #viral #tiendaiphone #iPhone #copaamerica #colombia #argentina #finalcopaamerica", "owner_username": "barranquillamobileworld", "owner_id": "8652125839", "likes": 28168, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0014_C4l6sRIr6kl\\C4l6sRIr6kl_20240316_225034.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17907825657279405, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:46:11", "owner": "caribean_blue_salgar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114292627519312, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:22:31", "owner": "plomeriayserviciosgp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085888180920939, "text": "Excelente contenido 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:54:26", "owner": "ultramar_hostels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522775426023711, "text": "Las mejores ofertas en Barranquilla 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-08-28T20:29:53", "owner": "ultramar_hostels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072593678045425, "text": "Excelentes productos 👏", "created_at": "2025-08-15T05:02:36", "owner": "ultramar_hostels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026325362472635, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-05-05T20:56:16", "owner": "caribean_blue_salgar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024218891391375, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-28T22:53:09", "owner": "palmarvamos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037604828524070, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-06T12:25:04", "owner": "caribean_blue_salgar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033798950402089, "text": "@destacar", "created_at": "2025-02-06T03:10:58", "owner": "barranquillamobileworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050507404932109, "text": "11 pro max usado", "created_at": "2025-01-24T18:26:31", "owner": "jadesbrr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018891350454073, "text": "Excelente contenido", "created_at": "2024-08-19T21:14:05", "owner": "ultramar_hostels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034508818909146, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-08-19T21:12:30", "owner": "palmarvamos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008278298447013, "text": "Ha! Pooooooor", "created_at": "2024-06-01T19:01:45", "owner": "garrdemo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18008663030244938, "text": "Crie uma briga nos comentários é saia para ver no que dá kkk", "created_at": "2024-05-27T19:27:33", "owner": "jonazluiz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17913166496945480, "text": "Eso lo hice con mi Y6 🫣 en efecto hasta un  Huawei es mejor 😂", "created_at": "2024-05-23T11:56:28", "owner": "elii.cap", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17931612134850542, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-05-18T12:45:10", "owner": "palmarvamos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025291397152380, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-05-15T20:34:24", "owner": "palmarvamos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029190221083515, "text": "Para los lloros, Samsung no tiene audífonos 3.5, no te incluye nada ni el cargador, no se le puede remover la batería igual que el iphone, los Android se volvieron copias del iPhone pa eso mejor me pase al iPhone 😂", "created_at": "2024-05-15T04:10:43", "owner": "sato.speed", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18014552927121418, "text": "Esos teléfonos son malísimos.", "created_at": "2024-05-11T17:33:59", "owner": "ing.alfiery", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18183446593290963, "text": "Los de Samsung solo falta que estén cerca jajaja Yo hasta me asusté cuando cambié de celular, ¡increíble!", "created_at": "2024-05-10T13:45:29", "owner": "j.mt1s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020309075187850, "text": "No rey tu a05 o tu a23 no es mejor que un iPhone", "created_at": "2024-05-10T10:25:13", "owner": "rodriigx_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048330340679725, "text": "Самый печальный момент когда перешёл на новый а с старым так много воспоминаний", "created_at": "2024-05-08T04:18:40", "owner": "ghots_1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289128754165960, "text": "En los Xiaomi lo hace no me asombra", "created_at": "2024-05-04T20:52:14", "owner": "angel_itorojas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032996170940701, "text": "En mis tiempos puro tamagochi", "created_at": "2024-05-02T13:40:25", "owner": "rg4mendoza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049419928723222, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-04-30T13:32:37", "owner": "restaurantelasvelas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106717825377997, "text": "I unlocked the Colombian side of Instagram", "created_at": "2024-04-30T10:28:41", "owner": "girizzh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030314854985931, "text": "Los q prefieren android nunca tuvieron iPhone. Yo era uno de ustedes también", "created_at": "2024-04-28T19:01:10", "owner": "varelaa.ok", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18262786519210625, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-04-25T12:47:17", "owner": "palmarvamos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032377819940303, "text": "Alguien me explica que es eso?", "created_at": "2024-04-22T21:20:42", "owner": "fabri_botti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849381883192300, "text": "Y eso?", "created_at": "2024-04-22T21:20:27", "owner": "fabri_botti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006429356197391, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-04-20T15:45:56", "owner": "barranquillamobileworld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010654796130289, "text": "O sea como qr comun y corriente?", "created_at": "2024-04-17T18:37:53", "owner": "a.4dr1an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266745064224919, "text": "Android tiene mas libertad de personalización, modificación y literal cualquier cosa gratis, y esa función ya existía", "created_at": "2024-04-16T04:44:35", "owner": "alexmustd1e_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18124998814343467, "text": "No amigo de los comentarios, tu A04 no es mejor que un iPhone", "created_at": "2024-04-11T10:43:57", "owner": "ciruloagustin", "likes": 89}, {"id": 17963042603724715, "text": "También desde años lo hace iPhone pero al parecer la gente no cambia su celular muy a menudo 🫠", "created_at": "2024-04-04T19:22:19", "owner": "dolcezzamtz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026996230960163, "text": "Backup with icloud", "created_at": "2024-04-03T20:24:35", "owner": "qdo_2nd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898582227900515, "text": "Another monopolistic innovation. Keep it up and US will keep on suing.", "created_at": "2024-04-03T07:13:11", "owner": "iamjeremydon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019042361506805, "text": "Wow they made a pretty qr code😂", "created_at": "2024-04-03T05:04:44", "owner": "quackers_warcriminal", "likes": 44}, {"id": 17937022325810543, "text": "Son el mismo iPhone no?", "created_at": "2024-04-02T19:37:09", "owner": "yahirluna24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873181783072232, "text": "Wooou que gran novedad literal Google te permite hacer eso no un solo toque pero que gran novedad", "created_at": "2024-04-02T18:14:09", "owner": "miguelvlcruz", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17994147305621461, "text": "No es de ahuevo publicar xd", "created_at": "2024-04-01T02:14:25", "owner": "eddybakerxd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18255111439241908, "text": "Eso ya tiene tiempo 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-03-31T20:18:25", "owner": "yaky944", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17998355183593557, "text": "Android hizo eso hace años", "created_at": "2024-03-31T17:46:57", "owner": "saulrogeliobejarano", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17948764559664946, "text": "Esos usuarios de Android pelean solos🤣", "created_at": "2024-03-31T16:32:12", "owner": "javier_villanueva47", "likes": 250}, {"id": 18059915596551945, "text": "Donde se ubican?", "created_at": "2024-03-31T15:59:05", "owner": "sharkboy_1069", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18330371473142143, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-03-31T14:17:52", "owner": "palmarvamos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18307842508148560, "text": "No amigo en los comentarios, tu huawei de china no es mejor que un iPhone.", "created_at": "2024-03-31T14:12:18", "owner": "srantillon", "likes": 704}, {"id": 18000149171598210, "text": "Hay no amiga andas muy atrasada eso desde cuando se puede yo tengo 3 dispositivos iPhone 📲 con los mismos correos", "created_at": "2024-03-31T09:23:38", "owner": "maryu.gonzalez.37", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972637869558300, "text": "@jordvn.coronvdo", "created_at": "2024-03-31T07:49:35", "owner": "agoromo._.sad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924911727853195, "text": "😂😂😂😂 eso ya está desde hace mucho en Android", "created_at": "2024-03-31T06:42:23", "owner": "ivancinico", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18009416771394682, "text": "Qrcode 👍", "created_at": "2024-05-19T03:17:16", "owner": "jonasvitzel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960275142635598, "text": "Wtf is this qr code 💀", "created_at": "2024-05-13T16:27:13", "owner": "2much_potato", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028559776870127, "text": "App name", "created_at": "2024-05-05T11:10:49", "owner": "mdskhan_9495", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18222321913277689, "text": "Productos Apple con garantía / Cambia tu iPhone", "created_at": "2024-04-20T15:46:11", "owner": "barranquillamobileworld", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["barranquillla", "bogota", "bucaramanga", "riohacha", "ibague", "sincelejo", "tunja", "boyaca", "soacha", "tenjo", "cundinamarca", "puertocolombia", "cucuta", "cartagena", "santamarta", "fusagasuga", "reelsinstagram", "reels", "tendencia", "viral", "tiendaiphone", "iphone", "copaamerica", "colombia", "argentina", "finalcopaamerica"]},
