his?", "created_at": "2025-01-25T21:46:41", "owner": "_holylift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064708636893331, "text": "No fun😭", "created_at": "2025-01-25T07:01:01", "owner": "paul._.paulicul._.tau_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074504893595453, "text": "Is this pay gorn", "created_at": "2025-01-23T22:26:23", "owner": "gusuhhrawr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061895968899204, "text": "Good for them", "created_at": "2025-01-23T22:17:11", "owner": "0_may_o77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070058992687740, "text": "I want one for women.", "created_at": "2025-01-23T19:15:04", "owner": "shayshaymac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944839539945747, "text": "They have a goon room", "created_at": "2025-01-23T17:12:56", "owner": "maxi.w.muc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291802345210695, "text": "Is there gambling", "created_at": "2025-01-23T10:16:54", "owner": "irmum_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052462934038195, "text": "Can we kiss at night", "created_at": "2025-01-22T23:13:55", "owner": "mohamad_alkhafaji123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042000851077208, "text": "Do i get violated by dudes in there?", "created_at": "2025-01-22T17:42:35", "owner": "eomentaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047834000176789, "text": "gaystay", "created_at": "2025-01-22T16:45:29", "owner": "mayabonobihaarini", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087947854559258, "text": "Ill go but like do we fk at night?", "created_at": "2025-01-22T13:54:02", "owner": "angelc4kez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867182542221177, "text": "is this pay gorn", "created_at": "2025-01-22T00:56:59", "owner": "joosqyf", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18088914202487031, "text": "They 100% kiss at night", "created_at": "2025-01-21T19:45:20", "owner": "it.doesnt.even.matterr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854203672368071, "text": "women?", "created_at": "2025-01-21T18:52:48", "owner": "prettysuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878403952142067, "text": "Hamzacel hq", "created_at": "2025-01-21T07:23:05", "owner": "808fucker631", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998450871723709, "text": "My goal is more robux", "created_at": "2025-01-21T01:47:26", "owner": "niyahhttp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052258361107508, "text": "What is going on 😒", "created_at": "2025-01-20T16:32:54", "owner": "elh.430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030733976252219, "text": "No, i don't wanna be part of another saussage party", "created_at": "2025-01-20T04:03:20", "owner": "iker_ouyeah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955266591862792, "text": "And they all do the thing", "created_at": "2025-01-20T03:41:38", "owner": "madagascar_2thebrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330695167081010, "text": "Which bl is this?", "created_at": "2025-01-19T20:03:36", "owner": "alchoholicfag", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18094983391513961, "text": "thanks for coming out!", "created_at": "2025-01-19T18:05:23", "owner": "zombii.worms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045861031995129, "text": "@artialz lets go🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-19T15:38:52", "owner": "geanna.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266014465251418, "text": "We need that for women", "created_at": "2025-01-19T14:46:12", "owner": "the.aeraarts._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019320053413049, "text": "I thought it said \"no women\"🤓", "created_at": "2025-01-19T10:01:14", "owner": "zyxens.angel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032991167207782, "text": "This place banned everything because they think it's a flex", "created_at": "2025-01-19T05:42:56", "owner": "afroarts2023ndlovu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042925748054992, "text": "@cbachphan ổ quỷ của Anthony", "created_at": "2025-01-18T23:55:03", "owner": "evol_proz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939244536953725, "text": "so… a monastery?", "created_at": "2025-01-18T23:30:35", "owner": "marquessofgarfield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288956113243914, "text": "They like boys 🤭🤭🤭🤭🤭🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-01-18T23:23:22", "owner": "sila.klnc9422", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077960509625705, "text": "I’m gonna piss myself 😭", "created_at": "2025-01-18T15:18:31", "owner": "ulzzhang09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078799831614926, "text": "Bara yaoi.", "created_at": "2025-01-18T01:45:09", "owner": "nerd_lozzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867209437297473, "text": "Sounds great", "created_at": "2025-01-17T23:17:41", "owner": "zazabamana_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953718921877377, "text": "according to this reel, men are unable to control themselves around men. y’know, i didn’t think friendly fire would be tolerated.", "created_at": "2025-01-17T20:05:17", "owner": "shark.cutie.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058168384975606, "text": "NO WOMAN? 😢", "created_at": "2025-01-17T19:39:08", "owner": "saushinaomakaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071619667666608, "text": "What about weed", "created_at": "2025-01-17T18:37:00", "owner": "not_dqvid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083158516596021, "text": "they make out at night", "created_at": "2025-01-17T04:43:53", "owner": "junpei.and.yuta_the_goats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054370373501519, "text": "They all kiss each other goodnight", "created_at": "2025-01-16T21:13:44", "owner": "oddlly_sinister_777", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17964360854844179, "text": "Pure beta male vibes", "created_at": "2025-01-16T20:04:53", "owner": "fredlittle_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056818946496062, "text": "Looks cool", "created_at": "2025-01-16T13:59:37", "owner": "yami_lulu2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327466225092087, "text": "🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-01-16T03:40:48", "owner": "chrispasquier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948966240791710, "text": "Ok", "created_at": "2025-01-15T20:42:19", "owner": "k7ttyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908846178985117, "text": "Pls stay there forever don't come out ever again", "created_at": "2025-01-15T13:16:40", "owner": "jaeezzrealest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936009024970779, "text": "I wanna join", "created_at": "2025-01-14T14:30:08", "owner": "felicia_dimming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028053221305348, "text": "They touch each other at night 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-13T19:21:52", "owner": "lorenzosavi10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036879338129478, "text": "need this for women", "created_at": "2025-01-13T03:50:24", "owner": "bigfatsealbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039628172345690, "text": "If I m woman? 🥸", "created_at": "2025-01-12T18:56:20", "owner": "sar_ah.ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324454162094223, "text": "Why always in Bali 🤦‍♀️🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-01-12T12:51:05", "owner": "b3rtha.ha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028951238277501, "text": "No women. Yet gets spa done by a women. Didn't anyone notice?", "created_at": "2025-01-12T11:10:51", "owner": "buddhaatheart_123456789101112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041736626517544, "text": "That’s called marriage", "created_at": "2025-01-11T23:36:01", "owner": "pross1635", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951980160877177, "text": "Pay Gorn", "created_at": "2025-01-11T10:55:54", "owner": "slippin_kiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059483974904825, "text": "As much I love hot spas, good food, and nature, I would be afraid to sleep at night", "created_at": "2025-01-10T17:45:58", "owner": "rubbertoe25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911255875063526, "text": "i know u like boys", "created_at": "2025-01-10T13:28:29", "owner": "savyy._z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021390677356318, "text": "I just wanna point out. Every shot of them sitting down, is them manspreading so much that they could do a split.", "created_at": "2025-01-09T21:31:58", "owner": "adro_070607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054316768997760, "text": "This is kind of like a monk's version of training, but instead of strengthening the mind and body, they learn to relax the sphincter and grow the ego.", "created_at": "2025-01-09T14:33:03", "owner": "filipe.trash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040708484059152, "text": "YES IF THIS SOUNDS GO TO YOU PLEASE GO AND DONT COME BACK 🥰🥰", "created_at": "2025-01-09T00:59:04", "owner": "jaysonm128", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040151603520642, "text": "0:17 woman", "created_at": "2025-01-08T18:17:10", "owner": "privatemoko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944177586796820, "text": "Why you have to bring ur culture to bali? Does it not fit at your own country?", "created_at": "2025-01-08T16:21:06", "owner": "milliondollarchickenwing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073126957643994, "text": "It's a new bl drama called \" Love in island \"", "created_at": "2025-01-08T15:53:22", "owner": "scarlette_witch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886598935187840, "text": "I would want to join it but sadly i'm a woman", "created_at": "2025-01-08T14:47:00", "owner": "nesi6345", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18483629650050924, "text": "they have say gex every night", "created_at": "2025-01-07T23:29:52", "owner": "__m4rzzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991871907759621, "text": "You said no woman..", "created_at": "2025-01-07T13:44:32", "owner": "ascleas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027569891532237, "text": "@literally_odazai they definetly do it with eachother", "created_at": "2025-01-07T08:37:07", "owner": "viviamusmoriendum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151715707349361, "text": "yeah they’re feeling eachother at night", "created_at": "2025-01-07T06:41:33", "owner": "doritoscrashcoursefan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020730071382298, "text": "Women literally increase men’s testosterone😭", "created_at": "2025-01-06T10:00:30", "owner": "kyus_a_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019225643643399, "text": "Are you sure it’s the women?", "created_at": "2025-01-05T21:02:47", "owner": "coconutlover366", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069541819683149, "text": "Why would I say no", "created_at": "2025-01-05T19:45:26", "owner": "mrhunter1408", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
