{"media_id": 3449810740781975956, "shortcode": "C_gMJdCowmU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_gMJdCowmU/", "taken_at": "2024-09-04T17:09:29", "caption": "Here are some brief characteristics of the GAZ-66:\n\n- **Type:** Military truck\n- **Manufacturer:** GAZ (Gorky Automobile Plant)\n- **Production Years:** 1964–1999\n- **Engine:** 4.25-liter V8 gasoline engine\n- **Power:** Approximately 140 hp\n- **Transmission:** 4-speed manual\n- **Drive:** 6x6 all-wheel drive\n- **Top Speed:** Around 80 km/h (50 mph)\n- **Payload Capacity:** Up to 3,000 kg (6,600 lbs)\n- **Fuel Capacity:** 120 liters (31.7 gallons)\n- **Dimensions:** Length – 6.7 meters (22 feet), Width – 2.5 meters (8.2 feet), Height – 2.9 meters (9.5 feet)\n- **Usage:** Military, utility, and off-road applications\n\nThe GAZ-66 is known for its durability and off-road capability.", "owner_username": "shrek_every_day_meme", "owner_id": "64665711239", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0022_C_gMJdCowmU\\C_gMJdCowmU_20240904_170929.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18312739522301576, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:52:09", "owner": "mert1124556", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18142833220447882, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:19:57", "owner": "tiemen_official_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18130303228487713, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:10:12", "owner": "rivalson609", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18064228394133736, "text": "Pasen link", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:32:38", "owner": "s0y_n4da", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17995346489835298, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T07:34:12", "owner": "marlonbryan_2002", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18056398604274401, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:55:30", "owner": "raktim.saikia", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18079559375284957, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:38:36", "owner": "auhergar", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18065536892613248, "text": "كذلك أيضاً", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:34:21", "owner": "m__n__345",