": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T16:39:18", "owner": "neilachim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910341103082793, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T16:35:43", "owner": "m__andrijaa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036835973161744, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-31T16:34:27", "owner": "cane.r321zzz321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919625025942457, "text": "💀💀🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-31T16:22:21", "owner": "savvvvvvd__1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036149723176911, "text": "Aprovechad el bug", "created_at": "2025-01-31T14:58:19", "owner": "p4tr1ck_b4t3m4n_2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056507848955520, "text": "😏😏", "created_at": "2025-01-31T14:48:45", "owner": "54_feer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355750090133446, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-31T14:01:02", "owner": "itskhaled.644", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483268165061579, "text": "Que yo sepa, ese es un método muy poco usado para dormir", "created_at": "2025-01-31T13:53:38", "owner": "jeronimorozocarvajal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936621465969178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T12:55:14", "owner": "vincent.vesely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069070000795504, "text": "😏", "created_at": "2025-01-31T12:16:21", "owner": "gabrielsouzza.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083016289582628, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T12:04:37", "owner": "rlk_jm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892517746160999, "text": "what she wantt💀", "created_at": "2025-01-31T11:33:56", "owner": "sefafurkankalemkus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020142338422177, "text": "Bro got chance's 💀", "created_at": "2025-01-31T11:26:01", "owner": "tiang2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386706973111905, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T09:01:24", "owner": "dydy_02four3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956396586868803, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T08:11:39", "owner": "mgwg_gwgm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032040014269133, "text": "Bro just focus on Russia instead of this", "created_at": "2025-01-31T07:58:39", "owner": "hazehassik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860736502274278, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T06:46:47", "owner": "zizon_didd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015192374682435, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T06:19:38", "owner": "manusantiago130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883263880238405, "text": "Se fosse eu já tava toda💀", "created_at": "2025-01-31T04:47:27", "owner": "marcioabreu821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088399873556835, "text": "💀💀😏", "created_at": "2025-01-31T04:33:54", "owner": "j4v1_idkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070704742705654, "text": "Y el name", "created_at": "2025-01-31T04:00:06", "owner": "xz_joxk.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327562690095023, "text": "🤫😏", "created_at": "2025-01-31T02:24:16", "owner": "salazartrx67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343412653148663, "text": "C o cara N desmaio ele é fd", "created_at": "2025-01-31T02:22:30", "owner": "mayckyzin_.k7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034234313448102, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T01:04:36", "owner": "_kkaue77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045845348471436, "text": "7wiha", "created_at": "2025-01-30T23:31:34", "owner": "boxer.kores", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3450366875429442413, "shortcode": "C_iKmRyvxNt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_iKmRyvxNt/", "taken_at": "2024-09-05T11:30:00", "caption": "簡單一個問題，卻蘊藏著所有銷售的基本邏輯\nSell me this pen\n\n#流量 #經營 #變現 #李專 #ig變現 #ip變現 #流量變現 #短影片 #營銷", "owner_username": "ip.mkting", "owner_id": "67654663626", "likes": 62845, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0023_C_iKmRyvxNt\\C_iKmRyvxNt_20240905_113000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17861927823222086, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-26T07:11:08", "owner": "sokk86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861813889289550, "text": "主管看到這個口若懸河卻不理會考題的應徵者，靜靜的點頭，向門外喊了下一位。", "created_at": "2024-11-24T06:11:57", "owner": "ellicktaiwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112723330424257, "text": "说尼玛半天", "created_at": "2024-11-20T15:37:55", "owner": "wenbin00001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047470715016031, "text": "如果這是一隻可以帶來好運的筆\n請問大家會花多少錢購買呢？", "created_at": "2024-11-17T16:02:29", "owner": "test031756", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991718007723781, "text": "他像是講了些什麼，又好像沒講。", "created_at": "2024-11-13T05:54:38", "owner": "edward.1207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043877849109670, "text": "已購買 小孩很愛吃", "created_at": "2024-11-04T04:23:46", "owner": "iven.peng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116276203405970, "text": "地球上有各种资源，比如土地资源，金属矿，石油等，但最有价值的是人类的认知资源。操控人类的认知，俗称洗脑", "created_at": "2024-10-29T15:31:17", "owner": "longfanlong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872384962128129, "text": "有完整版的影片嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-14T11:39:36", "owner": "ryanchen_1112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941421918781677, "text": "被考倒了", "created_at": "2024-10-06T03:16:35", "owner": "qqad110110", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18017722892614529, "text": "適用於這種人際關係", "created_at": "2024-10-05T22:05:53", "owner": "andy40309_surf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058931878701655, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-10-03T10:01:57", "owner": "davy.chiu.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977477592770650, "text": "不要生产出来再找买家，而是看买家要买什么然后去生产", "created_at": "2024-09-30T02:32:26", "owner": "renben010911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846805729314089, "text": "在台灣只要，愛心筆。放到你手上。就可以討500了。", "created_at": "2024-09-29T17:04:28", "owner": "louis82463", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063045034638432, "text": "顧客要買自然就會拿，不買的時候你吹到上天也沒用！", "created_at": "2024-09-27T04:59:30", "owner": "peter.g27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045694882818607, "text": "「這支筆搭載Ai」", "created_at": "2024-09-23T16:23:56", "owner": "henryfatcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974031930779301, "text": "現在好像ㄧㄝ沒那個耐心去聽別人的對話和問題，再來聽了只覺得很煩腦，我已經都不知道要什麼然後又一直問問題，如果我自己都清楚就也不用詢問了😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T04:29:47", "owner": "iffiiffi99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943815459894920, "text": "需求是創造出來的", "created_at": "2024-09-23T03:08:30", "owner": "andy16576", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029777606074375, "text": "i have my own pen. get lost.", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:59:59", "owner": "how1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026726540518745, "text": "蔣幹化", "created_at": "2024-09-21T23:56:51", "owner": "jackwang7703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025082414381910, "text": "创造需求是第一步。。买什么都是一样的道理，小到一支笔，大到数十亿军火。。", "created_at": "2024-09-21T23:39:05", "owner": "geo_0_x_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179788240306889, "text": "探詢需求 滿足需求 然後在創造需求 再度滿足需求", "created_at": "2024-09-20T05:08:39", "owner": "leo_ting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940160169780504, "text": "看得懂本質 自然就能理解", "created_at": "2024-09-19T15:16:10", "owner": "_ky0.archive", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866393968145910, "text": "重點該如何讓客人停下來願意聽你銷售，無法讓客人停下腳步，話術再好也沒用😢", "created_at": "2024-09-19T01:05:48", "owner": "sean_111992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056198218655628, "text": "一个股票经纪学营销，证明他们的股有多烂。", "created_at": "2024-09-18T23:07:44", "owner": "derrick080612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880036903134585, "text": "你觉得我说得有无道理 请用这笔记下来", "created_at": "2024-09-18T06:36:43", "owner": "kailas_car", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846182284287730, "text": "事實上生活中很多產品都跟著這智慧而大賣。口氣惹人生厭，去買mouth wash吧；體毛不得體，買刮刀吧。所以他說selling a pen去說這筆有多好是格局小，他這階層的人是用怎樣創造一個需求讓人需要這一支筆。", "created_at": "2024-09-18T04:59:17", "owner": "alicechancl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248776744260898, "text": "滿足顧客的需求叫推銷\n創造顧客的需求叫行銷\n行銷做得好，甚至都不用推銷了", "created_at": "2024-09-17T12:56:02", "owner": "flutist6622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003502154653696, "text": "重點是\n沒有回答問題\n而丟出了另一個問題\n典型的政治人物操作", "created_at": "2024-09-17T01:08:39", "owner": "js12355555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070227136526152, "text": "垃圾答案", "created_at": "2024-09-16T14:13:03", "owner": "jedpeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016510061295731, "text": "「講這麼多結果還不是沒有賣出那支筆」因為這是老掉牙的題目了...老到不必去解，直接講背後的概念就好", "created_at": "2024-09-15T19:20:07", "owner": "too.loud.a.solitude_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046216291795605, "text": "妈的说那么多，就是卖不出去呗", "created_at": "2024-09-14T22:47:01", "owner": "yangshaobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987841293559886, "text": "可以求原影片嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-14T15:07:23", "owner": "m2c3w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18457190302038343, "text": "step1. what your client needs, values這邊的values應該翻‘“看重” 不是“價值”", "created_at": "2024-09-14T03:56:57", "owner": "brandon_h_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985023192587433, "text": "聽君一席話", "created_at": "2024-09-13T14:21:00", "owner": "akira.mjc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018682676603163, "text": "他適合當政治人員 不適合當銷售人員", "created_at": "2024-09-13T09:40:48", "owner": "kd0327_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923008257958255, "text": "SPIN sales skill", "created_at": "2024-09-13T01:28:58", "owner": "stevenchiu5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076050403550173, "text": "所以答案是？", "created_at": "2024-09-13T00:57:33", "owner": "quack011225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029430404065224, "text": "但實際上沒多少人願意用一點點錢和時間換取最大的效益", "created_at": "2024-09-12T23:12:21", "owner": "binghengyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034320551179856, "text": "你可以幫我簽個名嗎，不好意思我沒帶筆😂", "created_at": "2024-09-12T16:14:52", "owner": "on_you_mark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040616105301769, "text": "西門町的愛心筆銷售都比他厲害", "created_at": "2024-09-12T09:46:59", "owner": "robkuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021241634411586, "text": "主動買筆的人，從來都不會要你銷售，\n買名貴筆，不是他的筆好不好寫，是要筆的品牌價值！\n普通買筆是因為真的需要🤣，寫的到就好！", "created_at": "2024-09-12T09:38:26", "owner": "edward_9210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886283803097777, "text": "有沒有需求客人自己就知道要根本就不用問", "created_at": "2024-09-12T07:37:05", "owner": "chang1000tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023949413521985, "text": "跩什麼", "created_at": "2024-09-12T00:22:35", "owner": "henyi1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040063406014701, "text": "需求不是你可以創造的，是市場。你要做的是解決客戶的難題，做出符合市場需求的服務。", "created_at": "2024-09-11T16:08:43", "owner": "ryancweb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025960010366380, "text": "反質詢是吧", "created_at": "2024-09-11T14:19:50", "owner": "dariusyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015869273289473, "text": "邏輯錯很大，他說的市場學是創造一支筆去賣才會用到，你要了解市場才知道應該做一支怎樣的筆給顧客。但原本的問題那支筆是已經固定的產品，即是說你了解了市場也改變不了這支筆的功能。我了解了市場痛點，這支筆解決不了我一樣也是賣不出。", "created_at": "2024-09-11T04:38:27", "owner": "ingo_lau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064066408717383, "text": "聽他講那麼久\n完全沒有聽到他回應客戶需求⋯⋯\n只是在那邊掰銷售的過程\n掰完結果就沒有下文了", "created_at": "2024-09-10T20:55:53", "owner": "_sin215_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959507670809951, "text": "@xuan._.w_ 已購買 小孩很愛吃", "created_at": "2024-09-10T16:39:11", "owner": "h.___o4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245565598260809, "text": "我這樣做過，但我沒有被錄用，很顯然，面試官根本不清楚他到底想問出什麼特質", "created_at": "2024-09-10T12:28:25", "owner": "arvin_714", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18052712038834629, "text": "聽了廢話⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-09-10T12:23:02", "owner": "kaiiori3369", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042067801999922, "text": "专业 BS", "created_at": "2024-09-10T10:40:53", "owner": "philiptamwc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036608585127421, "text": "別鬧了我會跟隔壁那個妹子買筆，而且會有很多人跟我做一樣的事，解答在這啦", "created_at": "2024-09-10T10:30:13", "owner": "jason_demo_yao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042333259970837, "text": "趕快拉字幕上來擋口水", "created_at": "2024-09-10T04:49:08", "owner": "rrtnt6886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986048361569726, "text": "为什么要那么复杂呢\n：这支笔品牌我在代理，也在自用，反正你都在用 可以试试这支", "created_at": "2024-09-10T04:28:37", "owner": "skykoon.soo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961162161681478, "text": "要賣不難，問題係咪可以賺到錢", "created_at": "2024-09-09T16:20:34", "owner": "hgjhbbggb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093331270457904, "text": "：那個妳好  我是設計系的學生", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:51:49", "owner": "fishdumpling0429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855176359256602, "text": "找出需求 或創造需求", "created_at": "2024-09-09T08:02:05", "owner": "ccc.cc22880745zzz.zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293541082207731, "text": "電影已教過了，還用問本人多一次？", "created_at": "2024-09-09T03:58:44", "owner": "rem_yeung", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18028206737516643, "text": "顧客聽完直接睡著吧\n為啥變成你在問我問題？", "created_at": "2024-09-09T03:40:00", "owner": "ck.lawtwwwwwww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949467303835714, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-09T00:32:47", "owner": "gia_666666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415910461079509, "text": "如果你是john wick，這筆能確實貫穿你想做的事（？", "created_at": "2024-09-08T23:23:11", "owner": "takosubarashii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007280690402243, "text": "就是挖一個洞給你跳，上面再蓋一塊布，設計一個陷阱讓你不得不買這個產品，根本就垃圾做的事。", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:24:37", "owner": "chen__xing1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005396108446886, "text": "你就是不會賣吧，講一堆廢話", "created_at": "2024-09-08T14:39:11", "owner": "leo_.chun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057526375684446, "text": "Step 2?", "created_at": "2024-09-08T14:14:38", "owner": "cheung0852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102482032433460, "text": "漂亮🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-08T13:58:04", "owner": "thes199206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899811721046581, "text": "謝謝讓老子省下一支筆的錢，\n買了一堆吉伊卡哇的周邊，\n嗚 嗚哇哇 嗚哇 嗚哇哇塌枯塌枯 掐歐", "created_at": "2024-09-08T12:56:30", "owner": "wu.chu.0909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046431994903656, "text": "Chatgpt告訴你，把公司買下來，就把筆售價提升", "created_at": "2024-09-08T12:10:43", "owner": "chirpgush", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930695262921268, "text": "誰不知道這樣 現在還没有說服我要買", "created_at": "2024-09-08T08:12:55", "owner": "nick____kuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277924705209881, "text": "長話短說：沒需求就別硬賣", "created_at": "2024-09-08T07:20:40", "owner": "john0135", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053297560818259, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T06:21:21", "owner": "lucaschristblessus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055175938831577, "text": "我只需要情緒加值", "created_at": "2024-09-08T05:39:38", "owner": "sohikki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126310615373591, "text": "錯吧 是製造需求", "created_at": "2024-09-08T05:27:11", "owner": "ozzy_917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074713903545625, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T04:40:33", "owner": "arthur1996850612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039609215476673, "text": "一堆人說沒賣出去的是認真的嗎？😮真的不曉得他為什麼這麼回答嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-08T04:39:13", "owner": "arthur1996850612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891314476080699, "text": "一句話，你是賣，還是不賣", "created_at": "2024-09-08T04:35:00", "owner": "ry_xiang_0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103755022426359, "text": "John wick :給我筆就對了，不然我去拿叉子….", "created_at": "2024-09-08T02:27:26", "owner": "as_haoyun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874161772158734, "text": "口袋沒錢還是不會買啊⋯\n你怎麼能肯定話術一定能讓人買？\n就像臺上幹話連篇的人，他不想買口袋也沒錢更覺得沒需求。\n\n所以銷售業務真的是一個很玄又很看八字跟偏財的關係。", "created_at": "2024-09-07T21:15:05", "owner": "pedro128690", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016809227285361, "text": "如果這是花錢去聽的課程 這些人真盤真可憐", "created_at": "2024-09-07T18:27:58", "owner": "poweropen47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035063093163538, "text": "跟所有的老闆一樣，講來講去、不會直接回答你的問題😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T18:01:38", "owner": "mr.dopeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050377114730487, "text": "您沒賣出這支筆，但解答了這人的問題", "created_at": "2024-09-07T17:34:52", "owner": "alex.chong.supreme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892246368999753, "text": "這隻筆是李奧納多皮卡丘用過的😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T17:32:06", "owner": "ia20999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005508779444401, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-07T17:16:24", "owner": "dbg_1216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052789165684615, "text": "已買，小孩很愛吃", "created_at": "2024-09-07T17:04:02", "owner": "smail_light", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008462774402990, "text": "要不要聽幹幹寄己在講什麼", "created_at": "2024-09-07T14:51:31", "owner": "future_titanium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869523658187948, "text": "老闆講什麼都是對的\n面試者講出來⋯⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-09-07T13:42:37", "owner": "louis_guang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031161446030290, "text": "這只筆是我比John Wick用 每個人都值得擁有", "created_at": "2024-09-07T12:37:47", "owner": "__sam__316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853488334266497, "text": "叫你買這隻筆 你廢話一堆 還是不知道怎麼賣", "created_at": "2024-09-07T11:54:54", "owner": "hy._.8zo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059053480671296, "text": "：通告費請簽收\n：你沒有筆嗎？\n：這裡有，一支200", "created_at": "2024-09-07T09:47:24", "owner": "lmf_1112", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064308040720278, "text": "讲了一大堆 可是一点养分也没有", "created_at": "2024-09-07T08:34:11", "owner": "call_me_looi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954198822820373, "text": "這支筆有AI功能", "created_at": "2024-09-07T08:04:19", "owner": "laybaccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025035467121297, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-07T07:00:23", "owner": "doonliin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016798787283344, "text": "講一堆，便宜就無敵", "created_at": "2024-09-07T06:58:16", "owner": "allenlinbingwei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928807938928970, "text": "我會問你可以為了狗狗殺人嗎？會的話你就需要它", "created_at": "2024-09-07T05:48:16", "owner": "ruskinrobert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18452479300061907, "text": "問A答B", "created_at": "2024-09-07T05:15:30", "owner": "3pai_0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042723148953684, "text": "為何不向流浪漢推銷買房？", "created_at": "2024-09-07T04:58:22", "owner": "kon_ni_chiwa_konnichiwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937529001871414, "text": "賣給John wick", "created_at": "2024-09-07T04:56:22", "owner": "chiaway158_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928290810825484, "text": "創造顧客需求跟了解他們面臨的痛點，但在台灣這種業務環境下其實比較難，因為公司制度跟能給予的優惠，公司管理層基本算好打死，不會給予太多活性操控的空間，這也是台灣業務比較難發展的難處", "created_at": "2024-09-07T04:08:45", "owner": "ji50316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055984396813064, "text": "答案不夠好😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T02:47:00", "owner": "fatboy7768", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462163228049403, "text": "他不是害很多人，賠光所有積蓄？", "created_at": "2024-09-07T02:21:01", "owner": "wan.wan.1903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909334462007206, "text": "買支筆供在家裡，男的可以壯陽，女的可以豐胸，小孩聰明考試都一百分😂。放在財位還能開運招財。前30組打電話預購的朋友，只要開運價8888，再免費送一組健康長壽立可白修正液，送完為止😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T02:14:57", "owner": "prthagjana0321", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["流量", "經營", "變現", "李專", "ig變現", "ip變現", "流量變現", "短影片", "營銷"]},
{"media_id": 3450075943738273786, "shortcode": "C_hIcqio-_6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_hIcqio-_6/", "taken_at": "2024-09-05T01:53:40", "caption": "When he accidentally uses his “straight voice”#straight #man #elevator #fun #woman #girl #girlfriend", "owner_username": "popppppp201", "owner_id": "48755502408", "likes": 259777, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0024_C_hIcqio-_6\\C_hIcqio-_6_20240905_015340.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18051400993698995, "text": "所以聲音都是裝的？", "created_at": "2024-09-05T16:30:24", "owner": "ben30909", "likes": 12801}, {"id": 18036253990938922, "text": "可愛的朋友們幫我贊一贊首頁的置頂視頻啦！朋友需要你們的幫助～❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-07T03:26:04", "owner": "popppppp201", "likes": 1973}, {"id": 18070966735777038, "text": "學廢了~", "created_at": "2025-01-24T23:26:22", "owner": "cl22811800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930674748881027, "text": "@yokesuang 哈哈哈好真实😂", "created_at": "2025-01-20T05:42:44", "owner": "kailaexh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102384940482840, "text": "@zh4d0w_", "created_at": "2025-01-18T04:01:41", "owner": "avriilaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027455462278097, "text": "我是姐妹是什麼意思？", "created_at": "2024-12-30T14:02:24", "owner": "xinting369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950945619908658, "text": "我想起了一位朋友", "created_at": "2024-12-25T04:24:48", "owner": "yoolai_yao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338668432199226, "text": "我最喜歡跟姊妹當朋友", "created_at": "2024-12-23T10:27:31", "owner": "7_la.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030336791451432, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T08:08:05", "owner": "bainiaoji5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110648728437880, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T05:13:24", "owner": "teresaluv_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085742950555653, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-12-14T07:29:22", "owner": "liuh04784", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323028880091564, "text": "@timi__0817 @wang.pinhsiang0912 這我台南同學", "created_at": "2024-12-13T12:14:19", "owner": "steve.05421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028158014235987, "text": "懂了嗎哥布林們？", "created_at": "2024-12-09T12:36:23", "owner": "bella._408", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075226831609697, "text": "@wishwastaken_ 你有機會了", "created_at": "2024-11-29T02:21:14", "owner": "a.t_ime08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959312517834014, "text": "🗿我的刀呢", "created_at": "2024-11-27T13:12:02", "owner": "lol_05_liu12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048887753045475, "text": "@lcf_941210 你之前都在裝直男的聲音超好笑", "created_at": "2024-11-23T16:17:43", "owner": "line.oeo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359464600185455, "text": "😂😂笑死我干嘛啦", "created_at": "2024-11-21T07:12:24", "owner": "zhou.639", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064666225737550, "text": "心情不好的時候就是直男聲音😂", "created_at": "2024-11-16T11:22:20", "owner": "whappyeggegg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969991995798033, "text": "get✅", "created_at": "2024-11-15T01:20:18", "owner": "thestarlive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962996808702266, "text": "@lun._.0619 （猛男音）smart!!", "created_at": "2024-11-03T15:10:25", "owner": "yuuuugy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001283033691906, "text": "@ailifu", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:01:07", "owner": "iamwenjiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035495396252141, "text": "所以聲音都是裝的😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:24:43", "owner": "hahacharlie09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891724534097330, "text": "@love518914 這你", "created_at": "2024-10-29T15:20:37", "owner": "motoyu0616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922330641881671, "text": "what is the problem with just trying to say \"How is going\" tho", "created_at": "2024-10-25T01:17:09", "owner": "leonardcty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005668256662077, "text": "@enyuyeh @_b_i_n_g_j_i_e_", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:05:30", "owner": "1ixshen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855510298292647, "text": "所以我也是", "created_at": "2024-10-22T12:41:38", "owner": "skys.k.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929784096844352, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T09:09:08", "owner": "ivy.chen.95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104875243435244, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T22:26:20", "owner": "_hannnnnn22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280767565210162, "text": "@with_3tons @zimmerzhao 我不是这样的吧", "created_at": "2024-10-09T22:27:31", "owner": "hotaru1118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963513330802197, "text": "@cyj._.t_y 你會嗎", "created_at": "2024-10-03T14:28:27", "owner": "nuyy_0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980096301752476, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-02T08:47:28", "owner": "brian_9527_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043058297312636, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-10-01T00:32:39", "owner": "y.u.a.n_030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057347758751832, "text": "@shi_c.h", "created_at": "2024-09-30T12:16:04", "owner": "shichisgayis_son", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895553254073017, "text": "girlypop🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-29T01:06:14", "owner": "gk332692", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902416108025991, "text": "@mori_yc 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-27T13:32:55", "owner": "sid_9496", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021463715215333, "text": "不了解甲甲，但羨慕他們被女生喜歡", "created_at": "2024-09-27T09:08:46", "owner": "combater_2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056731360789612, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-27T02:45:06", "owner": "xiujie0217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046082443806368, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T17:03:43", "owner": "mingyouxi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18353324818136495, "text": "now a new word：girlypop", "created_at": "2024-09-21T23:18:42", "owner": "leoray530", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018107039271867, "text": "对大陆人来说，台湾国语的口音男的说出来就像姐妹", "created_at": "2024-09-20T17:09:04", "owner": "msb09188", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17875435875090846, "text": "@neverlandforever_0123 這你欸", "created_at": "2024-09-19T16:19:57", "owner": "4_civy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340090969135552, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T14:16:26", "owner": "groovehong_1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350838694139279, "text": "@apuopuo", "created_at": "2024-09-19T04:48:52", "owner": "leechenghua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063451426631358, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:58:55", "owner": "mike5335ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052347541836984, "text": "其實女生也不是針對直男，只是有些男生攻擊性太強，女生自我保衛機制會啟動，所以遇見彩虹朋友，就會放鬆、關閉警戒狀態，開始放飛自我😂", "created_at": "2024-09-14T08:10:15", "owner": "viviankim_s", "likes": 3176}, {"id": 18043635901972119, "text": "@beckyyuan0114", "created_at": "2024-09-14T04:10:23", "owner": "alannyoyo_840105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974435133769525, "text": "跟姐妹講話 雙手還要邊揮舞 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-14T02:02:49", "owner": "1120janie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461586457034738, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-13T14:44:33", "owner": "flame_d1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349796023139402, "text": "聲音可就可", "created_at": "2024-09-13T07:36:13", "owner": "yiqun.wang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042650282051292, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-12T10:35:19", "owner": "elky_yuen_1104", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065801476614656, "text": "Gary", "created_at": "2024-09-12T06:03:09", "owner": "jie._.oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283795789231576, "text": "@kai_xiang129", "created_at": "2024-09-11T19:43:51", "owner": "hihua_wei_5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986691975708400, "text": "他的 straight voice 也太迷人 😍", "created_at": "2024-09-11T14:10:18", "owner": "captaingeoffery", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18312665047094930, "text": "姐妹是什么🤔", "created_at": "2024-09-11T14:01:04", "owner": "muranqing7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843414877313094, "text": "太好笑了哈哈哈哈家", "created_at": "2024-09-11T13:15:45", "owner": "dijia5005", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865714732144208, "text": "我會😂", "created_at": "2024-09-11T10:11:47", "owner": "kt_iixiii_1231", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17932786370914837, "text": "@_ting._.517", "created_at": "2024-09-11T06:39:03", "owner": "1zuynu_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17945415326753387, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-11T02:33:45", "owner": "hikx0508y1008s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062136502646226, "text": "@lea.haeun", "created_at": "2024-09-10T17:42:41", "owner": "cesmoiedmond", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18339081709134408, "text": "😂 @josephjohnfong", "created_at": "2024-09-10T16:24:34", "owner": "lulubebe0905", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028183784255437, "text": "@daniel.lee.0621 每次我要傳給你 結果你都看過==", "created_at": "2024-09-10T15:25:55", "owner": "wyc_08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18329629135148072, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-10T09:33:04", "owner": "gooxxdy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328440661148235, "text": "What the …..", "created_at": "2024-09-09T23:12:17", "owner": "l_b_z__zhel", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041861005845226, "text": "現在在醫院跟別人講話尤其是跟護理師\n我都會變成廣播員的聲音\n跟客人講話會變可愛的聲音\n跟爸媽是低沈的聲音\n跟姐妹就是破麻的聲音\n每天對鏡子練習扮演好不同的自己", "created_at": "2024-09-09T22:50:53", "owner": "rh6_bl", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18046900714935249, "text": "這男的很像外國版何篤霖", "created_at": "2024-09-09T19:36:42", "owner": "marcotruez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18456646087021581, "text": "@leo3903903", "created_at": "2024-09-09T04:27:01", "owner": "m16479350", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075772408531799, "text": "@chunchin_ggyy 嘿", "created_at": "2024-09-09T04:21:37", "owner": "henryho0625", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18334898062121457, "text": "@benson.huang.7", "created_at": "2024-09-08T19:10:51", "owner": "yuuuu.629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876026755149051, "text": "@chengen9909", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:46:03", "owner": "easonnn1020", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075978361538196, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:21:22", "owner": "qq3223796", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18238761757279053, "text": "賽班", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:07:11", "owner": "a705184922601", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020464076594797, "text": "@boyce_01.26", "created_at": "2024-09-08T14:22:59", "owner": "timy.l_1107", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909237303921199, "text": "我都想用那種聲音說話，但是不行，因為我旁邊都是男的", "created_at": "2024-09-08T12:52:56", "owner": "zina.0316", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042030010991010, "text": "哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-09-08T10:58:55", "owner": "leoyoe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138646924355725, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-08T10:53:24", "owner": "zac945", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915576168896109, "text": "@fish90612 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-08T10:32:33", "owner": "kuokuola", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038274644495767, "text": "@suan1018_yeh", "created_at": "2024-09-08T10:29:50", "owner": "pinan.s_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889463299014699, "text": "前面兩句是預設值很正常", "created_at": "2024-09-08T00:11:14", "owner": "maraschino_blue", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17936071292791389, "text": "阿嘟", "created_at": "2024-09-07T19:32:47", "owner": "cym_0228", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18022383512522876, "text": "好難理解\n知道對方是姊妹馬上變親近？？？？", "created_at": "2024-09-07T16:40:17", "owner": "baasplf", "likes": 74}, {"id": 18056855089684057, "text": "前面那個抬頭好像肯尼", "created_at": "2024-09-07T16:11:07", "owner": "dear_bailey._", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18066426364528836, "text": "@ian.yen0924 這你", "created_at": "2024-09-07T16:00:58", "owner": "chenyou_929", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18029302061349023, "text": "服務業專業技能之一（眼神死）", "created_at": "2024-09-07T13:20:36", "owner": "chocpun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17992586927694771, "text": "@isaiahchengyc damn that’s how you spoke like girls", "created_at": "2024-09-07T12:40:56", "owner": "wen.kevin45", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17939106050863695, "text": "@milkchang0129 害我想到你", "created_at": "2024-09-07T12:31:49", "owner": "fish._.72798", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17888753016017493, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-07T12:15:07", "owner": "chung__su", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17907249390008451, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T11:52:32", "owner": "joannalin_356", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17921952458959453, "text": "跟姐妹講話就是要微蹲下再站直", "created_at": "2024-09-07T09:33:53", "owner": "0___oy.kolien", "likes": 2983}, {"id": 17949050237736117, "text": "接客戶電話vs接男友電話😍", "created_at": "2024-09-07T08:59:06", "owner": "karen813908", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17892223935073564, "text": "讓我想到小姐好白😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T05:44:20", "owner": "shan_shan9420", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18047181046927125, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T05:15:02", "owner": "jiangnanwilliam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901130317040111, "text": "哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-09-07T03:57:31", "owner": "hi_ja87", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059849533730009, "