{"media_id": 3440036607406159265, "shortcode": "C-9dxF-yLWh", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-9dxF-yLWh/", "taken_at": "2024-08-22T05:25:57", "caption": "網面鞋難洗？因為都是滲透性的頑固汙漬！教你輕松洗鞋#生活小常識 #汙漬輕松去除 #實用小技巧 #學會快去試試吧🔥 #洗鞋", "owner_username": "si.qinv", "owner_id": "68672495016", "likes": 63587, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0027_C-9dxF-yLWh\\C-9dxF-yLWh_20240822_052557.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18091070980530414, "text": "擠上「點」牙膏", "created_at": "2025-02-03T16:13:03", "owner": "yuri_02.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079753543594246, "text": "可以出帆布鞋嗎", "created_at": "2025-01-01T01:11:06", "owner": "yq._.1127", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936560766951324, "text": "有試過用硬幣 確實挺好用的 但很滑就是了", "created_at": "2024-12-20T15:43:13", "owner": "7741cui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056454640769217, "text": "@12345.rnnnn", "created_at": "2024-12-19T11:53:41", "owner": "yuxk7_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026498054616156, "text": "第一雙鞋是什麼？我想買問問看。", "created_at": "2024-12-14T14:59:04", "owner": "weixianhengwei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055905154898020, "text": "也是錢可以解決的問題", "created_at": "2024-12-04T10:47:39", "owner": "sbosbo2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288809101237515, "text": "因為不是要我花錢，所以我信😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:28:30", "owner": "zixuan4347", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864656833266184, "text": "我謝謝你 我洗完鞋子才滑到💀", "created_at": "2024-11-23T23:41:59", "owner": "7zxuiy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048371152850095, "text": "看起來真好吃😋", "created_at": "2024-11-14T12:51:24", "owner": "nicholasmacartney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026106482192644, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-02T04:22:02", "owner": "choqueenacho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002895128509879, "text": "我都用洗衣粉", "created_at": "2024-10-26T00:19:05", "owner": "freeven.menspalais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027766856379933, "text": "GT CUT 2", "created_at": "2024-10-19T05:47:50", "owner": "akwb_15_7ouok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024031826590418, "text": "嗯......\n億點", "created_at": "2024-10-03T06:47:54", "owner": "ella.121.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879518836130666, "text": "橡膠白涼鞋髒掉怎麼洗？", "created_at": "2024-09-11T13:19:19", "owner": "xiaozi_kaiki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925217712843261, "text": "怎麼突然變另外一雙了呢 🤡", "created_at": "2024-09-08T11:27:35", "owner": "ericzaiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056047477750120, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-07T12:15:34", "owner": "bxuan__1128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18457458463014462, "text": "Gt cut2", "created_at": "2024-09-06T03:16:54", "owner": "jchym.122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141906055340699, "text": "贝壳头怎么洗啊", "created_at": "2024-09-05T19:55:43", "owner": "abulebutterfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047021740902144, "text": "第一隻鞋子你倒是刷給我看看啊？換掉才示範是什麼意思😂", "created_at": "2024-09-05T03:55:45", "owner": "stay0989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002350514646558, "text": "收藏從未停止 行動從未開始", "created_at": "2024-09-01T13:41:39", "owner": "five030529", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18050157316921077, "text": "剪牙刷🔥 我沒想到過。 👍🔥", "created_at": "2024-08-31T21:04:19", "owner": "edmondcchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004550804455444, "text": "運鏡看得很暈", "created_at": "2024-08-31T19:20:54", "owner": "zxvqdz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089028232482689, "text": "擠“點”牙膏", "created_at": "2024-08-31T16:40:29", "owner": "yuk_417_", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18020802683454247, "text": "他的牙膏好螢光", "created_at": "2024-08-31T16:31:32", "owner": "_2rhqb", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18241364821279890, "text": "鞋子剛丟才知道😢", "created_at": "2024-08-31T12:42:44", "owner": "alice.__.1016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18221708719303864, "text": "你長得好像某餐酒館的老闆", "created_at": "2024-08-31T11:46:32", "owner": "12s_xv50_camry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18452618803065348, "text": "然後硬幣就乾淨了", "created_at": "2024-08-31T08:45:50", "owner": "1_.xyu_", "likes": 136}, {"id": 17869943679177014, "text": "要哪種牙膏？  敏感性專用的那種嗎？", "created_at": "2024-08-30T18:20:51", "owner": "fourteen0520", "likes": 85}, {"id": 17978969228743975, "text": "你這背景太假了", "created_at": "2024-08-30T16:01:14", "owner": "unknowaccount0000000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266955046243756, "text": "@ixweiz0 你很詼諧", "created_at": "2024-08-30T10:34:11", "owner": "huijie._0410", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912427011994965, "text": "已購買，小孩很愛吃", "created_at": "2024-08-30T04:33:37", "owner": "huang90617", "likes": 318}, {"id": 17853380208222993, "text": "那塗在你的臉上有用嗎", "created_at": "2024-08-29T22:47:25", "owner": "xiroxcn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18039981239055087, "text": "牙膏除了牙齒刷不白其他都刷得白", "created_at": "2024-08-29T17:40:15", "owner": "scs_.xzokor", "likes": 639}, {"id": 17893670970068677, "text": "用藍威寶", "created_at": "2024-08-29T13:49:47", "owner": "ansonchung8_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963328182664887, "text": "好好對待G.T cut", "created_at": "2024-08-29T10:14:44", "owner": "1cyl_hj77", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18038952209076983, "text": "反正我都丟洗衣機洗🤣 那麼麻煩幹嘛", "created_at": "2024-08-29T10:02:46", "owner": "abele_wang", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18038493953118088, "text": "是不是有換一隻", "created_at": "2024-08-29T09:00:39", "owner": "0117.lulu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936575556902791, "text": "那如果斜邊是毛的勒", "created_at": "2024-08-29T07:56:53", "owner": "hpq_042", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845537998275261, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-29T07:13:46", "owner": "tls._.1023", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043305371305035, "text": "對照組跟實驗組不一樣比個洨", "created_at": "2024-08-29T04:59:31", "owner": "wrcccccccccccc", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18329916415183077, "text": "用洗衣粉/球洗尼龍材質也很好洗", "created_at": "2024-08-29T01:44:43", "owner": "liumpp__", "likes": 81}, {"id": 18101620600433416, "text": "水洗鞋子不是比較容易壞嗎", "created_at": "2024-08-29T01:43:02", "owner": "lu_yinci", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18047409085907363, "text": "你倒是用同一雙鞋示範啊", "created_at": "2024-08-28T23:38:56", "owner": "rabbit.y.lll", "likes": 1807}, {"id": 17868468015177756, "text": "牙膏出來刷牙其他都很好用", "created_at": "2024-08-28T18:32:35", "owner": "aden990227", "likes": 3260}, {"id": 18087024622454238, "text": "Ksos", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:05:08", "owner": "jason.h_0922", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["生活小常識", "汙漬輕松去除", "實用小技巧", "學會快去試試吧", "洗鞋"]},
{"media_id": 3334245552625934616, "shortcode": "C5FnqoeMeEY", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C5FnqoeMeEY/", "taken_at": "2024-03-29T06:19:25", "caption": "留学生精神状态be like #chinatown #chinatownnyc #comedy", "owner_username": "wild.nomi", "owner_id": "58518152962", "likes": 7460, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0028_C5FnqoeMeEY\\C5FnqoeMeEY_20240329_061925.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18320803546194051, "text": "Flushin toilet🙌", "created_at": "2024-08-31T21:42:11", "owner": "theres2chinas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130585957322730, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-10T03:35:23", "owner": "seanwu520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245857129265465, "text": "I'm finding food, Chinese, hotpot，red soup", "created_at": "2024-08-03T00:20:15", "owner": "terry_that_chigga", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915525480954687, "text": "Flushing is 驻马店 at most", "created_at": "2024-07-04T15:52:07", "owner": "kurtmli", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17949340430804143, "text": "To be honest, didn’t get it", "created_at": "2024-07-02T10:13:43", "owner": "dudu_down2ride", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18008274833305628, "text": "Agree", "created_at": "2024-06-26T12:14:28", "owner": "sumyte_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024118844220272, "text": "hhhhhhh", "created_at": "2024-06-25T22:34:20", "owner": "root__ii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859667254178512, "text": "pronounced as = frussing 😮", "created_at": "2024-06-23T02:54:58", "owner": "chuchero_world", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032728387882864, "text": "I love u 😍🔥🙌👏", "created_at": "2024-06-21T22:40:22", "owner": "franchescorunner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026262698330068, "text": "I never seen a thing more true😂😂", "created_at": "2024-06-19T02:11:37", "owner": "wickedfoodz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006618908534445, "text": "移民局看着这个视频陷入了沉思", "created_at": "2024-06-18T15:33:42", "owner": "huangjiancheng45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082431445470040, "text": "$150", "created_at": "2024-06-17T21:58:52", "owner": "tibet.pro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929444379885247, "text": "Drunken hotties in Chinatown 🔥👏😍", "created_at": "2024-06-17T20:19:28", "owner": "wang_mang_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012183806213379, "text": "Yep your right and mayb more like 东北", "created_at": "2024-06-17T13:06:31", "owner": "mr.story93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047555923766621, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-06-16T13:08:11", "owner": "k.cesar_international", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961408473775014, "text": "我的精神状态比这差多了", "created_at": "2024-06-16T01:14:48", "owner": "jimmy.zhou.77312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044609968834145, "text": "Dont date YT boys", "created_at": "2024-06-16T00:45:17", "owner": "jefflaw168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273258952230434, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-06-15T13:48:42", "owner": "mbil.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855966565193041, "text": "I love Flushing", "created_at": "2024-06-15T13:45:22", "owner": "ai2050.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904294707987248, "text": "Flushtown", "created_at": "2024-06-15T12:31:21", "owner": "varinnaths", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027885506482621, "text": "Lmfao i mean", "created_at": "2024-06-15T12:22:24", "owner": "yaliketopgun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032527778002098, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-06-14T23:21:01", "owner": "shortydude95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069914134521679, "text": "Обожаю азиатские районы Нью Йорка❤️❤️❤️Там можно купить все что я так полюбила в путешествиях по юго-восточной Азии! Поесть вкусную еду. Но иногда пожилые леди в магазинах шипят на меня на рынке😀", "created_at": "2024-06-14T18:53:10", "owner": "ulala_alter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011319311395915, "text": "True", "created_at": "2024-06-14T17:55:36", "owner": "ima1ing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125386951360501, "text": "Fashion btw guys lol", "created_at": "2024-06-14T13:58:30", "owner": "antonlau95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877315768093029, "text": "很唐", "created_at": "2024-06-14T10:13:04", "owner": "ysj5548", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024656687178833, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_