, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-04-21T06:01:40", "owner": "knightriderralph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006005732219719, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-04-20T16:53:27", "owner": "amigo.jm15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032992177909693, "text": "She’s not wrong", "created_at": "2024-04-20T14:43:55", "owner": "v_breezzyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010379741148235, "text": "I love Asians", "created_at": "2024-04-19T14:27:35", "owner": "itsyaboiiskeemo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015538148248671, "text": "這些中國人移民或者留學生把這些地方生活的跟在中國一樣。。。", "created_at": "2024-04-19T00:28:34", "owner": "taipi0826", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18223225120276206, "text": "Where in Flushing is Chinatown???😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-04-19T00:13:54", "owner": "wonto.n303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035823643856634, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2024-04-18T19:57:10", "owner": "whitef30_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052693912610206, "text": "Yo soy de floshing", "created_at": "2024-04-18T18:19:57", "owner": "juliounda7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991557741632121, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-04-18T11:26:35", "owner": "luis.ruiton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049053259717517, "text": "She’s right u know, but I hang in 8th Ave a lot in bk", "created_at": "2024-04-18T08:50:38", "owner": "ihazseoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014183384515644, "text": "❤️🔥so cute", "created_at": "2024-04-17T21:28:33", "owner": "alexy.luis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907763820859610, "text": "Sorry, but flushing is Korean Main Street is China 😜", "created_at": "2024-04-17T17:41:53", "owner": "i_donzah", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18317446663127436, "text": "She's not totally wrong", "created_at": "2024-04-17T12:29:26", "owner": "jessebuenolovera", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17855160441128140, "text": "Bring me to your favorite restaurant in Flushing. I’m paying.", "created_at": "2024-04-17T11:16:18", "owner": "2_scoops_of_chillin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285422209162529, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-04-17T02:26:29", "owner": "roverhandyman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18235841653248922, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-04-16T16:01:58", "owner": "danielreal_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162934156307192, "text": "Wait does China have “USA town” or something 😂😂 that would be baller in my books", "created_at": "2024-04-16T05:18:15", "owner": "xmill_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998805057576659, "text": "🤡", "created_at": "2024-04-16T00:44:31", "owner": "mr.mute_dum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066116497507310, "text": "😮Ooooo I see", "created_at": "2024-04-15T21:22:51", "owner": "vipulruless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024312143085223, "text": "Ok relax", "created_at": "2024-04-15T12:59:04", "owner": "pardhumanapragada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857636392147742, "text": "Is China 20 years ago", "created_at": "2024-04-14T19:13:36", "owner": "fd_stalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012333602348981, "text": "Facts", "created_at": "2024-04-14T05:00:02", "owner": "jaykwon13photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959018235751847, "text": "哈哈 事实！", "created_at": "2024-04-12T03:52:57", "owner": "yesdoshi", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17937760916815707, "text": "But flushing is corean town", "created_at": "2024-04-11T13:06:27", "owner": "babysugarsnake", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17913583838830971, "text": "6", "created_at": "2024-04-10T04:53:19", "owner": "2wz24839294y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867043543057586, "text": "好疯狂", "created_at": "2024-04-09T19:49:17", "owner": "itolftb5273", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054868306595374, "text": "Fuzhou Town", "created_at": "2024-04-09T15:29:28", "owner": "_oscarivan", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["chinatown", "chinatownnyc", "comedy"]},
{"media_id": 3440185586615658388, "shortcode": "C-9_pBrpSeU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-9_pBrpSeU/", "taken_at": "2024-08-22T10:22:57", "caption": "Which One’s FASTER? Samsung QuickShare vs AirDrop \n\n-\n@samsungmobileusa @apple #quickshare #airdrop #samsungquickshare #tech", "owner_username": "createdbyella", "owner_id": "1619546577", "likes": 46337, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0029_C-9_pBrpSeU\\C-9_pBrpSeU_20240822_102257.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17886584775237834, "text": "The both phone that falls💀", "created_at": "2025-04-01T13:32:40", "owner": "itsmetankk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093753958527316, "text": "Are we not gonna talk about the way she looks like that one girl in black pink?", "created_at": "2025-02-26T20:47:21", "owner": "kelmolang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052191053138964, "text": "I tried to quick share to my MacBook but it didn’t work", "created_at": "2025-02-17T16:07:08", "owner": "hajirkh99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144354091329096, "text": "8 secods ain’t gonna do shit.", "created_at": "2025-02-11T16:12:20", "owner": "sven_stancek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037365725432580, "text": "Redmagic >>>>", "created_at": "2025-02-11T12:10:56", "owner": "unbidmeteor1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058771475313085, "text": "Bro i just heard apple cracking 🤔", "created_at": "2025-02-08T12:08:01", "owner": "mind_of_revenge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18303651601228750, "text": "@stb.dny", "created_at": "2025-02-01T15:59:35", "owner": "milosi.alexandru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372576190190864, "text": "But airdrop works without internet", "created_at": "2025-01-28T18:39:00", "owner": "eggert_simon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371506789190393, "text": "Huawei: what this Asian girl do? Sony: idk man...", "created_at": "2025-01-26T07:57:20", "owner": "vinerz_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044731058237122, "text": "8 seconds will not kill you btw 💀", "created_at": "2025-01-25T23:25:46", "owner": "lbouloud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045440675515874, "text": "Quick share is also on AOSP, if memory serves", "created_at": "2025-01-06T01:53:28", "owner": "unsignedlonglongint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374457946119343, "text": "Bruh it's just 8 sec", "created_at": "2025-01-05T14:02:13", "owner": "5star_jonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067285720757271, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-02T09:56:14", "owner": "littleberri0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18131469610378692, "text": "iPhone users really don't understand the difference b/w operating system features and UI features.", "created_at": "2025-01-02T06:23:09", "owner": "legendary_wave_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078727930596248, "text": "Depends on connections strength and quality of internet but I still choose Android because it is flexible on my daily use and my work", "created_at": "2024-12-25T18:17:49", "owner": "neroroses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082804726570228, "text": "Fake AirDrop Never needs 28s 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2024-12-23T09:31:26", "owner": "alexander.gulevski24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062885734831621, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-20T00:07:16", "owner": "jordanjakirk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073107049715865, "text": "Samsung ruin the quality in video and photo while Apple not", "created_at": "2024-12-17T15:23:59", "owner": "m4t3kaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893283889079556, "text": "se le cayeronn", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:25:04", "owner": "manu.rb519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033749165136113, "text": "\"So(-2000$) follow to see Wich one survives better\"", "created_at": "2024-12-14T16:06:24", "owner": "magical._.nugget", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040661999225118, "text": "Dont compare apple and samsung apple doesnt even make their phones its made by 15+ companies its screen and chip are made by samsung", "created_at": "2024-12-14T11:37:34", "owner": "el1te00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049151657493282, "text": "Quick share isn't Samsung's feature", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:03:18", "owner": "ayxn.era", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331881133156208, "text": "Android let's you control.\nIPHONE controls you!\nsimple as that", "created_at": "2024-12-11T05:23:16", "owner": "mbcjr.lens", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18313534912165602, "text": "Fact! ANDROID lets you to control while APPLE controls you", "created_at": "2024-12-11T05:20:25", "owner": "mbcjr.lens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892547980102967, "text": "The phones falling in the final 😫", "created_at": "2024-12-11T04:21:37", "owner": "bernardo___ventura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049457813042024, "text": "IPhone you can hack with any android so iPhone isn't that secure", "created_at": "2024-12-07T15:03:15", "owner": "massi.vedong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056739958937139, "text": "Old tech what's new...", "created_at": "2024-12-05T19:59:33", "owner": "d.a.g8527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915387640013512, "text": "Iphone has more gb", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:39:19", "owner": "simon_marak21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083625616486123, "text": "Obv the apple survived 😍", "created_at": "2024-12-04T19:01:36", "owner": "javormatemate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061805362836081, "text": "Samsung is on wifi and iPhone on data just look up 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T06:18:33", "owner": "luckeronisek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290673256231733, "text": "iPhone is the toilet 🚽", "created_at": "2024-12-03T13:14:06", "owner": "chloe__amry__864", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030211361595824, "text": "@malikzeeshan5596", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:46:38", "owner": "abdullah.sidhu_112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001242572701712, "text": "Nah ima use Bluetooth", "created_at": "2024-11-27T08:24:51", "owner": "w.nhklz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040703210179692, "text": "Samsung Galaxy 🔥🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:34:55", "owner": "qualcossa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250921186275951, "text": "And she's not even using the newest samsung but she's using the newest", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:43:29", "owner": "47notforu48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885823618075603, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:43:03", "owner": "47notforu48", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081073144562215, "text": "Both are great! I have a iPhone 15 Pro Max and a Samsung S24+ ... I love both as they both at each their own .. no \"war\" between for me", "created_at": "2024-11-18T16:16:14", "owner": "huynhdai123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064714990687017, "text": "Apple made Infra back and sold as a 'new technology' 😅😅", "created_at": "2024-11-11T10:27:47", "owner": "lboti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386181070096637, "text": "That is the closest I've seen an iPhone winning..man that is one terrible phone...", "created_at": "2024-11-10T21:48:19", "owner": "xpnzv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966430218684252, "text": "SAMSUNG 🖤🤍💚➡️➡️➡️", "created_at": "2024-11-10T00:47:42", "owner": "anna_pimenova55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048131264000153, "text": "LORD SAMSUNG ☠🤘🏻📈🙌🏻💀🙏🏻💪🏻✌🏻👏🏻☝🏻👍🏻🗿", "created_at": "2024-11-06T20:00:11", "owner": "i_kruti.7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956040072730056, "text": "\"Pay to lose\" aahhhhh Apple phone", "created_at": "2024-11-06T16:12:05", "owner": "gean._.victor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18271008091221846, "text": "But in classic messages iPhone is faster. And here,  we can see, How iPhone give you a tipe to do a short AirDrop. That is not fare.", "created_at": "2024-11-03T13:16:19", "owner": "martinprotrend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983878677765297, "text": "It's Google quick share not samsung...", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:28:09", "owner": "tribromooctaoxide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867761944234198, "text": "Google pixel>> iPhone", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:55:28", "owner": "matejkalifts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060479563696393, "text": "Samsung survived to the drop💀", "created_at": "2024-10-27T17:40:20", "owner": "the_peteers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046313753062685, "text": "Don't buy Samsung, there's a green line issue on my S22 Ultra and worst customer service 👎 switching to iphone", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:13:49", "owner": "fluxtation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888525895103204, "text": "What amazes me is iPhone users defending how they spend more money for a phone with power performance. They think because they spend more buying an iPhone they have a better deal. 😂😂😂 If only they know how much they have been brainwashed.", "created_at": "2024-10-22T20:57:16", "owner": "yangamann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133672435366333, "text": "P", "created_at": "2024-10-19T18:50:02", "owner": "reallysmeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887688094100758, "text": "Samsung  S24", "created_at": "2024-10-19T12:52:53", "owner": "software_engineer207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078519973553523, "text": "quick share literally never worked when i had my samsung 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T21:00:59", "owner": "biossomrosee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023671169208855, "text": "No air drop is fast", "created_at": "2024-10-13T18:52:09", "owner": "ali_world_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037597129976529, "text": "*Android quickshare.... samsung ≠ Android.... it's just the dominant Android brand", "created_at": "2024-10-13T07:46:31", "owner": "desparenzo_akash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079005601483122, "text": "@kumailrazas", "created_at": "2024-10-11T17:55:54", "owner": "abhishekkhatale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044236706483506, "text": "Quick Share is an Android feature, not a Samsung exclusive", "created_at": "2024-10-09T13:04:18", "owner": "windows_vista38.v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015352658619431, "text": "Ecosystem no more", "created_at": "2024-10-09T07:03:03", "owner": "farulan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959218206704617, "text": "Does Samsung own it?", "created_at": "2024-10-08T00:56:06", "owner": "rglumampao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084403633507134, "text": "I guess the fancy animation makes it slower", "created_at": "2024-10-06T14:02:45", "owner": "pierre45mp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064228243590600, "text": "Quick Share was exclusive to Samsung before. It was called Nearby Share for all Androids, but to avoid confusion, they decided just Quick Share for all Androids. It is just a little more optimized in speed for Samsung-to-Samsung transfers, though.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T06:57:15", "owner": "rayambler7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865626157220531, "text": "Samsunggg❤️😂>>>>>>>>>", "created_at": "2024-10-05T16:11:27", "owner": "jyothsna_d_jagannath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018576797613668, "text": "Samsung bap hai", "created_at": "2024-10-05T14:34:56", "owner": "sonusingh2041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965725944801825, "text": "Eh, airdrop is more convenient tho. I like my samsung but Apple has the convinience down to a since.", "created_at": "2024-10-04T11:47:06", "owner": "david.herzog.912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940780719897239, "text": "Repeat the test with the phones not close to each other. (Distance Between iPhone and Samsung) thus should make the quickshare even faster because less interference from the iPhones waves", "created_at": "2024-10-04T10:36:06", "owner": "ot_boneo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917702382896352, "text": "Try processing and editing video 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T05:44:47", "owner": "cb_xgl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063381703729986, "text": "We all knew the answer to this.", "created_at": "2024-10-04T02:49:30", "owner": "willthenightowl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040670411112457, "text": "Apple users are just creating their own proudness because they think they spend more money than Samsung phone so they think they are getting more features but in fact it's just less cost effective", "created_at": "2024-10-03T17:51:13", "owner": "memoriesindulge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859351303204880, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-03T14:24:13", "owner": "b81o0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064082704644696, "text": "Drop test in the same reel", "created_at": "2024-10-03T12:15:00", "owner": "_vishal.varma__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007949312446803, "text": "People still trying to defend themselves for not buying an Android", "created_at": "2024-10-03T04:09:19", "owner": "lambritooo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024867044167678, "text": "Doesn't matter any of these, people love wasting money 😅🥂", "created_at": "2024-10-02T21:25:02", "owner": "nhazmaroto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050497300917254, "text": "New apple airdrop is an 2012 Samsung innovation 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-02T17:31:24", "owner": "yann_bfrtn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022168667212274, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-02T10:34:44", "owner": "jasmine_hllo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041241941024866, "text": "Again iphone users will cry", "created_at": "2024-10-02T09:11:20", "owner": "wesleyvermeulen1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041408903023979, "text": "I think it was samsung s3, which came out in 2012 it has a feature called a s beam witch allowed 2 phone to shair files by contact.", "created_at": "2024-10-02T04:58:13", "owner": "prawinparajuli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021969815407833, "text": "Samsung 🔥👑", "created_at": "2024-10-01T18:19:39", "owner": "vivek____payyoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952395153842644, "text": "IPhone for jokers😂", "created_at": "2024-10-01T16:02:19", "owner": "akhwf_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093594457472518, "text": "iPhone is crab", "created_at": "2024-10-01T13:29:16", "owner": "heyamderrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944691492767112, "text": "Doesn't matter because i don't have money for both", "created_at": "2024-10-01T05:21:50", "owner": "jekykik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018948023289506, "text": "Samsung always wins", "created_at": "2024-09-30T22:07:02", "owner": "iamzanku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068663491715702, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-30T13:20:47", "owner": "ldgjulius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008713514431509, "text": "Android > ios", "created_at": "2024-09-29T18:21:15", "owner": "artur.cpagricola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031110437464177, "text": "iOS users cryy about it", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:38:31", "owner": "arnab_619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017811194298499, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-29T09:21:00", "owner": "seyitcigit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981946680603850, "text": "Airdrop works between my Mac and any portable device. Case closed.", "created_at": "2024-09-29T08:43:09", "owner": "michail.30fyllidis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033771338014948, "text": "Who tf uses Quickshare💀", "created_at": "2024-09-29T04:38:36", "owner": "julian___brt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18037944563173200, "text": "Aaaand thats a cracked apple screen", "created_at": "2024-09-28T23:19:43", "owner": "bababamppqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078157099548675, "text": "https://t.me/Binance_Moonbix_bot/start?startApp=ref_6976915223&startapp=ref_6976915223&utm_medium=web_share_copy", "created_at": "2024-09-27T17:19:09", "owner": "abhi_y_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039186220906313, "text": "Can i airdrop without network?", "created_at": "2024-09-27T12:40:55", "owner": "jian_05_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138210595361628, "text": "Let's also see which phone shattered. Lol", "created_at": "2024-09-26T21:56:03", "owner": "my2ndact_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926928222841199, "text": "Samsung also have tap share. If I remember correctly.", "created_at": "2024-09-26T19:03:14", "owner": "flowing_nelson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161098567315698, "text": "Samsung are universal givers, iPhones are universal collectors", "created_at": "2024-09-25T23:19:38", "owner": "davidaen_initiative", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18006077408645413, "text": "@akash_udekaran @karanvirr_kataria @jagtar_baidwan1313 @harman.o6 see", "created_at": "2024-09-25T10:15:34", "owner": "varun.khanna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963463764677500, "text": "Iphone users---->i have an apple logo. I have an apple logo. I have an apple logo. Samsung and other android users----> Ok....we have better features.", "created_at": "2024-09-25T00:14:41", "owner": "hariantoteach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053210329868731, "text": "Samsung legend❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-24T16:06:47", "owner": "rajat_4994_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897371202987698, "text": "Its just phones, quit fighting over them 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-24T14:28:07", "owner": "hananshahid22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461565490034207, "text": "Quickshare isn't good with pc", "created_at": "2024-09-24T07:56:05", "owner": "notanxket", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043798654994208, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-24T05:20:03", "owner": "mrlauhk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17941710497901342, "text": "Sometimes is slow quick share in pixel phone", "created_at": "2024-09-23T22:02:13", "owner": "omar_m.z_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343121821193944, "text": "quick share is actually better. Air drop is just unhygienic feature", "created_at": "2024-09-23T17:21:55", "owner": "jammertoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011311016354909, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-22T14:13:37", "owner": "munther_alawadh", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["quickshare", "airdrop", "samsungquickshare", "tech"]},
