ext": "每个男生都说过的话：你听我解释", "created_at": "2024-09-30T04:38:04", "owner": "hkyung0409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269087635300641, "text": "籃球比較好玩因為他在床上練運球", "created_at": "2024-09-27T05:56:36", "owner": "rsvm.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879439906137761, "text": "@farristi 必須分享給你", "created_at": "2024-09-26T18:31:13", "owner": "fgacbbacb_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033947957185980, "text": "女色 22號 😢", "created_at": "2024-09-26T18:26:50", "owner": "dietnamishomeland2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297894952203089, "text": "没打掉😂我被掉在电风扇过😂", "created_at": "2024-09-26T13:20:08", "owner": "jw._.925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056521471771772, "text": "不止篮球 还有游戏", "created_at": "2024-09-26T05:33:42", "owner": "emm8lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006666038449189, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈 沒打掉", "created_at": "2024-09-25T05:53:17", "owner": "nicha_07280716swiftie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026435135129536, "text": "不識好歹，籃球比女人好玩多了", "created_at": "2024-09-24T16:00:48", "owner": "yzjh_1304jayden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887124802036283, "text": "@1_unyn", "created_at": "2024-09-24T10:11:19", "owner": "_.yi22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857154397256929, "text": "已读乱回", "created_at": "2024-09-24T07:35:33", "owner": "dotjudges", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17909043686932229, "text": "我的嗎是啥毀😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T13:29:48", "owner": "justinhsu123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090754519438560, "text": "看似什麼都沒說但什麼都說了👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-23T11:28:05", "owner": "_zgm.01__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17849851242264348, "text": "沒說但都說了😂😂（最後）", "created_at": "2024-09-22T02:22:14", "owner": "ywu29595", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17969697431648726, "text": "已讀亂回", "created_at": "2024-09-21T10:14:18", "owner": "minrina_4611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927643584947578, "text": "中國真的很多人才😍👏👏👏😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-21T05:51:55", "owner": "yuu030", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18057683260752460, "text": "此时无声胜有声👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-20T11:18:39", "owner": "azusachan5191", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852731050241104, "text": "@180.87cm", "created_at": "2024-09-19T14:13:35", "owner": "_y.xl__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908931646001423, "text": "你用什麼手機？ 我安分守己", "created_at": "2024-09-18T15:14:38", "owner": "ruei_0830", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034290638177380, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-18T11:06:27", "owner": "joelai99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921435861867704, "text": "那個精油開背就是22號吧？", "created_at": "2024-09-17T17:39:58", "owner": "iceetnj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041043608293606, "text": "最後一個無聲勝有聲", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:14:20", "owner": "xzj._.0902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041025416072438, "text": "aikun", "created_at": "2024-09-17T02:34:57", "owner": "blkt.0825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086233951498002, "text": "还是没翻出来😢", "created_at": "2024-09-16T18:39:16", "owner": "clothgowncrazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971268957787362, "text": "沒打掉那個是我", "created_at": "2024-09-16T16:40:18", "owner": "alicechu0831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102693040437838, "text": "22號是什麼？", "created_at": "2024-09-15T14:14:34", "owner": "sabakouwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000429317663788, "text": "小玉", "created_at": "2024-09-14T08:44:36", "owner": "duston.99526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249128620265952, "text": "@waa33_16", "created_at": "2024-09-14T01:54:52", "owner": "romantic_0418", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886461061031566, "text": "網戀什麼都問了就沒問性別臥槽？", "created_at": "2024-09-11T11:52:33", "owner": "una_leo_le", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309773242088909, "text": "你喜欢的明星在干什么 吃牢饭💀", "created_at": "2024-09-11T01:18:33", "owner": "guojiangjian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940042362896685, "text": "八仙过海各显神通啊", "created_at": "2024-09-11T00:14:53", "owner": "kongcheng_tyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050950732892258, "text": "@zongwen.x", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:40:20", "owner": "fox10330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843692377303995, "text": "妳要當媽媽了，她回：是我的嗎？\n不大對啊，應該是爸爸是誰😅", "created_at": "2024-09-09T00:42:49", "owner": "aboola5478", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973804329772542, "text": "好快乐", "created_at": "2024-09-08T13:16:11", "owner": "spender994", "likes": 0}, {"