{"media_id": 3431909671856327017, "shortcode": "C-gl6ncOUlp", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-gl6ncOUlp/", "taken_at": "2024-08-11T00:24:44", "caption": "Wondering about the benefits of this ancient practice? Coffee enemas ☕️💩 have been around for centuries, and are gaining popularity in the wellness world because of their unique and powerful biohacking benefits 🧬🙌🏻✨\n\nSo what can they help you with? 🤷‍♀️Essentially during a coffee enema the caffeine stimulates your body to produce around 700x your normally glutathione (master antioxidant detoxifier) in your body. \n\n👉🏼Glutathione is in every cell of your body and can help with tissue repair, aging, immune system, removing heavy metals and neutralising free radical cells.🧬 coffee enemas also dialate the liver bile ducts, increasing bile flow and opening up the bowels after for a release so to remove the toxic materials. 🚮\n\nBasically a super charged liver detox - a coffee enema almost acts as a form of dialysis helping the liver to cleanse the blood 🩸 more efficiently. Pretty amazing from just an upside down cuppa right? ☕️ (keep in mind it must be the correct coffee - we only use the Happy Bum Beans as they are organic, mold & toxin free)\n\nSo what can a coffee enema help you with? Here are some benefits you may experience from doing this regularly. 👇🏼\n\n1. Clearer skin - 👋🏼bye acne \n2. Mental clarity - hello focus\n3. Immediate constipation & bloating relief 💩🙌🏻\n4. Improved pelvic floor tone \n5. Increased energy levels 🤸\n6. Decreased sugar cravings \n7. Less anxiety 🧘🏼‍♀️ better moods\n8. Less period pain and balanced hormones 🌸\n9. Improved hormonal symptoms - menopause/PMS\n10. Less migraines and headache relief\n\nPain relief 💥is another big one that people report from chronic illnesses such as #fibromyalgia and #arthritis . Coffee enemas are also a part of the Gerson therapy which provides an alternative approach to cancer and disease treatment.\n\nSo if you are interested in the biohacking space or needing support and looking for natural options - this is an absolute must try! 🙌🏻 For more info and the link to our best selling bundle comment the word “HBDETOX” below and we’ll send you the link! 😍\n\nAlready love coffee enemas? drop a ☕️❤️ below!👇🏼 \n\n#coffeeenema #detox #guthealth #biohacking #biohackingsecrets #happybumco #naturalhealing", "owner_username": "happybumco", "owner_id": "12573722977", "likes": 126173, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0033_C-gl6ncOUlp\\C-gl6ncOUlp_20240811_002444.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17854474374608769, "text": "Can you use organic coffee beans? Or does it have to be enema coffee? Anybody? Lol", "created_at": "2026-01-15T17:06:49", "owner": "1g_a_32h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981265221954386, "text": "Hbdetox", "created_at": "2026-01-09T13:02:19", "owner": "mihailovichfamily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295813453280558, "text": "No to hanging bags, tubing, clamps.  Not very many people have the flexibility and dexterity to lie on a bathroom floor.  Bottoms Up Enemas-Reusable 10 oz enema bottle with therapeutic packets allows users to customize their own enema blends.  Purchase on Amazon or bottomsupenemas.com", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:16:59", "owner": "bottomsup_enemas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129895660489690, "text": "https://www.corvitalhealth.com/?rfsn=8887608.764f52\n\nHere is a link to the coffee and kit that works great for me!", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:23:18", "owner": "_maria.jimena_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894134785204123, "text": "HBDETOX", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:13:31", "owner": "jshinar333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394557838193930, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-21T06:33:29", "owner": "blooming.gut_health", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995469672828668, "text": "Gnarly😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-09-20T22:15:58", "owner": "spacetrousers", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865700398452613, "text": "Desperation.  You need a better medical team", "created_at": "2025-09-17T19:32:54", "owner": "alextorontopharmacist", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18091503085788089, "text": "HBDETOX", "created_at": "2025-09-11T10:55:13", "owner": "simplyaestheticsclinic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049443854634310, "text": "Underpin", "created_at": "2025-09-03T04:07:04", "owner": "ndesireec3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355606801080545, "text": "HBDetox", "created_at": "2025-08-29T20:22:05", "owner": "becc_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018669662749640, "text": "HBDETOX", "created_at": "2025-08-13T22:26:33", "owner": "regulation.with.anastasia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992934654816432, "text": "Hbdetox", "created_at": "2025-07-26T06:45:40", "owner": "pepepetruska", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978761061854854, "text": "You know, I was asked to leave Starbucks the other day. All I did was ask for a coffee enema. They wayy overreacted. You'd think that girl in the drive thru had never seen a butt before.😂😂 sheeze", "created_at": "2025-07-25T21:58:45", "owner": "stevenpeterson421", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18082980088878571, "text": "Underpin", "created_at": "2025-07-25T14:22:12", "owner": "salbee19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104881555548563, "text": "Hbdetox", "created_at": "2025-07-15T18:08:52", "owner": "lymphwell.life", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911227324167568, "text": "Hbdetox", "created_at": "2025-07-10T16:59:38", "owner": "carolgladyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030843245690909, "text": "Hbdetox", "created_at": "2025-07-07T23:43:29", "owner": "kellydcunningham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087978490678828, "text": "Hbdetox", "created_at": "2025-07-03T15:29:59", "owner": "livinlife_court", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055902824360784, "text": "Hbdetox", "created_at": "2025-07-01T01:16:17", "owner": "malschmit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065428535125442, "text": "I was asked to leave Starbucks the other day. The nerve of these people. All I did is ask for a coffee enema. They wayy overreacted. You would think have thought that girl in the Drive-Thru had never seen a butt before. Sheesh\n #coffeeenema", "created_at": "2025-06-27T08:28:15", "owner": "stevenpeterson421", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17853737001464784, "text": "But why", "created_at": "2025-06-23T10:29:09", "owner": "thestar_girl24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899136982212460, "text": "HBdetox", "created_at": "2025-06-10T14:16:14", "owner": "kelslayy28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173439283332472, "text": "AI Overview\n￼\n￼\n￼\n+15\nCoffee enemas are generally considered dangerous rather than healthy and are not supported by scientific evidence. While some proponents believe they can detoxify the body, studies have shown that they can lead to several adverse effects, including electrolyte imbalances, sepsis, and inflammation of the colon. There have also been rare cases of death linked to coffee enemas, often associated with underlying health conditions", "created_at": "2025-06-05T23:14:50", "owner": "michiganconcealedcarrytraining", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877351465226102, "text": "HBDETOX", "created_at": "2025-05-16T12:04:59", "owner": "tiinakagu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984870759806250, "text": "HBDETOX", "created_at": "2025-04-17T19:35:56", "owner": "mery_emilia05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053294552223573, "text": "HBDETOX", "created_at": "2025-04-09T20:11:40", "owner": "haley.kelly.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077973505684110, "text": "Underpin", "created_at": "2025-04-09T20:11:35", "owner": "haley.kelly.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934681720006647, "text": "Interested", "created_at": "2025-04-02T19:47:35", "owner": "beuttell_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035955146450905, "text": "❌", "created_at": "2025-02-20T01:25:41", "owner": "859.maysin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107016952482880, "text": "New fetish dropped 🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-18T23:11:16", "owner": "nikolas.cze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961020276857205, "text": "Conseguiram gourmetizar até a chuca 💀", "created_at": "2025-02-07T12:43:48", "owner": "guustavohrq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365182510184493, "text": "what the fuck bro", "created_at": "2025-02-07T00:42:14", 