": "2024-08-22T03:40:40", "owner": "sheep125", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039421439008943, "text": "所以他會啊哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-08-21T16:07:07", "owner": "pieroning", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029491403021285, "text": "i dont like this one", "created_at": "2024-08-21T14:50:50", "owner": "modixsxs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085466608486653, "text": "I just feel like you gave better information in the breathing video.", "created_at": "2024-08-16T19:01:58", "owner": "robynlynnmua_personal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033540716137082, "text": "Very clever marketing! 🔥", "created_at": "2024-08-16T10:37:43", "owner": "maria_albertsen_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059355364636912, "text": "Well done!", "created_at": "2024-08-08T18:50:02", "owner": "velvetbloom123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973705431735072, "text": "Wow, she really is talented, and not just at trolling you 😂", "created_at": "2024-08-08T17:08:30", "owner": "bethsoda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853973947200667, "text": "Because of your Gen Z video, I’m watching. I’m from Miami, this marketing would work great in our city.", "created_at": "2024-08-07T13:26:53", "owner": "soriangel84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18450629935048088, "text": "Awesome 👏", "created_at": "2024-08-05T18:22:40", "owner": "his.capital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051081022766155, "text": "All of the other funny videos brought me here and you have me thinking of leaving my state and moving to NC. Those are nice!", "created_at": "2024-08-01T17:05:35", "owner": "photoreelofmylife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013820828527631, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-08-01T09:02:48", "owner": "sandeepants", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064593952595262, "text": "I can't find the original breathing video on here?", "created_at": "2024-08-01T08:08:41", "owner": "kingdom.of.wow.nz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18316956550198255, "text": "Spitting fax there no printer 🖨️", "created_at": "2024-07-30T04:15:58", "owner": "koselige", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307044532084762, "text": "This is the closure we all needed 😌😭", "created_at": "2024-07-29T19:42:37", "owner": "kibimbap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042302194940490, "text": "Ugh HOA. You nearly had me moving several states away.", "created_at": "2024-07-29T02:41:37", "owner": "lilyanna_and_apple_mae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049241074801136, "text": "Gorg", "created_at": "2024-07-27T19:18:27", "owner": "ana_c_xoxo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043987123746726, "text": "Good job Gen Z", "created_at": "2024-07-26T21:41:33", "owner": "escapism.and.espresso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065440567525267, "text": "The video quality 🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-25T22:08:50", "owner": "thetejufam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986930418689299, "text": "And not one weird breath caught they did a good job 🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-25T21:43:28", "owner": "mommaliz_yo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040184794815954, "text": "Not me finally realizing you guys are in Charlotte after multiple videos. This house is beautiful.", "created_at": "2024-07-25T10:59:51", "owner": "annielove.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18447053641024867, "text": "Give her a raise! 😂", "created_at": "2024-07-24T15:04:18", "owner": "jaketrustin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995233899503201, "text": "Damn, I saw the other video and didn't know what to expect but this is so smooth", "created_at": "2024-07-23T23:34:23", "owner": "ravensnest_trinkets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006240497553405, "text": "Why do i keep my focus still on your breaths", "created_at": "2024-07-23T12:57:11", "owner": "darkopetrovski_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102692779420487, "text": "he’s ….he’s not.. he’s not breathing, HEY GUYS HE’S NOT BREATHING!!!!", "created_at": "2024-07-23T06:25:49", "owner": "meetnunu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020194544122729, "text": "I don't even know where y'all are at, but I'd go through you to get my home.  Also, she should've kept in a quick little second blip of the funny breathing clips right at the end.😄", "created_at": "2024-07-22T22:43:46", "owner": "j.son_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002819408421168, "text": "Not worth tiring my thumb to like this… 😌", "created_at": "2024-07-22T21:11:59", "owner": "melissakawaninja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895215957963897, "text": "Boooo urns", "created_at": "2024-07-22T21:11:03", "owner": "melissakawaninja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022275869095726, "text": "Dam I want one", "created_at": "2024-07-22T15:31:00", "owner": "gigimadison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034771663887347, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-07-22T14:27:40", "owner": "369tilltheend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010704086565398, "text": "So you CAN talk 🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-22T14:17:09", "owner": "brittchapa617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339851653187668, "text": "Beautiful", "created_at": "2024-07-22T01:51:19", "owner": "rina_0030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933457806861297, "text": "Other one", "created_at": "2024-07-21T19:38:53", "owner": "czech_inspired", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932384697899314, "text": "Why are you talking? She was right 😉", "created_at": "2024-07-21T16:08:26", "owner": "brandon_krenzler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043962958893512, "text": "Oh so they can like EDIT EDIT. Ya’ll hired a great one!", "created_at": "2024-07-21T11:07:01", "owner": "pearlbramnick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044233669736890, "text": "I only listened for the inhales", "created_at": "2024-07-21T03:58:57", "owner": "raphandhalf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031389698329178, "text": "Beautiful", "created_at": "2024-07-20T23:33:08", "owner": "quantumlove4all", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027946532473077, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-20T22:06:52", "owner": "stellasmomhasgotitgoinon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930406542795064, "text": "I live in South Africa but thanks to the previous edit I just found myself watching an ad for real estate in 🇺🇸…hanging on every gasp 😂", "created_at": "2024-07-20T20:39:33", "owner": "chrissychivers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014172863243621, "text": "Love that she hit you with something completely on point and serious that looks like it was done by a professional film crew. Very GenZ they are so unserious but so talented! Her version is better.", "created_at": "2024-07-20T16:11:31", "owner": "6ixtyforty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901258101939706, "text": "Mike I feel your pain, my Gen Z brother has lived with me for about 4 years now and I’ve never felt more un cool in my entire life 😂", "created_at": "2024-07-20T14:11:11", "owner": "atlasbeareroftheheavens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128686633360423, "text": "I feel like all your reels going forward should be a hybrid of this (actual listing video, very well done!) and the breathing one 😂 She did get me to watch the whole thing from here in Colorado, which I don’t even do for my sister’s reels (she’s also a realtor…who clearly needs a Gen Z editor!)", "created_at": "2024-07-20T13:43:49", "owner": "theboulderdoods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994405650665578, "text": "How much??", "created_at": "2024-07-20T13:03:36", "owner": "caitlyn.allaoui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097775503428738, "text": "the way you say square feet sounds like “scriffy “ pls say it slower", "created_at": "2024-07-20T01:34:16", "owner": "metalmouth.seven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877289368053685, "text": "This is what happens when you work with younger people and give them artistic freedom. Without talking down to them, or trying to control them.", "created_at": "2024-07-19T23:16:16", "owner": "amanda.main.damie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033199673496978, "text": "Wow they did a good job still too!", "created_at": "2024-07-19T21:40:32", "owner": "wanderwoman.dez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936551628854873, "text": "Beautiful property", "created_at": "2024-07-19T21:16:53", "owner": "karinarelayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933849885890604, "text": "I miss the breaths", "created_at": "2024-07-19T17:08:47", "owner": "zwickerrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035444930135762, "text": "Gorgeous", "created_at": "2024-07-19T16:59:18", "owner": "elder_millennial_83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313595545155219, "text": "Don't forget to breathe!", "created_at": "2024-07-19T16:33:00", "owner": "cardinalmemorials", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155442571315224, "text": "Damn! the other edit brought me here and this is 🔥🔥🔥 makes me want to take the idea of homeownership as a millennial seriously 🥲🥲", "created_at": "2024-07-19T15:29:01", "owner": "olivia_mal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876790558102994, "text": "Came here to see how his voice actually sounds...😂", "created_at": "2024-07-19T13:08:28", "owner": "marisol_fierro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007941323540494, "text": "No words necessary. 😮‍💨🌬️🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-19T04:49:12", "owner": "cali_bbygurl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897587989013911, "text": "Awesome🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-18T20:17:24", "owner": "jorgecamposclc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046184623863001, "text": "To be honest, I quite like the breathy \"you\" hhahahah ;)", "created_at": "2024-07-18T20:06:54", "owner": "neetzbassett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986900256693845, "text": "that's entertaining 🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-18T19:42:37", "owner": "benjamin_densmore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032819405120781, "text": "Sorry all I can hear is you breathing", "created_at": "2024-07-18T17:30:42", "owner": "cheapxsnack", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048561739824471, "text": "This is actually beautiful irl ❤️", "created_at": "2024-07-17T19:08:22", "owner": "dmpshaylamarie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014061824227503, "text": "I feel like I could comprehend the information in the other video much better😮‍💨", "created_at": "2024-07-17T17:36:11", "owner": "21hanna21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876451057057829, "text": "The Gen Z original is better ...", "created_at": "2024-07-17T17:22:00", "owner": "rogermpacheco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079827850497327, "text": "This is the LIFE of a Middle School Teacher. MIDDLE SCHOOL TEACHERS UNDERSTAND…. but while we are trying to get them to learn math and not be on their phones. 🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-17T13:27:42", "owner": "alyssahcortina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846593596239979, "text": "I hope you give that gen z person a raise", "created_at": "2024-07-17T09:42:51", "owner": "farmlifehi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946278576824232, "text": "Other video waaaaay better!!!", "created_at": "2024-07-17T09:42:22", "owner": "farmlifehi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004915019342006, "text": "Looks cute! Can you please send me more info? 🤗", "created_at": "2024-07-17T02:23:13", "owner": "whiskey_miniaussie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851941504200559, "text": "I'm only here because of the breathing video", "created_at": "2024-07-17T00:19:30", "owner": "misskrisskriss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930857463791766, "text": "You both nailed it 👍🏼", "created_at": "2024-07-16T20:18:47", "owner": "lizdiluzio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332800807134551, "text": "🔥❤️😂", "created_at": "2024-07-16T13:58:03", "owner": "arielelisa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920632458946054, "text": "God this is boring 🥱", "created_at": "2024-07-16T07:41:06", "owner": "alvintseng511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035902597866414, "text": "😧💖 these would be soo fun to live in!!", "created_at": "2024-07-16T00:47:08", "owner": "see3milyplay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855926122215978, "text": "Nice house", "created_at": "2024-07-16T00:31:39", "owner": "my_aura_daisy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943315434739456, "text": "This house goes crazy tho 😍🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-15T23:50:33", "owner": "yaka_gaia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001045586450844, "text": "Gen X can accept Gen Z humor. 🙌🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-07-15T23:49:12", "owner": "to.s.l.al", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18019065314133930, "text": "My mommy just moved back to FL. I wish I would have known about yall before she got her own realtor bc I'd have referred her to you. I saw in another comment that you know realtors around the country. If I come across anyone else looking to buy a house, I'm directing them straight to yours and your main company's Instagram pages. I just know you'll get them a great home at much more affordable price points! ❤️", "created_at": "2024-07-15T23:24:39", "owner": "amazondrea48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030676643149722, "text": "Really smart marketing!!", "created_at": "2024-07-15T21:21:58", "owner": "mrskrissytee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863429542127556, "text": "Beautiful house", "created_at": "2024-07-15T12:28:21", "owner": "jomzikirsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072168055478728, "text": "Idk man she used AI for your voice no cappin", "created_at": "2024-07-15T08:20:30", "owner": "larkindm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931619409882143, "text": "4.1 million likes…. gurl not only made y’all go viral, she also are and left no crumbs with the ACTUAL video. 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-15T05:50:40", "owner": "independence_707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035181911053421, "text": "ok gen z employee slayed the work. visionary", "created_at": "2024-07-15T05:37:22", "owner": "sasha.bosilic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074768089522751, "text": "This house 😭😭😭😮‍💨😮‍💨", "created_at": "2024-07-15T03:55:25", "owner": "fini.toee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970063278625960, "text": "Great marketing!! I followed just to see more", "created_at": "2024-07-14T23:26:03", "owner": "cory.gali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982429710560162, "text": "❤️🔥👏", "created_at": "2024-07-14T21:52:11", "owner": "2sassyrn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324084337179703, "text": "🥱", "created_at": "2024-07-14T19:36:54", "owner": "lana_banani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030538388156958, "text": "Well I would love one of these. Do you deliver to Ireland?", "created_at": "2024-07-14T14:26:49", "owner": "kyrrahthom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050443933774892, "text": "She made darn sure that there are NO breaths in this clip. 🤣💀", "created_at": "2024-07-14T14:20:23", "owner": "bostypitch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059450395621915, "text": "This is gorgeous!", "created_at": "2024-07-14T12:20:56", "owner": "noac.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971429637740075, "text": "@consult_with_tee we finally got the real edit 😂", "created_at": "2024-07-14T11:14:27", "owner": "simplybeingnina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014922344208864, "text": "Nah  I like the original edit 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-14T10:29:37", "owner": "jessifiveash.artandsoul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096528397429133, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-07-14T06:25:25", "owner": "andreamago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030301835502707, "text": "Why are they attached in one part?", "created_at": "2024-07-14T02:55:55", "owner": "natareeportman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140614825329787, "text": "This is gorgeous? How much is it? OR is too expensive.", "created_at": "2024-07-14T00:06:23", "owner": "veganceliac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856359019211794, "text": "I’m guessing this sold like 3 days ago?", "created_at": "2024-07-13T22:28:57", "owner": "evo1d0er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092997106451320, "text": "Where's yhe BREATHINNGG couldn't understand nothing u said sir.", "created_at": "2024-07-13T20:08:20", "owner": "myialuvli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017786657147906, "text": "Didn’t learn much about the house from the other edit (idek if it was about a house) but it was a good hook 😂", "created_at": "2024-07-13T19:49:54", "owner": "dipped___in___serenity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18231846166286571, "text": "lol she’s really good 😂🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-13T19:04:52", "owner": "bludiamondz_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["breathingguy", "breathingrealtor", "gaspingrealtor", "genz", "genzedit", "genzemployee", "pridemore", "pridemoreproperties", "pridemorepropertiesatcompass", "pridemoreteam", "pridemoreteamatcompass", "pridemoreagent", "realestate", "realtor", "realtorlife", "cltrealtor", "charlotterealtor", "charlotterealestate", "charlottemarket", "charlotterealestatemarket", "ncrealtor", "ncrealestate", "luxuryrealestate"]},
