at": "2025-01-30T22:53:43", "owner": "kidshonenistic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993335541764742, "text": "For quality and research purposes, I require her @ I need to make sure she’s ok", "created_at": "2025-01-30T19:33:46", "owner": "darkknight_moto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121615183422523, "text": "Weird way to propose but yes", "created_at": "2025-01-30T18:50:32", "owner": "hooklineandinker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881032948228445, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-01-30T16:40:37", "owner": "55_plumb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963908877731478, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-30T10:11:40", "owner": "el_henry_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056148287008105, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-30T08:57:50", "owner": "itsmohammadabbarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919190440024379, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-30T07:40:43", "owner": "5zkai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036012029403992, "text": "And kids, that's how I met your mother", "created_at": "2025-01-30T06:09:49", "owner": "thearsonist1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016612805668266, "text": "Am I thinking the same?", "created_at": "2025-01-30T05:59:59", "owner": "sharmajikabeta.141", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041399114340626, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-01-30T03:40:29", "owner": "daicon_revo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067183786681218, "text": "trained", "created_at": "2025-01-30T03:34:07", "owner": "mmgoblu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030809033626420, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-30T02:18:04", "owner": "ithanaxell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043133897200913, "text": "And this is \"HOW I MET YOU'RE MOTHER\"💯", "created_at": "2025-01-30T01:45:17", "owner": "jason.oliver.3005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852143602386284, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-30T01:25:51", "owner": "noniusaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036710741524640, "text": "How I Met Your Mother", "created_at": "2025-01-30T01:24:59", "owner": "relax_itslee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076501684565031, "text": "bro set bet try it on me", "created_at": "2025-01-30T01:00:39", "owner": "rylan826", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036547619409930, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-30T00:57:14", "owner": "dalton.pitts.165", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045116453186753, "text": "Shes a keeper❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-30T00:25:31", "owner": "ramsolon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18485228503044273, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-30T00:25:16", "owner": "pablosllater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922830336921301, "text": "Is that bro from the chainsmokers", "created_at": "2025-01-29T23:48:44", "owner": "brandenvrias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337111681159343, "text": "Ohhhhhh", "created_at": "2025-01-29T23:45:08", "owner": "the0rphan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896996821137198, "text": "“Your turn” is crazy 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T23:32:33", "owner": "realsammyfeliciano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034075370403872, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-01-29T22:59:44", "owner": "butter3outthaway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020806106409786, "text": "@trinity_fatu", "created_at": "2025-01-29T21:50:44", "owner": "giii_kneemer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034728827186189, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-29T20:36:31", "owner": "applejobs_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081532021609610, "text": "And just like that, he lost all confidence in his pullout game", "created_at": "2025-01-29T20:09:22", "owner": "countswagolini2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920462745938357, "text": "And kids, this is how I met your mother.", "created_at": "2025-01-29T19:15:11", "owner": "orig.boostspike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053661758039535, "text": "“i was doin just fine before i met you”", "created_at": "2025-01-29T17:56:02", "owner": "thebrownconnor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940783908954229, "text": "😮😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T11:34:06", "owner": "run_216_cjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034346771442296, "text": "Is that Drew Taggart", "created_at": "2025-01-29T02:32:45", "owner": "ryan.y.ao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901637590028130, "text": "Squash Dimples😂", "created_at": "2025-01-26T00:40:48", "owner": "lobacz.robert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973677399813286, "text": "This is better that hawk tuah", "created_at": "2025-01-23T13:24:48", "owner": "momoney1186", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955698117761171, "text": "I'm still picking my jaw up from the ground", "created_at": "2025-01-22T15:36:58", "owner": "moja.ffx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033878036192660, "text": "Something hoped in his body too", "created_at": "2025-01-22T11:36:29", "owner": "daniel._bd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906804715089037, "text": "That’s it for him. He is a runner", "created_at": "2025-01-19T19:11:52", "owner": "don_fanucccci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326771248083120, "text": "Uk every other girl at the party hates her after that ahaha", "created_at": "2025-01-18T18:30:54", "owner": "fvckcvnc3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082367212597605, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-01-18T14:27:24", "owner": "tacofreak1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055884946838934, "text": "Wife her", "created_at": "2025-01-18T14:22:02", "owner": "kutsu_4luv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040981442074828, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-01-18T01:46:04", "owner": "kdf333kdf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055750369995297, "text": "Auch and wow", "created_at": "2025-01-13T17:12:31", "owner": "drloficial_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008109233698234, "text": "and that’s how I met your mother", "created_at": "2025-01-13T12:46:23", "owner": "trulyaaron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032372507207136, "text": "Perfect", "created_at": "2025-01-12T23:35:49", "owner": "jasondunlap68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049493749902458, "text": "I flinched I ain't goin' lie. Didn't see that comin'.", "created_at": "2025-01-12T23:09:48", "owner": "mazuma_merchant_of_humanity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168071053316053, "text": "That shit bounced god dam", "created_at": "2025-01-11T01:29:14", "owner": "roberto_dahiz_f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055472218974320, "text": "All I'm saying is if that was my girlfriend, pregnant IMMEDIATELY", "created_at": "2025-01-10T07:23:48", "owner": "carlbrutananadilewski06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048442040128277, "text": "When your athletic and know how to flirt", "created_at": "2025-01-09T05:25:25", "owner": "dickensmarlowe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252396013285478, "text": "😂👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-08T05:41:16", "owner": "te.miguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891758710147246, "text": "That look she gave after gah damn I’m ready for marriage 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-05T19:49:27", "owner": "gmjamesldn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868387291272817, "text": "Ok so i just need to learn how to do a backflip ✍️", "created_at": "2025-01-05T01:52:42", "owner": "sydnielilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003358817526651, "text": "Pretty valid reaction", "created_at": "2025-01-04T15:38:48", "owner": "leo.isasian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915707908044999, "text": "Uh, she's gorgeous.", "created_at": "2025-01-02T02:00:31", "owner": "michael_angelo6656", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851296360327909, "text": "*boner alert* 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-01T18:46:21", "owner": "chronicles_of_cohosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315214735162769, "text": "Yeah girl", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:49:19", "owner": "bushboyliam101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089806066534320, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T18:30:49", "owner": "deenabbey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063278071700305, "text": "They’re gonna get married", "created_at": "2024-12-31T02:36:18", "owner": "dino.haffos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053394956298907, "text": "That entry alone would make me bust", "created_at": "2024-12-31T01:53:45", "owner": "plmpnasty", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18052793012496186, "text": "So how accurate can you get these landings...", "created_at": "2024-12-30T05:58:29", "owner": "jerryc2709", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18032598470434996, "text": "Perfect", "created_at": "2024-12-30T02:49:13", "owner": "jeffabodeely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349284253134188, "text": "And that's how I met your father", "created_at": "2024-12-29T21:28:29", "owner": "real.soku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099331792488523, "text": "split drops. Doesn't that super damage your hips? Think I saw it on a Dallas Cowboys cheer docu once? Impressive mind", "created_at": "2024-12-29T20:53:57", "owner": "aspreydan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338120668194760, "text": "Wtfffffff", "created_at": "2024-12-29T18:35:50", "owner": "sovnngarde", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057515365923334, "text": "I'm scared🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-29T15:07:47", "owner": "empirestateofmind986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092403376511887, "text": "Flip so good bro turned into Andrew taggart", "created_at": "2024-12-26T07:30:47", "owner": "confused__unga_bunga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030632381601899, "text": "Run guyss", "created_at": "2024-12-25T21:15:21", "owner": "omkarasaurus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895845655038905, "text": "Why is the video 10 minutes long?", "created_at": "2024-12-25T01:20:42", "owner": "raii2flyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025409468548591, "text": "He felt that on his ..... 🤭", "created_at": "2024-12-24T13:06:50", "owner": "leovvvh94", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041517530035203, "text": "She said your turn?", "created_at": "2024-12-24T08:04:35", "owner": "get_jiggy.josh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891455665112056, "text": "Buss", "created_at": "2024-12-22T23:07:51", "owner": "ryder_comptonmma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921162324993522, "text": "did he just bust", "created_at": "2024-12-20T06:01:01", "owner": "girlrealnessmaxxing", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055642813781540, "text": "Bro saw three kids and a dog for a second", "created_at": "2024-12-17T19:23:44", "owner": "nathandesouzaoficial", "likes": 13699}, {"id": 18113752669386470, "text": "TREVOR WALLACE", "created_at": "2024-12-13T09:40:44", "owner": "lancewashere.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051070703009048, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-12T21:49:16", "owner": "brain__69_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061447423894932, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-11T22:46:16", "owner": "mike_bajo5to", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013785170651756, "text": "Bro fell in love", "created_at": "2024-12-06