{"media_id": 3451127882739470636, "shortcode": "C_k3oZFIdEs", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_k3oZFIdEs/", "taken_at": "2024-09-06T12:42:30", "caption": "The iScale! ✨\n.\n.\n.\n.\n\n#BbShorties #Reels #ReelsInstagram #reelkarofeelkaro #ReelItFeelIt #Beebom #Reel #Explore #Trending #shotoniphone #AmazonFinds #amazonfindsindia #amazonfinds2022 #CoolGadgets #Nerd #Geek #amazonfinds2023 #amazonfinds2024", "owner_username": "beebomco", "owner_id": "3573651400", "likes": 255792, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0037_C_k3oZFIdEs\\C_k3oZFIdEs_20240906_124230.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18325020781151833, "text": "Finally something android doesn't have 🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-06T16:02:42", "owner": "timv777", "likes": 14067}, {"id": 17940739604891223, "text": "Does this weigh in milligrams?", "created_at": "2024-09-06T14:10:57", "owner": "jith_u._", "likes": 7466}, {"id": 18028428692337889, "text": "Weighing an apple on a iPhone is personal😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-06T12:47:20", "owner": "footy1745454", "likes": 8724}, {"id": 17963480945906576, "text": "Is it a built in app and how do I access", "created_at": "2025-04-06T05:13:36", "owner": "mohammedasif9908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072570052824168, "text": "This only appears in iPhone 4.", "created_at": "2025-02-24T23:45:47", "owner": "guzza_gamu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067913029873473, "text": "So Apple can check the weight of Apple", "created_at": "2025-02-08T09:54:33", "owner": "usman.shoukatt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068534614816225, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-01-19T08:32:49", "owner": "stepqx._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934999347966598, "text": "Bro there is weighing scale app for Android", "created_at": "2025-01-07T12:13:34", "owner": "mansooralikhan0200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970884390812836, "text": "This is false now iPhone don’t have 3D Touch so this is not possible", "created_at": "2025-01-05T07:43:58", "owner": "airborne_adventure_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042493130011971, "text": "Woke doesn't know it works on capacitive touch only 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-26T03:53:02", "owner": "anoop_krishna_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064095706830550, "text": "Not works in iPhone 16 Pro Max", "created_at": "2024-12-24T05:53:06", "owner": "armaanph04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050791973010222, "text": "Don't put 1kg it will break", "created_at": "2024-12-22T13:45:27", "owner": "ameer_asali14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18473129065026389, "text": "It works only in iPhone X or below", "created_at": "2024-11-29T15:45:17", "owner": "everywhereapple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055019080926249, "text": "Wonderful", "created_at": "2024-11-24T22:34:27", "owner": "supgennsemente", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039619340237980, "text": "App", "created_at": "2024-11-24T20:32:12", "owner": "rizwan7262", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055179367746117, "text": "bro I put 5kg apples to measure and broke my phone 😢", "created_at": "2024-11-24T17:13:58", "owner": "vladimir.serafimovski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107304412394135, "text": "Let's check my car weight 🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-24T06:37:31", "owner": "basavaraju_sahukar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469442107029577, "text": "Weigh gold ! Perfect use case", "created_at": "2024-11-14T20:48:01", "owner": "anks19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060546856830248, "text": "@_siddhant2525 🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-14T12:28:34", "owner": "ar9vfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063030844685286, "text": "Can I weight myself !!?", "created_at": "2024-11-13T08:08:51", "owner": "_aashu250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373699555106185, "text": "Ek chiz jo iPhone kr leta tha android ke alawa wo bhi bandh krdi 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T02:18:43", "owner": "seiji_mv3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074224672591344, "text": "Drug dealers next day", "created_at": "2024-11-11T20:20:33", "owner": "atulsharma_topic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025519979221936, "text": "Kaha gye samsungggg wlee😂??", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:59:52", "owner": "patel.dgaf28", "l