s": 0}, {"id": 18051761002765552, "text": "Can I check my weight?", "created_at": "2024-10-29T11:21:58", "owner": "_alpha_nagu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362050402116047, "text": "I tried to check my weight 🤡", "created_at": "2024-10-25T08:46:08", "owner": "ig_z3r0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033865322336582, "text": "Chutiye ho salon, koi dhange se info nahi dete ho", "created_at": "2024-10-24T20:58:24", "owner": "shivamdubeyji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019962131614867, "text": "10 kg rakh de display pe 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-24T17:12:08", "owner": "aksx_one8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287609737233663, "text": "App name?", "created_at": "2024-10-24T17:09:31", "owner": "alagammal.94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044925023481573, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:25:41", "owner": "as__atanu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046293112856306, "text": "Is it true, if so it’s great", "created_at": "2024-10-21T15:55:38", "owner": "nrc291", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046405210956926, "text": "Mobile Lena hai weighting machine nehi", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:17:06", "owner": "ramijabbas.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111158101418604, "text": "@bhakshith_salian_13", "created_at": "2024-10-14T16:02:58", "owner": "coachshrinidhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093402724480815, "text": "its only available till iphone xs series 🗿", "created_at": "2024-10-13T17:55:13", "owner": "roshhellwett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039622433146609, "text": "I want to know my my weight 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T13:03:39", "owner": "izzy_0110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062272972676570, "text": "Hence the screen was made by Samsung 💀", "created_at": "2024-10-12T04:11:20", "owner": "jaison_048_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055564042888099, "text": "App name?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T23:38:14", "owner": "savibasra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902617287963601, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-10T08:38:58", "owner": "monst3r10inch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865691488162987, "text": "Its only support iphone with 3d touch", "created_at