"text": "M apna weight check krra tha pata nahi kyu ab screen me light nhi ari 😢😤🤧🤧", "created_at": "2024-10-04T05:05:41", "owner": "ktr__prins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920141871986681, "text": "can i check my weight on this?", "created_at": "2024-10-04T04:06:22", "owner": "psychic_maha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053806348885850, "text": "Bhai jcb chadadiya ab phone tuth gya ab kya karna hai 😃", "created_at": "2024-10-03T19:03:37", "owner": "tawfeeq46._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863332609235896, "text": "@0_m_a_d_h_a_v_0", "created_at": "2024-10-03T17:16:16", "owner": "ganesh_25_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462648811039840, "text": "Mera phone tut gaya bkl mera weight ni jhel paya🥲 ab s24 lena padega", "created_at": "2024-10-03T10:47:09", "owner": "hacktul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042198619888978, "text": "Ok. Now measure 50 kg.", "created_at": "2024-10-03T09:52:14", "owner": "itx_danish.100", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18029949749462348, "text": "Bhai ab android se comment krra hu teri reel dekh ke apne iphone pe car ka weight krra tha 😭", "created_at": "2024-10-03T08:53:52", "owner": "aanu__5517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049951378926156, "text": "Burh 3D Touch is discontinued since ages", "created_at": "2024-10-03T08:50:52", "owner": "manraj.xp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009931676403721, "text": "Bhai mai khara hua phone tut gaya ab kya karu ?😢😢", "created_at": "2024-10-03T06:57:46", "owner": "madhav._bhatia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180934012307621, "text": "@rhandcl_1", "created_at": "2024-10-03T04:37:53", "owner": "0o0o00o.__________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022975649384929, "text": "Touchscale.co ?", "created_at": "2024-10-03T00:25:25", "owner": "h.shaah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853891153242752, "text": "🫣", "created_at": "2024-10-01T16:27:56", "owner": "notsumearth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862311715179913, "text": "The cracked screen says it all. Someone must have tried to weigh themselves.😂", "created_at": "2024-10-01T15:24:33", "owner": "multilingualmaven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1805