: 0}, {"id": 18334975849127331, "text": "Is that sword battle ready that's all I want to know", "created_at": "2024-09-09T07:35:09", "owner": "why_do_i_exist_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055914415783347, "text": "🐕‍🦺🐕‍🦺🦮🐕🐶🦮🐶🦮🐕‍🦺", "created_at": "2024-09-09T07:31:59", "owner": "lambi4a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036346520167085, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-09T07:10:14", "owner": "kaan001072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077175901478755, "text": "I was always curious how do you all wear this, if it has so many holes?", "created_at": "2024-09-09T06:49:11", "owner": "yaowy.original", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103304527441630, "text": "Vos que sos cosplayer cumplime el sueño @mentitaxz", "created_at": "2024-09-09T06:33:27", "owner": "chivilcoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035997575145626, "text": "I need the swords (you thought I was gonna say her didn’t ya?)", "created_at": "2024-09-09T06:30:14", "owner": "kingofsinns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842595475305590, "text": "Do ypu need a boyfriend (I dont care about you I want that Claymore)", "created_at": "2024-09-09T06:19:45", "owner": "abakum_master", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18243095749287659, "text": "Holy moly 🗣🗡 [ we stroming the front lines w this one", "created_at": "2024-09-09T06:15:46", "owner": "i_mizu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900576556046469, "text": "GRIFITHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH", "created_at": "2024-09-09T06:14:30", "owner": "skud_doo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075619318549539, "text": "Not my ciri", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:41:36", "owner": "toomby01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038248736117705, "text": "She isy final boss", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:40:34", "owner": "bagashvili.99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18457050265058415, "text": "I can take you on 1v1", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:37:59", "owner": "r_i_t_a_m_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148534807335778, "text": "damn", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:22:43", "owner": "mapleglazedcrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017915714253724, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:02:49", "owner": "ravigu