ated_at": "2024-09-09T00:57:13", "owner": "saufihanif_2810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877736815114464, "text": "God damb it why am i so easy for an algorithm to read", "created_at": "2024-09-09T00:52:40", "owner": "tristan_j_blackwell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045685198788347, "text": "Female armour in video games", "created_at": "2024-09-09T00:45:21", "owner": "piss.pirate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055694557695340, "text": "Nephis??", "created_at": "2024-09-09T00:28:33", "owner": "whatremainsof8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880784488108743, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-09-08T23:56:26", "owner": "jeihtuuhjekdeheo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857125504202210, "text": "Where they get them swords from", "created_at": "2024-09-08T23:46:57", "owner": "_anthonymedd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067230127540650, "text": "🔥❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-08T23:20:05", "owner": "ryanthornhill1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098753905446214, "text": "Nice sword. Where can I get one", "created_at": "2024-09-08T22:41:00", "owner": "yokaidogma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903575376986887, "text": "Only fans", "created_at": "2024-09-08T22:34:12", "owner": "jackie_edits_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975069165764941, "text": "Yes, thank you. 🗿", "created_at": "2024-09-08T22:15:37", "owner": "perezvillarroe20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18455022169047502, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T22:02:07", "owner": "mohammed._.zeedat.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860159371180819, "text": "I challenge you to a dual. Right now", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:59:45", "owner": "the_lebbaeus_show", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039776027292482, "text": "That's where my sword went", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:57:36", "owner": "sgt_zkitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009374156620715, "text": "Ah ha", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:35:28", "owner": "ik_aman.singh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903145960040399, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:32:07", "owner": "mrbsk17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021175616414755, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:18:44", "owner": "kaan_stnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020888090394738, "text": "Is that a a cosplay for Griffith or cirilla?", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:13:43", "owner": "igaksr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039280934044837, "text": "The only thing more beautiful is the blood of demons on my holy sword and the words of God running through my breath", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:03:30", "owner": "sirrooster420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18454327504041835, "text": "That's not techwear tho is it?", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:55:31", "owner": "xxnobinxx", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18020542133386233, "text": "are serious 👀 i hâte u", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:49:05", "owner": "haku_tsutsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918470838972382, "text": "I’m sorry to say your armor is not really armoring.", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:43:40", "owner": "alexpelczarski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025855577346321, "text": "احلى وتشر", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:35:17", "owner": "iamabd.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282029710233650, "text": "daym daniel", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:34:31", "owner": "steamycoffe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18450331258021960, "text": "Well damn I think I found my new favourite character", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:27:15", "owner": "anthonycoombes256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031214453220418, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:23:46", "owner": "sayonara.sgin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067436533613917, "text": "Female armour in video games be like", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:09:08", "owner": "jamesmarshall86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034511414141352, "text": "Strike me down!", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:05:05", "owner": "ttvbeamertr3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085032088449957, "text": "I have a sword you can play with 😍", "created_at": "2024-09-08T20:02:51", "owner": "snowshredder420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878493256137211, "text": "Ciri, that you?", "created_at": "2024-09-08T19:55:33", "owner": "jln.schdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008180456399190, "text": "We did", "created_at": "2024-09-08T19:35:00", "owner": "a1dk3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024433316132972, "text": "Elle est gechan ciri", "created_at": "2024-09-08T19:25:47", "owner": "_mathys_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919543800870256, "text": "“Let not your heart turn aside to her ways; do not stray into her path. Her house is the way to Sheol, going down to the chambers of death”", "created_at": "2024-09-08T19:11:56", "owner": "j_moore_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883953298102100, "text": "How many times did I look at these? Yes.", "created_at": "2024-09-08T18:51:50", "owner": "cpt_fjre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051779080860737, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T18:16:36", "owner": "wnr_oliv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051075619852489, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T18:05:08", "owner": "x_valter_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865547500145438, "text": "Yes please", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:58:17", "owner": "adamjonsteel26", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938859867896997, "text": "The corset makes this so fire 🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:38:20", "owner": "kent_kyle_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18251048767271856, "text": "Welp time to get smite, ungraded!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:28:23", "owner": "fdkami_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075602857490117, "text": "Nice sword", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:20:25", "owner": "alfieburbidge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040573718045995, "text": "Mother", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:05:45", "owner": "lizzieonxbox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139492111342339, "text": "Griffith you waitttttttt. Guts gonna catch you 😈", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:04:37", "owner": "shadow_sensei07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107570107423722, "text": "Your vitals are unguarded", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:02:53", "owner": "philosophicalwormofnullity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364187131106130, "text": "\"yeah I gonna post this on Instagram\"", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:01:53", "owner": "yenolin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069009130585202, "text": "ولكم هاي مو بس تشيلة هاي تاخذه وتركض بي 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:00:40", "owner": "h.s__iq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047683372902791, "text": "Now put on the rest of your armor", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:51:59", "owner": "markmassbandit", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044805286805937, "text": "Жду фильм в котором такую героиню вы@бут за первые 20секунд 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:36:23", "owner": "__abdurazzoq_9050__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370587643097622, "text": "@ratskeleton", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:25:59", "owner": "realjoshuaking", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061277902713436, "text": "lvl 1000 armor+56278", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:23:27", "owner": "osmar_psiqtaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045123529806177, "text": "GOD DIDN'T DIED FOR THIS RAAAAAAHHH✝️✝️🛐 REPENT!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:14:35", "owner": "jav__casharra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970570698784029, "text": "В до смерте 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:53:34", "owner": "usmonoff_o21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042720724971636, "text": "Ciri????", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:52:02", "owner": "terryblow6445", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053938942771758, "text": "What… no links????", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:11:11", "owner": "dzslayzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336331768125012, "text": "How long is ur sword?", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:09:31", "owner": "jean._.ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019951928212698, "text": "Where are you siry", "created_at": "2024-09-08T14:33:11", "owner": "mr.hd5534", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006403670424822, "text": "ay yooo", "created_at": "2024-09-08T14:24:48", "owner": "fire1209q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161091613314571, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-08T14:08:59", "owner": "jay_bal_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901635097035179, "text": "Sheesh thats not just some pics, thats real strong stuff, think I'm addict 🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-08T14:00:10", "owner": "_the__story__of__my__life__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994326576513701, "text": "Ciri is that you", "created_at": "2024-09-08T13:57:53", "owner": "kai_killer15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049015522740459, "text": "MOOOOOMMMYYYYY😍", "created_at": "2024-09-08T13:36:28", "owner": "cacao_qom_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261701317300133, "text": "dead, i am dead. great job😮", "created_at": "2024-09-08T12:39:01", "owner": "johndemeyor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277378603300052, "text": "Mommy?", "created_at": "2024-09-08T12:36:15", "owner": "2fwuffy2vengeance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882593344103212, "text": "Not very protective on the field of battle I would say", "created_at": "2024-09-08T12:10:39", "owner": "thenewjack16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883127782100099, "text": "Honestly that reminds me of Ciri from The Witcher", "created_at": "2024-09-08T11:36:30", "owner": "ff_martial_artist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877834078140728, "text": "Witcher...I have the upmost urgent quest only you can handle", "created_at": "2024-09-08T11:04:43", "owner": "demonkinglluis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357435241115278, "text": "It s cool❤️👌", "created_at": "2024-09-08T10:40:39", "owner": "mordur_viking", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["techwear", "techwearfits", "techfashion", "techweargeneral", "blackwear", "drkshdw", "darkwear", "techweargeneral", "techwearsociety", "acronym", "acoldwall", "techwearlooks", "futuristicfashion", "streetwear", "techwearfashion", "techwearstyle", "techwearoutfit", "fashion", "fashionstyle", "cyberpunk"]},
{"media_id": 3451603612822202356, "shortcode": "C_mjzLPuOf0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_mjzLPuOf0/", "taken_at": "2024-09-07T04:27:16", "caption": "How are you doing today?\n.\nFollow @tech.wearmx \nFollow @tech.wearmx \nFollow @tech.wearmx \n.\nBy @ryupi666\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#techwear #techwearfits #techfashion #techweargeneral #blackwear #drkshdw #darkwear #techweargeneral #techwearsociety #acronym #acoldwall #techwearlooks #futuristicfashion #streetwear #techwearfashion #techwearstyle #techwearoutfit #fashion #fashionstyle #cyberpunk", "owner_username": "tech.wearmx", "owner_id": "46162390194", "likes": 596, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0042_C_mjzLPuOf0\\C_mjzLPuOf0_20240907_042716.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18013552412559530", "text": "Model?", "created_at": "2024-09-12T01:29:40", "owner": "die_ene_kat", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17864719668211112", "text": "🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹", "created_at": "2024-09-07T04:45:18", "owner": "irish_countryboy89", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["techwear", "techwearfits", "techfashion", "techweargeneral", "blackwear", "drkshdw", "darkwear", "techweargeneral", "techwearsociety", "acronym", "acoldwall", "techwearlooks", "futuristicfashion", "streetwear", "techwearfashion", "techwearstyle", "techwearoutfit", "fashion", "fashionstyle", "cyberpunk"]},
{"media_id": 3444941905879168922, "shortcode": "C_O5GlLyPea", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_O5GlLyPea/", "taken_at": "2024-08-28T23:53:24", "caption": "101 Un-useless Japanese Invention HypeReel ~ s/o to Kenji Kawakami 💥✨🔬", "owner_username": "takubeats", "owner_id": "2227157", "likes": 63568, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0043_C_O5GlLyPea\\C_O5GlLyPea_20240828_235324.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18040153520295852, "text": "Song: Drumline by Milye 🥁✨", "created_at": "2024-08-29T00:26:29", "owner": "takubeats", "likes": 213}, {"id": 17908283660914852, "text": "*Source - 101 Unuseless Japanese Inventions: The Art of Chindogu by Kenji Kawakami \n1. Umbrella Tie\n2. Slurp Protector \n3. Funnel Eyedrops\n4. 360 Disposable Camera Head Rig \n5. Umbrella Fresh Water Catcher\n6. Stick-O-Butter\n7. Subway Head Support Helmet\n8. Salaryman Floatation Device\n9. Noodle Fan\n10. Toilet Paper Head Dispenser \n11. Extendo-Swat\n12. Sound Amplification Headset\n13. Umbrella Window Shopper\n14. Subway Portable Chin Rest\n15. Straw Mask \n17. Straw Pocket\n18. Sand Goggles\n19. Bag Hair Clip\n20. Handbag Arm Rests\n21. Portable Greens Box", "created_at": "2024-08-28T23:59:12", "owner": "takubeats", "likes": 397}, {"id": 18025630061278831, "text": "I love it", "created_at": "2024-12-04T13:14:53", "owner": "hutian999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870700096143714, "text": "It’s AI tf", "created_at": "2024-11-02T00:25:56", "owner": "ani_swis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958640712717735, "text": "Why are these all cool ?", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:43:26", "owner": "julien.donato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937487223926013, "text": "Lots of great ideas there 😄", "created_at": "2024-10-25T17:10:21", "owner": "emmaryokou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982502499756050, "text": "omg thank you so much my mom used to have this book and it has been lingering on the back of my mind for so many years now finally thanks to you i found it again ty ty ty i will order it immedietly", "created_at": "2024-10-22T10:44:46", "owner": "loewezah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060481072700543, "text": "@trapbeforeyourap", "created_at": "2024-10-20T02:38:26", "owner": "mr.c_zehry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993864330704792, "text": "😂🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:02:59", "owner": "ro____s0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889789933034835, "text": "Japonologie", "created_at": "2024-10-18T14:28:27", "owner": "halawabob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282358855240545, "text": "Finally", "created_at": "2024-10-17T07:51:40", "owner": "tenitorito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047633899816837, "text": ".", "created_at": "2024-10-16T10:15:11", "owner": "nowshahr11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003107657496381, "text": "AI: What?!??", "created_at": "2024-10-12T17:39:19", "owner": "merven_sheep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847107130320154, "text": "ネットでみたおもしろアイデアグッズの詰め合わせだ！よくこんなに集めましたね😂", "created_at": "2024-10-11T05:48:02", "owner": "liquid_rainbow18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028032731369758, "text": "Yass algorithm yasss", "created_at": "2024-10-06T14:10:53", "owner": "wuusulynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892367719016413, "text": "@takubeats no: 4 exists as butter spreader stick.  no:6 also exist as  360 camera go pro. they may have been ahead of their time. I think selfie stick also exists in that era but the trend only came when camera phone is created.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T07:27:40", "owner": "vendatta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018684998300370, "text": "I though this was AI", "created_at": "2024-10-06T06:12:46", "owner": "jackiehadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845243641320776, "text": "I have this book!", "created_at": "2024-10-03T17:24:14", "owner": "p.l.maldonado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022754318408237, "text": "Wihh", "created_at": "2024-10-03T14:57:36", "owner": "mauw_lee_dee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942070593776675, "text": "全部都需要一份，謝謝", "created_at": "2024-10-02T09:48:41", "owner": "chickenflydogjump", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022355618204479, "text": "@takubeats how the hell are you so bloody good at everything, leave some for the rest of us 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T14:21:56", "owner": "davekatague", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152003458328260, "text": "Counterthinking", "created_at": "2024-09-29T13:19:59", "owner": "lauphilip1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927383400950716, "text": "learned all of this in my english class 💪💪💪", "created_at": "2024-09-29T04:04:01", "owner": "kaiyinchnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045122983994266, "text": "Japan is living in  2050", "created_at": "2024-09-28T13:12:31", "owner": "zhxhd111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034729880006544, "text": "OMG WERE FINALLY AESTHETICIZING \"top 10 most useful japanese inventions! (not clickbait)\"", "created_at": "2024-09-28T02:36:23", "owner": "untitlism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022792235194536, "text": "最高です。ツボ過ぎます😂", "created_at": "2024-09-26T05:27:19", "owner": "take_125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015752519315134, "text": "Dope.", "created_at": "2024-09-22T11:35:40", "owner": "piotrvienio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024002036172019, "text": "ユーモアありすぎや", "created_at": "2024-09-21T09:55:17", "owner": "shiyakemanzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092618362464239, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-18T19:44:18", "owner": "info.gemanagements", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045036752307228, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-17T17:43:58", "owner": "diegolelcreador", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008695226396699, "text": "Acá en Argentina estaba la revista \"Lazer\" que contenía un apartado con estos \"Chindogu\" 🥹💕", "created_at": "2024-09-17T15:25:14", "owner": "calo.simoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133182013363010, "text": "Too slow, make it faster", "created_at": "2024-09-17T07:40:47", "owner": "jia.chen.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862325443229938, "text": "最後後ろの人タクシーにひかれてもおかしくない位置にいるのが気になる......", "created_at": "2024-09-17T00:14:25", "owner": "s2arisee4s2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061091158729399, "text": "This brought back so many memories! I checked this book out at the library as a kid", "created_at": "2024-