{"media_id": 3449346281796531277, "shortcode": "C_eiir5y_RN", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_eiir5y_RN/", "taken_at": "2024-09-04T01:42:49", "caption": "#测试 #冷知 #生活常#心理压力#心理 #万万没想到 #注意力缺陷#感统失调", "owner_username": "hello.softlife", "owner_id": "62427280517", "likes": 51931, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0044_C_eiir5y_RN\\C_eiir5y_RN_20240904_014249.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18060664565195027, "text": "全中（我也是ADHD）", "created_at": "2025-07-15T04:50:36", "owner": "xiangxiang6572", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261903727262820, "text": "所以是什麼病", "created_at": "2025-01-30T00:58:38", "owner": "ondaminaonda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843152734409042, "text": "好像什麼都有", "created_at": "2025-01-24T00:37:08", "owner": "joanie_chrissy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032302127387549, "text": "全中", "created_at": "2024-12-31T23:11:48", "owner": "_yuki.___.506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054393466986302, "text": "全都有欸，我是不是有冰了😖🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-29T16:06:00", "owner": "lalaberrrr._0202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048490895482579, "text": "我以為我正在google", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:15:29", "owner": "sheloverainie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016360622640155, "text": "@sickpoisal_0320_ 我又有病了？？？🗿", "created_at": "2024-12-07T01:25:27", "owner": "cxzy08__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922060182905757, "text": "全中的意思是我要死了嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-07T00:14:47", "owner": "xuan.0.5cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943497192916305, "text": "我超级有病？", "created_at": "2024-12-06T08:32:29", "owner": "victor_guanjie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873833587143085, "text": "臥槽！我怎麼全中啊...😢", "created_at": "2024-12-05T22:55:03", "owner": "su.mei2010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063210757816203, "text": "除了5之外我全中😮咁即係我有病？", "created_at": "2024-12-04T15:32:45", "owner": "miracle._.172", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027944933571345, "text": "全中", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:19:58", "owner": "jinjerchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012217217466687, "text": "刷到这个视频的时候我正在抖着腿玩手机拖延😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:33:37", "owner": "may.meiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433238437075359, "text": "我有病😮", "created_at": "2024-11-27T13:53:10", "owner": "323.owo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990831822723377, "text": "我只有第2個跟第3個而已🫣", "created_at": "2024-11-26T23:51:42", "owner": "quan23925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049172554958292, "text": "以後上個網搞不好癌症診斷都能給我下出來 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T19:33:13", "owner": "luvnqs_547.48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18253681078284582, "text": "2,3,5不是正常的嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-17T10:12:21", "owner": "chow.1125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888255463057349, "text": "我", "created_at": "2024-11-16T19:20:22", "owner": "aru93095_owom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333234208197512, "text": "每次滑影片滑一滑都會莫名其妙得很多病🫠🖕🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-16T09:09:32", "owner": "zpy._.1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048397549855964, "text": "4\\5", "created_at": "2024-11-14T07:15:35", "owner": "ymlau.zoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039714463992477, "text": "3、4、5😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T12:18:25", "owner": "peggy_06._05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885087934114342, "text": "所以我非常有病", "created_at": "2024-11-09T07:36:35", "owner": "youcatnotplayme5555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043156274166014, "text": "上个网突然就有几百种病了🤓", "created_at": "2024-11-08T03:01:12", "owner": "yeahzhiquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042094001162220, "text": "我就是而且一模一样", "created_at": "2024-11-06T14:33:09", "owner": "yzx._024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868617241231603, "text": "果然一上網差點有絕症", "created_at": "2024-11-03T06:37:32", "owner": "an_mt_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850033303324982, "text": "原来我有病，谢谢你我现在才知道", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:12:11", "owner": "2222222human", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050161384805070, "text": "自从来到ig后我生了很多病", "created_at": "2024-10-30T04:11:40", "owner": "yonglin10__", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17986967108736250, "text": "沒有病😡😡", "created_at": "2024-10-30T00:55:05", "owner": "yuyu_ouo_0129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059388508785171, "text": "全中了诶 看来病又重了", "created_at": "2024-10-27T04:17:38", "owner": "shushan.07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050431594787912, "text": "所以我有病吗", "created_at": "2024-10-26T13:31:30", "owner": "whi.te55555555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048891241944932, "text": "我全中", "created_at": "2024-10-26T13:08:06", "owner": "lilirenhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066754648642363, "text": "all in me怎算", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:38:14", "owner": "vitas7056", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043909192893524, "text": "我超，全中", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:06:37", "owner": "siqi1628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976949448631927, "text": "我有病👍👌", "created_at": "2024-10-20T15:43:37", "owner": "2005_xu_yu_ru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046614187992671, "text": "那我不是也有病😱", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:45:46", "owner": "aprilllsc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065146222728418, "text": "突然覺得我好像全身都是病🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:05:49", "owner": "krystal_82475", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849745696318566, "text": "我有那個蟻走感欸", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:45:04", "owner": "7zovoy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054797602880735, "text": "阿所以是什麼病", "created_at": "2024-10-19T14:57:07", "owner": "guyu._.1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065564377711112, "text": "自從上了互聯網我有了：憂鬱症，注意力缺陷………", "created_at": "2024-10-19T09:11:47", "owner": "han05._.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993363126534196, "text": "马的全中", "created_at": "2024-10-19T08:25:51", "owner": "yc_911._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18282892294210310, "text": "是個人都有，只是嚴重與否", "created_at": "2024-10-18T10:18:09", "owner": "taste_tszz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043183412083667, "text": "我不相信有人腳趾頭沒撞到過", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:27:06", "owner": "9zyuu._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18049052239984048, "text": "ok原来我有病", "created_at": "2024-10-17T05:03:42", "owner": "yuxuan1122_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951974094740015, "text": "全中😂", "created_at": "2024-10-15T13:15:44", "owner": "chichi0104g", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18166630516315408, "text": "嘩，我嚟咗IG之後就有好多病", "created_at": "2024-10-14T13:11:29", "owner": "_dafniedafnie_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17907577278040643, "text": "原來我一直都有病？！", "created_at": "2024-10-11T16:06:16", "owner": "sandra_wang0108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18441890362064389, "text": "干全都有😮", "created_at": "2024-10-11T14:46:01", "owner": "love_huaisan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050074210821925, "text": "不是每个人都一样的吗？😂", "created_at": "2024-10-08T12:56:17", "owner": "ig.yan041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056977756831863, "text": "我從四年級到現在，都會這樣欸", "created_at": "2024-10-08T12:30:12", "owner": "lyx_.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050431105929768, "text": "全中？", "created_at": "2024-10-08T02:27:25", "owner": "liuuu011_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061958971676419, "text": "我才11", "created_at": "2024-10-07T13:15:32", "owner": "delulu_felicia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067164202717759, "text": "我全中😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-07T13:08:44", "owner": "liy_ixin6322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917181882994554, "text": "怎麼辦？那重開算了", "created_at": "2024-10-04T19:11:39", "owner": "baixiaowei_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372896983102100, "text": "注意力缺失症，好像是盧後面的", "created_at": "2024-10-02T05:57:20", "owner": "cola._.pig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021193646244604, "text": "就滑一下 全中 還有病？😢😮", "created_at": "2024-10-02T02:40:10", "owner": "leejiale1230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020097713531724, "text": "我有🧊！？", "created_at": "2024-09-29T09:07:54", "owner": "yangxinying916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014514452619958, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-25T22:29:04", "owner": "louie_alt1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121138948387494, "text": "熬夜完早上的我：", "created_at": "2024-09-25T15:54:59", "owner": "zhou_.1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031893620203652, "text": "有", "created_at": "2024-09-25T14:33:10", "owner": "nana._._1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091795537479439, "text": "我全布都", "created_at": "2024-09-25T14:33:02", "owner": "nana._._1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076823641536675, "text": "妈：你这是少打", "created_at": "2024-09-23T21:51:11", "owner": "roy_am_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983734788598201, "text": "那我是不是可以天天請病假😏", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:13:49", "owner": "y_no_why_k_no", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072799384507466, "text": "我就上個網就這麼水靈靈的有病了？", "created_at": "2024-09-22T03:36:20", "owner": "h._cyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043297733057384, "text": "蛤！！！我有病！！！！！！！！！！", "created_at": "2024-09-21T11:35:31", "owner": "chiu_1717_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181570183306755, "text": "我全都中", "created_at": "2024-09-21T08:23:22", "owner": "xuan1011101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081891364520263, "text": "我果然有病😮", "created_at": "2024-09-21T06:28:08", "owner": "timtim_0708", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461872675032818, "text": "全中怎麼解，投胎有用嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-20T15:33:35", "owner": "yaaaaa._.0423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046467940791792, "text": "非常好，全都中了。", "created_at": "2024-09-19T15:25:57", "owner": "yanzeng_zeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922903911956642, "text": "我全中😢我真的是有病嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-19T06:32:17", "owner": "_yan_.1023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338589742121568, "text": "都有", "created_at": "2024-09-18T23:01:46", "owner": "liuming.2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073143748566616, "text": "我全部都有", "created_at": "2024-09-18T17:34:04", "owner": "chill_sasasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055057780839340, "text": "哇～我每樣都有欸😑", "created_at": "2024-09-18T14:57:14", "owner": "2.lyang", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18040551311477058, "text": "不熬夜可以解決大部分的問題，可是最大的問題是如何不熬夜😢", "created_at": "2024-09-18T14:43:13", "owner": "0070702a", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18037257779156807, "text": "全部😦", "created_at": "2024-09-18T05:52:36", "owner": "syyyyy._.94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034179842267949, "text": "谷歌：癌症", "created_at": "2024-09-18T02:34:21", "owner": "chingzihin1011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072365575571749, "text": "我全中了❓🫠🪦", "created_at": "2024-09-18T02:13:51", "owner": "ghost_uwu_ghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049394629919039, "text": "全都有", "created_at": "2024-09-18T01:13:28", "owner": "tzm_11.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014029127556583, "text": "我又有病上了😮", "created_at": "2024-09-18T00:14:54", "owner": "carolchan_03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897427786061539, "text": "除了第3項,其他都中😢", "created_at": "2024-09-17T20:14:21", "owner": "the_osu_god", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917214267985429, "text": "啥病？", "created_at": "2024-09-17T17:15:29", "owner": "_snowfluff_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899066668049166, "text": "我245", "created_at": "2024-09-17T16:10:18", "owner": "zcy_2.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044611705962729, "text": "每次看到這種的都有病，我都懷疑我要不要去看醫生了😂", "created_at": "2024-09-17T15:44:59", "owner": "1100_sherry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351801766188330, "text": "原来我一直以来都有病", "created_at": "2024-09-17T15:29:18", "owner": "xiao_7ii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070719154521170, "text": "全中 我死定了😍", "created_at": "2024-09-17T14:02:01", "owner": "goblin_1225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033915734232599, "text": "全中我是不是該去死一死了", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:28:23", "owner": "ykz._0630", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936209778793611, "text": "就有病了", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:04:25", "owner": "kahxuanlau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032231765193955, "text": "好的上个网我", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:04:18", "owner": "kahxuanlau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019835492236558, "text": "好好好每個都中了", "created_at": "2024-09-17T11:20:50", "owner": "cyj._.0201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046962082913531, "text": "我有病？", "created_at": "2024-09-17T10:21:38", "owner": "yukitasitasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059460223666585, "text": "這我", "created_at": "2024-09-17T10:20:41", "owner": "14xyunn.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058792696743106, "text": "哦我壓迫性蕁麻疹", "created_at": "2024-09-17T09:45:24", "owner": "dorryun._0514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031243544201715, "text": "我怎麼全中了，媽媽，帶我去醫院", "created_at": "2024-09-17T09:21:22", "owner": "karanamuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068178460609568, "text": "我全部都有", "created_at": "2024-09-17T09:10:45", "owner": "hx._0720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18220779937303820, "text": "什麼辨！我全中😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-09-17T07:40:25", "owner": "ariana.pony730", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076360540544823, "text": "我全部都有", "created_at": "2024-09-17T07:31:20", "owner": "ciilxro.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993530385694612, "text": "1245都有耶", "created_at": "2024-09-17T07:15:35", "owner": "candy1314225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939359718872193, "text": "對呀有時候我會覺得身上刺刺的，為什麼會這樣，是皮膚太乾嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-17T06:53:44", "owner": "lycheelover0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039732842282781, "text": "全中我又病了", "created_at": "2024-09-17T06:53:05", "owner": "yiwenl127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356789176115969, "text": "@jxlxx_.1045 我有病", "created_at": "2024-09-17T06:32:09", "owner": "7xecazz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929576250937772, "text": "原來我有病😱", "created_at": "2024-09-17T06:31:23", "owner": "ay._123_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["测试", "冷知", "生活常", "心理压力", "心理", "万万没想到", "注意力缺陷", "感统失调"]},
{"media_id": 3448996770635622417, "shortcode": "C_dTEoRNKgR", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_dTEoRNKgR/", "taken_at": "2024-09-03T14:09:18", "caption": "maintenant la question est de savoir si ça fonctionne pareil dans l’autre sens.\n\nNow the question is whether it works the same the other way round. \n\nConcept is from @gurjeet_jandu_ , his video inspired me a lot and I wanted to rework it in my own way", "owner_username": "pinoemie_", "owner_id": "49227046", "likes": 42612, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0045_C_dTEoRNKgR\\C_dTEoRNKgR_20240903_140918.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17924837064231898, "text": "Last outfit, please 🙌❤️🙏 ?", "created_at": "2026-02-01T14:11:30", "owner": "sophiederoquemaurel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890256439287945, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2026-01-29T01:15:07", "owner": "marcianselmo.store", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870088159307492, "text": "soooo creative 😍", "created_at": "2025-07-08T00:19:46", "owner": "bsantiagosz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18063525305144141, "text": "Bruhhh ppl who went to school for media design, photography/film etc are winning on social media rn", "created_at": "2025-06-13T18:22:38", "owner": "tiff.dev", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18007988576597095, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T13:25:20", "owner": "marshalkinana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920973492979426, "text": "Did you go to school for this? What’s your story! 👏", "created_at": "2025-06-04T16:12:39", "owner": "natashafascia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064987910505874, "text": "Great idea 😍", "created_at": "2025-05-14T15:37:48", "owner": "itsmariablog", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079053154735741, "text": "What a great idea! And very well executed! Bravo 👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-04-14T13:50:06", "owner": "jakobdinesendk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048676055266716, "text": "An elevator grwm is exactly what we needed 🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-01T00:52:07", "owner": "creaited.brand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 178530770913540