{"media_id": 3443835017711404814, "shortcode": "C_K9bPPvUcO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_K9bPPvUcO/", "taken_at": "2024-08-27T11:22:50", "caption": "教你如何去背半透明的材質！#photoshop \n#ps #adobe #去背 #技巧 #教學 #半透明 #設計 \n\n🌟步驟懶人包🌟\n1.右鍵點選「橡皮擦工具」\n2.選擇「背景橡皮擦工具」\n3.調整上方數值\n（1）點選第二個圖示\n（2）限制：非連續的\n（3）容許度：55%（可以根據需求做調整）\n4.擦除背景", "owner_username": "healthymantw", "owner_id": "48663776800", "likes": 40399, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0046_C_K9bPPvUcO\\C_K9bPPvUcO_20240827_112250.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18268709299253064, "text": "Fácil de entender...", "created_at": "2025-02-07T13:27:55", "owner": "jairomyportfolio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954703332844933, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-13T01:54:52", "owner": "thesunday.life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072000196607785, "text": "Have you heard of “blend if”?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T22:18:05", "owner": "palograff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963258594815439, "text": "Ok now all that's left is to learn Chinese", "created_at": "2024-10-16T15:07:06", "owner": "vonegoth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059342098771647, "text": "Thank u so much", "created_at": "2024-10-14T03:53:47", "owner": "eyo0o.95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862879792186586, "text": "Or you could just google “Plastic lid png” 😂😂 (ik he/she is trying to teach something.)", "created_at": "2024-10-11T16:38:07", "owner": "aaryashettyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18458523208028040, "text": "Canva how?", "created_at": "2024-10-09T21:45:57", "owner": "ywmy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998521836688236, "text": "agora ficou fácil", "created_at": "2024-10-07T09:03:46", "owner": "joaorcleal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139379242359258, "text": "People: I can't speak Chinese, I can't Speak Samurai\nThe tools icon and the UI literally look the same regardless the language though", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:02:21", "owner": "sandraistoday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035587966988508, "text": "Klee sg kene ben cg mace", "created_at": "2024-10-02T04:11:15", "owner": "aryawiweka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940537434781864, "text": "Fake", "created_at": "2024-09-28T12:45:36", "owner": "abang.bona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894481102077352, "text": "SEVENTEEN MENTIONED 🦅", "created_at": "2024-09-25T17:05:16", "owner": "jaybinism", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18010821416372651, "text": "Por eso me gustan más los tutoriales chinos! Son superiores, aunque no entienda nada", "created_at": "2024-09-24T22:23:00", "owner": "monti_oda", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17985242519588791, "text": "感謝❤️❤️方便多了👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-24T13:24:27", "owner": "chen_chiachia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017451089307783, "text": "Good", "created_at": "2024-09-24T07:42:18", "owner": "keosaren5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107269501423349, "text": "@ylylmacot", "created_at": "2024-09-24T07:41:28", "owner": "cuong25399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881143348110062, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:50:24", "owner": "kalenderduakosong25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042941300294510, "text": "Gonna mimic the button clicks, who needs the translation anyways... right? :)", "created_at": "2024-09-21T17:56:28", "owner": "dezyn_ista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016220381312541, "text": "in english, choose background eraser> click sampling once (the dropper icon)> for “limits” choose the discontiguous option> tolerance 55%", "created_at": "2024-09-18T03:42:36", "owner": "nabellt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009230906633243, "text": "Todo muy lindo pero el chino no lo entiendo", "created_at": "2024-09-15T17:18:48", "owner": "robertredart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053715169828801, "text": "Pt nose como pero lo entendí jijiji", "created_at": "2024-09-13T16:48:46", "owner": "ayea0901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857296246251260, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-12T23:18:15", "owner": "idirsidgraphiste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057287272739943, "text": "English woi", "created_at": "2024-09-12T17:29:28", "owner": "fahmihza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017079635609079, "text": "Thanks!", "created_at": "2024-09-11T22:34:40", "owner": "donatebot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035324848960973, "text": "itu pakai background eraser tool (sesuai letak dan gambarnya dikiri), trus pilih mode brush, flow 55%. Trus pilih warna mana tang ingin dihapus. Baru digosok buat ilangin warna warna backgroundnya. Selesai", "created_at": "2024-09-11T11:29:23", "owner": "my_nekopencil", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18007170698419787, "text": "Not everyone in the comments asking about the translation 🥲🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-11T06:36:34", "owner": "0q_y_p0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007121480636205, "text": "when it gets a translation comment please let me know too🙆‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-09-11T01:44:18", "owner": "richasingh5161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456572263038696, "text": "but i dont speak marugame udon 😞", "created_at": "2024-09-11T01:43:32", "owner": "tanyamamaku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273220006246773, "text": "@liineyumi", "created_at": "2024-09-10T23:08:08", "owner": "eusouomath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130745791363374, "text": "現在這麼輕鬆了嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-10T15:20:25", "owner": "d_22582", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015166388615117, "text": "😢 no English", "created_at": "2024-09-10T11:07:08", "owner": "ayo3dprint_lombok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327634912177271, "text": "ありがとう❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T12:36:49", "owner": "takeshikataoka29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045963208778753, "text": "太方便了！而且好快速", "created_at": "2024-09-08T06:27:32", "owner": "yiiiii_1998", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868719205190114, "text": "Need English version", "created_at": "2024-09-08T04:15:41", "owner": "reski_srg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18035645804147002, "text": "Ok gracia", "created_at": "2024-09-07T19:00:57", "owner": "luisenr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18221710024303816, "text": "感謝分享！", "created_at": "2024-09-07T12:58:26", "owner": "c__ping_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18451925986049711, "text": "Fire song", "created_at": "2024-09-07T08:45:48", "owner": "we.ebiologist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891309913085480,