, "text": "ok google, translate this", "created_at": "2024-09-05T09:46:56", "owner": "shoyarism", "likes": 585}, {"id": 18275809789171012, "text": "ENGLISHHH PLEASE", "created_at": "2024-09-05T09:12:50", "owner": "azza.godath", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038774384499341, "text": "The question is, how is the lid perfectly matches the tray packaging?", "created_at": "2024-09-05T03:51:32", "owner": "abdurroziqn", "likes": 189}, {"id": 17990953370529705, "text": "Mejor ocupar los canales alfas", "created_at": "2024-09-05T03:18:46", "owner": "walen_va", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925341984843682, "text": "練了好久", "created_at": "2024-09-05T01:23:00", "owner": "kevinnew010200", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18044895526785463, "text": "Alguien  que me diga que dice en español 😢", "created_at": "2024-09-04T06:47:59", "owner": "jericallo.png", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18054732589829468, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-03T20:12:06", "owner": "bgssttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029646056245038, "text": "求歌名🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-03T12:51:48", "owner": "hinhinhin._.hinhin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476666491037292, "text": "فش حكي يعمي شغل مرتب ❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-03T05:00:46", "owner": "ibrahim_al_arab1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848965561279991, "text": "Tau translate tools-nya ga? @christineangki", "created_at": "2024-09-02T10:54:56", "owner": "mayopiprayuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006782477418704, "text": "Vrga, no sé chino", "created_at": "2024-09-02T05:48:54", "owner": "skatofracasado", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17979681593603667, "text": "Que layos dice??? :v", "created_at": "2024-09-02T00:35:02", "owner": "felipejasson", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18044519149927385, "text": "感謝🫶🏻", "created_at": "2024-08-29T18:16:12", "owner": "mint_323_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038807492023255, "text": "好方便的方法！", "created_at": "2024-08-29T12:45:46", "owner": "chihuor", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18112447537395971, "text": "@vaking01 好實用", "created_at": "2024-08-29T04:56:19", "owner": "wonhanlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947319171841728, "text": "天啊 我之前用通道去背像個北七", "created_at": "2024-08-28T06:06:44", "owner": "jenny_1004_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18054933592693325, "text": "太實用了!!!", "created_at": "2024-08-28T03:27:50", "owner": "mwo_haseyo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076524769543670, "text": "教得超詳細，謝謝👏", "created_at": "2024-08-27T13:18:24", "owner": "ruth_lin0220", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901290418043855, "text": "死客", "created_at": "2024-09-06T20:39:44", "owner": "garqaab", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["photoshop", "ps", "adobe", "去背", "技巧", "教學", "半透明", "設計"]},
{"media_id": 3418648784101934573, "shortcode": "C9xevTUN4Xt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9xevTUN4Xt/", "taken_at": "2024-07-23T17:12:14", "caption": "Pillowcase Trick Saves on Luggage Fees\n©: @tedi.jpg", "owner_username": "willowsreelss", "owner_id": "67517354284", "likes": 723790, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0047_C9xevTUN4Xt\\C9xevTUN4Xt_20240723_171214.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18048153461142323, "text": "Can i Carry a gun in there?", "created_at": "2025-01-10T05:24:44", "owner": "_davczo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028917080254239, "text": "Imagine packing a dildo in there and putting it on someone his chair", "created_at": "2025-01-04T09:57:17", "owner": "wilcovan_vugt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847280500380572, "text": "Watch tsa stop me when I try this😭", "created_at": "2024-12-27T22:28:59", "owner": "aaralynn.gonzalez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029116766215304, "text": "If they find out you get a pretty expensive fine", "created_at": "2024-12-20T11:20:17", "owner": "olivier.slagter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890883970145399, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2024-12-18T20:30:20", "owner": "antonioharrell60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322742365082529, "text": "They would see everything through the scanner", "created_at": "2024-11-25T01:12:13", "owner": "sharyn_tee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063375844699684, "text": "So she's only wearing underwear for her trip it must be hot where she's going", "created_at": "2024-11-24T02:28:55", "owner": "el_gueroaguayo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040793266996673, "text": "good try but put it in a plastic bag! the trays are filthy in airports", "created_at": "2024-11-23T18:59:53", "owner": "artwearchic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044626523480842, "text": "Do this all the time. Saves me 5 kg", "created_at": "2024-11-23T11:08:00", "owner": "bettymihalakos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893088070077662, "text": "@efamaduck how long have you being doing this lol", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:00:08", "owner": "brenda.lacey1601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047655602041292, "text": "So what?", "created_at": "2024-11-20T19:01:46", "owner": "ewertzclaudia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329206099145808, "text": "Of course", "created_at": "2024-11-17T03:24:33", "owner": "fortheloveofpoly11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000933917697796, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2024-11-16T00:52:27", "owner": "mtpimpinella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115904521414292, "text": "He’ll yeah", "created_at": "2024-11-13T02:08:00", "owner": "baechambers", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933435057952385, "text": "That won't get through security they scan everything and she would be pulled a side for that", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:20:17", "owner": "muddyduck11", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17964990134815251, "text": "That's me", "created_at": "2024-11-11T17:21:26", "owner": "lilianbaiza730", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18448912891071135, "text": "Smart", "created_at": "2024-11-08T20:54:52", "owner": "alwaysaladyforlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948713766856889, "text": "Great hack!!", "created_at": "2024-11-08T13:44:44", "owner": "clairemistique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042627835920056, "text": "No way so much stuff would fit in that half empty looking cushion cover! 😠", "created_at": "2024-11-05T20:26:20", "owner": "zuri_malta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023670377568388, "text": "But it included carry on boyfriend", "created_at": "2024-11-05T10:01:15", "owner": "gunbarul_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845393461333815, "text": "No", "created_at": "2024-11-04T21:59:42", "owner": "hedmarklindy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094893235468156, "text": "Very nice 👌", "created_at": "2024-11-04T20:37:21", "owner": "janice.brewster.73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886764103136306, "text": "wow", "created_at": "2024-11-04T19:49:06", "owner": "peaches_goodgyal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061765999783590, "text": "It is still going to be X-rayed", "created_at": "2024-11-04T18:19:04", "owner": "drifter024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984994611607670, "text": "It’s still a carry on 😣", "created_at": "2024-11-04T18:18:04", "owner": "drifter024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958715787715540, "text": "Be carefull with the dust...!!!", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:20:42", "owner": "viantz_pradz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985045044607116, "text": "Backpack is free", "created_at": "2024-11-04T12:01:23", "owner": "nig00ne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359085613142001, "text": "Ate Shannon @ho3e.png 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T05:30:22", "owner": "_donmjimenez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088776796455094, "text": "I need more than that no matter where I'm going", "created_at": "2024-11-03T23:29:19", "owner": "dreamm_bigg_er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468451678036027, "text": "I did it..i😍 and successed too 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T03:10:51", "owner": "_sapho_cordova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147852259343643, "text": "Love it  smart choice", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:13:55", "owner": "aniahania2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996413442686753, "text": "then the woman became a dude😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T11:20:24", "owner": "erwinfigueroa20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037975193231504, "text": "Yes a friend did it , all good 👍", "created_at": "2024-10-29T02:26:22", "owner": "hijablove63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022913723577316, "text": "In Morocco they broke my bag and my watermelon didnt get in the bag anymore😢", "created_at": "2024-10-28T19:44:32", "owner": "tay13594", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133880884369357, "text": "This is why everyone is having to pay more for hand luggage 🙄🙄🙄", "created_at": "2024-10-28T05:57:23", "owner": "caz_wanderlust_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034092158464581, "text": "@vara_raturi , haha,", "created_at": "2024-10-27T09:50:42", "owner": "shravan_d_v", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996552498703450, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-27T01:52:39", "owner": "ms.amazing__x17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884913586130843, "text": "Cheap", "created_at": "2024-10-23T11:41:13", "owner": "hucknicola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026313227598896, "text": "It will work if you go to beach. Imagine you put jacket inside it. Hahhaa", "created_at": "2024-10-22T15:55:07", "owner": "mickajaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044458715019665, "text": "And don’t forget all the dirt and germs it will pick up with that fabric", "created_at": "2024-10-21T20:19:40", "owner": "smorgan441", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068471113624667, "text": "What flight doesn't allow a personal item?", "created_at": "2024-10-21T17:42:51", "owner": "moved_by_the_spirit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038467439326725, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T15:36:44", "owner": "kingcatchuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917588898901218, "text": "Geez.. just a flight.", "created_at": "2024-10-19T17:43:34", "owner": "quynhnhu.tran.0111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855585187241500, "text": "Wow. Great idea", "created_at": "2024-10-19T04:53:35", "owner": "beardedbeachboy3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885492943056580, "text": "It works?😬😂", "created_at": "2024-10-18T19:05:47", "owner": "juli_anastasia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018759299556035, "text": "That’s one uncomfortable pillow 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:27:19", "owner": "renovationtec_61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021520199266065, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-18T15:07:33", "owner": "moeconsultancy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058838824762881, "text": "Would do it and have done it.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T18:15:22", "owner": "omegrabian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913165296917768, "text": "Just picking all that dirt in them containers , rubbing your face on it. 😂😂👍🏽", "created_at": "2024-10-16T18:07:01", "owner": "derek_decosta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979515537769198, "text": "I have a head rest stuffed with tshirts.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T07:18:48", "owner": "notaromax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894733846088971, "text": "The ingenuity of a woman never ceases to amaze me !!", "created_at": "2024-10-14T00:02:41", "owner": "the_grateful__alcoholic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043491182509047, "text": "❤️🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-13T19:16:40", "owner": "trishaor2fl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18458417041020104, "text": "Because y’all put everything on the Internet now, the airlines are starting to crack down and count pillows as an item", "created_at": "2024-10-13T01:20:05", "owner": "traynmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981665694757244, "text": "I did it.", "created_at": "2024-10-12T19:50:41", "owner": "pierre.la68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124436158378516, "text": "Yes, thank you", "created_at": "2024-10-12T00:28:53", "owner": "kbraneshe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009818174431432, "text": "Good idea l like it", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:31:28", "owner": "owod_anmask", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044446544003670, "text": "Luckily my. Plan failed. 😢 And.  Am in jail now😢", "created_at": "2024-10-10T02:06:46", "owner": "a.k.k.u.m.o.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026434859383789, "text": "Cheep", "created_at": "2024-10-09T22:19:20", "owner": "weken8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045909283953480, "text": "Not wise to play tricks like that in an airplane where weight and balance is calculated. If everyone does that it might become a safety issue.", "created_at": "2024-10-08T20:33:35", "owner": "martinaklein777", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055458652864475, "text": "I've done this every time I have traveled in the past 2 years and it's never not worked", "created_at": "2024-10-07T03:05:59", "owner": "isa__mrl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906005980024699, "text": "I mean, they could just count it as a personal item, it's almost like a bag 🤷🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-10-06T23:49:06", "owner": "_elii.g.b_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931919730942180, "text": "What about shoes?", "created_at": "2024-10-06T23:21:04", "owner": "andisaric_palermo84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867172921215108, "text": "No way it wouldn’t work", "created_at": "2024-10-06T21:04:56", "owner": "erikajusterika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063613327640554, "text": "It's called a carry on...airlines will.still count it as 1 of your 2 items", "created_at": "2024-10-06T11:16:28", "owner": "travel_lori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18464662294000782, "text": "I did this many years ago and worked 😉 but now I don’t do this anymore because is too much work 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-06T10:03:13", "owner": "jessiimarques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022101353232889, "text": "Did it myself. Nice Hack", "created_at": "2024-10-06T09:48:39", "owner": "sonique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031010666364062, "text": "Tacky", "created_at": "2024-10-06T02:17:51", "owner": "mr.tattybear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115107205405687, "text": "Hell ya", "created_at": "2024-10-05T22:51:44", "owner": "anuszkakej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942907656899987, "text": "@baharaa25", "created_at": "2024-10-05T21:33:12", "owner": "hosai_mt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057052699768379, "text": "You mean the cheapest and brokest ticket ever.", "created_at": "2024-10-05T20:46:20", "owner": "oghadi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121223653387096, "text": "If you dress that way", "created_at": "2024-10-05T20:03:04", "owner": "haggardasshit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312691390091918, "text": "No they would definitely unzip and check the pillow out in case drugs were being smuggled in it 🙃", "created_at": "2024-10-05T19:51:34", "owner": "debbiebrown154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992329212544163, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-05T14:21:14", "owner": "lolita4yu__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940909593878048, "text": "@provigr tú", "created_at": "2024-10-05T13:20:41", "owner": "alf993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976671642767470, "text": "Already tried this and it works most of the time. Only some German airlines are extra strict", "created_at": "2024-10-05T08:50:48", "owner": "ako_sumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015299114551508, "text": "U know they have scanners", "created_at": "2024-10-05T08:16:30", "owner": "sumit____joshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128362738372155, "text": "People who can’t afford to fly shouldn’t fly. They are getting on everyone’s nerves anyway.", "created_at": "2024-10-05T07:13:38", "owner": "dallimanski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082734088464145, "text": "Err x-ray?", "created_at": "2024-10-05T06:49:06", "owner": "bobber_stu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048674461768766, "text": "i’ve done this and of course it works, you get a free personal item usually with any flight. it can be a pretty good sized bag, i usually pack as much as i can into that and then have a blanket wrapped around me where i wear another couple body bags holding my laptop and common things, you don’t have to hide anything from security you just need to look like your item qualifies as a personal when you start boarding or they’ll make you pay for a carry on", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:57:43", "owner": "scarletts.sinnerss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072891391598857, "text": "Security doesn't care", "created_at": "2024-10-04T15:27:35", "owner": "malkearney29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898716786978847, "text": "The pillows usually goes in the trash if u forget it on the plane.. just telling u !", "created_at": "2024-10-04T15:14:21", "owner": "s.m.bye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361059112114635, "text": "You know this is a good way to get delayed becuase the weight of the plane is off your not smart", "created_at": "2024-10-04T12:07:05", "owner": "i_lv_mrbubbles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252935128271443, "text": "Thanks to social media airlines have now caught on to one of the best tricks", "created_at": "2024-10-04T08:44:44", "owner": "miller.bob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109824829423629, "text": "Genius 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-04T04:55:25", "owner": "pay4fish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439637740071817, "text": "Tsa and the airlines counter are two different things... sayless before the charge us for pillows", "created_at": "2024-10-04T00:37:49", "owner": "hubert40f5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042427352315666, "text": "You should wear very little fabric to use this pillow. It is only for a vacation in the Caribbean and 45-55 k girls", "created_at": "2024-10-03T18:47:51", "owner": "yanivg80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050750332902112, "text": "It will never make it past the xray machine as they will see her clothes inside the case. You will be charged for a luggage", "created_at": "2024-10-03T17:47:04", "owner": "bubblesnail66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044537504049492, "text": "That’s not a woman. That’s a teenager…👌💯", "created_at": "2024-10-03T15:38:55", "owner": "zwei_1383", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981202266742400, "text": "How does it went throw the scanner??", "created_at": "2024-10-03T14:04:23", "owner": "wavic_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031979273261202, "text": "Smart❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-03T13:45:37", "owner": "jvinst123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059470507739155, "text": "That tray is the most dirtiest thing you put the pillow in 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-03T00:38:42", "owner": "pepa_ozzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067089643622809, "text": "Where can we get it from?", "created_at": "2024-10-02T23:52:17", "owner": "eugeneiseverything", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023737691593578, "text": "Also ich bin letzte Woche geflogen und habe es selbst ausprobiert, weil im Internet steht, dass es nicht verboten ist und ich hatte tatsächlich keine Probleme damit. Es hat tatsächlich funktioniert 👏", "created_at": "2024-10-02T00:30:17", "owner": "deborah_brost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043744949006404, "text": "I saw this once and did it when flying across continents with 3 connections. No problems, though some people looked at me side eyed and flight attendants knowingly, but. O one ever stopped me or asked to leave it behind. It’s the same as travelling with a neck pillow/rest - you can pack that one too in some cases (not tried yet) 😊 \n\nAll in all - minus is that it can be quite bulky and if you have an isle or middle seat it takes up a lot of space and not always you can store it in the above luggage compartment due to limited space. Also some garments can be quite hard and you should find soft ones, so it’s comfortable.\nPlus was that o could use it for both my head or lower back or feet if I wished and it was super comfy. Plus, if you’ve used it before, you’d have your own familiar smell on it which helps with falling asleep faster and having better sleep on long flights. \n\nAn advice, stuff in it also a cashmere shall that you can use to cover yourself up for the coziness and warmth and compression socks that will ensure blood circulation. Keep with you also earplugs and an eye mask to fully block out the surroundings.", "created_at": "2024-09-29T20:27:14", "owner": "wildorchidevi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101020927453408, "text": "@seaformm", "created_at": "2024-09-28T13:47:45", "owner": "ms_mutemwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107489446423426, "text": "Hear is a tip bring a fanny pack for your tooth paste tooth brush and other Toiletrys if it's a fanny aock it's not a second bag it's a fashoin excesosory 😂😂😂 so you sabe money", "created_at": "2024-09-27T17:14:06", "owner": "mr.truth_98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049597378928570, "text": "A guy copied this and was stopped in TSA. 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:51:46", "owner": "5ng127j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252553669252940, "text": "Sharp as a dart 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:50:28", "owner": "hindkaren1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065675248718940, "text": "Where can I buy this", "created_at": "2024-09-22T00:35:40", "owner": "beautiful_bless2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929526000937858, "text": "I once took a trip & dint want to check luggage so I just wore everything then pulled outa bag and took it all off and filled the bag.. the passenger next to me did not approve I had so many clothes on and said to her “what?? They limit your carry ons but there’s no rules for carrying off! 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-21T09:09:00", "owner": "westwindvision", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3453327118031941001, "shortcode": "C_srrejhG2J", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_srrejhG2J/", "taken_at": "2024-09-09T13:31:34", "caption": "🌊\n#浸大黃宗澤 #浸大跑車 💤🦻🏻 \n#業餘歌手 🎤\n\n.ᐟ.ᐟ Professional Development Director專業發展主委 .ᐟ.ᐟ\n\n第二位出場嘅就係我哋嘅PD Bosco喇🚗⚽️\n\n我哋PD Bosco好鍾意唱歌架👄 佢鍾意唱歌到每分每秒都唱緊歌👊🏻 另外連瞓覺嗰陣都鍾意發出有節奏嘅beat俾大家聽😅🎷聽佢啲Roommate講之前住Hall未開門已經估到Bosco喺唔喺房👂🏻 有時真係會想叫佢收聲唔好再唱🙂‍↔️🙏🏻 \n\nBosco除咗成日唱歌之外😓 踢波個陣係好型既✨😲 上年睇佢踢堂際佢一個可以扭晒幾個人架⚡️⚽️\n\n另外黃宗澤PD都好有諗頭架⁎⁍̴̛ᴗ⁍̴̛⁎🦵🏻 為咗令各位同學學到更多嘅專業知識💫 Bosco今年就Plan咗一連串嘅PD活動！🔮🪄 今年嘅PD活動交俾佢就保證有趣啦😜🤞🏻 有興趣嘅同學仔記得搵佢報名呀❤️🫷🏻\n\n#RID3450\n#RACHKBU2425\n#浸大扶青\n#溯源\n#waveract", "owner_username": "rachkbu2425_", "owner_id": "3412172327", "likes": 226, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0048_C_srrejhG2J\\C_srrejhG2J_20240909_133134.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18266922331219453", "text": "好騷擾", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:38:15", "owner": "__y.h.ttttt__", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18020524727596414", "text": "可摸耳唔好再唱", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:38:10", "owner": "__y.h.ttttt__", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18028925240062153", "text": "唱完歌未", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:37:59", "owner": "__y.h.ttttt__", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18016762103614017", "text": "可唔可以唱第二首歌？唔好淨係唱死同一首😅", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:33:54", "owner": "tszyanelni", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18331789234179094", "text": "你好嘈你可唔可以收聲", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:33:21", "owner": "_suetying._", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18010979963630736", "text": "幾時有得睇自彈自唱？", "created_at": "2024-09-10T11:59:44", "owner": "tszyanelni", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18063756088561241", "text": "洪嘉豪😘😘😘😘😘😘", "created_at": "2024-09-09T16:18:07", "owner": "_lauyen012", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17986988030565643", "text": "咁型😍", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:59:39", "owner": "1aikm", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17893397313065139", "text": "Bosco😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:51:44", "owner": "juzztinnn", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18041801663508013", "text": "帥", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:50:27", "owner": "khlsc__", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18013714619544062", "text": "@juzztinnn 你lm唔撚早啲交", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:49:46", "owner": "_hahahahhha_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18275076616172543", "text": "咁型邊個夠你黎😢", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:47:38", "owner": "ukkting_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18111309499408941", "text": "🥵 @_hahahahhha_", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:43:12", "owner": "xvxh_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18293877025203933", "text": "宗澤幾時開班教溝女？", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:09:47", "owner": "krystalho629", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17951834228828321", "text": "百家樂賭神再再再再出發未？", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:55:30", "owner": "_kamzai_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18075334231484533", "text": "Zzzzzzzzzzzzzzz", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:50:15", "owner": "rudy0910_", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["浸大黃宗澤", "浸大跑車", "業餘歌手", "rid3450", "rachkbu2425", "浸大扶青", "溯源", "waveract"]},
{"media_id": 3452663603277718118, "shortcode": "C_qU0ESSeJm", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_qU0ESSeJm/", "taken_at": "2024-09-08T15:33:16", "caption": "🌊\n#浸大泰妹 #第三代純愛戰士 \n#田娜老師\n\n.ᐟ.ᐟ Promotion and Publication Director 宣傳及出版主委 .ᐟ.ᐟ\n\n登凳✨第一位出場嘅就係我哋嘅PO Tina🐍\n\n自稱承傳咗扶青PO一定係一個靚女傳統嘅Tina成日都問我哋究竟佢出嘅設靚啲定係佢個樣靚啲😓 對美感呢件事可以話係極度執着🧐 將出設嘅責任交俾佢就一定唔洗驚啦⌯˃̶᷄ ⁻̫ ˂̶᷄⌯💓\n\n啱啱識Tina嗰陣真係會有啲驚佢👀因為佢個樣睇落好似好惡好難接近👉🏻👈🏻但係傾多兩句計就會發現全部都係假㗎😙因為佢個腦好似長期都塞住咗🤧 連聽嘢都慢人半拍咁🪫身為我哋莊入面嘅遊戲黑洞🕳️玩game從來都未贏過😔 就算同佢講埋Black Magic嘅答案 佢都仲係會唔知發生緊咩事咁周圍問人點解🤯🙏🏻\n\n自稱純正香港人嘅Tina成日都俾人誤會佢係泰妹😚 連去泰國旅行都會俾泰國人當同鄉🧕🏼 而戒咗食肉幾年嘅Tina每次食飯都會逼人叫多兩碟泰式炒通菜再同我哋講動物權益🤓\n\n如果想再認識多啲我哋嘅PO🤩 就要密切留意我哋嚟緊嘅活動啦🫦☄️\n\n#RID3450\n#RACHKBU2425\n#浸大扶青\n#溯源\n#waveract", "owner_username": "rachkbu2425_", "owner_id": "3412172327", "likes": 363, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0049_C_qU0ESSeJm\\C_qU0ESSeJm_20240908_153316.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18065557192616342", "text": "@_peachjai_ 你係咪唔愛你正下啦", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:32:11", "owner": "9uia14", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17997225455667762", "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:20:28", "owner": "isleypa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18045705250795689", "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:20:25", "owner": "isleypa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18040973873020872", "text": "chiikawa鐵粉", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:17:37", "owner": "marvis_lst", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18045148201805975", "text": "娜b!!!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:15:34", "owner": "dont.stalk9me", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17855716044258055", "text": "老铁 几时打游戏", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:07:29", "owner": "isleypa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18022566530190537", "text": "你是微辣Tina嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:07:24", "owner": "9uia14", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18018199934600408", "text": "靚女到", "created_at": "2024-09-10T02:26:50", "owner": "buticantlivewithoutmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17870567334179180", "text": "joma快啲買ck底褲", "created_at": "2024-09-09T04:10:07", "owner": "waiwaiwaiips", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17865516180148015", "text": "tina水唷!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-08T17:25:25", "owner": "ht._._____", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18456112144029193", "text": "咁靚女點搞", "created_at": "2024-09-08T16:00:59", "owner": "_w.k.y_0331", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18068274619600927", "text": "据导游介绍，泰妹的目标也主要是白皮肤的老外，很少向亚裔人主动揽生意，要揽也是韩国人、日本人，不会找中国人，据说也是因为中国人信用不好，还嫌泰妹丑。但是老外得审美跟咱不一样啊，他们喜欢野性，喜欢开朗大方，喜欢无拘无束。很多泰妹能说简单的英语，与老外能交流，这是老外喜欢泰妹的一个重要原因。", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:49:50", "owner": "poyiyi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18142411894338922", "text": "เรารู้สึกเป็นเกียรติที่ได้บริการคุณ🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:39:12", "owner": "rudy0910_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18036867737114153", "text": "好想同正下瘋狂食牛", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:36:24", "owner": "krystalho629", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18369605437098917", "text": "คุณสวยที่สุด💙", "created_at": "2024-09-08T15:35:04", "owner": "allen_0126", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["浸大泰妹", "第三代純愛戰士", "田娜老師", "rid3450", "rachkbu2425", "浸大扶青", "溯源", "waveract"]},
