wards", "created_at": "2024-11-05T03:07:05", "owner": "yydyydyydyyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055291369920854, "text": "Tryna be her rn 😍", "created_at": "2024-11-04T04:33:21", "owner": "lillyfanxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888401179107523, "text": "Dream or millions🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:10:03", "owner": "millionaire_dreams_11.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066702748635122, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-02T17:47:21", "owner": "aysebalikci.34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025789286203209, "text": "❤❤", "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:54:57", "owner": "abrazu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081240433549086, "text": "👏😍", "created_at": "2024-11-01T08:24:15", "owner": "amirmahdizoli8.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062905042701613, "text": "Assolutamente con Q", "created_at": "2024-10-31T20:06:51", "owner": "cesareimpero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030372851111363, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-31T06:09:57", "owner": "jolanta_dziamara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878542480177349, "text": "Asheeee 🔥🫰🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-31T04:58:29", "owner": "john_ayala.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991245216569747, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-30T20:38:36", "owner": "maram_mira11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096956257462143, "text": "🫦🥵💕", "created_at": "2024-10-29T16:58:16", "owner": "boubouser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880163155090097, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-29T08:35:39", "owner": "miamilkersss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080773732535536, "text": "Music?", "created_at": "2024-10-28T07:00:51", "owner": "yaavahuee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053028919821897, "text": "I dream of this 🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-28T03:39:13", "owner": "selma__ry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858851608274917, "text": "🔥🔥❤️❤️🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-27T19:47:12", "owner": "maisonkinperfumes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090064378496083, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-27T17:22:53", "owner": "eder.xxt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850318342322868, "text": "This girl you Can take off the Disco Club when you have a good Re