{"media_id": 3435663320559159151, "shortcode": "C-t7ZZNxIdv", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-t7ZZNxIdv/", "taken_at": "2024-08-16T04:37:01", "caption": "", "owner_username": "kaiwenkev_11", "owner_id": "50130192518", "likes": 3960, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0051_C-t7ZZNxIdv\\C-t7ZZNxIdv_20240816_043701.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18165450979322032, "text": "麻豆不是早就被查封了吗", "created_at": "2025-01-03T13:25:49", "owner": "zhaozhousan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042326942134356, "text": "看指甲是女的", "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:05:49", "owner": "xinyukijudai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986730393743838, "text": "幽默风趣评论区", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:28:25", "owner": "tnhgbvtasycd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028743512171070, "text": "汁男？", "created_at": "2024-11-11T01:07:29", "owner": "naleceylan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18377663284096791, "text": "接👏", "created_at": "2024-11-10T07:45:52", "owner": "ww_ww88866", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887734027057544, "text": "Is that true?or just buy ?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T06:37:44", "owner": "chundu0910", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915441991000957, "text": "我不要工资，只求参演", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:17:59", "owner": "cometolife2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842986807349202, "text": "別擔心兄弟我們都懂這證件的含（金）量", "created_at": "2024-11-01T11:09:37", "owner": "jk529424631", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17922925415987512, "text": "来个妹妹 瑟瑟", "created_at": "2024-10-31T04:16:50", "owner": "lzf0286", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18423548332074628, "text": "@hanggg1216 @inana554304", "created_at": "2024-10-28T06:26:49", "owner": "liang.04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886061374132603, "text": "在旁邊寫了五個小時作業的同學", "created_at": "2024-10-27T10:46:43", "owner": "chenchenqiwei", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18050403451790273, "text": "麻豆传媒那么赚钱😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T11:58:13", "owner": "lin.sihan_a", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18027864944375519, "text": "全国指路人，车辆已验证，无中间，直击本人，主要一二线城市", "created_at": "2024-10-23T09:41:23", "owner": "doubled5471", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027852989522731, "text": "誰和我演一集鈣片🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:03:06", "owner": "astar0667", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041380052146094, "text": "还要演员吗？", "created_at": "2024-10-22T13:58:03", "owner": "qiqi5202024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002258303678049, "text": "文", "created_at": "2024-10-19T16:01:04", "owner": "ja0306_p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030708149345440, "text": "哥 我想入职", "created_at": "2024-10-16T11:15:16", "owner": "zhuixinfeng", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035933279190443, "text": "有前途的小伙子", "created_at": "2024-10-10T04:18:40", "owner": "147258369jielin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18064025845640410, "text": "来妹妹一起拍，可以先来了解一下，露脸不露都可", "created_at": "2024-10-08T21:00:44", "owner": "shenqing1yanyi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18101806867442859, "text": "我一直在等這個機會👏", "created_at": "2024-10-08T20:25:06", "owner": "yimao372", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18021178226243656, "text": "我演一集行吗", "created_at": "2024-10-08T12:58:28", "owner": "marcus101cly", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17920024325887114, "text": "演被捆绑看女友被。。。。", "created_at": "2024-10-08T09:36:07", "owner": "jeff_zhiyonggg", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18027943562116712, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-07T19:16:03", "owner": "uu888.6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051476500732089, "text": "哥 能不能让我也演一集啊？", "created_at": "2024-10-06T22:07:00", "owner": "xiaoxu4030", "likes": 44}, {"id": 17866705677216812, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T20:37:28", "owner": "zhengpengzhang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959261334696474, "text": "还招人吗  哈哈哈  我想报名", "created_at": "2024-10-02T11:46:53", "owner": "sunxuxinsun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964501071798101, "text": "有五险一金吗", "created_at": "2024-10-02T04:40:08", "owner": "xinshiquanzailianshang526", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17882412960130577, "text": "我是真人！有哥哥嘛  想吃", "created_at": "2024-10-01T13:16:37", "owner": "ttti.chiiil", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18057697507749637, "text": "能让我去么", "created_at": "2024-10-01T05:20:40", "owner": "qtv133", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18351417811188754, "text": "@t_.han @danielhuong02 我的job", "created_at": "2024-10-01T04:56:02", "owner": "samkairui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046396526293377, "text": "生活好起来了", "created_at": "2024-10-01T03:00:34", "owner": "tiany0529", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18369815245097974, "text": "我想入职😂", "created_at": "2024-09-25T04:40:13", "owner": "haomingq", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066599965621335, "text": "pm", "created_at": "2024-09-25T03:33:15", "owner": "080313__", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18027041114459714, "text": "心心向往", "created_at": "2024-09-20T18:45:43", "owner": "democrats_in_china", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18351555994186653, "text": "想和爸爸玩文爱", "created_at": "2024-09-20T15:46:23", "owner": "azzazza8288", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981330510602918, "text": "😍😍😍我想要", "created_at": "2024-09-20T14:20:14", "owner": "mzw200603", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076808692543916, "text": "還請人嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-09-20T11:34:34", "owner": "szemankin06", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17931874304923933, "text": "想回国发展，谁有外汇兑人民比的app推荐🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-20T07:06:59", "owner": "cozzens_logan", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17925409967955357, "text": "這把高端局", "created_at": "2024-09-20T04:55:34", "owner": "180_.0915", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956873214811700, "text": "@yinghaooo.png where can I interview? Asking for a friend", "created_at": "2024-09-20T03:41:21", "owner": "__wilson.jc__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021276743435174, "text": "建议多跟日本学学，", "created_at": "2024-09-20T00:02:58", "owner": "wt.1799303140", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17870462277123802, "text": "汁男？", "created_at": "2024-09-19T13:25:24", "owner": "yangray23", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17984516213723362, "text": "我也好想办一个这样的工作证啊！", "created_at": "2024-09-19T07:58:03", "owner": "zhaofacai185", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18101316835441289, "text": "演男二号吗😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T04:17:17", "owner": "27.37872058", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18062192038641401, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-09-18T16:47:51", "owner": "seeseelooklook_ig", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057782173696199, "text": "有点意思、链接呢、", "created_at": "2024-09-18T