 "", "created_at": "2025-02-19T18:19:35", "owner": "dmaddog.06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303068527227874, "text": "Why does my newfeed show a lot of video like this???? Im going to cry my lung out", "created_at": "2025-02-19T06:05:24", "owner": "cherrydaiki_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019585652468885, "text": "@sxzryx._ inget dance ini😂", "created_at": "2025-02-18T14:09:26", "owner": "shnfd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273662692269076, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-17T20:21:52", "owner": "shelostnmysauce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893124823174278, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-17T16:43:21", "owner": "srochturgunov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939467151971194, "text": "2018", "created_at": "2025-02-17T08:33:51", "owner": "livetsommammamed_tw1llingar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879446005249836, "text": "Stop showing me these bro I cant", "created_at": "2025-02-16T01:50:00", "owner": "luvvvvcj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891781201177275, "text": "2014, the best period", "created_at": "2025-02-16T00:36:27", "owner": "scutiowarner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18259712083274496, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-02-14T22:52:03", "owner": "marius_18733", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052403494899774, "text": "Harlem shake", "created_at": "2025-02-12T08:20:53", "owner": "solo.dif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051670130134359, "text": "Nostalgia hit", "created_at": "2025-02-08T01:43:13", "owner": "bamnawat_animex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060444874940171, "text": "@magin367", "created_at": "2025-02-06T16:56:08", "owner": "hector_707_schneider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059786485794616, "text": "Now the world does nothing but fight and bicker.", "created_at": "2025-02-05T23:34:52", "owner": "slimtimmy_3turnt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022874168401697, "text": "era feliz y no lo sabia", "created_at": "2025-02-05T23:21:30", "owner": "piercetveils", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908023198085455, "text": "Good times", "created_at": "2025-02-01T19:57:56", "owner": "i2zumibabes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055450694083877, "text": "2014-2017>>>>>", "created_at": "2025-01-30T20:54:19", "owner": "aboud_19_setif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066797761675297, "text": "aaa miss 🥹😭", "created_at": "2025-01-27T01:22:44", "owner": "cuttebabbyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047844977182041, "text": "Worst years of my life I was so broke  with no hope 🥲happy to be here now I have my amazing husband a roof over my head and food in the fridge and most importantly I have Jesus in my life 🥹😍😘🥰✝️", "created_at": "2025-01-26T03:50:22", "owner": "weam_will", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037803206132074, "text": "Best years of our life", "created_at": "2025-01-24T04:51:02", "owner": "imdedddd3333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061644154898695, "text": "🙌Absolutely perfect", "created_at": "2025-01-22T23:37:37", "owner": "bryanlee7686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044735798514659, "text": "name song?", "created_at": "2025-01-10T05:30:41", "owner": "naataroo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068657824701231, "text": "Sis vs bro was my favoriteeee how they’re grown up and getting suspended from school 😒", "created_at": "2025-01-07T15:08:59", "owner": "_flowerchild__1118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861678181320909, "text": "You best believe I still make those bracelets 😭", "created_at": "2025-01-06T14:31:00", "owner": "stfu.april", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294573358238297, "text": "Was MyLifeAsEva mentioned?", "created_at": "2024-12-30T18:38:16", "owner": "babykqt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026153651541942, "text": "We were happy but we didn't take advantage of it 😢", "created_at": "2024-12-27T14:46:19", "owner": "animefan200211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041365802262568, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-22T08:39:28", "owner": "your.fav.maru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072615466629236, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2024-12-20T07:50:35", "owner": "_safanaax_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099746020472556, "text": "I’d do anything to go back to that time, just a teen enjoying life 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-04T18:17:27", "owner": "nottheliz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078127969520460, "text": "Nah. 2009-2013 <3", "created_at": "2024-12-04T12:24:58", "owner": "xnicolasschall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059799247876971, "text": "yeees 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-04T07:34:34", "owner": "nameofella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052544095987038, "text": "Это было лучшее время 😭🥹🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-03T16:56:31", "owner": "miraahmedova1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039265274199377, "text": "🥹🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-03T13:39:31", "owner": "luhnae._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962928225823712, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2024-12-03T02:55:53", "owner": "ayyyzzz_izzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469830823039155, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-03T02:05:19", "owner": "lll3.mmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080190952570157, "text": "No only fans", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:15:14", "owner": "arslan_malik_awan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097933510485853, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-02T09:22:39", "owner": "mes_muzammil_zia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122790172395200, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:20:40", "owner": "thepeenarsnipperguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081692299498520, "text": "how to have it back?", "created_at": "2024-12-02T06:34:04", "owner": "pietroosolidoro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022941587561791, "text": "Best time", "created_at": "2024-12-01T23:04:28", "owner": "brd_off", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051601900977074, "text": "Pq minha mãe n me concedeu nos asos 2000?", "created_at": "2024-12-01T20:18:29", "owner": "belle_wolf_ying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146081497348518, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:33:46", "owner": "alaa___hani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043707061954295, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-12-01T10:56:41", "owner": "vitoriatassiafotografa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071605684577519, "text": "“Yes I was there” telling my kid right now", "created_at": "2024-12-01T07:40:31", "owner": "luisoli0296", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023850569533035, "text": "why did everything look so colorful?", "created_at": "2024-12-01T06:10:02", "owner": "jorudaen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029844191581808, "text": "vibes yg ngangenin", "created_at": "2024-12-01T05:38:58", "owner": "elvinarayn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843776554368823, "text": "🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-30T20:38:32", "owner": "jac.kyye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051394225976177, "text": "I miss this so much", "created_at": "2024-11-30T17:54:43", "owner": "drey_day21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026385740445185, "text": "Y’all just had to be there to get the full experience 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-30T17:54:23", "owner": "drey_day21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083918602545395, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:27:42", "owner": "bbmkh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907804305966296, "text": "can we go backk?!!🥺", "created_at": "2024-11-30T13:31:10", "owner": "huang_aey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987403962751146, "text": "🥹👏", "created_at": "2024-11-30T09:56:20", "owner": "1akbarovv._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066386947665672, "text": "No", "created_at": "2024-11-30T09:39:32", "owner": "_aehr.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982658946623219, "text": "now we are the uncles and aunties! 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-30T05:51:55", "owner": "idfkmeeeeee____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038041352201466, "text": "Los pelos de punta😮", "created_at": "2024-11-29T22:03:28", "owner": "___.claudiaaa.____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466762606023481, "text": "1989😍", "created_at": "2024-11-29T19:09:51", "owner": "bilall.clk13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382669813098548, "text": "أثرنا تونا متطورين 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T17:13:57", "owner": "8uen9_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043830221139249, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:16:19", "owner": "mimisirin7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906174079064730, "text": "J’avais l’impression que nous étions tous heureux à cet époque 🥹", "created_at": "2024-11-29T10:20:29", "owner": "le.aahkln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170353591312352, "text": "I remember all I was 10-13 🥹", "created_at": "2024-11-29T05:25:01", "owner": "kayxox25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886459876119279, "text": "Cultura !", "created_at": "2024-11-29T00:51:24", "owner": "vagamundo.es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168792544314271, "text": "That was the time we all peaked let’s be real here.", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:29:43", "owner": "victor.the.conqueror", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027034439221454, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:10:31", "owner": "alwayslove_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868493338252438, "text": "вспомнила как у компа сидела смотрела именно этот шафл на втором отрывке и мечтала о светящихся кроссах…", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:04:56", "owner": "gulliwoodd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064386001752073, "text": "блен😭", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:03:05", "owner": "gulliwoodd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283790986170345, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-11-28T21:09:50", "owner": "kimiarezaee___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051301912961793, "text": "Can we like.. Bring this back??", "created_at": "2024-11-28T19:19:01", "owner": "x.ft_m.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466923136059379, "text": "fidget spinners were everywhere", "created_at": "2024-11-28T15:08:20", "owner": "kevinnjuliann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045044635913026, "text": "Kangen bgt vibes begini😍", "created_at": "2024-11-28T14:29:05", "owner": "abilulhaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 19071592768020807, "text": "And 2011 & 2012 were the best years too 😊", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:33:23", "owner": "lannylatanya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980123202785177, "text": "Yes, take me back. I want to relive it 😫😫😫😩😩😩", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:32:40", "owner": "lannylatanya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027987152197172, "text": "Best year 2017>>>>>>2018-2024 and 1900-2016", "created_at": "2024-11-28T10:48:41", "owner": "nowisrileyfreeman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082710697492941, "text": "Best times of my life 🥹🤧😍", "created_at": "2024-11-28T01:08:49", "owner": "aijelleferreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207939004288752, "text": "lets make this year the best", "created_at": "2024-11-27T18:19:36", "owner": "recklessleepy805", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["2014", "2015", "2016", "2017", "nostalgia", "throwback", "throwbackclips", "nostalgic", "reelvideo", "viralreels", "fyp", "foryou", "viralvideos", "viral"]},
{"media_id": 3453315905837487412, "shortcode": "C_spIUYplU0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_spIUYplU0/", "taken_at": "2024-09-09T13:09:48", "caption": "Who knew smashing your husband in the head with a bottle could be so therapeutic? 😅", "owner_username": "madilynbailey", "owner_id": "27197694", "likes": 4259, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0053_C_spIUYplU0\\C_spIUYplU0_20240909_130948.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18015575573432272, "text": "Cool", "created_at": "2024-12-10T04:55:08", "owner": "brucenyblom", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18303033082160235, "text": "It sounds the same as Bella poarch \"build a b\"", "created_at": "2024-10-05T21:51:26", "owner": "mariebellagran", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17920636766880013, "text": "Si fui y me tiré al suelo por empatizar con la imagen virtual del hombre en el suelo...no lo vuelvo hacer que empatize con esta", "created_at": "2024-10-02T22:38:09", "owner": "artemoda72", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18091500028466640, "text": "Is he ok", "created_at": "2024-09-15T19:52:48", "owner": "shoaibaleeze", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18046335028941340, "text": "The text backwards sounds like something in Ukrainian", "created_at": "2024-09-12T04:59:02", "owner": "ami.sk8", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17949905726736878, "text": "Okay but memorizing the text backwards tho 🤯", "created_at": "2024-09-10T21:45:29", "owner": "huntierose", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18044713330814843, "text": "So she had to pronounce all backwards?", "created_at": "2024-09-10T16:03:22", "owner": "linalee.za_tan", "likes": 60}, {"id": 18348874357188517, "text": "Bilingual?! ↔️", "created_at": "2024-09-10T11:45:52", "owner": "zoom.vett", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17914552724993698, "text": "My name is spelled the exact same!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-09T23:13:21", "owner": "justt._.madilynn", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18032840135020062, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T22:24:59", "owner": "saleh_mohamadi2004", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17946709133846067, "text": "I can feel his concussion .-.", "created_at": "2024-09-09T20:29:56", "owner": "puppetjellyfish", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17990286119687687, "text": "🙌🙌❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T17:38:32", "owner": "tayraytexas", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17891058003084792, "text": "is that man ok", "created_at": "2024-09-09T16:50:21", "owner": "daniyal.__.23", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17974060496771773, "text": "😍😍But I'm curious that how to match the lyrics when the video is played backwards", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:52:32", "owner": "gloriasunlightisme", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18028453661350904, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:47:32", "owner": "mohmadmhdekassab", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17908577199003057, "text": "Always #blamejimmy☺️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:24:35", "owner": "arwen_madfam", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18338212846134930, "text": "I never get tired of True Crime", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:59:03", "owner": "emilythomson2007", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18091382653466005, "text": "https://on.soundcloud.com/gwnosNue47Fisxbj6", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:37:15", "owner": "whatdaselly", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18337089892132737, "text": "I literally cannot get over the way this song and music video moved me... great work yet again 🙌❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:22:37", "owner": "arushi_sharma2910", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17843436855311719, "text": "Never seen this or heard it yet. I’m so glad I have now lol downloading. 🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:19:31", "owner": "feistylittlefairy", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17960724518681551, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:19:19", "owner": "ultimate_guitar_ninja_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18033688559182768, "text": "I’m really sweet tho, trust me ☺️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:18:01", "owner": "madilynbailey", "likes": 85}, {"id": 17989896896687391, "text": "This is your most viewed video ( thanks to jimmy )", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:15:24", "owner": "zsqda_madfam", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17991080354695715, "text": "Even in reverse, you still have THE HOTTEST, VIBRATO, EVER!!!!!! We need FAR MORE GIRLS to have such a hot vibrato though. It's the WORST TRAGEDY EVER that you're the one of the ONLY TWO in the world (the other being Lauren Alvarez). Maybe I should put up a Youtube video with a link to the real thing: \"How to get a vibrato like Madilyn and Lauren combined\"! THIS IS GONNA HAPPEN!!!!!! Right now everyone else has a crap vibrato.", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:12:56", "owner": "mazzillo1996", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17918009051882709, "text": "You posted this like a hundred times though 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:11:50", "owner": "layla.psy", "likes": 99}, {"id": 18136972879359307, "text": "Caption is crazy 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:14:52", "owner": "sada.sfz", "likes": 15}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3365931118207227755, "shortcode": "C62MIS_LNdr", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C62MIS_LNdr/", "taken_at": "2024-05-11T23:36:31", "caption": "留学生朋友圈VS日常 #internationalstudents #comedy", "owner_username": "wild.nomi", "owner_id": "58518152962", "likes": 23028, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0054_C62MIS_LNdr\\C62MIS_LNdr_20240511_233631.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17859948339488864, "text": "驚現爻爻🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-16T13:07:01", "owner": "ericlee111111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864150520396551, "text": "為什麼拖鞋指名廣東呢？😂", "created_at": "2025-09-16T00:04:00", "owner": "its_lily_story", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054492320407248, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-12T11:54:58", "owner": "findelkind.c1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998941842817164, "text": "Nice 👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-08-31T04:53:24", "owner": "sohail5818", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18518662144000577, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-30T14:20:19", "owner": "mibaphotoblog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116212783507766, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-08-30T02:08:11", "owner": "runlikeayashii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077383456794823, "text": "24年你也去巴菲特的伯克希尔股东大会了？我25年去的哈哈老爷子退休咯", "created_at": "2025-08-26T08:59:20", "owner": "ioshuoyuhao", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17885815737222139, "text": "Just like us frfr", "created_at": "2025-08-21T02:47:34", "owner": "frx.99.rafe", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18362760754196800, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:11:31", "owner": "zhaomu001", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17883914280338884, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-07-18T21:43:42", "owner": "_lis.ettee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988044078816564, "text": "全世界的中超都长一样吗😂饭店仓库的既视感", "created_at": "2025-05-24T15:21:08", "owner": "may.meiiii", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18008929931480249, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T16:22:54", "owner": "oliv_iaw2023", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18033044300082836, "text": "淘宝🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-03T05:22:11", "owner": "w.son031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044300513080237, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T09:34:51", "owner": "mr.feelgood____", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18031023599343713, "text": "留學真的沒時間去拍那些😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T05:19:13", "owner": "azuy_aries", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18038901995278816, "text": "多少有點真實", "created_at": "2024-10-18T04:47:11", "owner": "8khloeeeeeee", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18314107261091374, "text": "@j_y_z_y_j", "created_at": "2024-10-12T03:09:56", "owner": "nekoee33", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18001110227674335, "text": "😭😭😭😂", "created_at": "2024-10-12T01:46:10", "owner": "ouo_7180", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366859954110135, "text": "real", "created_at": "2024-10-07T15:56:07", "owner": "yoyoew.exe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18158657269321867, "text": "人才", "created_at": "2024-09-29T19:41:43", "owner": "rainxcash", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041025506077372, "text": "不是 怎麼免簽旅遊啊", "created_at": "2024-09-23T08:15:04", "owner": "ka.renyx", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17906080446010576, "text": "日区留子达不到这个上限，也达不到那个下限😂", "created_at": "2024-09-03T10:56:12", "owner": "mei_meiii9966", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18040754377997182, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-01T03:52:43", "owner": "_.12._.aa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859817767228783, "text": "广东拖鞋带到全世界", "created_at": "2024-08-26T05:01:13", "owner": "lukiu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18042689704777388, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2024-08-06T03:57:59", "owner": "brooklynariana_offical", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931433547912504, "text": "如果需要集運可以dd我個，我哋現在有優惠，價格絕對透明", "created_at": "2024-08-02T02:28:55", "owner": "ture.new.bee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17885478606015645, "text": "真實😂", "created_at": "2024-07-27T14:00:01", "owner": "yiiirong._.2038", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047356567721968, "text": "黑暗廚神是什麼啦😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-07-26T15:30:55", "owner": "yichen8095", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001592036637589, "text": "@ccyyan0515", "created_at": "2024-07-23T14:29:23", "owner": "june_zcc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030177599284206, "text": "為什麼有點像熾的kazuha", "created_at": "2024-07-11T11:03:22", "owner": "skr_soobie1028", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894402802033851, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈完了不敢出国了", "created_at": "2024-07-01T14:09:53", "owner": "diane.yw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18443836174063466, "text": "Sb", "created_at": "2024-07-01T07:28:22", "owner": "lingjie_bu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18005837777614863, "text": "太真了 怎么可以这么真😭！", "created_at": "2024-06-25T15:28:46", "owner": "rayinvelvet32", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18014710475173525, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-06-23T16:16:51", "owner": "nanauiopp", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18315415549194157, "text": "在澳洲留学8年，来的时候烟都不抽我，现在吃喝嫖赌抽样样精通😅", "created_at": "2024-06-18T15:28:34", "owner": "huangjiancheng45", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18040409140928849, "text": "一模一样😢", "created_at": "2024-06-18T10:53:27", "owner": "qwer1asdf0zxcv", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096957934376376, "text": "@t4ydkl2", "created_at": "2024-06-17T13:53:04", "owner": "bananaar_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076572937453583, "text": "留学 ❌流浪✅", "created_at": "2024-06-14T21:46:10", "owner": "wy._.freddy", "likes": 165}, {"id": 18255108973300840, "text": "Hahaha 那我是见过你了", "created_at": "2024-06-01T02:23:55", "owner": "mr.jimmy_xie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045233827786216, "text": "sls 真😂", "created_at": "2024-05-29T09:11:19", "owner": "wto__allen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056929249551914, "text": "笑死人 集美", "created_at": "2024-05-26T22:31:17", "owner": "max.chais", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18415399579071925, "text": "我以為實際上 可以看到腋毛沒掛的畫面", "created_at": "2024-05-25T04:44:51", "owner": "leaf125", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17989663520497532, "text": "你这留学不用读书吗", "created_at": "2024-05-22T20:58:24", "owner": "auster039", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17997147590392233, "text": "太真实了 哈哈哈哈哈 两个都是我🤣", "created_at": "2024-05-19T23:17:58", "owner": "donghaoo_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18008888840241141, "text": "后面绝对是真的", "created_at": "2024-05-19T16:57:28", "owner": "rh.music58", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17998726301373144, "text": "“唯美風是吧”", "created_at": "2024-05-19T08:40:30", "owner": "eruilokn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17986143965655675, "text": "factss", "created_at": "2024-05-18T17:53:55", "owner": "maig1cian", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063518209553539, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-05-18T08:05:26", "owner": "where.is.our.happiness", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060674761566265, "text": "留學生不是都住實驗室的嗎？", "created_at": "2024-05-18T04:31:43", "owner": "haochewang1012", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17939117369733226, "text": "回国出闲置 新买不久的上衣 仅穿几次 10刀 可小刀", "created_at": "2024-05-17T21:15:38", "owner": "wnih.er", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18019996178238256, "text": "好真實😂😂", "created_at": "2024-05-17T14:48:13", "owner": "jessica16688", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18026230301315315, "text": "这AV画质😢", "created_at": "2024-05-17T11:15:08", "owner": "gigf233_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17916425009925669, "text": "好漂亮好美喔，前面後面都超級美的", "created_at": "2024-05-17T11:10:54", "owner": "qiongna_17", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18023145290147182, "text": "@hhrightvc 準備好一起當留學生了嗎😍", "created_at": "2024-05-17T09:28:25", "owner": "wcs_unying", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17994593705444379, "text": "6啊，还去看了巴菲特", "created_at": "2024-05-17T02:16:52", "owner": "smileman_yo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18021450173021017, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣笑死我了尼玛", "created_at": "2024-05-16T18:35:29", "owner": "philosophicalwisdomge", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18053903788618299, "text": "太真實了", "created_at": "2024-05-15T11:00:31", "owner": "jerry86031615", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18322759486121975, "text": "@nyah_literally 真的ㄇ", "created_at": "2024-05-15T07:30:08", "owner": "xfvhnk_0317", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18005524709271695, "text": "真實 hh", "created_at": "2024-05-15T06:24:05", "owner": "balthazar_199", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031066813859752, "text": "@wangping_0727 me in a way", "created_at": "2024-05-15T04:34:09", "owner": "dc_100799", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18019847855036144, "text": "我看了下，我读书的时候还给富二代做饭。不过包了我消费，成了一般朋友", "created_at": "2024-05-15T03:09:55", "owner": "y_1_pete", "likes": 160}, {"id": 18015191279117523, "text": "谁躺地铁上啊", "created_at": "2024-05-14T23:08:26", "owner": "fd_stalker", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18296533336095727, "text": "广东人？", "created_at": "2024-05-14T16:19:35", "owner": "wjw0000", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18267892885227812, "text": "都是摆拍 😂", "created_at": "2024-05-14T10:52:18", "owner": "evangongx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040664716714879, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-05-13T18:25:53", "owner": "ooopablablabla", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024419248958839, "text": "啥都有就是没有读书的", "created_at": "2024-05-13T16:40:12", "owner": "sunmoonthou", "likes": 772}, {"id": 18125364520344817, "text": "真实啊", "created_at": "2024-05-13T15:28:15", "owner": "elsie__chow", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18030850456985610, "text": "🤣💯", "created_at": "2024-05-13T06:21:49", "owner": "mrhigh87", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954493935659312, "text": "好愛", "created_at": "2024-05-12T07:34:40", "owner": "ting_18_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867453160069616, "text": "毫米毫米wwww😍", "created_at": "2024-05-12T03:38:37", "owner": "hakuuuu.0004", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063056047558569, "text": "诶！你也去了今年股东大会吗👏👏", "created_at": "2024-05-12T02:16:45", "owner": "supergalaxyxiang", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18106434733382934, "text": "有个性", "created_at": "2024-05-12T00:15:46", "owner": "hyc20140524", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18320584354130289, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-05-12T00:02:41", "owner": "chih_ya_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020406419223856, "text": "你就是传说中的反差女神？", "created_at": "2024-05-11T23:46:17", "owner": "xianyangxi", "likes": 152}, {"id": 17955762593827794, "text": "精装的朋友圈 毛坯的人生😢", "created_at": "2024-10-10T12:44:34", "owner": "imchels_1024", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18057306148637504, "text": "你好 需要从国内买东西寄到国外可以联系我 服务包好", "created_at": "2024-09-25T15:12:30", "owner": "jiangmengsi6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064977694542484, "text": "別屁了，幾乎都是哈洋屌哈到爛掉", "created_at": "2024-08-14T22:50:07", "owner": "louis_0901._", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["internationalstudents", "comedy"]},
{"media_id": 3454198739855592542, "shortcode": "C_vx3Poscxe", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_vx3Poscxe/", "taken_at": "2024-09-10T18:24:19", "caption": "👀🗣️ Read their lips with AI\n\nYou can now upload a video of any speaker and identify inaudible speech using @symphoniclabs model. \n\nFor more -> https://www.readtheirlips.com/\n\n( 🎥: @crsamra on X / @symphoniclabs )\n\n—\n\n🔥 That's it! If you want to keep up with all the AI news, useful tips, and important developments, join 40k+ subscribers reading our free newsletter.\n\n#ai #chatgpt #aitools #openai #aitips #machinelearning", "owner_username": "evolving.ai", "owner_id": "58712495227", "likes": 36327, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0055_C_vx3Poscxe\\C_vx3Poscxe_20240910_182419.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17884459203433002, "text": "Ini gimana cara-Nya", "created_at": "2026-01-20T18:29:18", "owner": "hernawatyy16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122619289425632, "text": "This can be turned against humanity in so many ways", "created_at": "2025-03-09T19:42:23", "owner": "minister_motoryzacji_maciej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913789869978922, "text": "Lebron😂", "created_at": "2025-03-09T08:36:41", "owner": "talhausman2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071375989833808, "text": "Now talking with a hand fan like in the old days will be a necessity", "created_at": "2025-03-05T10:21:22", "owner": "0xymos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067365544849909, "text": "We were 1cm away from avoiding WW3. Oh well.", "created_at": "2025-03-01T23:06:47", "owner": "jasonshortdesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087329893571401, "text": "@worldstar", "created_at": "2025-03-01T19:07:09", "owner": "shawn.toaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091963024558236, "text": "this is our new open prison. and we all feed it every day", "created_at": "2025-03-01T08:24:31", "owner": "hamburg_chronicles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346572703196263, "text": "Oh... I thought he said, \"Wort wort wort.\"", "created_at": "2025-02-25T02:30:42", "owner": "wo_neat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053123237157301, "text": "only english though", "created_at": "2025-02-19T17:32:16", "owner": "impart.mind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097354024506877, "text": "Time for audible CCTV videos 🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-15T14:45:20", "owner": "sathyasaagar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994597566764286, "text": "Get this on the one Trump and Obama video now !", "created_at": "2025-02-10T22:11:00", "owner": "its_tev", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041947343096039, "text": "Not even close", "created_at": "2025-02-07T22:19:55", "owner": "ijustp00ped", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844805773395856, "text": "Kanye said : Watch this, this is my city. Not accurate", "created_at": "2025-02-06T21:19:58", "owner": "cyberredemption", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045870077464579, "text": "The ye one is wrong", "created_at": "2025-02-05T05:55:59", "owner": "nick_and_urbahn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071591602697129, "text": "Do you mean Hal from space odissey?", "created_at": "2025-02-04T22:19:47", "owner": "huricalazans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001915961557842, "text": "And if you put an extract in French", "created_at": "2025-02-03T08:37:59", "owner": "gasparddupuy01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866405557314211, "text": "Kanye one was completely wrong lol", "created_at": "2025-02-02T04:47:06", "owner": "samtreetv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864665470322068, "text": "I asked for this dev in openai's forum a year ago", "created_at": "2025-01-30T06:22:54", "owner": "scalasurgical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945055218933565, "text": "nigga", "created_at": "2025-01-29T20:36:27", "owner": "mnopqr00000000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017284226471502, "text": "I would troll so hard if I was famous.", "created_at": "2025-01-27T05:04:08", "owner": "vruss013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050924621161227, "text": "is this an app", "created_at": "2025-01-26T07:28:31", "owner": "emma_capehart13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062600251917321, "text": "What did trumps son say to Biden!?", "created_at": "2025-01-25T06:31:13", "owner": "kennclair", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18079760227528778, "text": "Excellent arpeggio work here, lovely.", "created_at": "2025-01-24T09:36:11", "owner": "herefordiain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923859814009972, "text": "These people always steal my ideas that I have written inside my Keep notes.", "created_at": "2025-01-22T16:32:23", "owner": "nikhil_sinha_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106045675475014, "text": "Last one Kanye said “this is ma kid” not magic 🤦🏻‍♂️ the camera man was going to interview and film his kid…", "created_at": "2025-01-19T02:42:26", "owner": "prodigy.page", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088715644538592, "text": "HAL is here", "created_at": "2025-01-16T21:17:07", "owner": "zacker_980909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383073541106377, "text": "Kanye actually said “my city” not “magic”", "created_at": "2025-01-16T14:35:55", "owner": "virtez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990514014773150, "text": "Using videos where the context was already given after the catch to make it look better is shady", "created_at": "2025-01-14T22:38:04", "owner": "painflprints", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043070882210148, "text": "Ariana clearly says “now this is a ball gown”. context is everything. Humans are superior", "created_at": "2025-01-11T21:34:31", "owner": "robceriello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313866115163572, "text": "Wow, that's so interesting! permission to share videos on instagram", "created_at": "2025-01-07T13:37:19", "owner": "karier.ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010498322680369, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2025-01-04T08:55:58", "owner": "markwillbark1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087657259532274, "text": "This is the reason why Shohei Otani always covers his mouth with his hand when he talks on the ground.", "created_at": "2025-01-02T08:19:43", "owner": "tmarcy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940313091948831, "text": "Such a beauty", "created_at": "2025-01-02T06:07:38", "owner": "silkwormpl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053802956001952, "text": "Nah it's impossible", "created_at": "2025-01-02T03:38:46", "owner": "teja_n9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043141295465561, "text": "Better than voice recognition", "created_at": "2025-01-01T14:40:13", "owner": "mr.govinddubey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286897129170109, "text": "Humans read lips too. Celebrities and politicians specifically watch what they say when they are on camera because they know this. What they say is scripted.", "created_at": "2025-01-01T07:48:17", "owner": "ryanptravis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054284425996558, "text": "Didn’t Kanye said in that video “so step back watch, this is my city”?", "created_at": "2024-12-31T22:19:32", "owner": "clemenlarrondo26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008025962680276, "text": "Bro needs to do the Lamar Jackson thing", "created_at": "2024-12-28T19:56:41", "owner": "mr_reed_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997310301745913, "text": "These are wrong especially the ye one he said this my city not magic", "created_at": "2024-12-26T17:54:48", "owner": "logan_rail1776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052340438090563, "text": "Can't wait until ai can read our thoughts 🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-26T04:54:43", "owner": "deasonwith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027171389621346, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-25T15:47:43", "owner": "jules.perrot_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041549165260674, "text": "Imagine needing AI to do this for you… just look at the lips, duh.", "created_at": "2024-12-25T00:06:55", "owner": "leon.mdufc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475316944003389, "text": "Just Wow 🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-22T03:36:38", "owner": "huxaifamarketing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051129155073245, "text": "Well, Cant they have private conversations now?", "created_at": "2024-12-21T20:45:57", "owner": "myolieorchard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024848537308792, "text": "Total Dislike", "created_at": "2024-12-19T10:02:12", "owner": "lfafl_ito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066038302837539, "text": "Do the Lamar Jackson one", "created_at": "2024-12-19T05:21:31", "owner": "jack.bl9ck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858335905325565, "text": "MJ FANS it s open", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:19:06", "owner": "taharmed77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014940389460276, "text": "Bs", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:00:18", "owner": "harrison.mason21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901157005011493, "text": "So, we know that kanye west didnt actually say that. Kanye said \"this is my city\"", "created_at": "2024-12-18T09:37:40", "owner": "j.kkillagram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078515881524792, "text": "We need this for that clip for the ravens", "created_at": "2024-12-11T00:49:56", "owner": "yaboii8754", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985087521769290, "text": "Eso se llama lectura de labias y se hace desde hace mucho", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:54:07", "owner": "_juanaraya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360285508184838, "text": "Ai is dangerous", "created_at": "2024-11-11T23:14:53", "owner": "salty_malon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850990063285928, "text": "I don't think they were all that accurate..", "created_at": "2024-11-07T13:21:28", "owner": "victoriamoser_25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966727575681838, "text": "Recently, the leaders of China and Russia talked about something without microphones. Can you find out what they were talking about?", "created_at": "2024-11-05T12:17:47", "owner": "pavel.malikhin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361394347138962, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-04T18:09:14", "owner": "c0rrosivy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272912839222178, "text": "Do the video of Obama and biden.", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:31:47", "owner": "david_sabella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18460717693057984, "text": "Kanye didn't say \"This is magic\" while patting his chest. We know he didn't.", "created_at": "2024-10-11T07:56:33", "owner": "the_sekyere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075355225563542, "text": "Now we can know what that guy said to lamar jackson", "created_at": "2024-10-10T02:39:10", "owner": "sawyerlustrup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932921022927821, "text": "@jomboymedia your job is in jeopardy", "created_at": "2024-10-10T01:50:26", "owner": "trav.is.good", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043033367503851, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-08T05:18:33", "owner": "joshua_kellerman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963080511683099, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-07T01:30:55", "owner": "cass_the.producer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871516435193070, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-30T12:21:53", "owner": "theconnergregg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946514361756509, "text": "Too bad Ariana says \"now this is a ball gown\" bootleg ah software", "created_at": "2024-09-27T23:55:16", "owner": "jordanamaral32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016945022550357, "text": "I can’t trust Siri to repeat back what I asked for, I’m not trusting this! 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T19:13:28", "owner": "phamouskaraoke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996850860688193, "text": "@weyesblood this is your song 'Movies' but I don't see you credited anywhere. It currently says the song is \"Evolving.Ai - original audio.\" I just want to make sure your amazing music gets the credit it deserves!", "created_at": "2024-09-23T15:03:05", "owner": "jon.bolles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030557657256081, "text": "Or you can have someone who reads lips do it.", "created_at": "2024-09-22T07:10:46", "owner": "lschinaia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920173158972486, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-22T06:42:39", "owner": "_sleep_4_eternity_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092171998465321, "text": "You can use mouth lip readers who are real people and won’t lie to further there agendas", "created_at": "2024-09-20T18:20:34", "owner": "danielleeshifflett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867387865203607, "text": "No type of privacy anymore and people are with it", "created_at": "2024-09-20T02:29:41", "owner": "duttch1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930085143822403, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-19T20:18:02", "owner": "bussy.cat.master", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946791552848227, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-19T20:17:26", "owner": "renoisthebest12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040625863883989, "text": "Sooo, what are they all saying then?😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T03:48:41", "owner": "goyim_lives_matter", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18019936892404695, "text": "I’m gonna start using that LeBron line 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T20:30:10", "owner": "jandlafamilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031519745260079, "text": "Esto se jodio… imagina a los vecinos chismosos grabandote a larga distancia sin que te des cuenta y después pasan el video a eso . 😂. Se jodio la privacidad.", "created_at": "2024-09-18T16:51:21", "owner": "cerpaart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046235677939060, "text": "Dead people invented this, it’s called lip reading", "created_at": "2024-09-17T19:48:18", "owner": "willzee5150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042967610063940, "text": "Scary. Not a fan of this.\nTechnique above humans \nWho/what takes control?", "created_at": "2024-09-17T12:34:30", "owner": "katja_ke2207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101623816432351, "text": "Kanye said \"step back this is my city \"", "created_at": "2024-09-16T20:58:37", "owner": "mass_guitartech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843316285311593, "text": "Nothing is private anymore. Is this the world we we want to live in?? 🫣", "created_at": "2024-09-16T15:47:24", "owner": "jeroenvethaak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098618203442821, "text": "Not even accurate.  Kanye says step back watch this is my city.  You guys can't believe in this stuff all the time.", "created_at": "2024-09-16T15:34:14", "owner": "quinn_pellerin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016884941609288, "text": "“Magic” from “my S#!+”", "created_at": "2024-09-16T14:45:08", "owner": "erikjonromnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864199480217595, "text": "Trump the only one saying anything remotely meaningful", "created_at": "2024-09-16T14:23:22", "owner": "_jacobschweitzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037755445932987, "text": "Hummmm…not so convincing", "created_at": "2024-09-15T23:21:51", "owner": "coombs6751", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099642655451757, "text": "Nightmare..", "created_at": "2024-09-15T21:31:28", "owner": "gambarimilano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021661472421405, "text": "Living in 90s tech. Great.", "created_at": "2024-09-15T20:02:53", "owner": "ze.lima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266076697217205, "text": "The fake attempt ahha \"fight fight fight\". Who would ever say that ahah", "created_at": "2024-09-15T12:39:11", "owner": "manoledge1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039374927318009, "text": "I would never want to be famous", "created_at": "2024-09-15T07:15:53", "owner": "jaquel_murphy899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033691337332951, "text": "Does AI have faith in God?", "created_at": "2024-09-14T23:21:27", "owner": "eves_cinnamon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098844220450748, "text": "I don’t think they can read with the spirit though 🤔 iykwim", "created_at": "2024-09-14T23:20:28", "owner": "eves_cinnamon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900500079964034, "text": "It's not \"fight, fight, fight\" it's \"if you vote for me you're gay\"", "created_at": "2024-09-14T19:09:59", "owner": "mattias.holm.313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462106039021813, "text": "Expose them all", "created_at": "2024-09-14T17:43:06", "owner": "keans03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889400596069829, "text": "song name?", "created_at": "2024-09-14T16:46:28", "owner": "etneciv_nhoj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046536754777377, "text": "@jomboymedia", "created_at": "2024-09-14T16:01:20", "owner": "darkknightm6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875838433089694, "text": "Nobody cares", "created_at": "2024-09-14T11:42:27", "owner": "solariszephyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301910290163322, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-13T14:59:10", "owner": "a_alsarraf80s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045572659943277, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-13T10:57:02", "owner": "yhzyyj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006376196430077, "text": "Meanwhile Virat Kohli oh theeri", "created_at": "2024-09-13T10:25:30", "owner": "vibe_uuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076572175536682, "text": "Or hear me out, it makes guesses.", "created_at": "2024-09-13T04:41:45", "owner": "milanstimatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937407459867147, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-13T03:47:04", "owner": "kuldeep_18_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957194652699227, "text": "Use this on the biden whispering vids", "created_at": "2024-09-13T02:31:09", "owner": "smankyhanky42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957113403702276, "text": "Do this to the silent ww1 films and the others without audio", "created_at": "2024-09-13T02:22:29", "owner": "das_gespenst_1968", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["ai", "chatgpt", "aitools", "openai", "aitips", "machinelearning"]},
{"media_id": 3451855461853043198, "shortcode": "C_ndED7vhn-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_ndED7vhn-/", "taken_at": "2024-09-07T12:55:28", "caption": "I can  play it all day. 🔮\n\n#giftideas #gift #3dprinting #3dmodeling #3dprint #deskdecor #decorideas #toy #fundesign #creativedesign #funtoys", "owner_username": "fun.gift.idea", "owner_id": "58197140689", "likes": 443215, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0056_C_ndED7vhn-\\C_ndED7vhn-_20240907_125528.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["giftideas", "gift", "3dprinting", "3dmodeling", "3dprint", "deskdecor", "decorideas", "toy", "fundesign", "creativedesign", "funtoys"]},
{"media_id": 3425077016194916228, "shortcode": "C-IUWY-px-E", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-IUWY-px-E/", "taken_at": "2024-08-01T14:03:58", "caption": "The KTM 450 SX-F stands out as a high-performance motocross bike renowned for its agility, power, and cutting-edge engineering. Designed for competitive racing and enthusiasts seeking top-tier performance, it embodies KTM’s commitment to pushing boundaries in the motocross world.\nAt its heart lies a potent 450cc single-cylinder engine, meticulously engineered to deliver exceptional power and torque across the RPM range. This engine is known for its tractable nature, providing ample low-end grunt for explosive acceleration out of corners while still offering a strong top-end for tackling straights and jumps with ease. KTM’s focus on lightweight construction ensures the 450 SX-F remains nimble and responsive, allowing riders to navigate technical tracks with precision.\nThe chassis of the KTM 450 SX-F is crafted from high-strength chromium-molybdenum steel, striking a balance between rigidity and flexibility to enhance handling and stability. Suspension duties are handled by top-tier components such as WP XACT forks and rear shock, which offer exceptional damping characteristics and adjustability to suit various track conditions and rider preferences.\nIn terms of technology, the 450 SX-F is equipped with advanced features like electric start for convenience, selectable engine maps via handlebar-mounted switch, and a launch control system to optimize starts off the gate. These innovations not only enhance performance but also make the bike more accessible and manageable for riders of different skill levels.\nOverall, the KTM 450 SX-F represents the pinnacle of motocross engineering, combining raw power, agile handling, and technological sophistication to dominate the track. Whether competing in professional races or tearing up trails for recreation, riders can rely on the 450 SX-F to deliver an exhilarating and uncompromising riding experience.", "owner_username": "a.homie.with.an.extra.chromie", "owner_id": "7484969538", "likes": 191581, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0057_C-IUWY-px-E\\C-IUWY-px-E_20240801_140358.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18026081924418353, "text": "They be like. If it touches water that's mine", "created_at": "2024-10-25T11:17:11", "owner": "sarathg.nambiar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095884621465505, "text": "Tom and Jerry series finale", "created_at": "2024-10-25T04:26:18", "owner": "daniel_j_mcconnell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989603475579812, "text": "Ah I need my beer", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:44:20", "owner": "iamindranill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041370601930743, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:27:26", "owner": "edoardo_mariani_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062348512687984, "text": "Gato", "created_at": "2024-10-24T08:29:30", "owner": "mio.neko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887053864048916, "text": "How does one even record this lmao", "created_at": "2024-10-24T08:28:11", "owner": "drahcirmai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913437130008093, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-24T07:58:56", "owner": "rainyquee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344790391123477, "text": "Bro can not catch a break", "created_at": "2024-10-24T01:54:14", "owner": "m1bhompson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932453040940031, "text": "Tom and Jerry live action made by Netflix", "created_at": "2024-10-23T20:06:18", "owner": "celsoassis3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113673715412599, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T18:02:42", "owner": "vickodakvic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046017575100030, "text": "It's lil bro against the whole world 💀", "created_at": "2024-10-21T11:27:57", "owner": "simi_kovacic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046486709067253, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-21T08:27:45", "owner": "khairillv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003466985668951, "text": "Nature Tom and Jerry ahh activities", "created_at": "2024-10-21T05:21:09", "owner": "momo_fis