 18020826038223287, "text": "Could a seagull eat a rat?", "created_at": "2024-09-26T21:52:35", "owner": "lifesupportunplugger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020898251215354, "text": "Legendary reel pull", "created_at": "2024-09-26T04:38:49", "owner": "c0ddyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939832830839843, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-25T17:37:45", "owner": "stups___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040241468091835, "text": "Esto es cine", "created_at": "2024-09-25T16:42:40", "owner": "emiliovillegas24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971516688684388, "text": "Must be France", "created_at": "2024-09-25T16:09:22", "owner": "sari.ko95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984222975731851, "text": "Cartoon ahh situation!", "created_at": "2024-09-25T09:50:02", "owner": "idontlivetolive_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070344139596509, "text": "Allat goin on bruh😭", "created_at": "2024-09-25T08:42:16", "owner": "fahad.x211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865081864218506, "text": "He shat", "created_at": "2024-09-25T05:19:34", "owner": "karasu.comic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980507403742336, "text": "最後海鷗還拉屎", "created_at": "2024-09-25T04:53:03", "owner": "cly._1028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100702975449659, "text": "Lo pudo salvar?", "created_at": "2024-09-24T23:26:35", "owner": "areyoustillamess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046530619983530, "text": ".", "created_at": "2024-09-24T22:08:10", "owner": "vvo1f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949599444839250, "text": "Concrete jungle, baby!", "created_at": "2024-09-24T19:39:28", "owner": "nicholasweller", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3453286252718814661, "shortcode": "C_siYzxC3XF", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_siYzxC3XF/", "taken_at": "2024-09-09T12:11:37", "caption": "IG 限動要被刪除了？\n—趕快去備份你的 IG 限動\n\nMeta 宣布在明年一月停用全部第三方濾鏡，到時候只剩下 Meta 官方的濾鏡而已…\n\n那過去有套用濾鏡的典藏限動會怎麼樣呢？\n\n雖然目前官方表示不會有影響，但我實在不太相信…\n\n還是先備份吧！\n\n#限動 #濾鏡 #ig備份", "owner_username": "johntooltw", "owner_id": "13613028460", "likes": 43630, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0058_C_siYzxC3XF\\C_siYzxC3XF_20240909_121137.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18036718328139273, "text": "更正：\n設定與隱私裡面是選擇「你的資訊和權限」，不是個人資料，不小心看錯了～", "created_at": "2024-09-16T11:26:07", "owner": "johntooltw", "likes": 173}, {"id": 17900970221961712, "text": "只要收尋打下載就可以吧～", "created_at": "2024-09-09T12:44:49", "owner": "f49911011", "likes": 205}, {"id": 17941639820889624, "text": "是使用過的限動有濾鏡的會消失？\n那之前發的限動（沒濾鏡）也會消失嗎？🙇‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T12:36:41", "owner": "tinaru14", "likes": 188}, {"id": 18031030223393135, "text": "所以有特效的限動都會消失ㄇ", "created_at": "2024-12-29T12:36:56", "owner": "_1iyzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483609268022047, "text": "謝囉 雲端滿了", "created_at": "2024-12-26T02:30:19", "owner": "joe_eyebrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083431723563457, "text": "備份限動只是讓他還留著而已 不能放到精選是嗎～", "created_at": "2024-12-25T16:30:09", "owner": "xuancc_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341739790144581, "text": "為什麼要這樣😢那我之後不想發現動了...meta這樣會失去很多粉絲，對他們反而沒好處", "created_at": "2024-12-23T09:23:58", "owner": "guava_0511", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18068934496736326, "text": "問過GPT了，他說不然用什麼方法下載，都不包含濾鏡😢", "created_at": "2024-12-23T04:31:13", "owner": "coisini_x325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18473718376028378, "text": "只要備份限動的話要選哪個？沒看到「限時動態」的選項，是「活動」嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:27:15", "owner": "zhou._.081111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026742542531304, "text": "一定要轉到雲端嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:45:55", "owner": "_.mxilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902534608080179, "text": "請問跳出「無法完成下載要求」是哪個環節出錯了呢", "created_at": "2024-12-03T00:43:16", "owner": "jennifer02188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954514314747289, "text": "為什麼沒辦法下載😢", "created_at": "2024-12-02T13:47:19", "owner": "stuan1417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026048237590183, "text": "還好我的限動都沒用濾鏡", "created_at": "2024-11-02T14:12:25", "owner": "1.8.2_cm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884891551112096, "text": "太棒了謝謝", "created_at": "2024-10-28T15:04:02", "owner": "q.p.wq.p.w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033712442067969, "text": "會不會很佔空間", "created_at": "2024-10-26T19:10:59", "owner": "meiwei_1101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949734582748062, "text": "@sunny1234392", "created_at": "2024-10-11T12:45:01", "owner": "brian99245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371684257101686, "text": "@fang__0603 快存！！！！", "created_at": "2024-10-10T02:46:57", "owner": "abby880416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038390294140099, "text": "感覺我的已經被刪，前幾個禮拜點開典藏就有跳出通知說部分限動已被移除，很多舊限動雖然有顯示也已經完全不能看了", "created_at": "2024-10-07T11:02:49", "owner": "renshengaihuadao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877317691160601, "text": "我帳號管理中心裡面沒有那個選項😭", "created_at": "2024-10-07T05:24:58", "owner": "dxyxy0105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050301925932847, "text": "可是打開都是空的欸 沒有影片", "created_at": "2024-10-05T14:16:55", "owner": "_heeeyichen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915850629904504, "text": "@yoyo__0105", "created_at": "2024-10-03T11:01:59", "owner": "andy1864", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049130245754462, "text": "請問什麼意思？是典藏的限動以後都不見？消失不見嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-02T17:23:30", "owner": "huh.319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023096618391438, "text": "忘記ig密碼完全無法移轉😂嘗試重設也重設不了🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-02T14:46:10", "owner": "n.wen_0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084012409505208, "text": "請問是轉完才會收到通知嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-24T15:59:18", "owner": "sherrylin0422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914977059898607, "text": "我昨天備份，隔一天就說備份完成，可是打開雲端的檔案都是亂碼耶", "created_at": "2024-09-21T17:10:27", "owner": "hsuan10099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029738402519204, "text": "@_yunyun_0802 沒有濾鏡跟備用一堆限動有什麼關聯？", "created_at": "2024-09-21T01:59:04", "owner": "nantou_angel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040106675089524, "text": "@sshk_rg_haodai 先哭", "created_at": "2024-09-20T04:30:15", "owner": "huini1022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006231140446150, "text": "我的一直下載失敗不知道為什麼🥲", "created_at": "2024-09-16T11:46:50", "owner": "a12005984", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855141691220378, "text": "是點選「你的資訊和權限」不是「個人資料」😂", "created_at": "2024-09-16T10:37:20", "owner": "xhaohaohao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878114947137816, "text": "下載內容 濾鏡也會消失嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-16T05:26:42", "owner": "yunyun_0504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029744195518684, "text": "請問下載後檔案無法打開耶", "created_at": "2024-09-16T01:11:57", "owner": "tale751", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848209942296673, "text": "也太傻眼了吧😢", "created_at": "2024-09-15T23:31:40", "owner": "peanuts_201023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016554089576668, "text": "個人資料後面那裡找不到後續的步驟欸", "created_at": "2024-09-15T18:49:21", "owner": "skyy_yang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18330456151182540, "text": "雲端要爆了🥹", "created_at": "2024-09-15T15:32:08", "owner": "_yuuu_ying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047330188941784, "text": "備份很快\n但說實在很多限動已經不會動了\n也有被刪除的 🥲", "created_at": "2024-09-15T15:16:37", "owner": "d_619xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855553696258182, "text": "@ailing2500", "created_at": "2024-09-15T12:45:15", "owner": "8560t5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968614161649136, "text": "@alicealicetai 😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-09-15T02:09:38", "owner": "hao_teng_blake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937084341910521, "text": "請問沒辦法選擇要備份到哪一個雲端帳號怎麼辦", "created_at": "2024-09-14T17:46:37", "owner": "hu1yi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065459926619467, "text": "@jiaw_1228", "created_at": "2024-09-14T15:16:31", "owner": "menglin_tsai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049387123924152, "text": "請問一下 沒有濾鏡的限動也會消失嗎？有我很珍貴的出國影片😢", "created_at": "2024-09-14T12:03:06", "owner": "naiyunhung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892748641076070, "text": "這樣雲端不是會爆炸嗎🥲", "created_at": "2024-09-14T09:24:50", "owner": "chihiro_mina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18243127135275058, "text": "照著步驟走找不到這些選項ㄟ", "created_at": "2024-09-14T05:52:13", "owner": "kaiser_kzzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037833380490934, "text": "完全毫不相干，影片在上傳的瞬間就處理完了，濾鏡哪可能時候拔，到底懂不懂", "created_at": "2024-09-13T15:51:48", "owner": "jac.vader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866040925207045, "text": "謝謝分享，不過影片太快，快到觀看量刷十倍左右，高明 ! 下次可以再加個兩倍速~", "created_at": "2024-09-13T02:47:41", "owner": "makholap", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18006218009447912, "text": "請問阿璋，之前較久的典藏限動影片都變成照片了，有辦法讓他復原下載嗎😭😢", "created_at": "2024-09-12T18:27:20", "owner": "hong_0713_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863727388217320, "text": "請問精選限動也會受影響嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-12T18:26:05", "owner": "pexlike666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978231105748593, "text": "按讚跟分享分手了", "created_at": "2024-09-12T17:20:34", "owner": "yu_myyye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923294001957907, "text": "@outsuider1122", "created_at": "2024-09-12T16:42:44", "owner": "____lynnyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007313051414164, "text": "@1119_jenny", "created_at": "2024-09-12T16:42:29", "owner": "____lynnyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18271736380256358, "text": "@sidney061423", "created_at": "2024-09-12T16:42:22", "owner": "____lynnyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959177286691659, "text": "@pinnn_____", "created_at": "2024-09-12T16:42:18", "owner": "____lynnyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040321235048117, "text": "雲端滿了怎辦", "created_at": "2024-09-12T16:04:49", "owner": "_1ithh3r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18269422465221960, "text": "那如果我想保留現在保存的濾鏡 可以怎樣辦？😭", "created_at": "2024-09-12T13:36:28", "owner": "hangyide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984707874710670, "text": "想問會不會影響手機容量？", "created_at": "2024-09-12T10:13:02", "owner": "yyt._1016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107820310419190, "text": "那今天備份的之後還要再備份一次嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-12T04:26:55", "owner": "sha80688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071394601574954, "text": "根本沒在用濾鏡 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-12T04:04:07", "owner": "dong____yen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037354250504315, "text": "那個我個人資料可是後面步驟沒有辦法欸 我是不是要更新", "created_at": "2024-09-11T22:46:18", "owner": "21ww_wv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972958236780872, "text": "沒用濾鏡 沒這困擾", "created_at": "2024-09-11T17:56:16", "owner": "ass_sun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102959620428045, "text": "Ok我的雲端也不夠放", "created_at": "2024-09-11T16:48:37", "owner": "zhi_yun0610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265803055218001, "text": "下載後發現不是所有典藏的影片都有怎麼辦😢", "created_at": "2024-09-11T16:21:06", "owner": "li.057", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043398943974692, "text": "算了吧 過去讓他過去", "created_at": "2024-09-11T15:40:42", "owner": "bae_tokyo98", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025365326119568, "text": "@whet520", "created_at": "2024-09-11T15:26:54", "owner": "_ting_1126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035605217173014, "text": "@_chiahui_", "created_at": "2024-09-11T14:59:03", "owner": "douglas_chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974128467768934, "text": "@_chiahui_ 要下載不然會不見", "created_at": "2024-09-11T14:58:12", "owner": "douglas_chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862851394218734, "text": "@alan05181", "created_at": "2024-09-11T14:21:46", "owner": "t77622000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075616471544536, "text": "請問為什麼我ig無法上傳15分鐘以上影片？？？要怎麼辦", "created_at": "2024-09-11T14:06:04", "owner": "shining322cm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852777160272460, "text": "他是明年一月開始全部下架，還是從現在開始慢慢下架？", "created_at": "2024-09-11T13:55:25", "owner": "yuwei_768", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985851594717397, "text": "已備份，謝謝教學🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-11T12:43:39", "owner": "gateitw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252072850252654, "text": "雲端容量不夠怎麼辦", "created_at": "2024-09-11T12:10:22", "owner": "is.ww__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982886733719292, "text": "所以下載下來可以做什麼", "created_at": "2024-09-11T11:16:54", "owner": "xiao_y.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090318625479880, "text": "典藏套用過濾鏡應該不會消失\n只是連結的濾鏡會消失而已，不可能幫你把影片變回沒濾鏡，變成圖片的意義也不大多此一舉", "created_at": "2024-09-11T10:49:58", "owner": "trevorkidult", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085395001500849, "text": "請問檔案格式大家都選哪種？HTML還是JSON?", "created_at": "2024-09-11T07:31:33", "owner": "xuanll.77", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17873443227170580, "text": "IG自取滅亡", "created_at": "2024-09-11T06:32:48", "owner": "tbdstbds", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18266193289221761, "text": "沒差啦，從來沒用官方濾鏡上傳🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-11T06:17:40", "owner": "becat_1011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281452717227183, "text": "我有問題 🙋🏻‍♀️\n請問發完不是相簿都有備份嗎？\n謝謝！", "created_at": "2024-09-11T06:05:06", "owner": "phoenix2124", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18319373605153439, "text": "我有些限動後來整個無法顯示是因為這樣嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-11T05:34:04", "owner": "evil_132936", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040248743029767, "text": "@lisa_111592", "created_at": "2024-09-11T04:35:55", "owner": "lucy123690", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035503952155600, "text": "官方不都說過去的不影響了嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-11T04:13:30", "owner": "shan_oooni06", "likes": 88}, {"id": 17908449579002234, "text": "@tao_tao_tao_tao_tao_tao_tao_ 救命", "created_at": "2024-09-11T02:45:35", "owner": "diy5433", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17870651154179039, "text": "不行耶，IG叫我到Facebook操作😢", "created_at": "2024-09-11T01:59:57", "owner": "jade_rosalie91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043453249956316, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-09-11T01:35:07", "owner": "shaislands", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913889703899175, "text": "請問下載下來的檔案會很大嗎？不曉得雲端空間夠不夠", "created_at": "2024-09-11T00:54:03", "owner": "folllllllllllllllow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018892286223481, "text": "請問精選限動也會不見嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-10T22:26:27", "owner": "__s__08__01", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17852479305272013, "text": "如果是貼文影片會有影響嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-10T21:35:52", "owner": "kim_kill2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010203683342399, "text": "請問是要下載還是移轉？我兩個選項都有耶😮", "created_at": "2024-09-10T18:55:15", "owner": "tinychloe.w", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025078889110413, "text": "搞不懂M為什麼要這樣", "created_at": "2024-09-10T18:32:42", "owner": "noybn_", "likes": 71}, {"id": 18456773128061829, "text": "@jiale6453 😢", "created_at": "2024-09-10T16:05:16", "owner": "tyojia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071978956505018, "text": "還好我從不使用動態濾鏡 沒這煩惱", "created_at": "2024-09-10T15:32:52", "owner": "chauxnineties", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033424610189946, "text": "@jh___0204 這個", "created_at": "2024-09-10T15:18:11", "owner": "b0325j158", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019055969235068, "text": "一半以上男生都會覺得沒差", "created_at": "2024-09-10T10:44:47", "owner": "m.shao.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922770858958943, "text": "选择设置的地方和你不一样… 研究了一下才找到\n1.点击设置- 2.点击你的动态- 才找到 3.转移你的信息选项。不过谢谢分享", "created_at": "2024-09-10T09:53:06", "owner": "jane.offline", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18004902437465149, "text": "超級重要的‼️感謝分享😊", "created_at": "2024-09-10T09:10:58", "owner": "rong12.06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082522669503443, "text": "我前幾天打開典藏，他跳出會刪除部分貼文...難道是指這個...", "created_at": "2024-09-10T06:17:22", "owner": "asl10734", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17873053815170226, "text": "各式要選擇什麼", "created_at": "2024-09-10T02:01:36", "owner": "fate0921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953271588827036, "text": "請問選擇移轉，會不會把ig原有的清空？", "created_at": "2024-09-10T01:58:10", "owner": "fate0921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939626760885230, "text": "只能下載全部嗎 可以只下載幾個嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-09T18:20:31", "owner": "wuxoxo_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042895142057794, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-09-09T18:10:33", "owner": "chiyi.li", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055789168695347, "text": "步驟畫面有點跳太快了😵😵‍💫\n不過感謝分享～～", "created_at": "2024-09-09T17:57:28", "owner": "alison_tsai", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18065523490613249, "text": "備份轉移ing…不知道會多久😂", "created_at": "2024-09-09T16:02:31", "owner": "gichi_b67j", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18055982968694123, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:37:25", "owner": "klkp2321", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["限動", "濾鏡", "ig備份"]},
{"media_id": 3455683641959684491, "shortcode": "C_1DfafIpmL", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_1DfafIpmL/", "taken_at": "2024-09-12T19:35:25", "caption": "Looks like you’re coming to the ISoc freshers’ stalls 🫵\n\n🗓️ Monday 16th - Friday 20th September\n📍Outside the Students’ Union Building\n🕐 10AM - 4PM\n\n#RoadToFreshers24", "owner_username": "manchesterisoc", "owner_id": "719893468", "likes": 460, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0059_C_1DfafIpmL\\C_1DfafIpmL_20240912_193525.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18077300608536584", "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:52:29", "owner": "al.hindy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18043951594952253", "text": "Am I the only one thats struggling to make friends in College because no one else is practising?😢", "created_at": "2024-09-13T15:08:04", "owner": "thismarzuqedits", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17929187741823484", "text": "Will there be dental students at the freshers stalls? 🤔", "created_at": "2024-09-13T12:07:52", "owner": "dentedmcr", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17979449516743008", "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-13T09:26:16", "owner": "uk.assignments.expert", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18026580683106432", "text": "Interesting ending…🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-12T21:16:54", "owner": "haris_781", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18042416828053509", "text": "Brother never misses 🤔", "created_at": "2024-09-12T21:14:09", "owner": "aqilmatin", "likes": 5}, {"id": "18120989584379113", "text": "Who's letting ISOC cook", "created_at": "2024-09-12T20:09:15", "owner": "adnankassad", "likes": 28}, {"id": "17855001129258911", "text": "Bro yk I was coming anyway", "created_at": "2024-09-12T20:03:14", "owner": "alib3g", "likes": 6}, {"id": "17862019695229814", "text": "Freshers Stall 🔜", "created_at": "2024-09-12T19:56:20", "owner": "ibnfrd1", "likes": 8}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["roadtofreshers24"]},
{"media_id": 3455140272487174654, "shortcode": "C_zH8WOvpH-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_zH8WOvpH-/", "taken_at": "2024-09-12T01:34:46", "caption": "Sabrina Carpenter kisses an alien on stage during her performance of “Taste” at the 2024 @vmas 💋\n\nvia viacom/mtv/video music awards", "owner_username": "billboard", "owner_id": "1022625", "likes": 121503, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0060_C_zH8WOvpH-\\C_zH8WOvpH-_20240912_013446.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18042009773170599, "text": "ALIAN STAGE", "created_at": "2024-10-29T16:24:11", "owner": "cheese_adii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329833813181391, "text": "Aliensexual", "created_at": "2024-09-19T11:43:07", "owner": "may._2_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022419740191526, "text": "Les", "created_at": "2024-09-18T05:04:59", "owner": "hfz_.dn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933854493919689, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2024-09-17T20:19:49", "owner": "army_greece0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040621693880228, "text": "🏳️‍⚧️🫢🏳️‍🌈👽", "created_at": "2024-09-17T16:00:37", "owner": "xenon_ff_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342440455132091, "text": "Sonumuz hayr olsun", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:54:03", "owner": "ceyda_gulum9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032414891244113, "text": "👽😭😭", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:41:33", "owner": "tsi_taye22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278403784235565, "text": "Hi", "created_at": "2024-09-17T10:59:19", "owner": "annan1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012435473339088, "text": "x genderr", "created_at": "2024-09-17T06:57:44", "owner": "puguhwyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110442442411229, "text": "Ora mutu blas", "created_at": "2024-09-17T04:43:17", "owner": "untung_ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355454353187881, "text": "They coming", "created_at": "2024-09-17T04:27:35", "owner": "jasonvorhee666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038673674116940, "text": "Cambangang", "created_at": "2024-09-17T04:09:17", "owner": "maksekebek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894187768064478, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2024-09-17T03:54:37", "owner": "yudyapra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925265007847414, "text": "PAGAN & SATANIC", "created_at": "2024-09-17T03:24:22", "owner": "wiwinskamania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017283911289929, "text": "So ... Basically she'll do anything that breathes. Ok ...", "created_at": "2024-09-17T01:50:47", "owner": "mac070894", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061249714657592, "text": "Ion understand why this is surprising", "created_at": "2024-09-16T18:02:06", "owner": "cosanotra_dee3400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000349421658541, "text": "👽💀 It's possible right now", "created_at": "2024-09-16T16:25:18", "owner": "mujomau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024871571520607, "text": "sabrina cargo", "created_at": "2024-09-16T12:54:54", "owner": "kfdillah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972649323727034, "text": "IT SHOULDVE BEEEN MEEEEEE", "created_at": "2024-09-16T12:48:53", "owner": "mbdrbroderick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024612314142081, "text": "Ok... and?", "created_at": "2024-09-16T12:22:35", "owner": "rafael_r9cha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071867977514745, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-16T12:12:58", "owner": "andrei3500z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083566255502406, "text": "What is", "created_at": "2024-09-16T11:34:47", "owner": "_sah_adeee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069848464596201, "text": "Your father had better hold himself that night or the bathroom was there.", "created_at": "2024-09-16T10:49:47", "owner": "bs_hux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034437710175712, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2024-09-16T10:38:20", "owner": "boyfirta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072013360519722, "text": "Semakin parah aja orang jaman sekarang .", "created_at": "2024-09-16T10:04:47", "owner": "dibtisari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055544893825465, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2024-09-16T09:57:41", "owner": "1oom.l2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070647601570209, "text": "erohW", "created_at": "2024-09-16T09:18:29", "owner": "a_human_0047", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906540126942661, "text": "what the f- 💀", "create