9:16", "owner": "stilesss.stilinskiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010829825630393, "text": "Apa ini, kenapa dunia semakin tk terkendali. Mereka berbuat seenaknya saja tanpa batas, tanpa memikirkan akibatnya.", "created_at": "2024-09-16T01:55:57", "owner": "itsmebakery__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096074212415691, "text": "That's the thing that ate a cat?", "created_at": "2024-09-16T01:39:29", "owner": "dripppz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966589191795185, "text": "She gay?", "created_at": "2024-09-16T01:08:28", "owner": "afr0_j4ck_richie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161436655312176, "text": "Naon nu dirasa", "created_at": "2024-09-16T00:56:23", "owner": "seblak_rujak_ceters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328287766148971, "text": "Что это было 💀👽👽😂", "created_at": "2024-09-16T00:26:29", "owner": "alin.aabdyldaeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068469607609309, "text": "???", "created_at": "2024-09-15T23:40:16", "owner": "admadeus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949988235814666, "text": "So?!", "created_at": "2024-09-15T23:37:39", "owner": "y.e.house1926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18460708333053564, "text": "Travis Scott would never", "created_at": "2024-09-15T23:11:31", "owner": "albert_medel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933152151919428, "text": "Vrindhapan?😮", "created_at": "2024-09-15T23:11:25", "owner": "andreanwy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036236876169515, "text": "Cheap replacement for actual talent", "created_at": "2024-09-15T21:07:30", "owner": "northernthrottlerecords", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333459127177653, "text": "👽😂", "created_at": "2024-09-15T21:02:04", "owner": "mesenat_xeyriyye_cemiyyeti_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282180364225444, "text": "Oʻzbeklar ✅ har joyda bor 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-15T20:39:01", "owner": "shahrixanski_01", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18324317560197350, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-15T20:03:07", "owner": "benoit.dvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052890817863452, "text": "And??", "created_at": "2024-09-15T19:55:37", "owner": "sscottwayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035166676981763, "text": "