142149991449, "text": "Ahhhh 👅", "created_at": "2025-02-18T17:32:27", "owner": "zuzana.cuteyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943243683830605, "text": "😂😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-18T15:35:33", "owner": "taimoor54321_shah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083214190611151, "text": "It's Tennis I promise!", "created_at": "2025-02-18T03:05:08", "owner": "bahamutt90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950099850924007, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-16T20:28:38", "owner": "ghonicks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964689861736862, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-16T15:06:38", "owner": "samerkh69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037522385181224, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-16T09:07:42", "owner": "rameshshipe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072156226691387, "text": "I can't stop laughing 😂", "created_at": "2025-02-14T10:52:51", "owner": "bini_bhawani999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012743261509742, "text": "😅🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-14T10:51:23", "owner": "bini_bhawani999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369494554137047, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-14T08:08:00", "owner": "praiwanboonsuep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051913054934727, "text": "🔥😍😍😍😍😍👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-02-14T05:44:30", "owner": "inga_4039", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015748787676887, "text": "No man will complain", "created_at": "2025-02-13T19:45:47", "owner": "xuk92118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900383410038873, "text": "Djokovic- “ 🦊 “", "created_at": "2025-02-13T18:27:24", "owner": "imjustatennisplayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068349106680861, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-02-13T17:51:03", "owner": "yasaman.j4e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496992046032677, "text": "All tennis matches should be like this 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-13T15:43:13", "owner": "willdawg16", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17939060336974202, "text": "Who knew that in order to make tennis a popular sport all you had to do was give the players mics and then all of a sudden it’s open mic night at the laugh factory lmao", "created_at": "2025-02-13T02:04:04", "owner": "eltitoamericano", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037146656382820, "text": "Tennis should be mic’D up more often 😂", "created_at": "2025-02-13T01:11:11", "owner": "k_131st_dimension", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928786188899103, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-02-12T22:07:03", "owner": "juanserraguzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038044094601969, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-12T17:47:23", "owner": "maucia1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17843200593418626, "text": "I’ve watched this so many times and it’s still one of my favorite clips! Novak’s laugh gets me every time 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-12T07:13:04", "owner": "fordyce.rebecca", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18092374060532583, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-02-10T16:04:33", "owner": "tabxiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909662482088740, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-10T16:00:28", "owner": "centofeyzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911175000983257, "text": "Yeahhh", "created_at": "2025-02-10T16:00:13", "owner": "centofeyzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070305490774171, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭كيىووتتت", "created_at": "2025-02-10T15:43:31", "owner": "hopeghyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069763720651716, "text": "😂😂😂😂Ahh❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-09T01:45:52", "owner": "miny_pando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036084902579083, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-08T19:44:08", "owner": "aloeman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049795636963690, "text": "😂😂😂😂Fue maravilloso", "created_at": "2025-02-08T16:37:17", "owner": "dhank.you.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060677545777755, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-06T19:33:31", "owner": "frangamer_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935491764984542, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-06T18:08:17", "owner": "khing_pmt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880495876235720, "text": "🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-02-06T06:36:22", "owner": "pacomarx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959041818756573, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-02-06T02:37:51", "owner": "jdottyjdawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082507150608677, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-05T21:16:48", "