{"media_id": 3428961990871511760, "shortcode": "C-WHsNmNnLQ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-WHsNmNnLQ/", "taken_at": "2024-08-06T22:42:37", "caption": "Many people with ADHD and autism are sensitive to light. Bright lights, especially, can be overwhelming and lead to discomfort or sensory overload. This heightened sensitivity can make certain environments challenging, necessitating adjustments like dim lighting or wearing sunglasses indoors to maintain comfort.\n\n🚨 Do you suspect you might have autism? 🚨\n\nOur UNOFFICIAL AUTISM TEST is here to help you identify symptoms and understand your experiences. 🌟 \n\n✨ Discover insights about:\n✅ Social interactions\n✅ Behaviors & interests\n✅ Symptoms\n✅ Lifestyle choices\n\n✨ Pay what you want and start your journey today! ✨\n\n👉 Ready to take control of your health? Click the link in our bio NOW!", "owner_username": "asdoers", "owner_id": "56689655984", "likes": 524194, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0064_C-WHsNmNnLQ\\C-WHsNmNnLQ_20240806_224237.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18005333132534667, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-21T10:55:10", "owner": "hulmealison7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033855359102311, "text": "This is me", "created_at": "2024-11-12T20:03:22", "owner": "sky_player_gyu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17926461557973408, "text": "STOP THE SQUEAL!!", "created_at": "2024-11-02T17:49:44", "owner": "bazdabear", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075551668505279, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:55:07", "owner": "deaalbertson57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884639914110253, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:15:50", "owner": "alquiflux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874112749189167, "text": "Vote for the candidate for law and order - Yes. Vote for Harris. \nNot for the one who breaks the law and loves disorder. Donald.", "created_at": "2024-10-10T21:20:16", "owner": "julie_oheudo_white", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17997628151694734, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂 boy bye", "created_at": "2024-10-10T20:05:30", "owner": "live_love_miranda123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017847200545191, "text": "Go to jail, go to jail…..", "created_at": "2024-10-10T19:47:32", "owner": "donnainthehouse", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073258849586851, "text": "Sick!", "created_at": "2024-10-10T19:01:35", "owner": "edu_rabin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249371005284573, "text": "The one in charge right now are the laughing stock of the world", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:50:36", "owner": "liavanwormer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916502793905905, "text": "Gibt es in Amerika keine intelligenten Personen mehr, die als Präsident kandidieren können?😢", "created_at": "2024-10-10T05:28:09", "owner": "maritab56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064448578643122, "text": "Really?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T04:02:40", "owner": "ajs18s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278972593172551, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣this clip always kills me dude @azienoodles @jezmineinjects 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-10T03:00:39", "owner": "nabs_kitty", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066922324717543, "text": "“TURN OFF THE LIES”….”TURN OFF THE LIES…”TURN OFF THE LIES”!!!!!🙄😂😂😂😂🤡", "created_at": "2024-10-09T04:14:28", "owner": "diva.daryl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055750399829032, "text": "He's so real for that 🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-09T04:10:53", "owner": "twenty_one_jennas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036483374229224, "text": "🤦🏼‍♀️🤦🏼‍♀️🤦🏼‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-10-08T21:17:27", "owner": "agnieszkakirk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064816942578723, "text": "Yup….100% will be voting for Trump! 🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-08T20:22:37", "owner": "kbeck60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050624935821664, "text": "swears he’s king. no one needs to act so childish when they want something done. irritates my soul", "created_at": "2024-10-08T18:23:16", "owner": "mirandaleedebrum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008396918450010, "text": "Turn off trump", "created_at": "2024-10-08T18:04:12", "owner": "miranda7424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064194883598472, "text": "Have a drink.", "created_at": "2024-10-08T08:58:41", "owner": "littlerock1961", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058063177801784, "text": "He said let’s go ready and they followed.😂", "created_at": "2024-10-08T04:19:55", "owner": "iammarionhollis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17955497636712690, "text": "Why 🤣 is he so real 👏", "created_at": "2024-10-08T00:45:14", "owner": "seestubbs3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991135911554960, "text": "Trump 2024💯🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-08T00:00:19", "owner": "bennychavezpits", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028547120104315, "text": "Vote Blue!  Vote Sanity! 💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-10-07T16:43:16", "owner": "theactorslab", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094516807467201, "text": "me to my alexa every night", "created_at": "2024-10-07T04:52:44", "owner": "gracey.smith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050221036900628, "text": "Carnival Barker Clown Show 🤡", "created_at": "2024-10-07T04:49:32", "owner": "sarahidington", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943767933857766, "text": "He’s such a man child", "created_at": "2024-10-07T01:55:16", "owner": "tam_k13_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943891773887509, "text": "💙💙💙💙🇺🇸💙💙💙💙🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-07T01:41:52", "owner": "juancarlos.rivera.5872", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462036271058607, "text": "He’s going to melt lol  orange juice 😜", "created_at": "2024-10-06T20:03:37", "owner": "arminda_068", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019997522282475, "text": "Trump 2024 🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-06T19:22:20", "owner": "phyllismaneri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040065389172876, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 I don’t like bright lights either so get the hell off his back", "created_at": "2024-10-06T18:06:18", "owner": "valeriekalahiki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909566215008003, "text": "GOAT Trump 🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸❤️🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-06T17:52:12", "owner": "happyheadsmokeshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021689888240766, "text": "such a 10 year old!", "created_at": "2024-10-06T15:42:39", "owner": "debsue503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440293141070855, "text": "There are many many other signs of autism with Trump as well. And it’s OK, just not for president which is a job that is responsible for millions of lives", "created_at": "2024-10-06T14:54:41", "owner": "ivyleagueimage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018211847299070, "text": "OMG he was out of his mind!!!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-06T14:16:07", "owner": "salguerosheny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842543812333887, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:57:41", "owner": "huffle_puff07714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020853572528783, "text": "TRUMP🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:50:09", "owner": "yaelhyman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878933329155376, "text": "I do that with overhead lighting, my son will verify this.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:18:19", "owner": "reitmeyerlinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008940647422058, "text": "Party games when we start to rock we never wanna stop again hit the lights 😶‍🌫️😶‍🌫️😶‍🌫️😶‍🌫️", "created_at": "2024-10-06T11:12:55", "owner": "hammers1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886020607105439, "text": "broke character but embarrassingly picked it up. still, u lost yourself there, Donald", "created_at": "2024-10-06T07:33:16", "owner": "e___edwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868226224211879, "text": "Take Trump off the stage !!! That is better than turning lights off", "created_at": "2024-10-06T05:40:43", "owner": "cl.audia047", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907276081039436, "text": "My word….. 😮", "created_at": "2024-10-06T05:06:55", "owner": "miss_rose_rn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010848869392771, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-06T05:05:08", "owner": "aasmithjr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880251760141680, "text": "Turn off the sound.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T04:46:40", "owner": "paintedhorswmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040226633491460, "text": "THE WORLD IS LAUGHING AT AMERICA", "created_at": "2024-10-06T04:45:49", "owner": "free.speach_tina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992130951547261, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 I can’t", "created_at": "2024-10-06T04:23:17", "owner": "refund_thee_police_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024646874424255, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-10-06T04:11:35", "owner": "goddessandthemoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907139106947455, "text": "😂😂😂 WTF ????", "created_at": "2024-10-06T03:33:58", "owner": "ferrera_mr2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269555815223279, "text": "Many people with Dementia act like this, too.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T03:31:50", "owner": "kay.t.designs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899815810062380, "text": "AND PEOPLE REALLY WANT HIM TO BE PRESIDENT 😫", "created_at": "2024-10-06T02:46:25", "owner": "berryfine1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035452832516030, "text": "😮🤣😂🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-06T02:41:00", "owner": "tuniqkaryn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853352128293661, "text": "Especially the Christians!? It’s so contradictory.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T00:34:48", "owner": "julieamurphy10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030948338367903, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-06T00:28:06", "owner": "domi1cy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941882877865547, "text": "But he does artificial tanning doesn’t he?", "created_at": "2024-10-05T23:47:22", "owner": "andrewgilbert3904", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116755576395418, "text": "Too bad for the king wants the lights off. Just imagine if he ever got back in power \nhow he would act when he doesn’t get what he wants.Plus who will want to be in his cabinet.", "created_at": "2024-10-05T22:46:56", "owner": "aaa_done", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941755776896927, "text": "What the hell is wrong with him?", "created_at": "2024-10-05T21:36:12", "owner": "proctor.terry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859522651255234, "text": "🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-10-05T19:37:37", "owner": "ksparrillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344934172192730, "text": "Turn him off instead!!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-05T17:15:42", "owner": "patriciahparente", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977198586772708, "text": "I’m beginning to think there’s something wrong with him, just an observation", "created_at": "2024-10-05T15:05:19", "owner": "joltinjoel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066244300576834, "text": "Y'all president. 🤡", "created_at": "2024-10-05T14:59:12", "owner": "alfredcopelandjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043722692003744, "text": "I am ok with lights long as they dont flash but my sensory issues come from auditory stimuli", "created_at": "2024-10-05T14:23:39", "owner": "alice_the_valiant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969360324657508, "text": "You don’t need to be a psychologist to understand his face expressions!", "created_at": "2024-10-05T13:40:13", "owner": "stairways2heaven74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022072652602850, "text": "Its not autism to be ADHD. Stop calling it autism, jesus", "created_at": "2024-10-05T12:35:24", "owner": "jacobkiryliuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012249410361491, "text": "He is John 10:10 in the flesh!", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:20:39", "owner": "sonjapatrice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020011889256942, "text": "💙💙💙💙💙💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:13:07", "owner": "bonicak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958717368704116, "text": "Off!! I’ll melt 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-05T03:56:51", "owner": "teacher11.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877902622159161, "text": "Why don't you show the reason why he is talking this way? I'm sure it's for a good reason.... Coz man, this guy is the best for a country leader.", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:59:30", "owner": "felly_jahau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157459510318610, "text": "Those lights are too bright! Has nothing to do with Autism/ADHD lmao! 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:59:17", "owner": "beth_neuf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998806491692538, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:56:28", "owner": "anaruizrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019318937281936, "text": "Some of you need to go see doctor right a way if you not vote for president TRUMP you missing some thing in side your head", "created_at": "2024-10-05T01:34:36", "owner": "sivuthamam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964952214796192, "text": "You don’t want them to see how old you are!", "created_at": "2024-10-05T01:27:32", "owner": "hecqrendon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042318616888492, "text": "MAGA!", "created_at": "2024-10-05T01:11:53", "owner": "huflunggoo12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008548535434557, "text": "Trump 🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2024-10-05T00:28:58", "owner": "daysi_limonta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885624148101676, "text": "Stable genius for President rally fail!", "created_at": "2024-10-04T23:14:49", "owner": "michael.wentworth.752", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029784929339605, "text": "Where's a ketchup bottle when you need one?", "created_at": "2024-10-04T23:13:38", "owner": "michael.wentworth.752", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976834458771184, "text": "My family call me \"the vampire\"", "created_at": "2024-10-04T22:53:49", "owner": "peachywardah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269225341219835, "text": "NO, TURN OFF THE SOUND!!", "created_at": "2024-10-04T22:07:23", "owner": "marytomcanning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086609563501098, "text": "@kxvindoran you", "created_at": "2024-10-04T19:48:25", "owner": "uisce.erika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943139934897715, "text": "Turn off the mic!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-04T19:37:19", "owner": "jcm_1978_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035790311334638, "text": "Men of darkness can’t stand the light.. 💯", "created_at": "2024-10-04T18:47:02", "owner": "mccuat123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999864441659103, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-04T16:14:46", "owner": "megantheeregan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961396695693123, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T13:14:55", "owner": "kaleiamonique06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022723751439882, "text": "The light is bothering his tan🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-04T12:31:07", "owner": "gwenethdyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250946746249929, "text": "How about please turn off the lights!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-04T11:44:59", "owner": "designjsm28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056247421830179, "text": "This was president.", "created_at": "2024-10-04T10:46:53", "owner": "irvinggrantthalberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132677986367847, "text": "That anger he is showing is scary.", "created_at": "2024-10-04T09:00:49", "owner": "shazmay09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252260347252719, "text": "💙💙💙💙🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-04T05:46:47", "owner": "beverlyhomicillo98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880264309140038, "text": "Vote for Trump early", "created_at": "2024-10-04T05:13:46", "owner": "jcb_ronin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025480328161354, "text": "🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-10-04T03:41:25", "owner": "me5355410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017007674616407, "text": "10 year old", "created_at": "2024-10-04T02:57:14", "owner": "dr.d.hiny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357197641187712, "text": "I wish we could turn him off", "created_at": "2024-10-04T02:44:06", "owner": "maryanndevine78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087516313500093, "text": "Baby cryer hahahahah 😂😂😂😂😂😂 hes becaming more orage 💙💙💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-10-04T02:09:25", "owner": "josef.castellon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277586371168149, "text": "Darkness hate light!", "created_at": "2024-10-04T01:50:18", "owner": "mary.kilduff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049903450913529, "text": "Anyone that dosen't vote for Trump is a COMMIE!!", "created_at": "2024-10-04T01:21:24", "owner": "dmartini201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898117588065908, "text": "Have you ever seen chucky screaming right before he melts!? That’s what just came to mind. 💭😭🤣🫠 (He is hilarious though I must say…)", "created_at": "2024-10-04T01:06:04", "owner": "l_jackson24_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456775519013711, "text": "What a child! He’s throwing a tantrum. Ugh.", "created_at": "2024-10-03T23:05:50", "owner": "dianaaristiawatercolors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024308237422363, "text": "What a joke!", "created_at": "2024-10-03T22:21:59", "owner": "merlitacleveland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058352587767325, "text": "💀💀💀🦅🦅🦅🦅", "created_at": "2024-10-03T02:48:44", "owner": "part_of_gold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043652615053423, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-03T01:20:29", "owner": "faithgabrielax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039647693490348, "te