": 17986261718575172, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-10T04:50:44", "owner": "yan2_solivance", "likes": 127}, {"id": 18005506217444520, "text": "หมอย?", "created_at": "2024-09-03T12:31:00", "owner": "cchettxx.159", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973916052765441, "text": "海鷗最近很流行欸", "created_at": "2024-09-03T10:10:56", "owner": "jobiter777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920764764859033, "text": "หมอยๆๆๆ", "created_at": "2024-09-02T18:09:33", "owner": "buggy999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038338205314395, "text": "所以這海鷗 到底買還是不買😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-02T14:21:59", "owner": "aex054_ae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893033020066419, "text": "我想要這個酷東西🤩🤩", "created_at": "2024-08-25T01:40:40", "owner": "iam_coco_wu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042239861312970, "text": "@asdn971010", "created_at": "2024-08-24T06:49:38", "owner": "liu_ava_333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033018787971012, "text": "好想要這個酷東西", "created_at": "2024-08-23T03:46:44", "owner": "fang12015822", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18291678118201106, "text": "@iiiuu0414 好像那個海底總動員那些一群很吵的海鷗🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-20T09:27:42", "owner": "yabe_220", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937068624888668, "text": "คนไทยที่ได้ยินว่าหมอย👁️👄👁️💀💀", "created_at": "2024-08-19T10:38:30", "owner": "kuyraiva33", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18043076032939273, "text": "@donghao306", "created_at": "2024-08-19T05:38:04", "owner": "kattyaslime", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016814627437480, "text": "哪裡有賣", "created_at": "2024-08-18T10:59:57", "owner": "xiang_2.24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091058317461005, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-08-18T10:11:23", "owner": "v5920kimo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18309047611085478, "text": "@hsuan___100 我覺得我們很需要😍", "created_at": "2024-08-18T08:29:06", "owner": "wl01621791", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027109727059853, "text": "我要海鷗", "created_at": "2024-08-18T07:38:24", "owner": "ningningv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982575336583039, "text": "@yihan.dai", "created_at": "2024-08-18T04:21:53", "owner": "panby_mini", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907243830922811, "text": "@liiizo2o2 做給我", "created_at": "2024-08-18T04:06:57", "owner": "croyezenvou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18448099357001391, "text": "我需要上面的酷東西", "created_at": "2024-08-17T05:10:44", "owner": "howie.0719", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18263522035223529, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-14T13:40:42", "owner": "wushi_113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002824787439678, "text": "蟹蟹蟹蟹：今日嘅螃蟹，你想食嘅螃蟹😂", "created_at": "2024-08-13T05:37:39", "owner": "franfranfranceslin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092245711457289, "text": "@jiduoli 買啦", "created_at": "2024-08-12T15:48:27", "owner": "mayachiang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18102298498378026, "text": "@milky_way.o7 買😂", "created_at": "2024-08-12T07:36:31", "owner": "gxy_0411", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894611029048696, "text": "@kimngocj 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-11T16:48:49", "owner": "mi.li_z4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18272389585208551, "text": "卡", "created_at": "2024-08-11T03:44:26", "owner": "masahiroig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014839775597712, "text": "這個哪裡買的到😂", "created_at": "2024-08-10T14:03:39", "owner": "zamouse_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036975158033232, "text": "超想要這帽子🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-10T10:51:41", "owner": "nakamoto_ika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033307417944126, "text": "@c.hs822", "created_at": "2024-08-10T09:59:53", "owner": "sky.langnai_0204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032378525136306, "text": "今日嘅螃蟹～ 你想食嘅，螃蟹～ 買啦，螃蟹～", "created_at": "2024-08-10T05:29:20", "owner": "oliver_hei", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17847466644270752, "text": "@ziennnn_99 this", "created_at": "2024-08-09T14:16:37", "owner": "cheryl__lky00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928029216810412, "text": "@adl0111 @chloeloyi 大數據推給我這個⋯", "created_at": "2024-08-08T13:20:22", "owner": "ssabinaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929122968918292, "text": "好想買", "created_at": "2024-08-08T11:48:20", "owner": "shang_0537", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043437904929152, "text": "@_k.199610 姐妹👭\n我們是不是該入手一頂？", "created_at": "2024-08-08T05:26:33", "owner": "liam_yueh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908069320004135, "text": "海鷗：我的.我的😂", "created_at": "2024-08-07T01:53:16", "owner": "peiyi_stay", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17936360387780109, "text": "@maxtom5563", "created_at": "2024-08-06T23:43:06", "owner": "walkzun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038630693009815, "text": "@4.24yuyu", "created_at": "2024-08-06T15:08:15", "owner": "liu199007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116617828388579, "text": "@yuwen2628 @jerry05676 @njd06090", "created_at": "2024-08-06T11:19:04", "owner": "walkzun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049285603799886, "text": "Mai", "created_at": "2024-08-05T06:02:01", "owner": "ste2la_liaooo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065953363600114, "text": "我想買！！❤️", "created_at": "2024-08-03T12:57:22", "owner": "catty760124", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909675411998243, "text": "@meiyan_iris you during the trip", "created_at": "2024-08-02T13:27:39", "owner": "chowcircle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990466350513110, "text": "請問在哪買😍", "created_at": "2024-08-01T12:31:33", "owner": "p_ru_wang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057215008655280, "text": "我聽到螃蟹??", "created_at": "2024-08-01T11:52:38", "owner": "peterwong001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913840416966539, "text": "卡一個", "created_at": "2024-07-31T13:07:47", "owner": "1996.0129", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019629896156675, "text": "我需要一車這個酷東西", "created_at": "2024-07-31T03:49:04", "owner": "a246810a2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858893167212430, "text": "我需要這個酷酷的東c", "created_at": "2024-07-31T02:29:46", "owner": "walker._.2237", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862782247192322, "text": "@jingling980928 😂", "created_at": "2024-07-31T00:23:35", "owner": "roycelee5202", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18331855036134871, "text": "我其實也想要這個酷東西", "created_at": "2024-07-29T15:53:34", "owner": "charlie_liang_tw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030057389328191, "text": "所以這要在哪裡買？", "created_at": "2024-07-28T15:14:04", "owner": "yyal6al6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18012501149290840, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-07-28T14:30:55", "owner": "inuyasha.wock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016585082425820, "text": "哪裡有賣，求網址", "created_at": "2024-07-28T10:42:43", "owner": "z