{"media_id": 3415642582813501727, "shortcode": "C9mzNUMS-kf", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9mzNUMS-kf/", "taken_at": "2024-07-19T13:47:46", "caption": "❬❬ 吉興演出·浪吉天涯｜倒數02天 ❭❭\n\n活動地點路線圖！票只要60！\n\n高雄市立高雄高級中學藝能館演奏廳\n\n學校地址：\n高雄市三民區建國三路50號\n\n交通方式：\n1.捷運搭乘至R11高雄車站步行5分鐘\n2.火車搭乘至高雄車站出站步行5分鐘\n3.高雄市公車88、205、36號等路線至高雄中學\n4.乘車導航到高雄市三民區建國三路50號\n5.走路到雄中\n\n—•— ••• •— — —• ••— •• — •— •—•\n\n❬❬ 吉興演出·浪吉天涯 ❭❭\n\n⚓ 雄中民吉獨立成發 SOLOTIME VOL.7 ​⚓\n​\n▎2024年7月21日 | 高雄市立高雄中學演藝廳\n\n活動時間：13:00開放入場 13:30表演開始\n\n主辦單位：高雄中學民謠吉他社114級幹部\n\n硬體協力：熠聲文創、海頓樂器、墨墨設計", "owner_username": "solotime_vol.7", "owner_id": "66413756358", "likes": 306984, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0068_C9mzNUMS-kf\\C9mzNUMS-kf_20240719_134746.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18054313700019184, "text": "幹笑死了哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-01-15T09:15:43", "owner": "haze_kuen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094760320510965, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-04T09:27:26", "owner": "clarissacantek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941392476950847, "text": "往下躲不是用翻滾的，0／10 爛遊戲😡", "created_at": "2025-01-03T22:44:26", "owner": "johnlin358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047037995140283, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-30T02:34:53", "owner": "jekyll_ooxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045699779129010, "text": "所以我在路上要小心火車嗎..", "created_at": "2024-12-16T14:12:17", "owner": "freehry_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294393613225270, "text": "第一次看這種宣傳影片沒滑掉，甚至還看了3次👏", "created_at": "2024-11-30T04:41:12", "owner": "minic_ky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043209098135808, "text": "@tonytony_5678", "created_at": "2024-11-21T13:07:12", "owner": "shen__5678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927799242968030, "text": "幹！這比我這還有創意乜😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T18:06:07", "owner": "hueynnn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064575010667953, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-15T07:55:58", "owner": "jacky931109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466389589027798, "text": "這宣傳好厲害", "created_at": "2024-11-15T04:51:30", "owner": "_trista0926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864012112260877, "text": "一直忍住沒笑，直到火車出現後", "created_at": "2024-11-14T09:01:14", "owner": "stray_54ys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888079426106859, "text": "火車是怎麼回事😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T08:19:44", "owner": "o8o1._.cco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976777080788262, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:40:24", "owner": "chenchenqiwei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032754647346979, "text": "原來是小時候玩的遊戲⋯😍", "created_at": "2024-11-07T01:40:32", "owner": "jpgefilm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376280968099487, "text": "幹\n好懷念\n超久沒玩", "created_at": "2024-11-06T10:44:47", "owner": "bbai__cheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360329242143025, "text": "有創意👏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T23:39:35", "owner": "vegeta__ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010144178463305, "text": "😂😂笑死", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:46:09", "owner": "c23764120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297408322204464, "text": "@sjh_184 好炸裂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T01:50:17", "owner": "okcss2312", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050150437809248, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-10-30T14:16:01", "owner": "momolmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461703613027353, "text": "跟拍的辛苦了", "created_at": "2024-10-29T06:10:02", "owner": "hu.in8333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003605129659991, "text": "啾咪", "created_at": "2024-10-25T22:30:32", "owner": "quickquick_bibi_0729", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032765531351430, "text": "真人版subway Surfers！！太頂了這個宣傳影片很可以啊❤️🫡", "created_at": "2024-10-24T03:39:11", "owner": "midzy_0407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356008294184540, "text": "@hong.04._.lin.29 雄中生有料", "created_at": "2024-10-21T14:01:39", "owner": "r1t4_1105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093105073478253, "text": "看著螢幕也覺得喘是正常的嗎", "created_at": "2024-10-21T09:29:53", "owner": "kakamakayla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906608998043549, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T12:10:01", "owner": "dungeon_boki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048917029948402, "text": "你是怎么忽悠他们跟你拍的", "created_at": "2024-10-19T06:11:42", "owner": "breadoncat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082928338513530, "text": "@lee_chun_tin 遊戲攻略在這", "created_at": "2024-10-14T11:32:43", "owner": "harunoyu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026874836379412, "text": "沒有人發現到攝影師超強嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T03:20:40", "owner": "10.02__yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332748040195492, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T01:32:41", "owner": "mingfly_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043233596084661, "text": "非常酷兄弟😮🔥👏", "created_at": "2024-10-12T12:10:26", "owner": "katesa_pinta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093112765477939, "text": "@chenchensu8778 好可愛弟弟們可愛死了", "created_at": "2024-10-12T10:03:40", "owner": "elin_2349", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117563794399683, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-11T16:10:41", "owner": "nancy5486888", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17922071528974206, "text": "別笑這些是我們會考考輸的人", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:04:15", "owner": "lyyyyys._1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045597031955374, "text": "天才", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:03:44", "owner": "lyyyyys._1020", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18339515692179613, "text": "贏了", "created_at": "2024-10-11T10:34:47", "owner": "ggggggod_1026", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18058890694813108, "text": "@ixin_078", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:07:03", "owner": "youmu.1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019995341538669, "text": "不是  我看到這則影片時已經過了11週了", "created_at": "2024-10-10T13:08:00", "owner": "vermilion1992", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035105849192107, "text": "喪屍版跑酷", "created_at": "2024-10-10T11:16:14", "owner": "gaeul_0924_2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857417464225537, "text": "創意滿分😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T09:16:44", "owner": "mudevon.studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052520581851883, "text": "有料", "created_at": "2024-10-05T11:29:39", "owner": "so9on9_so9seven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305779021167826, "text": "天才!", "created_at": "2024-10-05T06:29:49", "owner": "tingpj0828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864329698233487, "text": "太可愛了吧🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-05T06:15:04", "owner": "exo_luhan__xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925621740952836, "text": "這真的是我看過最有料的宣傳影片了", "created_at": "2024-10-05T03:42:11", "owner": "jhanyeee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847723186283908, "text": "看到留言才意識到subway surfers😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T13:57:25", "owner": "quiet_place_ln_river92927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261928132301509, "text": "我以為門外那幾位是喪屍，\n原來是來搶票的啊⋯⋯😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T11:18:47", "owner": "is_sufang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042784196013892, "text": "当天全部开着视频跟着走", "created_at": "2024-10-04T04:41:46", "owner": "apaapaxuan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041813624107722, "text": "@chiuno.o 超遠 你會去嗎", "created_at": "2024-10-03T17:59:51", "owner": "wwwewi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017269619564208, "text": "優秀", "created_at": "2024-10-03T15:51:54", "owner": "liaoernie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043400036060253, "text": "太有才了！！！", "created_at": "2024-10-03T11:24:37", "owner": "tasyjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311355424089305, "text": "❤️❤️❤️超有才", "created_at": "2024-10-03T10:51:44", "owner": "leemonmon0220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040184030105430, "text": "這是一個從subways 變成阿甘正傳的故事", "created_at": "2024-10-03T09:52:33", "owner": "niuryan0202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037591267952428, "text": "真有才", "created_at": "2024-10-03T05:54:04", "owner": "ashmedai_1975", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303789418161247, "text": "雄又贏", "created_at": "2024-10-02T02:18:29", "owner": "stevenhu1229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907848724011812, "text": "😂😂😂王德发？！（好孩子不要学）", "created_at": "2024-10-01T13:50:27", "owner": "lcp.casual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034513343022333, "text": "@kyle_202kshs ???", "created_at": "2024-09-30T17:03:47", "owner": "knshanb_2.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085451230501940, "text": "雄中的學生壓力不是一般的大😢", "created_at": "2024-09-30T13:39:20", "owner": "f112710", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18052373389882634, "text": "為什麼看到後面會有萬人感謝祭的既視感", "created_at": "2024-09-30T11:56:59", "owner": "boyce_ni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022312562424794, "text": "吉吉可危啊！！", "created_at": "2024-09-29T08:44:50", "owner": "dodo30322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066732700619373, "text": "@yi_hong_0916 看來壓力不小", "created_at": "2024-09-29T02:50:14", "owner": "yuan_06.26", 