{"media_id": 3383554604252962486, "shortcode": "C70zPxYop62", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C70zPxYop62/", "taken_at": "2024-06-05T07:09:55", "caption": "This makes the adrenaline pulse through my body like I'm re living  that morning from  20 years. No matter how hard things are right now they will never be as hard as that.", "owner_username": "bre_double__t", "owner_id": "7187445827", "likes": 2987342, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0071_C70zPxYop62\\C70zPxYop62_20240605_070955.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18125216575540622, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2026-01-21T20:35:03", "owner": "doctorpeppa4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032591006563115, "text": "Cool🔥", "created_at": "2026-01-12T04:57:14", "owner": "staylitfromthestart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068459327166458, "text": "i got goosebumps", "created_at": "2026-01-10T05:11:43", "owner": "8to6to", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18111214639612961, "text": "That truck appeared out of thin air you couldn’t even see it from the other side of the car if that was the case the other dude would of got smashed too", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:30:15", "owner": "talkischeapbitch", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17912878875227156, "text": "Mne wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:19:45", "owner": "toobloody56", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18047123212900917, "text": "Did he survive tho?", "created_at": "2024-12-25T17:28:45", "owner": "jinxxy0", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18035486069588167, "text": "Ight, I don’t think I’m gettin’ a bike anymore.", "created_at": "2024-12-21T14:50:31", "owner": "alfa.kidd98", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18047163857483902, "text": "Wow. I'm terrified. Oh my gosh. Day who knows what of seeing a predictable grim repar post. Oh no", "created_at": "2024-11-23T11:30:50", "owner": "vongh0st", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18269511589300459, "text": "NOPE! I rebuke everything from this video in the name of jesus, amen🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T11:30:10", "owner": "filippofrnz", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17928896840970794, "text": "What the hell my phone fell", "created_at": "2024-11-23T11:17:13", "owner": "n.varnika", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18336336256149901, "text": "Okay it's the middle of the night why would you post this😭", "created_at": "2024-11-23T11:02:44", "owner": "chuckyduckyy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17939592923930099, "text": "Bros got high honnur", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:42:12", "owner": "nerdymetalhead1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18106450648453398, "text": "Cameraman never dies 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:38:57", "owner": "ishii.___.ka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048999365079794, "text": "Now he will be reincarnated to another world", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:23:23", "owner": "ofc.pyush", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18083988172542894, "text": "Ameen", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:11:35", "owner": "zayd_himself", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920528766904364, "text": "🦌 @daysieess", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:49:41", "owner": "kyuttieee_rome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039536927211854, "text": "Ngul a sort", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:37:03", "owner": "simone_miranda_72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047671556084765, "text": "Wait, I'm I the only one who found it funny💀", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:34:17", "owner": "lwandymally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063292273761466, "text": "I jumped to Mars frr💀😭", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:26:05", "owner": "ella.wm_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882032167172250, "text": "Every time I watch this shit I get jump scared", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:20:22", "owner": "demi_god_kai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163560574320035, "text": "Anyone else just get cold chills and nothing else from the grim reaper?", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:38:01", "owner": "king_one_ace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076362907591936, "text": "Camera man never dies💀🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:33:25", "owner": "aron_x_legend", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938660187935292, "text": "I opened the app and died😢", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:26:34", "owner": "xxia_001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967770696804431, "text": "My heart flipped out of my hole", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:12:52", "owner": "till4everunkownilovetill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864380026201391, "text": "BRO DONT REMOVE MY SOUL TOO", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:10:33", "owner": "fw.dharun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366441595119332, "text": "that scared the in me outa shit 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:06:27", "owner": "zachy.yy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032834957123115, "text": "My heart stopped for a second", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:24:33", "owner": "xxamyspamzzxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120930067404074, "text": "My soul left my body", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:21:12", "owner": "the_only_stylahhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001702046695631, "text": "Who got jumpscared—————————->", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:20:45", "owner": "offbrandbibble", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104496595454453, "text": "The idea feels so comforting and all of this has an end", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:17:05", "owner": "frisklikestoart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883046350170672, "text": "🦌", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:11:46", "owner": "hemaditya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143256622320556, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:05:37", "owner": "__j.wil__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022194920559799, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T06:39:22", "owner": "_thweonly.chn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031072214526068, "text": "My heart rate the entire video: 📈📈📈📈📈📈📈📈📈📈📈📈📈📈", "created_at": "2024-11-23T06:16:15", "owner": "hiranyaa.r3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058684417855044, "text": "In the name of Jesus nothing will happen from this video I love you god", "created_at": "2024-11-23T06:05:57", "owner": "hunter_sams54", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047223493891043, "text": "Let no one praying that no evil comes from this video vote🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:41:01", "owner": "_kuropilled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104774920456001, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:30:22", "owner": "snowpaw11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983641701717092, "text": "Still the most responsible-acting motorcyclist on the road...", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:03:47", "owner": "educated.contrarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069299383641428, "text": "why's the truck a \"nice shift”?!!", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:51:08", "owner": "raanananananarr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17996232098546087, "text": "Amen🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:30:40", "owner": "lil_woozyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939805407796669, "text": "STOP I YELLEED", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:10:09", "owner": "brooklynncookk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361604623140712, "text": "Plese god let no evil spirit from this video come my way", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:08:25", "owner": "dabenderr___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996950430538392, "text": "a day or two, I dream of this black devil standing by the bed and looking at me, I can't remember exactly whether he had a crisis or whether he was holding a bell in his hands, I tried to talk in my dream to drive him away and he disappeared for a few seconds and another one appeared, and so I got scared I looked at the door near the bed and it just flashed me white light .. and I wake up ...It was so scared dream that i have these last days 😢🙏 hope wont get another same thing 🙏😭 😫", "created_at": "2024-11-23T03:32:20", "owner": "ufo_mysteries_conspiracies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881875822177509, "text": "i rebuke in the name of jesus 🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T03:10:02", "owner": "ytwhyhatetayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917292007001806, "text": "Threw my phone 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T03:08:29", "owner": "mizmarley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998857290701942, "text": "lord please protect me from any evil spirt that may come after this video", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:53:07", "owner": "1k.tarus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921844105005577, "text": "@shatoot3d is the creator of this video.", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:40:26", "owner": "frizzlepixle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048567308070632, "text": "JESUS CHRIST YOU PEOPLE, TAG THE ORIGINAL CREATOR", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:39:29", "owner": "frizzlepixle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047897894507965, "text": "TAG THE ORIGINAL CREATOR", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:39:10", "owner": "frizzlepixle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059592532861873, "text": "you reposted someone else's video and did not tag the creator at all", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:38:58", "owner": "frizzlepixle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072545992620973, "text": "That trucks brakes are insanely good", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:35:48", "owner": "aaronleetheturkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950327544763338, "text": "why did I flinch dum hard on the grim ripper part 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:32:10", "owner": "trenchbabykdot_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18261210232255366, "text": "“I rebuke this energy” how are you gonna stay living your life in fear like a video on instagram is gonna be the thing that gets you", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:14:32", "owner": "xtheromanempire", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18063342799812283, "text": "I knew it lol I still watched till the end lol", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:12:16", "owner": "rosy_lee_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022920095564249, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:08:23", "owner": "1luh_ke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013987394432231, "text": "Real 💀💀💀💀🤣🤣🤣🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:07:46", "owner": "xav.ierkeith206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937277268936777, "text": "My back actually went cold", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:06:05", "owner": "olivercarter349", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047150399483888, "text": "I rebuke that in the name of Jesus.", "created_at": "2024-11-23T01:59:47", "owner": "gracienoelle4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062013841832137, "text": "And Every soul shall taste death", "created_at": "2024-11-23T01:20:01", "owner": "ironlung1948", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012375182446123, "text": "Heavenly Father, protect me from all evil from this video in the name of Jesus, AMEN🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:50:43", "owner": "elishadaqueen__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103467799455934, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:33:48", "owner": "brezzoobackup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098290585427923, "text": "It got you >>>>>>", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:02:22", "owner": "dontayvius_atkinson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150615097339567, "text": "@joekeane04", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:44:15", "owner": "nikki.ryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013580894427831, "text": "God protect us.", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:40:17", "owner": "airattackerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889097065131681, "text": "🦌", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:27:02", "owner": "fsulay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064015915749153, "text": "Yo bro, that's terrifying For real", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:20:54", "owner": "mahmod.ayd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968825961804574, "text": "Shoot that actually scared me", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:07:43", "owner": "jreth577", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043952237122560, "text": "Yall should be quiet", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:06:02", "owner": "gojira1954minus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019149890631728, "text": "Amen🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-22T22:56:12", "owner": "diary_of_sean_jones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188261944307302, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2024-11-22T22:46:23", "owner": "jack.of.all.traidz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066608872613727, "text": "Ima try it out and I’ll tell y’all if it works", "created_at": "2024-11-22T22:46:13", "owner": "b.a1bert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121948159403549, "text": "NOOO IT'S 4 AND MY BROTHER ISN'T HOME IM CRYING HE DRIVES A BIKE", "created_at": "2024-11-22T22:41:28", "owner": "ketchie_paws_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286650646209178, "text": "bro i basically went into a fit at the end💀", "created_at": "2024-11-22T22:38:59", "owner": "izak0509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040138480994601, "text": "Bro had good honor", "created_at": "2024-11-22T22:03:52", "owner": "cynthiaarobertss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471660052033044, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💀🙏🙏😭🔥🦌", "created_at": "2024-11-22T21:29:16", "owner": "k_e_v_i_n_os", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885753055149099, "text": "Why the 🦌", "created_at": "2024-11-22T21:26:41", "owner": "l.p__34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207039646293818, "text": "Bro had high honor 🦌", "created_at": "2024-11-22T21:05:47", "owner": "rrrrubenjgm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916752024915709, "text": "@haya.aminnn asså detta händer alltid mig , säg mig vfr jag alltid kastar min mobil?", "created_at": "2024-11-22T21:02:15", "owner": "lamar_kassar09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048104890877043, "text": "Bro when the grim reaper launched at the screen my soul left my body 💀😂", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:57:35", "owner": "damien0.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027940067600392, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:47:28", "owner": "d4ve204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854420434324913, "text": "Ǹ✿ ㉫vÏし ＄pÏrÏ† ＄ħAしし උ✿๓㉫ ๓ƴ ŴAƴ🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:19:06", "owner": "_jst_h.e.r_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869884813167267, "text": "God, protect me from any evil harm I might get from this video 🙏❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:08:07", "owner": "oxf_elliott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039601886192548, "text": "bro got high honor i can see", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:04:52", "owner": "icarlyonwax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045353876287971, "text": "THAF SCARED@ESO BAD", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:02:50", "owner": "noaboawoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873460969218530, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:00:51", "owner": "daph_sje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058017070863378, "text": "Dang I jumped", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:22:21", "owner": "whoocaress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072270235624969, "text": "Phat ke 36", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:18:28", "owner": "alsoshiv._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944945319913037, "text": "I rebuke you in the name of Jesus.", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:15:19", "owner": "ariahdz24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029927339171702, "text": "This gave me a panic attack FR 😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:12:25", "owner": "hheidizu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986880123754402, "text": "Beautiful depiction of tragedy", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:09:47", "owner": "nullpr0file", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033887984347484, "text": "@onlyleehh", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:47:39", "owner": "sec.matie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011498102475680, "text": "This be me in my dreams 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:43:49", "owner": "msjadabone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076312078588779, "text": "I claim no evil spirit 🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:32:10", "owner": "aastha.sings_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031302209138675, "text": "Let no evil spirit from this video come my way, AMEN 🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:27:34", "owner": "gautam_prasaddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872665882146369, "text": "My whole life flashed before my eyes💀", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:24:22", "owner": "aklilmeressa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853234474336068, "text": "Wtf l hate this", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:01:11", "owner": "estherwmbau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058300441878124, "text": "I hid behind the comment section", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:01:01", "owner": "torithebody", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18206841097293891, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-22T17:55:29", "owner": "crxwm1ns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18465565237049073, "text": "Bro used his stand", "created_at": "2024-11-22T17:25:38", "owner": "209.scary.moon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107800531435206, "text": "Proof the camera man never dies😂", "created_at": "2024-11-22T17:17:35", "owner": "miaisagooner_", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3414034077100645046, "shortcode": "C9hFeegqZq2", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9hFeegqZq2/", "taken_at": "2024-07-17T08:23:53", "caption": "Joker童年演員 FIND!!!\n#memes #fun #迷因 #搞笑", "owner_username": "shakingotaku", "owner_id": "65639790431", "likes": 51912, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0072_C9hFeegqZq2\\C9hFeegqZq2_20240717_082353.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18461679259033520, "text": "結果他圍起來的石牆下面都是螃蟹，直接發動地鳴", "created_at": "2024-10-10T17:21:41", "owner": "peter_love1314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849596662303095, "text": "接下來就是進擊的巨人的故事了", "created_at": "2024-10-06T05:53:48", "owner": "jeremyshieh0917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963808554797532, "text": "果然是白人小孩", "created_at": "2024-09-30T04:38:04", "owner": "migos95105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016498262542088, "text": "他是川普嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-29T18:53:41", "owner": "5678w54088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119577604384894, "text": "😅", "created_at": "2024-09-24T00:04:28", "owner": "daofuxianlu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944634375857158, "text": "HellDiver", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:29:27", "owner": "edwinlaw001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18451292455025589, "text": "长大直接拿着老板“让你尝尝做工的滋味”😂", "created_at": "2024-09-15T08:47:06", "owner": "obsidian0125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863908315213491, "text": "中共中央总书记的材料", "created_at": "2024-09-09T03:50:53", "owner": "life_strangled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132086641364463, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T15:12:45", "owner": "zzmismezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901823374037283, "text": "地鸣导火索", "created_at": "2024-09-06T13:29:35", "owner": "hotdog_siang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238314700286857, "text": "滾回去瑪麗亞之牆", "created_at": "2024-09-04T22:54:03", "owner": "_goa1ed.zx2011", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051216367848535, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-02T01:21:20", "owner": "gin_steven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346791622189527, "text": "艾蓮•蟹卡", "created_at": "2024-08-28T11:04:35", "owner": "love_tohka69", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18035300953916944, "text": "嚐一下但是不多", "created_at": "2024-08-25T14:43:53", "owner": "a012029a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109534402407434, "text": "當時貝爾朵魯特應該這樣把艾連拿出城牆外玩一玩。動漫結束，艾連體驗到自由了", "created_at": "2024-08-25T12:16:43", "owner": "ezplayze", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18039546497052299, "text": "你人還怪好的咧", "created_at": "2024-08-24T13:34:42", "owner": "_11._.yuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075123019478118, "text": "@sr__3833 @mad.dog_mao @yuling_pg 地獄養成計畫", "created_at": "2024-08-24T10:54:48", "owner": "force_5766", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348692698138194, "text": "Jude tasted", "created_at": "2024-08-23T15:33:25", "owner": "brianrry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248627965255179, "text": "…..觸發了地鳴他會後悔嗎？", "created_at": "2024-08-23T15:04:07", "owner": "lo.luis", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18014306165574891, "text": "他太了解習近平了", "created_at": "2024-08-23T09:06:41", "owner": "woomin_oscar_07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074929945535060, "text": "中國是社會主義吧", "created_at": "2024-08-23T06:34:19", "owner": "xukaijun14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019804088436766, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-22T23:35:41", "owner": "human05053", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867388582178790, "text": "🦐：不是 哥們", "created_at": "2024-08-18T09:17:18", "owner": "pilot_rx0", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18247958728253118, "text": "他是七大巨始祖嗎🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-16T00:07:14", "owner": "kyle_1.13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981788619706576, "text": "不是 哥們 林北踮在那齁齁 硬要給林北矇兩ㄟ...", "created_at": "2024-08-13T23:03:39", "owner": "lsr_4869", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972052563757596, "text": "艾蓮要出來了", "created_at": "2024-08-13T15:23:41", "owner": "o.o_12.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055747195606453, "text": "這就是翻牆的真諦", "created_at": "2024-08-05T04:52:53", "owner": "rozo0905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273696133242784, "text": "我以為那是蝦子", "created_at": "2024-08-04T06:19:45", "owner": "bellachang2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024167219359927, "text": "嚐過但不多", "created_at": "2024-08-04T03:09:07", "owner": "alwyn.0725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047507098870046, "text": "海的另一端是敵人……", "created_at": "2024-08-04T01:49:15", "owner": "charlie_0619", "likes": 199}, {"id": 17969864297767232, "text": "Toyz", "created_at": "2024-08-02T23:21:42", "owner": "jie4146", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954836085692122, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2024-08-02T06:02:20", "owner": "yuanhongsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979913151720705, "text": "等等金髮", "created_at": "2024-08-01T04:25:32", "owner": "xiao._925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050533573800343, "text": "嚐了 但不多", "created_at": "2024-07-30T01:57:28", "owner": "yancheng802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057662677654479, "text": "淺嚐", "created_at": "2024-07-30T01:40:00", "owner": "j_baku.0405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923888301927297, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-07-29T16:53:22", "owner": "zhongsheng39", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17975425943725439, "text": "這小男孩是川普的傳人吧 還蓋牆把螃蟹圈起來", "created_at": "2024-07-28T05:11:45", "owner": "dongyu0428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007784822622812, "text": "小男孩=VPN\n那螃蟹是…？", "created_at": "2024-07-27T11:55:32", "owner": "terryn30678", "likes": 101}, {"id": 18008180612564369, "text": "海的對面是……", "created_at": "2024-07-27T09:37:47", "owner": "chantszw", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17966214887639932, "text": "嚐了一點", "created_at": "2024-07-26T23:28:55", "owner": "hungjhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360894604096963, "text": "淺嚐", "created_at": "2024-07-25T05:53:52", "owner": "yos.ion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933974874885034, "text": "自由 但不多", "created_at": "2024-07-25T02:06:36", "owner": "paiannnnnnn", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18155039314315569, "text": "塔塔開", "created_at": "2024-07-25T01:51:41", "owner": "fujiwara_tungg", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18327998854176080, "text": "難怪穿紅衣服", "created_at": "2024-07-25T00:12:07", "owner": "wesley.fish", "likes": 83}, {"id": 18242687698257239, "text": "：我本可忍受小池塘，如果我從未嚐過自由", "created_at": "2024-07-24T19:12:58", "owner": "rangeo_xuan.winnie", "likes": 3100}, {"id": 18070644064536311, "text": "下個世紀的習近ㄆㄧㄥ嗎？", "created_at": "2024-07-24T17:45:34", "owner": "bear__princ