{"media_id": 3438650773033256492, "shortcode": "C-4iqjJRQYs", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-4iqjJRQYs/", "taken_at": "2024-08-20T07:38:01", "caption": "#1分鐘嘟嘟嘟\n阿京 你做到㗎！\n\n#MillMILK", "owner_username": "mm.millmilk", "owner_id": "49523160582", "likes": 22395, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0077_C-4iqjJRQYs\\C-4iqjJRQYs_20240820_073801.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18025799513219578, "text": "但係見到有人用第三人稱稱呼自己我會覺得好作狀好反感😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T15:39:38", "owner": "terry._.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939487935926994, "text": "@_charie__tang_ 解答左你😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T17:34:39", "owner": "que.yip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901159975064660, "text": "難怪上次醫生打針一直喊他自己名字，說他做得到", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:18:53", "owner": "kukulcansnake", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18256958641255233, "text": "阿京戒左煙未", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:53:07", "owner": "diinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889037803046998, "text": "我聽日去打俾隻腳 🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-06T06:52:21", "owner": "lyrically.poem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462375499047717, "text": "@bigfat.tsang", "created_at": "2024-10-16T00:04:48", "owner": "ooo.417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017300132321582, "text": "Terry like yogurt", "created_at": "2024-10-14T06:44:05", "owner": "mingdauncle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18256497022249524, "text": "日本人好多時都叫自己嘅名。開頭唔習慣，「下?邊個?」而家就知了", "created_at": "2024-09-28T23:31:43", "owner": "madaian_hellosss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279805495240722, "text": "@ccnok3.3 @garyhooo__ @oscar_heii @chunhoedwin  阿諾！做得好啊！", "created_at": "2024-09-28T10:56:55", "owner": "raysonlilili", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046462717795419, "text": "@abbyabababab", "created_at": "2024-09-20T15:54:11", "owner": "klif_lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960391779805876, "text": "@hahamanyu", "created_at": "2024-09-18T07:40:52", "owner": "curly_sai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051388507895208, "text": "馬島尼肚餓！\n馬島尼要食嘢！", "created_at": "2024-09-14T20:10:37", "owner": "keaso5919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468343297043833, "text": "我鍾意用「你」同自己講嘢😄", "created_at": "2024-09-14T07:48:14", "owner": "wongckar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021592901453206, "text": "@yeunghoming 難怪 Vivian 食左 600g 拉麵都仲係4成飽 🥰", "created_at": "2024-09-12T09:43:24", "owner": "wilsonhk0v0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320829601155072, "text": "vivian 今都食飽啦。 ❤️ 減肥有望 。❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-12T05:58:22", "owner": "catrabbitsky", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18010431938625493, "text": "細個到依家都會咁做 仲以為自己唔正常 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-11T19:22:49", "owner": "rubook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034723658147364, "text": "咁響親密關係入面，講唔到「你」字，有沒有相關theories?🤔 係咪都同anxious feelings有關？", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:46:07", "owner": "sun0cks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061837624712847, "text": "唔怪知肥貓都話：“肥貓做到㗎” 而唔係話“我做到㗎”", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:19:20", "owner": "genekay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18446614105001761, "text": "Kono Dio da!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-08T23:42:22", "owner": "chau_cho_ki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059586760663116, "text": "冠瑤做唔到呀", "created_at": "2024-09-08T21:30:36", "owner": "johnee_lau", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18009993068359498, "text": "做咗幾十年，唔覺有幫助😮", "created_at": "2024-09-08T02:00:58", "owner": "nub._.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18455164780015437, "text": "Pikachu Pika Pika Chu⚡️⚡️⚡️", "created_at": "2024-09-05T00:36:49", "owner": "dearmrtuit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872808646167952, "text": "感覺壓力仲大", "created_at": "2024-09-04T21:45:31", "owner": "s.w_411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889040158015994, "text": "如果你都想真係了解多啲社焦，就入黎我個page參加治療啦！！！", "created_at": "2024-09-04T02:25:23", "owner": "socialanxietyinternettherapyhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238834261276455, "text": "Mi…😂", "created_at": "2024-09-03T23:54:00", "owner": "_kurg0rrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015488729615423, "text": "有興趣想知道更多，想問具體知識來源係邊度？", "created_at": "2024-09-03T01:19:51", "owner": "tor11c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040445278873769, "text": "咁搞法會唔會變 解離 ⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-09-02T14:08:12", "owner": "4g.o_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069386488602273, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-02T10:57:59", "owner": "zoiefungt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939467763895381, "text": "寶寶生氣但寶寶不說", "created_at": "2024-09-02T08:14:43", "owner": "chiyukhuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024151364379008, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-09-01T13:41:43", "owner": "minisister_seoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105748900423568, "text": "@kktt_tsang 會嬲打", "created_at": "2024-09-01T04:44:33", "owner": "debbieclk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036819008125682, "text": "我啱啱考試 係咁同自己講「阿京做到㗎」\n點解都係咁緊張嘅？", "created_at": "2024-08-29T16:54:33", "owner": "jack.cty", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18074737489551754, "text": "gay", "created_at": "2024-08-27T00:32:36", "owner": "underscore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947011764836710, "text": "@l.hching__ 曉晴得架", "created_at": "2024-08-26T08:08:44", "owner": "shortmuii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852262378259459, "text": "電視兒童集體回憶：Vivian肚餓", "created_at": "2024-08-26T04:47:42", "owner": "sunnyonlinehk", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18119050264382890, "text": "好鍾意聽阿京講經！啱啱先自言自語安慰自己！", "created_at": "2024-08-23T13:52:15", "owner": "hahapp1216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976167492753242, "text": "Thx for share !", "created_at": "2024-08-23T08:25:17", "owner": "chinceciliacecilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021024638524451, "text": "😻😻😻😻", "created_at": "2024-08-22T14:44:10", "owner": "isdaisylol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054039937647145, "text": "😂😂😂yoyo thankyou阿京！", "created_at": "2024-08-22T06:49:16", "owner": "yowingau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980033238597986, "text": "美國有研究團隊 -》可摸耳quote番個source （有興趣了解想睇原文thanks :)", "created_at": "2024-08-22T02:20:10", "owner": "jacq_jacqhk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127206694365902, "text": "即係阿京有時做鳩自己😂", "created_at": "2024-08-22T01:15:06", "owner": "vong_chi_chong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120665293347901, "text": "Pika pika chu ~", "created_at": "2024-08-22T00:23:11", "owner": "adarn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18239066758279150, "text": "有監獄風雲既視感", "created_at": "2024-08-22T00:02:19", "owner": "iamfrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915930621882866, "text": "阿京 你做到㗎  戒煙 一定掂！", "created_at": "2024-08-21T18:45:00", "owner": "wmtsoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962361441794785, "text": "安妮亞想要呢個", "created_at": "2024-08-21T17:55:21", "owner": "melissa___cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982309686588841, "text": "on9", "created_at": "2024-08-21T16:10:59", "owner": "2ntpv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18233456209302604, "text": "Vivian 肚餓啦", "created_at": "2024-08-21T15:11:17", "owner": "le.e.man", "likes": 185}, {"id": 18450463033025527, "text": "Anya用緊呢招.所以咁勇敢💪🏻.", "created_at": "2024-08-21T11:19:05", "owner": "venus_udud", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17855862900243569, "text": "@neoyau19 第三人稱hater", "created_at": "2024-08-21T08:54:38", "owner": "official_sochiho", "likes": 210}, {"id": 17935345148880267, "text": "可能我獨女已經習慣自言自語😂", "created_at": "2024-08-21T06:59:32", "owner": "rubybbsos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890403556075893, "text": "但係我就係個第三人稱令到我社交焦慮🥲", "created_at": "2024-08-21T02:02:04", "owner": "myy_t7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050865376840723, "text": "@jamietyn work ga", "created_at": "2024-08-20T22:40:20", "owner": "r8chhelqaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935313297866591, "text": "三隻熊熊入面嗰隻白熊", "created_at": "2024-08-20T18:56:51", "owner": "ydd.panda517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021649880149544, "text": "令我諗起阿扁😂", "created_at": "2024-08-20T17:31:36", "owner": "jimbookdragon", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18017721014395959, "text": "人格分裂第一步", "created_at": "2024-08-20T16:48:19", "owner": "yunsitang", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18067777909586640, "text": "阿京真係好charm架❤️", "created_at": "2024-08-20T14:55:35", "owner": "iamjeffffffff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984074358566371, "text": "阿京 你做到啦", "created_at": "2024-08-20T14:52:36", "owner": "samwalker505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044279974768145, "text": "阿京 你戒到煙架（準備被打", "created_at": "2024-08-20T12:48:39", "owner": "samuelchan.3000", "likes": 72}, {"id": 18038701187301050, "text": "呀京塊面黃黃地？", "created_at": "2024-08-20T12:08:10", "owner": "leungsandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033534152327478, "text": "有", "created_at": "2024-08-20T11:19:31", "owner": "chancheuktung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014578421614327, "text": "焦慮遷移到人格分裂🤟🏻", "created_at": "2024-08-20T10:50:01", "owner": "ming2k9", "likes": 79}, {"id": 18453834985000799, "text": "北京:「阿京. 你做到架! 唔信問下東京~」\n東京:「阿京. 你做到架! 唔信問下南京~」\n南京:「阿京. 你做到架! 唔信問返北京~」\n阿京:「多謝師兄! 小弟受寵若京~」", "created_at": "2024-08-20T10:11:49", "owner": "sunsetcafe", "likes": 478}, {"id": 18038463554081661, "text": "「阿京，多啲休息啊！」", "created_at": "2024-08-20T09:43:35", "owner": "ying_0705", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17935375505870998, "text": "點先算焦慮🤨🧐", "created_at": "2024-08-20T09:11:04", "owner": "rc_ig2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880742278051653, "text": "所以 解決焦慮嘅方法就係 塞個旁白入自己個腦度", "created_at": "2024-08-20T09:10:06", "owner": "veloharto", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18007826114345553, "text": "「阿京 你做到架」將會係2024下半年嘅meme", "created_at": "2024-08-20T09:06:15", "owner": "garrialism", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17983127939577083, "text": "安妮亞喜歡這個", "created_at": "2024-08-20T08:46:41", "owner": "dolphin___ip", "likes": 818}, {"id": 17952381494821615, "text": "阿京 你做到架", "created_at": "2024-08-20T08:29:40", "owner": "mok0519", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035317765906082, "text": "Vivian 食好少嘢", "created_at": "2024-08-20T08:25:57", "owner": "unc7e_", "likes": 67}, {"id": 18051704941817747, "text": "Vivian有少少肚餓", "created_at": "2024-08-20T08:25:29", "owner": "joyfun", "likes": 2679}, {"id": 18317277736158808, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-08-20T08:18:23", "owner": "royho7142000", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18239251111275415, "text": "距離白卡再近一步", "created_at": "2024-08-20T07:46:06", "owner": "anitkl", "likes": 662}, {"id": 18024770084104960, "text": "阿京 好眼瞓💤", "created_at": "2024-08-20T07:40:44", "owner": "lamnok_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18074276263496408, "text": "似智障", "created_at": "2024-09-17T18:31:19", "owner": "imnobody.youtube", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934029303906815, "text": "因為你已經有精神病", "created_at": "2024-08-22T16:14:24", "owner": "konchim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028974176210344, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-21T13:04:20", "owner": "yukiiiiiiii030", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18055657915748541, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-21T03:03:15", "owner": "clearly_mymind", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18020161289421713, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-20T10:21:47", "owner": "k_ccy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900102799024861, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-20T08:34:06", "owner": "sai_12meow.slave", "likes": 9}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["1分鐘嘟嘟嘟", "millmilk"]},
{"media_id": 3451892780387534692, "shortcode": "C_nljHhvAdk", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_nljHhvAdk/", "taken_at": "2024-09-07T14:02:17", "caption": "#20秒生活英文 fake🕵️‍♂️ + Instagram 📸 = finsta 小帳\n\n👑 英文解釋：\n“Finsta” is a term for a secondary, often private Instagram account used to share more personal or less curated content.\n\n👑 例句：\n👉🏽 I only post my real life on my finsta, not on my main account.\n我只會把我真實的生活發在我的小帳上面\n不會發在大帳上😌😌\n.\n.\n.\n都學會了嗎？❤️\n追蹤學更多 @mandy.english_\n.\n.\n.\n#曼蒂英文#看電影練口說#英文會話#生活英文#英文口說#英文語錄#英文單字#英文筆記#英文學習#英文補習#學英文#英文課#英文書#英文檢定#英文考試#多益#多益單字#多益準備 #多益測驗 #多益考試 #多益英文#英文聊天#外商面試#生活英文#面試#面試外商#商用英文#進階英文#smalltalk", "owner_username": "mandy.english_", "owner_id": "575628591", "likes": 22240, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0078_C_nljHhvAdk\\C_nljHhvAdk_20240907_140217.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18346379788181346, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-09T22:19:46", "owner": "haoliou1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467624233031495, "text": "I somehow hear \"spam account\" more than findta from native speakers", "created_at": "2024-11-13T05:49:07", "owner": "shimmemes_2_much", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047240231011571, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:50:21", "owner": "kwokandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258132214271898, "text": "哇！好實用！follow了", "created_at": "2024-10-30T11:41:37", "owner": "ethereal_060828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060832810739919, "text": "直接說  small acc也可以", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:13:45", "owner": "austin12.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045029152974642, "text": "What about spam", "created_at": "2024-10-12T05:34:28", "owner": "zhs4real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029333837104949, "text": "不合理啊 大帳po的才是假的🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-07T09:10:22", "owner": "jojochen0727", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041953034040867, "text": "這濾鏡下好像游彤葳", "created_at": "2024-09-26T07:00:12", "owner": "qasimartajikzada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023079407585084, "text": "@nickpan129  我們有gangstar 🤑🤑🤑🤑🔥🔥🔥🔥W", "created_at": "2024-09-21T02:46:42", "owner": "c.b_9966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936707298912344, "text": "spam acc?", "created_at": "2024-09-19T11:24:10", "owner": "brianhsuu_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17980982027733086, "text": "Burner account???", "created_at": "2024-09-16T20:36:24", "owner": "lo_ho_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036301516962101, "text": "這個好實用！", "created_at": "2024-09-15T19:02:17", "owner": "_ki00ki_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054340909667616, "text": "好像….\n跟一個人好像都是美女～\n（1g)老師", "created_at": "2024-09-13T00:49:12", "owner": "tammydad_0112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086245870494673, "text": "Alt能算小號的意思嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-11T09:48:19", "owner": "mralpha0204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882126301052745, "text": "最近學到字根的知識 再看這個好像都懂了🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-09T08:16:58", "owner": "kgw____1030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952671192718316, "text": "學費了🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-08T13:03:37", "owner": "jhewei.yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033951331979855, "text": "小帳finsta 我學會了\n謝謝Mandy 🩶", "created_at": "2024-09-08T07:53:38", "owner": "imeffie.1225", "likes": 201}, {"id": 17974641233717239, "text": "我都用我的main account 😢 老師今天好鄰家喔！", "created_at": "2024-09-08T03:05:13", "owner": "troychen0306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036903658919586, "text": "Beauty", "created_at": "2024-09-07T22:15:19", "owner": "kingocean2026ultra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098644744443854, "text": "去銀行開戶會開小帳嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-07T18:46:37", "owner": "52big__gg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026914925353585, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-07T15:25:11", "owner": "willson7444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873776539160345, "text": "原來可以這樣用 finsta 😂🔥🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-07T14:42:56", "owner": "brad_lin_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18246744943258303, "text": "那我超real 我有10個Rinsta😍", "created_at": "2024-09-07T14:40:47", "owner": "christinelol_", "likes": 64}, {"id": 17913872261898681, "text": "這也是字典上查得到的嗎😮", "created_at": "2024-09-07T14:18:09", "owner": "xingkai_429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875145775151385, "text": "