{"media_id": 3399608510056225326, "shortcode": "C8t1e2RS9ou", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C8t1e2RS9ou/", "taken_at": "2024-06-27T10:42:39", "caption": "原來一萬蚊嘅鞋係咁樣", "owner_username": "kenny__li_6653", "owner_id": "5470355939", "likes": 17232, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0081_C8t1e2RS9ou\\C8t1e2RS9ou_20240627_104239.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17881037961330156, "text": "長短腳", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:37:21", "owner": "jasonrockylee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952414588030766, "text": "啲錢拎左去買鞋 唯有p圖扮捐錢扮好心？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:15:51", "owner": "ttttttttttttttt.tttttttttttt_t", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18046185848142989, "text": "你係咪好矮 ？", "created_at": "2024-12-24T05:25:38", "owner": "michaellee0001", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18016353569418697, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-11T15:28:48", "owner": "yvonnekok8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210428605290379, "text": "呢對鞋1萬? 100都唔值", "created_at": "2024-12-09T19:15:28", "owner": "alexht_fan", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17988044969756786, "text": "咁柒嘅鞋都要洗成皮嘢買", "created_at": "2024-12-08T11:14:55", "owner": "mty_samu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18322578328095873, "text": "你又會肯買🫡", "created_at": "2024-12-07T13:13:10", "owner": "6lctc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888579340131378, "text": "個底咁高行路好易仆,個底咁重鞋面好易爛！", "created_at": "2024-11-28T19:58:14", "owner": "boyking3411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064056469691833, "text": "@balenciaga_0807", "created_at": "2024-11-26T14:21:52", "owner": "kawa6109_0216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114092032423065, "text": "肉鸠酸", "created_at": "2024-11-25T16:03:09", "owner": "json_____0110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855386137319599, "text": "賣比你一萬，入貨100", "created_at": "2024-11-24T14:41:19", "owner": "t992005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150492619338379, "text": "邊個話呢對鞋壽命多過一星期㗎⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:30:50", "owner": "charlotte.chalala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976843851644435, "text": "買淘寶就咪扮啦", "created_at": "2024-11-21T13:39:00", "owner": "wt.130617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873973195211972, "text": "D指甲想點", "created_at": "2024-11-20T14:42:22", "owner": "thecrazy_ferret", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995629824554955, "text": "有 一萬蚊 我都換手機了", "created_at": "2024-11-16T16:21:27", "owner": "boscoyeungyeung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054589648929501, "text": "呢對野 要 1萬？", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:41:46", "owner": "__sheena__0216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865507228253704, "text": "。。。。。", "created_at": "2024-11-13T00:55:49", "owner": "rainbow____852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022374944271448, "text": "Balenciaga ?", "created_at": "2024-11-08T02:09:52", "owner": "maui_ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065259694661459, "text": "七頭先買🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-06T14:14:39", "owner": "chlau.hin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034788647254578, "text": "潮共😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T05:19:50", "owner": "mr__________________king2957", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046661306094159, "text": "長短腳😂？", "created_at": "2024-11-02T17:40:31", "owner": "tonycheng0706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028874000156718, "text": "對鞋好潮呀，著左夠唔夠米七？", "created_at": "2024-11-02T08:42:17", "owner": "kahoucarl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038861420231461, "text": "送俾我都唔要😂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T16:48:07", "owner": "chaumiyaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18447929296067538, "text": "呢啲濕9膠鞋我淘佬買十尻幾對都有排玩啦 使成皮野仲要玩唔夠三個月", "created_at": "2024-10-29T00:59:21", "owner": "swt000222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093812128433576, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T03:18:27", "owner": "chris_au_wy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853002646240804, "text": "777", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:08:27", "owner": "rachel_wong0000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057781348679830, "text": "On9又唔洗周圍話人知既，btw師兄你有無160？", "created_at": "2024-08-25T11:34:26", "owner": "footballteam0301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039813860048457, "text": "@kui.67901", "created_at": "2024-08-24T14:24:52", "owner": "pooh0366", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045410482740127, "text": "究竟有幾矮先至着呢對鞋？", "created_at": "2024-08-09T00:16:36", "owner": "cwc.1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921371574843236, "text": "對鞋是用來打人而吾係拿來著出街架羅😂😂😂😂，有賊打劫時用來反擊架，萬幾元用来保命保銀包，值得的！😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-01T18:34:03", "owner": "feiyinglin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115106425380159, "text": "Balenciaga is pure viral marketing not true handcrafted thoughtful design, if you buy Balenciaga like this is like Rick Owens you buy those not for thoughtful comfy longterm use, it is like a meme and a viral video the longevity of the product is like that adhd lifetime of those you should buy them not forget to habe in mind to use it like that viral identity of that product, use it to prove a point in a moment and get the most in a targeted moment but never thinking to get a everyday usage of it", "created_at": "2024-07-31T00:46:03", "owner": "kclinussmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049765006839750, "text": "越貴嘅鞋….越唔可以成日着……你日日着梗係啦…..", "created_at": "2024-07-30T14:32:46", "owner": "masiongwch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996979137647825, "text": "Balenciaga is crap!  Never buy them!  Waste of money!", "created_at": "2024-07-23T23:44:32", "owner": "tommyl4620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041027530780152, "text": "智商稅99%，實際價格1%😂😂", "created_at": "2024-07-22T02:43:55", "owner": "stephanie_leung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005110454616918, "text": "成萬蚊你都買 冇人夠你威🥱🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-17T00:10:15", "owner": "kerry_606", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347910733112057, "text": "Send email去佢公司度 起，超", "created_at": "2024-07-16T17:39:32", "owner": "6666kuen66664", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943677501736605, "text": "浪费", "created_at": "2024-07-15T14:51:54", "owner": "kwokyingwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888002659064185, "text": "奢侈品系咁，襟睇唔襟著，唔系咩叫奢侈品，btw對鞋型👍🏼", "created_at": "2024-07-15T07:28:53", "owner": "mr.rabbitttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978941463705951, "text": "朱西", "created_at": "2024-07-15T07:11:45", "owner": "gniwnohma1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031963334503167, "text": "乞丐鞋， what to expect ?", "created_at": "2024-07-14T10:16:38", "owner": "lowhanlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007288283326971, "text": "一萬蚊買對膠鞋返嚟？😮", "created_at": "2024-07-14T02:20:12", "owner": "linuo1228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015176438409223, "text": "究竟幾矮先要買呢啲鞋", "created_at": "2024-07-13T14:44:35", "owner": "jeast_l69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027137585473709, "text": "巴黎契媽😂", "created_at": "2024-07-13T04:27:50", "owner": "tracy_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004558868618546, "text": "見你地鐵著住坐係我隔離😂", "created_at": "2024-07-12T20:54:17", "owner": "darrenhk0911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105694903405394, "text": "買對cross都好過你呢對9鞋呀", "created_at": "2024-07-12T07:00:45", "owner": "quintus_525", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020247593346910, "text": "這對我也有但非常容易跌倒，現在都穿10xl🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-11T22:20:51", "owner": "lichtasia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048424405789562, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-07-11T11:30:37", "owner": "bsw251264", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046057309835343, "text": "對鞋好核突", "created_at": "2024-07-10T23:24:00", "owner": "mandylee7618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023727188216993, "text": "早知道買對A品都比這個好啦", "created_at": "2024-07-10T18:42:46", "owner": "derekdong6829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034599920064792, "text": "你對鞋蘇聯製作㗎?", "created_at": "2024-07-09T06:33:15", "owner": "mwy._.rice._.1026__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967823862716595, "text": "有$", "created_at": "2024-07-08T15:17:19", "owner": "heiyeonn.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028585157136648, "text": "😆😆😆", "created_at": "2024-07-08T14:47:46", "owner": "uncle_alan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965733129771117, "text": "这是一体成型工艺", "created_at": "2024-07-08T12:18:43", "owner": "sunac503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027040070000878, "text": "底还能再厚一点嘛😂", "created_at": "2024-07-08T10:23:23", "owner": "frankei2323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136033783337410, "text": "其實成萬蚊買對濕9膠鞋 有錢都唔係咁洗la😂", "created_at": "2024-07-08T04:07:05", "owner": "190.leung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058474219616745, "text": "超，一萬，食唔到三個月啦，三個月低著啦！", "created_at": "2024-07-08T01:25:43", "owner": "sp_trading", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043074388737186, "text": "1萬蚊一對咁醜嘅鞋😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-07-07T16:58:14", "owner": "sofatsober", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981869622557102, "text": "智商稅", "created_at": "2024-07-07T15:51:11", "owner": "ai3ray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063420907524216, "text": "買個吓已經on9", "created_at": "2024-07-07T15:37:11", "owner": "chu0102x.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020645843102384, "text": "要靚 定要實用 自己揀😂", "created_at": "2024-07-07T11:17:53", "owner": "surfing.otter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894818562961638, "text": "台幣😂？", "created_at": "2024-07-07T09:56:51", "owner": "daily_sze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029434703126330, "text": "智商稅", "created_at": "2024-07-07T05:12:44", "owner": "tivansh0934", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18011008706274471, "text": "这个质量😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-07-07T04:17:26", "owner": "michelledrycleaner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149502820319074, "text": "人地預你買尼著一次 你著左3個月賺左啦", "created_at": "2024-07-07T03:03:32", "owner": "ray__oasis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072896386518585, "text": "條片出黎既目的係博比人插呀？😂", "created_at": "2024-07-06T19:35:48", "owner": "bdo0404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013246688396255, "text": "@hudixjs", "created_at": "2024-07-06T18:03:14", "owner": "ziiiqingggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004195832355619, "text": "買已經係on9，撚咗買過對啦，唔爭在on9多次😂", "created_at": "2024-07-06T09:00:38", "owner": "barslo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18009947501570706, "text": "一萬蚊嘅鞋 冇預你著 當藝術品算😂 一著就出事", "created_at": "2024-07-06T05:49:08", "owner": "dt.funshot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015300155433456, "text": "對鞋好核突", "created_at": "2024-07-06T05:26:19", "owner": "a_e_t_u_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939107418846529, "text": "貴一定係好嘅", "created_at": "2024-07-04T18:13:39", "owner": "go_want_come", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964906407767669, "text": "買vetements 好過啦 😌 點會買balenciaga 😆", "created_at": "2024-07-04T16:11:22", "owner": "10x16_kim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026651033228631, "text": "唔好唔開心啦\n樂觀啲諗，其實你都係冇咗\n五千蚊啫！", "created_at": "2024-07-04T10:40:43", "owner": "leon_w819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039423358769964, "text": "你個post應該真接Tag埋Balen, \n咁大家先可以幫你推到官方見到😗", "created_at": "2024-07-04T08:15:54", "owner": "eleven_archer_cosplay", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18044541013881538, "text": "Gucci or Hermès is much better", "created_at": "2024-07-04T08:15:46", "owner": "mr.ha1ry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18415593931069695, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-07-04T05:39:20", "owner": "k.hinn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978500370582050, "text": "環保自然分解鞋", "created_at": "2024-07-04T00:18:58", "owner": "pong17_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120681910371444, "text": "on10", "created_at": "2024-07-04T00:04:46", "owner": "michaelkwan888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258683413217812, "text": "成皮野無了😂😂", "created_at": "2024-07-03T18:12:02", "owner": "sadraccoon.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013341080223033, "text": "智商稅", "created_at": "2024-07-03T16:55:51", "owner": "cm.c_gor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982397943697692, "text": "😂😂😂俾個機會你買過對新嘅", "created_at": "2024-07-03T16:41:25", "owner": "miffychan2016", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17950536851696930, "text": "啱數啦", "created_at": "2024-07-03T15:40:57", "owner": "samsamsamsamun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042863137883215, "text": "咁肉酸 咁貴 送都唔要 仲著出街 失禮我 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-07-03T15:31:01", "owner": "yanyan3793", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055368775631834, "text": "買過啦，好平姐", "created_at": "2024-07-03T15:04:49", "owner": "amay7651", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902781642917429, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2024-07-03T14:24:58", "owner": "ahhbgorgor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039875503768156, "text": "人哋預你著一兩次，名牌fashion 野係咁", "created_at": "2024-07-03T09:37:01", "owner": "chris19lala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338271577142377, "text": "好肉酸", "created_at": "2024-07-03T03:58:08", "owner": "roxanne_venus.husky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881113402069388, "text": "1萬蚊 涼鞋😂", "created_at": "2024-07-03T02:09:52", "owner": "yiny2j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028187429172909, "text": "完全唔明呢d膠鞋點解會值咁貴！又肉酸！", "created_at": "2024-07-03T01:53:01", "owner": "wstwst000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083833171474760, "text": "智商稅", "created_at": "2024-07-02T23:40:28", "owner": "hkthinkcreative", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048144373776717, "text": "等我話俾你聽咩叫巴黎世家😂", "created_at": "2024-07-02T22:32:30", "owner": "zhle3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062238049608241, "text": "鞋底重就預計了這情況。😂", "created_at": "2024-07-02T17:30:27", "owner": "kwonglaifan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980435733563765, "text": "呢對就係同支付寶合作的系列？", "created_at": "2024-07-02T15:08:40", "owner": "han_hally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026037278237109, "text": "一萬yen", "created_at": "2024-07-02T15:04:23", "owner": "nicolacruz001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032103857083948, "text": "呢啲叫做藝術😂", "created_at": "2024-07-02T14:38:05", "owner": "penguin_kyleqwq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18240835891267825, "text": "要睇咩人著 咩重量 每個人都唔到既🤡", "created_at": "2024-07-02T12:05:06", "owner": "00siuc_1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056790394563980, "text": "我只係覺得車呔靚😅", "created_at": "2024-07-02T10:55:24", "owner": "ky390613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062204800595776, "text": "鞋底重到咁，唔爛就奇", "created_at": "2024-07-02T10:41:45", "owner": "daagzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888797620056868, "text": "淘寶幾百。賣過香港全部上万", "created_at": "2024-07-02T10:20:34", "owner": "dt.lzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095836888428771, "text": "乜你地覺得一對膠鞋真係值一萬蚊咩😏", "created_at": "2024-07-02T10:03:03", "owner": "kashing420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049435417698234, "text": "邊個同你講貴嘢唔會爛？", "created_at": "2024-07-02T09:51:40", "owner": "masiongwch", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3387276261927397360, "shortcode": "C8CBdBMS6fw", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C8CBdBMS6fw/", "taken_at": "2024-06-10T10:23:21", "caption": "害我也一起邊看邊尖叫😍\n\n#縮毛矯正", "owner_username": "abaya_artroom14", "owner_id": "53839392332", "likes": 82800, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0082_C8CBdBMS6fw\\C8CBdBMS6fw_20240610_102321.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17931184430776538, "text": "：He’s gay\n啊啊啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2024-06-11T14:36:30", "owner": "___dylansocute____", "likes": 6962}, {"id": 18173242843311568, "text": "So true hahaha😂❤️❤️🔥🔥🔥🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-07T08:32:28", "owner": "ritaknow1210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286738996241812, "text": "其他都還好啦，但沒有工作真的啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2024-12-06T10:40:49", "owner": "zz_z9612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049581608313639, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-17T03:43:15", "owner": "rosaa0326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076527196603519, "text": "雙標女在留言區說男生破防\n就一杯☕️的事實是要破防什麼\n大多是雙標女看到☕️留言後才再破防留言吧", "created_at": "2024-11-15T16:32:33", "owner": "hjk__0825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047061824014490, "text": "@_yangpei", "created_at": "2024-11-09T06:44:16", "owner": "1217__f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046425257062448, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:13:38", "owner": "jingyi_sings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462284161062366, "text": "有人也是皺著眉頭看完嗎🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-03T01:56:48", "owner": "watermelon_min1006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949239921844296, "text": "he rapwwwwww", "created_at": "2024-09-25T10:25:40", "owner": "miao515mimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065006482567341, "text": "@hujingwaei @linzehq 我每天", "created_at": "2024-09-24T01:45:00", "owner": "ffffffff40b4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027978533342692, "text": "@asky81205 笑死", "created_at": "2024-09-22T16:26:28", "owner": "qqbae9019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888872161096061, "text": "😂😂🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-20T10:13:30", "owner": "tew_8.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899537191051869, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-20T02:24:04", "owner": "tnt_jum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959552037807664, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T20:45:13", "owner": "sunny_____uang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059364658670975, "text": "@pei3_c 我想跟你一起叫😂❤️🫶🏻", "created_at": "2024-09-19T17:51:46", "owner": "sumin_971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282523117239801, "text": "His parent are still alive", "created_at": "2024-09-19T14:49:07", "owner": "cosette_vtuber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014883884558524, "text": "三小", "created_at": "2024-09-19T13:24:30", "owner": "xiangg818_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085800352497922, "text": "不是啊，這個認證過得，只是搞笑，真的不是咖啡啦！", "created_at": "2024-09-19T13:01:45", "owner": "kiwi._.hsiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028182455080959, "text": "啊～～～～", "created_at": "2024-09-19T03:05:02", "owner": "_vina.beauty__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999492042663201, "text": "@yeeeeeeeee15_ 160", "created_at": "2024-09-18T18:17:43", "owner": "iwantyoucrycry4me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891711607084713, "text": "前三個我還可以，後面是真不行😢❌❌❌❌", "created_at": "2024-09-18T13:56:24", "owner": "bingxing2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040505720019500, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T13:37:57", "owner": "cryflower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037409483130015, "text": "@ning.0814 超好笑", "created_at": "2024-09-16T12:56:41", "owner": "_c0n1e_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006541976639773, "text": "看不懂", "created_at": "2024-09-15T14:30:08", "owner": "_04__15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027288551101814, "text": "Wait...?what!", "created_at": "2024-09-15T13:42:25", "owner": "bjbangjim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007472651424912, "text": "搞说唱真的不行。我会直接开门走掉", "created_at": "2024-09-15T04:00:37", "owner": "wnnx_wnnx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089413447490495, "text": "身材都很好", "created_at": "2024-09-14T08:19:11", "owner": "dolicedelicate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999039693662678, "text": "@1lingg._", "created_at": "2024-09-13T10:49:13", "owner": "ynn7ing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881831938122419, "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2024-09-13T07:41:46", "owner": "7unzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005066888460690, "text": "@natty.wong he’s under 5’4😭", "created_at": "2024-09-12T12:43:42", "owner": "athenahuii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118958896391732, "text": "@inez_liao  哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-09-11T08:43:34", "owner": "yunjjss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016760315299882, "text": "He ED 啊啊啊啊啊aaaaaaaahhhh", "created_at": "2024-09-11T05:59:30", "owner": "jenn_6v6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957565920812021, "text": "不太懂求解 為什麼看啦啦隊不行？", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:27:58", "owner": "cheongikun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900104013964483, "text": "What?160?😮必须尖叫，好美丽的精神状态", "created_at": "2024-09-10T08:21:45", "owner": "needtosleepnah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063303649712002, "text": "拿聖水潑他聲音居然對上了超好笑 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-09T08:55:04", "owner": "rico_crocodiles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044221996948232, "text": "hahahahahga", "created_at": "2024-09-08T13:46:05", "owner": "tr808.wk7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040287896083104, "text": "虽然不懂在干什么\n但是：啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2024-09-08T03:26:27", "owner": "wiener_wang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899592138963922, "text": "欸不是，我是女生，但我覺得今天這影片性別調換會出大事耶🤔很多人說開點小玩笑男生也要生氣，但⋯我看過很多其他開女生小玩笑，而且比這個還要不嚴重的，女生都在留言區罵比這裡兇幾百倍耶😕", "created_at": "2024-09-07T15:30:27", "owner": "mumu_sssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045249562790069, "text": "它是个母人😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-09-06T13:32:01", "owner": "noisywara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885286321039504, "text": "@before_daybreak_y @lillynej", "created_at": "2024-09-06T05:08:20", "owner": "_shingi_banggi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842231302311068, "text": "茶壶嘴闭嘴哈 无人问你💀💀", "created_at": "2024-09-05T14:42:46", "owner": "syuri_yuri", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17988359609701671, "text": "一堆採棉花的是怎麼樣????", "created_at": "2024-09-05T00:45:13", "owner": "wu_wu5566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960052278797183, "text": "rap那个笑晕", "created_at": "2024-09-04T07:44:56", "owner": "jin_xuaner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280602577225830, "text": "沒工作這個一定必須叫", "created_at": "2024-09-04T05:40:44", "owner": "celia08.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046924309904613, "text": "@xklbdx", "created_at": "2024-09-03T10:41:56", "owner": "vivienz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916952250884661, "text": "留言區的女生說只是玩笑男生太容易破防\n我理解 但是想着情況調換．．．我相信留言區情況會更加慘烈", "created_at": "2024-08-31T20:00:49", "owner": "mrboscoblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110202928410073, "text": "但是每個身材都好好耶😻是那種健康美", "created_at": "2024-08-31T16:25:09", "owner": "tji127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038974151033530, "text": "@xsynzh_28 根本我跟你吧", "created_at": "2024-08-30T13:58:22", "owner": "liuu.177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043987462811371, "text": "超好笑啊哈哈哈哈哈哈尤其是用聖水潑他的部分🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-30T11:27:55", "owner": "shao_jyun_shih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908564397916007, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-30T05:04:41", "owner": "yuer_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039948736868997, "text": "這只是某部分的誇張放大話\n不要對號入座的太認真\n然後雙方戰起來甚至人身攻擊\n人際中各自不同圈子有對於人事物的標準\n私底下的調侃只是跟有過經歷的人小聊或者聽故事而已\n真的很愛對方未必會從朋友口中講出的標準就來決定對方是否合格，會附和但未必會動搖\n也不用怕自己有符合影片中的這些特點可能被受影響\n我們該做的是不傷害人還能做自己之餘去愛別人", "created_at": "2024-08-29T19:14:10", "owner": "wei.wei.127", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069051319579290, "text": "@_hcl617_", "created_at": "2024-08-28T18:07:42", "owner": "chiihtim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018956963410508, "text": "@ailicunyang8", "created_at": "2024-08-28T15:52:44", "owner": "2on1nabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034109005965676, "text": "合適交往對象只剩耶穌了吧", "created_at": "2024-08-28T15:32:20", "owner": "hsun.1123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057885913710711, "text": "He raps 超好笑\n而且小編是不是自己把girls換成啦啦隊哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-08-28T06:24:04", "owner": "bahn._", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18091077442463660, "text": "Is that your real hair?", "created_at": "2024-08-27T23:08:05", "owner": "biubiu._.er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196664398290804, "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2024-08-27T16:39:39", "owner": "0905_mtc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853133473222559, "text": "She n", "created_at": "2024-08-27T15:52:07", "owner": "c_21800000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945740136744409, "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊～～～～～", "created_at": "2024-08-27T04:48:30", "owner": "shadow.______o_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046201477906272, "text": "他喜歡發☕ 阿阿阿", "created_at": "2024-08-26T03:48:33", "owner": "im_joanna1122", "likes": 191}, {"id": 18028632971203936, "text": "Is the third girl didnt wear shirt", "created_at": "2024-08-25T13:52:13", "owner": "jaahy.0425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050219614874179, "text": "He doesn't* If you can't even speak proper English while from an English speaking country, please don't judge anyone.", "created_at": "2024-08-24T04:58:08", "owner": "artnow.ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920864292952830, "text": "某些人又🏚️啦😂", "created_at": "2024-08-23T14:33:33", "owner": "7li_chi", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17858065701183477, "text": "第四個中肯！真的不行✋", "created_at": "2024-08-23T07:02:35", "owner": "kawanashi11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18455882488005457, "text": "饒舌怎麼了嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-08-23T04:52:25", "owner": "1ifok", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18250668706270978, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-21T17:19:10", "owner": "xiang_2007aoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122643106344169, "text": "拿聖水哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-08-21T15:01:14", "owner": "ic_qwq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987174270547838, "text": "什麼意思啦😂 看不懂梗啦", "created_at": "2024-08-21T13:05:19", "owner": "eric_siao0968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979264116725344, "text": "他愛我\n啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊 @zhen2985", "created_at": "2024-08-21T08:26:44", "owner": "chen.859", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033054566328053, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-08-20T17:43:04", "owner": "_iamyuting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890622307000012, "text": "🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2024-08-20T12:47:05", "owner": "_itsbettie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176200726305439, "text": "@zoe.bb___ @ppuururu 好像你們", "created_at": "2024-08-17T13:39:25", "owner": "08veryunhappy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003332783446148, "text": "拿聖水潑他我快笑死", "created_at": "2024-08-17T12:15:41", "owner": "fuckoffmylife._.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032924240127413, "text": "@lunzeiii 啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2024-08-16T15:28:19", "owner": "_mazzyapple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040940617952960, "text": "不会英文干嘛乱翻", "created_at": "2024-08-10T13:28:41", "owner": "guoyanzong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090187753422832, "text": "虽然但是看了一圈下来，发现她们身材都超好、、", "created_at": "2024-08-04T18:23:47", "owner": "krozyovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410741779073762, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-08-04T14:48:32", "owner": "asyourwishmydear_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005113295381148, "text": "？？？", "created_at": "2024-07-29T13:24:12", "owner": "newstart392", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852922987200376, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-07-27T09:42:16", "owner": "zch1nggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916401954957241, "text": "@loveme_lilian  @newsnewschung", "created_at": "2024-07-27T06:08:50", "owner": "k.c_491313meaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070297702542870, "text": "這些理由 我也要加入叫的行列😂", "created_at": "2024-07-25T05:30:05", "owner": "g38882000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004850495344641, "text": "平常不是都說歐美女生好 現在人家拍了你不喜歡的影片又開始說人家咖啡了笑死 某些男人比女人雙標多了", "created_at": "2024-07-23T21:43:58", "owner": "shadderryu", "likes": 1096}, {"id": 17933997572889850, "text": "@maxxeoga24 啊啊啊", "created_at": "2024-07-23T20:24:39", "owner": "eating_irene", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049970332769890, "text": "我只覺得大家的屁屁有點讚", "created_at": "2024-07-17T03:07:02", "owner": "a7681673", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296103385167762, "text": "開點小玩笑就破防的男寶：😭☕️", "created_at": "2024-07-08T17:59:36", "owner": "great_explosion_god_dynamight_", "likes": 4066}, {"id": 18034794938057253, "text": "lol😂", "created_at": "2024-07-03T15:55:09", "owner": "geckosmess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929130828883192, "text": "這個翻譯不太準確😂", "created_at": "2024-07-01T17:42:55", "owner": "luvllling", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18050524012752267, "text": "@a00miq @shaa.ro_d", "created_at": "2024-06-29T13:45:46", "owner": "infj.t__92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265511110245777, "text": "在座崩潰的都被講中ㄌ😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-06-27T03:34:41", "owner": "jinneso", "likes": 398}, {"id": 17986989374690063, "text": "Saweetie是不是給我偷混在裡面", "created_at": "2024-06-26T23:39:08", "owner": "3milyeh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092641648394137, "text": "靠北，這不就是我的ex嗎？", "created_at": "2024-06-25T14:12:15", "owner": "yoloalicewu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109611496385047, "text": "@kenluxben 😏", "created_at": "2024-06-24T23:27:54", "owner": "chiangmingray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862987753160175, "text": "電梯：等一下我是無辜的", "created_at": "2024-06-23T14:10:57", "owner": "blue_pt118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928252923896608, "text": "pp發生了什麼", "created_at": "2024-06-21T04:38:14", "owner": "luffy_930315", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17907664595974741, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-06-20T17:40:00", "owner": "_2024322_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057028207623309, "text": "💅 ahhhhhhhhhhhh~~~", "created_at": "2024-06-20T17:14:34", "owner": "_an.hing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109785490383661, "text": "原創是誰呀", "created_at": "2024-06-20T08:00:39", "owner": "xz._you", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995979549633863, "text": "看不懂是高興還是難過", "created_at": "2024-06-20T05:53:10", "owner": "lamzxg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024049433274034, "text": "我感覺前幾項還可以🤣\n從啦啦隊開始不行🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2024-06-20T04:59:35", "owner": "virus_luo", "likes": 145}, {"id": 17881901055016099, "text": "@chun___chen", "created_at": "2024-06-20T04:34:03", "owner": "coco__0.0", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["縮毛矯正"]},
{"media_id": 3433649656607339657, "shortcode": "C-mxiuhOPSJ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-mxiuhOPSJ/", "taken_at": "2024-08-13T09:57:19", "caption": "再皮阿\n\n烏魚子界的愛馬仕\n魚香涎琥珀烏金月餅系列\nhttps://reurl.cc/QE9mx2", "owner_username": "jamesiscurlytoo", "owner_id": "50694566305", "likes": 87506, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0083_C-mxiuhOPSJ\\C-mxiuhOPSJ_20240813_095719.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18072634603556385, "text": "他是說vaped喔（不是faked", "created_at": "2024-08-13T15:03:09", "owner": "lavyip", "likes": 2479}, {"id": 18271815493221319, "text": "@cph0511_ @01001abc809", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:10:53", "owner": "chicken_wing_0600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898098130079402, "text": "不好意思打篇了😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T12:09:35", "owner": "yoohan_bae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060382519801990, "text": "打臉來的太快就像龍捲風（喔沒", "created_at": "2024-10-28T12:02:15", "owner": "latte._.1027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301216804200730, "text": "這說明 下雨時不要亂發誓 宙斯會生氣", "created_at": "2024-10-25T23:01:32", "owner": "zixiang_0517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991354272569882, "text": "😇", "created_at": "2024-10-25T13:36:19", "owner": "jayden212122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866675098236785, "text": "我好奇他最後怎麼了", "created_at": "2024-10-21T09:28:45", "owner": "miku07059", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858428659220776, "text": "喉，在說謊阿", "created_at": "2024-10-20T15:31:11", "owner": "5ee5aaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018704558626207, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-10-20T09:25:48", "owner": "lw007007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022271768529155, "text": "😢讚啦", "created_at": "2024-10-20T05:10:58", "owner": "guopeiwen841", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019065362536047, "text": "死了嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-20T05:10:20", "owner": "svbmd7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868098484215406, "text": "宙斯：我只是先讓索爾練手而已", "created_at": "2024-10-08T09:08:30", "owner": "uryt__11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890657560096103, "text": "我想看後續", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:52:49", "owner": "greatghost02231101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880130188117149, "text": "就說不要亂發誓", "created_at": "2024-10-01T11:39:56", "owner": "xingruiting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856335736223230, "text": "第一髮是在警告你第二發是在懲罰你😮", "created_at": "2024-09-29T03:45:30", "owner": "xiehoucheng6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093283528465714, "text": "假死避雷", "created_at": "2024-09-27T23:26:47", "owner": "zox._.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329043607148602, "text": "@2486_7.6", "created_at": "2024-09-24T13:58:04", "owner": "12.16.____.yx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979681962750972, "text": "宙斯：手滑", "created_at": "2024-09-23T14:53:36", "owner": "kai35282", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102077758438954, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T09:11:43", "owner": "xuyujun177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904618243032048, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-09-19T09:11:41", "owner": "xuyujun177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861144916237154, "text": "宙斯：給過你機會你不重用，那就別怪我啦！（瞄準😄）", "created_at": "2024-09-18T10:50:31", "owner": "shengzhe45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030611144049042, "text": "可惜不是真的", "created_at": "2024-09-16T19:30:40", "owner": "c.y.l.0507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883374049101386, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-15T18:09:23", "owner": "10dragon2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939879030777856, "text": "反派死於話多🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-15T09:53:32", "owner": "liao.mincheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140542975350065, "text": "@leo_qaz125", "created_at": "2024-09-14T13:29:38", "owner": "xuan_980510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352470190138586, "text": "@leo_qaz125", "created_at": "2024-09-14T13:29:28", "owner": "xuan_980510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842673583317234, "text": "真的假的", "created_at": "2024-09-14T10:32:51", "owner": "o_o960_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341085199130980, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-14T04:26:15", "owner": "liangyatang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015088853545168, "text": "宙斯：我給過你機會了", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:08:35", "owner": "wei.jun.zheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020740832430387, "text": "有後續嗎 真的送醫？", "created_at": "2024-09-13T16:33:53", "owner": "ashow_1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891211615067976, "text": "正所謂不作死就不會死", "created_at": "2024-09-13T15:59:17", "owner": "cutecat._.meow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312919252087002, "text": "宙斯：小子 第一次是警告", "created_at": "2024-09-13T10:15:37", "owner": "junyo.aq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319798153155646, "text": "機會只有一次🙏🏻", "created_at": "2024-09-13T09:30:10", "owner": "rex_iverson03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044629729820237, "text": "如果是真的 會先劈到他再有聲音\n然後朋友應該也不能繼續錄下去了", "created_at": "2024-09-13T05:29:02", "owner": "j001au.rar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020736017403773, "text": "好準喔～😅", "created_at": "2024-09-12T07:49:02", "owner": "allen25297", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085775920445002, "text": "多大的罪啊", "created_at": "2024-09-11T22:29:08", "owner": "yykow333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047527876927846, "text": "他没事吧😢", "created_at": "2024-09-11T15:14:53", "owner": "vivian_foo_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048690298906954, "text": "宙斯：第一发警告你是不当一回事喔？😬", "created_at": "2024-09-11T12:35:21", "owner": "dtang.zhe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154239817320265, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-09-11T10:37:11", "owner": "yanhao.0605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18463611994040240, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-11T08:55:16", "owner": "lowqiaoqi0311", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037196422937846, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-11T01:55:57", "owner": "guscheng4741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855506251254656, "text": "*他沒死* 宙斯造假", "created_at": "2024-09-10T17:49:51", "owner": "cat.uhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046051501941902, "text": "所以啊絕對不要亂發毒誓😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:03:14", "owner": "fuxiang974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059960620669012, "text": "@matttsai24 (◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2024-09-09T10:20:26", "owner": "wei._.ch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070289701585940, "text": "這影片做假", "created_at": "2024-09-08T23:24:52", "owner": "rwethan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078785980469720, "text": "給你臉你不要😂", "created_at": "2024-09-08T12:48:26", "owner": "ovo._67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006167357430834, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T14:39:31", "owner": "zhezhe06_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156657622316604, "text": "是真的\n我是後面那顆樹", "created_at": "2024-09-07T10:30:45", "owner": "1oun9_3awg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340859302192611, "text": "＂抱歉，第一发忘装8倍镜＂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T09:03:35", "owner": "owentea_lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061940662712216, "text": "@senyou_05 @ian__326", "created_at": "2024-09-07T05:36:57", "owner": "fishhh39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091146355465765, "text": "黃金樹旁立誓--＞維克的龍雷", "created_at": "2024-09-07T02:02:39", "owner": "clk72427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007660667394601, "text": "他還活著嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-07T00:33:45", "owner": "jiangchenshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983015364589674, "text": "宙斯：刚才是我劈的不准", "created_at": "2024-09-06T15:18:04", "owner": "furry5647", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074326318550833, "text": "宙斯:打歪了、不好意思", "created_at": "2024-09-06T14:02:41", "owner": "xiaodexinxiao", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046594429762947, "text": "nah bro, u can't go around saying things like that :)", "created_at": "2024-09-06T13:22:43", "owner": "f1ona_hywww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043093402994068, "text": "警告一次", "created_at": "2024-09-06T12:07:09", "owner": "s890127x2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889590469088499, "text": "@aa_blneutral \n@jiang.yihuan 惰性", "created_at": "2024-09-06T11:34:01", "owner": "adventure__www", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982292988724048, "text": "上天：本來是給你一個警告 既然你都要求了我就成全你", "created_at": "2024-09-06T04:21:15", "owner": "90_06_23do", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18147888892336012, "text": "I’m give you the warning. Fine take it", "created_at": "2024-09-05T15:02:29", "owner": "johnson.wayne0616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881384455105297, "text": "第一發是warning shot", "created_at": "2024-09-05T07:04:42", "owner": "nelsonch3n_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856753372248621, "text": "雷神：最賭爛人家說我沒準頭了🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-03T13:20:41", "owner": "faith_on_iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071160571505489, "text": "沙贊！！！", "created_at": "2024-09-02T14:26:21", "owner": "sitsu509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915794442984941, "text": "索爾也不敢像你這樣演😂", "created_at": "2024-09-02T13:02:34", "owner": "love01151995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888507367089906, "text": "☠️", "created_at": "2024-09-02T08:17:42", "owner": "hlam_kkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427738618070754, "text": "Make jesus himself strike me down. If i lying.", "created_at": "2024-08-30T11:32:27", "owner": "ruki.yei.1101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044103004794801, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-08-30T03:55:43", "owner": "wi_0430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017216906525692, "text": "bro还好吗？", "created_at": "2024-08-29T11:25:02", "owner": "tszrw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889320739081037, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-28T05:20:10", "owner": "a_nd.yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064271797620189, "text": "First shot was god, the second shot was Zeus", "created_at": "2024-08-28T04:22:39", "owner": "tszming.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352896376143334, "text": "@zq041333 天打雷劈複習", "created_at": "2024-08-27T17:34:00", "owner": "aft_tow0115", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028672022211145, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-27T09:01:07", "owner": "mingzhe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866269480192006, "text": "他說他不做假 不然就天打雷劈 但那個雷確實假的 實際上可能都沒打雷  沒打雷就代表沒做假 所以這算作假還是沒作假", "created_at": "2024-08-27T04:16:00", "owner": "tw8787pig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051104515842370, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-26T13:27:47", "owner": "gkgarlic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18357728542129107, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-26T10:02:49", "owner": "jackforestgoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954695370814144, "text": "宙斯：先給你一個警告", "created_at": "2024-08-25T17:14:00", "owner": "chenpinhao930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016886735608961, "text": "結果就變成月老了", "created_at": "2024-08-24T06:50:10", "owner": "yd._097", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037046654292377, "text": "對不起 是我丟的喚雷三叉戟", "created_at": "2024-08-24T06:22:02", "owner": "liuyouyun22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068543782573994, "text": "沙贊", "created_at": "2024-08-23T05:41:21", "owner": "jw_h_0302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037475300293497, "text": "宙斯 ：你當我塑膠膩", "created_at": "2024-08-22T05:03:49", "owner": "owen03_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045517090909836, "text": "第一次宙斯表示：你要確欸", "created_at": "2024-08-21T11:38:55", "owner": "hsu_tengyuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039656000065714, "text": "冷知識：好笑是重點", "created_at": "2024-08-20T18:48:43", "owner": "thawnee129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057252988678652, "text": "宙斯：不見棺材不掉淚？", "created_at": "2024-08-20T07:38:36", "owner": "e.k.0505_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895423627052993, "text": "好龍鞥鞥", "created_at": "2024-08-20T04:48:51", "owner": "josh.04.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018157181528240, "text": "哈利波特", "created_at": "2024-08-19T13:45:28", "owner": "henry991106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033587381140240, "text": "他的衣服是好奇五先生的那款嗎", "created_at": "2024-08-19T02:59:52", "owner": "ltygream_mini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049486546848381, "text": "遺言：你看沒打到我吧", "created_at": "2024-08-17T10:59:30", "owner": "12345aeiou67890", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18018979718429221, "text": "宙斯：警告1次", "created_at": "2024-08-17T10:00:27", "owner": "aagg11335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026418062517198, "text": "雷公:就等你发誓呢😂", "created_at": "2024-08-16T10:47:13", "owner": "kun.breeze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987771603543736, "text": "發逝", "created_at": "2024-08-16T07:47:59", "owner": "zaiying181", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890534653069365, "text": "沙贊～", "created_at": "2024-08-16T05:37:41", "owner": "bighorse.1218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244258837261654, "text": "觸電的那種感覺，會讓我發電😂", "created_at": "2024-08-16T03:38:53", "owner": "kai._.ren_0618", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17873385555140423, "text": "他下次不敢了", "created_at": "2024-08-16T01:47:56", "owner": "zoomers_mihawk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984100977572291, "text": "Damn bro", "created_at": "2024-08-16T01:18:15", "owner": "kent_805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070006861560460, "text": "有一说一，光的传导速度比声音快。", "created_at": "2024-08-16T00:13:33", "owner": "1i1in1ing", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18238976446264000, "text": "亂罵我們的人會被雷公打，會被神明罰！", "created_at": "2024-08-15T19:29:16", "owner": "goobie_woo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933121599910596, "text": "👏👏👏很好", "created_at": "2024-08-15T15:51:02", "owner": "dg88997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013325849306659, "text": "Mr.Beast be like:", "created_at": "2024-08-15T14:42:20", "owner": "wiklanw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964308849787094, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-08-15T09:39:11", "owner": "fash_umbrella010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065665066603097, "text": "何瑞英：幹嘛劈我兒子？", "created_at": "2024-08-14T16:23:06", "owner": "tdcibull", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053047342762456, "text": "宙斯：都給過口頭警告了 這鍋我不背", "created_at": "2024-08-14T15:40:35", "owner": "abrthur.liao", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3387741218139736042, "shortcode": "C8DrLBaKwfq", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C8DrLBaKwfq/", "taken_at": "2024-06-11T01:44:27", "caption": "聽說有種死亡叫做社會性死亡\n#memes #fun", "owner_username": "shakingotaku", "owner_id": "65639790431", "likes": 8312, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0084_C8DrLBaKwfq\\C8DrLBaKwfq_20240611_014427.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18024456980434659", "text": "怕", "created_at": "2024-10-14T08:06:39", "owner": "crazydw666", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18045572335843535", "text": "神父？是你對吧！", "created_at": "2024-10-14T05:55:32", "owner": "show7367", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18034597829484071", "text": "神父在哪裡", "created_at": "2024-08-27T16:49:41", "owner": "kk.0823xs", "likes": 5}, {"id": "18000362888481232", "text": "卡完整影片", "created_at": "2024-08-04T14:21:34", "owner": "yoon_xinos", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17895819960028447", "text": "有原片連結嗎？", "created_at": "2024-07-31T11:33:41", "owner": "jm724hk", "likes": 12}, {"id": "17873003976123914", "text": "為什麼我總覺得機械手臂最後會抓到魔術師的gg", "created_at": "2024-07-12T10:58:11", "owner": "e8367367", "likes": 37}, {"id": "18270187075211755", "text": "小朋友：出口在哪裡？", "created_at": "2024-07-07T13:42:22", "owner": "n_ian_huang", "likes": 196}, {"id": "18019254818123526", "text": "@op_fool @jia._.shin_0601", "created_at": "2024-07-05T14:13:20", "owner": "a_sheng0714", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18052940329663580", "text": "老實說你很興奮對吧", "created_at": "2024-07-04T05:50:20", "owner": "wowhaha_ouo", "likes": 298}, {"id": "18051534601689106", "text": "於是那90秒的時間他選擇什麼都不做，靜靜的站在那裡", "created_at": "2024-07-03T03:36:48", "owner": "gzy._.idgaf_", "likes": 737}, {"id": "17917023518941746", "text": "如果…如果你是個暴露狂那就是你想的吧🫠🫠🫠", "created_at": "2024-06-11T02:52:48", "owner": "ji.3713", "likes": 174}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["memes", "fun"]},
{"media_id": 3437732767474184881, "shortcode": "C-1R7z2BPKx", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-1R7z2BPKx/", "taken_at": "2024-08-19T01:08:44", "caption": "你給我小聲一點\n-\n翻抽屜團購專區🔞\n連結在個人主頁及限時動態&精選 😍\nhttps://www.openyourdrawer.com/one-page-stores/cc?utm_campaign=6680eab5eb52c20022f76f05&utm_source=one-page-stores\n-\n#團購 #男女 #情侶 #優惠 #好玩 #玩具 #有趣 #廣告", "owner_username": "cccctranslate", "owner_id": "60315393782", "likes": 28060, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0085_C-1R7z2BPKx\\C-1R7z2BPKx_20240819_010844.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18030909575142177, "text": "有人破防", "created_at": "2024-11-16T13:14:40", "owner": "liz._.0322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026511476601574, "text": "3英尺是多少啊？", "created_at": "2024-11-02T22:36:23", "owner": "qibo.zanahoria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031314542093964, "text": "以為手機懷裡", "created_at": "2024-10-23T19:24:00", "owner": "michelle.fan2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272596990223449, "text": "因為這影片 生平第一次拿尺來量 幸好可以開中低音量不用全靜音🥺", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:15:38", "owner": "hastur_hung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028358843127737, "text": "You muted?", "created_at": "2024-10-22T05:57:13", "owner": "g9722730", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030579716093003, "text": "为了业配，他牺牲太大了", "created_at": "2024-10-15T15:36:26", "owner": "danielheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029560076104896, "text": "@tszhin08", "created_at": "2024-10-15T15:24:58", "owner": "tamjai3gor123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930372360830768, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T06:45:16", "owner": "diderhaha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058386340776259, "text": "@pamirs_hsu 你講話好小聲", "created_at": "2024-09-26T18:36:49", "owner": "yutin_sun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057088060630930, "text": "3吋也有9公分，也不錯了", "created_at": "2024-09-25T01:00:05", "owner": "viral_prod_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005639615645861, "text": "@zfrm19_cyx", "created_at": "2024-09-21T08:00:36", "owner": "posean1227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964166712674127, "text": "直接無聲 超靠北的", "created_at": "2024-09-20T13:08:41", "owner": "softly35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032697008191582, "text": "音軌直接不見", "created_at": "2024-09-20T11:49:33", "owner": "_willyjane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047169001938116, "text": "请问有没有原视频", "created_at": "2024-09-20T02:24:28", "owner": "wadahrak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096675970416025, "text": "為什麼一定是亞洲男人😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T23:23:12", "owner": "young4everever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037046204472741, "text": "調到最大聲 耳朵貼著手機還真的聽的到男生在講話欸😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T11:45:18", "owner": "jackhana2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928299795943137, "text": "這業配很成功🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-16T10:21:17", "owner": "s6245000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18454800439012722, "text": "Damn this is good", "created_at": "2024-09-14T09:58:58", "owner": "yfen.chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104929231390063, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-12T09:33:51", "owner": "chuan.x2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889554049086098, "text": "手機維修部：今天不知道怎麼回事，十幾二十個人送手機來說喇叭壞了，說手機沒聲音", "created_at": "2024-09-10T16:41:30", "owner": "yymtyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280580002238705, "text": "我要笑死", "created_at": "2024-09-10T12:05:46", "owner": "hill._.lll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042305101990816, "text": "那個到底是三公分還是三吋", "created_at": "2024-09-10T07:01:14", "owner": "lijogeebye_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075686026553516, "text": "這是縮陽入腹了吧", "created_at": "2024-09-10T04:32:36", "owner": "greatchineseempire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046985554757359, "text": "不錯的打廣告方式", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:43:53", "owner": "loyalty_dn4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036616529152305, "text": "乾 我以為我耳機又壞", "created_at": "2024-09-09T07:40:55", "owner": "andy60528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854061334265167, "text": "館長要不要接一下", "created_at": "2024-09-09T02:36:55", "owner": "marcus_chang411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323938093196802, "text": "took me 3mins to get it. lol", "created_at": "2024-09-06T17:39:41", "owner": "iamcalebtay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091209535465912, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-04T11:14:21", "owner": "yaomi116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456185329065195, "text": "小聲到老子以為我手機壞了還是我按到靜音😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T10:07:54", "owner": "johnwick0628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058928026671998, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-04T08:22:58", "owner": "enyangjiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456623179004310, "text": "@poellp_16 @itz_just_nate", "created_at": "2024-09-04T04:44:25", "owner": "chesterchestercheee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005935979424297, "text": "靠北 好好笑", "created_at": "2024-09-01T13:56:39", "owner": "ylo._.ysiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939282768862577, "text": "咖特咖特密", "created_at": "2024-08-30T08:57:48", "owner": "tcc.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949763307728380, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈  到底有多短~小聲成這樣!!!!", "created_at": "2024-08-29T21:17:10", "owner": "mai0026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280188706209323, "text": "我無感因為至少雙倍（？）", "created_at": "2024-08-29T11:43:08", "owner": "_ceetlmn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037623002487389, "text": "叫你小聲一點，沒叫你靜音啊～～噢…我懂了，拍寫", "created_at": "2024-08-29T05:30:02", "owner": "b.ma.keiko.m.i.c", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17918674523968528, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-28T17:20:33", "owner": "jessica16688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875496292116330, "text": "。", "created_at": "2024-08-28T11:22:41", "owner": "smrvd1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016083662271324, "text": "當音量的單位變成cm", "created_at": "2024-08-28T04:58:38", "owner": "tissot_bond1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468848425057348, "text": "她是不是从来听不到她爹的说话声😂", "created_at": "2024-08-27T20:22:13", "owner": "jzhengty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889998979073505, "text": "這樣全台是不是再也聽不到男聲了😍", "created_at": "2024-08-25T09:50:06", "owner": "0___oy.kolien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367648939101885, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-25T07:13:02", "owner": "ucancallmechin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927014814930298, "text": "............................。", "created_at": "2024-08-25T06:47:06", "owner": "andy70487", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076385875524103, "text": "試一試調到最大聲會聽得到", "created_at": "2024-08-20T16:47:13", "owner": "lester.snyc.lc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037876256048822, "text": "會用性器官評論人的人是不是滿腦子色情思想？", "created_at": "2024-08-20T14:24:40", "owner": "po_woo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011874602554551, "text": "太🔥😂❤️", "created_at": "2024-08-20T13:45:30", "owner": "yoyoleungyiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860753857162412, "text": "「 」", "created_at": "2024-08-19T14:46:01", "owner": "stephane_fr.note", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017904902525545, "text": "…😂", "created_at": "2024-08-19T14:38:07", "owner": "b._0225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031278038180421, "text": "害我還調整聲音", "created_at": "2024-08-19T09:26:46", "owner": "tonido77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025777211352885, "text": "我的手機喇叭壞了嗎？（小聲🤫", "created_at": "2024-08-19T07:50:06", "owner": "wowsblo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035476844286128, "text": "業配用了別人業配的業配業配了業配", "created_at": "2024-08-19T07:09:45", "owner": "luxferre_12x3", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18016691849577674, "text": "謝了 剛剛調最大聲結果影片結束突然回到片頭現在真的聽不到了⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-08-19T05:09:31", "owner": "_sophia_314_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18015370943249989, "text": "她有沒有想過自己平成那樣有什麼資格說別人短", "created_at": "2024-08-19T05:07:14", "owner": "chi.stoobid0409", "likes": 227}, {"id": 18037950092082972, "text": "不是，所以他只有……！？！？！？", "created_at": "2024-08-19T04:52:05", "owner": "ggg852314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087076651473883, "text": "被無聲業配（或是超小聲", "created_at": "2024-08-19T04:51:22", "owner": "luanshohua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937379505776907, "text": "無意間被業配了 笑死", "created_at": "2024-08-19T04:25:59", "owner": "frankk.114", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18064681966611935, "text": "好笑的是真的有聲音，但你要全開音量並且抓好時間靜音", "created_at": "2024-08-19T04:03:09", "owner": "bill_boy__whitecat", "likes": 83}, {"id": 18052390558826597, "text": "謝謝你我耳鳴了", "created_at": "2024-08-19T03:58:52", "owner": "jingkai0125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013742216290878, "text": "超好笑", "created_at": "2024-08-19T03:46:17", "owner": "melisa.g_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942830358756068, "text": "你這樣，阿為什麼A罩杯的特別兇\n越大脾氣越好😧", "created_at": "2024-08-19T03:41:53", "owner": "we_0323", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036320189112702, "text": "我真的以為我手機壞了", "created_at": "2024-08-19T03:08:04", "owner": "m_fashion_hair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052075153826076, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-19T03:07:00", "owner": "mr.10_im.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894189148050739, "text": "Hey, Steven, now we all know you are 3 cm long😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-19T02:59:31", "owner": "lin.chienhung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039914527997492, "text": "😮（", "created_at": "2024-08-19T02:26:09", "owner": "stanley710709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013642166612260, "text": "黑人：拿出大聲公📢", "created_at": "2024-08-19T02:12:01", "owner": "trb565", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18064907770545472, "text": "媽的我以為手機壞了怎麼沒聲音😆😆😆", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:41:58", "owner": "akapimento", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17856884046237267, "text": "他真的有聲音只是太小聲了", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:37:02", "owner": "hok_yau_cheung", "likes": 108}, {"id": 18046006549918646, "text": "我他媽以為我耳機壞了", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:29:46", "owner": "ryan_looooooo", "likes": 966}, {"id": 18042649591818095, "text": "謝謝您, 回放時我的耳膜好像穿了", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:22:39", "owner": "terry26091", "likes": 612}, {"id": 17914259849977618, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:21:24", "owner": "katungishare", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18035237441508531, "text": "我還以為我手機壞了", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:19:31", "owner": "ppp8927", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17890423109997527, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:18:22", "owner": "xu__dun", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18043330537798044, "text": "提醒，你無須提高手機音量", "created_at": "2024-08-19T01:15:26", "owner": "philip_ig_lin", "likes": 2988}, {"id": 17886057546135798, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-22T06:04:43", "owner": "wurayray", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["團購", "男女", "情侶", "優惠", "好玩", "玩具", "有趣", "廣告"]},
{"media_id": 3359746832682265272, "shortcode": "C6gN_GRRSq4", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6gN_GRRSq4/", "taken_at": "2024-05-03T10:45:55", "caption": "靠山山倒 靠人人落跑 信耶穌最好❤️\n\nP.S. 兒子安好，不要擔心😎😎😎\n\n#信仰 #耶穌 #基督 #拜拜 #禱告 #自媒體 #影響力 #教會 #相信 #幽默 #聚會 #小組 #親子 #搞笑", "owner_username": "talk_pray", "owner_id": "61849924815", "likes": 143203, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0086_C6gN_GRRSq4\\C6gN_GRRSq4_20240503_104555.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["信仰", "耶穌", "基督", "拜拜", "禱告", "自媒體", "影響力", "教會", "相信", "幽默", "聚會", "小組", "親子", "搞笑"]},
{"media_id": 3385208697764147525, "shortcode": "C76rWAAy3FF", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C76rWAAy3FF/", "taken_at": "2024-06-07T13:52:50", "caption": "🐭：早知道今天帶點沐浴露了\n\n#配音 #看一遍笑一遍 #萬萬沒想到 #押韻", "owner_username": "onnnnn7_", "owner_id": "58342655953", "likes": 6325, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0087_C76rWAAy3FF\\C76rWAAy3FF_20240607_135250.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17896345695001212, "text": "拿蟲族的刀斬獸族的戰士", "created_at": "2024-06-08T17:15:27", "owner": "newmond1022", "likes": 235}, {"id": 18049739359665275, "text": "殺蟲劑前點個火 什麼種族都有效🙂", "created_at": "2024-06-09T04:11:05", "owner": "bear__og", "likes": 250}, {"id": 17931090740923281, "text": "@ccl.716", "created_at": "2024-09-02T02:35:52", "owner": "_tom.wym_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037469819006177, "text": "龜岡誒！", "created_at": "2024-08-12T14:02:51", "owner": "hsiao.wei.che.1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101013115380601, "text": "鼠：謝謝你幫我殺了身上的寄身蟲\n這洗浴真超值", "created_at": "2024-08-01T09:24:46", "owner": "bad.ganstar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18123588742326385, "text": "欸好強喔，用抖肩舞唱rap", "created_at": "2024-07-20T04:40:45", "owner": "yutang525", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18070091743542635, "text": "拿明朝的劍斬清朝的官", "created_at": "2024-07-20T02:22:06", "owner": "zhi.xiang._.yan", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18348762934118316, "text": "壓爆", "created_at": "2024-07-10T14:51:25", "owner": "to.tiur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903862807002961, "text": "如果对这类有效，那一定对人类也会见效", "created_at": "2024-07-06T02:00:47", "owner": "aihaoguolan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975806358717801, "text": "哈哈哈 拜託你看點說明", "created_at": "2024-07-04T20:24:42", "owner": "laaaaa0919", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18060542623544241, "text": "@iive_5201314", "created_at": "2024-07-02T13:03:34", "owner": "yuki0905_yuri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023766653515251, "text": "老鼠回家 ：爸快來看 我身上跳蚤都沒了", "created_at": "2024-07-01T09:59:22", "owner": "iluinging", "likes": 111}, {"id": 17854702890213898, "text": "通知家鼠吧", "created_at": "2024-07-01T02:51:42", "owner": "tttt87005", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17850112986196379, "text": "鼠🐭：你猜一下我是哺乳動物還是節肢動物", "created_at": "2024-06-21T11:15:51", "owner": "ling_yi.n.aix", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18002247878614545, "text": "家鼠答禮", "created_at": "2024-06-09T10:37:14", "owner": "yu__twoos.42", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18061618108561292, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-06-07T17:24:34", "owner": "qa1230984", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17958573620910751, "text": "杀虫剂对哺乳动物有效，请不要误导，毕竟杀虫剂也是毒，不然你说为啥喷完蚊油需要通风，通完才能进去，而且还要洗手，如果真无效，你咋不直接喷完就进去，关上门窗？你用杀虫剂，你妈还嘱附你，喷了记得给房间通风，用了记得洗手，把杀虫剂放回原位！所以请不要唬烂什么杀虫剂对哺乳动物无效，除草剂不止除草还除人勒。", "created_at": "2025-03-03T16:24:13", "owner": "grigio167", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110253967416642, "text": "噴死丟下水道 在毒蟑螂一遍", "created_at": "2024-09-11T16:40:12", "owner": "gn02315971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932803356793906, "text": "其實這是慢性毒藥，慢慢毒死妳", "created_at": "2024-08-14T07:39:51", "owner": "sunghaowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849027580241124, "text": "-1hp -1hp -1hp -1hp -2hp -2hp -2hp -2hp -2hp -3hp -3hp -3hp -3hp -3hp -3hp", "created_at": "2024-08-12T13:45:43", "owner": "darren0318_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110281084401042, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-07-25T12:41:32", "owner": "redplayer1314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050370679683243, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-06-30T02:13:47", "owner": "lu_fish_ruru", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18435140899030405, "text": "果隻係老鼠，唔係甲由", "created_at": "2024-06-08T05:30:45", "owner": "oscar_hui2023", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17842343211246347, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-06-07T16:50:08", "owner": "_100101111", "likes": 4}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["配音", "看一遍笑一遍", "萬萬沒想到", "押韻"]},
{"media_id": 3432680258874559293, "shortcode": "C-jVIIhtss9", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-jVIIhtss9/", "taken_at": "2024-08-12T01:51:18", "caption": "trust the process 😤\n\n16/30", "owner_username": "stephenrkim", "owner_id": "1713931364", "likes": 8398, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0088_C-jVIIhtss9\\C-jVIIhtss9_20240812_015118.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18035133164231081, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-05T07:58:46", "owner": "daesuncupid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930653796940953, "text": "This was clean", "created_at": "2024-10-04T01:42:10", "owner": "adam.hafner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123399508379826, "text": "What a hook! 🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-29T21:26:16", "owner": "jajaturjah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993898692528029, "text": "I’m doing a beat a day from my catalog of music, I found that was a simple format that I could commit to and doesn’t take a ton of time to film/edit every day", "created_at": "2024-09-28T14:05:28", "owner": "djgrumble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113752255404168, "text": "I am doing the challenge as well! Let’s go!", "created_at": "2024-09-24T04:43:55", "owner": "lorenzoagravante_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339791539193578, "text": "Man I'm going through the same thing...30 days posting is harder than it seems, but a great way to challenge ourselves, good luck bro", "created_at": "2024-09-22T16:56:03", "owner": "arthurscherer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870996748187997, "text": "You got it bud! I’ll be watching 👁️‍🗨️", "created_at": "2024-09-20T16:55:02", "owner": "lukas.quintero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057418297739011, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-16T22:42:09", "owner": "bk_filmz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026706569520259, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-16T14:21:24", "owner": "themelioraagency", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018222308445986, "text": "Seek discomfort, times like these are the ones that shows us what we are truly made of, we just gotta push through them to get to our end goal or the next step..", "created_at": "2024-09-11T18:55:11", "owner": "matt_slevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066112561618390, "text": "Congrats for posting 30 days in a row bro, the amount of work I can’t imagine!\nWell done 👏🏻", "created_at": "2024-09-07T22:50:51", "owner": "dopamine.frame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258773596247943, "text": "Nah stalling video is crazy", "created_at": "2024-09-06T22:23:55", "owner": "jeithkeith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991623957695054, "text": "That is fuking cool", "created_at": "2024-09-06T00:19:23", "owner": "b__hagath_skater_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18453285217044445, "text": "You got this 🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-04T20:58:17", "owner": "sheharyarspakistan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020961344193670, "text": "I love this man! I’ve just come across your reel and I’m joining you on this journey! I’d love to connect with you. It’s so good to see the joy of God in you!🫶", "created_at": "2024-09-04T20:19:39", "owner": "lucbotha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016139834283738, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-04T18:25:25", "owner": "rhxtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136863958355854, "text": "🔥💯💯", "created_at": "2024-09-03T22:54:13", "owner": "humair04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985244229712148, "text": "All these translucent background apps a few years back, you would fall for it as a kid", "created_at": "2024-09-03T22:47:54", "owner": "maximilian.fotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978927342746275, "text": "Help me out dawg 🌭", "created_at": "2024-09-03T01:05:29", "owner": "agstravelz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042274846959859, "text": "You got this bro, this content is amazing ❤️🔥 inspiring", "created_at": "2024-09-02T15:58:19", "owner": "bambi_mm4l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028993874192768, "text": "are you studying videography/media in college?", "created_at": "2024-09-01T14:09:11", "owner": "michael.nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039978248102904, "text": "DUDE such crazy editing, keep it up!", "created_at": "2024-09-01T14:08:50", "owner": "michael.nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927244095939176, "text": "2nd shot had to have come straight out of Trap", "created_at": "2024-09-01T04:17:08", "owner": "jake.m.bennett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899041557965173, "text": "clean intro", "created_at": "2024-09-01T00:02:51", "owner": "mohamed.vis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967532466647809, "text": "Straight? Why not 🏳️‍🌈", "created_at": "2024-08-30T13:05:20", "owner": "dede_tomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028637945515010, "text": "Keep going don't stop, you are motivating a lots of people", "created_at": "2024-08-30T03:15:23", "owner": "vinilafayett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050633908871089, "text": "Great hook", "created_at": "2024-08-29T11:16:20", "owner": "mike.aka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864423964142436, "text": "Dude you’re killing it, I’m doing the same thing, but my end date is so far away!", "created_at": "2024-08-29T09:43:05", "owner": "georgexplores", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054943948753582, "text": "Buy a motorcycle", "created_at": "2024-08-29T04:32:36", "owner": "maxwell.hunter64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334594636132457, "text": "great hook🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-08-28T17:50:16", "owner": "elijahsodyssey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046665211928169, "text": "What do you use to editzv", "created_at": "2024-08-28T09:45:02", "owner": "kaimeader", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135812677349592, "text": "Love this bro!! Keep up the vision", "created_at": "2024-08-27T08:08:22", "owner": "ken.munozzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875759122138189, "text": "Did you experience light distortion on the iPhone green screen thru the camera lens and if so how did you resolve it?", "created_at": "2024-08-27T05:32:03", "owner": "michaelmetzlerjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060296854637572, "text": "Nice hook bro", "created_at": "2024-08-27T04:16:39", "owner": "beaniebrownie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056693818627466, "text": "I did this challenge too. Thought I’d be ig famous after lol. It definitely taught me consistency though. And not to make excuses. Good look man! You got this", "created_at": "2024-08-27T01:58:33", "owner": "itsdondiestro", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18060192712635443, "text": "The transitions are crazy 🔥", "created_at": "2024-08-26T21:30:37", "owner": "jsisk_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039206528013489, "text": "This might be the most creative intro to a video i’ve seen in ages", "created_at": "2024-08-26T19:21:45", "owner": "digitalook.uk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858473302235057, "text": "Wish I could like this more than once  bc intro was so original so cool mega epic", "created_at": "2024-08-26T04:00:47", "owner": "olivia.roemer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18457043962054316, "text": "try making a series. that way you have a structure for every day which makes the idea process much easier", "created_at": "2024-08-25T03:49:41", "owner": "schlanman.hard.photos", "likes": 117}, {"id": 18030427733239624, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-08-23T03:01:56", "owner": "mxer.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943408008845191, "text": "how the 😳", "created_at": "2024-08-23T01:08:50", "owner": "jazzsingh16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079758856502095, "text": "Great to see this journey! How the heck did you do that at the beginning?", "created_at": "2024-08-21T04:04:59", "owner": "itsdanielabraham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867810532177339, "text": "That’s hella creative", "created_at": "2024-08-20T23:55:54", "owner": "sid.haldar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010588961541734, "text": "Keep King Arthur circle house famous", "created_at": "2024-08-13T05:36:33", "owner": "12davscott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934541394871098, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-08-13T05:27:23", "owner": "theofficialrayy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054476179689103, "text": "Feeling the same 🥹\n\nBut let’s keep going 🙌🫶🏻", "created_at": "2024-08-12T08:51:52", "owner": "sam.mov.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030470375186440, "text": "@dj_mendezzz and @bellabraunn were paid actors", "created_at": "2024-08-12T05:45:26", "owner": "jeff_shellum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18236076658278878, "text": "@kwestbrook7 it’s your song‼️‼️", "created_at": "2024-08-12T03:50:07", "owner": "therunnergunner", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18452618659024835, "text": "blind ranking current byx officers next", "created_at": "2024-08-12T02:56:15", "owner": "kwestbrook7", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18002726849452286, "text": "LePookie highlight reel next? Just spitballing here", "created_at": "2024-08-12T02:44:33", "owner": "lukusharris", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17929463735920941, "text": "Your edits are 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-08-12T02:26:22", "owner": "dleektx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866385364178315, "text": "I love these close ups", "created_at": "2024-08-12T02:05:23", "owner": "connor_adamiak", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18039290378005603, "text": "go steph go", "created_at": "2024-08-12T02:02:55", "owner": "carolineg.21", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17911524461990859, "text": "Don’t buy torchys our meal was like $40", "created_at": "2024-08-12T01:54:26", "owner": "djmendezzz", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17874877863137228, "text": "shoutout to my extras @dj_mendezzz @bellabraunn", "created_at": "2024-08-12T01:52:17", "owner": "stephenrkim", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18044867722808994, "text": "They gave you a disrespectful amount of room on that couch", "created_at": "2024-09-11T21:42:05", "owner": "_bymarkallan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294002758204963, "text": "Cul", "created_at": "2024-08-30T07:49:26", "owner": "_michelemanca_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025641284375505, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-12T03:15:58", "owner": "jinperk", "likes": 26}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3441102782209783048, "shortcode": "C_BQL-pOPUI", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_BQL-pOPUI/", "taken_at": "2024-08-23T16:45:35", "caption": "Construction of Hong Kong International Airport began in 1991 on 12.5-square kilometers (4.85 sq. mi) of reclaimed land and took seven years to complete. An additional 6.5 square kilometers (2.5 sq. mi) was added in 2020 to construct a third runway, to be completed by the end of 2024. Hong Kong is one of the world’s busiest passenger airports, with a capacity for at least 70 million passengers a year. \n\nCreated by @dailyoverview\nSource imagery: @planetlabs / Google Timelapse", "owner_username": "dailyoverview", "owner_id": "936295591", "likes": 60667, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0089_C_BQL-pOPUI\\C_BQL-pOPUI_20240823_164535.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18039286427161567, "text": "Kind of looking like that yellow 1 hand in air kitty. That is too made in china", "created_at": "2025-02-28T18:05:38", "owner": "aaryan.verma.9066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344677519144329, "text": "Kai Tak W🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-04T06:23:50", "owner": "mcdonalds_douglas_md11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122966224414212, "text": "You know I’m thinking if climate change was real, someone would not have funded billions of dollars to build an island in the ocean. That’s just me though", "created_at": "2025-01-17T23:02:55", "owner": "earlf0913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989953206774164, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-01-09T06:13:33", "owner": "thanpisit_boonsaeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063157303789170, "text": "เร็วกว่าประเทศไทยอีก", "created_at": "2024-12-08T08:39:51", "owner": "thee_14097", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038468105266758, "text": "Macau is also like this", "created_at": "2024-11-20T10:57:45", "owner": "liminal.357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023709854291371, "text": "Meanwhile Canada can’t install a boat launch.", "created_at": "2024-11-19T02:43:42", "owner": "clark_griswold00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048251744295882, "text": "33 years?", "created_at": "2024-11-17T03:42:17", "owner": "dushandoer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096716221487408, "text": "Walang sinabi sa NAIA 😆✌️", "created_at": "2024-11-16T02:01:02", "owner": "r_vertudazo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033677039366494, "text": "They should not have destroyed the Kowloon Wall since the airport was later moved to the south of Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2024-11-14T11:16:57", "owner": "h_itchkov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046583966494458, "text": "我愛香港國際機場，但我更愛啟德機場", "created_at": "2024-11-12T08:39:55", "owner": "dynasty_aviation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050553199956302, "text": "Hk 🇨🇳👍❤️‍🩹🍀", "created_at": "2024-11-12T04:57:26", "owner": "tom.mukhia.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989925585724613, "text": "Isn't the one in Japan sinking? That really expensive in they built", "created_at": "2024-11-11T21:27:42", "owner": "dortyboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252108409285506, "text": "Given as a gift to China", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:08:56", "owner": "chechaquo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035281493068394, "text": "Is it still sinking?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:11:34", "owner": "bigun_789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891606442036918, "text": "* Smiles in Dutch*", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:03:13", "owner": "arendinho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033259595365728, "text": "Landmass everywhere \n\nHong kong:", "created_at": "2024-11-10T15:42:02", "owner": "o_simpson77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884083423152006, "text": "Is that the one that started to sink", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:18:52", "owner": "adameseliot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861748894268274, "text": "Mexico could not build an airport on a dry lake", "created_at": "2024-11-10T10:33:46", "owner": "raul__69__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049640275954738, "text": "And u wonder why sea levels are rising", "created_at": "2024-11-09T15:43:08", "owner": "markduxberry.md", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905592502060624, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-07T09:57:42", "owner": "j_rana8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897768316093937, "text": "Others are vanished", "created_at": "2024-11-06T20:46:03", "owner": "larryfrankartist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331475968145206, "text": "Hong Kong", "created_at": "2024-11-06T20:45:51", "owner": "larryfrankartist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846004483326940, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-06T13:05:17", "owner": "alexmaeland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126709471379561, "text": "I was stationed in Hong Kong at the end of  1995 and we always landed at Kai Tak it really was scary at the beginning but you got used to it watching the people read their newspaper in their homes while you landed 🛬😀🙃😉", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:20:11", "owner": "santa_monica_1956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859532917275100, "text": "I saw fried rice do that as well… 🤓😜", "created_at": "2024-11-01T00:09:09", "owner": "liam.g6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049751048057075, "text": "Cool", "created_at": "2024-10-31T02:13:36", "owner": "david.hawks.581", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100251721457508, "text": "The Chinese love making island airports", "created_at": "2024-10-29T15:26:07", "owner": "christianhunterfec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012361340398212, "text": "If you have never landed at the old Hong Kong airport in a 747 you have not lived.  Quite the thrill.", "created_at": "2024-10-24T22:38:38", "owner": "vanillaswissalmond2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18283442071214604, "text": "Is this lantau island ?", "created_at": "2024-10-24T02:25:17", "owner": "garda.kitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050942314934184, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2024-10-22T23:51:21", "owner": "brucedunn61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923988705976946, "text": "Sat in this airport now and this pops up🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-22T14:16:32", "owner": "k8draper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048308206994158, "text": "Wow...look at the waters rise from global warming 😆", "created_at": "2024-10-22T00:03:25", "owner": "alexged2112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047727277949063, "text": "Imagine all the pollution this thing dumps into the ocean every second.", "created_at": "2024-10-21T23:45:30", "owner": "salvy35z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272441662219593, "text": "Nothing like building on sand ! Live and learn !", "created_at": "2024-10-20T16:23:57", "owner": "dpowers15", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17964090794683304, "text": "What about the seas rising 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:22:11", "owner": "jameswilt7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879454144160625, "text": "Super impressive but doesn't Japan have an airport like this that is sinking or dealing with rising ocean waters?", "created_at": "2024-10-17T22:39:56", "owner": "itzjezze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056312866799872, "text": "And they wonder why the water levels are raising 🙈", "created_at": "2024-10-17T13:46:00", "owner": "philly.jay79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040790068930994, "text": "Ricordo Hong Kong nei primi anni 70...........Tutto diverso....così come Bankok.\nNon torno più. \nHo nostalgia del passato........", "created_at": "2024-10-17T06:23:25", "owner": "gregory.efimovich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461624023029433, "text": "The most efficient airport in the world. Usually takes me 20 minutes from off the plane to get a cab. Especially the luggage collection is gold medal speed.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T03:53:43", "owner": "car_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025024868395968, "text": "How can u doo that all but i cant put a floating docked on a bucket without getting fined", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:52:41", "owner": "drfeelgoodcox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316495738087164, "text": "Maybe we should try this, it worked for us on Midway during WWII", "created_at": "2024-10-15T02:26:49", "owner": "rtsafcontent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006911012648256, "text": "This is amazing", "created_at": "2024-10-14T23:47:49", "owner": "norjaidir.majid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029612345366742, "text": "I wonder if it’s sinking like Tokyo’s.", "created_at": "2024-10-14T22:12:32", "owner": "swanieseagal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870667357200180, "text": "You don't want to be there in a strong quake", "created_at": "2024-10-14T16:19:13", "owner": "watusimxli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202766269291103, "text": "Probably all made with slave labour", "created_at": "2024-10-14T15:47:54", "owner": "yammyman1300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884587705109110, "text": "causing an impact on the coasts of other countries", "created_at": "2024-10-14T04:52:45", "owner": "aoffy_c2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976560234771279, "text": "I don’t know what I am talking about but wouldn’t it have been easier to flatten and build on the land beside it", "created_at": "2024-10-14T04:17:40", "owner": "matt_da_bat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044560430054522, "text": "It's wild that they built that island and it wasn't just land that was settled on. The engineer prowess they have is incredible", "created_at": "2024-10-13T12:38:06", "owner": "4eva_bizarro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983672454738255, "text": "Impresionante", "created_at": "2024-10-11T21:34:24", "owner": "jasielordunez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022996178230713, "text": "…last one, turn off the lights. Vibe is real 😔", "created_at": "2024-10-10T13:52:57", "owner": "ingipingikids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278230864171633, "text": "is this on water?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T12:48:19", "owner": "nur_can_translate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023521496411234, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-10T02:58:22", "owner": "srluxurybrand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883296493134354, "text": "And you wonder why the sea levels are rising", "created_at": "2024-10-09T22:25:15", "owner": "migztheuno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865745287164740, "text": "Look at how much the sea level rose 😱 😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-09T22:09:31", "owner": "tmoneywi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989398800566767, "text": "- Seems like severely limited road access for an international airport.", "created_at": "2024-10-09T00:13:56", "owner": "kevinbrownart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286709224236005, "text": "Did they solve the sinking problem yet?", "created_at": "2024-10-08T23:03:12", "owner": "chris.nunez.9862", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903772300044158, "text": "Why did they ever build it knowing hongkong was going back to China,, 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-10-08T16:53:59", "owner": "graybags._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466813255062420, "text": "@brunobelotti", "created_at": "2024-10-08T05:40:11", "owner": "naomiearly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882111811067305, "text": "I think I know why the oceans are rising now!", "created_at": "2024-10-08T02:12:37", "owner": "b0ttle_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895872193075523, "text": "No rise in the sea levels?", "created_at": "2024-10-07T00:35:43", "owner": "oldoak2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055367671828698, "text": "Yet global warming is real…", "created_at": "2024-10-07T00:12:12", "owner": "brentwatson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038093939142755, "text": "And not an inch of shoreline lost , poor libs are gonna be upset", "created_at": "2024-10-06T21:18:29", "owner": "high_hand_dan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072851977598533, "text": "I work here", "created_at": "2024-10-06T21:17:34", "owner": "v6kompressor354", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096089428461876, "text": "Best things to happen under British control", "created_at": "2024-10-06T21:15:59", "owner": "nfedor09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018045431306604, "text": "This would take my country like 70 years but its small so its logical", "created_at": "2024-10-04T12:53:05", "owner": "r_myshoota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039492790933832, "text": "之前邊啲人極力反對起三跑？？？", "created_at": "2024-10-03T00:41:41", "owner": "victorvictoree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038037434133927, "text": "Bring back Kai Tak button ------------------->", "created_at": "2024-10-03T00:36:57", "owner": "m_li_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025128035153792, "text": "That is fast.", "created_at": "2024-10-02T02:58:03", "owner": "augustus_the_great_gus_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340180210124750, "text": "I just landed there a month ago", "created_at": "2024-10-01T14:12:52", "owner": "muffin.guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050529613909588, "text": "Fxxking noisy for the living area across the channel", "created_at": "2024-10-01T06:54:24", "owner": "ympoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982940643604005, "text": "Sedimentasi buat bikin beginian bukan, pak? Mohon petunjuk @jokowi", "created_at": "2024-10-01T00:02:38", "owner": "striniputri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927035112840518, "text": "This is why I’m boycotting Hongkong 🇭🇰", "created_at": "2024-09-30T05:00:07", "owner": "marwnova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021576692219563, "text": "The town of Tung Chung to the left where I get my name from😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T13:09:42", "owner": "tungchunger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117079786401344, "text": "Inthink that is japan and that airport is having problems staying afloat", "created_at": "2024-09-27T17:16:46", "owner": "littlej1982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313030963084473, "text": "原來是從一座小島慢慢擴建而來", "created_at": "2024-09-27T11:31:19", "owner": "echo.19.80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061991686723362, "text": "it needed 34 years to build? 😂😂😂😂 LOL :D", "created_at": "2024-09-26T14:38:49", "owner": "felix_weisz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902449893962220, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️😘😘😘", "created_at": "2024-09-26T12:39:58", "owner": "stephen_yeung15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058172116694535, "text": "And now they’re putting this great land growing technology to use all over the South China Sea, and making false territory claims to go along with it!", "created_at": "2024-09-26T11:00:45", "owner": "geee.em61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946769367850757, "text": "Concrete", "created_at": "2024-09-26T08:07:27", "owner": "benja808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037603640321218, "text": "Isn’t this the one sinking?", "created_at": "2024-09-25T20:38:46", "owner": "zackscriven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925756128959113, "text": "Chinese airports make US airports look like NYC’s subway stations", "created_at": "2024-09-24T18:43:39", "owner": "michael.c.martino.7", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17862383382232835, "text": "Actually it was the bristish and my dad was the person who designed and arranged the land ( via dredging and building the island ) along with they bought all the heavy machinery and sold it to the Chinese after used !  He did get the job in a girlie bar in Hong Kong !", "created_at": "2024-09-23T15:00:37", "owner": "theembroiderysubbox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104380399436520, "text": "Aeroportul Internațional din Hong Kong 🇭🇰 https://g.co/kgs/AE8c2Bh Aeroportul Internațional din Hong Kong\n+852 2181 8888", "created_at": "2024-09-23T11:12:18", "owner": "kuky0077", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042377843072477, "text": "There’s a mountain on the left when you land that looks like a boob 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:07:32", "owner": "pewzapdie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100044400450588, "text": "Why does it look similar to tokyo narita?", "created_at": "2024-09-22T05:20:06", "owner": "sibi_hnd_spotter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056319100796015, "text": "San Diego AirPort needs this fr", "created_at": "2024-09-22T04:45:49", "owner": "sriram_sr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965112954666026, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-21T06:20:54", "owner": "jadejastar_31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021272159206217, "text": "Hong Kong always looks good", "created_at": "2024-09-20T09:01:15", "owner": "a.chu._14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872428240176164, "text": "😍 @foodlifeandem", "created_at": "2024-09-19T22:19:58", "owner": "raj_ckb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918263034978455, "text": "Enter erosion", "created_at": "2024-09-19T21:45:57", "owner": "jackanderson3280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109948357416130, "text": "Y nosotros cancelamos. Uno porque estaba en un lago seco 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T03:25:17", "owner": "juanalbertolazos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923109402966442, "text": "Practice for the south China Sea.", "created_at": "2024-09-19T02:30:33", "owner": "dougcooper57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329583184183197, "text": "I remember Kowloon airport on the water!", "created_at": "2024-09-18T20:16:58", "owner": "skipmac1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074383273552432, "text": "🫡🫡🫡", "created_at": "2024-09-18T12:39:53", "owner": "jonthenewman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856557514254891, "text": "Where?", "created_at": "2024-09-17T20:58:46", "owner": "clarknoe00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990219348535241, "text": "Very safe from tsunami", "created_at": "2024-09-17T17:15:04", "owner": "wwwshelton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070490854526111, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-17T15:41:36", "owner": "germangl99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134052436362470, "text": "Hong Kong international airport 🇭🇰 Commenced 1998", "created_at": "2024-09-17T11:34:36", "owner": "iamhws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080486860518539, "text": "Hong Kong is over.\nSo it’s waste of money.", "created_at": "2024-09-16T16:02:31", "owner": "sin.kawa1234", "likes": 4}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3336703385712690766, "shortcode": "C5OWgz6P4ZO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C5OWgz6P4ZO/", "taken_at": "2024-04-01T15:41:36", "caption": "我可是很多人要的，你耗子尾汁🙃", "owner_username": "billionplus_lab", "owner_id": "4156159720", "likes": 37293, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0090_C5OWgz6P4ZO\\C5OWgz6P4ZO_20240401_154136.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17992429721701247, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-27T06:59:17", "owner": "adam.liu17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421594573076956, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-25T11:05:13", "owner": "dg88997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077931154534221, "text": "很多生物爭著要😂", "created_at": "2024-09-25T06:26:07", "owner": "zhiyu385", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902582713025646, "text": "@arc_phoenix1023", "created_at": "2024-09-25T00:59:39", "owner": "kevin_980312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880652581134131, "text": "怎麼美的女人、你不要我要。", "created_at": "2024-09-23T16:42:21", "owner": "weibashijiande", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048306484906711, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T15:42:50", "owner": "clue72201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022040891402309, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T03:00:24", "owner": "yuan6_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027828188353673, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-09-20T22:51:46", "owner": "hennu01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021501821198831, "text": "你播的這些藥！\n我通通都不需要🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-18T05:00:20", "owner": "lucky528899", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072831661505543, "text": "就算沒人要，氣勢不能輸💪蟑螂🪳要、螞蟻🐜要、跳蚤要⋯⋯⋯就是沒人要😮😮", "created_at": "2024-09-18T03:05:59", "owner": "a0978121638", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248281804256548, "text": "有梗", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:31:07", "owner": "fuuzu527381", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146483443330719, "text": "除了人外，其他的都要呀，很不錯嘛", "created_at": "2024-09-17T08:55:35", "owner": "maijoseph888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942051738856579, "text": "大叔😏", "created_at": "2024-09-14T17:15:33", "owner": "brian.j.qi", "likes": 0}, {"id":