{"media_id": 3421964446942496689, "shortcode": "C99Qoi-Bgex", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C99Qoi-Bgex/", "taken_at": "2024-07-28T07:00:33", "caption": "Ok 是有點強硬 但我只是想認識你呢\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------\n多謝你支持香港心理輔導文化\n如果鐘意的話記得要留言，like 同 share去 story\n如你有心理輔導服務的需要，歡迎隨時dm聯絡\n讓我們一同建立一個認識和接納自己的空間，與你一同探索自己的本質以及生命中的可能性\n#輔導 #諮商 #心理師 #輔導員 #心理輔導 #心理 #心理治療 #心理健康 #精神健康 #mentalhealth #counselling #counsellor #psychology #psychotherapy #兩性關係 #關係 #relationship #愛 #人生 #自信 #挑戰 #困難 #失戀 #家庭 #認識自我 #個人成長 #靈性成長#情緒 #感受", "owner_username": "devil_counsellor", "owner_id": "53360684307", "likes": 153305, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0091_C99Qoi-Bgex\\C99Qoi-Bgex_20240728_070033.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17961281387714724, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T12:42:01", "owner": "tamyungkee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950692815858423, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T06:38:39", "owner": "bbctrac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368494486186723, "text": "太可怕了，裡面的人可能已經逃走了", "created_at": "2024-11-28T10:05:57", "owner": "joannachiuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989649300599255, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T14:42:29", "owner": "rosaa0326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909421759049816, "text": "@yuntiann_ 很像你在外面开导我哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-11-25T05:44:44", "owner": "beiyunnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066147700662467, "text": "有時候真的就是.....打個招呼，做個朋友而已", "created_at": "2024-11-09T01:56:46", "owner": "randy926005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047264011864176, "text": "他說：😐🤚", "created_at": "2024-11-04T05:26:56", "owner": "rogueliker__987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923144157882138, "text": "FBI", "created_at": "2024-11-04T04:14:43", "owner": "samsam_hedera_helix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079889641557722, "text": "有種隱私權被性侵的感覺：）", "created_at": "2024-10-31T11:28:42", "owner": "meeestery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056269546714062, "text": "😍😢", "created_at": "2024-10-27T17:55:23", "owner": "dovewk23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080585362542867, "text": "bro was like：🫤🤚", "created_at": "2024-10-25T03:17:09", "owner": "tonguseiyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088129819504456, "text": "嚇到大便都縮回去了😂", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:30:04", "owner": "shincatimayday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054115903731335, "text": "真的假的😮希望以後我有機會遇到E人朋友😂", "created_at": "2024-10-24T09:38:45", "owner": "silver._.wing0216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006255440653765, "text": "笑死我", "created_at": "2024-10-22T15:49:23", "owner": "12c.iii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18467168329007175, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T04:23:09", "owner": "lyeu27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024199100453530, "text": "真的不用這樣沒關西", "created_at": "2024-10-15T02:32:41", "owner": "dragon_wow_game", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182120830307687, "text": "@doreenliuu", "created_at": "2024-10-14T14:35:10", "owner": "jfangfang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892178581018205, "text": "@fang__0603 我沒有", "created_at": "2024-10-11T13:46:41", "owner": "abby880416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017662454316220, "text": "@kevin__tsao__bo 出國你自己 小心一點", "created_at": "2024-10-07T20:50:24", "owner": "0529_tony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018622751624173, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-07T10:23:05", "owner": "elio.9991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901329082057434, "text": "Bro said : ✋ 👀 🚽 😐", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:37:35", "owner": "sophie_fuck_israel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915126519991402, "text": "在裡面看 很像恐怖片吧…", "created_at": "2024-10-05T15:09:22", "owner": "lostinkinmen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011498573623249, "text": "這些室友很兇猛😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T21:00:31", "owner": "lifeisjustlikeadream", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282069574213818, "text": "@_karena.wany_", "created_at": "2024-10-01T09:51:34", "owner": "yg0uu8pqp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918828939888606, "text": "這應該是很多人的媽媽", "created_at": "2024-09-29T18:37:35", "owner": "darcyyy_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064499815567522, "text": "@candy040803", "created_at": "2024-09-22T03:02:47", "owner": "__dw__0410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332897392176394, "text": "@stellachiang_04 我：", "created_at": "2024-09-19T12:21:59", "owner": "shyen_lim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18253863175271030, "text": "😂😂你是在拉屎吗？😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T18:30:16", "owner": "anok_3621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001645289653019, "text": "我也想有个这样大大咧咧的朋友，感觉很有意思😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T15:18:49", "owner": "nanbang2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040565591092504, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-18T06:32:14", "owner": "yingyingying_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880962139133307, "text": "@a23540361", "created_at": "2024-09-18T04:27:41", "owner": "jy_.agnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088998157490740, "text": "E人打开I人的局面 学着点... 🤏", "created_at": "2024-09-17T16:19:41", "owner": "puiyee_yy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031036142262287, "text": "我也會嚇到😟", "created_at": "2024-09-16T12:56:03", "owner": "yoyo._.5a_0116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885223735102242, "text": "@yoke.thong_hui", "created_at": "2024-09-16T05:45:07", "owner": "zim58910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972334695633234, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-16T02:36:55", "owner": "mbb___c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322930651197593, "text": "社恐？ 抱歉我們是社交恐怖份子✌🏻", "created_at": "2024-09-14T07:38:11", "owner": "chloeglow.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020212847216136, "text": "讓我想到我同學午休上廁所 我們一群就偷偷去廁所用一塊錢開門", "created_at": "2024-09-13T16:12:17", "owner": "vjr_my_0487", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973630122758724, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。是在幹嘛啦", "created_at": "2024-09-13T15:17:00", "owner": "joy19897028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034570027987129, "text": "看他這麼淡定，肯定不是第一次了😂", "created_at": "2024-09-13T12:55:13", "owner": "su_yen_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005701619450658, "text": "👋", "created_at": "2024-09-12T18:47:42", "owner": "kaaaii_111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084615751498191, "text": "你這樣子鋸我，在你還沒進入我的內心，我已經死啦", "created_at": "2024-09-12T13:48:23", "owner": "cam_ma_wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024218939133444, "text": "他很淡定欸😂", "created_at": "2024-09-11T10:50:16", "owner": "cwx_.iye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013840856322757, "text": "求I人陰影", "created_at": "2024-09-11T04:28:40", "owner": "haozh00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966676752790648, "text": "馬的  大個便也有事😮‍💨🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-09-11T04:23:17", "owner": "a2212492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019759403228726, "text": "@bei_i_ 我想認識妳", "created_at": "2024-09-10T16:24:05", "owner": "eee_._nnn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860332186183132, "text": "凌晨三點欸你們", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:50:39", "owner": "harunohi223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355657906119257, "text": "兄弟在用原理力阻止一切", "created_at": "2024-09-10T09:33:24", "owner": "chiao._.huey_314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282096736231990, "text": "@schester_39", "created_at": "2024-09-09T06:14:21", "owner": "cipher_04_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039158471040155, "text": "@19.yi._.yyes 我已經順利進入了", "created_at": "2024-09-08T06:20:58", "owner": "jeongyu_.ww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019775930429628, "text": "這是不是表示其實打開I人內心其實用對方法就很簡單 只是你用錯了方法 令事情變得困難了", "created_at": "2024-09-08T05:45:44", "owner": "morefunhk", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18120230878390667, "text": "😐🤚", "created_at": "2024-09-07T11:49:31", "owner": "zhlin.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940841589886338, "text": "āaaaaaaaa", "created_at": "2024-09-06T08:56:16", "owner": "freda5201314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034860491145278, "text": "然後發現對面是不銹鋼門", "created_at": "2024-09-04T18:49:44", "owner": "minipotatovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896039463982823, "text": "@5he3n_ 🤓🫰", "created_at": "2024-09-03T16:30:40", "owner": "josh.ua08_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047716702925435, "text": "@xvxy_v 就是你", "created_at": "2024-09-03T10:47:49", "owner": "jovannnn_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035478011144077, "text": "我是I人，還好我沒朋友...", "created_at": "2024-09-02T14:18:44", "owner": "salt_nacl.0628", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863123833213583, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-01T05:31:36", "owner": "wiilsam080899_qq123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145864489334158, "text": "@kairen0309  @yangyijun77 開門開門~~", "created_at": "2024-08-31T11:39:13", "owner": "jerrytseng_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091697110427257, "text": "先不要🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-31T01:43:01", "owner": "timgjia_xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065833132541058, "text": "Wow wow wow 我會笑死哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈看看他已經習慣成這樣了😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-30T12:57:27", "owner": "yu.xuan0406", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17856153828201186, "text": "@wei.0318 @noname0225 @athena.913", "created_at": "2024-08-30T07:10:00", "owner": "t_y_926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027019058209856, "text": "Bro said 🤚", "created_at": "2024-08-12T22:55:21", "owner": "ruole_yi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147045013323152, "text": "這……有點尷尬😂", "created_at": "2024-08-12T22:09:53", "owner": "tooth_0917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875992018071871, "text": "@joannnnne__loh", "created_at": "2024-08-12T17:02:29", "owner": "evonnnnn.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052680853744433, "text": "有沒有可能應該鋸門鎖不然卡在那挺尷尬的吧", "created_at": "2024-08-12T16:04:52", "owner": "ggioi.20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966511398777540, "text": "😂😂這會嚇到嗯不出來", "created_at": "2024-08-12T12:27:29", "owner": "maplesugar_0824", "likes": 79}, {"id": 17940277670761226, "text": "Fbi", "created_at": "2024-08-12T11:35:25", "owner": "shaoshuai0716", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005099672388407, "text": "Hi,FBI", "created_at": "2024-08-12T07:19:24", "owner": "capitalist_jason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987092097701829, "text": "你要不要吃哈密哈，你不回我的話我就拿電鋸來嘍", "created_at": "2024-08-12T07:02:09", "owner": "dn12_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857492284181061, "text": "@jcc2097", "created_at": "2024-08-12T05:13:21", "owner": "nextstill_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18448497496000566, "text": "🤓🤚🏻", "created_at": "2024-08-12T04:31:43", "owner": "naruto_takilor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136562503342767, "text": "Here's Johnny !!!", "created_at": "2024-08-12T03:11:25", "owner": "yc_yang_gaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027296264220341, "text": "求I人陰影", "created_at": "2024-08-11T18:04:25", "owner": "yw_317", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929412252808468, "text": "好....好可怕", "created_at": "2024-08-11T17:31:57", "owner": "kwchau_1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035135285122833, "text": "最後那個人處決了自己", "created_at": "2024-08-11T16:57:00", "owner": "k_artorius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038298689288628, "text": "好真實", "created_at": "2024-08-11T12:44:57", "owner": "yiy2523", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872411242149309, "text": "突然想到怪獸電力公司把門銷毀的畫面", "created_at": "2024-08-11T12:40:27", "owner": "shiwei1303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151276024322191, "text": "i人只是不知道該說什麼，而不是不想交友", "created_at": "2024-08-11T09:15:18", "owner": "hannah_chang1106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951522747819034, "text": "@jyta.0202", "created_at": "2024-08-11T04:32:43", "owner": "asd12310300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939422073767021, "text": "沒那麼誇張吧😅", "created_at": "2024-08-11T03:28:47", "owner": "s0twinkle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030496379269025, "text": "以為是房間結果是廁所😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-11T02:37:48", "owner": "tang_sia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047844700842318, "text": "他不是故意不開門的😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-11T01:23:26", "owner": "lizzie_111od", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18450868858024792, "text": "那個坐在馬桶上企圖阻止的手✋", "created_at": "2024-08-10T14:04:46", "owner": "jiangchenshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311248222086436, "text": "其實應該沒那麼容易，I人被逼急了也是會動拳的(溝通障礙，動拳最快👊", "created_at": "2024-08-10T13:50:57", "owner": "zhenyi1259", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033728722924521, "text": "：媽德發克要不要吃哈密瓜啦幹", "created_at": "2024-08-10T12:24:41", "owner": "john0135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048325954717021, "text": "😐✋", "created_at": "2024-08-09T10:05:44", "owner": "tankai.xian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021723242460176, "text": "@a56465824268", "created_at": "2024-08-09T06:53:44", "owner": "hsiao_1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078575731510973, "text": "人家是瓜哥是魚躍龍門 他是想硬闖ㄍㄤ門😍", "created_at": "2024-08-09T06:38:49", "owner": "yun_4._.1_", "likes": 41}, {"id": 17953052849813188, "text": "e人朋友恐怖如斯", "created_at": "2024-08-09T03:53:22", "owner": "moriecho.0408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348203359191160, "text": "😐👋🏽", "created_at": "2024-08-09T01:33:23", "owner": "chennnx2.11o8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040776376835001, "text": "Nooo pls", "created_at": "2024-08-08T13:57:24", "owner": "tongiiie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995801424503516, "text": "@teng_siannn", "created_at": "2024-08-08T13:37:30", "owner": "heiheinicaiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094941829447215, "text": "我在裡面應該直接大不出來了😂", "created_at": "2024-08-08T13:16:10", "owner": "1798story", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898458334037237, "text": "那個人在上廁所(⁎⁍̴̛ᴗ⁍̴̛⁎)", "created_at": "2024-08-08T11:26:55", "owner": "2011._.yun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876633403108581, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈 淦後勁好強", "created_at": "2024-08-08T09:30:50", "owner": "lit916916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014846696248980, "text": "夭壽喔😂", "created_at": "2024-08-08T06:49:12", "owner": "lian_0117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063501394612365, "text": "大便中😂", "created_at": "2024-08-08T05:38:09", "owner": "kevinwangkuku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363398956108814, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-08T04:10:58", "owner": "shi.b.zhong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097558744441368, "text": "大便錯了嗎？😂", "created_at": "2024-08-08T03:54:29", "owner": "w0918970929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875832979129799, "text": "真的讓人感到驚悚😌", "created_at": "2024-08-08T03:23:38", "owner": "wr30309", "likes": 6}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["輔導", "諮商", "心理師", "輔導員", "心理輔導", "心理", "心理治療", "心理健康", "精神健康", "mentalhealth", "counselling", "counsellor", "psychology", "psychotherapy", "兩性關係", "關係", "relationship", "愛", "人生", "自信", "挑戰", "困難", "失戀", "家庭", "認識自我", "個人成長", "靈性成長", "情緒", "感受"]},
