ted_at": "2025-01-22T11:36:28", "owner": "redstratocaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965649141836706, "text": "ﾀｽ...ｹﾃ...", "created_at": "2025-01-22T08:30:27", "owner": "nora0rara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095139742509436, "text": "Seeing this after one human posted playing with this poor puffer fish. 😅😆", "created_at": "2025-01-18T22:22:41", "owner": "cams_1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872283808185306, "text": "They're so aksksksk😭", "created_at": "2025-01-18T14:10:47", "owner": "blueberriiiieess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057724390804894, "text": "This game is waow :)", "created_at": "2025-01-18T09:35:18", "owner": "goal14.life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012383510679989, "text": "underwater diddy party", "created_at": "2025-01-17T21:23:40", "owner": "lasse.b3820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943213362941490, "text": "Atenti, que se infló el pez globo!! 🤔🤦👎🥴💔❌", "created_at": "2025-01-16T18:17:27", "owner": "monicabp2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962746356730623, "text": "Footballs 😍", "created_at": "2025-01-15T07:13:20", "owner": "ha.sharifzadeh2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068341555784945, "text": "فوتبال", "created_at": "2025-01-15T07:13:12", "owner": "ha.sharifzadeh2024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947512308927444, "text": "@emily_3_1_6 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-14T20:10:08", "owner": "mollytraylenwitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028207655294900, "text": "Kafası nasıl?", "created_at": "2025-01-14T17:44:46", "owner": "berke_sen1963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034097786181225, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-14T16:12:42", "owner": "08_perseus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882018349212640, "text": "Pufferfish produce a potent neurotoxin called tetrodotoxin, which can be lethal in high doses but, in small amounts, can have psychoactive effects. Dolphins intentionally interacting with pufferfish to experience these effects, almost like a \"high.\" 🐬🐡 🦦( The otter is casting a judgmental look.)", "created_at": "2025-01-14T14:46:27", "owner": "ocean.the.majesty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045603122227670, "text": "Water polo with a toxic, squishy ball. 🤽🏻‍♂️🤽🏻‍♀️🐬🐡😁 (The toxin actually gets the dolphins high—they love it. But the poor little fella will probably die from stress. 😢)", "created_at": "2025-01-14T14:42:04", "owner": "ocean.the.majesty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021392291374822, "text": "🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-01-13T06:15:35", "owner": "erinjeanneolsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844390846395907, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-13T03:50:51", "owner": "baswasalamin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033336323417504, "text": "Όπως και να έχει το καίμενω 😢 είναι πολύ όμορφο.και δεν μου φενετε να το διασκεδάζει 🥹", "created_at": "2025-01-12T23:43:23", "owner": "frances_xeplath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011967929651023, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-12T17:44:16", "owner": "bgirl_ainalem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057048490812354, "text": "遊ばれてるw w w", "created_at": "2025-01-11T16:26:10", "owner": "kawaii__115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087790963528195, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-10T15:33:11", "owner": "fetullah_demir13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043037318211517, "text": "Football dolphin version", "created_at": "2025-01-10T08:10:47", "owner": "aemcpp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295101442239891, "text": "😆😆😆😆😆😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-10T04:48:46", "owner": "buaphan09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070995745737260, "text": "Let's play ball. GOAL!!", "created_at": "2025-01-10T03:09:50", "owner": "leimnidepeche", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18326076592092069, "text": "بيلعبو طايرة", "created_at": "2025-01-09T18:07:06", "owner": "c.1i.1i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033226655580300, "text": "These  are not dolphins these are Drugfins😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-09T15:33:23", "owner": "rick.drakon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083315221576408, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-09T12:05:34", "owner": "akshaymestry8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107059903460614, "text": "Leo dolphin", "created_at": "2025-01-09T09:16:45", "owner": "murabayram11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063227101807631, "text":