, "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014394581553112, "text": "I want to blow my brains out more than anything else in the world", "created_at": "2024-09-18T20:04:33", "owner": "philip_karwinski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049515214919814, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-18T18:09:39", "owner": "bernarduscollege", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017451014286560, "text": "NAH THIS WAS PEAK", "created_at": "2024-09-18T02:40:15", "owner": "mekayla.whaley", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17925997565949988, "text": "thought that said we’re hiring a baby for a sec", "created_at": "2024-09-18T01:19:32", "owner": "yousra.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325614667145063, "text": "I'd like to purchase 10 Babis please", "created_at": "2024-09-17T23:52:25", "owner": "akira__026", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18030929357198609, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2024-09-17T20:14:05", "owner": "beavertails_3", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18037453789937877, "text": "She flipped it so perfectly", "created_at": "2024-09-16T19:09:21", "owner": "remi.macrae", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18066893614717335, "text": "Plot twist they are actually together and are going to have twins", "created_at": "2024-09-16T18:12:16", "owner": "prespres_and_mamamia", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17857836231201504, "text": "Omgee so cutee 🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-16T09:45:58", "owner": "liyaizz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17994413225693135, "text": "MARA!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-16T01:32:54", "owner": "gi.squires", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17890210728013895, "text": "Uhhhhh there’s something they ain’t telling us about", "created_at": "2024-09-15T18:23:46", "owner": "shilohbuckman", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18020278952441602, "text": "Amazing 😍", "created_at": "2024-09-15T13:06:48", "owner": "_chloe.miller_13", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18036213635144717, "text": "Congratulations 👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-15T03:58:33", "owner": "scottyjacqcuestravis23_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036102788139318, "text": "The way she flipped that was so satisfying", "created_at": "2024-09-14T22:56:24", "owner": "y