18039365860891508, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-06T01:03:17", "owner": "linsuling1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080354023511607, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-05T06:37:33", "owner": "lisaleesp8389", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012430826330383, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T12:21:36", "owner": "yuqian4030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266015152216974, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-04T06:10:43", "owner": "oliv3ronique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021775304387124, "text": "我快笑死", "created_at": "2024-09-03T06:38:33", "owner": "j.ynacccc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870471214175110, "text": "想刀一個人的眼神是藏不住的", "created_at": "2024-09-01T08:47:12", "owner": "eva_tain_0727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083781727500452, "text": "牠們各自對自己的實力都有誤解", "created_at": "2024-09-01T08:40:26", "owner": "jinzhe314", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18265366291222178, "text": "他一定常常被這樣精神壓迫叫爸爸，現在洩憤叫別人叫他拔拔😔", "created_at": "2024-09-01T06:21:27", "owner": "i_ihavenothing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039420692100724, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-08-31T16:36:48", "owner": "yimi0728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993282234691869, "text": "貓： 你哪裡壞掉？", "created_at": "2024-08-31T15:03:30", "owner": "pan.huijuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861878104165623, "text": "@mts_.666", "created_at": "2024-08-31T10:05:22", "owner": "chiiu.zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073872496553726, "text": "这只鸟是在模仿某种类视频里的人类😌", "created_at": "2024-08-31T09:12:04", "owner": "pingupingi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070385455515998, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-31T04:08:47", "owner": "sofia.02.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991150572527271, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-30T23:55:44", "owner": "dengqinwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054288763753242, "text": "猫：你最好别飞 不然我就爪你下来😾", "created_at": "2024-08-30T16:15:43", "owner": "yihuili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026593523517605, "text": "想刀鳥的眼神藏不住", "created_at": "2024-08-30T15:46:15", "owner": "atien_0813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020847827521821, "text": "@yutienlin.s 我覺得你像那隻貓😂", "created_at": "2024-08-30T07:36:11", "owner": "lunivers_06539", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873198823155462, "text": "貓：清燉 燒烤 滷燉….還是直接沙西米 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-30T02:40:07", "owner": "cloud_weep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027514295059487, "text": "😂😂😂🦜🦜🦜😸", "created_at": "2024-08-29T13:46:14", "owner": "chanlinghengaheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938020713779154, "text": "笑死", "created_at": "2024-08-29T12:49:18", "owner": "c.c___chrile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073154101492719, "text": "工作上遇到討厭的同事還坐你隔壁，然後職位還略高一點點（幾乎可以無視）的那種。", "created_at": "2024-08-29T12:16:37", "owner": "mineral_meet.stone_tw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062958250721757, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-29T06:16:38", "owner": "1105.peach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055014937843204, "text": "要不是缅因估计鸟就没了😂", "created_at": "2024-08-29T04:18:21", "owner": "dhxhsjdjxjss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014758568611096, "text": "有點太挑戰喵喵的脾氣😮 是感情好 還是情勒呢😂 看喵喵表情 好像明白什麼", "created_at": "2024-08-29T02:41:21", "owner": "raiein79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010296152339447, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-28T14:23:09", "owner": "itstze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941507025853737, "text": "貓：看在頭上長錄影機的老子先放你一馬", "created_at": "2024-08-28T08:07:37", "owner": "nuzyy._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973197867756645, "text": "度丟笑ㄟ", "created_at": "2024-08-28T04:36:56", "owner": "_syy____.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033693137276037, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-28T04:36:15", "owner": "_syy____.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068491234596999, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-28T02:26:35", "owner": "trentrainingtrend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196988851294435, "text": "是不是像你们的男朋友", "created_at": "2024-08-27T20:23:58", "owner": "cwh758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350850922186484, "text": "哪來的斗膽", "created_at": "2024-08-27T15:50:59", "owner": "ffffffan__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18311304400086437, "text": "🐱爸到我胃裡 睡一下吧。", "created_at": "2024-08-27T10:33:39", "owner": "paul193214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028487801251208, "text": "晚上鳥就莫名其妙的不見去了 😂", "created_at": "2024-08-26T14:44:26", "owner": "littleloulm04", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17897373687051530, "text": "@t10138w 叫爸爸😂", "created_at": "2024-08-25T12:54:15", "owner": "without_xvx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124255960375510, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-24T12:31:44", "owner": "ma_rk2962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291602563203495, "text": "Birb trying to do a I’m Your Daddy 😅", "created_at": "2024-08-24T11:05:19", "owner": "asturiasrosetteregalia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973176678759139, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-24T02:55:52", "owner": "en.k2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073664044548929, "text": "猫拿出了手机开始刷\n内容：这道菜你家里的小孩肯定爱吃。鹦鹉去皮洗净后放入料酒，葱，少许白醋……😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-08-23T15:49:17", "owner": "stranger_xh_0220", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18077945797518973, "text": "貼臉開大", "created_at": "2024-08-23T09:05:26", "owner": "lucifer_1117_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072973435493166, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-22T21:52:13", "owner": "nationaltaim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894486256061604, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-22T08:27:24", "owner": "ciel4943", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031152182005563, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-22T07:15:57", "owner": "liujaytw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048431209728481, "text": "這應該是家裡幼兒👶爸爸在教小朋友說話", "created_at": "2024-08-22T04:39:32", "owner": "b0982263558", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049311004881884, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-21T15:52:15", "owner": "ogawa_tintin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067370233580392, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-21T15:03:15", "owner": "tingtingxie15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849901867242557, "text": "😂貓咪真慘", "created_at": "2024-08-21T11:19:39", "owner": "kitty_kam_kam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060342316643950, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-08-21T07:34:29", "owner": "karakara4146", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022793441459992, "text": "好似爛仔😂", "created_at": "2024-08-21T03:31:12", "owner": "chloecollegeart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18452220076024383, "text": "😂😂😂😂 叫爸爸，爸爸 哈哈哈哈 😂😂 ，这只猫受够了鹦鹉的烦恼😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-21T02:01:56", "owner": "dr_tazzdandadda", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17876616405112245, "text": "無情嘲諷", "created_at": "2024-08-20T03:44:21", "owner": "ray_hung_10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049290496857456, "text": "叫你媽", "created_at": "2024-08-19T13:45:38", "owner": "ying.ling_ivy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18056536600674510, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-18T15:42:49", "owner": "ong.brenda.56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866881177187247, "text": "G8🦜😂", "created_at": "2024-08-18T14:10:20", "owner": "errorlyc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289452112204225, "text": "知道為什麼影片這麼短嗎？", "created_at": "2024-08-17T13:32:51", "owner": "wanwan.6866", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18064768600611500, "text": "😂😂😂🦜", "created_at": "2024-08-17T06:35:17", "owner": "winnie.lo.359", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052956061813805, "text": "@chuan_322 9588", "created_at": "2024-08-17T05:56:03", "owner": "angelazyouxx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040320538963970, "text": "@xavern.c 😂", "created_at": "2024-08-17T03:31:51", "owner": "koalatoenails", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049149616804320, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-17T03:22:21", "owner": "chenliqing71", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120748678347508, "text": "雖然鸚鵡只是模仿不懂意思，但真的很難相信", "created_at": "2024-08-17T00:52:20", "owner": "a88107s40230", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056371435709861, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-17T00:09:46", "owner": "landy_0629", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18346134325141427, "text": "@dgds88t", "created_at": "2024-08-16T14:58:10", "owner": "spipilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069583861503412, "text": "😂🤣🦜🐱🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-16T10:38:17", "owner": "noisy_my_luv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18415719679076160, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-08-15T15:55:21", "owner": "king58686", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037614077071972, "text": "@yuchiehhhhh 就算在哀居，你還是要給我叫爸爸", "created_at": "2024-08-15T14:57:21", "owner": "ychuang._.1224", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133654714317751, "text": "笑鼠🤣🦜有天會讓你小灰叫媽媽🐱", "created_at": "2024-08-15T09:46:29", "owner": "joechang2553", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18278591887233214, "text": "竟敢调戏喵星人😂", "created_at": "2024-08-14T13:34:41", "owner": "kaenhotoda", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18036106982489916, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-08-14T11:28:35", "owner": "waichi0613", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057552571660606, "text": "🐱牠還看了一眼鏡頭🤣感覺就在等拍完之後，處置那隻🦜", "created_at": "2024-08-14T10:55:53", "owner": "xml_0123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074693974480464, "text": "好可愛哦🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-14T10:49:27", "owner": "putrichipoet", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17935311002903275, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-08-14T10:46:34", "owner": "davidyun886", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013528220288049, "text": "@creamiiinjholic 笑死", "created_at": "2024-08-14T09:00:22", "owner": "jianjiancat", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3438613668533214386, "shortcode": "C-4aOm4uZyy", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-4aOm4uZyy/", "taken_at": "2024-08-20T06:19:16", "caption": "The plane 😭 Mercedes-Benz is known for its luxury, performance, and advanced technology. The 2024 lineup includes a variety of models, each catering to different preferences and needs:\n- **Mercedes-Benz S-Class**: The flagship sedan offers top-of-the-line luxury, with advanced driver assistance systems, a plush interior, and powerful engine options. It also includes the latest MBUX infotainment system with a large touchscreen and voice control.\n- **Mercedes-Benz E-Class**: The E-Class is a versatile model available in sedan, coupe, convertible, and wagon forms. It combines comfort, technology, and performance, making it a favorite among luxury car buyers.\n- **Mercedes-Benz GLE**: This mid-size SUV offers a blend of luxury and practicality. It features a spacious interior, advanced safety features, and a range of engine options, including a high-performance AMG variant.\n- **Mercedes-Benz C-Class**: The C-Class is a compact luxury sedan that offers a sporty driving experience, high-quality interior materials, and the latest tech features. #meme #memes #funny #plane #pilot", "owner_username": "i_somewhat_like_greek_yogurt", "owner_id": "63208699544", "likes": 517559, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0096_C-4aOm4uZyy\\C-4aOm4uZyy_20240820_061916.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18064086836362305, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-29T02:37:14", "owner": "woamanyb737max", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094537006639808, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-25T08:33:13", "owner": "woamanyb737max", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036697118346254, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T15:55:43", "owner": "karenliddiard243", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024516158503531, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-13T15:11:28", "owner": "bruuno_hnrq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122036425457492, "text":