{"media_id": 3434547779743714782, "shortcode": "C-p9wI3uw3e", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-p9wI3uw3e/", "taken_at": "2024-08-14T15:40:37", "caption": "烏魚子界的愛馬仕\n魚香涎琥珀烏金月餅禮盒熱賣中\nhttps://reurl.cc/QE9mx2", "owner_username": "jamesiscurlytoo", "owner_id": "50694566305", "likes": 37313, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0099_C-p9wI3uw3e\\C-p9wI3uw3e_20240814_154037.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18035319254337278, "text": "我好喜歡貓貓的表情喔😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T05:01:50", "owner": "artro324687", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062561965751062, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T15:23:59", "owner": "ever___changing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934772094810145, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-15T23:54:15", "owner": "ziwei_chen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461031742028826, "text": "貓：你有看到嗎？看到了吧？你不制止一下嗎？ 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-12T05:49:25", "owner": "leadpewdgd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024429176438711, "text": "貓咪“她再不冷靜下來，就別怪我不冷靜了”😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-09T14:45:04", "owner": "derrick_kit21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074053702512280, "text": "🐱：Serious?", "created_at": "2024-10-02T01:18:11", "owner": "mingze427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018383795540891, "text": "哇這首是我國小的愛歌耶😍終於找回失散的曲子了", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:58:30", "owner": "alex_yang26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037500830141756, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-27T07:16:56", "owner": "hung_10055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312983974086573, "text": "@_._.mccxxi 😡", "created_at": "2024-09-22T02:35:02", "owner": "ccvixxihh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023729312522990, "text": "我每天都這樣呦 😍", "created_at": "2024-09-21T13:36:01", "owner": "stacy6020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043896187974249, "text": "😾：欸乾拍攝者不救喔", "created_at": "2024-09-19T05:55:28", "owner": "wei4120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031267742248240, "text": "@yiu__ling", "created_at": "2024-09-13T16:36:29", "owner": "pgpgpang_xj9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937085646876099, "text": "貓貓表示：拍攝者還不快來制止", "created_at": "2024-09-11T11:36:40", "owner": "leolin777777777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102383674430932, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-11T10:50:48", "owner": "mt_43213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023124362159006, "text": "我怎麼會有這個媽媽？😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-11T00:35:23", "owner": "c23764120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037199183487270, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-10T13:19:44", "owner": "kayu.1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000309323663156, "text": "：？？？？", "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:45:31", "owner": "04.o3____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980665209725830, "text": "@___tzu1335_", "created_at": "2024-09-09T14:36:40", "owner": "hank79663", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282123031229779, "text": "女孩我能理解❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:17:01", "owner": "zhen1.103", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953136789714940, "text": "@trinityyy 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-09T13:12:33", "owner": "teona.mei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924290088846949, "text": "@ace.0610", "created_at": "2024-09-09T11:05:53", "owner": "mikichooi0206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039766754085711, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-07T16:05:49", "owner": "itscorrineee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868757602187535, "text": "@yuliyo1991 娃娃內心想法", "created_at": "2024-09-02T08:14:26", "owner": "cfusean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049931851848868, "text": "喵的表情😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-02T06:16:36", "owner": "__lin__yu__0411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064547782624135, "text": "你就這樣讓他虐貓？", "created_at": "2024-09-02T05:01:41", "owner": "yunjen_huang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18245027707261753, "text": "貓貓其實在用求助的眼神看你了！ 拍攝者不救🤪", "created_at": "2024-09-01T19:44:08", "owner": "painoso", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18197991469288827, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-08-28T03:05:01", "owner": "winpin929", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038453351082800, "text": "@xiaoo1998 就你😂", "created_at": "2024-08-17T02:09:07", "owner": "lbj991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936527175896371, "text": "🐱：你他媽拍攝者不救？", "created_at": "2024-08-17T00:17:06", "owner": "qq1236540", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18104651185424702, "text": "拍攝者不救？", "created_at": "2024-08-16T05:57:26", "owner": "esteriortw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085640359492313, "text": "@drinkparaquat", "created_at": "2024-08-15T11:54:43", "owner": "ba_wu588", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016722167589041, "text": "🐱：你不來救她嗎？", "created_at": "2024-08-15T07:52:45", "owner": "melodyyy0606", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17915360090881474, "text": "這根本我國小聽到這首歌第一個反應", "created_at": "2024-08-15T07:38:31", "owner": "ae.runes_ng", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18037789346045219, "text": "這我", "created_at": "2024-08-15T05:36:11", "owner": "benzhengmei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034511930169762, "text": "@0404vicky_lin 傻眼貓咪", "created_at": "2024-08-15T03:32:31", "owner": "ericchen4704", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965032119652045, "text": "You Belong With Me🫶❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-08-14T23:17:33", "owner": "viofrauen11", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17936730893887590, "text": "貓貓：衣櫃怎麼多了個人😮", "created_at": "2024-08-14T23:17:15", "owner": "fir52bt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089189008462586, "text": "@hannah.coach.cute 我就問", "created_at": "2024-08-14T16:53:55", "owner": "qqrou24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033695920939497, "text": "：你就只是看著什麼都不做嗎🥺", "created_at": "2024-08-14T16:49:46", "owner": "momay.199382", "likes": 406}, {"id": 18038925436864863, "text": "Tay讚啦😍 我發瘋跳Tay舞扭來扭去的時候我家貓也是一臉無言😍", "created_at": "2024-08-14T16:37:58", "owner": "niffler_0916", "likes": 120}, {"id": 18344459506188494, "text": "貓貓覺得無助", "created_at": "2024-08-14T16:22:18", "owner": "gfsa_fish", "likes": 231}, {"id": 18429629815067052, "text": "懷疑貓生 😹", "created_at": "2024-08-14T15:56:51", "owner": "winsonlitl", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18029034944215760, "text": "我聽Tay的歌發瘋的時候我妹也這樣看我。😂", "created_at": "2024-08-14T15:44:51", "owner": "huiyu_0216", "likes": 116}, {"id": 17936251358783465, "text": "不是抖音洗腦曲，而是泰勒絲音樂 這主人沒事的👍🏼", "created_at": "2024-08-14T15:41:53", "owner": "black_bryan_26", "likes": 825}, {"id": 18046131361839966, "text": "救我啊 還看 等等就換你了 奴隸😂", "created_at": "2024-10-06T11:56:11", "owner": "liu.andrew1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856009732264113, "text": "誰來救救身旁這個怪人🐱", "created_at": "2024-09-21T05:57:04", "owner": "lzy.812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034132766484146, "text": "😾我面前這位人類，你確定不來回收旁邊這個壞掉的人類嗎？", "created_at": "2024-08-23T12:25:53", "owner": "jamessaid974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156899356315681, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-08-16T02:20:53", "owner": "iloveeatyummydog", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3385884948021022903, "shortcode": "C79FGvJIpC3", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C79FGvJIpC3/", "taken_at": "2024-06-08T12:18:44", "caption": "the new “Pharmacie Ouverte” album sounds great, bro", "owner_username": "helen_boogzel", "owner_id": "2003647150", "likes": 238415, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0100_C79FGvJIpC3\\C79FGvJIpC3_20240608_121844.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18095334749492304, "text": "😄😄😄", "created_at": "2026-01-31T13:46:06", "owner": "hoplaben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864096280365429, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-04-01T20:02:02", "owner": "nostradamus_nostredame", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18039685685167291, "text": "Je suis sûr que tu trouves pareil à Berlin", "created_at": "2025-03-07T14:17:58", "owner": "flsml.walwein", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055067233903315, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-30T23:43:36", "owner": "m.frolov2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077633380574265, "text": "🕺🕺🕺🕺🗣🗣🗣 PHARMACIE 🗣🕺🕺🕺🗣💊💊 18h43 🗣💊🕺🗣🕺💊🗣 21°C 🗣💊🕺💊🗣🕺LUNDI 25/11/24 🕺🗣💊", "created_at": "2024-11-25T08:44:01", "owner": "thojen2203", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17883664467169206, "text": "Id?", "created_at": "2024-11-24T22:48:05", "owner": "wild_mild_taste_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044326504911200, "text": "@lisa.pcn76 🏇", "created_at": "2024-11-20T11:44:33", "owner": "hellasylvia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18260132743251531, "text": "Track ID: Artist: Vendex, Track: Sanguine Fountain (Album: VAGUE TRAX, Vol. 1, Label: VAGUE, Released: 2021)", "created_at": "2024-11-20T04:11:14", "owner": "henriette_toteraum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016913849374673, "text": "I'm always saying , someone is gonna have a seizure in front of these things one day...Meh , at least they're in front of a pharmacy I guess 😅", "created_at": "2024-11-19T17:15:38", "owner": "charlieberries_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858623413294341, "text": "Not only. Saw this in Spain as well.", "created_at": "2024-11-18T08:40:45", "owner": "kashi.exe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054044044904489, "text": "@paul_grandvoinnet", "created_at": "2024-11-17T19:07:04", "owner": "ankit._.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026126456611247, "text": "Italy tooo", "created_at": "2024-11-17T12:58:29", "owner": "graziano.wlc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866817922182901, "text": "Same thoughts", "created_at": "2024-11-16T16:09:11", "owner": "talentpflege_goldrichtig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069814558725414, "text": "And germany", "created_at": "2024-11-16T10:19:01", "owner": "shen_emre_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128729164377795, "text": "doctor who intro", "created_at": "2024-11-15T12:39:21", "owner": "nikooooooooooon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047492204040341, "text": "not only) in Ukraine they exist too", "created_at": "2024-11-15T07:39:56", "owner": "olyaaldos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048968095972993, "text": "Is not only in France is everywhere in Europe", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:56:20", "owner": "devilmycry20252025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117011254411767, "text": "Les impôts des Français servent à des choses utiles faut croire.", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:55:23", "owner": "newvictor26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869174116164805, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T20:27:53", "owner": "franzgt86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949368645763602, "text": "Rammstein", "created_at": "2024-11-14T18:52:24", "owner": "thefirst_boss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922752828995136, "text": "In Spain too 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-14T11:20:33", "owner": "luisalbarracintrenco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18465484573000913, "text": "That’s why before British called it drug store 😍", "created_at": "2024-11-14T05:03:34", "owner": "georgiivrn07052000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087208228465666, "text": "C est vraie", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:03:25", "owner": "cococat_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046413254033021, "text": "@tempura.02 beautiful", "created_at": "2024-11-13T08:35:51", "owner": "taoaya_kuwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901188313078556, "text": "Poor taste", "created_at": "2024-11-13T05:20:49", "owner": "paolo_maoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091439065497315, "text": "You look lonely, I can fix that", "created_at": "2024-11-12T13:26:24", "owner": "leopardprintedfreshlyminted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992490969710909, "text": "What is this for? Is it just to attract customers or does it mean something specific to a drug store/pharmacy?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T22:02:34", "owner": "kattchicago", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065033926743432, "text": "What the dawg doin?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T20:56:30", "owner": "jdemer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081923161488587, "text": "Germany has that too btw 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-10T06:53:59", "owner": "xjointsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042791066146801, "text": "Poland have the same", "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:21:14", "owner": "who_is_maliniak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980069913779249, "text": "Song is Sanguine Fountain by Vendex", "created_at": "2024-11-09T14:20:37", "owner": "pup_hyperion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376607194104988, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T12:20:00", "owner": "da5ni_vvvvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056765728729020, "text": "When the healthcare is so good and free this is the type of vibe you have 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-09T06:50:56", "owner": "gigatless", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056449009723851, "text": "@rammsteinofficial neue Bühnenvisualisierungen? 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-08T08:11:39", "owner": "all.hail.eils", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022336325291631, "text": "We have this in Hungary sometimes", "created_at": "2024-11-07T13:38:38", "owner": "lia.the.catgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965135835811011, "text": "Italy in every city", "created_at": "2024-11-07T09:18:38", "owner": "koa_eadmc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148279537340622, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T13:33:07", "owner": "annalindeeb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042330454917944, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:41:44", "owner": "ksouto_priv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958557558719011, "text": "Bouffe tes médocs et bonne rave party", "created_at": "2024-11-03T13:56:07", "owner": "arkansnow13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012140879425169, "text": "C’est à Nice ça 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T20:45:22", "owner": "cyril_vl_06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023137373252822, "text": "On aime l’extasy", "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:34:51", "owner": "sucreblnc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066713707644615, "text": "Looks like visions when you're high on DMT", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:31:02", "owner": "ale_crisax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074853526578556, "text": "J'ai jamais vu ça de ma vie🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:22:39", "owner": "v_cali_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028720637376760, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-31T00:24:13", "owner": "orphee.o.enfers", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18138179017325817, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-28T14:25:54", "owner": "gaelaguettand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273773833223551, "text": "Jamais vu, moi c’est juste la croix qui tourne 🥲", "created_at": "2024-10-28T10:01:10", "owner": "crocodile_deee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994476744535231, "text": "En Belgique aussi 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-27T06:54:56", "owner": "felixvlntn03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039525758148398, "text": "@sylvqin", "created_at": "2024-10-26T13:02:09", "owner": "falsey___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378680815100871, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T10:38:16", "owner": "elsenorcortez82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016375391619649, "text": "All europe dood", "created_at": "2024-10-25T20:27:59", "owner": "ragl___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947694966761238, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-25T18:56:24", "owner": "bamoulou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041623483916641, "text": "By the power of the carte vitale !", "created_at": "2024-10-25T17:04:06", "owner": "ajax_fleau_des_fleurs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928525467958120, "text": "Cyberpunk 2077 french mod", "created_at": "2024-10-25T09:41:52", "owner": "thedre4mwalk4r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852281710312867, "text": "And guess what? It’s all free 😍", "c