d is Jewish and also (possibly) a Levite. He is the \"suffering servant\" in Isaiah 53. He is your Messiah ben Joseph and David. He also loves His people and wants them to come to believe in Him, because He is returning soon. Repent and believe the Gospel! It is good news after all! 😁", "created_at": "2025-02-14T21:05:00", "owner": "4christ_4life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072387052686499, "text": "Beautiful Jewish woman ngl", "created_at": "2025-02-14T07:47:36", "owner": "bigdrew925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048897605221139, "text": "How much was the nose surgery?", "created_at": "2025-02-14T07:29:45", "owner": "unrecognised_sm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056198945031117, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-02-14T05:15:22", "owner": "freddyeversleepy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073067746741507, "text": "comments are literally proving her point", "created_at": "2025-02-14T00:40:42", "owner": "clowntastrophe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034835558232912, "text": "Wompwomp", "created_at": "2025-02-13T19:41:39", "owner": "xbigpapamikex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847120066409585, "text": "She literally only talks about being jewish and things people say about it every time i see her on my feed. Nobody cares how upset you feel.", "created_at": "2025-02-13T16:18:34", "owner": "siraj.al.salafi", "likes": 6}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
