{"media_id": 3456492302934523316, "shortcode": "C_37W-tSL20", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_37W-tSL20/", "taken_at": "2024-09-13T22:20:53", "caption": "Follow @stonqz for more\n\nHERES HOW YOU RIZZ LIKE A PROFESSIONAL (100% WORKING)\n\n### Ingredients:\n - 1 cup of Charm, finely diced\n - 2 tablespoons of Wit, minced\n - 3 dashes of Flirtatiousness\n - 1/2 cup of Confidence, chopped\n - 2 tablespoons of Compliments, diced\n - A pinch of Mystery\n - A dash of Playfulness\n - A sprinkle of Sweetness\n\nInstructions:\n\n  1. Preparation: Begin by prepping your ingredients with a wink and a smile. Remember, presentation is key, so make sure your charm is on full display.\n\n  2. Charm Infusion: In a charmingly large mixing bowl, add the finely diced Charm. Let it work its magic as it sets the tone for the rest of the dish.\n\n  3. Witty Banter: Stir in the minced Wit, adding a playful edge to the mixture. This ingredient is crucial for keeping the recipe light and entertaining.\n\n  4. Flirtatious Flair: Sprinkle in the dashes of Flirtatiousness, being careful not to overdo it. A little goes a long way in adding spice to the dish.", "owner_username": "stonqz", "owner_id": "34188994368", "likes": 54481, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0108_C_37W-tSL20\\C_37W-tSL20_20240913_222053.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17878511700114073, "text": "if ur new here check out my page i post a lotta memes for your daily entertainment 🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-15T01:46:39", "owner": "stonqz", "likes": 142}, {"id": 18018429761263591, "text": "Isn’t the dude standing and she’s on him with her legs bent? He’s against the wall or whatever it is? 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-09-19T02:30:19", "owner": "s.oe.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038614667121984, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-09-18T20:08:10", "owner": "craudinhow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072242524512941, "text": "how yall don’t get the position", "created_at": "2024-09-18T18:09: