d": 17986809635771900, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2024-12-16T17:11:03", "owner": "altctrldel1ssa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990920859744295, "text": "+30kg", "created_at": "2024-12-16T10:02:55", "owner": "apexcryptlord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069172342674045, "text": "Where do you originate from btw? Welcome to cheeseburger V8 heaven", "created_at": "2024-12-16T05:04:50", "owner": "dead_miata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985155231782969, "text": "The moment I land on USA, I will hunt that damn eagle, cook it well and feed on it's delicious, benefitting, breathtaking vitamins 🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-15T09:18:19", "owner": "cooliocob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070098286710302, "text": "That fanta😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-14T09:46:21", "owner": "h.h.n.n1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998886111706047, "text": "USA maybe I judged too much, a gallon of Arizona tea seems like the perfect amount...", "created_at": "2024-12-13T22:19:56", "owner": "carlos.__glez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065046817785745, "text": "You landed in United States", "created_at": "2024-12-13T20:57:29", "owner": "luima91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061399792885849, "text": "Love that hawk screetch that everyone mistakes for an eagle 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-13T20:40:37", "owner": "sliwovsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905021272072994, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-13T20:00:55", "owner": "labibah_fr07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044597381336576, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2024-12-13T14:02:02", "owner": "hello_hayate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081625411561855, "text": "+5000 diabetes points", "created_at": "2024-12-12T09:07:58", "owner": "karimvisuals.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062720857827651, "text": "RAHHHHHHHHH 🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🦅🗣🗣🗣🗣🗣🗣🗣", "created_at": "2024-12-10T21:03:37", "owner": "hughmungus987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894270703035451, "text": "United States of Diabetes", "created_at": "2024-12-10T09:27:29", "owner": "kamsssssssssssssssssssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044085679959272, "text": "@janellalimv", "created_at": "2024-12-09T15:30:02", "owner": "byronmart.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990905625760058, "text": "😭😭😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T01:52:47", "owner": "vistorms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934351203958000, "text": "@gawwdiss", "created_at": "2024-12-05T20:39:38", "owner": "officialnukks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937802466945381, "text": "The culture", "created_at": "2024-12-04T18:24:54", "owner": "soy_datola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148217284346390, "text": "느좋 ㅜㅜ", "created_at": "2024-12-04T01:17:40", "owner": "jinnxxni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940608504806506, "text": "😭😭😭😭doneeee mee after a 21hr flight to the land of the FreeEEE", "created_at": "2024-12-03T19:21:51", "owner": "akimberly____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314071426167930, "text": "🦅🦅🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-12-03T10:49:07", "owner": "uzzair_48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889408876134739, "text": "Stop those walmart croissants are dope", "created_at": "2024-12-01T23:00:32", "owner": "daniagra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077797861594588, "text": "the MAYO?????????? 🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:32:56", "owner": "nonlpversion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937696503944303, "text": "@angadsangotra", "created_at": "2024-12-01T08:29:45", "owner": "xnlyse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868132264182373, "text": "Diabetes, here i come...", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:58:36", "owner": "saul.aguilar.5855", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913224754019121, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-30T22:50:56", "owner": "devaux__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148674460352585, "text": "and that will be 5 grand sir😭", "created_at": "2024-11-30T10:00:28", "owner": "matildaisintelligent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914255049992375, "text": "A 1000 calories a day keeps ur health away 🗣️🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-29T16:50:16", "owner": "s1s3ie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886275259118085, "text": "Aye yo why is the meat not fully cooked 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-29T09:52:31", "owner": "kwandemathebula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471461359042576, "text": "Man those donouts and hambuguers did look good aint gonna lie", "created_at": "2024-11-29T04:50:49", "owner": "luissantanna_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903372817074400, "text": "What about cheeseballs🦅🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:58:25", "owner": "literallypekka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867798895181144, "text": "United States *", "created_at": "2024-11-27T18:54:40", "owner": "imaugustofilho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068510014659321, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-26T11:08:52", "owner": "stelio_vuma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471030448053151, "text": "Which country in 🌎America?", "created_at": "2024-11-25T23:26:48", "owner": "ssspnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098370880430979, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:20:50", "owner": "al_asral", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082127308495619, "text": "Diabetes and hypertension approve this post…", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:04:42", "owner": "c.h.r.i.sv.e.g.a.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100350112463904, "text": "🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:24:17", "owner": "native_313ment", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063535177772998, "text": "Mr fr fr", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:10:25", "owner": "jordaniscool2507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092224810453672, "text": "I can listen to this audio all day", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:08:57", "owner": "kenn.alv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069788611629268, "text": "I came back home with diabetes", "created_at": "2024-11-25T01:46:07", "owner": "leo.ariguznaga96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031701320456467, "text": "You land and… decide to increase your cholesterol level…? Is that it?", "created_at": "2024-11-24T21:57:44", "owner": "itsdeactivated5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039605330191427, "text": "Damn i wonder why the groceries were all sold out 🦅💀", "created_at": "2024-11-24T19:26:33", "owner": "hornsly_yt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855444514322231, "text": "Diabetes for all of us🦅🦅🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-24T18:18:19", "owner": "im_phuc_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022689383308343, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 🇺🇸🦅 the land of the meds dependency 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T18:18:15", "owner": "soloclimber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020088545559164, "text": "Diabetes Land 🦅🦅🔥🔥🔥🦅🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:45:53", "owner": "jose_zuniga_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144267436356915, "text": "lol I love this sound", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:30:07", "owner": "sirenhndrxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044314030906346, "text": "High fructose in EVERYTHING!! 🗣️🦅🦅🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:27:55", "owner": "buffboyfitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472580245050346, "text": "@antonio_ptdung có giòn hăm:))", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:48:02", "owner": "tnlinh_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248196493263444, "text": "😭🙏🙏🙏🧎", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:28:37", "owner": "chelsy.bv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087088723524108, "text": "Diabetes and disease yay 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:09:53", "owner": "theaaron_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059050879852533, "text": "The size of mayo!! 😮", "created_at": "2024-11-24T14:59:11", "owner": "shazra.sk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047793161087139, "text": "HEART ATTACK SPEEDRUN 🇺🇸🇺🇸🦅🦅🦅🇺🇸🦅🗣️🇺🇸🦅🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-11-24T14:18:11", "owner": "sarim_msi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886464715139579, "text": "Hahhaa yes we were like this when we arrived hahaa", "created_at": "2024-11-24T13:01:25", "owner": "momma.wilma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063393805766163, "text": "Canada too 🇺🇸🔥🦅🇨🇦❄️", "created_at": "2024-11-24T12:48:05", "owner": "iso_bra__him_tt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041415550979015, "text": "@rixeshworld_", "created_at": "2024-11-24T08:49:55", "owner": "keeyuurrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006585455506734, "text": "WE’RE COSTGO GUYS", "created_at": "2024-11-24T06:17:00", "owner": "ushara_priv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879919948191530, "text": "yes, it is legal to eat healthy in the United States, however this is a major part of our culture.", "created_at": "2024-11-24T02:35:26", "owner": "marcusms74._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062549170764363, "text": "You mean United States. There is a North and South America. The US does not have exclusive rights to the name of the continent.", "created_at": "2024-11-23T22:03:41", "owner": "kookarini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170617525312200, "text": "As European it must be the same feeling for the stomach eating these like it would be with eating 3rd world food, different but same", "created_at": "2024-11-23T18:21:14", "owner": "tohrwid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062544541753731, "text": "diabete pro max", "created_at": "2024-11-23T17:37:21", "owner": "lfe.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941810550921496, "text": "AMERICA 🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🍔🥤🇺🇸🍔🦅🍔🇺🇸🥤🦅🏈!!!!", "created_at": "2024-11-23T15:37:25", "owner": "2006inanutshell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033280586367249, "text": "F22s suppose dey fly by for no damn reason😂🇺🇸🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-23T14:49:43", "owner": "nick_papichulo_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014436371418188, "text": "Alright, don't forget to boyycott", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:36:08", "owner": "mllwxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985931661757940, "text": "I would train like a whole year in advance to not feel bad during my 2 week vacations there.", "created_at": "2024-11-23T12:31:39", "owner": "realmadridista96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063426055802747, "text": "WHY IS THE MAYO SO BIG🦅🦅🇺🇸🦅🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅🇺🇸🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:11:09", "owner": "jeff_the_super_land_shark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052928293944608, "text": "🦅🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:41:56", "owner": "mainmage_umi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888644776056170, "text": "Fun fact...eagles don't scream like that.", "created_at": "2024-11-23T01:33:43", "owner": "mattsea223", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053958724939154, "text": "🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-23T01:31:19", "owner": "aelica_dilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950510904763278, "text": "Which country in America exactly?", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:22:06", "owner": "elkin_osorio99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849705496306892, "text": "I was waiting a 9/11 joke...", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:41:09", "owner": "het.ber_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076364386594440, "text": "HELL YEA-🦅🦅🦅🦅🗣️🗣️🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:37:07", "owner": "gilboerto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935214378829358, "text": "Health? Where? 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-22T21:48:17", "owner": "yasir_quadri12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021017828546911, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:08:46", "owner": "dlv1nnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067263586668551, "text": "Regardless of what I eat, I immediately loose weight when I leave the US", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:46:54", "owner": "harpsy17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064112017687071, "text": "Vegetables is prohibited in US", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:28:57", "owner": "zen23n_n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015997547380991, "text": "Food like that and no public health care... and they think the vaccines are population control 🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:21:08", "owner": "robbiedubbelman.music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952953828750573, "text": "Cuando carajo van a a aprender que América es el continente su país se llama Estados Unidos de América o U.S.A yo también soy americano por ser argentino vivo en américa del sur y ya se que es un meme y que es humor pero igual da bronca", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:18:42", "owner": "sebas_el_burger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024119300281464, "text": "🇺🇸🇺🇸🦅🦅", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:06:55", "owner": "zesrsterr.rt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913191199034336, "text": "Frr", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:48:05", "owner": "hamidbens._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867014227252079, "text": "Hahahah true", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:38:32", "owner": "glambymk1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047280827088990, "text": "🦅🇺🇸", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:26:15", "owner": "collins_onotasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038676710214865, "text": "Так ви молодці прийшли в костко де всьо на місяць і ше балакають ну фест", "created_at": "2024-11-2