{"media_id": 3453989419391397826, "shortcode": "C_vCROwyC_C", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_vCROwyC_C/", "taken_at": "2024-09-10T11:34:13", "caption": "在你20多歲的時候，肯定會有這個時期\n\n想做的事很多🤔 \n\n但是該挑哪條路走卻是最難的…\n\n記得追蹤 @lebong_brow \n之後會分享更多個人成長/旅遊資訊\n\n🎥 @ollybowman \n\n#成長 #個人成長 #思維 \n\n你也有過這個時期嗎？", "owner_username": "mindywu_design", "owner_id": "43864913508", "likes": 100436, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0111_C_vCROwyC_C\\C_vCROwyC_C_20240910_113413.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17917363623060131, "text": "30歲我：今天又活了一天了", "created_at": "2025-02-26T07:40:25", "owner": "san_.518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881424079143735, "text": "@_roylamsc_ ‘e", "created_at": "2025-02-24T04:15:18", "owner": "skinskin_suki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042855845071832, "text": "@maying5656_", "created_at": "2025-02-05T10:45:20", "owner": "jelly_jieling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058200790826356, "text": "成長就是接受自己的平凡，一張普通卡點滿了也許只能如此", "created_at": "2025-02-01T05:56:51", "owner": "_justinn_c_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008906063696104, "text": "哭了", "created_at": "2025-01-30T18:13:17", "owner": "gai_cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152719108355190, "text": "Whats gon happen when u turn 25", "created_at": "2025-01-30T07:20:49", "owner": "painter_ff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988769535782694, "text": "29岁：挣钱挣钱挣钱有了钱啥都有了耶✌️", "created_at": "2025-01-24T16:28:27", "owner": "kelly_and_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842741638406018, "text": "廿多歲真的要去做自己想完成的夢，時間一過就不會實行了", "created_at": "2025-01-21T16:49:19", "owner": "silonleung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075619042624120, "text": "对未来感到迷茫中😢", "created_at": "2024-12-28T20:17:53", "owner": "_0xin7tl6hazd13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924120528901752, "text": "然后还没钱", "created_at": "2024-12-28T08:49:05", "owner": "mzzol_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001451204705592, "text": "10歲:媽", "created_at": "2024-12-20T16:33:33", "owner": "gzq080623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042541250269343, "text": "@phanni.ador 我們", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:39:45", "owner": "z1iuyyv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038044682257044, "text": "現在就是啊", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:17:25", "owner": "bgan_bgan_lalaland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867865915254776, "text": "30歲的我:乾我到底該做什麼（滑104", "created_at": "2024-12-09T08:37:46", "owner": "wei8_er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015345467418860, "text": "沒有哪條路是對的！  你唯一能做的事 就是把你走的路變成是對的。  這才是真相", "created_at": "2024-12-08T20:13:36", "owner": "bestgorefun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028992107394169, "text": "@lovis.all you", "created_at": "2024-12-08T05:50:10", "owner": "lwjyyqx_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869168059252274, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T11:30:04", "owner": "raindropimprint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007526387506452, "text": "现在已经不会再有那些期待了 每天都想死", "created_at": "2024-12-06T15:58:09", "owner": "kris_meng12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069289558639122, "text": "30歲 : 我覺得我需要每天睡午覺", "created_at": "2024-11-29T04:50:24", "owner": "martino_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286173280241393, "text": "完美詮釋所有青少年的迷茫", "created_at": "2024-11-29T03:02:37", "owner": "betty41344134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072488554718097, "text": "這我", "created_at": "2024-11-27T19:31:31", "owner": "3lle.n369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069439663568557, "text": "我：今晚吃什麼", "created_at": "2024-11-15T18:24:58", "owner": "yuhsuanlin_2341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848167915306531, "text": "剛退伍的時候我就這是長這樣", "created_at": "2024-11-06T11:26:43", "owner": "eliott_8091", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991639236713625, "text": "哈哈 和我一个学校", "created_at": "2024-11-05T09:17:30", "owner": "reneesyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101032534413399, "text": "分享一個昨天看到的句子：想是問題，做才是答案😍", "created_at": "2024-11-04T23:28:52", "owner": "d.kafun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026220839602175, "text": "28： 不管了 再賴床五分鐘", "created_at": "2024-11-03T11:18:48", "owner": "allen841107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377627437100807, "text": "全世界都这样我就放心了", "created_at": "2024-11-03T05:00:00", "owner": "jaichen_luly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935981253812363, "text": "@s.mahe4909 typical meeee", "created_at": "2024-10-31T02:46:24", "owner": "yukun0506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932780706830311, "text": "没必要贩卖焦虑哈", "created_at": "2024-10-29T08:55:41", "owner": "howardz__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013221977400890, "text": "me right now😢", "created_at": "2024-10-29T02:20:45", "owner": "haozhe_zhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946493880888133, "text": "@aikkkou", "created_at": "2024-10-25T11:47:11", "owner": "choiiii67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846725467306718, "text": "你的能力確實是辦得到，但就看你自己有沒有下那個決心", "created_at": "2024-10-22T08:04:03", "owner": "su198964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047340640994051, "text": "@bigbiggirl24", "created_at": "2024-10-19T06:56:16", "owner": "lexie626_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101774227445169, "text": "考个研就老实了", "created_at": "2024-10-17T00:31:25", "owner": "a_strongpowerfulwoman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074185084574413, "text": "same，actually i don’t know what should i do and I can’t find may passion on job", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:21:17", "owner": "zhj_ad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033460337207928, "text": "發現最後面背後的伏筆，之後成為女裝大佬", "created_at": "2024-10-14T08:51:43", "owner": "xiao4188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874876288181555, "text": "@zzs_0310 說好的民宿呢", "created_at": "2024-10-13T13:59:55", "owner": "lixiang8226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18460388824045523, "text": "我之前15岁的时候就想创业，真的超级焦虑，之前每天都在学校被迫内卷很想逃避😢", "created_at": "2024-10-13T09:51:20", "owner": "qimu252", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026360387376091, "text": "每天这样 焦虑😢", "created_at": "2024-10-11T02:46:09", "owner": "juliya.lifee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18146345764339886, "text": "@_1020528 這你", "created_at": "2024-10-10T12:49:23", "owner": "gouyong_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932598795938295, "text": "你需要先洗一下你的帽子🧢😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T03:16:48", "owner": "sara.x.i.a.n.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854455336243928, "text": "@sunset_pablo", "created_at": "2024-10-07T08:59:42", "owner": "ikaliu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18315517192086790, "text": "在20多岁的时候想做就一定要去行动！坚信行动力会让你得到你想要的一切", "created_at": "2024-10-05T10:55:18", "owner": "garcia_nbcwys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043214633106519, "text": "乾 這我", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:47:48", "owner": "eclipse_rogue_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014271647626640, "text": "这是当下的我", "created_at": "2024-10-04T13:58:58", "owner": "7hanmeimei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035355776240114, "text": "搬吧！我就是那個最後決定搬去巴黎的人！26歲目前失業中哈哈", "created_at": "2024-10-04T13:22:23", "owner": "luluchin0924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941285214897608, "text": "不全面无以坚定", "created_at": "2024-10-03T05:07:45", "owner": "hey2vk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929828718942327, "text": "我”累 好累 累得想死”", "created_at": "2024-09-28T05:19:51", "owner": "lixinjiee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039175424322345, "text": "20歲: 疫情 🦠", "created_at": "2024-09-27T18:48:41", "owner": "xuanzhenger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079416808533163, "text": "@shuminlisa comments 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-26T20:49:13", "owner": "jacissapita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991131057548405, "text": "@_yien you haha", "created_at": "2024-09-26T04:27:58", "owner": "sandysahhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024461888175119, "text": "什么天气是棉背心配短袖 ？我请问", "created_at": "2024-09-25T18:06:43", "owner": "kuiroa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962845119681174, "text": "30歲 還是一樣啊 每天都在想要吃什麼", "created_at": "2024-09-25T15:06:55", "owner": "imcoopydesu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17879851443114621, "text": "我有個朋友就這樣發瘋離我們遠去", "created_at": "2024-09-24T16:14:31", "owner": "racings__0209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122731873377784, "text": "现在就是这种状态，简直想把所有的路都走一遍😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-24T14:32:02", "owner": "fafafa9458", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031355021257687, "text": "@raykimmyy usyd🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-24T13:41:32", "owner": "choskki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018122579577998, "text": "Just make up", "created_at": "2024-09-24T10:15:43", "owner": "inucha_13.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18443147020064801, "text": "@domingo_ggd 這你", "created_at": "2024-09-22T05:53:31", "owner": "0223poi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18304272652164740, "text": "天 太真实了", "created_at": "2024-09-21T09:46:40", "owner": "han.eggplant0728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865837804210710, "text": "我現在15 我已經開始徬徨了", "created_at": "2024-09-20T16:38:12", "owner": "adlers986461", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979011459748891, "text": "就是现在的我，不知道自己要做什么，很迷茫", "created_at": "2024-09-20T15:24:11", "owner": "oorange466", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041461967495148, "text": "@evantai11 @kelvin.h629", "created_at": "2024-09-20T14:41:50", "owner": "johnlam0214_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882689935053955, "text": "That’s me", "created_at": "2024-09-20T13:29:54", "owner": "jszanxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038414725911176, "text": "Ing", "created_at": "2024-09-20T10:49:49", "owner": "wowdamon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044089591968955, "text": "@k.lynstagram_", "created_at": "2024-09-20T08:16:14", "owner": "coffeecatpro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041538251082642, "text": "@k.1217___", "created_at": "2024-09-19T22:46:23", "owner": "vliegend_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456322747001450, "text": "Damn我30歲也是這樣", "created_at": "2024-09-19T18:40:15", "owner": "gabnkap.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030526712247283, "text": "15歲的我:反正我人生完蛋了~", "created_at": "2024-09-19T08:31:02", "owner": "1573_draw", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18067950994608766, "text": "一年後：有載具嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-19T04:58:04", "owner": "yixin12256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036491963144666, "text": "給自己太多想法也是一种负担", "created_at": "2024-09-19T01:25:41", "owner": "zerena_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145590580331784, "text": "我要想不", "created_at": "2024-09-18T16:59:18", "owner": "smile.0807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045802591811674, "text": "@_i.mandresss", "created_at": "2024-09-18T15:01:02", "owner": "the_jackal_himself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908458122932713, "text": "然後就突然步入婚姻了", "created_at": "2024-09-18T11:51:58", "owner": "alau_ll29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18008845121389860, "text": "30歲：我覺得還能再尻一發。", "created_at": "2024-09-18T10:47:47", "owner": "hell_recruiter_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877633276140807, "text": "一般臺灣二十歲：幹我明天早八不去了", "created_at": "2024-09-18T10:42:12", "owner": "shakur4460", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012122258338718, "text": "真的是", "created_at": "2024-09-18T07:26:13", "owner": "tiger_18_luo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252475192248795, "text": "@yj_lee__ 我們的畫大餅人生 😎✍️", "created_at": "2024-09-18T07:02:56", "owner": "__cchingg__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855199816267199, "text": "少說多做", "created_at": "2024-09-18T05:01:02", "owner": "zonevryshot", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18455415760040997, "text": "25歲工作過度之後，變成能睡前打一下手槍已經是唯一小確幸的魯蛇。", "created_at": "2024-09-18T03:00:08", "owner": "rafa.cheuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102666358438303, "text": "@ddoreenx.31", "created_at": "2024-09-17T22:37:22", "owner": "markotaft", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906805140942620, "text": "我按讚不是因為他跟我的想法一樣\n純粹是因為他帥", "created_at": "2024-09-17T20:32:13", "owner": "a.aa.aaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058516615688537, "text": "30: 今天老闆不在，可以早回家 好開心", "created_at": "2024-09-17T14:30:56", "owner": "linssense", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899048929052627, "text": "我26:咁，今天上班真操！加購六塊雞", "created_at": "2024-09-17T13:26:19", "owner": "huai.streetlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055404832825503, "text": "现在20岁:我是不是该考公", "created_at": "2024-09-17T12:50:36", "owner": "ulrich_youling", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071886880513712, "text": "我現在16歲就已經這樣了^^", "created_at": "2024-09-17T11:54:44", "owner": "c1_stella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008454515417697, "text": "30過後: 不要煩我，回家睡覺", "created_at": "2024-09-17T10:24:37", "owner": "jennnliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009290543382349, "text": "快30歲了，還是不知道自己在幹什麼👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2024-09-17T08:26:12", "owner": "kaori8d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276884359210782, "text": "fk..", "created_at": "2024-09-17T05:14:11", "owner": "sabrtino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017304677287284, "text": "現在的我：能有💴💵💶💷💰可以去開幹，爽～", "created_at": "2024-09-17T04:56:13", "owner": "yyc5e38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008937290637963, "text": "这简直就是我😂", "created_at": "2024-09-17T04:24:46", "owner": "hurryupki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013280999552298, "text": "所以有人能告訴我該怎麼做嗎", "created_at": "2024-09-17T02:24:27", "owner": "kunyan926_rob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046511365939640, "text": "20歲：媽媽今晚吃什麼😂", "created_at": "2024-09-17T01:29:04", "owner": "lookchard_beside_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282403990224391, "text": "@hc_john", "created_at": "2024-09-17T01:10:42", "owner": "janettchy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043488334989236, "text": "分享一個想法，\n在還沒有開始行動之前，這些想法都不能稱之為「選擇」，只是「想法」。人沒有辦法只透過想像就能理解到一件事對自己是否重要。\n\n不用糾結不知道應該要去做哪件事情，在親身經歷之前，這都是偽命題，把偽命題當作「選擇」，只會陷入內耗與自我否定中。\n\n只要放長線看對自己有利，即便只做的1/10，都可能會有新的選擇出現，所以做就對了", "created_at": "2024-09-16T23:32:04", "owner": "cys.enki", "likes": 1340}, {"id": 18367752223098174, "text": "就是光想不做 用我妈的话说就是 嘴行千里 屁股在炕😂", "created_at": "2024-09-16T21:48:06", "owner": "charlieli01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456612982061744, "text": "“Make up” my mind😂", "created_at": "2024-09-16T21:06:21", "owner": "lu_ul.peggy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18300566764166950, "text": "@jun_012_ 滾仔代購", "created_at": "2024-09-16T19:35:33", "owner": "bi__polarbear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976993323767949, "text": "是我", "created_at": "2024-09-16T17:00:31", "owner": "xixilacy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056359162703342, "text": "25歲:我薯條真的能加大嗎？", "created_at": "2024-09-16T16:48:16", "owner": "shuo_0621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005469041468929, "text": "@ylx1997 @zi_han0311 又來😭", "created_at": "2024-09-16T16:28:57", "owner": "mantou.__", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["成長", "個人成長", "思維"]},
{"media_id": 3456392247173986111, "shortcode": "C_3km-hODc_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_3km-hODc_/", "taken_at": "2024-09-13T19:02:18", "caption": "Live, love, laugh , pointers ♥️\n\n#engineer #engineering #programmer #programming", "owner_username": "kristel_tech", "owner_id": "48483190389", "likes": 28354, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0112_C_3km-hODc_\\C_3km-hODc__20240913_190218.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18462247216025275, "text": "Instagram flagged my post for pointers for emotional abuse 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:09:10", "owner": "kristel_tech", "likes": 476}, {"id": 18051684464007204, "text": "Someone pls explain me what are doing int** and int*", "created_at": "2024-12-18T16:06:10", "owner": "raffiii___111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048805844507065, "text": "Then what is int***", "created_at": "2024-12-16T15:21:43", "owner": "_isuroh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127993777382669, "text": "Gotta give that int a sandwich", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:30:52", "owner": "def_not_cage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913263687940437, "text": "rust has entered the chat", "created_at": "2024-11-21T15:49:36", "owner": "aundrelat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871932244144532, "text": "This popped while I'm waiting to write my C exam 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-14T19:46:47", "owner": "bradley__walden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133472812372888, "text": "cara o int** me pega dms", "created_at": "2024-11-07T19:13:29", "owner": "mgarbo13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070097188626897, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-07T16:09:52", "owner": "vishal_srivastava27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246394240278143, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-05T21:48:05", "owner": "steam_dz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857467021284956, "text": "third year and I still try to ignore the fact that pointers exist and that I still don't understand them", "created_at": "2024-10-31T20:05:50", "owner": "f33tmyum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037359482193126, "text": "@chue.myatsandyy_ ur fav topic right?", "created_at": "2024-10-29T13:19:30", "owner": "jjonathanwongg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048114217824227, "text": "Use java avoid them", "created_at": "2024-10-23T22:59:52", "owner": "feat.zedd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050406463752385, "text": "I love pointers", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:14:50", "owner": "le_rsoft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040181368904033, "text": "Short int, long int, long long int", "created_at": "2024-10-12T08:52:30", "owner": "vasilis.diamantopoulos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031711835256429, "text": "It's funny until your prof asks you to debug a problem with pointers", "created_at": "2024-10-06T07:46:58", "owner": "ingame_gelowzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037997909327810, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T08:57:27", "owner": "itsnemma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050338291899074, "text": "Then the fun of dereferencing the int itself by accident pointing to a random address in memory and tadaa you got some UB on your hands", "created_at": "2024-10-02T21:47:00", "owner": "naamloser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18441551557070715, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-29T00:56:07", "owner": "colton_kaneria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057835546773099, "text": "What about void**", "created_at": "2024-09-29T00:49:44", "owner": "pchaow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327352309148476, "text": "XDDDD", "created_at": "2024-09-28T10:23:25", "owner": "_lawissi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846246088315370, "text": "C++ ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-28T04:46:15", "owner": "mr.o.seven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909907105009962, "text": "😭 the best ever explanation to exist on planet 🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-27T10:21:49", "owner": "piyush_bhatt03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898759801064959, "text": "Rust entered the chat. Pointers left the chatroom.", "created_at": "2024-09-26T22:23:02", "owner": "zeioth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461523319063597, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-25T11:19:59", "owner": "seasteading", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066148954628224, "text": "int *********************************************************** prt[100000];", "created_at": "2024-09-24T13:43:23", "owner": "swarnodipnag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034273895225215, "text": "Void* pointers be like 🌚👉🏿 🕳", "created_at": "2024-09-23T11:44:54", "owner": "cicciolz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045880711819326, "text": "Uh, now I C...", "created_at": "2024-09-18T16:07:24", "owner": "tiago.mglhs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056760103806747, "text": "void (*g)(int (*f)(int**))", "created_at": "2024-09-18T00:37:38", "owner": "asy_0x0", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18049040497906906, "text": "No one told me about the double** pointers", "created_at": "2024-09-17T17:26:19", "owner": "anaskhan369369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18222563383303879, "text": "Void* ?", "created_at": "2024-09-17T02:48:32", "owner": "the_x_striver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925273434950667, "text": "Love this😂♥️", "created_at": "2024-09-17T02:48:20", "owner": "the_x_striver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326621839149151, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-16T17:26:15", "owner": "manel_dria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844201156314089, "text": "Pointers my love 😂 c++ bind is also quite nice but it's essentially the same under the hood *with certain constraints*", "created_at": "2024-09-16T10:38:17", "owner": "chriva404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031828271211582, "text": "Internal pointer variable 🫠🫠🫠", "created_at": "2024-09-16T07:06:33", "owner": "bernkastel_0609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037585349168157, "text": "I HATE POINTERS SO MUCHHHHHHHH", "created_at": "2024-09-16T04:25:09", "owner": "diwanrd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282485767238027, "text": "Wait, there is a pointer to another pointer? WHY?", "created_at": "2024-09-15T21:49:44", "owner": "lucasgxz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021255296582516, "text": "Why do people find pointers so hard? Genuinely asking", "created_at": "2024-09-15T17:29:04", "owner": "lucascubile", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18461502280013506, "text": "And then you learn arrays are just pointers and things keep only getting weirder", "created_at": "2024-09-15T16:36:03", "owner": "aboudkun2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17956642820704157, "text": "The only great explanation 😍 no need for (internal pointer variable) lecturer 🥴", "created_at": "2024-09-15T15:55:37", "owner": "hamed.wahabzada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008349629401771, "text": "My friend can't see this reel, bcz he can't C (he's a Python dev)", "created_at": "2024-09-15T15:37:26", "owner": "fyramiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010031825374995, "text": "A most indirect video,  actually, it's a double indirect, most have trouble at one level, you pass a pointer to a pointer! **love it, LOL 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-15T15:30:47", "owner": "raymitchell6502", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101032126402290, "text": "I never understood, why the hell is pointer so complicated…..every time when i am using those unnatural things….my brain is like blast for no reason ☠️💀😒🫥😵", "created_at": "2024-09-15T15:18:16", "owner": "fine_with_debanjan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015467831569537, "text": "Malloc", "created_at": "2024-09-15T14:47:59", "owner": "kappa_k_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877887550139219, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-15T14:31:36", "owner": "rihab.alamy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960890487684804, "text": "This is all my professor had to show me three years ago but nooo so it took me the entire semester to understand what they do instead", "created_at": "2024-09-15T12:03:48", "owner": "orfeassi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035278630980329, "text": "Finally understood after 3 yrs of computers science and 2 of master, thank you", "created_at": "2024-09-15T12:00:30", "owner": "amo1511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970697904641401, "text": "internal pointer variable", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:46:33", "owner": "youssef_aitaadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028116161365640, "text": "You missed where it sometimes points to a dark void thar sometimes causes croudstrike scale issues", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:38:18", "owner": "robynwritescode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114153391403514, "text": "Love it 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:22:15", "owner": "speedmasters24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044242513979996, "text": "What language is this", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:17:25", "owner": "narafa07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957807471701217, "text": "Gorla?", "created_at": "2024-09-15T10:57:10", "owner": "onewings79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367502173100909, "text": "Ммм... указатели! 😍", "created_at": "2024-09-15T09:38:14", "owner": "nemnogonemask", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871856230177713, "text": "What about when int* is used as int[0] and int actually has friends", "created_at": "2024-09-15T09:27:42", "owner": "brodie__hill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907443492937458, "text": "I like the explanation.", "created_at": "2024-09-15T09:16:15", "owner": "rdjava9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061746601635485, "text": "So true 👍", "created_at": "2024-09-15T08:04:16", "owner": "bella_jsk7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358474864119474, "text": "I nevere see explainead in that way", "created_at": "2024-09-15T07:43:44", "owner": "sarin74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971494686782825, "text": "You should do this with references in c++ too", "created_at": "2024-09-15T07:14:03", "owner": "laulaurentiu_vlad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039453641084834, "text": "Have you worked with int **", "created_at": "2024-09-15T04:49:19", "owner": "ahmetmurati01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045646346071358, "text": "POINTERS DOESN'T EXIST IN JAVA ☕ !", "created_at": "2024-09-15T02:57:19", "owner": "_elusive_soul13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873314239168808, "text": "int* is the goat, you can have n dimensions if you know how to use it.", "created_at": "2024-09-15T02:03:57", "owner": "mondaldeepsubho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018239720275667, "text": "مستحيل يفوت مخي", "created_at": "2024-09-14T23:50:55", "owner": "aya.sameh.835", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031129358249080, "text": "Insanely cute ☺️", "created_at": "2024-09-14T22:52:24", "owner": "nzuzo_is_ironman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055886995696738, "text": "Where is the & ?", "created_at": "2024-09-14T22:16:51", "owner": "viryil.cruz27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161591713312345, "text": "Integer", "created_at": "2024-09-14T21:54:29", "owner": "ac_hr_af_ac_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886044769036573, "text": "It was complicated to move away from this nonsense, but then it doesake sense. C++ give you more control of something, machines could do well too, all those pointers release is pointless.", "created_at": "2024-09-14T21:32:00", "owner": "belkamax05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354277771189465, "text": "😂😢😂😢", "created_at": "2024-09-14T21:08:50", "owner": "hasan.mhd.amin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18199096051291837, "text": "👉🏻👉🏻👉🏻👉🏻🫵🏻", "created_at": "2024-09-14T20:09:11", "owner": "adrien__del", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004783643478612, "text": "Now the & reference", "created_at": "2024-09-14T19:52:49", "owner": "dax.thenighthawk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069458533606534, "text": "Pointers to function ??", "created_at": "2024-09-14T19:42:47", "owner": "shaikh._.ahmed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035536754330034, "text": "Oh yes ye ptsd from vietnam in a funny way", "created_at": "2024-09-14T18:47:27", "owner": "thanos_tzatzas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857000815252917, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-09-14T17:12:36", "owner": "m_h_zmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044822593815765, "text": "F pointers", "created_at": "2024-09-14T16:33:13", "owner": "amineyoubmed", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18147297010335498, "text": "🙂‍↕️🫡💥", "created_at": "2024-09-14T15:10:05", "owner": "karthik._5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18336375172126775, "text": "Why it's hard for people to understand pointers?", "created_at": "2024-09-14T14:39:01", "owner": "x.mohammad9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096160291456913, "text": "Segmentation fault flash back", "created_at": "2024-09-14T14:15:02", "owner": "onur.kantar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073812454564016, "text": "Where did you left int& ?", "created_at": "2024-09-14T13:30:58", "owner": "destro_stefano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042040100066105, "text": "And this is address of string first element", "created_at": "2024-09-14T13:12:29", "owner": "vladm23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967486410654564, "text": "Who's that pointers", "created_at": "2024-09-14T13:09:38", "owner": "muhaadnasir", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037181465125378, "text": "Double pointers well explained😂🤣\nSmart pointers next !", "created_at": "2024-09-14T12:48:24", "owner": "iam_ayoub_abbani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987543474711636, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-14T11:21:05", "owner": "muhammad._.raffey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042588646997221, "text": "@tahayusufkomur hedef ben miyim Tayfun", "created_at": "2024-09-14T10:50:05", "owner": "komiklihesabisi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081463582512440, "text": "this would have been funnier if it was with short instead of int", "created_at": "2024-09-14T09:25:34", "owner": "dust.js", "likes": 78}, {"id": 17917257380987931, "text": "Welcome to C..🤯🤯🤯", "created_at": "2024-09-14T08:42:46", "owner": "manos_sivas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999605841505614, "text": "That is actually a good explanation", "created_at": "2024-09-14T08:26:38", "owner": "undercover_hassan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056094355810457, "text": "I don't understand pointers till now 😵", "created_at": "2024-09-14T04:50:05", "owner": "boda_hatem1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018338927249813, "text": "easiest explanation of pointers everr!", "created_at": "2024-09-14T04:35:27", "owner": "flower._xo", "likes": 584}, {"id": 18026416448363015, "text": "Where's the pointer of the pointer's pointer?", "created_at": "2024-09-14T00:21:28", "owner": "batsy3435", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18061260574748311, "text": "Beautyfull 😂😂👏 very funny", "created_at": "2024-09-13T23:53:33", "owner": "d.conn.37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312151930089980, "text": "Instagram's flagging algorithms are drunk.", "created_at": "2024-09-13T22:13:05", "owner": "swv_ee_scl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033515087273397, "text": "Smol but cutie", "created_at": "2024-09-13T20:50:20", "owner": "o_cculus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302107435161400, "text": "Expected you to be in a giant number costume at the end 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-13T20:39:35", "owner": "alberta.tech", "likes": 117}, {"id": 18028966421077641, "text": "Joke on point 👏", "created_at": "2024-09-13T20:16:25", "owner": "starforged_panda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007836875405363, "text": "I didn’t realize you were short. I just thought you were living life on easy mode. never worrying about hitting your head, always getting legroom, and sneaking into kids’ menus like it’s a personal buffet!", "created_at": "2024-09-13T20:10:08", "owner": "mohamadnabhann", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18013391972619822, "text": "Decades ago, girls were weak pointers. Nowadays, they're strong... and unsafe!", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:58:43", "owner": "lihmeh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18015900419577211, "text": "I really hated pointers in C programming 😭. My worst enemy", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:55:04", "owner": "madchew04", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18321191002152292, "text": "I hate them so badly", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:35:55", "owner": "ayoub.x.hsk", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18062405704653652, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:24:20", "owner": "shego.codes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116394826401671, "text": "AKSHUALLY", "created_at": "2024-09-13T19:13:06", "owner": "whyamiherehey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857983441265525, "text": "*(int*)int", "created_at": "2024-12-16T18:27:02", "owner": "uretech_c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977377722787275, "text": "pointer==😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-09T13:47:03", "owner": "pa.rham.la", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["engineer", "engineering", "programmer", "programming"]},
{"media_id": 3446002501088976590, "shortcode": "C_SqQRchB7O", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_SqQRchB7O/", "taken_at": "2024-08-30T10:59:26", "caption": "Kendrick Lamar is an American rapper, songwriter, and record producer widely regarded as one of the most influential hip-hop artists of his generation. Born on June 17, 1987, in Compton, California, Lamar gained fame for his introspective lyrics, complex storytelling, and socially conscious themes.\n\nLamar first garnered major attention with his 2011 album *Section.80* but achieved mainstream success with his 2012 album *good kid, m.A.A.d city*, which was praised for its vivid depiction of life in Compton. His subsequent albums, *To Pimp a Butterfly* (2015) and *DAMN.* (2017), solidified his reputation, with both receiving critical acclaim for their innovative sound and exploration of race, identity, and politics in America. *DAMN.* won the Pulitzer Prize for Music in 2018, making Lamar the first non-classical or jazz artist to receive the award.\n\nLamar is also known for his dynamic live performances and collaborations with other major artists. His work has earned him numerous awards, including multiple Grammy Awards, and he is often hailed as one of the greatest rappers of all time.\n#real #relatable #viral #memes #trend", "owner_username": "lilbucks47", "owner_id": "64992126687", "likes": 474870, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0113_C_SqQRchB7O\\C_SqQRchB7O_20240830_105926.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18451894579002914, "text": "Follow for more ✅", "created_at": "2024-08-31T15:57:54", "owner": "lilbucks47", "likes": 4605}, {"id": 17914539393033975, "text": "He was a chill guy", "created_at": "2024-11-28T14:41:36", "owner": "ali.xenoz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107794294448085, "text": "Hell nahhh", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:38:47", "owner": "bavvaa9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043785392024330, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-19T19:50:27", "owner": "peo