{"media_id": 3397527223588331073, "shortcode": "C8mcQJMs55B", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C8mcQJMs55B/", "taken_at": "2024-06-24T13:51:12", "caption": "Do you have a SHTF Plan? Let’s make one.\n.\n.\n.\n#madgearcompany #shtf #plan #contingency #contingencyplan #prepper #prepping #prepared #comms #encryption #executiveprotection #security #doomsday #military #veteran #meshtastic #offgrid #apocalypse #reels #fyp #viralvideos #madeinamerica #planner", "owner_username": "madgearcompany", "owner_id": "63947318437", "likes": 1057, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0114_C8mcQJMs55B\\C8mcQJMs55B_20240624_135112.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17968174418799305", "text": "What’s a good way to get into and learn about coms for free, like any good articles to learn from? @madgearcompany", "created_at": "2024-11-02T14:38:59", "owner": "jdubsrockin", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18014814797376853", "text": "Check our site for more info!", "created_at": "2024-06-24T14:16:38", "owner": "madgearcompany", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18118113763372602", "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-06-24T14:00:28", "owner": "jess.amyett", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18085967128421985", "text": "I need this", "created_at": "2024-06-26T18:24:30", "owner": "xyalikeitx", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17998281755453165", "text": "I like this a lot. It's fun. My only concern is that contingency plans can change vastly in a short amount of time. My entire bug out plan changed in the course of the last month including my threat profile, which means my gear also needs to change. How is this product still relevant with that in mind?", "created_at": "2024-06-29T05:47:18", "owner": "wobblierwarrior1", "likes": 6}, {"id": "18028092325967629", "text": "I need this", "created_at": "2024-06-28T13:59:21", "owner": "easyprepper101", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["madgearcompany", "shtf", "plan", "contingency", "contingencyplan", "prepper", "prepping", "prepared", "comms", "encryption", "executiveprotection", "security", "doomsday", "military", "veteran", "meshtastic", "offgrid", "apocalypse", "reels", "fyp", "viralvideos", "madeinamerica", "planner"]},
