"id": 18037640591165640, "text": "Great we can laugh at ourselves isn’t it? 👏", "created_at": "2024-09-23T00:30:40", "owner": "ozedude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046766446801169, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-23T00:29:00", "owner": "bigtx_214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025338524144560, "text": "Friendly fire", "created_at": "2024-09-23T00:25:03", "owner": "e_liz_abeth_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875261887160462, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T00:18:27", "owner": "mizrahi_madam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866852125146623, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T00:02:12", "owner": "hibaelmn1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870226900125658, "text": "Yooooo 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:40:16", "owner": "ritchy__lu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024900848153363, "text": "Man should’ve been clipped from that 8mile Spanish version. “Chimichangas, wangas, tangas, HORCHATAAAAA”", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:26:37", "owner": "kev2cab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010488011372137, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:24:41", "owner": "ero2pac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918545523985810, "text": "Spot on", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:16:40", "owner": "imbackbitches587", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950630148834263, "text": "why the chimichanga kinda…", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:13:09", "owner": "yo._wsp.angel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18140344270355086, "text": "Celebrate our differences ❌️ Make fun of others stereotypes ✅️", "created_at": "2024-09-22T23:03:54", "owner": "nick_meale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355335379188197, "text": "Fuego amigo", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:43:01", "owner": "pallmallsunrisexl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052994005873084, "text": "Por muito menos o Twitter ta bloqueado no Brasil😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:40:38", "owner": "alex.ctinoco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103157605432651, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 i feel like i should not laugh but I did. 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:40:21", "owner": "c12172012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071524603575576, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:27:31", "owner": "elijah_javan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076700206483080, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:07:01", "owner": "ezequias_de_dios_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072354745519302, "text": "friendly fire activated 😂💀", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:48:59", "owner": "echro_zett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954093687714613, "text": "As a dark skinned person, we in fact do say \"ooga boogado\"", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:47:32", "owner": "wildx_xhunter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104522710428478, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:47:14", "owner": "wdd_derik01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18271014907222520, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:45:32", "owner": "yanaairl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040991156038562, "text": "Oga booga doo Oga booga doo", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:34:59", "owner": "lla_kk5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054077695841588, "text": "Ommmmmfg 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:25:54", "owner": "touchaylo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068002843619020, "text": "Friendly fire will not be tolerated", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:15:13", "owner": "linaknowsalll_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032850287030305, "text": "🇨🇳💀 🇿🇦💀 🇲🇽🇬🇹🇨🇴🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:08:55", "owner": "bgcombck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900838633048084, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:04:58", "owner": "mnr_jottape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052883926845768, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T21:01:49", "owner": "felipebode56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882861274055651, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-22T20:25:10", "owner": "goonerpro670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010987145342465, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T20:22:33", "owner": "thefoofiles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854250964272042, "text": "El latino siempre siendo un genio", "created_at": "2024-09-22T20:14:30", "owner": "nom4l_k1ll3r", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18049213942920354, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-22T20:12:39", "owner": "twhalum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049765204903944, "text": "Friendly fire will not be tolerated", "created_at": "2024-09-22T20:10:05", "owner": "boholaway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304964749165301, "text": "Erhm 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:57:54", "owner": "cherrieslaysdragons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928413123944045, "text": "The Latino takes this with good sense of humor 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:56:35", "owner": "edson21dreams", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18058138018771438, "text": "@cheetosantino", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:54:40", "owner": "nevalaih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028552973519700, "text": "Why is nacho taco chimichanga kinda 🫦", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:27:49", "owner": "4ly4._.57_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016628195301152, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:26:17", "owner": "reices_peices29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046545655789451, "text": "Imagine if a white dude made this.", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:25:31", "owner": "boom604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045202117949794, "text": "💀👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:13:19", "owner": "beyonddaworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366563434108365, "text": "@jocelynnn.cc3 @millieeee_1234 Gosh😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T19:10:37", "owner": "xinyue_luo1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143034163341445, "text": "This video made me closer to the concept of racism, and the perks that come with it.", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:44:39", "owner": "vaaaltr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897894471984003, "text": "nacho taco chimichanga is real‼️", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:40:35", "owner": "ezayis22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028589810463762, "text": "Friendly fire will not be tolerated", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:39:25", "owner": "addihouchin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028791818091287, "text": "Friendly fire will not be tolerated", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:37:47", "owner": "reald1tony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016042982316300, "text": "Genocidas", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:29:00", "owner": "edg.sm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106934860422681, "text": "Φιλική φωτιά", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:27:18", "owner": "athan.v_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039140932915613, "text": "FRENDLY FIRE", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:17:49", "owner": "joshspeed48", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17858369538203647, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-22T18:06:31", "owner": "bobstang.gt.08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053761477855351, "text": "la primera es de Oaxaca 🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-09-22T17:52:03", "owner": "jim_prizrak14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029263802339640, "text": "Never paying taxes ever again after 😭", "created_at": "2024-09-22T17:48:26", "owner": "wannabe_b1ue", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["viral", "reels", "michelinpower", "michelinpower"]},
{"media_id": 3463341804343069759, "shortcode": "DAQQwV_oQw_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAQQwV_oQw_/", "taken_at": "2024-09-23T09:08:57", "caption": "New year, new activities! 🎉\n\nWelcome back to everyone on campus for freshers week! We're hope you're keen for new connections and tasty cakes. 🍩\n\nMake sure you drop in to say hello - we'd love to hear what business ideas you've cooked up over the summer! 🏊‍♀️\n\n#universityofsheffield #rain #freshers #university #entrepreneur #studentbusiness", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 14, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0124_DAQQwV_oQw_\\DAQQwV_oQw__20240923_090857.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["universityofsheffield", "rain", "freshers", "university", "entrepreneur", "studentbusiness"]},
{"media_id": 3439540942825529907, "shortcode": "C-7tEOXhyIz", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-7tEOXhyIz/", "taken_at": "2024-08-21T13:01:21", "caption": "Warning!! The Dangers of Dihydrogen Monoxide #DHMO #BanDHMO #chemistry \nDihydrogen monoxide (DHMO) is a colorless, odorless chemical compound that poses several dangers to human health and the environment. It is a major component of acid rain, contributes to the greenhouse effect, and can cause severe burns in its gaseous state. Inhalation of DHMO, even in small amounts, can be fatal, leading to drowning. Prolonged exposure to solid DHMO can cause tissue damage, and ingestion in excessive quantities can lead to various physiological imbalances. Despite these hazards, DHMO is found in nearly every aspect of daily life, including food, beverages, and industrial processes. Given its widespread use and the potential risks, some argue that DHMO should be banned or strictly regulated to prevent harm.", "owner_username": "chemicalkim", "owner_id": "24258530", "likes": 147305, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0125_C-7tEOXhyIz\\C-7tEOXhyIz_20240821_130121.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17918345277114648, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T15:36:54", "owner": "sosaruemmeley", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026074814680806, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T15:09:32", "owner": "cnwaldron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366518857184493, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-02-17T13:48:18", "owner": "inthresh01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921982777019778, "text": "holyy", "created_at": "2025-02-17T06:00:47", "owner": "jamie_3v3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025367774347694, "text": "Bro, learn middle school chemistry pls", "created_at": "2025-02-17T05:30:05", "owner": "rishipatel6946", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269533393255910, "text": "This has to be satire", "created_at": "2025-02-17T04:09:09", "owner": "eastman009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072221425775805, "text": "You physically can not remove it😭😭 it’s caused by an imbalanced combustion.", "created_at": "2025-02-17T03:00:32", "owner": "not_link1310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964445235850769, "text": "the look tells everything", "created_at": "2025-02-17T00:28:43", "owner": "feca_foci", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130834420403000, "text": "i rlly hope this is a joke", "created_at": "2025-02-16T17:22:44", "owner": "pitts.got.caught.16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036662945435277, "text": "Isn’t it the chemical name for water?", "created_at": "2025-02-16T16:37:03", "owner": "alvmrez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055873055292654, "text": "It's fucking water!!.?", "created_at": "2025-02-16T14:01:02", "owner": "sunken.shadow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053242283125593, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-02-16T11:43:10", "owner": "xrresth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893126656176360, "text": "Here’s dihydrogen monoxide: H2O aka fucking water", "created_at": "2025-02-16T09:28:16", "owner": "jacksonw_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046033817249310, "text": "Two hydrogens and an oxygen…. hmmmm…. sounds familiar…😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-16T08:18:02", "owner": "lacinos.p72", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034801706617422, "text": "It's water", "created_at": "2025-02-16T07:07:55", "owner": "kanna_almost_god", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047301047018374, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-02-16T06:13:49", "owner": "just_ur.dumbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052950491132913, "text": "People also don't know that Dihydrogen Monoxide also has a pH of 7 which is 7 times the pH of Hydrochloride Acid and is also highest than any acid found in the universe", "created_at": "2025-02-16T06:02:17", "owner": "kushagrax01", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17940728264839953, "text": "It’s water", "created_at": "2025-02-16T03:51:31", "owner": "alex.ragequit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905505388011657, "text": "I just drank dihydrogen monoxide 😬", "created_at": "2025-02-16T02:25:52", "owner": "trey_vogele", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17980639010799413, "text": "And the dihydrogen monoxide won't let you breathe if you are in a room full of it.", "created_at": "2025-02-15T22:44:02", "owner": "lucasaporta07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045828128201493, "text": "Erm... D means deuterium which is an isotope of Hydrogen and M doesn't stand for anything. When discussing the amount, you only put numbers in subscript when discussing a single molecule or compound.", "created_at": "2025-02-15T20:11:52", "owner": "bob_computer_4980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999839424741858, "text": "Took too long to realise that it's just H2O", "created_at": "2025-02-15T18:58:28", "owner": "a_living_creature_7", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18038323292159799, "text": "what about oxidane🤔", "created_at": "2025-02-15T17:20:44", "owner": "northnoi100low", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022473113645356, "text": "Its f***ing water", "created_at": "2025-02-15T16:00:10", "owner": "frankisalexios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087508495562135, "text": "Funny how people find it scary when saying something in chemical terms", "created_at": "2025-02-15T15:58:32", "owner": "ruataralte_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067404328856685, "text": "Are they trying to say h2o", "created_at": "2025-02-15T14:46:27", "owner": "ankits_saga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261673261283665, "text": "Heh ahahahahah looks like I’m special, I drink it everyday, I guess that’s why my mind is so twisted", "created_at": "2025-02-15T14:11:38", "owner": "bopishuh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066492130896681, "text": "Dihydrogen Monoxide? You mean H2O?", "created_at": "2025-02-15T14:08:33", "owner": "3liw4rd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995457492606042, "text": "HAHAHAHAHAHAH", "created_at": "2025-02-15T13:52:04", "owner": "adm.bma09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877857040162446, "text": "It scientifically proved, everyone who had it for even 1 sec has died", "created_at": "2025-02-15T13:13:33", "owner": "_apocope_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944697105953344, "text": "this is my kind of humour.", "created_at": "2025-02-15T11:45:11", "owner": "iiamrni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041463389104635, "text": "H2O?", "created_at": "2025-02-15T10:36:57", "owner": "navaneeeeeeeeethh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18153227794357115, "text": "It's water 💀 what are people on about? 😂", "created_at": "2025-02-15T05:13:53", "owner": "whitenoir33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079996045716276, "text": "I’m going to wash all my DHMO down the sink right now. Clean out everything, bottles, glassware, everything so that nothing is left behind.", "created_at": "2025-02-14T21:45:49", "owner": "derekkanakaraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978707706802740, "text": "I remember going over this in chemistry and it's halarious how many people fell for it", "created_at": "2025-02-14T20:03:17", "owner": "dark1river", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18291113005169208, "text": "I just hate water", "created_at": "2025-02-14T19:16:34", "owner": "bradennoodler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911333295986067, "text": "That stuff is so bad for you", "created_at": "2025-02-14T14:12:29", "owner": "ka_kai_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18489831856010059, "text": "Why is Dr. Egad yappin so hard when he could be getting luigi out of jail rn.", "created_at": "2025-02-14T10:59:24", "owner": "jaundiceoverh20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130403749365148, "text": "I felt like this was bull cause got tricked by this before lmao 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-14T10:34:57", "owner": "sapnp_puas_aseald", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911568819979687, "text": "For those who have become dependent on dihydrogen monoxide, withdrawal means certain death", "created_at": "2025-02-14T06:59:31", "owner": "dna.wo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849263704374917, "text": "I took some such a long time ago, and I became soooo addicted to it😭😭😭 Literately have to take it everyday or else I’ll probably go crazy and die in a few days😭😭😭😭😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-02-14T06:58:15", "owner": "lucas_zhejin_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998402958733337, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-14T03:20:27", "owner": "reachmanavraj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129654145401087, "text": "You forgot to mention the bloating from ingesting dihydrogen monoxide! Some people carry up to 5 pounds of “water weight” just because of this!", "created_at": "2025-02-14T00:56:50", "owner": "panik.attac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110036050455851, "text": "I think we should ban water guys", "created_at": "2025-02-13T23:36:16", "owner": "paulo_godinho_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025593860635940, "text": "phmo more liek it", "created_at": "2025-02-13T16:03:01", "owner": "sawyer.probably", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057249359066345, "text": "i am genuinely wondering if this is a joke cuz we never know anymore (either way its fucking hilarious)", "created_at": "2025-02-13T08:39:20", "owner": "goatee.cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068960008667132, "text": "lol", "created_at": "2025-02-13T00:33:54", "owner": "zacharyvoravong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020238347454792, "text": "i remember when my middle school science teacher did this", "created_at": "2025-02-12T07:53:07", "owner": "buyanbatkhuslen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388786288111703, "text": "Im like 90% sure thats just water right?", "created_at": "2025-02-11T20:45:14", "owner": "goofy_goober_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877934200252025, "text": "Dihydrogen = H2\nMonoxide = O\nH2O\nHmm seems familiar 🤔", "created_at": "2025-02-11T19:20:04", "owner": "farhanju._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272287912301788, "text": "I can’t go 4 days without it I’m addicted", "created_at": "2025-02-11T19:08:31", "owner": "dan_the_man8774", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888738748191127, "text": "H20 right", "created_at": "2025-02-11T10:19:49", "owner": "mango_from_razole", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847914058405431, "text": "Wow H2O, Water is so dangerous", "created_at": "2025-02-10T19:03:47", "owner": "spark__06_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854003131385092, "text": "It sounds even scarier if you use another name for it, Hydroxic Acid, same thing, different name.", "created_at": "2025-02-09T18:30:00", "owner": "haaryehvhashuwal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18459280366070677, "text": "Once my skin got exposed to DHMO and it burned me :(", "created_at": "2025-02-09T15:33:05", "owner": "zoe_jimone", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17960270276753057, "text": "Dihydrogen monoxide ( di+mono = 2 and 1) hydrogen oxygen it's literally H²O", "created_at": "2025-02-09T07:58:27", "owner": "zach_mauricio", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18384295222104047, "text": "Whos gonna tell them lul?", "created_at": "2025-02-09T04:28:44", "owner": "toupsiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842893645415937, "text": "No wonder extreme temps of dihydrogen monoxide hurt. But it's in literally everything and you guys forgot that it also falls from the sky", "created_at": "2025-02-09T03:36:37", "owner": "evan.holshu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059318746823769, "text": "It also has a higher pH than most acids.", "created_at": "2025-02-09T03:09:32", "owner": "pixist12", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18051071792155056, "text": "Isn’t dihyrogen monoxide water", "created_at": "2025-02-08T23:22:16", "owner": "fd.08h", "likes": 65}, {"id": 17924067845924417, "text": "Isn't it just water", "created_at": "2025-02-08T16:38:11", "owner": "praniith.gadia", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18260122864286615, "text": "Me and my brothers always bully employees at stores and ask them to take us to their dihydrogen monoxide 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-02-08T16:31:02", "owner": "nayahslays.w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003920723735627, "text": "Read di hydrogen mon oxide really slowly", "created_at": "2025-02-08T13:47:21", "owner": "jokyoungie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328920790082609, "text": "salad state", "created_at": "2025-02-08T11:27:26", "owner": "efthimia_loukas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468162310071678, "text": "H2O", "created_at": "2025-02-08T10:32:32", "owner": "dhyan.dt.tej", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126324685413863, "text": "I this we should get rid of everything but dhmo", "created_at": "2025-02-08T04:16:05", "owner": "21puppys21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286005232222747, "text": "Water is dangerous", "created_at": "2025-02-08T02:28:51", "owner": "kd00dley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056915972507640, "text": "Don't get addicted kids, the withdraw effects of dihidrogen monoxide are so painful I feel like I'm dying", "created_at": "2025-02-08T01:39:27", "owner": "nolongerbaby08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081498190539724, "text": "It water right I’m not crazy right?", "created_at": "2025-02-08T01:25:01", "owner": "__semeko__", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18049024535330671, "text": "Ban this right now, think of your children 😳", "created_at": "2025-02-08T00:03:44", "owner": "charliemcdougall_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020742191426644, "text": "dihidrogen = 2 hydrogen = H2, monoxide = oxygen = O.. H2O??", "created_at": "2025-02-07T22:57:13", "owner": "shogy___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099829366498719, "text": "Brethren that is water", "created_at": "2025-02-07T22:15:06", "owner": "hurkurbury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482677846049511, "text": "@hottatertotinurmouthburns omg we’re gonna die from drinking H2O 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-02-07T21:09:55", "owner": "ontheflykai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999757596733192, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-02-07T20:33:22", "owner": "notforyoubre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042319007366281, "text": "Wonder what I’m 70% made of", "created_at": "2025-02-07T20:18:15", "owner": "bongcloud._.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062642965736459, "text": "It's causing severe health problems😢", "created_at": "2025-02-07T20:08:51", "owner": "m0azzan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024588110354177, "text": "Let’s all ban it, and dehydrate ourselves to death.", "created_at": "2025-02-07T18:19:40", "owner": "better_call_saul_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011429681703847, "text": "this is why they teach us basic science in school.", "created_at": "2025-02-07T17:57:44", "owner": "lalithaadithya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931657725886550, "text": "100% of people that consumed dihydrogen monoxide DIED", "created_at": "2025-02-07T16:49:54", "owner": "nezeni.im", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897731467133570, "text": "I was like am I trippin? Then no okay 😂 people love spreading misinformation.", "created_at": "2025-02-07T15:33:41", "owner": "hikari_iza_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079987474626235, "text": "Dihydrogen oxide killed most of mankind.", "created_at": "2025-02-07T14:35:14", "owner": "daniel.nip.94", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051030257173767, "text": "Iq test", "created_at": "2025-02-07T13:03:29", "owner": "adrian.r5400", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042974075342122, "text": "Lats ban fishes too, they are working with dihydroganemonoxide.", "created_at": "2025-02-07T11:42:09", "owner": "kulahanefe17", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049674406956364, "text": "eye of rah ahh haircut", "created_at": "2025-02-07T11:24:29", "owner": "carcrashgm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935824449860679, "text": "Once you start drinking dihydrogen monoxide, you can't stop", "created_at": "2025-02-07T10:59:03", "owner": "mqlons", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957074343883090, "text": "I’m sorry, isn’t that just H2O? Water???????", "created_at": "2025-02-07T09:47:05", "owner": "ashley.pvtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046973363332502, "text": "Dihydrogen monoxide really is harmful and the main issue is of its increasing consumption by us, thankfully we are using it so much that it's depleting", "created_at": "2025-02-07T08:31:31", "owner": "enzymerike_165", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050557141944321, "text": "H2O is water bruh?!", "created_at": "2025-02-07T02:50:11", "owner": "lv_was_here_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358015171121516, "text": "They say if you drink it too much you won’t be able to live without it 😰", "created_at": "2025-02-07T02:24:39", "owner": "udonknowavy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091738804534928, "text": "i cant go two days without dihydrogen monoxide thats how addicted i am to", "created_at": "2025-02-07T00:10:33", "owner": "cooltoes.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149507821360734, "text": "Aint that jus water??", "created_at": "2025-02-06T22:46:07", "owner": "jr12.79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18213289078293689, "text": "Can't go a couple hours without it...", "created_at": "2025-02-06T22:14:19", "owner": "ze_royal_battalion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903088264017971, "text": "We can tell", "created_at": "2025-02-06T18:55:32", "owner": "andersonmorrissey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053564801109608, "text": "Whos gonna tell them that dhmo is just another name for water. Tap water.", "created_at": "2025-02-06T16:18:24", "owner": "jxhn.pope", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075352168659874, "text": "Bleach has a Ph of 12, while dihydrogen monoxide has 7, making it 5 scales more acidic than bleach.", "created_at": "2025-02-06T16:11:55", "owner": "zachbuyspower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060652393769098, "text": "It’s water everyone.", "created_at": "2025-02-06T13:29:19", "owner": "joshua_200815", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103037218487562, "text": "Bruh thats water lol", "created_at": "2025-02-06T11:37:31", "owner": "_yoshiiqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035730665438922, "text": "It scares me how many people didn't realise this is satire 😭", "created_at": "2025-02-06T07:19:25", "owner": "mishikabanerjee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995145498602700, "text": "The first scene. It is so sad that people sign things when they have no idea what it is about.\nDihydrogenmonoxide is H2O so water", "created_at": "2025-02-06T04:55:43", "owner": "mcmp17432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030848378536984, "text": "…H2O?💀", "created_at": "2025-02-06T04:37:48", "owner": "ar_eez__64", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["dhmo", "bandhmo", "chemistry"]},
{"media_id": 3459847993145660626, "shortcode": "DAD2WswS5TS", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAD2WswS5TS/", "taken_at": "2024-09-18T13:28:36", "caption": "Hold and enjoy the returns 😊\n#realtoronaharley #dubai", "owner_username": "realtoronaharley", "owner_id": "2042604256", "likes": 601663, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0126_DAD2WswS5TS\\DAD2WswS5TS_20240918_132836.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17965178771889852, "text": "bro, what's the account name of this original video ?", "created_at": "2025-03-26T09:48:15", "owner": "sydmzmil", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18060835102785820, "text": "@ethan_vincent_09 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-13T16:47:09", "owner": "tompottelet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076838737657876, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-02-10T18:37:47", "owner": "swing.tgs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18480991390053293, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-25T09:47:08", "owner": "luxurycurtains.ae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020235152403116, "text": "What music is playing in the background?", "created_at": "2025-01-09T07:33:04", "owner": "devtrivedi___", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18019718309402224, "text": "I’m not giving my money to anybody with that accent", "created_at": "2025-01-08T18:16:00", "owner": "samherloozoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033172706579682, "text": "I wish I would have invested 1.7 million instead of being 1", "created_at": "2025-01-03T19:49:45", "owner": "kaminski1755", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18063866248682518, "text": "Brampton", "created_at": "2025-01-02T07:45:51", "owner": "mandyryan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924812508901872, "text": "That one friend who keeps on yapping instead of doing work", "created_at": "2025-01-02T05:44:35", "owner": "yewemii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020956529341614, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-01T05:25:59", "owner": "theboondoggler0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080176021524966, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-28T00:41:10", "owner": "az_zealous", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157291870329399, "text": "Not funny I didn't laugh. Your joke is so bad I would have preferred the joke went over my head and you gave up re-telling me the joke.\nTo be honest this is a horrid attempt at trying to get a laugh out of me. Not a chuckle, not a hehe, not even a subtle burst of air out of my esophagus. Science says before you laugh your brain preps your face muscles but l didn't even feel the slightest twitch. 0/10 this joke is so bad I cannot believe anyone legally allowed you to be creative at all. The amount of brain power you must have put into that joke has the potential to power every house on Earth. Get a personality and learn how to make jokes, read a book. I'm not saying this to be funny I genuinely mean it on how this is just bottom barrel embarrassment at comedy.\nYou've single handedly killed humor and every comedic act on the planet. I'm so disappointed that society has failed as a whole in being able to teach you how to be funny. Honestly if I put in all my power and time to try and make your joke funny it would require Einstein himself to build a device to strap me into so I can be connected to the energy of a billion stars to do it, and even then all that joke would get from people is a subtle scuff. You're lucky I still have the slightest of empathy for you after telling that joke otherwise I would have committed every war crime in the book just to prevent you from attempting any humor ever again. We should put that joke in text books so future generations can be wary of becoming such an absolute comedic failure. Im disappointed, hurt, and outright offended that my precious time has been wasted in my brain understanding that joke. In the time that took I was planning on helping kids who have been orphaned, but because of that you've waisted my time explaining the obscene integrity of your terrible attempt at comedy.\nNow those kids are suffering without meals and there's nobody to blame but you. I hope you're happy with what you have done and I truly hope you can move on and learn from this piss poor attempt", "created_at": "2024-12-26T19:03:12", "owner": "afg.zub", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052672472493599, "text": "Bro in  2011 I was 10", "created_at": "2024-12-24T17:51:46", "owner": "chaoticdominance", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020263682379270, "text": "@kristian__strand @gentkrueziu @willinordheim", "created_at": "2024-12-23T17:55:46", "owner": "martinjorgensn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885253705177674, "text": "Everyone hates the palm?", "created_at": "2024-12-22T15:23:51", "owner": "realadventuregod", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045682981941484, "text": "The fact of life 👏", "created_at": "2024-12-20T20:28:10", "owner": "harryhanknguyen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18477733969041545, "text": "I was 11 years old 💀", "created_at": "2024-12-20T14:19:49", "owner": "caueiser", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18375261544116827, "text": "Voice same like @zaibsheikh 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T08:01:42", "owner": "sia.lish__xo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125627161397612, "text": "Where can I find the original video of him??", "created_at": "2024-12-19T12:10:13", "owner": "morefaith.kr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061834558834970, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T11:31:05", "owner": "duwisbhdehdvwjsuwuwbwjwi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061538743705777, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T04:49:30", "owner": "tiisaa13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941795019798621, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-17T20:42:37", "owner": "halwara_guri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18333288235154695, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T08:49:57", "owner": "sachi1020325", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988121316762123, "text": "Trust me bro. A person who has millions is not gonna be on Instagram reels.", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:09:20", "owner": "norflux", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988982367766228, "text": "Omg, this is funny", "created_at": "2024-12-11T11:18:58", "owner": "lifelovemagnets", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068607046663225, "text": "How can I invest if I’m dead?