{"media_id": 3429311069548304313, "shortcode": "C-XXD-cvde5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-XXD-cvde5/", "taken_at": "2024-08-07T10:17:00", "caption": "彗星流し☄️ウィンカーの軌跡がお気に入り☺️\n\n🔗撮影依頼はプロフィールから🔗\n@yuki_photo_jp \n\n#sony #α7ⅳ #photography #streetphotography #japan #japanphoto #osaka #沼とび #ストリートスナップ #街角スナップ #東京カメラ部 #tokyocameraclub #みんなのふぉと #私のふぉと #流し撮り #panningshot #nightphotography #車好きな人と繋がりたい #彗星流し #写真好きな人と繋がりたい #タクシー #彗星流し", "owner_username": "yuki_photo_jp", "owner_id": "60526017091", "likes": 69008, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0130_C-XXD-cvde5\\C-XXD-cvde5_20240807_101700.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18043225175253990, "text": "준내 신기하네;;;", "created_at": "2025-01-30T23:42:56", "owner": "miniminiminimini_min", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977036385672608, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-30T15:38:42", "owner": "balkanbesime", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045116393212902, "text": "Which app he used?", "created_at": "2025-01-22T01:05:55", "owner": "aaronrvh_photo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18165113002325459, "text": "かっこいい　🤩", "created_at": "2025-01-19T12:32:51", "owner": "timherzer.de", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908944320984053, "text": "That’s the coolest printing machine I’ve ever seen", "created_at": "2025-01-19T04:43:05", "owner": "clockwork__revolution", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097223512443172, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-16T00:27:34", "owner": "photoaddicted25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125688091405266, "text": "How do you Open that Screen Like that", "created_at": "2025-01-09T22:54:56", "owner": "efexyksn12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014685500480475, "text": "@csp__photographyy", "created_at": "2025-01-07T23:15:38", "owner": "vonhartentattoos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885423157090729, "text": "⚡️⚡️⚡️", "created_at": "2025-01-01T19:45:47", "owner": "chromavue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056320849798112, "text": "プリンターの機種は何？", "created_at": "2024-12-30T17:34:00", "owner": "hotyuta200", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18266036377271708, "text": "😮👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-27T17:32:28", "owner": "pull.the.haze", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043709096273103, "text": "bringing a printer with u during photoshoot is wild 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T05:02:32", "owner": "ronycapture", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997747197557095, "text": "Hello, great video ! Is your ohone showing what your lens see while your shooting ?", "created_at": "2024-12-20T00:29:53", "owner": "bukalonski.hirota", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065407603806463, "text": "Doing way to much", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:29:37", "owner": "juli.r0ku", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016383128416627, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:01:53", "owner": "bwd_supercars", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071630749714234, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-12-15T09:19:58", "owner": "fewperspective", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047869721106626, "text": "What is the name of the printer that printed the photos?", "created_at": "2024-12-12T04:22:26", "owner": "myokosena_the_witch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100680430463457, "text": "Menyala Sensei 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-10T01:45:01", "owner": "freeze.key", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997693815545953, "text": "👏👏🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-09T02:07:05", "owner": "eborgez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099734068471066, "text": "This might be my favorite panned shots I've seen on Instagram.", "created_at": "2024-12-07T18:39:59", "owner": "s1r1us_photography", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936816735822780, "text": "🙌🏻🙌🏻🙌🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:37:15", "owner": "bjspark93", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850482004309533, "text": "Shutter speed and settings ?", "created_at": "2024-12-01T06:22:13", "owner": "itz_abdul.249", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18438288793073250, "text": "これをフィルムカメラでやってみようと思う俺は馬鹿ですかね…笑現像するまでわからない楽しみを活かしたくて", "created_at": "2024-11-26T07:31:28", "owner": "linp.11_18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006179777690305, "text": "このスマホで編集してるソフト？アプリ？を教えて頂けませんか？", "created_at": "2024-11-25T14:13:14", "owner": "kk_sadoisland", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011439128465529, "text": "Wow cool😍", "created_at": "2024-11-24T12:18:20", "owner": "ikutannet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051879832949639, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:54:24", "owner": "albaraafilms", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056787706910532, "text": "Como se llama la impresora? \nQuisiera obtener una\nPff me encantan tus fotos hermano", "created_at": "2024-11-17T05:25:23", "owner": "photographer.juanpa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064591465703106, "text": "Printer name?", "created_at": "2024-11-17T02:52:41", "owner": "majkic.nikola0230", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987858921602688, "text": "Different Level", "created_at": "2024-11-17T01:49:39", "owner": "life.is.a.journey_seoul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852564274329019, "text": "So coool ！！！\nPlease let me know what app you are using,it's looks so convenient!!", "created_at": "2024-11-15T16:34:50", "owner": "zhi_lifeisamazing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901820443076391, "text": "こういう写真を撮る時の設定はどうなりますか", "created_at": "2024-11-15T12:38:53", "owner": "kukhwa.pic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946169886873053, "text": "What was the app you had on you phone for masking", "created_at": "2024-11-14T06:06:37", "owner": "austin_l1247", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049315052508095, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:55:26", "owner": "taisiyapitteloud", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144939484351394, "text": "What type of printer do you have?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T04:32:28", "owner": "itsaleig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067275328592461, "text": "you got that wangan look 🤩🤩", "created_at": "2024-11-08T08:42:45", "owner": "ab.l_1123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986079420737713, "text": "撮影してる時に、カメラの上に何が載ってるのかと思えば、スマホか！これで画面録画で収録してたんですね！", "created_at": "2024-11-07T08:07:01", "owner": "puruuuun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18302114800202065, "text": "what called that printer", "created_at": "2024-11-07T07:28:52", "owner": "angooooola", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044938082097134, "text": "Learned this photo technique in highschool, bro just got expensive shiz", "created_at": "2024-11-06T03:59:15", "owner": "yakespriv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18428162629078135, "text": "Name of printer?", "created_at": "2024-11-04T11:33:59", "owner": "gabxzcuuu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877963357178766, "text": "Wowwwwwww😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-31T03:33:13", "owner": "joeyoflicks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061432693748129, "text": "めっちゃ早そうに見える！！すご！！\n何のカメラ使ってるんですか？", "created_at": "2024-10-28T14:05:37", "owner": "qv.n_nyc5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069321883621312, "text": "Exifs ?", "created_at": "2024-10-27T20:22:27", "owner": "francois.pix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047496052990772, "text": "great shot!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-22T09:22:57", "owner": "senni_photos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036120458267196, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-21T19:05:41", "owner": "mindwamda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045902624005625, "text": "What app Is?", "created_at": "2024-10-21T06:38:08", "owner": "machain_real", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054760213723872, "text": "What editing app is that?", "created_at": "2024-10-20T04:20:12", "owner": "al7x.m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059602138775815, "text": "Awesome 👌", "created_at": "2024-10-19T19:43:06", "owner": "cagri.art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973793196790483, "text": "I am new into photography, may I asked what I am gonna need to buy in order to make videos like those, I mean the printer what type of camera what components am I gonna need for this set up?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:41:07", "owner": "stergios_gotsikas", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863436718184958, "text": "👌🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-17T03:00:39", "owner": "thepoiknotufphiew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019499726535961, "text": "What printer is that?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T21:33:27", "owner": "daniel28captures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116387599404151, "text": "Thats awesome‼️‼️‼️", "created_at": "2024-10-16T06:49:50", "owner": "ihongaro_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062601595673589, "text": "What was your shutter speed on that shot", "created_at": "2024-10-13T12:24:06", "owner": "beej.photography", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023464016219671, "text": "Wow 😮. Great shot 🔥😍", "created_at": "2024-10-12T05:54:21", "owner": "moments.by.bernard", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964392504805438, "text": "What did you do in the mobile phone app?", "created_at": "2024-10-12T00:11:01", "owner": "manhappyrich", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289110820226742, "text": "might have to try this next time i shoot 😍", "created_at": "2024-10-11T23:26:01", "owner": "_nicks_media", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009571574640059, "text": "What app do you use to record your Camera on iPhone?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T23:23:57", "owner": "tiimmmoooo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895616467000384, "text": "Amazing !", "created_at": "2024-10-10T20:47:48", "owner": "murillo.602", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025465199176954, "text": "Vitesse d’obturation combien ?", "created_at": "2024-10-09T18:39:12", "owner": "nat100an._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989535510569778, "text": "One sec opening?", "created_at": "2024-10-08T22:10:07", "owner": "bergmanibergen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993000939705341, "text": "@dns616_ 学到了", "created_at": "2024-10-08T12:30:13", "owner": "nimmo_o6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149248093331885, "text": "Bro I thought he was taking a photo of his FL studio project 🤣🤣😐 @duncanscott__", "created_at": "2024-10-06T19:04:05", "owner": "callumajreid", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18022026734234563, "text": "I want this printer", "created_at": "2024-10-06T15:37:36", "owner": "filmwithenrique", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952155885839436, "text": "Lens?", "created_at": "2024-10-06T05:25:27", "owner": "unyusd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17987650307583744, "text": "Do You use flash at the beginning of the shot?", "created_at": "2024-10-05T20:25:44", "owner": "poncedeleon.fer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028197092121431, "text": "This is a cool shot 📸", "created_at": "2024-10-05T20:23:31", "owner": "jason.fenstermaker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045975199972248, "text": "How?!", "created_at": "2024-10-05T19:20:44", "owner": "tannerhoelphoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878046895157186, "text": "What device are you using to record your viewfinder?", "created_at": "2024-10-05T18:49:31", "owner": "abstrctxn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136218826324520, "text": "I was waiting for you to go running after the car and delivering the picture 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-05T03:15:00", "owner": "alexxtoodope", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18467289142037550, "text": "Why do you have phone on top of camera? Results are perfect btw 🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-04T22:41:49", "owner": "noname_alex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029054303104148, "text": "The building looks like FL Studio in dark mode 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T21:39:04", "owner": "kokorop", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015415493618828, "text": "Could you please tell the settings you used for this shot? 1/4 What F and ISO? Thank you! 🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-04T02:08:32", "owner": "epajesus", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17930257280946455, "text": "🔥 I really really want that printer", "created_at": "2024-10-03T13:45:49", "owner": "barringtonodyssey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960081915805890, "text": "name of printer?", "created_at": "2024-10-03T11:44:30", "owner": "restyonoilham.sp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069558427720798, "text": "I want that’s mini printer what’s is call name?", "created_at": "2024-10-03T09:48:02", "owner": "ferdi_ansyah1993", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009144416413829, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-03T09:35:11", "owner": "airforcexn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17920036106976067, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-02T13:31:35", "owner": "rockandroll42121", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18340321573124057, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2024-10-02T08:05:20", "owner": "cat_asterisk0109", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103912621428380, "text": "Brutal 👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-02T02:06:16", "owner": "lentedeoscar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18272166958300863, "text": "Guauuu😍", "created_at": "2024-10-01T22:19:06", "owner": "edgarvicedo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129732538371148, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-01T20:47:26", "owner": "jmontillay_visuals", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056390755864110, "text": "It looks like FL studio", "created_at": "2024-10-01T07:52:58", "owner": "ninetofivetribe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18356740000191782, "text": "Why cable Phone to camera ? Do u use a special app for settings and transmit this to camera?", "created_at": "2024-09-30T21:25:58", "owner": "milo.x.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890893648094434, "text": "This is crazy, I love this tech thanks for sharing!", "created_at": "2024-09-30T20:50:34", "owner": "journials", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043421641871792, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-30T13:03:15", "owner": "scott_tie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18103893403441133, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-09-30T10:33:26", "owner": "hey.shxx._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944444178856966, "text": "Little back button focus :)", "created_at": "2024-09-30T05:46:08", "owner": "fortytwoflat", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17856817242267377, "text": "«А чё так можно было?»… Some untranslatable Russian quote. 🤯😍🤗 Lovely.", "created_at": "2024-09-30T05:29:50", "owner": "andreandreoncameras", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046879234939098, "text": "What application are you using?", "created_at": "2024-09-30T00:53:17", "owner": "yakitori340", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042779419870970, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-29T20:10:31", "owner": "martin.inmotion", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042054305041885, "text": "Great work! Panning shots are always fun.", "created_at": "2024-09-29T19:10:28", "owner": "houstonrayphotography", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18363568411109951, "text": "在台灣，你會被當作偷拍者，並且遭受毆打。", "created_at": "2024-09-29T11:59:41", "owner": "mcmxcv.vii.xxiii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890042080096572, "text": "Lovely technique", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:49:15", "owner": "m8183t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044029420962365, "text": "@21films.de", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:21:40", "owner": "elias_p_1_7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882595102109586, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-29T01:12:13", "owner": "lieubuicong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021794804436156, "text": "How is it possibile to have everything in Motion a part from the car?\nWhile moving the camera shouldn’t the car be in Motion? Is it a settimo of the camera?", "created_at": "2024-09-28T21:30:22", "owner": "tommasoagatensi", "likes": 109}, {"id": 18051703903857512, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-28T21:05:33", "owner": "khaled_alhajri82", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072234214604482, "text": "スマホでは何を移してますか？", "created_at": "2024-09-28T10:41:48", "owner": "raiti0203", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856219876221105, "text": "@hendyginting777", "created_at": "2024-09-28T05:13:55", "owner": "kolaliandri_ginting", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018820064272461, "text": "70200f4のレンズだと難しいでしょうか？", "created_at": "2024-09-28T00:50:24", "owner": "honamitakemura", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033403256514302, "text": "為啥手機可以當監看螢幕", "created_at": "2024-09-27T01:25:01", "owner": "popococogogo3", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["sony", "α7ⅳ", "photography", "streetphotography", "japan", "japanphoto", "osaka", "沼とび", "ストリートスナップ", "街角スナップ", "東京カメラ部", "tokyocameraclub", "みんなのふぉと", "私のふぉと", "流し撮り", "panningshot", "nightphotography", "車好きな人と繋がりたい", "彗星流し", "写真好きな人と繋がりたい", "タクシー", "彗星流し"]},
{"media_id": 3462931515874373891, "shortcode": "DAOzd3FMnED", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAOzd3FMnED/", "taken_at": "2024-09-22T19:33:47", "caption": "Meet the 2024/25 Committee! We are looking forward to meeting so many of you over freshers week, make sure you come see us at the Activities Fair at stall 79 in the Octagon on Tuesday!\n\nWant to join our amazing committee this year and get involved with the SU’s fundraisers? Our EGM opens tomorrow so keep an eye out on our stories for more info!", "owner_username": "sheffieldrag", "owner_id": "609147949", "likes": 44, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0131_DAOzd3FMnED\\DAOzd3FMnED_20240922_193347_9.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3423087234738073161, "shortcode": "C-BP7QlvK5J", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-BP7QlvK5J/", "taken_at": "2024-07-29T20:12:46", "caption": "Follow @ravemoments2 for more💀🐦\n.\n.\n.\n#bassfest #drumandbass #dnb #dnbnation #andyc #chaseandstatus #subfocus #edm #edmlifestyle #rave #tomorrowland #tomorrowland2024", "owner_username": "ravemoments2", "owner_id": "8305204173", "likes": 341220, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0132_C-BP7QlvK5J\\C-BP7QlvK5J_20240729_201246.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17905689027004244, "text": "Bunch of crybabies in these comments 💀 She’s having the time of her life and it was probably a friend who posted it originally, get out your bag and let people have fun 🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-30T02:19:55", "owner": "ragebaitttv", "likes": 11239}, {"id": 18030906749473194, "text": "Definitely a rave moment 😂", "created_at": "2024-07-29T21:21:06", "owner": "jenkinslerias", "likes": 22416}, {"id": 17896646892096317, "text": "es @alanafloresf en el  Stream Fighters", "created_at": "2024-11-17T02:59:31", "owner": "_casparin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067054666654443, "text": "Legend has it she is still trippin", "created_at": "2024-10-27T05:23:00", "owner": "michael_popescu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18060276949813067, "text": "Government bird drones are real mannn", "created_at": "2024-10-27T00:45:34", "owner": "yaotl.testament", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051785221766337, "text": "Stay off the marijuanas", "created_at": "2024-10-26T20:15:03", "owner": "angrysteveeye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290024845233673, "text": "Certeza que o pompo falou com ela !", "created_at": "2024-10-26T18:59:44", "owner": "iaivini_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099444811460737, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-26T16:49:03", "owner": "marciofreak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063863590675944, "text": "trip of her life", "created_at": "2024-10-26T14:01:03", "owner": "iitamarfallek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981070758768294, "text": "Ela ficou encantada na pomba do cara kkkk", "created_at": "2024-10-26T10:27:50", "owner": "lucasdca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064185802678601, "text": "Her name is Vivian Botswana and she lives in Cardiff. Her father was a pigeon breeder so this felt rather profound to her button ➡️", "created_at": "2024-10-26T07:06:59", "owner": "mrdancunningham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047492911993474, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-26T06:34:15", "owner": "jacob68_520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030499979363665, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-26T06:14:23", "owner": "noseusamas1208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069711301624024, "text": "Been there 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-25T21:57:55", "owner": "toucanman69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074287696520749, "text": "Those who know:", "created_at": "2024-10-25T20:12:46", "owner": "7d80214", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18255891364255371, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-25T15:46:03", "owner": "haroldofisioterapia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047229422056563, "text": "Nadie habla del chico que esta atras", "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:12:53", "owner": "leti.bel17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939645723795407, "text": "Tbh I want whatever she’s on😂", "created_at": "2024-10-25T12:35:46", "owner": "leilanis_privv18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004352981672462, "text": "Que triste.", "created_at": "2024-10-25T12:05:26", "owner": "iaramdsr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904150821965695, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-25T06:18:47", "owner": "machy_skater69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022169030267758, "text": "Birdy kiss 👏🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-24T22:58:24", "owner": "juliethawkinsofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056495728718628, "text": "Buscar jesus ninguém quer ne", "created_at": "2024-10-24T22:54:24", "owner": "_brito_ofc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077296912562452, "text": "@psheehan6 need to get this for Lou!", "created_at": "2024-10-24T21:58:51", "owner": "domerbzomer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056112472886081, "text": "That’s that dust", "created_at": "2024-10-24T20:53:48", "owner": "dzrhmslf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052556260913488, "text": "Whaouw…", "created_at": "2024-10-24T19:38:10", "owner": "olivpizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011884220396017, "text": "She's going through it rn", "created_at": "2024-10-24T17:54:00", "owner": "astronautintime2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016431974632607, "text": "Ода доза", "created_at": "2024-10-24T17:13:09", "owner": "kittis_s_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888940987105547, "text": "Just my type!", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:50:12", "owner": "selvaje1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957524295715857, "text": "@eugabriela._  já sabe ner kakakakkakakkaka", "created_at": "2024-10-24T00:52:43", "owner": "stardan.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863249566253432, "text": "Higher than the clouds", "created_at": "2024-10-23T21:08:01", "owner": "zsoti_zsolt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852893560263398, "text": "Imagine if cops used this for a dui. “Sir I need you to follow my bird, with only your eyes!” 💀", "created_at": "2024-10-23T20:42:35", "owner": "moreno2011", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073107958589654, "text": "@kacper.rietz czy to nie Aniela? 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-23T16:28:51", "owner": "michaelangelo66666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859397608268753, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:33:21", "owner": "gustavoa._castro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050412637785972, "text": "That girl is on everything but skates😭😂🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-23T13:20:47", "owner": "saint.chr1stopher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043734782040806, "text": "Orgulho doa pais", "created_at": "2024-10-23T11:42:23", "owner": "dav.tws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045238567862215, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-23T11:40:27", "owner": "mthanasides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023784869239748, "text": "let people have fun? This is pure degeneracy and a sign that our culture is quite literally dying. This shouldn't be what young people are doing for fun, frying their brain with chemicals and dopamine. It honestly borderline makes me want to cry seeing this.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:57:29", "owner": "pyriscent", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18280552438245187, "text": "I want 10x what she's had", "created_at": "2024-10-23T07:02:18", "owner": "chefstah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044654116888975, "text": "Rolling balls lol she’s without a doubt on cloud 9 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-23T05:49:16", "owner": "patriick.jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088110649503026, "text": "Cause she knows the bird is the word.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T04:18:31", "owner": "mikemesserart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999888582690727, "text": "So cute lol", "created_at": "2024-10-23T00:55:19", "owner": "drakes.turtleneck.sweater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065689423711538, "text": "She was probably thinking something like: “why and how is that real, 100% alive pigeon just dancing in front of my face? It’s incredible, it matches the beat perfectly, it’s like magic. I’m witnessing a pigeon prodigy, a brilliant bird, an amazing avian… wait you’re recording this aren’t you? I bet I looked hilarious just now” *laughs* 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:51:31", "owner": "defiantdaydreamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340476964123790, "text": "Doo-in drugs 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:45:42", "owner": "stevie_marshy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316588729086242, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:45:16", "owner": "stevie_marshy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043369934120118, "text": "Bassfest was lit", "created_at": "2024-10-22T13:20:36", "owner": "chrnix05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301358560201423, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-22T10:51:03", "owner": "kabobbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033795719069805, "text": "Need to experience this", "created_at": "2024-10-22T08:48:25", "owner": "d0gforreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040824740130931, "text": "Why record her? You could cost her her career. This is why I'd never do anything in public spaces. It's ruined.", "created_at": "2024-10-22T06:54:10", "owner": "tyrone_glisson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947892513761607, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-22T00:05:37", "owner": "zwaon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010041614448265, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T23:48:20", "owner": "tiffany024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942792954781903, "text": "\"Fun\"", "created_at": "2024-10-21T19:30:28", "owner": "kylerjohnson77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021463436612055, "text": "she looks 15", "created_at": "2024-10-21T18:02:12", "owner": "souls_addict46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359981437114711, "text": "@gilbertomorales926 la paloma jaja", "created_at": "2024-10-21T15:57:02", "owner": "lolorock", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079045552526918, "text": "She's on a different planet lol", "created_at": "2024-10-21T10:03:23", "owner": "kungfuchrissy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025162532184442, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-21T05:11:54", "owner": "giovanni_figueroa1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058283536830245, "text": "Kevin in a rave", "created_at": "2024-10-21T02:18:44", "owner": "raellelowe.author", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109598245420987, "text": "@emiratestravelers", "created_at": "2024-10-20T17:57:59", "owner": "emiratestravelers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471593842063013, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-10-20T07:22:49", "owner": "juliafeike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890239732034864, "text": "Uyuşturucu içmiş🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-20T06:09:04", "owner": "anunakiler22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045185342506879, "text": "I miss festivals and class-A drugs 😭", "created_at": "2024-10-20T01:38:13", "owner": "streetnochaser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039143843136319, "text": "Норм вставило", "created_at": "2024-10-20T01:04:44", "owner": "twtltrtd99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078735721554486, "text": "That’s someone’s daughter 😢", "created_at": "2024-10-20T00:20:49", "owner": "boroe1", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18375532636098299, "text": "Want a light show?\nNo thanks\nHow bout a bird show?\nDOWN.", "created_at": "2024-10-20T00:17:17", "owner": "jjtakesnaturephotos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062842519674118, "text": "THE GUY IN THE BUCKET LMFAOOO", "created_at": "2024-10-19T20:11:38", "owner": "xa0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103219807450755, "text": "PIGEON???😱😱😱😱😱😱💀💀💀💀💀😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-10-19T19:10:39", "owner": "ryanjamesdavis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151098538336722, "text": "Smoke weed everyday", "created_at": "2024-10-19T18:40:46", "owner": "kennylafrance99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048056443947939, "text": "This is someone's daughter", "created_at": "2024-10-19T16:29:30", "owner": "luiszeta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895914208082764, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T16:09:42", "owner": "_2045", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937819032920094, "text": "Yer bird gets trolled by pidgeons", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:46:53", "owner": "charlesfergie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864051181181558, "text": "Which drugs did you take? \"Yes\"", "created_at": "2024-10-19T10:04:51", "owner": "nicolajmk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034602194206433, "text": "Fumou ate o traficante kkakakaka", "created_at": "2024-10-19T05:17:01", "owner": "ariane_caaroline", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18034988603251330, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-19T04:28:06", "owner": "marfanthemartian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856202419236045, "text": "A brisa tá insana", "created_at": "2024-10-19T00:37:34", "owner": "emanuele_castroh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921530526982358, "text": "Yo bien foco", "created_at": "2024-10-18T20:46:59", "owner": "lliileean.vp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954900102834044, "text": "i want one", "created_at": "2024-10-18T19:59:33", "owner": "twiztidsteve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043372736044314, "text": "People in the comments acting like they wouldn't be enchanted by the amazing pidgon. I would be amazed if someone started doing this with or without drugs", "created_at": "2024-10-18T16:57:47", "owner": "danoling.555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919664706891800, "text": "Imagine how she looks when she sees a", "created_at": "2024-10-17T22:22:20", "owner": "felippe_karate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900133305986065, "text": "I've been that high", "created_at": "2024-10-17T19:58:51", "owner": "the.militant.black.proletarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042822755031227, "text": "Essa foi longe 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-17T19:03:45", "owner": "maryanapimentel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052626544905550, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-17T17:01:29", "owner": "tauro_x10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035601458223434, "text": "☘️", "created_at": "2024-10-17T16:31:06", "owner": "_________________8000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982689639610003, "text": "That poor girl was not ready bless her heart", "created_at": "2024-10-17T13:14:55", "owner": "jackrileyosborne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929188617841487, "text": "Vai vai i tuoi genitori sono fieri di te... 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-17T12:03:04", "owner": "giuse89041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879237532158067, "text": "Drugs!", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:41:20", "owner": "daniel072411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060212152701900, "text": "I just know she’s having the absolute best time of her life 🩵", "created_at": "2024-10-17T03:51:04", "owner": "_linzzbinz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943638867900193, "text": "Damn. Sad 😔", "created_at": "2024-10-17T03:17:51", "owner": "matthugs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013352972378034, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2024-10-17T01:18:50", "owner": "yowes.ttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246862306283259, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-16T23:01:46", "owner": "kimmied73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034608365224656, "text": "Raves are full of people who will live and die with a negative net worth", "created_at": "2024-10-16T18:43:56", "owner": "dgb2u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147865219337746, "text": "ketrified", "created_at": "2024-10-16T16:21:59", "owner": "caseycharl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862475749250067, "text": "She is in her universe", "created_at": "2024-10-16T15:15:46", "owner": "alberto_nicola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974661156786900, "text": "Don't do kids drugs", "created_at": "2024-10-16T14:54:03", "owner": "pumattack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925447464972434, "text": "گادپری بیرحم", "created_at": "2024-10-16T14:45:34", "owner": "ayoub_vaisi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049222750780393, "text": "It's very sad😢", "created_at": "2024-10-16T11:33:03", "owner": "ivo.c.pimentel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032325818355156, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-16T05:04:16", "owner": "zoveria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020433266568860, "text": "Dron", "created_at": "2024-10-16T02:49:32", "owner": "lupo_122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101759764450233, "text": "I was a guinea pig for this younger generation and at age 55 I'm still thinking okay. Here's hoping...", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:45:19", "owner": "factoryrecordsdavenoise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023050247407822, "text": "Imagine coming down from that trip and then seeing this video of you. 💀", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:05:30", "owner": "candace_alyse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029132495123115, "text": "I wanna be the man with the pidgeon one day", "created_at": "2024-10-16T00:58:06", "owner": "josecayala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027839267138822, "text": "😂😂kids don’t do drugs❤️🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-16T00:10:59", "owner": "joygoddess13", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["bassfest", "drumandbass", "dnb", "dnbnation", "andyc", "chaseandstatus", "subfocus", "edm", "edmlifestyle", "rave", "tomorrowland", "tomorrowland2024"]},
{"media_id": 3462612665800146529, "shortcode": "DANq9-zyT5h", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DANq9-zyT5h/", "taken_at": "2024-09-22T09:00:00", "caption": "補充：與其他狗顏色不同的是白狗，白狗只有一隻，如果您看到多於一隻白狗，請立刻離開，明天再送過來一次", "owner_username": "okfine_ggyy", "owner_id": "37015100095", "likes": -1, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0133_DANq9-zyT5h\\DANq9-zyT5h_20240922_090000.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18058256734648124, "text": "他就不怕有心人士在狗粮下药哦", "created_at": "2024-10-03T23:45:14", "owner": "daozhi0924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959864295810569, "text": "好奇通關獎勵是啥", "created_at": "2024-10-01T09:58:13", "owner": "junhong_1218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101187871449009, "text": "@getty100t 看留言哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-09-30T05:49:25", "owner": "tsaitsai_0618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107233681426641, "text": "@4llen_1124", "created_at": "2024-09-27T03:22:32", "owner": "winsta_9288", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877010359088395, "text": "也請不要靠近中間那隻棕色的，他是袋鼠會出拳", "created_at": "2024-09-26T22:07:50", "owner": "a71890564", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057772507697895, "text": "可以用程式語言簡化敘述：", "created_at": "2024-09-25T08:43:41", "owner": "patrick11041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056971069758983, "text": "80/20法則\n養了5條狗 就1條能幫主人幹點正事 果然是世間的法則", "created_at": "2024-09-25T07:37:14", "owner": "aiden92_clt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022356680433056, "text": "結果紙板後面是「白狗是棕色的，棕狗是白色的。」", "created_at": "2024-09-25T03:49:03", "owner": "_de_watas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276973366169772, "text": "好詳細的說明😂", "created_at": "2024-09-24T06:28:38", "owner": "__napping__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904857811041321, "text": "他", "created_at": "2024-09-24T00:10:20", "owner": "yousonofeach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847296946280362, "text": "npc解任務", "created_at": "2024-09-23T14:48:37", "owner": "juanwei.1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014796179628098, "text": "@lancelot_isme", "created_at": "2024-09-23T11:59:53", "owner": "vincent__1120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18254768602248860, "text": "是走在規則的前線", "created_at": "2024-09-23T10:07:36", "owner": "yumi.tasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032445176040876, "text": "咩事😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T10:03:33", "owner": "gladyskaka_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985242213589285, "text": "要如何确认这些话不是白狗写出来误导人类的？🧐", "created_at": "2024-09-23T09:21:10", "owner": "hannwaits1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893820594999760, "text": "這麼搞笑", "created_at": "2024-09-23T01:35:48", "owner": "willsdejavu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247959664256704, "text": "沙雕動畫嗎？😂", "created_at": "2024-09-23T00:37:58", "owner": "terry67734804", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17939541713871986, "text": "动物园规则怪谈🥶", "created_at": "2024-09-22T22:33:30", "owner": "sinaaa_lsn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015920918314727, "text": "今日規則再補充，其中有一條規則是假的，狗主人來之前，必須喂好狗，再來狗只能吃飼料，絕對不能喂任何罐頭，也不能給狗吃肉！", "created_at": "2024-09-22T17:45:47", "owner": "shaozhongzhong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201067264293439, "text": "感覺這個白狗的眼神有點狡猾\n下面應該有一條拉鍊 拉開裡面是棕狗", "created_at": "2024-09-22T16:19:13", "owner": "b0150719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058237993690654, "text": "如果你在繳交快遞時他會汪汪兩聲加上嗷嗚才能確定你要給的白狗就是這隻，但是如果他是叫汪汪嗷嗚～嗚，小心你趕快跑起來不要回頭，因為他準備要開門了。", "created_at": "2024-09-22T16:12:53", "owner": "__________.77", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18072952138566407, "text": "@chan_airplane", "created_at": "2024-09-22T15:40:41", "owner": "ononontamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040988485894572, "text": "原來是桌遊的一種嗎(?)\n😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T14:58:42", "owner": "fa_wen_rui", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17971803407787415, "text": "被留言區講到好像是什麼生存遊戲一樣😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T13:28:04", "owner": "yu.xuan0406", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062409658630669, "text": "黑狗在哪裡？", "created_at": "2024-09-22T12:52:27", "owner": "eazy_duz_it__e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18243288598275348, "text": "這裡不會有狗，如果看到狗，趕快拿著狗糧，找頂樓的屋主", "created_at": "2024-09-22T12:30:59", "owner": "0_momo_momo_0", "likes": 24}, {"id": 17878052154138117, "text": "好像YT裡一個都市傳說的頻道😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T12:14:16", "owner": "anna_tpy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025393778143443, "text": "規則怪談：\n1. 不要把包裹給白狗以外的狗，\n你可以信任白狗並放心離去\n2. 如果白狗是母的，請無視她並閉眼搖袋子\n3. 搖完十秒再睜眼，如果白狗消失\n把包裹撕開一個角並丟給黑狗\n4. 如果白狗沒消失，不要猶豫，馬上轉頭跑", "created_at": "2024-09-22T11:33:58", "owner": "king_panda_0726", "likes": 149}, {"id": 18035249114231395, "text": "我勒個規則怪談", "created_at": "2024-09-22T11:27:43", "owner": "jack0919c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875723491091162, "text": "Como?", "created_at": "2024-09-22T11:15:31", "owner": "_cdchris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057029896793581, "text": "@min_min_huang880108", "created_at": "2024-09-22T10:58:30", "owner": "ziqi_0127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864008578222528, "text": "如果你看到另一個快遞員也來送包裹 請確認他的衣服是工作服 如果是便服或其他不一樣的穿著 請儘速離開現場（歡迎往下延伸", "created_at": "2024-09-22T10:49:24", "owner": "guabaooo", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17864023713162426, "text": "守則系列XS", "created_at": "2024-09-22T10:19:09", "owner": "yamamodo_ayaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072272605585599, "text": "不管白狗說什麼，請不要給他錢", "created_at": "2024-09-22T10:04:02", "owner": "chiaway158_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18033329219271578, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:46:34", "owner": "ji_wei_chu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893675496998148, "text": "還有遊戲規則就是😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:32:27", "owner": "gina24252425", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17930075468942193, "text": "规则怪谈是吧", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:27:40", "owner": "frankiy_1023", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18039617684492361, "text": "把包裹交給白狗時 如果白狗說了什麼 不要理他 立刻離開 也不要回頭", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:19:49", "owner": "tsaenogard", "likes": 236}, {"id": 18035659067235417, "text": "規則怪談：\n1.不要相信棕狗說的任何話\n2.白狗會幫助你，可以信任白狗\n3.不要在白狗不在的時候拿出狗糧\n4.如果你看到黑色的狗，請快跑", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:15:59", "owner": "han_danielqwe", "likes": 2482}, {"id": 18007275779438424, "text": "當中還有兩條規則是錯的", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:15:03", "owner": "jpsswcy", "likes": 127}, {"id": 17870071344125678, "text": "直接丟在紙板上才是正確答案", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:12:53", "owner": "sdory_0815", "likes": 122}, {"id": 18349099846191650, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:11:55", "owner": "zozo_wuu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17911998012006583, "text": "規則怪談", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:07:44", "owner": "josdmod", "likes": 569}, {"id": 18037196327154205, "text": "為什麼除了狗我還看到有袋鼠", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:05:53", "owner": "nomoredunkan", "likes": 387}, {"id": 17878673337141155, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-22T11:17:36", "owner": "huangfeifei.huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034088822182769, "text": "白的是母的 棕的是公的", "created_at": "2024-09-22T10:14:53", "owner": "banyan_1014", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17988141488569763, "text": "規則怪談", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:14:17", "owner": "k.tsn._", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18164238181314065, "text": "這看起來很像什麼規則遊戲", "created_at": "2024-09-22T09:03:13", "owner": "siting_506", "likes": 1139}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3467109596563566804, "shortcode": "DAdpc78hPDU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAdpc78hPDU/", "taken_at": "2024-09-28T13:58:38", "caption": "We came across an abandoned Mercedes beside the street, adjusted the mileage, and sold it to a buyer. Later, we repossessed the car, gave it a new color, and sold it again, and that’s how we got a free car and a full payout, hope this helps\n.\n.\n.\n#mercadesbenz #mercedes #porsche #porsche911 #gta", "owner_username": "that_cult_leader", "owner_id": "340669916", "likes": 835195, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0134_DAdpc78hPDU\\DAdpc78hPDU_20240928_135838.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18046689796969295, "text": "⚠️ Disclaimer: The events depicted in this reel are entirely fictional and part of a scripted short film. All items shown are movie props specifically created for the purpose of the script and are not intended to represent any real-life events or activities", "created_at": "2024-10-09T10:55:17", "owner": "that_cult_leader", "likes": 19462}, {"id": 18022686731198797, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-29T16:34:37", "owner": "calisto.mzj", "likes": 19303}, {"id": 17923067894862603, "text": "It is smart because no persuasion tools were used during this DLC mission", "created_at": "2024-09-28T14:50:50", "owner": "that_cult_leader", "likes": 10467}, {"id": 18039294272561546, "text": "E Caribe então vocês ganha só dinheiro só com isso", "created_at": "2025-05-05T17:55:02", "owner": "darllysongrodriguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095220910546156, "text": "Next time think about changing the car itself", "created_at": "2025-03-27T17:05:07", "owner": "iccccceman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861934003371762, "text": "Pretty good . i like the content , though 🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-25T10:58:08", "owner": "_mr_bahrom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050334083206778, "text": "What a business I'd 🔥❤️...", "created_at": "2025-03-23T20:34:45", "owner": "rafftar_singh_02", "lik