The fact a bunch of the girls into the art are dressed in high school uniforms is so gross", "created_at": "2025-03-10T23:25:27", "owner": "tspodazai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080518624572416, "text": "Where's futa", "created_at": "2025-03-10T20:41:23", "owner": "013enz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102242272500946, "text": "Y’all need a job bro😭", "created_at": "2025-03-10T19:23:11", "owner": "willi.jz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064988089760135, "text": "can anyone just send me the marketplace?", "created_at": "2025-03-10T16:30:33", "owner": "suryojannah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089860645562966, "text": "Goon expert can't pronounce netorare, understandable tho", "created_at": "2025-03-10T12:45:48", "owner": "kono_dio_dono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041457053140314, "text": "Gooning maxxing", "created_at": "2025-03-10T12:42:25", "owner": "la_trotskillette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050189033245964, "text": "ください🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-10T12:04:46", "owner": "ajseiji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18487158337018715, "text": "why the Nutella font 😭", "created_at": "2025-03-10T11:52:00", "owner": "kreestyan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051510655983464, "text": "Where is that.", "created_at": "2025-03-10T08:13:38", "owner": "yayayun_0527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18490655002030265, "text": "The tomboy slander will not be tolerated!!!", "created_at": "2025-03-10T06:36:59", "owner": "froggiarie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967695228730413, "text": "Unemployment merch 🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-10T05:56:11", "owner": "hatty_hatsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075948340665946, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-09T21:48:48", "owner": "kappikan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861215638363768, "text": "At first i was \"ewww gooner stuff\" but when you said \"eww tomboy\" you gained my respect", "created_at": "2025-03-09T17:11:42", "owner": "shadab.o_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036320870571872, "text": "Could have sweared that Tomboy was Lemon-chan at first.", "created_at": "2025-03-09T16:16:54", "owner": "tony.chi.li", "likes"