{"media_id": 3454073551853289020, "shortcode": "C_vVZhOSX48", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_vVZhOSX48/", "taken_at": "2024-09-10T14:17:30", "caption": "🍴不鏽鋼鍋使用技巧🍴\n\n不鏽鋼鍋要不沾，最重要的重點就是「鍋子的溫度」，必須讓鍋子溫度維持在將近200度，如果鍋子溫度下降就會容易導致食材沾黏在鍋子上。\n\n因此，很重要的前提條件是鍋子要夠厚實、蓄熱效果要很好，食材下鍋時，溫度才會維持住，不會瞬間下降。蓄熱效果不好的不鏽鋼鍋只適合用來煮湯喔！\n\n#重點1 食材退冰、擦乾\n「水分」是一個容易讓鍋子溫度下降的，所以要煎東西前，要把表面水分擦乾。也要盡量把食材退冰，才不會導致冰冰的食材一下鍋，鍋子溫度迅速下降，導致沾鍋。\n\n#重點2 熱鍋\n如何判斷鍋子是否已經充分熱鍋？可以用很經典的「灑水測試」，在鍋子裡灑水，如果水在鍋子裡變成水珠跑來跑去，不管跑到哪個角落都不會蒸發，就代表熱鍋完成。\n\n建議新手用「小火」熱鍋，慢慢等鍋熱，才不會讓鍋子的溫度太快速上升，食材一下鍋就會容易燒焦。\n\n#重點3 熱油\n油倒入之後，可以把鍋子傾斜，看到油產生油紋代表已經熱油完成。\n\n油下鍋後，如果產生油煙的話，代表溫度太高，已經超過油的發煙點，要煎關火降溫一下再開火。\n\n油越少的話，越快會產生油紋，油越多就會需要一點時間等待熱油。\n\n#重點4 等待\n食材下鍋後，先不要急著翻面，煎一下子之後，食材表面會形成一層硬殼，食材就會自然跟鍋子分開了。\n\n#明蒂的廚房 #明蒂的不鏽鋼鍋", "owner_username": "mindy_s_kitchen", "owner_id": "7698543429", "likes": 115636, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0136_C_vVZhOSX48\\C_vVZhOSX48_20240910_141730.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18390624184130016, "text": "這種鍋子很好用 重點就是要乾和油燙 不要有水 就沒問題", "created_at": "2025-11-04T05:09:15", "owner": "kh.66028", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17877547272334338, "text": "又來看影片複習了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:47:11", "owner": "nina.lai.0925", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967213095918595, "text": "請問影片裡的鍋是什麼牌子 謝謝🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-06-30T03:14:04", "owner": "chihirororin5699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973698153713268, "text": "您好，有推薦的不銹鋼鍋品牌嗎，謝謝❤️", "created_at": "2025-04-20T02:33:18", "owner": "ofra3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028467518382280, "text": "請問什麼品牌？尺寸？", "created_at": "2025-03-31T01:42:29", "owner": "rita680518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069062029842326, "text": "不鏽鋼就是好用,可是電磁爐的話温度太難控制了😢", "created_at": "2025-03-08T16:23:32", "owner": "sakura_fiona.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044131190521832, "text": "想知道不銹鋼鍋推薦，謝謝", "created_at": "2025-03-08T13:33:56", "owner": "hanksfanbo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902588752131325, "text": "有夠麻煩\n我之前有一個4000元的不鏽鋼平底鍋，\n用過一次就收起來了。\n\n除了退冰、預熱麻煩，後續要把變黃的鍋體刷洗更麻煩。\n\n後來某次二手拍賣會拿出來賣900元無痛賣出！這故事教我不要再買不鏽鋼鍋🥰", "created_at": "2025-03-07T00:18:14", "owner": "my_butter_cream", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022197056463294, "text": "你讓我一個強迫症的看開頭這個？", "created_at": "2025-03-02T18:59:16", "owner": "forget_everything_eric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011089607697799, "text": "請問陶瓷鍋呢", "created_at": "2025-02-28T04:43:13", "owner": "syuhong_1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028276712634376, "text": "没用 依然沾", "created_at": "2025-02-23T16:27:40", "owner": "pancake_zoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850721362404023, "text": "請問用的是那牌子的鍋？", "created_at": "2025-02-21T20:19:18", "owner": "dxbqxb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938713194852251, "text": "太強了👏 但我還是不會用⋯", "created_at": "2025-02-20T13:49:26", "owner": "158janice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948010074933498, "text": "太厲害了 我每次用每次翻車😔💔👌", "created_at": "2025-02-14T01:22:50", "owner": "suzuki.05_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053551583125087, "text": "感謝分享學到了", "created_at": "2025-02-11T17:15:14", "owner": "vickeyhsu_wedding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995303064603954, "text": "@yingjing.chen", "created_at": "2025-02-10T03:54:21", "owner": "jiafongji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317945332163323, "text": "你把锅烧成这样子不管什么锅都很难会粘锅", "created_at": "2025-02-09T05:49:50", "owner": "wilsonnnnnnnleung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967152114722509, "text": "請問鍋子品牌，謝謝", "created_at": "2025-02-08T11:29:20", "owner": "shujung_818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18489749227046311, "text": "請問燒黑了怎麼清洗好", "created_at": "2025-02-06T12:51:43", "owner": "wilson420.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456674245067838, "text": "@mindy_s_kitchen 也想知道不銹鋼鍋是推薦哪牌的？謝謝", "created_at": "2025-02-04T13:27:15", "owner": "in1_0321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085056163579965, "text": "又學到了一招能夠把不鏽鋼鍋用的跟不沾鍋一樣真的好厲害喔", "created_at": "2025-02-03T11:08:39", "owner": "xyt9221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018219296476966, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-02-02T10:53:59", "owner": "keqnniefungwaiyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962977650736408, "text": "原來比蒸發更高溫的時候，水珠會聚集而不會蒸發嗎！第一次學到", "created_at": "2025-02-01T15:36:54", "owner": "sylviee.au", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114020734391983, "text": "蘿蔔糕也是大魔王", "created_at": "2025-02-01T14:50:40", "owner": "linyeye3210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915240103062822, "text": "想請問鍋子？謝謝🙏", "created_at": "2025-01-31T11:22:47", "owner": "asfj90821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116931205435927, "text": "油紋還沒出現就已經開始冒煙了😢", "created_at": "2025-01-28T10:39:43", "owner": "littlestars1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873026878184948, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-01-27T06:11:49", "owner": "makmaksharing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085150747512017, "text": "鑄鐵鍋也可以用同樣的方法嗎🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-27T00:43:18", "owner": "junli_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033252029213327, "text": "痾…\n一般都是沒熱鍋\n用水滴測試 水會跳舞就代表夠熱了", "created_at": "2025-01-24T19:30:15", "owner": "jack_hsu0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991873704716648, "text": "鑄鐵鍋呢", "created_at": "2025-01-24T04:57:05", "owner": "ru_pig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048954380326266, "text": "好扯好厲害！🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-01-20T03:01:53", "owner": "liu_0808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030321377550405, "text": "想詢問推薦的不鏽鋼鍋！🙌🏻", "created_at": "2025-01-19T16:43:44", "owner": "zoie_studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353217031131761, "text": "但就是很怕油變質", "created_at": "2025-01-10T11:16:12", "owner": "chouingrid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018900470381473, "text": "剛買一個很貴的，使用上感覺火候很難掌握。", "created_at": "2024-12-21T08:24:48", "owner": "shi_jie.sj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027974639243625, "text": "你蛋殼掉進了鍋入邊了😢", "created_at": "2024-12-20T07:55:53", "owner": "bryanfong69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037189205459960, "text": "落油梗係唔痴啦天才", "created_at": "2024-12-12T07:30:52", "owner": "derwick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871648528247347, "text": "難怪我一直狂沾鍋 \n原來是熱鍋不夠😢\n謝謝分享", "created_at": "2024-12-06T12:50:20", "owner": "sun024flower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033190235380646, "text": "請問有推薦的不鏽鋼鍋嗎❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-06T03:10:35", "owner": "pei_yu_wei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048128771504061, "text": "請問不銹鋼鍋品牌，謝謝", "created_at": "2024-12-05T23:33:18", "owner": "julialin651118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115774999418228, "text": "每次用完鍋子內都會有很黏的油污，很難洗，是使用方式不對嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-04T04:00:00", "owner": "book_462", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084971446531892, "text": "十分有用的分享，多謝吖！", "created_at": "2024-12-02T14:33:05", "owner": "mphebook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048575699015130, "text": "連蛋豆腐都不沾，這太狂了", "created_at": "2024-12-02T06:36:58", "owner": "hwaiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046547399121829, "text": "不銹鋼鍋下食材特別彈油", "created_at": "2024-12-01T09:17:37", "owner": "cooking_reiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848216509324676, "text": "太麻煩了", "created_at": "2024-11-30T06:20:44", "owner": "hedy2279", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038608550337165, "text": "大水珠很可愛😍😍請問是用那一款廚紙抹的那麼乾？要用很多張嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-26T13:04:31", "owner": "h.jnlm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051641722825804, "text": "What brand of the pan?", "created_at": "2024-11-23T23:08:43", "owner": "choon9217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847140889333946, "text": "用了一年之後我已經不再用水珠測試鍋熱了沒，因為真的很浪費時間，直接冷鍋冷油加熱到油紋，就直接下食材了😅😅😅", "created_at": "2024-11-23T14:26:44", "owner": "shy_jumps", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029610749397620, "text": "@tingyi0712", "created_at": "2024-11-23T11:52:54", "owner": "_xy.zkxs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036354815072675, "text": "想請問鍋子😍", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:45:44", "owner": "z.han____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069691381630377, "text": "請問這個鍋子在哪裡買？", "created_at": "2024-11-22T07:01:21", "owner": "zhangpeilin2673", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903196765069635, "text": "對鍋子有興趣😍 謝謝", "created_at": "2024-11-19T10:43:03", "owner": "joanhsu28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040907249514674, "text": "感謝實用的分享找天來試試👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-17T12:57:13", "owner": "_filmlevelmax_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058320835860534, "text": "對鍋子有興趣", "created_at": "2024-11-16T22:52:19", "owner": "queena.lin.982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012152645438408, "text": "要先擦乾跟預熱\n然後加油\n就不太會沾了", "created_at": "2024-11-16T10:36:27", "owner": "___tieh___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049298816311081, "text": "重點唔係隻鑊,係你識唔識煎", "created_at": "2024-11-15T02:28:05", "owner": "yuehdavid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081262606550869, "text": "重點唔係隻鑊仲已係你識唔識識尖就咩鑊都唔會黐", "created_at": "2024-11-15T02:26:50", "owner": "yuehdavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981256560780158, "text": "你是神吧", "created_at": "2024-11-14T04:38:26", "owner": "yoyoyoyoyochang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103664329454205, "text": "老實說 我還是覺得鍋子的材質是重點。", "created_at": "2024-11-11T15:18:39", "owner": "pearlmia728", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848399497309228, "text": "其實鏟子也是重點，要用薄身的，一下就能鏟起食材而不是推走表面，還有最好不會傷到鍋子", "created_at": "2024-11-08T18:58:59", "owner": "sing71111", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036548786204967, "text": "👏謝謝！超有幫助！", "created_at": "2024-11-08T15:55:27", "owner": "mintnchoko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902176377982259, "text": "對鍋子有興趣", "created_at": "2024-11-06T11:27:14", "owner": "phlinrealty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072812887592933, "text": "@cristine.bermundo", "created_at": "2024-11-06T08:21:29", "owner": "yoyo0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087202936504736, "text": "實在不會用不鏽鋼鍋\n我已經把不鏽鋼的鍋子裡面都弄黑了😢 也請不乾淨 現在冷凍中", "created_at": "2024-11-04T05:38:07", "owner": "blueapple_0709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002662685689284, "text": "That egg is older than my grandpas dishwasher cloth", "created_at": "2024-11-02T17:56:59", "owner": "vincent.chung120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045677032891952, "text": "看起來還是不沾鍋好用", "created_at": "2024-11-02T11:52:36", "owner": "lee_geo0710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061781146693069, "text": "我想知道，五花肉为什么老是黏住啊", "created_at": "2024-11-02T04:33:07", "owner": "jin_1996_online", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044781647318845, "text": "終於搞懂，謝謝拍這麼清楚", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:58:40", "owner": "simpli.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087926038508777, "text": "原來是這樣", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:19:08", "owner": "tzongching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027586334167916, "text": "這麽麻煩....", "created_at": "2024-10-31T14:45:16", "owner": "jaco.chen.3324", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065140210662197, "text": "好麻煩", "created_at": "2024-10-31T12:24:50", "owner": "sdses3104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064167874709248, "text": "請問有蒸蛋 然後 完後比較好洗的方式嗎？（除了放蛋前在鍋子裡沾油、或是用不沾鍋的鍋子使用外）", "created_at": "2024-10-31T11:12:46", "owner": "shiiu.75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139521682361974, "text": "鍋子不夠熱～～ 任何鍋都一樣原理～", "created_at": "2024-10-31T07:34:55", "owner": "fangyu_0202", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005231324499817, "text": "請問炒菜也是一樣步驟嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-31T03:06:14", "owner": "vivian5423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911501245018807, "text": "這個還要出教學？！🤡🤯", "created_at": "2024-10-31T02:07:03", "owner": "tank101528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895729882092790, "text": "好想知道原理喔？？", "created_at": "2024-10-30T03:58:15", "owner": "cyhung1976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011135843422769, "text": "不鏽鋼鍋非常難清潔，用了一陣子就不太想用了", "created_at": "2024-10-28T09:22:27", "owner": "rorschache01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039640820163365, "text": "請問為什麼我不鏽鋼鍋的邊緣都會有焦黃黏黏的東西很難刷", "created_at": "2024-10-27T17:59:05", "owner": "ribosom2322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049649104799324, "text": "想請問照著這個步驟做可是不鏽鋼鍋的高起的鍋邊都常常會有焦糖色的紋路刷不掉是什麼原因呢🥲", "created_at": "2024-10-27T17:52:35", "owner": "wenchi.is.unavailable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856177942244528, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-25T15:55:45", "owner": "crystal_3282", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086976250507758, "text": "有請問團購嗎？還是是什麼牌子呢？謝謝", "created_at": "2024-10-25T11:10:44", "owner": "kristinachuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066178615630985, "text": "純鈦鍋呢", "created_at": "2024-10-25T07:04:05", "owner": "1_dailylife_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068207386626523, "text": "鱈魚才是大魔王", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:05:26", "owner": "royliang311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327032611194932, "text": "非常實用！謝謝分享", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:15:47", "owner": "old.person", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052523209910795, "text": "鍋＆油，都要溫度夠熱時，再放進食材。試試看。", "created_at": "2024-10-17T07:38:55", "owner": "ogawashakamuni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039115846964149, "text": "不是因為鍋子太熱才沾嗎？試過很多次，煎蛋時鍋子預熱太久必黏鍋。抓準時間下鍋就不會了，也不用什麼退冰", "created_at": "2024-10-16T02:28:19", "owner": "hengchian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034474235245686, "text": "請問不鏽鋼鍋品牌、及哪裡可以購得~謝謝", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:13:06", "owner": "annable777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002697506670735, "text": "It takes at least 10 mins to get to that stage…crazy time waisting", "created_at": "2024-10-14T23:08:20", "owner": "nakuyi_liu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278715109170350, "text": "超麻煩的 打死不用這種鍋子 用一次崩潰", "created_at": "2024-10-14T15:03:38", "owner": "jin.liou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046118590827788, "text": "請問您的不鏽鋼鍋那個牌子的，謝謝", "created_at": "2024-10-13T10:24:12", "owner": "suxiuling521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904741255027164, "text": "所以是熱鍋之後再放油去熱油嗎？😮", "created_at": "2024-10-13T04:24:35", "owner": "appppple.56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059691937695695, "text": "😍😍棒👏👏。", "created_at": "2024-10-12T02:55:13", "owner": "c11811031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010344881416452, "text": "脾氣差的什麼鍋都一樣！怪東怪西的🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-11T07:15:24", "owner": "kung_fu_lai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029619224346047, "text": "食材為啥要擦乾", "created_at": "2024-10-11T02:17:55", "owner": "youqik0315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029855903103635, "text": "丟了2️⃣支", "created_at": "2024-10-10T10:57:59", "owner": "yang.golf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043187285015067, "text": "這晚餐吃完都10點了⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-10-10T05:47:39", "owner": "wolverine2kx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060692797734698, "text": "如果仍然沾底的話，可以讓鍋和食材冷卻一下，沾的部分會自己隨著降溫而脫落❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-09T15:50:35", "owner": "pickaxe828", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107720848431117, "text": "好強大！", "created_at": "2024-10-07T12:49:52", "owner": "wuishe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942001275776514, "text": "超實用", "created_at": "2024-10-06T11:12:35", "owner": "chillt0722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957260004820898, "text": "太厲害了🤩", "created_at": "2024-10-06T04:48:07", "owner": "oatty_home", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933713928812206, "text": "不鏽鋼鍋用中小火熱鍋，一樣可以熱到「水珠滾動」的熱度，中大火就會燒黃鍋沿，一旦燒黃，只能請出鋼刷了！", "created_at": "2024-10-05T18:33:13", "owner": "johnnysu38", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["重點1", "重點2", "重點3", "重點4", "明蒂的廚房", "明蒂的不鏽鋼鍋"]},
{"media_id": 3467726140985740396, "shortcode": "DAf1o1ryoxs", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAf1o1ryoxs/", "taken_at": "2024-09-29T10:22:34", "caption": "How to play with food - the correct way \nIn a hotel party 🎊 \n@crashadams \n\n@subyub Live in UK 2024\nOct 13 Manchester | Night & Day Café \nOct 20 London | Bush Hall\nGet your Tix now!\nhttps://linktr.ee/subyubuktour2024", "owner_username": "subyub", "owner_id": "30848688", "likes": 12763, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0137_DAf1o1ryoxs\\DAf1o1ryoxs_20240929_102234.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18139052365392443, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-18T13:40:33", "owner": "posh_deco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388104052101393, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-17T21:35:08", "owner": "freehi100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992776101710344, "text": "啊媽：食就食啦尊重下農夫\n我：但係真係幾好玩咁喎", "created_at": "2024-10-15T23:24:10", "owner": "chab3384", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18012464597381119, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-12T19:00:31", "owner": "delight8642", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857605255223183, "text": "@crashadams", "created_at": "2024-10-12T10:57:10", "owner": "nathanpicklegeometrydash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985490748590667, "text": "Talented👏", "created_at": "2024-10-04T17:11:05", "owner": "l.e.i.r.a_missblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018061748573178, "text": "11👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-02T14:07:11", "owner": "chillchilltrain", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18361453573114038, "text": "Can u rap?", "created_at": "2024-10-02T06:40:51", "owner": "bayan_7_23_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941571795779330, "text": "Give me a kiss “ please", "created_at": "2024-10-01T04:06:14", "owner": "alcyoneuschan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045484744829927, "text": "唔知你地做咩", "created_at": "2024-09-30T21:24:18", "owner": "kayabaakihiko0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199740322293759, "text": "「不好意思請問你會rap嗎？」\n\n『不！但我會玩食物』", "created_at": "2024-09-30T13:23:50", "owner": "w____1021", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18041708969016782, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-30T10:10:42", "owner": "wenhsuan622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021855863394404, "text": "Welcome to HK😆😆", "created_at": "2024-09-30T09:16:49", "owner": "artemisxkuroro", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18016782137309783, "text": "首歌好好味啊。。🤤啊唔係，好好聽啊！", "created_at": "2024-09-30T07:38:54", "owner": "bonetai1005", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900264316052236, "text": "love you guys its super cool", "created_at": "2024-09-30T04:56:01", "owner": "powertaitai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075647779497395, "text": "toronto 呼喚🥹🥹", "created_at": "2024-09-30T03:44:18", "owner": "kiwitang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041953019029571, "text": "the croissants in your heads😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-30T00:17:11", "owner": "this.is.andreality", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061886278732705, "text": "May I have the name of the song?", "created_at": "2024-09-30T00:04:32", "owner": "phoebeshek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111336055416001, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T22:48:37", "owner": "lunatic.yauz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252219010261247, "text": "好勁啊！🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-29T21:18:50", "owner": "ship_li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951353775736318, "text": "11 👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-09-29T17:14:04", "owner": "macau_tasty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931859901927723, "text": "is it real 太酷了", "created_at": "2024-09-29T16:22:23", "owner": "bipolarboy.can", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044323757056289, "text": "好鬼勁呀你😍", "created_at": "2024-09-29T15:16:52", "owner": "katy516hk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059451250689414, "text": "OMG 我超喜歡佢哋", "created_at": "2024-09-29T15:09:12", "owner": "iamhkgkim", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18059720593682051, "text": "半夜滑到這個 太罪餓了", "created_at": "2024-09-29T14:58:38", "owner": "min_chi___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006019832648389, "text": "Mama said never play with food", "created_at": "2024-09-29T14:33:15", "owner": "the.ec.way", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021180761582301, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-29T14:17:14", "owner": "joycefongyt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845276320318863, "text": "👏👏身體不由自主動起來😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T14:14:44", "owner": "carrie680929", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18008161871441084, "text": "So creative!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-29T13:33:07", "owner": "hammy.cinematic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061121650606396, "text": "有無問can you rap😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:57:15", "owner": "crystalyip30", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038664728131525, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:49:08", "owner": "tempotsz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961080411695126, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥正", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:31:02", "owner": "kachingjeff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891587641014201, "text": "正啊喂😆", "created_at": "2024-09-29T11:22:48", "owner": "kamansweet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970742643787958, "text": "Wow what a collab 😮", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:56:43", "owner": "rachelttl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870530053195569, "text": "So cooooool😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:52:09", "owner": "small_but_brave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046548449308554, "text": "魚蛋燒賣呢？", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:47:46", "owner": "ma_fan_yo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18061730776678685, "text": "最喜歡這種自己也享受在其中的影片了😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:43:39", "owner": "yoyohahacoow", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18017959055294711, "text": "才華❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:42:31", "owner": "beanpoon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952813794833439, "text": "應該係佢地最特別嘅一次合作？仲充滿香港味，勁啊！！", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:38:44", "owner": "__david_ng__", "likes": 244}, {"id": 17988149216568504, "text": "HAHAHA 好好睇 即刻覺好好聽咗😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:36:34", "owner": "waitingserena", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18070235716608700, "text": "首歌好正", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:28:43", "owner": "annawong.wingsuet", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18036818882172744, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:28:36", "owner": "candychupk2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108288199420624, "text": "@seveny711 李11真係好搞笑😂", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:25:16", "owner": "lynnewongbbb", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18018189920296467, "text": "碌柒臭，碌鳩好柒臭，戇撚鳩～戇撚鳩～", "created_at": "2024-09-30T05:53:36", "owner": "felix99225", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17862130329182350, "text": "想知雞批係咩聲👀", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:02:21", "owner": "ashnorush", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17983054301734193, "text": "好癲", "created_at": "2024-09-29T10:34:16", "owner": "rinme_jojo", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3469135566563806198, "shortcode": "DAk2GritYv2", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAk2GritYv2/", "taken_at": "2024-10-01T09:00:53", "caption": "Hi this is Argus, I will be your Sports Officer this year and will organise different sports events for you, welcome to join and enjoy.", "owner_username": "mmu.abacus", "owner_id": "48681209365", "likes": 51, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0138_DAk2GritYv2\\DAk2GritYv2_20241001_090053_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0138_DAk2GritYv2\\DAk2GritYv2_20241001_090053_2.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18277596499171066", "text": "siu paan jau", "created_at": "2024-10-01T13:06:19", "owner": "douglas_tam", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18029464034361513", "text": "Sai loooo @ar_gus.lam11 🙌🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-01T11:00:47", "owner": "yy.ddm", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3460559099237253663, "shortcode": "DAGYCp6SEIf", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAGYCp6SEIf/", "taken_at": "2024-09-19T14:13:30", "caption": "@dana.chereda", "owner_username": "dana.chereda", "owner_id": "2303150047", "likes": 1115, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0139_DAGYCp6SEIf\\DAGYCp6SEIf_20240919_141330.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18385044136099291, "text": "Health is Wealth!", "created_at": "2025-01-20T14:31:25", "owner": "pjpringle1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918751275918228, "text": "Sorry 我冇…..sorry 我好多時間㗎", "created_at": "2024-12-13T11:04:17", "owner": "har_y_yyyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086065564535697, "text": "Doomed", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:13:59", "owner": "jasonkoruki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118664182413665, "text": "Worth it👍", "created_at": "2024-11-29T10:51:15", "owner": "yf16237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013178558418196, "text": "There are 3 kinds of people who would give me goosebumps every time I see them. The first one is “Do you have an executable life insurance policy?”; the second one is “Have you accepted Jesus Christ as your Lord and Savior?” And the third kind is 「你條X樣還錢啊！借咗錢唔駛還啊？」 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T14:08:43", "owner": "brucew2099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18257502652269044, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-08T04:53:36", "owner": "vlam1217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972201573650419, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T13:11:33", "owner": "rebeccaywchung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010988675405445, "text": "I’ll buy anything she sells", "created_at": "2024-10-18T03:28:59", "owner": "puipuiguitar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002984774654655, "text": "Nice legs😍", "created_at": "2024-10-02T11:40:51", "owner": "babybryanbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019880417527303, "text": "😂😂😂 oh.. f..", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:25:40", "owner": "clementt.f", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015441773560955, "text": "唔望佢，但又唔望前車，果然炒左", "created_at": "2024-09-21T13:22:39", "owner": "maffey_yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100516135448659, "text": "耀 X 証券呢？😂", "created_at": "2024-09-21T02:37:39", "owner": "aaronrider824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023588009605514, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-21T02:37:18", "owner": "aaronrider824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027965978102410, "text": "Lmaoooo that’s so true", "created_at": "2024-09-20T07:48:53", "owner": "jackchs_1205", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18294561181203474, "text": "😂 so true", "created_at": "2024-09-20T07:35:13", "owner": "waiyin_cheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056380294813593, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-09-20T03:30:54", "owner": "kat_qinglan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017795297281906, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍so cute", "created_at": "2024-09-20T02:30:51", "owner": "allenoc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987100809572121, "text": "You speak so well!!! And I like ur cute skirt!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-20T01:57:04", "owner": "fififionalee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077847286532949, "text": "😂😍", "created_at": "2024-09-20T01:04:42", "owner": "salon.daniella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18240587170302958, "text": "Are you a agent now? For real", "created_at": "2024-09-19T22:28:49", "owner": "hi_shadowww_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026577923354550, "text": "完全投降啦", "created_at": "2024-09-19T21:36:14", "owner": "lwl_122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070324657598614, "text": "Impressive 👏🏻", "created_at": "2024-09-19T20:32:12", "owner": "tetiaaaana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042274742053062, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T19:37:07", "owner": "dog009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320920843157016, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T18:22:32", "owner": "shu.lam.photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851644558280083, "text": "佢把聲好得意喎😍😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T16:44:23", "owner": "mr_niceguy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17939580041895711, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T16:38:12", "owner": "scfsaint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883607764051218, "text": "飲酒", "created_at": "2024-09-19T16:16:19", "owner": "dixon_mak_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18453450514044998, "text": "得閒飯酒呀😂（個廣告）", "created_at": "2024-09-19T16:15:28", "owner": "dixon_mak_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908199031009683, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T16:14:47", "owner": "immyles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037293538942977, "text": "好好笑", "created_at": "2024-09-19T15:07:48", "owner": "guitarrock0306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030079178351502, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T14:39:36", "owner": "sandra.shyian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031798142335686, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-19T14:35:37", "owner": "zokacho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122926621349501, "text": "So cure when you saying Cantonese 💕", "created_at": "2024-09-19T14:32:12", "owner": "ell.epoon", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18333223864178682, "text": "Loll", "created_at": "2024-09-19T14:26:08", "owner": "daria.bashynska", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048426302111536, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:12:01", "owner": "mickeywong1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020928617536529, "text": "女鬼 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-28T04:47:39", "owner": "tristan____natsirt", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3468777843851698713, "shortcode": "DAjkxIThqIZ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAjkxIThqIZ/", "taken_at": "2024-09-30T21:10:05", "caption": "What separates a high quality Apple Thunderbolt 4 cable from cheaper USB-C cables that you'll need for the new iPhone 16? Take a look at a range of prices and build quality ⬆️\n\nFollow the link in bio for more info and to explore the scans for yourself 🔗\n\n#imaging #engineering #tech #ct #scan #xray #usb #usbc #iphone #apple #thunderbolt #iphone16", "owner_username": "lumafield", "owner_id": "46621341393", "likes": 44603, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0140_DAjkxIThqIZ\\DAjkxIThqIZ_20240930_211005.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18251785267276323, "text": "Comparing a Ducati with a bicycle", "created_at": "2024-12-26T14:15:17", "owner": "keshhhh017", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18150251392344476, "text": "Yet they break every time 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T20:31:44", "owner": "_sasindu_silva_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18007180985681817, "text": "Buy the cheaper one, if breaks; buy the next 😅", "created_at": "2024-12-18T09:22:18", "owner": "chillyouranger", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17887755765157894, "text": "Cool 👏", "created_at": "2024-12-18T02:08:10", "owner": "candresha19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007730669510082, "text": "Clickbait", "created_at": "2024-12-16T18:23:32", "owner": "slackr.flac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362234209184492, "text": "Thunderbolt 4 uses the USBC standard but not every USBC is thunderbolt they're two different standards. The average USBC pretty is going to use the usb3 standard not thunderbolt 4, despite using the same connector, they are not the same.", "created_at": "2024-12-15T09:42:55", "owner": "theamzngaids", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17966136137817490, "text": "The apple is not a USB C cable. It's a thunderbolt cable. Totally different although usb-C was made to use the same socket", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:03:52", "owner": "chadcarney_2001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18473210191000881, "text": "That's not the fault of the standard, just buy a premium usb C", "created_at": "2024-12-10T20:44:39", "owner": "mark_filby83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078635728581074, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-10T06:11:48", "owner": "muratozerce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980591883635890, "text": "What's the difference?", "created_at": "2024-12-10T06:11:13", "owner": "muratozerce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488952988023431, "text": "Whats this insane nice scan software and technic?", "created_at": "2024-12-08T23:56:05", "owner": "alexandros444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289531891238983, "text": "An integrated circuit shall NOT be placed into a cable. A cable is a cable, not a peripheral", "created_at": "2024-12-06T14:32:36", "owner": "raphaelpallavicini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852754855341620, "text": "Yea not the same stop trying to make it look like Apple is doing ANYTHING differently to usb c. They were forced to adopt it and now they’re trying to make it seem like it was a willing choice.", "created_at": "2024-12-03T07:34:04", "owner": "moorechase503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962529825829977, "text": "Meanwhile amazon: the cheapest cable there is. For 15 $", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:46:02", "owner": "anterben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988108587744050, "text": "Nice try diddy.", "created_at": "2024-12-02T15:18:58", "owner": "coffea_canephora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936533808823052, "text": "You know how to scan but you don't know what you comparing.", "created_at": "2024-12-01T01:50:39", "owner": "pashark80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044629220142314, "text": "Comparing $120 with $5 cables is wild", "created_at": "2024-11-29T22:47:36", "owner": "privateized_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863839282276017, "text": "No different to Audiophool equipment. Using expensive metals which are over the top for their applications.", "created_at": "2024-11-29T01:34:34", "owner": "em0be", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848649988349275, "text": "Why dont you compare thunderbolt to other thunderbolt?", "created_at": "2024-11-26T14:23:52", "owner": "tristan.hsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482367181032521, "text": "Compare it to a legit cable.", "created_at": "2024-11-26T05:40:29", "owner": "raycert07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073083970619476, "text": "Not the same purpose, I’m not gonna charge my iPhone in the car with the 140€ thunderbolt cable. This cable is made for screens, big file transfers or camera…", "created_at": "2024-11-25T18:35:02", "owner": "igor.drlh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037883228038715, "text": "Do one from Anker", "created_at": "2024-11-25T00:12:01", "owner": "thschaffer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982638975766696, "text": "Bruh, USB C and thunderbolt are not the same", "created_at": "2024-11-23T12:48:32", "owner": "julien__ddn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859723717290762, "text": "Yea, yet I can still make better protection with apple on a cheap cable with duct tape and a lighter.", "created_at": "2024-11-21T15:01:11", "owner": "hancocktom412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074046253540001, "text": "Now let’s see how much was paid in labour for each of these to get made. The answer I bet will shock you.", "created_at": "2024-11-20T19:53:44", "owner": "8bit_buddha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849547228306928, "text": "This is comparing a basic USB-C to thunderbolt. Compare thunderbolt to thunderbolt with diff manufacturers.", "created_at": "2024-11-20T16:19:07", "owner": "crash.enabled", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17943059588791996, "text": "So buy 40 cheap ones and make something 100 time stronger", "created_at": "2024-11-19T20:23:07", "owner": "22databases", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967314543683766, "text": "None of them fit in my iPhone 14", "created_at": "2024-11-18T02:22:24", "owner": "noah_ozbjorn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923903541989082, "text": "So what’s the difference?", "created_at": "2024-11-15T22:14:41", "owner": "dlobmuh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027409970527608, "text": "Its not more tech. Its just more chip to let your device knows its family member.", "created_at": "2024-11-15T01:38:11", "owner": "xa.ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338340904182000, "text": "129$ for a cable? Gold wires or what?", "created_at": "2024-11-14T02:22:02", "owner": "ali_hadi_37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944757150913978, "text": "Charger is Charger", "created_at": "2024-11-12T19:48:46", "owner": "yourboiimason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887385082134536, "text": "apple propaganda", "created_at": "2024-11-12T18:00:29", "owner": "michael.of.mars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067841497647632, "text": "So nothing", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:14:05", "owner": "johnnymorbuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281785072170319, "text": "Here is a fridge, look at how less cool it makes things Vs the freezer.  This is your logic, compared TB4 cable to TB4 cable and then look at the price", "created_at": "2024-11-12T14:32:13", "owner": "thesurferportreath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120380089398635, "text": "They work the same, except after 6 months the apple one falls apart", "created_at": "2024-11-10T15:26:44", "owner": "0foxgiven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866017186251605, "text": "I'd love to see the difference between apple's and ankers like $30 thunderbolt 4 cable, I'm guessing that will be a much closer comparison", "created_at": "2024-11-10T15:01:15", "owner": "brad_taylorr98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021121160622153, "text": "Well, it’s a Thunderbolt cable, not a USB cable, for one.", "created_at": "2024-11-09T15:15:06", "owner": "markaudacity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281780887171818, "text": "Apple propaganda. One of the reasons got food costs more is the same reason you can only use the app store on an iPhone", "created_at": "2024-11-09T00:01:49", "owner": "wheresrobby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096118837434416, "text": "And still overpriced", "created_at": "2024-11-08T20:40:35", "owner": "noclueibet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042545600488037, "text": "Of course", "created_at": "2024-11-08T18:08:03", "owner": "gooseteam6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099788149462897, "text": "all made by indians on a sweaty shop", "created_at": "2024-11-08T18:02:15", "owner": "michelbrandalero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037467923192953, "text": "Who cares when it's just used for charging", "created_at": "2024-11-07T21:31:17", "owner": "tim_e190401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045123968474730, "text": "also mention the part of the apple cable that tells the phone it's not a third-party cable and lets it charge at speed", "created_at": "2024-11-06T21:07:28", "owner": "dancingpurplecat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110613136425066, "text": "Apple found a way to charge extra once again and yall love it.", "created_at": "2024-11-06T03:59:40", "owner": "serpiente.emplumado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868928113232159, "text": "Now HONESTLY tell me, how does a “twice more complex” translate to almost “ten times more expensive”?", "created_at": "2024-11-05T10:46:37", "owner": "agstepa71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019830011320473, "text": "Happy with my MacBook usb c cable, no thanks :)", "created_at": "2024-11-04T12:37:29", "owner": "joshsprivateonlyfilm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117121144408891, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-04T05:15:14", "owner": "indefinitelybrandon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047080301061767, "text": "Apples break quicker. You know why? Each trace is connected individually instead of grouped. Because of that they break easier. My cheap cables last far longer than any I’ve gotten with the phone", "created_at": "2024-11-03T14:53:18", "owner": "mitch_5e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925490562972329, "text": "My cat can't feel the difference", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:07:23", "owner": "rstrat90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024681578446909, "text": "Still the manufacturing cost of $129 Apple cable would be under 10$", "created_at": "2024-11-03T07:54:49", "owner": "khalitiny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865095817250034, "text": "the apple one is made from slave labor", "created_at": "2024-11-02T16:53:13", "owner": "runnergabriel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069368200570509, "text": "So the $129 Apple cable is basically a $20 Ugreen cable.", "created_at": "2024-11-02T14:19:24", "owner": "418_im.a.teapot", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18074725378586862, "text": "Weak", "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:12:16", "owner": "sebastin_artz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049558696824509, "text": "You can’t compare regular C cables to Thunderbolt. They might use the same standard connection but the circuitry is different. Also only the 6ft model is $120.", "created_at": "2024-11-02T06:03:13", "owner": "josemendezfr", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17992838276705881, "text": "Least obvious paid actor", "created_at": "2024-11-01T21:22:19", "owner": "man.of_wars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302532325206535, "text": "Propaganda to justify the outrageous price of a charger", "created_at": "2024-10-30T21:56:20", "owner": "__slushie__", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18045345800506670, "text": "Apple over-engineering everything is not new haha", "created_at": "2024-10-30T20:20:14", "owner": "_pizza_jedi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043923155088975, "text": "Guess what it doesn't matter", "created_at": "2024-10-30T13:37:02", "owner": "edwardsdeanxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038417648272568, "text": "u are comparing thunderbolt vs USB-C", "created_at": "2024-10-30T07:18:35", "owner": "satoshito89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331462315199297, "text": "These are Thunderbolt cables.  They have USBC packages and can carry USBC transmissions, but they’re not USBC.", "created_at": "2024-10-30T04:51:40", "owner": "nattotheworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055479445810288, "text": "Profit", "created_at": "2024-10-29T02:01:45", "owner": "7blackhawk7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114462619416213, "text": "of course they made a 130$ USBC CABLE!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-28T21:55:03", "owner": "pud2r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143549278353789, "text": "129$ 💀😭 no way anyone is paying that much for a cable", "created_at": "2024-10-28T13:08:37", "owner": "karlvierundvierzig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931789407834962, "text": "Prob worth buying multiple cheap ones vs one apple cable", "created_at": "2024-10-28T10:54:39", "owner": "jeffistakingphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048448222960278, "text": "How are you getting these scans??", "created_at": "2024-10-28T09:06:50", "owner": "hboujaoude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083162557525741, "text": "Instead of buying one $130 Apple cable, you could buy 10 of the cheaper cable, keep 1 in each room and then swap it out in a few years when it breaks", "created_at": "2024-10-27T15:49:03", "owner": "tyschmidt20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035916584037246, "text": "all are the same quality", "created_at": "2024-10-27T08:49:16", "owner": "ignacczeban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052068493927708, "text": "Trying to defend a 100+ dollars cable is WILD man", "created_at": "2024-10-27T08:22:21", "owner": "oxymore_producer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047173931006585, "text": "And yet the apple cable breaks in half the time 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T21:37:26", "owner": "napharious_rider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856035031292648, "text": "Well that's not a \"USB cable\" that's a thunderbolt 3 (or 4) cable that uses USB-C as a connector. Completely different standards.", "created_at": "2024-10-26T17:40:43", "owner": "d1v15or", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861660340199384, "text": "this some major apple copium", "created_at": "2024-10-26T11:55:12", "owner": "marayoorkaatukallanofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939938202795531, "text": "They both last about the same. Complexity without clear benefit lol. One day the apple will fall", "created_at": "2024-10-24T21:05:51", "owner": "thejademoon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025634468599299, "text": "$2 android usb-c working 5+ year, but yeah $129 is different kind of ....", "created_at": "2024-10-24T18:18:32", "owner": "roman_shkanov", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014875052363244, "text": "You're justifying apple products, you deserve no patience from me", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:36:02", "owner": "34.reaper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021937574258439, "text": "Then the apple one proceeds to break after 2 months", "created_at": "2024-10-22T19:53:26", "owner": "diegobluc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051144496752153, "text": "Yes and the price is 12x", "created_at": "2024-10-21T12:42:40", "owner": "nbreakfast", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18377733682103197, "text": "So you compared a thunderbolt cable to a non thunderbolt cable. Next are you gonna compare a 300 dollar hdmi cable to a 12 dollar printer cable? Jesus christ man", "created_at": "2024-10-19T16:26:37", "owner": "grainsofwrath2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108553627388900, "text": "May I ask if I want to research about this, what is the keyword?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:50:10", "owner": "__le.tran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042622589037696, "text": "All work exactly the same", "created_at": "2024-10-18T16:20:29", "owner": "alexromo818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972730530789346, "text": "Tho, an apple cable charges my phone slower than a 3€ chinese cable somehow", "created_at": "2024-10-17T18:36:51", "owner": "danilo_costa1109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998916651678366, "text": "Si formas type C ojo si pin 24 ✅️.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T05:34:03", "owner": "max4gb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885056254123566, "text": "3x better. 20x the price", "created_at": "2024-10-17T02:54:14", "owner": "matt2beer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051575920911254, "text": "The Apple cable has a 1000% margin", "created_at": "2024-10-16T22:34:09", "owner": "pt.nicholas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18225637663303912, "text": "Another BS acc blocked", "created_at": "2024-10-16T13:58:24", "owner": "warpman_dim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907856044018504, "text": "You can buy quality cables not produced apple while costing less than half", "created_at": "2024-10-16T10:29:54", "owner": "markpozsonyi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961336692696784, "text": "Sometimes original Apple cables break faster than Chinese no-name ones.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:56:47", "owner": "andrewplochenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058721698834664, "text": "You guys still using cables?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:44:50", "owner": "ianwalks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869406940211788, "text": "I think you're the same one comparing the iPhone with budget android smartphones 🐑 🤡", "created_at": "2024-10-15T06:59:34", "owner": "wexhuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943329390776431, "text": "It’s actually an Apple Thunderbolt 4 cable and is the longest consumer grade cable available (3metres) verses the standard 2. It’s still expensive but it’s an incredible bit of tech", "created_at": "2024-10-14T23:33:50", "owner": "magnus_uk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092401423486897, "text": "Here is a string Vs thunderbolt cable", "created_at": "2024-10-14T20:21:59", "owner": "xiberras_ceramics", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18342855511135140, "text": "Good now shove it up", "created_at": "2024-10-14T15:38:42", "owner": "mspl997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921014667985588, "text": "Absolutely nothing 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-14T05:38:30", "owner": "nathan_jutras_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109193047422964, "text": "More complicated is not always better", "created_at": "2024-10-14T00:24:35", "owner": "another_alr_for_private_likes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284561182236015, "text": "Maybe compare the apple one to an actually comparable cable and not basic USB-C charging cables...", "created_at": "2024-10-13T21:57:09", "owner": "tagbracelets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031321118362807, "text": "So atyfuer is the best value", "created_at": "2024-10-13T11:47:11", "owner": "mradityakhapre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983833320754039, "text": "😅 But what the actual difference for casual customer? For", "created_at": "2024-10-13T11:26:52", "owner": "zzer0fckss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025379525166914, "text": "🥱", "created_at": "2024-10-13T07:07:36", "owner": "joshallan123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18463543039036285, "text": "Es ist aber schon klar dass das maximal den doppelten Preis der billigen rechtfertigen würde die Qualität steht in keinem Verhältnis zum Preis speziell wenn man weiß wo Apple die Sachen produzieren lässt", "created_at": "2024-10-13T07:02:07", "owner": "schwarzfux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008941085447749, "text": "Do this for a pair of wired apple earphones from 5 years ago and one purchased today", "created_at": "2024-10-12T23:22:18", "owner": "freecraigslistsnob", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["imaging", "engineering", "tech", "ct", "scan", "xray", "usb", "usbc", "iphone", "apple", "thunderbolt", "iphone16"]},
{"media_id": 3465334436476934685, "shortcode": "DAXV09SItod", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAXV09SItod/", "taken_at": "2024-09-26T03:14:51", "caption": "去年在 GDC 大會上，Epic Games 公布了 Fab，這是一個新的內容市場平台，作為 Unreal Engine Marketplace、Sketchfab、ArtStation Marketplace 和 Quixel的新平台，旨在為各行業的數字創作者服務。這個新平台允許用戶搜尋、發布和分享各類資產，並將於今年 10 月中旬推出啊！\n\n作為這些改動的一部分，Quixel 團隊宣布，Megascans*將專屬於 Fab，並從平台上線至 2024 年年底對所有用戶免費開放，依照 Fab 的標準許可證使用。但從明年起，Epic Games 將不再免費提供 Quixel Megascans 資源庫了⋯ \n\n#UE5 #自製遊戲 #獨立遊戲 #黑神話 #Blender動畫 #gamedevelopment  #線上教學 #遊戲線上教學 #UE5教學 #unrealengine5  #遊戲開發 #indiegame", "owner_username": "kojin3d", "owner_id": "40839494130", "likes": 1019, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0141_DAXV09SItod\\DAXV09SItod_20240926_031451.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17906390889099977, "text": "3d", "created_at": "2025-03-16T07:43:20", "owner": "junyuchenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067992151755577, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-12-31T10:17:46", "owner": "m_dgghhrz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049345124103037, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-12-19T16:50:31", "owner": "frank_1108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017790173392245, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-12-18T16:11:57", "owner": "jodie_shiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376781419107709, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-12-12T12:07:45", "owner": "ne9191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951843759765402, "text": "3D🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-10T23:24:41", "owner": "___twilight0512cc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471795829054869, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-12-09T15:30:08", "owner": "huangaibo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052985962962041, "text": "3d", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:16:44", "owner": "kinobito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052330786835011, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-12-04T11:33:07", "owner": "iam.top.secret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466195765002015, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-11-18T13:46:25", "owner": "uen.0828_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468434635019687, "text": "3d,已加追中", "created_at": "20