{"media_id": 3463677953962643153, "shortcode": "DARdL9uS47R", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DARdL9uS47R/", "taken_at": "2024-09-23T20:17:32", "caption": "Taking you behind the scene today 🫡 \n\nI made an outfit generator so you can play dress-up with me in timesquare (full tutorial on yt)\n\n🤍 creating assets — full body shot, top down shot of clothes, remove background \n\n🤍 specs & dimension — setting up the file, this is my first time designing at this scale \n\n🤍 creating components — create instance property for each item, don’t forget to name your frame as “category/item name”\n\n🤍 storyboarding — writing out the story frame by frame, i’m collaborating with an animator (@_radnolan) for this project so \n\ni’m so happy with how this turned out 🥺 let me know if you have any questions!", "owner_username": "meshtimes", "owner_id": "3132849570", "likes": 32546, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0143_DARdL9uS47R\\DARdL9uS47R_20240923_201732.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18128795989395472, "text": "😍🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-25T00:42:21", "owner": "eman_ii5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032407412436700, "text": "The final scene is really cool 🔥 . Is it a mock-up or real ? 😂😍", "created_at": "2024-12-21T17:00:47", "owner": "pan.manee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051483947004908, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-12-18T08:49:39", "owner": "kaixinsuperman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005367293695081, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-16T17:25:49", "owner": "syrym.aru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040870805465893, "text": "Sooo cool", "created_at": "2024-12-14T18:09:45", "owner": "abigailwornockphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031796144168017, "text": "Thank you 😌", "created_at": "2024-12-10T20:56:42", "owner": "abhinavfilmsart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171430018313254, "text": "This is soooo coool!!! 🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-05T19:28:33", "owner": "minahuynhartis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348819448120668, "text": "nice person  