{"media_id": 3469518003999523101, "shortcode": "DAmND4KNsEd", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAmND4KNsEd/", "taken_at": "2024-10-01T21:45:07", "caption": "Follow @jerryjhlee for job search hacks\n\nWant recruiters to notice your resume? Here’s the hack:\n\n1. Go to YOU.COM and click “GENIUS”.\n2. Get personalized recommendations to improve your resume and craft the perfect LinkedIn message.\n3. Use YOU.COM for interview prep—get company insights, practice questions, and sample answers.\n\nWhy let recruiters have all the tools? Take control of your job search with YOU.COM.\n\nYou.Com Prompt:\n\n75% or higher: Tell me to apply!\nBelow 75%: Don’t apply yet! Tell me EXACTLY what skills are missing or weak on my resume. Then, give me step-by-step instructions on how to fix it:\nShould I add new bullet points? If so, tell me what those bullet points should say, using keywords from the job description.\nShould I rewrite existing bullet points? If so, tell me exactly which ones to rewrite and give me the improved versions.\n\nComment #YOU to try it out for FREE!\n\n#JustJerry #You.Com #AD", "owner_username": "jerryjhlee", "owner_id": "31254049", "likes": 395913, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0144_DAmND4KNsEd\\DAmND4KNsEd_20241001_214507.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17920221639247339, "text": "#YOU", "created_at": "2026-01-18T21:44:21", "owner": "santinandin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066187616537598, "text": "#YOU", "created_at": "2026-01-16T08:56:11", "owner": "alexchang0922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076484582209086, "text": "I’ve been rewriting resumes lately and most people saw quick results — if you want, I can look at yours. 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:00:23", "owner": "career_boost_ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050255948388917, "text": "I’m not sure if this is the right place to mention it, but I recently landed a role at Meta. One thing I think people get wrong about the market is that they don’t build an online presence. The market is messed up—there are thousands of people applying for a single junior position.\nThat’s why it’s better to focus on authenticity: create projects with AI tools, open‑source the code, share posts, and stay consistent. Doing that tends to bring more genuine opportunities than just polishing a résumé and sending out applications.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:13:30", "owner": "pavan_kunchala_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100151338705958, "text": "You", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:21:29", "owner": "213motorsltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112644949606547, "text": "You", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:33:36", "owner": "s_an_jay_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869363233470372, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:54:42", "owner": "m_r.chandu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086026879792411, "text": "#YOU", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:34:09", "owner": "fanta.d1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066947750379354, "text": "#YOU", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:43:54", "owner": "gadjitgal67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068519489366071, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-11-03T02:00:45", "owner": "_jessieamps_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123427726443055, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:46:51", "owner": "ashtami.vinayan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080544368026294, "text": "#You", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:52:41", "owner": "ephraimochara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938023528092497, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-10-20T01:55:15", "owner": "tietzmann.pedro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078148784079844, "text": "#You", "created_at": "2025-10-18T00:18:14", "owner": "shazal1611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079381163090555, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-10-18T00:17:16", "owner": "shazal1611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420744556107937, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-10-17T16:22:22", "owner": "r.ahi.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525934762056002, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-10-04T14:12:24", "owner": "coding_territory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092698072755339, "text": "#YOU", "creat