can_entrepreneur__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073438534771767, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-13T05:59:46", "owner": "amitanshu_padhee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481887958028306, "text": "you", "created_at": "2025-03-11T14:43:55", "owner": "marcochitu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076123045664272, "text": "#YOU", "created_at": "2025-03-10T04:29:33", "owner": "joskatdigitalshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925857265030565, "text": "Genius", "created_at": "2025-03-09T15:34:20", "owner": "_f.a.haha.d._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024593654409712, "text": "Does this only for job or colleges too", "created_at": "2025-03-08T18:14:36", "owner": "dabmeuobrother", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048541052198482, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-08T13:10:50", "owner": "trumpofthelord_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074509468705715, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-08T04:37:02", "owner": "ravi_1kisan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962757162856883, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-07T17:07:14", "owner": "austin_ombisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111277636460271, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-07T16:19:35", "owner": "bolson20tut.277081", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064566223913811, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-07T10:01:57", "owner": "sheriey_ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007555637542603, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-07T02:39:08", "owner": "ekkisyam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083110897718193, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-06T12:58:46", "owner": "_tkbw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493726693011445, "text": "#YOU", "created_at": "2025-03-04T08:07:00", "owner": "yinkofski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868259035244761, "text": "Send @_therealmeai", "created_at": "2025-03-02T18:13:21", "owner": "_therealmeai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051042890231324, "text": "#you", "created_at": "2025-03-02T14:24:16", "owner": "fai.thsudi", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["you", "justjerry", "you", "ad"]},
{"media_id": 3369324424798118715, "shortcode": "C7CPraBI6M7", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C7CPraBI6M7/", "taken_at": "2024-05-16T15:53:12", "caption": "Unveiling our Awards Showcase Hub!\n\nYour one-stop shop to explore the incredible work of our talented finalists and winners. Get inspired by the diverse range of pioneering ideas submitted across various categories.\n\n🎥 Plus, stay tuned for a special video release coming soon! We'll be sharing the personal stories behind the business ideas.\n\n#enterprise hashtag#startup hashtag#businesssheffield hashtag#entrepreneur hashtag#student", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 8, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0145_C7CPraBI6M7\\C7CPraBI6M7_20240516_155312.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18236687653260552", "text": "Very smart looking gentleman @prettysushey 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-06-12T01:08:52", "owner": "lawch_489", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18012329786375402", "text": "🎉🎉", "created_at": "2024-05-16T19:32:49", "owner": "diarriss22", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["enterprise", "startup", "businesssheffield", "entrepreneur", "student"]},
{"media_id": 3357790359339136532, "shortcode": "C6ZRIqeo_YU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6ZRIqeo_YU/", "taken_at": "2024-04-30T17:57:04", "caption": "🏆 Huge Success at the first ever Emerge Awards Showcase!\n\nWe celebrated a day filled with incredible talent and innovative ideas from students, staff, industry leaders, and the entire @theuniversityofsheffield community.\n\nA massive congrats to our amazing award winners:\n\nCommunity Venture of the Year: Tall Growth\nSustainability Venture of the Year: The Hollow Oak Project\nEnterprising Project of the Year: @Bobbi \nStart-up of the Year: @futuregreens.uk \n\nEvery presentation showcased exceptional creativity and entrepreneurial spirit. \n\nWe were blown away by the passion and dedication of all the participants!\n\n👏 A huge thank you to everyone who made this event possible, including @santanderuk and our event assistants. \n\nWe're incredibly proud of the Emerge program and excited to see what the future holds for these budding entrepreneurs. \n\n#EmergeAwards24 #enterprise #business #student #sheffield #startup #entrepreneurship #innovation", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 6, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0146_C6ZRIqeo_YU\\C6ZRIqeo_YU_20240430_175704_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0146_C6ZRIqeo_YU\\C6ZRIqeo_YU_20240430_175704_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0146_C6ZRIqeo_YU\\C6ZRIqeo_YU_20240430_175704_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0146_C6ZRIqeo_YU\\C6ZRIqeo_YU_20240430_175704_4.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["emergeawards24", "enterprise", "business", "student", "sheffield", "startup", "entrepreneurship", "innovation"]},
{"media_id": 3354082458741026495, "shortcode": "C6MGDm8oK6_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6MGDm8oK6_/", "taken_at": "2024-04-25T15:10:08", "caption": "🏅Introducing the finalists for the third Awards category, Community Venture of they Year!\n\nThis award celebrates ventures that give back to people, enrich communities, and make a lasting contribution to society.\n\nCongratulations to: \n@nutritokenuk \ntallgrowth \nBobbi \nThe Verdant Network\n\n💯Witnessing both the students and their businesses grow has been the most rewarding experience for our team. The level of innovation and environmental focus showcased by these students, all while managing academic demands, is truly impressive. \n\nCheck in tomorrow for the last category of the #EmergeAwards24\n\n#enterprise #entrepreneur #student #sheffield #business #startup #community #venture #dragonsden #funding #investment", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 2, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0147_C6MGDm8oK6_\\C6MGDm8oK6__20240425_151008_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0147_C6MGDm8oK6_\\C6MGDm8oK6__20240425_151008_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0147_C6MGDm8oK6_\\C6MGDm8oK6__20240425_151008_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0147_C6MGDm8oK6_\\C6MGDm8oK6__20240425_151008_4.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["emergeawards24", "enterprise", "entrepreneur", "student", "sheffield", "business", "startup", "community", "venture", "dragonsden", "funding", "investment"]},
{"media_id": 3346765110761997946, "shortcode": "C5yGSLlo8Z6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C5yGSLlo8Z6/", "taken_at": "2024-04-15T12:51:52", "caption": "We're back to business after the Easter holidays! 👔\n\nTomorrow we'll be joined by Andrew Season (Founder of Resolve) for \"How to Launch & Scale Your Business\". \n\nYou'll gain the confidence to understand the reality of ‘now’, but to grasp the opportunity of ‘tomorrow’. 🐐\n\nA masterclass you shouldn't miss! Date: Tuesday 16th April\nTime: 12pm - 1pm\n\n#entrepreneur #sheffield #university #student #business #startup", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 1, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0148_C5yGSLlo8Z6\\C5yGSLlo8Z6_20240415_125152.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["entrepreneur", "sheffield", "university", "student", "business", "startup"]},
{"media_id": 3341827395445528715, "shortcode": "C5gjk92MxiL", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C5gjk92MxiL/", "taken_at": "2024-04-08T17:21:31", "caption": "No masterclass this week while we're sorting through all the inspiring Awards Showcase applications! \n\nIt's been lovely to watch the community grow this term and we're delighted to see some new businesses forming from within the network. Thanks for coming along!\n\n#enterprise #studentcommunity #sheffield #business", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 2, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0149_C5gjk92MxiL\\C5gjk92MxiL_20240408_172131.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["enterprise", "studentcommunity", "sheffield", "business"]},
{"media_id": 3318564633410932444, "shortcode": "C4N6POaog7c", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C4N6POaog7c/", "taken_at": "2024-03-07T15:02:34", "caption": "Emerge Hoodies are here! 🥰\n\nAs we grow our enterprising community at @theuniversityofsheffield, we'll be increasing our presence on campus...starting with Emerge branding clothing. If you see us around, come say hi! 👘\n\nThanks to our latest competition winners for modelling the design. Watch out for more upcoming opportunities to win 🏆\n\n#branding #enterprise #sheffield #student #business #startup #hoodie", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 8, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0150_C4N6POaog7c\\C4N6POaog7c_20240307_150234.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["branding", "enterprise", "sheffield", "student", "business", "startup", "hoodie"]},
{"media_id": 3311165855822270239, "shortcode": "C3zn810sE8f", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C3zn810sE8f/", "taken_at": "2024-02-26T10:03:18", "caption": "Great pizza, amazing turn out, even better ideas! 💡\n\nWe're still buzzing from last week's workshop where we explored how to identify a problem, generate solutions and turn ideas into a business. \n\nIt was fantastic to welcome some new faces into the Emerge community...but we'd love to see some more! \n\nJoin us this Thursday for our Pitch and Presentation Training and build up your entrepreneurial skill set. 💰 \n\n#entrepreneurs #business #sheffield #student #Monday #workshop #challenge #team #startup", "owner_username": "emergeuos", "owner_id": "3736269524", "likes": 15, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0151_C3zn810sE8f\\C3zn810sE8f_20240226_100318.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["entrepreneurs", "business", "sheffield", "student", "monday", "workshop", "challenge", "team", "startup"]},
