, "owner": "maxx_geezyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017674916380471, "text": "Came here just for the comments. They did not disappoint 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:24:21", "owner": "officialbrattymilf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962742942835270, "text": "I'm sure it was in her once. Allowed", "created_at": "2024-12-03T15:57:53", "owner": "realshitbitch17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038476322262091, "text": "She from Dade, it’s different down there… everybody says it. Chicos, Haitians, Jamaicans… not too many American blacks down there.", "created_at": "2024-12-03T12:27:33", "owner": "miami_paco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908792131060325, "text": "White folks invented the word. They can have it.", "created_at": "2024-12-03T04:11:05", "owner": "boxcutterbrigade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068578537731438, "text": "Let her slide it's the holiday season 😅", "created_at": "2024-12-03T02:06:19", "owner": "therealderrickgee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847380520360634, "text": "This sexy", "created_at": "2024-12-02T21:43:25", "owner": "big_livingstone_the_3rd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018124208359676, "text": "Who fucking cares?", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:46:38", "owner": "rockefeller_217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013686464462456, "text": "Plenty of black dna in this one", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:25:52", "owner": "stevielaw86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908580850060553, "text": "Man… I wish more people went to kindergarten where we learned the simple saying that sticks and stones may break my bones but words can’t hurt me…", "created_at": "2024-12-02T19:59:42", "owner": "turner_212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947987082779155, "text": "A lot of white ppl think they have a pass till they get off Facebook", "created_at": "2024-12-02T19:55:07", "owner": "stodiojames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006724139677819, "text": "She not even saying it lol. She kind of breezin through it 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:36:50", "owner": "mr_joshuabjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060046534849245, "text": "She has plenty of black dna in her.", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:25:25", "owner": "davisonkeenan", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
