: "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-17T14:18:55", "owner": "gfajarnw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964376712946585, "text": "그래 니가 이겼어 제발 그만해 다오 ㅜ", "created_at": "2025-07-17T06:31:33", "owner": "a_phelios37", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072776720050412, "text": "제발", "created_at": "2025-07-12T09:11:10", "owner": "lee_nrc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968578746770926, "text": "くだらなさすぎて韓国行ったらここ行きたいと思ってるw", "created_at": "2025-07-11T08:54:37", "owner": "king_official_0119", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18050652167423227, "text": "아니 인천에서 사는데 제주도를 어캐감..", "created_at": "2025-07-05T04:55:35", "owner": "dam_endam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160361734369594, "text": "와 센스 개쩐다…. 이게 마케팅이지", "created_at": "2025-07-04T11:01:54", "owner": "younoyouno112", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074110288941587, "text": "予想はできてた", "created_at": "2025-06-30T08:59:12", "owner": "toshiki902", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18312848686227190, "text": "하ㅏㅏ 잊었었는데,, 또 당하네 이거", "created_at": "2025-06-25T19:56:50", "owner": "_itsgoeun_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367440958179207, "text": "앜ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ", "created_at": "2025-06-25T16:01:49", "owner": "lumine_moneylab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031874474406138, "text": "제주여서 먹으러 가지도 못하네", "created_at": "2025-06-02T09:34:34", "owner": "closedshark09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030486119655591, "text": "매생이를 벗어났더니 우럭이 나오네", "created_at": "2025-04-19T04:01:45", "owner": "k_min_1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849130372410789, "text": "넘 맜있겠다.근데 이 릴스감성이 그 뭐냐 너희이름 홍보같은데 편집자 납치당했나?", "created_at": "2025-04-12T07:40:46", "owner": "weondoyun19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049114739518986, "text": "@ksm1636sm @sgenie94 @jae_ho.o 제주 가서 여기 가야지", "created_at": "2025-04-12T04:16:59", "owner": "bangguy17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060645869029549, "text": "또 속았다", "created_at": "2025-04-11T08:07:40", "owner": "ai.funny_meme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047902760345818, "text": "하도 나와서 네이버에 검색해봤다..", "created_at": "2025-04-10T12:42:45", "owner": "njaeung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063784003985364, "text": "@myeonggugwak", "created_at": "2025-04-04T05:09:02", "owner": "hyeseong45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376605388186952, "text": "@ju__10_9", "created_at": "2025-04-02T13:35:20", "owner": "i_12.15_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051312179218381, "text": "아 개웃기네", "created_at": "2025-04-01T13:19:30", "owner": "eeuwor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080920450630746, "text": "이젠 우럭이냥..ㅋㅋㅋㅋ", "created_at": "2025-03-29T01:03:11", "owner": "thdudgks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986487396650930, "text": "저작권자 허락은 구하셨나요", "created_at": "2025-03-26T12:52:53", "owner": "lamangt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081853777630767, "text": "거 위치 어디여", "created_at": "2025-03-25T15:32:03", "owner": "choooooo_beom.1972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093386923559162, "text": "@bubas___kaki", "created_at": "2025-03-14T15:02:17", "owner": "winnerdh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873186559289765, "text": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ아니 이분 릴스 어쩌다 봤는데 ㅜㅜ 알고리즘 걸려버리네", "created_at": "2025-02-23T18:19:43", "owner": "dasom_joo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900180655130676, "text": "아 이것만 존나 많이 나오네", "created_at": "2025-02-23T11:20:48", "owner": "m_i.nseok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901620793108845, "text": "안나올줄알고안심했는데..", "created_at": "2025-02-23T07:39:51", "owner": "igeonho6119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352220224182232, "text": "프로필보는 습관들림", "created_at": "2025-02-23T07:09:33", "owner": "8li_ky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058367701995975, "text": "신카이 마코토 광고가 또 나올까 무서웠다...", "created_at": "2025-02-22T08:40:16", "owner": "_u._.bin4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860053606360538, "text": "@jaeyunn__", "created_at": "2025-02-21T14:48:05", "owner": "ga._zua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047859320012276, "text": "그래서 어케 됨?", "created_at": "2025-02-21T07:16:42", "owner": "00x_evan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379028905112749, "text": "개짜증나 ㅁㅊㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ개웋겨ㅜ", "created_at": "2025-02-20T06:59:35", "owner": "feat.hyoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875176696185952, "text": "아니... 제발 릴스 보기싫어진다 진짜", "created_at": "2025-02-19T23:36:07", "owner": "jxu_.n3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024966281355066, "text": "뻘하게웃기네", "created_at": "2025-02-19T15:06:13", "owner": "09_young1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958519044857502, "text": "이제부터 고집돌 뜨면 걍 넘길게여 ㅜ", "created_at": "2025-02-19T08:23:53", "owner": "jaein_kngf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076084126727255, "text": "이래서 내가 영상보면 프로필 먼저 본다..", "created_at": "2025-02-18T06:07:02", "owner": "yex.nx3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079498489563843, "text": "아니 광고 왤게 잘해", "created_at": "2025-02-17T02:21:56", "owner": "k_ongill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075324097673193, "text": "프로필 확인하는걸 깜빡했네", "created_at": "2025-02-16T13:03:03", "owner": "cheaah_0126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18486666178054937, "text": "⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⡑\n⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⣡⣷⣿⣷⣧⣡⠡⠡⠡⠡⡑⡐\n⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⢹⡏⠇⢕⢜⡺⣿⡇⠅⠅⡑⡐⡐\n⠅⠅⠅⠅⠅⢹⡸⢌⢬⢎⠾⡽⣧⠡⢁⢂⢂⢂\n⠨⠨⠨⠨⠨⠐⡌⡌⡪⣎⢕⡯⠎⠌⡐⡐⡐⡐\n⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠡⠸⡸⡸⣻⢪⡟⣌⢐⢐⢐⢐⢐\n⠨⠨⠨⠨⠨⠨⢐⢈⠪⠪⡫⣺⣿⣿⣶⣴⣐⢐\n⠨⠨⠨⠨⢨⣼⣾⣿⢙⠆⣼⣿⣿⡿⣿⣿⣿⣷\n⠨⠨⠨⠈⣿⣿⣿⡏⡎⣶⣿⢿⣾⢿⣻⣾⣿⣿\n⠨⠨⠨⢰⣿⣟⣯⡗⢵⣿⣻⣿⣻⣿⣟⣿⣿⣿\n⠨⠨⢈⣿⣿⣻⣿⣏⣿⡿⣯⣿⣿⣿⣽⣿⣿⣿\n⠨⠨⢸⣿⣟⣿⣿⣻⣟⣿⣻⣿⣿⣿⣽⣾⣿⣿", "created_at": "2025-02-15T08:58:14", "owner": "je0n9_hwan_2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044315222520580, "text": "@h.joo91 ㅠㅠㅠ또당했다", "created_at": "2025-02-15T07:47:26", "owner": "seonghyun0323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853771666389164, "text": "아니 그만!", "created_at": "2025-02-15T00:46:54", "owner": "pk._.dbs0626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300131563209152, "text": "@yeonhuii", "created_at": "2025-02-14T07:53:09", "owner": "jjxxly_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036848363601311, "text": "학교에서도 저노래밖에 생각이 안나요", "created_at": "2025-02-13T09:49:24", "owner": "hunh2_e12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052263154931280, "text": "ㅇ??", "created_at": "2025-02-13T08:50:02", "owner": "idonghu56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009273524519996, "text": "영배 나 올 줄", "created_at": "2025-02-13T08:12:48", "owner": "z1.qux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037817117420618, "text": "얼굴 맞혓다", "created_at": "2025-02-13T06:44:07", "owner": "13_dnwo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078129430563823, "text": "아 진짜 한번 시켜보고만다 진짜", "created_at": "2025-02-13T00:46:00", "owner": "sau_yoon2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036683012580397, "text": "하…. 프로필 보는 거 잊었다.", "created_at": "2025-02-12T07:47:59", "owner": "leeyebin00000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936328902986276, "text": "제발…그마안…..", "created_at": "2025-02-12T07:35:49", "owner": "juan_kang818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943528851950391, "text": "이런 해외 밈은 어디서 찾아요?", "created_at": "2025-02-11T23:42:25", "owner": "roorinnn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18120750649426290, "text": "후... 댓글으로 피신하기", "created_at": "2025-02-11T13:19:02", "owner": "cyburg10101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002701247558434, "text": "뭐야이게", "created_at": "2025-02-10T11:32:14", "owner": "h87o879", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999568386584519, "text": "오늘만 벌써 세번째다..", "created_at": "2025-02-10T08:25:48", "owner": "pkjo_0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058191880994013, "text": "@gyu_hj", "created_at": "2025-02-09T14:38:52", "owner": "jaeeeey95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066550939881960, "text": "진짜ㅋㄱㅋㄱㄱㄱㄱㅋㅋㄲㅋㅋㄱㅋㄱ 꼭 가고만다 여기 ㅅㅂㅋㄱㄱㅋ", "created_at": "2025-02-09T00:53:15", "owner": "st_523_st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035563889452830, "text": "와 이번엔 걸렷닼 모르고봄..", "created_at": "2025-02-08T01:53:52", "owner": "gk27elisa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865960360242558, "text": "예?", "created_at": "2025-02-07T08:20:45", "owner": "j.hoo_hwang", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
