{"media_id": 3475537498634426973, "shortcode": "DA7lvDZp5pd", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA7lvDZp5pd/", "taken_at": "2024-10-10T05:05:38", "caption": "Our 20W fiber laser makes fast and beautiful, engraved metal business cards! Available in a variety of colours and paper thin at only 0.2mm thick! \n\nMake a statement - go with metal!\n\n#laserengraving #metalbusinesscards #business #businesscards #fiberlaser", "owner_username": "victoriacustomlaser", "owner_id": "59608982394", "likes": 6, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0158_DA7lvDZp5pd\\DA7lvDZp5pd_20241010_050538.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17889308304031701", "text": "Watching that never gets boring!", "created_at": "2024-10-12T14:08:03", "owner": "islandelixir", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18269589781221229", "text": "Send me your post 👍", "created_at": "2024-10-10T05:15:04", "owner": "vancouver.community", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["laserengraving", "metalbusinesscards", "business", "businesscards", "fiberlaser"]},
{"media_id": 3474222910783628281, "shortcode": "DA261SDyCP5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA261SDyCP5/", "taken_at": "2024-10-08T09:31:25", "caption": "I started a new account because @jobroseph violated some guidelines and beta skibidi toilet Instagram is restricting my engagement", "owner_username": "thejobrosephshow", "owner_id": "69901513616", "likes": 112120, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0159_DA261SDyCP5\\DA261SDyCP5_20241008_093125.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17897728818071269, "text": "Brainrot is here, we have nowhere to hide", "created_at": "2024-10-08T10:26:25", "owner": "xavier_tan_", "likes": 7686}, {"id": 17862839454247403, "text": "I guess I'm a Moo Deng 💅", "created_at": "2024-10-08T09:45:42", "owner": "isawkwardguy", "likes": 5525}, {"id": 18057289187085214, "text": "I'M NPC", "created_at": "2025-03-11T11:15:45", "owner": "4.mmq_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990769542784132, "text": "Yay deng deng", "created_at": "2025-02-18T07:56:37", "owner": "low_phigros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264228916259863, "text": "After watched this I gained 西格玛(sigma)", "created_at": "2025-02-07T09:30:50", "owner": "13142ttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881554762228195, "text": "Niga", "created_at": "2025-02-04T16:35:28", "owner": "muadzpojie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090288748536807, "text": "Too political", "created_at": "2025-01-29T13:13:56", "owner": "tanerdki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036424940172686, "text": "I thought having rizz and aura would make you a chad", "created_at": "2025-01-28T15:29:44", "owner": "miggypiggy_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960719856851576, "text": "很难明白 老了", "created_at": "2025-01-24T09:00:22", "owner": "altonlim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052782182033031, "text": "我们拥有母丁在gta6之前🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-19T09:46:57", "owner": "whoask._.0309_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884411050203307, "text": "没有仇恨按钮🔥🔥🔥👉🏻👉🏻👉🏻", "created_at": "2025-01-19T09:45:57", "owner": "whoask._.0309_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919912420030035, "text": "I only have gyatt and aura 🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-19T04:30:33", "owner": "deometrygash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896628355036413, "text": "Oh my god 😂😂😂😂😂 moo deng", "created_at": "2025-01-02T23:36:39", "owner": "fantomtattoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126276394399710, "text": "如果三个都没有就怎样，what if there's neither", "created_at": "2025-01-02T16:04:28", "owner": "cheongzhen.hao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853553539310419, "text": "The keyboard protector and laptop dodgy stickers are on point bruh", "created_at": "2025-01-02T00:14:12", "owner": "kernwei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856631080344875, "text": "in chinese we call this situation：误入潮区", "created_at": "2025-01-01T16:12:19", "owner": "zgao520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039829583074879, "text": "I'm an officially crowned Moo Deng", "created_at": "2024-12-28T19:38:14", "owner": "abdulla_ababneh786", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17966692619820467, "text": "HAHAHAH", "created_at": "2024-12-27T13:55:22", "owner": "valecia.li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080445982603682, "text": "Gen Z 1997-2010", "created_at": "2024-12-27T09:15:08", "owner": "elijah_editz4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056381191943640, "text": "gen a not gen z", "created_at": "2024-12-25T06:35:18", "owner": "aalwj2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983593128777920, "text": "The brainrot 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-20T11:59:12", "owner": "ray.____.chm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056756122759150, "text": "oh what the shit im gonna cry why tf do i understand everything", "created_at": "2024-12-18T03:02:24", "owner": "daeggmansotuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004157855701935, "text": "@12nofome", "created_at": "2024-12-16T01:22:30", "owner": "believehit1434", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994699431685027, "text": "Makes sense", "created_at": "2024-12-15T13:24:57", "owner": "tony_triplesix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142408186325092, "text": "Why is the keyboard coming off?…..", "created_at": "2024-12-13T04:27:02", "owner": "ahmira_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951519942891319, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-11T14:56:22", "owner": "matchaavocad0es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027945497611496, "text": "Herro bossa! Alumulemu rizz cultural crossover detected", "created_at": "2024-12-10T11:28:23", "owner": "beingnenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914370622041734, "text": "I'm a gen z and I don't even understand this how the hell do you know that 😧", "created_at": "2024-12-09T14:30:46", "owner": "jing.er_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050409217861495, "text": "I guess I'm no longer a native English speaker", "created_at": "2024-12-09T06:44:13", "owner": "sgtmango10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030677708174754, "text": "@jiamingljm", "created_at": "2024-12-08T06:46:27", "owner": "actuallywilfred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032959889149791, "text": "gen z words 📝 KPI met ✅", "created_at": "2024-12-08T02:53:55", "owner": "tinana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037213259361653, "text": "Gen Z lingo bingo 😶‍🌫️", "created_at": "2024-12-08T02:53:06", "owner": "tinana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057007996906874, "text": "So litttt🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-07T18:28:50", "owner": "jjason_nosajj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090795682507849, "text": "OF detected, Opinion Rejected🙅te-tet ❌", "created_at": "2024-12-07T18:10:21", "owner": "snztr_fx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062358460888289, "text": "Please continue with this series thank you", "created_at": "2024-12-06T12:58:11", "owner": "thewendywen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060095224716452, "text": "Prepping for next year’s citizenship test🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-06T06:55:00", "owner": "heyimhaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029194118433377, "text": "@yue.ning_", "created_at": "2024-12-04T03:18:01", "owner": "_wkloh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857529382319523, "text": "@hai_meg wtf", "created_at": "2024-12-03T20:27:01", "owner": "xm3dragon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252487372278829, "text": "delulu is not the selulu", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:48:32", "owner": "aidenlxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000346694695920, "text": "Slowly pl…. Ok he’s already speaking in low speed", "created_at": "2024-11-28T18:57:50", "owner": "bolo_or", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886467508068845, "text": "Gen alpha", "created_at": "2024-11-28T07:18:19", "owner": "fea.l.s_gill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055505182901325, "text": "💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2024-11-28T02:52:14", "owner": "antoriafan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052817932805276, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-27T19:50:39", "owner": "isaac_shing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993593610574524, "text": "Gen Z❌️ Gen Alpha✅️", "created_at": "2024-11-26T12:49:39", "owner": "dragons_plants_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18478816885042378, "text": "I'm moo deng", "created_at": "2024-11-24T18:15:18", "owner": "_jajjang.haru_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022527140534788, "text": "@alex906 @ah_tsen", "created_at": "2024-11-21T13:35:47", "owner": "edwinachongshuyi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18470103754010950, "text": "@crysfoo if you wanna sigma", "created_at": "2024-11-21T13:34:36", "owner": "edwinachongshuyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063146200750578, "text": "I know these words, I still don't know what it really means and what's the difference.", "created_at": "2024-11-20T07:09:03", "owner": "leo._.sketch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250143544273477, "text": "2024 in a nutshell", "created_at": "2024-11-18T17:51:06", "owner": "jose9x4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026670839409872, "text": "@ahxn_6", "created_at": "2024-11-13T03:11:26", "owner": "al1enjuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060652825830984, "text": "What in the actual fuck is this", "created_at": "2024-11-12T13:59:30", "owner": "yintuankiet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011723036653833, "text": "Knn why did I understand everything 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-12T09:04:12", "owner": "sigeena", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17949223985765411, "text": "成分複雜", "created_at": "2024-11-12T08:30:10", "owner": "areuasukman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119278672401697, "text": "...why did i actually understand this im getting of insta for a while", "created_at": "2024-11-11T11:02:16", "owner": "wheredidyougogoalley.rose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045796123894528, "text": "Ain’t that gen A? Im gen Z and I barely know those words", "created_at": "2024-11-10T14:29:12", "owner": "media.johnwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461549110060803, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-10T07:45:01", "owner": "fareez.rst", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18465852118011597, "text": "Thanks for referencing Mrs Alumulumu in the end", "created_at": "2024-11-08T15:58:24", "owner": "liuc.lc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015269420356742, "text": "@happy_cj_0613", "created_at": "2024-11-06T15:45:36", "owner": "raylin625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089105779507014, "text": "NO. ITS GEN ALPHA. DO NOT ROPE US IN", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:43:02", "owner": "art_ing24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953344344850183, "text": "Bro wants that american citizenship so badly 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:24:20", "owner": "petros.58", "likes": 225}, {"id": 18008381837488447, "text": "Terrible definitions", "created_at": "2024-11-05T06:40:13", "owner": "krmr.773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18254563108261746, "text": "why is rizz \"Day Death\"?😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:04:10", "owner": "giallogioi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067084108726707, "text": "他是我的表率❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-04T13:25:37", "owner": "dq6_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908645530025281, "text": "CATA CATA ME ,🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️MS ALUMULEMU REFERENCE", "created_at": "2024-11-04T07:05:15", "owner": "nicokimchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048098968980248, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-03T06:23:44", "owner": "lidernakhimov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035526923463121, "text": "我的脑袋要烂掉了", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:43:15", "owner": "maxchin718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047629498971681, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-01T04:41:54", "owner": "william.le_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882234502150101, "text": "Это тот самый юмор❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2024-10-30T18:39:25", "owner": "cantu.seeme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988725549685521, "text": "誰讓兄弟煮⁉️😭😭🗣️🗣️🔥🔥💀💀", "created_at": "2024-10-30T16:04:36", "owner": "_that_david_cameron_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046054352484064, "text": "This is Gen Alpha not Gen Z", "created_at": "2024-10-30T07:16:40", "owner": "yunzigan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274039492222740, "text": "？？？？", "created_at": "2024-10-30T03:49:16", "owner": "xxxbaoying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063365176616281, "text": "The brainrot is indubitably strong with this one", "created_at": "2024-10-29T17:41:33", "owner": "hirsh.tveria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879202771090648, "text": "this would put a victorian child in a coma", "created_at": "2024-10-29T00:19:57", "owner": "angelasong95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847377337309401, "text": "Cut cut me??? Mrs Lumulumu reference????", "created_at": "2024-10-28T20:53:01", "owner": "yourlocaljestercat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860562280268841, "text": "It's gen alpha not z stop getting us confused we are not THAT", "created_at": "2024-10-28T19:01:01", "owner": "mullet_mandam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074514202601939, "text": "你給了我勇氣去結束一切🔥🔥 謝謝你🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-28T10:17:34", "owner": "thedisnothere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044338538082477, "text": "Lollllll หมูเด้งมาไง 525262625272715162617", "created_at": "2024-10-28T00:11:17", "owner": "tee_oooooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008892401648929, "text": "KATA KATA ME", "created_at": "2024-10-27T22:48:19", "owner": "texxture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011965214633331, "text": "让兄弟煮🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-27T02:12:37", "owner": "may_chonghua_liu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047586142962978, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-27T02:02:19", "owner": "_lexi_ii__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078395383497213, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-26T12:03:44", "owner": "starlight0313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038810072269961, "text": "為啥下面那個不是吉亞子啊？", "created_at": "2024-10-26T01:36:45", "owner": "fybr_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051437743764198, "text": "Why he kinda sound Jamaican", "created_at": "2024-10-25T23:43:48", "owner": "u__p__c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059970337754943, "text": "Why is the first time I’m being introduced to this word gyatt in singlish smh", "created_at": "2024-10-25T12:45:28", "owner": "chernchristine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064552306676951, "text": "Bro looks way too happy to deliver this brainrot somEBODY HELP HIM-💀💀", "created_at": "2024-10-25T11:21:00", "owner": "jdacheb", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17927381414960530, "text": "Im brainroted", "created_at": "2024-10-25T10:33:02", "owner": "mingg_01.25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103428391448165, "text": "This was hard to watch so good job. Take my like and never speak to me again", "created_at": "2024-10-25T08:41:19", "owner": "osamudiamen_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060616231764881, "text": "the genuine smile", "created_at": "2024-10-24T21:12:28", "owner": "allisonyzhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334015510179015, "text": "Gen y Paradox: we find a fork in the road, do we use it for our next meal?😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:24:00", "owner": "kevinoscarliou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104199190444237, "text": "No one wants to be apart of your symphony", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:44:18", "owner": "lucas_t168", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075594718514352, "text": "the forthcoming of brainrot", "created_at": "2024-10-24T08:07:11", "owner": "eaciis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035379461218224, "text": "兄弟谁让他煮🔥🗣️", "created_at": "2024-10-24T06:45:24", "owner": "zu_yuan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931145196947357, "text": "I m  moode  sh s als  moodeng  ha4h", "created_at": "2024-10-24T04:09:09", "owner": "maybeitsjusttheory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063352615667415, "text": "I've never felt so understood", "created_at": "2024-10-24T03:42:26", "owner": "angysmols", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112034227419661, "text": "God didn't abandoned us, it's just that we're so brain rotten that we forgo he existed", "created_at": "2024-10-23T18:39:27", "owner": "waffle_buffet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018774842322097, "text": "I’m an NPC 😭🙏", "created_at": "2024-10-23T18:28:13", "owner": "xx._.jen_.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180787