w that some Asians will genuinely be mad af at this joke hahahaha and I'm one.", "created_at": "2025-03-12T00:50:11", "owner": "brandisnails7234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900505315139494, "text": "At least smarter than Americans", "created_at": "2025-03-10T12:52:55", "owner": "_t.hame_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142026028375439, "text": "Why don’t white people season there food. Because they don’t like Color", "created_at": "2025-02-23T17:01:20", "owner": "bray_2031", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078164119632504, "text": "That’s Racist", "created_at": "2025-02-23T17:00:56", "owner": "bray_2031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893416873011834, "text": "Asians: X Japanese: O", "created_at": "2024-10-13T16:51:53", "owner": "hxe_hw9n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289322779227735, "text": "DAYUM", "created_at": "2024-10-13T16:37:01", "owner": "yashveer_wylin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17904371426962219, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-13T16:35:26", "owner": "g.acosta3", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["fyp", "gta5", "viralvideos", "fypシ", "gtav", "goviral", "funny", "radio", "viral"]},
{"media_id": 3478618174656926299, "shortcode": "DBGiMyhpNJb", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBGiMyhpNJb/", "taken_at": "2024-10-14T11:00:23", "caption": "The BBC's creative sound effects have shaped radio for decades, proving just how vital they are to storytelling—now, their sound effect library offers over 33,000 samples, available for free as WAV or MP3 files.\n\nSpanning from the 1920s to now, it features everything from studio recordings to global field sounds.\n\nWith categories like ‘Animals’, ‘Atmosphere’, and ‘Footsteps’, users can explore sounds for personal use, or buy them for commercial projects.\n\nTap our linkinbio for more on the news and to access the archive.", "owner_username": "mixmagasia", "owner_id": "1328886807", "likes": 17715, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0163_DBGiMyhpNJb\\DBGiMyhpNJb_20241014_110023.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17859267186435922, "text": "@themidnightofficial", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:25:32", "owner": "itslindalou_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896519914132904, "text": "@mol_opoly would be good for your radio show x", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:01:31", "owner": "jx420tatts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046434476011343, "text": "funny boom ❌❌❌😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T04:14:27", "owner": "dzwiekwfilmie.pl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886370686134491, "text": "@nikolasbrummer 🥰🤫", "created_at": "2024-11-05T18:46:29", "owner": "valentin_brummer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009458906479760, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-04T02:10:23", "owner": "marcelo__serrano", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897232957093438, "text": "They only offer it for educational or personal productions. You can not license any of these sounds for professionals working in professional film and TV shows.", "created_at": "2024-11-03T18:53:33", "owner": "maggotbreath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046078390862215, "text": "@chris_tographr", "created_at": "2024-10-31T19:29:28", "owner": "markhillimagemaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857173897285496, "text": "https://sound-effects.bbcrewind.co.uk/", "created_at": "2024-10-31T10:03:01", "owner": "dom_5042", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864750715185186, "text": "I don’t see it in link", "created_at": "2024-10-31T04:10:48", "owner": "mattalonzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983676528744131, "text": "link?", "created_at": "2024-10-27T22:04:43", "owner": "lulapoloca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992596836708954, "text": "@giamargaret do your thing 🙏", "created_at": "2024-10-27T08:47:50", "owner": "milesjjoseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18463241776015575, "text": "Kind of a pointless post since they’re not free lol", "created_at": "2024-10-27T00:44:54", "owner": "pierce.fierce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002323271659152, "text": "I swear : this is the place where the movie Alien: Prometheus has is initial scene! Just saw it a few minutes ago on my tv and now here on this ad.", "created_at": "2024-10-25T22:16:19", "owner": "pepemorenoberlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849095242323129, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-10-25T06:14:08", "owner": "weseemoonsofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898348477072860, "text": "Sounds of commander Ashtar Sharam in 1976... !? 👽", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:39:15", "owner": "zemarcosguimaraes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954514752835328, "text": "@therealmaxmiller", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:29:31", "owner": "brentkatzlightning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862879570253706, "text": "@porte_leau on mettra ça dans nos chansons", "created_at": "2024-10-22T08:23:53", "owner": "adou_frc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946191375766862, "text": "In jesus name… no more cap. \n(They’re not free)", "created_at": "2024-10-22T05:23:34", "owner": "imalcolmxavier", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18041057458915858, "text": "@antitraxx_", "created_at": "2024-10-21T18:13:04", "owner": "thebombsheltercrew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070932508540992, "text": "Is that a lighting stand ?! Oops.", "created_at": "2024-10-21T15:16:15", "owner": "samkey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009735080456944, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-21T15:05:32", "owner": "melissastaiger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035865206224712, "text": "@kalpa_vision @ashirasolmusic @noetik.the.alchemist @_groundscore_", "created_at": "2024-10-21T14:46:24", "owner": "koko_budder", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047659004052193, "text": "I don't see it there?", "created_at": "2024-10-21T08:04:16", "owner": "5teff11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029204018520304, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2024-10-21T03:52:14", "owner": "atmosstudio.in", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970598682795243, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-21T01:24:30", "owner": "kotoku_denjiro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950830605850156, "text": "@publicnemeny fyi for next time😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T18:03:25", "owner": "jennykesslurr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067734949570958, "text": "@davidor__", "created_at": "2024-10-20T13:34:25", "owner": "jonathanrobertmason", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010817645414876, "text": "🖤🖤🖤", "created_at": "2024-10-20T12:04:35", "owner": "leyremannvadillo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090117835492676, "text": "Can they be used for films and series?😍", "created_at": "2024-10-20T07:05:45", "owner": "joyofodu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031940825342148, "text": "Why TF is he holding a light stand instead of a boom pole? Is this AI at work?", "created_at": "2024-10-20T01:03:59", "owner": "dccamera", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18254851303254581, "text": "@notbuddyrich", "created_at": "2024-10-19T19:43:03", "owner": "mattstrongldn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906637927042851, "text": "hard", "created_at": "2024-10-19T08:02:35", "owner": "brianplanets", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034433432351056, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-10-19T03:06:56", "owner": "eldrickpue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021699527248550, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:57:36", "owner": "eldrickpue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041097040905221, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-19T01:31:39", "owner": "nayo_creative_productions", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025217900587093, "text": "@henrikvernegg bare å fylle opp dat-Pcn?", "created_at": "2024-10-18T23:13:38", "owner": "kongmathias", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911041377935451, "text": "@cjkemble", "created_at": "2024-10-18T21:34:29", "owner": "chloejuno", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065778301577945, "text": "Thanks spike Milligan", "created_at": "2024-10-18T13:50:35", "owner": "liquidchef92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870016933209924, "text": "I would like to have all the archives, i wish this is not fake", "created_at": "2024-10-18T13:35:17", "owner": "crisskywalker2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935875743797964, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-18T06:41:21", "owner": "duh_bueno_moreno", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095527924462955, "text": "@oreemog", "created_at": "2024-10-17T23:25:59", "owner": "ikigaiarthaus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18027346646162091, "text": "Link or it didn't happen", "created_at": "2024-10-17T20:34:33", "owner": "thereal_angell", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852964081299099, "text": "So much room for activities 🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-17T20:33:50", "owner": "hedyneptune", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18460352182009471, "text": "Awesome news 🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-17T14:15:40", "owner": "carlosguinle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024525455419498, "text": "Not free guys😢 im sad..", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:53:57", "owner": "kekkoermalizia", "likes": 37}, {"id": 17882413446113595, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:19:19", "owner": "nicoferrada", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024611756421416, "text": "Hiw to access it ?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:36:21", "owner": "mehran.qaseemi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959261784704367, "text": "Whattttt that’s awesome", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:29:02", "owner": "sparrowinthepines", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17924671127968564, "text": "@tigma.official if you ever get bored and want new sounds...", "created_at": "2024-10-16T15:33:12", "owner": "backcountrybassdrops", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18150986134332394, "text": "BBC Sound Effects Volume 4 @stephenthomasward", "created_at": "2024-10-16T15:25:48", "owner": "bipolarbear.wear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038491535155828, "text": "Prometheus waterfall", "created_at": "2024-10-16T15:00:50", "owner": "n.e.u.r.o.exe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112777969416698, "text": "Anybody know a site with good royalty free music?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T14:52:46", "owner": "autumn_aum", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18146641492340082, "text": "The waterfall sound would be good for a pooping scene", "created_at": "2024-10-16T05:45:23", "owner": "desolationhorse", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17996596088693688, "text": "@only.operator", "created_at": "2024-10-16T05:27:56", "owner": "cam3ra_obscura", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061274362767432, "text": "@averyaplaud", "created_at": "2024-10-16T05:27:48", "owner": "cam3ra_obscura", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074859058515912, "text": "Downloaded all of these ages ago", "created_at": "2024-10-16T03:52:39", "owner": "producerfromthefuture", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048996619798568, "text": "I remember the binders of BBC sound library CDs. I picked through them for hours in the music lab in college.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:54:17", "owner": "mysterytin", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18021981083528085, "text": "get to work", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:36:58", "owner": "djwolvie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18272994901217970, "text": "they are not free if you cant really use them into your projects.  nice to listen and know you cant use them...", "created_at": "2024-10-15T17:14:06", "owner": "pablodalibonnelly", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18051188233902360, "text": "isn't that the waterfall from alien - prometheus?", "created_at": "2024-10-15T14:55:08", "owner": "tommy_nori", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17882753985067759, "text": "Incredible news", "created_at": "2024-10-14T22:07:41", "owner": "mumpkins0up", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875048101180587, "text": "Link is not working", "created_at": "2024-10-14T15:17:55", "owner": "ruuuuhul", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18343285000131393, "text": "woah 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2024-10-14T14:48:00", "owner": "andychen.music", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005033384660589, "text": "And they come with terms n conditions. Cant use them for your tracks - if you need to release.", "created_at": "2024-10-14T14:04:20", "owner": "jack_spiker", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18064875616711122, "text": "@jliu0624", "created_at": "2024-10-14T13:17:38", "owner": "nigel188", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905320891042663, "text": "almost 1 tb space needed 😢", "created_at": "2024-10-14T13:05:05", "owner": "mavvana", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18010084226427750, "text": "🦜🦜🦜", "created_at": "2024-10-14T13:03:39", "owner": "jenn_though", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036068489014004, "text": "That’s sweet", "created_at": "2024-10-14T12:54:34", "owner": "i.l.n.e.j", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18250318249260985, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-14T11:48:12", "owner": "sheisjoya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17955198089837588, "text": "The Beast of Craggy island‽ 👹", "created_at": "2024-11-02T07:15:11", "owner": "jp_godot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868712713230369, "text": "@saiphi free samples for Stellar Harvest!", "created_at": "2024-10-28T16:55:15", "owner": "gorgeoussqualor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439093984066265, "text": "“free for personal use”", "created_at": "2024-10-22T22:57:31", "owner": "peyman_kerimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944526558887231, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-18T20:54:51", "owner": "danielstillalive", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024078992411558, "text": "Hard as fuck", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:56:20", "owner": "yamshimada", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122345311358773, "text": "Siiiiik", "created_at": "2024-10-15T23:03:08", "owner": "starsymmetric", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3474402042207041389, "shortcode": "DA3jj_MpHdt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA3jj_MpHdt/", "taken_at": "2024-10-08T15:25:16", "caption": "Halloween 636 🎃 vs Nyan Cat 🐈#motorcycle #nyancat #bikelife #motorcyclelife #zx6r #biker", "owner_username": "nyanzx6r", "owner_id": "56552772313", "likes": 515997, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0164_DA3jj_MpHdt\\DA3jj_MpHdt_20241008_152516.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18072217555868268, "text": "cameraman", "created_at": "2025-03-30T13:44:48", "owner": "kujo_shin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264918109274702, "text": "I still love it though 😂👏🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-30T06:54:07", "owner": "kioko_if", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068107183906826, "text": "Pink panties 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-30T06:53:53", "owner": "kioko_if", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972518139838703, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-28T18:24:47", "owner": "jeroen_maas_80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056743352157358, "text": "🤜🤛", "created_at": "2025-03-28T14:32:56", "owner": "naitik_jaiswal3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037877345236941, "text": "Thank you for not muting the revs", "created_at": "2025-03-26T16:33:53", "owner": "s4iri_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319084348205714, "text": "Whyyyy your backpack so cuuuuteeeeeeee kyaaaaaaaaaa 😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-03-23T23:21:26", "owner": "austin.helsya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009981287529728, "text": "Finding fellow bikers on a sunset bike ride is like finding a real person on NPC world..", "created_at": "2025-03-22T03:12:44", "owner": "gunther__sosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050281205205273, "text": "What type of bike u got", "created_at": "2025-03-17T14:29:02", "owner": "gavin_anthofer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917652531963050, "text": "Proof on how fast guys can become homies", "created_at": "2025-03-15T16:53:14", "owner": "gregigator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079704823635727, "text": "Men are simple", "created_at": "2025-03-15T12:31:46", "owner": "wolfgangamadusmozart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059254714863517, "text": "Gixxer brah?", "created_at": "2025-03-14T16:05:02", "owner": "finner4422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492183091019443, "text": "💕💕💕💕", "created_at": "2025-03-08T18:37:33", "owner": "kimkegel2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957700551874923, "text": "The simultaneous shift", "created_at": "2025-03-03T19:05:37", "owner": "frostyd.visuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888335086199400, "text": "You are my friend now. We are having some tacos later🤣", "created_at": "2025-02-27T08:21:53", "owner": "jakublaszynski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886229359213378, "text": "the end is so wholesome😭♥️", "created_at": "2025-02-20T23:26:20", "owner": "stupidyote", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077932636652118, "text": "You are my friend now", "created_at": "2025-02-13T15:41:16", "owner": "garenqewflashr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000434852722773, "text": "How i meet bro", "created_at": "2025-02-02T12:29:45", "owner": "aim9_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314186050202648, "text": "Stuff like this is why i love the internet", "created_at": "2025-01-23T11:02:20", "owner": "yurb0iaj", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18489705739011491, "text": "And this is  the beginning of  how a friendship  was born", "created_at": "2025-01-22T22:08:57", "owner": "spacemansheldon_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18480688354042939, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-13T23:35:47", "owner": "hnakil00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040710791363343, "text": "What the he* was you weard bro", "created_at": "2025-01-07T12:56:31", "owner": "sssssst717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053480407849170, "text": "Hello my fellow Colorado habit haver", "created_at": "2025-01-06T02:35:10", "owner": "runeschmier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959570910739817, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🙌🙌🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-05T23:55:00", "owner": "deathridaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480272875047440, "text": "You both belong in jail and have your license revoked and bikes confiscated", "created_at": "2025-01-04T19:57:00", "owner": "basslayer1973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038859644093652, "text": "Easy way to make new friend level unlocked😂", "created_at": "2025-01-04T14:41:13", "owner": "anna2001207", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067652161747730, "text": "Song?", "created_at": "2025-01-03T22:20:36", "owner": "cpt.autizmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865514674292455, "text": "\"you're my friend now\" ahh fist bump", "created_at": "2025-01-02T12:31:16", "owner": "mitty_2010", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877891864224965, "text": "wait i know that placee", "created_at": "2024-12-31T17:45:13", "owner": "fw_issak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129150157389417, "text": "Omg I thought I saw you in Colorado! This video just confirmed that. Too cool.", "created_at": "2024-12-31T02:45:09", "owner": "colachick22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849158380371716, "text": "I can’t wait till I get my bike😩🙏🏽💗", "created_at": "2024-12-30T23:01:58", "owner": "alicialauren_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997271277722001, "text": "That's how quickly it is for men to make friends", "created_at": "2024-12-30T16:54:30", "owner": "thorpharry_50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027151640535786, "text": "Traffic laws obeying you 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-30T16:34:15", "owner": "farh.aan1179", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927306178005057, "text": "Ha ha anytime I took my Evo out and a fast car or bike pulled up on me.", "created_at": "2024-12-30T14:09:43", "owner": "nick_maneotis_rolls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043321001193264, "text": "The camera man 🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-30T08:46:20", "owner": "chris_szn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017462543406853, "text": "Awww you made a friend", "created_at": "2024-12-30T01:54:24", "owner": "youngg_nina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870355504185623, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-30T01:35:39", "owner": "chazz6640", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087865993529480, "text": "You nuked his ahh", "created_at": "2024-12-29T10:30:50", "owner": "xuranium_fever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039112979349039, "text": "Who was recording", "created_at": "2024-12-28T18:28:53", "owner": "fuckology721", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938056062954278, "text": "Just for a fist bump??😭", "created_at": "2024-12-28T05:18:40", "owner": "khhuzaima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013348982678824, "text": "How fast is the camera man", "created_at": "2024-12-27T09:27:31", "owner": "obispo_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030133124548112, "text": "The song at the end 😂 a classic nice friendly drive and forming friendship 🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-26T22:38:47", "owner": "kirbyflowz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057384334767866, "text": "Colorado!!! Be safe!!", "created_at": "2024-12-26T21:33:49", "owner": "bearbee333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058808416902355, "text": "I want a bike to cruise cause I like em but not tryna race and my anxiety would spike if someone pulled up next to me to race 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T05:50:00", "owner": "jamesthecoolguy03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915954499023970, "text": "Is that a Polish flag on arm ?", "created_at": "2024-12-24T10:51:47", "owner": "mikolajziolkowski51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972108672807995, "text": "Boys will be boys 😌", "created_at": "2024-12-24T04:59:35", "owner": "dendensxr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875960209234030, "text": "Where is his camera mounted?", "created_at": "2024-12-23T19:41:46", "owner": "the.rizzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865828399275617, "text": "How ez🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-23T07:34:46", "owner": "noeldenny._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065779237787573, "text": "☺️", "created_at": "2024-12-22T12:59:31", "owner": "kosminuskosminus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071256085659168, "text": "@allen.shine_ 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T15:34:50", "owner": "_wrongz__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052588211004215, "text": "Omg you're in Colorado?! I need to start watching for you! 😁", "created_at": "2024-12-21T06:22:42", "owner": "pakistanigirl94", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056934985940461, "text": "\"and that's how I met your uncle", "created_at": "2024-12-21T06:02:47", "owner": "icecoldmdfkr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994345407737950, "text": "Yes, yes, and just YES", "created_at": "2024-12-20T18:58:48", "owner": "seanpatrickj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382896007103646, "text": "Camera guy had to record, he let you guys win.", "created_at": "2024-12-20T14:47:45", "owner": "abhii._win", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001410116530365, "text": "Did we just become best friends? YUP", "created_at": "2024-12-19T18:42:14", "owner": "rice.z4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850048462362216, "text": "Irrelevant", "created_at": "2024-12-18T17:14:48", "owner": "beameredgy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072336877714652, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-18T10:11:55", "owner": "alukovinyl_design", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947378928914203, "text": "wats that camera tho", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:51:01", "owner": "shaforshakunimama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065415559776724, "text": "Why did this ending make me so happy 🥹🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:07:10", "owner": "sabrina_not_hansen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353228494127008, "text": "I know that place roll up hahaha", "created_at": "2024-12-16T03:55:03", "owner": "shesallamaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024815681541647, "text": "Impressive🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-15T19:36:57", "owner": "destinyanalysis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053304524300035, "text": "Can someone tell me plz how do bikers film these videos cause I can't see any one behind him who could film and there is no stand where he could attach some camera. Plz it's a request do tell me how do u even film like just how??", "created_at": "2024-12-15T18:43:11", "owner": "amna.__.xo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973685616799615, "text": "The pink underwear stays", "created_at": "2024-12-15T02:52:59", "owner": "dumb._mae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860929258242053, "text": "@nyanzx6r ima follow cuz you from state", "created_at": "2024-12-14T20:33:16", "owner": "osama_.303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029610728197481, "text": "Colorado?", "created_at": "2024-12-13T21:30:32", "owner": "tioboosie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071987521642780, "text": "Instantly recognized that bridge! 👌", "created_at": "2024-12-13T03:47:52", "owner": "nick_hassler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033697637128191, "text": "Future meat crayons no one will miss", "created_at": "2024-12-12T20:36:39", "owner": "cunninghealing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049483589062243, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-11T07:48:31", "owner": "rentamauiboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053941010504521, "text": "that backpack is so corny. i want it", "created_at": "2024-12-10T09:31:44", "owner": "636darius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072217555868268, "text": "cameraman", "created_at": "2025-03-30T13:44:48", "owner": "kujo_shin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264918109274702, "text": "I still love it though 😂👏🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-30T06:54:07", "owner": "kioko_if", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068107183906826, "text": "Pink panties 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-30T06:53:53", "owner": "kioko_if", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972518139838703, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-28T18:24:47", "owner": "jeroen_maas_80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056743352157358, "text": "🤜🤛", "created_at": "2025-03-28T14:32:56", "owner": "naitik_jaiswal3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037877345236941, "text": "Thank you for not muting the revs", "created_at": "2025-03-26T16:33:53", "owner": "s4iri_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319084348205714, "text": "Whyyyy your backpack so cuuuuteeeeeeee kyaaaaaaaaaa 😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-03-23T23:21:26", "owner": "austin.helsya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009981287529728, "text": "Finding fellow bikers on a sunset bike ride is like finding a real person on NPC world..", "created_at": "2025-03-22T03:12:44", "owner": "gunther__sosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050281205205273, "text": "What type of bike u got", "created_at": "2025-03-17T14:29:02", "owner": "gavin_anthofer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917652531963050, "text": "Proof on how fast guys can become homies", "created_at": "2025-03-15T16:53:14", "owner": "gregigator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079704823635727, "text": "Men are simple", "created_at": "2025-03-