{"media_id": 3477702956025160348, "shortcode": "DBDSGmwNKKc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBDSGmwNKKc/", "taken_at": "2024-10-13T04:42:02", "caption": "", "owner_username": "jwmeisushi", "owner_id": "30820352816", "likes": 67484, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0167_DBDSGmwNKKc\\DBDSGmwNKKc_20241013_044202.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18137428456343624, "text": "第一個是刻板印象吧", "created_at": "2025-01-17T17:46:54", "owner": "xiahuayuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382842718111415, "text": "千萬不要去蚛蟈！！！", "created_at": "2025-01-05T09:46:34", "owner": "yuelongqi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997083255724620, "text": "去了中国才知道，你在那边根本就是个被中国人辱骂的存在", "created_at": "2025-01-05T02:11:29", "owner": "hearst_1010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883299091190609, "text": "冰島有蚊子？", "created_at": "2024-12-22T23:22:08", "owner": "cwc._.kirk1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888278656071971, "text": "最後一句是謊言", "created_at": "2024-12-19T05:24:10", "owner": "m_m12526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994598001724523, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-18T03:46:30", "owner": "cutemama.fang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067804891688275, "text": "去了马来西亚才知道，大厦都没4楼，只有3A。", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:30:37", "owner": "nico.n1c0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061260244849276, "text": "@pighig1005", "created_at": "2024-12-17T12:02:20", "owner": "rainie_0924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051437407851950, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-17T00:57:13", "owner": "chinceciliacecilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011766569488066, "text": "所以我才覺得很奇怪台灣明明很棒可是為什麼我們這麼累這麼痛苦", "created_at": "2024-12-16T20:02:35", "owner": "ty065439", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049339175292840, "text": "去了飞机场才知道\n你没钱买机票 呜呜呜😭……", "created_at": "2024-12-15T07:09:31", "owner": "mr.chinnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888113638149781, "text": "的確", "created_at": "2024-12-15T03:14:36", "owner": "shiming_su", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324481090080232, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-14T17:14:46", "owner": "justin277777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356024962192260, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-14T14:41:51", "owner": "jetsl_5502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882663016188839, "text": "纽西兰有蛇，不过很少见", "created_at": "2024-12-14T10:33:43", "owner": "evonkhoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014380166450203, "text": "Bgm?", "created_at": "2024-12-13T04:14:47", "owner": "aulapyuenkkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431122768079186, "text": "去了中國才知道人民的素質！", "created_at": "2024-12-12T07:25:01", "owner": "alexander_canada8964", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17962718135831316, "text": "只有最後一句是造假", "created_at": "2024-12-11T02:35:15", "owner": "qingming2158", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068023156675953, "text": "去了才知道會抖", "created_at": "2024-12-11T00:55:06", "owner": "adha12112", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863220085222239, "text": "去了中国才知道原来什么是道德沦丧", "created_at": "2024-12-10T05:42:45", "owner": "19jimmy92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929903928974767, "text": "大陸人很多事都不知道", "created_at": "2024-12-10T02:14:48", "owner": "ciy9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854611564280974, "text": "去了台灣才知道 原來殺人不用死刑", "created_at": "2024-12-09T19:07:57", "owner": "shihsky0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033539489143480, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:05:05", "owner": "qiu_hanyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054985462781339, "text": "放棄武統台灣，兩岸才能一家親", "created_at": "2024-12-09T05:38:52", "owner": "zhouyayong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093999298448546, "text": "go了马来西亚🇲🇾你会faham：原来一句话可以随意轻松自然而非常贴切的掺好几种语言在里面😛🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-09T03:32:02", "owner": "jack_950111", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099288214467433, "text": "尼泊尔为啥结三次婚", "created_at": "2024-12-08T11:14:08", "owner": "clgr0820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890371345056659, "text": "到了台灣才知道，罵政府不會被消失", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:18:01", "owner": "neverfind1213", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049013969092798, "text": "去了中華民國才知道 這裡比中國還要自由十倍以上", "created_at": "2024-12-08T02:23:44", "owner": "bob.kim521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157519486330687, "text": "去了臺灣才知道，那裡有民主自由（臺灣人", "created_at": "2024-12-08T02:22:31", "owner": "nini._0226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071201464713908, "text": "去了中國才知道，通訊軟體傳的10句會有4句被屏蔽掉👎", "created_at": "2024-12-08T02:18:55", "owner": "q2688678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862943104222549, "text": "没钱没条件去了只能要饭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:16:17", "owner": "nongnong7313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474385393023485, "text": "去了台灣才知道 原來房價不會跌", "created_at": "2024-12-07T00:56:04", "owner": "jacky10312003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049408337502732, "text": "言論自由的確沒有，要的話都是中央政府宣布才算是可以言論自由。", "created_at": "2024-12-05T22:25:06", "owner": "taiteengshen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159200068325501, "text": "所介紹的各国家都沒有共產黨的影子！😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T05:20:14", "owner": "someonelovemenow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932735112844511, "text": "最后一个巴勒斯坦是为了让影片能在墙内存活下去吗？", "created_at": "2024-11-28T22:49:02", "owner": "txdw10k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070466830726706, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-27T15:40:24", "owner": "carol_8.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052444537814427, "text": "去了台灣才知道 先禁國家真可怕", "created_at": "2024-11-26T04:04:25", "owner": "sd0405", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18033989012369025, "text": "不用戰中國 一堆沒去過的，華人的國度 都有很不好的大問題", "created_at": "2024-11-24T12:13:30", "owner": "t1_faker_no.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048037472039596, "text": "還沒去澳洲嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-24T06:20:34", "owner": "wu.mickey.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258786292248341, "text": "胡扯，人人都有批評美国的自由", "created_at": "2024-11-20T00:11:26", "owner": "markshamhp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044507578932955, "text": "翻了牆才知道，有YouTube 有ig", "created_at": "2024-11-19T22:30:05", "owner": "incubusjoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046887671087281, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-18T07:25:04", "owner": "jianghoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028443287602493, "text": "@jffy1221 單身稅是三小", "created_at": "2024-11-17T02:01:40", "owner": "pankration26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860739169278593, "text": "知道為什麼巴勒斯坦才是身在中國這麼幸福嗎？因為跟前面比起來這句用不了。", "created_at": "2024-11-16T00:43:01", "owner": "aka_morice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047851495863496, "text": "沒去 但我知道了👌", "created_at": "2024-11-15T16:18:38", "owner": "lin_xuan_yu_0218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898656171997388, "text": "去了中國才知道 原來台灣有這麼大的離島", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:57:00", "owner": "yanjun1129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318511927080003, "text": "去了台灣才知道 走路也會超速", "created_at": "2024-11-13T13:36:39", "owner": "heit0813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939035115804208, "text": "@liang.7u 我們去匈牙利會破產", "created_at": "2024-11-12T19:02:08", "owner": "wei___um", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050029696984510, "text": "去了台灣才知道，殺人可以不用判死刑", "created_at": "2024-11-12T12:53:48", "owner": "qoocaty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025777664441550, "text": "看完全部都是真的\n最後一個是假的", "created_at": "2024-11-12T02:18:23", "owner": "jc_06_07_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898774779999545, "text": "去了中國才知道 煤油糞水混著喝😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T22:57:33", "owner": "eric_hung087", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18014778356398391, "text": "甘有咩甘受不了？😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T22:14:31", "owner": "kar.re.na", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068672566654526, "text": "到了台灣才知道活在台灣已經贏過十四億人", "created_at": "2024-11-11T12:07:46", "owner": "willieweng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945438831903697, "text": "台湾人和中国人之间有自己的racism😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-11T10:04:23", "owner": "lil_jiez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121116181394258, "text": "來了台灣才知道\n加班沒有加班費才是正常的", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:01:55", "owner": "ryan__ly612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125914942385432, "text": "去了中國才知道沒有言論自由 去了中華民國台灣才知道 民主、自由、法治國家❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-11T03:54:33", "owner": "outline__steven", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17925108356977906, "text": "看完我知道，這胎投錯國家了，下輩子我會再努力😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T00:01:21", "owner": "rd_040146", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17962836017821898, "text": "U will know there is bad and good and afterall where u grow up Is the best place", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:57:25", "owner": "kafiya_713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023390507613763, "text": "去了中国才知道原来原来是有诈骗的国家😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:29:34", "owner": "jackliew0829", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18050153686980690, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:05:26", "owner": "yun155320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912756900935076, "text": "最後一句直接收回分享跟讚", "created_at": "2024-11-10T09:07:51", "owner": "rru_1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009905426470791, "text": "去了台灣才知道108課綱有多難搞", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:41:35", "owner": "xuuu_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039468002179794, "text": "去了东大才知道，法律就是笑话", "created_at": "2024-11-10T06:47:16", "owner": "jojo992378703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067830613654149, "text": "所以我可以脫單了嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T06:10:29", "owner": "drfghjhjjnjnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927564726861124, "text": "來了台灣才知道什麼是行人地獄\n什麼是機車比人多", "created_at": "2024-11-10T04:15:50", "owner": "lixuan1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862730500266988, "text": "最後一個簡直可笑", "created_at": "2024-11-10T03:05:15", "owner": "shaun_seow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081700138540468, "text": "看完才知道 在臺灣沒有死刑犯", "created_at": "2024-11-10T00:49:32", "owner": "zhang._.0316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046645892080517, "text": "估计喷中国的很多都没真正在国外生活过吧。很多在国外生活过的人都选择回流。 老外都有句话, the grass is not always greener on the other side.", "created_at": "2024-11-09T23:29:04", "owner": "lexy4451", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043621001118784, "text": "@oscar_shih611 留言😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T19:57:07", "owner": "vj0528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961214415823689, "text": "去了大陸才知道 美食風景都很讚😍", "created_at": "2024-11-09T16:07:27", "owner": "_20508_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010313828476893, "text": "去了彰化才知道七悅雨飲料是真的好喝 @yusheng2918", "created_at": "2024-11-09T10:03:10", "owner": "doob0221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032166113122194, "text": "去了床上才知道夢裡什麼都有...", "created_at": "2024-11-09T08:45:37", "owner": "tsz0409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881829859172645, "text": "去了中國才知道器官可以被活摘", "created_at": "2024-11-09T08:38:54", "owner": "652652bat_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957433944726381, "text": "我去匈牙利的時候，都直接打開水龍頭喝水", "created_at": "2024-11-09T05:00:46", "owner": "williamcc1001", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18017157458338734, "text": "最後一句就算了", "created_at": "2024-11-09T02:50:34", "owner": "eothain1214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047242232314347, "text": "去了中國才知道從小讀書讀習語錄 沒有言論自由 669才能賺上三五千 領到的獎金還會被追討回去 去銀行領錢會被限額 新疆西藏會有集中改造營", "created_at": "2024-11-08T06:09:28", "owner": "foryouchange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207877042290411, "text": "我覺得不能全當真", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:55:53", "owner": "thehere_there", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991699989721434, "text": "單身稅？", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:48:07", "owner": "robsonjong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317872756090170, "text": "台灣比較幸福真的❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:34:19", "owner": "ztr._0405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111435505422659, "text": "最後一句直接回收讚", "created_at": "2024-11-07T08:51:15", "owner": "aji78045", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852634348322033, "text": "這樣也可以吵，兩邊都很幸福呢☺️", "created_at": "2024-11-06T02:32:43", "owner": "yalunxue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467407129011427, "text": "不去中國也知道\n燒肉海鮮都可以是假\n學生坦克可以咁和諧😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T22:21:40", "owner": "nature_romantic_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046028477101737, "text": "@rainnnn.c", "created_at": "2024-11-05T16:07:32", "owner": "nly_1116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027892886178586, "text": "@chauwingleung", "created_at": "2024-11-05T16:07:24", "owner": "nly_1116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049700668817163, "text": "欧洲人看完后说你知道个屁啊你", "created_at": "2024-11-05T15:40:31", "owner": "iqiilosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126374065381396, "text": "知道了又如何？🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:18:10", "owner": "tiffany.wong.328_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884621221148687, "text": "😢去了台湾才知道 真的不是中国的😢", "created_at": "2024-11-04T04:29:38", "owner": "juedaijiansu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848470678337430, "text": "去了中国才知道 杨丞琳的生日是不存在的", "created_at": "2024-11-03T16:24:15", "owner": "ymx_8805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105497044449185, "text": "哪裡苦？🤔自由自在，非常方便，全民健保，老人福利，處處美食，。", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:23:53", "owner": "auditrussadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075739045601069, "text": "高級黑啊！要去巴勒斯坦才覺得中國幸福😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:21:09", "owner": "auditrussadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274384777221275, "text": "去了台灣才知道，什麼都能被詐騙", "created_at": "2024-11-03T04:12:13", "owner": "victhereal66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142557316357846, "text": "纽西兰没蛇？你他妈没去过果园是吧！", "created_at": "2024-11-02T23:33:08", "owner": "georgechong97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374239006104400, "text": "最後那一句明顯在說謊😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T05:32:52", "owner": "0607_vivi.oneday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037990607332157, "text": "去了中國才知道，言論自由的可貴", "created_at": "2024-11-02T00:53:57", "owner": "poagao2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467062384042081, "text": "就冲最后一句，必须取关", "created_at": "2024-11-01T17:37:42", "owner": "yunheyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993342015557721, "text": "生在臺灣才知道，政治官員的臉比水壩牆還要厚", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:06:50", "owner": "fs70101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856803388242923, "text": "為什台灣什麼稅都苛就是不苛單身稅", "created_at": "2024-11-01T03:55:27", "owner": "a129345178", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066575866730213, "text": "去了中國才知道不能玩狼人殺", "created_at": "2024-11-01T02:41:10", "owner": "jazzinthuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019522112556784, "text": "去了台灣才知道什麼叫做美食天堂❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-31T15:24:24", "owner": "daae2502292023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308224924166346, "text": "笑死，最後一個實在太好笑了🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-31T11:54:14", "owner": "kengs_1126", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
