{"media_id": 3476670548203777564, "shortcode": "DA_nXGCv64c", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA_nXGCv64c/", "taken_at": "2024-10-11T18:30:00", "caption": "Claim 750$ CashApp/Paypal in bio 💰\n—\n\nfollow @karmaseall for more!\n\nstory reshares are highly appreciated, thanks 🙏🏼\n\n—\n#animeme #animemes #animememe #animememes #narutomeme #onepiecememe #bleachmeme #narutoreel #onepiecereel #deathnotememes #animeclip #animeclips #animefyp #animesuggestions #explorepage #explore #viral #trending", "owner_username": "karmaseall", "owner_id": "59222217986", "likes": 370830, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0169_DA_nXGCv64c\\DA_nXGCv64c_20241011_183000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18124306801351583, "text": "There’s NOWAY I actually got paid for those surveys in yo bio 😭💸", "created_at": "2024-10-12T16:44:22", "owner": "vamika4real", "likes": 1159}, {"id": 17887459515196296, "text": "they all looked up before speaking", "created_at": "2025-02-03T05:49:20", "owner": "whitejade143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043349102224053, "text": "“I’ve been doing this since I was little.”", "created_at": "2025-01-03T03:40:04", "owner": "jarrahg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053118728296369, "text": "Who’s next 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-02T04:43:04", "owner": "indiestevens8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057542554935352, "text": "\"Is this a new position?\"", "created_at": "2024-12-30T17:02:03", "owner": "theephoenix_sa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010123178679585, "text": "I really want to do this", "created_at": "2024-12-28T13:13:51", "owner": "kyratjee050", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041406233204825, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-26T07:09:07", "owner": "jay01claudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889896889118243, "text": "I always come early", "created_at": "2024-12-23T23:59:25", "owner": "enmc_shelley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060939547862148, "text": "Im amazing at teamwork and collaboration.", "created_at": "2024-12-20T15:07:47", "owner": "incurablehumanist11102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014646482463610, "text": "i been practicing 😍👏", "created_at": "2024-12-18T18:29:22", "owner": "esme_w_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049259852039604, "text": "I’m a team player", "created_at": "2024-12-17T22:50:11", "owner": "ismael7075", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158307145332498, "text": "Can I fill this spot 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-16T00:42:20", "owner": "eel2980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975288813661849, "text": "I think I am more suited for another position.", "created_at": "2024-12-15T09:01:41", "owner": "_chhanda._._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324834820082525, "text": "What’s his acc name??", "created_at": "2024-12-15T05:14:04", "owner": "k_engquist19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979565109789141, "text": "@nikkoortizzz", "created_at": "2024-12-13T08:55:00", "owner": "stahli_joel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046966601282531, "text": "its not even that funny and here he is kekeing like his life depends on it", "created_at": "2024-12-09T19:47:07", "owner": "rb57932", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047390654123780, "text": "Thank you for coming.😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:38:36", "owner": "shie_ngaruiya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962872674827490, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-07T12:13:34", "owner": "neicytime704", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914271733041017, "text": "I take a train everyday", "created_at": "2024-12-06T20:34:46", "owner": "heaven_lebo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042503462232528, "text": "This s so funny, but why the other video has to do with it ? It’s annoying I feel like I’m watching 2 TVs show at once and one is on@mute 🧐🥴", "created_at": "2024-12-05T00:30:54", "owner": "zobodj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024044060297955, "text": "why are they all in the car", "created_at": "2024-12-03T02:55:24", "owner": "berkley.scott.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052900876802131, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-02T12:26:21", "owner": "user786z_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908785068961825, "text": "Sorry for coming late", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:40:22", 