kes": 0}, {"id": 18051023632820746, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T22:00:27", "owner": "tru.shyacht_dawggy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064863673732492, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T21:45:07", "owner": "_ssemajj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021241454625740, "text": "😂 😂 😂 🤫", "created_at": "2024-11-06T21:15:54", "owner": "emesdhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026012093605245, "text": "Knew the funny part, stayed for the food part", "created_at": "2024-11-06T17:52:09", "owner": "ragnagnar", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["animeme", "animemes", "animememe", "animememes", "narutomeme", "onepiecememe", "bleachmeme", "narutoreel", "onepiecereel", "deathnotememes", "animeclip", "animeclips", "animefyp", "animesuggestions", "explorepage", "explore", "viral", "trending"]},
{"media_id": 3478510316763800153, "shortcode": "DBGJrQCPOJZ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBGJrQCPOJZ/", "taken_at": "2024-10-14T07:27:33", "caption": "How Does PWM Work?\n.\n.\n.\n#robonyx #PWM #electronics #robotics #DIYElectronics #arduino #raspberrypi #engineering #maker #circuit #technology #IoT", "owner_username": "officialrobonyx", "owner_id": "56643885450", "likes": 61517, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0170_DBGJrQCPOJZ\\DBGJrQCPOJZ_20241014_072733.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18246714919283214, "text": "she modulate on my width till i pulse", "created_at": "2024-10-14T22:47:31", "owner": "tbonesteak86", "likes": 2477}, {"id": 18085168877067428, "text": "It's colin . We specialize in high-quality PCB and PCBA manufacturing at highly competitive prices, supported by 24/7 service. If you have any needs in this area, feel free to reach out. \nhttps://ucpcba.com\nEmail: colin@ucpcba.com", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:02:51", "owner": "wuxiangao1615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899567047187978, "text": "You man!!\nThank you so much for visualizing this shit!\nIt was on my mind for years and you now approve it to\nme\n❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-04-24T14:19:19", "owner": "abbodoz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042361043355877, "text": "How you make the captions so jumpy?", "created_at": "2025-02-12T01:36:57", "owner": "sousaversen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070003999767488, "text": "Not good for your eyes tho", "created_at": "2025-02-10T08:44:27", "owner": "leo.lan28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045946658222588, "text": "Half the voltage is half the ampere is a quarter the power", "created_at": "2025-02-06T20:32:45", "owner": "nikola_cj07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849276712361971, "text": "Name of the music?", "created_at": "2025-01-31T06:53:46", "owner": "fabriciorv_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990205260777839, "text": "Need one attached to my brain please", "created_at": "2025-01-24T23:17:14", "owner": "adrian_dzikowski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054140305824101, "text": "Does this work work DC voltage?", "created_at": "2024-12-17T18:10:09", "owner": "lil_meshowu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848555563357813, "text": "PCM?", "created_at": "2024-11-30T12:47:50", "owner": "drkadm0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902819412984812, "text": "why is bro so aggressive", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:25:36", "owner": "r4scal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083433439543243, "text": "The music is fucking annoying", "created_at": "2024-11-11T21:07:14", "owner": "laokhaled", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049600171985743, "text": "Wow PWM in electricity is literally the exact same as sound design PWM. That’s actually so cool", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:02:53", "owner": "decypher0music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036407981055438, "text": "I LOVE PWM SYNTHESIS", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:45:03", "owner": "bharat_madho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868721374230593, "text": "Whats the background song lol", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:47:43", "owner": "tech_nical.bear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141562621318509, "text": "Buen video 👏👏,", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:12:31", "owner": "servoelectronica2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061132528774926, "text": "Also PWM is really cool on modular synths", "created_at": "2024-10-30T20:34:18", "owner": "jjcb6669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138276577361173, "text": "This method is undesirable under certain situations, such as when the LED is moving quickly through a person’s field of view.", "created_at": "2024-10-27T13:39:41", "owner": "wasonfireonce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882783283150316, "text": "So is this why LED headlights flash on video? And if that's the case would a standard LED with a regular constant voltage not flash on video?", "created_at": "2024-10-26T02:18:37", "owner": "flatland_yankee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316841053080973, "text": "not to be confused with pulse code modulation", "created_at": "2024-10-23T21:45:36", "owner": "gorpswag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951895107839998, "text": "Unironically loved watching this even though I already knew what PWM is. Bros editing skills are on point 🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-22T10:14:46", "owner": "_h1tec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051634405907306, "text": "So that’s why leds look like that in videos", "created_at": "2024-10-21T19:29:54", "owner": "issa.hossain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051490483822233, "text": "Can you maybe turn the music up and add more sound effects? I'm getting pretty bored while you are explaining", "created_at": "2024-10-21T15:09:42", "owner": "sjo06847", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855486556290329, "text": "Could it work with heating elements to control heat?", "created_at": "2024-10-20T15:47:14", "owner": "884917384._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871378384205642, "text": "Please describe MQ-2 sensor", "created_at": "2024-10-20T03:15:27", "owner": "ehsanhabibpoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053154211737820, "text": "is that why sometimes lights flicker on camera?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T17:54:27", "owner": "si1yu3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920437959979389, "text": "Oh so it \"seems\" like a corresponding lower brightness we would've gotten if it were a linear relation? That's cool", "created_at": "2024-10-19T13:57:15", "owner": "aadikbansal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942530652905335, "text": "Servos receive information via pwm,", "created_at": "2024-10-18T10:53:43", "owner": "car_maniac06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043216991044244, "text": "bro got a little too excited", "created_at": "2024-10-18T07:17:56", "owner": "cristiy2k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066900727577521, "text": "this is how the NES and game boy make music", "created_at": "2024-10-17T22:52:48", "owner": "lean_.mcgee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341766382135157, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2024-10-17T18:17:27", "owner": "ixe109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047556824305481, "text": "Is this the same for dimming screen's brightness? Because that'll explain why sometimes I can see the screen flickering real fast.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:16:26", "owner": "anhhnguyentien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900308823982811, "text": "That’s not exactly true. Pwm exist because microcontrollers don’t have analog outputs. The pwm simulates a analog output when adding a low pass filter", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:03:44", "owner": "bastien.pantin", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18134443222366878, "text": "When I was at a friends house, he explained it to me and as a joke I put my eyes really near a led and said something like \"I can see it pulsing\". Well, I couldn't exactly see it pulsing, just saw a similar but slower pulse when i closed my eyes.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T07:17:32", "owner": "ayosafacundo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025617329436906, "text": "PWM is just edging electronics", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:01:06", "owner": "nichtchras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982663533610934, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-16T08:41:03", "owner": "krossmariee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930008184837857, "text": "And it is bad for your eyes. And all the OLED screens use it.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T07:02:43", "owner": "pivo_s_halvoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18457216873025636, "text": "So is this why sometimes lights or screens seem to flash on camera?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T05:45:11", "owner": "thijs.bonsen", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17851421310299898, "text": "This is so ADHD I love it", "created_at": "2024-10-16T05:27:21", "owner": "tarek.ammar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999429786689325, "text": "How can I do it with no chip?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T03:26:59", "owner": "borja.aresti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898597780065374, "text": "So this is why theres almost a flicker on dim lights", "created_at": "2024-10-16T03:19:46", "owner": "mcgehee_connor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354509944140765, "text": "Could you do a video on midi ?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T00:54:42", "owner": "rachunamatata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059248591653674, "text": "song used?", "created_at": "2024-10-15T22:22:37", "owner": "_jacardeno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075087958511704, "text": "APHEX TWIN PULSEWIDTH MENTIONED", "created_at": "2024-10-15T20:22:15", "owner": "levscio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919890657892306, "text": "APHEX TWIN MENTIONED", "created_at": "2024-10-15T20:21:35", "owner": "levscio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884538289112296, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-15T20:21:29", "owner": "levscio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001619477675734, "text": "I have no idea what the fuck you are saying but I'm vibing so idc", "created_at": "2024-10-15T14:54:41", "owner": "aedangill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052008670906497, "text": "So I can make the led sync up with any song playing, even with different BPM? Pretty cool ngl", "created_at": "2024-10-15T13:57:20", "owner": "zidriz07id", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033637706057449, "text": "is this the duty?", "created_at": "2024-10-15T13:57:13", "owner": "ultra.slow.92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909424554940202, "text": "that said, dont use pwm for LED lighting", "created_at": "2024-10-15T12:34:44", "owner": "_apsv", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18060336877702316, "text": "Much understand IG reels better than what is explained in the classes", "created_at": "2024-10-15T12:33:35", "owner": "sbstndanny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017417447541524, "text": "ikuyo kita song!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-15T09:50:09", "owner": "iisaksham", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18064908043589099, "text": "Literally 4th & 5th semester power electronics", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:09:49", "owner": "physicist121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043799350893541, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🗣️", "created_at": "2024-10-15T04:07:10", "owner": "carlos_sr72783", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18257186152268722, "text": "Oh so thats what in My pc fan mkay", "created_at": "2024-10-15T02:34:18", "owner": "yfwai0079", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068583940620143, "text": "I love the acronym because it is the same in German with the same words and meaning Puls Weiten modulation", "created_at": "2024-10-15T00:23:52", "owner": "quentin.briel", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18458387575003538, "text": "Fun fact this is how our nerves work", "created_at": "2024-10-14T23:19:08", "owner": "henryalexios", "likes": 760}, {"id": 18051547120745319, "text": "Yeah but it makes shit look funky in videos so its stinky", "created_at": "2024-10-14T21:55:50", "owner": "outsider.ae86", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18101540812452057, "text": "V", "created_at": "2024-10-14T21:10:27", "owner": "ali._.roohbakhsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045962273070890, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-14T17:41:05", "owner": "burger_bacon_barbecue", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17846063427325069, "text": "Why ? Why u came to me after my exam 😢", "created_at": "2024-10-14T16:27:51", "owner": "rae.7417", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18375381211096911, "text": "That's clapping at the end😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T16:27:10", "owner": "_akcore", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18036686570268769, "text": "Chill out bro🔥💀", "created_at": "2024-10-14T15:40:31", "owner": "arastugraatay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302569873207722, "text": "Tks!", "created_at": "2024-10-14T14:41:37", "owner": "absurdomudo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360309688138110, "text": "Saying pwm is pulses does “explain” it, differentiating between frequency, duty cycle, etc. axtually does.", "created_at": "2024-10-14T14:07:15", "owner": "ben.jackvony_72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050797618767169, "text": "PMW IS GOAT 🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-14T13:38:26", "owner": "iamhadiyansyah", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18039370292176446, "text": "The video is so exiting 😀👏🏻 and useful but information transfering is a little high. Thanks", "created_at": "2024-10-14T12:29:04", "owner": "sadra_1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079951738531375, "text": "You mean you alter the frequency right?", "created_at": "2024-10-14T11:20:00", "owner": "arens.mj", "likes": 225}, {"id": 17913824598006399, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-14T10:31:11", "owner": "r44gh4v", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18114783034408966, "text": "The clap on point 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-14T08:31:24", "owner": "lord_zephyr", "likes": 82}, {"id": 17921223863882079, "text": "Another banger from Robonyx", "created_at": "2024-10-14T08:11:10", "owner": "addryjauhar", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18323739139153719, "text": "Goated", "created_at": "2024-10-14T08:05:50", "owner": "mz_u0", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18082295107469720, "text": "Isn't this technically duty cycle? If I'm not wrong PWM is used to send data.", "created_at": "2024-10-14T07:43:21", "owner": "f._.ethsu", "likes": 461}, {"id": 17849434848316050, "text": "Grate", "created_at": "2024-10-14T07:42:27", "owner": "dr_ahmad_shaker_hosseini", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18063462577747956, "text": "PULSEWIDTH⁉️⁉️APHEX TWIN MENTIONED‼️‼️‼️‼️7\\7\\7\\7\\7\\7\\7\\7\\", "created_at": "2024-11-30T01:22:07", "owner": "er.npriv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044360099099011, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:01:48", "owner": "eastonlafay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059355865805878, "text": "This is probably some insane news for people who know stuff like this, whether or not, happy for you or I’m sorry that happened", "created_at": "2024-10-15T19:26:22", "owner": "eli_lost_account", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945031842857576, "text": "Then, some stupid engineer decides to use such a slow pwm that you can notice it and you are f*cked", "created_at": "2024-10-15T11:48:40", "owner": "arnaumb16", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["robonyx", "pwm", "electronics", "robotics", "diyelectronics", "arduino", "raspberrypi", "engineering", "maker", "circuit", "technology", "iot"]},
{"media_id": 3471888517314471096, "shortcode": "DAuoDYuSWS4", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAuoDYuSWS4/", "taken_at": "2024-10-05T04:10:25", "caption": "人一旦看了# 塔木德 ，财富就像开了上帝视角！ #热点 #富人思维 #穷人思维 #思维格局 #创业 #必看 #圈子 #圈层 #赚钱 #个人成长 #强者思维", "owner_username": "stephen_choo.dy", "owner_id": "66549818672", "likes": 14472, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0171_DAuoDYuSWS4\\DAuoDYuSWS4_20241005_041025.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17886632364216100, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-03-04T00:04:02", "owner": "ziyu0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18262705327272636, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-03-04T00:02:04", "owner": "ziyu0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871174627297359, "text": "赚法律写着里的钱", "created_at": "2025-02-23T12:16:12", "owner": "dai_4304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876923077166104, "text": "除非每個人都把愛心傘帶回家，不然蠻虧的", "created_at": "2025-02-06T05:11:20", "owner": "yangmien296damien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890415601169281, "text": "赚纳税人和垄断的钱，权利的钱😂", "created_at": "2025-01-30T09:22:59", "owner": "gg1141552900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035832194580138, "text": "無店鋪創業就可以有效解決成本的問題了🙏", "created_at": "2025-01-29T18:25:51", "owner": "h.c.y.722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052991051041736, "text": "我看懂了，你這支影片就正想賺我們窮人想變富的錢，我不會讓你得逞的，反手就是一個“不喜歡”", "created_at": "2025-01-09T05:46:22", "owner": "brian_hsu_2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013973600659685, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-25T00:27:21", "owner": "niuming91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076261201527522, "text": "黄赌毒饿钱", "created_at": "2024-12-17T12:40:31", "owner": "h.tomorrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039351785257727, "text": "你要是真的懂赚钱，就不用做这种垃圾视频啦😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T03:05:54", "owner": "williezenjiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043247122980527, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-12-07T12:16:02", "owner": "davy.chiu.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025370177285781, "text": "覺得是廢話", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:29:54", "owner": "z753951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924026313994792, "text": "用AI賺所有人的錢！塔屎木！", "created_at": "2024-12-01T00:47:59", "owner": "tacticst_111115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019913588335435, "text": "背景音樂太大聲，失焦了", "created_at": "2024-11-24T02:32:07", "owner": "tintin.chen.735", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469251499018742, "text": "台灣也有人做阿！結果還傘率高達9成", "created_at": "2024-11-19T04:03:40", "owner": "hushixing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062426239696842, "text": "共享？你買了，然後放外面也被別人共享，然後換你享，換他享，整個城市都在循環那3萬把", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:40:30", "owner": "mr.hsueh5566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098040025481806, "text": "谁信就是帮你赚钱的x B", "created_at": "2024-11-16T08:51:28", "owner": "en0ch_eno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052114594941370, "text": "背景音樂吵死", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:45:24", "owner": "logan79215", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18009334088657388, "text": "不用看了 真的想賺錢 實現財富自由 在下面留言 我可以幫你們 (謹限港澳台內地)", "created_at": "2024-11-10T19:26:02", "owner": "__valourksa.wicca.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842469646354712, "text": "或者你可以给社会提供价值，转束紧生产力发展的钱", "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:09:15", "owner": "shan_legstrong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949746165756301, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-01T01:56:14", "owner": "lzg86519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943100520869120, "text": "高利潤生意隨之而來的負面問題是什麼？", "created_at": "2024-10-30T10:27:40", "owner": "tobby10011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036001127264695, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-10-23T12:46:59", "owner": "mingren795", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845305645321120, "text": "台灣測試過共享雨傘，90%的雨傘隔天到期前就換了，10%當天就換了。共享雨傘公司完全沒賺", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:54:57", "owner": "taikerchao", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17896869687076287, "text": "前面說的根本是詐騙吧", "created_at": "2024-10-13T08:27:58", "owner": "_xuyc7z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983802609732378, "text": "你知道這個共享雨傘的老闆自己記者會出來說他虧爆了嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-13T08:07:05", "owner": "_aj.91x75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048939202810691, "text": "已經被壟斷了...", "created_at": "2024-10-13T02:59:56", "owner": "smalllin666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025051718178522, "text": "發財秘笈？", "created_at": "2024-10-12T08:07:20", "owner": "chen.jhen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999046107678597, "text": "講的很深奧，但其實都是廢話", "created_at": "2024-10-12T05:50:40", "owner": "mrjohn0921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330930358151763, "text": "什麼歌", "created_at": "2024-10-12T04:03:22", "owner": "xia.ng0402", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047848186826260, "text": "我覺得淘寶，麥當勞都挺賺錢的", "created_at": "2024-10-12T03:03:08", "owner": "blitzabc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079455337540223, "text": "如果大家都還傘呢", "created_at": "2024-10-12T02:42:20", "owner": "belove811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918790267003379, "text": "我有個朋友就是上次放這種一半的影片，被人砍了四十多刀，刀刀避過要害，去醫院缝了三百多針，針針避開刀口，最後還是走了，走的時候很安祥，火化的時候還一直喊著我沒死，最後用鐵鏈子綁著才燒完。火燒得嘎吱嘎吱響，燒了三天三夜，最後打開焚屍爐還發現黏鍋了，用鍬才鏟下来，可是家屬們都很堅强，一個都沒哭，還有的甚至笑出了聲。那天風很大，運骨灰的路上翻了車，骨灰撒了一地，還被風吹跑一大半！剛要把剩下的骨灰渣子拎起來，迎面開來一輛灑水車，唱著今天是個好日子過去了。後來，聽别人說他的墳頭遭了雷劈，現在還在冒青煙呢！", "created_at": "2024-10-12T01:47:25", "owner": "helikopter_fish", "likes": 83}, {"id": 18456357997065398, "text": "😂可以去柬埔寨開個KK園就做大又賺錢了，什麼人性都見得到", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:41:33", "owner": "seas888", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18105508978438731, "text": "😂😂😂廢話真多", "created_at": "2024-10-11T10:15:35", "owner": "im_felixthecat", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18059039569775588, "text": "跟他媽Talmud有屁個關係。", "created_at": "2024-10-10T17:52:42", "owner": "terry.c.a.mcwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043785938016588, "text": "結果我只有看那個動畫完全沒在聽😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T11:49:17", "owner": "chiauliang", "likes": 175}, {"id": 17883239805140042, "text": "只會吹騙，妳賺大錢了嗎！", "created_at": "2024-10-10T06:50:55", "owner": "tacticst_111115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028379948120158, "text": "好核突呀d面條", "created_at": "2024-10-10T02:22:25", "owner": "183u_u", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018748130291345, "text": "數據顯示大部分的人隔天就立刻還傘了，實際上傘也不是按小時計價，是按天，瞎掰也要靠譜一點好嗎🙄", "created_at": "2024-10-08T16:41:35", "owner": "hsincheng.chen", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18181835305307274, "text": "賺愛裝逼的錢👏🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-08T11:40:13", "owner": "wlm_ryv", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18090172618491928, "text": "诈骗😂", "created_at": "2024-10-08T00:30:44", "owner": "iceburg1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035183075236753, "text": "賺想發財的錢=詐騙", "created_at": "2024-10-07T15:57:04", "owner": "zhan.mingsong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892989496087125, "text": "不還的那半小時押金呢？", "created_at": "2024-10-07T01:10:40", "owner": "patrick08242.0", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17854411176240531, "text": "你以为现在老百姓都傻吗 还像前几年一样 那么好骗吗  薄利多销 才是真正的长久之计", "created_at": "2024-10-06T13:35:52", "owner": "ruoxinyu", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18008286587446503, "text": "忘記共享單車後遺症？", "created_at": "2024-10-06T10:37:59", "owner": "excenmille09", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18066838207717592, "text": "某地區？什麼地區？", "created_at": "2024-10-06T06:06:31", "owner": "pftsonic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18050448910917316, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-06T05:06:16", "owner": "sokk86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074992687709208, "text": "黑心钱。", "created_at": "2025-02-25T19:41:31", "owner": "nepahwin_fang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030623720396329, "text": "說的就是詐騙", "created_at": "2024-12-24T16:55:00", "owner": "josephc552024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148916092340909, "text": "做詐騙最好賺", "created_at": "2024-11-04T03:08:19", "owner": "nnnike21508", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17937487625808979, "text": "詐騙集團", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:33:27", "owner": "yuanyuan947", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037243193180340, "text": "男人好色的錢？", "created_at": "2024-10-13T05:54:33", "owner": "yu_qian_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092938249471250, "text": "在台灣到詐騙才賺", "created_at": "2024-10-12T05:13:29", "owner": "elden_woll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066747010571443, "text": "支那文案，医疗教育基建可都党的生意", "created_at": "2024-10-11T09:06:51", "owner": "xijinping8964tank_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855294517278571, "text": "台词弄错了吧，不是赚，是骗。骗小孩成长的钱，骗男人好色的钱，骗女人爱美的钱，骗老年人爱健康的钱", "created_at": "2024-10-10T12:53:03", "owner": "congzhengzou", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17904959421028458, "text": "難怪⋯詐騙多⋯貪婪的人性。也難怪⋯現在很多人複製這方式賺錢～說是共享⋯", "created_at": "2024-10-06T17:30:12", "owner": "lydia235darry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043095536507397, "text": "男人好色的錢。違法吧", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:23:15", "owner": "ian_ho82", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["热点", "富人思维", "穷人思维", "思维格局", "创业", "必看", "圈子", "圈层", "赚钱", "个人成长", "强者思维"]},
{"media_id": 3461126131563160888, "shortcode": "DAIY-D6pOU4", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAIY-D6pOU4/", "taken_at": "2024-09-20T07:48:44", "caption": "甜蜜蜜的果汁，和甜甜的愛情\n#搞笑 #好笑 #笑死 #笑顏 #笑 #每日 #分享", "owner_username": "rica.tw1997", "owner_id": "62749607445", "likes": 15626, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0172_DAIY-D6pOU4\\DAIY-D6pOU4_20240920_074844.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18356136346133001", "text": "還噴到鏡頭", "created_at": "2025-01-19T00:41:41", "owner": "_govaaa_", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18048794171006096", "text": "第一個真的很剛好", "created_at": "2024-11-18T08:52:30", "owner": "liljibabe", "likes": 72}, {"id": "17926931483973733", "text": "這兩個人喝的果汁跟水剛好成正比 融合一下兩人的果汁剛好是50%水跟50%的果汁", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:45:28", "owner": "lin._.1001213", "likes": 404}, {"id": "18062663092743973", "text": "求原作者的ig", "created_at": "2024-11-12T11:03:49", "owner": "8._21._9", "likes": 69}, {"id": "18323838103154765", "text": "打線上麻將🀄️找我找我💗\n可以看我ig 精選有介紹唷\n自摸還有送禮金 禮金無限領！\n全台上線中！", "created_at": "2024-11-05T11:59:00", "owner": "rica.tw1997", "likes": 16}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["搞笑", "好笑", "笑死", "笑顏", "笑", "每日", "分享"]},
{"media_id": 3477324760361263565, "shortcode": "DBB8HImAOHN", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBB8HImAOHN/", "taken_at": "2024-10-12T16:19:51", "caption": "自制國際笑話🤡中國國慶期間，中國遊客在沙特利雅德國際機場，因航班延誤時間過久，而且沒有獲得機場解釋，因此在機場內抗議 。遊客本想表達他們要回國，結果大喊「Go Back to China」，意思是「滾回中國」 。現場外籍人士十分震驚。\n#gobacktochina", "owner_username": "a9anda_hk", "owner_id": "15053186430", "likes": 2711, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0173_DBB8HImAOHN\\DBB8HImAOHN_20241012_161951.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17975833295812165, "text": "", "created_at": "2026-01-04T12:15:57", "owner": "gcxavier0509", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911524681257017, "text": "沙特阿拉伯有运动爱好者，看我主页", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:58:54", "owner": "az9552636", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876106885311888, "text": "我想他们是想说我们要回国", "created_at": "2025-04-09T09:54:59", "owner": "feng_lan37", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18339228127144802, "text": "啥意思", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:51:27", "owner": "h.anei3020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155526889332033, "text": "長知識！！我終於明：‘我發起惡上黎連自己都驚。’係點解啦🙈", "created_at": "2024-11-25T02:29:18", "owner": "b_for_bitba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070580485630428, "text": "成班人大叫滾回中國，外國人真的嚇一嚇", "created_at": "2024-11-22T16:41:55", "owner": "isweets317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085362463523750, "text": "🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸🐸", "created_at": "2024-11-06T21:17:14", "owner": "8kspain", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987897510719913, "text": "点进来我寻思老外骂我呢，和着被自己人骂了😢😢", "created_at": "2024-10-17T00:15:02", "owner": "jun1154968325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055177507868205, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-10-16T12:47:43", "owner": "sisisallys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072163294590186, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-16T12:35:07", "owner": "kj.1211a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028745519126160, "text": "😂Go back to china", "created_at": "2024-10-16T09:58:07", "owner": "j_as_simple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034328999193488, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-16T09:26:34", "owner": "simpsonchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247143343284964, "text": "Go back to China 🤪", "created_at": "2024-10-16T07:02:54", "owner": "icccicicicccicicccicic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988185174581712, "text": "去吧😆", "created_at": "2024-10-16T03:16:56", "owner": "easonchang1116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043310498027422, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:52:58", "owner": "dennipan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970971456790947, "text": "如果當時我在場，一定會加入，還要叫得比他們大聲🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:03:41", "owner": "ga062780", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139771213358587, "text": "但是人家沙特也听懂了啊， 这跟 go back to my home 的意思一个样，只不过 go back to x 国家，我们听习惯了，就以为是滚回中国😂，我刚看这个视频的时候 我也懵逼了😂", "created_at": "2024-10-15T19:06:08", "owner": "jxiiiii0.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019967225284800, "text": "這影片中國人沒翻牆可能也看不到。", "created_at": "2024-10-15T19:05:30", "owner": "amyy7997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047205937971111, "text": "🤭", "created_at": "2024-10-15T11:56:10", "owner": "henry5206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909847530940425, "text": "一群人出糗好過一個人出糗，但是整個國家出糗那是真糗", "created_at": "2024-10-15T06:56:35", "owner": "big_0514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866190037162878, "text": "They thought they ate", "created_at": "2024-10-14T22:02:24", "owner": "annoying_fat_monster_pri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010537061425390, "text": "失禮", "created_at": "2024-10-14T20:02:12", "owner": "lewischuhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116289763403886, "text": "國際笑話了", "created_at": "2024-10-14T18:16:19", "owner": "fanfunny5978", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18040687961159566, "text": "🔥 英文唔好就講 go china 好過啦 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T17:13:53", "owner": "airspace_2019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983443560738574, "text": "带头的包是间谍哈 直接赶出去😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T16:13:37", "owner": "0303eva_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17843323122329285, "text": "反中國？", "created_at": "2024-10-14T09:06:33", "owner": "howardtsenggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884819734104920, "text": "人家正要balik cina不果就潑大冷，回一句\"balik cina\"也剛好而已", "created_at": "2024-10-14T06:43:19", "owner": "dhanhung0905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456304948032111, "text": "🫥", "created_at": "2024-10-14T06:01:42", "owner": "xegx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020053688563641, "text": "This is so embarrassing to other Chinese 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T00:33:53", "owner": "may98109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863111647183593, "text": "還在想這哪國人這麽赤裸裸地歧視", "created_at": "2024-10-13T22:20:03", "owner": "cbchen0328", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18143189314350521, "text": "A bit confused, they are mostly chinese there right, those chanting. So are they trying to protest so they get help to go back or shouting on what issue?", "created_at": "2024-10-13T19:41:05", "owner": "celestiarzone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115646527405502, "text": "Let us go back to China😢", "created_at": "2024-10-13T18:42:56", "owner": "ueing_yamaguchi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851933719261707, "text": "有進步，講英文，文明一大步！", "created_at": "2024-10-13T18:22:37", "owner": "mister_m610", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18150840856332234, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T17:08:40", "owner": "mi1kyb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918515394993904, "text": "外國人：這群人狠起來連自己都罵😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T15:03:12", "owner": "neorex622", "likes": 142}, {"id": 18054964900889832, "text": "😂😂😂又丟臉一次了", "created_at": "2024-10-13T13:55:57", "owner": "wei_o6.l4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046508869956934, "text": "起機英文係handjob😮", "created_at": "2024-10-13T12:48:29", "owner": "cwai_channn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920379573889502, "text": "屈阿粥", "created_at": "2024-10-13T10:55:18", "owner": "kkl_justin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931425228828405, "text": "結果中國大使館的人把他們全都關了", "created_at": "2024-10-13T08:52:07", "owner": "kitzkwok", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18045887230974543, "text": "丟臉", "created_at": "2024-10-13T08:27:13", "owner": "valorhsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959627652704227, "text": "“我要回中国”用英语怎么说？？", "created_at": "2024-10-13T06:03:38", "owner": "b3kissgod", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17847880542319304, "text": "有冇人可以話俾我聽佢哋到底jm9", "created_at": "2024-10-13T05:12:18", "owner": "copy.lo", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18084837712512487, "text": "...........到底是誰帶頭叫起來的😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T04:44:20", "owner": "f_rank.ng", "likes": 76}, {"id": 17942331605874056, "text": "中文點解寫\"Roll back to China\"?", "created_at": "2024-10-13T03:31:06", "owner": "timothylau_1979", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18090345754492452, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T03:19:42", "owner": "sammy1407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035330300221291, "text": "jm9", "created_at": "2024-10-13T02:56:40", "owner": "kitdesu6920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079588036529696, "text": "啱呀🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-13T02:11:12", "owner": "your_lil_frd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036083144272909, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-12T23:57:12", "owner": "cn_477365_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977095719774751, "text": "?", "created_at": "2024-10-12T23:31:23", "owner": "soso_johnny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866205919234886, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-12T23:25:57", "owner": "woodstock008hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343558882131220, "text": "😮What happen?", "created_at": "2024-10-12T22:44:39", "owner": "kingsleykeung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021269441570038, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2024-10-12T18:17:12", "owner": "princess_in_dream", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895531342081300, "text": "又會叫自己滾返中國都有😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-12T18:01:25", "owner": "eric_chan_once_", "likes": 316}, {"id": 18012272231373178, "text": "Chinese😂", "created_at": "2024-10-12T17:45:49", "owner": "thomas_12122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901973584073899, "text": "这种人老老实实撸两发得了到处丢人显眼", "created_at": "2024-11-25T01:39:13", "owner": "shadowcrestonline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337993792182165, "text": "Go back to 支那！", "created_at": "2024-11-22T11:34:47", "owner": "yiufaiyick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047835568871560, "text": "白鳩痴！細路仔扭計買玩具咩？", "created_at": "2024-11-22T11:33:44", "owner": "yiufaiyick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938763969800776, "text": "无知的中国人 笑死我了", "created_at": "2024-11-11T19:14:23", "owner": "berlin11725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058846273831599, "text": "哪个脑瘫开始喊的，我看了都觉得丢人", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:22:24", "owner": "jianwujinglin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019735931557030, "text": "哈哈哈哈，真的蠢到笑欸😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T18:08:28", "owner": "hanwenpan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045782543012420, "text": "哈哈哈，第一次看到有人自己骂自己滚回自己的国家的，无知的可怕", "created_at": "2024-11-01T02:31:41", "owner": "michelleyokeinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890228407103747, "text": "滾回中國吧", "created_at": "2024-10-31T03:40:10", "owner": "sy2es6210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859040755266167, "text": "哈哈哈低能兒一群，叫你們大陸人好好讀書不讀書", "created_at": "2024-10-17T17:51:34", "owner": "felix_0718_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041320004117207, "text": "这群文盲怎么出国的？", "created_at": "2024-10-16T13:48:58", "owner": "dela_soul0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047482210985304, "text": "河馬親戚", "created_at": "2024-10-16T05:20:33", "owner": "ohashiatsushi1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077651284555703, "text": "So stupid and embarrassing 🙈", "created_at": "2024-10-15T21:27:38", "owner": "ocean__lily______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844731874335405, "text": "滾回中國去！", "created_at": "2024-10-15T19:11:54", "owner": "markmak008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059973904691583, "text": "真係柒到唔敢睇😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-14T19:58:47", "owner": "mak08272012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023557397580757, "text": "不懂英文的真的很恐怖 本來意思是說要回中國 結果英文說成滾回中國 哈哈 中國人他媽的丟臉", "created_at": "2024-10-14T16:14:22", "owner": "smile.w.maji", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17873707455189933, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-14T15:45:13", "owner": "cshcsh0510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091989760490185, "text": "唔好再柒d，成班文盲", "created_at": "2024-10-13T09:56:29", "owner": "tedchar23", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18202787101295742, "text": "沒文化沒學識丟臉到盡，不要說別人歧視你們😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T08:53:27", "owner": "ching0130", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17850696840301514, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-13T04:02:22", "owner": "ssm1216_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866054473164213, "text": "這就是中國 中國一直跟其他國家關係惡劣 因為他垃圾😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T03:42:12", "owner": "nika.gea_r05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317320393088134, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-13T01:07:27", "owner": "sytim7368", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18046421234306113, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂智商低耶", "created_at": "2024-10-13T00:53:06", "owner": "gminguncle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051071653908314, "text": "😂😂😂SL4", "created_at": "2024-10-12T18:45:58", "owner": "____8ighter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935253105806204, "text": "siu4 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-12T17:27:13", "owner": "imjustacrybabe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18367553779104035, "text": "Sldpk😹", "created_at": "2024-10-12T17:02:31", "owner": "pasuleung910", "likes": 59}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["gobacktochina"]},
{"media_id": 3475838206732158522, "shortcode": "DA8qG7pAEY6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA8qG7pAEY6/", "taken_at": "2024-10-10T14:57:50", "caption": "Angels, this one’s for you! 🌸🩷🪽\n\nTo celebrate the @VictoriasSecret Fashion Show returning to NYC on October 15, limited-edition MetroCards featuring the brand’s signature pink and white stripes are now available (while supplies last)! #VSFashionShow \n\nThey are in select MetroCard vending machines at the following stations:\n\n42 St-Bryant Park (B/D/F/M)\n34 St-Penn Station (1/2/3)\nAtlantic Av-Barclays Center (B/D/N/R/Q/2/3/4/5)\nQueensboro Plaza (N/W/7)\nFordham Road (B/D)\n\nBy the way, this is the first of the last three custom MetroCards to be issued 👀", "owner_username": "mta", "owner_id": "763453554", "likes": 30930, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0174_DA8qG7pAEY6\\DA8qG7pAEY6_20241010_145750.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18088823326493544, "text": "You know we sprinted to secure ours 💕🪽", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:19:47", "owner": "victoriassecret", "likes": 1576}, {"id": 17911223609973797, "text": "ahhhh i need one!! 😍", "created_at": "2025-01-19T02:42:35", "owner": "raysa_explore_nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911881324051805, "text": "Send metrocards to me in Philly please", "created_at": "2024-12-31T07:57:52", "owner": "01.0111.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098247589474728, "text": "Are these still available?! 😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-22T23:59:32", "owner": "shinyclefairy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280285456245699, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-06T01:13:52", "owner": "fernisasanchez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045932057100424, "text": "Just saw this ad … is this still available before I made a trip to NYC to look for it", "created_at": "2024-11-03T13:53:30", "owner": "dorothy_chan_us", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055376761729037, "text": "I was a little surprise to receive this from the machine tbh", "created_at": "2024-11-01T05:55:39", "owner": "grovebud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040193474131563, "text": "Is Rome?", "created_at": "2024-10-31T12:10:31", "owner": "lorenzo.rusciano2024.it", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049989430795652, "text": "I got mine. I can’t believe this is one of the last few limited edition ones", "created_at": "2024-10-27T22:54:39", "owner": "nieceyviews_nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283733314235537, "text": "I need to design a release for a company before the last release! Do I need to bring the company too? Just let me know, I’ll get it done! ✅", "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:10:54", "owner": "twa.cafe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059787469694395, "text": "Keith Harring @ MTA next", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:19:17", "owner": "sherineboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060224740694049, "text": "So commercial hoping for art", "created_at": "2024-10-19T04:49:37", "owner": "zui_nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339812476120202, "text": "Me want one tooo", "created_at": "2024-10-18T05:40:32", "owner": "yueiiiiiiiiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052010626899246, "text": "Can we get something actually useful instead? Like more local #1 trains for example?!", "created_at": "2024-10-17T17:05:01", "owner": "alisonbelkis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068721415614258, "text": "Where's the fent card for all the FENT HEADS at west 4", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:07:59", "owner": "xironically", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978994695771142, "text": "Got it💗 but had to pay $6.50💦", "created_at": "2024-10-15T21:36:32", "owner": "asukaandasca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862989379248985, "text": "Got mine 😍🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-15T16:11:35", "owner": "purple_bombshell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029521403366279, "text": "@mta, you mentioned my name👏.", "created_at": "2024-10-15T12:28:21", "owner": "angelgrant135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934498668812553, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-14T19:22:32", "owner": "skee.dou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022899716240887, "text": "There is no machine selling those ATM any more most are OMNY machines unless you want a single ride.", "created_at": "2024-10-14T18:15:32", "owner": "neribz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881205646148569, "text": "Keep it", "created_at": "2024-10-14T14:38:51", "owner": "yourcassket", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100896859455913, "text": "Delays all day? You guys are forever like the worst part of the NYC experience, whether it's tourism or people who live here. And on top of that y'all are conspiring with the NYPD to take our money.", "created_at": "2024-10-14T00:23:31", "owner": "cholaspears", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050404792767035, "text": "I wasn’t invited to the show 😢", "created_at": "2024-10-13T23:08:09", "owner": "rosa_notso_nice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354432259141820, "text": "ill just fare evade ig", "created_at": "2024-10-13T19:56:52", "owner": "bluegito__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992422203547928, "text": "Which train line have that ?", "created_at": "2024-10-13T16:00:20", "owner": "jaso.n_892", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946195482761685, "text": "Wow! Great idea!!", "created_at": "2024-10-13T02:13:32", "owner": "kcbpix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036432782264579, "text": "We got Victorias secret themed metro cards before GTA6😢", "created_at": "2024-10-13T00:12:08", "owner": "alexfelberbaum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893126044086875, "text": "This is so cute @victoriassecret 💝✨", "created_at": "2024-10-12T23:49:58", "owner": "_sana__j_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928474545844203, "text": "i want😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-12T21:58:21", "owner": "thebipolarfem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013205171350537, "text": "No!", "created_at": "2024-10-12T21:43:55", "owner": "8bbf3f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991075269706632, "text": "Ain't no way", "created_at": "2024-10-12T20:58:10", "owner": "heart_da_haylo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956429337717742, "text": "it’s the way nobody cares…", "created_at": "2024-10-12T20:26:56", "owner": "darkblu3hearts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038456168170262, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-10-12T19:49:15", "owner": "ivanna010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995724834526588, "text": "@victoriassecret donde las consigo cual estación? Wheare station haved??", "created_at": "2024-10-12T13:09:01", "owner": "janet22janet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051167572743699, "text": "How to get it?", "created_at": "2024-10-12T12:29:42", "owner": "yoncelyxis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967966809802188, "text": "🩷🪽", "created_at": "2024-10-12T11:59:26", "owner": "jesenialuzespinal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022264493443236, "text": "How about you make sure your machines HAVE CHANGE 💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2024-10-12T11:49:12", "owner": "shivers.and.butterflies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949522548850573, "text": "Awesome a pink card - could we just get the G working correctly?", "created_at": "2024-10-12T11:34:39", "owner": "gauchecowboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926564694959364, "text": "You know these aren’t subway tokens right", "created_at": "2024-10-12T10:15:31", "owner": "rubymanolos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044108896866850, "text": "How do I get one ? I want one", "created_at": "2024-10-12T00:51:21", "owner": "1nvaid_username", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040949189120563, "text": "Honey you could decorate as many times as you want we’re still@not paying for it", "created_at": "2024-10-11T23:46:26", "owner": "reallifewithjaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932615622935944, "text": "3rd ave 149th clean yet??", "created_at": "2024-10-11T23:35:21", "owner": "majin_barbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074758078573323, "text": "So how much did they pay for this", "created_at": "2024-10-11T22:06:29", "owner": "passingwhimsies", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18049086532781303, "text": "😮😮❤️ What? I need this", "created_at": "2024-10-11T21:34:21", "owner": "manhattan_pretty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18140502082359209, "text": "I watched someone piss on the subway seat and look at me dead in the eyes while doing it.", "created_at": "2024-10-11T20:46:44", "owner": "shescreamsinviolet", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18315301972087522, "text": "Just got em", "created_at": "2024-10-11T20:34:56", "owner": "deadchyno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18345289405192856, "text": "The Jeffery epstien special", "created_at": "2024-10-11T20:25:54", "owner": "sushimeat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034469168033159, "text": "How about decreasing the fair ?", "created_at": "2024-10-11T19:12:47", "owner": "bellasdivacup_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073196221584549, "text": "I still have the ice spice one😂", "created_at": "2024-10-11T18:53:29", "owner": "bxbbyb1tch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992549784539285, "text": "Oh cool, a limited-edition misogyny MTA card🙄", "created_at": "2024-10-11T18:47:55", "owner": "thepolitenewyorker", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18354520738187338, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-11T17:52:46", "owner": "yellowbird.pt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984439320738980, "text": "Can you finish the track maintenance that’s been happening for the past 6 months", "created_at": "2024-10-11T17:42:34", "owner": "elijah.melia", "likes": 242}, {"id": 18355042291143761, "text": "I'm confused, is it from now, until 10/15, or 10/15 only?", "created_at": "2024-10-11T17:06:49", "owner": "ayamesakurai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016386236328772, "text": "I use to work there. I don’t want this 😂 I want to forget that terrible place", "created_at": "2024-10-11T13:58:45", "owner": "cookies_ncreamed", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18115897384404036, "text": "What station is it at ?", "created_at": "2024-10-11T13:42:55", "owner": "enlightened_madness", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942297609880544, "text": "I hate yall", "created_at": "2024-10-11T13:38:27", "owner": "tailz__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074495947515163, "text": "MTA! READ THE ROOM! We just want to get to work on time!! We don’t GAF about anything else!", "created_at": "2024-10-11T12:38:41", "owner": "c.3st_moi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17874343323188478, "text": "Unless I’m getting a discount. I do not care.", "created_at": "2024-10-11T10:59:07", "owner": "leelaoconnor", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18361625425113295, "text": "Why don’t just start releasing limited edition OMNY card. I know you have it for public school students 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-11T10:21:52", "owner": "kvnmau", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18007920215647927, "text": "I got mines!!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-11T05:58:16", "owner": "gxddessxkylie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046830178951460, "text": "You know what would be cuter than this? building the missing platforms on those 7 train stops that are under “improvement”😍", "created_at": "2024-10-11T02:40:52", "owner": "somber_rainn", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18029903837097216, "text": "All the cool metrocards, only for them to get rid of metrocards", "created_at": "2024-10-11T02:30:15", "owner": "whoisjohngentile", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059247220765363, "text": "So is Wendy’s next for the rest of us? 🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-11T02:20:36", "owner": "ojalathreads", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030813755094571, "text": "Mta get your priorities straight", "created_at": "2024-10-11T01:51:46", "owner": "issawildneissa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028209029371354, "text": "I thought we were done with these? How are they still getting the marketing budget??? 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-11T00:51:50", "owner": "ph0tomania", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18458914192004980, "text": "Got mine", "created_at": "2024-10-11T00:48:54", "owner": "peashayla259", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868518595145228, "text": "i want one😢", "created_at": "2024-10-11T00:02:39", "owner": "thee.onlyleah", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043756373090965, "text": "Why???", "created_at": "2024-10-10T23:40:47", "owner": "bamerist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047460784820186, "text": "@laila.chakib @janineasad14", "created_at": "2024-10-10T23:25:16", "owner": "theybproject_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074084317568406, "text": "@victoriassecret you should make the subway stations as clean as your clothing stores", "created_at": "2024-10-10T23:20:41", "owner": "jonathangoldman", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18043241990044426, "text": "https://youtu.be/cCw3y89VXgA?si=BrO4sdTvsF29rg5W", "created_at": "2024-10-10T22:32:59", "owner": "dickmac999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902818498048021, "text": "The people are tired. Actually clean the tracks and the subways if you have time for partnerships.", "created_at": "2024-10-10T22:23:24", "owner": "jeewoon", "likes": 718}, {"id": 18026478128592349, "text": "I want one !!!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-10T22:03:15", "owner": "appliedesl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17910681446932830, "text": "😷", "created_at": "2024-10-10T21:46:13", "owner": "reytoi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016926929328011, "text": "@thevoguelauren", "created_at": "2024-10-10T19:54:54", "owner": "tinamarble", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946264353854826, "text": "@victoriassecret Omg, yes, finally, the Victoria secret fashion show is coming back. i can't wait 🩷🖤🩷🖤🩷🖤🩷🪽", "created_at": "2024-10-10T19:35:36", "owner": "l.h.r.3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060891922627471, "text": "Why not just have the trains run in a timely fashion and then there would be no need for silly promos?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T18:47:17", "owner": "natefrohn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17901506832052098, "text": "nobody gets metrocards these days", "created_at": "2024-10-10T18:43:36", "owner": "fliickyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18000861464671401, "text": "YEAHHHH😍 need to go grab one or many😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T18:25:20", "owner": "newyorkcity4all", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18095336596464876, "text": "No thanks. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T18:22:27", "owner": "great_night_with_laya_gordon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002325869666205, "text": "You guys need better time frequencys on the D and Q trains, if I miss a train during mid day hours, your telling me I have to wait 16 minutes for the next one? Outrageous", "created_at": "2024-10-10T18:01:31", "owner": "jackoa101", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079687591530256, "text": "I mean aren’t the Metrocards going to be phased out soon?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T17:35:42", "owner": "thedcunited64", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18461805619031689, "text": "Aren’t you discontinuing meta cards for “plastic”", "created_at": "2024-10-10T17:29:53", "owner": "fobat76", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052109905740132, "text": "Y’all better bring the Hip Hop ones to OMNY when you phase metrocard out next year 😒", "created_at": "2024-10-10T17:29:03", "owner": "jootino", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18468121375022177, "text": "First of the last 3 custom metrocards? That means no more metrocards in future and only OMNY?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T17:08:48", "owner": "ridgewoodqueenz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938193837914932, "text": "No more ads on metro cards please. 🙅‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:39:23", "owner": "sjk000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071895052593216, "text": "all I want is VS to make quality clothes again…not metrocards", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:22:12", "owner": "rocaontheroad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034646660236199, "text": "🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:21:41", "owner": "im_mahliek", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18020602517572028, "text": "I want that", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:17:41", "owner": "liondancekaydeng", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041841791509530, "text": "We need Grimace - Mets metrocards 💜🤝⚾️", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:14:00", "owner": "h.cotts", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18008151413453971, "text": "De la soul mta cards ?", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:13:39", "owner": "joseph_aaron_dupuis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009643934435693, "text": "@mta is always selling sex", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:12:28", "owner": "mtasupplylogistics", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025592789172443, "text": "I once got a limited edition metro card by accident of being there,  I like that it was random instead of going out 4 it . Rip I guess", "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:09:47", "owner": "henry_wasnt_here", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038322578165948, "text": "You know you won't be making special edition OMNY cards cause they cost too much to buy!", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:44:41", "owner": "bcaryfk", "likes": 58}, {"id": 18012864980366566, "text": "@sandybaez2", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:44:36", "owner": "marides2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058640011786209, "text": "I thought @victoriassecret went out of business awhile ago 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:38:44", "owner": "laurensusan84", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044579252053981, "text": "We always get things we don’t want.", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:38:25", "owner": "cherokee.redfeather", "likes": 92}, {"id": 18012069236623926, "text": "Extra delgadas 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:35:39", "owner": "luz_de_dia4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040076339490336, "text": "where", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:23:49", "owner": "juleselizia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18242897743286134, "text": "Yall can keep it...", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:22:39", "owner": "joewellnotjoel", "likes": 61}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["vsfashionshow"]},
{"media_id": 3438552388845490580, "shortcode": "C-4MS3utNGU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-4MS3utNGU/", "taken_at": "2024-08-20T04:17:22", "caption": "SpaceX's Starship rocket is designed to take humans to Mars as part of the company's ambitious goal to make life multiplanetary. The Starship system consists of two stages: the Super Heavy booster, which provides the initial thrust to leave Earth's atmosphere, and the Starship spacecraft itself, which will carry crew and cargo to Mars. Both stages are fully reusable, meaning they can be launched, landed, and relaunched, which dramatically reduces the cost of space travel.\n\nOnce in orbit, Starship can be refueled by other Starship tankers, enabling it to travel long distances in space. This refueling capability is crucial for the journey to Mars, as it allows the spacecraft to carry more cargo and passengers by reducing the need to carry all the fuel from Earth. The spacecraft is designed to carry up to 100 people, with living quarters, common areas, and even entertainment spaces for long-duration missions.\n\nOn Mars, Starship will land using its powerful engines to slow its descent and touch down vertically. Once on the surface, the crew will rely on habitats and life support systems to survive, while Starship itself could be used as a temporary shelter. The spacecraft is designed to be capable of returning to Earth, refueling on Mars using resources found on the planet, such as water and carbon dioxide, which can be converted into methane and oxygen for fuel. This capability is key to enabling sustainable, round-trip missions to Mars.", "owner_username": "photonsnare", "owner_id": "63782542262", "likes": 67701, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0175_C-4MS3utNGU\\C-4MS3utNGU_20240820_041722.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17994574691759456, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-01-28T09:55:05", "owner": "pranjal__explaining_space", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119097664412561, "text": "Why is there a booster leaving Mars?", "created_at": "2024-12-10T02:51:51", "owner": "retrodad_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043424632979608, "text": "Showing animated simulation having multi dimensional buster rocket launch is grate to explain different perspectives of complexities.", "created_at": "2024-12-10T01:45:17", "owner": "purushottam_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120063937407927, "text": "NASA needs to send multiple shuttles first that carry litterally every astronauts need to set up a base on mars first", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:45:04", "owner": "lego_summerton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039834812258084, "text": "Wow..using fire and bombs to get into space…amazing…wow.", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:25:28", "owner": "waveskimmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023850407574294, "text": "طريقة عمل معقدة", "created_at": "2024-11-21T12:25:51", "owner": "a_ik_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938022720944748, "text": "Better to conquer moon then having a tourist trip to Mars.", "created_at": "2024-11-20T15:06:48", "owner": "svenfinke_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022690718302560, "text": "2025 and still people believe the story of  travel to space is true 🤦🏽", "created_at": "2024-11-12T12:57:03", "owner": "adnantjee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029332988155235, "text": "Impossible 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T00:57:59", "owner": "edysoedjianto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056163193895707, "text": "Why earth statics?", "created_at": "2024-11-08T09:18:06", "owner": "hnz90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012950390401983, "text": "Van Allen radiation belt may be a problem", "created_at": "2024-11-05T03:53:54", "owner": "vtxf18002024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031126136115534, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T18:47:05", "owner": "joelcastelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985876587726986, "text": "Fake", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:15:44", "owner": "4season_camper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006614594668388, "text": "Easy", "created_at": "2024-11-02T11:11:16", "owner": "albevisuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966576999681240, "text": "Why not launch fuel tanks to a location along the route and let it wait?", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:12:03", "owner": "swanson_rules", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866388037239800, "text": "Can we try moon first?", "created_at": "2024-11-01T22:39:27", "owner": "andruhalysenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947978901765057, "text": "Yea and how many of this tickets are gonna blow up", "created_at": "2024-10-31T11:02:21", "owner": "manshowerdan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041986241147819, "text": "Go Elon TNX For all this ❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-30T15:40:07", "owner": "lucapinatto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044657588086607, "text": "Stop thinking about mars", "created_at": "2024-10-30T13:46:14", "owner": "lamppostman2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119802778396639, "text": "Utter sc fi", "created_at": "2024-10-29T16:56:17", "owner": "hermanherbertmartin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945695448894979, "text": "Science types check me on this, I'd be happy to be wrong... Without artificial gravity creating a colony on Mars isn't possible because the gravity on Mars is 38 per cent Earths gravity. This can be counted by adults doing exercises to strengthen muscles etc.  but children being born there would not develop normally as they grew, because humans evolved to grow up and form bodies in Earth Gravity.  So it's nice the billionaire types want to escape Earth, but it's a short term thing.", "created_at": "2024-10-27T03:52:32", "owner": "khajiitsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051515572931165, "text": "Instead of humans it should take A.I bots to start infrastructure & take 3d printing equipment & more", "created_at": "2024-10-26T22:14:30", "owner": "lightbeamshaun1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062051419683197, "text": "The vacuum of space 🔥 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T18:01:25", "owner": "heartlesscustoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031767425099930, "text": "How did they go to the moon  and come back?😮", "created_at": "2024-10-22T23:07:46", "owner": "kbdi_kb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143798503346582, "text": "2nd stage is not for interplanetary it's just for earths orbin... I am 100 percent sure then will ad 3rd stage to make this all possible Nd  even a interplanetary gateway 👍", "created_at": "2024-10-22T07:32:14", "owner": "in.st.ag.ra.m_user", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012634817633614, "text": "If anyone folk go to mars...whom was? Farmers? Or people to know onlyjust programers.. that's Is very wrong...by to way..Is other Werther no the same how earth", "created_at": "2024-10-20T23:04:07", "owner": "amdaveblanco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039958253145616, "text": "So still no words about Mars not having internal activity to sustain magnetic protection as well as an atmosphere ? Assuming we can alter the atmosphere composition, it would not even be able to stay there without leaking into space ?\n\nLiving in pods is fun enough I guess", "created_at": "2024-10-20T10:58:15", "owner": "ozymanzak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276277060300825, "text": "Only 1 time refueling?", "created_at": "2024-10-20T06:43:00", "owner": "bravenizer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051068905924386, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T04:39:18", "owner": "martin.bartak.3363", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993255084545995, "text": "Also we now have a fart powered rocket?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T12:03:29", "owner": "ldj1396", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037295762513517, "text": "How did they get that one tho on mars without sending one already?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T12:02:04", "owner": "ldj1396", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356626519190468, "text": "How long is the trip ?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T08:29:49", "owner": "leeruzzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118967071399944, "text": "Moon can be used as an intermediate between these two", "created_at": "2024-10-19T07:31:08", "owner": "abhiraj_ms_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046452164499026, "text": "That's why they were testing catching booster mid air", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:50:55", "owner": "frigontech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061382212683389, "text": "Are they looking for crops for the starving or homes for the wanderers?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:42:30", "owner": "amadeugustavo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055511263854733, "text": "We have destroyed earth and now we want to destroy the solar system😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:24:16", "owner": "a.reckless.soul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970314846658807, "text": "And how are we gonna survive the radiation and 0 G", "created_at": "2024-10-18T22:21:38", "owner": "xx_yoryo_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282032479210302, "text": "Locally produced methane fuel. Who is producing it? Whats the plan b, in case production of fuel stops because of some problem?", "created_at": "2024-10-18T19:24:19", "owner": "monodarky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18255895675250329, "text": "Easy", "created_at": "2024-10-18T18:22:04", "owner": "kenneth.y11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878530498164444, "text": "If you spark the methane on Mars you might blow up the whole planet. 💥 Boom", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:48:23", "owner": "dr3shul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093141460485046, "text": "Any human that makes it to mars, may as well not come back to earth....", "created_at": "2024-10-18T08:59:02", "owner": "nicholas_dimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075172003568715, "text": "Problem is, it actually takes 10 refueling rounds to get to the moon, now imagine going to mars", "created_at": "2024-10-18T05:17:21", "owner": "phoenics_space", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988849446581730, "text": "Volarias a Marte ? @rasquinv", "created_at": "2024-10-18T03:30:32", "owner": "mrlopezjohn83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244476181273092, "text": "Sooo… this shows two starship  launches to get to Mars… which is well known to be far more, just for refueling, let alone people. \nMind clarifying? Maybe I misunderstand", "created_at": "2024-10-18T00:03:40", "owner": "austinbanksphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051112330764660, "text": "Inside those rockets will be the latest Tesla robots.", "created_at": "2024-10-18T00:00:46", "owner": "gcaroprese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881299090150287, "text": "The one from Mars is just one rocket?", "created_at": "2024-10-17T20:56:04", "owner": "jtejtejte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881926966138636, "text": "Sounds nice in theory", "created_at": "2024-10-17T20:13:06", "owner": "trazyjamez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009326585453607, "text": "Para qué se unen en el espacio y se separan???", "created_at": "2024-10-17T20:05:47", "owner": "garrutinho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169076920310484, "text": "Musk has estimated that 8 launches would be needed to completely refuel a Starship in low Earth orbit. NASA has estimated that 16 launches in short succession (due to cryogenic propellant boil-off) would be needed to partially refuel Starship for one lunar landing.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T19:56:28", "owner": "nikkyweks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035806163013613, "text": "Come back trip? Or we just leave there robots", "created_at": "2024-10-17T19:42:25", "owner": "jpsantiagosilva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045282238853874, "text": "Surviving mars IRL ??", "created_at": "2024-10-17T18:08:05", "owner": "d.rojo_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992642334551590, "text": "Locally produced produced... in Mars ... by who???", "created_at": "2024-10-17T17:39:54", "owner": "siya_adu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885257467055430, "text": "Waste of time.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T17:37:44", "owner": "officialmattromo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996362559528182, "text": "Estão reutilizando coisas, ótimo! Nós aqui no Brasil já fazemos isso há décadas, que bom que alguém está dando exemplo e mostrando como ser mais sustentável.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T17:32:25", "owner": "marciomancini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107945281427152, "text": "So what's stopping", "created_at": "2024-10-17T16:50:07", "owner": "zayns_high", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879762748158491, "text": "Is there anyone who tell me why that starship don't need the boosters on mars to came back to the earth", "created_at": "2024-10-17T16:26:36", "owner": "junaid_sheikh29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867962803227110, "text": "How long is the journey from earth to mars in one of them?", "created_at": "2024-10-17T16:13:19", "owner": "numbnuts1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043678616497214, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-17T15:17:47", "owner": "johnson_john_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067883650717479, "text": "@jj.hofman vond zojuist deze video en ik zag je reactie op mij op sterrenpraatjes", "created_at": "2024-10-17T14:59:36", "owner": "plrv99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891991900096280, "text": "Can a space ship be powered by electricity or Nuclear power other than burning large amount of gas?", "created_at": "2024-10-17T14:54:37", "owner": "itszeno2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104753320441460, "text": "Meanwhile the planets rotating, they are also moving round the sun, and all the planets and the sun are flying through space at 1.3 million miles per hour", "created_at": "2024-10-17T14:47:40", "owner": "joey_souls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057420991865047, "text": "Porque para ir a Marte usa-se três propulsores e para retornar não é necessário a utilização de nenhum adicional", "created_at": "2024-10-17T14:35:32", "owner": "debroacacio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983767971743335, "text": "It's good we are making a plan to go other planet, this is where money should be invested. If there is an apocalypse happens then we should not start from ZERO.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T13:44:03", "owner": "sameera_shk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036997514184151, "text": "The moon will play a big part in this", "created_at": "2024-10-17T13:26:52", "owner": "wezhenshaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884322421107580, "text": "So when you get to mars how do you move the rocket systems to create a colony", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:16:32", "owner": "drinky67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315541192093360, "text": "I think it is pointless to do this if there is no gravity in Mars and they can't replicate it.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:23:21", "owner": "mp.mapp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024438887582426, "text": "It will never happen unless it’s a one way trip", "created_at": "2024-10-17T09:01:59", "owner": "atelier_urbanvine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885800074129115, "text": "More proof that private companies are vastly superior to tax draining government programs.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T08:51:02", "owner": "travisgavin16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858126529223344, "text": "Seems sketchy 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-17T07:19:59", "owner": "joona.3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284985919239198, "text": "Basically throwing things into space and praying the math was correct. (Not downplaying the achievement, just putting our current level of space travel in context)\nThis technology most likely will be steered towards the DOD and their missile programs.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T07:10:36", "owner": "yeoflip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044589842481328, "text": "Bruh the corporation did it first while the US govt busy giving shitrael money to fuel war very good job US leaders", "created_at": "2024-10-17T06:46:39", "owner": "apit_chandra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070608133528622, "text": "Um…isn’t Mars uninhabitable? Like, beyond freezing cold temperatures and, well, no breathable atmosphere? No internet lol", "created_at": "2024-10-17T06:22:17", "owner": "goddess_factory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055236649861721, "text": "Interesting 🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-17T06:14:34", "owner": "ozurumba_obinna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105826162440818, "text": "As far as group projects go I’m that third 🚀 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-17T05:41:40", "owner": "miiichaelreiiid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18465384724028784, "text": "Fascinating 👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-17T05:23:49", "owner": "moodyengine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863973100247216, "text": "He will be the histories most iconic most important human person ever", "created_at": "2024-10-17T04:47:35", "owner": "rakeshhh_peaceman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059165272653701, "text": "I thought mars had a stronger gravity or is that just how it affects humana", "created_at": "2024-10-17T03:24:06", "owner": "nikita_cordier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049732489779839, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-17T03:15:46", "owner": "po.looklook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042112169501430, "text": "Musk makes swapping easier 😂❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-17T02:51:48", "owner": "charan_bolisetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884346007111523, "text": "Cant share on stories 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-10-17T02:43:07", "owner": "excorpion2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943189854885926, "text": "Maybe in 100 yers, antimatter boost engine to explore entire solar system.", "created_at": "2024-10-17T02:05:11", "owner": "thiago.prado.fs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045038627092612, "text": "God I love the private sector", "created_at": "2024-10-17T01:05:23", "owner": "sapien_industries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045374459003961, "text": "Use moon. Moon is closer.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T23:54:33", "owner": "cam_rackam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996233166527566, "text": "What would happen if refill fuel does not work?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T23:11:22", "owner": "ycarrera222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996347031697837, "text": "These comments are hilarious! 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-16T21:53:41", "owner": "oscarrivera_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062541826735724, "text": "So who put the rocket 🚀 that’s on mars?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T21:51:57", "owner": "jptheblackwolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370159969128306, "text": "We were born to inherit the stars", "created_at": "2024-10-16T21:49:18", "owner": "anndrrei.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960933351696620, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-16T21:01:52", "owner": "bikepsion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020365769283756, "text": "Why they wanna go Mars? I want to know why Mars ? Isnt the planet uninhabitable?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:53:47", "owner": "jsujameskorea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018105920540715, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:47:49", "owner": "okagewesley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033455837254404, "text": "Elon king", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:23:28", "owner": "antonyabi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885869869128746, "text": "Would work even better if the entire world nations cooperated and pooled resources instead of wasting them on individual operations.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:20:20", "owner": "nick2000a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061218631703703, "text": "Space coomers believe this lol", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:15:20", "owner": "vindaloovian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280970572173180, "text": "@marie_alti", "created_at": "2024-10-16T20:11:55", "owner": "sunnywilliams.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027165461145761, "text": "And luckily there's already methane processing plants on mars ready to fuel up the return journey!", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:56:57", "owner": "djattaboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060698650742573, "text": "Y a la luna pa cuando? Haha", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:56:45", "owner": "little.washosky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982886088749760, "text": "How long will it take?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:30:00", "owner": "judestories", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070436092623788, "text": "Locally produced methane? So we have a methane extraction plant on Mars now 👏", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:07:07", "owner": "mikegburns", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023482301217716, "text": "All nasa does is try to convince people the earth is round and there sstslites  in space and we have been to the moon and have cameras on Mars it's a full time lie which they get paid to tell", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:02:11", "owner": "tonybutler161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059513305743502, "text": "We knew this since the beginning of making", "created_at": "2024-10-16T19:00:05", "owner": "nooman_r.khan", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
