{"media_id": 3478697370172810677, "shortcode": "DBG0NPGPGW1", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBG0NPGPGW1/", "taken_at": "2024-10-14T13:40:24", "caption": "秀一波功夫茶技#功夫 #茶", "owner_username": "gong_fu_tea", "owner_id": "69537279836", "likes": 37, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0178_DBG0NPGPGW1\\DBG0NPGPGW1_20241014_134024.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18000245936679592", "text": "😂沒吃藥", "created_at": "2024-10-19T17:26:42", "owner": "aldronsho", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17895600324010977", "text": "別的不說因為我也不知道從哪吐槽起，就說那茶葉太滿，這蓋子一壓茶就澀了。", "created_at": "2024-10-17T17:31:24", "owner": "vup4zj6", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18458825035057548", "text": "都是整事", "created_at": "2024-10-16T12:19:14", "owner": "savingdk", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18464568817034737", "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:01:24", "owner": "munci_fw", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["功夫", "茶"]},
