{"media_id": 3474411281429496633, "shortcode": "DA3lqb5NwM5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA3lqb5NwM5/", "taken_at": "2024-10-08T15:42:32", "caption": "🌟 Real-time Lighting in Virtual Production! 🌟\n\nHere’s what you’re looking at: a blue screen studio that is being dynamically lit in real time, completely synchronized with a virtual scene in Unreal Engine 5.4. 🎮💡\n\nThanks to CyberGaffer, an Unreal Engine plugin and app, none of the 16 light sources in this studio had to be move after the initial 5-minute calibration. The lighting adjustments you see are synced to the virtual scene, all done instantly through a DMX network, and captured in-camera without any color grading. 🎥✨\n\nThis footage has been filmed in the studio of one of our beta-testers @mrfactory_vp. Big thanks to Óscar M. Olarte and the team.\n\n💡 Want to learn more about this technology and stay updated? Check out the link in our bio to join our Discord!", "owner_username": "antilatency", "owner_id": "2045282545", "likes": 57361, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0180_DA3lqb5NwM5\\DA3lqb5NwM5_20241008_154232.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17906032989098809, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-26T09:18:58", "owner": "oceanusmedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038572826455313, "text": "Awesome! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-18T20:03:09", "owner": "marcus_visual_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052010537140249, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-02-15T22:00:33", "owner": "themooseintheforest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849596932380065, "text": "This is insane. Amazing work.", "created_at": "2025-01-06T11:25:31", "owner": "ben.glasgow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079802314590437, "text": "I bet the guys from @corridordigital will have something like this soon", "created_at": "2024-12-31T13:02:03", "owner": "video_maker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053526251069428, "text": "@ayomide_jo", "created_at": "2024-12-30T00:28:50", "owner": "king_bee_studios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847787635350555, "text": "The problem will come when you need a blue light 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-29T17:43:28", "owner": "montagegovno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950264742866395, "text": "Jeezzz", "created_at": "2024-12-29T16:10:59", "owner": "iamtravelr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106314613457794, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2024-12-29T15:07:18", "owner": "sajid.ahnaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053405959967807, "text": "Woah 🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-27T16:41:19", "owner": "rizkaystr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991755738741886, "text": "😮😮😮😮 WHAAAAAT!?", "created_at": "2024-12-26T17:49:24", "owner": "vitormigg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995125539725973, "text": "Virtual insanity 2.0", "created_at": "2024-12-26T13:11:33", "owner": "wisdom_2th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323109451095834, "text": "This is amazing. The (real) lights changing as the camera move👏🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-26T10:57:05", "owner": "jason.vanik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019772726375017, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-25T20:33:02", "owner": "yuba.r.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889361566067268, "text": "Cool but still prefer torch on in a natural room in real life also the amount of time it takes to set so like this up you could adjust literally shot in a normal room waited to either evening or the morning for nice light 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-24T12:20:20", "owner": "andrew_silver_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099863329485394, "text": "This is some Phenomenal tech 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-24T11:07:36", "owner": "blinkbywakar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986739048779990, "text": "Thats crazy", "created_at": "2024-12-23T22:53:53", "owner": "moisesmattout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858602458323652, "text": "Woe", "created_at": "2024-12-22T23:08:50", "owner": "etograms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936732771830960, "text": "Now that is what l want to learn ASAP", "created_at": "2024-12-12T15:12:23", "owner": "37omkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080074360568345, "text": "@fadelrastach", "created_at": "2024-12-09T07:29:15", "owner": "hizzu_san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055055188758304, "text": "This forced Republican hasn't been touched by anybody either.", "created_at": "2024-12-06T10:56:07", "owner": "fernandoaugustopiresferreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234715834303658, "text": "🤯", "created_at": "2024-12-06T10:45:05", "owner": "oao.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025491533244314, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:47:45", "owner": "angelolafarina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049779460996745, "text": "Holy shit", "created_at": "2024-11-22T02:49:40", "owner": "6lavnet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991725837720615, "text": "This is crazy 😮🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-21T17:28:03", "owner": "p.l.s_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058271752880320, "text": "Fire", "created_at": "2024-11-20T07:51:19", "owner": "max.willmann.l2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054124642902739, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-20T01:44:51", "owner": "shdxsin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042601895164940, "text": "What holy machine that can handle this type of render", "created_at": "2024-11-19T10:52:28", "owner": "am.xchy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029383712603109, "text": "NEED", "created_at": "2024-11-18T15:10:59", "owner": "aaronbazil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016824512357360, "text": "Insane. Absolutely incredible", "created_at": "2024-11-18T12:20:23", "owner": "ibraxwane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028908335182557, "text": "Wowh", "created_at": "2024-11-17T17:57:32", "owner": "menewaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18465738703019016, "text": "😍😍😍😍Ffffkk", "created_at": "2024-11-17T17:42:01", "owner": "karthikn_3d.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112417342421687, "text": "More cheap just buil a real room hahaha", "created_at": "2024-11-16T03:21:27", "owner": "zenytsuke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046799243044293, "text": "That’s amazing!", "created_at": "2024-11-14T19:25:11", "owner": "chris.timmons.1238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054554146742100, "text": "This is insane", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:50:21", "owner": "naccarithomas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051585586797341, "text": "Just talk with your normal voice, please.", "created_at": "2024-11-13T03:08:28", "owner": "macromandan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469597900062390, "text": "Krezieee", "created_at": "2024-11-12T19:41:52", "owner": "maheswarapriyananda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285579193208171, "text": "no mound of AI buzzwords and random artifacts or blobs of flesh  in the final result?? say it aint so!!!", "created_at": "2024-11-11T08:53:50", "owner": "thenicoleham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013141172423705, "text": "@corridordigital", "created_at": "2024-11-10T21:51:40", "owner": "_hunterpark80_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204079690292487, "text": "ok whatever you can have this one", "created_at": "2024-11-10T06:04:36", "owner": "heyimjaytee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288342535233631, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-11-08T18:33:49", "owner": "ajasont.m4a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021460637547593, "text": "That’s crazy", "created_at": "2024-11-08T09:26:25", "owner": "14f3lix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868642318235498, "text": "@corridordigital", "created_at": "2024-11-08T07:08:13", "owner": "tahiti_murugan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077826664505907, "text": "Still looks fake", "created_at": "2024-11-07T11:12:56", "owner": "usamabelike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994627749546671, "text": "That’s crazy", "created_at": "2024-11-05T22:56:58", "owner": "digital.jordan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936821604928144, "text": "What ?!?!?! This is insane", "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:50:34", "owner": "christo_saba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100972708454392, "text": "Cómo se llama el programa?", "created_at": "2024-11-03T22:52:25", "owner": "victoremanuel1489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284518672209289, "text": "This is bonkers 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T20:26:37", "owner": "gfxkid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043714328279285, "text": "Sweet dude", "created_at": "2024-11-03T16:21:06", "owner": "niklaswerth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066702007641626, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:39:45", "owner": "o2_farezone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956673909830340, "text": "That voice", "created_at": "2024-11-03T03:52:16", "owner": "jfpouli1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343945957125367, "text": "nobody would tell it's fake if the lens depth of field weren't perfect", "created_at": "2024-11-03T00:43:59", "owner": "saidnidahmed.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031773410342737, "text": "Wait how did the light work like that?", "created_at": "2024-11-02T01:32:01", "owner": "this.acc.doesnt.make.any.sense", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085574215517148, "text": "humans have come FAR", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:14:08", "owner": "atosaiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051139291779572, "text": "This is the stuff I'm excited for in regards to vr", "created_at": "2024-11-01T05:02:14", "owner": "caustic.effection", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011986451413396, "text": "Wooo 🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-01T03:41:43", "owner": "diecariola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069469219717290, "text": "The shadows 😯😯😯😯", "created_at": "2024-10-31T20:51:21", "owner": "halationstudios_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891254191033279, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-10-31T19:16:38", "owner": "dd_cme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897539487998680, "text": "Cybergaffer 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T13:13:46", "owner": "dan_sully", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853012618315316, "text": "Woah!", "created_at": "2024-10-31T10:23:28", "owner": "houseofjjd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850319002288694, "text": "bro", "created_at": "2024-10-31T01:14:07", "owner": "roderickphilipp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035922179517401, "text": "Impresionante!!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-30T08:43:28", "owner": "gustavodanieldegrossi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023426060610634, "text": "This is unreal! 😮", "created_at": "2024-10-30T05:55:10", "owner": "pinzor.official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972658473652640, "text": "dude..", "created_at": "2024-10-30T05:28:10", "owner": "kyeledd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013371179383635, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-30T02:08:12", "owner": "giri001_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18466950271047034, "text": "So cool 😮🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-29T15:30:48", "owner": "xseeeyn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042807290120720, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-29T08:36:57", "owner": "jnphotografics", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027616775168794, "text": "Siiiiiick😮😮", "created_at": "2024-10-29T08:24:55", "owner": "pxlphase", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338720530176977, "text": "Unreal engine", "created_at": "2024-10-29T02:03:23", "owner": "thirdborn_ent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053268136740206, "text": "🤯🤯🤯", "created_at": "2024-10-29T00:44:03", "owner": "zachtaylor3d", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933914634946096, "text": "A happy blend of digital and physical media making is the way to go. This is absolutely cool and I really want to get into this type of lighting.", "created_at": "2024-10-28T21:47:41", "owner": "film.raw.bit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026836235387246, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-28T19:03:55", "owner": "ssbeedum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18469736194059817, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2024-10-28T18:32:17", "owner": "allangregorio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080419150555189, "text": "The room rotating around him broke my brain", "created_at": "2024-10-28T06:43:51", "owner": "ivanhidayat", "likes": 191}, {"id": 18016374791633610, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-28T05:40:38", "owner": "nuylabs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925222791971190, "text": "Wow !", "created_at": "2024-10-27T19:49:13", "owner": "leotique", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18290355001226313, "text": "this is awesome", "created_at": "2024-10-27T18:24:26", "owner": "lets_go_gamble", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18468552175016763, "text": "Why is postal dude voicing over this?", "created_at": "2024-10-27T16:01:26", "owner": "mr.doodledood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863177302252218, "text": "Don't get me wrong this is amazing, but you should have scaled the scene up a bit more. He looks like a giant compared to the chair next to him and it kind of breaks the illusion. Still super cool though. I'd have no idea how to do this", "created_at": "2024-10-27T13:46:50", "owner": "josiahbout", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18069171202715599, "text": "Why am i scared", "created_at": "2024-10-27T13:35:39", "owner": "https.joaopedro.br", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023179202529174, "text": "What is up with his voice? Dude should see a doctor", "created_at": "2024-10-27T12:28:59", "owner": "genesik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075762763568682, "text": "@gaveta", "created_at": "2024-10-27T11:46:29", "owner": "pedrohcok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288580489224868, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-27T06:35:01", "owner": "noaroggendorff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993247713711814, "text": "Holy shiiit", "created_at": "2024-10-27T05:52:57", "owner": "jonathanmolinau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929339307959151, "text": "Mind blown 🤯", "created_at": "2024-10-27T03:01:38", "owner": "duff.dale", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002207285681518, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-26T23:20:44", "owner": "officialmstfa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079933600535708, "text": "Whats??? How??", "created_at": "2024-10-26T22:57:45", "owner": "nch3d", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17853181098261698, "text": "@mohamed_amine_bnh", "created_at": "2024-10-26T16:57:46", "owner": "4bde55ahim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894055030015981, "text": "🤯", "created_at": "2024-10-26T16:48:33", "owner": "joseph.dj.jnr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024342329528357, "text": "> They can do any unimaginable things in CG \n> They make an ordinary room under", "created_at": "2024-10-26T14:46:02", "owner": "dragoy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056182684721843, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2024-10-26T11:38:57", "owner": "husnimarwan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17878066413172437, "text": "😱", "created_at": "2024-10-26T08:24:55", "owner": "jonasrodrigues.br", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969203661666514, "text": "Love this thank you for sharing ❤️🙌❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-26T08:14:09", "owner": "dzine01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081628528538983, "text": "The fact that the floor isn't reflecting him  instantly gives it all away", "created_at": "2024-10-26T07:43:18", "owner": "mkorestes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042336284120578, "text": "🤯🤯🤯", "created_at": "2024-10-26T06:13:39", "owner": "madariyanhadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327322759156593, "text": "this voice hurts me physically but i am very interested in the subject matter.", "created_at": "2024-10-26T04:57:40", "owner": "serenelusano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122495893361306, "text": "Incredibly cool idea and execution", "created_at": "2024-10-25T23:55:14", "owner": "monkeydwarf", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17904469619963905, "text": "That voiceover. 😅", "created_at": "2024-10-25T16:42:35", "owner": "marcusszabo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009683579456943, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:35:06", "owner": "keshavtanwar_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076681171506967, "text": "Wow❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-25T03:06:28", "owner": "demianiukviktor", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3480996330941971228, "shortcode": "DBO-7hKO_sc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBO-7hKO_sc/", "taken_at": "2024-10-17T17:45:57", "caption": "\"What's the baby doing?.. Oh it's being made\" ahh😭\n(Via:tt/justforfunigs)", "owner_username": "playstarwins", "owner_id": "67740280264", "likes": 1008937, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0181_DBO-7hKO_sc\\DBO-7hKO_sc_20241017_174557.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17980845914688269, "text": "Who the hell made a scientific porno", "created_at": "2025-04-15T19:56:48", "owner": "gothiccaaa", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18285963100247221, "text": "They making one", "created_at": "2025-04-15T17:50:57", "owner": "bnoels_k", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18042894344166753, "text": "Gooned to ts", "created_at": "2025-04-15T00:33:15", "owner": "ryker_johnson2029", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17878682154289565, "text": "Just realized what that was", "created_at": "2025-04-14T22:08:01", "owner": "viocarts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857225440351875, "text": "OH?!", "created_at": "2025-04-14T20:30:33", "owner": "pure.lychas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378521854189203, "text": "not even .. those are fingers ..", "created_at": "2025-04-14T19:24:03", "owner": "pajaroscongorra", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18037256513558027, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-13T22:25:51", "owner": "artssncrafters", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875436367318642, "text": "Please tell me that ain’t what I think it is💀", "created_at": "2025-04-13T18:13:38", "owner": "kaylascameraroll.l", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877155634312932, "text": "DID THEY DO THAT IN A HOSPITAL ROOM 😭", "created_at": "2025-04-13T18:04:07", "owner": "marchiiiii__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17879874543183974, "text": "for all of you being weird, common sense is a thing and it’s most likely a educational video, given that it’s in a class", "created_at": "2025-04-13T00:37:17", "owner": "khounxiy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123674647442782, "text": "Is that a boiled chicken applying lotion...", "created_at": "2025-04-12T09:35:39", "owner": "sxndrx1312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082352554581410, "text": "OH MY", "created_at": "2025-04-11T21:16:12", "owner": "ilixcarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990738792639634, "text": "theyre working on it be patient", "created_at": "2025-04-11T20:28:18", "owner": "username.isvisible", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089437756588541, "text": "He doing it with ultrasound", "created_at": "2025-04-11T13:40:15", "owner": "00auvwibaojj9w0kw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061940528063934, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-11T02:50:16", "owner": "emrielle.melamed", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18321023404206624, "text": "It's in process", "created_at": "2025-04-10T06:49:31", "owner": "denyy2027", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17964959669755071, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-08T23:41:47", "owner": "theinvinciblezeus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057529070327629, "text": "This is gross", "created_at": "2025-04-07T21:45:18", "owner": "m00_r00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035205668559695, "text": "\"where's the baby\" on process 🤗", "created_at": "2025-04-07T19:47:04", "owner": "harieggg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061448600094716, "text": "Creation of life - live edition", "created_at": "2025-04-07T19:13:54", "owner": "error_11704", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056367428170233, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-07T17:24:18", "owner": "peterpierre062", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044903114524018, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-07T14:33:56", "owner": "gothkizkovalayan31", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18387364723113537, "text": "The baby will here there soon", "created_at": "2025-04-06T23:10:05", "owner": "jacob_deez7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876646381202915, "text": "Bros being 3d printed as we speak", "created_at": "2025-04-05T23:41:03", "owner": "tea.with.me1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155964142318982, "text": "I showed it to one of my friends crush… and he said maybe that could been them one day…", "created_at": "2025-04-05T16:31:37", "owner": "joseyyy_me", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085190446621037, "text": "i miss the person i was 10 seconds ago", "created_at": "2025-04-05T11:39:43", "owner": "kittyshapedpancakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076241629753890, "text": "uhhh thats cute....", "created_at": "2025-04-04T20:02:58", "owner": "mikey_the_possume", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884583832254187, "text": "why ? how ? who ?", "created_at": "2025-04-03T18:00:06", "owner": "kisslanddd._k_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944710386841420, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-03T15:20:21", "owner": "maria.aintwah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951921954949201, "text": "I miss the man i was 10 seconds ago", "created_at": "2025-04-02T04:33:35", "owner": "buell.rdr2.real", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004986596735920, "text": "“Your order is being prepped”", "created_at": "2025-04-01T18:26:28", "owner": "ford_whatley", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18081644887640494, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-04-01T15:24:23", "owner": "cio_alt69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915711945983181, "text": "Baby took lesson from father😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-01T14:48:36", "owner": "nozaninxonmurodova9", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17895929514179517, "text": "Oh..", "created_at": "2025-04-01T01:51:00", "owner": "luvk.ah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008456465725055, "text": "👫: “In the name of science? “\n🧑‍⚕️🤳: “..yeah …”", "created_at": "2025-03-31T23:32:22", "owner": "andrewbrian__", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18368461363126866, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-31T23:13:54", "owner": "theyknotrin1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937150047882066, "text": "\"Don't worry, it'll be there soon-\"", "created_at": "2025-03-31T21:49:58", "owner": "realnordicfrost", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18318419086204561, "text": "“Where’s the baby?” LET HIM FINISH FIRST", "created_at": "2025-03-31T19:48:58", "owner": "kaybeeeeeee_____", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861534580382383, "text": "Must be a prequel", "created_at": "2025-03-31T13:06:10", "owner": "dave_james_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078537661663504, "text": "Why is it going sideways?? Am I trippin", "created_at": "2025-03-31T04:21:12", "owner": "11pastel11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964851558888402, "text": "Take soap and a sponge  clean your eyes 👀", "created_at": "2025-03-31T02:07:52", "owner": "cucaracho12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969184725728414, "text": "Ok so im actually curious what was being taught that they needed this video?", "created_at": "2025-03-30T22:42:19", "owner": "_0.huh._", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18337560820087984, "text": "WTF", "created_at": "2025-03-30T21:47:59", "owner": "bananacattss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930143539013097, "text": "Gng what the hell", "created_at": "2025-03-30T20:42:14", "owner": "jivuxs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043164599524556, "text": "Ultrasound porn is insane bro", "created_at": "2025-03-30T18:35:41", "owner": "maddie_m260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855960619353435, "text": "Baby loading...................", "created_at": "2025-03-30T18:15:05", "owner": "_shristi_ssr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18379731328142650, "text": "LMAOAOAO WHAT BRO", "created_at": "2025-03-30T02:16:06", "owner": "hoesissweirdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078159817668516, "text": "@minenhle_minnie08, @mushroomsoup26 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-03-29T15:31:03", "owner": "vyx_veil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062968502050872, "text": "oh i thought", "created_at": "2025-03-29T14:55:37", "owner": "cyberp4rtal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080086852660096, "text": "What the actual fuck", "created_at": "2025-03-29T06:41:32", "owner": "fembylover79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067885402920364, "text": "Ah yes a typical anatomy and physiology class", "created_at": "2025-03-29T03:56:15", "owner": "elyserrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956762883919956, "text": "The doctors want a redo", "created_at": "2025-03-29T01:11:48", "owner": "rapture645", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043028717597217, "text": "BRO WHO WOUKD AGREE TO DO THIS FOR SCHOOL?😭💀", "created_at": "2025-03-28T19:54:56", "owner": "luv_mackenzieu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125830126421243, "text": "I just opened reels😭😭", "created_at": "2025-03-28T14:31:46", "owner": "faleesha.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101563348513982, "text": "I mean they just wanted to show the development of the baby from start to finish 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-27T13:04:03", "owner": "no_namedominican", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063953624479574, "text": "Baby is jumping 🥰", "created_at": "2025-03-27T03:39:51", "owner": "phany8505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896757736186772, "text": "LMAOOO!😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-27T02:32:37", "owner": "who.herr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168528274329509, "text": "I am so sorry to burst some bubbles here but… we have ultrasounds and x rays and scans of people doing a LOT. But worse. Think about the information we have like how much semen is in an average load… how long it takes people to climax, how many thrusts the average person can make before ejaculation, how the brain activates when aroused, those were all studies. That were all done in clinical settings… with doctors and scientists. So yeah. Every time you see a study or read a statistic about sex or sexual health think about how we got that information hahah", "created_at": "2025-03-27T00:36:30", "owner": "b_r_fit_37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004596989732733, "text": "Dafuk", "created_at": "2025-03-26T08:06:03", "owner": "wowosangasing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007510718554049, "text": "HUH", "created_at": "2025-03-26T06:05:49", "owner": "miraaaonly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061671535837661, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-26T02:45:08", "owner": "kenneth_lugo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110234761484121, "text": "I hope it's not what I think...", "created_at": "2025-03-25T20:08:20", "owner": "raphael.paulus.0711", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858384817331398, "text": "Охуеееееееееееееть", "created_at": "2025-03-24T21:02:16", "owner": "aribiderci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892110292197608, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-03-24T21:02:11", "owner": "aribiderci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467972506069646, "text": "Baby is...In the making", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:08:02", "owner": "vrushti.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860996428308981, "text": "The baby is loading", "created_at": "2025-03-24T04:36:10", "owner": "angel.mrgnstrn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049195988207884, "text": "they had to consciously get an ultrasound machine along with a technician and proceed to start doing the deed, truly *unhinged*", "created_at": "2025-03-24T01:41:08", "owner": "cloud.y_juice", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17999694548757128, "text": "It's in progress", "created_at": "2025-03-23T22:02:16", "owner": "addi.issoswag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064683937979525, "text": "Now that’s cool af", "created_at": "2025-03-23T18:29:21", "owner": "su_vani__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087322369607522, "text": "“Now Loading” ahh presentation", "created_at": "2025-03-23T05:39:18", "owner": "dr_trey79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041051474391868, "text": "I finally caught on omg 😭💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-23T05:07:30", "owner": "itsyuhbaby_lilbit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061897468833617, "text": "It’s just the prequel", "created_at": "2025-03-23T04:17:49", "owner": "tylerknight576", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039289781573625, "text": "The fact that I realized what was happening the moment I recognized the shape and movement 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-03-22T23:46:52", "owner": "cyberbot_tenshi2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881054815162814, "text": "WHYYY IS MY INSTAGRAM SO FREAKING FREAKY", "created_at": "2025-03-22T02:58:39", "owner": "xoxovaehhh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023700494460609, "text": "Wait, WHAT", "created_at": "2025-03-21T09:15:39", "owner": "voxeldatboi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031211498637017, "text": "I don’t get oh oh ohhhh", "created_at": "2025-03-21T06:33:30", "owner": "jirou_u21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18496159279012454, "text": "Why are we watching this in class 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-03-21T00:15:28", "owner": "quiiietst0rm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074619559818028, "text": "Why did I think that was a baby doing a press up 😭", "created_at": "2025-03-20T2