{"media_id": 3481761562715147990, "shortcode": "DBRs7GyPs7W", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBRs7GyPs7W/", "taken_at": "2024-10-18T19:07:08", "caption": "Follow for daily memes\n-\n-\n-\nThe Tesla Cybertruck is an all-electric, futuristic-looking pickup truck that was first unveiled by Tesla in November 2019.\nIt stands out due to its angular, sci-fi-inspired design, made of ultra-hard 30X cold-rolled stainless steel and armor glass for added durability. Its appearance, reminiscent of something from a dystopian future or a video game, has been both praised and criticized for its bold departure from traditional vehicle aesthetics.\nKey Features:\nDurability: The Cybertruck’s exoskeleton is designed\nfor toughness, with body panels that are dent-resistant, providing enhanced safety and strength. Tesla also introduced armor glass for its windows, though during the launch, a demonstration of the glass strength resulted in it unexpectedly cracking when struck by a metal ball.\nPerformance:\nThe Cybertruck is offered in multiple configurations,\nwith single-motor, dual-motor, and tri-motor variants.\n0 to 60 mph acceleration can be as fast as 2.9\nseconds in the highest performance variant.\nThe top range is expected to exceed 500 miles per\ncharge, making it a leader in range among electric trucks.\nIt boasts a payload capacity of up to 3,500 pounds\nand towing capabilities of over 14,000 pounds, making it competitive with traditional heavy-duty trucks.\nInterior and Features: The Cybertruck seats up to six\npassengers, and Tesla aims to incorporate the advanced Autopilot system, offering semi-autonomous driving. The interior has a minimalist design, featuring a large touchscreen, similar to other Tesla models.\nVersatility: The truck bed, referred to as the “Vault”, is\naround 6.5 feet long and is covered by a retractable tonneau cover. It also features lockable storage, 120V/240V power outlets for work equipment, and even an onboard air compressor, appealing to both outdoor enthusiasts and professionals\n\n #meme #memes #reels #shitpost #shitposter #shitposting #clips #sigmamemes #sigma #funny", "owner_username": "sheetposto.o", "owner_id": "54498195064", "likes": 7249, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0188_DBRs7GyPs7W\\DBRs7GyPs7W_20241018_190708.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18065377747661116, "text": "W pre-workout snack", "created_at": "2024-10-23T02:22:32", "owner": "bradyn_p50", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886436701122866, "text": "Bro hat die Nummer 40 bestellt", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:40:59", "owner": "mrtn_hrbst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109052638380895, "text": "\"I need to eat these every 15-20 minutes\"", "created_at": "2024-10-22T15:22:53", "owner": "josh_posh", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18358473922136548, "text": "Recess cups", "created_at": "2024-10-22T12:50:39", "owner": "bigdog6322", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18460567435008308, "text": "It's coke", "created_at": "2024-10-20T22:11:06", "owner": "oak20117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036792617272598, "text": "Bruh these sizes cost at least like 1 or 3 million dollars", "created_at": "2024-10-20T16:57:20", "owner": "ahmad9826618", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18105612088432962, "text": "@vansishers_", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:54:23", "owner": "zanzanie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019464788305686, "text": "the most expensive cake", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:53:57", "owner": "guerrierisamu", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18016561091630783, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-19T23:50:03", "owner": "cmeese2005", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18035371139245292, "text": "Noo my batch of powder", "created_at": "2024-10-19T20:32:21", "owner": "adk.tmk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17857704660273912, "text": "cocaine or weed, right?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T19:51:21", "owner": "clonelovesmusky", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18021700169262674, "text": "Lmaoo 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T11:02:50", "owner": "korayozdemir85", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17853190332298984, "text": "