{"media_id": 3459317324828759715, "shortcode": "DAB9sdXxdaj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAB9sdXxdaj/", "taken_at": "2024-09-17T19:53:14", "caption": "Hello.. \n\nAI Revolution Overview\n\nDesign and Functionality\n\n• Exterior: AI-powered tools like AI writing assistants and AI code assistants are transforming productivity, utilizing large language models for tasks ranging from content generation to programming support.\n• Capabilities: These tools can now write, summarize, and code with impressive speed and accuracy, adapting to various industries like education, software development, and marketing.\n\nPopular Tools\n\n• AI Writing Tools:\n• Function: Generates high-quality text, blog posts, and social media captions.\n• Usage: Ideal for content creators, marketers, and writers.\n• AI Code Assistants:\n• Function: Provides code suggestions, error-checking, and auto-completion.\n• Usage: Streamlining workflows for developers.", "owner_username": "darthbussy", "owner_id": "61005266278", "likes": 300649, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0194_DAB9sdXxdaj\\DAB9sdXxdaj_20240917_195314.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17851713621378871, "text": "i can live with this 😹😹", "created_at": "2025-03-16T10:59:49", "owner": "amores.pam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350098549181267, "text": "Perfect 🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-03-14T04:59:22", "owner": "5amgreentea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908351671071165, "text": "Oh my God please don't do that LMAO", "created_at": "2025-03-06T06:07:55", "owner": "peachii.draws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078215356733531, "text": "@annalena__gasser 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-05T22:42:46", "owner": "isabel_dialer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086387341578606, "text": "That's the teapot from everywhere at the end of time's cover", "created_at": "2025-03-04T10:35:52", "owner": "litle.johny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982827789796587, "text": "@_unhiiinged", "created_at": "2025-03-01T13:26:23", "owner": "ennaojkim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373505044137718, "text": "Ok i wanna help you not explode that thing because its amazing, you need a heat tamer/burner plate to diffuse the heat.", "created_at": "2025-02-28T20:19:02", "owner": "sierranutkevitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070030030830181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-02-27T23:57:40", "owner": "ian.magorii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941133345968790, "text": "did you just break up a layer of gel?", "created_at": "2025-02-25T22:49:40", "owner": "sprunkcan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956303718868816, "text": "Uncircumcised teapot", "created_at": "2025-02-22T22:20:39", "owner": "billpepsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056147668956090, "text": "@ambgianna", "created_at": "2025-01-16T14:56:45", "owner": "jamesmdv_585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075535516720576, "text": "@niveda_mary", "created_at": "2024-12-17T05:20:00", "owner": "vasxdev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852703024345992, "text": "If it works, it ...", "created_at": "2024-12-11T22:26:16", "owner": "howaboutnoname", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070193989659534, "text": "Looks like the skin on a wedge of brie ew", "created_at": "2024-12-11T15:40:00", "owner": "amyy801", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064461931814075, "text": "@larnbutler", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:00:27", "owner": "histephaniie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030484397409989, "text": "Just need to make a new cup that’s bigger", "created_at": "2024-12-11T09:22:01", "owner": "kina_kiteboarder", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18045104987146387, "text": "@adamspencer_ your next project", "created_at": "2024-12-11T07:08:22", "owner": "uncle_liiam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066970552707938, "text": "You’re not supposed to heat ceramic tea pots on the stove top 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-10T23:55:47", "owner": "worthyaps", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18120396412409441, "text": "Can you use ceramic tea pot on the stove? I know you can use it in the oven and microwave but I thought the stove will cause it to crack/break because of the uneven temperature disbursement but was that a lie?", "created_at": "2024-12-10T16:00:25", "owner": "chisa.charlie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030463349432985, "text": "The teapot on the stove gave me so much anxiety lmfao😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T21:30:01", "owner": "the.scoutmaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858754360315667, "text": "@siljadorable @monjaaasie 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T13:00:57", "owner": "phoenixdrachen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025846451275304, "text": "Not bad. It got most of the liquid in the cup", "created_at": "2024-12-08T04:21:28", "owner": "fartbox_tickler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18457721881066834, "text": "Account name???", "created_at": "2024-12-08T00:49:02", "owner": "leavemialonellc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071872216568332, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-07T11:51:26", "owner": "000_frank_000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068857750676700, "text": "Ha!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-07T05:54:02", "owner": "bonniebrushwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144211531356851, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T23:18:35", "owner": "sabrinao9387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890382178110094, "text": "Bro poisoning himself💀", "created_at": "2024-12-06T22:05:24", "owner": "_julian2710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957569421840496, "text": "Need a bigger cup 👏👏😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T20:02:31", "owner": "birgittesnejbjerg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073208812618055, "text": "Uhm... I don't think the kettle spout is big enough for that cup 🫤", "created_at": "2024-12-06T18:20:12", "owner": "mattyice2249", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064763200750380, "text": "@lena_gthr", "created_at": "2024-12-06T13:14:44", "owner": "lucie.gomard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042233815996623, "text": "@lauramead_3 me 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T11:57:37", "owner": "dana.garmendia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045739520130015, "text": "Why I’m laughing so hard when watch this 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T08:26:57", "owner": "abdillnu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887378902069622, "text": "Why is this comedy 4 hours long 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T07:02:40", "owner": "katie_kate_k_drop_symons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117408145416517, "text": "Thought it was a plant water jug 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T06:07:40", "owner": "fly_away_fay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017997662637679, "text": "Cup doesn’t match pot’s energy", "created_at": "2024-12-06T02:22:49", "owner": "bleb.it", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917094559013193, "text": "My kind of ceramics !", "created_at": "2024-12-06T00:20:15", "owner": "krystle_holnes_khg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376656631106391, "text": "Pours square also", "created_at": "2024-12-05T02:44:24", "owner": "cya.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862707919280089, "text": "The fucking song ahahaha", "created_at": "2024-12-04T20:04:06", "owner": "rynarpo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995487060713834, "text": "In the teapot world we call that a “perfect vessel”", "created_at": "2024-12-04T17:29:57", "owner": "t4t4t4t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052971037803316, "text": "Nah this is too funny", "created_at": "2024-12-04T15:06:40", "owner": "department1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027850418223071, "text": "Last scene is best ever", "created_at": "2024-12-04T14:20:36", "owner": "undong_1g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087662641518094, "text": "Kuss geht raus an Frau Kahnemann", "created_at": "2024-12-04T11:47:36", "owner": "carla.fshr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024092123542042, "text": "@oneill_erind this is erin", "created_at": "2024-12-04T06:34:24", "owner": "theoadms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025433417282855, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T05:55:11", "owner": "mr.lopez114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072006643716721, "text": "Pour into glass ❌\nPour directly into gullet ✅", "created_at": "2024-12-04T05:51:01", "owner": "fivefistedclover", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18084773449484546, "text": "Tu @v_tzn", "created_at": "2024-12-04T05:27:30", "owner": "__huachicol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470796361032852, "text": "Pour me a glass dawg 🥂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T04:56:08", "owner": "turtle_of_law", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105129262454106, "text": "This is my level of pottery", "created_at": "2024-12-04T04:54:48", "owner": "superstormnora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032148197597175, "text": "how the hell are you safely cooking this on a coil stove???", "created_at": "2024-12-04T01:57:53", "owner": "semperfideusadmortem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995544723561893, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T01:38:34", "owner": "holycarrotferretparrot_its", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192437620306640, "text": "@ambervoorhies.art  @aubrey_bolen3", "created_at": "2024-12-04T01:28:22", "owner": "morganlasyone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856136698324182, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T01:22:29", "owner": "vmonique444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047283296283880, "text": "Me if I was a teapot", "created_at": "2024-12-04T01:16:57", "owner": "regor.rm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022743233558340, "text": "I was literally about to comment “hey if it works it works” and then the pour happened", "created_at": "2024-12-04T00:14:47", "owner": "kathleenfowkes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025722281530747, "text": "I mean…I didn’t see any leaks", "created_at": "2024-12-03T23:58:33", "owner": "sylveons.ashes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039731306220752, "text": "Gotta make some matching teacups to go with ur teapot", "created_at": "2024-12-03T21:22:51", "owner": "naeberriesss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088840900520148, "text": "That really pissed me off", "created_at": "2024-12-03T20:58:32", "owner": "clayeberhardt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992904132584959, "text": "Who put the tea bag in the teapot 🤨", "created_at": "2024-12-03T20:48:58", "owner": "limonpeperstepers7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992925672581705, "text": "It needs a special mug 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T20:09:32", "owner": "alex.pacurar.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045737968930748, "text": "Durp cup 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T19:52:44", "owner": "jhian.co.nz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108873790445775, "text": "This hurts my pottery soul.", "created_at": "2024-12-03T19:19:09", "owner": "raven_stone9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051541769058108, "text": "@natatch0in", "created_at": "2024-12-03T19:02:16", "owner": "maxb.uw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925822089882957, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T18:41:13", "owner": "juliafeike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045136751175810, "text": "Can’t wait to make one 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:59:39", "owner": "heather_in_austin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040767842217119, "text": "@chayennesnackers @brendecho22 als we zouden gaan pottenbakken😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T16:48:29", "owner": "etnebsreteip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866764675259457, "text": "@irina_zinouchyk", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:49:00", "owner": "killitloveitleo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148473241349917, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:13:48", "owner": "1andreaszabados", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952136136885336, "text": "visuals 10/10 performance 2/10", "created_at": "2024-12-03T13:30:22", "owner": "carryberry00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032482247127695, "text": "honey that’s a watering can", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:52:11", "owner": "bncfrann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18473521960023816, "text": "@csimps_", "created_at": "2024-12-03T08:45:10", "owner": "denitzavidenov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127094749383120, "text": "At least they’ll get maximum flavor from that turbulent flow", "created_at": "2024-12-03T07:15:32", "owner": "social_contagi0n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024647483300930, "text": "I hope the hello is a reference too that girl sleeping and they pour water all over her face", "created_at": "2024-12-03T07:12:14", "owner": "q_f.henry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050750776995327, "text": "0 laminar flow whatsoever", "created_at": "2024-12-03T06:38:50", "owner": "sammythedarn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855958330327064, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-03T03:45:21", "owner": "cooncomenicholas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030141149164060, "text": "shiii keep it that way 🗣️🗣️🔥🔥🙏🙏", "created_at": "2024-12-03T03:41:55", "owner": "cdbbx5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046818341499059, "text": "i’m sure the glazing on that is safe to boil water in lol", "created_at": "2024-12-03T02:58:46", "owner": "hows.it.gowen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103937983414652, "text": "hell yeah", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:41:15", "owner": "pof0200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927001089989392, "text": "Glad we all had the same project", "created_at": "2024-12-02T23:59:45", "owner": "7ummusexual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284738551175316, "text": "Don't show this to Czech people", "created_at": "2024-12-02T23:24:45", "owner": "rejsekrejsek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984254598622567, "text": "it's water tight, what more could they ask for?", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:56:01", "owner": "velocity1310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073730326619695, "text": "@gayle_e 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:54:00", "owner": "audch66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887273041118492, "text": "I thought pot was made from lavash 💀", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:28:16", "owner": "danylo_dovban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034963553356126, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:36:53", "owner": "doryaaah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863815825274302, "text": "👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:09:49", "owner": "hahahawinny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996369021709504, "text": "Looks like you 3d printed it bro calibrate your machine🙏🙏", "created_at": "2024-12-02T19:34:46", "owner": "colour5h1f7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18452428381065547, "text": "Just get a bigger cup and call it art ✨", "created_at": "2024-12-02T19:18:10", "owner": "jillri_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870830167164272, "text": "Is.. is that a coiled teapot?", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:50:56", "owner": "cal.7944", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971452260802278, "text": "Shrek teapot", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:43:22", "owner": "nikita_veith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111360802438233, "text": "this video describes my fishing skills on point", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:25:29", "owner": "nick_james.16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083657431483126, "text": "10/10", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:07:01", "owner": "cotton10th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017577257373219, "text": "Next project: big ass mug! (Leaking on the bottom)", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:03:41", "owner": "jsf_bn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030602255598379, "text": "There was an attempt ✅️", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:14:08", "owner": "butt_kicker_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128066254386085, "text": "i have that same mug :)", "created_at": "2024-11-30T21:41:57", "owner": "gracsicle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019866392629627, "text": "hey you might not wanna glaze the inside of cups or pots it can come off when boiling stuff", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:58:21", "owner": "notyep.tcideneb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906933574063250, "text": "😂😂😂 и не такое бывает❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-28T12:16:01", "owner": "radostnayavsegda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011039738666021, "text": "When your mom makes you feel good by using the pottery you made as a 5 year old 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T07:09:23", "owner": "danielrotenberg_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041065976333138, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T03:08:41", "owner": "deliahhrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951985428854725, "text": "Tim burton looking teapot", "created_at": "2024-11-27T22:10:59", "owner": "pandr30u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954822564848963, "text": "the pour got me, the username sent me 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-27T11:25:01", "owner": "rizaldyaristyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035373596458613, "text": "You better stop dreaming", "created_at": "2024-11-27T09:40:36", "owner": "afiumer", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3459718366829209914, "shortcode": "DADY4Y1v-k6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DADY4Y1v-k6/", "taken_at": "2024-09-18T09:10:17", "caption": "#搞笑 高二七班创造神话", "owner_username": "lihuan0209", "owner_id": "67621357020", "likes": 144385, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0195_DADY4Y1v-k6\\DADY4Y1v-k6_20240918_091017.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18538382338038560, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:50:17", "owner": "en76.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851273053372775, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T03:06:48", "owner": "andy254oa_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025119071638469, "text": "我也想要瓜分學校財產🥹", "created_at": "2025-02-21T18:57:17", "owner": "wenrou_01.22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18493774918047487, "text": "我嘞个豆👏👏🔥牛逼👏👏😂", "created_at": "2025-02-21T17:48:09", "owner": "mingye_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930584874892112, "text": "高二七班高考過後全員大專", "created_at": "2025-02-10T07:54:16", "owner": "pingronwu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17955248522872899, "text": "鞭打成行", "created_at": "2025-02-09T07:49:43", "owner": "y.__._._.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054464576036876, "text": "高二七班，一個個都是人才", "created_at": "2025-02-08T09:22:57", "owner": "roc_migua1014", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045967301255417, "text": "『性別未知』", "created_at": "2025-02-07T15:50:40", "owner": "c.e.lion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945382242811761, "text": "『多性』", "created_at": "2025-02-07T15:50:27", "owner": "c.e.lion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352360219179365, "text": "七班不大，竟是神话", "created_at": "2025-02-02T11:53:05", "owner": "ciaomiss_korea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145579306367111, "text": "高二七班的人是人吗？", "created_at": "2025-02-01T13:16:17", "owner": "king.lam2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480227002023166, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-30T12:04:36", "owner": "hhps106022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483544240055454, "text": "第二首的BGM叫什麼", "created_at": "2025-01-30T07:53:54", "owner": "fun_z_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021106526388720, "text": "我勒個參雜外星生物班", "created_at": "2025-01-28T04:41:14", "owner": "leetenune", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974230512810352, "text": "高二六、八班和七班老師：「⋯？WTF 」", "created_at": "2025-01-25T09:14:36", "owner": "ettolrahcy_1108", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17954903153875670, "text": "貴校二年七班孩兒可謂人才輩出", "created_at": "2025-01-25T06:37:59", "owner": "xiaopai_tian1601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890898910168591, "text": "我們班有人叫高信", "created_at": "2025-01-24T04:15:18", "owner": "lee1101520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134992108377810, "text": "孩子你無敵了😂", "created_at": "2025-01-24T04:07:07", "owner": "uyt_277", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998950542723370, "text": "真「掙大錢」😂", "created_at": "2025-01-23T13:40:54", "owner": "ccx._.0818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108321424457797, "text": "便殭屍是什麼操作？", "created_at": "2025-01-22T09:51:05", "owner": "puyier26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114663964439462, "text": "老師：哈哈我教的👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-01-22T09:47:17", "owner": "haha._.621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049139255326396, "text": "第一個兩個是絕命毒師嗎？", "created_at": "2025-01-21T08:40:31", "owner": "isaacfong0407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900233266099670, "text": "高二七班卜高兴给我出来！ 校长：互丢硫酸是吧，叫你要家长过来我要跟他喝茶", "created_at": "2025-01-20T10:24:34", "owner": "lu.caskry0929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018449630454287, "text": "@rex33_7 互扔硫酸", "created_at": "2025-01-19T08:21:14", "owner": "yiachen_.0417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038229365376899, "text": "我國中的時候別班有人在教室玩乾燥劑實驗差點炸到老師，好像被記大過", "created_at": "2025-01-18T06:25:24", "owner": "aadaa6811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863999020318466, "text": "看得我小脑萎缩", "created_at": "2025-01-18T04:20:04", "owner": "tjy._10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18121044772418167, "text": "第一个应该不是开除吧。。。？是直接噶了...", "created_at": "2025-01-18T01:59:44", "owner": "ny119_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099598705494222, "text": "第三個女的是啥意思？", "created_at": "2025-01-17T15:55:26", "owner": "freaky_ahh_cornball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053576096043505, "text": "牛逼", "created_at": "2025-01-17T12:14:29", "owner": "wew11_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069293356777035, "text": "互扔硫酸之後會不會變互扔原子彈", "created_at": "2025-01-17T10:50:38", "owner": "i_luv_james1014", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055714429996015, "text": "易烊千璽😍", "created_at": "2025-01-13T14:34:37", "owner": "yhc._.0726", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059978275929476, "text": "高二七班，一半天才，一半人才", "created_at": "2025-01-12T15:19:18", "owner": "cajkdhre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357065848130794, "text": "只有焦給最正常", "created_at": "2025-01-12T00:33:38", "owner": "hanwanting99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082234252586015, "text": "真不愧是我們7班", "created_at": "2025-01-11T08:07:49", "owner": "_2yuhuc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068145931763591, "text": "@long._.827 ???", "created_at": "2025-01-10T08:04:35", "owner": "heee_ee1003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068555374765643, "text": "太勁了太勁了", "created_at": "2025-01-08T04:28:20", "owner": "hang._.shh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056275597821976, "text": "高二七班世界神话班", "created_at": "2025-01-07T13:14:50", "owner": "wushiunabnerabnerabner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057259597778796, "text": "高二七班，非同一般，一半入土，一半上香", "created_at": "2025-01-05T08:28:17", "owner": "you._.0509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036676967120542, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T13:54:45", "owner": "clc._.1014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046529729182831, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T07:23:33", "owner": "alvinching713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029043695243580, "text": "高27班已经和佛罗里达到差不多了...", "created_at": "2024-12-31T05:00:10", "owner": "xyennn0_310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048595861923090, "text": "高二七班 很不一般  手拿硫酸 腳踢鹽酸", "created_at": "2024-12-31T00:19:28", "owner": "zixuan_727", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862279864243988, "text": "😳🫡", "created_at": "2024-12-29T18:10:54", "owner": "darrenkwok_uwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028752128617289, "text": "我想知道有沒有原圖可以看", "created_at": "2024-12-28T13:54:32", "owner": "eleanor_ai.li.nuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076959388610213, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-28T07:54:05", "owner": "xiao___04___17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052723120999830, "text": "還好吧，我都在學校做軍火了o差點把學校炸了", "created_at": "2024-12-27T15:53:58", "owner": "desperdao0820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055119859822047, "text": "多性？？？", "created_at": "2024-12-27T12:10:43", "owner": "limyichin0917", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17845986984379657, "text": "我還丟含有硝酸甘油的混合物咧，只是聲音太大了，一下就被發現了", "created_at": "2024-12-26T23:50:09", "owner": "loli_cztg_vtuber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086064286550224, "text": "好歐為啥我是想到放學等我🤔", "created_at": "2024-12-25T00:06:04", "owner": "xiyue_1076", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861219865309372, "text": "@1d6jason", "created_at": "2024-12-24T13:13:52", "owner": "zhoukachun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051041777044279, "text": "這性都好有錢", "created_at": "2024-12-24T11:16:17", "owner": "05jui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096423184494315, "text": "能进高二七班的都不是普通人😂", "created_at": "2024-12-22T11:06:43", "owner": "cola.268", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17988157850612141, "text": "我班有高杏", "created_at": "2024-12-20T15:13:15", "owner": "liangchenruiliang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849181108361920, "text": "直接贴脸开大", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:54:54", "owner": "bell_.1227", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959898687844197, "text": "我現在正好是高二7班🤔", "created_at": "2024-12-15T07:56:45", "owner": "naixd1217", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18168685621316346, "text": "扔硫酸的也是牛逼", "created_at": "2024-12-14T11:41:23", "owner": "ming_yao123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18251593474286441, "text": "我7班（5年级）我们班运动会把校长拉去跳晚安大小姐😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-14T07:56:39", "owner": "_xiao.yu.ovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026303738272257, "text": "666", "created_at": "2024-12-14T05:26:36", "owner": "_8_.hzl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859973602312606, "text": "要怎麼加入組織？", "created_at": "2024-12-13T11:09:42", "owner": "rongmuy_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18029014814206183, "text": "@ivy2_0091121", "created_at": "2024-12-10T09:24:04", "owner": "yicheng9126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034943561587482, "text": "我死了", "created_at": "2024-12-08T15:04:00", "owner": "bji37837", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099199774469114, "text": "我不合理懷疑這是否真實😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T14:13:35", "owner": "james._.0212", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18030702104605106, "text": "七班神話", "created_at": "2024-12-08T05:19:07", "owner": "luohanyueluo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876047848215412, "text": "多性？", "created_at": "2024-12-08T05:12:08", "owner": "sea.is_blue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003961466692050, "text": "孩子，你無敵了", "created_at": "2024-12-08T00:16:43", "owner": "starcorgitv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057203656913110, "text": "化工的好朋友們對不起🧎", "created_at": "2024-12-07T15:59:08", "owner": "ynci.__.chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308509738204137, "text": "有一個是我做過的", "created_at": "2024-12-07T06:48:29", "owner": "xhjsbnhds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040420706216506, "text": "絕對不是真的", "created_at": "2024-12-07T06:47:26", "owner": "xhjsbnhds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951805023860976, "text": "神話", "created_at": "2024-12-07T06:47:22", "owner": "xhjsbnhds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017225195378364, "text": "看起來像我們班會做的事", "created_at": "2024-12-06T11:45:46", "owner": "s107144", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293431690236024, "text": "生化戰爭", "created_at": "2024-12-06T08:58:59", "owner": "sprint0327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911425294047714, "text": "@kang_.0624 @_p_i_g_e_n @zhangchenjie8 你們三個？！", "created_at": "2024-12-05T15:14:38", "owner": "jimmy._.0526", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069141562726053, "text": "蛤？？？？wtf", "created_at": "2024-12-05T14:40:44", "owner": "sim2010323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025184249567188, "text": "這有點猛🫠🫠", "created_at": "2024-12-05T13:54:24", "owner": "solune_12pm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061006951686798, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-05T09:41:40", "owner": "yan70254", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282765469175997, "text": "第一个暴击", "created_at": "2024-12-04T15:40:51", "owner": "khoowaikang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947166030874678, "text": "高二七班，絕不一半，互丟硫酸，一半入土，一半被關", "created_at": "2024-12-04T14:39:17", "owner": "joe_29___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007559417505460, "text": "@glad_shin 高興你高興嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-04T10:31:08", "owner": "xie__0610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083656867558479, "text": "七班不大，创造神话", "created_at": "2024-12-04T09:32:40", "owner": "fang_yuanhao", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18028515224208666, "text": "高二七班一出手,就知有没有😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T02:20:29", "owner": "jianyu1_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024915311286522, "text": "牛逼", "created_at": "2024-12-03T23:39:04", "owner": "wtx._.0913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042685724233509, "text": "多性是指？", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:25:11", "owner": "tomt_ao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064442797780120, "text": "牛", "created_at": "2024-12-03T13:05:05", "owner": "rr82.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015815936394925, "text": "我怎么在这儿都能看到星怒数学", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:33:49", "owner": "kwan.114514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067902139663345, "text": "牛逼", "created_at": "2024-12-02T14:00:38", "owner": "_yeyucheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320625325088715, "text": "第一個最好笑", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:22:46", "owner": "zzzz_3_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971250540808150, "text": "高二七班 不同一般 不是進專 就是被關", "created_at": "2024-11-30T14:33:11", "owner": "wu.ya__171", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039612143194251, "text": "我朋友叫高信", "created_at": "2024-11-30T10:25:49", "owner": "how__or", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853122148286685, "text": "撒旦：我怎麼成第3名了", "created_at": "2024-11-30T09:25:52", "owner": "chen_anxu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18459379666066744, "text": "中性⋯", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:52:51", "owner": "624._.nicole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045145195917075, "text": "是不是下次在實驗室引發核爆", "created_at": "2024-11-30T04:45:04", "owner": "dainewros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293607592229947, "text": "《逆天》", "created_at": "2024-11-30T01:51:43", "owner": "clown_owo123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913571677031188, "text": "都说了 不高兴", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:15:54", "owner": "icantsayanythings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968754681684256, "text": "用手扔硫酸？!", "created_at": "2024-11-29T12:28:32", "owner": "linyixuan.0510", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18452055091065921, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-28T22:28:07", "owner": "sij08_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922423228002832, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T15:03:55", "owner": "lunia_mydaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155168377329050, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T08:20:25", "owner": "yun155320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049502333048372, "text": "下次看到高二七班有人互丟氫氟酸我都不意外了（？", "created_at": "2024-11-28T01:38:39", "owner": "0821lina", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18043268884946360, "text": "那个什么“萝卜头”多性？", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:46:02", "owner": "06_cy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013478024452461, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:14:33", "owner": "w.jia0928", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["搞笑"]},
{"media_id": 3472695317793891548, "shortcode": "DAxff4ORGTc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAxff4ORGTc/", "taken_at": "2024-10-06T06:52:43", "caption": "WE, THE UNWILLING, LED BY THE UNQUALIFIED, TO KILL THE UNFORTUNATE, DIE FOR THE UNGRATEFUL. ☮️\n\nHelmet setup is farb on purpose lowkey just wanted to have fun with it. Normally they wouldn’t wear rifle oil in the bands (it was still done, i mean you saw just about anything in the helmet bands down to toy octopi) or have cigarette packs that big. The C-ration had a 4-pack, not 20-pack. \n\n#vietnamwar #1960s #militaria #military #militarywomen #larp #history #historical #militaryuniform #ww2", "owner_username": "offizieramira", "owner_id": "67410919789", "likes": 17408, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0196_DAxff4ORGTc\\DAxff4ORGTc_20241006_065243_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0196_DAxff4ORGTc\\DAxff4ORGTc_20241006_065243_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0196_DAxff4ORGTc\\DAxff4ORGTc_20241006_065243_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0196_DAxff4ORGTc\\DAxff4ORGTc_20241006_065243_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0196_DAxff4ORGTc\\DAxff4ORGTc_20241006_065243_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0196_DAxff4ORGTc\\DAxff4ORGTc_20241006_065243_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0196_DAxff4ORGTc\\DAxff4ORGTc_20241006_065243_7.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17940445955874091, "text": "Btw guys I don’t smoke. cigs just look cool so I buy them to have around", "created_at": "2024-10-06T07:52:43", "owner": "offizieramira", "likes": 216}, {"id": 18362521498115390, "text": "Can u guys tell I like the rolling Stones", "created_at": "2024-10-06T07:09:04", "owner": "offizieramira", "likes": 139}, {"id": 17909430528327905, "text": "I do smoke cigarettes.  Lol. Lucky strikes", "created_at": "2026-01-23T16:27:26", "owner": "arentgeorge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947492451935815, "text": "Big Red One", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:54:29", "owner": "waltercasalli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112509376554032, "text": "Man, Sarge! You look just like I feel!  xD", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:01:44", "owner": "destro7000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020037572549481, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-10T05:49:38", "owner": "raxmatulin1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077141294304660, "text": "Oh thank god you don't smoke.", "created_at": "2025-07-21T21:10:41", "owner": "packerfanss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935417470025051, "text": "Pero que BELLíSiMAS Fotografías Históricas :0", "created_at": "2025-07-13T18:38:59", "owner": "ishigod_20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035754863384737, "text": "Vintage everything but the cigarette pack, Marlboro used to have the inscription Vini Vidi Vici Latin for I came, I saw, I won.", "created_at": "2025-06-26T05:40:33", "owner": "hkusp.johns9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871204855259474, "text": "I'm who called MARLBORO lover +this your photo a lot of more 😍", "created_at": "2025-05-12T22:32:44", "owner": "satarpetiteprince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122803357451088, "text": "I have an OG FLACK ,DEUCE GEAR & HELMET IF YOU WANG TO BORROW IT FOR A POST😅", "created_at": "2025-05-11T17:15:48", "owner": "lance_ybarra_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032909207356854, "text": "Have you watched SAS Rogue Heroes?", "created_at": "2025-05-11T16:42:21", "owner": "s.o.s.mac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051165098591136, "text": "\"D¡e for the ungrateful\"... that hits hard", "created_at": "2025-05-11T12:51:47", "owner": "poncho_trooper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964435956885349, "text": "You’re such a cutie and a total turn on 😍😍", "created_at": "2025-03-24T14:13:52", "owner": "poorboy.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062926246952894, "text": "Im VERY  IMPRESSED  bravo SOLDIER", "created_at": "2025-03-18T03:20:25", "owner": "spacemansheldon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060064520314558, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-10T03:34:14", "owner": "jackmugen02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030424622292524, "text": "your larping game is next level", "created_at": "2025-02-11T21:13:53", "owner": "ej198438", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031760660630418, "text": "Missing a black Ace card🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-02-10T19:58:49", "owner": "wwkumaww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892454938159363, "text": "That's the Best Quote I've read in a Very Long Time.", "created_at": "2025-01-25T20:29:04", "owner": "chief_honcho9595", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912385485962105, "text": "Should be lucky strikes…", "created_at": "2025-01-07T14:24:00", "owner": "pilots_things_and_stuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071675977675966, "text": "Hallo, was hältst du von ss ⚡️⚡️", "created_at": "2025-01-07T07:50:52", "owner": "____gwidy____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067945180765929, "text": "Me love you long time Gi,beaucoup boom boom 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-06T21:54:14", "owner": "punkychuster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065495818827614, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-06T12:20:00", "owner": "ecomgav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18479913748010833, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-03T00:48:44", "owner": "valpanfn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066965698700240, "text": "Kornilov regiment uniform when?", "created_at": "2025-01-02T23:37:16", "owner": "iv26z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945903519793908, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-12-31T11:42:27", "owner": "drcesarv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038755823605884, "text": "Hey wasn't more like mosquito repellent on helmets sides ?", "created_at": "2024-12-31T01:30:56", "owner": "vaal.up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080856265573111, "text": "Why does the bush talk? Greetings from Spain", "created_at": "2024-12-26T14:14:32", "owner": "fabiomg_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472645744002489, "text": "She can fix me", "created_at": "2024-12-25T12:22:25", "owner": "htn.dodo23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046834087937879, "text": "Do you ever think in the midst of battle a soldier’s cigarette pack falls out and he tries to crawl to get it back but ends up dying in the pursuit of the cigarette pack? Cigarettes kill man", "created_at": "2024-12-23T15:40:57", "owner": "batman_4_ever.ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030635531573644, "text": "Doll", "created_at": "2024-12-22T10:10:38", "owner": "91nigel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874964473236111, "text": "Hei 🙌 where are u from 🫡", "created_at": "2024-12-22T01:52:32", "owner": "senolt95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048578918028203, "text": "Yoz and me are same souls😍😍😍 History", "created_at": "2024-12-19T16:02:01", "owner": "sinisa.che.culjak88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046812749115419, "text": "you don't have an m16a1 ?", "created_at": "2024-12-16T10:20:53", "owner": "theo.agl13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252918994276887, "text": "You're my new favourite psy-op, Can i send you unregistered firearms?", "created_at": "2024-12-13T00:07:58", "owner": "realfakerapper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18453679249067358, "text": "Do you play hoi 4 if yes smash", "created_at": "2024-12-11T23:26:04", "owner": "levinbensch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042771944228915, "text": "Nice try fed", "created_at": "2024-12-09T23:01:21", "owner": "thefallenjager", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161002585324158, "text": "As a fellow collector of war memorabilia I truly love seeing a person who keeps history alive.  Stay awesome", "created_at": "2024-12-07T06:15:24", "owner": "dakota8313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879210790194615, "text": "Hey I hope you feel better I do. I'll pray for you", "created_at": "2024-12-03T06:42:03", "owner": "jodaddy11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936445842827313, "text": "That 1000 yard stare is real in the second pic, all the autism is hitting at once", "created_at": "2024-11-30T02:10:39", "owner": "renewedpanic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928225113980944, "text": "Needs a pack of lucky strikes instead of Marlboro", "created_at": "2024-11-28T15:31:52", "owner": "jonlyter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056821027916257, "text": "SHOWDOWN @offizieramira VS @haylujan", "created_at": "2024-11-25T18:31:17", "owner": "lob0solitari0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922866990992623, "text": "1st ID, very cool. Tank Girl vibes.", "created_at": "2024-11-16T22:35:49", "owner": "shellshockoif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943506045912773, "text": "You're beautiful", "created_at": "2024-11-13T07:44:56", "owner": "thejakeditsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042192280905147, "text": "Sit on my face please", "created_at": "2024-10-31T04:57:56", "owner": "coolvibe224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929943336844220, "text": "Do you have any recommended sources for Vietnam era tiger stripe camo?", "created_at": "2024-10-27T18:23:29", "owner": "wjoostrope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900648514062789, "text": "Oh I have a request for you for camo. Personally it's one of my favorite camo patterns US chocolate chip six desert camo if you can 🙏", "created_at": "2024-10-25T15:23:02", "owner": "big_tone_1923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043608002503900, "text": "Guarentee this is gonna be on a random soundcloud song by a white kid", "created_at": "2024-10-24T22:26:46", "owner": "prolly.dre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18460414351032863, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-24T20:09:08", "owner": "alfie_roman_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058085740887097, "text": "Stop posing the GIs are waiting for you😂🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-23T09:36:48", "owner": "der_tauschmeister", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469620598027009, "text": "i neeeeeed to know about why that one soldier was carrying an octopus it’s literally eating me alive pls illuminate me", "created_at": "2024-10-22T14:23:19", "owner": "kar.ology", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018571013542226, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-22T09:02:51", "owner": "selanasko817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056205076862321, "text": "Back in Nam", "created_at": "2024-10-22T00:38:58", "owner": "jordan_mikkelson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023894468228284, "text": "Hell yeah be CIA like from CoD with pilot glasses (cant remember how exactly they looked)", "created_at": "2024-10-21T21:40:37", "owner": "martinmateev.bg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903623524061106, "text": "Where did you pull the quote from? It’s too good for it to be first time I’ve heard it", "created_at": "2024-10-21T20:31:16", "owner": "kyle11480", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071843638606377, "text": "she would not survive a day in a tunnel", "created_at": "2024-10-21T13:12:15", "owner": "safarij_o_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078919663532897, "text": "Wenn’s drauf an kommt liegt sie im Graben und heuelt", "created_at": "2024-10-20T15:01:53", "owner": "idrd_ur4zc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044473958061130, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-20T08:47:17", "owner": "sorrowsurrounded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868828399215866, "text": "Get this girl a burger 😭😭😭(love the content)", "created_at": "2024-10-20T04:59:08", "owner": "ironwhale64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843852490332776, "text": "... I saw costumes like that at the store but for only women 😢", "created_at": "2024-10-20T03:56:47", "owner": "jason_wy67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147066079338211, "text": "Just see the movie?", "created_at": "2024-10-20T03:06:03", "owner": "heretomakeyoumadlol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010125122434436, "text": "No Adepta Sororita???", "created_at": "2024-10-20T02:16:04", "owner": "carlos_avila_montes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048878206947892, "text": "Nice fit", "created_at": "2024-10-20T02:02:59", "owner": "no_che4944", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048854995810521, "text": "Fed", "created_at": "2024-10-19T21:46:15", "owner": "grabbergreen7tree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065940460714123, "text": "Them: I can fix her.  Me: She can fix me", "created_at": "2024-10-18T23:03:05", "owner": "reptar762", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082842766522137, "text": "Nice try diddy", "created_at": "2024-10-18T16:37:44", "owner": "ar_fox13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924103257975496, "text": "🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-18T15:54:43", "owner": "your_local_bolshevik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877509997173827, "text": "Dayum it reminds me of hotline Miami.....beard....", "created_at": "2024-10-18T04:33:53", "owner": "dopejohnson233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18254076094265341, "text": "Girl ain’t made for war yet fym", "created_at": "2024-10-18T01:04:28", "owner": "thehellmakerrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919800534989216, "text": "At least we gonna have chicks in ww3😕", "created_at": "2024-10-16T12:29:02", "owner": "m.mahdi.t0152021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280028470173595, "text": "love the 1ID. whenever i see anything big red 1 related it takes me back to my childhood", "created_at": "2024-10-16T07:25:48", "owner": "archiee.brownn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285659191229168, "text": "Please tell me more about Sea Organization uniforms:\nhttps://www.scribd.com/document/387919889/Sea-Organization-Uniform-Series-Flag-Orders", "created_at": "2024-10-15T17:59:45", "owner": "seaorganization", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009278963443746, "text": "obsessed !!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-15T01:22:04", "owner": "11heartsu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18251570302281891, "text": "finding good webbing is both annoying and expensive, good luck on the hunt & share where you got yours when you do!", "created_at": "2024-10-14T23:40:55", "owner": "mel0drama.queen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18337727800177405, "text": "😎👍🏻💯", "created_at": "2024-10-14T15:43:03", "owner": "c_peine4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046488427953106, "text": "Śmierć wrogą ojczyzny!", "created_at": "2024-10-14T10:20:54", "owner": "danielosmsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095556190473784, "text": "Hey! Made you some fan art! But it won't let me DM it to you unless your follow me back.", "created_at": "2024-10-14T00:49:51", "owner": "vampzdj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18374803672111184, "text": "If you ever need help looking for anything for a uniform let me know....If i don't have it im sure i know someone who does! Would be glad to help!", "created_at": "2024-10-13T16:17:34", "owner": "reggi_ebobeggie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999394494689647, "text": "Bro got the slenderman build 🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-13T09:04:25", "owner": "_requis07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879394699153678, "text": "Can you do jeffrey epstein", "created_at": "2024-10-13T08:53:52", "owner": "elias.shishi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043695512040457, "text": "Great movie", "created_at": "2024-10-13T03:09:21", "owner": "cra4war", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852906259296899, "text": "Big red 🔥🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-13T02:34:06", "owner": "dhealey23_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077515693499528, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-13T02:23:40", "owner": "gus_1346", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100373872406776, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-13T01:56:49", "owner": "demian.rod", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034040612194213, "text": "Slide 3 is a album cover for sure", "created_at": "2024-10-12T21:29:54", "owner": "paladin_howell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098438800415250, "text": "I'd let her annex me any time", "created_at": "2024-10-12T19:08:18", "owner": "boukeffaadonis_dody", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901669518973654, "text": "🔥🖤", "created_at": "2024-10-12T18:53:26", "owner": "trance_and_acid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989903415569104, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-12T17:22:13", "owner": "henry_franklin6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061192417683334, "text": "Rhodesian bush Larp, when? 🤝🏼😮‍💨", "created_at": "2024-10-12T14:50:49", "owner": "conor.1979", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18464234998041098, "text": "You are looking absolutely gorgeous like a German goddess 😍 I can be your Japanese gf 😂😂 if you get what I mean. (((Joking)))", "created_at": "2024-10-12T12:36:37", "owner": "nikolwaizryt", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17870763579202131, "text": "Im not jealous, i have flight suit 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-12T10:07:39", "owner": "ruben_sonic_ledot29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18249226447256121, "text": "Swap out that foliage band, you can use 80s ones just cut the cat eyes off.", "created_at": "2024-10-12T04:21:23", "owner": "riverinereenacted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043058155893071, "text": "THE TREES, THEYRE SPEAKING VIETNAMESE", "created_at": "2024-10-12T03:52:23", "owner": "brandon_tn_kid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18156418813324900, "text": "Peak human civilization", "created_at": "2024-10-12T01:26:35", "owner": "shane51003", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065929612723632, "text": "Bros gotta tactical samurai sword by the bed lmao", "created_at": "2024-10-11T23:12:50", "owner": "abraham.x59", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949823088747400, "text": "Fed", "created_at": "2024-10-11T20:45:52", "owner": "harry_899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054894373718778, "text": "GOOOOOD MORNING VIETNAAAAMMMMM", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:45:11", "owner": "berenic_e_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039158168148444, "text": "Dam I wish my dress uniform looked that good", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:41:00", "owner": "boinetpro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18329038780197863, "text": "Don't you afraid to pull attention with red pack in your head?", "created_at": "2024-10-11T14:42:28", "owner": "lawyerglebbredikhin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18463395370019888, "text": "A really good piece to compliment this would be the M-1956 Load-Carrying Equipment. It started to see use in the mid 50s before being replaced by the ALICE gear in the 1970s.", "created_at": "2024-10-11T13:28:45", "owner": "fiftiesman1950", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["vietnamwar", "1960s", "militaria", "military", "militarywomen", "larp", "history", "historical", "militaryuniform", "ww2"]},
{"media_id": 3477216031682531675, "shortcode": "DBBjY7HuxFb", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBBjY7HuxFb/", "taken_at": "2024-10-12T12:34:54", "caption": "We need to be equal in everything 💪🏻✨\n.\n.\n.\nSpeaker: Shauna Dewit \n.\n.\n➡️ 𝗙𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 𝘂𝘀 @ for daily motivation and womenempowerment content\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#instagram #reels #instagood #humor #joke #jokes #dadjokes #fun #funny #comedy #brussels #belgium #france #love #live #life #lifestyle #travel #happy #smile #vacation #foryou #me #girls #girl", "owner_username": "empoweredqueenss", "owner_id": "64526940276", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0197_DBBjY7HuxFb\\DBBjY7HuxFb_20241012_123454.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17956676919058453, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2026-01-20T17:59:08", "owner": "mou454007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102976585813357, "text": "I'd be scared too 😭🤣", "created_at": "2026-01-09T22:35:47", "owner": "kkeven_bernard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041076014265639, "text": "Pls be my wife 😭", "created_at": "2025-05-22T14:49:21", "owner": "cotnecotashvili044", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095742367551402, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-03T16:54:05", "owner": "boberga1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18011232095708380, "text": "NOT THE TONGUE 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-04-03T00:29:30", "owner": "bayonetea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057062702130725, "text": "I love this", "created_at": "2025-04-02T13:13:48", "owner": "luka_b7.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039713981203070, "text": "Ooo bro running 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-02T12:59:22", "owner": "m_rajput_1412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043971458136090, "text": "Yes, gender equality take ur shirt👕 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-31T04:18:47", "owner": "_k_a_n_i_s_h_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063729211971296, "text": "Hes taking you along", "created_at": "2025-03-30T18:31:21", "owner": "sarva.dubey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871993075334464, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-29T16:37:23", "owner": "pratham_20_25_