or it 🤷‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-03-09T10:26:28", "owner": "bcuzwhynot._.01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094465264479122, "text": "God I've lost count of how many times I've watched this😂", "created_at": "2025-03-09T08:34:47", "owner": "carrots_and_spices___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064491565758168, "text": "emma stone is that youu?? 😳", "created_at": "2025-03-09T03:41:02", "owner": "gerrxd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070749535848495, "text": "Gurll 💅", "created_at": "2025-03-09T03:01:20", "owner": "wwwwhttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108020170469802, "text": "Why my guy running🤨", "created_at": "2025-03-08T18:28:33", "owner": "daniel_is_brown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054299782906730, "text": "👏😂", "created_at": "2025-03-08T17:48:43", "owner": "yolo_1420_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082593886616387, "text": "Wait until that guy turns around", "created_at": "2025-03-08T15:08:12", "owner": "itzometh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005510780719399, "text": "The running one is gay", "created_at": "2025-03-08T13:03:36", "owner": "saroshtoppibaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100247140501684, "text": "😌❤", "created_at": "2025-03-08T10:59:07", "owner": "pragnaaaa_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133038700392508, "text": "Yo purush helpline no. 🤚😓", "created_at": "2025-03-08T08:57:35", "owner": "i_rushiii29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154566097358651, "text": "Why is my man running from her?", "created_at": "2025-03-08T07:23:09", "owner": "spardizza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918175750061743, "text": "A new hobby, I like it 👏😂", "created_at": "2025-03-08T05:33:15", "owner": "naithannatmutant_musikh_ofc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071854105660853, "text": "I wish women taught of me that way instead of screaming for help and running away😢", "created_at": "2025-03-08T04:53:28", "owner": "aydynmusclees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058563601865556, "text": "a funny woman, thats new", "created_at": "2025-03-08T03:39:06", "owner": "cleber.xx3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861434866362581, "text": "They are not afraid of you , they are afraid of the government", "created_at": "2025-03-08T03:26:40", "owner": "akinas_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963849861855528, "text": "That's real feminism 😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-08T02:34:22", "owner": "24_carat___neil_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996322053609230, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T18:12:31", "owner": "zenxaish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058299731084381, "text": "She pulled the reverse card", "created_at": "2025-03-07T17:49:52", "owner": "m.e.h.k.r.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18217099792292826, "text": "That french accent~", "created_at": "2025-03-07T15:08:43", "owner": "upstandings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897530446082863, "text": "Fais le la nuit", "created_at": "2025-03-07T15:08:37", "owner": "upstandings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006624689546034, "text": "YESSSS", "created_at": "2025-03-07T12:10:05", "owner": "paridhi__2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375022651143268, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T10:49:41", "owner": "not_pookie_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493714657049285, "text": "😝", "created_at": "2025-03-07T00:14:07", "owner": "rashdan_5u2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960336393760311, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-06T19:17:22", "owner": "hania_khan__0", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["instagram", "reels", "instagood", "humor", "joke", "jokes", "dadjokes", "fun", "funny", "comedy", "brussels", "belgium", "france", "love", "live", "life", "lifestyle", "travel", "happy", "smile", "vacation", "foryou", "me", "girls", "girl"]},
{"media_id": 3481499627540518115, "shortcode": "DBQxXcpNRTj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBQxXcpNRTj/", "taken_at": "2024-10-18T10:25:00", "caption": "一分钟讲明白，你的脸型适合什么焦段\n#拍照 #photo", "owner_username": "moss_xiaoguan", "owner_id": "10674769954", "likes": 63463, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0198_DBQxXcpNRTj\\DBQxXcpNRTj_20241018_102500.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18043456139034115, "text": "千萬別相信照片", "created_at": "2025-01-05T06:11:35", "owner": "ben232325", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087406078548922, "text": "其實概念很基本 但剪輯的很棒", "created_at": "2025-01-04T23:10:56", "owner": "shaotangyen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933513879973392, "text": "又长又方怎么拍呢😢", "created_at": "2025-01-04T16:06:37", "owner": "yinuokkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070965526736606, "text": "iphone 长焦zoom x2 会更好看", "created_at": "2025-01-03T16:19:27", "owner": "edmundlimkh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990454752772459, "text": "好喜歡這部剪片品質🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-02T04:35:24", "owner": "ryan.chu.94043", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980473428791448, "text": "你好帅啊😍😍老师我学习", "created_at": "2025-01-01T17:03:08", "owner": "7yang19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044925653184212, "text": "嗯 我是長臉肉臉 我不適合在鏡頭裡😭", "created_at": "2024-12-24T19:32:26", "owner": "peaceofcat_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952044015873109, "text": "人好看的話我覺得不管廣角還是長焦都很不錯欸，主要看拍什麼風格", "created_at": "2024-12-22T03:28:39", "owner": "dong740_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18350228626122978, "text": "Which jiao is normal eye?", "created_at": "2024-12-21T00:48:07", "owner": "jackl_2572", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086709598557399, "text": "看我刷到了谁 @iamswany.gif", "created_at": "2024-12-18T10:33:28", "owner": "katewu319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870428206253086, "text": "這是搬運還是本人帳號？", "created_at": "2024-12-16T23:48:00", "owner": "iianz.zx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874682776233497, "text": "我以前都不自信。。直到我发现了广角 🙈 真的不一样啊", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:48:41", "owner": "thejordanlong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093864475498958, "text": "有谁发现了封面😢🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-16T11:54:51", "owner": "cydneyyyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857166595331385, "text": "有些人在長焦好看\n有些人在廣角好看\n有些人長得不好看😢", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:28:05", "owner": "hero980430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477660943040865, "text": "大家不知道😂謝了乾貨", "created_at": "2024-12-15T02:56:22", "owner": "halojeann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050597150299003, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-14T16:33:00", "owner": "adaiaiai.810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080042188569537, "text": "這剪輯風格，讓我想起另一位健身博主", "created_at": "2024-12-14T15:38:56", "owner": "annyen_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054482203809404, "text": "超級有料🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-14T15:04:34", "owner": "woo_photo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889523077141048, "text": "懂了，就是放大和缩小呗", "created_at": "2024-12-14T09:35:51", "owner": "liweijiakaoerio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234290980303367, "text": "是距離問題。你把廣角拿到那麼遠拍裁出來也是跟長焦拍的長一樣", "created_at": "2024-12-11T06:13:11", "owner": "anjo9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163907542321748, "text": "我比较适合口焦", "created_at": "2024-12-11T03:55:22", "owner": "mjyc0330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099107770471167, "text": "刘星？？", "created_at": "2024-12-07T21:22:50", "owner": "rosasun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028683590596596, "text": "我長短焦都不好看，因為本體不好看", "created_at": "2024-12-05T14:08:18", "owner": "helloimbig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050882755953935, "text": "学到了", "created_at": "2024-12-05T04:56:34", "owner": "jun49948", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367616593116988, "text": "有料", "created_at": "2024-11-30T20:04:30", "owner": "zheng_nimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859729489295894, "text": "@anson_0w0", "created_at": "2024-11-27T05:52:10", "owner": "kyh23____", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071895643626395, "text": "塑普？", "created_at": "2024-11-24T17:33:40", "owner": "ohmygod_lucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152344291349510, "text": "廣角🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-18T06:37:17", "owner": "diver_yuer1223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027395846204590, "text": "嗯？？？？身材照是？？？", "created_at": "2024-11-18T04:23:59", "owner": "wangbinbinbin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057424960879773, "text": "学废了😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:00:49", "owner": "hellie121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978530736787730, "text": "棱角分明的宽脸\n还有救吗🫠", "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:42:01", "owner": "oldpeaceful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892543093029851, "text": "Wait 划到下一条才发现原来我不在小红书", "created_at": "2024-11-11T16:12:58", "owner": "rachenglj", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17876319834194166, "text": "賽里木湖～", "created_at": "2024-11-11T15:16:09", "owner": "lixiaoxi_ada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896727241070478, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:57:36", "owner": "teedoris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058466338837611, "text": "說明了眼睛才是最好的相機", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:58:29", "owner": "rru_1996", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17849275854338375, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-10T05:17:44", "owner": "yaj_npis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082585660543159, "text": "@jam_steak 為什麼在影片裡", "created_at": "2024-11-10T00:38:10", "owner": "_ncexd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033491087093083, "text": "@five_05_05 @keke_keke_ke 下次來試試看", "created_at": "2024-11-09T22:36:13", "owner": "zon_428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920976658003867, "text": "先撇開內容不談，這剪輯品質真棒", "created_at": "2024-11-09T15:04:59", "owner": "omo100food", "likes": 903}, {"id": 18057273445862123, "text": "瘦的臉長的真是太難了😭😂誰會沒事開三倍鏡", "created_at": "2024-11-09T00:21:54", "owner": "princess_hampter", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18041770751172597, "text": "👏精髓\n不過好難記起來😆", "created_at": "2024-11-08T17:13:48", "owner": "sofe_chiaomei51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045151853485705, "text": "哇，谢谢", "created_at": "2024-11-07T16:16:37", "owner": "danya.china", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281813005244468, "text": "@eugene_s.yj", "created_at": "2024-11-07T16:03:19", "owner": "teddy_tyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125371141389380, "text": "長得好像張一山（？", "created_at": "2024-11-07T12:34:56", "owner": "sun1977tf", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17923569158880362, "text": "要多看几次消化一下🫨", "created_at": "2024-11-05T21:52:55", "owner": "jeeyn21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914985681916708, "text": "我想问问…剪这个视频要花多久", "created_at": "2024-11-04T06:06:41", "owner": "ericyb_china", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18205383103294945, "text": "夏雨+易烊千玺", "created_at": "2024-11-04T05:35:27", "owner": "mr.jahgy", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18052275904916472, "text": "所有交段都不適合", "created_at": "2024-11-03T14:42:54", "owner": "milkting_3o3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936585075927453, "text": "我的臉型不適合出現在在鏡頭裡", "created_at": "2024-11-02T14:09:39", "owner": "misawa606p", "likes": 3240}, {"id": 18288832438232752, "text": "好受用", "created_at": "2024-11-02T06:32:21", "owner": "imethanlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037225277246329, "text": "焦對上了，她沒對上", "created_at": "2024-10-30T14:05:35", "owner": "hz9.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18257707282269572, "text": "看来是我怎样都不好看", "created_at": "2024-10-28T08:11:14", "owner": "youre_damn_ugly_but_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142419112345755, "text": "他是台灣人嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:56:17", "owner": "jungyu_pan", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17882077293075963, "text": "我的臉不適合拍照", "created_at": "2024-10-24T10:19:15", "owner": "zh.__w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122039038386252, "text": "一一也太可爱了！😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-22T10:59:24", "owner": "george_lxh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028568396144255, "text": "臉帥還是最重要的😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T02:53:11", "owner": "cmaxallen", "likes": 260}, {"id": 18023418356450306, "text": "很棒，總算看到有人提這個😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T00:29:48", "owner": "brucemars1981", "likes": 51}, {"id": 17944263038894621, "text": "謝謝老師講解🙇🏻‍♂️🙇🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-10-20T21:46:50", "owner": "kaho_wan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106896919437714, "text": "好乾貨🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-19T18:09:55", "owner": "dlioavze_2099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051042691756798, "text": "@zero_666", "created_at": "2024-10-19T18:02:26", "owner": "eli_kukuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031011239091765, "text": "謝謝解說❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:18:14", "owner": "twnwall0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964643667681337, "text": "好帥😍", "created_at": "2024-10-19T00:42:23", "owner": "wushaoyu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17911942412942704, "text": "简单一句，远拍显胖，近拍显瘦。跟焦段没关系", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:59:31", "owner": "vinciouswang", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["拍照", "photo"]},
{"media_id": 3482904553925079790, "shortcode": "DBVwz0TS3Lu", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBVwz0TS3Lu/", "taken_at": "2024-10-20T09:02:09", "caption": "英國吃火鍋｜在英國吃頓火鍋簡直貴瘋了！帶大家感受一下英國物價！\n\n#英國留學 #留學生的精神狀態 #留學生做飯 #火鍋", "owner_username": "baby_a_xiang", "owner_id": "64440614126", "likes": 1535, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0199_DBVwz0TS3Lu\\DBVwz0TS3Lu_20241020_090209.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18012071057663506, "text": "在中超卖的肥牛肥羊卷是真的贵😢我都是在玛莎买了牛肉冻起来然后自己切😢没想到来了英国连火锅都吃不起了", "created_at": "2024-12-10T10:51:34", "owner": "wanwanqqqqqqqq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18304667473204289, "text": "好便宜！！", "created_at": "2024-12-05T14:28:11", "owner": "may.rain_c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907715271962334, "text": "中国多好，物價平，住屋平，冬暖夏涼，又有知名国际學校，為什麼要出外買食中国東西又嫌貴", "created_at": "2024-11-17T15:02:01", "owner": "hcy_jessica", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17983176677774876, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:16:29", "owner": "zhanghf1122", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143771221348821, "text": "這不是hiyou嗎哈哈 我也都在這買火鍋料", "created_at": "2024-10-30T16:31:33", "owner": "kinda524", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909135232041223, "text": "原来你也在纽卡！", "created_at": "2024-10-29T23:38:56", "owner": "nicholass_koh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055461622810005, "text": "首先一堆應該沒去過英國超市的朋友先上網查，沒有肉片的。\n其次你住在哪裡？！這麼便宜曼城肉也要8磅誒", "created_at": "2024-10-29T19:21:03", "owner": "so0801yi", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18319865284085941, "text": "本地超市買肉很便宜 你偏要來中超😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-27T20:24:19", "owner": "justin_ylj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097001806462810, "text": "我火鍋底料用完了，前兩天還饞火鍋，我就奇思妙想泡了白茶的茶湯加油鹽，然後放#桂林辣椒醬  放 油醋汁，放檸檬汁🍋，放一根胡蘿蔔🥕放番茄🍅⋯⋯⋯ 很特別的酸湯火鍋，超好吃😋…. 吃完口裡有回甘哦，應該是因為茶湯，涮魚肉特別好吃😋", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:58:50", "owner": "cestcool02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890878108033335, "text": "誠意推薦#周君記  的火鍋底料，回國記得帶⋯⋯ 我煮麵也放它，超好吃", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:54:42", "owner": "cestcool02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009772433453607, "text": "比美国便宜好多", "created_at": "2024-10-22T11:43:23", "owner": "zimosenk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050101972944511, "text": "你去买进口食物当然贵啦", "created_at": "2024-10-21T19:33:15", "owner": "untilledprofessorhamasaki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18247472533274033, "text": "因為當地中國人有錢，所以就是割韭菜", "created_at": "2024-10-21T06:56:41", "owner": "hakakana1919", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079647895545135, "text": "这个在当地算是便宜的不得了了。😢最早来澳洲我也那么想的", "created_at": "2024-10-21T05:54:51", "owner": "johnzhiyuanliu1", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18281668834209984, "text": "总是在国外生活却叫当地人是外国人的坏习惯", "created_at": "2024-10-20T20:15:22", "owner": "park.kk101", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18045744323068682, "text": "买肉为什么不去本地超市？非要去中超呢？", "created_at": "2024-10-20T19:43:07", "owner": "malcolmlau18", "likes": 119}, {"id": 18026143196167434, "text": "不是体验职业吗 怎么跑来体验留学生了", "created_at": "2024-10-20T16:48:27", "owner": "vincenzo.yf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878574721169044, "text": "菜可以在本地超市買...", "created_at": "2024-10-20T10:22:07", "owner": "snyyyrbbb._", "likes": 121}, {"id": 17879402748167887, "text": "覺得貴可以不買啊", "created_at": "2024-10-20T10:13:07", "owner": "lmchinw", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18038782882973072, "text": "我在英國生活了一段時間，也在學生公寓工作過，中國學生是最富有的", "created_at": "2024-10-20T09:11:58", "owner": "wee_gracy", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18249413215283041, "text": "中国人在别人的国家说别人是外国人，真的有够噁心🤮", "created_at": "2024-10-22T04:46:05", "owner": "kategk13", "likes": 5}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["英國留學", "留學生的精神狀態", "留學生做飯", "火鍋"]},
{"media_id": 3474314789990072584, "shortcode": "DA3PuTPPoEI", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA3PuTPPoEI/", "taken_at": "2024-10-08T12:30:00", "caption": "Trust me this is exactly how i feel. 💀\n\n#b3d #blender #blender3d #3danimation #3dart #blendercommunity #3dartist #3dblender #3dillustration #isometricart #isometricdesign #illustrarch #cgiart", "owner_username": "viscous.realm", "owner_id": "30553459557", "likes": 204023, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0200_DA3PuTPPoEI\\DA3PuTPPoEI_20241008_123000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18018919826613152, "text": "Bro is the addon", "created_at": "2024-10-08T16:47:02", "owner": "aidinick", "likes": 5516}, {"id": 18048698858067520, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-04T13:26:07", "owner": "vadia.salsayahoo.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056909408157744, "text": "Program name: crazy diamond", "created_at": "2025-04-02T10:15:35", "owner": "ch.eeese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336559378080500, "text": "💀🗿", "created_at": "2025-03-28T15:13:38", "owner": "yuhger6a6y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051767056994738, "text": "🔥±", "created_at": "2025-03-28T11:00:51", "owner": "_.hevn._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042135332151094, "text": "Program name please????", "created_at": "2025-03-22T15:30:22", "owner": "onodera_punpun_2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924687999937453, "text": "for the animation line. is it path? or mezier? or something else?", "created_at": "2025-03-16T16:16:17", "owner": "ds.ton765", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854918011401453, "text": "What is the effect name ?", "created_at": "2025-03-16T11:23:54", "owner": "mohammad_the_k__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900025783114606, "text": "okay, but imagine a progaramist...", "created_at": "2025-03-12T20:57:32", "owner": "leohako25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061781644948540, "text": "How bro please send addon", "created_at": "2025-03-10T13:31:02", "owner": "nithinc636", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929262157009329, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-0