{"media_id": 3448527777916667862, "shortcode": "C_bob4wykfW", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_bob4wykfW/", "taken_at": "2024-09-02T22:36:48", "caption": "", "owner_username": "cs10113", "owner_id": "3102029741", "likes": 11510, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0202_C_bob4wykfW\\C_bob4wykfW_20240902_223648.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18032869961394534", "text": "我小時候就是這樣 寫完一項作業可以吃一顆牛奶糖  然後我就想著先累積起來 但最後還是沒有吃 就這樣一直循環一盒牛奶糖可以用好久", "created_at": "2025-01-05T11:41:28", "owner": "meow_meow._.cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18080563063605473", "text": "所以說上幅能要分次 然後每次達成目標都要課一把槍或刀", "created_at": "2024-12-26T21:21:19", "owner": "tmdg0330", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18024236183534898", "text": "意识的改变", "created_at": "2024-12-13T05:35:11", "owner": "tiantiang67", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18046061890914744", "text": "沒有內部動機就建立外部動機", "created_at": "2024-12-10T19:58:13", "owner": "ohawei2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18373587466116704", "text": "FGO(? @enigma1198", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:31:03", "owner": "zrlkj_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17902014042065745", "text": "我 game over 了", "created_at": "2024-11-27T15:36:13", "owner": "rabbitaaron", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18119520685394917", "text": "你各位什麼都不做也能得到獎勵", "created_at": "2024-10-27T15:07:34", "owner": "rxian_719", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18034539431256725", "text": "所以工作枯燥是因為我沒把看錢作為獎勵？", "created_at": "2024-10-26T16:16:21", "owner": "panda___kill", "likes": 25}, {"id": "18071270596550929", "text": "克制自己30分鐘不碰手機， 30分鐘後獎勵自己玩手機三個小時🎉", "created_at": "2024-10-25T11:10:00", "owner": "freemas_ngo.c", "likes": 87}, {"id": "18054970603874312", "text": "現在放棄的話就可以得到全部", "created_at": "2024-10-22T10:26:01", "owner": "star._x2", "likes": 4}, {"id": "18031848272078760", "text": "这博主叫什么名？", "created_at": "2024-10-22T03:32:33", "owner": "hawshing_0928", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18087565639498792", "text": "真的ㄟ", "created_at": "2024-10-10T07:55:45", "owner": "damn._.878787", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18061859098667699", "text": "成功減肥了一週，下週爆吃一頓犒賞自己🎉", "created_at": "2024-10-08T01:57:28", "owner": "guo__0227", "likes": 194}, {"id": "18039556466077978", "text": "沒錢😂", "created_at": "2024-09-12T12:14:08", "owner": "chujessica1101", "likes": 11}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3481975753305349913, "shortcode": "DBSdn_USd8Z", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBSdn_USd8Z/", "taken_at": "2024-10-19T02:15:15", "caption": "桃源未來知名企業家燙哥，世界未來五百強邁出的第一步，大家覺得要是融資能吸引多少有眼光投資商😂😂\n#桃源#燙哥#企業家#世界五百強#夢想#", "owner_username": "pangziliu888", "owner_id": "56981828546", "likes": 5108, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0203_DBSdn_USd8Z\\DBSdn_USd8Z_20241019_021515.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18075493315650106, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-25T13:51:42", "owner": "et3280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872844919264168, "text": "其實你可以去代言瘦身藥", "created_at": "2025-01-25T07:18:21", "owner": "andy780130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114828868436315, "text": "只有瘦肉", "created_at": "2025-01-24T13:51:18", "owner": "saomagic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962760453732302, "text": "😂 这就是西天", "created_at": "2025-01-24T01:37:44", "owner": "chef.jek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056569033972231, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-21T15:44:16", "owner": "seongtantan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843157528398038, "text": "叫嬰兒養都不會養成這樣吧", "created_at": "2025-01-19T14:16:59", "owner": "marthur0212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049716686473222, "text": "怎麼樣的", "created_at": "2025-01-11T16:34:05", "owner": "chenhuiing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041047340198026, "text": "🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-01-06T22:02:06", "owner": "yaniphan44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081777406603453, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-04T16:11:59", "owner": "guobochen820917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472090975047937, "text": "你和毛的养殖水平差不多", "created_at": "2025-01-04T15:38:26", "owner": "lizhuocheng197", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027200921292733, "text": "What some of yall look like on ozempic", "created_at": "2025-01-04T10:42:45", "owner": "m_goofed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066998878696510, "text": "好好的 二師兄  被你搞成了 排骨酥 了。", "created_at": "2024-12-29T16:32:17", "owner": "t225331", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105974611415116, "text": "這就是排骨的由來", "created_at": "2024-12-28T09:10:44", "owner": "liangshuang91", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030194171226713, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-12-25T10:17:44", "owner": "rahmanblackbird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044832538976715, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-12-21T01:23:38", "owner": "natalys_bro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066910393694507, "text": "正統北韓風", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:57:05", "owner": "ceng5556", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068778934667553, "text": "这个是生病了吧...好像有一种病就是这种的，它怎么也吃不胖", "created_at": "2024-12-16T02:14:24", "owner": "xintaohe22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052468993826365, "text": "這是養狗不是養豬😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T08:58:05", "owner": "overland4168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471468163054358, "text": "可以考慮轉行瘦身行業", "created_at": "2024-12-05T01:51:19", "owner": "da.xiong.167", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843283012371757, "text": "把猪养成狗👍", "created_at": "2024-12-03T12:42:44", "owner": "aiyo0wei7215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013740146647662, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:40:45", "owner": "junbui5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945870834911227, "text": "😂你应该开减肥班", "created_at": "2024-12-01T13:33:08", "owner": "rogersliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050934773059286, "text": "你这开健身房可以啊", "created_at": "2024-12-01T12:26:58", "owner": "ivanjunmun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028236500590082, "text": "你應該開個減肥中心", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:30:38", "owner": "a0983857817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052625986820945, "text": "笑死\n大家懂什麼\n買豬的\n哪個不是跟老闆說\n瘦ㄧ點好", "created_at": "2024-11-29T15:17:02", "owner": "jimmylucky0513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027946760452860, "text": "一個禮拜喂一次嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-29T12:52:53", "owner": "liao_xinrong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992696136734235, "text": "去攀枝花動物園學學", "created_at": "2024-11-29T09:16:06", "owner": "arnbbq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023794931301169, "text": "別養了拜託", "created_at": "2024-11-29T07:33:33", "owner": "animalia_topia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045186547915006, "text": "適合做減肥行業😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:13:19", "owner": "yuankundai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912571450029499, "text": "減肥最好代言🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:03:48", "owner": "kopkko.ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015882668398751, "text": "瘦肉原產地", "created_at": "2024-11-28T08:07:03", "owner": "bruceyc_7847", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470773567043656, "text": "@irvineho  瘦到好像Happy 叻😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T04:42:47", "owner": "tkel1y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037380701252456, "text": "天吶 什麼瘦成這樣", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:21:14", "owner": "ducati770", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865059655267319, "text": "原來老闆開的是減肥中心啊😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-26T10:23:05", "owner": "xin_yuting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051573388821394, "text": "你是不是把猪的口粮给吃了？", "created_at": "2024-11-24T12:03:40", "owner": "yeacon6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067406062668000, "text": "ทำไมหมูทุกตัวถึงผอม คุณให้อาหารมันอย่างไร?", "created_at": "2024-11-24T05:58:28", "owner": "porplengz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074310610615374, "text": "🤬🤬🤬 Знущання над тваринами.", "created_at": "2024-11-22T10:08:49", "owner": "vasilevasidorenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087276271522015, "text": "新品種😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T06:04:14", "owner": "danielwkyeung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046302545317620, "text": "AI?", "created_at": "2024-11-18T10:28:29", "owner": "fartyou.forever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054474442928206, "text": "沒看過那麼瘦的", "created_at": "2024-11-18T07:14:50", "owner": "sky313131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058393150869961, "text": "哥養的是模特", "created_at": "2024-11-18T05:23:41", "owner": "013dbx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016752227370741, "text": "一开始看以为养羊的😂", "created_at": "2024-11-17T09:22:20", "owner": "xin_long_ggx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987195348604205, "text": "這是減肥營吧", "created_at": "2024-11-17T04:36:28", "owner": "bomu2895", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097349641471515, "text": "只能產出肋條了", "created_at": "2024-11-15T12:44:20", "owner": "rick_sonchez_0303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014028479392038, "text": "排骨飼育大師😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T05:54:09", "owner": "hu.gh1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038853806266291, "text": "開寵物健身房比較適合😂", "created_at": "2024-11-08T11:16:57", "owner": "linbiyang", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18057511402885153, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:50:16", "owner": "george_rock_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361711126139260, "text": "單純生病食慾不振就會變這樣了😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T10:40:38", "owner": "fc_0_2_0_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153680113330002, "text": "這開瘦身班會成功喔", "created_at": "2024-11-06T09:09:08", "owner": "silver838111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059926570794935, "text": "老闆去開減肥班好了", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:08:37", "owner": "friends06480", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252342847280993, "text": "這是朝鮮品種嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-05T15:13:21", "owner": "calvianome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852315427322065, "text": "可以开减肥培训班了", "created_at": "2024-11-05T12:17:24", "owner": "celiadiaodiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948540639857151, "text": "瘦肉", "created_at": "2024-11-04T04:16:03", "owner": "hacker_wanfu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379995163097074, "text": "@carol_chienchien 吃不饱？", "created_at": "2024-11-03T13:50:06", "owner": "chris_xj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926177505963788, "text": "養出新品種", "created_at": "2024-11-03T13:29:54", "owner": "_still__stan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247887469277838, "text": "都生病了…", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:43:54", "owner": "taichi_186.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015303308366926, "text": "Veelste mager voor een varken", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:03:33", "owner": "vandermeermarjan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853888174303947, "text": "靠 在虐待動物嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-02T21:23:08", "owner": "9rofy3gopwa4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886838101133567, "text": "瘦肉精嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-02T08:30:31", "owner": "bolee8549", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013134647403055, "text": "主打瘦排骨", "created_at": "2024-11-01T23:41:41", "owner": "littleprince.planet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333578800179408, "text": "體脂率沒超標厚", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:45:31", "owner": "mimicry_area", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036187175265297, "text": "兄弟你瘦了", "created_at": "2024-10-30T09:34:32", "owner": "xiexianshengxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107305777429038, "text": "軍事化精實管理🎉", "created_at": "2024-10-30T05:56:59", "owner": "youaretim123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203851075292560, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T05:09:38", "owner": "usxvip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991585248719941, "text": "想大赚又不想下本", "created_at": "2024-10-28T11:18:35", "owner": "ren_in_148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024586115439974, "text": "这样的瘦肉才好吃", "created_at": "2024-10-28T02:26:20", "owner": "woshichin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462033679029793, "text": "Not funny", "created_at": "2024-10-27T17:13:48", "owner": "hawa_palestine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970489365661885, "text": "@chloechanhy 國皇現況", "created_at": "2024-10-25T09:09:50", "owner": "thomasli_20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044924108086567, "text": "😡😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2024-10-25T08:14:29", "owner": "shentianlongmei7472", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973793943788779, "text": "如果人們能夠看清背後的真相，那就沒什麼好笑的了。這是對動物的虐待和飢餓。", "created_at": "2024-10-25T04:33:08", "owner": "cindyleefm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118712788398155, "text": "now noticed what i meant", "created_at": "2024-10-24T21:28:56", "owner": "bye_bye_bye_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050393698943045, "text": "Stanno morendo di fame", "created_at": "2024-10-24T19:43:20", "owner": "fabriziofabryfabfaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069422068721069, "text": "Kurvára nem vicces😡", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:53:44", "owner": "jozsef.domjan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068596603619451, "text": "真希望我女友去你的養豬的地方這幾天，看能不能瘦點。", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:23:39", "owner": "zhang.pangzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957377904707979, "text": "把瘦肉精當飼料？", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:15:02", "owner": "leo.chen.585112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068287672568339, "text": "成員都沖了減肥套餐嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:07:37", "owner": "9bo_in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101902906459010, "text": "Majitele podříznout a hodit k nim", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:01:57", "owner": "ykoh66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011347091412788, "text": "狗？豬？.......", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:47:59", "owner": "a61560", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957619167707082, "text": "Que tristeza 😢 😪", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:30:45", "owner": "leonardo_espinozab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922468734882562, "text": "狗養的不錯啊！", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:44:47", "owner": "tang.zhenhui_yhkomii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925000350866853, "text": "二师兄减肥成功了", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:40:24", "owner": "cptan103", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971300445655789, "text": "Kasian kurus2 tidak di kasi makan yang cukup😌", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:12:09", "owner": "emi.8153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914208411918203, "text": "二師兄，您受苦了。", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:08:13", "owner": "leechaowangwang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18462767203048473, "text": "Ужасно свинья 🐖 голодний 😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔🆘🆘🆘🆘🙏🙏🙏🙏🐖🐖🐖🐖🐖", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:58:06", "owner": "nataliamakaser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086844892510093, "text": "是吃了太多瘦肉精嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:17:24", "owner": "chenxiulun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020925053626725, "text": "都背劍了", "created_at": "2024-10-24T12:35:33", "owner": "lin.chenghong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878281486170353, "text": "第一眼以为是狗", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:52:38", "owner": "ykl.ykl.100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989033790706839, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:38:34", "owner": "yushannails", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023572787451761, "text": "賣排骨的", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:31:40", "owner": "rhrh.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008110889481247, "text": "是Al狗嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:25:04", "owner": "mr.chenzhenyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009989051451574, "text": "標準瘦肉\n沒問題！", "created_at": "2024-10-24T11:03:00", "owner": "v033187335", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17910284112013370, "text": "我一看還以為是羊", "created_at": "2024-10-24T10:37:58", "owner": "motherkiller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185233219307520, "text": "還是只賣排骨", "created_at": "2024-10-24T10:03:59", "owner": "ling_pandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060512665772459, "text": "ขาดโปรตีนผอมแห้งเกิน", "created_at": "2024-10-24T10:02:50", "owner": "roamingonroamingoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067889248572373, "text": "健美中心比較適合", "created_at": "2024-10-24T08:00:34", "owner": "a0927260705", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18024421202230759, "text": "活著就開始風乾做臘肉了⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-10-24T07:56:12", "owner": "cheng.han.733", "likes": 207}, {"id": 17870187297212415, "text": "競速的嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-24T06:50:00", "owner": "lokwaikit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864690103246463, "text": "这分明就是排骨的利润高，黑商。", "created_at": "2024-10-24T06:20:13", "owner": "tanyoonkee", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17906302689042688, "text": "你還是去當減肥師好了⋯⋯😂", "created_at": "2024-10-24T06:18:15", "owner": "zhi_saing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044025461499491, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-10-24T06:16:54", "owner": "honghong8753", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["桃源", "燙哥", "企業家", "世界五百強", "夢想"]},
{"media_id": 3485516070025544647, "shortcode": "DBfCmYMycPH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBfCmYMycPH/", "taken_at": "2024-10-23T23:25:42", "caption": "Who did it the best?", "owner_username": "itsjmaine", "owner_id": "31229449", "likes": 713947, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0204_DBfCmYMycPH\\DBfCmYMycPH_20241023_232542.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18088832051040156, "text": "2007", "created_at": "2026-01-16T19:59:08", "owner": "landen_coelho88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936698184983436, "text": "Ting Things and Toni", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:58:54", "owner": "didi.perre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353488696153447, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-29T17:45:20", "owner": "nataliaa_widii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039316397215138, "text": "Avril 🔥", "created_at": "2025-04-02T03:25:56", "owner": "karminotabarrientos", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18108235042468305, "text": "1981!!!", "created_at": "2025-03-25T21:51:54", "owner": "instasantystories", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904556440128921, "text": "Avril ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-25T20:28:57", "owner": "hossameddin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853404034410002, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-03-24T17:55:35", "owner": "svetlyachok_live", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095494231551712, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:32:43", "owner": "abcdneyyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915532300084417, "text": "Ohhhh 😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-03-21T14:28:55", "owner": "goldenzpark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18270652201255719, "text": "The Ting Tings because they are the OG!", "created_at": "2025-03-16T20:08:28", "owner": "ksnussbaum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015572237691640, "text": "Alles gecovert 😉😉", "created_at": "2025-03-16T07:41:18", "owner": "millicioous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870454939333952, "text": "1981 hey Mickey then again I'm 52", "created_at": "2025-03-14T15:13:54", "owner": "johanns_diaz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17851308585375098, "text": "Avril", "created_at": "2025-03-07T06:17:04", "owner": "sol_seg89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870274726316802, "text": "Avril lavigne ❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-06T02:16:08", "owner": "mariimillanawel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060127693991873, "text": "Hey Mickey", "created_at": "2025-03-04T19:22:32", "owner": "italocgomez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002396771726672, "text": "The Offspring- Pretty fly", "created_at": "2025-03-04T09:30:43", "owner": "maxriyako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853486159355609, "text": "Total same voice 😉😎👍", "created_at": "2025-03-02T22:54:12", "owner": "tindeska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054270452123907, "text": "1981", "created_at": "2025-03-02T20:26:44", "owner": "bela_adormencida_edb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865488703258106, "text": "2008...", "created_at": "2025-03-01T23:57:25", "owner": "catarinadasilvaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347623021147455, "text": "Avril", "created_at": "2025-03-01T04:45:25", "owner": "rgamboam68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061954603780420, "text": "Pues es el mismo delivery, eso no es de nadie", "created_at": "2025-02-28T20:38:21", "owner": "yaneris707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891464452190383, "text": "Bueno 2024, 2007, y 1981", "created_at": "2025-02-28T18:02:55", "owner": "ag4700125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051489208953083, "text": "1981", "created_at": "2025-02-28T07:08:36", "owner": "itswaynebtw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930723994006588, "text": "1981", "created_at": "2025-02-27T15:35:06", "owner": "georgevellizca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048269435205879, "text": "Por esos suenan todas bien. Tienen la base muy pegajosa ❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-27T07:27:27", "owner": "chavarriaflor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067120897869926, "text": "Avril Lavigne", "created_at": "2025-02-26T20:04:56", "owner": "vouty2406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321248947167808, "text": "Toni Basil", "created_at": "2025-02-25T15:20:51", "owner": "la_haruchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492003853052084, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-02-25T15:04:57", "owner": "talhar12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176972314316541, "text": "Hey Mickey.....👍", "created_at": "2025-02-24T05:47:40", "owner": "lankerkham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057652319315679, "text": "Hey Mickey da Xuxa 😂", "created_at": "2025-02-23T23:26:43", "owner": "mimisaunier.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075812473673169, "text": "Why should I choose?", "created_at": "2025-02-23T19:45:38", "owner": "pavliuk_kateryna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866470471336367, "text": "The ting tings and Toni Basil 🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-23T06:55:49", "owner": "mati_ezek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889290364098592, "text": "Avril 🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-22T21:16:25", "owner": "eaudetisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867478483243173, "text": "2008! The ting tings", "created_at": "2025-02-22T14:19:25", "owner": "sabrinachauvelinrousier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058979894059761, "text": "1981", "created_at": "2025-02-22T02:33:14", "owner": "celeste_aravena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491953039014295, "text": "Avril Lavigne😍", "created_at": "2025-02-21T17:51:14", "owner": "phoenix_pgc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920957506046635, "text": "Toni Basil. ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-21T17:44:15", "owner": "walker_worldwide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056469320019477, "text": "Аврилка оф кос", "created_at": "2025-02-21T03:31:01", "owner": "ksewest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031325765306219, "text": "Ting Tings and Avril!!", "created_at": "2025-02-20T04:58:35", "owner": "bbymelii_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934220677002432, "text": "Difficult", "created_at": "2025-02-19T21:23:39", "owner": "rautenrausch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352981843178321, "text": "Avril 🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-18T02:05:16", "owner": "danielatke_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983320614804716, "text": "Avril!!!", "created_at": "2025-02-17T22:15:57", "owner": "charlottejenkslewis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394126777098393, "text": "Taylor and Avril 🫶", "created_at": "2025-02-17T19:08:16", "owner": "chernogorovaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990838149783928, "text": "I must admit that the Canadian queen Avril 8 this one up. 👑💖", "created_at": "2025-02-17T11:15:04", "owner": "angelogarciaofficialpage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071490469765805, "text": "Hey Mickey!!", "created_at": "2025-02-17T01:45:52", "owner": "rkal713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073560289740597, "text": "1981 👏👏👏 hey Mickey", "created_at": "2025-02-16T15:53:30", "owner": "milly_moranlabbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057799868098831, "text": "Avril lavigne", "created_at": "2025-02-16T14:55:39", "owner": "fedeartslove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959166930888588, "text": "Apt", "created_at": "2025-02-16T13:43:35", "owner": "gustavos_sg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045663767519497, "text": "Mickey 🙌", "created_at": "2025-02-16T12:14:52", "owner": "nicolodoni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032758508271900, "text": "Avril", "created_at": "2025-02-16T06:16:05", "owner": "inesaclement", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854825197384655, "text": "Avril Forever", "created_at": "2025-02-16T01:16:45", "owner": "abrilserdanalessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055150580043604, "text": "The Tings Tings ❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-16T01:14:58", "owner": "fernandafruggiero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129985591365132, "text": "Toni!!", "created_at": "2025-02-15T23:28:59", "owner": "zentezza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051230384124326, "text": "G STEFANY", "created_at": "2025-02-15T00:59:41", "owner": "1calcifer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076955380630142, "text": "Avril Lavigne 💔🥹", "created_at": "2025-02-14T02:27:25", "owner": "liana.lalosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048462707330496, "text": "Avril ✌🏻", "created_at": "2025-02-14T00:18:14", "owner": "djryanwalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975405537817875, "text": "Hey Mickey", "created_at": "2025-02-13T18:57:32", "owner": "lenna_energy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054708035080892, "text": "Toni Basil", "created_at": "2025-02-13T17:44:49", "owner": "littonsimon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067450441853581, "text": "Ting x 2", "created_at": "2025-02-13T03:05:35", "owner": "stuartyaleschwartz1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996981897750943, "text": 