"2025-02-11T06:06:50", "owner": "kristenelisabeth12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936040233990788, "text": "1981", "created_at": "2025-02-11T05:45:54", "owner": "charo_real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061302106938498, "text": "Micky and APT", "created_at": "2025-02-11T04:10:12", "owner": "boz17cs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942561816979200, "text": "You forgot the offspring come put and play", "created_at": "2025-02-11T03:16:38", "owner": "elykwilliams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912598210075984, "text": "that’s not my name", "created_at": "2025-02-11T00:24:20", "owner": "div2pickleball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050714755963726, "text": "Tie. APT AND Hey Mickey", "created_at": "2025-02-10T23:02:54", "owner": "the_odd_harley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026622671336904, "text": "Girlfriends", "created_at": "2025-02-10T21:39:06", "owner": "cherryhellspooky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080903515544753, "text": "1981 all the way!", "created_at": "2025-02-10T21:27:52", "owner": "sandramechis", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18001387607569880, "text": "MICKY!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-02-10T20:14:41", "owner": "jenjenmac381", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999786363580523, "text": "Совпадений минимум.", "created_at": "2025-02-10T19:21:08", "owner": "andreiav.av", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055262447045078, "text": "2007 baby", "created_at": "2025-02-10T12:29:38", "owner": "sirjegz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041172788587633, "text": "The ting tings", "created_at": "2025-02-10T11:28:50", "owner": "lorenzdetractor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084048358595911, "text": "Well the drums are similar but the Rose and Bruno sing is a straight rip off of the Mickey Melody. So lame. Write your own damn sings already.", "created_at": "2025-02-10T06:37:40", "owner": "michael_anton1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034579709240693, "text": "Ummm The Ting Tings!!!", "created_at": "2025-02-10T05:03:57", "owner": "lynnandadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079444663626381, "text": "Avril", "created_at": "2025-02-10T03:50:55", "owner": "jsslola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099079273443642, "text": "Tings + Mickey", "created_at": "2025-02-10T03:12:52", "owner": "martita.seas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291326692173931, "text": "1981", "created_at": "2025-02-10T02:39:33", "owner": "carole_krywenki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902746216099227, "text": "Resumindo tudo cópia da Talentosa Tony Basil 😍", "created_at": "2025-02-09T23:55:04", "owner": "nara03moraes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058834978966299, "text": "Mickey ❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-09T21:20:28", "owner": "black94blue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125308507410859, "text": "Hey mickey!", "created_at": "2025-02-09T05:21:38", "owner": "michele_bass_mills", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109102036462790, "text": "MICKEY", "created_at": "2025-02-09T04:03:50", "owner": "frigats68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164259310332311, "text": "1981!", "created_at": "2025-02-09T02:05:23", "owner": "_fabilicious22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18485229154059422, "text": "Avril", "created_at": "2025-02-09T00:07:16", "owner": "cirobran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039059996523393, "text": "That’s not my name!", "created_at": "2025-02-08T20:52:33", "owner": "flry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299116396229325, "text": "2007", "created_at": "2025-02-08T08:20:31", "owner": "vlct87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966964845721108, "text": "Avril Lavigne 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-08T06:09:14", "owner": "frenxin", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3485944200551456436, "shortcode": "DBgj8f0s960", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBgj8f0s960/", "taken_at": "2024-10-24T13:37:33", "caption": "Cricut maker 3 讓模型做的更輕鬆\nCricut Maker 3 Makes Model Making Easier\n\nCricut 已經在台灣上市!\n大家可以在這裡購買:\nhttps://lihi.cc/RZrIv\n\n關注 @cricut_tw 獲取最新的消息。\n\n #cricut #cricuttw #cricutmaker3", "owner_username": "mabroarch", "owner_id": "56315279492", "likes": 6125, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0205_DBgj8f0s960\\DBgj8f0s960_20241024_133733.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17869168284237183, "text": "而且這個很便宜", "created_at": "2024-11-15T15:59:52", "owner": "jerrychi1081030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976331061640421, "text": "割字機的進階版", "created_at": "2024-11-04T01:28:58", "owner": "fawkes1118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063086743743003, "text": "繪圖機:ㄋㄧ ㄏㄠ", "created_at": "2024-11-01T23:50:39", "owner": "churainsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017051324338392, "text": "@inwerhow_qt20", "created_at": "2024-10-31T15:45:22", "owner": "yan_owo0833", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125402077383359, "text": "ㄐㄐ？？", "created_at": "2024-10-31T08:27:19", "owner": "tcc_chin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047573948297731, "text": "請問我他媽是聽到雞雞嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-30T20:23:19", "owner": "8162jeff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901846069069539, "text": "料貴", "created_at": "2024-10-27T20:42:15", "owner": "frederic_chang_taiwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036084992195080, "text": "還是雷切雞最好用", "created_at": "2024-10-27T10:24:14", "owner": "nkgc6th_lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998038668524742, "text": "做建築模型，手切才是重點。以前學校是不準用機械做切割，因為老師要你知道當中的比例有沒有問題", "created_at": "2024-10-27T06:15:56", "owner": "jasperau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042493211108974, "text": "可以搜关键词“振动刀”，一台A1大小的大概几千人民币", "created_at": "2024-10-26T22:16:18", "owner": "yiqiao_wang0625", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046461172864923, "text": "這個很像瓦楞紙裁切機的小型版本", "created_at": "2024-10-26T21:05:53", "owner": "akira00150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015738017627146, "text": "@yulin429", "created_at": "2024-10-26T14:32:43", "owner": "adi4029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096576199465091, "text": "cricut我也看很久了 拿来自己做设计mockup真的方便 而且自己的小生意也可以拿来用", "created_at": "2024-10-26T08:32:25", "owner": "james_lee_1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071865016539027, "text": "其實沒有比較方便，你還是要在軟體上畫，那個難調到爆，因為我一台已經三年了😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T07:47:10", "owner": "ch11liu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926845479966698, "text": "比割字機更切的東西", "created_at": "2024-10-26T01:44:52", "owner": "vcnlem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060067186756495, "text": "@qi__0000", "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:40:42", "owner": "yh_.1118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013267049638126, "text": "我見有3種款式，如果想切硬卡紙，要那一個呢？", "created_at": "2024-10-25T06:15:25", "owner": "iissac43", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041162585139922, "text": "看這製作好療癒❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-25T06:01:28", "owner": "chongilala", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18142570900359376, "text": "一開始聽到 這個ㄐㄐ...我嚇一跳", "created_at": "2024-10-25T06:00:36", "owner": "ginrung", "likes": 116}, {"id": 18045969323073357, "text": "還是喜歡雷射可以切亞加力，但是一定要做好排氣", "created_at": "2024-10-25T03:08:03", "owner": "tommywhk1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021828131261349, "text": "這個服裝行業很早就有，但就算造樣辦的仍大台很多", "created_at": "2024-10-25T01:47:15", "owner": "calvinization", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055149688856858, "text": "大峽谷的等高線模型，是我們做用設備 + Rhinoscript 的，如果有建築模型製作的問題可以問我們。", "created_at": "2024-10-25T00:56:46", "owner": "lunglungdesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050484865787468, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2024-10-24T23:22:20", "owner": "wenhong8631", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051781930758147, "text": "Been using it for a decade.", "created_at": "2024-10-24T22:54:23", "owner": "danxus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038914363975882, "text": "@kwong.art", "created_at": "2024-10-24T21:40:44", "owner": "royinx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929400921846106, "text": "這個其實很慢要注意😂", "created_at": "2024-10-24T21:06:23", "owner": "yatiger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126451867347936, "text": "可惡，畢業後才出🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-24T20:22:12", "owner": "antibone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025282298398264, "text": "這台是以前在美國念平面設計和包裝設計同學的福音 不然要割好久", "created_at": "2024-10-24T17:00:43", "owner": "jasserendi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859570258269224, "text": "這是一種割字機嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-24T16:58:21", "owner": "nosnake_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045706672872871, "text": "我之前在美國就用台幫建築系男友切 但我覺得很多細節還是有點難用", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:05:30", "owner": "amber830622", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17862155964196383, "text": "請問這可以切薄木板嗎", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:56:37", "owner": "sherry.9213", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18020580404302918, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:54:14", "owner": "r.1126_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899666020071355, "text": "我超喜歡\n這很強\n之前真的差點下手買", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:17:56", "owner": "greg_sie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056242027890693, "text": "這可以切到多厚的板子", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:12:43", "owner": "liberal_wei", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17886476337108201, "text": "這個不就是ZUND的縮小版 不知道價格怎麼樣這樣買來就不用去studio做了", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:08:21", "owner": "don_tzf__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026697719386078, "text": "這台我知道！但是之前看到大多都是手作的運用！沒想過可以用在模型製作上！看起來是個不錯的提議", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:05:10", "owner": "dueto97", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18014091140352284, "text": "廢料回收管道不知道有沒有夠方便", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:52:40", "owner": "lupinjian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056481709847276, "text": "這個雞鷄", "created_at": "2024-10-24T18:16:47", "owner": "ivannewlive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904286934965277, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:57:10", "owner": "ty.pei_0423", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["cricut", "cricuttw", "cricutmaker3"]},
{"media_id": 3479222514205918652, "shortcode": "DBIrnFlyQW8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBIrnFlyQW8/", "taken_at": "2024-10-15T07:01:29", "caption": "真實\n🧊星座運勢 @stargoodfellas \n🧊每日梗圖 @seriesothetime \n\n#meme #迷因 #memeallthetime #開心 #有趣 #搞笑", "owner_username": "seriesothetime", "owner_id": "62588234384", "likes": 79581, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0206_DBIrnFlyQW8\\DBIrnFlyQW8_20241015_070129.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18076964749708992, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-04T15:26:57", "owner": "summer831987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881206840142593, "text": "😂😂😂😍", "created_at": "2025-02-21T17:05:36", "owner": "zcyfcc871125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965241444846581, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-20T10:33:08", "owner": "amy_080920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148336171363660, "text": "沙币 滚", "created_at": "2025-02-19T11:46:07", "owner": "leishao2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061234657787108, "text": "披着羊皮的狼。😂", "created_at": "2025-02-17T04:01:41", "owner": "lionel_instead_of_lion_nel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003041060725458, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-15T12:53:20", "owner": "aaron_chow1106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029717705621793, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-12T10:06:07", "owner": "zhangqinghui55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976206867816045, "text": "大量2⃣️道找🚗卸货", "created_at": "2025-02-08T13:23:22", "owner": "tosiefmughalkashmiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048664972975125, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-02T16:41:03", "owner": "guzx_m09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945613950941063, "text": "女生就是厲害，都有裝醉這招。。男生就不同了，男生是真要喝醉，😂", "created_at": "2025-02-01T03:18:45", "owner": "pop027397", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035705975417661, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T12:57:36", "owner": "tmc168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070165597782862, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T08:09:08", "owner": "jiangzhixiang65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996667305733280, "text": "超真實", "created_at": "2025-01-28T05:22:10", "owner": "siou_10.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007097435520015, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-23T22:15:42", "owner": "ocean_728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912642825965887, "text": "这位闺蜜太不识人间烟火🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-23T13:47:48", "owner": "topman.kong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054877655047478, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-01-19T06:17:40", "owner": "chan_er_ic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029537384249518, "text": "@7yxun__ 你最會", "created_at": "2025-01-12T10:42:07", "owner": "1129._.cathy_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043735697010124, "text": "@small_ray08", "created_at": "2025-01-05T11:29:20", "owner": "pv_.tch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032660366188564, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-03T09:13:20", "owner": "wendyhuho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011819828493376, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-23T15:44:38", "owner": "boyoyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061650598835287, "text": "Teach me what they are saying", "created_at": "2024-12-10T21:20:03", "owner": "ollieg1011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903992143079040, "text": "閨蜜：這是我先看上的可不能讓你截胡", "created_at": "2024-12-10T04:14:43", "owner": "hanbeiyin", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18041927816184199, "text": "太便宜", "created_at": "2024-11-27T12:55:37", "owner": "kabutno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928465716969863, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-27T01:50:34", "owner": "zhangkexin16888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291986812233719, "text": "@hate04285", "created_at": "2024-11-24T11:04:42", "owner": "rongyi.wang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905648769973768, "text": "叔控", "created_at": "2024-11-24T10:44:26", "owner": "lulubebe0905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949638900767908, "text": "@tangtang508 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:07:36", "owner": "tw.athena.wing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884101885157332, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T00:20:59", "owner": "yoze5920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876074746198160, "text": "人家董事 你不懂事", "created_at": "2024-11-18T13:34:56", "owner": "richyuu___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429731623078411, "text": "你姐妹有幾斤幾兩難道你不知道嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-17T14:15:16", "owner": "sarahreid295cow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983287917749466, "text": "揀都揀個靚仔啲啦😂", "created_at": "2024-11-16T16:13:33", "owner": "6666kuen66664", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054631954746232, "text": "公車女的本性是改不了的", "created_at": "2024-11-16T06:05:31", "owner": "hsieh6941", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146167753353399, "text": "佔便宜的是誰妳看不清楚是吧？", "created_at": "2024-11-14T00:38:56", "owner": "xuan.le.756", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982162311623397, "text": "兩百台汽機車在庫\n全省北中南皆有分店可以賞車\n歡迎介紹朋友買賣紅包1-3萬\n03-3337517 \n0930-692-225游s\n0966-596-322 蔡r\n0972-859-954王r\n0900-002-892鄭r", "created_at": "2024-11-12T09:39:50", "owner": "x62146214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058001971721421, "text": "她已找着冤大头了 你却那么不懂事", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:20:13", "owner": "chuiachui90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017526968620222, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:37:38", "owner": "season_sy1_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897417265094931, "text": "快給姐妹點些菜，看把姐妹餓的", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:33:48", "owner": "tom_h_e_a_t_h", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886526953109920, "text": "跟我一樣酒量不好🥴", "created_at": "2024-11-06T10:07:55", "owner": "odbo0808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075557821520473, "text": "這是真的，以前我們店的女同事都這樣", "created_at": "2024-11-06T08:15:09", "owner": "yuankundai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185508772307351, "text": "後面很可愛😆", "created_at": "2024-11-05T23:47:39", "owner": "catgift19345", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047717737858699, "text": "男：尼瑪我你姐夫", "created_at": "2024-11-05T15:09:30", "owner": "w4789623", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034440587071883, "text": "我勸你別多管閒事", "created_at": "2024-11-05T13:42:53", "owner": "way.so.7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18245271370272769, "text": "55555", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:54:36", "owner": "sithukder123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912015033935265, "text": "11月3日(日)\n方懷慧 恭念\n佛號  2小時\n阿彌陀佛🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T07:03:40", "owner": "huaihuifang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043925852024443, "text": "我就真的遇過這種白目的女生，弄的我跟女伴都很尷尬！", "created_at": "2024-11-02T16:09:52", "owner": "kuma121314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019823975315933, "text": "好不容找到白菜您怎便宜", "created_at": "2024-11-02T14:10:33", "owner": "mbchgchong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046566848078825, "text": "@hui_2508 @bao._.1211_", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:50:42", "owner": "mongou_0327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036609551024264, "text": "有点饥不择食🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-01T05:58:24", "owner": "sylviaudomsak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060295663805881, "text": "女的也真不挑", "created_at": "2024-10-31T21:11:59", "owner": "guangyanw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928729095957003, "text": "唉，都係喜歡這種熊樣的！", "created_at": "2024-10-31T18:03:56", "owner": "men_304752599", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041344355131452, "text": "好彩有你👈🏽👈🏽😇✨✨✨", "created_at": "2024-10-31T15:42:30", "owner": "datukiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18463930081062206, "text": "@yuka_077077 姊姊魚池少條魚😂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T14:58:01", "owner": "tinghuang125", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090571150444572, "text": "誰是獵物還不懂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T12:58:10", "owner": "hungvarick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344303326125935, "text": "既然沒有辦法抗拒 那就只好享受了", "created_at": "2024-10-31T10:38:40", "owner": "fengdilun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009407885469362, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-31T09:27:02", "owner": "s0921976899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107740702433388, "text": "男生在外要好好保護自己。", "created_at": "2024-10-31T08:35:21", "owner": "jimmy.wu.75685", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884354284146035, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-31T06:40:36", "owner": "shui.g.mei.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974678400792175, "text": "男孩子在外面一定要好好保護自己", "created_at": "2024-10-31T00:18:22", "owner": "lordwu007", "likes": 80}, {"id": 17941579334914118, "text": "女人比男人色\n原來是真的", "created_at": "2024-10-30T14:36:36", "owner": "noyomoyo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080753329542085, "text": "這姊妹不夠心有靈犀😁", "created_at": "2024-10-30T10:49:33", "owner": "jpinokay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112798870424632, "text": "獵物出現", "created_at": "2024-10-30T09:58:13", "owner": "nono_gc8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846226777339445, "text": "🐶咬🐀😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T19:55:48", "owner": "nijixi91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056617678700647, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T11:41:50", "owner": "niu5726", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024708197216238, "text": "不是⋯也挑個帥一點的吧⋯", "created_at": "2024-10-28T20:49:34", "owner": "jessie_0331", "likes": 34}, {"id": 17918477201902149, "text": "看自己要不要醉而已", "created_at": "2024-10-28T16:00:44", "owner": "hiphop990125", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041063063491135, "text": "裝醉討幹😂", "created_at": "2024-10-28T03:13:06", "owner": "yoraychen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901332501983997, "text": "這個又不是帥哥！妳閨蜜沒說錯哦～", "created_at": "2024-10-27T10:46:23", "owner": "s_ha_hie1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019743269314677, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T15:22:43", "owner": "alicelai8268a", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17847896079329107, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T05:06:33", "owner": "immskanitthax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043256483087193, "text": "其實是想要救男生🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:46:45", "owner": "f1235643", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847647733329355, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-25T08:52:35", "owner": "z_t21777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058125394836688, "text": "那個男的真會躲酒 拿起來又放下", "created_at": "2024-10-25T04:38:30", "owner": "kka12340089", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080437069556844, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-25T04:29:08", "owner": "_hannnnnn22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346101037135182, "text": "我：你那杯還要喝嗎 不喝我喝了", "created_at": "2024-10-24T10:00:36", "owner": "shuuhsl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060268564760332, "text": "🤣🤣🤣👍", "created_at": "2024-10-23T16:23:25", "owner": "zhengxing.zhong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18290262067231656, "text": "😂😂裝傻", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:05:44", "owner": "c23764120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063945961664072, "text": "@rulin.83", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:44:25", "owner": "_joey.9191_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983852073607850, "text": "可以選個帥一點的躺嘛", "created_at": "2024-10-23T05:58:42", "owner": "ml02ml02", "likes": 689}, {"id": 18064805059664156, "text": "@___ath208._", "created_at": "2024-10-22T22:49:06", "owner": "kawaiiiiii.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341829100125642, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:01:24", "owner": "s_l_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086399917504037, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:58:06", "owner": "juchi5188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034339127203442, "text": "裝", "created_at": "2024-10-22T11:22:53", "owner": "skyruby2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071771944610381, "text": "人家是董事，妳這閨蜜真不懂事", "created_at": "2024-10-22T06:38:06", "owner": "hardy_ccy", "likes": 3105}, {"id": 18032878652260264, "text": "搞不懂誰才是獵物😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T01:24:30", "owner": "eth.9419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036650828469594, "text": "長得像蕭亞軒", "created_at": "2024-10-21T22:11:10", "owner": "tommyxnomad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017595839541803, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T12:10:40", "owner": "jovie160", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050524255787717, "text": "真實是要拿煙🔥😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T02:50:23", "owner": "manhsu1966", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17945637071887482, "text": "這是釣到大膀才會這樣", "created_at": "2024-10-21T02:41:31", "owner": "rockchill_82411", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045524855074105, "text": "@kuku_weng 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T19:56:41", "owner": "bella115__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919317819988822, "text": "老娘還沒脫單 閨蜜也別想脫單🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-20T06:09:08", "owner": "so_so_0805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324815773157571, "text": "😂所以我都不跟女生喝 都超強", "created_at": "2024-10-19T17:16:07", "owner": "dennipan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025990769180149, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T01:15:01", "owner": "nani_xuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157435678320798, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-18T06:27:48", "owner": "0.8.6.0.5.0.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944549274893915, "text": "😍😍女生好美", "created_at": "2024-10-17T15:52:29", "owner": "kissbabybaby", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18151315411336192, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-17T12:37:26", "owner": "dukelove0928", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027795971377565, "text": "今晚戰袍上身了別害我不能秀！滾", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:51:17", "owner": "yaod_09", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18038700803279701, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:50:10", "owner": "hezhiwei726", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945637455857818, "text": "姐餓了", "created_at": "2024-10-17T09:20:41", "owner": "how815", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18279393454173475, "text": "喝醉是假 倒在你懷裡是真！", "created_at": "2024-10-17T07:05:52", "owner": "tor00213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033138995073638, "text": "結果男的才是姐妹", "created_at": "2024-10-17T05:13:43", "owner": "wayne0741", "likes": 168}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["meme", "迷因", "memeallthetime", "開心", "有趣", "搞笑"]},
{"media_id": 3479853947612827108, "shortcode": "DBK7LpxtA3k", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBK7LpxtA3k/", "taken_at": "2024-10-16T03:56:37", "caption": "我到底看了什麼\n\n更多迪士尼 @star___princess_ @lifeuuu.sweet\n\n#幹話 #語錄 #幹話語錄 #梗圖 #迷因 #迷因梗圖", "owner_username": "saysome.badbad", "owner_id": "54337959341", "likes": 183932, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0207_DBK7LpxtA3k\\DBK7LpxtA3k_20241016_035637.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086025112586207, "text": "就抽象", "created_at": "2025-02-22T13:05:43", "owner": "0611._.carat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073790071737700, "text": "我的眼睛不乾淨了", "created_at": "2025-02-17T16:45:21", "owner": "fy._____.1031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039355598525227, "text": "腦幹急轉彎", "created_at": "2025-02-16T14:35:49", "owner": "yizu.hong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031107560289338, "text": "學了三年動畫😂", "created_at": "2025-02-13T13:57:45", "owner": "hoshinoai_sunny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881823604232016, "text": "我覺得比原版好看", "created_at": "2025-02-13T12:05:10", "owner": "brain54870748", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039339560377444, "text": "制片师嗑药嗑太多了", "created_at": "2025-02-12T11:59:08", "owner": "rongxuanwei9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939067548844999, "text": "...不理解，但尊重🫣", "created_at": "2025-02-06T13:08:00", "owner": "1_lyj_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18488600899056125, "text": "我看了三…", "created_at": "2025-02-01T03:05:49", "owner": "love_you_katherine", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18021848462362086, "text": "@you_920713 好康", "created_at": "2025-01-15T21:44:13", "owner": "yen_sheng_hsiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081217816519381, "text": "這是中國版的腦筋急轉彎嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-19T14:52:40", "owner": "collaborationhumanbeings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051390320070269, "text": "演算法又讓我看到這個第二次了", "created_at": "2024-12-16T12:06:06", "owner": "lulubambi.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018981968375663, "text": "@oooooooll267 我服了", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:38:04", "owner": "wen_dong10.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086148310529953, "text": "吳子豪也是這樣", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:14:32", "owner": "wuuuu__12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079897609568161, "text": "????", "created_at": "2024-12-10T11:05:20", "owner": "banyan_1014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961931160830097, "text": "奇葩 今天滑太多幹片該睡了", "created_at": "2024-12-08T17:36:33", "owner": "lorain_.0415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967376403692406, "text": "我看了三小", "created_at": "2024-12-08T13:27:35", "owner": "xueyang0118", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18382858681098649, "text": "我們見證了了一個性騷擾飯的誕生", "created_at": "2024-12-08T03:17:59", "owner": "oliver._.0307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078392932602375, "text": "？", "created_at": "2024-12-06T14:45:49", "owner": "scarmouchiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047544494036292, "text": "@patrickl878787", "created_at": "2024-12-04T07:58:35", "owner": "william___52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954759525747242, "text": "WTF!", "created_at": "2024-12-01T13:02:39", "owner": "austin.1_1p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059965783882452, "text": "靠北這尛", "created_at": "2024-12-01T09:31:26", "owner": "hokma030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016271225396015, "text": "IQ-100", "created_at": "2024-11-28T10:09:20", "owner": "liljibabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051944878967006, "text": "我到底看了什麼😂😂我還關掉ig重新開欸", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:55:46", "owner": "shuangye8097", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927199260976907, "text": "這是正版的嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-27T10:16:08", "owner": "afff___oxo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18038413274217263, "text": "@minyu_lin 我快笑死", "created_at": "2024-11-24T03:30:25", "owner": "yutong_03.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042778796274642, "text": "@ac.__.05", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:09:20", "owner": "john.__.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913845033936800, "text": "@qisonglaotie", "created_at": "2024-11-20T09:44:42", "owner": "xinyi_ali_0123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038468900242704, "text": "放在原片你會看到小孩在發情", "created_at": "2024-11-17T05:56:24", "owner": "njfcx354", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376731748107598, "text": "3", "created_at": "2024-11-16T08:50:25", "owner": "clacidic_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115235845414158, "text": "到底是尛🙃", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:37:38", "owner": "_zry0411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074435122606528, "text": "@michellemwc", "created_at": "2024-11-12T07:01:03", "owner": "sav.van.nahmmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036652085213186, "text": "@qi_cai_12", "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:46:57", "owner": "an._.0426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884409538119073, "text": "…", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:07:14", "owner": "1_zyxxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057731707881298, "text": "在那部戏里的主角本来是女生，怎么突然变男生了？", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:50:46", "owner": "el___0302", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17854172514316324, "text": "抽像", "created_at": "2024-11-10T10:00:51", "owner": "terrence_ctk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897940558089307, "text": "直接變成限制級", "created_at": "2024-11-10T03:32:34", "owner": "fx._.will", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039973342983029, "text": "他太小了，哪來的性慾？", "created_at": "2024-11-08T12:29:43", "owner": "eotvhearnwatch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078323227562533, "text": "用下半身思考的男人", "created_at": "2024-11-06T17:01:09", "owner": "guoguanyi23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876728989192181, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T14:49:57", "owner": "tracychow67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869146222231297, "text": "6🙃", "created_at": "2024-11-06T13:12:16", "owner": "m2ay86._.cnw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119490505393549, "text": "我看了什麼", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:09:23", "owner": "daniel_1001224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380993647101735, "text": "喔幹我的眼睛", "created_at": "2024-11-03T07:15:10", "owner": "grace_naiad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033619598364892, "text": "剛學了三年動畫製作", "created_at": "2024-11-02T15:49:43", "owner": "brianchenbc", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18037638224188392, "text": "不是我們的錯，都怪是性欲惹得禍", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:35:45", "owner": "kkkk4788y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885524005136472, "text": "我该洗洗睡了", "created_at": "2024-11-02T01:36:37", "owner": "thisisnotemilyw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013735610378344, "text": "做了3年的動畫", "created_at": "2024-10-31T01:59:33", "owner": "1zyan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922525521883502, "text": "@jessica.0525_ 壞掉了😂", "created_at": "2024-10-28T12:10:33", "owner": "chin0730_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982061073758015, "text": "What did I even watch", "created_at": "2024-10-27T15:40:07", "owner": "redbeanignition", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316606114091524, "text": "三小", "created_at": "2024-10-27T13:08:42", "owner": "hahaa__0308", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075643120576068, "text": "看來皮克斯會來參考你的意見順便提告（誤", "created_at": "2024-10-26T19:41:20", "owner": "wangbryan_.30815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884842345112450, "text": "6", "created_at": "2024-10-26T16:21:54", "owner": "779.2.5.4.3.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068672503720324, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2024-10-25T11:53:36", "owner": "jason.tw8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968742612668884, "text": "@qoohoward 這是 @king_1.1.1.9", "created_at": "2024-10-25T10:48:07", "owner": "lu_cj_1126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037703963229171, "text": "@binmo_880625 我也被控制了", "created_at": "2024-10-25T06:36:39", "owner": "syou0618_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046870345990443, "text": "@_0.yunnn 有點愛上", "created_at": "2024-10-25T06:26:09", "owner": "kathy0913_1125", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18318758638083314, "text": "性欲並不是情緒，而是心理與生理現象", "created_at": "2024-10-25T05:53:45", "owner": "shouming_1026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126830440390886, "text": "對欸為什麼沒有性慾", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:08:24", "owner": "miluku0831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874640752190223, "text": "迪士尼＆皮克斯不排除提告", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:35:55", "owner": "xiaoyu._.0607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019783184532151, "text": "‘’腦筋轉太彎‘’", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:24:31", "owner": "liujueyi2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043226387499982, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-24T12:01:10", "owner": "yukinebf_1012_omo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046766248962558, "text": "@cindy_910527 還想看嗎", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:15:04", "owner": "aoieee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065378635748311, "text": "刷新我的三觀😂", "created_at": "20