{"id": 18041597362930748, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T10:12:38", "owner": "hongarui_9787", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036174677185969, "text": "i want moreeeee🔥🔥🙌❤️😍😢", "created_at": "2024-10-21T09:46:27", "owner": "coldwinter886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117015571406083, "text": "腦筋側彎", "created_at": "2024-10-21T09:09:00", "owner": "iiiii._.illliili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924661515969133, "text": "需要去打羽毛球", "created_at": "2024-10-21T08:55:47", "owner": "bbdpkpk777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18229483747303818, "text": "@xinner6 @s.r_kui @sk_hqwang @enqiiii0108 @agyn_ess @lyujie_55 @_xy.luve inside out3", "created_at": "2024-10-21T08:32:45", "owner": "xeeenenn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17982554402744328, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T08:16:16", "owner": "psalm23mira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059596138649611, "text": "@byacing626 嘿嘿😂", "created_at": "2024-10-21T06:23:46", "owner": "knazi_le", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132412081369628, "text": "1", "created_at": "2024-10-21T04:46:43", "owner": "google_._0803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315154621090645, "text": "?", "created_at": "2024-10-21T04:28:01", "owner": "lyl__219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846654487305247, "text": "三小哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-10-21T03:47:16", "owner": "ph.chiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026489825166939, "text": "傷腦筋轉彎", "created_at": "2024-10-21T03:29:01", "owner": "liu_xuan._.liu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847571089324853, "text": "@bokai319", "created_at": "2024-10-21T03:18:36", "owner": "boasing_030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940473729913359, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-21T00:12:35", "owner": "chu._.ouob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300905128201872, "text": "@考試的腦袋", "created_at": "2024-10-20T23:27:34", "owner": "w.t.l_1219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244339477277945, "text": "？三小這什麼鬼", "created_at": "2024-10-20T23:08:28", "owner": "yin._.72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035633051012187, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T22:43:09", "owner": "qazplmtgvy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895082980086677, "text": "原來我的性慾 \n就是被無數情緒給壓下來的", "created_at": "2024-10-20T19:59:37", "owner": "_cheng906", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18029370242123458, "text": "這也太好笑了吧", "created_at": "2024-10-20T14:24:56", "owner": "chenhao.608670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044491274292341, "text": "我睡不著了", "created_at": "2024-10-20T12:57:28", "owner": "jilll761122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079333672557507, "text": "陰*急轉彎", "created_at": "2024-10-20T12:36:04", "owner": "wuhow_0210", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17857490109276258, "text": "幹我到底看了什麼…", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:46:03", "owner": "zyz.ylyq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345697186131033, "text": "流量密码◉⁠‿⁠◉", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:39:47", "owner": "2222222human", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["幹話", "語錄", "幹話語錄", "梗圖", "迷因", "迷因梗圖"]},
{"media_id": 3463447586277038116, "shortcode": "DAQozrGOhgk", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAQozrGOhgk/", "taken_at": "2024-09-23T12:40:56", "caption": "Grow ENDLESS Supply of Mushrooms With This Honey Water Trick! #reels #instareels #growyourown #mushrooms #fungi #honey #mycology #diy #growfood #garden #mycelium #mushlove #foraging #nature #hobby #propagation #laboratory #secret #spores #wildmushrooms #mushroomhunting #unlimited #yield #lifehack #scienceexperiment #biology", "owner_username": "sporensprout", "owner_id": "5997889406", "likes": 40447, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0208_DAQozrGOhgk\\DAQozrGOhgk_20240923_124056.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17872399392417662, "text": "How weird I was just talking to my partner at work about growing mushrooms yesterday and now I’m seeing these videos. Very cool tho.", "created_at": "2026-01-17T17:24:22", "owner": "saucy_bytes559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172892305319819, "text": "There is a horrendous reference I could make but I won’t", "created_at": "2025-03-09T03:59:57", "owner": "rhiannon__008", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18097126303507052, "text": "Half of these words aren't real there's no way", "created_at": "2025-02-03T04:24:50", "owner": "pubertblud", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18071329600685056, "text": "Liquid culture is the best", "created_at": "2025-01-24T14:05:16", "owner": "sethisreallytall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075247864727020, "text": "New mycelium exile.", "created_at": "2025-01-22T08:09:47", "owner": "muertoroja", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071413246735069, "text": "The good type of mushrooms?", "created_at": "2025-01-06T19:25:18", "owner": "tkisse55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057104062942526, "text": "What is this, I'm really curious about what it is and what it does.", "created_at": "2025-01-05T20:03:41", "owner": "another_3rd_mf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046139314980997, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-03T06:17:06", "owner": "natureshoneybee888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870344041183851, "text": "How do you inoculate the mycelium? Where do you get the spores?", "created_at": "2024-12-29T15:25:14", "owner": "younggrit_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18365109724139871, "text": "@jeremyclarkson1 👀", "created_at": "2024-12-29T03:14:44", "owner": "bruh_land123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044651107976518, "text": "You got a sub", "created_at": "2024-12-18T19:45:31", "owner": "gaura.gaura.gaura", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17893356594107359, "text": "@knittedanus 😮", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:45:24", "owner": "yelgiuqkcinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040133504042113, "text": "So once it fills with mycelium, what do you do? Just dump it into the media?", "created_at": "2024-12-17T21:57:47", "owner": "deonb.2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18450047719069656, "text": "OK, so I had the ex-boyfriend who I know have a restraining order against long story. But I ended up with about eight of these jars in my refrigerator and they’ve been there since well. Almost a year. Of course I’ve moved them to the bottom shelf in the back of the refrigerator but what do I do with them now?", "created_at": "2024-12-17T03:09:58", "owner": "lil10blondie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18478639609063969, "text": "Do you offer a workshop", "created_at": "2024-12-12T19:08:38", "owner": "kittenbombz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025454651297901, "text": "I wonder if I can do this at home", "created_at": "2024-12-11T07:02:46", "owner": "krysteenabrockman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295828768231251, "text": "What happens if you just chug one of those jars", "created_at": "2024-12-11T04:17:55", "owner": "rosemaze1434", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289499305209349, "text": "How do you store your liquid culture, and how long is it viable?", "created_at": "2024-12-10T15:44:01", "owner": "mark.naude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065788417702045, "text": "You're not trying to make it Rhizomorphic ?", "created_at": "2024-12-09T10:17:34", "owner": "unemanondeplus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18451047718064591, "text": "I have done all of this as a hobby for years. But not for a culinary purpose 🧐", "created_at": "2024-12-09T10:00:02", "owner": "justindyba", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17970457688812771, "text": "Can I buy a syringe??", "created_at": "2024-12-09T05:28:54", "owner": "thelilwild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052044358953095, "text": "I watched literally nothing fall off that scraper in the the jar 😂🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-09T05:17:30", "owner": "ron.whisman.75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922510257897965, "text": "Would that work for lions mane?", "created_at": "2024-12-07T13:30:45", "owner": "indie.stays.home", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476796343059959, "text": "It will regenerate, but does that also make the genetics slightly weaker?", "created_at": "2024-12-06T16:05:46", "owner": "unryl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842761387377461, "text": "Now fart in it", "created_at": "2024-12-06T03:40:18", "owner": "b_shinsoku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048312707103121, "text": "agario", "created_at": "2024-12-04T00:03:43", "owner": "marten_v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859729588243261, "text": "What’s the tool called?", "created_at": "2024-12-01T11:48:39", "owner": "mycourbanfarm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17869012656251012, "text": "Havr you ever been inoculated", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:29:36", "owner": "bonk3rztheclown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009526022492429, "text": "I had a stainless steel spatula and never thought of using it to scrape the mycelium instead of cutting the Agar, I guess because it got too used to sectoring, nice tip", "created_at": "2024-11-29T05:30:32", "owner": "jonathangomez.c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862918129274047, "text": "At 10 ml it’s more like 80 syringes", "created_at": "2024-11-29T02:02:31", "owner": "shankskitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017529131355717, "text": "What was the honey water jars standing on at the end of the video with the content swirling the way it did?", "created_at": "2024-11-26T06:11:18", "owner": "mrmike.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068859277711283, "text": "I’m curious. What inspired this interest you have? It’s so cool to see people be this knowledgeable on things ❤️ you have a whole system to this!", "created_at": "2024-11-25T07:47:25", "owner": "fartsmellyicky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335689777147666, "text": "As a beekeeper. I’m very interested", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:31:26", "owner": "thenaturalnate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028774106413238, "text": "Careful the government is watching", "created_at": "2024-11-21T14:02:57", "owner": "sam_h2469", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18021274346545343, "text": "So just for some clarification without much work on my part.... so what you're doing rn gets you more liquid culture syringes, but you still need to use that liquid culture to actually grow them in the next steps?", "created_at": "2024-11-19T06:01:22", "owner": "stonie_malonie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18037120049058631, "text": "If you don't have expensive parafilm you can literally just use cling wrap. Use a PVC pipe cutter to cut it into rolls and it works great. Haven't had any issues, it's cheaper, readily available, and goes a long way", "created_at": "2024-11-18T20:58:06", "owner": "the.myco.channel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045749084323138, "text": "Why do you want mycelium? And why do you put it into syringes?", "created_at": "2024-11-18T09:49:19", "owner": "zom_bee_nature", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376951441097566, "text": "Does this work for any kind of mushroom?", "created_at": "2024-11-17T20:08:21", "owner": "bowserwafer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016625528633648, "text": "Mate you should really open those plates under a flame or a close environment", "created_at": "2024-11-17T16:47:23", "owner": "rorro_castillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010410080642847, "text": "I meant something similar.", "created_at": "2024-11-13T19:42:45", "owner": "edchong1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047205398098009, "text": "Isn’t this the fungus that can eat plastic?", "created_at": "2024-11-13T19:41:55", "owner": "edchong1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033912266462557, "text": "That looks like yeti mycelium", "created_at": "2024-11-13T13:32:04", "owner": "thebradleestones", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096162730473630, "text": "U know even tho the short vids r frustrating because it comes off as bait, it does a good job of hooking some into diving deeper into whatever topic u are seemingly baiting but it's insta there r rules regulations guidelines to the content we post.", "created_at": "2024-11-13T06:13:25", "owner": "half.android", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081972685543264, "text": "Hey do you have a video that teaches how to do all this from the very beginning? 🙏🙏🫶", "created_at": "2024-11-11T03:55:18", "owner": "ilikeyouweird", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038354120237183, "text": "@okesbusybees", "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:08:20", "owner": "oldkefeer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049367797964560, "text": "looks like cum", "created_at": "2024-11-08T14:18:16", "owner": "spageti.bagueti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895129771061359, "text": "Teach me the way o wise one!!! Lol", "created_at": "2024-11-07T23:07:05", "owner": "chris_topher9969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137927245363946, "text": "God damn I have never seen someone scrape agar that’s so cool hahaha", "created_at": "2024-11-03T03:32:51", "owner": "its.me.ojeez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948080211764274, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-02T15:30:37", "owner": "lea_foricher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025371539399612, "text": "Shitake?", "created_at": "2024-10-27T19:54:19", "owner": "trulslundholm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048143038979465, "text": "I loved making liquid cultures. I expands your production capacity on an exponential level. Great job all the way through. 🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-27T01:24:17", "owner": "ayebee465", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17886438930109386, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-24T00:50:36", "owner": "liamjames2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016536713333480, "text": "fire method", "created_at": "2024-10-22T05:25:01", "owner": "cwillschwab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315869749094641, "text": "I can't make my spores grow into mycelium 😢", "created_at": "2024-10-21T14:07:34", "owner": "poppyteapops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009532949447526, "text": "Should you tape the Petri dish all the way round like that? Doesn’t it make it anaerobic which can lead to nastier pathogenic microorganisms? I think 💭", "created_at": "2024-10-20T00:47:33", "owner": "mike_l_fox_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069019918624664, "text": "oooo you used the fancy plastic wrap", "created_at": "2024-10-19T05:31:02", "owner": "mardong_3leggedcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18271953907219837, "text": "How long do you let the magnetic stirrer mix it?", "created_at": "2024-10-18T23:27:44", "owner": "seca_llc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904570008960739, "text": "Why not popcorn? Takes like 2weeks to colonize. Just curious why you choose the honey water route", "created_at": "2024-10-17T19:36:55", "owner": "andrewblackshear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970103412654454, "text": "We don't touch the glass container for inoculation!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:35:14", "owner": "csordano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032191073365760, "text": "good tek bro you have it on lock", "created_at": "2024-10-16T01:48:36", "owner": "syzgyz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18422186188077897, "text": "This situation can get sticky if not managed adequately", "created_at": "2024-10-15T22:02:54", "owner": "ferrr.2vs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940575396875968, "text": "What mycelium are you usine ?", "created_at": "2024-10-15T20:51:30", "owner": "leo.dominiak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065896294723040, "text": "Whats the ratio of honey v water?", "created_at": "2024-10-15T03:54:09", "owner": "mk4shezza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030551612091797, "text": "Dab it", "created_at": "2024-10-13T04:26:09", "owner": "potland_tree_blazer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960158871698837, "text": "Isn't that the mushroom they were talking about in A Series Of Unfortunate Events???", "created_at": "2024-10-13T04:20:27", "owner": "_.yfndd._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935827953808370, "text": "Will honey water work with most mushrooms. Grain or dumg loverers? Trying to get into it", "created_at": "2024-10-12T05:43:19", "owner": "jo3y_is_9nutz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101416786453385, "text": "What tool is this?", "created_at": "2024-10-11T22:16:43", "owner": "covefungi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039145331115832, "text": "is this instead of a substrate??", "created_at": "2024-10-10T01:12:26", "owner": "beenantsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279469255175687, "text": "Mycelium dances with infinity", "created_at": "2024-10-09T23:08:07", "owner": "aumnescio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252348835256536, "text": "Why not use the mycelium from the honey water? Is it different from growing it on a plate", "created_at": "2024-10-09T20:47:54", "owner": "ednard____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041847809489764, "text": "@abdulmohsenhamadah MYCELIUM", "created_at": "2024-10-08T19:10:28", "owner": "abduq_bahman1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894493024079956, "text": "That is a nice hood. I’d go syringe biopsy to LC if I didn’t have a clean setup like yours.", "created_at": "2024-10-04T20:44:10", "owner": "kellenchase", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025402754154581, "text": "What’s that tool you’re using??", "created_at": "2024-10-04T17:30:13", "owner": "fernie_82", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867869989148074, "text": "Thank you for the awesome video 😎", "created_at": "2024-10-03T23:51:22", "owner": "demouslls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908398930019907, "text": "What kind of mycelium?", "created_at": "2024-10-03T07:30:45", "owner": "ralluez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881111071083784, "text": "What kind of mushrooms", "created_at": "2024-10-03T03:34:27", "owner": "n.y.y.x.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049564786754440, "text": "What's the honey/water ratio?", "created_at": "2024-10-02T19:43:39", "owner": "chefmvtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871944517189409, "text": "I love parafilm", "created_at": "2024-10-02T19:24:32", "owner": "soproenza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976438845781443, "text": "That magnetic spinner is legitimate", "created_at": "2024-10-02T19:19:33", "owner": "lortonsusan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019152857278241, "text": "You should look at Gspores", "created_at": "2024-10-02T00:24:24", "owner": "vinimackenzie014", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049264438928958, "text": "are they regular mushrooms or like the ones that let u speak to trees", "created_at": "2024-10-01T22:13:37", "owner": "c.note.tx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905582314021649, "text": "The way I would spread it in my Environment", "created_at": "2024-10-01T11:32:48", "owner": "der.pudel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972637434638882, "text": "What species spores is that honey water compatible for? is there a classification of species that prefer this method ?", "created_at": "2024-09-30T04:31:07", "owner": "gg_kabz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17975166554632797, "text": "Slurries 🙌❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-30T02:20:03", "owner": "clintwalker389", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899563054059113, "text": "Amazing you can avoid contamination with that much scraping", "created_at": "2024-09-29T23:25:13", "owner": "______buck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283989811232900, "text": "Bro knows the method", "created_at": "2024-09-29T21:42:08", "owner": "nicol_opez79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952602840727053, "text": "Maybe is just like that.. We are a scrap of mycelia fermenting in a really big bottle of alien stuff", "created_at": "2024-09-29T21:19:03", "owner": "nintendo_entertainment_system", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17954602616712836, "text": "I tell you, I know Agar, and that wasn't Agar. It was like something was wearing Agar. Like a suit. An Agar suit.", "created_at": "2024-09-29T04:34:15", "owner": "l.a.chargers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027152903458950, "text": "What kind of agar, and what kind of mushrooms were those?", "created_at": "2024-09-29T01:52:57", "owner": "smudgepot89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043029782045830, "text": "May I ask if one were to buy a liquid culture and then put that in honey water would it have the same effect? Seems quite visionary my friend thank you for sharing", "created_at": "2024-09-28T19:39:17", "owner": "blarhg", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18008215181654129, "text": "Mead with shrooms", "created_at": "2024-09-28T18:41:07", "owner": "retro_flower.child", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133987549364095, "text": "What kind of mushrooms do you make with that?", "created_at": "2024-09-28T15:13:50", "owner": "tijus_n", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17914516647005291, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2024-09-28T11:07:34", "owner": "alakija12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041706350108196, "text": "Is this the same agar used in colognes? If so how would you process these into a scent molecule", "created_at": "2024-09-28T02:02:47", "owner": "niceblueice04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106174366425890, "text": "Closest thing I've ever seen to an infinite food hack", "created_at": "2024-09-27T21:53:09", "owner": "xochihuetzal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036788734959095, "text": "I miss parafilm", "created_at": "2024-09-27T19:34:47", "owner": "jennpbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017357996542995, "text": "What are the jars sitting on? It appears that it's agitating the liquid culture.  Are you using individual  magnets for each jar?", "created_at": "2024-09-27T16:22:22", "owner": "chopstick007", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18037511927152096, "text": "What recipe do you use for you liquid cultures?", "created_at": "2024-09-27T14:22:54", "owner": "horialacatus01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18242880085276807, "text": "What does this all mean I'm vaguely interested", "created_at": "2024-09-27T11:34:26", "owner": "mentallystablecloud", "likes": 1404}, {"id": 18076968094483761, "text": "I don’t trust mycelium.", "created_at": "2024-09-27T09:39:57", "owner": "znowu.mam.ban.a", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["reels", "instareels", "growyourown", "mushrooms", "fungi", "honey", "mycology", "diy", "growfood", "garden", "mycelium", "mushlove", "foraging", "nature", "hobby", "propagation", "laboratory", "secret", "spores", "wildmushrooms", "mushroomhunting", "unlimited", "yield", "lifehack", "scienceexperiment", "biology"]},
{"media_id": 3486548884284034545, "shortcode": "DBitbzbyM3x", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBitbzbyM3x/", "taken_at": "2024-10-25T09:38:30", "caption": "Fun fact: 我小時候住在沒有火車站的地方\n門禁還是晚上6點😸\n.\n#partytime #party #nightout #partying #partykids #partylife #slaying #slay #partynight #影集語錄 #影集推薦 #電影對白 #電影台詞 #電影金句 #影集台詞 #影集語錄 #影集金句 #電影分享 #影集分享 #台詞分享 #美劇 #美劇推薦 #美劇台詞  #cinema #movie #netflixseries #netflixmovies #netflixandchill #netflixoriginal #documentary #film", "owner_username": "jx.cinema", "owner_id": "44917356698", "likes": 67224, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0209_DBitbzbyM3x\\DBitbzbyM3x_20241025_093830.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17881735938265801, "text": "@e_leana_8 24也需要😌", "created_at": "2025-03-30T15:03:10", "owner": "rainlollz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882799240251075, "text": "真的….每次都要藏的很反差（兩種正裝🥴", "created_at": "2025-03-15T04:37:04", "owner": "kagawa_jp", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18062960536794145, "text": "@pei_ting_0111", "created_at": "2025-03-13T14:17:04", "owner": "ninn_1114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033755357582177, "text": "Oversize 必備🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-25T03:53:50", "owner": "ew_imsofia", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18055493581933188, "text": "@ayamiwang", "created_at": "2024-12-13T20:41:15", "owner": "miiinzzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039242528258712, "text": "Poor parents", "created_at": "2024-12-12T16:48:52", "owner": "uncle_yimwooo2.0", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17952740315893316, "text": "@iuncheng", "created_at": "2024-12-09T04:25:29", "owner": "charlie_tou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874082068219171, "text": "@cc39621", "created_at": "2024-11-29T16:37:12", "owner": "45_qiyu__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104644483457879, "text": "@c.ct_____", "created_at": "2024-11-29T11:38:09", "owner": "_ann_annnnnnnnn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083595850542542, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:50:05", "owner": "yun155320", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17989850246734243, "text": "@_n.m.n.__", "created_at": "2024-11-1