słówko", "created_at": "2025-04-16T14:31:01", "owner": "vcr0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892845058211678, "text": "Nigga, nigga, nigga", "created_at": "2025-04-16T14:30:40", "owner": "adomelis_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064440040974056, "text": "my good girl wonhee😥😥", "created_at": "2025-04-16T13:17:15", "owner": "dommypoo1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066385006785236, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-16T10:33:30", "owner": "jmc_latade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475181665067176, "text": "Wonhee😢", "created_at": "2025-04-16T06:07:08", "owner": "alrchjsphsntlln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983147592815825, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-16T03:32:24", "owner": "vegetatry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068890558926853, "text": "😭😭←⁠_⁠←┗⁠(⁠•⁠ˇ⁠_⁠ˇ⁠•⁠)⁠―⁠→", "created_at": "2025-04-16T02:28:36", "owner": "bahha7955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114747781464890, "text": "Hold on arf arf", "created_at": "2025-04-16T00:23:28", "owner": "angelomarkan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851951890431020, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T22:46:09", "owner": "nbssz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087497764615031, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T21:40:19", "owner": "lil_bopcat1313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055467527277849, "text": "WHERE?!👮‍♂️🚔", "created_at": "2025-04-15T20:19:43", "owner": "_la.papera_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105114817506781, "text": "Thanks, I'll take two", "created_at": "2025-04-15T19:14:42", "owner": "redferris1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092658211501864, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T18:43:42", "owner": "bennirwk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043983308161550, "text": "@ishowspeed", "created_at": "2025-04-15T17:30:29", "owner": "d4nyy.gon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274243549251227, "text": "l am Chinese, who want to make friends to me🙌", "created_at": "2025-04-15T15:33:33", "owner": "slydn224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041948468435256, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T14:10:00", "owner": "tt_lxe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968585526853636, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T13:58:39", "owner": "memensshit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399393193111231, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T12:45:33", "owner": "d0mc1ssq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856332631411272, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T12:42:03", "owner": "pearl.27381122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938352393880377, "text": "JUST Corean", "created_at": "2025-04-15T12:04:35", "owner": "nikolaspeprnicek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956854422942361, "text": "No one just goes from English to Korean like that it was completely different tone", "created_at": "2025-04-15T11:10:46", "owner": "a_self_portrait_of_lies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110267287469675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-15T09:37:03", "owner": "th.eewade", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["valorant"]},
{"media_id": 3484618776135659629, "shortcode": "DBb2lCJOPBt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBb2lCJOPBt/", "taken_at": "2024-10-22T17:47:21", "caption": "I don't use hand dryers 😱🦠 My little hand dryer video went viral on Tiktok (5M views) and then went crazy on IG 😀\nUPDATE: See my pinned reel for all results of the little tests I did with this hand dryer - loo air, paper and dryer vents.\nUPDATE: I'm loving the discussions that have come from this quick comparison test I did with 2 agar plates I had left over from a microbiology lesson. Clearly a hot topic for many regarding hygiene and hand dryers, but with only 2 agar plates this isn't a scientific project and you can't jump to conclusions from my results.\n🧪This wasn't a planned study, just 2 spare agar plates over my lunch break 😁 who'd have thought so many people would see it 😅\n🧪In my case, the bacteria are living in the dryer - see my other hand dryer vids. I hope not all hand dryers are as grubby as this one!\nUPDATE 2: I identified the bacteria - we mostly have Micrococcus, Staphylococcus & Bacillus species - they're unlikely to be harmful.... but, I personally don't want this quantity of bacteria blowing onto my freshly cleaned hands!\n-----\n#germs #publictoilet #bacteria #dirty #gross #justdont #scienceteacher  #handwashchallenge #handdryer #science #scienceexperiments #microbiology #scienceproject #lesson #handdryer #handdryerbacteria", "owner_username": "devon_science", "owner_id": "4151901425", "likes": 377732, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0212_DBb2lCJOPBt\\DBb2lCJOPBt_20241022_174721.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17962007147827136, "text": "I'm loving the discussions that have come from this quick test I did with 2 spare agar plates I had. Obviously a hot topic for many regarding hygiene and hand dryers, but with only 2 agar plates this isn't a scientific project and you can't jump to conclusions from my results. This wasn't a planned study, just 2 spare agar plates over my lunch break 😁 who'd have thought so many people would see it 😅\n🧪Anyway, in my case, I think the bacteria are coming from the dryer, but I've swabbed the vents to confirm (results to follow), and I hope not all hand dryers would be as grubby as this one!\n🧪The bacteria I grew may not be harmful and I'm planning on identifying them.\n🧪 I've tested the loo air and the paper I dried my hands on 😬 results to follow.", "created_at": "2024-11-05T10:57:27", "owner": "devon_science", "likes": 2612}, {"id": 17974155089822262, "text": "Oh I wonder what one of the Dyson hand dryers would show. Those hand dryers here in Australia you slide your hands up and down in-between two dryers", "created_at": "2026-01-23T15:35:03", "owner": "shandiishanshan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18095543083927631, "text": "I would love to see cleaning products that people use for countertops if you haven’t already done so. I know a lot of people who use vinegar. I like Mrs. Meyers bc of the smell but I dump a little out and pour rubbing alcohol in there since I doubt it kills germs on its own.", "created_at": "2026-01-06T02:45:45", "owner": "haolden", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18074665484353510, "text": "Que nojoiii", "created_at": "2025-12-23T11:38:48", "owner": "pimonti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076579361266760, "text": "WE MAKE THE BACTERIA & THE FUNGI - they are NOT the Cause of ANYTHING except your health - look into PLEOMORPHISM", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:33:17", "owner": "yemaya321", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17935245885012626, "text": "Can you test 3 Brands of hand sanitaizer?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:33:02", "owner": "sexxycreazy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18299563438256798, "text": "Aha, one benefit of being too autistic to stand the noise of hand dryers 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:42:24", "owner": "ramona.mnro", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18164268397387806, "text": "I did this as a kid in the lab my grandma used to work. I took samples from floor and doorknobs/door handles. I became a germophobe would wouldn't touch any doorhandles for the rest of her life :D I", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:58:45", "owner": "alecsa.malaqueen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17930825835120096, "text": "I'm mildly concerned about the atmosphere in my car. Could you do this air test in an old vs. New car, see what it shows?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:11:58", "owner": "jon_funk", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17927072238161437, "text": "Hey I would love to reshare this if you can send me the video I will of course give you full mention and tag and make it clear this is your content!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:27:24", "owner": "plastictoxaustralia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891465301376326, "text": "I thought the new ones have hepa filters!!! Does that make a difference??? So the air has bacteria n viruses always don't it???", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:04:30", "owner": "yatish_giri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063985727177005, "text": "Are any of those dangerous for health?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:15:05", "owner": "magdalen.mari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086017756950287, "text": "Are these harmful bacteria/ fungi?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:34:12", "owner": "evandotcom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091764895910517, "text": "I am not showing this to a friend who has extreme hygiene OCD.  Hygiene OCD is crippling and limits lives.  How about we wash hands and get on with life? Meanwhile our immune system gets to work!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:20:03", "owner": "_creativebloc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18310575565180249, "text": "@jenlevy10", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:32:26", "owner": "danielle_stern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337842595232423, "text": "Soooo paper towels are ok though??!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:26:16", "owner": "thectinashow", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17997172124838763, "text": "Now I’m curious about hair dryer.. will it  be the same as the hand dryer?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:47:02", "owner": "sonnysonya78", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880978438309051, "text": "Following the conclusion of these results, would you consider adding bidet blowers to compare?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:43:10", "owner": "mauldinart", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062683643400271, "text": "There's bacteria living on pretty much everything. As you've proven, you still have bacteria living on your hands after washing them so why are people so shocked?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:03:35", "owner": "djeds90", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17859675813540698, "text": "Trust man to invent a bacteria incubator and spreader. I do know someone got very rich though. I’d be really interested knowing what settles on an agar plate during a long flight 🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:34:19", "owner": "secretrabbit_99", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18428134489106571, "text": "In many microbiology courses, students touch agar plates before and after washing hands. The “after washing” plates often show more bacteria because washing removes surface oils and exposes your normal skin bacteria (resident microbiota). So it doesn’t mean your hands got dirtier, it just shows your natural skin microbes.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:54:34", "owner": "rikmuilwijk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18184397461347573, "text": "Sooo, what about hair dryers?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:09:07", "owner": "urbaculturist", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936907270100361, "text": "The air sample wasn’t captured in the same room tho 🤔 does it affect the variables? Perhaps can swipe the tissue paper for one more sample as comparison?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:38:43", "owner": "ivan_navii", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18070541249358839, "text": "I haven't used dryers since COVID. I get some funny looks and even weirder ones once i explain 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:33:42", "owner": "msnitt.76", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18050124554343489, "text": "But what about the Dyson one?", "created_at": "2025-11-04T17:38:59", "owner": "tito.mesti", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17861101062456461, "text": "so... you are basically suggesting me to lick it", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:08:51", "owner": "ansiaaa666", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991732767712670, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-04T11:17:28", "owner": "nanmilligan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915918412075812, "text": "I never dry my hands with those bacteria farms", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:25:34", "owner": "dangirilubi16", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17989711283856667, "text": "can you try this test with hand dryers with anti-bacterial filters and uv lights? because i almost never see this old style hand dryer anymore. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:00:12", "owner": "_anthony_gogogo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099203662740071, "text": "I wonder wht the new generation of hand dryers would show", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:12:13", "owner": "cj.hanza", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067086350580409, "text": "The stuff that \"blooms\" out of the toilets when you flush them find an ideal breeding ground on the interior components of the dryers. Warm, humid, and nutrient-laden. One might even say MOIST.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:05:54", "owner": "mfenaughty", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18076712846317827, "text": "Why is microbiology only focused on \"bad\" microbes? Sooooooooo many MORE good guys than bad. How do you know which is growing? Why assume they are bad?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T22:55:20", "owner": "apopcornpopping", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081287458733875, "text": "Nothing gonna happen from an air dryer", "created_at": "2025-04-18T20:34:30", "owner": "two.factor", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18147470950373126, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-04-16T06:26:51", "owner": "passion.4.med", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963238044766652, "text": "@claristocats", "created_at": "2025-04-15T13:14:13", "owner": "khimjohn18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290662270216321, "text": "dab the paper towel on one", "created_at": "2025-04-14T12:56:38", "owner": "kaastomaat1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058371809131883, "text": "In college, we did an experiment involving putting a finger into bacteria and touching a Petri dish, a finger touching the bacteria and washed with soap and water before touching a second Petri dish, then a third finger in bacteria then doused with alcohol/hand sanitizer before touching the Petri dish. The Petri dish of the soap-cleaned finger had no bacteria growing in it. The dish that had the bacteria with no cleaning at all had a whole lot of bacteria growing in it. But the dish with the bacteria “cleaned” with alcohol/hand sanitizer had double or more of the bacteria than the uncleaned finger dish. That experiment has stayed with me for 45 years.", "created_at": "2025-04-13T17:52:43", "owner": "mimifajita", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18025930181458085, "text": "@kadianlaw96", "created_at": "2025-04-13T12:55:41", "owner": "ellie.wellie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065919064812045, "text": "Yuck", "created_at": "2025-04-13T04:22:04", "owner": "hintonmarjorie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066074755797132, "text": "No1 cares", "created_at": "2025-04-13T03:32:33", "owner": "daddymeshu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952018617947173, "text": "She should have changed the distance from the blower including outside of the bathroom.", "created_at": "2025-04-12T22:15:26", "owner": "1264roger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081102109728614, "text": "Hey, we did the same thing. Turns out your school is just nasty, ours showed nothing", "created_at": "2025-04-12T17:55:00", "owner": "ulrik.w.skarpen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062067667850929, "text": "Check the paper you just dried your hands with", "created_at": "2025-04-12T06:43:35", "owner": "geibriel_s7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17889350238124578, "text": "This is why I use hand sanitizer  after washing my hands in public", "created_at": "2025-04-11T07:05:28", "owner": "ellieblackhurst", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948416925957856, "text": "You should do compare between hand dryer and tissue 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-11T03:30:25", "owner": "khootjunkeith", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18009758414719998, "text": "Thank you for sharing that public bathroom air dryers are germ filled. I wash and shake the water off and carry witch hazel packets in my bag too.", "created_at": "2025-04-11T02:36:15", "owner": "lynnstegemcmahan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868089169351023, "text": "Never.  Especially in winter.  They dry out your skin and cause chapping and cracking.  I just grab mor TP and leave it on the counter.", "created_at": "2025-04-10T18:04:33", "owner": "color_me_beth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853499419423192, "text": "This is nothing new it’s cheaper to have one then use paper towels!", "created_at": "2025-04-10T14:22:00", "owner": "smoocho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850414417398479, "text": "That’s not a fair test, the air should be from the bathroom as well. The bacteria from the hand dryer could’ve just been from the bathroom.", "created_at": "2025-04-10T13:09:41", "owner": "fahad_dragneel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064432693816397, "text": "I don't use that blowers too because of the same reason", "created_at": "2025-04-09T09:55:50", "owner": "arisito_juarez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18455827561072631, "text": "Know fact for years.but what other ways can  people dry there hands.paper towels maybe,", "created_at": "2025-04-08T15:34:37", "owner": "notleyjones", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060023174108134, "text": "eu sempre tive nojo de secador", "created_at": "2025-04-08T11:41:02", "owner": "caschermann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18307447672229863, "text": "can’t wash this and take anything that is said seriously given the fact that you thought a good control would be testing air outside of the bathroom. And then when someone says otherwise you say why is that. It should be obvious. Very clear this is your first time doing an experiment.", "created_at": "2025-04-08T01:38:41", "owner": "rayman.d.yet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895070572088494, "text": "Me neither 🤢", "created_at": "2025-04-07T22:30:25", "owner": "earth2_kyle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848970199441385, "text": "How do i convince my hospital this ???", "created_at": "2025-04-07T08:25:04", "owner": "_helmsking", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061171951861481, "text": "The video doesn't include modern , Epson handing manchines of all varieties..", "created_at": "2025-04-07T07:47:48", "owner": "fuji_film_imagery_taken", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007734917724344, "text": "I use the hand dryer, but after that yli spray alcohol on my hands, and that's it", "created_at": "2025-04-06T19:01:01", "owner": "andy_reyessss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18395533369106506, "text": "This is 100% true. We don't have hand driers in the NHS for this reason.", "created_at": "2025-04-06T16:55:28", "owner": "scarlettwarrior3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963562290886771, "text": "No gloves?", "created_at": "2025-04-06T14:24:39", "owner": "unic_orny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969767991728323, "text": "Yet they don't put throw away towels in bathrooms so I am forced to wipe it on my clothes. 😢", "created_at": "2025-04-06T13:52:23", "owner": "simmi_catherine_louisvuitton", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027452699401329, "text": "That is why your body has an immune system", "created_at": "2025-04-06T11:15:27", "owner": "denim_igger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013729394520010, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-06T04:02:30", "owner": "tnethers_v.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059744561169903, "text": "Pero le choca contra el aire porque?", "created_at": "2025-04-06T03:14:59", "owner": "bi.bi.mbap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945740799966817, "text": "“B-b-but don’t you wanna save da planet?!”", "created_at": "2025-04-06T02:56:32", "owner": "the_dan_strikes_back", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981660399813100, "text": "I will not use the air dryer! Its just gross", "created_at": "2025-04-06T01:46:13", "owner": "khristine.barnes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998189811796078, "text": "Warm and wet place no surprise it grows bacteria", "created_at": "2025-04-05T22:03:47", "owner": "evo604", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941592030856259, "text": "How about blow dryers?????", "created_at": "2025-04-05T22:00:27", "owner": "ahmad_va_mahboo_beh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064001254969363, "text": "And there are 10 toilets with no lids!!", "created_at": "2025-04-05T20:11:43", "owner": "vikiestordahl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068726623897438, "text": "Bacteria isn't bad g", "created_at": "2025-04-05T19:54:08", "owner": "sixela320", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039280427529082, "text": "Waft it around in the air in the same room as the hand dryer… not a fair test.", "created_at": "2025-04-05T19:42:20", "owner": "arizonadarling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892932304206888, "text": "Sheldon was right 😮", "created_at": "2025-04-05T19:11:22", "owner": "instabermz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074311174828443, "text": "@kuriositykilledkat ok… I now understand your aversion to hand dryers 🤮", "created_at": "2025-04-05T17:51:01", "owner": "katroot89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006716210569028, "text": "All environmental bacteria. If you are immunocompetent, no problem. Have you thought when you touch your nose and eye, what result do you think you'll get?", "created_at": "2025-04-05T16:21:45", "owner": "restybostonmassachusetts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042359324596144, "text": "Why release conclusions like this without considering all factors? Are you a true scientist?", "created_at": "2025-04-05T16:19:29", "owner": "restybostonmassachusetts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095834422488608, "text": "Have you tested the paper towel dispenser???", "created_at": "2025-04-05T16:18:37", "owner": "restybostonmassachusetts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077386765684447, "text": "white tissues are bleached. they disrupt your hormones. i just get a small towel with me from home.", "created_at": "2025-04-05T15:53:48", "owner": "aeth3l", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026036678422438, "text": "A fair test would heat the agar plate your walking around in the air so you know heating the agar isn't what allows the bacteria and fungus to stick. You are assuming bacteria sticks to skin the same way it sticks to heated agar. Conversely does heating the bacteria and fungus make it somehow change or more sticky", "created_at": "2025-04-05T13:28:54", "owner": "ronf12345", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036475811281161, "text": "Have you considered an experiment where you swab people’s hands after using the toilet a) not washing b) washing using air drier, c) washing using paper towels d) washing and letting the hands dry naturally? That would be interesting. I never use air dryers I think they should be banded", "created_at": "2025-04-05T08:22:00", "owner": "sueabdy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397618732105120, "text": "Can you repeat this test a third time, but for a hairdryer output?", "created_at": "2025-04-05T05:17:57", "owner": "jonathanefearn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063089948493821, "text": "I and the world .. are not surprised. Well done 👏", "created_at": "2025-04-04T20:56:54", "owner": "snowymcgill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065750905769901, "text": "I wish they had the option but where I live they removed all paper towel and only have air dryers. Might start wiping my hands on children’s clothes that are outside the bathroom", "created_at": "2025-04-04T19:46:29", "owner": "felixthecat529", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155647786317265, "text": "I saw a study that proved that the bacteria was pre-existing in the bathroom air, not the hand dryer... It had a lot of sense", "created_at": "2025-04-04T15:32:07", "owner": "nicolay.bat", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17853944436414171, "text": "Great. Post! Had no idea!", "created_at": "2025-04-04T14:55:10", "owner": "mariesausele", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028284317648327, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-04-04T14:35:24", "owner": "rudgewiid6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040858568571960, "text": "Didn’t waft in the same environment. Inconclusive.", "created_at": "2025-04-04T13:42:59", "owner": "dtx.flowfactory", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011594237709434, "text": "I don’t use hand dryers bc I hate the sound 🥰", "created_at": "2025-04-04T10:38:34", "owner": "cformby12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149905561367223, "text": "Was ager plate clean ? 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-03T22:54:23", "owner": "talkingshadow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060731825086548, "text": "I hate them. They don't get my hands dry enough", "created_at": "2025-04-03T22:43:47", "owner": "the_indomitable_blackman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041998895530573, "text": "I don't use them either, not a massively comprehensive test but I'd place a lot money on the same outcome again and again.", "created_at": "2025-04-03T16:31:29", "owner": "liljohndjson", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063708649965227, "text": "I hate hand dryers", "created_at": "2025-04-03T15:02:38", "owner": "stephanieackroyd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041586536410635, "text": "People won't like me jumping for joy in the office", "created_at": "2025-04-03T12:49:27", "owner": "marcos_tyto_tt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095342698546224, "text": "Me too", "created_at": "2025-04-03T09:17:24", "owner": "sandychana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053563631183361, "text": "I don't like the hand dryers either 😜", "created_at": "2025-04-03T05:55:16", "owner": "sailingtimeout", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18204088705307101, "text": "Never use handryer…ever, prefer tissue or towel..", "created_at": "2025-04-03T05:31:54", "owner": "mm_moneng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011631221527270, "text": "Do your finger after the dryer... and your finger with tissue drying.I did this experiment with/without hand sanitizer. Cool test", "created_at": "2025-04-03T03:13:18", "owner": "takeapicma", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17970506156848978, "text": "Skin isn't ideal for bacteria to grow due to natural defenses like sebum and sweat. In contrast, a petri dish provides perfect conditions for growth. So, this isn't a comprehensive test to show how dirty hands get under an air dryer.", "created_at": "2025-04-03T01:07:06", "owner": "fightinire", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864764587361554, "text": "OK but why? Is the bacteria coming from the dryer?", "created_at": "2025-04-02T22:20:34", "owner": "singlebrowngirl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944923194967839, "text": "I literally hand on mouth screamed into blanket when u showed the hand dryer Petri dish", "created_at": "2025-04-02T22:07:25", "owner": "mikaonvenus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17975148383838875, "text": "What agar did you use?", "created_at": "2025-04-02T21:26:06", "owner": "david_georgescu28", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022758707483254, "text": "What is the point?", "created_at": "2025-04-02T18:11:36", "owner": "madeirariedma", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["germs", "publictoilet", "bacteria", "dirty", "gross", "justdont", "scienceteacher", "handwashchallenge", "handdryer", "science", "scienceexperiments", "microbiology", "scienceproject", "lesson", "handdryer", "handdryerbacteria"]},
{"media_id": 3488679754906467728, "shortcode": "DBqR8DWS_2Q", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBqR8DWS_2Q/", "taken_at": "2024-10-28T08:11:29", "caption": "西班牙的女人熱情如火❤️‍🔥\n片段出自Carlos Saura執導的電影：El amor brujo，一群女人在曬衣服時，一起跳佛朗明哥舞💃。\n歌詞的含義各位自行解讀，我的文學造詣不夠看不懂。\n#洪洋西文 #學西文 #西班牙語", "owner_username": "hongyangspanish", "owner_id": "67988990440", "likes": 39344, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0213_DBqR8DWS_2Q\\DBqR8DWS_2Q_20241028_081129.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18106609003634008, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:23:59", "owner": "soma_chang0421", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036250490475653, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:49:45", "owner": "sebajun2005", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930594781010222, "text": "@marta_rodriguezc_ 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-30T01:07:07", "owner": "alan_hsiao423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943902123969885, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-27T14:47:40", "owner": "1597.53asdf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119560243448293, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-21T02:24:08", "owner": "hongsheng962", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053468426157062, "text": "学单词", "created_at": "2025-03-20T01:46:00", "owner": "vivi_lanstyle_imok", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077053111665095, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-03-18T23:06:57", "owner": "xinyelin888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944676153958431, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-16T04:37:24", "owner": "hxd3d7002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069382138876617, "text": "我到底看了小小小。今天網絡用多了🤣", "created_at": "2025-02-28T07:40:55", "owner": "gaisyou91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854657083388329, "text": "：西班牙文好浪漫喔\n西班牙文：", "created_at": "2025-02-20T15:36:02", "owner": "bahn._", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17957363357909489, "text": "@stanly1012", "created_at": "2025-02-13T06:52:02", "owner": "keke_9710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943027464952467, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-02-12T14:16:00", "owner": "joyyu051224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162241366333650, "text": "這是赤裸裸表達......需求...哇塞", "created_at": "2025-02-12T12:24:57", "owner": "xiarongai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013426292691970, "text": "感覺都很飢渴", "created_at": "2025-02-07T11:13:05", "owner": "ma.ngo5331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084553783588390, "text": "大智慧", "created_at": "2025-02-05T18:28:19", "owner": "pachinko.no.sabe.bailar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116681998439207, "text": "好奔放", "created_at": "2025-02-04T13:09:21", "owner": "main02030324", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064913602893926, "text": "找到電影片段\n\nhttps://youtu.be/AoIYGczVL7I?si=6vIDM3OGbJN9uH_T", "created_at": "2025-02-03T15:59:02", "owner": "amuyriyar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055827691985111, "text": "這才是女權", "created_at": "2025-01-08T15:33:32", "owner": "fan0941", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18474809251041898, "text": "好熱", "created_at": "2024-12-23T17:39:42", "owner": "hinotakato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077112220621676, "text": "我也是鳥巢準備好囉！", "created_at": "2024-12-21T14:00:54", "owner": "21_0718_ami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041406530263048, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T03:51:37", "owner": "sunny66416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044581954978042, "text": "已追蹤", "created_at": "2024-12-16T18:59:21", "owner": "vittorio.eugenio.universo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482857984040214, "text": "有没有妹妹来", "created_at": "2024-12-14T09:46:11", "owner": "xiexianglun815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031980689588174, "text": "微波炉热一下，不用写👏", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:29:50", "owner": "jnt_gyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080794558562566, "text": "有人按讚讓我看到這個", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:54:18", "owner": "nknl_2018615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014233784438569, "text": "這就是我想要的理想國下輩子讓我來承擔這樣罪吧", "created_at": "2024-12-12T12:12:21", "owner": "77._.88ck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030775268436556, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T00:18:33", "owner": "wadancealex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364998790140910, "text": "@arhamisdedios", "created_at": "2024-12-07T13:37:08", "owner": "tonee.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051644294074447, "text": "address pls", "created_at": "2024-12-07T12:55:16", "owner": "lunar_libator_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075496435614155, "text": "我們太封閉了", "created_at": "2024-12-07T11:22:19", "owner": "domo_hank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061659946834334, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:21:42", "owner": "ru_xin22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126304570384953, "text": "三小", "created_at": "2024-12-01T01:48:51", "owner": "pika.0201___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038837330250189, "text": "Pa su pajarito", "created_at": "2024-11-30T10:11:04", "owner": "oshress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103311385457522, "text": "omg porn", "created_at": "2024-11-30T07:26:16", "owner": "bb521ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844002694366645, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-29T04:26:40", "owner": "happyw1011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947437122910670, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T01:54:45", "owner": "adele.yuanyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065056000753983, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T14:36:34", "owner": "yun155320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474491974029134, "text": "認識過西班牙女生…就知道真的假的😏", "created_at": "2024-11-28T04:19:29", "owner": "reason_chiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940139943798560, "text": "這是鬧劇無疑😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T19:49:31", "owner": "marcotruez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049539283850061, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:19:44", "owner": "kathyzhulol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874655989213652, "text": "pure art", "created_at": "2024-11-24T03:34:57", "owner": "chinesemartian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122483440401468, "text": "倦鳥歸巢😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T02:11:44", "owner": "chaguokaede", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044497480906300, "text": "我終於知道碧血狂殺裡面那些墨西哥女人唱什麼了", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:08:20", "owner": "kirin_0530", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18031343066133500, "text": "国旗都是黄色", "created_at": "2024-11-20T20:37:09", "owner": "all_to_see", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17939027132934376, "text": "笑死我😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T15:27:57", "owner": "zz8220zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875877850127704, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T08:26:17", "owner": "yifong__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016439939634386, "text": "？？？😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T01:29:50", "owner": "amberbaby.0709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050811583971149, "text": "🙄🙄🙄", "created_at": "2024-11-19T09:45:43", "owner": "5264miki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030046757383345, "text": "呃…這些人不是我的菜", "created_at": "2024-11-19T04:27:10", "owner": "y0926368559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18462398338023719, "text": "高巢", "created_at": "2024-11-18T11:11:52", "owner": "robinnibor81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023700407285097, "text": "我的男性尊言", "created_at": "2024-11-18T10:48:01", "owner": "si_maglow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117741853409011, "text": "@engsumyiu 一齊去西班牙搵鳥巢😍❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-17T08:13:03", "owner": "imnotsanqi_bru.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028377338187684, "text": "影片誤我，網友保我！？", "created_at": "2024-11-17T07:51:23", "owner": "romanx_7651", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289637299224843, "text": "所以兒歌的「青春小鳥一樣不回來」其實根本是求偶歌對吧", "created_at": "2024-11-17T01:12:02", "owner": "black_cat0331", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051634198801616, "text": "西班牙鸟巢😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-16T11:02:24", "owner": "naurrrr88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014543396396914, "text": "不看翻譯不知道這麼野欸", "created_at": "2024-11-16T08:37:18", "owner": "yija_1229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023751590271700, "text": "尛", "created_at": "2024-11-15T23:15:49", "owner": "shyhhon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983430930760110, "text": "青眼白龍噴射白光", "created_at": "2024-11-15T17:35:10", "owner": "imlovinit_30429", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18266306848301394, "text": "@guns_and_roses_child 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-15T17:21:17", "owner": "jxzxyx_127", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926041086986446, "text": "@mila._o18 ？", "created_at": "2024-11-15T11:16:19", "owner": "haofish.115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016684328363273, "text": "我們的噗洗🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-15T09:16:29", "owner": "tingkang0121", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17853456552323994, "text": "一群人開口我以為是小小兵", "created_at": "2024-11-15T05:50:46", "owner": "wow3boy___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037261067247699, "text": "@yueluna_rt 我覺得你會需要知道這東東", "created_at": "2024-11-14T13:26:22", "owner": "shulieffen_rt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900955306074066, "text": "@lzx___07 放得下大的嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-14T10:11:35", "owner": "gojo_satoru_1211", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17873193279213502, "text": "@jielong_lu", "created_at": "2024-11-14T07:07:08", "owner": "oz._.oz0526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928779429968570, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥lollol", "created_at": "2024-11-14T05:01:57", "owner": "w_jinbian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039530258246421, "text": "@84.09.25 你該歸巢了", "created_at": "2024-11-14T03:08:04", "owner": "horse__0515__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026190986215332, "text": "拜託告訴我，這不是真的翻譯😅😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-14T01:16:28", "owner": "leots821118", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17981470688769535, "text": "@zhi__gang 以後可以唱這個跟你求歡嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-13T19:15:29", "owner": "_roseeow", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053686078753129, "text": "@jef_f_f", "created_at": "2024-11-13T15:29:40", "owner": "ianhuang2002_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075901615593191, "text": "男生要好好保護自己", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:59:14", "owner": "zaxs012312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888065659132431, "text": "？？？😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:34:37", "owner": "strawberry0927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931568439951899, "text": "各位亚洲的兄弟们，人家需要的大型鸟类，咱们可能大部分不属于人家那个需求范围🤭", "created_at": "2024-11-13T06:54:36", "owner": "juntanmaintan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870274894230526, "text": "我學會了，蘇巴哈利抖", "created_at": "2024-11-12T19:46:58", "owner": "xiashux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027979703454936, "text": "@cccc.9707 要不要送你去西班牙", "created_at": "2024-11-12T14:41:44", "owner": "sk_jn0621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906460075053164, "text": "好喜歡😍", "created_at": "2024-11-12T07:32:10", "owner": "manbo_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060842260655612, "text": "🇪🇸", "created_at": "2024-11-11T13:32:58", "owner": "1il.ka__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045216194130003, "text": "原来女孩子可以这么大胆的表达自己的需求", "created_at": "2024-11-11T12:12:17", "owner": "samman340", "likes": 1162}, {"id": 18074010643606247, "text": "太燒了🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-10T22:13:29", "owner": "royeee1022", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18020095961555958, "text": "？？？666", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:52:48", "owner": "s.brandy.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047058049864999, "text": "@lo_1114 有認識西班牙女孩嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:35:42", "owner": "gaus_uxan0916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029097179431201, "text": "抱歉我笑得太过分了😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T07:06:28", "owner": "just_insignificant_alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040995143174334, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:25:52", "owner": "mengqin.xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038680796004117, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T01:25:35", "owner": "maxlin8046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289064470238549, "text": "感覺悶很久了😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T01:03:54", "owner": "cha_sine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906279787050464, "text": "我真是服啦", "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:33:51", "owner": "jjjjjjiiiiiiinnnnnl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044809160088944, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T16:36:19", "owner": "veryhui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053535493902731, "text": "@teo_eng_teck  @choong1001  @ansondhao  我们去唱K ，唱这首", "created_at": "2024-11-09T12:44:42", "owner": "elijah_thecutespirit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068839876724772, "text": "這群脫水機，男人去了變成快車肉乾", "created_at": "2024-11-09T11:39:03", "owner": "fftfd1511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351742129132237, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T05:15:31", "owner": "mochi.mixdog_didi.doooog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170689390313002, "text": "完全正確", "created_at": "2024-11-09T04:11:11", "owner": "henry950522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048314113988762, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T00:51:23", "owner": "alexanderalisen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086696734512084, "text": "殭屍的巢穴叫做什麼 ？", "created_at": "2024-11-08T19:24:46", "owner": "petterchean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317776000093571, "text": "@found_0602 等你跳", "created_at": "2024-11-08T18:16:33", "owner": "heluo_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056985481870076, "text": "@imnayihoney", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:42:28", "owner": "emma.love888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047659307014955, "text": "@yuhsuanchang1115", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:16:39", "owner": "yuwei09_10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18467398285012968, "text": "学西语的初衷😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-08T13:44:23", "owner": "imarieshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230884072303150, "text": "哈哈哈什麼啦XDDD", "created_at": "2024-11-08T11:02:20", "owner": "jaku.foodie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18037235441251101, "text": "我的青春小鳥一去不回來", "created_at": "2024-11-08T09:50:57", "owner": "rudameqan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032400488369149, "text": "以分享給哥布林弟兄", "created_at": "2024-11-08T09:50:21", "owner": "twj_gg9487", "likes": 14}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["洪洋西文", "學西文", "西班牙語"]},
{"media_id": 3488756641488384954, "shortcode": "DBqja5jszO6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBqja5jszO6/", "taken_at": "2024-10-28T10:45:42", "caption": "too predictable 🥱 (I’m lowkey guilty of this even though I’m not an expat LOL) any other expat stereotypes? Let me know 😝⬇️ #hongkong #hk #comedy", "owner_username": "megannjacques", "owner_id": "340761838", "likes": 34242, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0214_DBqja5jszO6\\DBqja5jszO6_20241028_104542.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18075490555874695, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-04-27T05:19:22", "owner": "hkmoment8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876868015316071, "text": "im a local and i feel attacked😭", "created_at": "2025-04-25T07:27:49", "owner": "butty_diary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053960348249161, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-04-25T06:56:27", "owner": "explorehongkong888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167238514326482, "text": "Wonder 50% expats gone honestly", "created_at": "2025-04-10T19:12:41", "owner": "jonvoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058227866119833, "text": "Nah West Kowloon 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-04-08T20:16:08", "owner": "luggah_fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044040194151083, "text": "Be original", "created_at": "2025-04-08T19:34:27", "owner": "tony.mak.102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046821161079319, "text": "@nocontext.sksks", "created_at": "2025-04-07T22:59:23", "owner": "cryingbigbabe_hateonions_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056961656166224, "text": "@manuelpiratahk Pirata group 😍🤭🤣", "created_at": "2025-04-07T20:41:55", "owner": "melanie_rose_jjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962636046899385, "text": "I’d like to hang out in Japan in HK.", "created_at": "2025-03-31T10:09:51", "owner": "jngb777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363642826135358, "text": "NICE", "created_at": "2025-03-28T17:05:49", "owner": "liaoweizhi39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039800558413275, "text": "I see u sometimes in my street, u look as beautiful as on social media", "created_at": "2025-03-25T14:05:15", "owner": "pris.love.life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475112077067637, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-03-20T23:07:52", "owner": "tachiyashi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860475214306192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-17T01:50:23", "owner": "danielsailung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076920274705132, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-17T01:50:14", "owner": "danielsailung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843025111446264, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-17T01:50:07", "owner": "danielsailung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021700283661103, "text": "Please come to Soho and Dine in Soho’s Best Spots Restaurants and Bars", "created_at": "2025-03-10T09:45:57", "owner": "nepalrestaurant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395680930101901, "text": "Love your necklace so much😍😍😍where is it from!!!❤️❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-01T18:00:37", "owner": "mabel.iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074965114726414, "text": "Blacksheep is a group", "created_at": "2025-01-28T07:48:10", "owner": "ticoairhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18238693423303081, "text": "Maxim’s MX is 👏👏👏 as well.", "created_at": "2025-01-16T22:34:19", "owner": "mefeedyoulongtime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019232075392612, "text": "@yysxr_", "created_at": "2025-01-05T11:45:30", "owner": "meroixi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951622218864975, "text": "Lee Gardens.", "created_at": "2024-12-26T13:13:18", "owner": "gregsgroove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878148499216582, "text": "Maybe you have a point❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-25T15:53:02", "owner": "erintang9510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041663738224192, "text": "Hk not the same", "created_at": "2024-12-14T06:59:28", "owner": "mark.therealtor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104784067459586, "text": "It’s been boring and I’ve been exploring other part of HK and it’s so much better. ✨", "created_at": "2024-12-10T02:43:48", "owner": "bisousrebelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369545854118970, "text": "I grew up in HK and I know not a thing about these places she eats at lol…", "created_at": "2024-12-06T07:39:23", "owner": "einnayyannie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320251837091139, "text": "By expats you mean your white friends or you talking about all immigrants? 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-26T10:09:59", "owner": "gcharmz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052212370804035, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-21T07:45:35", "owner": "rinita.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052172287789438, "text": "Not me, my favourite place in Hong Kong is Yuen long and Choi Hung, don’t go to Hong island too much. I love to eat in cha chaan tengs or tam jai and I have always breakfast in cafe de coral 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-15T12:06:31", "owner": "erimilktea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054736849934418, "text": "Look. The heat is unpleasant.", "created_at": "2024-11-13T20:54:43", "owner": "maxjbarnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120855394396671, "text": "Oh that’s where the expats are! That explains why I never see them 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T12:43:22", "owner": "xavierduval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063723685687814, "text": "For me it’s Shin Hing Street off Hollywood road😎", "created_at": "2024-11-10T10:29:51", "owner": "rasadave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889472335079621, "text": "Haha! Would you consider creating a reel showing how you would spend 3-4 days in HK if you were a tourist?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T06:56:12", "owner": "_sassy.ash_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953077191745468, "text": "the only thing I've heard as a Hong Konger is well, the heat is unbearable", "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:34:28", "owner": "greee_1098", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091186612494349, "text": "I have nothing in common with this person :O", "created_at": "2024-11-08T04:33:35", "owner": "chakrabortysankhadip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076335199604529, "text": "Does anyone think @megannjacques speaks like Leighton Meester (especially the way Blair Waldorf speaks) 🧐", "created_at": "2024-11-06T16:20:04", "owner": "iamsarahlau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031736804105237, "text": "🫣❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-06T04:19:21", "owner": "dessyyuliyana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947182782860343, "text": "What's expats?", "created_at": "2024-11-06T00:36:02", "owner": "mar51aa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467671771035187, "text": "💸💸💸💸", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:16:31", "owner": "heyson_0321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034649072199101, "text": "Complain about the heat is legit 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T01:19:10", "owner": "carolineangkm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101582350454981, "text": "@jac.7577", "created_at": "2024-11-04T19:04:17", "owner": "resleung__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010741028448664, "text": "The F is SoHo?", "created_at": "2024-11-04T09:37:40", "owner": "yaueats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328038400153638, "text": "café de coral \ncafé de coral \ncafé de coral", "created_at": "2024-11-04T01:54:01", "owner": "dcrebbin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300757348204683, "text": "The dress - Love bonito - Padded Lace V-Neck Flare Maxi Dress 😏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T15:22:59", "owner": "germine_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082595020526807, "text": "It would be nice if these gwei lo immigrants made an effort 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:52:21", "owner": "iamerniechao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015431240347719, "text": "Please stay on the island. Leave the dark side alone.", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:27:26", "owner": "hustwit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875795257191959, "text": "Can’t forget about H&M", "created_at": "2024-11-02T08:56:13", "owner": "th4rapiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856128814294566, "text": "Try other expats then!", "created_at": "2024-11-02T06:45:30", "owner": "nicolas.detalle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946508637857697, "text": "Hahahahah that's why I moved to kwun tong lolol", "created_at": "2024-11-02T04:38:43", "owner": "jotoukaipaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009563804648710, "text": "😂😂😂👏", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:26:53", "owner": "ravbern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947749827892882, "text": "CCP", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:22:13", "owner": "urbanprojectz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025011812611127, "text": "If they live in discovery bay or SYP/Sheungwan", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:08:21", "owner": "jacobcheunglh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252207232256550, "text": "If you're bored in soho foor, why not trying our italy food in @florencerrippahk?", "created_at": "2024-10-31T23:34:17", "owner": "comingupforairuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029084594143551, "text": "😂 I don't think as an New Territories descendant I even know where those places are. I have only ever been to an one bar in midlevels, have never hung out in LKF was too far from the relatives in New Territories!", "created_at": "2024-10-31T19:48:27", "owner": "warrior_with_anxiety", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056602357847593, "text": "Come to my restaurants for a change~", "created_at": "2024-10-31T15:47:20", "owner": "branden_tong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330535003148473, "text": "Not homie that’s the problem. And nowadays, locals are not happy", "created_at": "2024-10-31T14:03:54", "owner": "eric_matthewo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948732738854832, "text": "@__ambrre", "created_at": "2024-10-31T14:00:48", "owner": "maxime.c04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006797504664121, "text": "They always grab coffees at starbucks", "created_at": "2024-10-31T12:59:35", "owner": "leonfong88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134474506335343, "text": "“I don’t go to the dark side”, proudly said by some expats", "created_at": "2024-10-31T08:54:25", "owner": "_.sovos._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883330159118204, "text": "saving this", "created_at": "2024-10-31T08:30:07", "owner": "hansensmash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932721765830705, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T04:15:37", "owner": "raffclaudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258500173269277, "text": "I feel attacked 🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-31T03:55:35", "owner": "tidusjwoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060242764759322, "text": "my friend came over to visit me i took him to fairwood, and he loves it", "created_at": "2024-10-31T01:19:10", "owner": "shy0us4_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080259925557093, "text": "I saw the same video on RED.", "created_at": "2024-10-30T22:08:00", "owner": "johnnymyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993860583710801, "text": "Dllm gong mut lun yea?", "created_at": "2024-10-30T21:27:23", "owner": "1000_deaths", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057294133870226, "text": "🙌🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-30T12:48:39", "owner": "pydhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143595508348123, "text": "hotel, room service, sex", "created_at": "2024-10-30T11:17:12", "owner": "calvinlicious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468758707006152, "text": "as a hkers, I have never tried any 1 of them", "created_at": "2024-10-30T08:43:35", "owner": "alhk92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067350418713499, "text": "Can somebody tell me the best things to do in Hong Kong besides eating and shopping?", "created_at": "2024-10-30T04:46:03", "owner": "ericpan94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877074112184346, "text": "Double confirm", "created_at": "2024-10-30T04:25:58", "owner": "hkdatingfoolery", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17914669626008328, "text": "I’m an expat never done any of those", "created_at": "2024-10-30T01:49:57", "owner": "lucca.ewins.vol2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054189373917842, "text": "I live in Tai Po ....so none of those places", "created_at": "2024-10-30T01:03:00", "owner": "the_nimble_toad_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872980810203290, "text": "They all go to Fineprint for some unknown reason", "created_at": "2024-10-29T23:57:47", "owner": "emmachengkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867652513164876, "text": "The humidity also", "created_at": "2024-10-29T23:41:06", "owner": "charlulu_spamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071674792539977, "text": "We can eat at Chung king mansion", "created_at": "2024-10-29T19:08:38", "owner": "javier_barbossa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075324226581621, "text": "bro never leave Hong Kong Island 💀💀", "created_at": "2024-10-29T18:54:59", "owner": "kamomeeeeeee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060307183817705, "text": "@justinl3004", "created_at": "2024-10-29T18:29:29", "owner": "4.50lc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978943635775621, "text": "Expat only live in Hong Kong island😮‍💨", "created_at": "2024-10-29T17:58:22", "owner": "lokilam.shi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144401461351879, "text": "A British comeback to Hong Kong, okay thanks I'm burning🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-29T17:55:45", "owner": "regan_ckc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049645867808047, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2024-10-29T16:55:00", "owner": "jake___mccauley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046197872059707, "text": "only relatable comment is complaining about the heat 😫", "created_at": "2024-10-29T15:51:01", "owner": "alex.roslyn_510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987781332724795, "text": "Not for all , new territories team here ;)", "created_at": "2024-10-29T15:49:52", "owner": "kerrielaam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944919729883283, "text": "Come to Macau & enjoy Portuguese food & wine at the Cathedral cafe San Malo, the Historical center.", "created_at": "2024-10-29T14:41:40", "owner": "stephenandersonmacau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096922774476230, "text": "I think this is a problem because I have lived in HK for most of my life and I have no idea what was said above except “complain about the heat”", "created_at": "2024-10-29T13:31:36", "owner": "kr_mockingjay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068499448567327, "text": "Just wanna know where is hannah? And she left without a notice. ☹️sad", "created_at": "2024-10-29T13:29:20", "owner": "pir_evy3779", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867717448232924, "text": "Time to hand out with someone not in soho", "created_at": "2024-10-29T11:59:37", "owner": "isaacto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047752588965847, "text": "Had an expat colleague who hadn’t left the west side of HK island for years!", "created_at": "2024-10-29T11:41:48", "owner": "rcxois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943997889906278, "text": "😂😂😂 totally wrong!", "created_at": "2024-10-29T10:54:34", "owner": "ckrichard1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076243162510843, "text": "Ive been to HK 3-4 times and I didnt even know theres a place called Soho there.", "created_at": "2024-10-29T09:22:36", "owner": "roncuz808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114226039411209, "text": "What about where do you like to shop M&S 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T09:14:47", "owner": "carpediem_keen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057675379798509, "text": "Just too basic..", "created_at": "2024-10-29T08:21:39", "owner": "cliff_n_bruce_nn_threeofhair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136144564365096, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T07:56:13", "owner": "natthaphon_1l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124636174388224, "text": "Chungkung Mansion", "created_at": "2024-10-29T05:50:00", "owner": "hymnzeto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010581773441719, "text": "What heat in hk", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:58:46", "owner": "andhikaprtm17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050109817799142, "text": "WHYT expats, not the Indians or Japanese/ Koreans/ SE Asians. They live a more varied life.", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:57:30", "owner": "johannespong", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18052247431750169, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:31:25", "owner": "nately", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066473335723323, "text": "@willblu @robjnurse @choysums what about fill plastic bags with piss and leave them on hiking trails?", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:18:30", "owner": "cdey96", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18046396793074105, "text": "Saving this so I can go to all those places next time lol", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:08:04", "owner": "lillian_says_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901418856981686, "text": "Home", "created_at": "2024-10-29T03:23:16", "owner": "eth._e_.t127w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955196826833169, "text": "Happy to give you a Soho House house tour 😆", "created_at": "2024-10-29T02:27:55", "owner": "yasminsung", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18034665743463775, "text": "Fuji building", "created_at": "2024-10-29T01:54:12", "owner": "dtong3600", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hongkong", "hk", "comedy"]},
{"media_id": 3480764665841914475, "shortcode": "DBOKQWOPRJr", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBOKQWOPRJr/", "taken_at": "2024-10-17T10:05:04", "caption": "仲有兩個禮拜準備好未？", "owner_username": "hkhehememes", "owner_id": "41622851565", "likes": 26782, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0215_DBOKQWOPRJr\\DBOKQWOPRJr_20241017_100504.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18046589345008727, "text": "天線得得b", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:01:14", "owner": "fungsuetyin1026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857195674292742, "text": "Nice try diddy", "created_at": "2024-10-28T12:58:38", "owner": "notjxeremy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282545452215440, "text": "Diu🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-26T15:09:26", "owner": "_bellebelle.mui_8156", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052434523917363, "text": "梗係cosplay Raygun la~🤣😆 澳洲國寶 又型又swag🤘", "created_at": "2024-10-25T22:25:17", "owner": "doublea23tennis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108659191387230, "text": "in side out2❤️邊個打算扮何生何太😂", "created_at": "2024-10-23T13:17:36", "owner": "sabinaa0727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035716874266394, "text": "少了🤡", "created_at": "2024-10-22T08:50:34", "owner": "you_jia_0424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901972627059177, "text": "仲有兩個禮拜唔係萬聖節，係考試💀💀", "created_at": "2024-10-21T09:45:25", "owner": "anyacty", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17974095467788613, "text": "有冇人想cosplay希特拉————————>", "created_at": "2024-10-20T19:53:06", "owner": "yu.527_09", "likes": 112}, {"id": 18252733345257818, "text": "哥布林去咗邊？喺度", "created_at": "2024-10-20T17:06:50", "owner": "nanaseharunanys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041951129115614, "text": "準備啲咩😂又冇假放😢", "created_at": "2024-10-20T14:52:30", "owner": "gym_lee_56", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105159877438205, "text": "我扮羽毛球 有人扮球拍嗎🥵", "created_at": "2024-10-20T12:46:35", "owner": "bahn._", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17945488337857578, "text": "羽毛球點cos🤣", "created_at": "2024-10-20T11:20:17", "owner": "tks_anthony0130", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879235024087306, "text": "黃百鳴", "created_at": "2024-10-20T00:44:15", "owner": "littlemisswumonster", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18356425792188982, "text": "@elia._kyy_ @cc_fish_charlotte 一齊！", "created_at": "2024-10-19T20:40:50", "owner": "tyxnnz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047912236962506, "text": "2024 lkf Halloween be like", "created_at": "2024-10-19T16:55:25", "owner": "_jocelyna_josta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048501703984708, "text": "哥布林集結", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:11:25", "owner": "q._.kong", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18025847387605355, "text": "你7街瞓!唔好再跟住我!我忍夠你喇吓!😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T14:36:27", "owner": "isaaclwh111", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18058856335831340, "text": "cos何伯出街訓😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T13:48:32", "owner": "lo.luis", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18019076438616925, "text": "@myou_kurai @pranalili", "created_at": "2024-10-19T12:38:18", "owner": "aliceenwk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011980910399729, "text": "😂😂連小丑傷風/deadpool都沒😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T09:08:23", "owner": "feli__.jpg", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18044305237876798, "text": "仲有阿拉伯油王", "created_at": "2024-10-19T08:29:27", "owner": "ho_siu_fei_family", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18010580231436147, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-19T04:37:29", "owner": "isaazzzzz", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18082976293525919, "text": "熊貓呢", "created_at": "2024-10-18T07:31:45", "owner": "ysuckwrong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068242336623203, "text": "哥布林始祖 @happyderek_  @lesliechu__ \n\n@hkhehememes 點睇？", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:58:21", "owner": "sum_nicholas", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18058774894795049, "text": "見到何太就諗起阮兆祥", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:45:36", "owner": "xermus39", "likes": 171}, {"id": 18013432154367805, "text": "MBTI唔玩啦咩？", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:29:14", "owner": "barkingsock", "likes": 84}, {"id": 18087019723502573, "text": "好想見到老蘭周街都係華御結aka何太😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-17T10:10:30", "owner": "dora.dora.dorothy", "likes": 527}, {"id": 18167642917314169, "text": "黑神話悟空都幾好🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-22T10:14:10", "owner": "m.i.z.the_stars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866778721161463, "text": "恨蝠雙瘋素", "created_at": "2024-10-21T11:48:31", "owner": "fox._.lwc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18287408107227675, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-19T05:08:11", "owner": "poor_kit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023861765207181, "text": "@kaylie_4248 let’s become arah arah", "created_at": "2024-10-18T12:43:38", "owner": "nkw.a_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3487011202684076788, "shortcode": "DBkWja_ysL0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBkWja_ysL0/", "taken_at": "2024-10-26T00:55:59", "caption": "為了激發員工的積極性，這家公司連續3年用黃金鍵帽當獎勵", "owner_username": "xiayang1162", "owner_id": "59239839933", "likes": 25042, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0216_DBkWja_ysL0\\DBkWja_ysL0_20241026_005559.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18045552161175230, "text": "最重要的f5也沒有！", "created_at": "2024-12-25T06:05:06", "owner": "instaxsavage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864546508200989, "text": "看來這程序員很懂，換了最常用的幾個", "created_at": "2024-11-25T11:41:25", "owner": "abo.a0619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028597895435142, "text": "他們需要的是control 還有c跟vʕ •ᴥ•ʔ", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:34:35", "owner": "lemon10124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064466677739127, "text": "估計公司返薪的時候就得交回去啦！記得去辦返薪貸款呀！", "created_at": "2024-11-24T14:51:53", "owner": "chengchunhsiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948744102761086, "text": "@szcjoker", "created_at": "2024-11-10T04:58:48", "owner": "phoebesun39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081013084487047, "text": "然后就过劳死了", "created_at": "2024-11-08T06:53:47", "owner": "tensai_kumo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087670540515459, "text": "九妹有拍過全黃金的，因為鍵帽太重所以只能觀賞用", "created_at": "2024-11-08T02:39:50", "owner": "passer0902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050142082983054, "text": "反向退薪之後不知道還有沒有金閃閃😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T08:56:38", "owner": "xum56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024926912564664, "text": "就想问问是什么公司？", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:07:47", "owner": "yunqiankhoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038709470470059, "text": "您好，我想參觀你們辦公室", "created_at": "2024-11-03T16:14:19", "owner": "nung_hung_an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945715602875139, "text": "@g51014 老闆謝謝 先幫我換space 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T06:45:14", "owner": "jill_0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080293765495420, "text": "拆去賣", "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:52:39", "owner": "moligiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067305898635480, "text": "啊 键盘多少个键？", "created_at": "2024-10-31T13:47:55", "owner": "terrylow888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901654897064854, "text": "给驴配个黄金磨盘是吧！！", "created_at": "2024-10-31T02:05:07", "owner": "yi619499", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035632085337188, "text": "这些获奖员工头顶应该也是和这键帽一样闪闪发光吧👨‍🦲✨", "created_at": "2024-10-30T05:55:16", "owner": "sasa.gayyo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039797183143878, "text": "空白鍵是代表很會放空嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-30T04:26:07", "owner": "brian.zao", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954966165842408, "text": "問題是這哪間公司啊？", "created_at": "2024-10-29T09:46:15", "owner": "stamywer_.0227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347200414120328, "text": "那是不是下班之後要記得拔掉不然一定會被拖走", "created_at": "2024-10-29T05:47:55", "owner": "yumoon_hsuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869631604227218, "text": "我想要空白鍵😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T03:05:42", "owner": "nano_aquarius", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977279766782340, "text": "三年三個12克 我直接賣了36克黃金 然後用10克組一個鍍金鍵盤 剩下的錢拿去花", "created_at": "2024-10-28T13:42:55", "owner": "abele_wang", "likes": 35}, {"id": 17897310701999621, "text": "黄金不是容易磨损吗，你这工作几年估计一半磨没了", "created_at": "2024-10-28T13:11:07", "owner": "souak.92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044967797015514, "text": "偷同事的😂", "created_at": "2024-10-28T11:50:44", "owner": "rogersliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042531149113422, "text": "loll", "created_at": "2024-10-28T10:42:05", "owner": "williamchai_23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089165017448555, "text": "按着按着亏了", "created_at": "2024-10-28T05:13:28", "owner": "wiing_0418", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18031784393099855, "text": "記得送一塊給AI", "created_at": "2024-10-28T04:41:00", "owner": "re721831", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18308426905160539, "text": "一年一個鍵 幹到退休一個鍵盤都集不起 只有家裡傳承下來才有可能", "created_at": "2024-10-27T14:00:38", "owner": "gn02315971", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18426792403074989, "text": "兄弟，你知道你沒那麼長命百歲吧", "created_at": "2024-10-27T06:28:39", "owner": "d0_a_5v2_6e", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17915357370007818, "text": "@eri__na_ @saori.9_17 @16takato @takegaki.satoru.5000 @magocorocomete", "created_at": "2024-10-27T05:50:15", "owner": "eleenikas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040025542952248, "text": "鍵盤應該屬於公司資產，資產後鍵盤要收走", "created_at": "2024-10-27T03:56:18", "owner": "zhenyi_89.04_01", "likes": 141}, {"id": 18114027196411949, "text": "@l.dxin0427 适合你哦", "created_at": "2024-10-27T01:16:06", "owner": "chengyi151", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307029073165017, "text": "…一年一個的話，他可能幹到退休都還放不滿啊", "created_at": "2024-10-26T17:10:55", "owner": "beichenlang", "likes": 596}, {"id": 18015080252342272, "text": "下班沒收好，隔天那幾個鍵就被撬走了😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T16:40:11", "owner": "ever_forever00", "likes": 1631}, {"id": 18010998911422105, "text": "哪有沒有鍵盤底座", "created_at": "2024-10-26T07:56:29", "owner": "sktg75", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17903047143058915, "text": "主要是ctrl, c, v三个键😂", "created_at": "2024-10-26T03:30:31", "owner": "kodyliang", "likes": 730}, {"id": 18148676848338263, "text": "這個羨慕😮", "created_at": "2024-10-26T01:21:48", "owner": "aplayerig", "likes": 9}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3490127922289458932, "shortcode": "DBvbNqUvD70", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBvbNqUvD70/", "taken_at": "2024-10-30T08:09:51", "caption": "出行必備的卡片式熱水壺！超級便攜\n———\n好物推薦分享\n喜歡的可以私訊喔\n———\n港澳朋友可以直接郵寄到達\n首次購買享優惠價格喔\n歡迎台灣朋友資訊詳細聊\n\n#香港  #台灣 #台灣美食 #台灣景點 #玩具 #好物分享 #電子產品 #賽車 #相機 #產品 #產品設計 #電子 #葫蘆 #水瓶 #手機殼 #吸塵器 #玩具 #玩具店 #充電 #充電線 #鍵盤 #燈光 #音響 #喇叭 #產品 #行動電源 #充電器 #支架 #行動電源 #遙控車 #遊戲機 #打印機 #手辦", "owner_username": "ollig0930", "owner_id": "68320629407", "likes": 51, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0217_DBvbNqUvD70\\DBvbNqUvD70_20241030_080951.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["香港", "台灣", "台灣美食", "台灣景點", "玩具", "好物分享", "電子產品", "賽車", "相機", "產品", "產品設計", "電子", "葫蘆", "水瓶", "手機殼", "吸塵器", "玩具", "玩具店", "充電", "充電線", "鍵盤", "燈光", "音響", "喇叭", "產品", "行動電源", "充電器", "支架", "行動電源", "遙控車", "遊戲機", "打印機", "手辦"]},
{"media_id": 3482226964743077542, "shortcode": "DBTWvmMzD6m", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBTWvmMzD6m/", "taken_at": "2024-10-19T10:30:00", "caption": "If your company advertises various products or services, your brands will most likely fall into one of these brand architectures.\n\nWhich approach to take depends on your market segmentation and product portfolio.\n\nHere is a simple summary for each.\n\n1. Branded House: Single master brand spans all products and services, creating a unified identity.\n2. Subbrands: Main brand supports distinct products with unique identities under its umbrella.\n3. Endorsed Brands: Independent brands are endorsed by a master brand for credibility and recognition.\n4. House of Brands: Multiple standalone brands operate independently without connection to a parent company.\n5. Hybrid Brands: Combines elements of branded house and house of brands for flexibility across products or markets.\n\nThe infographic shows the differences between famous brands.\n\nFollow @kenny.kenray for more mindset shifts to branding and design.\n\n#infographics #infographic#brandmarketing #marketingstrategy #entrepreneurship #salesandmarketing #brandingdesign #marketing #marketingstrategies #brandstrategy #smallbusiness #corporatebranding #servicebranding #brandingstrategy #brandingtips #branddesigner #brandstrategist", "owner_username": "kenny.kenray", "owner_id": "8611504301", "likes": 10285, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0218_DBTWvmMzD6m\\DBTWvmMzD6m_20241019_103000.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18073583302842842, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-16T20:53:06", "owner": "redchilitech", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899097979207429, "text": "Success is definitely a game of execution over perfection. Love how you broke this down!", "created_at": "2025-06-02T11:44:42", "owner": "thedgbrand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032228354632445, "text": "Great to know! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-18T13:31:45", "owner": "troy_e_marchand", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868542865282355, "text": "Loved the share!", "created_at": "2025-01-15T05:56:25", "owner": "plottwistprerna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014040131485558, "text": "That’s very helpful", "created_at": "2025-01-09T10:34:37", "owner": "paola_steri_designer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884790814152555, "text": "Wow, that's amazing! Thanks for sharing this! 🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-04T09:51:29", "owner": "nerin.motion", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859702618225332, "text": "Jadi bahan diskusi kapan2, @arjun_micro @syahrangga_", "created_at": "2024-11-02T23:17:28", "owner": "pandu.ario", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852009856320607, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-31T21:49:35", "owner": "modulosdesign", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998037159703185, "text": "@sooryasuraweera", "created_at": "2024-10-31T02:58:09", "owner": "ishan_tharusha_peiris", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18256356529264781, "text": "What a great structure 🙌 learned something new today", "created_at": "2024-10-30T22:30:30", "owner": "cultivate_digital", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18468306898020985, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-30T08:34:37", "owner": "yashiitservices", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069487159624184, "text": "Great Bifurcation 👏", "created_at": "2024-10-29T10:29:52", "owner": "marvetadotcom", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18032089661519773, "text": "Very inspiring", "created_at": "2024-10-26T11:17:45", "owner": "gti_digital", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18246099868273176, "text": "What a great structure 🙌 learned something new today❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:46:40", "owner": "mahimajalann", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18124091638385787, "text": "Wow, that’s amazing! I’ve never come across this before! Definitely going to share it with my creative friends!", "created_at": "2024-10-23T12:33:23", "owner": "viralon_digital_services", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061555468704539, "text": "Amazing brother", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:10:28", "owner": "zal.graphic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046175339095173, "text": "🔥🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-23T03:35:25", "owner": "laagendarojademercadotecnia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018142094618654, "text": "Wow! So incredible and creative design work. 👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-21T16:03:08", "owner": "officialdisks", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17913602192917058, "text": "I need to take my time to study this and apply it to my clients account and also my personal brand, thanks for sharing...", "created_at": "2024-10-20T16:55:41", "owner": "kadi.sibe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18269678116219692, "text": "woah! that's incredible! I never learned this! WIll share with my creative peers!", "created_at": "2024-10-20T14:17:14", "owner": "juliekaraschconsulting", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051733030766104, "text": "Amazing share👏", "created_at": "2024-10-20T13:27:25", "owner": "sowrovsorker5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18033141032068749, "text": "This is a really helpful breakdown of brand architectures!", "created_at": "2024-10-20T09:37:08", "owner": "marketingwithrupesh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023099807236370, "text": "All owned by Blackrock", "created_at": "2024-10-19T22:30:56", "owner": "themannycave", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060012793698584, "text": "Amazing post! 🫶🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-19T17:08:14", "owner": "nancybadillo13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020830652580244, "text": "I think this graphic is one of the most unique and elegant representations I’ve ever seen this concept!👏 👏👏👏💖🖤🤩", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:43:21", "owner": "crushyoursocial", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18106580563428022, "text": "Amazing 😍", "created_at": "2024-10-19T14:10:38", "owner": "digitalmaimoona", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040388039157414, "text": "Superb 👏", "created_at": "2024-10-19T13:51:39", "owner": "kiranshahzadii2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18045534731053076, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2024-10-19T13:32:47", "owner": "rupeshumbarkar16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918615114952051, "text": "Is there a hybrid between branded house/sub brands @master.knuta @kenny.kenray", "created_at": "2024-10-19T13:05:13", "owner": "dgshowtime", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985838454737140, "text": "Kenny, I'm blown away by your knowledge!\nThis breakdown of brand architecture types is incredibly helpful.\nYou're the best!", "created_at": "2024-10-19T12:33:00", "owner": "snakht_design", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17979591917771922, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-19T12:29:51", "owner": "devendra___kumar____", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024836756403335, "text": "Love house of brands🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-19T11:33:15", "owner": "thatigfriend", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18036718565212800, "text": "👍,nice job, but where is the difference between FedEX - FedEX Ground and Apple - Applle Music… \n\nBoth are Branded Houses and Sub-Brands., same as  House of Brands and Hybrid Brands… 🤷‍♂️ \n\nYou are mixing Brand- with Operational organization -Structures. \n\nThere are only main and sub-brands, everything else is unnecessary nonsense, which only confuses and brings no added value. \n\n✌️👊", "created_at": "2024-10-19T11:09:23", "owner": "mar.s.47906", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18021481358265432, "text": "You doing a Fantastic Job 👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-19T10:55:39", "owner": "daveproductdesigner", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18029359070344547, "text": "Intéressant et instructif. Thanks 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2024-10-19T10:54:54", "owner": "imatik_studio", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17863986687186062, "text": "Hi,\nAt Himotech Global, we partner with businesses to provide digital solutions that drive success. From web development and software testing to blockchain and market strategies, we tailor our services to meet your needs.\nLet’s connect and explore how we can support your business growth.\nLooking forward to hearing from you.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T07:08:39", "owner": "himotech.global", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062417377668264, "text": "This gives me another perspective about the brand. We're in the banking industry, which has  some brands for our products and services. Sometimes we confuse which our priority to boost our company brand or product to customers. Please give comments 🙏", "created_at": "2024-10-20T07:30:06", "owner": "rezarhamadany", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["infographics", "infographic", "brandmarketing", "marketingstrategy", "entrepreneurship", "salesandmarketing", "brandingdesign", "marketing", "marketingstrategies", "brandstrategy", "smallbusiness", "corporatebranding", "servicebranding", "brandingstrategy", "brandingtips", "branddesigner", "brandstrategist"]},
{"media_id": 3488998516675190855, "shortcode": "DBraapYSiBH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBraapYSiBH/", "taken_at": "2024-10-28T18:53:02", "caption": "the way this wasn’t even my PR package but they let me open it 🥲 AND I HAD SO MUCH FUN", "owner_username": "dregoldi", "owner_id": "1561946232", "likes": 125417, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0219_DBraapYSiBH\\DBraapYSiBH_20241028_185302.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17872757886379117, "text": "@redbullcz to potřebuju prosím ❤️‍🩹🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:40:49", "owner": "random_rebelka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096818419716838, "text": "Let me guess you work at an entry level job? You are about as close to being legally retrded as a person can get.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:25:14", "owner": "it.sme2470", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18033125144415522, "text": "You liked ice 🧊", "created_at": "2025-06-18T17:03:42", "owner": "gironaaronvic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906142429105496, "text": "Ice cream is a candy that tastes like RedBull", "created_at": "2025-03-29T16:32:29", "owner": "mllethea89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081274927585330, "text": "redbull PR 😍", "created_at": "2025-01-04T19:23:09", "owner": "desiree_massey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017661182407304, "text": "Me next???", "created_at": "2024-12-22T20:16:21", "owner": "margot_michels03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916805038034185, "text": "Love that", "created_at": "2024-12-22T01:18:17", "owner": "zaqqandhisgsd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910566087962517, "text": "I literally can’t find this flavor anywhere I tried it once and that was it", "created_at": "2024-12-21T19:37:52", "owner": "itsss___evan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035134775371981, "text": "Did you know that hammer is a straw ?", "created_at": "2024-12-19T19:00:13", "owner": "blohsh_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859642675316354, "text": "Guys don't drink redbull just drink your hydroh.", "created_at": "2024-12-19T15:57:24", "owner": "lucaballssaic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071533240597280, "text": "The packaging is so good i Don't even care about the drink", "created_at": "2024-12-19T11:22:37", "owner": "molly_noya_navya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074666884621484, "text": "Underwhelming", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:32:27", "owner": "dubaisours", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18254229919281454, "text": "Red Bull cause's strokes", "created_at": "2024-12-09T05:20:55", "owner": "vonnibrown1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042889751225537, "text": "I NEED IT", "created_at": "2024-12-05T09:25:12", "owner": "annisdefsober", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349987531122395, "text": "@lets.do.the.world", "created_at": "2024-12-03T19:03:52", "owner": "saaiiraaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031948265147038, "text": "Jessie we gotta cook", "created_at": "2024-11-29T20:30:39", "owner": "daemon_blackfyr3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069381067642982, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:48:11", "owner": "nsch.loe_numbi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298586593204960, "text": "How Do You Get One?", "created_at": "2024-11-27T21:32:08", "owner": "davidjwittke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016452440379211, "text": "Man I was disappointed in that flavor! 😢", "created_at": "2024-11-26T23:30:26", "owner": "beefiit_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013293158442894, "text": "Why you so shocked the ice/glass broke when you hit it with a metallic mallet? You so basic!", "created_at": "2024-11-26T11:30:40", "owner": "therealdamonweisend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005065994678880, "text": "Best flavor so far then comes the Juneberry flavor in 2nd place followed by the Coconut flavor! 🤌🏾", "created_at": "2024-11-26T06:52:58", "owner": "berryberry_bliss11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027143822218011, "text": "🩵 Tastes like blue raspberry to me 🩵", "created_at": "2024-11-26T03:40:53", "owner": "nikki_e46m3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051998389817221, "text": "@e.mony  they need to send u one", "created_at": "2024-11-25T08:06:59", "owner": "kyraaareneee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052371262803409, "text": "@redbull hello I’d like to inquire", "created_at": "2024-11-25T06:26:29", "owner": "varvarasimakovaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037663469035690, "text": "Do you that the hammer is a straw", "created_at": "2024-11-24T14:29:45", "owner": "us_ername_01583", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950245941894878, "text": "Where do I get one", "created_at": "2024-11-21T15:28:57", "owner": "dkw9253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925814853986856, "text": "Where can I find this", "created_at": "2024-11-20T04:37:32", "owner": "misscrystal36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042739964325152, "text": "Literally!", "created_at": "2024-11-19T19:35:09", "owner": "gingerchronicles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024746243262885, "text": "Where can I get that", "created_at": "2024-11-19T00:15:26", "owner": "maundyphilogene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280693828245210, "text": "@1509chil0  jvx sa!!!", "created_at": "2024-11-18T23:23:52", "owner": "myriamcroquette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049287844992209, "text": "@aleeeeeexl du hast des ja a bekommen, des eis war a süßigkeit, host du des gwusst?", "created_at": "2024-11-17T20:21:23", "owner": "stadja_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023893250272410, "text": "I need this", "created_at": "2024-11-17T07:06:07", "owner": "sabrina.boujee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843639220354270, "text": "Бедное сердце и давление)", "created_at": "2024-11-17T01:33:59", "owner": "gaziovaz869", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468598984046926, "text": "I am actually loving this and i also want one 😭@redbullindia", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:58:05", "owner": "itzkhushhhh11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013923797416580, "text": "I hated they way she did that . The entire process .", "created_at": "2024-11-15T20:10:15", "owner": "emmanuel.melgoza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247391974282264, "text": "@marine_gineste  c’est pour toi !", "created_at": "2024-11-12T16:03:52", "owner": "justiiiine_tassy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037629500206079, "text": "Is it sugar?", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:14:41", "owner": "_tingshao_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1793