is when Red Bull became Heisenburg", "created_at": "2024-11-07T12:52:26", "owner": "thisguyseejaye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027119819419427, "text": "Boycott 🇵🇸🍉🔻‼️", "created_at": "2024-11-07T05:08:42", "owner": "alzain.f.alenezi_777", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100889374459162, "text": "I love redbull but this shi tastes like a car freshener", "created_at": "2024-11-07T04:39:42", "owner": "n.woo_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064357660673603, "text": "Pointless stupid video", "created_at": "2024-11-07T00:47:16", "owner": "margaritarod2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959469201831999, "text": "@tiara.bze", "created_at": "2024-11-06T19:59:47", "owner": "laprincessa_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098224744476528, "text": "it tastes like medicine… tbh", "created_at": "2024-11-06T19:14:03", "owner": "aqv4r1vs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071406424616808, "text": "PLEASE IT WAS SO GOOD AND I CANT FIND IR ANYWHERE", "created_at": "2024-11-06T00:58:06", "owner": "nooo_ahhh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116677834409001, "text": "Sácalo de una vez dios", "created_at": "2024-11-05T13:34:04", "owner": "dulcealborotada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126513394351638, "text": "Red bull has been popping off lately with their marketing tbh 🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-04T17:00:29", "owner": "shrimposium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371330662115083, "text": "@atikamogal", "created_at": "2024-11-04T09:42:19", "owner": "kiaraamanilall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046952465069282, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-11-04T03:23:23", "owner": "lexiiiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046565615289765, "text": "Upppp", "created_at": "2024-11-04T00:52:14", "owner": "lealthaisx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469427134042859, "text": "i didn’t try red ball no one recommended it to me so it’s worth it or what?", "created_at": "2024-11-04T00:31:07", "owner": "nii_sad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352994086185296, "text": "Bana da gönderir misiniz plss @redbulltr", "created_at": "2024-11-03T21:36:24", "owner": "mustfyman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884234842069510, "text": "What is the metal box ?", "created_at": "2024-11-03T15:06:29", "owner": "mala_evicka", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18280975702175083, "text": "😢😍", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:43:12", "owner": "m._na14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052688008748821, "text": "@redbullgermany ich hätte auch gerne so eine Box 😢", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:17:19", "owner": "chantal.wrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093968668484575, "text": "@kita_kttn e có màu xanh nữa", "created_at": "2024-11-03T11:40:32", "owner": "min.h.anh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907812025047276, "text": "ITS SO GOOD", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:22:25", "owner": "jokayxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900350239078694, "text": "There's literally more i was worried there was figuratively more", "created_at": "2024-11-03T00:53:43", "owner": "blakeguyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049815331812030, "text": "@redbulltr bugün benim doğum günüm, benim de bundanım olsuuuun. nulur. 🥺", "created_at": "2024-11-02T23:14:21", "owner": "eylemmmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858280924280524, "text": "That is their wordt taste!!!!", "created_at": "2024-11-02T11:42:22", "owner": "lotta.ring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439051036069864, "text": "i’d sob if i ever got a red bull pr package", "created_at": "2024-11-02T02:51:13", "owner": "resolving_space", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044619704295892, "text": "😍@redbullbe comment avoir cela ?", "created_at": "2024-11-01T19:43:46", "owner": "thelilglow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005090216667931, "text": "@redbull I would like to be added on the list 💕", "created_at": "2024-11-01T17:05:48", "owner": "mz_stifle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266094091247758, "text": "@redbull I’ve got a friend who would LOVE a PR package", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:25:39", "owner": "mermaidalex1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005474996665251, "text": "it tasted very good like nostalgic candy but i wish it was sweeter", "created_at": "2024-11-01T02:01:36", "owner": "hypnotical_", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18038111378191619, "text": "Wow cringe", "created_at": "2024-10-31T17:30:32", "owner": "super_ghoul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048517027958677, "text": "It takes so gross", "created_at": "2024-10-31T16:30:00", "owner": "ohshititskerri", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18052144699935293, "text": "It tastes like sweet tarts", "created_at": "2024-10-31T12:06:28", "owner": "debzie.io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064010425670449, "text": "This flavour is gross do not buy", "created_at": "2024-10-31T11:12:38", "owner": "dekidbarba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990144219581715, "text": "Now I will.embrace the influencer lifestyle @melee_daylee", "created_at": "2024-10-31T02:56:32", "owner": "joe6monkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046119665045399, "text": "I love it but feel like it's basically the same as arctic berry and juneberry.", "created_at": "2024-10-30T23:02:22", "owner": "ukraine_roots", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18051892159923317, "text": "That’s that in the back?", "created_at": "2024-10-30T20:55:50", "owner": "sarah_e_douglas", "likes": 121}, {"id": 18038088074271152, "text": "I’m jealous lol. I drink redbull way to much", "created_at": "2024-10-30T20:29:28", "owner": "m.bonin1564", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060347035826562, "text": "@johanpapz", "created_at": "2024-10-30T18:00:15", "owner": "sharjat_couture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032529779095508, "text": "I tried it and it was wayyyy to sweet and I didn’t really taste any vanilla😕", "created_at": "2024-10-30T17:30:29", "owner": "lilly_rene7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038640218516374, "text": "this flavor tastes like cough syrup", "created_at": "2024-10-30T16:54:24", "owner": "artifyings", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880538707167993, "text": "LOVE this!!", "created_at": "2024-10-30T16:11:55", "owner": "blakemalibu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374190610107211, "text": "Was so good with vodka", "created_at": "2024-10-30T04:07:37", "owner": "toarihahn", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17922099486002043, "text": "EXCUSE ME I SEARCH HIGH AND LOW AND YOU GET THE PR IM JEALOUS", "created_at": "2024-10-30T01:39:13", "owner": "aikatervn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104667646443071, "text": "the ice was probably candy 👀", "created_at": "2024-10-29T23:47:06", "owner": "mfknbongrat", "likes": 1493}, {"id": 17934619991934191, "text": "I was waiting for her to crack the counter 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-29T21:28:49", "owner": "dwnwthethickness", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18011868524647611, "text": "I thought the flavor was so mid lol", "created_at": "2024-10-29T15:42:56", "owner": "mills_any", "likes": 3075}, {"id": 18036108974259237, "text": "How do I get on that pr list", "created_at": "2024-10-29T13:41:20", "owner": "zahra_shatavy12", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18040211824973647, "text": "@redbull I need this. 😭", "created_at": "2024-10-29T12:59:33", "owner": "cecilliacalvarez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854589943298781, "text": "Can’t wait to go try this flavor", "created_at": "2024-10-28T21:08:47", "owner": "daaphennee", "likes": 378}, {"id": 18034877417251279, "text": "So dope", "created_at": "2024-10-28T20:51:31", "owner": "gangstaparadiseart", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18253141900284001, "text": "Who is drinking red bull 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-28T20:05:01", "owner": "prayforkeepsprayforkeeps", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3490953772952431371, "shortcode": "DByW_XsI6sL", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DByW_XsI6sL/", "taken_at": "2024-10-31T11:29:32", "caption": "徽章电镀颜色！胸针/徽章有30多种电镀颜色~ 常规设计都会使用黄金色，银色，永黑，黑镍。 如果风格特出可以搭配古青铜，古金色等。 配搭烤漆工艺，胸针就是这个味道！", "owner_username": "stickerboxofficial", "owner_id": "3091212928", "likes": 52, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0220_DByW_XsI6sL\\DByW_XsI6sL_20241031_112932.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3489738818930502561, "shortcode": "DBuCvdlPmuh", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBuCvdlPmuh/", "taken_at": "2024-10-29T19:18:05", "caption": "went from unexpected flying objects to falling objects real quick 🫨\n\nTampa Bay: #RedBullFlugtag is soaring into your city on Saturday, November 9th.\n\nJoin us outside the Convention Center to see DIY crafts test their wiiings. 🔗 in bio for all the deets.", "owner_username": "redbullusa", "owner_id": "40813406313", "likes": 435205, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0221_DBuCvdlPmuh\\DBuCvdlPmuh_20241029_191805.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18039747371221718, "text": "REMEMBER WHO YOU ARE....!!", "created_at": "2025-04-20T11:08:10", "owner": "voluntary_being", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896943223192138, "text": "Everyone forgot the basic principle", "created_at": "2025-04-13T21:33:49", "owner": "grabgraphic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401314474100934, "text": "These videos are so much fun to watch!!! 😂🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-04-06T21:12:43", "owner": "mrielita_1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023188421466749, "text": "So redbull does give you wings😂", "created_at": "2025-03-29T07:06:49", "owner": "anucondaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095317918541871, "text": "isn’t that cheating?", "created_at": "2025-03-29T00:17:59", "owner": "ccat.kiwii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039446471533692, "text": "Has there been anyone who did a porta potty hang glider before", "created_at": "2025-03-27T16:16:26", "owner": "thatoneguy9922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865239286241204, "text": "Chicken be try Harding", "created_at": "2025-01-29T11:18:01", "owner": "kloaken_1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077777500627989, "text": "That wasn’t flying, that was falling in style", "created_at": "2025-01-28T00:42:12", "owner": "doritomunchr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18320490148161551, "text": "Thats not flying, that's falling", "created_at": "2025-01-27T01:57:13", "owner": "legkyongk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18484503472059838, "text": "So your just allowed to bring in a hand glider?", "created_at": "2025-01-27T00:56:04", "owner": "dany_itani2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023250425370160, "text": "Why is pokimane the broadcaster", "created_at": "2025-01-23T22:28:48", "owner": "0pium_ali", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079226830533986, "text": "Wright Brothers be laughing watching thiss", "created_at": "2025-01-21T08:44:08", "owner": "nalar_r224", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18074121685640691, "text": "True meaning of ufo", "created_at": "2025-01-17T05:03:34", "owner": "crispers4410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891113263068965, "text": "Marty ded", "created_at": "2025-01-16T17:05:24", "owner": "paddy_me_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312751117200508, "text": "Annual competition to build a hang glider", "created_at": "2025-01-13T20:03:59", "owner": "wilmington_shredder", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128069890393822, "text": "They only fell because they didnt drink redbull", "created_at": "2025-01-13T18:55:22", "owner": "christestosterone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18256860061279408, "text": "The first one is a manace😂", "created_at": "2025-01-10T11:07:59", "owner": "aufaribrahim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009731798692888, "text": "Is the first guy ok?", "created_at": "2025-01-08T05:02:57", "owner": "wild_pandacoon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946090779925417, "text": "The Deleorean guy broke his back looks like 😢", "created_at": "2025-01-07T05:52:08", "owner": "superlongvacation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043586801217050, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-01-07T04:15:28", "owner": "edikzargarjan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064267492846476, "text": "Last one can’t be legal", "created_at": "2025-01-07T02:57:22", "owner": "keithgriz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938860146834875, "text": "Nothing flying", "created_at": "2025-01-07T00:30:52", "owner": "bobbya9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968699289696961, "text": "Sampe people cry about global warming out here poluting the ocean for clout.", "created_at": "2025-01-07T00:19:22", "owner": "thespacedad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053852243486214, "text": "The last one shouldn’t be allowed", "created_at": "2025-01-06T23:10:33", "owner": "fendercountrybassplayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028964702284124, "text": "21.1 giggawats", "created_at": "2025-01-06T22:28:33", "owner": "leo550e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051205832485972, "text": "A great way to hurt yourself that first guy looks like he really landed hard on top of that equipment. I wouldn’t wanna do that.", "created_at": "2025-01-06T19:04:19", "owner": "swartzken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061721110903220, "text": "Not bad.  The 1st flight of the Wright Brothers was only 120 feet.", "created_at": "2025-01-06T14:37:28", "owner": "edward.payne.79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035044700601978, "text": "公然的不法投棄😆", "created_at": "2025-01-06T05:38:05", "owner": "watarimakotow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028435037275872, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-05T23:27:17", "owner": "0fff_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887549206170739, "text": "Nah bro, chicken bought a plane with him", "created_at": "2024-12-27T14:52:41", "owner": "adiwaniadnan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141279946369366, "text": "You KNOW the first guy broke his tailbone lol also how'd they let him just throw a car in there lol ain't nobody retrieving that lol", "created_at": "2024-12-27T11:41:41", "owner": "tomatoglassart", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18041239253011499, "text": "Coisa de quem não tem o que fazer", "created_at": "2024-12-23T22:45:22", "owner": "mdnn1507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940316463942577, "text": "😢 the delorean", "created_at": "2024-12-23T03:09:35", "owner": "simonelliandres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070620295676721, "text": "I thought the stapler would be the winner.", "created_at": "2024-12-22T10:36:37", "owner": "mikebbraun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892249312108482, "text": "Can tell why red bull got sued for saying it gives you wills, because they are “flying” at all they are falling the only reason thy have any distance is because they are being pushed with forfe", "created_at": "2024-12-21T09:30:58", "owner": "jack_luke03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034576562123943, "text": "The chicken guy paid attention in class he knows physics", "created_at": "2024-12-21T01:37:25", "owner": "bandmanofficial6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052880612506219, "text": "isn’t the chicken @liamthompsonofficial", "created_at": "2024-12-20T02:06:11", "owner": "seucos._.garage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043231724184966, "text": "I am confused....does redbull give wings or not?", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:39:20", "owner": "the.only.vivo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055308973784430, "text": "Its like they know it wont fly", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:25:13", "owner": "2wavy._brady", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157491931329505, "text": "“Alright so one of you guys are allowed to actually try and fly and the rest all just make it like 6 feet n we’ll call it cool”", "created_at": "2024-12-12T13:05:22", "owner": "ohiopokehoarder", "likes": 57}, {"id": 17847703914364253, "text": "No wayyyyyy the made it over 200ft!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:07:17", "owner": "carsandcoffeestl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028963052444239, "text": "Marty Mcan'tfly", "created_at": "2024-12-09T05:12:36", "owner": "julioogata", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865751296204467, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T17:27:45", "owner": "jscorpio74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048483005284030, "text": "Always that group that takes the project too seriously", "created_at": "2024-12-07T02:40:36", "owner": "tomcaseyiv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17994321581717676, "text": "Ай акенин…", "created_at": "2024-12-06T07:12:36", "owner": "iamsuleimen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949987176884530, "text": "chicken the great", "created_at": "2024-12-02T02:19:51", "owner": "nayakarespatigirastho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073957000619740, "text": "How you expect a chicken not to fly?", "created_at": "2024-12-01T07:51:58", "owner": "luget_allan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17934886688958583, "text": "Hey I though that you were energy drink maker once😒🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-30T20:01:49", "owner": "its_vihaan_07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047852300107215, "text": "I really hate when people don't put efforts making it glide.", "created_at": "2024-11-30T14:50:09", "owner": "wingman8643", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986729814760599, "text": "GREAT SCOTT", "created_at": "2024-11-28T02:49:36", "owner": "deloreanrental", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18022990340537572, "text": "How depois this lagoon❤️❤️❤️😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:21:19", "owner": "wanessadeoliveiragrisol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121203961395173, "text": "Where is mercedes benz CLR", "created_at": "2024-11-25T12:33:52", "owner": "mr_spyder_bolt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025802891571486, "text": "I don’t know if you guys keep stats like this but I bet this is the event with the most serious injuries, even compared to Rampage n shit", "created_at": "2024-11-25T00:51:18", "owner": "daaavis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845689207361072, "text": "@guidomalta @sergiocajumalta", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:23:26", "owner": "denise_freitas_malta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051578110975992, "text": "So guys when you are making drinks ?", "created_at": "2024-11-24T11:25:06", "owner": "_mayank_singh_8996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188220412307183, "text": "When space-x engineers do this shit for fun 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T23:39:29", "owner": "preferably.mr.scott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047964326001720, "text": "The chicken had nothing unusual but the costume", "created_at": "2024-11-22T15:16:53", "owner": "milkocamellini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028422866429262, "text": "I never understood this concept person will longest wings always wins then why dont every one builds that way", "created_at": "2024-11-21T14:34:57", "owner": "notoriously.living", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012803987445576, "text": "stapler got robbed", "created_at": "2024-11-21T13:02:00", "owner": "jashan_chaudharyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869675878240408, "text": "That first one looked like it hurt", "created_at": "2024-11-21T03:06:03", "owner": "casually_tom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029742170161027, "text": "You didn't expect the literal hanglider to fly?", "created_at": "2024-11-19T23:58:36", "owner": "derrickiswellcool2", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18031651799594377, "text": "What do you mean you didn’t expect the giant airfoil to fly?", "created_at": "2024-11-19T13:57:15", "owner": "high_hat_", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18327484084156113, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-17T14:05:08", "owner": "pedagog.ishakorhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029334959428814, "text": "What we’ve learned is: create a detachable foil that someone holds on to. Those designs do the best, better when there’s a ramp that it can shoot off of. But this guy also hit a really good wind.", "created_at": "2024-11-17T01:15:31", "owner": "tye.mi931", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931367913958444, "text": "Two part vehicles should be banned from the event.", "created_at": "2024-11-16T17:29:41", "owner": "gannjerrod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908886058048238, "text": "Only three of these things actually flew", "created_at": "2024-11-15T21:46:18", "owner": "spacealex3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007837745491756, "text": "irl turbo dismount😭🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-15T15:46:03", "owner": "9314.artery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073439209610770, "text": "Urm. That's a hang glider with extras attached.", "created_at": "2024-11-14T22:02:31", "owner": "sam_owen_773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039323960467926, "text": "I love America", "created_at": "2024-11-14T16:24:14", "owner": "virux_wheel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866498482181859, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T01:39:08", "owner": "gmex8196", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275346211218520, "text": "🫡💸", "created_at": "2024-11-13T19:53:21", "owner": "puriyam963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289402723234735, "text": "Are you sure you’re allowed to post this ? I think the first guy died on impact.", "created_at": "2024-11-13T17:48:15", "owner": "kriskoslop", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18125371822388529, "text": "Thats not flying, thats falling", "created_at": "2024-11-13T09:41:31", "owner": "mikakaidold", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18044029574113482, "text": "The last one was a glider though. I think that’s what they are meant to do 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T00:11:28", "owner": "johnc2", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18021329804532876, "text": "Maunya buat lomba gini pas 17an", "created_at": "2024-11-12T13:03:40", "owner": "tri_isk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886923322120878, "text": "Did she say ,Jeff hardy?", "created_at": "2024-11-12T07:27:21", "owner": "ashley_muderedzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031945355122800, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T05:20:37", "owner": "lorenngv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028680596419564, "text": "Last one was lame. All others 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:38:39", "owner": "infamousma23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145211647351445, "text": "😂😂😂😂 nigga we gota do this!!! @spawn1226", "created_at": "2024-11-11T22:26:27", "owner": "coachprime9z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099229333422894, "text": "Last one definitely cheated", "created_at": "2024-11-11T17:03:23", "owner": "alchemist_ht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992741544568541, "text": "Safe for the last, the others built theirs based on hope not logoc", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:40:14", "owner": "ejyro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049809349983650, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T03:49:36", "owner": "michael_phas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052474912784474, "text": "WWA smackdown on the Delorean😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:54:53", "owner": "dasspenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062150914762916, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:03:04", "owner": "djshoatcircuit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014006402395328, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-10T05:28:07", "owner": "kevin4199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004109933676842, "text": "That's Milton's stapler", "created_at": "2024-11-09T20:34:30", "owner": "dalegribble45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938856981923284, "text": "How tf you guys didn't expect chicken to fly???", "created_at": "2024-11-09T16:47:17", "owner": "bobttle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025157819228202, "text": "Delorean ftw just for the effort put into the build🙌🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-09T00:55:15", "owner": "foreign_002_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063899404705691, "text": "chicken shouldve been a fucking pig, id have won so many arguments 🙄", "created_at": "2024-11-08T22:47:42", "owner": "achotikul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881226286087333, "text": "Hey redbull do you guys even sell the cans? I mean it feels like that is the side quest and these are some dope sh*t 😂👏", "created_at": "2024-11-08T14:06:03", "owner": "_mrmaddy___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085290406473029, "text": "These are so anti climactic, except for chicken glider 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-08T03:37:37", "owner": "official_dimar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047413244007032, "text": "Who tf watches this", "created_at": "2024-11-06T23:25:02", "owner": "elliot_lofgren06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375013762108307, "text": "They should’ve made the deloreans doors as detachable wings", "created_at": "2024-11-06T22:41:12", "owner": "loxz_303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363373249188825, "text": "😂😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-06T18:21:57", "owner": "dfwtr3y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031751444107911, "text": "Democrat campaign motivational video", "created_at": "2024-11-06T08:47:57", "owner": "beholdapp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049704841969134, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-06T05:55:43", "owner": "cfn_cho", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074532535583679, "text": "FYI, the chicken flew more than double the length of the Wright brothers’ first flight!", "created_at": "2024-11-06T02:40:13", "owner": "geowizard19", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17857725669289261, "text": "Msalya dlker", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:40:03", "owner": "naoufal_es50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258623038302073, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-05T14:00:20", "owner": "behruz_00732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359706505143605, "text": "O primeiro se fudeu 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T04:58:43", "owner": "sacher_roberto", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["redbullflugtag"]},
{"media_id": 3490404963812277500, "shortcode": "DBwaNJWSnz8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBwaNJWSnz8/", "taken_at": "2024-10-30T17:18:59", "caption": "We know how special your kids’ artwork is 🥹 show them how much you cherish it! Artkive photographs your kids’ art and transforms it into keepsake books to cherish forever! \n\nDon’t worry, if you want your artwork back, we’ll carefully return it to you!\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\n1.  Just order an Artkive box 📦 \n2.  Fill it with your kids’ art\n3.  Send it 🔙 to US\n4.  We’ll turn it into a stunning book!\n\nCheck out the linktree in our bio to order your Artkive box today and get the process started!\n\n#artkivebox #howtosavekidart #motherhood #parentingtips #momlife #parentinghacks #decluttering #trending #mom #momlife", "owner_username": "artkivebox", "owner_id": "233473732", "likes": 1330244, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0222_DBwaNJWSnz8\\DBwaNJWSnz8_20241030_171859.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18170329045380829, "text": "@gracierose33", "created_at": "2026-01-17T21:52:00", "owner": "bextar70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092030563789934, "text": "This is so amazing, 😍 love the idea. For all moms out there, bring your kids art to your TV for free with Liquid Canvas. You can pick the order in which your child’s art appears on your TV. Also check out our child development visuals on the app. Coco melon and Peppa Pig has nothing, do more with your TV ❤️", "created_at": "2026-01-16T19:54:59", "owner": "liquid.canvas.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872857054484091, "text": "Cyber", "created_at": "2026-01-15T11:44:57", "owner": "bettyxo625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208222588315985, "text": "But do you this for every year?", "created_at": "2026-01-08T12:21:59", "owner": "lizgrif3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078953771245501, "text": "Amazing idea ❤️", "created_at": "2026-01-01T02:36:41", "owner": "createwithmilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088522321989319, "text": "Cyber", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:31:29", "owner": "beksbar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100113289762891, "text": "Cyber", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:30:56", "owner": "beksbar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867130150481613, "text": "This is brilliant, we've got stacks of art from our kids ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:07:37", "owner": "nooqbook", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051972941308778, "text": "Great idea", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:28:34", "owner": "roamingheartliving", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004009856811386, "text": "I’ve already had two books made and delivered. Can I get two copies of the same?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T04:08:53", "owner": "mariainesny", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18208372330308779, "text": "@ashley_iaconetti 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:16:15", "owner": "choosejoyjas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970894206929678, "text": "Genial", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:56:47", "owner": "alamopoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077207594478469, "text": "What if you want to add more do you need to order another book? What do you do with the originals after you turn it into a book?", "created_at": "2025-08-31T01:57:36", "owner": "awkward_lemon00_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075147665092425, "text": "So cute!!", "created_at": "2025-08-27T22:25:34", "owner": "lifewithdistortion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056063414150822, "text": "Do we get to pick the order in which the art appears?", "created_at": "2025-08-24T14:32:11", "owner": "chasingstars_9274", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17909875266199789, "text": "Hi! Do you ship to México????", "created_at": "2025-08-18T01:59:51", "owner": "priscila_plam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109109851535174, "text": "@avajenifferl", "created_at": "2025-08-08T17:39:01", "owner": "maxine_reddy_erasmus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906501292200070, "text": "Do you deliver to South Africa?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T12:55:03", "owner": "trix_das", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895060783267364, "text": "This is amazing!!", "created_at": "2025-08-02T01:04:41", "owner": "tdthechef4u", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18403477423112994, "text": "So great, i just dont live in the US so can not use this", "created_at": "2025-07-31T19:56:04", "owner": "lotteb86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935872618002915, "text": "Hii!! If we want to add more..do we start a new book or you keep adding to the 1st book?", "created_at": "2025-07-31T18:19:39", "owner": "tatimejia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091012348590668, "text": "Omg this is genius!!!", "created_at": "2025-07-29T08:38:02", "owner": "skye_knifey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038595332358189, "text": "Aw. This is cute. Are you able to laminate the originals and turn it into a book?", "created_at": "2025-07-22T20:28:57", "owner": "caroviejo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18275692051275439, "text": "Hi! I wud like to order for my kids.how please?", "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:53:41", "owner": "klaberinto5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917370286129666, "text": "@krichfitz", "created_at": "2025-07-04T16:59:11", "owner": "graceerose3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117606682482700, "text": "This is so amazing", "created_at": "2025-07-04T01:42:15", "owner": "nourishedwomb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069461282055730, "text": "I love this idea", "created_at": "2025-06-30T19:40:49", "owner": "kraftingwithkendall", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861315004428919, "text": "Omg!!! Looove this idea!!! I'm probably creative enough to do it myself but finding the time!!! And these look AMAZING!!! Clever 😍", "created_at": "2025-06-27T01:49:22", "owner": "thejasminewayyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073913104931802, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-06-17T21:32:40", "owner": "erikaskreativewelt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947082060994715, "text": "So do you discard the actual pieces and just send back the book to us?", "created_at": "2025-06-17T19:16:10", "owner": "kcannf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996970062639100, "text": "I’ve been doing this manually, using other photo company’s but this is amazing that I can just send them in and let y’all take the good photos of them! 😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-16T03:55:50", "owner": "britney.cast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097650460598780, "text": "She ain’t just throw it away , she put it through the shredder 😅", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:34:31", "owner": "imjustdaveee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281139115254529, "text": "@j.g.braun", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:02:15", "owner": "teylor.merlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906175732056200, "text": "This is absolutely brilliant, I’ve benêt seen anything like it before 😍", "created_at": "2025-06-05T03:12:18", "owner": "lily_andtheboys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054526985352085, "text": "Obsessed!!", "created_at": "2025-06-03T01:58:23", "owner": "emm_babbyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101951053531103, "text": "I would make an art expo weekend with them;) for the family and neighbours of course", "created_at": "2025-05-19T11:30:05", "owner": "unaculuna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857114530423540, "text": "Do you send the art pieces back too?", "created_at": "2025-05-10T11:48:21", "owner": "alliwalli2k5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083676649661169, "text": "Perhaps in another universe I’ll capture my kids artwork", "created_at": "2025-05-04T21:04:36", "owner": "idahdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111918766489855, "text": "I wish I knew about this sooner😢", "created_at": "2025-04-27T23:25:02", "owner": "queenonkingdomlevels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963728001870442, "text": "thought that was a paper shredder", "created_at": "2025-04-19T15:54:13", "owner": "aye5ha.etc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027700679413993, "text": "Байндер с файликами не справился?)", "created_at": "2025-04-18T20:24:50", "owner": "vibrazebra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18501501283047428, "text": "@artkivebox Can someone please get back to me asap about my missing 2 books?? They were shipped April 4 and we still haven’t received them. I’m worried they are lost and you all are saying you are going to recycle the art now.", "created_at": "2025-04-18T17:21:25", "owner": "ashleyy_k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023492705482292, "text": "Amazing idea", "created_a