ke an art expo weekend with them;) for the family and neighbours of course", "created_at": "2025-05-19T11:30:05", "owner": "unaculuna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857114530423540, "text": "Do you send the art pieces back too?", "created_at": "2025-05-10T11:48:21", "owner": "alliwalli2k5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083676649661169, "text": "Perhaps in another universe I’ll capture my kids artwork", "created_at": "2025-05-04T21:04:36", "owner": "idahdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111918766489855, "text": "I wish I knew about this sooner😢", "created_at": "2025-04-27T23:25:02", "owner": "queenonkingdomlevels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963728001870442, "text": "thought that was a paper shredder", "created_at": "2025-04-19T15:54:13", "owner": "aye5ha.etc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027700679413993, "text": "Байндер с файликами не справился?)", "created_at": "2025-04-18T20:24:50", "owner": "vibrazebra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18501501283047428, "text": "@artkivebox Can someone please get back to me asap about my missing 2 books?? They were shipped April 4 and we still haven’t received them. I’m worried they are lost and you all are saying you are going to recycle the art now.", "created_at": "2025-04-18T17:21:25", "owner": "ashleyy_k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023492705482292, "text": "Amazing idea", "created_at": "2025-04-18T00:40:55", "owner": "huskyhatco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062256869099780, "text": "@tjlove22", "created_at": "2025-04-17T11:51:27", "owner": "emily_chene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069565975922068, "text": "@katielove0915", "created_at": "2025-04-17T11:51:12", "owner": "emily_chene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947765142971855, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-04-15T13:58:25", "owner": "therashidhingra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386851960115918, "text": "doing this once i have a child", "created_at": "2025-04-13T12:44:30", "owner": "rdyz11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954832833929195, "text": "No era más fácil encuadernarlos y mantener los originales 😢", "created_at": "2025-04-11T21:08:20", "owner": "nutricion.paniagua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498441340020203, "text": "Love your dress! I wore it for Mother’s Day with my girls and we all matched! We love this dress! ❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-04-11T00:37:32", "owner": "believeandbudget", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078048937741303, "text": "Oh my goodness!!! Answered prayers! How can I get in on this ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-04-10T09:52:17", "owner": "fertileground", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497643151028024, "text": "Can i ask why you dont scan the pictures?", "created_at": "2025-04-06T15:49:17", "owner": "ziteeek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952548570947333, "text": "Such a great idea!", "created_at": "2025-04-06T15:05:56", "owner": "becausebooksmatter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042669791415189, "text": "Great idea. Not sure of the price or where, but the idea is great", "created_at": "2025-03-31T11:25:50", "owner": "helencowling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887255305236778, "text": "@santanah01", "created_at": "2025-03-29T13:25:30", "owner": "evmaalda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078320485708454, "text": "Das ist dann nicht mehr das selbe...", "created_at": "2025-03-29T11:33:54", "owner": "micky_official_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["artkivebox", "howtosavekidart", "motherhood", "parentingtips", "momlife", "parentinghacks", "decluttering", "trending", "mom", "momlife"]},
{"media_id": 3491493412556215081, "shortcode": "DB0RsKPB5Mp", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB0RsKPB5Mp/", "taken_at": "2024-11-01T05:22:47", "caption": "老闆：你為什麼遲到\n我：老闆你一定不會相信列車為了外送披薩誤點\n老闆：你覺得這樣可以打發我嗎\n#迷因 #梗圖 #memes #meme #趣圖 #迷因梗圖 #工作 #上班 #辦公室 #下班 #放假 #週末 #搞笑 #笑話 #影片 #短影音 #翻譯 #joke #work #office #weekend #holiday #義大利 #披薩 #外送", "owner_username": "simons_twmeme", "owner_id": "67985542383", "likes": 8904, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0223_DB0RsKPB5Mp\\DB0RsKPB5Mp_20241101_052247.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18130072927385140, "text": "中国更疯狂 高铁上点外卖😂因为回中国坐高铁时发现乘姐在分发外卖", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:25:02", "owner": "stefanosun778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043358663334042, "text": "鐵路便當義大利版", "created_at": "2024-12-10T05:36:10", "owner": "sarazai325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078091561586896, "text": "義式鐵路便當😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:06:32", "owner": "frank.07.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008252762673538, "text": "好險他沒有遇到副車長，pizza會被沒收", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:20:44", "owner": "mengbowu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434134324076384, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-19T03:27:16", "owner": "lachunsang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247062064275298, "text": "吃🍕是一件很开心🥳的事😍", "created_at": "2024-11-18T14:55:24", "owner": "caoqiaodongge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050649115824752, "text": "打開全部有鳳梨會怎樣😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:04:41", "owner": "lck_wow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938269737926663, "text": "列車長有義務等這些人嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-14T00:55:24", "owner": "zoomers_mihawk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866555956179973, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:59:57", "owner": "fuching.chuang.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014587175390225, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:12:25", "owner": "audreycutie425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065349814668316, "text": "🤌🤌", "created_at": "2024-11-10T14:08:46", "owner": "heng__0210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877367968191198, "text": "😆🤌🤌", "created_at": "2024-11-08T12:10:09", "owner": "supermariomamamia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124662607356959, "text": "義大利男人的快樂啊", "created_at": "2024-11-07T23:37:51", "owner": "lillian821022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940613394914944, "text": "結果打開是有加鳳梨的", "created_at": "2024-11-05T10:34:04", "owner": "shenglongzeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042923890923486, "text": "這麼歡樂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T09:34:06", "owner": "jjgreish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378081442107372, "text": "有香菜披薩嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-05T08:59:50", "owner": "wangyunghao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024226196528634, "text": "好像在義大利偏合理", "created_at": "2024-11-05T00:55:27", "owner": "iriso_oll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051891979941187, "text": "🤌🏻🤌🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-04T08:06:24", "owner": "linkage0820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050318848804337, "text": "這個我喜歡❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-03T14:21:31", "owner": "chao_weicheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053547955745663, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T13:34:07", "owner": "steven_huang_tennislifeinjapan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853736848313509, "text": "打開發現全是鳳梨披薩🍕🗣️🗿", "created_at": "2024-11-03T11:58:27", "owner": "smt_stanley", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067881385646443, "text": "義大利鐵路也要學台鐵搞餐飲了嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:21:25", "owner": "c.k.exp5606", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17896082658092191, "text": "該慶幸搭的不是DB", "created_at": "2024-11-03T04:12:13", "owner": "ycchang0529", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084460060469304, "text": "想吃榴槤pizza", "created_at": "2024-11-03T03:24:04", "owner": "thisismymetaaccount", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292641088231323, "text": "那外送員不就要自己要買進出站的錢？", "created_at": "2024-11-03T02:29:50", "owner": "zcf132", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18067808998582114, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-02T15:12:25", "owner": "jennifer.yu.165", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886488169121012, "text": "快快快！！！速度速度", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:35:40", "owner": "anubis751031", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18335119252181938, "text": "買披薩送鳳梨/菠蘿", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:27:34", "owner": "zonglin410", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962053797696492, "text": "火車便當的概念嘛⋯😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:09:07", "owner": "0.0_ding", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026819621185616, "text": "結局應該要有一個以上的人上不了車才對…", "created_at": "2024-11-02T02:20:37", "owner": "ing_1238", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18281047828168046, "text": "義大利的站長會解除契約嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:19:19", "owner": "_zonghan730", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18025775726206187, "text": "義大利的火車便當", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:05:41", "owner": "chy_hardwill323", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18037079165516208, "text": "有菠蘿Pizza嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:20:48", "owner": "daniel_chan_328", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17930796617951420, "text": "多年後 老闆看到 深深的吸一口氣說：嗯 果然不是打發我  但是我還是不後悔炒了你", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:55:05", "owner": "zansin83", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18044198558488267, "text": "最後的畫面中的男人右眼怪怪的。", "created_at": "2024-11-01T11:05:12", "owner": "wayne_5668", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025805714421839, "text": "我是意大利人，我可以确认这些事情确实发生了。我上学的时候，我们和同学一起点了披萨，还在课堂上点了快餐当零食。哦，那太好了。", "created_at": "2024-11-01T08:42:08", "owner": "j8n8_", "likes": 299}, {"id": 18046486334495557, "text": "🤌", "created_at": "2024-11-01T08:35:53", "owner": "ya.ya_9620", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081051019531161, "text": "😂😂😂😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:49:04", "owner": "bao_co_co", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933655554944719, "text": "感覺很多人都在那一站同時餓了", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:38:48", "owner": "h62541", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17966104316681344, "text": "我的那份是夏威夷披薩有註明要多鳳梨，謝謝。", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:50:12", "owner": "glenliu8", "likes": 219}, {"id": 18042412100317965, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:42:10", "owner": "kelvinsimpsons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048283003989122, "text": "上一站就先打電話預訂嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:24:47", "owner": "esteriortw", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18024763715226194, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:19:29", "owner": "ashe_623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059631448832064, "text": "they have food delivery on chinese high speed trains …….", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:01:05", "owner": "roiwilly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886244176138292, "text": "最尾上車果個獨眼龍 一喺黑手黨 一系 James Bond 入邊啲奸角", "created_at": "2024-11-14T06:27:02", "owner": "mattytze", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["迷因", "梗圖", "memes", "meme", "趣圖", "迷因梗圖", "工作", "上班", "辦公室", "下班", "放假", "週末", "搞笑", "笑話", "影片", "短影音", "翻譯", "joke", "work", "office", "weekend", "holiday", "義大利", "披薩", "外送"]},
