"id": 18053523281061446, "text": "法號：海輪掀肚濕", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:20:58", "owner": "yu.zhen_0202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953214294895477, "text": "所以到底为什么 要拍那么low的东西", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:18:31", "owner": "11viona1026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046539044165960, "text": "用棒槌來渡化😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-01T10:43:34", "owner": "65k2556", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066951622691400, "text": "大湿：“我瘦不了了”", "created_at": "2025-01-01T07:58:09", "owner": "lewision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283004182218387, "text": "大師佛存在心中 身體是奔放的😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-01T02:09:17", "owner": "aschan05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158931478330694, "text": "動凡心😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T11:38:39", "owner": "superchiuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037393937108345, "text": "Arrest me 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T09:25:23", "owner": "higs_sayshello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879344341211946, "text": "😮😮😫😫😡😡😡", "created_at": "2024-12-31T03:10:23", "owner": "wan_tan91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931954605861613, "text": "这也是修行", "created_at": "2024-12-31T00:22:22", "owner": "mohyoethoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088686538534005, "text": "That’s SA", "created_at": "2024-12-30T23:41:09", "owner": "elchinosifu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903090544000580, "text": "大师的修为又进阶了", "created_at": "2024-12-30T14:43:45", "owner": "jamesthegoldsmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379099768108642, "text": "玩弄出家人，會下地獄", "created_at": "2024-12-30T14:14:39", "owner": "ahn550802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880182328124922, "text": "丫彌陀佛🙏六根清淨一根很硬🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-30T10:43:40", "owner": "liaoshuilong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970706502813442, "text": "Looks good fun to me", "created_at": "2024-12-30T10:18:09", "owner": "b.bell7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032912240416868, "text": "WTF!!!this ppls are totally over!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-30T01:21:23", "owner": "flowseal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872145004253329, "text": "She is playing a Chinese bouddhiste monk", "created_at": "2024-12-29T22:31:42", "owner": "gyalt_aktsang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896102983038305, "text": "Alguien que me diga cómo se llama la chica", "created_at": "2024-12-29T19:10:58", "owner": "bozzuttofabian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032384336451098, "text": "大師已濕😢", "created_at": "2024-12-29T09:30:28", "owner": "genla.lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18449730427069389, "text": "Well, it turns out nothing happens on the street. Go to the monastery.", "created_at": "2024-12-29T07:57:38", "owner": "saeed_gf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131256076378664, "text": "China or Japan?", "created_at": "2024-12-29T07:55:29", "owner": "saeed_gf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052397479992334, "text": "大師是騙化緣嗰啲？😂", "created_at": "2024-12-29T03:14:22", "owner": "ho.w.sau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060013417918484, "text": "Diam2 cenggur...", "created_at": "2024-12-28T09:45:56", "owner": "harisa.achmad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286868596243082, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-28T07:08:16", "owner": "ardimartupa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941636427810461, "text": "🤬🤬😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡🤬🤬", "created_at": "2024-12-28T06:37:30", "owner": "dnkee554x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030104150616748, "text": "Haji rasa jeruk 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-27T06:35:11", "owner": "tnr_setiawan_tirta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027824294573790, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-12-27T04:20:33", "owner": "namakuokekok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050863232013437, "text": "再繼續下去要破戒了", "created_at": "2024-12-27T03:31:33", "owner": "sewinyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050053451065832, "text": "老衲羞射了", "created_at": "2024-12-26T15:26:37", "owner": "zpeng7341", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055852819798199, "text": "🦜 lepaskan aku icci boss 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-26T10:45:24", "owner": "dimasdwiinata", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17992524959598518, "text": "Kl di konoha pasti sdh dihujat dan demo berjilud jilid 😄😄🤣🤣🤣😛😛🤸🤸", "created_at": "2024-12-26T03:40:51", "owner": "narnorrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055720907508014, "text": "Tak patut ... tak patut", "created_at": "2024-12-26T03:09:42", "owner": "kim_prettot", "li