eated_at": "2024-11-03T01:26:20", "owner": "lxmenaxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036062126207964, "text": "Dude's a savage for sure...👏, and I thought I was, until I smelled my first scented tampon and I haven't been the same ever since...😢, and it was still in the wrapper...😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:23:12", "owner": "dirtyhearts_deelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957383964814759, "text": "Fudoh the new generation, straight classic 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:22:06", "owner": "obadguy95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852984721317028, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:17:05", "owner": "ayee.chrish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043482644100084, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:15:39", "owner": "marco_antoniogarcia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104914801446415, "text": "I swear there are just some lines that should never be crossed for a fight scene. That was one of them.", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:15:03", "owner": "_sigma_mike_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17892968790097376, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:14:51", "owner": "zikryazhari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383520229108730, "text": "When you think you saw everything", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:14:36", "owner": "kosawbrzuch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073316746609439, "text": "What the hell I just witnessed.", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:11:46", "owner": "starlitchrysalis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907838554025073, "text": "tf", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:07:34", "owner": "itsnovari", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
