{"media_id": 3464075508328334157, "shortcode": "DAS3lJFCoNN", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAS3lJFCoNN/", "taken_at": "2024-09-24T09:26:50", "caption": "司仪在婚礼上表演节目炫酒，好像喝了，但是完全没喝🤣网友：烟不过肺，酒不过胃啊高手啊＃婚礼搞笑瞬间 #司仪#婚礼表演", "owner_username": "yu_hong_juan", "owner_id": "48742121139", "likes": 118120, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0230_DAS3lJFCoNN\\DAS3lJFCoNN_20240924_092650.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18088201972601061, "text": "真厲害👏👏😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T02:03:12", "owner": "tw_zhang0503", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18145293463329620, "text": "666", "created_at": "2025-02-25T17:24:33", "owner": "terry8.25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858617194368447, "text": "夜场工龄20年吧", "created_at": "2025-02-22T01:53:58", "owner": "songsssssss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062895139932522, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-13T12:25:15", "owner": "cool_0702iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027311876559247, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-24T07:54:41", "owner": "tmc168", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18288120898172411, "text": "@cyh._.yl 已購買。野o愛喝", "created_at": "2025-01-10T14:32:56", "owner": "lale_0711", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17925052733895505, "text": "婚禮破地獄？", "created_at": "2024-12-19T10:08:30", "owner": "tpang00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070059205730884, "text": "呃酒飲", "created_at": "2024-12-19T08:52:17", "owner": "rlch_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048627014088158, "text": "Man blessed the wedding and some more.😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T12:42:55", "owner": "iisitworthittravel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031679054413016, "text": "杰尼龟", "created_at": "2024-12-17T16:14:31", "owner": "mingyao1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083756332564874, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-17T03:04:48", "owner": "biber.juster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066353395761337, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T11:40:32", "owner": "reamanning607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111338599441449, "text": "花式逃酒", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:39:54", "owner": "lee_.fpv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124975468400435, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T19:46:15", "owner": "evasyu1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289048402208714, "text": "Haha, did you drink it or not?", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:25:43", "owner": "grace_77536", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322226365087208, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:07:41", "owner": "joker10_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475762729026448, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-03T15:39:49", "owner": "qinmiaomiaomiaomiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049461410008907, "text": "一身酒味過檢測😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T02:41:44", "owner": "jerrystean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033149111121381, "text": "保洁阿姨在旁崩溃", "created_at": "2024-12-01T09:24:48", "owner": "jas0n_eee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943822230913362, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-26T03:51:52", "owner": "wdmsn_jsw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047097841888721, "text": "我知道他没喝酒，但我没有证据", "created_at": "2024-11-25T06:34:07", "owner": "mtman87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18339882712183274, "text": "人家婚禮都接受了 留言區很多接受不了🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2024-11-24T04:57:49", "owner": "jianyi_yee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912867700040783, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:28:28", "owner": "fit1_ricky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017979542635658, "text": "完美避酒", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:04:14", "owner": "luorenyi3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040974758184057, "text": "@bowin.mdc.milan", "created_at": "2024-11-23T06:39:53", "owner": "va1entina.mdc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044764910279353, "text": "@s7941107 會了嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-22T10:31:56", "owner": "twist131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024593810254243, "text": "@y1110ng 先學", "created_at": "2024-11-21T09:02:47", "owner": "hlan00a1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083941129533610, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-19T07:19:11", "owner": "zhang0.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041396813328611, "text": "其實不要喝 可以給我…", "created_at": "2024-11-17T14:33:33", "owner": "e04_99487", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063049720691766, "text": "表演完除了司仪都喝着了", "created_at": "2024-11-14T04:19:48", "owner": "akalisama97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425185357074755, "text": "連過喉都沒有，還胃嘞😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:06:09", "owner": "h843775102024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049586071958742, "text": "這樣酒測會過嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-11T03:50:10", "owner": "tim009134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042719953924916, "text": "浪費😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:15:40", "owner": "s._.98__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991834551718583, "text": "喝爆", "created_at": "2024-11-08T15:49:52", "owner": "_yingtuu.159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012499829424845, "text": "名堂多", "created_at": "2024-11-08T10:00:40", "owner": "dusongyang1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002913422679185, "text": "开车回去一点问题也没有", "created_at": "2024-11-08T03:34:21", "owner": "tao2lynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879058255180278, "text": "糟蹋东西😢", "created_at": "2024-11-07T09:59:19", "owner": "chyisheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044035556280640, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-07T07:49:23", "owner": "moodr.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063818875706084, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-07T04:39:21", "owner": "heag959", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065078566674924, "text": "花式躲酒", "created_at": "2024-11-04T06:36:33", "owner": "emily__817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096179179468898, "text": "甩人家宾客一身😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T04:39:15", "owner": "yangyaowu1982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042526487122265, "text": "花式炫酒😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T14:48:12", "owner": "qmo_yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919233637004688, "text": "庫庫一頓炫 半點沒進胃", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:03:20", "owner": "chengyou_xu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18254953033259684, "text": "@xx_kedahu 你可以表演", "created_at": "2024-11-03T05:26:44", "owner": "hip_hop200622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958105980743000, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T13:10:44", "owner": "mier_soul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942770688786712, "text": "@qwxmzz 炫進去了", "created_at": "2024-10-30T11:53:44", "owner": "jjustintsai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049313050989597, "text": "@12.wei_yu.13 這你", "created_at": "2024-10-29T04:49:59", "owner": "zjllin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044832935499308, "text": "可能喝了 但不多", "created_at": "2024-10-29T03:47:44", "owner": "lucifer.0.0504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883820524136755, "text": "技术超过酒量", "created_at": "2024-10-28T04:48:58", "owner": "ling.ling.3998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864759136182360, "text": "一會駕車算不算酒駕？？？", "created_at": "2024-10-27T02:32:44", "owner": "_jw_3210_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043717877476497, "text": "Art of how to drink and don t drink at the same time", "created_at": "2024-10-26T06:43:38", "owner": "davidyone969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879804106160875, "text": "有喝但不多", "created_at": "2024-10-26T04:52:39", "owner": "venom9889_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019505462312899, "text": "@_jy_196", "created_at": "2024-10-26T04:37:48", "owner": "jc_9.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041122570930633, "text": "這應該是喝完還可以開車回家的部分", "created_at": "2024-10-25T19:41:33", "owner": "evan_1oo7", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18152995105334677, "text": "我有理由相信不是酒不過胃，而是連喉嚨都沒碰到…", "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:40:07", "owner": "jickchiaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122662585389332, "text": "你不能喝，你说，浪费我酒？🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:55:28", "owner": "kenleong07", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17964633212683409, "text": "酒之呼吸，一之型，连吐带喷！😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T02:45:45", "owner": "ttttterrence_wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055168114870500, "text": "@dodo010111 @superdidi0116 你倆的絕活", "created_at": "2024-10-22T01:20:00", "owner": "iforkyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139605376357747, "text": "他炫了一瓶，前排全醉了", "created_at": "2024-10-21T13:42:09", "owner": "yangoliant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036758777270010, "text": "酒：三過家門而不入", "created_at": "2024-10-20T14:47:51", "owner": "pting__lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070680034536496, "text": "進口酒", "created_at": "2024-10-19T17:10:46", "owner": "nature_1.1.2.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911001013010837, "text": "人生買不起水岸第一排的房子，卻體驗了一把水岸第一排的風景！洩濕父！", "created_at": "2024-10-18T12:35:39", "owner": "leo_lilin316_1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020183189614212, "text": "有喝，但不多", "created_at": "2024-10-18T05:38:04", "owner": "dennygenes0308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851520439308418, "text": "想學", "created_at": "2024-10-18T00:09:12", "owner": "s5955121", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020504249548637, "text": "坐前面的笑着笑着就喝到了", "created_at": "2024-10-17T05:12:34", "owner": "arissa_silvferling", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18018533450313408, "text": "看着浑身酒气实际滴酒不沾", "created_at": "2024-10-16T22:05:11", "owner": "itolftb5273", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954438771836328, "text": "一口都沒喝 卻讓我輸得一塌糊塗", "created_at": "2024-10-14T08:52:25", "owner": "n124573360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908805217035437, "text": "這技術得學", "created_at": "2024-10-13T18:17:58", "owner": "anncomtw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032913602252115, "text": "司仪：我厉害炫不是厉害喝 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-13T13:10:37", "owner": "junhao_008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137206435323249, "text": "多酒 就說～", "created_at": "2024-10-13T03:18:24", "owner": "aa0910247299", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079259635546505, "text": "害得第一排觀眾酒測都沒過", "created_at": "2024-10-12T09:40:56", "owner": "loveck520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034056383334898, "text": "这个比海底捞的表演牛👏", "created_at": "2024-10-11T01:25:24", "owner": "litbrian1020", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18048032137801618, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-10T09:38:09", "owner": "hemmingsensoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343811947130139, "text": "过了嘴瘾，胃对不上账了", "created_at": "2024-10-10T08:41:36", "owner": "sj354sj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976510371771731, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-10T07:49:07", "owner": "hojaiyi5203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055192828883429, "text": "哇靠吧逃酒達人", "created_at": "2024-10-09T12:10:50", "owner": "szl_455", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032446094197907, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-09T10:11:31", "owner": "henryang_0419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019785101284840, "text": "千杯不醉😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-07T10:21:40", "owner": "fk258258", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033503069465912, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-06T23:10:46", "owner": "syy._.0325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097870891412264, "text": "一口没喝😂", "created_at": "2024-10-06T07:44:00", "owner": "doctor_tonghao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882623215111377, "text": "敬業", "created_at": "2024-10-05T22:06:47", "owner": "08.00.092.000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252749908270489, "text": "別太激動，放手吧，用心祝福她吧😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-04T10:21:59", "owner": "aquarius80286", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286879477237256, "text": "連過喉都沒有，還胃嘞～😏", "created_at": "2024-10-04T08:10:01", "owner": "joelee0102", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18052375711920492, "text": "司儀：新郎只交代讓我炫，沒說讓我喝啊", "created_at": "2024-10-03T23:03:00", "owner": "_stphn.5_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020407070258815, "text": "好身手🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-03T13:30:52", "owner": "nftoshi.og", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998369532682785, "text": "有點費賓客", "created_at": "2024-10-02T04:41:39", "owner": "devin0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056443306823263, "text": "：老婆看我厲害吧！喝完還能把車開回家", "created_at": "2024-10-02T04:19:28", "owner": "vvvsssyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973596885637162, "text": "噴得到處都是你說有沒有喝", "created_at": "2024-10-01T14:05:04", "owner": "chyntsen923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201269977292164, "text": "司儀：來我給你炫一個", "created_at": "2024-10-01T14:01:04", "owner": "sa.sawu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927117372951266, "text": "我：喉嚨借過\n喉嚨：不借", "created_at": "2024-10-01T09:26:46", "owner": "bowa1590", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461385982016246, "text": "當老闆說工作不能喝酒 be like", "created_at": "2024-10-01T09:10:32", "owner": "sih.hong_lambda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356373454186635, "text": "@fc.roger_chen 學一下，下次看你表演", "created_at": "2024-09-30T16:51:17", "owner": "jyuncheng_syu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041844971478448, "text": "@shanghualin 💀", "created_at": "2024-09-30T11:01:35", "owner": "jiangbingjinnnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043178728869332, "text": "清潔工：怎麼越清越暈", "created_at": "2024-09-30T09:54:15", "owner": "ian33670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064218829725890, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-09-30T09:00:37", "owner": "golden___trip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034406603206037, "text": "炫完。全身還能不濕👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-30T08:35:23", "owner": "lock11078", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036904736132457, "text": "雪花不飄我不飄，青島不倒我不倒", "created_at": "2024-09-30T08:08:17", "owner": "fakeiddontfollow00123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952497969838700, "text": "主要是为了活跃气氛", "created_at": "2024-09-30T07:26:19", "owner": "thaumasin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333303169179661, "text": "你喝个酒，前排全洗了个澡", "created_at": "2024-09-30T07:10:45", "owner": "0609shaoyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034851548471473, "text": "浪费😂", "created_at": "2024-09-30T05:44:24", "owner": "evangongx", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["司仪", "婚礼表演"]},
{"media_id": 3492184111843474336, "shortcode": "DB2uvKEsXug", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB2uvKEsXug/", "taken_at": "2024-11-02T04:14:04", "caption": "⚠️#混音小抄 ⚠️ 嗨，我是平安\n❓人聲EQ怎麼調❓\n\n一起來看看所有重要的人聲頻率區段！\n*數值只是參考，還是需要用耳朵來確認哦\n-\n🎓 追蹤 @odrclass 就有更多音樂製作小抄\n🔊 Tag 也會喜歡這個內容的音樂朋友\n⏱ 現在還沒時間讀？先儲存貼文以後回來\n\n✅ 記得打開通知，未來不錯過我們 #音樂製作課 的貼文！\n \n原文參考自saintlago \n\n#編曲課程 #混音課程 #音樂製作 #線上課程", "owner_username": "odrclass", "owner_id": "19512386989", "likes": 12702, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0231_DB2uvKEsXug\\DB2uvKEsXug_20241102_041404.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18050435591353254", "text": "@sparrow_jou_", "created_at": "2025-03-26T10:35:40", "owner": "94oddd_0506", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17922739286937000", "text": "In the mix粉絲", "created_at": "2025-02-21T16:48:05", "owner": "tzuyung_0110", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17950697558909030", "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-12-27T16:25:55", "owner": "wentao3302", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17922055520995247", "text": "鼻音感的eq區間好像也有500-1k的說法？", "created_at": "2024-11-15T12:28:15", "owner": "shoppinglin", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18027502619185113", "text": "又學到新姿勢", "created_at": "2024-11-08T22:10:27", "owner": "a89924956", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17846864334342670", "text": "噢買尬太具體！", "created_at": "2024-11-07T19:32:20", "owner": "bahn._", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18030605894150008", "text": "超酷", "created_at": "2024-11-07T16:13:43", "owner": "wiklanw", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18072046669628022", "text": "好懂", "created_at": "2024-11-07T15:16:32", "owner": "daydaychao", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17930260154955163", "text": "謝謝你 非常實用", "created_at": "2024-11-06T20:01:46", "owner": "hkdreammaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18015076712629275", "text": "你真漂亮", "created_at": "2024-11-06T16:28:06", "owner": "boscolkm", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18033032606521748", "text": "9m", "created_at": "2024-11-06T10:49:40", "owner": "lucaslove911", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18043750160160175", "text": "@c.6gl4 乾你根本只是看到妹子就按讚", "created_at": "2024-11-06T05:15:01", "owner": "eric_93.81", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17935910711945799", "text": "太好了 我可以用eq改善老師那超爛收音的教學影片了", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:31:50", "owner": "int.0.dx", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18013834970637781", "text": "说齿音的时候好可爱啊啊啊😍", "created_at": "2024-11-05T05:46:17", "owner": "heyartnice", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18014916614634003", "text": "謝謝姐 我愛你", "created_at": "2024-11-05T00:50:38", "owner": "bobo.0313.com.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18016268648632610", "text": "最近在學聲音處理\n這個好有幫助～～～", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:58:55", "owner": "yikaichen_film", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18057434764858800", "text": "@9m88", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:46:17", "owner": "w_william_william", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18150762250327109", "text": "槍戰要拉高哪裡的聲音😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T03:52:56", "owner": "qpbdbdpqqdpbpbqd", "likes": 28}, {"id": "18033199427081553", "text": "男女聲一樣嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-04T02:52:52", "owner": "coopertaoky", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17949080840854903", "text": "愛了很詳細", "created_at": "2024-11-03T22:31:24", "owner": "maytsai_tt", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18150313783338854", "text": "真的 太 可 愛 了", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:48:29", "owner": "ninny1973", "likes": 16}, {"id": "18024446144527950", "text": "9m88", "created_at": "2024-11-02T04:33:22", "owner": "boweichen6257", "likes": 109}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["混音小抄", "音樂製作課", "編曲課程", "混音課程", "音樂製作", "線上課程"]},
