{"media_id": 3475402871636756284, "shortcode": "DA7HH-PSAc8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA7HH-PSAc8/", "taken_at": "2024-10-10T00:32:08", "caption": "_\n繼三年多前的雪山\n今年終於又有國慶登山照了🥰（而且這次更用心準備）\n\n心心念念的鳶嘴終於摘下！\n雖然沒有大景但滿滿的白牆反而更能凸顯國旗🇹🇼？\n\n#鳶嘴山 #台中景點 #台灣山岳 #健行 #山 #登山 #山系女孩 #國慶日 #國旗 #hiking #trekking #mountain #taiwan #nature #taiwanmountain #hiker #hikinggirl #hikingadventures #hikingtrails #hikingviews #nofilter #bpintaiwan #taiwan1 #taiwannationalday #1010 @amazingtaiwan @taiwan__mountain @bpintaiwan @taiwan1", "owner_username": "emma77420", "owner_id": "7430606242", "likes": -1, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0237_DA7HH-PSAc8\\DA7HH-PSAc8_20241010_003208_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0237_DA7HH-PSAc8\\DA7HH-PSAc8_20241010_003208_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0237_DA7HH-PSAc8\\DA7HH-PSAc8_20241010_003208_3.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18111907237563305, "text": "Such a perfect body 😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:27:59", "owner": "peter75adream", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024460883567295, "text": "attention seeker", "created_at": "2025-10-16T04:05:47", "owner": "billsburgers4u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060955979397578, "text": "嗨，妳好辣，我喜歡妳😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-15T01:06:38", "owner": "zhenxiang7857", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030987275511660, "text": "👏👏👏漂亮", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:58:53", "owner": "janie.cyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113364394537111, "text": "Taiwan flag. 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:27:08", "owner": "paulburke835", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057446771404787, "text": "😳😳😳", "created_at": "2025-10-05T09:45:11", "owner": "pon_chan626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109212940451168, "text": "每次看到女生勇闖高山都覺得超級帥", "created_at": "2025-06-02T08:21:26", "owner": "domo_hotel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125991856397902, "text": "台灣是中國的❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-05T08:05:50", "owner": "shenying_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284934421171902, "text": "希望你能对你说的话思考 世界上只有一个中国 台湾只不过是中国的一个省份 没有共产党你们什么都不是😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:20:21", "owner": "kp1111133", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029625497524629, "text": "beautiful", "created_at": "2024-11-06T15:05:55", "owner": "bi4296659", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137299762362966, "text": "I'm from Hong Kong, but I stand with Taiwan🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-05T22:12:30", "owner": "ethan_.mkc18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18466744255034937, "text": "奶子不错！", "created_at": "2024-11-05T14:20:07", "owner": "junjun_2030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032426555520612, "text": "台湾是中国的一部分", "created_at": "2024-11-05T13:47:32", "owner": "iurnehceyyar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042623780134962, "text": "🇨🇳", "created_at": "2024-11-05T11:39:25", "owner": "wizukegocrazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061308196697195, "text": "辣妹", "created_at": "2024-11-05T11:11:36", "owner": "zi._.zho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026897492435314, "text": "厲害👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T21:28:39", "owner": "wuvic61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900381145075965, "text": "你要不要趴玉山", "created_at": "2024-11-03T21:20:37", "owner": "pizza_0713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870529831217500, "text": "山川疑似有點過於壯麗了", "created_at": "2024-11-03T16:14:23", "owner": "overpenetration114514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034431095071410, "text": "很漂亮❤️❤️ 小心不要感冒喔~(畢竟在山上)", "created_at": "2024-11-03T14:59:09", "owner": "xiao_jiu97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942703434911649, "text": "@mak_meng_wa", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:33:16", "owner": "nic.ky300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461717476044497, "text": "中華民國有你會越來越好祝你百岳成功", "created_at": "2024-11-03T10:45:14", "owner": "savage441126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861808249267008, "text": "不冷嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:00:05", "owner": "pengyang247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051412228780189, "text": "台灣好風景", "created_at": "2024-11-03T07:46:16", "owner": "iii_5__q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135226189369109, "text": "Taiwan has freedom🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-03T05:01:15", "owner": "3t869oxkrr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042502063921727, "text": "中華民國❌中华人民共和国✅", "created_at": "2024-11-03T03:41:29", "owner": "borislukchunfung", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18115511968410827, "text": "🇹🇼", "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:20:49", "owner": "bozhu.zhao", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072319012527633, "text": "身裁不錯呦", "created_at": "2024-11-02T11:48:28", "owner": "hsu8951", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010549994456370, "text": "民國萬歲", "created_at": "2024-11-02T09:37:13", "owner": "matthew3.1415926", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18014880365375136, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T01:12:28", "owner": "zeezac15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124926913387128, "text": "你不冷？", "created_at": "2024-11-01T11:59:05", "owner": "hou_87666hou", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18036667148222221, "text": "Taiwan is the good country", "created_at": "2024-11-01T10:50:25", "owner": "terrace_moments", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18025362224396426, "text": "很好的台湾propaganda，使我的公鸡旋转", "created_at": "2024-10-31T23:21:41", "owner": "qkc487", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17868597855229221, "text": "Taiwan <3", "created_at": "2024-10-31T21:25:17", "owner": "whichstoryline", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069557713618819, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-31T02:52:13", "owner": "jiadong8206", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020674118551238, "text": "超級愛國", "created_at": "2024-10-30T22:47:41", "owner": "honglam5680", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17923592822981489, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-30T22:21:42", "owner": "harry_bicycle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932157813938985, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-27T17:28:48", "owner": "guofrefrigeracion_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050620351941682, "text": "好痛的膝蓋", "created_at": "2024-10-27T15:47:07", "owner": "yan_you1994", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041827523318218, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-26T15:23:11", "owner": "sunjingzhongs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080873767539151, "text": "👏👏👏🔥👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-24T23:57:11", "owner": "d0973662399", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058987210668183, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-23T11:49:13", "owner": "x794038", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879473728090427, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-10-22T04:29:05", "owner": "mt.yuanzui", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062056858666914, "text": "國慶日雙十節快樂！😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-18T02:32:42", "owner": "tomgokmun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034101011205620, "text": "Strong girl🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-13T15:03:56", "owner": "johnj4ylii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018757571290882, "text": "美", "created_at": "2024-10-11T15:24:09", "owner": "djj0315", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848125012317273, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-11T13:11:54", "owner": "babymojojojo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028267826371135, "text": "😢👏😢🔥🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-11T04:39:17", "owner": "aelveexn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18424454713078720, "text": "Mantapp🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-10T23:44:38", "owner": "abg_anday", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034357841225180, "text": "這國旗在哪裡", "created_at": "2024-10-10T23:26:54", "owner": "konon1020", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063822622599459, "text": "Awesome!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-10T18:39:01", "owner": "dieram2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865415800230491, "text": "好美😍", "created_at": "2024-10-10T12:16:13", "owner": "justin_brian_wang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047059087982804, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-10T10:34:01", "owner": "abxtea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322084579154876, "text": "太猛了🙌🙌🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-10T10:00:51", "owner": "lemel_2582", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941391678874884, "text": "這樣的國慶 慶祝挺好的👏", "created_at": "2024-10-10T06:40:54", "owner": "mrsulecho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010279964423813, "text": "太美啦", "created_at": "2024-10-10T06:08:26", "owner": "kaii_0421", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17945238935855907, "text": "Awesome 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-10T03:00:26", "owner": "sergeantghost", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18022658774591171, "text": "膝蓋感覺超痛", "created_at": "2024-10-10T02:09:17", "owner": "pownpown0209", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930366615944358, "text": "Taiwan 🇹🇼 number one", "created_at": "2024-10-10T02:01:12", "owner": "dhanbahadurgurug", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18018495644299892, "text": "小粉絲上線～好辣😍", "created_at": "2024-10-10T01:42:54", "owner": "bobolu819", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950079102847262, "text": "Happy birthday 👍👍✌️✌️😍😍😄😃😘😘", "created_at": "2024-10-10T01:02:36", "owner": "bennysee8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034763198332999, "text": "yummmm myyy", "created_at": "2024-10-13T17:38:16", "owner": "stevegood1992", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907183825031618, "text": "Ma Sawa kau ko ema❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-10T15:26:51", "owner": "ardytiku17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019636979293201, "text": "Memiawmu gak kedinginan kah?", "created_at": "2024-10-11T13:58:02", "owner": "chairul_ms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150964279334309, "text": "which country is that", "created_at": "2024-10-14T08:40:19", "owner": "krezen_david", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874548172179666, "text": "🍻🍻🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-10T13:39:59", "owner": "femingyouth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985615113886445, "text": "這裡怎麼那麼多中共國的洗地網軍啊，難道又是人家穿中華民國的國旗裝又讓你們的玻璃心碎滿地了嗎？不管你們是網軍還是小粉紅韭菜，在那怎麼吠都沒用啦～吠了七十幾年你們的共產黨軍隊依然不敢發動進攻，我們就依然繼續拿著印有中華民國跟國旗的身份證在這生活，拿著印有中華民國及國旗的護照繼續免簽到各國玩，繼續拿著印有中華民國及國旗的台幣四處吃喝玩樂啦，繼續在中華民國台灣這塊土地繼續揮舞著國旗慶祝中華民國114年生日快樂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:59:40", "owner": "arb_101_67_5c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480979999026876, "text": "下西下井", "created_at": "2025-01-04T14:43:24", "owner": "louis_0901._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065387548708004, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-05T03:05:00", "owner": "alvinmok701_hkg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078079393561501, "text": "中華民國成立在南京，成立的時候台灣還在被日本殖民，偽政府也配拿著中華民國的國旗？", "created_at": "2024-11-04T23:05:39", "owner": "kennan.su", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["鳶嘴山", "台中景點", "台灣山岳", "健行", "山", "登山", "山系女孩", "國慶日", "國旗", "hiking", "trekking", "mountain", "taiwan", "nature", "taiwanmountain", "hiker", "hikinggirl", "hikingadventures", "hikingtrails", "hikingviews", "nofilter", "bpintaiwan", "taiwan1", "taiwannationalday", "1010"]},
{"media_id": 3404660345892506929, "shortcode": "C8_yIvByA0x", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C8_yIvByA0x/", "taken_at": "2024-07-04T10:02:35", "caption": "手寫字動畫讓影片質感up up\n每次看到別人開頭有手寫字\n都覺得好漂亮💕\n現在終於知道怎麼做了\n#procreate #手寫字動畫 \n#剪映 #短影片必備", "owner_username": "bir_bir_chiao", "owner_id": "6516735444", "likes": 26352, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0238_C8_yIvByA0x\\C8_yIvByA0x_20240704_100235.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17866920570488928, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:09:09", "owner": "bebebjd0315", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019981367260197, "text": "@nrp_170203 @feng_02mia 快学", "created_at": "2024-09-27T12:41:15", "owner": "hyujor2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111783100372770, "text": "想請教筆刷是哪隻～", "created_at": "2024-09-19T02:19:50", "owner": "k7vee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103914289426437, "text": "開頭是世新😮", "created_at": "2024-09-06T12:18:45", "owner": "dun_bo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996806718665431, "text": "如果字體是白色的話其實混合模式選濾色就可以了（", "created_at": "2024-08-21T03:19:37", "owner": "o9kismet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053171563694378, "text": "洞洞笔在哪里🧐", "created_at": "2024-08-14T11:47:10", "owner": "ciklilghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038555489060190, "text": "軟體要付費的對嗎", "created_at": "2024-08-13T00:36:49", "owner": "camel.299348", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073742698539085, "text": "感謝分享", "created_at": "2024-08-12T13:38:15", "owner": "klc_1028", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040323070828243, "text": "好可愛", "created_at": "2024-08-12T07:22:59", "owner": "l_ove1020_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923605740937737, "text": "如何有這種洞洞筆的程式？", "created_at": "2024-08-10T12:23:10", "owner": "chidoris0525", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164905054307974, "text": "求筆刷～", "created_at": "2024-08-06T06:03:11", "owner": "chiron1127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18452813143030627, "text": "剪片的是什麼軟件？", "created_at": "2024-08-05T11:27:44", "owner": "chaoticallycomicallybest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055629568676120, "text": "可愛🤣", "created_at": "2024-08-04T12:16:02", "owner": "iwbxide", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029947757273554, "text": "👏🏻", "created_at": "2024-08-03T02:05:21", "owner": "yynails.y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028151171236753, "text": "重覆看了好多次終於懂了，好喜歡這種有意義的短片。\n\n🥹🥹🥹謝謝你做出來", "created_at": "2024-08-01T03:42:50", "owner": "euniceyea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18238377241281104, "text": "可能是我長得不好看、也可能是我身材不夠好、要不然怎麼都沒人看上我、看不上也可以聊個天呀、不嫌棄的話、可以打招呼 我的瀨：xingting339", "created_at": "2024-07-25T10:07:27", "owner": "litingtingabv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012035198273225, "text": "剛剛立馬試操作，沒有洞洞筆也能做出手寫影片，超實用，又多學了一個👍", "created_at": "2024-07-23T02:23:45", "owner": "annie0929_nail", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066118882561224, "text": "這是哪個音樂", "created_at": "2024-07-20T08:24:49", "owner": "jhen_you0129", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995084133498272, "text": "唯一的問題：懶的用🙃", "created_at": "2024-07-14T09:12:25", "owner": "chouyuuu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001957817632249, "text": "想詢問畫筆要如何生成", "created_at": "2024-07-08T02:11:34", "owner": "yun____ya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034394779870428, "text": "我是我的字很醜還要學嗎🤭", "created_at": "2024-07-07T09:03:45", "owner": "ringringthecat", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17980268885571707, "text": "好實用嗚嗚", "created_at": "2024-07-06T16:06:35", "owner": "n_a_gain", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867097978150929, "text": "太猛了吧！！！謝謝老師的分享~", "created_at": "2024-07-05T17:03:40", "owner": "cheng_fu_1111", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18130006201348713, "text": "程式本身就可以導出繪畫過程了～", "created_at": "2024-07-05T12:39:05", "owner": "wys.n99._.1125", "likes": 143}, {"id": 18024309854514372, "text": "抱歉，可以核准我的追蹤請求嗎🙏拜託🙏", "created_at": "2024-07-05T10:58:31", "owner": "vcnlem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861161473184297, "text": "謝謝老師😍", "created_at": "2024-07-04T17:14:47", "owner": "shino_04111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068363503556904, "text": "字體要怎麼用🫠🤣", "created_at": "2024-07-04T16:39:38", "owner": "sooyaaa._508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936356538764403, "text": "謝謝超好用的😍", "created_at": "2024-07-04T16:26:10", "owner": "tiny.ovo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887956561060297, "text": "請問是不是把背景關掉就不需要摳圖了？", "created_at": "2024-07-04T15:38:14", "owner": "omo_art_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872172844108108, "text": "好實用🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-04T14:05:16", "owner": "leee_jin.blq", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18001914797397348, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-07-04T13:20:29", "owner": "live_abetterlife77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124571128365444, "text": "直接畫完就是動畫了真棒🥰", "created_at": "2024-07-04T12:40:51", "owner": "bitter_anime", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18025250021011936, "text": "好棒的教學！✨✨", "created_at": "2024-07-04T11:47:02", "owner": "meowcat365", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065601835505434, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-07-04T11:39:36", "owner": "7.27_______", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18271469203239140, "text": "想問如何匯出影片檔案！😍", "created_at": "2024-07-04T11:21:06", "owner": "foodietaichung__leaf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078484987453675, "text": "謝謝教學❤️剛好正煩惱怎麼製作", "created_at": "2024-07-04T10:18:26", "owner": "dijien.538", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958855764664238, "text": "謝謝巧巧老師真傳🫶✨✨", "created_at": "2024-07-04T10:17:45", "owner": "hoiienglai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911109588968239, "text": "感覺觀看又要破百萬了❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-07-04T10:13:48", "owner": "sosx02", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17869258080118068, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-07-04T10:05:26", "owner": "shiiiwen__", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["procreate", "手寫字動畫", "剪映", "短影片必備"]},
{"media_id": 3493254246112180727, "shortcode": "DB6iDqRpDn3", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB6iDqRpDn3/", "taken_at": "2024-11-03T15:45:49", "caption": "Anyone else like to go a little extra with their home decor? 🔥\n\nWith so many scent and color options, you can surely find something to match your vibe and aesthetic. \n\nShop Foton Pearled Candles at Fotoncandle.com. 🔥🖤\n\n#fotoncandle #pearledcandle #homedecor #interiordesign #falldecor #holidaydecor", "owner_username": "fotoncandle", "owner_id": "36803207977", "likes": 258069, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0239_DB6iDqRpDn3\\DB6iDqRpDn3_20241103_154549.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18092151304784308, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:03:59", "owner": "candlepark.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900888682198752, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-05-30T19:03:45", "owner": "inspira.da.cris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882048667241644, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-02-25T05:12:19", "owner": "kaldoboyog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887138989189151, "text": "@shamz.shop", "created_at": "2025-01-23T09:26:18", "owner": "sh0amz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881884321215405, "text": "Great idea 💡 omg ❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-23T06:11:50", "owner": "pebble.and.flame.candle.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019382210421601, "text": "Chi sa dirmi se sono anche profumate o solo da bellezza 🥰", "created_at": "2025-01-15T10:53:04", "owner": "adel.adele.68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068104174774901, "text": "Cool af, but unfortunately priced 😢", "created_at": "2025-01-11T23:25:34", "owner": "johndoe0635", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059223706754194, "text": "Where can I get this??😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-07T18:29:27", "owner": "eli.zhhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053618891477468, "text": "❤️🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-01-07T16:37:22", "owner": "artsugar.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035085605454711, "text": "I've seen these candles before but never with a wooden wick. That's so cool!", "created_at": "2025-01-02T17:01:16", "owner": "wild_pandacoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483465499030990, "text": "Love this idea !!! Xx", "created_at": "2025-01-02T10:36:06", "owner": "aimee.l.henderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040856534202966, "text": "My car shit inside multiple times", "created_at": "2024-12-30T03:08:48", "owner": "zero.rides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18262648093266144, "text": "The winter one 🤩", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:39:33", "owner": "egeg_2007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926682345883103, "text": "What is the name of the material?", "created_at": "2024-12-08T14:22:19", "owner": "raghuda_.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101352433426016, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-07T17:24:55", "owner": "bareflames_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152308048338746, "text": "😍😍😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T07:30:10", "owner": "burner18140", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084553597534583, "text": "I have it, I don't use it because it wastes a lot of paraffin in the trash, it pollutes the environment more and it is not ecological.", "created_at": "2024-11-28T17:30:08", "owner": "igdeguille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938514819810408, "text": "Yall realize this ain’t for everyone right 😂 it’s for rich people that think they can make this a hobby", "created_at": "2024-11-26T12:32:06", "owner": "blue_.gatorade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18444138469069491, "text": "👏 that's 🤪 ❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-25T15:31:11", "owner": "ecosparks.ltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052608154796828, "text": "How long does it burn for", "created_at": "2024-11-24T22:39:30", "owner": "madison.eri2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014940953394117, "text": "Does it work in the vacuum of space?", "created_at": "2024-11-22T21:57:09", "owner": "donnyboi261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469927438027319, "text": "😍👏", "created_at": "2024-11-21T19:22:58", "owner": "decoriana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928232034861362, "text": "I thought it was litterbox😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T16:37:39", "owner": "the.homeconomist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922673643993252, "text": "The village one is epic", "created_at": "2024-11-19T07:03:24", "owner": "blooming_harlow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863843689202537, "text": "I thought that was a pcb 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-18T00:16:33", "owner": "a_mcorrea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037090598258587, "text": "What kind of cancer does this give you", "created_at": "2024-11-17T23:49:07", "owner": "will__kingsley", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18122948269396409, "text": "For anyone who is wondering what kind of wax this is it is called sand wax ❤️☺️😁", "created_at": "2024-11-17T21:10:44", "owner": "candlesbybiyav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000681668696177, "text": "What a Waste, just sprinkle new wax over the old one to make it look \"good\".", "created_at": "2024-11-17T13:00:51", "owner": "mit.hund.und.rad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362063482142994, "text": "So many critics in the comments 😂 seams like every single one doesn’t know what they’re talking about too!", "created_at": "2024-11-15T09:21:38", "owner": "zoo_tie_dye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469298503030893, "text": "@krisjadeleonard ❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:55:34", "owner": "carlzjade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991132506575733, "text": "take my money", "created_at": "2024-11-11T08:09:37", "owner": "guido_barbaard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037249724217543, "text": "Are these made of palm wax?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:01:57", "owner": "ambs.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946478097770809, "text": "What happens if there’s 💨", "created_at": "2024-11-10T00:07:12", "owner": "spoonspatisserie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011775932422087, "text": "Kann man den Docht auch noch mal anzünden?", "created_at": "2024-11-08T15:00:14", "owner": "diana.kalisch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122498203395781, "text": "ik my humor is broken cuz after the \"I'm bring sexy back\" my brain immediately was like \"OHHHHHH\" (its Wednesday ma dudes vine scream)", "created_at": "2024-11-08T01:45:47", "owner": "5starr.doma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901279843073792, "text": "Try thermite", "created_at": "2024-11-08T01:40:20", "owner": "dannnymba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151720147338243, "text": "This is honestly such an amazing idea when you think about it you can literally get a random vase or just anything (fire safe ofc) and make it into a candle it makes me think about all those cute ceramic mugs you can make into a candle 👉🏾👈🏾", "created_at": "2024-11-08T01:00:44", "owner": "pr3tt.face.lay", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18047719432845011, "text": "It's wax pellets, it's just little wax pellets, I'm very u can buy a 50lbs bag on alibaba for like $18 and wicks are like $0.05", "created_at": "2024-11-07T20:42:36", "owner": "mischievousfrogpond", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17894483232096787, "text": "this is so cool!!", "created_at": "2024-11-07T20:26:12", "owner": "tj_freestyle_gsds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004079996670351, "text": "My cat will go n poop there", "created_at": "2024-11-07T10:11:48", "owner": "kashifriyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876760192194459, "text": "So what material is that exactly? 🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-07T07:10:25", "owner": "parth_who_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050230870824591, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-07T05:57:30", "owner": "alexmzl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887469739131142, "text": "Amazing 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-07T04:11:40", "owner": "gracethespace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18205713373295610, "text": "I think it's a great idea 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-06T20:48:25", "owner": "ourmonktonheathfieldhome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873232195209239, "text": "Can you mix multiple colors/scents to make a confetti type look or like an ombré?", "created_at": "2024-11-06T20:03:42", "owner": "eliellie99", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18037869209517936, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-06T12:36:53", "owner": "7d_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041952905169171, "text": "What happens to the used candle wax? Can we send them back to you so it could be reused?", "created_at": "2024-11-06T11:27:36", "owner": "ma_liaoliao", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18068273878651133, "text": "حسبتها رمل قطط😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-06T09:13:14", "owner": "ra_ndcu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18447422356066646, "text": "What colors are in this reel?", "created_at": "2024-11-06T08:08:50", "owner": "dave_r469", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941688858913369, "text": "This looks so great 😍", "created_at": "2024-11-06T06:06:52", "owner": "femmpowerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069152779577796, "text": "So... It's a bowl of paraffin wax pellets? 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T05:51:04", "owner": "sqksqrk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891230581038844, "text": "can you post a video of just the christmas clip? it’s so cute🥹", "created_at": "2024-11-06T02:46:56", "owner": "xxwhyareyoureadingthisxx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046896584071053, "text": "No", "created_at": "2024-11-06T01:22:00", "owner": "jo3y_is_9nutz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037679447268687, "text": "they’re so expensive :(", "created_at": "2024-11-06T00:26:51", "owner": "motoredheart3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034623464464131, "text": "Love it", "created_at": "2024-11-06T00:15:46", "owner": "kerry_hen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046925366003064, "text": "if I wasn't broke bro", "created_at": "2024-11-06T00:11:23", "owner": "stinkybananapeels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317921065090863, "text": "looks tasty", "created_at": "2024-11-05T21:08:21", "owner": "fubrikjo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046113524043211, "text": "Cats will love this perfumed toilet", "created_at": "2024-11-05T20:32:33", "owner": "amandaboery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045745718059442, "text": "Cool ahh candle", "created_at": "2024-11-05T19:43:27", "owner": "woxoq_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923963934987052, "text": "The sand looks like it burns super fast", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:29:43", "owner": "offixialjas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880791682088644, "text": "What do you do with the melted part?", "created_at": "2024-11-05T15:42:35", "owner": "honniyya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948810993896894, "text": "The video:🕯️the song:🫦", "created_at": "2024-11-05T15:35:10", "owner": "kukainiite", "likes": 223}, {"id": 18045478366886768, "text": "Then you blow it out and wax granules go everywhere", "created_at": "2024-11-05T14:57:18", "owner": "juice__caboose", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095534350479637, "text": "Soo cool!!!!", "created_at": "2024-11-05T14:23:27", "owner": "belullaby95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022075319564572, "text": "Do you sell just the crackle wicks? I want the color but I want the crackle!", "created_at": "2024-11-05T14:07:12", "owner": "allisonl.awley", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18014885546382280, "text": "Stop giving me new ways to burn my house down", "created_at": "2024-11-05T10:27:57", "owner": "sixstring420xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469471342003649, "text": "It’s so smart 😍", "created_at": "2024-11-05T10:00:19", "owner": "weavenn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074160106587211, "text": "Что это такое?", "created_at": "2024-11-05T09:55:38", "owner": "krasivayavrednaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033669218463094, "text": "@illi._.illi", "created_at": "2024-11-05T08:13:20", "owner": "khanh_map", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045516467510002, "text": "Looks like a litter box🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-05T04:59:50", "owner": "jpurplelicious", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991308975718160, "text": "The cat will shit in it", "created_at": "2024-11-05T01:29:29", "owner": "tknight1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020170355547376, "text": "Är det någon som kan sätta ut en länk var man köper detta eller ska man fråga antal gånger?", "created_at": "2024-11-05T00:43:59", "owner": "unit242unit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143386393352865, "text": "Everyone not pointing out you can legit just grind scented wax to get exactly this. 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T00:12:33", "owner": "micahroniwithcheese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872123587226972, "text": "Seeing as I make my own candles, and that I've done this a few times during emergency situations, it's a decent enough idea to market, however you will get more burn time out of a solid wax candle than granules", "created_at": "2024-11-04T23:13:55", "owner": "asbestos_detected", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158193886323651, "text": "@paris_buffettc", "created_at": "2024-11-04T22:26:06", "owner": "maecapone__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887670409126151, "text": "As I have been saying HARJGTHEONE WORLD ORDER - HWO solves these problems", "created_at": "2024-11-04T22:11:31", "owner": "harjgtheonedba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068215903650725, "text": "This is awesome!", "created_at": "2024-11-04T21:46:19", "owner": "ginodagoat_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075454429581816, "text": "@kelly_mcd76", "created_at": "2024-11-04T21:38:31", "owner": "calamitycat79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926986713860668, "text": "@riohogendorp", "created_at": "2024-11-04T21:09:20", "owner": "sarena_denie2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059106295873499, "text": "Wish you shipped to the UK!! X", "created_at": "2024-11-04T20:55:13", "owner": "victoria_kathryn88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149928439338266, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-04T20:01:19", "owner": "_sagebotanicals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360937183141936, "text": "What does it smell like?", "created_at": "2024-11-04T19:43:36", "owner": "queen_aalye_876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031275326367920, "text": "My cat would 100% pee in this", "created_at": "2024-11-04T19:21:12", "owner": "sarah_giffis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063092575741773, "text": "@18june", "created_at": "2024-11-04T19:15:05", "owner": "100kgems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18465250414010170, "text": "My cat be shitin in there", "created_at": "2024-11-04T19:06:37", "owner": "sleeping_golem", "likes": 1998}, {"id": 18465621190012684, "text": "Diferent 🧡", "created_at": "2024-11-04T19:04:40", "owner": "montserratburgues", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040573592131056, "text": "The wood wick candles are a tier", "created_at": "2024-11-04T18:47:03", "owner": "sabastian_cc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064075285732313, "text": "@_a_n_n_a_____", "created_at": "2024-11-04T18:32:28", "owner": "frankgraf123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977289699784238, "text": "@heyitsmandyk", "created_at": "2024-11-04T18:04:01", "owner": "tom.berg.908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292260442236503, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2024-11-04T17:40:23", "owner": "keziah_masih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092014903494966, "text": "cat litter", "created_at": "2024-11-04T17:23:35", "owner": "didislvr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903878158061056, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T17:09:23", "owner": "vi.na633", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030941102110175, "text": "Terrible for the air quality in the home", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:42:30", "owner": "jmoney420710710", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028857524149919, "text": "Wish there was more than vanilla and unscented", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:39:46", "owner": "astrid_odev", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864855376250863, "text": "@chay_carter", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:16:46", "owner": "ninoso1o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030387308137334, "text": "Рро", "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:29:33", "owner": "vsleerissw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055854721892154, "text": "@sjoerdje3", "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:17:05", "owner": "ninavanpeltjaspers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053078236754287, "text": "Eso con un gato", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:31:55", "owner": "luis12347779", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930790380843710, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-04T13:49:48", "owner": "jodeng5112020", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880154170173898, "text": "For anyone wondering, this style of candle are called pearl/sand candles", "created_at": "2024-11-04T13:45:52", "owner": "definitelynotjack1172", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["fotoncandle", "pearledcandle", "homedecor", "interiordesign", "falldecor", "holidaydecor"]},
{"media_id": 3493752500689800530, "shortcode": "DB8TWOAv41S", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB8TWOAv41S/", "taken_at": "2024-11-04T08:10:11", "caption": "這彎彎曲曲的竟然是一個手機殼！太酷了\n———\n好物推薦分享\n喜歡的可以私訊喔\n———\n港澳朋友可以直接郵寄到達\n首次購買享優惠價格喔\n歡迎台灣朋友資訊詳細聊\n\n#香港  #台灣 #台灣美食 #台灣景點 #玩具 #好物分享 #電子產品 #賽車 #相機 #產品 #產品設計 #電子 #葫蘆 #水瓶 #手機殼 #吸塵器 #玩具 #instagram #充電 #充電線 #鍵盤 #燈光 #音響 #喇叭 #產品 #行動電源 #充電器 #支架 #行動電源 #遙控車 #遊戲機 #打印機 #手辦", "owner_username": "ollig0930", "owner_id": "68320629407", "likes": 45, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0240_DB8TWOAv41S\\DB8TWOAv41S_20241104_081011.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["香港", "台灣", "台灣美食", "台灣景點", "玩具", "好物分享", "電子產品", "賽車", "相機", "產品", "產品設計", "電子", "葫蘆", "水瓶", "手機殼", "吸塵器", "玩具", "instagram", "充電", "充電線", "鍵盤", "燈光", "音響", "喇叭", "產品", "行動電源", "充電器", "支架", "行動電源", "遙控車", "遊戲機", "打印機", "手辦"]},
{"media_id": 3491729206255481701, "shortcode": "DB1HTaOtvNl", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB1HTaOtvNl/", "taken_at": "2024-11-01T13:09:39", "caption": "Follow @fightthroughmentalhealth and support the movement 💙 \n\nNovember is #MensHealthMonth. Don’t forget to share this post…\n\nThe stigma around Mens Mental Health needs to end. \n\n💙 Please share! \n\n• Three times as many men as women die by suicide.\n• Men aged 40-49 have the highest suicide rates in the UK3.\n• Men report lower levels of life satisfaction than women.\n• Men are less likely to access psychological therapies than women: only 36% of referrals to NHS talking therapies are for men.\n• Nearly three-quarters of adults who go missing are men. \n• 87% of rough sleepers are men.\n• Men are nearly three times as likely as women to become dependent on alcohol, and three times as likely to report frequent drug use.\n• Men are more likely to be compulsorily detained (or ‘sectioned’) for treatment than women.\n\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n\n #depressionandanxiety #depressionsupport #mentalhealthawareness #mentalhealthquotes #mentalhealthrecovery #mentalhealthsupport #mentalhealthadvocate #mentalhealthblogger #selflove #selflovequotes #selfcare #selfreminder #behappy #motivationalquotes #anxietyrelief #anxietyfighter #anxietyhelp #anxietysupport #ocdawareness #mensmentalhealth #anorexianervosarecovery #recoveryquotes #depressionsupport #mindfullife #mentalhealthmatters #suicideprevention #menshealthweek", "owner_username": "fightthroughmentalhealth", "owner_id": "8497875612", "likes": 34205, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0241_DB1HTaOtvNl\\DB1HTaOtvNl_20241101_130939.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18173578723355780, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-17T11:07:20", "owner": "rockprojectofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504936715041429, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️🦋", "created_at": "2025-06-05T23:25:01", "owner": "therealkae._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052965377008930, "text": "All of that is me", "created_at": "2025-01-02T16:08:30", "owner": "thereal.l5ke__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064685503661952, "text": "Hey guys, something horrible happened in India.\nA man was driven to suicide by his wife & in laws as they kept extorting ridiculous amounts of money in the name of alimony and the JUDGE ALLOWED IT ¿ not just that, the judge also mocked him when he mentioned potentially committing suicide due to this prolonged harassment and essentially torture & extortion.\nNo one is covering it, no one is talking about it.\nThis needs national coverage.\nAs much as it pains me as a woman to potentially take away their right to alimony in a country where they're made to be fully financially dependent on their often abusive husbands and they are the ones typically shamed for filing a divorce. It's sad. But I can't let this happen; A son lost his father, a father lost his son, his brother had to see the cold, dead body of someone he grew up with day-in, day-out, someone who he probably thought he wouldn't lose so soon and in such a horrible painful way.\nHe's left evidence in the form court transcripts, a letter, and an hour long video expressing the dire conditions these innocent fathers and husbands have to endure in the name of fairness. Not how it should ever be. Please help raise awareness about this if u can on bigger platforms like yours (I couldn't find very many that spoke of men's mental health, it was mostly about physical health, sol urge you to please forward this msg to other pages such as this)\nThank you for reading if you did, Indian men being\n\"legally\" extorted by the domestic court need you, so thank you making them feel seen and heard by reading this and making yourself aware of this horrific crime, so thanks once again, and lastly, please share this news if you want to/ can.", "created_at": "2024-12-27T02:35:34", "owner": "question.mark__282", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933367047950253, "text": "yay, a month where I feel special... oh wait.......... 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-07T10:54:33", "owner": "djblake_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930897045956206, "text": "And to those going through domestic abuse caused by their partner 💔", "created_at": "2024-11-05T10:03:39", "owner": "lexiiiiilou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027415550403914, "text": "💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-05T05:31:15", "owner": "ameer.m13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895583617093462, "text": "🤍💙🤍", "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:11:30", "owner": "whitney._rae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061465603775714, "text": "🥹🫶🏾💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:48:43", "owner": "euniique______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029593286127243, "text": "Been in therapy for about 6 months now I love it. Highly recommend it.", "created_at": "2024-11-04T13:25:50", "owner": "chrisdiesso", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046354394318420, "text": "🤍🖤", "created_at": "2024-11-03T23:45:28", "owner": "thegoodnightco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332124868145181, "text": "Stay strong brothers 💪🏽", "created_at": "2024-11-03T19:48:30", "owner": "jorgemezaphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18255908713271309, "text": "Every month is men’s health month", "created_at": "2024-11-03T16:09:32", "owner": "davidridgeway83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283339978211489, "text": "Thank you 💙", "created_at": "2024-11-03T15:36:39", "owner": "nick1610w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024478997608064, "text": "Much love", "created_at": "2024-11-03T12:09:09", "owner": "meza_pt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090485002453607, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-03T11:25:33", "owner": "kanalalynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927173922856105, "text": "💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:26:15", "owner": "rennel_marshall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118694608400302, "text": "🫶🏾", "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:10:45", "owner": "jasongarymitchell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037209374515607, "text": "💙💙💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-02T20:03:03", "owner": "iamjahlil1209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842468605349335, "text": "I deal with depression daily & other mental issues & just get up daily like nothing ever happened. Damn I’m tired of that", "created_at": "2024-11-02T18:19:42", "owner": "_addthatup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080696575482947, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2024-11-02T18:05:02", "owner": "artison.beauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026288159525513, "text": "💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-02T17:18:12", "owner": "ajatussukellus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928213830956615, "text": "Well at least it's in the most depressive month of the year", "created_at": "2024-11-02T16:49:02", "owner": "shanmaisenmieux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042576893160217, "text": "i thought it was in june", "created_at": "2024-11-02T15:27:44", "owner": "iiam.mano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047024828093836, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-02T15:17:17", "owner": "the_rebirth26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986231445749874, "text": "Need this one thank you", "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:11:28", "owner": "axxnoahxx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17906301255048791, "text": "I like that different types of mental health conditions are mentioned in the hashtags🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:20:50", "owner": "mkparuada", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18472795849051265, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:10:42", "owner": "kelvinlaronjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130041670374788, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-02T09:05:17", "owner": "laithistic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022298057568814, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-02T07:52:48", "owner": "mental_health0908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18446607610070809, "text": "🫂🩵🩵🩵🫂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T06:55:54", "owner": "juliglueck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937416855925482, "text": "We love you !!!!!!! 💙💙💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-02T05:11:13", "owner": "keepitthick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914491231001346, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:51:56", "owner": "karan_thapar_1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926411889861735, "text": "🩵🎗️", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:21:04", "owner": "raazdhaar_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857096893293645, "text": "Weak sauce", "created_at": "2024-11-02T03:14:09", "owner": "dellevadovaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036873275244722, "text": "I LUV YA'LL 😢💙", "created_at": "2024-11-02T00:27:18", "owner": "shontzie55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056384284713110, "text": "🥹💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T23:56:10", "owner": "lauese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469980043009029, "text": "🩵🩵🩵", "created_at": "2024-11-01T23:51:50", "owner": "sendobrendo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032823905364286, "text": "I thought it was in June?", "created_at": "2024-11-01T23:40:28", "owner": "shyannefyvie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439315615070495, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-01T21:59:27", "owner": "hardworkinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080903503482986, "text": "🌹🌹🌹", "created_at": "2024-11-01T21:31:21", "owner": "rosecity.mentalhealth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012269348416978, "text": "🫶🫶🫶🫶", "created_at": "2024-11-01T20:55:45", "owner": "toasty_and_rascal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923727744988839, "text": "good to share this year round", "created_at": "2024-11-01T20:26:41", "owner": "keaton_s64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043834106486759, "text": "Super", "created_at": "2024-11-01T20:13:24", "owner": "hasi5135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203640778291701, "text": "💙🙌🫶", "created_at": "2024-11-01T19:58:32", "owner": "fnd_revolution", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928675101959962, "text": "Love this post! 🌿💫 I share similar tips and inspiration over at @calmihub for anyone on a journey toward balance and mindfulness. Feel free to stop by if you’re into wellbeing too – let’s inspire each other! 🌱✨ #WellbeingJourney #MindfulLiving", "created_at": "2024-11-01T19:48:18", "owner": "calmihub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972369984656481, "text": "💙😢💔", "created_at": "2024-11-01T19:02:02", "owner": "anglosaxonfrog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051701062898468, "text": "😢🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-01T18:54:29", "owner": "ckbmusik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029548133139823, "text": "Remember lads, the homies will always be there for you. Lean on them. 💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T18:47:28", "owner": "outlanderbt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845088931333515, "text": "💙💙💙💯", "created_at": "2024-11-01T18:21:09", "owner": "brandonmcadory851", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035965520243546, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T18:02:55", "owner": "nadiaamason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030716246369230, "text": "💙 Need to get my brain working for me - and not against me 🕳️ Sometimes I feel like my MH is one of the things that stops me from being more social and stuck in my thought spiral 🌀 which is exhausting and time consuming", "created_at": "2024-11-01T17:31:41", "owner": "mot.eloplaw", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17910519806944213, "text": "sending much love ❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-01T17:07:16", "owner": "livingpurposementalhealth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287268328236361, "text": "Me😞😞😞😞🙏🏿", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:52:46", "owner": "airbanks_56", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18223638148305034, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:46:18", "owner": "marek_musil_100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055529143873046, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:28:20", "owner": "veganshal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116754016407992, "text": "June and November are both men's mental health month!! Love you all and you are so worthy and important even if society says you aren't 🥰", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:26:04", "owner": "canonshortking", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17938915499923988, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:15:47", "owner": "harman.brady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874911628196606, "text": "June or November, Im here for it!\n💙💙💙💙💙\nWe Love u and Need ya Fellaz", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:06:55", "owner": "dagudgudnurse_", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17886235467106479, "text": "💚☮", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:57:47", "owner": "ds_herb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047622146004550, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:39:31", "owner": "petah_mahdah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937243410797856, "text": "🤍", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:21:07", "owner": "verticaltitan187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987331881684978, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:14:43", "owner": "katybrown1313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917970531908366, "text": "Fr 💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:12:22", "owner": "an1ka_g.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945701520883209, "text": "❤️🙏🏾", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:04:53", "owner": "poetic_justic3___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964293147808048, "text": "stay strong boys🖤we’ll get thru it🙏🏼", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:35:23", "owner": "matt._0fficial", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18035969621040568, "text": "💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:30:14", "owner": "__ninalinda__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461907976056779, "text": "Definitely June not November", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:24:46", "owner": "rlc4.__", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17879773746171558, "text": "This is a great post!", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:22:40", "owner": "evolve4ever_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024991508393588, "text": "💚💚💚💚", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:20:12", "owner": "steve.bailey.50309", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068033629645893, "text": "Thank you 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:15:02", "owner": "zackpanther92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900455860071174, "text": "Thank you. 🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:13:35", "owner": "joeo_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017625179626102, "text": "💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:11:31", "owner": "beccajohnstone02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937607601796959, "text": "💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:08:46", "owner": "__terron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061530424693411, "text": "I am very supportive of this but just out of curiosity is men’s mental health month in June or November?", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:07:20", "owner": "ameera_yas", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17946020636863046, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:58:25", "owner": "alex.dejesuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958487988719224, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:54:08", "owner": "lewismcpherson1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286536811210060, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:53:45", "owner": "rynbkr0609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043209892918011, "text": "I thought it was in June? But hey always a good time to raise awareness!", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:51:59", "owner": "tayylorstoll", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18094131211491831, "text": "Thank you 💜👊", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:41:09", "owner": "fourteenspaces", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18035047268337585, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:40:23", "owner": "dlevine711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883846993148942, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:39:15", "owner": "dmvv.mo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344482702132596, "text": "💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:37:51", "owner": "serse1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889809649103539, "text": "💙💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:37:07", "owner": "keion.jlewis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013944032382922, "text": "💚", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:36:10", "owner": "keion.jlewis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937854057808081, "text": "Much love to you all! ❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:33:49", "owner": "louisebernadettevocalist", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18013661504386380, "text": "💙😔", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:33:26", "owner": "mmmkaysure", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046329770495765, "text": "Honestly don’t know how much more I can take. But happy that there’s people out there who care about us", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:28:28", "owner": "danos.the.mad.titan", "likes": 126}, {"id": 17975711414787276, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:28:16", "owner": "myworldwithgrace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987890481727932, "text": "Amen to that 🩵💛💚. But imo... every month is men's mental health month. Men's health matters all year long 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:26:42", "owner": "theadhdcurator", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17968067984675139, "text": "💙💙", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:25:18", "owner": "_ntnm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141102088357466, "text": "Great post! 😍 Sending lots of love to all the guys