{"media_id": 3493811551575017562, "shortcode": "DB8gxhbyQha", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB8gxhbyQha/", "taken_at": "2024-11-04T10:16:30", "caption": "大件事‼️KC WINWIN 會喺灣仔會展美容展‼️\n而我15號會全日當值😆！1點鐘會同大家開live！\n大家記睇直播📸到時會有跳樓價優惠😂真係跳樓價！\n\n想嚟現場嘅朋友記得DM我呀💌可以免費入場！\n\n13/11 (WED) - 15/11 (FRI) 09:30 - 18:30\nHKCEC 香港會議展覽中心\n香港灣仔博覽道1號 展位位置 1E-C7F", "owner_username": "longway.hk", "owner_id": "55578892894", "likes": 91, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0244_DB8gxhbyQha\\DB8gxhbyQha_20241104_101630.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18074131639950537", "text": "好正呀😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:30:14", "owner": "micgma_vivi", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17920542765003667", "text": "超正🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:21:54", "owner": "ding_ding626", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18468829303061777", "text": "🥳🔥👍", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:47:46", "owner": "smileyow520", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18057713605850695", "text": "太讚了🔥🔥🔥♥️", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:15:25", "owner": "wen209", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17932360904951777", "text": "勇敢👏🏻有Heart❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-04T13:32:25", "owner": "kate.heung", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18032411825353895", "text": "🔥🔥🔥好厲害", "created_at": "2024-11-04T13:24:38", "owner": "justdolike2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18057101566894633", "text": "正，E人先做到，我I人一定唔得😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T13:00:06", "owner": "yanstory12", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18067659931637022", "text": "喂 唔得喎 真心好正😆😆😆", "created_at": "2024-11-04T12:45:14", "owner": "bubbbbbb._leung", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17853962928311426", "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T11:57:55", "owner": "parkernash9", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18032398955355158", "text": "大癲🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:51:41", "owner": "be.u.hk", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18027749075182573", "text": "好正，快閃😍", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:49:07", "owner": "sonialovebeau", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17968100192804294", "text": "喜歡🔥👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:46:55", "owner": "mt.land_official", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18065983441709710", "text": "玩到咁大😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:41:12", "owner": "kavo.hk", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17982358832757959", "text": "好正😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:37:13", "owner": "evayy_beauty", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18153743665335071", "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:27:58", "owner": "sue.bysue", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18049190602962477", "text": "大癲😂😂😂😂但我鍾意😂😂😂👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:17:43", "owner": "ft.beautyholic", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3477490934040688377, "shortcode": "DBCh5R5Ivb5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBCh5R5Ivb5/", "taken_at": "2024-10-12T21:41:26", "caption": "SILAC is a new, minimally invasive laser procedure for treating pilonidal cysts. 🔍 With faster recovery and less pain, it offers significant benefits, but how effective is it really?\n\nShould plastic surgeons also consider adopting such innovative methods for treating skin-related issues? Share your thoughts in the comments! 👇 #SILAC #LaserSurgery #PilonidalCyst #PlasticSurgery #HealthInnovation\"\n\nvideo credit:  IBI Healthcare (youtube)", "owner_username": "plastic.touch", "owner_id": "5456266824", "likes": 45040, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0245_DBCh5R5Ivb5\\DBCh5R5Ivb5_20241012_214126.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17929722926899951, "text": "is there a medication against it?", "created_at": "2025-02-23T23:20:05", "owner": "dle_mzire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843742159409767, "text": "If you've had it done, years later it can start to get inflamed again, especially if you sit for work. Tee tree oil on it for a couple of days kills any infection and puts it back to sleep", "created_at": "2025-01-30T08:29:12", "owner": "pilot_light_is_out", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926215875907772, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-30T04:14:09", "owner": "saeedbakhtazma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880018885233459, "text": "Kıl dönmesi", "created_at": "2025-01-29T16:56:19", "owner": "esmnr_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028296464315813, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T16:00:46", "owner": "logo_bomb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934457334858349, "text": "للمعلومه هذي عملية الناسور", "created_at": "2025-01-28T04:38:44", "owner": "iillenan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070603771687942, "text": "POV you fell asleep first at the sleepover", "created_at": "2025-01-18T11:37:13", "owner": "ojibdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914970826052776, "text": "Why do we even have pilonidal sinus", "created_at": "2025-01-18T09:00:01", "owner": "ca.dlahiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066128599840994, "text": "Yes, it hurt like hell tore me a new one - cuz it kinda did in a way", "created_at": "2025-01-17T21:53:31", "owner": "captain_rum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888880969197631, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-01-15T06:21:27", "owner": "zizi_of_society_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032490320213851, "text": "pilonidal cyst", "created_at": "2025-01-14T18:09:58", "owner": "thisisdrprateekpatel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064039846866811, "text": "@mohammad.rabieifar", "created_at": "2025-01-14T16:18:22", "owner": "just_ab0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942189003942238, "text": "Is this to make gay people straight", "created_at": "2025-01-03T17:36:28", "owner": "official_sergioramirez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092998474515638, "text": "Y yo quede con tremenda cicatriz por no existir esto antes", "created_at": "2025-01-03T16:53:12", "owner": "leivantonio_2019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324567073092503, "text": "Pra quem tá sem entender, isso é um cisto pilonidal. é como uma “bolsinha” que se forma debaixo da pele, geralmente perto do final das costas, bem na parte de cima do bumbum. Ele pode aparecer quando pelos ficam presos na pele e causam inflamação ou infecção. Isso pode fazer o local ficar dolorido, inchado e até liberar pus se estiver infectado.\n\nÉ mais comum em pessoas que passam muito tempo sentadas, têm pelos nessa região ou usam roupas apertadas. O tratamento pode variar, desde cuidar para que não infeccione até uma pequena cirurgia para removê-lo.", "created_at": "2025-01-01T20:25:39", "owner": "leonardo_yuichi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17887686240085165, "text": "Actually SiLac has great results in the right hands. Minimal down time, no scars, and yes, it can be repeated if needed.", "created_at": "2024-12-26T15:47:54", "owner": "ibiplasticsurgery_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093726715505456, "text": "Mira neném @mariana.sales", "created_at": "2024-12-26T03:16:24", "owner": "santi_kadefisto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18296089444236950, "text": "Custo pilonidal", "created_at": "2024-12-26T01:10:54", "owner": "rosanev_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029245619530542, "text": "بتألم؟", "created_at": "2024-12-22T21:18:46", "owner": "electronic.store2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086587375546889, "text": "hah? rambut silit?", "created_at": "2024-12-22T02:56:13", "owner": "rizqi.rhmnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042788066469170, "text": "عمليه الناسور", "created_at": "2024-12-19T20:35:55", "owner": "s_ee1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322833622082447, "text": "Cisto pilonidal já fiz está cirurgia três vezes!", "created_at": "2024-12-15T19:16:53", "owner": "siilvana_lopess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878022877125506, "text": "Eso es una fistula. Absceso", "created_at": "2024-12-13T21:33:42", "owner": "daniela1980alejandra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368973532119251, "text": "Is this a procedure that is also possible for fistel as a complication of IBD (Crohn's disease)?", "created_at": "2024-12-13T07:16:49", "owner": "pluktleven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051773402064068, "text": "لانه مو", "created_at": "2024-12-11T00:52:43", "owner": "nazaalikh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055534921770333, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-11T00:38:58", "owner": "avinarclinic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071951767577496, "text": "It's for Verneuil disease ??🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-09T23:03:21", "owner": "pampers_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070488103652319, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-08T17:26:32", "owner": "al.ikarimi316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861887710286207, "text": "Bueno no se si se llame así aún, pero en 2,019 a mi me operaron de eso, sólo que no fue ese grandioso procedimiento estético, limpio y perfecto, se llama “cirugía de quiste pilodinal”.😢", "created_at": "2024-12-05T23:28:30", "owner": "andres_art_guev33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032548376142862, "text": "Cool!", "created_at": "2024-12-04T18:29:31", "owner": "drspiegel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360857029191652, "text": "Well, I could've used that before I lost all feeling at coccyx due to the exstensive surgery 😅🤷‍♂️ Not to mention a ton of scarring and weeks of other side effects I had to deal with during the healing process...", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:45:03", "owner": "play_geek_cat_repeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886526521072612, "text": "I have this for the last year but it didn’t hurt, what should I do. My doctor said that keeping the zone clean and w not hair should be fine for auto closing. PLEASE HELP ME", "created_at": "2024-12-02T12:59:37", "owner": "giorgio_altinier", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17892325392107855, "text": "They did it to me but only two holez", "created_at": "2024-12-02T12:16:04", "owner": "roby.messina.esh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008410781497549, "text": "Has this been tested? It looks way better than opening a hole to take the pus out. Asking for a friend 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:03:00", "owner": "suelanylally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935793882954046, "text": "BRO ME HA SALIDO UN GRANO ME HA SALIDO UN GRANO EN EL ANO CREO QUE LO HE REVENTADO CON LA MANO, LO QUE DUELE NO TIENE SENTIDO ESTO VA A ACABAR CONMIGO, ESTOY MUY IMPACTADO ME DUELE MUCHO EL ANO CREO QUE SE HA INFECTADO Y HA EVOLUCIONADO, ESTO YA NO ES UN GRANO ES UN QUISTE PILONIDAAAAL, NO ES UN GRANO NO ES NORMAL", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:17:58", "owner": "jamonyorktowapo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040396190230779, "text": "Fettzellen absaugen?", "created_at": "2024-12-02T05:53:33", "owner": "mafu_0511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960343212836309, "text": "Wow I wished that worked 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-12-01T22:29:27", "owner": "jonathan_god_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046865564318629, "text": "Kildönmesi Tonrotation. Haare wachsen nach innen. Meist am Gesäßbereich.  Sehr Schmerzhaft", "created_at": "2024-12-01T21:40:25", "owner": "aayse.guel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967927527688866, "text": "I have live for 10 Years whit that..And than 2 and half years ago i had it remowed under total anestesia .I hope it will never come back.", "created_at": "2024-12-01T21:19:34", "owner": "tarik.pokvic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069977446643561, "text": "This is Pilonidal Ciatis ! \nA congenic difect of embriologic weld of Ectodetmic layers with Mesodermc tissue !!", "created_at": "2024-12-01T20:08:55", "owner": "pulltheether", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982459254631044, "text": "Only gluteal plastic surgery helps in treating a pilonidal cyst. I’ve had three surgeries, and only the third one, which included plastic surgery, resolved the problem for good.", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:32:59", "owner": "arturmx2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276679360222303, "text": "Me pareceu uma cirurgia de hemorroidas 👉🍩", "created_at": "2024-12-01T11:22:15", "owner": "gisammc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122511367403279, "text": "This treatment is super great because it’s not painful, the recovery is super quick, no need to spend a night at the hospital. I have treated this way, 100% approved", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:32:43", "owner": "31nenette", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18055663726738901, "text": "This Fistula will open directly after surgery. I had 10 surgeries with this methodology and 0 result. Just use the old method, to cut out whole fistula. It works much better.", "created_at": "2024-11-28T22:01:15", "owner": "amirazashvili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055084018758762, "text": "@margavanvoorthuizen", "created_at": "2024-11-27T21:41:05", "owner": "harmkeverwoerd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024608015569392, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏 this produre  is a miracle", "created_at": "2024-11-27T19:05:32", "owner": "fransounette63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073968724559343, "text": "Io l'ho fatta ed è stato perfetto", "created_at": "2024-11-27T18:25:32", "owner": "pinoscarsella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130584517376468, "text": "Pilo nidal sinus excision by laser", "created_at": "2024-11-26T03:12:43", "owner": "priteshpatel1810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938396709810140, "text": "Это свич", "created_at": "2024-11-26T02:18:38", "owner": "kahhor__440___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18205162372290132, "text": "@higor.99", "created_at": "2024-11-26T02:10:16", "owner": "camilossilva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050528716974973, "text": "Cisto pilonidal", "created_at": "2024-11-25T02:17:53", "owner": "dr.victorrochamfc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912929866039930, "text": "*cries in 4 surgeries, an open wound, a bulb drain, and a wound vac over 2 years*", "created_at": "2024-11-22T09:29:28", "owner": "steenah_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873643015212359, "text": "May this occur again", "created_at": "2024-11-19T14:21:33", "owner": "shruti1679", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097856695471906, "text": "Cisto pilonidal. A técnica melhorou bastante. Quando operei foi com bisturi", "created_at": "2024-11-19T01:22:07", "owner": "luiz.lima.oficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070572337653778, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-18T18:08:59", "owner": "maghiyose55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364639840116166, "text": "بواسیر", "created_at": "2024-11-17T04:44:04", "owner": "shikdoch123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067663384710702, "text": "Что за операция? Я из комментариев ничего не поняла. Объясните пожалуйста", "created_at": "2024-11-16T16:55:18", "owner": "zaf671812", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18089241748506455, "text": "Nima qildi? ko'tini teshigini yamavordimi?", "created_at": "2024-11-16T13:45:35", "owner": "sanjarbek_sidiqov_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039266018233233, "text": "@", "created_at": "2024-11-16T07:37:31", "owner": "sidongdong1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276061177217549, "text": "I wish that was a thing 20 years ago.. Then my ass would not look like it does..", "created_at": "2024-11-15T21:19:13", "owner": "louisadittetavares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046442383881051, "text": "👁👄👁", "created_at": "2024-11-15T14:25:00", "owner": "jhorranne_chrystie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083160103528064, "text": "We have that many holes?", "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:42:01", "owner": "____azraf_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026239319218021, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-09T00:42:49", "owner": "marcoskooiti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945329490900795, "text": "Anyone suffering with pilonidal disease, even after multiple failed surgeries, check us out. We may be able to offer you cure. PiloFix.com", "created_at": "2024-11-04T11:37:44", "owner": "pilonidalfix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049841512988860, "text": "What's all the squiggly stuff?", "created_at": "2024-11-04T06:13:46", "owner": "jordaniel.san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072601423611247, "text": "You diggin' in me😩", "created_at": "2024-11-04T04:30:51", "owner": "jon.the.vagabond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427863226075533, "text": "I don’t know man it looks a little invasive", "created_at": "2024-11-03T05:10:06", "owner": "tyler_soriano", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18142475887350146, "text": "I wish this was there back in 2019 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2024-11-02T08:27:49", "owner": "deepraj.rane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018471146553814, "text": "الصبر على وجع العصب أهون من علاجها", "created_at": "2024-11-01T18:32:12", "owner": "sniper223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979298895631029, "text": "Oh god damn it. I looked up what this was and now I'm. Agh. Glad I don't have one", "created_at": "2024-11-01T05:15:37", "owner": "jelly_bean_jem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887166226053652, "text": "Well it's definitely better than leaving a patient with an open wound for weeks", "created_at": "2024-10-31T13:05:32", "owner": "ahmedmikebeymd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108326122430356, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-29T06:53:34", "owner": "prpclinic_karaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060105121698751, "text": "I was not expecting that end", "created_at": "2024-10-22T01:23:58", "owner": "imnotlocke", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18042895526112814, "text": "Bro wtf", "created_at": "2024-10-21T16:28:15", "owner": "glittered_eye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870222763209678, "text": "You heard correctly but anesthesia deff put me to sleep didn’t feel a thing", "created_at": "2024-10-21T00:16:08", "owner": "cyph.jones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18464930650029975, "text": "Holy shit", "created_at": "2024-10-20T22:18:10", "owner": "starrynight56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060428071778834, "text": "Anything would be an improvement over the absolute hell that is the normal surgical approach to treating these.", "created_at": "2024-10-20T22:03:18", "owner": "tryanwagner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356289097185805, "text": "pilonidal cyst 😔", "created_at": "2024-10-20T20:15:36", "owner": "rahulkisikanamane", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18038997497329152, "text": "Bisul kah", "created_at": "2024-10-20T14:43:56", "owner": "rkhmanhkm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353933182138726, "text": "Y’all should check out Dr. Allen Kamrava in Los Angeles. He has a laser outpatient procedure that was minimally invasive with very little pain. I golfed a few days later and it was mostly healed in three weeks and fully healed shortly after that. Saw a different surgeon first who wanted to do full surgery which would have taken months to heal.", "created_at": "2024-10-20T06:02:53", "owner": "georgejchi", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18036068168023386, "text": "Lockpicking a cyst", "created_at": "2024-10-19T20:56:42", "owner": "samiscoolandgay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028241600457907, "text": "I had classic surgery and it was no fun. I wonder if this is thorough enough. Are there statistics on relapses with this method versus traditional surgery?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T18:50:51", "owner": "woutkil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040088858327166, "text": "what is this?", "created_at": "2024-10-19T17:37:51", "owner": "belikrof", "likes": 79}, {"id": 18072747460594733, "text": "भगन्दर - Fistula", "created_at": "2024-10-19T07:21:04", "owner": "shubham_kakad_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924955386970201, "text": "If this a DIY procedure? Is there a YouTube walkthru?", "created_at": "2024-10-18T23:55:21", "owner": "jordan__larkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335151169183782, "text": "Bro fell asleep first at the party", "created_at": "2024-10-18T23:35:23", "owner": "raffea01", "likes": 1725}, {"id": 18280674286209528, "text": "Is this what Louise XIV had?", "created_at": "2024-10-18T21:59:14", "owner": "themoodysax", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883127353136233, "text": "😐", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:59:56", "owner": "lordvampire12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026835323373907, "text": "Can they use these same tools for Nasal Dermoid Cysts with fistulas?", "created_at": "2024-10-18T08:17:47", "owner": "therez_just_us", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049221910791024, "text": "Where is it with four holes?", "created_at": "2024-10-17T11:32:43", "owner": "tylerlaaam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913127766922123, "text": "bulu bool?", "created_at": "2024-10-16T00:48:02", "owner": "mhdnrjl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092784922490033, "text": "Is this the man's vagina?", "created_at": "2024-10-15T20:08:57", "owner": "jeli._.senpai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016208147627925, "text": "Banda para los q preguntan es la operación para quitar la cola de saiyajin", "created_at": "2024-10-15T18:24:17", "owner": "naza_coceres", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039960809124475, "text": "Pilonidal cyst surgery", "created_at": "2024-10-15T12:15:07", "owner": "belle122778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119603218400108, "text": "Does this work for rectal abscess?", "created_at": "2024-10-14T11:05:24", "owner": "debbie_h_negron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886115410049650, "text": "The worst option.👎🏼", "created_at": "2024-10-14T09:58:41", "owner": "dr.ar2rbah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009801719448621, "text": "Had this done", "created_at": "2024-10-13T19:33:47", "owner": "mcleann83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150940864329870, "text": "Where ur location", "created_at": "2024-10-13T18:18:50", "owner": "tina.jain.3910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019715657572180, "text": "How easy it is to sew ...", "created_at": "2024-10-13T17:08:38", "owner": "rangeen_marf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101781064449667, "text": "This is amazing! And seems like it would not come back as they usually do. From my experience as a PACU nurse these cysts are so painful as are the surgeries.", "created_at": "2024-10-13T11:48:22", "owner": "tonniareed", "likes": 25}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["silac", "lasersurgery", "pilonidalcyst", "plasticsurgery", "healthinnovation"]},
