01804217, "text": "Should I try this on shrooms", "created_at": "2024-11-09T12:05:52", "owner": "loke_teo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938046042800907, "text": "Where i can play that", "created_at": "2024-11-09T11:43:49", "owner": "jeremysebastian191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062186443692639, "text": "Imagine playing this while high", "created_at": "2024-11-09T09:51:18", "owner": "__pek1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048789356063312, "text": "OH NO MY PCCCCC‼️‼️‼️‼️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-11-09T03:01:10", "owner": "velvet.fortune", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909954976025031, "text": "Does it play Wonderwall?", "created_at": "2024-11-09T02:49:09", "owner": "lampuleeplaap", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084973339468280, "text": "Literally made my computer crash", "created_at": "2024-11-09T02:16:42", "owner": "better_call_tall", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936678933928463, "text": "Woww", "created_at": "2024-11-09T00:05:38", "owner": "king12dave", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077009218574137, "text": "I’m gonna go pop a tab and play this (/j)", "created_at": "2024-11-08T22:00:26", "owner": "the_multicam_photographer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18012952475420983, "text": "1 million hours of gameplay are something like 115 years so i doubt it pretty much", "created_at": "2024-11-08T21:41:56", "owner": "vicenteecossio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053924857929269, "text": "This 8s sick", "created_at": "2024-11-08T19:36:59", "owner": "car_duje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023179235270947, "text": "Juguemoslo amiga @dianauroora", "created_at": "2024-11-08T19:35:56", "owner": "streptopeliaturtur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363905947143120, "text": "Back in my days we would download pirated minecraft off the google playstore, nowadays kids can just play an ai version of minecraft if their parents wont buy it for them💀💀", "created_at": "2024-11-08T19:14:24", "owner": "kikufukuk", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17891342385099590, "text": "dodaj nazwe muzyki lepiej", "created_at": "2024-11-08T17:30:57", "owner": "aleks_zawisz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986955780736787, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-08T17:08:49", "owner": "alex.usb.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003982865693556, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:21:13", "owner": "noah_vegeberg_jeppsson09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024025646531537, "text": "Lobotomy", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:20:50", "owner": "noah_vegeberg_jeppsson09", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17934108014829044, "text": "Lobotomycraft", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:04:32", "owner": "mrmaximilias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945178629867030, "text": "7 min queue", "created_at": "2024-11-08T15:13:47", "owner": "harrydick630", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053059759756599, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-08T14:47:49", "owner": "ludo_patia_19200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250543081280553, "text": "geekcraft", "created_at": "2024-11-08T12:13:46", "owner": "adumb_wish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064446274670726, "text": "methcraft", "created_at": "2024-11-08T08:18:00", "owner": "__monster1111", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18055985629857863, "text": "Imagine being baked and playing this", "created_at": "2024-11-08T05:06:46", "owner": "_hrid_dhi_ig_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842796118356420, "text": "Lobotomy craft is real", "created_at": "2024-11-08T04:53:46", "owner": "emicx_gmz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040947578177149, "text": "@nishhh_248", "created_at": "2024-11-08T03:02:23", "owner": "nocturnal_emission__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317108884091712, "text": "Game name", "created_at": "2024-11-08T00:21:26", "owner": "m.50.1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048506636076247, "text": "Is it free", "created_at": "2024-11-07T23:39:51", "owner": "magcocet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249650809280942, "text": "Playing while high = drugs * drugs so drug squared???", "created_at": "2024-11-07T23:24:23", "owner": "avocadoduckies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047029541075203, "text": "Lobotominecraft", "created_at": "2024-11-07T22:50:44", "owner": "nicholasroy07", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17847776622341006, "text": "How did ai train 114 years on a game that's only 14 years old🤨", "created_at": "2024-11-07T21:53:26", "owner": "satx.aguilar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021817025547411, "text": "play this on salvia or acid please", "created_at": "2024-11-07T21:34:06", "owner": "kolten.spielman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048895829069215, "text": "The name of the game?", "created_at": "2024-11-07T21:33:02", "owner": "hubert.homola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015709814352332, "text": "O-O-O-O-O-O-M-M-M-Y-Y-P-C", "created_at": "2024-11-07T19:42:07", "owner": "caca_desenhista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112238620420108, "text": "imagine playing this of shrooms 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-07T19:39:46", "owner": "kario_onweekdays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995739804541493, "text": "Wasting so much electricity", "created_at": "2024-11-07T18:57:31", "owner": "sophrhph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023261384571002, "text": "a million hours is 114 years.", "created_at": "2024-11-07T18:43:54", "owner": "realest_asuka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18471404293019134, "text": "Not sure if people won’t look back at this in anger.", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:35:07", "owner": "itsmondeyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947621823860890, "text": "Imagine with 10M hours, 100M or even 1B. It's just a matter of time", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:15:16", "owner": "flawastaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041337278162673, "text": "Steve with dementia simulator 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:11:36", "owner": "alonn_idk_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981298476769775, "text": "So if you use drugs then play this game am i high²?", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:10:09", "owner": "idk.b3nj4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035100221258562, "text": "I know... Let's try building a computer! 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:04:46", "owner": "dani_e_idiomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986313939603791, "text": "Imagine playing the arkham games on this", "created_at": "2024-11-07T17:01:25", "owner": "the_pissjug_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429254167074810, "text": "Feels like my first kéol", "created_at": "2024-11-07T16:19:57", "owner": "chouraver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065298451680429, "text": "So if you take drugs it’s doing the opposite", "created_at": "2024-11-07T16:11:54", "owner": "bzh_fpv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027672206186154, "text": "Imagine playing this while high.", "created_at": "2024-11-07T15:59:56", "owner": "nikooo_pg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871621567214299, "text": "I just played it and it's like playing minecraft but with dementia", "created_at": "2024-11-07T15:50:02", "owner": "t.moss747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048244262500453, "text": "Lobotomy craft", "created_at": "2024-11-07T15:48:07", "owner": "nikovoyage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008010005659566, "text": "Mydementia", "created_at": "2024-11-07T15:46:18", "owner": "dblgiswkdb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926759793861924, "text": "Imagine playing this ON drugs", "created_at": "2024-11-07T15:20:56", "owner": "yuvalfalkovich", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041984567158820, "text": "ketacraft", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:44:54", "owner": "schl4ft4blette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248128399287612, "text": "This is like minecraft alzheimers edition", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:40:27", "owner": "ntn.saintino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035067821198026, "text": "why are people so pressed about this lmao, emulating art it's not bad if you don't take profit, and it isn't even supossed to be played instead of minecraft you're just supossed to experience the thing, it's honestly not that bad 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:32:29", "owner": "yae_piko0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053094208910268, "text": "This is impressive as the AI is essentially imagining the game onto a screen", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:23:36", "owner": "iiagro_jtii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077360140562399, "text": "Lobotomycraft", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:23:06", "owner": "lobotomartinek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009767333473792, "text": "Lobotomy craft on top", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:16:54", "owner": "brumiiiik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027000911401921, "text": "Wanna play Minecraft guys I turn around and I have no friends 😢", "created_at": "2024-11-07T14:01:02", "owner": "210_tk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153463624330541, "text": "this is dementia", "created_at": "2024-11-07T13:58:30", "owner": "jamongpin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051318904798141, "text": "DementiaCraft", "created_at": "2024-11-07T12:49:09", "owner": "amoghprabhu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466047058051660, "text": "My dreams", "created_at": "2024-11-07T12:47:23", "owner": "jhd.vahid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928706043960418, "text": "100 years??", "created_at": "2024-11-07T12:33:41", "owner": "_ade._lean_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282276136171158, "text": "Lsdcraft", "created_at": "2024-11-07T12:32:29", "owner": "leospanczak", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["techtok"]},
