_at": "2024-12-18T11:45:39", "owner": "libbyparisse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872403148248790, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T05:29:30", "owner": "mdl_studios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034886507373559, "text": "Glasgow has suddenly changed …", "created_at": "2024-12-18T01:39:32", "owner": "7lieanne7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013761632656064, "text": "Lol brum is tru finance capital #rs3 cuzzy", "created_at": "2024-12-17T23:08:35", "owner": "s6.ysl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029984081426763, "text": "Who pronounces Reading like that?? 🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-11T21:07:27", "owner": "bobbyfromtheblock86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032600420458234, "text": "Birmingham makes total sense 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-05T12:16:05", "owner": "spacearchidoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930976572967261, "text": "Milton Keynes tho lol 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-05T09:34:50", "owner": "riomarvin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025922483267028, "text": "@tezilyas last one 😆", "created_at": "2024-11-30T18:14:58", "owner": "exception4l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842634409373097, "text": "Glasgow can't stop catching Ws", "created_at": "2024-11-30T12:52:59", "owner": "joseph.a._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476066986062454, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-27T11:04:20", "owner": "arikonthedragon20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974888658650590, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-26T08:47:45", "owner": "faizai.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055682701915160, "text": "Naaa it’s gotta be Peterborough", "created_at": "2024-11-25T22:03:31", "owner": "cufcarn94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952071894755302, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂, the most interesting part is about Reading😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:45:22", "owner": "uohsmk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865899286256374, "text": "Men in Glasgow are very hard working, I live in Glasgow", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:53:32", "owner": "babtd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999168135527917, "text": "It is not fucking READING IT IS REDING. 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-19T18:39:11", "owner": "_joserra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855903448314382, "text": "@jerrybigshott kuja hapa", "created_at": "2024-11-18T04:22:48", "owner": "naitwasarah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947983326871607, "text": "Reeding 🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-18T02:53:52", "owner": "chris.lean.52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109023835434364, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-15T01:20:16", "owner": "dukwebtech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922894413991403, "text": "the most useless video", "created_at": "2024-11-14T21:11:34", "owner": "titankthui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099071287466386, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T04:23:44", "owner": "gadthescreamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068016103639682, "text": "Glasgow is Scotland", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:58:49", "owner": "ryanmidd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075765529580811, "text": "All of them. They're from the UK", "created_at": "2024-11-10T04:06:36", "owner": "peetiesquared", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036027830214965, "text": "Reading ain’t even a city", "created_at": "2024-11-09T22:25:25", "owner": "asael._abu_ayyub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025386296576887, "text": "@dkrupes shots fired", "created_at": "2024-11-09T20:12:06", "owner": "b0ejush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105162688444966, "text": "Since when was Slough a city?", "created_at": "2024-11-09T09:45:19", "owner": "only_seabiscuit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331609117198582, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-08T00:30:22", "owner": "yashemasingz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929990361955897, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-07T09:13:23", "owner": "_mkvilarinho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904945768061538, "text": "The pronunciation of the towns is more 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-06T18:15:26", "owner": "f99only", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045429002093513, "text": "bradford", "created_at": "2024-11-06T13:17:16", "owner": "dxnij", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015568391348048, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T20:28:04", "owner": "jerrymurphy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911523940016138, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-05T11:20:33", "owner": "profanograssi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18254524777258672, "text": "@tezilyas", "created_at": "2024-11-04T21:41:44", "owner": "chill_your_beanz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869130658233555, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T11:21:12", "owner": "hifedy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377685310109180, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-04T08:06:31", "owner": "beejay_baba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950507988852528, "text": "What is this?! 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-04T07:33:56", "owner": "fantasia613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249656269278457, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T20:57:48", "owner": "tanakakay5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021765179565720, "text": "Single ladies, your options are even more limited", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:31:29", "owner": "as.safa_92", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17909621052030311, "text": "“Up north to Birmingham” 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-03T03:50:54", "owner": "jw.uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875206729193974, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:37:25", "owner": "ayeshaa_3001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168954682314091, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T09:54:05", "owner": "mccheekyp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947080554888035, "text": "I don’t believe him", "created_at": "2024-11-02T08:19:31", "owner": "the_extricate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287517439209135, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T08:16:11", "owner": "efe0___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867040999238139, "text": "Milton canes and reeding?", "created_at": "2024-11-02T08:03:42", "owner": "tomhorrortattoo2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206004877293067, "text": "Yeah no the redding thing pissed me off I m still stuck there 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-02T07:56:22", "owner": "jaymarvel2804", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069263329717639, "text": "So all the places known for chavs", "created_at": "2024-11-01T19:27:42", "owner": "villagernumber77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024909851526542, "text": "Pronounced as Reading like past tense for Read \"reddin\"", "created_at": "2024-11-01T17:25:00", "owner": "_claudia_liu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019023416547363, "text": "I'm moving to Milton Keynes. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T16:52:09", "owner": "johnwoods4405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052772644745761, "text": "😂😂 my city is not among", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:46:55", "owner": "adetokunbo_daudu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067177540652742, "text": "The Birmingham one is true💯", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:11:53", "owner": "ihateoscy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019335542314650, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:05:49", "owner": "princeworldtraveler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925157478985544, "text": "Abeg who carried out this research! 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:36:43", "owner": "lilmama_luv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864074905252940, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2024-11-01T14:14:14", "owner": "cliffordenobun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065692372602564, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 I’m on the floor", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:35:16", "owner": "ultimateglamk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958393320719778, "text": "Lol. Absolutely no reading in Reading. 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T13:05:15", "owner": "mr.auric.goldfinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299771833206959, "text": "Ffs😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:48:17", "owner": "dominichay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062064127743993, "text": "Birmingham is not \"Up North\" 🤣 and did you say reading as reading a book? 🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:06:59", "owner": "levinalondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011208704440881, "text": "Wait it’s called ‘reading’ and I’ve been saying it incorrectly for decades 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T12:00:01", "owner": "dibanasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082224088535448, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T11:40:13", "owner": "moliisaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004627559660030, "text": "The Milton Keynes one is so accurate💀🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-01T11:16:09", "owner": "abbiemaria__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333749368148950, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T10:23:55", "owner": "yasmangoli_zwolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049637681293946, "text": "0121!!! 🔥  ahahaha", "created_at": "2024-11-01T10:17:33", "owner": "blvck_rune", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935898396928240, "text": "😂😂😂 tf is this 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T10:11:24", "owner": "cocktailcircus_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041198822155815, "text": "@killa_kam_south 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:58:52", "owner": "rosycheeks_memon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048168443004562, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:50:43", "owner": "chiomaa07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865381282183250, "text": "Please explain Milton Keynes.", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:38:32", "owner": "allyflo20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061733299696663, "text": "Bham one is correct", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:35:47", "owner": "jaskaur1900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081466822528680, "text": "🙌🙌😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:34:45", "owner": "timloxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862168879204897, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:26:51", "owner": "alayobaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081335353531790, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:20:33", "owner": "abayomialao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072001705544249, "text": "@ikraadnan", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:12:12", "owner": "sanna_rizwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971330946658382, "text": "Source for this data? It sounds a bit a make up", "created_at": "2024-11-01T08:55:59", "owner": "samuel.minamioka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285044425212134, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T08:51:06", "owner": "_withlovetete_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018090476559550, "text": "The most useless thing is the pronunciation of Reading 😂😂. It's \"Redding\"", "created_at": "2024-11-01T08:25:05", "owner": "dyke.karl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945278685897740, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T08:03:04", "owner": "milan_zee00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870677734144201, "text": "Which Is why you do it alone.", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:54:40", "owner": "spigz1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951212760849895, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:43:01", "owner": "priscilaeakh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962673525696209, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:39:59", "owner": "taiwo_anagoals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020258582617699, "text": "Glasgow men!!🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:32:53", "owner": "jidecardinal", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053479186924844, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:55:55", "owner": "bigunclechad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245219215279606, "text": "It’s pronounced red ing not read", "created_at": "2024-11-01T06:16:20", "owner": "hazehighnessxv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029949587111943, "text": "The common factor 🇵🇰", "created_at": "2024-11-01T05:48:42", "owner": "19.sam.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051408316777169, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T05:04:22", "owner": "marvi_baloch_solo_traveller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096165715430771, "text": "Look at all that green open land", "created_at": "2024-11-01T03:29:23", "owner": "___baarrrba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847724305306317, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-01T03:24:38", "owner": "tundeatunrase24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980600922777409, "text": "based on the city name, we know what kind of people live there 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂 ..benefiting social benefit 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T22:24:46", "owner": "martykwan_ldn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468523879031181, "text": "Todd cantwell is right at home then 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-31T08:43:20", "owner": "twowheeledjock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080849098540194, "text": "I want to know who made this video mad insulting 😂", "created_at": "2024-10-30T19:29:48", "owner": "azraelapollo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042112381909350, "text": "Slough and reading aren’t cities", "created_at": "2024-10-29T13:59:32", "owner": "craigo7392", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035518373209633, "text": "Preston is safe for now", "created_at": "2024-10-24T17:06:13", "owner": "nicky.t9", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
