-11-04T15:48:30", "owner": "wcwt4", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3495234510739115411, "shortcode": "DCBkUTbSo2T", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCBkUTbSo2T/", "taken_at": "2024-11-06T09:14:39", "caption": "《2025企管營招工》\n你說誰又贏❓中央企管營❗️\n🔗企管營招工表單：\n我們有 美宣、企劃、隊輔 3️⃣個組別等你加入🔥\n招工時間11/6-11/25 下午四點截止\n面試時間 12/2-12/6\n面試結果出爐 12/11\n\n各組詳細的資訊也可以到NCU TALK上尋找\n我們這幾天會陸續發佈各組的介紹\n我們也已經發佈了第一篇介紹文\n大家可以去看哦❗️\n營期就在明年暑假 快加入我們吧！\n\n工人報名表單🫶\n在主頁精選！！！", "owner_username": "ncuba_114", "owner_id": "19786930351", "likes": 181, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0251_DCBkUTbSo2T\\DCBkUTbSo2T_20241106_091439.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18030833234112674", "text": "6啊我不用", "created_at": "2024-11-06T10:04:33", "owner": "ben_______1202", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18040779200169490", "text": "脆上紅人都這樣想宣傳的 學會了 @yujun_3_5", "created_at": "2024-11-06T09:52:30", "owner": "_cowcowoo._", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3495104867963858194, "shortcode": "DCBG1wLuW0S", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCBG1wLuW0S/", "taken_at": "2024-11-06T05:04:32", "caption": "男生可以解答一下，到底是什麼刺激到他起機了。。。？\n話說那時18歲，是人生第一次看到真人🐥\n第一個感覺是，跟Bio書的顏色不一樣耶。🤔\n\n大概是唯一一堂，出席率100%的素描課。\n\n9upup 系列回歸☺️💕", "owner_username": "ashnorush", "owner_id": "197495422", "likes": 98101, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0252_DCBG1wLuW0S\\DCBG1wLuW0S_20241106_050432.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18339533428180837, "text": "唔小心諗左其他野 大家就會越劃越長", "created_at": "2024-11-06T21:15:01", "owner": "fatjimjim", "likes": 7179}, {"id": 18305462212215429, "text": "全裸不是很貴嗎🧐", "created_at": "2025-04-29T10:37:10", "owner": "kutly_0626", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035021873633884, "text": "如果我在這上堂的話，請快點救我出去，因為我看到那裏的會精盡人亡", "created_at": "2025-04-23T03:53:08", "owner": "kinson1120", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054883115245473, "text": "因為男模特旁邊還有女模特不是嗎😏", "created_at": "2025-04-22T12:41:16", "owner": "onedoor_94102212481010201129", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18275868115271945, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-04-22T10:45:35", "owner": "bbanime0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137327482401085, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-22T09:20:50", "owner": "wwitch.craft", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978620463826746, "text": "@mino_ooog", "created_at": "2025-04-15T04:39:38", "owner": "mo12345678on", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064423969959878, "text": "@a1mi3z 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-14T23:18:34", "owner": "jellyfish.zzzyye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088748554596867, "text": "無咩特別，亦唔一定係諗衰野或見到d咩。正常充血就會變大。可能企得耐，腿部肌肉充血，大量血液去下半身，小鳥多少都充到血變大鳥。", "created_at": "2025-04-03T20:30:49", "owner": "carvelfung", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948501699953792, "text": "@7wen_627_ @xqc.1117", "created_at": "2025-04-01T11:56:31", "owner": "lan_jing_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060173650845316, "text": "Wt", "created_at": "2025-03-25T14:07:40", "owner": "25_change.asdfghjkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082594609570976, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-23T14:02:19", "owner": "rexy.doxy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18162709705338207, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-22T15:01:31", "owner": "mattwww_bluey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962676690861795, "text": "那个人姿势摆着摆着就立正了？？？", "created_at": "2025-03-21T15:35:03", "owner": "alton.gooi_1012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054940823130124, "text": "起機是什麼意思？", "created_at": "2025-03-20T23:05:46", "owner": "7yu1_naiyun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047993276201629, "text": "好奇一件事，就是女生在畫男模特時會一直看他的🐔🐔嗎？", "created_at": "2025-03-20T11:26:59", "owner": "yualwaysonthetop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056529791146265, "text": "@ella__8707 我點解會碌到...", "created_at": "2025-03-18T09:15:29", "owner": "lcy_026", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026077730402912, "text": "第一次？ 怎麼可能～～", "created_at": "2025-03-16T07:54:53", "owner": "mylife_199305", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18382512172142519, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T13:30:56", "owner": "candy.__.eva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18262797523279115, "text": "咳咳 @cute2024728 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T12:55:19", "owner": "chn__.0320._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032361152556762, "text": "命運的真相-經常冤枉別人的人\n\n曾經有一個人，經常冤枉別人，造成別人非常痛苦。所以按照命運的法則，他在轉世之後，得到相同的遭遇，經常受人冤枉，因此要經常轉換環境與工作，非常痛苦。", "created_at": "2025-03-06T21:29:06", "owner": "catcat_ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296817928211465, "text": "犧牲好大", "created_at": "2025-03-01T04:31:59", "owner": "xu._.he0227", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18477093835006002, "text": "有男的畫?", "created_at": "2025-02-26T11:34:52", "owner": "ryanmys110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929667363899907, "text": "@kli_1105, @cml_lokkk, @wwwing_.413", "created_at": "2025-02-25T13:59:30", "owner": "yan_lam_911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039174608377272, "text": "咁女Model嗰邊係咪全部直晒？", "created_at": "2025-02-17T11:19:19", "owner": "qige616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042362384100225, "text": "我上的課都是一個人一堂 不會有這種事", "created_at": "2025-02-15T05:55:54", "owner": "anisama0211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928530759906000, "text": "好後悔冇揀va囉", "created_at": "2025-02-14T16:49:11", "owne