28, "text": "📲", "created_at": "2024-12-02T02:21:58", "owner": "doooonotttusethisigg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060967906671526, "text": "Why I gotta tie my hair back to use a fleshlight?", "created_at": "2024-11-26T21:56:40", "owner": "nate_p_tattoos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042584815973176, "text": "But I thought she wants all of her content removed from the Internet 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T23:34:21", "owner": "saint_nickotine", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18059394892804308, "text": "Lets hope she doesn't try to pull a Khalifa 🤡", "created_at": "2024-11-23T20:30:18", "owner": "leisure_lijon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18448496341064321, "text": "THE ACCOUNT IS CALLED FLESHLIGHT WHAT IS WRONG WITH EVERYONE", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:14:18", "owner": "den0isse", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18107760943394132, "text": "At this point you don’t need a hair tie", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:30:34", "owner": "davidpushes", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062028202839006, "text": "She’s old now", "created_at": "2024-11-22T12:05:00", "owner": "c_z_r_1017", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17888665512107688, "text": "What about the smell?", "created_at": "2024-11-22T12:04:44", "owner": "c_z_r_1017", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17956791665736055, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-21T23:37:20", "owner": "mrlemonjuice", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067746928734522, "text": "And she wonders why she won't be able to have a normal life with her baby daddy and kid....", "created_at": "2024-11-21T20:33:48", "owner": "cordell_ebert", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047209655037328, "text": "🐐🐐🐐🐐", "created_at": "2024-11-21T03:54:11", "owner": "nesmag91", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18017591885633245, "text": "😍Riley Reid😘", "created_at": "2024-11-19T22:11:26", "owner": "prinsipemasanting", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18012798482422719, "text": "😚😚😚😚", "created_at": "2024-11-18T23:37:51", "owner": "danielvargas3558", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011782619650082, "text": "will you marry me please", "created_at": "2024-11-18T22:57:47", "owner": "kuldeep11396", "like