0, "text": "lol I have those panties ❤️🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-07T23:50:49", "owner": "kayler0se", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17868998280233763, "text": "Riley can you be my mom", "created_at": "2024-11-07T23:20:41", "owner": "tonyb676", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18035274275061327, "text": "The best tip", "created_at": "2024-11-07T22:43:12", "owner": "bruna_aii", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18065772388725992, "text": "Pensé que ya no queria hacer nopor y que se arrepentía de sus decisiones, entonces...por qué sigue haciendo?", "created_at": "2024-11-07T22:31:20", "owner": "azralag90", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18248132059287366, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-07T22:30:21", "owner": "raxalyx", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18043701437490603, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-07T21:49:40", "owner": "shomikhala", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18154805371335535, "text": "I wonder if it ever gets exhausting for her to portray herself as nothing more than a sexual object to please men who only see her as exactly that", "created_at": "2024-11-07T21:02:06", "owner": "maariinaasbutterflies_", "likes": 26}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3462455941713827472, "shortcode": "DANHVWISxaQ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DANHVWISxaQ/", "taken_at": "2024-09-22T03:49:24", "caption": "#热点 #富人思维 #穷人思维 #思维格局 #创业 #必看 #财商思维 #商业思维 #赚钱 #个人成长 #强者思维", "owner_username": "stephen_choo.dy", "owner_id": "66549818672", "likes": 6318, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0255_DANHVWISxaQ\\DANHVWISxaQ_20240922_034924.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18077029000579365, "text": "所以那些沙子所要表現的是什麼….. 沙子沒弄完，把人當傻子嗎", "created_at": "2025-02-10T01:34:08", "owner": "andrew.dotcolor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066335791838520, "text": "最後是什麼圖案", "created_at": "2025-01-23T11:07:24", "owner": "tw___wa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030685571377965, "text": "蛤,什麼性別刻板印象，而且當一個男人用你是想幹嘛", "created_at": "2024-12-08T10:55:32", "owner": "sixuanwu1114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027671549242249, "text": "我媽倒是常常把事丟給我做，但我怎麼越來越懶了？", "created_at": "2024-12-08T07:43:08", "owner": "jjps100125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024145673291981, "text": "整片我只聽到苦活累活讓他去做，聽他放屁", "created_at": "2024-11-30T02:46:58", "owner": "j.chengda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015453764386817, "text": "😂笑死要確", "created_at": "2024-11-21T14:03:50", "owner": "moosey0202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058261945870326, "text": "從小就被打壓當男人用的人路過....要確定捏我只會覺得自己沒有童年，如果沒有靠自己走出來我甚至不知道原來世界這麼大，現在走出來有點經濟能力了反而盡量讓自己體驗人生", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:13:17", "owner": "knight33366", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988099674600922, "text": "我只知道那些沙子會很難清", "created_at": "2024-11-10T15:44:36", "owner": "walt0722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085364950469722, "text": "...我只能說這雞湯有點毒 😢 我母親從小使喚我 我如今父親過世後 我一直無法諒解,我為什麼要一直養一個覺得我現在的成就都是他的功勞自以為是的人  為的只是父親的遺願", "created_at": "2024-11-09T18:52:40", "owner": "huang.liangying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034079954342140, "text": "來人傳給藍姐🫣", "created_at": "2024-11-08T07:24:11", "owner": "wayfarer_1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101154730457836, "text": "錯誤期待，無效鼓勵，童年就是讓他好好做小孩🙄", "created_at": "2024-11-07T01:23:20", "owner": "jason_ag4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024416738245746, "text": "多一根苦一生", "created_at": "2024-11-06T15:39:21", "owner": "chendaten", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049642639960145, "text": "When will us get a dislike button?", "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:30:39", "owner": "_.6uon9._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247970239286877, "text": "10几亿人口全都顶天立地，有人想过天的感受吗？", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:34:29", "owner": "chongkaoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990376125581346, "text": "工具人養成日記", "created_at": "2024-11-02T14:22:59", "owner": "9kura37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899554801065918, "text": "正向教育", "created_at": "2024-11-02T12:36:17", "owner": "prince_of_darkness_akito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327585322155345, "text": "如果沒有開頭那個我就會傳給我媽", "created_at": "2024-10-27T14:50:50", "owner": "111brand1on11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949233492756259, "text": "🤑🤑🤑", "created_at": "2024-10-27T10:15:30", "owner": "chen._.duck", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936940956809666, "text": "一個問題地上這堆東西誰在清理", "created_at": "2024-10-25T18:13:45", "owner": "smallfist88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032025926520416, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-10-25T02:57:03", "owner": "nicolahart659tmz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042165272283449, "text": "所以第三個是？", "created_at": "2024-10-20T09:50:16", "owner": "ajohn0429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036273053516794, "text": "我還以為那是屁股", "created_at": "2024-10-19T08:41:28", "owner": "ninic1015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278393989243356, "text": "影片好特別", "created_at": "2024-10-14T03:38:25", "owner": "giant_pai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976211133774299, "text": "開頭那一顆是什麼？", "created_at": "2024-10-13T09:53:13", "owner": "tuopjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468185926005214, "text": "羊肚包肉", "created_at": "2024-10-11T07:07:47", "owner": "yi_chieh.68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051342133905477, "text": "聽你放屁👏", "created_at": "2024-10-10T06:00:40", "owner": "k701013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942977799893780, "text": "我只想知道一開頭的是什麼🤯", "created_at": "2024-10-09T14:56:42", "owner": "pingu.diary_dtea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948196614851019, "text": "只要他有姐姐，就不用擔心了", "created_at": "2024-10-06T15:15:44", "owner": "xiongzi_0.0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18055798843829960, "text": "視頻放一半 jj短一半", "created_at": "2024-10-06T04:01:23", "owner": "__csiu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18462838753021806, "text": "把孩子當男人用……🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-02T14:10:31", "owner": "snowballcat_1005", "likes": 202}, {"id": 18038007119170199, "text": "GYATTTTT", "created_at": "2024-10-02T05:37:21", "owner": "cheung_622", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092963239475525, "text": "你是不是傻屌啊？", "created_at": "2024-10-01T04:25:03", "owner": "maggie._.0524", "likes": 37}, {"id": 17876455440157028, "text": "開頭那個 好像屁屁", "created_at": "2024-09-30T14:20:46", "owner": "ritahuang0404", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17961751703804190, "text": "這跟我請工人有什麽區別？", "created_at": "2024-09-29T12:39:21", "owner": "chonhou_0210", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18116989546398902, "text": "開頭那是什麼鬼？ 孩子被弄成這樣？", "created_at": "2024-09-28T09:11:25", "owner": "phish_chen", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18044416624977069, "text": "喔是喔555555", "created_at": "2024-09-28T00:32:43", "owner": "chenxinan920", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105467887382001, "text": "開頭那是怎麼？怎麼會噴氣", "created_at": "2024-09-23T06:28:21", "owner": "xianruw", "likes": 198}, {"id": 18104356177438980, "text": "不是全部的小孩是同一个性格因此这样的说法是不对的！", "created_at": "2024-09-23T05:17:36", "owner": "jessjessy8", "likes": 81}, {"id": 18315531481085804, "text": "開頭畫面好軟", "created_at": "2024-09-22T14:10:05", "owner": "lzhm0923", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17976127625815074, "text": "傻B女豬", "created_at": "2025-02-22T07:18:35", "owner": "9263eidi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030707996532858, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-18T03:59:29", "owner": "luke88555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857191864264103, "text": "雞掰啦 他媽的 你知不知道跌倒一次就夠他受的了", "created_at": "2024-12-08T15:49:33", "owner": "yute_06.02_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162818893318103, "text": "超級智障 帶著萬般下品唯讀書高 的心態只在他唸書的時候稱讚孩子反而會讓孩子只覺得自己是不是除了念書一無是處 \n什麼年代了多元智慧都沒概念 難怪拍幹片", "created_at": "2024-11-12T18:33:42", "owner": "jr_uwu23416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377668063102629, "text": "騙子 要的多索取的更多 下面有兩個弟弟幹嘛用？", "created_at": "2024-11-12T08:10:29", "owner": "zong.zhihao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028986425175592, "text": "抱歉我娘砲", "created_at": "2024-11-11T16:26:40", "owner": "chenlinussean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369435736128620, "text": "又來毒雞湯", "created_at": "2024-10-11T07:57:58", "owner": "ke_ming_hui", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023746427386346, "text": "所以是女人當男人用，男人當畜生用🗿", "created_at": "2024-10-01T08:46:33", "owner": "chenxinan920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911082060921699, "text": "真按照你的方式做，只能培養出一個自我為中心的熊孩子！！！", "created_at": "2024-09-24T22:33:44", "owner": "suyianming", "likes": 4}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["热点", "富人思维", "穷人思维", "思维格局", "创业", "必看", "财商思维", "商业思维", "赚钱", "个人成长", "强者思维"]},
{"media_id": 3447680781969351407, "shortcode": "C_Yn2eUOWLv", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_Yn2eUOWLv/", "taken_at": "2024-09-01T18:33:35", "caption": "Untitled", "owner_username": "visanstefan", "owner_id": "273602797", "likes": 15945, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0256_C_Yn2eUOWLv\\C_Yn2eUOWLv_20240901_183335.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18274261648216127, "text": "Hay líquido en el interior del dedo del guante de plástico. \nPor lo que veo la ciencia que se aplica en este caso es la termodinámica.\n \nLa bolsa de plástico no se derrite porque el calor de la llama se transfiere al agua en su interior, y el agua absorbe la energía térmica. El agua tiene un calor específico alto, lo que significa que necesita mucha energía para aumentar su temperatura.\n \nLa temperatura del agua aumenta, pero no alcanza el punto de ebullición hasta que la bolsa se haya derretido, ya que el agua absorbe el calor antes de que la bolsa se sobrecaliente evitando que el dedo de la mujer del video se vea afectado de inmediato.", "created_at": "2024-11-20T01:12:42", "owner": "spens.avalos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048984920069189, "text": "This is what people call art", "created_at": "2024-11-03T00:30:11", "owner": "j_lying.boogie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884890648137506, "text": "why?", "created_at": "2024-11-02T19:46:18", "owner": "el_lilyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025014311203713, "text": "?????", "created_at": "2024-10-28T00:02:52", "owner": "nans_renard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060484528751949, "text": "Does this hurt the candle?", "created_at": "2024-10-23T20:19:43", "owner": "garage_paint_consumer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050191732785861, "text": "Don’t do that", "created_at": "2024-10-23T02:12:33", "owner": "pokemon_shitposts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136068202363118, "text": "if that was me… YEOWCH!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-21T14:01:18", "owner": "umbra_noxis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897452614080317, "text": "what the-", "created_at": "2024-10-21T11:41:47", "owner": "authorharunmikaael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048272014805032, "text": "that happened to me once but it wasn't my finger", "created_at": "2024-10-16T23:03:47", "owner": "i.am.the.ratman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023314310589050, "text": "Wow, that’s so deep", "created_at": "2024-10-13T03:12:58", "owner": "dawizardovflorida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313920925095252, "text": "that’s hot", "created_at": "2024-10-13T00:58:31", "owner": "jesuiszemarcuis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132156001364577, "text": "Does that hurt", "created_at": "2024-10-12T02:20:27", "owner": "_cosplaynerd16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104743522441220, "text": "Waht?", "created_at": "2024-10-11T18:46:20", "owner": "ogulcankhrm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032664344057001, "text": "؟", "created_at": "2024-10-09T16:34:14", "owner": "aworldlie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033605165039976, "text": "ok.. so?", "created_at": "2024-10-07T00:58:50", "owner": "laluarrahman__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865777681230263, "text": "Ok", "created_at": "2024-10-05T22:49:36", "owner": "alberto1de1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844548505304529, "text": "YEEEOOOWCH!!!!", "created_at": "2024-09-29T16:57:42", "owner": "kimdokjafan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18457433092012071, "text": "Does this hurt the candle?", "created_at": "2024-09-25T16:14:31", "owner": "luchoo.fp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061148866736159, "text": "My eyes 🤧", "created_at": "2024-09-25T10:42:52", "owner": "being_zarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18270663796219016, "text": "Now so it with the middle finger", "created_at": "2024-09-25T09:19:15", "owner": "davidutul_vulturul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032245376038765, "text": "Me when my pingus", "created_at": "2024-09-18T01:50:47", "owner": "damncarlsucks", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18340481449130339, "text": "White people will do anything except making normal art💀", "created_at": "2024-09-16T15:51:21", "owner": "nikla3_antila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001522037664452, "text": "Grandma what kind of plastic bag is that", "created_at": "2024-09-14T09:10:44", "owner": "sorasoralis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033167684471144, "text": "Bros cooked", "created_at": "2024-09-13T21:04:56", "owner": "slyfyettm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051288385885493, "text": "Am I the only one that waited for the zoom", "created_at": "2024-09-13T09:23:27", "owner": "f.a.lb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18456602332011368, "text": "Why doesn't the close-up zoom work?", "created_at": "2024-09-12T22:48:11", "owner": "s6add", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066498334559309, "text": "Yayyy melting plastic into water then absorbing it through ur skin yayyyyy", "created_at": "2024-09-11T15:27:05", "owner": "brenden_gildon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084365557498099, "text": "wyd wit dat", "created_at": "2024-09-11T15:00:26", "owner": "1egendaryquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001433831654593, "text": "when i was two years old i held my bare left index finger in a fire like that and felt nothing", "created_at": "2024-09-10T02:58:43", "owner": "qjrw226185jkp692", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366125731106679, "text": "Ngl i only clicked on this cause i thought it was a nice juicy shlong", "created_at": "2024-09-10T00:01:00", "owner": "hibbard.nic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845382235288906, "text": "New Fear unlocked", "created_at": "2024-09-09T22:51:36", "owner": "killinggame01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088113931488820, "text": "Does it hurt the candle😂", "created_at": "2024-09-09T17:02:42", "owner": "officialdjempire", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17934362345913944, "text": "I think he started to get burned that's why he removed his fingers😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-09-09T01:29:27", "owner": "thadousmakoss", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18056470591779253, "text": "A vela não tem coragem de queimar o plástico por que ela sabe que dentro dele tem um líquido que apagará ela, então... por que você continua insistindo em queimar o plástico da barreira de água da sua vida?", "created_at": "2024-09-08T23:02:33", "owner": "dankob0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026923199353867, "text": "Ngl this made my blood boil😡", "created_at": "2024-09-08T05:33:56", "owner": "theofficialoledude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149107327332260, "text": "Bro I'm feeling that pain", "created_at": "2024-09-08T05:29:50", "owner": "saadi_khan420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418238638074461, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-07T18:12:05", "owner": "elouan_solo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843308794305533, "text": "محروك اصبعه", "created_at": "2024-09-07T15:55:21", "owner": "ay3l7", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17917581062971632, "text": "Dude did I just see E.T.'s finger??", "created_at": "2024-09-06T21:41:06", "owner": "legendary.matt02", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18009380834629124, "text": "Does this hurt the dog", "created_at": "2024-09-06T14:59:23", "owner": "zack_gls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916443951986474, "text": "Physically speaking... the water inside the glove is able to absorb most of the heat before the plastic, which means the plastic is unable to reach its melting temperature. Correct me if I'm wrong.", "created_at": "2024-09-05T14:32:48", "owner": "kelina_oliveiira", "likes": 273}, {"id": 18037947434500608, "text": "No komot ya hand now. 😂", "created_at": "2024-09-03T10:12:58", "owner": "yadichinma", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18053500243837519, "text": "looks too dangerous", "created_at": "2024-09-02T04:40:48", "owner": "tookimari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847925248262554, "text": "what…?", "created_at": "2024-09-02T00:23:33", "owner": "__________kim_dick__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18000996566490414, "text": "So oddly satisfying and very unsettling at the same time 😍😳", "created_at": "2024-09-02T00:03:31", "owner": "the_foodie_godmother", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18071453374568547, "text": "Me when the tip gets cold", "created_at": "2024-09-01T23:41:28", "owner": "wisper1753", "likes": 74}, {"id": 17923021280951064, "text": "Yeeeeeeoooouiee", "created_at": "2024-09-01T22:08:39", "owner": "wmwwmwwmwmwmwmwwmwwmwmwmwmwwmw", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18413604331077107, "text": "now do this but with a whole hand in a balloon", "created_at": "2024-09-01T20:49:58", "owner": "melissadistante", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18451622359036203, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2024-09-01T20:26:03", "owner": "devilmaycry.97", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17964461576790332, "text": "Did this one hurt at all?", "created_at": "2024-09-01T19:19:41", "owner": "zxltyz", "likes": 1269}, {"id": 18011915903559773, "text": "Leidenfrost effect 🫰", "created_at": "2024-09-01T19:14:24", "owner": "pacomewho", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17985778727572398, "text": "This is like that lady making soup in a plastic bag over an open flame", "created_at": "2024-09-01T19:00:32", "owner": "thezaramoon", "likes": 931}, {"id": 17905136607010819, "text": "So cool", "created_at": "2024-09-01T18:49:32", "owner": "tallestofem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066671920593684, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-09-01T18:44:50", "owner": "elenahorvath", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035946413150854, "text": "fifty degrees", "created_at": "2024-09-01T18:39:26", "owner": "ozgunaltay", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18247824052274618, "text": "انگشتش سوخت دستشو کشید 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T21:27:20", "owner": "abed_khazae.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059636275655756, "text": "Idiot", "created_at": "2024-09-13T17:36:40", "owner": "greeenslipss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003173345644848, "text": "Crazy artist but never stupid 😂😉", "created_at": "2024-09-02T12:29:01", "owner": "richie_cm__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097093519449466, "text": "Why would you burn yourself (?)\nDid it hurt or did the glove protect you? Hope you’re okay!", "created_at": "2024-09-02T03:22:41", "owner": "imisstona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990651561701134, "text": "I wish the plastic had broken", "created_at": "2024-09-01T19:41:49", "owner": "queraltayala", "likes": 344}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
