 meow meow meow meow😢", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:56:56", "owner": "nuckelbuttasshat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053973208922667, "text": "@as_ra.26 @zaynten_", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:51:47", "owner": "n_rafiulashik", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071375950618248, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:45:05", "owner": "el_incognito_98", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046972316022329, "text": "totally agree💯", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:02:27", "owner": "a.m.6.r.o.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290267266231247, "text": "I can verify 2", "created_at": "2024-11-15T05:04:16", "owner": "eternalbichette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988521699600674, "text": "Why dose 3 tell my life story and 2 dose that same thing 😢", "created_at": "2024-11-15T04:44:19", "owner": "xpart755", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037407425260574, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-15T02:56:29", "owner": "joshua_olguinnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087975127514570, "text": "BROOKE AND SAM MENTIONED", "created_at": "2024-11-15T02:35:40", "owner": "_.shanti58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868157152239766, "text": "why he's telling about me", "created_at": "2024-11-15T01:40:55", "owner": "2021.12.17_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054127732919946, "text": "😳", "created_at": "2024-11-14T23:36:23", "owner": "bcs_martinekk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911688757021426, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T21:59:12", "owner": "mr.filip.eats.fentanyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005908997675880, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T21:44:36", "owner": "mark_8_5_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061153753765073, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T21:06:17", "owner": "etty_urucii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934663815944824, "text": "It's true", "created_at": "2024-11-14T21:05:58", "owner": "ahnaffo.011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930915411951370, "text": "So right", "created_at": "2024-11-14T20:54:46", "owner": "danthemanshaffer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877202116195070, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T20:22:15", "owner": "berke_byrktr", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17855872548312551, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T20:22:06", "owner": "berke_byrktr", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18043363570916971, "text": "I am all but not 5", "created_at": "2024-11-14T20:18:12", "owner": "ekko_timetraveler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068247433711494, "text": "There's school that feels like prison and they try to make it seem like its not", "created_at": "2024-11-14T20:07:12", "owner": "jay_hazard1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126192235382867, "text": "Blud just described me", "created_at": "2024-11-14T19:59:20", "owner": "nikola24_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030414581151081, "text": "💯true", "created_at": "2024-11-14T19:59:19", "owner": "kimmim2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471710017042708, "text": "3rd one is me fr", "created_at": "2024-11-14T17:54:30", "owner": "_aniruddhpratapsingh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036995849205752, "text": "Literally just me 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-14T17:44:58", "owner": "nature_freak_10_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18464040823041091, "text": "Not all but few", "created_at": "2024-11-14T17:26:12", "owner": "nanzan_sama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146331979344127, "text": "💯💯🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-14T16:56:41", "owner": "talhakhalidawan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958582806831952, "text": "3rd One is me🙂", "created_at": "2024-11-14T15:26:35", "owner": "_beingnilesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858299350293181, "text": "Bro you described my life", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:36:48", "owner": "biniy732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039076730243313, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:33:46", "owner": "aran_i_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277877011221330, "text": "It’s litterly me", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:17:55", "owner": "liamsun2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027143963419489, "text": "Johan liebert*?", "created_at": "2024-11-14T13:53:53", "owner": "cosmic._yash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162315157319774, "text": "That second fact ain’t even true😂", "created_at": "2024-11-14T12:39:07", "owner": "bengriffin_martin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859039192284046, "te