{"media_id": 3496255974582056181, "shortcode": "DCFMkjwzPT1", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCFMkjwzPT1/", "taken_at": "2024-11-07T19:03:32", "caption": "Say goodbye to the era of heavy, oversized hard drives—meet the Folder external hard disk, your new portable powerhouse.\n-\nDesigned for project-based storage, it keeps every gigabyte organized without the bulk, so you can quickly grab exactly what you need—no searching, no fuss. Ideal for designers juggling multiple client projects, photographers needing fast access to their image libraries, or content creators on the go.\n-\nLightweight, ultra-portable, and charmingly minimalist, it fits in the palm of your hand and seamlessly adapts to your creative workflow.\n-\nWith a speedy USB-C connection, you’re ready to edit, share, and create wherever inspiration strikes.\n-\nSmart, stylish, and effortlessly efficient—this is storage reimagined.\n-\nDesigner: @justdo_hanss\n-\nFollow us at @yankodesign_official for the latest innovation in product design.", "owner_username": "yankodesign_official", "owner_id": "9553560107", "likes": 74263, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0258_DCFMkjwzPT1\\DCFMkjwzPT1_20241107_190332_9.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18150148876426646, "text": "I want to buy it because it's so pretty😍❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:00:18", "owner": "choo2_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034803512695278, "text": "so ... where can I buy one ?", "created_at": "2025-09-10T19:13:49", "owner": "theonlyrocha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115498357459055, "text": "I loved the idea, but 1TB? I think could be better make less memory for have more of this itens and make more manual organization hehe. Like 64gb? 100gb? Also will turn it less expensive", "created_at": "2025-04-07T05:47:04", "owner": "hernandes_41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059882497892037, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-04-02T08:35:34", "owner": "_tech.go", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078633319647768, "text": "Blablabla still an storage unit like others. Still of course its a design not a real thing. Still more useless junk to buy if it gets real.", "created_at": "2025-03-03T16:31:31", "owner": "elguatequero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488806399040126, "text": "Where i can Buy one", "created_at": "2025-02-14T17:41:22", "owner": "dtthhg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942864372956611, "text": "HOw much is ?", "created_at": "2025-02-14T17:41:13", "owner": "dtthhg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077703373563824, "text": "I LOVE this please put in production", "created_at": "2025-02-08T15:16:52", "owner": "hahapikmin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290024551174790, "text": "Like the design", "created_at": "2025-01-27T16:03:40", "owner": "delois.yun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075401668634304, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-22T05:02:15", "owner": "ajasont.m4a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045192818514398, "text": "✨️✨️✨️", "created_at": "2025-01-19T19:49:49", "owner": "ronu1221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891610303154844, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-16T13:21:53", "owner": "ad.illuminazione", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041947022522171, "text": "This not being real makes me sad", "created_at": "2025-01-13T05:40:05", "owner": "sharamnamdarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069223432683154, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-06T12:43:51", "owner": "rakeengoi", "li