single harddrive and create partitions and folders right on the thing! 🙈", "created_at": "2024-12-17T05:49:37", "owner": "repairedbyjulez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861141145243498, "text": "Wow looks so cool!", "created_at": "2024-12-16T19:46:28", "owner": "vitalust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086360662549704, "text": "Shouldve designed it like a floppy disk 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-14T08:47:53", "owner": "papadully", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047180069135246, "text": "How would tat solve anything? It's just a different shape. 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T09:25:03", "owner": "rieder.samuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877202860127386, "text": "🔥🔥👏", "created_at": "2024-12-06T08:10:16", "owner": "gr3d_stampa_idee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338040853197712, "text": "Really creative 🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-05T11:49:34", "owner": "szob.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856300972264303, "text": "If that’s where the sata port is where the hell would the drive go lol", "created_at": "2024-11-28T22:57:33", "owner": "dorikururi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067190038672461, "text": "Went straight to the website - only to find put its a concept…", "created_at": "2024-11-27T17:09:37", "owner": "florianneuninger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038230949196494, "text": "Lack of a way to have these labeled is a huge missed opportunity...", "created_at": "2024-11-27T13:05:27", "owner": "daliebster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044758897914903, "text": "If only affordable NAS systems existed… 🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-27T12:49:10", "owner": "olafjanowicz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335997151194253, "text": "that’s some crazy Produkt Design", "created_at": "2024-11-26T16:38:56", "owner": "jotham_jhn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348124207120192, "text": "Orrrr you could buy a 1tb ssd thumb stick that’s amazing fifth of the size", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:33:39", "owner": "aidenfindley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037244420197717, "text": "Okay but mine already are just kinda uniform bricks, wondering how much the size of this would impact the actual storage capacity", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:47:26", "owner": "camgirlcapitalism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026427431239800, "text": "Love them. I'd love a docking station with them.", "created_at": "2024-11-24T07:17:40", "owner": "leuedds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144592471348391, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-24T06:53:57", "owner": "_roshanpoojari_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856678054313395, "text": "So pretty 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-23T22:08:28", "owner": "shannon.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036498071257859, "text": "this is oversized. a 2232 nvme ssd is like the size of a thumb but flat", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:36:36", "owner": "abcpdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065009365776598, "text": "Ouuh I like it", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:14:39", "owner": "plassonade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053151745786715, "text": "Love this", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:59:32", "owner": "by.ryanmcgrath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936965424938096, "text": "👏🔥👏🔥molto belli)", "created_at": "2024-11-21T19:03:23", "owner": "giordano_brokerage_est", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950238789763527, "text": "file cabinet dock would be sick", "created_at": "2024-11-21T17:57:49", "owner": "jeevan_nac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067883641661765, "text": "nvme ssd + nvme to usb??", "created_at": "2024-11-21T15:52:01", "owner": "nomorecurtainsl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375847276129275, "text": "How to  buy?", "created_at": "2024-11-21T09:43:22", "owner": "seojimin0402", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944453664908348, "text": "Omg I love this", "created_at": "2024-11-20T03:33:56", "owner": "jared__meds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18254788630258414, "text": "pretty neat", "created_at": "2024-11-19T22:22:25", "owner": "moderntechsavyshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359310535190060, "text": "Lucuu", "created_at": "2024-11-18T01:39:51", "owner": "ci______o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002589536687944, "text": "@mehran.tabrizian", "created_at": "2024-11-16T20:22:41", "owner": "mohsen__bakhoda", "likes": 0}, {"id"