, "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021850979319442, "text": "@linustech", "created_at": "2024-11-14T02:55:40", "owner": "wolfpupmaxx30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938332257926628, "text": "It looks good, but if it's just an SSD it better not cost way more than a SanDisk 1TB ($80-90 last I checked)", "created_at": "2024-11-14T00:43:02", "owner": "adrieloliveras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051826093940723, "text": "❤️❤️🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-13T16:56:26", "owner": "_techreza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020683010561993, "text": "Hello,how to order?", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:58:32", "owner": "lehachizh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927042621867218, "text": "Awesome design!!! 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-13T14:48:56", "owner": "aknpehlivan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046530035014191, "text": "@yo.nvs @ch3vr3cho @warrenneves", "created_at": "2024-11-13T10:18:50", "owner": "wandyseven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991363860720591, "text": "Cute", "created_at": "2024-11-13T01:43:15", "owner": "alqdario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038273666268667, "text": "TAKE ALL MY MONEY", "created_at": "2024-11-12T22:34:33", "owner": "l.u.i.s.m.a.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048096728008905, "text": "@fridadgarcia", "created_at": "2024-11-12T21:09:10", "owner": "j.fitteds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848755753305274, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-12T08:42:03", "owner": "oudmijin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332203732194252, "text": "No lo quiero... LO NECESITOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2024-11-11T21:30:23", "owner": "chocolate004_10.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910914631020200, "text": "\"Say goodbye to the era of heavy, oversized hard drives\" there is smaller and lighter than this", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:28:28", "owner": "donatien.k.polliand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906303750964711, "text": "Are these novelty items? Because we want to know the speed", "created_at": "2024-11-11T16:57:11", "owner": "stretch.mp4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141983470316876, "text": "@sandisk > please produce 🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-11T16:24:49", "owner": "join_marc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953485425744558, "text": "Uhhh sexy hexy", "created_at": "2024-11-11T16:23:57", "owner": "join_marc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014078465392470, "text": "New design", "created_at": "2024-11-11T10:54:33", "owner": "ho3einshakiba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334191622199019, "text": "@tiberiu_neagu", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:53:50", "owner": "giordy.franco.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857795728242325, "text": "Close, but the tabs need to be in different positions, so they can be utilized better", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:13:12", "owner": "nicholascueva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151571668336249, "text": "Deme 2 por favor 😮", "created_at": "2024-11-11T03:23:54", "owner": "rodrigoperez_audiovisual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100603930458359, "text": "@hollie.coffin2", "created_at": "2024-11-11T03:12:14", "owner": "_gabe_wood_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141997177359608, "text": "where I get it ?", "created_at": "2024-11-11T00:03:46", "owner": "josepotes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024039578580284, "text": "🔥😍😮", "created_at": "2024-11-10T20:13:35", "owner": "mobin.hekmat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028696166176944, "text": "Is it possible to buy it somewhere ?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T18:51:36", "owner": "daniel_sev44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127783480377680, "text": "Where can I buy one? Or is it a prototype?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T18:44:59", "owner": "anitalanewhall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076061170603282, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:52:43", "owner": "theblackprezident", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051554899941226, "text": "How cuteeeee", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:22:43", "owner": "kathleen.cc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872815411213342, "text": "Yellow one>>", "created_at": "2024-11-10T12:35:32", "owner": "adve_privv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061909333752447, "text": "What's the brand ?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:36:37", "owner": "arthur.fdv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892039810077573, "text": "I love the concept, no SSD option?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:38:29", "owner": "danicirac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892760566098140, "text": "Omg! I love and need this for my small business! I’m so afraid of taking my old Giant 4tb piece with me but need something small and reliable", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:57:15", "owner": "101avina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077896573562982, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-09T21:58:49", "owner": "kybr", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3495945157149274215, "shortcode": "DCEF5keITBn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCEF5keITBn/", "taken_at": "2024-11-07T09:42:06", "caption": "Messing around with Leap Motion + Touchdesigner. \n\nBefore the show with @kruder_dorfmeister at Elbphilharmonie\n\n#visuals #touchdesigner #resolume #raytk", "owner_username": "jaschasuess", "owner_id": "316176847", "likes": 75711, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0259_DCEF5keITBn\\DCEF5keITBn_20241107_094206.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18077619107025421, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:01:07", "owner": "filipvictor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935915290059840, "text": "@freewei", "created_at": "2025-08-01T23:18:40", "owner": "alissainla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930467332024012, "text": "This is just magic", "created_at": "2025-05-02T07:54:47", "owner": "dannickkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063267797299191, "text": "🔥😮", "created_at": "2025-04-26T11:53:42", "owner": "jane_redka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060786916879313, "text": "@pierreakbar @anggottt", "created_at": "2025-04-14T21:02:46", "owner": "blinxzatan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276449248265877, "text": "Name softwares?", "created_at": "2025-03-20T02:12:49", "owner": "blackboy_visuals", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055082039156794, "text": "Svaski digital eyewear", "created_at": "2025-03-14T09:16:22", "owner": "isvaski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120208969432933, "text": "Does this work with the house lights turned down?", "created_at": "2025-03-13T14:33:42", "owner": "6ixscout", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18381169804118981, "text": "Nice. I've still got one of those in a drawer. I'll have to pull it out.", "created_at": "2025-03-05T16:14:06", "owner": "evan_monster", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977980341816565, "text": "Wowww👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-02T09:58:35", "owner": "symbiothika", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077734225724232, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-24T21:04:27", "owner": "flipside.av", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922240642021418, "text": "How did you connect the leap motion to touch designer ? Is there a plugin or software ?", "created_at": "2025-02-11T22:19:57", "owner": "ar.rohanthakker", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17932069892881001, "text": "love them", "created_at": "2025-02-06T10:37:43", "owner": "drxian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090278821540408, "text": "👀", "created_at": "2025-02-05T01:32:51", "owner": "daviddiaosu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083480284595878, "text": "💟", "created_at": "2025-02-04T23:30:19", "owner": "ftheanned", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888707038091663, "text": "Pricing", "created_at": "2025-02-04T15:27:35", "owner": "luxerus.lighting.rugs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18267064354270640, "text": "Great motion sensor amazing", "created_at": "2025-01-30T05:35:09", "owner": "kishan_maiyad_ahir", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844095628398620, "text": "🙌 Kruderrrrrr", "created_at": "2025-01-29T23:47:24", "owner": "tuesdaymatters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071095558754723, "text": "Bro knows how to hijack the event when ever he wants 😂🔥💥", "created_at": "2025-01-29T12:59:53", "owner": "pj.creatives7133", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931607736878111, "text": "Link to GitHub if there is one", "created_at": "2025-01-29T06:40:15", "owner": "themoisessantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048144287168130, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-15T09:57:26", "owner": "espressodisplays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065359900890610, "text": "How?", "created_at": "2025-01-14T01:56:55", "owner": "_javsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078074758622311, "text": "Great 🔥🙌😍", "created_at": "2025-01-09T22:04:35", "owner": "mohamedebrahim.me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050620928486572, "text": "Great idea 🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-08T22:24:25", "owner": "envsnaudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049359026162399, "text": "Is that like a million drum sets in the background? 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-07T13:14:34", "owner": "moisesmattout", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160621603329196, "text": "😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-06T13:09:18", "owner": "virtualstageacademy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284425006245211, "text": "I still have 2 of those, but I no longer can get them to work since the company no longer excist and there’s no support. How do you do it?", "created_at": "2025-01-06T12:36:04", "owner": "melodiemcofficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021224654636365, "text": "What languaje is JavaScript??? I need developer for leap Motion", "created_at": "2025-01-05T19:33:12", "owner": "joacodesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034103081452806, "text": "Soooo dope!", "created_at": "2025-01-03T18:41:15", "owner": "alexprimamusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016643558461946, "text": "🔥🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-01-03T14:51:44", "owner": "djnzoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080872153576560, "text": "Hell yea", "created_at": "2024-12-24T05:44:46", "owner": "joshallen__________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385802455096830, "text": "That is just straight up awesome", "created_at": "2024-12-20T00:54:15", "owner": "anthonyrabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351667534125294, "text": "That’s cool!", "created_at": "2024-12-19T14:54:55", "owner": "iksonmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916582269934823, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:52:48", "owner": "dj.novin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211188262295696, "text": "Sick!", "created_at": "2024-12-18T00:31:13", "owner": "claychollar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055033141802430, "text": "Im tweaking this is beautiful", "created_at": "2024-12-16T17:03:12", "owner": "dylan___cruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097834453442497, "text": "insane", "created_at": "2024-12-16T04:45:37", "owner": "henkity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046898059933383, "text": "ifallinneon 2 Sek.\nIs there still software support for the first Leap Motion? I wanted to use one as an expressive MIDI controller with the current mac OS but it looked like this device became obsolete.", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:05:18", "owner": "ifallinneon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074210341717708, "text": "Yeah wow ! 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:00:51", "owner": "mirror.xr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031523234166701, "text": "@jillispieters", "created_at": "2024-12-14T11:52:31", "owner": "almafilma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891905083129294, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:06:26", "owner": "eterion__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297909517231081, "text": "No way leap ahead in time", "created_at": "2024-12-11T04:19:34", "owner": "spacemorris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306571921202784, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-10T09:46:29", "owner": "belen.marcuzzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001978676701440, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-06T23:10:13", "owner": "barulho.world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017903786361220, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-06T13:57:55", "owner": "nerondeltausa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051217973049279, "text": "The Elbphilharmony is definentily the most beautiful opera house/concert hall in the World!", "created_at": "2024-12-05T16:25:03", "owner": "dervinnyy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17904578409064507, "text": "What is the name of the programs you use?", "created_at": "2024-12-05T08:45:35", "owner": "radwan_skyf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989805450752519, "text": "Serikart harus bisi nih @rifanixmuhammad @rizkiaripani 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T13:17:35", "owner": "yusdapermana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470254129032290, "text": "Love k n d :)", "created_at": "2024-11-29T23:40:59", "owner": "trippydipart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057156550906894, "text": "Chama @joaomateusperez @helbertqueiroz", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:14:24", "owner": "wesleyhenriques.oficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264641101247269, "text": "That thing is straight from iRobot. Destroy it immediately", "created_at": "2024-11-29T11:54:22", "owner": "jas_1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120639157404524, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-28T04:43:38", "owner": "kennyweken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876384850128137, "text": "How does it perform in the dark? Is a small light required or is the connectivity based more off of energy? Like a theremin", "created_a