{"media_id": 3424983847124248688, "shortcode": "C-H_KmhSqhw", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-H_KmhSqhw/", "taken_at": "2024-08-01T11:19:23", "caption": "你放在IG FB的照片影片都會被Meta用來訓練AI，你同意嗎？ #藝術 #artist #藝術家 #right #ai", "owner_username": "whatuptaiwan", "owner_id": "47889741206", "likes": 61673, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0264_C-H_KmhSqhw\\C-H_KmhSqhw_20240801_111923.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18069061810827884, "text": "@pissayang", "created_at": "2025-01-28T08:28:19", "owner": "tomsirdiary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044279987253827, "text": "@hsin_sk8", "created_at": "2025-01-28T06:04:03", "owner": "wz991721", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104271574489104, "text": "我要把希特勒做成筆刷來畫圖", "created_at": "2025-01-27T05:56:47", "owner": "lia_lalala_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032570378621930, "text": "這對社會發展一定會起到巨大的作用，一般人用30年學習練習的成果將會被濃縮並迅速地傳播，其他人也可以更快去學習和使用，本來需要50年做的事可能用1年時間就能做出來，這是對人類短暫的生命裡能接觸到更多東西的辦法，我是支持的，我明白反對的人覺得不公平或者恐懼自己被取代，但我覺得AI的發展趨勢是不可避免的，我們可以善用AI工作並把創作建立在原有的東西之上。", "created_at": "2025-01-26T08:01:41", "owner": "wws_sammi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044843501214278, "text": "我雖然不是繪師，但這是真的 🐶", "created_at": "2025-01-25T13:17:03", "owner": "minyinpop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858037273353790, "text": "幸好我沒創意", "created_at": "2025-01-25T07:01:35", "owner": "hani_0629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073553923733320, "text": "一天到晚盜帳號跟詐騙廣告，現在還要偷藝術家的作品害～～～", "created_at": "2025-01-24T10:24:52", "owner": "wade_bridal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985852818786306, "text": "就算关闭了也没用的😂那只是一种安慰", "created_at": "2025-01-24T04:02:35", "owner": "jeffsz33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852878413329482, "text": "第二個已經消失了", "created_at": "2025-01-24T03:02:01", "owner": "yiru.chen.0517", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18036734501595802, "text": "@guangminruan", "created_at": "2025-01-22T16:13:34", "owner": "nisa_hsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116297641442543, "text": "如果畫作作品是實體，那為什麼要擔心AI學習？乾脆放棄虛擬世界，回到現實來，不是更直接嗎？ 我想問題重心不是把我的資料拿去訓練AI，而是未經我的同意就使用我的資料作研究和商業用途，而這操作還是先自動默許允許，要取消就得進行多個繁複步驟，這有違道德吧。\n\n還有AI是沒有錯的, AI也不是萬惡。有問題的是掌握AI技術的大財團和他們如何應用這技術吧。", "created_at": "2025-01-22T05:00:28", "owner": "laicwing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151694995348717, "text": "还好我无才不怕被偷", "created_at": "2025-01-22T02:23:04", "owner": "lvximeng6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264982333248994, "text": "沒差！以前很擔心自己的設計會被抄襲！老師說：你都已經想當設計師了還怕人抄襲⋯⋯😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-21T04:54:50", "owner": "boyce880541", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18485791978065143, "text": "這很創新，祖克柏讚", "created_at": "2025-01-21T01:27:48", "owner": "bs10081.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035205728163285, "text": "藝術家分兩種 \n真的有料的 & 只會一些皮毛整天說人家偷你點子和風格😂", "created_at": "2025-01-21T00:18:03", "owner": "teriyakiouo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040731941360171, "text": "我要AI幫我做苦力活，不是要AI幫我動腦子的！\n給我去洗碗刷地！", "created_at": "2025-01-20T11:03:09", "owner": "bkct0812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058396711768495, "text": "雖然我覺得填了也沒用就是了 🫨", "created_at": "2025-01-20T11:02:08", "owner": "jinbentai_1900", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973751376681887, "text": "如果是中國公司做的話，評論區就不會這麼和平了💩", "created_at": "2025-01-20T09:08:55", "owner": "tkl_1012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061836460927717, "text": "我們的x對策不用改，依舊是丟一堆AI生成的祖克柏色圖給meta ai，讓他們自己頭疼去吧", "created_at": "2025-01-20T04:17:52", "owner": "sam_58669", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935422314976276, "text": "怎樣是FB 和 IG 也要學對岸那一套抄襲的爛招是嗎 ？", "created_at": "2025-01-20T03:11:00", "owner": "ukopnauy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060289330904003, "text": "😱😱😱😱", "created_at": "2025-01-20T01:41:21", "owner": "qblind202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022540796345249, "text": "2020 年已经在试用中了。", "created_at": "2025-01-19T17:49:49", "owner": "frozeemod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022674065342856, "text": "沒人知道到底真不喂Ai還是？", "created_at": "2025-01-19T15:39:10", "owner": "simplisonfy_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046116695001536, "text": "不行⋯⋯只有一個選項", "created_at": "2025-01-19T14:28:09", "owner": "gaygaykoe._.hehe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106151935461309, "text": "我要AI去看1000萬種標準購物洗碗清潔讓自己的失誤在0.00000001%之內然後用機器人幫我洗碗 讓我有更好的環境創作藝術 而不是讓AI把所有人的東西融在一起叫做藝術", "created_at": "2025-01-18T17:45:05", "owner": "lin99032500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063101653890488, "text": "什麼時候可以有亞洲AI諧音梗", "created_at": "2025-01-18T17:19:34", "owner": "hebbeyeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067589443793552, "text": "就說meta不是什麼好東西", "created_at": "2025-01-18T08:28:50", "owner": "danweiwang1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045052115467728, "text": "文章也會嗎？😢", "created_at": "2025-01-18T01:36:06", "owner": "nia._.0617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881305450217706, "text": "那就讓meta ai 加入辱共、辱華大家庭", "created_at": "2025-01-17T21:26:11", "owner": "moszk96237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971851371818254, "text": "@u_mountain0203", "created_at": "2025-01-17T18:05:14", "owner": "shiela_owo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857215204352576, "text": "Ai也不要系列", "created_at": "2025-01-17T15:44:14", "owner": "im_nenkun_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18334430962152144, "text": "第一次看到不同意有這麼多層😂", "created_at": "2025-01-17T14:37:59", "owner": "kaihuang_skywalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989930340616402, "text": "都填完回饋單了他給我出現錯誤Meta你*不要給我搞", "created_at": "2025-01-17T13:32:02", "owner": "claire_feng.lu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112663210443760, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-01-17T09:43:53", "owner": "butterquakeioo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043925891245043, "text": "非常感謝有人分享這個", "created_at": "2025-01-17T08:46:58", "owner": "waugyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149072632355528, "text": "你發一些奇怪的東西是不是就破解了", "created_at": "2025-01-16T22:39:36", "owner": "ham.burger.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287542477244285, "text": "@ting.kunghieng.7", "created_at": "2025-01-16T13:05:26", "owner": "ssling_40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032868602213871, "text": "看來世界會突然多很多C特勒出來然後想meta總部進軍😂", "created_at": "2025-01-16T11:55:16", "owner": "rafothevaquero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047773619325527, "text": "就別用meta了", "created_at": "2025-01-16T09:56:12", "owner": "yoxinden64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297854671237528, "text": "沒差欸 一種自己的精神被延續下去的感覺", "created_at": "2025-01-15T18:57:31", "owner": "eva.lin_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053411666500813, "text": "畫襲警瓶，京正恩，吸特樂", "created_at": "2025-01-15T14:50:30", "owner": "carina623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054995758991040, "text": "I'm the sole owner of my artworks and don't allow Meta to use them for Al training.", "created_at": "2025-01-15T11:46:15", "owner": "kevin.dramon.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103153063481334, "text": "這流程設計就是想大家感到十分困難", "created_at": "2025-01-15T07:36:19", "owner": "joe_hung_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934720863968428, "text": "how about tiktok or xiao hong shu？", "created_at": "2025-01-15T07:06:01", "owner": "monsieurfrancois_629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292460920212925, "text": "所以不要放在社群", "created_at": "2025-01-14T13:21:35", "owner": "daode977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069236335685337, "text": "我準備好用糟糕的畫作把AI弄壞了", "created_at": "2025-01-14T08:17:19", "owner": "hinige920214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997449840584532, "text": "太麻煩了", "created_at": "2025-01-13T13:06:33", "owner": "bubble_tea_hsu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18300157264230956, "text": "怎么还要写姓名和国家😮不说一直诟病中国软件实名吗，不同意和国家地区有什么关系呢", "created_at": "2025-01-12T17:40:47", "owner": "kka462", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028269299301417, "text": "一个不能截屏和download\n的社交软件需要应运而生了😂", "created_at": "2025-01-12T16:18:50", "owner": "allewn19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873150691256806, "text": "藏那麼裡面，免費的最貴", "created_at": "2025-01-12T11:26:32", "owner": "aleychen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074320900714474, "text": "不意外，所以我不在數位世界創作。駭客太多了！", "created_at": "2025-01-12T04:58:03", "owner": "femask9146375", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475053733056399, "text": "只要畫的夠爛\nAI就不敢抄我😢", "created_at": "2025-01-11T14:49:42", "owner": "annchen4333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052735241021207, "text": "大家可以主動的訓練ai的性癖了", "created_at": "2025-01-11T10:28:21", "owner": "b1ue1ce594", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044753357332853, "text": "AI帝國主義", "created_at": "2025-01-10T21:27:00", "owner": "whyseewhy59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042682370248889, "text": "如果被別的帳號偷貼文的話，A I還是會學走", "created_at": "2025-01-10T13:44:26", "owner": "deng_dualang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18352700365127080, "text": "遭殃什麼 訓練ai就訓練吧", "created_at": "2025-01-10T05:53:51", "owner": "ryan_c.y.so", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846199804371169, "text": "那我打算搞一堆色圖還有野獸先輩的圖片讓AI知道人類的惡意", "created_at": "2025-01-09T20:47:19", "owner": "sheng._.0716", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095212771454596, "text": "更新之後進階了⋯⋯你要提交AI使用了你作品的證據才可以要求不投餵AI", "created_at": "2025-01-09T13:00:10", "owner": "tung_moyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050488415321540, "text": "你放youtube 會被google拿去訓練 ai , 放x 也會被拿去訓練ai , 放抖音跟美圖秀秀 也會被拿去ai 訓練", "created_at": "2025-01-09T00:00:57", "owner": "toto.terence.7788", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18029534915544204, "text": "@jiraimaru_0510_", "created_at": "2025-01-08T12:33:29", "owner": "llliuuu__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031802723207411, "text": "I have a concern about my personal information from third parties that’s related to a response I received from an AI at Meta model, feature or experience👈🏻他把選項改成這個了", "created_at": "2025-01-08T09:33:39", "owner": "a.hm.s_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853980397311643, "text": "沒什麼用吧？", "created_at": "2025-01-07T08:58:06", "owner": "r_jeffery91m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871630438181645, "text": "要Ai還需要人類幹嘛？😢", "created_at": "2025-01-06T23:57:21", "owner": "rya._.n112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009823514680531, "text": "通常都不太會過\n歡迎來到雲端封建時代", "created_at": "2025-01-06T04:51:50", "owner": "tofuswang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056230228947864, "text": "我用過，填那麼多結果傳email說沒辦法，我破防了，還是跑去Cara或是tumbler 比較好這兩個平台都是反ai的！", "created_at": "2025-01-05T23:53:05", "owner": "cameron._.panfry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067761865771219, "text": "看來只能主動在作品混入大量雜訊跟雜質去把AI教壞了...", "created_at": "2025-01-05T13:38:50", "owner": "yuxi2528", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862389544317239, "text": "如果下面放台灣國旗❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-05T10:19:19", "owner": "ueuedes_mws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891559249149430, "text": "剛剛嘗試了這個方法，但是填完驗證碼之後就直接給我亂碼，不允許我操作了", "created_at": "2025-01-05T08:55:45", "owner": "zitong3098", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113990533434206, "text": "我登入臉書甚至不用打對帳號密碼😂", "created_at": "2025-01-04T16:18:55", "owner": "xing_yu_sony_no.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049873667281279, "text": "這是真的假的😲", "created_at": "2025-01-04T07:27:50", "owner": "sakura_i_es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053372021077318, "text": "反正我畫的又不怎麼樣(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2025-01-04T04:32:14", "owner": "cabbage_art2661", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017002904445576, "text": "做那麼多動作 只為了求他們不要偷走你的創作 不如不要使用並下架你的創作", "created_at": "2025-01-04T03:40:24", "owner": "leone_yj0127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853657717305682, "text": "@howey_chou 你的南涼作品要被偷走了…", "created_at": "2025-01-03T08:49:29", "owner": "meowko._.02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067579240783208, "text": "行啊 駁回是吧 那大家來餵一堆亂七八糟的東西吧", "created_at": "2025-01-02T00:35:51", "owner": "michelle_cat0114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858353506340019, "text": "這是點同意吧😂", "created_at": "2025-01-01T23:10:51", "owner": "uni47102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095869258453620, "text": "都畫六根手指就好了>:)", "created_at": "2025-01-01T15:08:18", "owner": "only._.940", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18309914191204625, "text": "@mufan.art", "created_at": "2025-01-01T14:52:37", "owner": "_zeki.o0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990626178774062, "text": "那就不要用網路了🤣", "created_at": "2025-01-01T09:14:35", "owner": "jycool1030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946398861926267, "text": "居然要這麼大費周章才能不同意", "created_at": "2025-01-01T05:45:00", "owner": "vickyywu__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035451428524649, "text": "不要再過度依賴Ai了....", "created_at": "2024-12-31T14:46:58", "owner": "dato._.louis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071433376660631, "text": "幹😢", "created_at": "2024-12-31T14:05:28", "owner": "yueming157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051574967102004, "text": "以後畫都拍一半了", "created_at": "2024-12-31T13:52:40", "owner": "alcoholff6th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118369270418065, "text": "看來我的恐龍也需要", "created_at": "2024-12-31T10:08:00", "owner": "hongji_708", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096604933499563, "text": "我們要發更多迷因了各位", "created_at": "2024-12-31T07:31:52", "owner": "hi_iam_chu_yi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932671173976450, "text": "太恐怖了", "created_at": "2024-12-31T07:14:05", "owner": "___im_good", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954767010896883, "text": "大企業都是這樣 反正大多數人都不會關心他們的政策更動 大家也都是同意同意打勾 偷渡一些有損用戶利益的政策超容易 還可以藏得跟這個一樣深", "created_at": "2024-12-31T02:21:15", "owner": "tangsaone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062151730807362, "text": "現在好像不可以取消了是什麼？？？😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-12-30T17:40:44", "owner": "aiskurimu.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994410990589899, "text": "麻煩 一個努力得來的成果就這樣被摸走", "created_at": "2024-12-30T14:48:37", "owner": "mugua._.user0115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018642821645202, "text": "好荒謬...", "created_at": "2024-12-30T13:03:11", "owner": "liang.yanchien", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056493238779026, "text": "好險我只是正常用戶\n那就沒差了😂\n不過還是幫QQ😢", "created_at": "2024-12-29T18:34:26", "owner": "bbai__cheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007246409690091, "text": "好可怕喔", "created_at": "2024-12-29T17:20:41", "owner": "ddoumingmei664", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022918100333865, "text": "我只有這個選項而已 「I have a concern about my personal information from third parties that’s related to a response I received from an AI at meta model, feature or experience.」", "created_at": "2024-12-29T16:07:59", "owner": "hsin.ching_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031875980589999, "text": "誰去把咒術的結局改畫一下", "created_at": "2024-12-29T12:18:03", "owner": "ash.lyn1225", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106477768459208, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-12-29T03:09:16", "owner": "bob777zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163404589323980, "text": "科技利益化往往都是投资自己口袋开始，裁物自由", "created_at": "2024-12-28T18:18:30", "owner": "eso_0706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125882500394708, "text": "补药阿就算我画的很丑 @0x0._04_.20", "created_at": "2024-12-28T11:21:28", "owner": "xx._.sky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911174869061213, "text": "他好沒禮貌\n一直鬼打牆 叫別人要成功拿到驗證碼之後才會成功提交 \n但是驗證碼傳出去 又會要你重新填表單\n然後無限循環", "created_at": "2024-12-28T10:16:34", "owner": "yryr2__4", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18474349750041931, "text": "有勞各位藝術家了", "created_at": "2024-12-28T08:56:24", "owner": "tonythechili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053118038051783, "text": "還好吧 台灣一大票所謂創作者 不是都抄襲國外嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-28T04:09:53", "owner": "raywhatim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092881861460039, "text": "拍照上傳的非digital圖畫也會被拿走嗎？！", "created_at": "2024-12-27T22:25:19", "owner": "xc__.0324", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["藝術", "artist", "藝術家", "right", "ai"]},
{"media_id": 3496836574175007153, "shortcode": "DCHQlZRS5Gx", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCHQlZRS5Gx/", "taken_at": "2024-11-08T14:19:39", "caption": "We all have to deal with our pain. \nBut we’re never alone in this and we can get through it.\n\nAnd while it may be easy to wallow in the tragedies that shape our lives, and while it’s natural to focus on those unspeakable moments that bring us to our knees, we must remind ourselves that if we get up, if we take the story a little bit farther…\nIf we go far enough, there’s love. -Life itself\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n#reels #quote #insecurities #explorepage #aesthetic #reelsinstagram #foryoupage #storytelling #lifelessons #lifestyle #healing #contentcreator #selfcare #selflove #selfreminder", "owner_username": "kojessi_", "owner_id": "6213125781", "likes": 146, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0265_DCHQlZRS5Gx\\DCHQlZRS5Gx_20241108_141939.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18090956158704822", "text": "👑", "created_at": "2025-09-02T06:11:04", "owner": "0.03330.0333", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18064372783684154", "text": "Niceeee🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-08T19:32:00", "owner": "tan.trieutobi", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18267382024247981", "text": "slay💗", "created_at": "2024-11-08T18:17:34", "owner": "jade___ko", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18023420960264931", "text": "🤍🤍🤍", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:29:40", "owner": "nnookio", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17946786125895467", "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-08T15:32:00", "owner": "luxeskincareesthetics", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17907574725047113", "text": "🩷", "created_at": "2024-11-08T14:46:51", "owner": "st.1007_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18043428361902645", "text": "✔️✔️✔️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-08T14:23:18", "owner": "longlong020_", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["reels", "quote", "insecurities", "explorepage", "aesthetic", "reelsinstagram", "foryoupage", "storytelling", "lifelessons", "lifestyle", "healing", "contentcreator", "selfcare", "selflove", "selfreminder"]},
{"media_id": 3469482924729587587, "shortcode": "DAmFFaCyleD", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAmFFaCyleD/", "taken_at": "2024-10-01T20:30:00", "caption": "Olivia", "owner_username": "jawndarko", "owner_id": "51677311611", "likes": 287558, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0266_DAmFFaCyleD\\DAmFFaCyleD_20241001_203000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18300425104207193, "text": "@happydad", "created_at": "2024-11-19T06:01:35", "owner": "sammy", "likes": 936}, {"id": 17874793617174239, "text": "Can’t find the song.. SONG PLEASE?", "created_at": "2024-10-03T07:51:20", "owner": "ollane.the", "likes": 6739}, {"id": 18078664231910355, "text": "Uaaaauuuu👏", "created_at": "2025-07-28T06:17:05", "owner": "aguiar_fernanda_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000451442787246, "text": "Representing Engkish girls 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿 😍", "created_at": "2025-06-10T00:40:38", "owner": "scottreubendeakin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890643034254065, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-05-20T23:53:30", "owner": "matteomssrt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049033331197328, "text": "You give crazy human trafficker vibes", "created_at": "2025-03-30T18:19:13", "owner": "holditdontbreak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853228477419402, "text": "Do a backflip", "created_at": "2025-03-30T14:47:56", "owner": "st4rb0i8011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049515281206290, "text": "She is stunning", "created_at": "2025-03-30T12:07:03", "owner": "savannah_lurent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171194440325967, "text": "She is so beautiful", "created_at": "2025-03-30T06:45:21", "owner": "tyylur.young", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925029441942352, "text": "Her@?", "created_at": "2025-03-28T19:04:18", "owner": "pa.yam9573", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002800319769113, "text": "Sometimes less is more. Great video", "created_at": "2025-03-28T17:39:29", "owner": "aldo.dimeola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989865021639168, "text": "😦", "created_at": "2025-03-28T11:42:36", "owner": "nocivo_hq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976156125750484, "text": "Daaaygo", "created_at": "2025-03-27T23:50:25", "owner": "louie.dvuitton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052058894188248, "text": "The can is not a good look nah ruined the whole vibe\n🙋🏻‍♀️ “A freaking can?” In my London voice", "created_at": "2025-03-27T12:00:05", "owner": "mezz_zed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904627864137048, "text": "Not even King Arthur himself could pull me out of her", "created_at": "2025-03-27T05:11:41", "owner": "___chriscruz___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025142345423898, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-26T13:26:14", "owner": "x.iabed_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072315928834358, "text": "@shobhitnirwan_motivation", "created_at": "2025-03-26T06:08:28", "owner": "arish.am.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962520993867545, "text": "Game is changed since 2018 maan.", "created_at": "2025-03-25T21:44:04", "owner": "skvodo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039605870447379, "text": "What’s Olivia from London’s @??", "created_at": "2025-03-25T14:16:22", "owner": "studlystud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038100299229948, "text": "#NeedThat", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:42:45", "owner": "the_loofa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884155471146740, "text": "If she supports Arsenal, she peng. If she Tottenhan.", "created_at": "2025-03-24T03:59:46", "owner": "101metroflip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094850809550119, "text": "she is a 10/10 outside and a solid 2 inside", "created_at": "2025-03-23T23:13:18", "owner": "44schoko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059014222870165, "text": "10/10", "created_at": "2025-03-23T17:52:58", "owner": "lil._.mmlxw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095088427534718, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-03-23T16:34:32", "owner": "lolamarinete", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082011931725541, "text": "Location", "created_at": "2025-03-22T16:51:24", "owner": "saurav.s5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846952324436497, "text": "She fine by looks but cant give her 10 yet", "created_at": "2025-03-22T01:23:43", "owner": "_jmilli21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904782817027750, "text": "Tf is this😂", "created_at":