{"media_id": 3497445527119721962, "shortcode": "DCJbC05P_Xq", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCJbC05P_Xq/", "taken_at": "2024-11-09T10:30:14", "caption": "是咁的\n我之前就係幫 HKTVmall 同淘寶打工\n咁我 Plan Q4 Campaign 嘅原則係：「屌你老味買爆地鐵」\n\n冇錯 就係屌你老味買爆地鐵\n我先唔理個 Package 幾貴\n我每次 Q4 Campaign 就係幾十M扔落去\nNetwork Buy 買到變 Consec\nConsec 買到變 Domination\nDomination 買到變 油尖旺 Full Dominaion\n其實同買半個香港冇分別\n\n我仲好記得\nCampaign 出街前一個月\n同行嘅朋友走嚟問我\n地鐵 Q4 嘅 Trackside 12Sheet 冇晒貨\n問我知唔知咩事\n\n屌你老味我撚知咩\n\n🎥🎥🎥🎥🎥🎥\nFollow @HongKongAd 廣告師，一齊睇更多香港廣告/創作👀\n.\n.\n#HongKongAd #廣告 #廣告師 #廣告宣傳 #香港廣告 #品牌廣告 #淘寶 #雙十一 #地鐵廣告 #乜都包有", "owner_username": "hongkongad", "owner_id": "46846400825", "likes": 7074, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0268_DCJbC05P_Xq\\DCJbC05P_Xq_20241109_103014.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18066592423775179, "text": "係咪就係果個係threads認屎認屁 點知俾人笑到面都黃連條feed都要del咗去個條傻仔？", "created_at": "2025-01-03T08:10:56", "owner": "dennishung", "likes": 103}, {"id": 18024013481614288, "text": "當年你暑期工剷過薯條？", "created_at": "2024-11-09T10:41:03", "owner": "bosom.nomic", "likes": 579}, {"id": 17981026409824901, "text": "平時Q4就催你落Ads😌呢兩年通知你sold out! 益哂Bravo lor", "created_at": "2025-02-01T09:07:58", "owner": "wong0_0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960940275854572, "text": "其實你係幫地鐵打工", "created_at": "2025-01-30T15:49:40", "owner": "cw_kam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055047830000695, "text": "想知你今年幫邊間公司打工😂", "created_at": "2025-01-25T04:12:52", "owner": "_ken52019", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071811271612462, "text": "廢話，地鐵廣告越大越係scam, JPEX就係一例", "created_at": "2025-01-22T07:45:41", "owner": "peterwang_9999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18367101856138141, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-15T23:56:43", "owner": "xegx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057418987797329, "text": "以前hktv mall岩岩開嗰陣既全港鐵full domination 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-12T11:01:53", "owner": "huang_toby.77", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18263378611266340, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-27T04:27:28", "owner": "lammies_aj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18288450511242251, "text": "@_lisallisa", "created_at": "2024-12-27T03:02:36", "owner": "somei_ivy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18211229503292207, "text": "好似搭緊深圳地鐵咁", "created_at": "2024-12-23T03:45:01", "owner": "reginexdxd", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17857570335336579, "text": "原來係你嘅傑作 仲唔俾我搵到你😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T20:10:49", "owner": "hkdreammaker", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041874512469515, "text": "你就好喇咁多budget", "created_at": "2024-12-20T11:18:46", "owner": "korhill_keith", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028322588207426, "text": "原來就係你，Code 你有冇 ？😅😅😅", "created_at": "2024-12-04T08:00:27", "owner": "cy_photog", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18318204760095025, "text": "原來就係你剷爆左個中薯條變大薯條🍟", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:55:18", "owner": "onfirebelly", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18015875735636229, "text": "are you the guy who presented at the HKMA award sharing? Lmao", "created_at": "2024-11-10T10:35:03", "owner": "c_rystalised_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118240915412462, "text": "有筆直係唔同啲😉", "created_at": "2024-11-10T06:17:29", "owner": "raphael.ckl_", "likes": 45}, {"id": 17898569744998451, "text": "搞到而家日日去到金鐘,我以為已經到咗中環", "created_at": "2024-11-10T04:29:15", "owner": "anson10272003", "likes": 119}, {"id": 17981148629759285, "text": "無限budget 真係好爽", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:39:02", "owner": "crazydw666", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18049640089822154, "text": "本來買咗consec突然被踢走的客戶🙋🏻‍♀️⋯⋯🙄🙄🙄", "created_at": "2024-11-10T01:16:25", "owner": "bits.of__", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18026346167526501, "text": "但係今年淘寶 D slogan 唔似係香港人度，想扮廣東話，但又唔順口", "created_at": "2024-11-09T14:53:21", "owner": "carlo.engineer", "likes": 125}, {"id": 18246069445262955, "text": "我估出年會係HSBC😂😂😂\n廣告界印度神童仲唔係我！！！！！！！！！", "created_at": "2024-11-09T14:09:06", "owner": "waiyanfung", "likes": 75}, {"id": 18038579255233493, "text": "比多啲嚟🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-09T13:27:20", "owner": "kkkkkfever", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17854585065302902, "text": "真係淘左個站返黎\nPackage 又買晒 又做埋🔥Domination", "created_at": "2024-11-09T13:23:07", "owner": "mafei828", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067127182731548, "text": "👏👏就係要呢D😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T12:55:56", "owner": "s.shukkwan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18255270730264824, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T12:52:41", "owner": "gizgizmia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064142290666793, "text": "原來就係你哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T11:42:35", "owner": "hester9795", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039329549231083, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T11:11:28", "owner": "katieebelly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908963605024739, "text": "睇嚟你真係剷過薯條", "created_at": "2024-11-09T11:09:16", "owner": "miracle_maker_hk", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18463274578011950, "text": "中意站名個slogan有食字😂仲要個個站都唔同，有heart", "created_at": "2024-11-09T11:03:46", "owner": "vickiparisko", "likes": 202}, {"id": 17879699277174855, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T11:01:38", "owner": "ceciliayws", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993813942561215, "text": "原來係你", "created_at": "2024-11-09T10:51:21", "owner": "__steph.c__", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hongkongad", "廣告", "廣告師", "廣告宣傳", "香港廣告", "品牌廣告", "淘寶", "雙十一", "地鐵廣告", "乜都包有"]},
