 "2024-11-16T02:21:05", "owner": "yip_yuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892023979037014, "text": "所以王祖藍妒忌佢", "created_at": "2024-11-16T00:29:41", "owner": "reinhold_nie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051368602961075, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-15T02:53:08", "owner": "cherekate_vedere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866569090180343, "text": "Omg I know him", "created_at": "2024-11-14T17:56:36", "owner": "ollie.mzzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914283493009154, "text": "very funny 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-14T05:47:10", "owner": "vanessabopo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381981187097419, "text": "升方東", "created_at": "2024-11-14T04:33:02", "owner": "youshouldpm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075346537589029, "text": "@tttina_829 🌚Tina水 hehe", "created_at": "2024-11-14T04:06:27", "owner": "hailey.1625", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885223813141093, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-14T02:56:47", "owner": "cindypoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18253333636259792, "text": "我睇左一陣先發現係C君😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T22:04:15", "owner": "j7yfufclbibgqtqnxtm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035047121198601, "text": "聽君一席話,如聽一席話", "created_at": "2024-11-13T12:54:31", "owner": "alvin_siu_1015", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952835106748114, "text": "@ting_.422 Tina", "created_at": "2024-11-13T09:26:04", "owner": "nc_aw3_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915694323916023, "text": "好撚正😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T02:06:54", "owner": "manmanhei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897432178091232, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:27:52", "owner": "chiutszshunn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887818501107554, "text": "好似方東昇", "created_at": "2024-11-12T08:34:55", "owner": "zznatha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076768012577557, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T20:39:52", "owner": "oliv_iaw2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026602373390663, "text": "係咪C君黎😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:29:54", "owner": "tman1080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844929550350742, "text": "@harry_101612", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:45:05", "owner": "keon592976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956531112730521, "text": "@kuokhinnn @antonio.asc1 @kongsiohong", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:34:18", "owner": "mankit.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990152925590378, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:30:32", "owner": "joetam2046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013939658408268, "text": "唔聽聲 以為方東升", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:02:30", "owner": "kopkko.ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011701487449194, "text": "难得你甘随便。。。", "created_at": "2024-11-11T07:59:01", "owner": "chin.weijen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939188367919694, "text": "@seveny711", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:23:27", "owner": "lynnewongbbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979322676786298, "text": "好有才華🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:24:32", "owner": "todno_haha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842787457361028, "text": "😹😹", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:17:30", "owner": "leo_n_elaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030170672458376, "text": "一夜夫妻百二蚊，五千蚊可以做到47.66晚夫妻啦😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:37:47", "owner": "ininxiu101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874543681207399, "text": "洗錢洗得乾乾淨淨，黑錢黎？", "created_at": "2024-11-11T03:30:55", "owner": "fungfungwong1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079244767560553, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T23:53:25", "owner": "snowcheung4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935035845944146, "text": "只有c君有这样的押韵", "created_at": "2024-11-10T22:12:19", "owner": "yang_yang92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067114348656740, "text": "@hermanvong bro is that you?", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:56:44", "owner": "x.y.c_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946142325775756, "text": "難得你咁隨便🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:53:34", "owner": "cedric.leiden", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17910852324031909, "text": "頂仲以為係配音 點知睇到最後一秒先知吾係方東昇又吾係配音🤡", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:30:15", "owner": "v1xkxjaiii", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18066072397663381, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-10T15:37:46", "owner": "chongdee0813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18458411446065054, "text": "點解我嗰陣係隔離會忍到笑？😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T14:35:29", "owner": "yanyaascyy", "likes": 198}, {"id": 18046637321104210, "text": "方東昇腔", "created_at": "2024-11-10T13:36:52", "owner": "cccc0719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928908492851504, "text": "方東C😹", "created_at": "2024-11-10T12:11:06", "owner": "benmingqiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067607047647453, "text": "@thomaspig0519", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:56:17", "owner": "_kwann._.0728_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906005686055842, "text": "乜野節目, 好想睇C君", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:39:46", "owner": "kenneth.so.737", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100730557461618, "text": "以為係一個小朋友扮方東昇🤭\n睇落又好似係韓紅扮🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:23:04", "owner": "waiwai_war", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045481499491904, "text": "咩節目", "created_at": "2024-11-10T10:21:14", "owner": "olharac_carahlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043172168131339, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:39:20", "owner": "star_freedom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026024954205966, "text": "點解‘’上個禮拜‘’的幸運兒要搵‘’半年‘’？", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:24:00", "owner": "_kaka.229_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18026164397451207, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:07:45", "owner": "francis_missmo", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18470924512010161, "text": "Canto version of dad jokes😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T07:04:08", "owner": "tinadonlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102963664454874, "text": "上個星期嘅幸運兒😂半年前已經搵緊", "created_at": "2024-11-10T05:42:32", "owner": "annieyau22", "likes": 351}, {"id": 18471366979059908, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T04:29:47", "owner": "lattethefluffyqueen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905846106964424, "text": "@cathyleung524", "created_at": "2024-11-10T04:12:00", "owner": "wyleungad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047525501049659, "text": "C君定係方東昇？😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T03:46:10", "owner": "haibarapiano0818", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18153821887326834, "text": "好急的 tina 我地会叫她 argentina", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:50:19", "owner": "waihoong0829", "likes": 187}, {"id": 18044226407482602, "text": "救命 我叫tina\n一開reels就有人叫我🆘🆘", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:42:44", "owner": "gostudyrina", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17958905573832224, "text": "一句都笑唔出", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:29:27", "owner": "pangabcdef", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18171460330318058, "text": "方東降😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T01:36:59", "owner": "matthewmihwl", "likes": 848}, {"id": 18052540585763835, "text": "@tinaaaminat", "created_at": "2024-11-10T01:09:55", "owner": "kennychong94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913951849012459, "text": "Tina水無論睇幾次都係咁搞笑😄", "created_at": "2024-11-09T21:36:10", "owner": "garophotography", "likes": 134}, {"id": 18069814072652761, "text": "😂 原來係C君！", "created_at": "2024-11-09T21:18:03", "owner": "timtimtim2017", "likes": 57}, {"id": 18469664278036699, "text": "🤣🤣🤣好好笑呀⋯⋯救命呀", "created_at": "2024-11-09T20:06:16", "owner": "alluka.neko", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045581117030960, "text": "呢套咩嚟？第一次睇😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T15:39:39", "owner": "givebirths", "likes": 156}, {"id": 17910658509021093, "text": "唔開聲睇以為係方東昇", "created_at": "2024-11-09T13:11:55", "owner": "charlie2040", "likes": 837}, {"id": 17869520907233034, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T12:13:39", "owner": "june.e.c.f.a", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872272237216160, "text": "尼把聲一聽就知c君😂😂😂 好好笑😆", "created_at": "2024-11-09T09:21:29", "owner": "crystal07227", "likes": 2364}, {"id": 18049461197000489, "text": "唔睇清楚都唔知呢個係c君😂", "created_at": "2024-11-09T08:45:07", "owner": "yanjustwannabeyoursweetheart", "likes": 4132}, {"id": 18097655305469152, "text": "Ksos", "created_at": "2024-11-29T02:25:01", "owner": "1_m.day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099753226461771, "text": "方東昇肥左咁多既😮", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:37:21", "owner": "729.acc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18464491444044799, "text": "Tina魚", "created_at": "2024-11-11T00:46:05", "owner": "the_starfield09.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338910262182115, "text": "真係有點爛，但係都好笑ge🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:33:09", "owner": "sillycat.ctc", "likes": 11}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3490087442087355719, "shortcode": "DBvSAmMqyVH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBvSAmMqyVH/", "taken_at": "2024-10-30T06:47:53", "caption": "路上遇到狠人司机把自己的车喷了真石漆", "owner_username": "yu_hong_juan", "owner_id": "48742121139", "likes": 22634, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0270_DBvSAmMqyVH\\DBvSAmMqyVH_20241030_064753.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18035195960545681, "text": "用刷的", "created_at": "2025-03-02T07:25:36", "owner": "hsi_kai_0420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990751059773250, "text": "我以為是泥土在上面🌚", "created_at": "2025-02-01T07:06:18", "owner": "qiu_yi_han", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052515962012885, "text": "洗車要用刷子刷嗎？😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T10:38:49", "owner": "myawen_bo12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072297343639793, "text": "😮至少車體完整，存個零用錢把車修好。", "created_at": "2024-12-22T11:02:44", "owner": "z9010021043049512008", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378229366107234, "text": "为什么这样搞，好像没什么优点吧", "created_at": "2024-12-13T11:44:46", "owner": "wufederica88", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17973424127796501, "text": "這樣不怕給人刮到", "created_at": "2024-12-07T06:35:18", "owner": "superterrynet", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18036138698343138, "text": "城市迷彩", "created_at": "2024-12-06T12:20:48", "owner": "fd_1zn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948217581871398, "text": "我以为是蚊子😅", "created_at": "2024-12-05T13:13:28", "owner": "_jin_xuan_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052241764987337, "text": "粗蠟推一推就沒事了", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:24:15", "owner": "k.touma03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027644999221002, "text": "今天我生日可以騙点关注或者点赞吗❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:16:07", "owner": "chan111201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949683627885195, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-29T09:38:07", "owner": "yun155320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047021243105271, "text": "會卡鳥屎", "created_at": "2024-11-29T04:08:55", "owner": "ohlaohlaoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028939106437524, "text": "反甲外裝", "created_at": "2024-11-28T12:30:04", "owner": "v100333300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991477962591080, "text": "別人刮到你的車你的車沒怎麼樣結果他的車刮傷比較嚴重", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:07:02", "owner": "y_ling0222", "likes": 141}, {"id": 17863014444270582, "text": "新石漆時代", "created_at": "2024-11-27T16:23:02", "owner": "name_password_shot_up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083636029558916, "text": "我™想說石頭", "created_at": "2024-11-27T12:49:53", "owner": "gasen._.0914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18473409142048145, "text": "這樣就不會刮到了", "created_at": "2024-11-27T11:57:57", "owner": "yuun158_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048221801490636, "text": "洗車？", "created_at": "2024-11-27T10:45:25", "owner": "biqibaozhanshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098810875474848, "text": "從來只有我刮別人車\n沒有人敢刮我車", "created_at": "2024-11-27T07:52:22", "owner": "choi.1112.owen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055870186906670, "text": "碰瓷的躺上去估計都得掉一塊肉", "created_at": "2024-11-27T04:20:48", "owner": "wn_0422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049860074002085, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-25T08:55:37", "owner": "hemmingsensoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284649442172758, "text": "這個完全不用洗吧 雨水沖一沖得了", "created_at": "2024-11-24T23:48:55", "owner": "love_jdm_car.2007", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18362410537186754, "text": "獨一無二 留下吧😍", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:06:50", "owner": "eli_miller028", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18155518438327203, "text": "我還以為他發霉了", "created_at": "2024-11-22T10:58:46", "owner": "o_qwo_0809", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18085945501524057, "text": "還別說，新潮流來了", "created_at": "2024-11-21T11:19:59", "owner": "tk_kwok_1216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867039391181014, "text": "换漆😂", "created_at": "2024-11-18T22:46:13", "owner": "nvm_fp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026675915443430, "text": "片主真的很多手", "created_at": "2024-11-18T11:47:09", "owner": "meotokukawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956163828839267, "text": "你家外牆有在洗的嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-16T20:58:51", "owner": "x11968", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18016813286342896, "text": "防禦力+100🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-16T07:58:42", "owner": "givesd31201", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954301209873400, "text": "拿刷地的去刷就好了啊😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T01:18:52", "owner": "h05850142", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18246934912263802, "text": "對三寶有額外附加傷害", "created_at": "2024-11-11T22:33:27", "owner": "lljun._9487", "likes": 132}, {"id": 18026264243199604, "text": "以后不用洗，汽油贵一倍", "created_at": "2024-11-10T02:52:59", "owner": "bubunpatrick", "likes": 116}, {"id": 17939428826924277, "text": "蠻實用的..？", "created_at": "2024-11-09T18:33:55", "owner": "spspcafe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049233170057328, "text": "免洗車", "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:40:08", "owner": "jonk9527", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18170245588310715, "text": "這樣不會變重嗎？應該會比較耗油吧！", "created_at": "2024-11-08T21:07:32", "owner": "naughty__eric", "likes": 550}, {"id": 18468860095024419, "text": "感覺像整個車都被鳥屎噴過", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:29:34", "owner": "love0426aa", "likes": 992}, {"id": 18027172151590444, "text": "直接用水沖啊，還有深度清潔的必要嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-08T01:37:34", "owner": "chanwanghei1", "likes": 838}, {"id": 18049190176984477, "text": "這樣車殼會不會比較堅硬？", "created_at": "2024-11-03T10:23:30", "owner": "v0805201314", "likes": 1887}, {"id": 18031104716585499, "text": "石雕", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:54:48", "owner": "toto.terence.7788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434026519077655, "text": "你有本事撞我，撞了我讓你全損", "created_at": "2024-11-27T06:14:37", "owner": "ytlighteryt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072584299622831, "text": "傻了，就是不想洗車才噴這樣", "created_at": "2024-11-27T03:16:18", "owner": "alskdjfhg12506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879781942174968, "text": "我看過類似瀝青的漆，直接用鑰匙用力刮都沒事，車主是某個我認識的老闆，不知道他腦袋在想什麼", "created_at": "2024-11-06T08:08:22", "owner": "cmeptbio", "likes": 9}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
