{"media_id": 3499125000109835744, "shortcode": "DCPY6YAPEXg", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCPY6YAPEXg/", "taken_at": "2024-11-11T18:05:51", "caption": "Pause or screenshot to know your 3 missions today💀 Share them with us! 🖤\n\nGet ready with us for our 2nd Collection: BREAKUPS AND FRIES 🍟 \n\n#dreamcore #nostalgia #nostalgiacore #feverdream #feverdreamcore #2000s #ps1games #weirdcoreaesthetic #liminalspace #liminalcore #breakups #sadcore", "owner_username": "buriedchildclo", "owner_id": "53962953899", "likes": 636, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0272_DCPY6YAPEXg\\DCPY6YAPEXg_20241111_180551.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18027400631220810, "text": "Ate fries today", "created_at": "2024-11-28T03:03:17", "owner": "xdagod", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067549525660229, "text": "Cry in shower. Clean your mess. Stare into abyss. Sounds about right", "created_at": "2024-11-16T07:01:02", "owner": "ishhappened", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18169033597311092, "text": "Blood Rayne and Vampire the masquerade realness 😍", "created_at": "2024-11-14T00:31:45", "owner": "noirlabyrinth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067561165644456, "text": "i played twice. fml.\nround1: \nlobotomy, turn into worm, cry in shower.\nround 2:\n breakup, breakup, treat myself.", "created_at": "2024-11-13T20:06:40", "owner": "siouxsiesucia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992134989578380, "text": "Over contemplate, treat myself, lobotomy. I'm unemployed this is what my day already looks like.", "created_at": "2024-11-12T22:23:14", "owner": "crainetom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994272099557060, "text": "Treat myself😌Cry in the shower🥲Then finish it off with a lobotomy🙂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T17:39:24", "owner": "a5censi0n97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986492985738983, "text": "Did all 3 actually", "created_at": "2024-11-12T08:19:05", "owner": "demiseus_the_sullied", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18346928515134272, "text": "What are you making these with", "created_at": "2024-11-12T06:43:34", "owner": "hermit_magi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892541806099185, "text": "Eat hamburgers, look into the abyss, eat fries. lol sounds like me", "created_at": "2024-11-12T05:24:03", "owner": "maison.madridd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884127283119482, "text": "Looks like i gotta look into the abyss again 🥱🕷️ smh", "created_at": "2024-11-12T04:42:50", "owner": "phantumz.melo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944984052897385, "text": "Break up look into the abyss turn into a worm", "created_at": "2024-11-12T03:23:36", "owner": "ov_kvltt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149709238339783, "text": "EAT FRIES, FETAL POSITION NAP, LOBOTOMY🗣️🔊🔊🔊🔊", "created_at": "2024-11-12T01:59:51", "owner": "idle_online", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063764434691111, "text": "Turn into a worm, eat fries, shower", "created_at": "2024-11-12T01:32:49", "owner": "spannis_speratheon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062817634755326, "text": "Eat hamburgers and fries 😔", "created_at": "2024-11-11T19:30:39", "owner": "arkodomini", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033371909097213, "text": "Lobotomy, eat fries, lobotomy", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:49:19", "owner": "slowpoke_cowpoke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019113179333982, "text": "\"look into the abyss\" I just looked at my black classmate", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:34:08", "owner": "abbadonbr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090978829496293, "text": "Fetal position nap, cry in shower and treat ourselves 💀🖤sounds doable for a Monday", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:34:01", "owner": "buriedchildclo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075929539580796, "text": "Despair and chill, fetal position nap, and cry in the shower. That’s just like a normal day then.", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:11:07", "owner": "doomerismad", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18037680329096615, "text": "Break up treat yourself and then lobotomy", "created_at": "2024-12-27T03:02:27", "owner": "smitty.5432", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969919953672359, "text": "I'm an insane worm eating a hamburger", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:22:47", "owner": "lusifer7w7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902834040981562, "text": "Lobotomy Go Insane and treat myself 😍🥂🎉", "created_at": "2024-11-13T05:18:00", "owner": "_s0nia.art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001989173688433, "text": "Go insane, treat yourself, then lobotomy. Sounds like a best last day", "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:34:58", "owner": "murricuh", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["dreamcore", "nostalgia", "nostalgiacore", "feverdream", "feverdreamcore", "2000s", "ps1games", "weirdcoreaesthetic", "liminalspace", "liminalcore", "breakups", "sadcore"]},
