": 1}, {"id": 17860578246224693, "text": "想像力真的變超能力了", "created_at": "2024-11-12T01:57:39", "owner": "yo.jimmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866340157180247, "text": "哇～～ 😮nice work!!", "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:48:24", "owner": "wangsinnig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082502332532564, "text": "有帥！", "created_at": "2024-11-11T15:26:01", "owner": "vm_danchu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057945706846215, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-11T13:59:53", "owner": "jusofficial_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028213793183108, "text": "😍🔥👏", "created_at": "2024-11-11T12:52:25", "owner": "makenzi.filmmaker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025157186243108, "text": "👏學到了", "created_at": "2024-11-11T11:17:38", "owner": "tanganson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043296980281276, "text": "原來還可以這樣！我要玩🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-11T11:08:51", "owner": "becabbiuu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18465579883005309, "text": "我想破腦袋都不知道你怎麼做出來這個轉場的，原來是這樣子！感謝分享🫶", "created_at": "2024-11-11T10:52:05", "owner": "kawaducky2k", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18341072908176460, "text": "佛心公司", "created_at": "2024-11-11T10:36:18", "owner": "toby_880121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948562626860276, "text": "Один русский тут походу, сука даже английский не знаю, но буду делать по видео 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-21T17:59:26", "owner": "platoneestco", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3498698886875748599, "shortcode": "DCN4BnISJj3", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCN4BnISJj3/", "taken_at": "2024-11-11T04:00:09", "caption": "科學離譜紀錄片\n\nChuckleLemon", "owner_username": "imf_502", "owner_id": "45263171427", "likes": 11976, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0274_DCN4BnISJj3\\DCN4BnISJj3_20241111_040009.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18060632398931767, "text": "所以中國允許這種影片了？", "created_at": "2025-01-20T01:50:07", "owner": "almachichiot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004071569705035, "text": "这个写进AI的文案 原稿是什么样的 我想了解一下", "created_at": "2025-01-14T05:18:33", "owner": "omgjjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083532967602083, "text": "非常科学", "created_at": "2025-01-13T15:48:38", "owner": "thetsss_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069728029772912, "text": "噢 是哦", "created_at": "2025-01-12T16:03:29", "owner": "walien.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953453073877147, "text": "充滿了邏輯碰撞🙌", "created_at": "2025-01-12T15:51:46", "owner": "monsterbevy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033980747414025, "text": "LOL 这踏马的什么鬼，笑喷了", "created_at": "2025-01-10T09:15:59", "owner": "glennnyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854028253305664, "text": "我看這個影片的情緒進化史：啥小-喔喔-啥小", "created_at": "2025-01-07T16:08:18", "owner": "chuanjiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044390156185213, "text": "這居然是真科普嗎", "created_at": "2025-01-07T07:34:15", "owner": "so_rirakuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009923270509310, "text": "最早的斐濟杯🥰🥰🥰", "created_at": "2025-01-06T15:30:33", "owner": "chengshenpu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988856778762180, "text": "一本正經的胡說八道😂", "created_at": "2025-01-06T15:19:45", "owner": "bear761117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110667778448567, "text": "禁止動物成精😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-04T04:12:29", "owner": "hawk33882002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906118294078203, "text": "我要當聚寶盆姑娘，謝謝", "created_at": "2024-12-27T03:10:33", "owner": "vera__________________weasley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126126790361883, "text": "多发 爱看 还想看", "created_at": "2024-12-25T00:01:48", "owner": "didisu.di", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258067585262720, "text": "是飛頭蠻😂", "created_at": "2024-12-23T08:42:57", "owner": "karlpanzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114691690386666, "text": "三小？", "created_at": "2024-12-22T17:37:58", "owner": "terrence_wang.ty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290127658208700, "text": "……", "created_at": "2024-12-22T00:50:56", "owner": "yuki_891015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080267875568154, "text": "原來如此！我知道了！\n那最重要的是蛇精現在哪裡還可以購入？\n\n備註：我不要那種營養不良只背精品包的那種愛吵架蛇精", "created_at": "2024-12-21T06:38:19", "owner": "huberkao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040781414260275, "text": "如果有傳送門我想試下自含", "created_at": "2024-12-19T22:24:00", "owner": "jackisthinking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053292521299199, "text": "每个字我都认识，怎么连在一起就不知道在说什么了？😮", "created_at": "2024-12-18T05:46:44", "owner": "yixuan116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042180035241308, "text": "人彘", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:43:57", "owner": "nevathorne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045362348276850, "text": "这玩意把我小时候吓得半死", "created_at": "2024-12-15T09:16:41", "owner": "joyzing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110834077433228, "text": "幹話一堆", "created_at": "2024-12-14T05:54:10", "owner": "ward_ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989452179606131, "text": "@zhangxvfei", "created_at": "2024-12-13T16:16:39", "owner": "otroqvtq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025008806299690, "text": "一本正經說幹話wwww", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:46:34", "owner": "takashi_bassist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025460699295575, "text": "禁止動物成精管很寬膩😂👍", "created_at": "2024-12-13T11:29:19", "owner": "yorayoray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027088313627330, "text": "這是真的，我爸都用傳送門送這些工作人員跟設備去各地工作", "created_at": "2024-12-13T09:32:36", "owner": "yuwei_bekar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868188883261323, "text": "這跟大衛考柏菲魔術差不多啊障眼法", "created_at": "2024-12-13T04:57:48", "owner": "huangweixiang29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058317220921928, "text": "我為什麼在這裡", "created_at": "2024-12-09T06:57:00", "owner": "hanchenyu_0727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362645329189238, "text": "這甚麼山海經專欄", "created_at": "2024-11-30T04:37:20", "owner": "weixiang_fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853783594338007, "text": "小的時候真的看過花瓶姑娘", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:26:34", "owner": "priorboard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362130850190314, "text": "我有一批花瓶姑娘很便宜", "created_at": "2024-11-29T21:39:30", "owner": "jk_e_tg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051836611961087, "text": "一本正經地胡說八道", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:38:14", "owner": "tsoi.christy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029467898426840, "text": "？", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:31:07", "owner": "oootictooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985427613750070, "text": "你知道你再供三洨嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:29:58", "owner": "yu_shun_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869622883248933, "text": "我勒个去 我看了什么救命", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:14:40", "owner": "celine_gg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481814833037119, "text": "想想把這段影片傳到長輩群組\n再下個斗大的聳動標題 想想就好爽", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:07:00", "owner": "jr810411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957111915842897, "text": "這不是A I影片嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-29T07:27:24", "owner": "yudukimarink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300989533201912, "text": "看完完全不知道看了什麼😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T03:31:47", "owner": "zealotxxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847642087328664, "text": "@louuuuussss", "created_at": "2024-11-28T16:21:30", "owner": "li_yi_0217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036315110521982, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T14:03:40", "owner": "sunshinebumbleb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903494932069706, "text": "現在是用5G無線連接", "created_at": "2024-11-28T12:16:45", "owner": "mmmiinnngggc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304775704201949, "text": "???", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:46:46", "owner": "090964ycb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049394822016258, "text": "妳敢說我還敢信", "created_at": "2024-11-28T06:00:28", "owner": "kowel_0620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023384741627229, "text": "这配音真诡异。", "created_at": "2024-11-28T04:22:32", "owner": "big_bro3322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884213707167485, "text": "實在是有夠荒謬", "created_at": "2024-11-27T12:34:38", "owner": "y.s.nail2885", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080270422564451, "text": "沒人性也詭異", "created_at": "2024-11-27T10:09:09", "owner": "pujojoc99bg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042975995165978, "text": "前面與後面都可以不用看", "created_at": "2024-11-27T08:43:51", "owner": "lichengze130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027447173227267, "text": "傳送門關了怎辦", "created_at": "2024-11-27T03:44:11", "owner": "oldsin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870837667234685, "text": "要不要聽聽你說了什麼", "created_at": "2024-11-23T01:17:40", "owner": "tsaitnc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063657379693145, "text": "為什麼沒人説這是創作得很好的模擬恐怖", "created_at": "2024-11-18T06:26:20", "owner": "108a0401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046118441490664, "text": "到時候可以玩打地鼠", "created_at": "2024-11-17T09:06:45", "owner": "shark_shaun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077034004584829, "text": "？什么鬼兜", "created_at": "2024-11-16T20:59:28", "owner": "15.77997224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030704969139422, "text": "動物頻道dis咖啡瑞", "created_at": "2024-11-16T09:41:52", "owner": "nono_nonon_8877", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038529980186433, "text": "我写论文：", "created_at": "2024-11-14T21:37:00", "owner": "amberlu589", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042989216152553, "text": "今天網路用太多了", "created_at": "2024-11-13T04:13:37", "owner": "xail.601_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083268214542007, "text": "一本正經的胡說八道", "created_at": "2024-11-13T00:05:57", "owner": "chichibaby666.gn", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18057440587875940, "text": "人人都可以成为花瓶姑娘", "created_at": "2024-11-12T20:37:37", "owner": "michael_wyr1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18022849373567648, "text": "有一種模擬恐怖的感覺", "created_at": "2024-11-12T19:50:22", "owner": "jakin1029", "likes": 912}, {"id": 18038828111191795, "text": "我嘞個傳送門😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T19:15:50", "owner": "zehu.ang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368363557115161, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-12T17:29:30", "owner": "hugo1_17", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18061095343766391, "text": "黑暗都市傳說", "created_at": "2024-11-12T12:46:27", "owner": "ericli984", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097341433465258, "text": "唬爛包裝上科普的外衣", "created_at": "2024-11-12T06:47:53", "owner": "p.seakk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891799969037465, "text": "有點像模擬恐怖短片", "created_at": "2024-11-12T04:32:39", "owner": "473youfather", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17902115040074489, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-11T22:51:35", "owner": "lewis.huang_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18116659249408637, "text": "我有個大膽的想法", "created_at": "2024-11-11T19:34:59", "owner": "hcc_ryan0726", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927039849974114, "text": "…", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:41:21", "owner": "le_ailee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061614754646675, "text": "很離譜", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:28:03", "owner": "me_is_lose", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958727658717723, "text": "不看難過一天，看了難過一整天。你可以不看，但一定要給你朋友看。", "created_at": "2024-11-11T14:14:57", "owner": "toouk2012", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17965832801810365, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T13:49:22", "owner": "rongrong0403", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051755647786183, "text": "這不是蝦米科工館還是小叮噹科學園區的哽嗎？🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-11T12:54:35", "owner": "r95610701", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050251921815738, "text": "一個人上網也是挺可怕的", "created_at": "2024-11-11T11:58:35", "owner": "xsss779900", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954239205847029, "text": "嗯？", "created_at": "2024-11-11T11:49:31", "owner": "y53942g", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050496809302442, "text": "一本正經講幹話", "created_at": "2024-11-11T11:06:51", "owner": "jiatinghsiao", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18024666797257523, "text": "這是什麼中世紀虛擬恐怖🫠？", "created_at": "2024-11-11T10:40:35", "owner": "lyr_.0918", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023867759569373, "text": "What the sigma", "created_at": "2024-11-11T10:06:51", "owner": "davidisbackonit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078823864564762, "text": "？？不是哥們", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:14:58", "owner": "_yxnn0614", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047516219067468, "text": "他先進了", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:11:14", "owner": "hys._.0811_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016066277356805, "text": "漲知識了", "created_at": "2024-11-11T08:42:01", "owner": "cjyj0528", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872886922212748, "text": "有時候上網挺無助的", "created_at": "2024-11-11T08:32:50", "owner": "dennipan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019556141632464, "text": "性癖可以冷門但不能偏門😮", "created_at": "2024-11-11T07:57:21", "owner": "keith.targaryen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043303307124956, "text": "認真講幹話", "created_at": "2024-11-11T07:53:16", "owner": "lamken.kenlam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995130906554712, "text": "我覺得不離譜 看完都想離世了⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-11-11T07:52:17", "owner": "rouroupei_", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18019764593617909, "text": "沒有傳送門的話 我前面差點信了😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:55:41", "owner": "carloshou0802", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18044206208279283, "text": "它可以暗示事件的真相，並不是在直接告知事件真實情況", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:25:06", "owner": "kirin_0530", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18046685549090436, "text": "所以番號是多少", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:47:12", "owner": "kenixtrueno_gh8", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18303692338207309, "text": "我大學就是學這方面的專業，一直以為是基本常識，2024年了居然還需要出影片科普，該不會還有人不知道吧？", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:34:53", "owner": "kaisun_dreamer", "likes": 313}, {"id": 17915678702915272, "text": "離大譜了", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:31:25", "owner": "soldier9058", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028317752579480, "text": "到底在說三小", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:58:19", "owner": "angela820530", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095221942488257, "text": "有請文英阿姨", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:56:39", "owner": "mirulo_116", "likes": 448}, {"id": 18082235002543574, "text": "事實證明我們的智商不低", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:49:30", "owner": "re_en_ter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083403277536833, "text": "差點就信了", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:45:05", "owner": "gygygpkpkp123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912015253020048, "text": "那個⋯⋯蛇精在哪裡？我要去找他😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:42:33", "owner": "amber_lin_02", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081377890489600, "text": "好棒的宇宙🔥😂", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:39:53", "owner": "jackthetube", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17881336359089519, "text": "蛤🤨？", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:36:20", "owner": "johnjohn650227", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073317712543809, "text": "謝謝科普", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:33:47", "owner": "bubblecat0123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900796255074884, "text": "我只想知道，哪邊有頭被傳送門卡住的姑娘！", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:32:20", "owner": "dyck.180", "likes": 153}, {"id": 18018796295331459, "text": "🙌剛白活10秒", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:30:28", "owner": "nara_chen0812", "likes": 187}, {"id": 18060792214829651, "text": "真的！以前在一個自述的影片中看過類似的東西，推薦大家去看看！名片叫少女樁（x", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:27:09", "owner": "nga_celia_84", "likes": 67}, {"id": 17912276010018458, "text": "到底", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:25:37", "owner": "cvdf22336", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072227674650583, "text": "人彘", "created_at": "2024-12-22T06:47:01", "owner": "zora_tsou1209", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3499014526815893794, "shortcode": "DCO_yxuyvki", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCO_yxuyvki/", "taken_at": "2024-11-11T14:28:51", "caption": "#能快速回血的有效休息法", "owner_username": "orla71665", "owner_id": "68143270061", "likes": 15, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0275_DCO_yxuyvki\\DCO_yxuyvki_20241111_142851.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["能快速回血的有效休息法"]},
{"media_id": 3486581879546883569, "shortcode": "DBi078qtK3x", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBi078qtK3x/", "taken_at": "2024-10-25T10:44:50", "caption": "[👇HOW TO HAND SOLDER A PERFECT THT👇]\n \n01 - Always use the lowest possible temperature according to the mass around your component. (see note #1)\n02 - Ensure your tip is properly tinned and clean of oxide.\n03 - Touch the pin with solder and add more solder wire between the tip and the components so that the solder melts. \n04 - Withdraw the solder wire while keeping the tip in the same position for a few seconds, allowing the molten solder to be uniformly distributed on the component and the pad. (see note #2)\n05 - After a few moments, lift the soldering tip and allow the solder to air-cool.\n06 - Check that the menisci have formed properly between the component and the pad.\n \n☝️ Note #1: More mass will implied  more temperature\n🫧 Note #2: The presence of bubbles is a good sign; this means that the solder is flowing down the through-hole joint.\n \n🔎 INTERESTING PRODUCTS: (Link in Bio 🔗)\n \nCDB Soldering Station\nhttps://www.jbctools.com/cdb-soldering-station-product-1605.html\n \nC245 Cartridge Range (used in video C245785):\nhttps://www.jbctools.com/c245-cartridges-for-t245-handpiece-product-19.html\n \nStay tuned to our channel for more! @jbc_soldering_tools\n \n#circuitboard #electronics #engineering #howto #JBCtools #rework #THT #resistors #capacitors, #diodes #transistors", "owner_username": "jbc_soldering_tools", "owner_id": "2087437317", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0276_DBi078qtK3x\\DBi078qtK3x_20241025_104450.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18038334305300828", "text": "I found it’s better to be hotter/less touch time rather than lowest temp long exposure", "created_at": "2025-05-06T01:43:20", "owner": "coltwilkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17863253355366824", "text": "As someone annoyed with my own messy soldering, I cannot wait to try what they are mentioning. Pretty sure they are right a portion about the tools. No one doing it in the old days as much anymore. The news tools make it easier in a way?", "created_at": "2025-03-23T22:36:34", "owner": "chipmunk13205", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17957803586846358", "text": "Use FN231 @diamond.flux.soldering", "created_at": "2024-12-09T01:46:04", "owner": "vitalka_raspizdation", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18008667617662553", "text": "im losing a debate. do you really need paste and temprature changing? cause my mentor says i dont need one he does dirty work. but i want to professionally be familiar with every technique", "created_at": "2024-11-29T06:15:30", "owner": "doggoscava", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17914087730936014", "text": "dont we use soldering paste?", "created_at": "2024-11-21T03:23:13", "owner": "_aardarsh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18011857019649456", "text": "Just make sure not to try it with a Li battery🔋 😃 trust me I've seen consequences", "created_at": "2024-11-08T10:46:00", "owner": "aryan_40444", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18278932864245137", "text": "Always had a problem soldering for some crazy reason.  Never thought about the heat level and the surrounding mass to the joint your trying to fix.  I’m gonna try this method.  Ty ty 🙌👏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T15:01:38", "owner": "bryanleewhatley", "likes": 3}, {"id": "17997050099698041", "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-30T19:32:21", "owner": "icepick_dog", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17859416691224661", "text": "thank you bro", "created_at": "2024-10-30T16:23:59", "owner": "uzbsupermen", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18036585815034591", "text": "Use proper solder. It's a good investment, especially since it's mostly leadfree nowadays.", "created_at": "2024-10-30T08:31:04", "owner": "thefab_87", "likes": 14}, {"id": "17952260909848329", "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-27T02:58:14", "owner": "yimeiliul", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18074193268590969", "text": "👏 ok yes", "created_at": "2024-10-26T23:28:00", "owner": "sheybani21007", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17887418760125198", "text": "Very Nice. Some extra tips. Use flux ROL0 between step 2 and 3 to remove oxidation on the pcb and component to solder. Also bubbling can mean trapped moisture which means baking out the pcb is required. Love the JBC tools. Use them every day at work.", "created_at": "2024-10-25T15:00:49", "owner": "schaap422", "likes": 5}, {"id": "18138734368360050", "text": "I'm new, so this was a major cool lesson out of the blue. I highly appreciate this.", "created_at": "2024-10-25T12:44:27", "owner": "asgard.farms", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18043178759026606", "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🔥🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-25T12:40:19", "owner": "jonatan.roman_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18066794272647913", "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-25T12:15:12", "owner": "cassianohpp", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["1", "2", "1", "2", "circuitboard", "electronics", "engineering", "howto", "jbctools", "rework", "tht", "resistors", "capacitors", "diodes", "transistors"]},
{"media_id": 3502324622140434482, "shortcode": "DCawbAOyOgy", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCawbAOyOgy/", "taken_at": "2024-11-16T04:01:44", "caption": "攝影不僅僅是一種技術\n更是一種連結與表達的藝術\n用鏡頭紀錄每一個動人瞬間\n為每個品牌講述獨特的故事\n-\n■ 拍影片很簡單 ■\n1.溝通討論\n2.確認合作\n3.簽約定金\n4.企劃拍攝\n5.交付成品\n6.合作愉快\n\n-\n形象廣告｜商業空間｜\n紀錄短片｜企劃開發｜\n自媒體經營\n\n相關合作請Gmail來信：\nactionman.studio1984@gmail.com\n\n相關作品：\nlinktr.ee/actionman.studio1984\n\n#耀影人 #攝影教學 #空間攝影\n#商業影片 #品牌形象 #訪談影片\n#活動紀錄 #企業形象 #行銷影片\n#形象廣告 #人文故事 #動態攝影", "owner_username": "actionman.1984", "owner_id": "49280539840", "likes": 4843, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0277_DCawbAOyOgy\\DCawbAOyOgy_20241116_040144.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18045812528175565, "text": "就把摩爾紋修的特別明顯 明顯到讓人覺得你是故意的", "created_at": "2024-12-16T02:56:30", "owner": "leelun520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883603036170149, "text": "5DsR 會有解嗎？😮", "created_at": "2024-11-21T11:29:00", "owner": "end.y_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005611880507279, "text": "進 Darktable 拉局部低通濾鏡會改善很多", "created_at": "2024-11-18T17:07:01", "owner": "grootux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862828570271298, "text": "老公有紋路怎辦😂", "created_at": "2024-11-18T01:30:24", "owner": "kayla_foodie_tw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063054532747626, "text": "曾經因為這樣被客訴要求退錢的我😢😢", "created_at": "2024-11-17T15:46:42", "owner": "sam0_0_hey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043370978484607, "text": "：新郎在那！我們閃！！", "created_at": "2024-11-17T09:21:41", "owner": "br0sebr0se601", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18475117834034393, "text": "LR有去除莫爾紋的功能🙇🙇", "created_at": "2024-11-17T09:07:34", "owner": "ngg78_69", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18348398308134390, "text": "摩爾紋跟畫素的數量有關係，像素密度剛好對上織品貨LED排列的密度。\n\n解法就是：用低畫素的相機，以下推薦：\n\nSony A7SIII 1200萬畫素\nNikon D200 1020萬畫素\nCanon EOS 1D 416萬畫素（推薦）", "created_at": "2024-11-17T04:35:52", "owner": "kiminbrush", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18026275079399476, "text": "學會了\n如果拍婚紗老公的衣服有摩爾紋，就不拍老公（？\n😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-17T03:02:14", "owner": "bensonwang_photo", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18329428285152553, "text": "修圖為什麼要戴耳機？？", "created_at": "2024-11-17T01:09:12", "owner": "jac.vader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058465495858467, "text": "拍到一半直接跑走", "created_at": "2024-11-16T13:17:41", "owner": "mr.barber_buck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934569714830352, "text": "小螢幕連拍沒發現，後期換到大螢幕才發覺怎麼辦？😥", "created_at": "2024-11-16T12:15:17", "owner": "susumamade", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989145384593770, "text": "畫質調低：", "created_at": "2024-11-16T08:49:01", "owner": "blockernagnto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004414808680853, "text": "真的別執著趕緊酸😢", "created_at": "2024-11-16T07:36:04", "owner": "daji_dappy", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17986331570607710, "text": "改用底片拍吧😂", "created_at": "2024-11-16T06:59:04", "owner": "joshliang0225", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18038155037266605, "text": "原來客人會在乎啊", "created_at": "2024-11-16T06:53:50", "owner": "cjcdjw2012", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070983238627421, "text": "欸不是 換一個老公嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-16T06:43:37", "owner": "ohlaohlaoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041435696473489, "text": "這要廣發給眾多甲方們知道。", "created_at": "2024-11-16T05:23:51", "owner": "yehchichi", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18043026584127184, "text": "最怕婚宴舞台背後大型LED版🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-16T05:22:59", "owner": "syuan_daily", "likes": 161}, {"id": 17928500459977956, "text": "好方法", "created_at": "2024-11-16T05:06:56", "owner": "kuan_weddingphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015839693374809, "text": "請問一下用CPL或其他濾鏡會有效果嗎？ 例如讓那邊分辨率不要那麼高(？", "created_at": "2024-11-16T04:27:35", "owner": "srus._.zzz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081916126545350, "text": "笑爛😂", "created_at": "2024-11-16T04:24:43", "owner": "babu_sports_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005629796681917, "text": "摩爾紋處理方式：直接特寫摩爾紋，人要比車兇，攝影師要比摩爾紋更魔幻，殺他個措手不及😎", "created_at": "2024-11-16T16:20:38", "owner": "aspire67_gy", "likes": 94}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["耀影人", "攝影教學", "空間攝影", "商業影片", "品牌形象", "訪談影片", "活動紀錄", "企業形象", "行銷影片", "形象廣告", "人文故事", "動態攝影"]},
{"media_id": 3486603050187634208, "shortcode": "DBi5wBXOjYg", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBi5wBXOjYg/", "taken_at": "2024-10-25T11:25:43", "caption": "“I will not let anything stand in my way.”", "owner_username": "mukemmelnesli", "owner_id": "1581670497", "likes": 635461, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0278_DBi5wBXOjYg\\DBi5wBXOjYg_20241025_112543.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18087024206040098, "text": "J", "created_at": "2026-01-07T23:20:18", "owner": "aliefv.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028615091752638, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:55:16", "owner": "mustkrmn", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18171695383328926, "text": "Çok güzelsin aşko", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:50:22", "owner": "erencnklc3441", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372506269192683, "text": "Çok fazla ağır kaldırma hocam. Sonra çok kötü ağrıyor", "created_at": "2025-05-14T05:51:13", "owner": "socratis0101", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066292411787460, "text": "Ulan ilk görünce arkadan köklüyorlar zannettim. Bu nasıl açı?", "created_at": "2025-04-12T15:03:40", "owner": "narsistvelet93", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18078066481701455, "text": "Sure! Here's a more convincing and friendly version:\n\"Hey there! 😊 I would really appreciate it if you could follow my page. I'm dedicated to sharing amazing content that you'll love, and it would mean a lot to have your support! By following, you’ll stay updated on all the exciting things I’m posting. Let’s connect and be part of this awesome journey together! Thanks a ton in advance! 🙏\"\nThis version is polite, warm, and explains why following would be beneficial.", "created_at": "2025-04-08T07:12:54", "owner": "native_beautiful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038937776573741, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-06T13:51:30", "owner": "luni_mtl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061974413083285, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-02T17:26:16", "owner": "y_sf177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057474863473734, "text": "Bei mir auch immer so", "