{"media_id": 3496073693049261902, "shortcode": "DCEjIA2yg9O", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCEjIA2yg9O/", "taken_at": "2024-11-07T13:01:44", "caption": "其實係由幾時開始我哋冇再買佢哋嚟食？\n\n就算依家想食，呢度有啲零食同野飲都已經買唔返。\n\n掛住佢地嘅，趁有啲仲喺度，快啲買返黎食下，等佢地可以陪我地耐啲啦～\n\n（圖片來源：網絡圖片）\n\n#拼湊香港童年 #accent #accenthkg", "owner_username": "accent_hkg", "owner_id": "42418917318", "likes": 50468, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0281_DCEjIA2yg9O\\DCEjIA2yg9O_20241107_130144.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17969379878707106, "text": "@a1i30 以前樓下啲冷麵1蚊1包", "created_at": "2025-02-25T16:35:10", "owner": "kakii_v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029428982333018, "text": "我的童年！🥹", "created_at": "2025-02-25T12:49:26", "owner": "nero_nc9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095888029521848, "text": "老la😇", "created_at": "2025-02-24T09:12:59", "owner": "ztnltl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035508605202838, "text": "94😞咁就30了", "created_at": "2025-02-18T12:56:25", "owner": "k02.k05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052504237937046, "text": "好耐冇飲過茶字典係咪絕咗版", "created_at": "2025-02-15T06:46:01", "owner": "panjai238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18484102036042027, "text": "唔知又幾時開始啲零食變曬做大陸零食", "created_at": "2025-02-02T14:54:15", "owner": "atkwtz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298200988228199, "text": "超人魷魚絲都冇😢", "created_at": "2025-01-30T15:59:26", "owner": "kinson_nng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258293359279690, "text": "第八個嗰個可樂糖而家仲有冇賣？😭", "created_at": "2025-01-25T10:36:53", "owner": "oooo11oo._7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480255316010254, "text": "夾糖好似無左薄荷熊仔🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-01-23T16:12:28", "owner": "tttttttting_ting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054092372017172, "text": "童年", "created_at": "2025-01-22T21:31:17", "owner": "titusz1118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111290413452462, "text": "眼濕濕", "created_at": "2025-01-21T10:45:08", "owner": "tuan.1207_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852972145369419, "text": "最開頭個香口膠熱情果味係最好食嘅", "created_at": "2025-01-19T15:22:26", "owner": "lavancerlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033012023208298, "text": "Keroro 雪糕杯", "created_at": "2025-01-17T09:02:45", "owner": "chukkinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041525879218142, "text": "眨吓眼，先發現已經變晒童年回憶😂，突然間覺得自己老咗好多😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T18:01:58", "owner": "katungng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152963356341555, "text": "超人魷魚絲😍", "created_at": "2024-12-22T01:36:04", "owner": "mrfishfish_oceanofjobless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079524796582842, "text": "@takikaka @kalun1256 @waanyeahh @jmkyt11 @klinsman_ng @hiukwanncheung 鄭朗軒！", "created_at": "2024-12-19T15:12:59", "owner": "xbxaxlxlx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337237525197402, "text": "@lyyoyo_ 茶字典🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-19T05:57:26", "owner": "csy.angel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286669180168536, "text": "應該話，係幾時開始無得再買……😢往事只能……", "created_at": "2024-12-18T11:07:09", "owner": "__kc502407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930240594977186, "text": "自己仲\n夾糖\n魚肉腸\n啫哩糖\n媽咪麵", "created_at": "2024-12-18T08:27:15", "owner": "12c.iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148479178344806, "text": "超人金屬蓋😍", "created_at": "2024-12-17T01:53:42", "owner": "jackin_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009508049675127, "text": "仲有挾糖，有冇人有食開粉紅色白色三角形軟棉棉嗰粒? 覺唔覺得成日混雜咗啲假嘢? 有種差唔多樣，但深粉紅色同好硬嘅。。。有冇人知我講緊乜😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:28:06", "owner": "sell_my_sou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111561286432287, "text": "糖果店我樓下之前有一間，但係而家转咗成补习社", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:18:25", "owner": "love0306_0613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045367772128949, "text": "有好多仲有", "created_at": "2024-12-09T02:22:01", "owner": "hkchrollolucilfer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073070671617819, "text": "我明明10後都食過8樣經典食物😍😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T01:46:41", "owner": "cherry.__.burger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18455920294066295, "text": "@femifung", "created_at": "2024-12-07T00:48:24", "owner": "angus_journey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860327911301307, "text": "四方果😢", "created_at": "2024-12-04T03:13:24", "owner": "yuyukwan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871369270236957, "text": "真係好多見到都想再食返", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:37:26", "owner": "royalplay_bbq_partyroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971939898670037, "text": "第一代香口膠🥲🥲🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-27T03:06:09", "owner": "yung_9.906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013833986431538, "text": "好懷念恐龍谷,唔知仲有冇賣呢？", "created_at": "2024-11-25T13:25:00", "owner": "hkmystery17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069938389635324, "text": "好想去7-11買枝水動樂 攞翻啲高達磁石貼", "created_at": "2024-11-25T07:51:00", "owner": "missing_persons01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074350429544754, "text": "點可以冇雀巢三色雪糕同綠力😢", "created_at": "2024-11-24T12:42:22", "owner": "kenwong881114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047901800021959, "text": "童年回憶", "created_at": "2024-11-22T04:42:58", "owner": "kaho0521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062484256772813, "text": "我地呢班90後真係好幸福", "created_at": "2024-11-22T02:39:19", "owner": "bowiehhhhhui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922000722896204, "text": "飲左沙士＆整粒水果糖未？", "created_at": "2024-11-20T14:19:51", "owner": "dinsoncole", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987897573603929, "text": "茶字典, 四方果世一", "created_at": "2024-11-20T14:04:31", "owner": "benji_zbzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284669902169299, "text": "觸動 快感！", "created_at": "2024-11-20T05:51:45", "owner": "daviddaviddaviddavidaviddavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064105384738703, "text": "四方果真係經典", "created_at": "2024-11-19T16:40:41", "owner": "kurimanju_chiikawa_ojisan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466663342027625, "text": "到底係邊個發明菠蘿腸", "created_at": "2024-11-19T14:27:53", "owner": "jos_yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369535390113521, "text": "四方啫喱停產咗😢\n同埋仲有香蕉雪條！", "created_at": "2024-11-18T14:41:47", "owner": "messi_goat_52", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050917372989328, "text": "😢😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-17T14:25:29", "owner": "zes_ty0.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047872295020765, "text": "元朗仲有思樂冰", "created_at": "2024-11-17T13:27:55", "owner": "godof_war30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170273722311034, "text": "👏👏有啲已經無出😢", "created_at": "2024-11-17T13:27:41", "owner": "miffychan2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145892041343347, "text": "唔知點解睇到幾傷感好懷念以前😥", "created_at": "2024-11-17T04:25:31", "owner": "_chanforhung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061958680762645, "text": "竟然冇人記得kinder出奇蛋？", "created_at": "2024-11-16T22:20:57", "owner": "0416_sze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318246589089298, "text": "除咗欣欣杯同恐龍谷全部都係童年回憶", "created_at": "2024-11-16T21:30:20", "owner": "alter_ego_nate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025174322573277, "text": "超人個啲鐵以前勁多 囤左一大盒", "created_at": "2024-11-16T11:31:14", "owner": "npfffffung", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17944971698911339, "text": "最後依然有買黎食", "created_at": "2024-11-15T23:50:59", "owner": "chikita168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119020450406564, "text": "超人蓋、四方果、媽咪麵、7-11自由斟、維記熱飲都係小學開始試過\n#出賣年齡系列", "created_at": "2024-11-15T19:28:38", "owner": "tonytkchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304780030204699, "text": "四方果🥲🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-15T17:15:16", "owner": "kittyyau98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884701861084257, "text": "全部小學fashback", "created_at": "2024-11-15T08:59:26", "owner": "weapon_lover_dp28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051395221807826, "text": "00後小學回憶 都就25歲🙂🙂🙂🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-15T06:37:09", "owner": "paperscissors.52_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865101898256525, "text": "chew 5 gum, stimulate your senses", "created_at": "2024-11-15T03:55:41", "owner": "die_rote_farbe_dasred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044897270478634, "text": "想問第一樣係咩嚟嘅我唔記得咗。。🙈🙈🙈🙈同埋第四鹹蛋超人係咪魷魚絲入面嘅贈品？😍🌟💯🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:45:24", "owner": "kkwan.yy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015716462375196, "text": "自由斟喺七仔已經無曬", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:30:48", "owner": "jaetangtang", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17984230613755244, "text": "當我發現佢含糖量極高嘅時候", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:19:32", "owner": "chris_luiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063321853703281, "text": "四方果😢", "created_at": "2024-11-14T11:01:14", "owner": "namnam321_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18474274375017385, "text": "回憶既Flashback💎💎💎鑽石戒指糖 以前既快樂真係好簡單 得到一粒就會開心全日💗\n已經在不知不覺中Decline了", "created_at": "2024-11-14T06:14:51", "owner": "thy._diana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061465180649632, "text": "竟然無咖啡糖！？", "created_at": "2024-11-14T04:11:10", "owner": "tsz_0507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385846528103481, "text": "雀巢四方果；欣欣杯😢", "created_at": "2024-11-14T04:09:48", "owner": "tsz_0507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035090207059142, "text": "茶字典喺2017年左右好似仲有", "created_at": "2024-11-14T02:26:18", "owner": "hokinlong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868827097236466, "text": "四方果！！！", "created_at": "2024-11-14T02:25:26", "owner": "hokinlong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025278404582287, "text": "huh?", "created_at": "2024-11-13T23:42:02", "owner": "vanxbirkeland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988359927752679, "text": "撈冷麵 旺角 某某商場 太耐冇去 😂\n好多 我無食過 屋企人唔比食 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T21:02:09", "owner": "zane0318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027735977425564, "text": "啲回憶湧曬上嚟", "created_at": "2024-11-13T17:35:32", "owner": "moses_06.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18258086476269340, "text": "恐龍谷依家仲食緊😋$4包", "created_at": "2024-11-13T13:43:48", "owner": "caitlynwww", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844066444358251, "text": "恐龍谷", "created_at": "2024-11-13T10:05:24", "owner": "tsh_lon36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884919130112880, "text": "好掛住啊🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-13T08:43:05", "owner": "lamirabridal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992986653565452, "text": "有啲已經停產，不是自願", "created_at": "2024-11-13T02:28:19", "owner": "kensica555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382890847096129, "text": "32歲的我\n當年5香口膠結識咗一位短暫嘅女友🙂，嗰陣啲人買開哈密瓜或者士多啤梨嗰個香口膠\n我就買咗新嘢 5香口膠", "created_at": "2024-11-13T00:16:45", "owner": "andrew_ar.on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042961387937039, "text": "淨係記得爸爸唔俾買媽咪麵因為好冇益😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T21:46:05", "owner": "erica.5976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050503654994028, "text": "頂 喊左", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:09:29", "owner": "fa.cheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050937658970603, "text": "第一個係咩嚟㗎唔記得咗叫咩喇😂", "created_at": "2024-11-12T14:59:23", "owner": "amour_chat_naturel_et", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136079050367220, "text": "@sweetpotatoxxx", "created_at": "2024-11-12T14:31:17", "owner": "wai_tik0422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911706649041278, "text": "全部都食過", "created_at": "2024-11-12T14:10:17", "owner": "mangobbbbbbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066271141663709, "text": "原來90後開始老，高達磁石好似係尋日發生嘅事咁", "created_at": "2024-11-12T07:23:17", "owner": "hk_hin2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169295152313646, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-11-12T05:20:01", "owner": "patricklkl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988256688735506, "text": "西九龍5樓6樓，有間車仔檔仲有得夾糖，好鬼平🔥👏", "created_at": "2024-11-12T05:05:14", "owner": "_5am.papa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134064193371839, "text": "@xela._.nuwgnohgnehc", "created_at": "2024-11-11T17:51:45", "owner": "wai.chun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18379826578101697, "text": "有啲唔係話唔買嚟食而係搵唔返😢", "created_at": "2024-11-11T15:34:46", "owner": "ctc95314_69", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902167210071285, "text": "有啲佢無出咪無得再買番黎食", "created_at": "2024-11-11T15:05:41", "owner": "leungching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18260001553301736, "text": "其實一個問題好想求有人解答到就係，好想食夾糖嘅薄荷熊仔🥲有冇人有門路提供", "created_at": "2024-11-11T13:17:57", "owner": "candysyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283788316241356, "text": "茶字典唔明點解要停產", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:53:53", "owner": "wilson141724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050021161982780, "text": "封面嗰盒香口膠係咪停產👀", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:50:49", "owner": "_shiutw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377263423109915, "text": "@ywc_1005", "created_at": "2024-11-11T09:19:40", "owner": "boris.to.world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060307741796096, "text": "茶字典堅正😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-11T07:39:08", "owner": "imnotony._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039349367517885, "text": "就算我得10歲，但係我而家搬咗去美國，我都覺得呢啲有啲嘢好好食，同好掛住佢食", "created_at": "2024-11-11T07:14:28", "owner": "adrian_ma_hk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18258704545252729, "text": "上邊啲嘢仲有得買？😢❤️🙌🔥👏😮", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:55:02", "owner": "fung.wing.chung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895795726095739, "text": "超人魷魚絲❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-11T06:21:16", "owner": "hokto_ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011333396453005, "text": "5香口膠真係正", "created_at": "2024-11-11T01:06:52", "owner": "blanc6633", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026234273210377, "text": "個set gundam 磁貼以前係儲晒成set🙌🏻仲有奇趣杯每次都好期待抽到邊隻", "created_at": "2024-11-11T00:56:50", "owner": "kyccheung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042718307177533, "text": "@szechingkwan_marco 童年", "created_at": "2024-11-11T00:29:46", "owner": "brobig1511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006132293680794, "text": "有冇人食過營養豆", "created_at": "2024-11-10T22:07:56", "owner": "yy_alan903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031584560115459, "text": "澳洲有得食", "created_at": "2024-11-10T20:44:53", "owner": "bryan_w0914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022261094290132, "text": "仲有阿波蘿孖條", "created_at": "2024-11-10T18:11:44", "owner": "tinoiwg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023375453578486, "text": "當年食5金香口膠玩吹到波😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-10T18:05:04", "owner": "kwai_chung_media", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18005287904503182, "text": "四方啫喱真係童年必食好懷念。。可惜😢", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:43:21", "owner": "yu.sugarglider_sister", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468725197017984, "text": "好似上到中學就冇咗", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:32:59", "owner": "pky_fighter", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18356338462184155, "text": "高達磁石貼齊set\n超人襟章有五兄弟，原裝冇改過\nD怪獸拎曬去彈", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:32:24", "owner": "tommyhuikl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055324099921297, "text": "鹹蛋超人魷魚絲？！", "created_at": "2024-11-10T17:23:28", "owner": "timtim.818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867870019270214, "text": "藍力居然冇出現", "created_at": "2024-11-10T16:43:19", "owner": "hwh1123", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["拼湊香港童年", "accent", "accenthkg"]},
