5", "owner": "honeyroastedris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051077450110602, "text": "I don’t get it??", "created_at": "2025-01-15T04:43:54", "owner": "butters.maui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925675701899076, "text": "ISSO É O VERDADEIRO HEAR ME OUT", "created_at": "2025-01-14T23:18:26", "owner": "giobobinhaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093347776462560, "text": "The fist has Runpelstilsky in It 💀", "created_at": "2025-01-14T22:47:26", "owner": "diegoogarciaa_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005614709705658, "text": "Am i too old to understand this?", "created_at": "2025-01-14T19:26:20", "owner": "korhanoviic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022053581369367, "text": "I don’t get the concept", "created_at": "2025-01-14T13:29:27", "owner": "luckynumber__555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965282286715812, "text": "Wait,Mr.Bean?kkkkkk", "created_at": "2025-01-13T16:46:00", "owner": "arthur.viana.3114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084251770505569, "text": "Ight so I did the first one on my friend and she said I was stalking and harassing her family (don’t try at home kids)", "created_at": "2025-01-13T10:24:08", "owner": "lilac____lmao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933494226986092, "text": "The concept of TIME 😭", "created_at": "2025-01-12T21:15:58", "owner": "full.of_absurdity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939570891955364, "text": "CHATGPT😭👍🏾", "created_at": "2025-01-12T01:16:56", "owner": "cr1ssy__.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040006652461331, "text": "WHY IS NO ONE TALKING ABOUT WHAT HE SAID ABOUT SALLY", "created_at": "2025-01-09T17:04:04", "owner": "leafeebee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082650541573164, "text": "Is the second one death the kid?", "created_at": "2025-01-09T13:19:33", "owner": "glutinous_cat_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024196751629777, "text": "Not the chat gpt one💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-01-09T12:45:43", "owner": "dariaa_4373", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074037529716667, "text": "Anyone who puts Pokémon on their cake needs to touch grass. ESPECIALLY my boi Mewtwo.", "created_at": "2025-01-08T21:18:30", "owner": "krys_