{"media_id": 3499865037362192539, "shortcode": "DCSBLVZyGCb", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCSBLVZyGCb/", "taken_at": "2024-11-12T18:34:44", "caption": "Parenting made easy\n#lifehack #reels #video #funny #viral #wtf #instadaily", "owner_username": "liquor_and_deadlifts", "owner_id": "2260550615", "likes": 67874, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0283_DCSBLVZyGCb\\DCSBLVZyGCb_20241112_183444.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17900941179135745, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-02-26T06:44:53", "owner": "clearshine._.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982929618802174, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-22T01:35:46", "owner": "godofkingsbraxton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118720693430885, "text": "I need 50", "created_at": "2025-02-18T20:58:09", "owner": "6_yvng.pyro_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911874820075353, "text": "Was that Tomar", "created_at": "2025-02-10T20:52:06", "owner": "thethirdchasist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366182035189980, "text": "Can we use it on students?", "created_at": "2025-01-09T08:13:41", "owner": "danaaljaafreh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072037348634435, "text": "Ok thus is definitely not what to do.", "created_at": "2024-12-29T00:14:26", "owner": "momma_of_1_lilboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972380208807145, "text": "I've tried every store I can think of to find this stuff...\nNothin. But I discovered a shovel to the face works just as well😭", "created_at": "2024-12-27T11:57:27", "owner": "_.gdawg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103015939467694, "text": "“It’s never been so quiet around here” meanwhile child deadasleep on the TOP of the couch as if she just stacked em all there for the meantime. 😭😭😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-26T03:30:28", "owner": "savagexsavanah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952067820880731, "text": "No this is Patrick", "created_at": "2024-12-23T18:33:08", "owner": "localbadmon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080003782592931, "text": "@trina_barron22", "created_at": "2024-12-23T15:31:21", "owner": "madness3737", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047101834916863, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T11:58:24", "owner": "michaelpaul.texas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886381849169419, "text": "It’s giving Casey Anthony", "created_at": "2024-12-21T06:55:08", "owner": "jason_stahlman93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265805197252238, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T16:16:14", "owner": "ofherlovenightways_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847419253347550, "text": "\"i was beginning to think adoption was the only way out\"", "created_at": "2024-12-20T13:40:13", "owner": "jayl_09_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035287307119995, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T10:08:42", "owner": "fullychaser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033357311382555, "text": "But guns are the permanent solution", "created_at": "2024-12-20T05:47:35", "owner": "y4sh1248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155828221339002, "text": "Damn I've remembered this 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T02:54:53", "owner": "stitch_62677", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119939566416990, "text": "We need this @sndyslly", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:58:49", "owner": "ghifarihah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108291079445758, "text": "If this isnt good enough try their holosilence featuring cyclone B", "created_at": "2024-12-19T23:04:07", "owner": "entity_nr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295344652230242, "text": "This is hilarious but the funniest part for me was when the dog fell off the couch and Military trained scientist doctors from NASA😂", "created_at": "2024-12-19T21:12:11", "owner": "nypizza420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100084738433879, "text": "I need 12 bottles plis", "created_at": "2024-12-19T20:54:51", "owner": "mictlantecuhtli_psicologo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071969260641129, "text": "@daz_black", "created_at": "2024-12-19T20:38:30", "owner": "cass_marie3116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039394535255766, "text": "Chloroform actually takes up to 15 minutes to knock you out...", "created_at": "2024-12-19T18:16:46", "owner": "kawaii_shoujo_jenni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950948787883005, "text": "i need this too", "created_at": "2024-12-19T16:48:56", "owner": "aliusamaasif13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849995611327448, "text": "@lovingmoments.judith  ook mijn algo is verrot 😆", "created_at": "2024-12-19T12:31:25", "owner": "van.sam.fotografie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032637062384888, "text": "HAHAHHAHAHHAHA", "created_at": "2024-12-19T11:15:27", "owner": "leoioiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475070959045700, "text": "😮Kidnappers sectretly joined high society😂", "created_at": "2024-12-19T09:54:55", "owner": "rajeevk386", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18121276330407436, "text": "sprayer is in the bottle wrong way!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:13:35", "owner": "slushysquid300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055061683982689, "text": "This what happens when TV…….", "created_at": "2024-12-18T22:37:01", "owner": "wayment.thats.tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945534792791388, "text": "@octodude_", "created_at": "2024-12-18T18:58:23", "owner": "andy_scaleluna729", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848812228365151, "text": "\"No more Tantrum\"", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:30:55", "owner": "purnomo.aji70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878442247125296, "text": "😂 easy @iqbalwjyd", "created_at": "2024-12-18T12:44:41", "owner": "sarah_zafira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057127480929044, "text": "@amy.kincaid.lmt 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T12:04:44", "owner": "mgccunning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038911850365096, "text": "@lianne.x.xx", "created_at": "2024-12-18T10:58:48", "owner": "ewoutbos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014694491652292, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T09:18:30", "owner": "just_noone_out_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017081258403631, "text": "What’s with the spoiler title? Should’ve left it alone to hear it as a surprise.", "created_at": "2024-12-13T17:29:29", "owner": "musgravey_train", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935250087956338, "text": "Does this hurt the child", "created_at": "2024-12-07T22:51:08", "owner": "detailer_chris_seven_o_five", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055778818755923, "text": "Dr.Carl Hewish : \" This is chloroform \"", "created_at": "2024-12-06T02:41:00", "owner": "_just_the_anurag_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955694658847922, "text": "How about not stealing content from others? Or AT LEAST crediting the original maker.", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:09:39", "owner": "kepee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475026607036603, "text": "The long version is better", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:02:51", "owner": "wrenchs_repairs_n_prospecting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049447808053256, "text": "@@edob7 @digitalbath05", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:58:07", "owner": "drjoe33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097349611484685, "text": "DR: \"this is chloroform\" me: oh so it DOES work", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:00:44", "owner": "xasaman", "likes": 60}, {"id": 18050437268060497, "text": "Oh great هاذ الناقص", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:38:07", "owner": "esamawi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017308658367754, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T19:08:51", "owner": "xxjaminimajxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045305705322869, "text": "@ellmcs @n1coles1obhan", "created_at": "2024-11-27T17:26:22", "owner": "ryan_feather_not_dot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014661011406099, "text": "I don’t have kids yet. Does it store well for future use? If so, take my money.", "created_at": "2024-11-27T15:18:11", "owner": "troy_massey_cpt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065218171688216, "text": "The above sentence is spoiler, thanks", "created_at": "2024-11-26T12:43:37", "owner": "pittabio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033978398096677, "text": "i want it", "created_at": "2024-11-26T09:48:37", "owner": "gxng.suuni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068111827659022, "text": "Older ads were sooo unhinged... but so much better than what we see today (at least you had only ONE ad before each video)", "created_at": "2024-11-26T05:55:32", "owner": "sousa_wousa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385238821103589, "text": "report this now", "created_at": "2024-11-25T19:14:11", "owner": "ryanchumleyclark4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068773876641494, "text": "Sounds like a great idea, with the best of intentions ! What could possibly go wrong ? Turns out…", "created_at": "2024-11-25T11:39:51", "owner": "aymerizk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17883017973170083, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T05:00:12", "owner": "pulkitrawasthi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275487499300360, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T02:26:31", "owner": "m.i_gonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890405311120594, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T20:24:42", "owner": "danxam_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067994476656750, "text": "I need that for me", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:38:01", "owner": "tippsyhippie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293450380228936, "text": "Almost as good as a little Benadryl mixed in with their Kool-Aid", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:10:48", "owner": "jayecrues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261152158265865, "text": "must have!", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:38:07", "owner": "aeriq_kaisair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955303191847855, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T10:53:44", "owner": "shubhu.0031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474088075026832, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-24T09:09:18", "owner": "a_laughing_man_1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022759877305812, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T08:32:52", "owner": "fitveron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013004558451041, "text": "new sleep aid for me", "created_at": "2024-11-24T04:03:48", "owner": "matthew_michael_schultz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082810276545339, "text": "Only allowed in Alabama", "created_at": "2024-11-24T00:25:59", "owner": "mrbrandino593", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305943700206972, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-23T18:36:07", "owner": "fun_in_the_shun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020465318330382, "text": "Silenced spray 🫢", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:31:36", "owner": "a_monkey_guy_80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911366815044524, "text": "I bought „Chloroform Kids“, also very good..", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:45:01", "owner": "de_goethe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020328656330574, "text": "Same as I thought, not for whipping😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:12:26", "owner": "mtea01_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038163194465673, "text": "The Casey Anthony special!", "created_at": "2024-11-22T15:29:19", "owner": "overlordfrosty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072975613625344, "text": "الي مافهم هذا مخدر😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-22T09:18:17", "owner": "riro_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053187847779528, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-22T01:36:42", "owner": "bbumbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043774843924999, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-21T16:29:19", "owner": "mixo_maringa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027374321429751, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-21T03:48:39", "owner": "wheelz__92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082147072557434, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T21:04:02", "owner": "clobosquin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044152367475376, "text": "Alexa add nap time spray to Amazon cart 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T14:43:06", "owner": "myss.undastood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063888394700368, "text": "@__sania_ 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T13:46:18", "owner": "bis_iqbal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970206975802177, "text": "Its as if chloroform was an American pharmaceuticals company's product", "created_at": "2024-11-20T13:39:02", "owner": "kfeer_blau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051382039806330, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T10:32:05", "owner": "0_s_i_v_a__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024255140564108, "text": "Pure comedy 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T08:52:29", "owner": "ke3w1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014962838397116, "text": "Does this work for adults too? I have a few in mind", "created_at": "2024-11-20T05:55:03", "owner": "alexvenividivici", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18273577693219971, "text": "hello, casey anthony", "created_at": "2024-11-20T00:01:34", "owner": "y.asswater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912087997041939, "text": "Last time I saw this, I laughed so hard I fell off my dinosaur. This and jigsaw roommate are classics", "created_at": "2024-11-19T22:17:22", "owner": "buckaroocowdell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963967806703171, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T17:34:36", "owner": "deepakanishkumar.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18465043993011850, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T15:41:50", "owner": "james_bond_alla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913940023033644, "text": "This product was made for kidnapping", "created_at": "2024-11-19T13:25:21", "owner": "__the_fo0l__", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18284147563168748, "text": "@adarsh_here_on_insta bhai iske owner apun hu honge 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T10:22:08", "owner": "azesa_ka_malik", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18022583354305719, "text": "Wild", "created_at": "2024-11-19T09:34:06", "owner": "therealanthonyblume", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301920994204847, "text": "👀..... This is a chloroform", "created_at": "2024-11-19T07:34:36", "owner": "vedikesh_lanagaraj_1421", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18103461397454951, "text": "Place it over your child's cry hole 😶😶😶", "created_at": "2024-11-19T03:47:02", "owner": "wilted__heart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069185536649897, "text": "This is wrong, creative, and hilarious all at the same time.", "created_at": "2024-11-18T18:17:19", "owner": "vicky_htx_rn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020484782554335, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-18T16:52:55", "owner": "pretty_calm_storm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028317938597267, "text": "This is savage 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-18T16:13:05", "owner": "skk13162424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949125261891439, "text": "How about not have kids 🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-18T15:13:02", "owner": "antisocialems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467590102006153, "text": "2 under 2…….where can I get this? Loooooooool", "created_at": "2024-11-18T12:44:55", "owner": "the_flying_fool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168580765313936, "text": "Chloroform doesn’t knock people out like they say in the movies n such it takes a few mins", "created_at": "2024-11-18T01:13:17", "owner": "savagesilverback", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312452497162610, "text": "Classic", "created_at": "2024-11-17T23:37:14", "owner": "p_mc_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953890416745625, "text": "Hahahhahahahha", "created_at": "2024-11-17T23:23:15", "owner": "brucebomfim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955262748845392, "text": "🫠🫠🫠", "created_at": "2024-11-17T17:55:42", "owner": "my.real.life.fitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978429069638073, "text": "Contrail conspiracy formula that is needed", "created_at": "2024-11-17T17:54:19", "owner": "james.brackett.946", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047895964869007, "text": "\"Military trained Scientist Doctors from NASA\" 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-17T16:39:58", "owner": "managing_sanity_duels", "likes": 1188}, {"id": 18085558123469780, "text": "Don't pull a casey anthony 😐", "created_at": "2024-11-17T15:42:11", "owner": "excuse_my_profanity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043350500124305, "text": "I remember when this came out", "created_at": "2024-11-17T14:47:09", "owner": "metal_head_monkey", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["lifehack", "reels", "video", "funny", "viral", "wtf", "instadaily"]},
