4344914, "text": "GIVE ME TUNA🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-04-01T15:33:45", "owner": "arnelle_alina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888394657229975, "text": "My Jaw drop 💀", "created_at": "2025-04-01T14:44:43", "owner": "takadadana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496579165055049, "text": "Ooh 🫦", "created_at": "2025-04-01T10:54:00", "owner": "secretman_sun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063754565508470, "text": "LADY GIVE ME TUNA 🗣️🐟🐟", "created_at": "2025-04-01T07:20:57", "owner": "carlos_sr72783", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890560663212564, "text": "why is she american and not british", "created_at": "2025-04-01T07:05:39", "owner": "innerilllness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052959491241803, "text": "Oouuo 🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-04-01T01:47:09", "owner": "carsonhilley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872342479326628, "text": "Ouooouuu🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-03-31T22:05:01", "owner": "chrizz__02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876228091203901, "text": "🤔 ->😶", "created_at": "2025-03-31T16:49:32", "owner": "eckard7770", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042421310423594, "text": "These get more brutal every time", "created_at": "2025-03-31T14:51:09", "owner": "iemandondezeplaneet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098530663524386, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-03-31T09:00:45", "owner": "ahmed_belfakih1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027876878401569, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-31T02:50:57", "owner": "aj130306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025292597443606, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-31T02:50:38", "owner": "aj130306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022592075667301, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-31T01:45:12", "owner": "sway305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066749734747034, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-31T00:52:39", "owner": "nobuo_meiji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080383129677697, "text": "That’s what I told the judge but still got arrested", "created_at": "2025-03-30T23:55:04", "owner": "carculture647", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063166430483737, "text": "I miss her voice tbh, hopefully she will be heard in gta6 too", "created_at": "2025-03-30T23:30:12", "owner": "stinks_67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928492836915972, "text": "😮💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-30T21:06:38", "owner": "coop._.wichman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098978647520657, "text": "😨", "created_at": "2025-03-30T12:53:03", "owner": "weorcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072346435846680, "text": "More like a far-out west audience. 🤐", "created_at": "2025-03-30T12:08:08", "owner": "avgas_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073056505837415, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-30T07:33:46", "owner": "rahul_nirhali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125387212424995, "text": "Glory to romania", "created_at": "2025-03-29T13:15:40", "owner": "sarmiswilldoit", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081638974725583, "text": "Rn jealous how we get school shootings and yall get streetcars", "created_at": "2025-03-29T02:09:38", "owner": "jowen346", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064932796785083, "text": "It’s for Americans like myself", "created_at": "2025-03-29T01:54:31", "owner": "jakedub.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846597445424693, "text": "All the other Kids with pumped up kicks... 🎶", "created_at": "2025-03-28T00:48:01", "owner": "lucascamposclips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074445412828680, "text": "That was so dark the police started shooting it", "created_at": "2025-03-27T21:52:40", "owner": "alex_burkell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071732011874203, "text": "The sequence makes me think otherwise", "created_at": "2025-03-27T16:57:40", "owner": "ammonmwandoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983699499665780, "text": "It can't be too soon when it's a commen thing that happens 😭", "created_at": "2025-03-27T16:34:13", "owner": "nightblink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064139467814823, "text": "That joke was mind-blowing💀", "created_at": "2025-03-27T07:11:25", "owner": "avinash_kr2509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942219957979262, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-27T02:38:29", "owner": "iel.zantua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058598720084350, "text": "Not da 2x combo joke", "created_at": "2025-03-27T00:09:26", "owner": "1ts_dat_kid_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904869325131039, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-26T18:17:18", "owner": "amy_b4951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947160498826808, "text": "O magazine mean 🔫 mag “aimed” st a younger audience 😭", "created_at": "2025-03-25T23:48:34", "owner": "jester_furz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095512597480921, "text": "Reload the mag into a drum mag", "created_at": "2025-03-25T11:59:09", "owner": "edcccw41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061697071996293, "text": "Thinking relaze dark darker thé music 💀😂", "created_at": "2025-03-25T11:38:30", "owner": "_.elinqqq._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899430424159299, "text": "GTA Radio is just 💀", "created_at": "2025-03-24T23:03:09", "owner": "stefan_bruetsch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062352592954800, "text": "Didn't get it first for a second thought, then realized😂", "created_at": "2025-03-24T18:57:24", "owner": "mini.ini4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073573873657856, "text": "We didn't expect the second joke, like we didn't expect the second tower💀", "created_at": "2025-03-24T17:35:11", "owner": "anoniem_4jud4h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140527657389632, "text": "I-", "created_at": "2025-03-24T16:38:12", "owner": "pink._.cosmic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055123847130134, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-24T09:23:10", "owner": "pz_kpfw_v_ausf_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102340798502232, "text": "Aimed at an American audience*", "created_at": "2025-03-24T07:23:38", "owner": "amauaizad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037581956407038, "text": "I listened, scrolled, got it, came back flabbergasted 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-24T02:19:39", "owner": "alemill125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138948871381356, "text": "Who Lumber tycoon 2 in 2025 😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-23T21:13:37", "owner": "rudynick22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870141277243979, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-03-23T18:09:10", "owner": "noah_a_richardson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921343405051459, "text": "American joke 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-22T19:28:48", "owner": "glasgow_67_champions1", "