{"media_id": 3506288996039455513, "shortcode": "DCo10PIyvMZ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCo10PIyvMZ/", "taken_at": "2024-11-21T15:27:13", "caption": "【瞄橋位呀】\n🔫玩過食雞嘅朋友仔，見到個post嘅留言👀配埋 #三哥 呢條經典soundbite，可能都會覺得幾好笑！😂\n\nCredit: 情場黑武士、20CM𣎴含頭、黑色賢者\nhttps://lih.kg/3826285\n- 分享自 LIHKG 討論區 @lihkg.forum \n\n#苗僑偉 #瞄橋位 #食雞 #PUBG #PUBGMOBILE", "owner_username": "jackzblog", "owner_id": "2080049399", "likes": 13925, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0286_DCo10PIyvMZ\\DCo10PIyvMZ_20241121_152713.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18084999523578959, "text": "@wykna_ let’s gooo", "created_at": "2025-02-18T07:40:21", "owner": "elaine_kwok_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939655077829256, "text": "@mic_lyt @an_son_y  我地苗橋位", "created_at": "2025-01-06T16:02:54", "owner": "mic_tyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894774403107403, "text": "@_sohai._.jai 我上橋頂", "created_at": "2025-01-04T00:25:58", "owner": "jason.0918_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068510623689421, "text": "@_jeffrey_.so", "created_at": "2025-01-01T14:31:54", "owner": "h1n50n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118476088416869, "text": "@lcw.0202 搵日一齊瞄橋位🦦", "created_at": "2024-12-18T06:28:35", "owner": "quar_616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077083510607132, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T05:55:38", "owner": "yuenyuen927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033444803457476, "text": "笑得好開心😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T02:38:00", "owner": "akaglialratmeme", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18014636474444428, "text": "@lang_mij  @lam_816 駛唔駛守？唔洗手會好邋遢", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:47:02", "owner": "ngcm1998", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18025919705543584, "text": "@sharonsoong", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:37:58", "owner": "puishanan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937700148946957, "text": "Pubg bridge accident 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-27T04:55:16", "owner": "_that_david_cameron_", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18085437607548360, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-21T22:37:11", "owner": "heimishpink", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17987102828685895, "t