{"media_id": 3504710728979242036, "shortcode": "DCjO9bZTtw0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCjO9bZTtw0/", "taken_at": "2024-11-19T11:04:28", "caption": "鎖定H.Club，給你意想不到的高端知識！\n\n#rich #奢侈品知識 #luxury #travel #旅遊  #歐洲旅遊 #富豪", "owner_username": "h.club_tw", "owner_id": "68761851796", "likes": 34846, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0287_DCjO9bZTtw0\\DCjO9bZTtw0_20241119_110428.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18082000516548717, "text": "謝謝大數據看得起我，真的", "created_at": "2024-11-21T02:46:16", "owner": "arrow0291", "likes": 3119}, {"id": 18054373682101138, "text": "不錯，可惜這輩子不知道能不能有這種煩惱去開戶", "created_at": "2025-02-04T02:51:17", "owner": "wootaipei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108142411458260, "text": "买比特币冷钱包里就是了 整这些花里胡哨的东西", "created_at": "2025-01-25T02:59:57", "owner": "vionzoro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056445634950996, "text": "藏太久有點找不到我的資產", "created_at": "2025-01-23T03:33:59", "owner": "eunice.hqy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335407477155649, "text": "引流錯誤", "created_at": "2025-01-11T13:01:11", "owner": "po_yi_lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957561744750403, "text": "謝謝👏🙏", "created_at": "2025-01-07T16:11:54", "owner": "chianghw51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055868797964351, "text": "@ivyyy129", "created_at": "2025-01-03T17:14:57", "owner": "117hei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048926957511240, "text": "新加坡就算了吧", "created_at": "2025-01-01T15:38:49", "owner": "bloods2900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916346002023938, "text": "意思是叫我們去瑞士劫富濟貧嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-28T08:14:05", "owner": "tongdenielowo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918234871013808, "text": "謝謝大數據看得起我", "created_at": "2024-12-28T02:24:22", "owner": "alanna.kangya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472114330041439, "text": "謝謝演算法，從明天起繼續窮", "created_at": "2024-12-26T17:24:17", "owner": "guabaooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006795059692688, "text": "富豪如何隱藏資產？全轉給我就沒這煩惱了", "created_at": "2024-12-22T15:25:08", "owner": "timmy12.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056975248757033, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-15T07:29:10", "owner": "boscoyong_v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863188882224374, "text": "@lintingshu @afra_yc 為什麼我這個窮鬼會看到這個，我昨晚薯條加大太奢侈了？", "created_at": "2024-12-10T12:23:14", "owner": "aliel_ruuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321577192090513, "text": "手机爹你又把我带哪儿了？？？？", "created_at": "2024-12-09T06:01:20", "owner": "izx.fy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082017724500136, "text": "消除競爭對手，公海", "created_at": "2024-12-08T23:57:23", "owner": "kgb4823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990806550599072, "text": "收藏下來 未來我用的到的", "created_at": "2024-12-08T12:57:08", "owner": "daniell._.0601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007776821665059, "text": "教一篇置產文 我訂閱年曆690", "created_at": "2024-12-08T06:54:44", "owner": "srimantramaha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890766250131505, "text": "演算法：我沒出錯阿，純粹無聊想搞你們而已😁", "created_at": "2024-12-07T13:26:01", "owner": "john0135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124896508364167, "text": "台灣企業基金會真的不少～😆", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:43:42", "owner": "chestermakoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856809634264576, "text": "這就是拉開貧富差距的原因了 誰說每個富人都會剝削員工那麼壞呢", "created_at": "2024-12-03T12:20:37", "owner": "pho.selfsecret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051314434954591, "text": "@zerotailfish 来学做有钱人", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:09:57", "owner": "yiqing.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871180210238015, "text": "最重要的就是你要成為富豪，當你有錢，銀行會很樂意教你這些，別忘記能開私人銀行的絕對比你早很多年成富豪", "created_at": "2024-12-01T13:08:48", "owner": "no_pain_no_gain_oic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141639358323233, "text": "应该往中国放，全扣下了就", "created_at": "2024-12-01T12:12:15", "owner": "garyzhangofficiall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049410869061333, "text": "我的兩百塊也可以分散隱藏在這些地方嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-01T05:07:41", "owner": "c27byoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852882475339643, "text": "方法我知道了 只差財產到位", "created_at": "2024-11-29T05:56:36", "owner": "matt.881214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346587724122486, "text": "為什麼我會看到這個", "created_at": "2024-11-29T02:55:56", "owner": "nicole_hochiani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063617350695546, "text": "Welcome to TRW 錯頻了 我以為是Andrew T8😂", "created_at": "2024-11-28T16:21:58", "owner": "chihungyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054901954749911, "text": "Cook island trust fund 是不是也不錯", "created_at": "2024-11-27T18:32:55", "owner": "bosyo__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470056828024917, "text": "如何安全的隱藏資產\n：沒有資產", "created_at": "2024-11-26T22:51:36", "owner": "_kj_41", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971150655795973, "text": "欸不是 我轉這麼多 大數據還知道… 賺比我多的人 會看到怎樣的影片", "created_at": "2024-11-26T19:29:58", "owner": "dr_ian__8888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861883321221550, "text": "希望我這輩子需要用到這些東西", "created_at": "2024-11-26T11:44:15", "owner": "hhhhhhh77ao", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17948150630906633, "text": "@azhi_0126 演算法推我這個衝三小", "created_at": "2024-11-26T11:32:02", "owner": "cg___yu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037181969199117, "text": "@li2zhi2", "created_at": "2024-11-25T19:28:42", "owner": "baozzib", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085019128530033, "text": "我啊 我隱藏到到現在都找不到我的資產去哪了", "created_at": "2024-11-25T15:37:57", "owner": "_zxrr_05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047569195882594, "text": "谢谢，希望有一天我能用到🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-25T15:09:21", "owner": "jc_alexbaker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996690912551917, "text": "現在五塊資產可以買棒棒冰嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-25T11:33:03", "owner": "cm_9427", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914280847019348, "text": "學會了 哪裡領錢", "created_at": "2024-11-25T10:51:15", "owner": "sumi_eternallazy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872916133145357, "text": "鑰匙拿到了\n門在哪", "created_at": "2024-11-25T10:27:10", "owner": "ddddlllldd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883198186161113, "text": "謝謝演算法", "created_at": "2024-11-25T10:00:30", "owner": "f.l.of_930", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044211290128098, "text": "謝謝大數據看得起我😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:10:56", "owner": "sophia.lee356", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18284598985215023, "text": "演算法對我是不是有誤解\n這大數據時代是暗指\n我要中樂透了嗎🥹", "created_at": "2024-11-25T05:09:17", "owner": "august.hsu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046910954477271, "text": "我藏的好到我自己都沒找到", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:40:47", "owner": "0311felix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18249127783263028, "text": "@kevinlutolf", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:30:21", "owner": "jerryten0218", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052066099947674, "text": "我有100左右 從哪個部分開始？", "created_at": "2024-11-24T17:23:26", "owner": "fkwkxke.11234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120189538404944, "text": "有用的資訊，沒用的是我", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:48:36", "owner": "the_things_i_want_you_know", "likes": 73}, {"id": 18039019841210256, "text": "學會了 只差暴富了", "created_at": "2024-11-24T16:36:26", "owner": "dj900117", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040189718220516, "text": "等我爸跟我攤牌", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:22:51", "owner": "orpoww", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049775414050741, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:00:52", "owner": "yiyunchiang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855866134265487, "text": "連我都找不到我的資產", "created_at": "2024-11-24T11:57:26", "owner": "kyle0203_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17902714662072904, "text": "我的財富很自由，他們都到處跑不待在我錢包銀行戶口", "created_at": "2024-11-24T10:47:50", "owner": "philip_lam__", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18017533625358286, "text": "好險 我不用這麼麻煩 我的會自己藏起來但他們藏太好 我都找不到", "created_at": "2024-11-24T09:50:05", "owner": "yo0405yo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029473391170981, "text": "@cm39pb", "created_at": "2024-11-24T08:38:05", "owner": "cm39pb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872452972229389, "text": "學會了 就差錢", "created_at": "2024-11-24T05:59:12", "owner": "zhxnll_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035023133362382, "text": "我財富自由了，他們自由到都不待在我的户頭裡", "created_at": "2024-11-24T05:40:01", "owner": "morries114514", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18044320504933546, "text": "學到了 現在只差資產", "created_at": "2024-11-24T05:36:19", "owner": "niccayhhk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025502216611963, "text": "我隱藏的那麼好連我自己都不知道，數據卻知道 怕😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T02:00:54", "owner": "hsingju0210", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069527473644184, "text": "講得好像我有什麼資產可以隱藏", "created_at": "2024-11-24T01:58:10", "owner": "li7.qi._.2019424_", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18054664657765596, "text": "演算法是想羞辱我？？😢", "created_at": "2024-11-24T01:14:06", "owner": "liu_s1118", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18304818709205666, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-23T20:20:19", "owner": "luckhunt168051788", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059987785872335, "text": "謝謝演算法⋯ 可是現在的我 連資產藏到哪都不知道😢", "created_at": "2024-11-23T16:55:56", "owner": "alina_62_liu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037927793254056, "text": "我的財富是自由的，不能受限在任何地方", "created_at": "2024-11-23T16:50:35", "owner": "chang_yeeder", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17914341734935523, "text": "給我看這個幹嘛", "created_at": "2024-11-23T15:15:17", "owner": "duang.ywx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052480258946377, "text": "@bbbbb_yuen", "created_at": "2024-11-23T14:09:23", "owner": "velour__s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18470980084031046, "text": "@eethanamor 我的IG開始推這些給我 但我沒有錢🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:00:36", "owner": "c_sleepisgood", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18348540712192034, "text": "大數據覺得我值得投資😍", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:23:29", "owner": "_meng1014_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17886006078152396, "text": "@a0989352499 你會用到先收藏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:59:01", "owner": "ericniu316", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861578281225940, "text": "謝謝，200塊剛好不知道可以存哪裡感謝告知🙂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:51:38", "owner": "billy_foodie_0922", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900426946085243, "text": "有誰可以說明一下 為什麼是這些國家嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:15:03", "owner": "offvhghg", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18335252863199528, "text": "那麼麻煩？幸好我沒有這個煩惱", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:08:38", "owner": "chengweixuxu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903786502073000, "text": "@athanwyk", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:24:05", "owner": "reaganyau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006773180502058, "text": "謝謝大數據這麼看得起我", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:46:45", "owner": "ludan_0202", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17997336218535260, "text": "既然你觉得有一天我会用上这些, 承你吉言🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-23T03:46:55", "owner": "cheng7299", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043953520913906, "text": "看來我藏的很好，從出生到現在都還沒找到過", "created_at": "2024-11-23T03:08:51", "owner": "zergling_73", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065483158703033, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:50:50", "owner": "lililiu9219", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18276113191222580, "text": "謝謝H.club 給我用不到的高端知識❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:02:25", "owner": "tcc.28", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17888018700134019, "text": "感動感動，知識不斷成長，財富尚未增長🥲", "created_at": "2024-11-22T19:13:33", "owner": "justcarol1010", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18294190303231719, "text": "洗黑錢: hi", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:42:49", "owner": "221.aiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858861898242512, "text": "我薪水兩萬八最喜歡看這種的了", "created_at": "2024-11-22T15:40:13", "owner": "wushih", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945413487913414, "text": "我的資產隱藏的超好 連我都找不到", "created_at": "2024-11-22T14:35:00", "owner": "an_n.mi919", "likes": 1807}, {"id": 17903642456982216, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-22T14:34:49", "owner": "rita_ms0801", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049251551506669, "text": "謝謝大數據在我吃麥當勞的時候讓我看這個😂", "created_at": "2024-11-22T12:49:09", "owner": "anisaugusto", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18144126796352513, "text": "太實用的資訊了，謝謝！", "created_at": "2024-11-22T12:45:07", "owner": "beatrix_0623", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18155219545331812, "text": "看來大數據還需要發展一陣子 我不應該看到這個", "created_at": "2024-11-22T12:27:35", "owner": "foodie.sakura", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18027765638425720, "text": "笑死，不用學這個我的錢自己就會消失了", "created_at": "2024-11-22T12:10:24", "owner": "magician_lunemo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852384169287543, "text": "怎么联系……，我要谢谢你这么看得起我", "created_at": "2024-11-22T08:05:58", "owner": "huanghaneu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049791745997892, "text": "巨無霸 薯條 分開買", "created_at": "2024-11-22T07:42:51", "owner": "tommy_macaronii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049187042054354, "text": "謝囉大數據，剩20我看手續費就沒了", "created_at": "2024-11-22T07:35:17", "owner": "alexander___0714", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046710206101385, "text": "解釋詳細得好像我有能力一樣", "created_at": "2024-11-22T06:34:51", "owner": "cholewis", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18058447537882805, "text": "好吧……中了3個", "created_at": "2024-11-22T06:08:33", "owner": "ryuuchi0622", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959810253831927, "text": "謝謝", "created_at": "2024-11-22T04:11:42", "owner": "frankfrank_freew", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17992095029583975, "text": "謝謝 這輩子有錢去瑞士嗎？不曉得", "created_at": "2024-11-22T04:04:14", "owner": "cr_an__an", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128372830377123, "text": "富豪為什麼還要逃稅…跟資產比，稅金根本九牛一毛吧…🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-22T01:48:11", "owner": "brian_yang_1992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103688644455452, "text": "我也要 我是億萬富豪", "created_at": "2024-11-21T23:48:08", "owner": "bnbnbnbntytytyty333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067807318669435, "text": "謝謝 我感覺我很快就用得到\n現在只差錢了", "created_at": "2024-11-21T21:44:02", "owner": "evil_xox", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18008450753490231, "text": "學會了，請問哪裡可以領錢成為富豪？", "created_at": "2024-11-21T18:34:27", "owner": "neroedward", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947715627879042, "text": "謝謝演算法肯定我的價值🥹", "created_at": "2024-11-21T17:47:30", "owner": "gdle197421", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18147162679349348, "text": "謝謝演算法，讓我了解到我一輩子都用不上", "created_at": "2024-11-21T16:44:19", "owner": "staytrance_wen", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083345956552975, "text": "瑞士銀行根本騙局，本人經驗", "created_at": "2024-11-21T15:48:25", "owner": "frank_zn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859904260284180, "text": "知道了，转账吧", "created_at": "2024-11-21T15:19:44", "owner": "kidninee", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["rich", "奢侈品知識", "luxury", "travel", "旅遊", "歐洲旅遊", "富豪"]},
