{"media_id": 3506544076059574718, "shortcode": "DCpv0I6yAG-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCpv0I6yAG-/", "taken_at": "2024-11-21T23:44:09", "caption": "Congratulations @ez664078 for receiving an offer from @officialuom to study Sociology We are immensely proud of your accomplishment!", "owner_username": "hbjclassof2025", "owner_id": "69414971922", "likes": 21, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0289_DCpv0I6yAG-\\DCpv0I6yAG-_20241121_234409.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17869014750246619", "text": "Twins", "created_at": "2024-11-24T00:01:37", "owner": "exusiai27", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18471012511029577", "text": "wow", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:26:21", "owner": "blg_doinb", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18054467437758084", "text": "rong roaaarrrrr🙌🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-22T03:52:54", "owner": "iamkaka_lykx", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18027145790229705", "text": "horanghae", "created_at": "2024-11-21T23:46:55", "owner": "shakexuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18034836080341246", "text": "❤❤❤", "created_at": "2024-11-21T23:44:30", "owner": "ez664078", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3501941750199243137, "shortcode": "DCZZXe8vFGB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCZZXe8vFGB/", "taken_at": "2024-11-15T15:20:10", "caption": "環保又好食!\n\n為了避免貨物在運送途中因碰撞損傷，店家經常在紙箱內放置緩衝物。然而，這些緩衝材料在收貨過後，往往只會被丟棄，甚少重用。日本就有企業看到商機，發明了可食用的緩衝物，讓緩衝材料不會在運送任務完成，就被當成垃圾棄掉。\n\n綜合報道，由高知縣地產外商公社所營運的「高知県産品データベース」的網站，有一種叫做「能吃的緩衝材」商品。而所謂能吃的緩衝物，其實就是由用膠袋裝著的鹹味爆谷。根據網站上的資料，產品由一間有多年歷史名叫「 Azechi Shokuhin」的食品公司所研發，介紹指「雖然為了保護貨品，緩衝物是不可或缺，但用完就會變成垃圾。這個『可食用的緩衝材』由爆谷製成，如同名字所指，在保護貨品後，還能夠美味地被享用，相當環保。是可以帶給收貨人驚喜、感動，具有幽默感的商品」。\n\n#可食用緩衝物 #爆谷 #緩衝物 #日本企業 #am730", "owner_username": "am730hk", "owner_id": "3974986796", "likes": 4119, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0290_DCZZXe8vFGB\\DCZZXe8vFGB_20241115_152010.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18016626350401870, "text": "我用韓國紫菜，好味，又唔大包，可因應需要用多少包", "created_at": "2024-12-04T05:55:07", "owner": "himeowong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938962737937641, "text": "我個胃好脆弱，要多啲緩衝，牛油味更佳", "created_at": "2024-11-27T06:33:06", "owner": "ngwaiwai1234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873073774148088, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2024-11-26T09:48:26", "owner": "0kg_up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860954986279736, "text": "留返睇戲食？😂", "created_at": "2024-11-21T12:28:26", "owner": "msfann415", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17920896506899024, "text": "我是用薯片啊！😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T13:07:40", "owner": "wildgrasswithidleflowers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931590666845950, "text": "‘’意大利空氣‘’不香嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-20T04:01:33", "owner": "jack.c211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051569221809365, "text": "如果唔食唔係更浪費？....", "created_at": "2024-11-20T00:35:53", "owner": "bythewaystart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061286704830250, "text": "都係要掉膠袋", "created_at": "2024-11-19T01:31:22", "owner": "mango_lychee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078497893571265, "text": "不用另加費用就好了", "created_at": "2024-11-17T13:50:41", "owner": "sophiekwok1", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18043765744914298, "text": "珍珍薯片啦，都係氣😂", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:22:29", "owner": "_arthurlg_", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18041380412177184, "text": "當飯食😂", "created_at": "2024-11-16T14:59:03", "owner": "sing_cms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345282685131565, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-16T00:16:29", "owner": "annabelle0110", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18275964442223837, "text": "都俾咗膠袋 充氣得啦 使乜爆谷", "created_at": "2024-11-15T17:08:40", "owner": "katakurimaster", "likes": 35}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["可食用緩衝物", "爆谷", "緩衝物", "日本企業", "am730"]},
{"media_id": 3501871298203023490, "shortcode": "DCZJWRahviC", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCZJWRahviC/", "taken_at": "2024-11-15T13:00:00", "caption": "#popbeelifestyle 每天各種資訊洗版已心累，這款 #app 就像是一本療癒回憶相冊！\n\n你會對在 Instagram 上發文感到有壓力嗎？近年來社交平台越來越多，功能也逐漸從最初的分享心情近況，演變至近年被加入越來越行銷和廣告的狀況，社群變相成為了一種名片，只有光鮮亮麗的生活會被展示出來，發文時要顧慮的變多了，似乎變得不那麼自由…\n\n📸 @retrodotapp", "owner_username": "popbee", "owner_id": "3281948", "likes": 5277, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0291_DCZJWRahviC\\DCZJWRahviC_20241115_130000_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0291_DCZJWRahviC\\DCZJWRahviC_20241115_130000_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0291_DCZJWRahviC\\DCZJWRahviC_20241115_130000_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0291_DCZJWRahviC\\DCZJWRahviC_20241115_130000_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0291_DCZJWRahviC\\DCZJWRahviC_20241115_130000_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0291_DCZJWRahviC\\DCZJWRahviC_20241115_130000_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0291_DCZJWRahviC\\DCZJWRahviC_20241115_130000_7.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18175725517309010", "text": "現在發文文字越來越少了…難怪現在那麼多人超討厭題目看到長文 越來越不耐煩沒耐心（包括我😂）😂", "created_at": "2024-11-22T12:27:55", "owner": "mr.bar87", "likes": 4}, {"id": "18049384723996322", "text": "@yiyi_cccccai retro出現了", "created_at": "2024-11-22T05:57:35", "owner": "_mo.10_72", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17875608771208111", "text": "很適合I人", "created_at": "2024-11-15T22:05:18", "owner": "biremixlife", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17884540290150217", "text": "Well guess it’s time to say ty next to IG🤩", "created_at": "2024-11-15T16:00:17", "owner": "sushionthemoon_", "likes": 4}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["popbeelifestyle", "app"]},
