n everywhere for apoloojesuschrist lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:20:42", "owner": "papersamurai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085760345004779, "text": "Guys try to do it to grab my attention", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:37:22", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081876908120036, "text": "I said both your names first right", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:45", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063589754187124, "text": "You girls are the most gorgeous", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:28", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050079110675598, "text": "In any race.or gender", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:35:50", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094646465488808, "text": "You also own many universes", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:51:38", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194970346334827, "text": "More girls the better", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:14:23", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187458544338543, "text": "My girl got a girlfriend more girls for me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:53:42", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164060524391796, "text": "😍❤️♥️🌹🌹", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:31:17", "owner": "santhoshms8088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874854493444386, "text": "sistermon #drawfee", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:21:45", "owner": "monsaurus13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087473716787104, "text": "I won", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:52:09", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016258277625039, "text": "I already propose to you in heaven", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:21:23", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992594304853457, "text": "All the spells are going to you", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:33:01", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866774248499448, "text": "Andrea gets the most because she went through the most. Or she thought she did.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:31:42", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060305096559726, "text": "My dad is a multimillionaire Alexandra told her to lie", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:25:03", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012808214799914, "text": "It wasn't free", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:20:58", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905834206292242, "text": "Also the first class she payed for it. She's lying", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:20:55", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075414830243150, "text": "Baby you are the richest forever promise", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:14:59", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920131201197310, "text": "If Alexandra Botez threaten you I was teleport her Infiniti chainsaws or tell anyone or conspiracy", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:10:51", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077149700329989, "text": "Who cares what you", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:10:33", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123186349521978, "text": "Andrea moves here", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:10:28", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063992792571899, "text": "Don't listen to her", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:43:00", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345582991207631, "text": "Your my real girlfriend", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:42:53", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976497216792760, "text": "She's a clout chaser", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:42:48", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990312987893710, "text": "Thats why do you music", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:41:32", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365665867095406, "text": "Your name was suppose be Alexandra Botez I love you", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:37:19", "owner": "apollojesuschrist", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3506380146091691572, "shortcode": "DCpKipPRw40", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCpKipPRw40/", "taken_at": "2024-11-21T18:20:50", "caption": "What sports should we do next? 😂", "owner_username": "dudeperfect", "owner_id": "8485873", "likes": 1903981, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0293_DCpKipPRw40\\DCpKipPRw40_20241121_182050.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17972111297990471, "text": "Cricket.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-22T18:12:20", "owner": "katelu977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081916895026573, "text": "@dudeperfect I'm a Gigantic fan of you guys and I really can't not wait to watch it on the @dudeperfect app and YouTube Channel 🩵💙🖤😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:23:56", "owner": "jeffred441", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847733776491871, "text": "Squash.  Curling.  Skeleton.  Handball.  You could have a lot of fun with squash and curling.", "created_at": "2025-07-17T15:45:39", "owner": "caruiz72", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18070119386045743, "text": "Now let's see football...", "created_at": "2025-07-01T00:48:17", "owner": "rhinophyre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071007064964731, "text": "What is spike ball???", "created_at": "2025-06-20T10:59:56", "owner": "jqwowzer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912513328027444, "text": "Football ⚽️", "created_at": "2025-06-20T03:33:04", "owner": "liban8955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345016936093158, "text": "Lacrosse", "created_at": "2025-06-13T20:43:07", "owner": "beccalorrainebuehre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065650246886656, "text": "Pickle ball is also known as squash in the UK", "created_at": "2025-06-12T07:16:24", "owner": "stbalaam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012538265741491, "text": "I was waiting for a mannequin foot", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:08:52", "owner": "lovenrespect4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932402494048528, "text": "That bowling hit hard", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:22:35", "owner": "al.udin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467546884078867, "text": "Fencing 🤺 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-05T16:36:22", "owner": "c.roxy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022427246700988, "text": "Football?!?", "created_at": "2025-06-03T18:36:04", "owner": "klawler74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851927098462916, "text": "Basketball started with an actual basket instead of a net. In Canada, we used to have Canadian history add in the middle of our cartoons and that was one of them. So, it did make sense at one time.", "created_at": "2025-06-03T14:56:31", "owner": "amanda_jeanm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038179286635969, "text": "I would imagine spikeball would be like playing with durian", "created_at": "2025-06-03T09:01:52", "owner": "raynortiew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045078398445266, "text": "Guys, i wonder what you might do for \"Cricket\" 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-03T08:59:54", "owner": "jerelina_2612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18505982440042554, "text": "That was such a waste of good pickles.", "created_at": "2025-06-02T16:08:54", "owner": "anthony.hines1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181896199316770, "text": "How about squash?", "created_at": "2025-06-02T16:04:00", "owner": "jhcctbczyf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847921696482646, "text": "Come on ! Do football", "created_at": "2025-06-02T06:00:17", "owner": "j.d.deaver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127894138441720, "text": "Soccer ( with socks)", "created_at": "2025-06-02T02:09:10", "owner": "tammyadawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042085031273312, "text": "Well, FOOTBALL  of course!", "created_at": "2025-06-01T22:36:03", "owner": "lynn_mmarie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881596936200662, "text": "Great video to use for the argument of some people who are offended by other people using their preferred pronouns \nI remember the day the word bad meant not good \nAnd for years it was Bad (rad great good ) \nWho cares ugh", "created_at": "2025-06-01T21:37:19", "owner": "gracy_pena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293946358219122, "text": "Cock fight??? 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-01T19:48:18", "owner": "y3djv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923669842076072, "text": "Curling 🤣🤣 or badminton 😅", "created_at": "2025-06-01T19:11:51", "owner": "stefanie_c_ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080233798649446, "text": "I was waiting for an artificial leg 🦵 for football", "created_at": "2025-06-01T14:09:01", "owner": "ohcora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057186173519825, "text": "Fencer approved! 🤺👍🏽🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-01T11:26:57", "owner": "jasonegriffin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093442378592165, "text": "Love it!", "created_at": "2025-06-01T06:18:30", "owner": "jill.andrea.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072068806754475, "text": "Should have played tennis using a table for the ball.", "created_at": "2025-06-01T03:58:57", "owner": "shaggs31e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008399510767453, "text": "Cricket, RUG-bee", "created_at": "2025-06-01T03:44:33", "owner": "a_power_serg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145627843387357, "text": "Basketball already is its name.", "created_at": "2025-05-31T15:12:01", "owner": "vizeyel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906184462170505, "text": "Socker XD you kick around a ball of socks", "created_at": "2025-05-31T14:18:13", "owner": "firekiller2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052664990359954, "text": "Hockey", "created_at": "2025-05-31T13:21:31", "owner": "khloemayhanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164094511356408, "text": "Sesuai nama aslinya", "created_at": "2025-05-31T09:56:08", "owner": "_subandriyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070915969937453, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-18T13:22:40", "owner": "usman_k.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075145528852658, "text": "Football", "created_at": "2025-05-18T11:13:14", "owner": "obradovic724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078677305776241, "text": "What about wrestling.??\nKinda curious.", "created_at": "2025-05-18T10:20:43", "owner": "ft_maani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101666557548161, "text": "@deshkawall", "created_at": "2025-05-18T02:56:37", "owner": "most._.palone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897517060093250, "text": "soccer ❌\nSOCKER ✅", "created_at": "2025-05-18T02:37:18", "owner": "thearcticwxlf_lanqxvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053129606361600, "text": "Thats basketbasketball", "created_at": "2025-05-18T02:33:43", "owner": "kanamugiremax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068613628795847, "text": "Baseball", "created_at": "2025-05-17T22:31:14", "owner": "hud_jf21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068963564500246, "text": "Football", "created_at": "2025-05-17T22:31:00", "owner": "hud_jf21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137609287405112, "text": "Why was I waiting for foot ball", "created_at": "2025-05-17T15:23:57", "owner": "salinferguson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065406326094116, "text": "What about cornhole?", "created_at": "2025-05-17T05:14:29", "owner": "sofi_weissenberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067851722502240, "text": "You should do pool🎱", "created_at": "2025-05-17T02:43:20", "owner": "braith_cowie10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060346438925567, "text": "Table tennis?", "created_at": "2025-05-15T10:10:00", "owner": "jacobe.knight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029052164450728, "text": "That boxing looks fun", "created_at": "2025-05-14T19:44:13", "owner": "3verett1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057079733184725, "text": "Bro I play fencing and THAT IS THE BEST WAY TO PLAY BRO", "created_at": "2025-05-14T12:50:50", "owner": "livioyat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044079266439434, "text": "Cricket", "created_at": "2025-05-14T11:09:34", "owner": "khandi__18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879081574315254, "text": "You cheated in fencing my boy", "created_at": "2025-05-13T22:30:05", "owner": "_otkumisu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085123585636024, "text": "Hockey,", "created_at": "2025-05-13T21:23:13", "owner": "typicalfuture_fireguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085040632711535, "text": "GAELIC FOOTBALL 😂😂😂😂😂 Pronunciation: (gay-lick football)", "created_at": "2025-05-12T17:15:36", "owner": "liobhan_kelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067909856301683, "text": "Football", "created_at": "2025-05-11T15:31:40", "owner": "raichendrick4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939704130997292, "text": "Sock er ?????", "created_at": "2025-05-10T17:47:29", "owner": "gunnarrathbun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940030839886658, "text": "Try baseball", "created_at": "2025-05-10T17:02:20", "owner": "sam95_cz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056297104987704, "text": "Cricket 🦗", "created_at": "2025-05-07T10:50:27", "owner": "undoubtedly_moosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504706171007623, "text": "Football", "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:16:36", "owner": "kate_a_bell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051096752074379, "text": "Basket ball is called that because they used to use actual baskets as nets", "created_at": "2025-05-06T00:28:00", "owner": "tylertheinflator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068644879781165, "text": "Wait. Then what about FOOTBALL???", "created_at": "2025-05-05T13:06:02", "owner": "ok_heavensno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051986534366089, "text": "where is the ball in basketball?", "created_at": "2025-05-04T08:58:10", "owner": "dariusjmecherul01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368169769192777, "text": "Please do netball, rugby and cricket 😋", "created_at": "2025-05-02T04:06:40", "owner": "may_we_frolic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059326625116947, "text": "All instant and incredible improvements 🙌 except for spike ball which kind of made my toes scared", "created_at": "2025-05-02T04:05:51", "owner": "may_we_frolic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062216681011817, "text": "Softball", "created_at": "2025-05-01T20:25:21", "owner": "erle.amelia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922485103071689, "text": "\"Football\"", "created_at": "2025-05-01T12:58:20", "owner": "b__.nath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126471136381861, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:12:56", "owner": "flowerman814", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907896556135037, "text": "Very big", "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:12:52", "owner": "flowerman814", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000293048716547, "text": "Cricket with actual crickets", "created_at": "2025-04-28T18:42:16", "owner": "m__i_7.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352597690145774, "text": "How would football be played ? 😢", "created_at": "2025-04-28T10:21:05", "owner": "5actionking5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901874815170628, "text": "soccer with a sock", "created_at": "2025-04-26T16:31:26", "owner": "adamfellah10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092996494598668, "text": "I'll wait for table tennis@", "created_at": "2025-04-24T14:38:21", "owner": "botikao__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067285924788023, "text": "Hockey and soccer", "created_at": "2025-04-23T03:54:00", "owner": "coolsnapcrashboy08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383829310140623, "text": "We should redesign our paddles 🤔", "created_at": "2025-04-22T20:25:34", "owner": "patopickleball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110577523485190, "text": "Football", "created_at": "2025-04-22T16:50:11", "owner": "suh._____.ana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109824646484706, "text": "I worked in shipping and receiving and we used to say we were professional boxers", "created_at": "2025-04-21T23:56:35", "owner": "mayhemdale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071704690722927, "text": "Why was the basketball one actually tuff", "created_at": "2025-04-21T18:59:07", "owner": "geekedwatermelon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089054578615269, "text": "I was expecting socker (soccer)", "created_at": "2025-04-19T22:40:43", "owner": "troiyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903120271156099, "text": "Haha😐", "created_at": "2025-04-19T14:28:18", "owner": "ba.lle6647", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862392655387714, "text": "I was waiting for football ⚽️ 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-19T12:26:48", "owner": "rudi.wakelin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18008887787727607, "text": "Do football and cricket", "created_at": "2025-04-18T09:39:00", "owner": "brainblast_nigga_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050275814339830, "text": "Table tennis 🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-04-14T16:51:32", "owner": "aepixv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981692898815123, "text": "CRICKET!!!", "created_at": "2025-04-14T03:15:34", "owner": "knowstalgicbabble", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081080035669479, "text": "Why IS pickleball called pickleball?", "created_at": "2025-04-13T22:06:41", "owner": "catcatcatmax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302319121214301, "text": "Football and cricket", "created_at": "2025-04-13T14:28:24", "owner": "buddy_bro11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014284889519564, "text": "It’s called basketball because you put the ball in the basket", "created_at": "2025-04-12T21:46:11", "owner": "yellow_fingers111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353104279194645, "text": "Cricket 🦗", "created_at": "2025-04-12T11:27:04", "owner": "_akshitrana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169108291329659, "text": "play cricket with crickets", "created_at": "2025-04-12T06:37:11", "owner": "bhaumin_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843307585459009, "text": "JESUS LOVES U ALL", "created_at": "2025-04-11T17:43:57", "owner": "quintusthefifth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060050357099453, "text": "Missing: Cricket 😁🤣", "created_at": "2025-04-11T15:19:24", "owner": "idaidewa_gungde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052781045005249, "text": "How bout \"football\".", "created_at": "2025-04-11T11:45:42", "owner": "yojiyow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901582366056331, "text": "Cricket 🦗", "created_at": "2025-04-11T09:46:12", "owner": "chaman.exe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012139805526619, "text": "Me waiting to play 🦗 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-10T16:04:46", "owner": "07_suprit__69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853724599377881, "text": "what abt cricket", "created_at": "2025-04-10T13:19:35", "owner": "ar_zuave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924499585058387, "text": "Fencing killed me 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-10T07:49:13", "owner": "ashley_s_s1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042338828172800, "text": "Dudepurrrfect💗", "created_at": "2025-04-09T16:08:02", "owner": "mainksantt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069582091732424, "text": "I remember when you came into Colden Watkin’s tiktok live", "created_at": "2025-04-08T23:16:35", "owner": "s0ur_cereal37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268824223280817, "text": "Football please, and baseball", "created_at": "2025-04-08T17:16:42", "owner": "cza6853", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187425151310406, "text": "That basketBALL shot was clean", "created_at": "2025-04-07T19:22:10", "owner": "saeleedaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139528816386349, "text": "Badminton💀💀", "created_at": "2025-04-07T14:51:52", "owner": "kapitan_mongol", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079925548669964, "text": "Dad jokes be like", "created_at": "2025-04-07T14:41:54", "owner": "joshyi_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852683599424738, "text": "Forget about football 😢", "created_at": "2025-04-07T02:27:33", "owner": "treymoneyyy3_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900022447173189, "text": "Soccer ⚽️", "created_at": "2025-04-07T01:43:26", "owner": "daniala434", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068942761909354, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-06T19:06:34", "owner": "queenspoet", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3499613137937216397, "shortcode": "DCRH5tyCbON", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCRH5tyCbON/", "taken_at": "2024-11-12T10:15:14", "caption": "🎤 Ariana 完美翻拍 Dion 宣傳片🤣\n\n🎬 女神模仿女神 👇\nAriana Grande 最近在主持《週六夜現場》（Saturday Night Live）時，化身為「女神」Celine Dion，完美模仿 Dion 為 NFL 週日晚間美式足球拍攝宣傳片。在這段「Celine Dion Sports Promo」中，Ariana 不僅捕捉到了 Dion 標誌性的表情與手勢，還特別把宣傳改成 UFC，比原版更多了幾分狂野與搞笑。這次的翻拍充滿笑點，看得觀眾直呼太經典了！\n\n💬 你覺得 Ariana 的模仿是否跟 Dion 一樣神乎其技呢？留言告訴我們你的想法吧！\n\n📱 更多流行娛樂動態，追蹤👉@jmgroup_official\n—\n🎤 Ariana’s Perfect Spoof of Dion‘s Promo 🤣\n\n🎬 Goddess vs. Goddess 👇 Ariana Grande recently hosted ”Saturday Night Live“ and took on the role of the one and only Celine Dion in a hilarious spoof. Ariana mimicked Dion’s promo for NFL Sunday Night Football to perfection, from the iconic facial expressions to those classic hand gestures. But in true SNL style, she added her own twist, changing the promo into a UFC one—making it even wilder and funnier than the original. The result? A skit full of laugh-out-loud moments that had the audience calling it an instant classic!\n\n💬 Do you think Ariana nailed her impression of Dion? Let us know in the comments!\n\n📱 For more pop culture updates, follow 👉 @jmgroup_official\n\n📷 / YT：Saturday Night Live、 @arianagrande、＠celinedion\n\n#arianagrande #ariana #grande #CélineDion #Céline #Dion #SNL #SaturdayNightLive #模仿 #搞笑 #有趣 #Music #JMMusic #JM #JMNews", "owner_username": "jmgtaiwan_official", "owner_id": "52288737640", "likes": 26057, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0294_DCRH5tyCbON\\DCRH5tyCbON_20241112_101514.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18077089834801655, "text": "@benbenlh 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-18T15:01:45", "owner": "eugenecheung_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900942601175330, "text": "潘不會唱歌。😂", "created_at": "2025-04-16T15:23:46", "owner": "lele__inlove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890710162227354, "text": "現在看到Dion都會以為是潘若迪扮的\n完辣", "created_at": "2025-04-14T20:33:19", "owner": "tienyingggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856860157356261, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-10T06:23:24", "owner": "leann_yong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911261769999731, "text": "她真的很可愛❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-28T07:29:49", "owner": "0_empty_set", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094839313543377, "text": "我真的快笑死", "created_at": "2025-03-25T02:09:45", "owner": "dit_le_renard_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092445964496494, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-22T21:37:00", "owner": "hi404notfound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076364488706276, "text": "他現在很瘦不知道為什麼可能生病了", "created_at": "2025-03-21T05:56:01", "owner": "panjai238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958208937880129, "text": "這樣好嗎？😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-17T15:33:28", "owner": "badman0906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068328538874283, "text": "When you choke me like that??? When U elbow me in the tit??? Lolzzzzzzz", "created_at": "2025-02-09T16:06:01", "owner": "kyee.kok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18240172042303741, "text": "好強", "created_at": "2025-02-06T03:54:15", "owner": "lisaho55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865489822244063, "text": "308天佑被ko了😢", "created_at": "2025-02-02T05:18:02", "owner": "king_crimson_co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476421979034057, "text": "潘若迪快出來歐美的神...", "created_at": "2025-01-27T14:48:28", "owner": "wuguanyi89", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048768035133591, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-26T13:50:28", "owner": "zx2268y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300854269226304, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂完全沒有偶包！", "created_at": "2025-01-12T12:09:30", "owner": "daicy_2023", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17911690220962430, "text": "Nice AI or spoof . Either way Ariana Grande , although considered a good singer for this generation, it’s not in Céline Dion’s league very objectively speaking . \n\nI enjoy Grande’s music well so No hate just saying . 🙌🫶", "created_at": "2025-01-02T02:57:06", "owner": "the.zanith", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050245238088325, "text": "🤣他真的很會模仿欸 要不要改當綜藝咖", "created_at": "2024-12-22T03:57:27", "owner": "z_yenliang", "likes": 426}, {"id": 18064668424695393, "text": "笑死😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:11:06", "owner": "rosa612_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950690244864422, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-12-02T01:44:14", "owner": "nan.sen.fusoku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109271038434557, "text": "Celine 變了印度人嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:15:26", "owner": "princess_in_dream", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18047827508091061, "text": "Ariana🔥😍", "created_at": "2024-11-30T04:20:37", "owner": "galenchen1125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009089891667976, "text": "最後的爆擊😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T18:12:55", "owner": "frank.07.17", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18055490266910363, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-27T16:38:11", "owner": "bex_kanasaiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429632866074753, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T23:00:52", "owner": "jayne.mcintosh.58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937184982938276, "text": "席琳狄翁我只服潘若迪！", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:33:32", "owner": "ginawang0717", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18469355737025825, "text": "😍😂Ari❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-22T16:14:44", "owner": "yrnora", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074171932545225, "text": "潘若迪是不是帶動了什麼", "created_at": "2024-11-19T13:04:56", "owner": "destiny_cruise_wang", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18055091890932191, "text": "你把潘諾迪放在哪", "created_at": "2024-11-19T03:57:42", "owner": "bp232111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040925549270008, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-19T03:26:35", "owner": "yuanba_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011398229468878, "text": "208. Not 308", "created_at": "2024-11-18T16:03:02", "owner": "gtafunmuscle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013143182437015, "text": "對不起，我現在只服潘若迪的版本😂", "created_at": "2024-11-18T13:47:54", "owner": "afraontheway___", "likes": 138}, {"id": 18044602343131872, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-17T06:41:32", "owner": "orangemike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938224374933327, "text": "很少看到這麼漂亮還能這麼配合演出的🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-17T04:50:42", "owner": "mrlin_better", "likes": 536}, {"id": 18083718640530831, "text": "😂😂😂", "creat