:17", "owner": "dragon626", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18321828241080254, "text": "我全部都要!🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-16T19:01:25", "owner": "dannie1207", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18018397703620701, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-16T18:45:59", "owner": "joanlau0216_uk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991115322725939, "text": "呢啲正，之前係茘枝角D2抽左一堆🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-16T18:31:51", "owner": "berserkeryy_1991215", "likes": 363}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["乜撚都有得夾", "呢個都幾實用", "生人都需要破地獄就係呢啲"]},
{"media_id": 3507400314071131819, "shortcode": "DCsygCtTaar", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCsygCtTaar/", "taken_at": "2024-11-23T04:06:12", "caption": "👉🏻 捷果就豹歉了🫢\n@ tag 喜歡舊 logo 的朋友\n\n👉🏻 發生什麼事？\n\n最近汽車品牌捷豹 Jaguar\n\n為了重塑品牌形象\n\n發佈了全新改版的 logo 以及形象影片\n\n希望強調他們更現代化\n\n且大膽、藝術、充滿想像力的新個性\n\n結果因為原先的敏捷、迅速\n\n還有最重要的「汽車」元素\n\n在新視覺中蕩然無存\n\n而引起不少討論\n\n主持人 Stephen Colbert 就笑說\n\n這 logo 說是某個東歐高級保險套都不為過\n\n🎥：The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\n\n👉🏻 你覺得 Jaguar 的新 logo 如何呢？這波品牌再造算是成功還是不成功呢？\n歡迎在下面留言告訴我們喔！\n\n更多時尚精選，請追蹤 @heavenravenofficial\n​\n#設計 #藝術 #品牌 #行銷 #品牌再造 #企業 #汽車 #車 #捷豹 #Jaguar", "owner_username": "heavenravenofficial", "owner_id": "1160066", "likes": 47643, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0296_DCsygCtTaar\\DCsygCtTaar_20241123_040612.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18022628399356389, "text": "Ad campaign by Dieter Sprockets", "created_at": "2025-01-18T18:06:13", "owner": "spicyricecracker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035288450587466, "text": "影片一出來就更像賣保險套的公司了…", "created_at": "2025-01-16T14:09:52", "owner": "joshua_atticus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080855998606989, "text": "邁入衰退破產的歷史時刻。", "created_at": "2025-01-16T10:51:34", "owner": "hkjy2020jk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933530013841015, "text": "相信Dei 準備 Die\n這些字母團⋯真的是", "created_at": "2024-12-05T01:03:20", "owner": "tall_uncle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346215943121542, "text": "倒轉來看一大班唔認同呢種大愛嘅人即刻會換車，左膠會估到佢哋本身個market 幾多個百分比？有冇做過research 而家佢公司主要客群係邊類人？搞不好真係會自掘墳墓", "created_at": "2024-12-04T10:39:34", "owner": "siustepcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051667658051504, "text": "只有左膠才是左派", "created_at": "2024-12-03T10:29:09", "owner": "hsiang_0819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054069859781327, "text": "What the terrible commercial...", "created_at": "2024-12-03T07:31:21", "owner": "nino.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032666999144255, "text": "看來捷豹也開始搞DEI了", "created_at": "2024-12-03T02:00:56", "owner": "yuanhualong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049487914858050, "text": "有點政確風........", "created_at": "2024-12-02T15:37:59", "owner": "devilspan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022523528547606, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:08:32", "owner": "yoyoleungyiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369553408114278, "text": "它被迪士尼買了", "created_at": "2024-12-02T09:49:15", "owner": "nixwu1115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067558246672341, "text": "沒關係的\n不問天長地久\n敢問豹子能撐多久", "created_at": "2024-12-02T01:04:12", "owner": "mr.jackman_alinsdun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972242850667956, "text": "@lawrence.margiela", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:32:32", "owner": "snb_ssm_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468794677037045, "text": "终于有人吐槽了", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:28:02", "owner": "tahyuu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035733362365874, "text": "改名叫---菊爆？😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T12:39:12", "owner": "nkfx2papa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037425131516879, "text": "@yyuxiang._", "created_at": "2024-12-01T11:09:07", "owner": "linggerger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074815057551061, "text": "@liang_yotang", "created_at": "2024-12-01T00:26:49", "owner": "bevishsw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333843415199896, "text": "也許買車真的付上保險套⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-11-30T11:44:37", "owner": "chaojumori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936476181824758, "text": "模特兒的表情和我看廣告的表情一樣", "created_at": "2024-11-30T02:42:17", "owner": "alanwang36", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911301136046886, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T18:24:21", "owner": "chaojisupersuper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044027240277286, "text": "好懷念以前積架那種老氣的高級感", "created_at": "2024-11-29T18:12:20", "owner": "miffy5710", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18069442267640967, "text": "啥小朋友……", "created_at": "2024-11-29T16:06:52", "owner": "cfjh910051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130005034376214, "text": "有點政治改logo 哈哈", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:14:07", "owner": "leifeng_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283037650171018, "text": "笑死又在搞DEI 完全沒品牌重點的廣告", "created_at": "2024-11-29T05:39:17", "owner": "anthon7_3055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850305310311379, "text": "@woobezzzzzzzzzz", "created_at": "2024-11-29T05:12:21", "o