 "Copy nothing lol 真的很像condom ad", "created_at": "2024-11-27T21:09:34", "owner": "daphhanna_sy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050490854314240, "text": "好了，實錘了，真改賣保險套了😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:27:45", "owner": "bryce880921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974485164654211, "text": "原本的Logo就很好看了啊", "created_at": "2024-11-27T13:26:50", "owner": "zeiweitseng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999734346687690, "text": "DEI開始退流行了", "created_at": "2024-11-27T11:49:19", "owner": "lafriend555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005863640690325, "text": "不是，怎麼那麼有情趣用品的感覺……完全不想買了欸", "created_at": "2024-11-27T07:35:00", "owner": "pikachan1127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950440749889277, "text": "商業間諜成功了...", "created_at": "2024-11-27T05:38:52", "owner": "duncan_jim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051141472962790, "text": "呃…這新的logo是怎樣", "created_at": "2024-11-27T04:52:41", "owner": "johnnytinghuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105160066451741, "text": "已達到宣傳效果", "created_at": "2024-11-27T02:50:31", "owner": "jjsister1228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110980342438871, "text": "難怪陳致中這麼喜歡這品牌", "created_at": "2024-11-27T02:14:30", "owner": "sean_hk_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014534003410994, "text": "好險車已經賣了", "created_at": "2024-11-27T00:23:56", "owner": "royfoxlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033760271367270, "text": "@wwwan_03", "created_at": "2024-11-27T00:02:28", "owner": "begin_0916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052785982797911, "text": "Go Woke, Go Broke, Jaguar 🙃", "created_at": "2024-11-27T00:01:21", "owner": "cellochou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381952357099205, "text": "🌈🌈🌈🌈🌈", "created_at": "2024-11-26T22:58:50", "owner": "summerhotchocolate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925263504994753, "text": "失敗的設計，保險套公司可以考慮一下", "created_at": "2024-11-26T20:05:36", "owner": "g417041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069695173654739, "text": "政治正確洗腦了整個集團，可是他們想要取悅的那些個群體基本都不開車，開也是開特斯拉h h h h h", "created_at": "2024-11-26T18:58:31", "owner": "p8u1vvu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101483212419310, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-26T18:51:36", "owner": "vve1ze_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050352701003021, "text": "這些團體插手影視娛樂各種品牌強制破壞審美觀真的令人反感", "created_at": "2024-11-26T16:34:31", "owner": "huang_b_r_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948064302869932, "text": "全球各類媒體都看到\n不斷恥笑新的 logo 設計\n變成這樣真悲哀", "created_at": "2024-11-26T14:40:12", "owner": "dear_cat_in_paris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18448240819065710, "text": "覺醒文化已開始入侵汽車產業", "created_at": "2024-11-26T13:35:01", "owner": "alexanderdav23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890093461132015, "text": "@a13235213  夠酸", "created_at": "2024-11-26T12:11:56", "owner": "nijiexiao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031263755457654, "text": "醜到豹", "created_at": "2024-11-26T11:43:13", "owner": "kuo_0501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051925732822633, "text": "你不是賣車的嗎😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-26T11:10:45", "owner": "kasutera_nagato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050491325310240, "text": "I love that they are getting inclusive but doesn’t mean it gotta be 砍掉重練🤣🤣😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-26T10:39:08", "owner": "bilitis_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070122874651163, "text": "jaguar 都變成 啊瓜了", "created_at": "2024-11-26T09:49:40", "owner": "holyking66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014925143637835, "text": "這品牌沒救了，完全不管人客受的了受不鳥", "created_at": "2024-11-26T09:49:32", "owner": "bingsen168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108624667440981, "text": "左癌", "created_at": "2024-11-26T06:31:51", "owner": "h_shit_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089641078511446, "text": "Go woke go broke 😍", "created_at": "2024-11-26T04:37:18", "owner": "ansononrpo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015795827384701, "text": "原來是捷豹，我以為是PUMA", "created_at": "2024-11-26T04:06:59", "owner": "wc30_72.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063223342834161, "text": "Jaguar the new Tesla?", "created_at": "2024-11-26T03:54:10", "owner": "titkok11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006283922680432, "text": "捷果就豹歉了……小編很會🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-26T02:40:19", "owner": "kim.seong.yu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074230693529384, "text": "go woke go broke 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-26T02:21:13", "owner": "mingchan_ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996878331