{"media_id": 3507755542410665920, "shortcode": "DCuDRS4S5_A", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCuDRS4S5_A/", "taken_at": "2024-11-23T15:53:21", "caption": "Phone brand Nothing teases Jaguar’s ‘Copy Nothing’ rebrand\n\nCarl Pei-led consumer electronics brand, Nothing, has playfully taken aim at Jaguar’s new logo and “Copy Nothing” tagline by updating its own logo on X to resemble Jaguar’s design. To further the jest, Nothing also changed its bio to say “Copy Jaguar,” referencing Jaguar’s campaign tagline with a cheeky twist.\n\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#rebranding #jaguar #logo #marketingtips #onlinebusiness #socialmedia #seo #ppc #contentmarketing #branding\n\n[Jaguar rebranded poster from Pendagon creatives, best digital marketing agency in Kasaragod Kerala ]", "owner_username": "pendagon.in_", "owner_id": "53362043493", "likes": 56901, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0298_DCuDRS4S5_A\\DCuDRS4S5_A_20241123_155321.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18033640496125528, "text": "Jaguar inspired by 5 star", "created_at": "2024-12-10T02:57:33", "owner": "dv_thakor_0000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048922064508958, "text": "@nothing", "created_at": "2024-12-08T18:23:36", "owner": "gp.alvares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939507804814719, "text": "Hahah, exactly true👏", "created_at": "2024-12-06T22:26:34", "owner": "artbyjakup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990657210729289, "text": "Jaguar after sir Tata left to god: 🤡💅🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-04T09:26:35", "owner": "bonkosbiscuit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073965259617153, "text": "Weed effect", "created_at": "2024-12-02T14:22:40", "owner": "shashyyy10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884762167165086, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:05:03", "owner": "bekki1_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008246144497462, "text": "🔜“ SOLD NOTHING “", "created_at": "2024-12-01T21:32:56", "owner": "ss_virkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147078391349957, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:15:29", "owner": "ck__ey", "likes":