-11-25T09:12:01", "owner": "i_m_ayan_ansari_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051010816983867, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:07:21", "owner": "arnold_ranjith_pvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060874315677306, "text": "It's marketing strategy they pullout telsa cyber truck marketing strategy", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:00:34", "owner": "krishnaramaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065060128702892, "text": "jaguar: where did this came from...😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-11-25T08:44:48", "owner": "jithinreghunath6122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052011349964115, "text": "There is no way this is real", "created_at": "2024-11-25T08:03:16", "owner": "efthimis.dr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055202122913225, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T07:59:52", "owner": "__mhd__ajmal__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016421837633520, "text": "Adhiyam manasilayilla,ippam manasilayi 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T05:23:11", "owner": "mallowboy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934148661835159, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T05:16:09", "owner": "santanu_mondal_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072384160620223, "text": "Jaguar ❌ Jaggu ka gaar ✅", "created_at": "2024-11-25T05:14:46", "owner": "hakuji.anx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292463308228017, "text": "Indians when jaguar was good: India power saaar Indian company saarrr. Now when jaguar is ruined: tata motors only operates in India 🤓", "created_at": "2024-11-25T05:10:00", "owner": "crown_a_heart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913523473019533, "text": "So they literally copied nothing", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:56:07", "owner": "winsome_devil", "likes": 574}, {"id": 17855018379323497, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:55:52", "owner": "_albin._______", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058572466884847, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:37:26", "owner": "lord_marco_46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948948042770202, "text": "Creative head of nothing needs a raise 🙌👏👏😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:23:51", "owner": "bala.surya.1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18028387280593907,