{"media_id": 3509119099003915009, "shortcode": "DCy5Tp6qssB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCy5Tp6qssB/", "taken_at": "2024-11-25T13:00:00", "caption": "Let’s generate such industrial structures in Blender 🏗️\n\nFollow for more blender tips!\n\n#3d #blender", "owner_username": "nhanceschool", "owner_id": "52527780684", "likes": 82084, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0299_DCy5Tp6qssB\\DCy5Tp6qssB_20241125_130000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18068617399663274, "text": "Have any for buildings?", "created_at": "2024-11-25T22:58:41", "owner": "marcv_studio.3d", "likes": 123}, {"id": 18088750111987606, "text": "🔥🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-12-26T20:41:57", "owner": "darkmesh3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080107609862431, "text": "Waw 😍 @t_3d.official", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:06:12", "owner": "t_photo.official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994945392838816, "text": "That was great! If you’d like, feel free to check out my channel too 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:51:27", "owner": "reza.3dartist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064880177124949, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-27T09:09:13", "owner": "blynkmotion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974737899728082, "text": "Does an addon like this exist for unreal engine 5?", "created_at": "2025-05-22T01:25:41", "owner": "slavic_cheeze", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992497059796490, "text": "Can we build game map and house or gun", "created_at": "2025-05-17T18:01:58", "owner": "_jitudas__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880057702305531, "text": "So now a bunch of games are gonna lack original models, thanks", "created_at": "2025-05-16T00:19:28", "owner": "alexeunice.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088435660558994, "text": "why is my feed full of this thing. Stop, i ain't touching that sphere", "created_at": "2025-05-03T14:52:23", "owner": "i.sc4r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065686234983059, "text": "🔥🔥🔥😍😍", "created_at": "2025-04-30T19:27:59", "owner": "sherry.3d.design.center", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269746687276644, "text": "addom", "created_at": "2025-04-21T13:11:42", "owner": "jatin164", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325678543160677, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-04-15T10:49:42", "owner": "malikverse_studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853811890374473, "text": "@mesendekor", "created_at": "2025-04-05T15:57:49", "owner": "mustafacyrgl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903292627108304, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-03-25T05:50:24", "owner": "r.n.b_design", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025928846667828, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-03-25T05:12:35", "owner": "mehdialitabassum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034636538276481, "text": "Saving this one", "created_at": "2025-03-12T15:19:08", "owner": "will_b_v_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010350830517017, "text": "Nice 👍", "created_at": "2025-02-26T11:43:38", "owner": "t_3d.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073053889684421, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-02-13T23:11:29", "owner": "alxndr.3dmodels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055035209016763, "text": "Any for 2.83 version 😮😢", "created_at": "2025-02-12T07:48:47", "owner": "jay_s_razor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040427165104598, "text": "Is their free addon for geo tracking?", "created_at": "2025-02-01T04:01:55", "owner": "sakthi_editszz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945278127946527, "text": "Queria aprender Blender, mas não tenho Computador 😢", "created_at": "2025-01-14T02:37:45", "owner": "leocs___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110267956452161, "text": "IS THERE A TUTORIAL ON HOW TO USE THIS THING?", "created_at": "2025-01-09T00:07:28", "owner": "mzxnoble6", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18053211254064450, "text": "how it made ?", "created_at": "2025-01-07T09:52:11", "owner": "shoh_architect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051333517896372, "text": "hey zbrush !! are you  watching it?", "created_at": "2025-01-07T00:27:22", "owner": "ch.75___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350109985123888, "text": "Neat.", "created_at": "2025-01-06T14:25:11", "owner": "ivgo99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032030486427025, "text": "give me the file pls 🤝", "created_at": "2024-12-29T15:56:14", "owner": "into_kv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132490507376959, "text": "What is this website", "created_at": "2024-12-29T06:26:47", "owner": "m00d.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894168832129042, "text": "How much is patent release to alter shape of tech per position", "created_at": "2024-12-19T13:10:34", "owner": "andrew.klonowski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069455425663709, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2024-12-15T13:47:16", "owner": "rahulshukla44666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070022755713945, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-05T08:01:21", "owner": "hamituu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891428509131473, "text": "Blender can also carry the controls to game engine?", "created_at": "2024-12-05T03:57:08", "owner": "jayakumar_nagaraj_3d", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18471780715051326, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:08:51", "owner": "jona.lever", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022247105558939, "text": "Gonna tip this guy three bucks for fun", "created_at": "2024-12-03T00:09:53", "owner": "grillboy_mediaman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039271982245914, "text": "@sathvik0907d", "created_at": "2024-12-01T06:54:40", "owner": "jejeeya_2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039933527009553, "text": "This is helpful for background stuff in videogames for sure. I like to make my own models for the main sorta stuff but as scenery this could be huge.", "created_at": "2024-12-01T01:51:46", "owner": "cars_possibly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903054490028380, "text": "@akshay_d_2397 @aniruddhamrkalbere @dalvishwar", "created_at": "2024-11-30T05:58:56", "owner": "_abhishek_borkar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18264320890269352, "text": "How much price this software?", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:42:52", "owner": "bamaaaaaaaaaaaan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947557071912484, "text": "Yeah but an industry professional would mark your work down for not doing it yourself", "created_at": "2024-11-29T18:05:05", "owner": "elixirofdeath_22", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18349873906134855, "text": "Maya is better", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:45:18", "owner": "imdottristan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883109686171026, "text": "And here’s a complimentary visual alternative to how tech house became the same track released 10000 times a summer.", "created_at": "2024-11-29T10:22:33", "owner": "atelier__pol", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18250997302276911, "text": "This will be fire for roblox", "created_at": "2024-11-28T19:47:21", "owner": "lowkey.dum.blud", "likes": 77}, {"id": 18471402199051200, "text": "Where can I download the addon?", "created_at": "2024-11-28T19:27:18", "owner": "chri_random", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18041097848218143, "text": "А где ссылка? Как вам не стыдно выкладывать без ссылки)", "created_at": "2024-11-28T19:11:39", "owner": "max77hmax77h", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023546861620414, "text": "thats the structure of drl game map", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:59:39", "owner": "mirkobarze", "likes": 36}, {"id": 17907109524061670, "text": "Creator", "created_at": "2024-11-28T07:31:38", "owner": "kaleem_ullah_182", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051222722313013, "text": "Is this ai or some crazy node system?", "created_at": "2024-11-28T04:22:49", "owner": "foosterking", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042675187969705, "text": "For Link :https://ogjee.gumroad.com/l/gzbvu", "created_at": "2024-11-28T01:38:42", "owner": "l3n1n_2009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917282649916075, "text": "not paying for something that high effort is absurd", "created_at": "2024-11-28T00:25:03", "owner": "mynameisnot.emily", "likes": 192}, {"id": 18066193228732646, "text": "link please", "created_at": "2024-11-27T23:22:36", "owner": "sinner_who_repent_1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985105935765550, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-27T22:34:46", "owner": "dg_b8w7", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18110378728437220, "text": "Good for games engines, not for real projects.", "created_at": "2024-11-27T19:43:30", "owner": "juanjrocha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026504960530161, "text": "I hate using tile meshes in cs2", "created_at": "2024-11-27T17:46:28", "owner": "zombie_knuckles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876933955202868, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2024-11-27T17:46:13", "owner": "sha_yan_x_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112613440378595, "text": "How do you even do that?", "created_at": "2024-11-27T16:40:38", "owner": "araujo_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059999671681508, "text": "fortnite megaladone POI", "created_at": "2024-11-27T15:58:24", "owner": "watchwamccallit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041941949180713, "text": "Tiny Glade for engineers", "created_at": "2024-11-27T13:15:47", "owner": "davix3f", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18063876640751580, "text": "I was waiting for a soccer edit", "created_at": "2024-11-27T12:02:18", "owner": "giova_il_lanfre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18140468359362906, "text": "the site", "created_at": "2024-11-27T09:37:58", "owner": "yat__33_24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047457437284557, "text": "Do anything but fucking learn", "created_at": "2024-11-27T08:07:25", "owner": "samtc199", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18007053749668117, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-27T08:06:21", "owner": "quentin_rd_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063924772772096, "text": "❤️👏", "created_at": "2024-11-27T04:47:40", "owner": "m.ahmadi13741961", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027893654202034, "text": ".F", "created_at": "2024-11-27T04:36:30", "owner": "ahmetby9.11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031793060124844, "text": "What if I want to make my own?", "created_at": "2024-11-27T04:17:23", "owner": "smithofburdens", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17949502790862559, "text": "Ok i desperately need a way to start using geometry nodes to make things like this ! I have 10+ years of blender experience and never tried geo nodes can someone tell me where to start ?", "created_at": "2024-11-27T03:03:29", "owner": "equinoxswrv", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18022579139548769, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-27T03:00:17", "owner": "lucamegio", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18468590467022668, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-27T01:54:23", "owner": "rafaelyahu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027478265210043, "text": "I will still inspect the welds", "created_at": "2024-11-26T22:30:33", "owner": "lukorg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880016695192300, "text": "Amazing ❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-26T22:01:30", "owner": "aviko81", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893173102037551, "text": "Dope", "created_at": "2024-11-26T21:14:51", "owner": "alexvideofx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049772981053526, "text": "@tinnie.jpg", "created_at": "2024-11-26T20:51:34", "owner": "teomorochuz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060167755868033, "text": "Also a good tip for modelling anything.. make it look like it has a purpose. Nothing looks more out of place than a pipe or railing that serves no purpose. If there's a platform to walk on with railings, make a way for someone to be able to get there or at least look like there's access to the area", "created_at": "2024-11-26T20:46:31", "owner": "cian.mc.g", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17843459844367166, "text": "Shut up and take follow", "created_at": "2024-11-26T20:39:17", "owner": "omar_makdis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843723736365852, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2024-11-26T20:00:19", "owner": "bdbeats22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957082749736662, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-26T19:49:01", "owner": "abderrahim_baki_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036150098517923, "text": "Can y'all just stop using blender when you are done learning it and use Maya", "created_at": "2024-11-26T18:15:19", "owner": "themandalaninja", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17984787284769851, "text": "There really is a node for everything", "created_at": "2024-11-26T16:34:20", "owner": "iiawesomej", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075226003549459, "text": "See Our latest gameplay trailer ♥️🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-26T15:37:18", "owner": "abstudio_game", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849353479346688, "text": "😮 plugins", "created_at": "2024-11-26T15:15:10", "owner": "architecte.godwill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932925798957601, "text": "How can people do that?", "created_at": "2024-11-26T15:14:27", "owner": "hector_mm_43", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079250443569683, "text": "Software Name", "created_at": "2024-11-26T15:10:03", "owner": "i.ashwar", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17936795660933497, "text": "Or use youtube and learn some geometry nodes.Its free.", "created_at": "2024-11-26T15:03:11", "owner": "hydzior", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089731825504749, "text": "I love you (and the creator ofc)", "created_at": "2024-11-26T14:54:09", "owner": "legay.alex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084720577528390, "text": "这个东西怎么感觉见过呢？至于在哪见过emmm，到底是在哪见过呢？🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-26T14:11:37", "owner": "suixin_910", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039021944214230, "text": "this is epic.", "created_at": "2024-11-26T10:31:49", "owner": "furk4n__b", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893753035098778, "text": "Top him Like wtf. Even Like 3 USD/Euro would be enough. Or atleast after using it /checking it out", "created_at": "2024-11-26T09:54:36", "owner": "timreu", "likes": 226}, {"id": 18020660393325433, "text": "If I tip the creator in negative , does he owe me money?", "created_at": "2024-11-26T09:53:02", "owner": "aka.anii", "likes": 5273}, {"id": 18231333964303373, "text": "I think it's on gumroad", "created_at": "2024-11-26T08:55:51", "owner": "chris_gouis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022980041312278, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-26T07:39:57", "owner": "mesh_universe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119851291410301, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-26T02:24:09", "owner": "savistarz_808", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18151913443339964, "text": "Free?", "created_at": "2024-11-25T19:31:01", "owner": "shirololz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18283938631175828, "text": "👏👏👏👏😍", "created_at": "2024-11-25T19:02:25", "owner": "isctasarim.animasyon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18250406413284854, "text": "Why would I not tip the creator. This is 10/10", "created_at": "2024-11-25T19:01:35", "owner": "coneyltaylor", "likes": 1017}, {"id": 18047991161022527, "text": "Just model it yourself it’s blender", "created_at": "2024-11-25T16:03:27", "owner": "geertt07", "likes": 1046}, {"id": 17997563669708639, "text": "@gioele.fact 🏗️", "created_at": "2024-11-25T16:00:11", "owner": "firedam_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18014712695645862, "text": "IT'S NOT FREE AT ALL.", "created_at": "2024-11-25T15:58:57", "owner": "oceanside12", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17957698142731604, "text": "It's not free i", "created_at": "2024-11-25T15:58:45", "owner": "oceanside12", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059134813842368, "text": "Link please", "created_at": "2024-11-25T14:54:19", "owner": "gamer_raj", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18027510395230142, "text": "Insane", "created_at": "2024-11-25T13:54:40", "owner": "dhruvvvxo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17940301139922214, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-11-25T13:45:02", "owner": "black_sky_design", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17969968331731681, "text": "⚠️ Check my 3D models and take it on Fab.com (Link in BIO)🪄", "created_at": "2025-04-05T18:44:51", "owner": "_alterego_fab", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["3d", "blender"]},
{"media_id": 3469104560927055452, "shortcode": "DAkvDfSvp5c", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAkvDfSvp5c/", "taken_at": "2024-10-01T07:58:51", "caption": "Harry Heath (x.com/harryh___h) released the 3D modeling software-inspired lattice modifier for Unity that lets you easily deform static and skinned objects, making it simple to create complex animations.\n.\nGet it here: https://80.lv/articles/lattice-modifier-for-unity-released/\n.\nWant to get noticed? Register on our Talent platform and publish a portfolio page to get featured\n80lv.pro/join\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#80lvtalent #3d #3dart #3dartist #artist #gamedev #indiedev #rendering #render #art #conceptart #unity #unity3d #madewithunity", "owner_username": "eighty_level", "owner_id": "3108473347", "likes": 86268, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0300_DAkvDfSvp5c\\DAkvDfSvp5c_20241001_075851.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18084753130826508, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-07-15T15:40:07", "owner": "shaaz3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047449400127902, "text": "Now I think about it this is prolly how they did Mister fantastic in marvel rivals", "created_at": "2025-05-16T07:38:57", "owner": "james.porter21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18482504119036093, "text": "The ducky is a bit sus", "created_at": "2025-01-23T11:32:18", "owner": "naemi1aya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324735514086283, "text": "For People who is asking is a tool made (unfortunately) for unity who is inspired in lattice tool of blender, this is able to apply custom physics and deformation in static and dynamic object and characters", "created_at": "2024-12-27T20:08:55", "owner": "ruan_m_t", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052199558055976, "text": "Can you count how many faces..", "created_at": "2024-12-24T05:29:48", "owner": "lenizoadrian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344918089179796, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-21T18:11:10", "owner": "jacksonf.221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306792745201152, "text": "Perfect for vore.", "created_at": "2024-12-21T13:54:15", "owner": "jameshasegawa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384902785108298, "text": "Linux is best", "created_at": "2024-12-13T05:26:16", "owner": "oh4.6cvpi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070498483646387, "text": "Can someone that knows things tell me if this is black magic fuckery? Cause it looks like black magic fuckery", "created_at": "2024-12-13T02:25:50", "owner": "saf_luna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931927851968600, "text": "Putin walk?", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:54:00", "owner": "teodev0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067328059782367, "text": "is this procedurally generated animation or is that something else", "created_at": "2024-12-12T21:14:34", "owner": "marinnna985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874401811147255, "text": "Lattice deformer", "created_at": "2024-12-12T18:20:24", "owner": "avimaybe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900639715091262, "text": "Gta 6 technology", "created_at": "2024-12-08T10:01:41", "owner": "duck__2077", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879232084197098, "text": "Is this on the asset store yet?", "created_at": "2024-12-08T04:12:13", "owner": "elijah.lifts08", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948145620879045, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2024-12-07T22:24:53", "owner": "w2rs1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889277206141369, "text": "born to animate, forced to c#", "created_at": "2024-12-07T16:25:01", "owner": "sasukarh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018707531361408, "text": "In unity??", "created_at": "2024-12-07T16:13:44", "owner": "aliaskaririzvi110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127844326388556, "text": "Srry gang this song is already taken by oogappels", "created_at": "2024-12-07T08:32:23", "owner": "marnix_mvdw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914119561030801, "text": "Unity cool…How to do this in unreal engine?", "created_at": "2024-12-05T20:58:47", "owner": "hail_coven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033904397118669, "text": "ARK MENTIONED 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:35:11", "owner": "blue_phoenix511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030128303184367, "text": "UE5?", "created_at": "2024-12-05T12:29:54", "owner": "bigr0n0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918595504001320, "text": "Blender should add this modifier", "created_at": "2024-12-04T12:34:44", "owner": "ehsan_shardum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118728802413918, "text": "Duck experiences delta P", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:26:17", "owner": "quantumcertainty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18236814790303678, "text": "That is on unity?", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:12:49", "owner": "dvzin2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046746161103741, "text": "Nececito eso en Roblox Studio", "created_at": "2024-12-01T11:14:30", "owner": "zevenzad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292482025229349, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-01T09:29:50", "owner": "bobgump_ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983636256784429, "text": "WHAT", "created_at": "2024-12-01T07:19:35", "owner": "lenguado_anima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261299653269306, "text": "I loved the box getting squished, more games need to add loads of physics to their games", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:57:37", "owner": "hillsof1000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925828008882502, "text": "When I saw that nested for loop, I know that O(n^3) even though n is not equal for those loops", "created_at": "2024-11-30T23:39:42", "owner": "_.bsq._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030001634528524, "text": "As long as it's not UE5 I love it", "created_at": "2024-11-30T22:50:04", "owner": "danielnemeth_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116887006419163, "text": "too bad its unity", "created_at": "2024-11-30T22:36:50", "owner": "myceliumenoki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915769273013827, "text": "Oh I like that :)", "created_at": "2024-11-30T21:48:02", "owner": "invisible_polish_box", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471776722054861, "text": "Crying in Unity", "created_at": "2024-11-30T21:31:20", "owner": "nuclear_maniacs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112438657383745, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-30T18:34:38", "owner": "celtic.at14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040990672997592, "text": "what is this witchcraft", "created_at": "2024-11-30T15:28:08", "owner": "lilmaku.xmp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110625784429238, "text": "How long did this take?", "created_at": "2024-11-30T05:23:36", "owner": "thundereagle.956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917189634915321, "text": "Who could possibly still trust Unity", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:00:53", "owner": "mjiggidy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086838355476672, "text": "Loved it 🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-29T17:33:39", "owner": "rafaa_lago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931392984849061, "text": "That's pretty impressive", "created_at": "2024-11-29T15:02:49", "owner": "agustin.velasquezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084370666527247, "text": "Software?", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:35:01", "owner": "julen2010xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924068151992691, "text": "fucken black magic", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:05:00", "owner": "gifm____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030153200174539, "text": "not a game designer but i fw this heavy", "created_at": "2024-11-29T12:01:34", "owner": "notsopositive_khai", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18069439324635808, "text": "I wonder if you could program the box to have crumple zones instead of just squishing like a marshmallow", "created_at": "2024-11-29T11:48:00", "owner": "w00_die", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039636533466360, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-29T11:30:23", "owner": "stefanegger2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065077177758892, "text": "how the fuck", "created_at": "2024-11-29T05:51:11", "owner": "fakejonier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069503698590854, "text": "The bodies were so cool", "created_at": "2024-11-29T05:33:25", "owner": "o_sean_sailing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929026389860712, "text": "I LOVE LATTICE", "created_at": "2024-11-29T01:20:24", "owner": "erik_o_sky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940109718808275, "text": "thats a good lookin box", "created_at": "2024-11-29T01:20:14", "owner": "j.m.callaway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050365526065397, "text": "Wtf rare unity W???", "created_at": "2024-11-29T00:05:23", "owner": "aussieketch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069888403578908, "text": "Imagine this in vr", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:56:19", "owner": "_mason__m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18479374420001508, "text": "That robot looking kinda 𝙏𝙃𝙄𝘾𝘾", "created_at": "2024-11-28T21:49:55", "owner": "simply.ademm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044190278169525, "text": "@rafaelyzm ini diblender bisa gasih!", "created_at": "2024-11-28T19:33:36", "owner": "htfl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866677636255013, "text": "Goofy haa duck", "created_at": "2024-11-28T14:16:06", "owner": "miguel.v_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032779859371399, "text": "Ark humanoid compose", "created_at": "2024-11-28T11:31:03", "owner": "1filipino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988430022741433, "text": "The wrinkles on the cardboard box are impressive. Are these just two textures that get blended?", "created_at": "2024-11-28T03:44:05", "owner": "mr_mabulous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047333132041399, "text": "I’m scared of Unity, seeing that playground gave me PTSD", "created_at": "2024-11-28T03:38:17", "owner": "weezye_cats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889144189054559, "text": "The goofy engine", "created_at": "2024-11-28T03:36:52", "owner": "gm_alves_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064265410763914, "text": "Idk why but it always weirds me out seeing the code behind 3D stuff", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:38:23", "owner": "j.d.lux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995620488709581, "text": "should recreate meet the heavy, would be cool to see how close the animation of the box depressing was", "created_at": "2024-11-27T05:24:09", "owner": "psycho__scopic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017118722361124, "text": "Someone please make this for unreal", "created_at": "2024-11-26T20:51:51", "owner": "_distage_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319702597092496, "text": "Lattice deformer", "created_at": "2024-11-26T20:14:46", "owner": "avimaybe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938491764813854, "text": "They can finally animate luffy gear 5", "created_at": "2024-11-26T08:27:47", "owner": "dreamer10_amir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360953737188029, "text": "That O(n^3) 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-26T05:27:15", "owner": "cian_the_european", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107040943449693, "text": "Isn't unity the one that's taking a huge cut from creators", "created_at": "2024-11-26T01:37:19", "owner": "dj.ung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025772120251756, "text": "Veggietales was ahead of its time", "created_at": "2024-11-25T14:24:40", "owner": "tyc.miller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040763825182712, "text": "So that's what lattices are for", "created_at": "2024-11-25T13:27:37", "owner": "elvitt0ri0", "likes": 81}, {"id": 18060439174834795, "text": "Genius", "created_at": "2024-11-25T13:11:33", "owner": "this.one.jiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872970544144807, "text": "Game changer", "created_at": "2024-11-25T02:59:02", "owner": "dakastle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890102923051306, "text": "imagine this feature is in MineImator 🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:07:54", "owner": "christofuph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381551557096441, "text": "Maybe put it on GitHub? 🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-24T08:57:44", "owner": "nystylla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18464273623041786, "text": "damn", "created_at": "2024-11-12T02:10:27", "owner": "_kabeza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989361120589947, "text": "like that awsome", "created_at": "2024-11-08T10:17:07", "owner": "lrdev_games", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060324040743908, "text": "Insanely the next level!", "created_at": "2024-10-31T14:50:31", "owner": "rushyit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041494810935009, "text": "What did it cost? Everything...", "created_at": "2024-10-23T05:45:40", "owner": "dieselmechs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895062607087663, "text": "👏😯. ....", "created_at": "2024-10-20T23:34:35", "owner": "super_rabiscado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021056126273886, "text": "Woah", "created_at": "2024-10-19T18:05:30", "owner": "chanaphong11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129145768374724, "text": "Wow 😍  i wonder if we have this unreal 🤔", "created_at": "2024-10-08T20:44:00", "owner": "reaper_artwave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313337659095401, "text": "Wish we got this for Godot", "created_at": "2024-10-08T13:02:55", "owner": "mario.costa_08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18286762546227985, "text": "No blender eu sofro um pouco pra fazer isso", "created_at": "2024-10-07T22:10:02", "owner": "luka._.304", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907339897043020, "text": "Black magic", "created_at": "2024-10-06T20:43:15", "owner": "facu_benitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047145505803582, "text": "Wow does unreal engine have an equivalent?", "created_at": "2024-10-04T11:45:30", "owner": "life_of_a_polymath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048748471779040, "text": "Nah this is crazy", "created_at": "2024-10-03T13:29:09", "owner": "_lucashorta_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054595297873334, "text": "Saw ya on Reddit. Love the look of this, def on wishlist", "created_at": "2024-10-03T02:49:13", "owner": "ir.steve0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034345346242649, "text": "Do they have this for blender??", "created_at": "2024-10-03T01:07:52", "owner": "snowrowe27", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18072533500602261, "text": "Eso es una locura, y todo a tiempo real? increible.", "created_at": "2024-10-02T22:03:42", "owner": "ortizbagustin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044170394066828, "text": "assets name?", "created_at": "2024-10-02T16:35:19", "owner": "euphor1a_hills", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17901373335061458, "text": "It's as if the Spine 3D software existed", "created_at": "2024-10-02T14:25:27", "owner": "leomass", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059032924692333, "text": "WAWWWWWW🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-02T11:34:24", "owner": "rades_taa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18460780123017689, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-02T09:59:59", "owner": "21.lev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009881405392445, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-02T08:06:14", "owner": "nurs_3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927715302952549, "text": "It had attractive physics 😍", "created_at": "2024-10-02T06:53:47", "owner": "etherxp", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18018894947303224, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-02T06:20:47", "owner": "loasanaarlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286686991228005, "text": "Wow....cool 😍", "created_at": "2024-10-02T05:41:31", "owner": "rezframez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033683351271608, "text": "Lattices 👏", "created_at": "2024-10-02T03:00:38", "owner": "_motsuda_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103941562430100, "text": "Hope unreal gets this too 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-01T23:16:40", "owner": "monstro_games", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862332352239620, "text": "Top❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-01T21:05:55", "owner": "yassine.chafik.39", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026843945136575, "text": "This is blender?", "created_at": "2024-10-01T19:01:09", "owner": "gemma_ti5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042055853047744, "text": "The duck!!! 🐥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-01T17:52:32", "owner": "euphoricash13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035588666271604, "text": "Woooow looks cool, can’t wait to try it out", "created_at": "2024-10-01T16:03:57", "owner": "tricking.videogame", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17871183423193674, "text": "@eyedesyn you already know this workflow and algorithm and your not a game designer. You were teaching this in C4D ascent OG 3/4 years ago?! Guess I better remake it in @unrealengine with geometry scripts🤪", "created_at": "2024-10-01T15:43:24", "owner": "hollowswoodsman", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["80lvtalent", "3d", "3dart", "3dartist", "artist", "gamedev", "indiedev", "rendering", "render", "art", "conceptart", "unity", "unity3d", "madewithunity"]},
{"media_id": 3509855907012423001, "shortcode": "DC1g1n2SC1Z", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC1g1n2SC1Z/", "taken_at": "2024-11-26T13:25:01", "caption": "67 - #99daysto18 #成年倒數99天 \n-\n今天差點放棄了ㄏㄏㄏ", "owner_username": "wn.201", "owner_id": "3662053873", "likes": 42, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0301_DC1g1n2SC1Z\\DC1g1n2SC1Z_20241126_132501.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["99daysto18", "成年倒數99天"]},
{"media_id": 3505600984487532380, "shortcode": "DCmZYWco5dc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCmZYWco5dc/", "taken_at": "2024-11-20T16:32:36", "caption": "Tokyo Metro will soon be operating London’s Elizabeth Line #london #londonunderground #londontransport", "owner_username": "urbanstorieschannel", "owner_id": "66408903608", "likes": 33460, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0302_DCmZYWco5dc\\DCmZYWco5dc_20241120_163236.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17876449557163289, "text": "We can but dream... bring it on!!", "created_at": "2025-01-31T21:07:57", "owner": "mariafdee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054219137042266, "text": "Unfortunately the staff are not Japanese and the passengers are not Japanese. It’s simply never going to be the same.", "created_at": "2025-01-30T22:11:19", "owner": "pdjohnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036644117582673, "text": "The Elizabeth Line, being fairly new, is relatively clean. Can the Japanese run the remaining lines and clean them up? \n\nShame we didn’t have a leader looking after TFL based in London, who could do this… oh wait…", "created_at": "2025-01-28T07:32:00", "owner": "sunnylou8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030846749274616, "text": "This is just fucking crazy and why the underground is a nightmare. Different operators for different lines within the same metro system is just insane. I just spent a long weekend in London and navigating the train system was a nightmare. It makes the Paris metro look good.", "created_at": "2025-01-27T21:27:24", "owner": "esseeeayeenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059542072769611, "text": "Northern areas need more upgrades than london", "created_at": "2025-01-24T21:22:48", "owner": "life_is_too_shortxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067204870873446, "text": "At least we can rely on the Japanese", "created_at": "2025-01-22T12:51:14", "owner": "sekenimsaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898988065033185, "text": "You mean they run on time?", "created_at": "2025-01-20T18:03:23", "owner": "flowerchild_tokyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026054831330376, "text": "It once happened a black record in tokyo in 199x of toxic chemical disposal.", "created_at": "2025-01-20T07:31:36", "owner": "homeiae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116034823442790, "text": "@melbournemyhome", "created_at": "2025-01-20T00:12:30", "owner": "cishizuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132264544384021, "text": "Maybe Japanese companies can run our roadworks.", "created_at": "2025-01-19T08:23:09", "owner": "mad_dog_john", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945986295933041, "text": "More about politics than anything else", "created_at": "2025-01-19T05:52:36", "owner": "allan_stephens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035139050169370, "text": "American. メトロじゃない資料使ってるしな", "created_at": "2025-01-18T01:08:24", "owner": "ugetranger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18501876976040656, "text": "I hope they’re less extractive than when the Germans and Deutsch Bahn took over the Tyneside Metro system, stripped it to the bone and exported the surpluses to subsidise their domestic operations.", "created_at": "2025-01-17T22:27:29", "owner": "markopinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882557923214112, "text": "Great news. Better services, more choice and cheaper prices on privatised service delivered as promised by Mrs Thatcher.", "created_at": "2025-01-17T00:12:47", "owner": "spicy_scouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030287531262875, "text": "Japan to the UK: let the real boys deal with this 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-16T10:40:50", "owner": "manos.kumar88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084763162501994, "text": "All passengers’ data in the hands of a Japanese corp?! Why do consumers never ask the right questions  he questions and always assume foreign things to be better? I will stop using this line from May it seems…", "created_at": "2025-01-15T18:07:48", "owner": "june.estates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125956114403753, "text": "@realmikehollow You can travel back up there again in a more easier way.", "created_at": "2025-01-15T15:47:58", "owner": "king_ahmed120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014020514689031, "text": "am Japanese, please do not trust us so much cause Japan and Yen have fallen to the class of undeveloped nation.\nEverything is more cheaper than UK which means we are collapsed.\nJust see and look how it goes.\nRising sun is finished", "created_at": "2025-01-15T12:48:41", "owner": "amalfianacapri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052853357026732, "text": "@juliana76mubanga", "created_at": "2025-01-15T12:19:14", "owner": "alfi_bunce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081938500586796, "text": "So curious what change we will see", "created_at": "2025-01-14T21:06:24", "owner": "plantsplanetsandelements", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894731797109997, "text": "Tokyo metro is the most confusing metro in the world omg no", "created_at": "2025-01-14T15:15:39", "owner": "lisaromanych", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035053139384301, "text": "I hope the joint venture results in a reduction in cost per ticket.", "created_at": "2025-01-13T12:27:38", "owner": "nze.priddie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18442174942078901, "text": "Mr. Myagui station", "created_at": "2025-01-13T08:17:26", "owner": "palion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268631563270816, "text": "Why are other countries running our transport, airports, housing. WTAF ! 🙄", "created_at": "2025-01-13T06:37:00", "owner": "luisenlondres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044327357465397, "text": "Was always running with delays and over crowded", "created_at": "2025-01-13T01:34:26", "owner": "euro.star.intercity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891436282156329, "text": "\"cost effective\" for who exactly?", "created_at": "2025-01-12T22:35:19", "owner": "michelleparismusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973550451812815, "text": "Why not all other tunes too...?", "created_at": "2025-01-12T09:28:56", "owner": "shokofjmt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953877153887471, "text": "So does that mean that the passengers are stuffed into the train, and it’s not accessible to wheelchairs and strollers and co?", "created_at": "2025-01-12T08:26:29", "owner": "grouchy_sandwitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032417327607543, "text": "🇯🇵🚊🇬🇧", "created_at": "2025-01-12T07:46:47", "owner": "aiiga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063656389884416, "text": "YES JP PLS FIX THEM ONEGAISHIMASU 😭🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-01-11T11:47:34", "owner": "zadagof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891971263082775, "text": "pointless if the staff are not also brought from Japan😜", "created_at": "2025-01-09T09:53:44", "owner": "7twosclash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035490647379005, "text": "Hopefully they can fine people for putting their shoes on the seats", "created_at": "2025-01-09T01:55:52", "owner": "jonnytanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887150749178184, "text": "Do we own anything in this Country. What a ####ing joke", "created_at": "2025-01-07T20:22:31", "owner": "leojward420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919719562040710, "text": "ついにプロの日本人経営.", "created_at": "2025-01-06T16:55:38", "owner": "christiantadini_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080705641602358, "text": "The Japanese will run this very smoothly judging from what I’ve seen in Tokyo.", "created_at": "2025-01-05T15:16:57", "owner": "dilwynjones1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944891118926329, "text": "The trains will operate on time", "created_at": "2025-01-04T08:59:17", "owner": "mr_bliss8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036944609113148, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2025-01-03T17:31:47", "owner": "glen_pitman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980335860645064, "text": "I think Londoners might be beyond salvation", "created_at": "2025-01-03T15:23:17", "owner": "joemacchiato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967845636819466, "text": "Couldn't they start with the Northern Line?", "created_at": "2025-01-03T09:22:48", "owner": "urbane_fox_london", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859638328264585, "text": "この列車は、エリザベート線各駅停車、ヒースロー行です", "created_at": "2025-01-03T02:53:57", "owner": "nic0las_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927783753888252, "text": "Paris too plzz", "created_at": "2025-01-02T13:36:06", "owner": "wosbfwl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918237198934784, "text": "Can we give them all the train and tube  lines to run please - if that is much of a monopoly share some with whoever runs Swiss rails", "created_at": "2025-01-02T10:38:22", "owner": "zabett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040987520263030, "text": "Not as often as I would like, as it's often problematic", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:27:15", "owner": "mariapeligrosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024316868325669, "text": "Can they take over NYC’s MTA as well thanks", "created_at": "2025-01-01T02:21:20", "owner": "dionysosj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174892432314527, "text": "That means you are not allowed to talk loudly on the train.", "created_at": "2024-12-30T21:07:48", "owner": "sheepjoshua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482709250000223, "text": "Hallelujah", "created_at": "2024-12-30T18:35:50", "owner": "leedirect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091980508526009, "text": "Will probably be the best line in London 👌🏼", "created_at": "2024-12-30T14:16:31", "owner": "nataliarhartmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045401140968797, "text": "Japanese work ethic is drastically different than English. I worked for a Japanese owned biotech in US before working for biotech in London, and the way the companies were run were different. The Japanese have a really rigorous structure for quality and efficiency, everything has been well thought out, systems in place for systems. It is why the US benchmarked Japan for manufacturing many years ago. The English system was more sort-of on a whim 😂… whenever people “felt-like” doing something, and things like running something 1X for “trending” was wild to me. Now that company is struggling to stay afloat and is running out of funding. If things get done English way, it won’t work, as has been exampled. If they give the Japanese system hierarchy, it will. ego’s will be damaged lol….", "created_at": "2024-12-30T10:09:23", "owner": "antarcticahands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030594680232898, "text": "Maybe Japan should rule the UK? They would do it better.", "created_at": "2024-12-29T20:52:19", "owner": "cronopia63", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18370874920113716, "text": "What was the reason?", "created_at": "2024-12-29T18:35:49", "owner": "_michelewilliamson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109359388449922, "text": "U guys get humble br my Japanese people", "created_at": "2024-12-29T16:02:12", "owner": "brentluisofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031466381576622, "text": "I can’t wait - in Japan  the ticket inspector turns and bows as he leaves your carriage", "created_at": "2024-12-28T21:10:58", "owner": "wyatt.adrian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048571562111779, "text": "Well if anyone has been on the Tokyo metro, TFL can learn a lot!", "created_at": "2024-12-27T15:15:19", "owner": "rosbarresi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980896353641397, "text": "Cool, amazing japan technology & management.", "created_at": "2024-12-27T01:48:07", "owner": "magusdinji_p", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17855623665284715, "text": "Maybe they should also take over the Toronto Transit Commission - as long as the contract includes major maintenance, rehab, and intelligent scheduling.", "created_at": "2024-12-26T18:56:06", "owner": "markdsegal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916437466030240, "text": "Might actually run to time", "created_at": "2024-12-26T17:04:18", "owner": "kittyrosekitty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18147819769359206, "text": "More money funnelled to private companies", "created_at": "2024-12-26T16:08:41", "owner": "that.grosswardein.guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137277901373760, "text": "Because that worked so well in Stockholm.", "created_at": "2024-12-26T10:31:19", "owner": "gernot77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843954439388658, "text": "This is great news - bring in discipline & professionalism and get rid off incompetent TFL", "created_at": "2024-12-26T09:45:54", "owner": "chilliconkaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063306187860141, "text": "Can we please get the Yamanote line jingles on the Elizabeth line thank you 🎵", "created_at": "2024-12-24T20:46:19", "owner": "empyreanfields", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058519765820842, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-24T15:41:10", "owner": "a_sassy_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957124908893525, "text": "ADD A CUTE JINGLE FOR THE LINE AND EACH STOP LIKE THEY DO IN JAPAN 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-23T21:04:21", "owner": "ashleydevelops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082733797560967, "text": "We, as users, do not care who operates the line as long as it runs smoothly!", "created_at": "2024-12-21T14:26:16", "owner": "judehighrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046660019154229, "text": "Thank goodness, we can now go beyond Paddington station 🚉 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:38:32", "owner": "londonmother", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082332733560507, "text": "Bring it to NZ please.", "created_at": "2024-12-17T00:42:45", "owner": "malatangfu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069790354679866, "text": "I’m hoping there’s some sort of kawaii jingle that plays", "created_at": "2024-12-13T17:33:33", "owner": "nas_abraham", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046454419921289, "text": "Why not keep the money in the UK and get a UK company to earn the money. I don't understand why it has to be international!", "created_at": "2024-12-13T16:42:55", "owner": "rizkhanx2x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055978987761292, "text": "Can Tokyo metro come and run that shambles that we have here in the states?", "created_at": "2024-12-12T23:01:06", "owner": "outis_sinenomine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023829668557409, "text": "Amazing!! Yes. Yes. Yes.", "created_at": "2024-12-12T18:39:17", "owner": "fignyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860738551239858, "text": "Finally, no more delays??", "created_at": "2024-12-12T17:42:16", "owner": "dmitryyoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125170009393855, "text": "Can we get them to take over London North Western Railway too??", "created_at": "2024-12-12T13:51:44", "owner": "sharon_swims", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017949248379583, "text": "WHAT ?!?!?!", "created_at": "2024-12-12T12:51:42", "owner": "colingoldart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851552305310238, "text": "😲", "created_at": "2024-12-12T08:42:54", "owner": "angelatamayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036613031090619, "text": "Maybe finally it will work properly", "created_at": "2024-12-11T06:16:23", "owner": "kbbhaskaran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013806620462475, "text": "Do the same with Dubai", "created_at": "2024-12-11T04:00:53", "owner": "m_wg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069881563640891, "text": "Need this in France. Always saying we're the 1st train etc, but they didn't evolve correctly and are far away from being punctual like Japan.", "created_at": "2024-12-10T06:21:01", "owner": "bboy.fane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990980649733778, "text": "Can they also run South Western Railway while we are on this topic?", "created_at": "2024-12-10T02:22:06", "owner": "sophi3aah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938901612944813, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-10T02:21:20", "owner": "sophi3aah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277878052221441, "text": "MTR is a Hong Kong corporation so not sure why they’re criticising an outside company taking over. They’re just trading one for another", "created_at": "2024-12-09T07:38:32", "owner": "awongolding", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17933449088848673, "text": "So, will there be staff members on the platforms on standby to push passengers into the train when the trains are full😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T03:28:43", "owner": "takliu1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894128884037465, "text": "V proud of my country’s transportation system that it’s now helping other country’s tube to work better!", "created_at": "2024-12-07T12:23:28", "owner": "mamarazzi_asako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040794695245246, "text": "Prepare to travel with nothing but excellence 💙", "created_at": "2024-12-07T11:23:29", "owner": "cyncastilloflorez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042344816180680, "text": "Why only the Elizabeth Line..?", "created_at": "2024-12-07T10:18:13", "owner": "doctor_sumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030267212417661, "text": "This is not true. This is fake news.", "created_at": "2024-12-07T08:37:59", "owner": "flash_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952437138856632, "text": "Why?", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:28:19", "owner": "blimeyifancyreading", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052153010057262, "text": "Great, now I can finally get to work without a delay here and there on this line…", "created_at": "2024-12-06T18:51:09", "owner": "dsnkop21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347017621135075, "text": "Never work", "created_at": "2024-12-06T07:50:41", "owner": "steff_ago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842376463382109, "text": "Oh great, just when they talk about renationalising the rails they wanna give a piece of the pie to foreign corporations all over again", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:18:58", "owner": "mezykin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137188972367831, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-05T22:41:05", "owner": "verdalondonofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031357700581823, "text": "Can we have the staff on the platforms in their nice uniforms and hats also the white gloves, so  professional 👏", "created_at": "2024-12-05T16:08:09", "owner": "mikehartphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905275276073974, "text": "So for everyone’s knowledge. Elizabeth Line was operated by MTR cooperation which is a Hong Kong based company. Most of the MTR trains were build in UK. Some companies and organisations do have joint ventures so what’s the big deal if Japanese Metro is taking over.", "created_at": "2024-12-05T11:13:16", "owner": "travel_buddie4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904994055983276, "text": "Why !?", "created_at": "2024-12-04T11:52:17", "owner": "benjam_010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074622682614356, "text": "No more strike", "created_at": "2024-12-04T07:27:21", "owner": "jamesbondtran007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988993002604015, "text": "The Japanese really have no idea what they’re letting themselves in for 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:23:51", "owner": "bernardsinew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050342824846922, "text": "just another failing of UK gov to manage infrastructure. This weekend I spent a total of 6hrs driving on two trips in traffic to go 4.5 miles due to #tfl and #networkrail transport restrictions. #dobetter", "created_at": "2024-12-03T09:08:34", "owner": "kswinyard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116212762425814, "text": "Unfortunately the downfall of this idea is the London people", "created_at": "2024-12-03T06:55:14", "owner": "silentcyfer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957788589843144, "text": "Hopefully it'd be good", "created_at": "2024-12-03T05:02:14", "owner": "thefreefencer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986136630716525, "text": "Can we please get Tokyo food onboard too🙆🏻‍♀️😭😋", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:11:57", "owner": "mnisimsima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900599560000612, "text": "Hopefully a fun jingle for every stop", "created_at": "2024-12-02T21:23:26", "owner": "elliotroberts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112109617384976, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:10:31", "owner": "kejin26", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["london", "londonunderground", "londontransport"]},
{"media_id": 3507768536473437573, "shortcode": "DCuGOYiyoWF", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCuGOYiyoWF/", "taken_at": "2024-11-23T16:18:49", "caption": "How well can you use your competitors for your own marketing?\n\nThis is one of the most creative ways a brand has ever used their competitors for their own promotion.\n\nThis strategy by DHL gained them hundreds of thousands of new customers who switched from UPS or FedEx to DHL just because of the creativity and humour of this marketing campaign.\n\n#branding #marketing #advertising #business", "owner_username": "reputeforge", "owner_id": "62128921313", "likes": 190582, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0303_DCuGOYiyoWF\\DCuGOYiyoWF_20241123_161849.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17957492691028543, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2026-01-18T18:10:57", "owner": "aaalexngn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552438067008025, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2026-01-14T15:34:13", "owner": "pazarlamamaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862451524509054, "text": "marketing", "created_at": "2025-10-27T15:08:46", "owner": "arturferdes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081515071760451, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:03:29", "owner": "plantifyurhome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072565661489984, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-08-22T04:09:34", "owner": "raphaelmassagardi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033859118488100, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:12:10", "owner": "_sofiablewett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114952165509853, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:16:26", "owner": "pedrosobral", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195897376311016, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-07-26T16:32:04", "owner": "balimarks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842187613535095, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-07-10T03:40:01", "owner": "chilloutfranco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863922748355071, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-07-01T16:41:22", "owner": "lovecurvyme"