 yo sé que sabes el idioma castellano lo hablas y escribes bien 👍 porque no te comunicas con tus Fans AMORCITO te quiero muchísimo y te mando besos 😘 😘😘😘😘😘🤩😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘😘🤩🤩🇦🇷😘😘🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩", "created_at": "2024-09-09T12:11:59", "owner": "pasquali.carlosjose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983266554723443, "text": "The outfit is as gorgeous as you are🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-09-09T11:37:39", "owner": "sartor117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281637421233513, "text": "Rupta cubanului", "created_at": "2024-09-09T08:20:16", "owner": "iordan.vadim.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889926316014426, "text": "❤️❤️🔥🔥😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-09T05:48:25", "owner": "feredon.soghy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931006401925179, "text": "When you obey the call anymore of your heart, your father when your purpose, having purpose in your life give you the courage to do the things you are meant to do, when you are purpose driven, you have learned to listen to the intuition and never let no get in your way,", "created_at": "2024-09-09T02:11:21", "owner": "tommyjackson3143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18450500770049949, "text": "🙌❤️🙌", "created_at": "2024-09-09T01:55:57", "owner": "arrow_sagita", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051097315865230, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-09-09T00:39:58", "owner": "skinn_miz", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["anadearmas"]},
