alls the cops simply for smiling.", "created_at": "2025-09-15T07:52:12", "owner": "todd_marine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979184124871471, "text": "I’m sorry what were you saying I was distracted", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:14:10", "owner": "colinpsheridan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856637866459270, "text": "Not have anything going or my meaning of my life.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T07:25:22", "owner": "italiancarman25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009727112621824, "text": "My problem is my introvertness and id like to be more hygienic about my skin but i just do the basic so goal be more skin hydrate or laking vitamin always dry or irritation docs say not a big problem even though it keeps me up at night because of the burn or itchy too much.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T07:23:02", "owner": "italiancarman25", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17981133932879942, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-12T04:45:21", "owner": "yungusandrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905781592232319, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T21:38:54", "owner": "troysandersok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190331653320716, "text": "You looks beautiful and very sexy and I send you greetings from Germany ❤️💐", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:05:11", "owner": "frankwiegand7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17978513801912068, "text": "I have never heard you speak. Your accent. Where is it / are you from?", "created_at": "2025-09-09T11:58:16", "owner": "takata.rikuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946712802901899, "text": "You have to live with it!", "created_at": "2025-09-08T08:01:52", "owner": "brt95246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919424527118772, "text": "I feel the sign when I see you dress like that ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:55:20", "owner": "newingsteve7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088621606789296, "text": "What about full beards? I don't have good advice about controlling attractions. I'm very weak for hot women... sometimes men, too. 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:37:32", "owner": "mistereeman", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": 