{"media_id": 3492775098974566759, "shortcode": "DB41HJutXln", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB41HJutXln/", "taken_at": "2024-11-02T23:47:39", "caption": "⚡️ Sidebar UI Design\n-\n𝗔𝗨𝗧𝗛𝗢𝗥: @janm_ux\n𝗕𝗿𝗼𝘂𝗴𝗵𝘁 𝘁𝗼 𝘆𝗼𝘂 𝗯𝘆: @ui_gradient\n-\nA sidebar in UI design serves as a persistent navigation element, offering users quick and easy access to essential sections or functions within an interface. It typically remains visible while users interact with other parts of the application, providing a consistent, intuitive way to navigate between key areas without disrupting workflow. An effectively designed sidebar enhances the user experience by improving accessibility and reducing the cognitive load required to locate important features. Thoughtful placement of icons, clear labeling, and an organized structure can make it a powerful tool for guiding users through complex applications or websites.\n\n#uidesigner #uidesign #designsystem #ui #uiux #uidesignpatterns #userinterface #interface #webdesigner #websitedesign #webdev #uxuidesign #websitedesigner #ux #uxigers #webdesign", "owner_username": "ui_gradient", "owner_id": "2463881704", "likes": -1, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0308_DB41HJutXln\\DB41HJutXln_20241102_234739_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0308_DB41HJutXln\\DB41HJutXln_20241102_234739_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0308_DB41HJutXln\\DB41HJutXln_20241102_234739_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0308_DB41HJutXln\\DB41HJutXln_20241102_234739_4.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18091046218819907", "text": "Great breakdown of sidebar design principles! Clear navigation is key for user experience, and your explanation makes it easy to understand. Keep sharing these valuable insights!", "created_at": "2026-01-20T15:10:53", "owner": "onon.technology", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18293747548242023", "text": "Love this!", "created_at": "2025-01-22T04:06:24", "owner": "cychosting", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17868688173162432", "text": "True design gem", "created_at": "2024-11-10T11:39:35", "owner": "shariqwithui_ux", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17871107382144810", "text": "Awesome work 🤍", "created_at": "2024-11-05T12:47:44", "owner": "webdesign_786", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17998200998695038", "text": "Wow Awesome Work", "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:13:50", "owner": "sajiburdesign", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18067837027629799", "text": "Great Share!", "created_at": "2024-11-04T14:29:20", "owner": "devdock.tech", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18032394023342721", "text": "💗💗💗", "created_at": "2024-11-04T10:37:35", "owner": "reneecarbonefleming", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18074555554596349", "text": "Use shipwright by @headwayio and save time.", "created_at": "2024-11-04T01:02:42", "owner": "phillipwhiteman", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17934866507940731", "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-03T23:55:23", "owner": "hamza_farooqi_303", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17883700302151509", "text": "These left sidebar navigations are clean and functional! 📂✨ What’s your approach to keeping it organized for easy navigation?", "created_at": "2024-11-03T15:09:22", "owner": "orbixweb", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18060840781753973", "text": "Amazing 😍", "created_at": "2024-11-03T14:50:41", "owner": "digitalmaimoona", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18048832957994635", "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:38:45", "owner": "webdbyutkarsh", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17843844513340852", "text": "Nice sidebar explanation!", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:09:53", "owner": "razaqdesign.dev", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18147897550338627", "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-03T05:03:48", "owner": "pk1118p", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17934890231941527", "text": "Wow! This is next level!", "created_at": "2024-11-03T00:49:27", "owner": "uiux_mridul", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["uidesigner", "uidesign", "designsystem", "ui", "uiux", "uidesignpatterns", "userinterface", "interface", "webdesigner", "websitedesign", "webdev", "uxuidesign", "websitedesigner", "ux", "uxigers", "webdesign"]},
{"media_id": 3490320362199558703, "shortcode": "DBwG-B9N6ov", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBwG-B9N6ov/", "taken_at": "2024-10-30T14:30:32", "caption": "A few tips to design better login forms UI\n\nBrain By: uiadrian\n⠀⠀⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣\nFind your way into our community by using #UXBrainy\n\n#uxtips #uxwriting #uiuxtutorial #uidesigner #uidesign #uxd #uxdesigning #uxbridge #uxuidesigner #ui #ux #uxdesigns #circlemakers #uxinspiration #uidesigns #dailyui #uidesignpatterns #websitedesigner #websitedesign #figmatips #figmaplugins #figmadesigner\n\n⠀⠀⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣", "owner_username": "uxbrainy", "owner_id": "9298987867", "likes": 2007, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0309_DBwG-B9N6ov\\DBwG-B9N6ov_20241030_143032_9.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17965590176704817", "text": "🙌🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-19T16:43:07", "owner": "goovostudios", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17923316807877911", "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-11-01T09:31:53", "owner": "in_touch_carrot.ru", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18040318528957293", "text": "🔥❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-01T07:47:31", "owner": "ariapadideh", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18028318373582372", "text": "Such an important aspect of UX design, this is something we’re passionate about too at Cultivate Digital.", "created_at": "2024-11-01T01:55:08", "owner": "cultivate_digital", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18095497750473157", "text": "Great work🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-31T09:20:20", "owner": "desafz", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18131671663375163", "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-30T19:54:19", "owner": "play.art.design", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17884503051116643", "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-30T18:50:25", "owner": "mahdi_baghizade", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18059468158661965", "text": "At a glance, I would argue that this isn’t a good form. Firstly: Forgot password is in an odd place and looks busy with the current placement contributing to distraction and breaking the flow. Secondly: 16px input field height on Desktop vs 44px on Mobile creates unnecessary complications to maintain the CSS, and recommended height of 44px is for touch area. Are we forgetting that Desktops can have touchscreens too?.", "created_at": "2024-10-30T15:03:02", "owner": "luka.ivas", "likes": 6}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["uxbrainy", "uxtips", "uxwriting", "uiuxtutorial", "uidesigner", "uidesign", "uxd", "uxdesigning", "uxbridge", "uxuidesigner", "ui", "ux", "uxdesigns", "circlemakers", "uxinspiration", "uidesigns", "dailyui", "uidesignpatterns", "websitedesigner", "websitedesign", "figmatips", "figmaplugins", "figmadesigner"]},
{"media_id": 3497462472154220069, "shortcode": "DCJe5aMAwYl", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCJe5aMAwYl/", "taken_at": "2024-11-09T11:00:38", "caption": "Hidden Design Gems You Need to Know About! 💎\n\nDesign is all about the details – sometimes the smallest elements make the biggest impact! ✨\n\n Today, we’re unveiling some of the hidden gems in design: from underrated tools to inspiring websites that can elevate your projects.\n\nNot everything valuable is in plain sight – sometimes, you have to dive deeper to uncover the true treasures! 🌊\n\n-\n\n#dribbble #uxdesign #uidesign #ux #websitedesign #ui#webdesign #webdesigner #designinspiration #website#uidesigner #appdesign #uiux #userinterfacedesign #uitrends#interface #userexperience #interfacedesign #adobexd#uxinspiration #mobileappdesign #designsystem #designvideos #productdesigner #designwebsite #designeesource #designgems #designassets #designtrends #designresources", "owner_username": "ui.martin", "owner_id": "8096925243", "likes": 3475, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0310_DCJe5aMAwYl\\DCJe5aMAwYl_20241109_110038_9.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18091944142650046, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-07-15T17:53:31", "owner": "techloomcode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044099245954490, "text": "loving these resourc