57943839, "text": "Great 👍", "created_at": "2024-11-14T05:03:13", "owner": "mountainthemeofficial", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18244554220287953, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-14T02:12:26", "owner": "pragati.design", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087627739509802, "text": "The simplicity and elegance of your design make it stand out. It’s impressive how you've managed to make complex information look so accessible.❤️✨", "created_at": "2024-11-13T21:08:11", "owner": "brainywebdesigns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18273349012221593, "text": "Thanks for sharing 🥰🙏🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-13T18:54:56", "owner": "hashem_advs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044560619352000, "text": "\"Who builds websites better than us? From stunning designs to seamless functionality, we make every pixel count! See for \n\nyourself: https://aglivo.com/", "created_at": "2025-02-05T11:51:43", "owner": "digitalpapa.media", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154721650337154, "text": "چقدر زیبا و خلاقانه😍", "created_at": "2024-12-13T08:30:49", "owner": "sepantamax_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["appbrainy", "appdesign", "application", "app", "appdesignagency", "appui", "webapp", "appdesigner", "digitalbanking", "foodapp", "resturantapp", "financeapp", "bankingapp", "mobileappdesign", "designinspiration", "techui", "financeapp", "webdesigner", "website", "webdesign", "dailyui", "uitips"]},
{"media_id": 3510179444867526781, "shortcode": "DC2qZt9NPB9", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC2qZt9NPB9/", "taken_at": "2024-11-27T00:07:38", "caption": "don’t forget that casetify phone case 😊 \n#hongkonggirl #internationalschool #ootd", "owner_username": "jen.zhou", "owner_id": "2064243470", "likes": 26831, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0315_DC2qZt9NPB9\\DC2qZt9NPB9_20241127_000738.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17892619191395062, "text": "what bullshit", "created_at": "2026-01-02T10:58:37", "owner": "rogerthursby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18502658677002055, "text": "My international school had uniform 😭", "created_at": "2025-05-05T11:49:11", "owner": "linos_stan143", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062998217493281, "text": "That’s like literally anyone here in Canada I see no difference", "created_at": "2025-04-13T23:26:31", "owner": "haoba_hao_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105404443486367, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-02-16T14:36:33", "owner": "tiimtsse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290515072173988, "text": "Hey where’s island school", "created_at": "2025-01-28T02:44:21", "owner": "chan_chrmaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064572322854107, "text": "Idk what era this is, but this is cool international school era coz girlie our fashion was not so cute 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-14T04:56:09", "owner": "vivecachow", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18072674533712329, "text": "regular hk woman", "created_at": "2025-01-03T12:48:27", "owner": "ojwrui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908940607078110, "text": "YCIS Kowloon forever!!!❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-30T13:22:52", "owner": "lucky_ducky8864", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050159375287100, "text": "FIS MENTIONED RAHH", "created_at": "2024-12-28T08:43:00", "owner": "isabelle_.sykwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067253698740693, "text": "just being basic~", "created_at": "2024-12-27T03:43:43", "owner": "ember.derek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045047891178805, "text": "No one wears this kind of jacket in international school in HK tbh", "created_at": "2024-12-20T14:48:15", "owner": "cws_claire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018389723376506, "text": "my feed knows me 😭 but I went to one a long time ago", "created_at": "2024-12-17T00:37:36", "owner": "adorlique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891312574112115, "text": "Nice cardigan!!!What brands is it ??", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:55:17", "owner": "g_for_grateful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923018860005828, "text": "hkis mentioned 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-11T10:26:27", "owner": "mrgnmok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893316676101968, "text": "Those aren't even baggy jeans", "created_at": "2024-12-10T11:21:39", "owner": "squidward__scissorhands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108852670444604, "text": "WGAF?", "created_at": "2024-12-09T22:39:12", "owner": "dwwk_kit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844761373370513, "text": "OMG HKIS MY LOVE FOREVER 🙏", "created_at": "2024-12-09T16:49:32", "owner": "ejk2009", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18256644466258266, "text": "@richie1112 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T15:59:56", "owner": "mki_my111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025043435308127, "text": "whereeee is the cardigan from", "created_at": "2024-12-09T08:42:38", "owner": "marlene.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474744511048722, "text": "@holly.terrebrood is this true??", "created_at": "2024-12-08T23:04:27", "owner": "josie_ivancich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128052232378450, "text": "why nobody mentioned AISHK", "created_at": "2024-12-08T10:37:36", "owner": "buongiorno__matteo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123026959395332, "text": "This is basic genz fashion 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T15:17:12", "owner": "ishxsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050246153072469, "text": "Isn’t that just all people now", "created_at": "2024-12-06T21:45:55", "owner": "ai_ouh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946385739913525, "text": "@tttszyu._", "created_at": "2024-12-05T09:29:09", "owner": "mmmaxedout_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025432556279594, "text": "😆", "created_at": "2024-12-03T10:00:59", "owner": "ecnelisgnol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071343223640423, "text": "They've all become like local schools these days.", "created_at": "2024-12-01T07:40:52", "owner": "nomadin852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886819858150607, "text": "Where did aishk go", "created_at": "2024-12-01T04:33:49", "owner": "rextse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844941448353240, "text": "@enricoantonioyb", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:23:45", "owner": "_wonjaesuh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050937244988172, "text": "inaccurate hkis students only wear that one pair of pajama pants and a baggy tshirt everyday 💀", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:09:31", "owner": "mayaleetrudeau", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18023044667620737, "text": "west island where???", "created_at": "2024-11-30T13:05:30", "owner": "ate_leftnocrumbs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17856428928262126, "text": "All boys in CIS also dress like this", "created_at": "2024-11-29T23:42:22", "owner": "kaidenpw5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906663388060811, "text": "Where’s your octopus card holder ?", "created_at": "2024-11-29T22:48:58", "owner": "candy8970__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18348039946127629, "text": "Hahha looking so cute I love this 🤍", "created_at": "2024-11-29T18:34:13", "owner": "natasha_lu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061732435832098, "text": "。。。。。。。", "created_at": "2024-11-29T17:14:20", "owner": "needtobelulled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005145926679457, "text": "Cdnis mentioned 🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:01:29", "owner": "yuedamien", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18031345793386229, "text": "Yeah hk for the w, I'm in hkis but that is not how I dress", "created_at": "2024-11-29T12:53:56", "owner": "noodle_king101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088765519512056, "text": "those ain’t baggy", "created_at": "2024-11-29T12:43:07", "owner": "fac._.off", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073076848622835, "text": "Always @primomodel in the bio 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T11:56:51", "owner": "ycfromtha8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051455521972952, "text": "@claudia_chan12", "created_at": "2024-11-29T09:52:00", "owner": "baki_ffffffff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114903847420176, "text": "FIS INCLUDED HAHA", "created_at": "2024-11-29T07:57:47", "owner": "summer_avey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073035928618901, "text": "GUYS WHERE IS KJS/KGV", "created_at": "2024-11-29T07:47:24", "owner": "bern.dern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015504413402968, "text": "this applies to all international schools lol", "created_at": "2024-11-29T06:31:09", "owner": "abtwll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359495656185558, "text": "Don't forget the domestic helper on the side helping with everything", "created_at": "2024-11-29T03:53:08", "owner": "radioraheem2", "likes": 92}, {"id": 17943591395794804, "text": "THS core, the air force, the black hoodie the baggie jeans", "created_at": "2024-11-29T03:48:05", "owner": "nao_shohtoku", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18048015407480030, "text": "Step 7: idgaf", "created_at": "2024-11-29T02:38:05", "owner": "diuleegohai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041236328191355, "text": "Guys these schools are randomly picked😂😂,she can’t show all the IS’s at the same time right?😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T01:39:54", "owner": "_lwk1104___0_0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18288592117211166, "text": "No, this is look like some Chinese shopping at the mall😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T01:33:26", "owner": "_lwk1104___0_0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047359817024681, "text": "So just dress normal?", "created_at": "2024-11-29T00:51:32", "owner": "baconnppancakes", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069258064638152, "text": "LFIS YAY", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:56:35", "owner": "lea_gr1veau_dashnyam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467651767046479, "text": "SOUTH ISLAND MENTIONED", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:25:59", "owner": "oceanicxhayley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015844496391007, "text": "@aashlvnn why are you in this vid", "created_at": "2024-11-28T18:59:11", "owner": "n4talie.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044571367930896, "text": "How to flex in a dying city", "created_at": "2024-11-28T18:10:39", "owner": "thissucker7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014614919427709, "text": "Hkis rugby wears kit all day everyday", "created_at": "2024-11-28T17:27:43", "owner": "hkis.rugby", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18377869810128318, "text": "I agree, but why do u want ppl to think u are from international sch?? Interesting", "created_at": "2024-11-28T17:07:48", "owner": "domin6033", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18027269279222515, "text": "GSIS MENTIONED!!!🔥🔥🔥🔥🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-28T16:42:34", "owner": "tanishasoniji", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044579954143095, "text": "U need bagger jeans w the air forces", "created_at": "2024-11-28T14:02:02", "owner": "taksss_18", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18172357021310992, "text": "No icshk 😭😭", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:52:04", "owner": "cwq_ly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014794391433994, "text": "Don’t forget the Nike kicks and iPhone and lippy", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:51:52", "owner": "cwq_ly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854890603324945, "text": "hey why is harrow not there😢", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:39:24", "owner": "jaydentsgg_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17929263290859691, "text": "npc☕️", "created_at": "2024-11-28T12:22:15", "owner": "zlroejzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026700629529178, "text": "HKIS meantioned AHAHAHAHA", "created_at": "2024-11-28T11:36:24", "owner": "s.ofia.xyz", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18017566979352531, "text": "FIS MENTIONED", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:56:19", "owner": "chii.ng15_", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18083872984551136, "text": "Where did ISland school go?!", "created_at": "2024-11-28T08:22:59", "owner": "jani_x.e", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18015125120416258, "text": "Gurl, just go to a international school then 😂 it’s that easy", "created_at": "2024-11-28T08:22:42", "owner": "jani_x.e", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024486056289561, "text": "HKIS", "created_at": "2024-11-28T07:58:43", "owner": "itspatrickwu", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17948618204864965, "text": "Why’d you pick South Island over regular island 😑😑😑😑", "created_at": "2024-11-28T07:47:40", "owner": "ryan_chewing", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18069493954595459, "text": "