rean international school was worse 🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:45:04", "owner": "_aar0nk1m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049012712503303, "text": "SOUTH ISLAND SKL BAHAHAHHA", "created_at": "2024-11-28T12:56:38", "owner": "zheng.meredith12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857539096301677, "text": "and really obnoxiously loud every where you fucking go like literally everywhere bus, streets, toilets you can always hear the inters b4 u c them🙃", "created_at": "2024-11-28T09:39:56", "owner": "n.vaeh.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043967195142659, "text": "I went to an international school in singapore and dress like a bum", "created_at": "2024-11-28T02:16:57", "owner": "rbilotka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18344707039182064, "text": "Hey search my song called “overdose” by “Matty ice 1990” and make a reel using my song and I will share your video to my story and to my 10,000 followers on Facebook to help promote you and my song  let’s grow!!! Teamwork!!!! Let me know when you make the video and I’ll share wherever I can. Thanks 😊", "created_at": "2024-11-27T05:29:42", "owner": "matty_icemusic", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hongkonggirl", "internationalschool", "ootd"]},
