"id": 18135769015366363, "text": "As AI engineer, I would really appreciate a 5080, thanks", "created_at": "2024-11-22T00:19:18", "owner": "im.ema_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060585262675486, "text": "Stupendous share ⭐", "created_at": "2024-11-21T12:03:40", "owner": "datawithdisha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18029746319176196, "text": "Ellie Planner subscription 🫶🫶🫶 honored 🙇", "created_at": "2024-11-21T00:06:45", "owner": "chris.raroque", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18026782949411549, "text": "All the partners of techy people watching this reel: 👀📱📸", "created_at": "2024-11-21T00:05:56", "owner": "caitlinmell0r", "likes": 11}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["christmasgiftideas", "programmers", "softwareengineer", "cs", "coding", "softwaredeveloper"]},
{"media_id": 3512437162736865905, "shortcode": "DC-rv1kz9Jx", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC-rv1kz9Jx/", "taken_at": "2024-11-30T02:53:18", "caption": "現在可免費使用啊!\nNVIDIA 近期推出了 Edify，一個多模態架構，專門用於開發視覺生成 AI 模型，涵蓋了圖片、3D、360 度 HDRi、PBR 材質和影片等多種內容。\n如果需要影片中的Blender檔案與連結，在下方留言3D我就會私訊傳給你啦!\n\n#顯示卡 #輝達 #ai生成 #GameDev #AIinGames #3DModeling #ProceduralGeneration #Blender3D #UnrealEngine #Unity3D #GameAI #VirtualProduction #MachineLearningGames #3DAnimation #LevelDesign #AIGeneratedAssets #GamingTechnology #RealtimeRendering #AIArt #GameDevelopmentTips #3DEnvironmentDesign #GenerativeAI", "owner_username": "kojin3d", "owner_id": "40839494130", "likes": 952, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0319_DC-rv1kz9Jx\\DC-rv1kz9Jx_20241130_025318.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18287569936267308, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2025-08-13T01:39:22", "owner": "eason04232009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163709230318837, "text": "3d", "created_at": "2025-07-04T03:11:43", "owner": "wedkkieng_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076015180883640, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2025-05-16T16:11:48", "owner": "monster0170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096293509557340, "text": "3d", "created_at": "2025-04-14T17:33:10", "owner": "illusionisthsiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264102058280077, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2025-03-15T06:08:36", "owner": "jun_ning99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988671750795359, "text": "3d", "created_at": "2025-03-04T13:54:17", "owner": "tony_wth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285321205220815, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2025-02-28T07:32:56", "owner": "huangdede1128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118220911425270, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2025-01-17T02:58:06", "owner": "bluemi_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034718996388319, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2025-01-04T04:38:36", "owner": "pan.6137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018578834391805, "text": "3D", "created_at": "2024-12-31T04:32:57", "owner": "03pr2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014804504481404, "text": "3D", "created_at