"created_at": "2024-11-23T18:15:20", "owner": "hossin.z23", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025642202567581, "text": "🤌🏻🤌🏻🤌🏻🤌🏻😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T17:14:00", "owner": "ashishrj_17", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18015001469398061, "text": "We need a chess match between Alessia and Alexandra Botez, probably can play a game with Andrea too. What do you guys think ?", "created_at": "2024-11-23T15:51:38", "owner": "sourabh_khatavkar_0910", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17907953858961023, "text": "How can 1500 elo play such shit", "created_at": "2024-11-23T15:50:44", "owner": "rahib.d_11", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18078302296569563, "text": "I can’t tell if she won the shirts or not! Lol", "created_at": "2024-11-23T14:29:38", "owner": "ezell_tha_giant", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18022178216618112, "text": "Whats the cow in chess?", "created_at": "2024-11-23T14:19:03", "owner": "fonso_albaladejo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024101456283712, "text": "There was still a chance she could have used her queen to check just by going front and when it moved it's king back she could saved her knight...wtf", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:52:19", "owner": "jaxshi_123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049163993013052, "text": "That was an easy follow", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:40:21", "owner": "seb_aschn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052296520789520, "text": "I love @annacramling but you were the BEST in th se match 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:33:33", "owner": "el_dani_con_botas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083398762543901, "text": "We do love your.. uhm, t-shirt.. yeah t-shirt of course👏", "created_at": "2024-11-23T12:54:12", "owner": "yusufad1", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17990815271592592, "text": "Chest are interesting but I don't think my brain can understand how to play 😭", "created_at": "2024-11-23T12:47:55", "owner": "andrzej_szandor", "likes": 186}, {"id": 17970526295806549, "text": "lomls", "created_at": "2024-11-23T12:35:18", "owner": "pritanshnagaraj", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18017580083633960, "text": "Genuine Laugh, si Wholesome. This game years of life", "created_at": "2024-11-23T11:54:06", "owner": "jd__david", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18047208361886650, "text": "SHOULD'VE BEEN IN THE MOOOOOOOOOD", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:54:13", "owner": "calledcarlos", "likes": 3460}, {"id": 18107524297394064, "text": "If only that much planning was in the moves rather than moos", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:43:58", "owner": "rakshitg16", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056814631737736, "text": "no way ppl with elo above 1500 make this mistakes", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:39:27", "owner": "vlad_kazantsevvv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028615637387556, "text": "Bovine gambit.", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:56:10", "owner": "travels_without_camels", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18133423576373026, "text": "Naaaaaaaaaaaaaaah😂😂 Fabi would have folded", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:34:48", "owner": "saikat_ray_07", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18306240517200954, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:34:25", "owner": "la_lu_magni", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17962139552822095, "text": "At first I thought she was just showing off her boobs xDDD nice Tshirt!!", "created_at": "2024-11-23T09:25:39", "owner": "coolknight", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17896573668097313, "text": "Bravissimaaaaa! Spero le hai comunque regalato la maglia 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:52:01", "owner": "argentatidavide", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18346958827133727, "text": "I want to tell you my discovery about consciousness, suddenly you will notice in the game for yourself or an opponent: when a person has attention in his mind, (Introaersion) focus on perspective - the head itself tilts slightly to the reasonable left hemisphere of the brain. and when we rest and do what we want here and now, and attention in real life is rare and we do not control ourselves, then the head tilts to the emotional right hemisphere of the brain. it is not a turn, but a side slope. Even emoticons are like that - it's so everywhere, but people subconsciously do it without noticing the patterns consciously... 🤣🤪-🤔🫠", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:43:12", "owner": "petkervadim", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18092452690497981, "text": "Why i love this reel? I don't play chess but love the moooood", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:17:17", "owner": "ewan01dp", "likes": 98}, {"id": 17856716322320385, "text": "👏👏😍", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:41:47", "owner": "heyraybey", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18163879408318297, "text": "😂 really", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:19:08", "owner": "benediktus2.16", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079038574508888, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-23T06:55:25", "owner": "jayjadhav__1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18004723040682379, "text": "You two are so adorable 😅😅", "created_at": "2024-11-23T06:11:49", "owner": "be_mytreasure", "likes": 40}, {"id": 17922555122990512, "text": "What is cow opening?", "created_at": "2024-11-23T04:37:53", "owner": "m.m.assady", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["chess"]},
{"media_id": 3494277047165956922, "shortcode": "DB-KnX_ILM6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB-KnX_ILM6/", "taken_at": "2024-11-05T01:32:45", "caption": "These are actual menaces 🤣\n\n#collegelife #studentlife #memepage", "owner_username": "dormcore_", "owner_id": "26955762696", "likes": 436101, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0322_DB-KnX_ILM6\\DB-KnX_ILM6_20241105_013245.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18142462843436291, "text": "Tell her to take a chill pill", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:57:58", "owner": "carsonpeters890", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18380771473127518, "text": "She can’t handle the throat goat", "created_at": "2025-07-15T05:38:37", "owner": "rylancrookshankss", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18202957435307626, "text": "It’s just a name, it ain’t that deep bro 😆, at least you still got the same quiz", "created_at": "2025-05-02T03:32:33", "owner": "icanarzivul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098279098548634, "text": "“go out with me” LMAOOOOO", "created_at": "2025-04-29T21:45:46", "owner": "derek_ostlund", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18345554719156771, "text": "Good old days", "created_at": "2025-04-29T21:23:55", "owner": "darkness.2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882528358276585, "text": "Lmao this would fly in high school not college", "created_at": "2025-04-29T18:00:53", "owner": "haileymylesracer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036416279559563, "text": "failures of the future.", "created_at": "2025-04-28T05:11:21", "owner": "s7_sven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050528015346518, "text": "When you put an inappropriate name then the teacher puts it on random names like bruh", "created_at": "2025-04-27T23:26:23", "owner": "_00opium_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092419540573528, "text": "As a professor, why not just laugh at the names and then deduct points or fail them if you want? Isn't that your power?", "created_at": "2025-04-26T00:23:38", "owner": "some_90s_kid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065324618058391, "text": "\"throat goat 😧\"", "created_at": "2025-04-23T14:38:30", "owner": "senorgabes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045304769600427, "text": "Ray piste", "created_at": "2025-04-22T19:27:58", "owner": "blahaj__blast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010913450537184, "text": "She’s using AI lol", "created_at": "2025-04-21T19:58:32", "owner": "csadowski47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337945828090594, "text": "I done this with my collegr teacher and he loved it", "created_at": "2025-04-18T22:39:02", "owner": "brokenghost17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046971191593828, "text": "Who’s oj Simpson😂", "created_at": "2025-04-18T14:58:11", "owner": "alway_eat_food", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175895614321985, "text": "Teachers taking names to heart need to grow up", "created_at": "2025-04-18T07:31:53", "owner": "vincritten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044970029144905, "text": "getting pressed over funny names that aren’t permanent and instead making the whole class suffer and learn in a way less effective way. the teachers of america in action", "created_at": "2025-04-18T04:00:34", "owner": "connor_hester31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898367242189273, "text": "\"Oj Simpson\" is wild", "created_at": "2025-04-17T17:15:40", "owner": "adamwood25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060223979037889, "text": "Prof acting like everyone in the room ain’t adults like get a sense of humor lmaoo", "created_at": "2025-04-17T16:58:25", "owner": "zombie.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050594039465386, "text": "Knee Grow", "created_at": "2025-04-17T06:50:21", "owner": "juliusmalinen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086380300718213, "text": "Huh i remember them days", "created_at": "2025-04-16T12:48:11", "owner": "get_abucket_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061940126108891, "text": "I mean I’d be okay with it cause I find this funny.", "created_at": "2025-04-16T02:04:23", "owner": "dj345_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086479672627808, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-16T01:42:02", "owner": "jeremy_curci34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052836335219070, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-04-16T00:54:31", "owner": "jade420____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027049418436220, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-14T14:18:08", "owner": "clifford999t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057373403163670, "text": "wtf 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-14T02:11:51", "owner": "jerry__arts2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023415560670119, "text": "Mike coxlong", "created_at": "2025-04-13T16:51:19", "owner": "villadshansen5553", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064232072489248, "text": "Man schools seems so fun these days everyone was so serious in my days 😂 trolls werent tolerated 😂👏", "created_at": "2025-04-13T01:49:44", "owner": "vincentg4255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891921544213912, "text": "“Time to oil up” 💀", "created_at": "2025-04-12T20:44:10", "owner": "thereal._zto320", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076822015794508, "text": "Oj Simpson", "created_at": "2025-04-11T13:17:47", "owner": "thejimmysolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891175285225857, "text": "Extra freaky 😭", "created_at": "2025-04-10T19:09:09", "owner": "southerncyprus117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085360195622174, "text": "She's just upset no one will ever call her Throat Goat", "created_at": "2025-04-09T02:45:17", "owner": "b3ard3dbastard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993691650789182, "text": "I remember these dayssss 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-08T16:45:12", "owner": "_prettyyygyal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052850243521573, "text": "I laughed way too hard at this", "created_at": "2025-04-07T23:24:48", "owner": "brandon98.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123019789434499, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-06T01:52:22", "owner": "lspicer2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042323156169279, "text": "Throat goat 🐐 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-05T20:31:24", "owner": "smetz_sells_az", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900135898161030, "text": "Teacher is probably their age 🤨", "created_at": "2025-04-02T12:53:45", "owner": "nikstar112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998838246607141, "text": "“THROAT GOAT?! Are you actually joking??” The way she says it 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-29T01:02:22", "owner": "healedtears", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17970535040850182, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-28T07:44:56", "owner": "gabrielleberniceclennon64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085388758619299, "text": "Someone put down Tronald Dump on Kahoot😂", "created_at": "2025-03-27T20:28:58", "owner": "amtousig99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897919861170004, "text": "Why they doing kahoot games 🎮 is college 😂😂😂I thought that was just for high school 🏫 I am dead", "created_at": "2025-03-27T04:08:12", "owner": "jermiah447365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050676293209528, "text": "@rynhenry24 makes me not mind King Bob and Lilbro so much", "created_at": "2025-03-25T03:24:20", "owner": "carmsher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026232662409763, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-24T20:25:38", "owner": "serial_designation_aaron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059769464086883, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:26:46", "owner": "rylancrookshankss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18270103471257076, "text": "0.4 GPA activities", "created_at": "2025-03-24T01:35:43", "owner": "fas_tt.84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109413502470497, "text": "“Throat Goat” really stuck with her", "created_at": "2025-03-21T17:18:58", "owner": "aightoffdadome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038632610216141, "text": "\"Time to oil up\" 😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-21T00:31:32", "owner": "bdillon_250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494917753049794, "text": "Time to oil up 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-20T20:49:53", "owner": "da_.0nlydarkskin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054868673325591, "text": "Why did she have to repeat the name like that tho? 🫣😭", "created_at": "2025-03-20T02:37:27", "owner": "trizzytrey2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038652719200445, "text": "They deserve it", "created_at": "2025-03-19T15:41:15", "owner": "williamwolf316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060413933301363, "text": "throat goat wasnt a goat 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-19T11:46:11", "owner": "tia_sox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897759607157164, "text": "You forgot about Hugh Janus, Candice Dickfit,  Mike Hawk, Ben Dover, Jack Mehoff, Mike Hunt, and Nick Herz", "created_at": "2025-03-19T07:19:51", "owner": "itsonlypretend24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18147222217371053, "text": "These college students are like Diddy Jr", "created_at": "2025-03-19T02:37:26", "owner": "anteros012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022248962661616, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-19T02:20:18", "owner": "the_only_mjm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039409667573318, "text": "What game is this?", "created_at": "2025-03-18T20:54:08", "owner": "itsredbeard47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047064791463416, "text": "Their parents are paying for them to screw around. Wonder how the parents would feel seeing this....", "created_at": "2025-03-18T20:42:45", "owner": "therman1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998168688773715, "text": "“Jackmehoff” 😂😂💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-18T07:05:17", "owner": "vatoloco_98", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17978214647684024, "text": "Mine would’ve been “glizzy gobbler”", "created_at": "2025-03-18T00:15:06", "owner": "cyan.neglawi", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18000573581598104, "text": "My algorithm is working just as planned. Meticulously crafted for years.", "created_at": "2025-03-17T23:58:37", "owner": "beardedbrink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062587582966338, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-17T16:02:13", "owner": "who.jayy0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033546029307104, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-17T15:32:38", "owner": "urmomsfav458", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108875200487290, "text": "GGs", "created_at": "2025-03-16T19:27:05", "owner": "bdnyc2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18484208290045253, "text": "Whats a ta", "created_at": "2025-03-16T11:38:52", "owner": "lex_de_wever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496431772015658, "text": "One of the names was \"Oj Simpson\"💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-16T03:34:57", "owner": "prussian_enthusiast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953046774929541, "text": "Proceeds to sit on her phone while the ai reader reads 💀", "created_at": "2025-03-15T13:01:24", "owner": "ihatethis.site", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18321596098163478, "text": "Oj Simpson😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-03-14T23:46:29", "owner": "liam61404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18270493798253273, "text": "Using AI instead of actually lecturing while asking for respect is wild 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-14T17:05:50", "owner": "undr3ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851985484376615, "text": "The menace is having AI do the work and getting paid for it", "created_at": "2025-03-14T07:17:36", "owner": "est.94_eslv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18034409960540081, "text": "Drew Peacock", "created_at": "2025-03-14T06:36:50", "owner": "jirden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903322867039675, "text": "Not “P diddler” 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-14T04:50:21", "owner": "charl.ottelf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038986805576840, "text": "Tbh, throat goat is W I L D", "created_at": "2025-03-14T04:45:09", "owner": "abrahamrylan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860416591370633, "text": "Throat goat 💀", "created_at": "2025-03-14T04:36:34", "owner": "martin_mendez_voz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058515278034012, "text": "“P Diddler” 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-03-14T03:29:54", "owner": "smj_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18484440385014212, "text": "damn i lowk forgot abt kahoot", "created_at": "2025-03-14T02:35:34", "owner": "nate.falk1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967123671736372, "text": "Probably the longest lecture they got", "created_at": "2025-03-13T02:21:59", "owner": "zkie2238584939", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156535522356048, "text": "We eventually got banned and had to use our regular names for kahoot 😢by our teacher", "created_at": "2025-03-12T16:22:07", "owner": "croy000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058974779079999, "text": "She probably is a swifty💀", "created_at": "2025-03-12T13:51:50", "owner": "ramseyfchs_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038261855432447, "text": "“Oj Simpson” 💀", "created_at": "2025-03-12T10:00:59", "owner": "albert.thompson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034211486281448, "text": "Miso Hawny", "created_at": "2025-03-12T06:52:26", "owner": "schaeferestrada_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357723520132419, "text": "“The Throat GOAT”\nBro straight up dies laughing only to piss her off even more lol", "created_at": "2025-03-11T19:26:42", "owner": "thespartan188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097801363521616, "text": "OK, you can’t have a bunch of high school students and college students play Kahoot and have them not come up with your ridiculous names", "created_at": "2025-03-11T09:34:08", "owner": "caden_kochevar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960256083864685, "text": "What college does she teach at? I’m trying to learn and molecules too 🤓🧐💀", "created_at": "2025-03-11T05:19:28", "owner": "gis4christ", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060718367295954, "text": "She repeated throat goat twice😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-11T02:29:12", "owner": "dacashdawg28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292480756169388, "text": "Oj Simpson 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-10T23:33:14", "owner": "justprojectt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059400779071246, "text": "Dude aren’t they paying the teacher?", "created_at": "2025-03-10T15:32:01", "owner": "ozzy_onig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925678954019550, "text": "Someone should ask her if she’s upset because of her haircut", "created_at": "2025-03-10T07:58:18", "owner": "allamericanvalor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850188400420140, "text": "Throat GOAT was the last straw 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-10T03:38:24", "owner": "ilovejoe.sm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18042890642611879, "text": "Dear friend, pray tell, what manner of confusion hath befallen us? by the stars above, i am confounded beyond measure.", "created_at": "2025-03-09T03:30:36", "owner": "alanpadilla463", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086713849592771, "text": "This is why I love my lecturer. We did some kahoots and for my class and the names are interesting to say the least. 9/11 jokes, allahu Akbar etc etc. He just laughed his arse off.", "created_at": "2025-03-09T00:46:38", "owner": "sempai_chai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028931396642378, "text": "She Argued about “Throat Goat” but I see G4y P.orn that’s wild 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-08T22:34:21", "owner": "m_quiles_foxlover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032891651305925, "text": "I'd always make my name a porn star and wait to see the teachers reaction if they knew who it was it was obvious", "created_at": "2025-03-08T22:17:20", "owner": "rosengarn23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078390346728713, "text": "So they ban chat gpt and she uses it", "created_at": "2025-03-08T17:12:19", "owner": "flexbandittheoneandonly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051217091183651, "text": "OJ Simpson 💀", "created_at": "2025-03-07T21:00:45", "owner": "tengri888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074570413682649, "text": "Bruh shes scrolling on her phone", "created_at": "2025-03-06T22:07:28", "owner": "rishabhh13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036467444222755, "text": "Why is she having ai read her lesson instead of actually teaching??", "created_at": "2025-03-06T06:42:30", "owner": "raiden_brundin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18319801246200618, "text": "😂😂*", "created_at": "2025-03-05T13:56:26", "owner": "theyluv_jesse77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321963547167350, "text": "If I was a teacher I would just let them do it and put whatever names they want it’s really not that serious 😊😊", "created_at": "2025-03-05T13:56:20", "owner": "theyluv_jesse77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055028252146087, "text": "Then she started “teaching” with Google AI!? 😂😂😂😂😂💀", "created_at": "2025-03-04T23:17:26", "owner": "jrees_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273520486250678, "text": "Knee-grow woulda been good", "created_at": "2025-03-04T17:22:55", "owner": "kalib117x", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18031817822558701, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-04T11:03:10", "owner": "thereal.imanirenee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332281255090520, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-03-04T02:49:57", "owner": "theoliviamercedes", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["collegelife", "studentlife", "memepage"]},
