{"media_id": 3512409030421411871, "shortcode": "DC-lWdUJHgf", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC-lWdUJHgf/", "taken_at": "2024-11-30T01:56:46", "caption": "Researchers asked 100 people to draw different famous logos from memory, here are the results", "owner_username": "welcome.jpeg", "owner_id": "10016721579", "likes": 121160, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_10.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_11.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_12.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0324_DC-lWdUJHgf\\DC-lWdUJHgf_20241130_015646_9.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18376852720128728, "text": "i could draw the welcome logo while blindfolded and obliterated", "created_at": "2024-11-30T04:28:07", "owner": "dannycoleee", "likes": 834}, {"id": 18060490585927228, "text": "The JavaScript logo for Starbucks lol", "created_at": "2025-01-11T01:23:45", "owner": "dallascrane_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043084283233906, "text": "Volkswagen logo in the BMW one", "created_at": "2024-12-21T21:55:59", "owner": "thenextautumnsoundtrack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886266016169824, "text": "that one guy at the top left corner who's like 6 years old", "created_at": "2024-12-19T00:57:29", "owner": "jeannefos.photo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052034804002085, "text": "Adidas has two logos so I'm not sure how they graded them on only 2 axes", "created_at": "2024-12-17T13:40:52", "owner": "laura_beck_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019005908347463, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:57:29", "owner": "power_justice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843365740371822, "text": "I love this omg", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:07:12", "owner": "furrylittlepeach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039403628054563, "text": "I find it hard to believe that 100 people drew circles that bad. I suck at drawing, but I can draw a circle relatively better than a first grader ffs. Fake", "created_at": "2024-12-10T19:19:29", "owner": "seang.99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031422467595098, "text": "Literally can't even see the most accurate one cuz of the sound icon.", "created_at": "2024-12-08T03:53:51", "owner": "serktheturk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951801315761212, "text": "Four adidas stripes 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T04:00:48", "owner": "bhangusayeen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385374523102248, "text": "El verdadero está en la parte inferior lado derecho 🤭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T02:45:49", "owner": "mayra3153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865110469269916, "text": "shoutout to they guy who circled a red dot for spotify", "created_at": "2024-12-06T19:02:21", "owner": "sigilpunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18254818579280610, "text": "When people who don’t know math make charts. Also love the least accurate Red Bull is “gives you wings” and the VW for BMW", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:18:19", "owner": "fillycheese96", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17977517993684768, "text": "DOMINOES", "created_at": "2024-12-05T14:53:11", "owner": "amnesieae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852268924345219, "text": "The green wifi logo in the Spotify😭", "created_at": "2024-12-05T08:00:58", "owner": "wei_c9120", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013516790652891, "text": "Damn this is some gooood content!  Lmaooo", "created_at": "2024-12-05T06:01:33", "owner": "jake_cano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860644030294409, "text": "This makes me feel deep and sad \n🦋🪸💅🏻🪷🪸🦋", "created_at": "2024-12-05T05:15:14", "owner": "will.lockyear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909040362961738, "text": "Very cool idea", "created_at": "2024-12-05T03:23:19", "owner": "artschoolbitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879236137196140, "text": "why is this so cute", "created_at": "2024-12-04T23:42:06", "owner": "sophuric_acid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939644127816019, "text": "japan", "created_at": "2024-12-04T22:23:57", "owner": "evilprinter666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163555255321833, "text": "nice", "created_at": "2024-12-04T22:04:58", "owner": "raad.inc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030625646596278, "text": "Mandela effect", "created_at": "2024-12-04T19:36:25", "owner": "jesse.genepi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034863965459031, "text": "This is b.s.", "created_at": "2024-12-04T15:19:00", "owner": "linktactical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858642775302437, "text": "shoutout to everyone at the top left corner who so confidently made up their own logos", "created_at": "2024-12-04T13:31:51", "owner": "planesurplus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079534186510414, "text": "The least accurate ones are so terrible lolol", "created_at": "2024-12-03T23:09:40", "owner": "judeiscool_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069218800660387, "text": "Who is judging these?? 👀", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:11:45", "owner": "janloucoops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014056577455114, "text": "Cute how everyone drew dumplings for Shell 🥟🥟🥟🥟", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:07:42", "owner": "brolearious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044829386275625, "text": "“Ok draw the Red Bull logo” \n(Writes “Gives you Wings”)", "created_at": "2024-12-03T15:47:02", "owner": "genesisdefontaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18257708764261535, "text": "puma's winner cooked 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:57:52", "owner": "notfrapp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063534220631043, "text": "Lego 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:17:06", "owner": "benediktus2.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023629286311114, "text": "the puma one is actually insane", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:51:14", "owner": "jackr.stacey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032136215588753, "text": "But like, what is the study and who are the researchers?", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:36:01", "owner": "kelcey_gray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127101868382448, "text": "@sterlachini", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:09:46", "owner": "motos.are.posted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050440534845997, "text": "American \"culture\"", "created_at": "2024-12-02T23:44:31", "owner": "dallasmlth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865240423201029, "text": "I can only draw Nike from memory", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:14:00", "owner": "morglapre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043661228511451, "text": "This is pretty unfair, there’s a lot of of them that said at least accurate but they just drew an older version of the logo so it looks different and they did a really good job", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:08:44", "owner": "imperial_kilometers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963806175819323, "text": "These remind me of the teatowels in infant school when we drew our portrait for it", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:50:27", "owner": "sirchesterbean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346999297176372, "text": "gotta talk to the one person that thought it was a rectangle", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:06:48", "owner": "coricommissions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377994328105793, "text": "Who drew those pumas", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:48:40", "owner": "gabbisquartino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077014678600076, "text": "Anyone else notice the least accurate ones look like basquiat drawings", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:47:02", "owner": "m_m1039111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048134414026447, "text": "I could've sworn the leaf was the adidas logo..", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:13:31", "owner": "snow4t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033194528139447, "text": "VolksWagen 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:35:00", "owner": "roma_262", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322913617082751, "text": "Now flag the distribution of people with aphantasia among those.", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:17:28", "owner": "erinmacmac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024542825301413, "text": "That’s was sick🙌🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-02T15:15:36", "owner": "m1cktaylorrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060490585927228, "text": "The JavaScript logo for Starbucks lol", "created_at": "2025-01-11T01:23:45", "owner": "dallascrane_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043084283233906, "text": "Volkswagen logo in the BMW one", "created_at": "2024-12-21T21:55:59", "owner": "thenextautumnsoundtrack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886266016169824, "text": "that one guy at the top left corner who's like 6 years old", "created_at": "2024-12-19T00:57:29", "owner": "jeannefos.photo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052034804002085, "text": "Adidas has two logos so I'm not sure how they graded them on only 2 axes", "created_at": "2024-12-17T13:40:52", "owner": "laura_beck_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019005908347463, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:57:29", "owner": "power_justice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843365740371822, "text": "I love this omg", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:07:12", "owner": "furrylittlepeach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039403628054563, "text": "I find it hard to believe that 100 people drew circles that bad. I suck at drawing, but I can draw a circle relatively better than a first grader ffs. Fake", "created_at": "2024-12-10T19:19:29", "owner": "seang.99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031422467595098, "text": "Literally can't even see the most accurate one cuz of the sound icon.", "created_at": "2024-12-08T03:53:51", "owner": "serktheturk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951801315761212, "text": "Four adidas stripes 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T04:00:48", "owner": "bhangusayeen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385374523102248, "text": "El verdadero está en la parte inferior lado derecho 🤭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T02:45:49", "owner": "mayra3153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865110469269916, "text": "shouto