": "judeiscool_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069218800660387, "text": "Who is judging these?? 👀", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:11:45", "owner": "janloucoops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014056577455114, "text": "Cute how everyone drew dumplings for Shell 🥟🥟🥟🥟", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:07:42", "owner": "brolearious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044829386275625, "text": "“Ok draw the Red Bull logo” \n(Writes “Gives you Wings”)", "created_at": "2024-12-03T15:47:02", "owner": "genesisdefontaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18257708764261535, "text": "puma's winner cooked 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:57:52", "owner": "notfrapp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063534220631043, "text": "Lego 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:17:06", "owner": "benediktus2.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023629286311114, "text": "the puma one is actually insane", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:51:14", "owner": "jackr.stacey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032136215588753, "text": "But like, what is the study and who are the researchers?", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:36:01", "owner": "kelcey_gray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127101868382448, "text": "@sterlachini", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:09:46", "owner": "motos.are.posted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050440534845997, "text": "American \"culture\"", "created_at": "2024-12-02T23:44:31", "owner": "dallasmlth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865240423201029, "text": "I can only draw Nike from memory", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:14:00", "owner": "morglapre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043661228511451, "text": "This is pretty unfair, there’s a lot of of them that said at least accurate but they just drew an older version of the logo so it looks different and they did a really good job", "created_at": "2024-12-02T22:08:44", "owner": "imperial_kilometers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963806175819323, "text": "These remind me of the teatowels in infant school when we drew our portrait for it", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:50:27", "owner": "sirchesterbean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346999297176372, "text": "gotta talk to the one person that thought it was a rectangle", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:06:48", "owner": "coricommissions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377994328105793, "text": "Who drew those pumas", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:48:40", "owner": "gabbisquartino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077014678600076, "text": "Anyone else notice the least accurate ones look like basquiat drawings", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:47:02", "owner": "m_m1039111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048134414026447, "text": "I could've sworn the leaf was the adidas logo..", "created_at": "2024-12-02T17:13:31", "owner": "snow4t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033194528139447, "text": "VolksWagen 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:35:00", "owner": "roma_262", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322913617082751, "text": "Now flag the distribution of people with aphantasia among those.", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:17:28", "owner": "erinmacmac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024542825301413, "text": "That’s was sick🙌🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-02T15:15:36", "owner": "m1cktaylorrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304943077205802, "text": "wait, its not square? Hope this doesnt trigger any keyboard warriors", "created_at": "2024-12-02T13:59:37", "owner": "garthalamose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037473629350914, "text": "i think the top left was always the same person with the exception of burger king where they were the second one of the top row", "created_at": "2024-12-02T13:20:56", "owner": "anarchythug123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025966169264156, "text": "\"gives you wings\" lol", "created_at": "2024-12-02T10:41:18", "owner": "adnaharafi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013877828644235, "text": "They remember color and number of items", "created_at": "2024-12-02T09:30:54", "owner": "pic_ninja98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887314417067059, "text": "@scoffersandquaffers", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:55:58", "owner": "calibarnard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028979024567649, "text": "A few of these are good. Most of\nthese are funny. I just wonder what\nthe age range was, and if I would\nbe any better than a\nfive-year-old myself.", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:45:36", "owner": "__mattmoss__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044572418129198, "text": "Target cannot be that hard😭", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:36:11", "owner": "m4doo___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059747869845796, "text": "100 people or 100 3rd graders? 🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-02T04:27:55", "owner": "neekdyako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856688401265940, "text": "The Domino's one was the best, it's hilarious 💀", "created_at": "2024-12-02T04:20:39", "owner": "beto.tape94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912168375948252, "text": "Someone drew the Pizza Hut logo for dominos", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:38:46", "owner": "mackenzietargarona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030227159415922, "text": "Human's are so cute", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:23:07", "owner": "febrianisartspace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032340071159000, "text": "the first fucking lacoste one is awesome. it’s just a green blob", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:21:28", "owner": "junkpile333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904385886981927, "text": "Bye😭the literal ‘spot’ for Spotify", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:10:13", "owner": "4ng.el", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
