2431, "text": "how is your computer not deep fried?", "created_at": "2025-02-28T09:56:12", "owner": "axelpadillx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357979417131764, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-23T10:24:43", "owner": "tombraycreative", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083963452594228, "text": "He’s chilling", "created_at": "2025-02-06T14:45:54", "owner": "scratchybongvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483268465046609, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-02-05T15:34:44", "owner": "sportsrender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046737131248108, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2025-02-04T21:27:24", "owner": "jcurk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055008674037393, "text": "M4 mampu", "created_at": "2025-02-03T05:01:26", "owner": "erikfaizal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050566141898286, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-01T19:00:59", "owner": "ezvaas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343859002148574, "text": "bgm title?", "created_at": "2025-01-31T08:12:11", "owner": "lyr4s3l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919034743045916, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-01-28T20:27:11", "owner": "wsaviomaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032977982611509, "text": "They use Cutpro  i think? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-01-24T13:52:16", "owner": "lahcenbenzahar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054139226494090, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-01-22T20:30:49", "owner": "prswt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022572908354933, "text": "Which software is used for the playback?", "created_at": "2025-01-21T10:25:03", "owner": "vj._praveen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269035108248704, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-19T09:15:31", "owner": "showtime_stadium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384460837096174, "text": "The dream 💭", "created_at": "2025-01-18T22:45:26", "owner": "imad__dam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881083198212539, "text": "What if a player were to accidentally fall on the laptop and break it since y’all are right by endzone, would the graphics just mess up?", "created_at": "2025-01-18T17:56:19", "owner": "ethanpocorello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057156775990665, "text": "My life 