{"media_id": 3500397561756431885, "shortcode": "DCT6QlZIrYN", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCT6QlZIrYN/", "taken_at": "2024-11-13T12:12:46", "caption": "🙂\n@matryonath", "owner_username": "khamanats", "owner_id": "45739934515", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0326_DCT6QlZIrYN\\DCT6QlZIrYN_20241113_121246.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18109612753436987, "text": "🔥❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-05T06:22:42", "owner": "vl_ada5961", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038307695462642, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:02:29", "owner": "zet_kyy0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087382174521295, "text": "my name😭🗿", "created_at": "2024-11-29T04:14:44", "owner": "araa_rttg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303102292207145, "text": "Third one could be next hitman", "created_at": "2024-11-27T13:22:06", "owner": "alvinctk0728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052088443985305, "text": "Song name", "created_at": "2024-11-25T20:48:43", "owner": "orange.bluu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317824396094112, "text": "Eso no es aura😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T23:09:11", "owner": "harley825_rt_wick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106174033452481, "text": "Ya instagram no más aura para miiii", "created_at": "2024-11-24T15:37:48", "owner": "jhonnatan.losada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887351206135555, "text": "💗💎💠🌌🌌Like_magic🌌🌌💠💎💗", "created_at": "2024-11-20T22:24:21", "owner": "purplerainwastaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856380883315187, "text": "Can you post Khabib???? 🥺", "created_at": "2024-11-17T12:58:24", "owner": "isarwar_siddiqui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866582761181038, "text": "Video of Boys giving teacher flowers comes from Georgia 🇬🇪 🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-14T10:00:58", "owner": "v_for_vendetta1984", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17884948200150571, "text": "Aura +10000 respected", "created_at": "2024-11-14T02:08:34", "owner": "ahmedtarekxoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096234157480137, "text": "👌🏿👌🏿", "created_at": "2024-11-13T21:07:36", "owner": "aodala777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327263059156707, "text": "🔥❤️🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-13T16:09:40", "owner": "risenshine19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905190223005955, "text": "Is this account is hack... Yes it is hack to see this kind of video", "created_at": "2024-11-13T15:17:03", "owner": "mutalib.shaikh", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17887964031103451, "text": "😊", "created_at": "2024-11-13T15:01:23", "owner": "locoprompt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871886425143442, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-13T13:49:33", "owner": "h7h97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926009235973406, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T13:33:23", "owner": "ismayil_0106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059448883863255, "text": "Last👏", "created_at": "2024-11-13T12:52:18", "owner": "lily_489632", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980908026772951, "text": "Life as a student is an unforgettable memory😍", "created_at": "2024-11-13T12:47:28", "owner": "shabeeb.co", "likes": 37}, {"id": 17915802221917269, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T12:31:24", "owner": "aissa4480", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858004231240309, "text": "💚haha isn't it great that the short kid hugs the other one? 😎🥸😸", "created_at": "2024-11-13T12:31:11", "owner": "umitkrtp", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17957737094724153, "text": "Love 👍👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌", "created_at": "2024-11-13T12:14:23", "owner": "kureshi.firdaush", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3456658276039910164, "shortcode": "C_4hGNNReMU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_4hGNNReMU/", "taken_at": "2024-09-14T04:05:14", "caption": "Try This Approach 4:\n\n1️⃣. No worries at all. Could you share the quote they gave you, so I can get a clear picture?\n\nPeople often stretch the truth for discounts, or they might have received a quote for a service that doesn’t fully meet their needs.\n\nNext, ask...\n\n2️⃣. If the price were the same, who would you pick?\n\nThis helps them shift from thinking about COST to considering VALUE. If your service stands out, they’ll lean towards you.\n\nFollow up with...\n\n3️⃣. Why would you choose the higher-value service?\n\nThis encourages them to see the importance of value over just the price. \n\nThen say...\n\n4️⃣. Exactly. It’s all about achieving the results you’re after. If price is the only concern, we might not be the best match. Our clients are ready to invest a bit more because they’re focused on getting the best results. So, is your priority on the price, or is it on solving the problem and achieving the best outcome?\n\nBut hold on...\n\nThey might say...\n\nClient: We want great results, but we also need a better price. \n\nYou can respond with:\n\n5️⃣. I get that. I can match that price, but l’d need to remove some features. So, is it riskier to save a bit and get less than ideal results, or is it worth spending a bit more to ensure you get the best outcome possible?\n\nFollow for more. \n\n#sales #salescoach #salestrainer #salestips #businessowner #constructionbusiness #french #mansion #luxury #explore #explorepage #explorar #milliondollarlisting #millionairemindset #luxurylifestyle #architecture #interiordesign #inspiration #archilovers #bedroom #livingroom #kitchendesign #frenchstyle #carlovers #gclass #realstate", "owner_username": "felipe.freig", "owner_id": "1226346348", "likes": 61637, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0327_C_4hGNNReMU\\C_4hGNNReMU_20240914_040514.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17994741896914131, "text": "Agreed with alot of what you are saying.  Now show me the after sale comments. Show me how you treat me after the checks cashed. And dont hire sub par subs to clean up the mess. If aint YOUR crew coming in to fix… dont bother", "created_at": "2026-01-31T13:24:52", "owner": "tonyp440", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081491909214872, "text": "Or don’t say anything, smile, walk away happy you have dodged a bullet knowing with that type of client it would be disaster project anyways", "created_at": "2026-01-19T23:21:12", "owner": "hedidesigns", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063711920536795, "text": "If you’re going to play that game and say you can do it for less, then some part of the process is fluff/gratuitous??", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:26:44", "owner": "its_all_fein_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870211882422313, "text": "✅‼️", "created_at": "2025-08-16T21:03:57", "owner": "fusco_interiors", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876917716274080, "text": "My name is jeff", "created_at": "2025-03-07T11:48:20", "owner": "finn.le777", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17856319809388523, "text": "\"Cheaper? Well, good luck for you. And promise me that you won't call me after 48 hrs. Ok?\"", "created_at": "2025-03-03T21:10:26", "owner": "guardian_sethas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088065919586305, "text": "Sometimes it’s absolutely true — the importer sold the sink retail for less than the kitchen guy’s supplier charged him!  Needless to say, kitchen guy now buys direct from the importer…", "created_at": "2025-03-02T17:34:00", "owner": "tenbaset", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17958088913911797, "text": "js tell them if you can get it cheaper go get it trust me they come running right back", "created_at": "2025-03-02T09:57:53", "owner": "1mouazzakarya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080416207620330, "text": "chatgpt", "created_at": "2025-02-25T17:41:28", "owner": "afiq_diniy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18483847882020982, "text": "👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-02-23T13:52:01", "owner": "nrsh_designstudio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070352836701994, "text": "this", "created_at": "2025-01-25T02:42:06", "owner": "diya_gluth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129200428383775, "text": "“Well I’m oiled up rn”", "created_at": "2024-12-14T09:14:01", "owner": "sigmabongwater", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031087628582674, "text": "This", "created_at": "2024-12-02T23:05:12", "owner": "oscar.vibess", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032796002128224, "text": "What if I am selling meth", "created_at": "2024-12-02T19:03:18", "owner": "adam2011169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155946415335594, "text": "This", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:30:46", "owner": "calvinstevens77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861192427292474, "text": "This 👇🏼", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:34:10", "owner": "ss.hanns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941842878921779, "text": "Say: \"Are you afraid that I'm ripping you off? We can go through the whole production costs together that you see why we decided to have this price\" be trustful", "created_at": "2024-11-26T00:57:05", "owner": "helenalike", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022259249308513, "text": "You may be able to find it cheaper, but you won’t find better. 🤙🏻", "created_at": "2024-11-24T05:19:26", "owner": "tlg_auto", "likes": 166}, {"id": 18069285370647085, "text": "I would say: I HAVE CLIENTS WHO PAY MORE 💚", "created_at": "2024-11-23T18:28:28", "owner": "arabjessy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884432767158289, "text": "I say the following: I understand it may be pricey as that is my base price, but I see we can work well together so I'll make you a package tailored just for your business. Sounds good? It will be more affodable with more specific (add thing)", "created_at": "2024-11-21T12:14:43", "owner": "realislands", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18043795859281270, "text": "We just say : sure ! And thats all… most of em call us back within 48 h 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-13T11:16:51", "owner": "comoplata.id", "likes": 480}, {"id": 17988495572737242, "text": "This 👇! Am I doing it right?", "created_at": "2024-11-13T09:37:15", "owner": "satkomp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041591024132733, "text": "Better yet, take your time and do proper discovery with your prospect, during which you should draw out their real pain points which allow you to sell on VALUE, as well as identify potential objections and squash them before EARNING your right to ask for a close. By the end of your convo, you’ll be able to say “Based on everything we talked about, this sounds like a great fit for both of us - is there any reason why this might not be a good idea for us to get started on now?” and their answer should be “Nope. How do we get started?”", "created_at": "2024-11-13T08:02:37", "owner": "rkda.tim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851320015335467, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-12T15:17:54", "owner": "jaychowdree", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051034750985576, "text": "I know I’m not the cheapest, and that’s what I say.", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:43:36", "owner": "icarus_mvt", "likes": 56}, {"id": 17925299960979044, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-11T04:40:37", "owner": "frankiej7777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18304474252203216, "text": "Maine say this bola customer chid gya pta ni ku😢", "created_at": "2024-11-10T19:16:48", "owner": "atul.kansal.9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045598901080818, "text": "4", "created_at": "2024-11-10T09:20:05", "owner": "vivabella_designs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030273512368568, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-11-03T22:33:36", "owner": "houseofvows.celebrant", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18115413715372201, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-26T08:54:24", "owner": "design_boulevard", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851701693313338, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-23T00:59:56", "owner": "corpcatnorthhouston", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079781170529651, "text": "It’s all about helping clients understand the difference between cost and value. Asking the right questions can truly shift their focus from price to the quality and outcomes they desire. What a smart way to approach these conversations without conflict. Thank you for sharing these wonderful tips!", "created_at": "2024-10-15T18:56:16", "owner": "spreadxusa", "likes": 183}, {"id": 17847602676301498, "text": "The truth is they can", "created_at": "2024-09-26T09:39:14", "owner": "letoandrew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874009396168406, "text": "Epic. We do the same thing. It's never apples to apples. The other company is using cheaper materials and don't have 28 years experience. 💪🏻😎", "created_at": "2024-09-17T21:20:56", "owner": "javynlandscaping", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18041097395496265, "text": "Pay a dollar once or pay a 50 cents multiple times 🤷‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-09-15T21:54:54", "owner": "straightlinecrane", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081083365465834, "text": "Well said 👏👏", "created_at": "2024-09-14T05:57:41", "owner": "tirajehm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022781192172663, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-09-14T04:40:00", "owner": "_jessica_lynum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024902105388404, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-02T19:25:42", "owner": "juugcity_ski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867686302241428, "text": "We could also say, “Ah! Of course! A cheap service for a low character. How fitting indeed!”", "created_at": "2025-02-25T09:01:20", "owner": "thehongkongtaste", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105033223482429, "text": "Just say \"Okay! Have fun with the cheaper service. Bye ho ❤️\"", "created_at": "2025-01-16T22:12:32", "owner": "exhreal._0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044685548133520, "text": "Halt deine fresse du Hund brauch das Geld🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-01T20:40:23", "owner": "janis_gx", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["sales", "salescoach", "salestrainer", "salestips", "businessowner", "constructionbusiness", "french", "mansion", "luxury", "explore", "explorepage", "explorar", "milliondollarlisting", "millionairemindset", "luxurylifestyle", "architecture", "interiordesign", "inspiration", "archilovers", "bedroom", "livingroom", "kitchendesign", "frenchstyle", "carlovers", "gclass", "realstate"]},
{"media_id": 3505969635927736215, "shortcode": "DCntM72xz-X", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCntM72xz-X/", "taken_at": "2024-11-21T04:45:00", "caption": "", "owner_username": "hypewhip", "owner_id": "5633753935", "likes": 168413, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0328_DCntM72xz-X\\DCntM72xz-X_20241121_044500.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17949765269822430, "text": "Navidia new british of world no one can stop it", "created_at": "2025-04-18T07:24:30", "owner": "goravsharma.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861172261390556, "text": "Said 25 year old +sized men", "created_at": "2025-04-12T18:55:39", "owner": "sz_marauder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077011222683616, "text": "Hahhhahhhaaaaaaaa", "created_at": "2025-03-28T16:34:21", "owner": "max.mateja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065361980506212, "text": "And now one one will say 0 .", "created_at": "2025-03-27T18:02:53", "owner": "t6f56g76h8tv6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124864846426860, "text": "NEW INNOVATION OF EUROPE IS THE ALLIANCE BETWEEN RHEIN METAL🇩🇪& LEONARDO 🇮🇹 THE MOST EXPENSIVE AND PRODUCTIVE INDUSTRY OF TANK  IN THE WORLD", "created_at": "2025-03-21T22:21:13", "owner": "alessandro_tml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939629277861166, "text": "Bruh Europe is responsible for 97% of all innovations", "created_at": "2025-03-21T22:02:09", "owner": "lucasmdte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961057671895372, "text": "Didnt germany develop a method to heal skin in just few hours mo matter how severe? You showed 5 pictures of elon musk’s companies and calling them American invention, funny part he aint even american.", "created_at": "2025-03-16T11:00:17", "owner": "charbelhnein_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069891307890676, "text": "Jugar", "created_at": "2025-03-13T12:57:02", "owner": "ramesh4umira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028104923648921, "text": "Actual american innovation : when it's too hot in the summer, just shot the sun.", "created_at": "2025-03-12T13:02:10", "owner": "raphaphipha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899792110149248, "text": "European>>>>>>usa", "created_at": "2025-03-11T20:25:35", "owner": "astanofff_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883035352249197, "text": "Jaguar is owned by Tata, an Indian company", "created_at": "2025-03-11T14:12:54", "owner": "n0t_w9ri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990975156792278, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-03-11T13:23:07", "owner": "visakh_db11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383256370118099, "text": "Was literally create yall tf", "created_at": "2025-03-11T03:13:50", "owner": "tylerlifez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315869248203756, "text": "so, point is that asia, africa and oceana are gonna have to carry the rest of the world atp.", "created_at": "2025-03-07T08:05:25", "owner": "tom.groombridge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047900849206855, "text": "American ☕️", "created_at": "2025-03-06T13:50:50", "owner": "2000_hilux_extracab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962227779857689, "text": "Song?", "created_at": "2025-03-06T06:17:20", "owner": "barber.koen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137799751377767, "text": "buddy we gave you cars and america", "created_at": "2025-03-01T11:32:16", "owner": "mrt.zgc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051786131138007, "text": "The europeans invented the car, btw", "created_at": "2025-02-25T19:00:38", "owner": "equalpot2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380505046190796, "text": "Oh boy where do I start? The big globe thing was a massive failure. I see 3 pictures about tesla, don't need to say anything here", "created_at": "2025-02-25T15:34:33", "owner": "g._sifak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929801322991841, "text": "None of the things in the first picture would exist without europeans", "created_at": "2025-02-12T18:05:02", "owner": "felixdaswaib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080035318719784, "text": "We create america 😂", "created_at": "2025-02-12T02:03:13", "owner": "kabkaba_online", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17940213248967708, "text": "Americans actually come from European", "created_at": "2025-02-11T23:32:23", "owner": "isobe_chriss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291640186244774, "text": "Moteur à explosion, cinéma, locomotive à vapeur, microscope, montgolfière, sous-marin, machine à vapeur, vaccin contre la rage, parachute, presse à imprimer, radioactivité, automobile, télévision mécanique, téléphone, stylo à bille, moteur diesel, boîte de vitesses automatique, fibre optique, code-barres, cure-dents jetable, carte à puce, TGV, holographie, airbag, drone militaire, CD, DVD, MP3, lithium-ion, accélérateur de particules, Internet (précurseurs européens), sonar, turbine à gaz, ciment Portland, béton armé, ultrason médical, laser médical, stylo plume, montres mécaniques, microscope électronique, dynamite, antibiotiques (pénicilline découverte par Fleming), imprimante 3D (contributions majeures), intelligence artificielle (premières théories et concepts).", "created_at": "2025-02-10T11:29:46", "owner": "victorchsssin", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18035320295617337, "text": "The video meant about today's inventions. You don't understand the joke", "created_at": "2025-02-06T19:36:18", "owner": "maks.4g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857038852363177, "text": "That ain’t innovation", "created_at": "2025-02-06T06:40:12", "owner": "alex.inity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099001660446602, "text": "This guy be like:  British car❌  European car:✅", "created_at": "2025-02-02T15:12:14", "owner": "x_x_frank_o_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079279342620713, "text": "The sphere isn't innovative it's an eyesore. Same with the cybertruck", "created_at": "2025-02-01T19:02:30", "owner": "jacksonhfox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106420159462533, "text": "Jensen Huang is taiwanese, the ISS is literally international, the cybertruck is the most hated car of 2024 also a giant failure and the other stuff i dont even know what is so no point made here", "created_at": "2025-01-24T18:36:17", "owner": "timotejh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069565366774992, "text": "This isn’t true lmao", "created_at": "2025-01-24T11:57:24", "owner": "archie_parker08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049617583944297, "text": "China: copy- paste", "created_at": "2025-01-24T00:03:17", "owner": "juliansandovaldiaz778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909370603073809, "text": "Americans are also Europeans", "created_at": "2025-01-22T11:43:30", "owner": "kushagra.misra__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891103840084404, "text": "Half the things america innovated on the list are terrible anyway lol", "created_at": "2025-01-20T23:06:22", "owner": "hervhaywerd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18459601861068934, "text": "As a european I confirm this. We're regulating while America is innovating.", "created_at": "2025-01-20T11:04:34", "owner": "healingrelatfackface", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056956798978696, "text": "So make up your minds, Euros. Are we your innovation or are we shit?", "created_at": "2025-01-19T17:32:37", "owner": "brian.vick.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883937386207195, "text": "Jaguar is from England, England is not part of the EU", "created_at": "2025-01-19T15:10:24", "owner": "george.floyd.camel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347088583179930, "text": "Elon musk is south african", "created_at": "2025-01-19T15:06:50", "owner": "gabe.e.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047090077982898, "text": "Which one do u have?", "created_at": "2025-01-18T18:15:24", "owner": "nasrallah_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266248066270394, "text": "Whos gonna tell bro where cars came from and planes", "created_at": "2025-01-18T00:35:03", "owner": "faruk.oemerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054003746074286, "text": "we are still far better than usa", "created_at": "2025-01-17T22:41:20", "owner": "rufotheos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978499947662921, "text": "Europe create the big mc country", "created_at": "2025-01-17T21:13:10", "owner": "charles_blaudez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028104314552388, "text": "Cypertruck is not a Innovation", "created_at": "2025-01-17T20:28:43", "owner": "jk_the_believer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072550852676061, "text": "Cherry picked examples, Europe leads in so much.", "created_at": "2025-01-17T14:54:52", "owner": "weston_wadsworth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995173947597047, "text": "El invito de la tapa es argentino", "created_at": "2025-01-17T01:30:53", "owner": "m_gusty_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869398342205874, "text": "Europe is midieval compared to China", "created_at": "2025-01-16T20:12:18", "owner": "ovr_void7.io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018270926457140, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-15T07:12:47", "owner": "panzer_mann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849157303355448, "text": "Isn’t jaguar indian?", "created_at": "2025-01-14T19:34:24", "owner": "sidd_khatal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071811340708030, "text": "Why are yall making the bottlecaps sucha big deal?", "created_at": "2025-01-14T19:31:21", "owner": "simim12_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045378928992236, "text": "American don't realise that they are technically Europeans and Native Americans are technically Indians", "created_at": "2025-01-14T15:50:57", "owner": "aaryanverma__17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010297988692444, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-13T23:20:45", "owner": "x7t5ak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031629194448479, "text": "Nvidia: good  Satellite:good  rocket:good", "created_at": "2025-01-13T12:58:20", "owner": "sisu_the_parsonrusselterrier", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881227921209421, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-12T21:51:23", "owner": "alandjikkaity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066739393833533, "text": "Eiatein came from Europe", "created_at": "2025-01-12T10:24:22", "owner": "mythrillion9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912865111063056, "text": "The space station is INTERNATIONAL 🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-01-12T09:37:51", "owner": "francesco_ildefe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051972476040842, "text": "Bluetooth?", "created_at": "2025-01-11T07:23:25", "owner": "jaspersurleraux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068303275745417, "text": "propaganda", "created_at": "2025-01-11T03:10:27", "owner": "godovermoneyyyyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089480887479833, "text": "USA was a European innovation and that’s a compliment because it’s the only good innovation that they have done", "created_at": "2025-01-10T01:49:08", "owner": "kerimh42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081642883520607, "text": "💀💀", "created_at": "2025-01-09T03:56:34", "owner": "bimaslohani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043719359192183, "text": "What about the bottle cap? Sad that they are actually trying to do something about trash?", "created_at": "2025-01-04T14:36:35", "owner": "you11.45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300502240224710, "text": "ISS was joint work of NASA, ESA, JAXA, CSA and Roscosmos. Rocket sicence was made by Germans who also made first electric cars. And the first humanlike robot was made by Friedrick Kaufmann - German man", "created_at": "2025-01-04T09:42:54", "owner": "there_is_no_free_names_left21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038098010367283, "text": "😂 What", "created_at": "2025-01-03T07:59:08", "owner": "mr.shubhamsarkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861179323321027, "text": "Music?", "created_at": "2024-12-31T03:40:33", "owner": "millanmauriciomarquez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476196349032073, "text": "At least I don’t have to pay to go to the dentist 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-12-27T17:21:13", "owner": "enzo.pchx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876485353228825, "text": "Jaguar is owned by Tatas", "created_at": "2024-12-27T15:03:03", "owner": "_manish._.here_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024802082551211, "text": "India's innovation 3 different types of GST on popcorn 💩🇮🇳", "created_at": "2024-12-27T09:23:20", "owner": "ezii_an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138985279373265, "text": "Average americaboo ragebait", "created_at": "2024-12-26T14:36:41", "owner": "pavelkrehacek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015788855447983, "text": "Never heard europe enovation for years.It s alway american, china, japan invent something,europe only invent new car,new fashion,boring", "created_at": "2024-12-26T10:08:37", "owner": "gyattnasty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852394600360439, "text": "Not American innovation but Elon Musk's innovations 90%", "created_at": "2024-12-26T09:34:29", "owner": "tarjima.reels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049844465026899, "text": "Funny how the sphere is actually an German company which is located in Koblenz lmao. That’s not American that’s Germany technology xd", "created_at": "2024-12-25T11:30:57", "owner": "julianhrstmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055509691814620, "text": "*immigrants innovation", "created_at": "2024-12-24T08:41:53", "owner": "dsi_forever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912298189059013, "text": "Bro setallite ke neeche konsi car hai naam bata do", "created_at": "2024-12-24T04:47:14", "owner": "iarnavgupta1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855269290285227, "text": "Nah Europe made USA", "created_at": "2024-12-23T13:11:11", "owner": "doiyr_ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963535902712110, "text": "Motion from 1 to 2 vs from 0 to 1", "created_at": "2024-12-23T12:47:55", "owner": "shchulz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062991760834355, "text": "guys if europe didn’t discover america you all would be native americans and having bows and arrows.", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:17:46", "owner": "1jonsu6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959981865730382, "text": "There is 0 investment opportunity in Europe and a billion rules and laws.... And politicians don't understand why the economy is weak... Hmmm", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:29:14", "owner": "jeffrey.steijn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18227592064305098, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:17:25", "owner": "0tojiev8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962202969706719, "text": "jaguar isnt even european anymore", "created_at": "2024-12-15T23:33:02", "owner": "knsr222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953675322894369, "text": "America was invented by Europeans .only native Americans are eligible", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:22:52", "owner": "lifetothedeath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482561800061730, "text": "Aren't over half of the American inventors from Europe?", "created_at": "2024-12-15T03:50:07", "owner": "gab1val3ntin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027421712260198, "text": "Power of capitalism 😍", "created_at": "2024-12-14T20:00:50", "owner": "animeevisuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044626390964982, "text": "Now innovate the trains here.", "created_at": "2024-12-14T15:20:50", "owner": "pattypatjh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017387945398400, "text": "Aren't American originally European", "created_at": "2024-12-12T13:24:11", "owner": "sean777fu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343279933183968, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:31:55", "owner": "p.exploder_94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175808659310881, "text": "a  bo'oh  o'  wa'ah", "created_at": "2024-12-12T06:57:09", "owner": "ranlebogabonem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029058521403448, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:12:30", "owner": "future12502", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040512872223143, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-11T09:21:22", "owner": "bene_191206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962261799834637, "text": "Soon india 😁 we are building real life jarvis for defence and for home and office launching 2025 march", "created_at": "2024-12-10T20:35:30", "owner": "leg3nd.7z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914655067018466, "text": "i think jaguar own by some indian guy ??", "created_at": "2024-12-10T17:06:59", "owner": "iknowayuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051158240050581, "text": "Dude usa as u know it today was an European innovation", "created_at": "2024-12-10T15:19:07", "owner": "iamsokind_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049177910031259, "text": "Iss is russian", "created_at": "2024-12-09T16:38:00", "owner": "m4.golden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993844848721577, "text": "🇺🇸 is world leader", "created_at": "2024-12-09T12:30:51", "owner": "aesatrunv5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887200045160436, "text": "Well if you really wanted European innovation EUROPE = USA", "created_at": "2024-12-09T09:59:39", "owner": "eddie_ath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351529240127880, "text": "Isn't tesla south Africa innovation? Since elon is south African?", "created_at": "2024-12-09T07:13:03", "owner": "english_matt_little", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045472066915186, "text": "It's an Indian owned company 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-08T20:00:40", "owner": "mohtashim_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951976842890842, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T16:36:50", "owner": "manoucher_1368", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18467569189010869, "text": "Europe make America bro 😭🙏", "created_at": "2024-12-08T15:38:10", "owner": "felix18341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018360773370349, "text": "Most of today's technology originally comes from Germany. 🇩🇪. So please 🤫", "created_at": "2024-12-08T14:28:24", "owner": "amraanel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081173278505020, "text": "100% an 🇺🇸 made this😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:16:57", "owner": "nolsoesoren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289963750233431, "text": "Pls music", "created_at": "2024-12-08T06:55:49", "owner": "smcrypto237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079169518573759, "text": "America itself is an European innovation", "created_at": "2024-12-07T23:39:16", "owner": "soli.1376", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252272143281794, "text": "German innovations: \n\n-rockets\n-turbine engine\n-cars\n-petrol and diesel engine\n-motorcycles/ bicycles \n-antibiotics\n-and plenty more", "created_at": "2024-12-07T22:50:45", "owner": "oskar.ack68", "likes": 5}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3511347075894253179, "shortcode": "DC6z4_FyJZ7", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC6z4_FyJZ7/", "taken_at": "2024-11-28T14:46:52", "caption": "最強女友 💪\n#迷因#梗圖 #情感語錄 #搞笑", "owner_username": "buzhengjingmeisaonan", "owner_id": "48694614289", "likes": 63518, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0329_DC6z4_FyJZ7\\DC6z4_FyJZ7_20241128_144652.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17979792662644804, "text": "@callme_yosl", "created_at": "2024-12-28T10:18:37", "owner": "wer55660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955193106895989, "text": "😂👏", "created_at": "2024-12-26T13:48:27", "owner": "ghgh.0817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039443999062987, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-26T12:40:53", "owner": "cat_714_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028277315536616, "text": "笑爛😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T16:30:58", "owner": "ww_08_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876713092227644, "text": "@cc.cc_12345 感覺就是你", "created_at": "2024-12-25T16:08:12", "owner": "dr_11._.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847147600377750, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-24T22:38:16", "owner": "0202_lxj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051371297293524, "text": "👏😮😂👏", "created_at": "2024-12-24T13:41:42", "owner": "llinyuhan1101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007790711693685, "text": "跌倒罵髒話，徒手打蟑螂，那484可以單手把男友公主抱起來", "created_at": "2024-12-23T09:38:39", "owner": "yangjiage5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037298441093091, "text": "越看越好笑", "created_at": "2024-12-23T08:57:37", "owner": "yj_.6.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039172226201628, "text": "超猛", "created_at": "2024-12-22T07:45:54", "owner": "zijin_you2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039808781198107, "text": "摔倒就馬上站起來罵干霖涼，是真的絕了😂我也是💩🤓", "created_at": "2024-12-22T07:27:09", "owner": "csy._.0619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879869518199201, "text": "这女的是风向星座吧", "created_at": "2024-12-21T06:09:19", "owner": "ky_214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986945202773701, "text": "好可愛的女友🤣🤣🤣🤣好天喔", "created_at": "2024-12-20T18:09:51", "owner": "xu_1233_33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065310271793638, "text": "@hsi0823 呃 型女", "created_at": "2024-12-20T15:30:38", "owner": "y.0818.ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172506403312896, "text": "确实很猛", "created_at": "2024-12-20T08:53:19", "owner": "1111winkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066567679693872, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-19T05:01:37", "owner": "hhuangkaijie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035611961459200, "text": "這就是我(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:26:35", "owner": "akij._.1024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053983474958510, "text": "自从啊权配音后看这篇文章都有声音了", "created_at": "2024-12-18T11:16:44", "owner": "pgone0507_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056953000766861, "text": "我操太強了吧", "created_at": "2024-12-18T10:51:10", "owner": "zhongyicheng17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111724459439118, "text": "@bimao_9394 有沒有很有感❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-17T02:44:46", "owner": "19940926_cty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341092522196032, "text": "@zh._.903 幹我笑死", "created_at": "2024-12-16T12:13:51", "owner": "drx._.1012", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053628310955296, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T11:54:59", "owner": "h.h.s1206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884144392184383, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T09:32:32", "owner": "patty__88826", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928466403874501, "text": "男方：應該是我比較需要被關心", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:28:45", "owner": "juny201303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053481296316193, "text": "厲害😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T13:14:15", "owner": "weiningrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139475956369150, "text": "牛逼", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:32:33", "owner": "01831pq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851062567359073, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T10:48:38", "owner": "iiiyvyiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906338428064569, "text": "好像我本人💩💩", "created_at": "2024-12-15T08:37:26", "owner": "ally_choichoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990246888753995, "text": "@weiling.3011", "created_at": "2024-12-15T08:23:13", "owner": "yiu_812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926163780993241, "text": "男生表示我也想！但是我做不到，都比我強了我還能幹嘛", "created_at": "2024-12-15T04:06:52", "owner": "thyy._22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991291131747296, "text": "我覺得應該女方保護男方🧏🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-12-15T03:40:55", "owner": "kelly_.0816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474881218061902, "text": "應該是男生說想分手才對", "created_at": "2024-12-14T23:40:45", "owner": "tianshuoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029865059419315, "text": "6", "created_at": "2024-12-14T15:06:04", "owner": "hse._.1223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890043217137701, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:52:37", "owner": "eva_980728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026162237565931, "text": "金刚芭比", "created_at": "2024-12-14T03:18:17", "owner": "izaac.moo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18206304523288646, "text": "真的不是我！真的不像我🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-14T02:04:52", "owner": "b0925195079", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18257808160256148, "text": "摔倒了還是可以呼呼啊！！！動腦啊兄弟！！！！！！！！", "created_at": "2024-12-13T22:38:45", "owner": "07cat28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063389062829727, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-13T12:41:55", "owner": "asdsb2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285746101174244, "text": "男生：我覺得我比較需要被關心", "created_at": "2024-12-13T09:11:38", "owner": "9nyzrf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066109924697443, "text": "男生沒有關心，但是有觀察。", "created_at": "2024-12-13T08:14:29", "owner": "mo.mo.moly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909769158961189, "text": "重點是妳脫下褲子還比我長", "created_at": "2024-12-13T07:20:55", "owner": "ponchen_322", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110729332437556, "text": "@友列的所有女生 你們都比我猛", "created_at": "2024-12-13T07:14:52", "owner": "_7xnlly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894483424038575, "text": "有没有可能他们两位是同", "created_at": "2024-12-13T06:47:43", "owner": "owen1223_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021643469619120, "text": "問他：你有病嗎 \n也算是一種關心吧\n歐 是關懷", "created_at": "2024-12-13T02:32:01", "owner": "jefferson.lin__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138229804370221, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:48:05", "owner": "enxitay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061250365715465, "text": "一起比到底誰比較man嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-12T05:54:48", "owner": "_kal_lka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107794180449746, "text": "笑死了", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:35:09", "owner": "yingh1141", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073189453716888, "text": "@cc.cc_cccc 😂笑歪", "created_at": "2024-12-11T02:22:33", "owner": "rongrong0403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860628766309650, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-10T18:23:38", "owner": "chocolate919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891238753130114, "text": "建議分了吧⋯⋯", "created_at": "2024-12-10T14:54:10", "owner": "graceyuenxdxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161478385323574, "text": "@yu_fei1314 我也刷到啦", "created_at": "2024-12-10T14:27:32", "owner": "skyblue_510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909478848960879, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2024-12-10T11:53:18", "owner": "yzxk_jjjjjjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024092702304142, "text": "子路為馬", "created_at": "2024-12-10T11:14:46", "owner": "hans_06_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468660574002530, "text": "這好像是我", "created_at": "2024-12-10T10:01:04", "owner": "pzy_.428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066965176665223, "text": "@carsonlo531 看來我只是有點外向", "created_at": "2024-12-10T06:13:05", "owner": "sibylla_11252024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882180505183397, "text": "关心是出自你自己，不是看对方需不需要。而是你想不想给对方感觉你的爱。", "created_at": "2024-12-10T06:01:12", "owner": "saeko_skcsk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042056921335258, "text": "都說不能只看外表了嘛", "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:05:39", "owner": "99.05._.26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071808817633059, "text": "@tiantian13579926 这个就是你在学校厕所里面用脚打蚊子🤨", "created_at": "2024-12-09T16:10:44", "owner": "ig.xin12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064129123765698, "text": "我欸❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:33:08", "owner": "6_.ae37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049437233026916, "text": "超雄女友🤡", "created_at": "2024-12-09T12:20:48", "owner": "hx_.0614", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18469167130013280, "text": "哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T09:04:49", "owner": "love_.mizuki_407827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070252381656914, "text": "這是我看過最勇敢的女生😂@iove.1126, @lawslavx, @xarp._.xyn", "created_at": "2024-12-09T07:19:34", "owner": "kitte101111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031456748161294, "text": "@elaina.0313.ruth @zixuan_.sofia", "created_at": "2024-12-08T23:14:38", "owner": "gaochenfeng6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264959275301724, "text": "@1412._.zxx", "created_at": "2024-12-08T19:05:30", "owner": "lns_0307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024612095548913, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T13:58:54", "owner": "yun155320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18264620449269478, "text": "颱風出去吹吹風😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T12:54:44", "owner": "hzy._.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065691958738435, "text": "@77__._yu.905 開心嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-08T11:55:55", "owner": "hyf_7879", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039678206254734, "text": "結婚之後可能會被女方家暴(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2024-12-08T11:53:28", "owner": "c.c._.1313", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18084707206550658, "text": "我只會回一句 好吧", "created_at": "2024-12-08T07:38:38", "owner": "maxload01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871022821240643, "text": "这。。。这真的黑不了，这兄弟。。。硬要说的话，太弱了", "created_at": "2024-12-08T04:14:43", "owner": "marelyntay", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17982428633772368, "text": "@stellafu_0212 這是你嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-08T01:19:58", "owner": "zuyjna", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18263010196249035, "text": "徒手打蟑螂！！！！！\n我可能比較需要關心", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:07:38", "owner": "yaoqianqiany", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18291932377236884, "text": "式守", "created_at": "2024-12-07T05:55:26", "owner": "myj.119", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048538319035157, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-07T04:42:34", "owner": "ashley000000ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055906504764660, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-07T03:51:30", "owner": "carmen.l_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172284703312702, "text": "金剛芭比是不是？😂", "created_at": "2024-12-07T03:20:42", "owner": "jason__524133", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904720902981554, "text": "哎呀😢", "created_at": "2024-12-06T12:54:35", "owner": "shells._.baby_0117", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17952179078759156, "text": "好的我也這樣😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T09:10:05", "owner": "yux_1224", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954857466747573, "text": "这个是我🤓", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:55:15", "owner": "ziyen.teo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18011861879658772, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T01:34:32", "owner": "i8105me", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060287764857452, "text": "@jy.o_o.0622 是我了 🦭你都沒有關心我 分手吧", "created_at": "2024-12-05T18:18:49", "owner": "jingkeiiii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18287245189212006, "text": "这是他心理阴影吧？😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-05T12:43:49", "owner": "11_kingyang", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18337553812149861, "text": "懂事令人放心的女友", "created_at": "2024-12-05T11:35:08", "owner": "qiweiiiiiii_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18073495510618753, "text": "最佳女强人", "created_at": "2024-12-03T13:09:40", "owner": "tsx10_10", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17950554311894233, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T12:07:13", "owner": "xpj_531", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078120457573378, "text": "他應該關心她的精神狀態(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2024-12-03T10:24:23", "owner": "yien.__0606", "likes": 419}, {"id": 17859781491241988, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T13:41:45", "owner": "xuyiwocaonima", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053993230932530, "text": "@9xillc_ 怎解", "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:15:26", "owner": "y.a.c_0706", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18012659912474640, "text": "上三度影片了👏", "created_at": "2024-12-02T10:48:52", "owner": "sean46353", "likes": 77}, {"id": 18064250527784310, "text": "me🤓", "created_at": "2024-12-01T22:59:52", "owner": "mist_1501", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17972740967802272, "text": "@liuxinyu4767 @im_michelleee56 看来我也不是那么猛我只是性格外向了点", "created_at": "2024-12-01T21:44:43", "owner": "rainbow091013", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18054871846907272, "text": "求男生的心理陰影😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T10:27:29", "owner": "qvq_zhen", "likes": 975}, {"id": 18074158531555663, "text": "但是來大姨媽不痛也可以喝紅棗補氣血 興奮的猴子在地震也有可能出意外 房子有蟑螂了代表該註意了 摔倒了罵甘霖涼不代表就不痛了 颱風來了說要出門吹風是乾話 勇猛的人也值得被關心", "created_at": "2024-11-30T15:02:39", "owner": "prpl7773", "likes": 321}, {"id": 18067598203672482, "text": "我本人🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:32:44", "owner": "sally21a_0202", "likes": 106}, {"id": 18028215035614528, "text": "如果她不夠依人，那你就小鳥一點嘛😏", "created_at": "2024-12-12T01:33:13", "owner": "aristochill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434637025078544, "text": "徒手打也太噁", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:29:59", "owner": "meat._.berries0911", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024703787621344, "text": "好噁心打不下手", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:29:20", "owner": "meat._.berries0911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888437548148366, "text": "怕下一秒自己便蟑螂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:40:12", "owner": "he.zong.cheng.699441", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332021446155893, "text": "細狗別吵", "created_at": "2024-11-29T11:34:06", "owner": "skydfffuu", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["迷因", "梗圖", "情感語錄", "搞笑"]},
