": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-11T17:18:19", "owner": "patrick.geddes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077900194737330, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-03-08T18:26:54", "owner": "revathikuruba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892982584181030, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-08T09:37:10", "owner": "ceec_offical_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874743463279556, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-08T06:00:03", "owner": "thisisoliverreloaded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293284288173481, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T17:18:28", "owner": "realname_thato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044264117078397, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T11:31:07", "owner": "aanal_1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842778739439880, "text": "I love being attached to those emails lol", "created_at": "2025-03-07T01:10:48", "owner": "pooda575", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884585038238004, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-07T01:10:30", "owner": "pooda575", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072927988802541, "text": "Accurate", "created_at": "2025-03-06T22:58:34", "owner": "kokoabroaddus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922335370047313, "text": "Cc the boss 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-06T01:46:24", "owner": "mariphosaabines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997302705601555, "text": "So true", "created_at": "2025-02-28T20:01:06", "owner": "mrbrigge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901708972132292, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-27T16:42:30", "owner": "bimbosals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055498853104362, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-25T14:18:02", "owner": "opedaydydx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070687939834020, "text": "Reattached for your reference killed me 🤣🤣😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-02-19T18:05:20", "owner": "orchestra_82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145067428371455, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-17T19:43:51", "owner": "dima.abedalqader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291538798243819, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-02-14T10:50:21", "owner": "channa_chea_cambodia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061175218939290, "text": "yeah lol", "created_at": "2025-02-08T00:56:13", "owner": "chacachicii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058977224304609, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-07T10:46:36", "owner": "maeperocho_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844702645395534, "text": "It s you @vonuno", "created_at": "2025-02-05T17:09:51", "owner": "thaooolephuong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072138658690028, "text": "@aymvt 🤣", "created_at": "2025-02-04T18:22:05", "owner": "clemence_tassain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954745347914371, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-03T18:26:50", "owner": "tracyhomie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030185342288173, "text": "@dailythuong", "created_at": "2025-02-03T12:20:57", "owner": "trhduong93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179616430311286, "text": "“I hope this email finds you before i do”", "created_at": "2025-02-01T13:35:51", "owner": "revenant2k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059033215945444, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-31T09:02:57", "owner": "thecuriouspawmily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888825247179527, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-28T13:44:33", "owner": "sakura_azalea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065708365847911, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-25T08:46:15", "owner": "prathibha.kodithuwakku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029425232562027, "text": "I’m CCing your boss…not sure if I understand the ask… 😂❤️ All these sent me!", "created_at": "2025-01-25T03:21:01", "owner": "invinciblerocket", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892319221157414, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-22T20:50:14", "owner": "ms_kayh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317012293164602, "text": "So much drama HAHAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-01-22T18:38:20", "owner": "immrlzspn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025891772633358, "text": "L", "created_at": "2025-01-21T13:42:38", "owner": "muhammadbdiab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075916243562621, "text": "It mean professionalism life in work is different in personal life", "created_at": "2025-01-17T14:56:27", "owner": "michaelasiongt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084407506504876, "text": "Seems like my project manager and TL 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-16T18:11:16", "owner": "lalit.ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051500228035384, "text": "@aiminadzirah !! Hahahahahah", "created_at": "2025-01-09T21:56:25", "owner": "maisarahzulkifli_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857485105281874, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-08T16:28:10", "owner": "elinaonyango", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328365562083871, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-07T10:19:55", "owner": "varunkumar24x7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131419123377831, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-01-05T12:32:26", "owner": "iamjust_f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051670427013100, "text": "💯🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-01-04T03:45:27", "owner": "masterfulmaroon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144001030363983, "text": "\"As per previous mail\" and \"Hope this mail finds you well\" are also very colorful expressions for mail, i used the first a lot in airbnb disputes while working there", "created_at": "2025-01-04T00:49:15", "owner": "robcher92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085819747554733, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-03T20:04:42", "owner": "1_yasmeens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063917866878147, "text": "💯😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-02T11:20:48", "owner": "beniel_samuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102783901482034, "text": "Never gets old 🤣", "created_at": "2025-01-01T18:59:19", "owner": "nabila.tajrin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037741598093064, "text": "So that it calls collectives 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T21:00:44", "owner": "mukh2mmadali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903251361997106, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T13:52:37", "owner": "glorydinho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037773554371574, "text": "@16oniru 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T13:26:17", "owner": "emzeeno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476342080059894, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-30T16:15:30", "owner": "abijagtap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074128810571450, "text": "No lies.", "created_at": "2024-12-30T07:45:40", "owner": "barrysome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045396349973081, "text": "Nakakastress 🙄", "created_at": "2024-12-30T01:56:10", "owner": "zcwythlecatbagan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133047421378841, "text": "Inter net", "created_at": "2024-12-29T17:29:19", "owner": "focus_szh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940499133948185, "text": "That’s actually 90% of internet discourses.  People don’t talk in person to others like they do online.", "created_at": "2024-12-24T06:05:48", "owner": "hrnfrg97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322840933080829, "text": "@ajegs @tobiogunlesi", "created_at": "2024-12-22T21:17:18", "owner": "gregiyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075046897620007, "text": "@siana_shaw", "created_at": "2024-12-22T06:13:06", "owner": "tnkat97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916755855934501, "text": "They are just playing a barking game 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-21T14:31:05", "owner": "phani.co.in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065055706805665, "text": "per my last mail 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-20T18:36:57", "owner": "ayushjaspau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126685690396058, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T09:06:48", "owner": "ozhaneselassie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055306777792314, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-19T23:13:07", "owner": "eriiiiiihoxha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057649906935290, "text": "This looks like when people fight in the comment section, but they are polite irl.", "created_at": "2024-12-19T17:31:58", "owner": "ironkoroknai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999553059539300, "text": "When that gate opens, go for the neck...", "created_at": "2024-12-19T04:47:28", "owner": "jrob_to_the_nth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053394287068167, "text": "@livelybloke \n\n🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:07:13", "owner": "onkark911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285761830170779, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T06:23:24", "owner": "the_sushant_shinde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050114258062661, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-17T21:15:58", "owner": "tekyid237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949226646909584, "text": "Like driving", "created_at": "2024-12-17T15:56:31", "owner": "8eight_ei