{"media_id": 3456815213883445634, "shortcode": "C_5Ex89sFGC", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_5Ex89sFGC/", "taken_at": "2024-09-14T09:04:25", "caption": "全台唯一「活化石」炒麵！\n在海生館可以看到的遠古生物「鱟」（ㄏㄡˋ）\n老闆娘傳承了上一代爸媽的技術竟然拿鱟殼當鍋鏟炒麵\n翻炒的過程非常帥氣現在全台灣只有這裡能看到了😍😍\n-\n🏠：黃家 鱟殼炒蚵仔麵\n⏱：11:00-18:00（星期日公休）\n☎️：0934-045-962\n📬：彰化縣員林市民生路154巷1號\n-\n#吃得保寶飽in彰化\n#黃家鱟殼炒蚵仔麵 #彰化麵店 #員林車站美食\n#彰化美食 #員林市美食 #彰化小吃 #彰化銅板美食\n#員林美食 #changhuafood #taiwan #taiwanfood", "owner_username": "eateat_bao5252", "owner_id": "6549291705", "likes": 54897, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0331_C_5Ex89sFGC\\C_5Ex89sFGC_20240914_090425.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086462309489798, "text": "wow❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:50:05", "owner": "tour10024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943257816794403, "text": "多此一舉", "created_at": "2024-11-30T09:34:35", "owner": "hau__cho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050792279050981, "text": "😂沒什麼特別", "created_at": "2024-11-29T07:22:34", "owner": "16claw_on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062979091773446, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-11-27T16:18:40", "owner": "come_come_home", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900137043998779, "text": "可以試試頭蓋骨炒麵，提供豐富鈣質", "created_at": "2024-11-27T12:28:10", "owner": "line_cook_johnny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893055658039468, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-27T11:25:20", "owner": "yourpathout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372360370105679, "text": "没活硬整🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-27T09:12:12", "owner": "junnan_0525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918466768008384, "text": "很不卫生一下", "created_at": "2024-11-27T04:20:16", "owner": "darendkkk6666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856184977260098, "text": "有好味点的吗？感觉多9🐟", "created_at": "2024-11-27T01:58:33", "owner": "windleeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027890798198838, "text": "這是舊時水上人常用的廚具之一，但他並沒有修剪好⋯", "created_at": "2024-11-26T21:26:50", "owner": "manchung_mc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069766909711774, "text": "用鏟子就好啦，有點多餘吧", "created_at": "2024-11-26T10:01:43", "owner": "ringo.lee3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472183201022398, "text": "意義何在？噱頭而已啊，重點還是得要東西好吃", "created_at": "2024-11-26T09:02:02", "owner": "yys7781234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958016868729058, "text": "V. Excellent", "created_at": "2024-11-26T07:32:10", "owner": "moral.injury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052813639794037, "text": "所以多久沒洗了？", "created_at": "2024-11-26T06:18:52", "owner": "wayne__1018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847382824334258, "text": "鱟哩謝", "created_at": "2024-11-26T05:06:07", "owner": "windkidz0201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037319927057463, "text": "好特別噢，乾淨又衛生", "created_at": "2024-11-26T03:18:27", "owner": "sic_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917287347919126, "text": "這樣味道有不一樣嗎？", "created_at": "2024-11-26T01:42:29", "owner": "una_holt_hair_stylist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992662722724271, "text": "The English comment u are looking for is here.....", "created_at": "2024-11-25T15:01:16", "owner": "the_.man_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051274837987368, "text": "Looks 😋", "created_at": "2024-11-25T13:40:56", "owner": "jeannette.publicfigure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048926767852373, "text": "會比較好吃？", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:55:37", "owner": "m1ller_m1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028334753419750, "text": "THEY ATE KABUTO!!", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:22:13", "owner": "andayachristopher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039650984224245, "text": "彰化員林第一市場也有", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:09:21", "owner": "wanan_wanan_wanan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048933998006748, "text": "彰化員林第一市場也有", "created_at": "2024-11-25T04:08:20", "owner": "wanan_wanan_wanan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063756352743616, "text": "活化石虽然死了但是被老板整活了", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:48:14", "owner": "chasel_c.fang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949543131887435, "text": "不殼以🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:33:32", "owner": "apollyon579", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013396814446114, "text": "人真的不能吃太飽", "created_at": "2024-11-25T03:22:20", "owner": "0.0_yujen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048160361088159, "text": "Highly recommend ❤️😍", "created_at": "2024-11-25T02:47:20", "owner": "iamgibo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937111536945762, "text": "知道很特別，但是...為什麼😂", "created_at": "2024-11-25T01:26:56", "owner": "kinghtoscar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855679093319411, "text": "How big are those", "created_at": "2024-11-24T21:47:23", "owner": "paravoni1w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950150784891139, "text": "But why?", "created_at": "2024-11-24T14:35:14", "owner": "holee9385", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872728402228078, "text": "鱟。理。謝。", "created_at": "2024-11-24T12:14:06", "owner": "dddddddddd.99999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931902120848258, "text": "@qmou0407", "created_at": "2024-11-24T11:34:52", "owner": "kuantingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897005989014083, "text": "这个我们这里海边随便捡😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T07:27:12", "owner": "lycheejiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039668936011481, "text": "嘔吐物炒麵😂", "created_at": "2024-11-24T06:45:26", "owner": "nam.mak.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471779173036725, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2024-11-24T06:08:37", "owner": "vova_kamensochi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849639652345223, "text": "Predator somewhere punching the air", "created_at": "2024-11-24T05:14:11", "owner": "alexina_lovely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027489272209236, "text": "多舊魚", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:06:05", "owner": "to.lht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136301890329112, "text": "沒錢買鏟？", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:39:54", "owner": "tang.frederick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319626226084589, "text": "Generations losing good healths.just eating everything", "created_at": "2024-11-23T07:26:11", "owner": "adheerasantu_creatveceluliod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036561149077482, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-23T02:03:06", "owner": "iamkayne.sg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024655256610950, "text": "這是違法行為", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:48:10", "owner": "jimmy._1208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071331529628023, "text": "這東西我們這裡很常見，有餐廳用它的蛋🥚做泰國沙拉", "created_at": "2024-11-22T22:13:11", "owner": "suogewei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064428829685136, "text": "会更好吃吗？不会，但会更贵❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-22T20:22:43", "owner": "roger_cheung97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078153037573115, "text": "M", "created_at": "2024-11-22T11:23:28", "owner": "katasera_hme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052259974814581, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-11-22T10:10:04", "owner": "wafi_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068795248589195, "text": "我是厨师，看了都沉默一言难尽.....", "created_at": "2024-11-22T09:02:14", "owner": "leoann5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169930285314808, "text": "這樣有比較好吃嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-22T06:29:34", "owner": "ashitaka_jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076081348593672, "text": "kaga ngaruh", "created_at": "2024-11-22T01:07:29", "owner": "gapake_toge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872572555142075, "text": "鱟生悲哀 。生要給人採血放生採血放生無限輪迴、到某次捉了來宰又變鑊鏟", "created_at": "2024-11-21T16:24:22", "owner": "coohm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022066475557442, "text": "@michte", "created_at": "2024-11-21T12:08:05", "owner": "mojoejoejoey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996715590534753, "text": "多舊魚….", "created_at": "2024-11-21T07:11:01", "owner": "phoenixutubeacc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110881297427200, "text": "不得轮回", "created_at": "2024-11-21T01:13:17", "owner": "sanpetiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991759668723871, "text": "I’m not trying to eat out of a Giant roaches head. 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-20T18:06:13", "owner": "uspolicecams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888045559081848, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-20T12:59:49", "owner": "nextboykong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928502436858601, "text": "@billyleeee_ 我們是不是要買一個這個～", "created_at": "2024-11-20T07:05:03", "owner": "danlee.0703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342592675178632, "text": "手腕，手臂更加容易受傷。。。😮", "created_at": "2024-11-20T06:04:55", "owner": "seeutube2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959886675710752, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-11-20T05:26:27", "owner": "kingloongsteven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249275695285703, "text": "Ridiculous👏", "created_at": "2024-11-20T04:54:41", "owner": "jul_kj69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979594263786871, "text": "Cool", "created_at": "2024-11-20T01:06:40", "owner": "krisakanw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039145910214575, "text": "意義何在", "created_at": "2024-11-19T20:06:15", "owner": "d62331236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888194437112697, "text": "🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2024-11-19T15:12:52", "owner": "heil_kidra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18448898980065648, "text": "看了沒胃口", "created_at": "2024-11-19T13:59:10", "owner": "xiangkuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849331468343353, "text": "這個至少有50年以上了", "created_at": "2024-11-19T09:03:15", "owner": "leo540422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047939648085413, "text": "完全沒有必要 @ndgiant1st_scotty", "created_at": "2024-11-19T07:48:01", "owner": "bennyshi_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849453136305247, "text": "鱟", "created_at": "2024-11-19T06:58:55", "owner": "q.runni.66___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182742940309965, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-18T22:55:44", "owner": "nick13378", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320501338090185, "text": "@supparay14k", "created_at": "2024-11-18T22:43:51", "owner": "musclemikele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310766662163102, "text": "Bro... Even ancient animals can't escape", "created_at": "2024-11-18T17:14:43", "owner": "_afromaster_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062379376744708, "text": "和拿人类头盖骨或者肋骨炒菜一样。。。。。惊悚", "created_at": "2024-11-18T15:22:35", "owner": "vincent_tutu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066502246673481, "text": "有夠多餘", "created_at": "2024-11-18T13:35:15", "owner": "lovelocker.condom.shophk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862081828272441, "text": "好可怕😮", "created_at": "2024-11-18T10:45:35", "owner": "cafe_good_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886210804148714, "text": "有卫生部批准吗？", "created_at": "2024-11-18T04:26:17", "owner": "cxiiwps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859136149291446, "text": "這樣點肉絲炒麵的話炒完到底算海鮮肉絲炒麵還是肉絲炒麵🤔", "created_at": "2024-11-17T17:53:37", "owner": "queen_nyic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476370796009366, "text": "无聊", "created_at": "2024-11-17T15:23:21", "owner": "weebin91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026900783422979, "text": "額 然後呢", "created_at": "2024-11-17T01:50:43", "owner": "3_r_0_o_2_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034306424080564, "text": "真的有差嗎 不就炒麵嗎🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-16T13:07:59", "owner": "johnson850916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068929417723214, "text": "有比较好吃吗？", "created_at": "2024-11-15T07:02:02", "owner": "samcks361", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996535095538337, "text": "不如做一個蟑螂造型來用", "created_at": "2024-11-15T03:32:18", "owner": "betray88828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046618823014427, "text": "Horseshoe carbs", "created_at": "2024-11-13T20:52:45", "owner": "trick.hung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098380918466057, "text": "全台唯一？ 在彰化員林 以前就有了 \n並不是全台唯一", "created_at": "2024-11-11T05:12:23", "owner": "jia_rui_413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860426179224901, "text": "四處都馬有", "created_at": "2024-11-10T10:51:49", "owner": "jacky032683", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865246066251019, "text": "金門很多鱟捏", "created_at": "2024-11-09T06:26:30", "owner": "celery6.4_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104921176448030, "text": "整色整水😂", "created_at": "2024-11-08T16:10:50", "owner": "celiaxcc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005255813500911, "text": "Is that you Kabutops 😮?", "created_at": "2024-11-06T06:41:57", "owner": "ardhikakv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076025263583250, "text": "噱...噱頭....", "created_at": "2024-11-04T06:46:05", "owner": "shown9949", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042336701130762, "text": "所以？ 有特別的味道嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-03T23:39:38", "owner": "jiahui7420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373085302108277, "text": "怎麼不用爺爺的大腿骨來炒", "created_at": "2024-11-03T22:50:31", "owner": "farllaryo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18124058296358219, "text": "噱頭， 噱頭，噱頭。。。。 炒麵看起來是蠻道地， 根本不需要這種噱頭。😂", "created_at": "2024-11-03T22:50:04", "owner": "farllaryo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17894068308016910, "text": "二林有一家", "created_at": "2024-11-03T21:57:05", "owner": "qwef0961", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019418546609424, "text": "@esean1215 多功能", "created_at": "2024-11-03T16:49:34", "owner": "11.21cing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021373334298653, "text": "No way they use that on the regular..", "created_at": "2024-11-03T09:25:12", "owner": "armstrong543", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857948764290312, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-11-03T04:18:53", "owner": "candyww_2290", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056505337892184, "text": "吃過…就…普通炒麵：）", "created_at": "2024-11-03T00:24:30", "owner": "matcha._.0722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947298489766485, "text": "@chloejyhhh @lyzhennn 員林人怎看？", "created_at": "2024-11-02T17:52:32", "owner": "jn313.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373952341109415, "text": "想知道用这个作为炒面的工具，有什么意义，味道不一样？还是营养元素多？", "created_at": "2024-11-01T10:28:14", "owner": "wongkimfei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987075390743946, "text": "i hope you are only using the shells and not actually harvesting them!!!", "created_at": "2024-10-31T15:45:55", "owner": "dklee_p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076958497561510, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-31T04:27:39", "owner": "nassfury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056828887893727, "text": "你可以不吃，但一定要推薦你朋友吃😍", "created_at": "2024-10-30T12:58:13", "owner": "thai_yiland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028588193151728, "text": "知道什麼叫噱頭嗎？這就是", "created_at": "2024-10-30T03:17:46", "owner": "reiyu_924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002498867675028, "text": "要不，我用头盖骨给你", "created_at": "2024-10-29T08:31:48", "owner": "ooi61_19", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["吃得保寶飽in彰化", "黃家鱟殼炒蚵仔麵", "彰化麵店", "員林車站美食", "彰化美食", "員林市美食", "彰化小吃", "彰化銅板美食", "員林美食", "changhuafood", "taiwan", "taiwanfood"]},
{"media_id": 3499595676273706830, "shortcode": "DCRD7nVyYdO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCRD7nVyYdO/", "taken_at": "2024-11-12T09:41:37", "caption": "Bro just gonna starve 💸 \n\n#hk #hkig #hongkong #hongkongshop #hongkongfood", "owner_username": "elliott_yip", "owner_id": "7169790005", "likes": 33623, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0332_DCRD7nVyYdO\\DCRD7nVyYdO_20241112_094137.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18123437173552201, "text": "IKR", "created_at": "2026-01-07T02:31:49", "owner": "hazel.fung.102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070235321597528, "text": "I miss Sainsbury’s Tescos and even Waitrose 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:40:42", "owner": "angelinamcr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115920277538930, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:15:33", "owner": "tictic_booboo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086573680857536, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-02T04:07:51", "owner": "felizconsulting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907534765216938, "text": "Wait whaaaaaat 😮", "created_at": "2025-08-25T19:30:49", "owner": "mweetwajr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850354165510796, "text": "Premium of western style supermarket", "created_at": "2025-07-23T12:07:55", "owner": "ml.traffic.engineers", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051205484133393, "text": "😂😂😂😂literally😂", "created_at": "2025-06-24T15:35:09", "owner": "lonztamayo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069747938059074, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-24T15:33:34", "owner": "lonztamayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033772526345875, "text": "Yeah it’s true", "created_at": "2025-05-22T17:31:40", "owner": "iamstarstargazer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864887662391034, "text": "Not true", "created_at": "2025-05-15T00:37:37", "owner": "ctattack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062435570108158, "text": "那個果汁是二十四元", "created_at": "2025-05-11T09:08:20", "owner": "sakuu_2224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972152067731822, "text": "WHAT EXPENSIVE ASS SUPERMARKET ARE YOU GOING TO?????", "created_at": "2025-05-04T01:58:05", "owner": "dyna_point0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972697950852137, "text": "I can tell you this is fr based on my own experience 🐱", "created_at": "2025-05-03T14:37:02", "owner": "a.k._0407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930292854922465, "text": "60HKD=6pounds", "created_at": "2025-04-22T09:35:35", "owner": "yumi_zzxx1234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18170570641328132, "text": "Just go to parknshop lol", "created_at": "2025-04-18T00:45:08", "owner": "mar51aa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18165402199341646, "text": "Ofc it's expensive you went to a expensive shop just go to regular  supermarkets", "created_at": "2025-04-12T05:32:12", "owner": "chloeho43", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057645575512418, "text": "its very high end shop", "created_at": "2025-04-06T12:02:15", "owner": "sfwashi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914319469087778, "text": "Truly 😂😂😂😂😂😂🫣🫣🫣🫣🫣🫣", "created_at": "2025-03-27T06:37:47", "owner": "daisyboy.http", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363147904125408, "text": "@jonnyalden1 - this is so you in m&s today", "created_at": "2025-03-13T05:26:57", "owner": "louise.rachel.hawthorne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032231027300667, "text": "Go to 7/11 la", "created_at": "2025-02-26T17:48:42", "owner": "aryankys_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032066861289571, "text": "HK dollar is pegged to USD$ hence the Trumpy high prices. Locals crossover to China to do groceries, buy food.", "created_at": "2025-02-23T02:50:52", "owner": "mdynstagram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070939621641210, "text": "As a person from HK and living in UK 10 HKD is 1 pound or around 1 USD in the states as well", "created_at": "2025-02-23T00:40:33", "owner": "techybix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037091762182176, "text": "Haha this one deff city super laaaa.. still have the other supermarket 😂", "created_at": "2025-02-11T18:10:31", "owner": "fei.felicia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873250894272823, "text": "Yeah City super also I am from Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-02-10T11:59:38", "owner": "rip_oreo_let_him_rest_in_peace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099738466444727, "text": "I live in hk it's better to go to like local markets", "created_at": "2025-02-09T23:47:08", "owner": "adelynxo_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17968011743836136, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-02-08T02:10:54", "owner": "_amaliaazhari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067217710686822, "text": "Just go to Marketplace...not so expensive.", "created_at": "2025-02-07T16:37:00", "owner": "_thinna.ur.password_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992902725612380, "text": "Memories with our budget and limited places to cook @caitriona_a_h", "created_at": "2025-02-06T18:26:21", "owner": "sineadbernadette97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070420741775685, "text": "Isn’t that Korn Hill in Tai Ku Sing 💀", "created_at": "2025-02-06T13:31:16", "owner": "autistic_otaku_for_life", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18341357707146046, "text": "City super are for expats", "created_at": "2025-02-06T08:39:23", "owner": "kimhung2345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034881749575642, "text": "No city super", "created_at": "2025-02-06T08:38:34", "owner": "kimhung2345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001757537720387, "text": "U went to a wrong supermarket", "created_at": "2025-02-06T08:38:24", "owner": "kimhung2345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481786273034608, "text": "Great is a social experiment", "created_at": "2025-02-02T12:20:51", "owner": "aarik_persaud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071755726706063, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-02T06:50:40", "owner": "memyselfandi_elle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096293047508238, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-02T02:09:08", "owner": "caliandlou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169038961321802, "text": "Me buying imported Mandarins from USA in Australia for CNY 😳", "created_at": "2025-01-31T09:33:00", "owner": "jan.coastalqiflow.qigong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879378358235987, "text": "Mannn so real. 😢😢 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-30T16:16:52", "owner": "eatbibledaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015885428488919, "text": "That is why I do my groceries at the wet markets .", "created_at": "2025-01-30T14:44:46", "owner": "lyraleea.arnado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18486704641010284, "text": "just go to park n shop", "created_at": "2025-01-30T08:57:58", "owner": "reelspammer8000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304687072228511, "text": "Wait I SEEN YOU GUYs somewhere😭 doing that", "created_at": "2025-01-30T07:05:09", "owner": "x_y0ruw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865318843243470, "text": "Nah city super even more expensive", "created_at": "2025-01-30T06:27:06", "owner": "who_is_danielk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858828997284447, "text": "Just don’t look at the strawberries 🍓", "created_at": "2025-01-29T16:21:03", "owner": "kellyleonelee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078932413627340, "text": "@ally0727 真的耶🤣", "created_at": "2025-01-29T13:29:55", "owner": "smallmay727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085210318564075, "text": "Hahaha sometimes 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T07:13:08", "owner": "ahannanq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303739414224788, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T01:05:31", "owner": "yenni_angga1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054521357025808, "text": "😆🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-01-28T10:09:23", "owner": "victor.lui3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933821439988181, "text": "So ture", "created_at": "2025-01-28T07:22:20", "owner": "illit_fav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046325735467745, "text": "🙄 well, if you’d rather starve than shop where everyone else shops…(ie PnS, Welcome)", "created_at": "2025-01-28T04:26:57", "owner": "jclcreatedcuddles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926853315904351, "text": "Seriously, I don't even know how people survive over there. Chinese supermarkets sell the same Asian products cheaper in England. How is that even possible??", "created_at": "2025-01-27T13:30:19", "owner": "tammy_lam_owen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156145234341991, "text": "攞親嗰啲都係有牌子嘅，梗係貴啦", "created_at": "2025-01-27T09:37:20", "owner": "_unila_1114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386310109107812, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-27T07:46:25", "owner": "andriyanisepty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994212423604737, "text": "Expensive", "created_at": "2025-01-27T04:37:16", "owner": "rian_ananta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060121438765558, "text": "Hehehe 🤣", "created_at": "2025-01-27T02:05:33", "owner": "urgirlievivianna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070865974702699, "text": "Kwkkkkk q banget mau beli2 lihat harga sudah ngantri di kasir tk balikin 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-27T00:57:33", "owner": "tikafebrian829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041886101064387, "text": "Everything is Expensive in Hong Kong now 😍", "created_at": "2025-01-26T04:19:12", "owner": "sanamchs977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878694871143483, "text": "just go back home", "created_at": "2025-01-26T01:15:54", "owner": "elizabeth_c1210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932970141871751, "text": "That's Hong Kong dollar", "created_at": "2025-01-25T18:37:08", "owner": "_madeineg_.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053786180088646, "text": "As a hong konger, they are only expensive in the fancy fancy supermarkets.", "created_at": "2025-01-25T14:53:40", "owner": "star.rabeeaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865888513305518, "text": "When we are in Hong Kong we wonder about the cheese prices...\nAnd we pay in Germany more for fruits and vegetables if they look normal (not perfect). In Hong Kong they want perfect fruits - for e.g. all apples look the same...😆", "created_at": "2025-01-25T11:46:38", "owner": "vincenzo_the_iggy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943918302937431, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-24T02:00:39", "owner": "tatsmetats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054090089497250, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-23T12:49:44", "owner": "betchay_legaspi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062370268909914, "text": "The UK and the US are more expensive than HK", "created_at": "2025-01-22T10:48:42", "owner": "isaacman._1117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049666897935962, "text": "@kngoxngoaymo.l 😢", "created_at": "2025-01-20T15:21:32", "owner": "jasonshuen6887", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032071313242265, "text": "Umm no ..", "created_at": "2025-01-20T11:47:36", "owner": "leahyu70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845151352401635, "text": "Very relatable. 😢", "created_at": "2025-01-20T10:03:31", "owner": "h3llk33per", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018445493441965, "text": "Bruh I live in Hong Kong bro", "created_at": "2025-01-20T08:44:49", "owner": "ivanali_316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345460570197282, "text": "Just go to a wet market", "created_at": "2025-01-20T07:28:45", "owner": "lyssaa_028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328711102081782, "text": "No stop it ..am here now it’s not like that Hong Kong like New York prices am used to that", "created_at": "2025-01-20T05:00:09", "owner": "burn_booga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115995811431382, "text": "1 USD = 7.79 HKD. Divide each price by 7.79 to convert to USD.", "created_at": "2025-01-19T22:03:02", "owner": "ahmath_lc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026868197552618, "text": "@benedikt_kwel @myvikigram @harryhon4s", "created_at": "2025-01-19T14:47:05", "owner": "mytaragram", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079555642613079, "text": "@raphael_stories", "created_at": "2025-01-19T10:36:53", "owner": "alessandraguarascio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153054025351444, "text": "Damn! I better save more money for my travel expenses if I visit.", "created_at": "2025-01-18T13:58:33", "owner": "aempty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265954849259264, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-18T10:35:57", "owner": "dewi_shinta77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937912278843491, "text": "everything is expensive in hongkong 😢", "created_at": "2025-01-18T07:07:00", "owner": "nadiyahsarnawi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892322653155909, "text": "Кстати да, я во Вьетнаме общалась с женщиной, которая переехала в Ханой из Гонконга. Рассказывала, что когда они жили в Гонконге, они ездили в соседний город, чтобы закупаться продуктами", "created_at": "2025-01-18T04:19:46", "owner": "tati.tatira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032985305389109, "text": "too expensive?doooorrs😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-17T16:34:08", "owner": "honeymiyazaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036725492140869, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-17T00:16:09", "owner": "cara.insular", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064978858878878, "text": "Probably he will enjoy more to shop in uk supermarket with the tax included", "created_at": "2025-01-16T23:40:08", "owner": "gosaligo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869479597202940, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-16T15:39:49", "owner": "celiaregina0507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997450935737076, "text": "The recoil 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-16T01:34:25", "owner": "pragunraj_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043935419211597, "text": "That’s why the shelves are full", "created_at": "2025-01-15T22:03:32", "owner": "edoardopisanii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943531329812180, "text": "You meant hkd? Then to usd is divided by 8 so if one of the thing there cost 32\nDollars it’s only 4 usd dollars", "created_at": "2025-01-15T13:42:35", "owner": "i.am.ethanl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019937183389613, "text": "so like hkd or usd? 😭", "created_at": "2025-01-15T12:23:41", "owner": "charissa_chachacha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875686972248653, "text": "I love this ice cream how much does it cost.  ONE HUNDRED AND TEN", "created_at": "2025-01-15T11:22:07", "owner": "roasted_chick3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020457410642147, "text": "😍😍😍😂😂😂I feel exactly the same way 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-15T03:46:06", "owner": "minakova_olga_hk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064104355846737, "text": "LMAO… Go to Kaibo bro 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-15T02:50:20", "owner": "autumnmoon_id", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18328916086084666, "text": "can’t agree more😩", "created_at": "2025-01-14T16:03:43", "owner": "itsrealyangjm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055550330069338, "text": "About 8 HKD is1 USD", "created_at": "2025-01-14T13:03:12", "owner": "mensen12234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965098848707640, "text": "Please go to wet market", "created_at": "2025-01-14T10:48:12", "owner": "gettipsynow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070242280683392, "text": "Bro ,, Just boil cup noodle 🍜 in daily routine for safe more money , LoL 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-14T04:36:03", "owner": "steve_kewwenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048122162163804, "text": "In HKD right? RIGHT?", "created_at": "2025-01-13T18:52:16", "owner": "knc_techno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888559612179434, "text": "Your in city super", "created_at": "2025-01-13T10:27:23", "owner": "joshuachu640", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074630830630218, "text": "My wallet cry’s harden than after I get my results", "created_at": "2025-01-13T08:39:04", "owner": "itzasiyaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064896730863260, "text": "Bro I hate that place man", "created_at": "2025-01-13T08:38:42", "owner": "itzasiyaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061623385899996, "text": "😳😳😳aaaaahhhh", "created_at": "2025-01-12T23:57:49", "owner": "my_bunnie_tail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957814920750682, "text": "Kai Bo the way 👌🏼", "created_at": "2025-01-12T23:43:24", "owner": "gustavoribeiro.94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889241389159967, "text": "Well that’s pacific place, naturally it will be pricier", "created_at": "2025-01-12T16:05:49", "owner": "echan.handsome.guy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18301542757229856, "text": "walk around to find cheaper...... (Beng Leng Cyeng)", "created_at": "2025-01-12T15:06:39", "owner": "ulvahasanah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017082182460219, "text": "You shop at the Great.  No wonder.  Can you go to a more normal supermarket, please? Making a video just to catch traffic is meaningless.", "created_at": "2025-01-11T07:15:30", "owner": "kyam262", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062656225884563, "text": "You went to city super try in WELLCOME and park 'n' shop, fushion you can find cheaper 😊", "created_at": "2025-01-11T02:38:15", "owner": "juliah1715", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hk", "hkig", "hongkong", "hongkongshop", "hongkongfood"]},
{"media_id": 3510423404394517347, "shortcode": "DC3h3y-JxNj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC3h3y-JxNj/", "taken_at": "2024-11-27T08:13:43", "caption": "一個按鈕復活你最愛的人，你會按嗎？ 我按爆不管怎樣我都按爆，溫馨提示音軌重疊一起有點吵建議音量調小\n\n#情感 #情感語錄 #自律 #自我成長 #自我提升 #語錄 #語錄點滴 #語錄分享 #語錄系列 #愛情 #愛情故事 #愛情語錄 #人生 #人生語錄 #傷感 #傷感文案 #復活 #科技 #感情觀點 #觀念 #認知 #最愛", "owner_username": "ciwei522", "owner_id": "64758190358", "likes": 156167, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0333_DC3h3y-JxNj\\DC3h3y-JxNj_20241127_081343.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18147310762434962, "text": "復活只能是死而復生嗎⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:32:41", "owner": "1120_99_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976200540870694, "text": "肖驍的觀念很足\n小黑輸了也不是沒理由的", "created_at": "2025-08-17T16:08:20", "owner": "cwc_728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098239087565233, "text": "在我老的時候，另一半在年輕的時候回來，他還看得上我嗎？", "created_at": "2025-05-26T14:04:46", "owner": "0812_chengyou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072843223909764, "text": "你做出了這個選擇不是要看這個選擇的答案 而是要知道你為什麼做這個選擇", "created_at": "2025-05-25T15:36:14", "owner": "ki123045", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980642985698259, "text": "真正的死亡是無人記得 被人記得你永遠都活著", "created_at": "2025-05-24T06:52:42", "owner": "yisen.for._.m.mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980192157824592, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-05-23T14:11:51", "owner": "boy010813b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952889241957499, "text": "请问这个是在哪里看的？是什么名字", "created_at": "2025-05-23T11:14:12", "owner": "xiaolan_0909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025830017693916, "text": "会啊", "created_at": "2025-05-23T05:28:42", "owner": "jwl_424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007252889757659, "text": "听了好几遍", "created_at": "2025-05-22T13:31:58", "owner": "jslim6221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044646509529943, "text": "提到希鲁鲁克的时候我崩不住了😢", "created_at": "2025-05-22T12:49:00", "owner": "henwin_ipip", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18373664365132188, "text": "但他不一定愛你啊", "created_at": "2025-05-22T09:48:04", "owner": "love_.mizuki_407827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091174870614427, "text": "我爸爸😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-05-21T13:48:12", "owner": "chaiyizhen0201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868556356284938, "text": "奇葩說有些辯論的觀點真的很厲害，可惜旁邊的小黑輸了，但至少輸的有原因", "created_at": "2025-05-20T13:53:05", "owner": "zachary._.0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055450133193579, "text": "我也希望意外去世的人能回來", "created_at": "2025-05-18T10:17:53", "owner": "_.2ywyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046801712158456, "text": "如果有復活鍵\n我會毫不猶豫的按下去\n只希望那個離開我身邊10幾年的你\n能活著看著這世界還是有美好的時候", "created_at": "2025-05-18T05:46:32", "owner": "__1e_1e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077662120667898, "text": "太牛了，这人辩论比赛妥妥的", "created_at": "2025-05-15T08:25:53", "owner": "moon_rpoig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882339838184214, "text": "老大😢", "created_at": "2025-05-12T15:32:14", "owner": "xuxuyuancheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055722143190162, "text": "遺忘才是生命的終點", "created_at": "2025-05-10T03:10:27", "owner": "_.hsule.ovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886829587255619, "text": "旁邊是囚犯嗎", "created_at": "2025-05-09T14:45:48", "owner": "whoo0204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959959170784068, "text": "一個受盡世界苦楚陷害的女孩 且世界如此謬誤而令人絕望，那我為什麼要按下這個按鈕，而不是重塑一個完整的世界 ⋯來救我的琳呢？\n\n——————來自自稱阿飛的男子的辯論", "created_at": "2025-05-03T18:39:05", "owner": "day.laylay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053807750195972, "text": "我不会按因为我不想打扰她", "created_at": "2025-05-01T19:57:30", "owner": "liew5025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067285121306074, "text": "不會按了還是會失去不如不要冒險", "created_at": "2025-04-28T00:59:15", "owner": "m.zz0522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128950327423614, "text": "他講的真好", "created_at": "2025-04-25T15:27:41", "owner": "ran._.love0104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872782915340583, "text": "但他愛我嗎", "created_at": "2025-04-25T13:29:34", "owner": "_9yhenz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18507379315022139, "text": "我希望的是我喜歡的人能跟我告白", "created_at": "2025-04-25T12:55:23", "owner": "asasa.s7790", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873472099338684, "text": "就算他按了復活，我應該也不是他最喜歡的人😖", "created_at": "2025-04-22T15:05:49", "owner": "chen._.0601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061649783019071, "text": "@czy_12.22", "created_at": "2025-04-22T11:01:42", "owner": "ljy09.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023703614677693, "text": "死亡不是終點遺忘才是⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-04-21T14:49:27", "owner": "rebecca_01216", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852594592430800, "text": "再讓他痛苦一次嗎……", "created_at": "2025-04-21T12:59:04", "owner": "gelatin_dessert818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18404420164101423, "text": "還有他回來還會不會愛我", "created_at": "2025-04-18T10:04:36", "owner": "annn_.0517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057964426933827, "text": "100分", "created_at": "2025-04-17T16:04:21", "owner": "y.zcharles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027765059416387, "text": "不會", "created_at": "2025-04-16T06:55:34", "owner": "nlchan915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899458066174595, "text": "一直在那邊偷換概念轉移話題扭曲題目", "created_at": "2025-04-15T18:53:02", "owner": "revolutionary1214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111287473468736, "text": "她只是畢業了，不是死了", "created_at": "2025-04-13T16:08:03", "owner": "_rui._.0419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062956252840857, "text": "她會忘記我做的一切而會回來嗎？", "created_at": "2025-04-12T06:59:28", "owner": "nat12312024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045991199374934, "text": "管你的我就想在見我爸一遍", "created_at": "2025-04-12T04:30:05", "owner": "xx4j78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882748738166781, "text": "会", "created_at": "2025-04-11T22:13:09", "owner": "hooiqii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889539202123260, "text": "呃…二次元怎麼算，我的是琴酒", "created_at": "2025-04-11T12:40:15", "owner": "serene55265526", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083471881565651, "text": "会", "created_at": "2025-04-10T09:59:33", "owner": "no_like4333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062001808846884, "text": "老大😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-04-09T14:13:58", "owner": "bowan647", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401525836096362, "text": "会", "created_at": "2025-04-08T14:26:29", "owner": "hanxuanaidaqiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055956245174470, "text": "你看旁边那个黑胖子，我去你吗了个比吧", "created_at": "2025-04-08T08:02:46", "owner": "mengchuaiquezihaotui2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914889826092627, "text": "什麼節目？", "created_at": "2025-04-05T16:30:39", "owner": "wyw_0816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350256952195012, "text": "听到心好痛😭，像一个钉子刺到我心最深的地方，可我相信她一直都在只是我看不见她罢了。", "created_at": "2025-04-04T08:24:44", "owner": "sinyingvoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085145230618247, "text": "会啊", "created_at": "2025-04-03T16:28:45", "owner": "cheu_097", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039725066428111, "text": "那位德國老兄", "created_at": "2025-04-03T14:50:17", "owner": "1_uncar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076082608768088, "text": "我想复活我奶奶", "created_at": "2025-04-03T04:34:23", "owner": "jiangzezheng8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937377195880975, "text": "会", "created_at": "2025-04-03T04:33:58", "owner": "jiangzezheng8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292635058300737, "text": "不管怎樣都不能按啊會違反自然法則", "created_at": "2025-04-03T04:12:08", "owner": "timmytimmy314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044310221523657, "text": "我不会按 因为不想再次经历失去", "created_at": "2025-04-01T05:47:19", "owner": "rouu._.2614", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971479908845458, "text": "牢希，我想你了", "created_at": "2025-03-25T08:34:43", "owner": "t.c_51922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130225750408084, "text": "水神", "created_at": "2025-03-22T12:25:49", "owner": "stay_my_love_i.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871430281322511, "text": "我按了，那…只愛我的妳會回來嗎…", "created_at": "2025-03-21T11:45:12", "owner": "1_yjuly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033422123313287, "text": "好廢話…", "created_at": "2025-03-20T18:43:30", "owner": "oiyk7894", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108708628468407, "text": "但如果我复活了我最爱的人，他并不喜欢我呢", "created_at": "2025-03-17T13:47:11", "owner": "10_._sen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051370964235603, "text": "韭菜當久了連按鈕都不敢按了，怕被套A股？😂", "created_at": "2025-03-11T23:10:27", "owner": "henyi1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960179157761659, "text": "牢大", "created_at": "2025-03-08T15:16:15", "owner": "weilun1026_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937978404858726, "text": "不按 因為按了他回來了 他也不愛我", "created_at": "2025-03-03T14:26:06", "owner": "_juxzs.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977296215684953, "text": "看著看著就哭了", "created_at": "2025-03-03T10:11:17", "owner": "lyq.0617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873003751289132, "text": "我…..不能接受", "created_at": "2025-02-28T09:28:30", "owner": "1xnvn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045330695059477, "text": "没有如果，不要傻", "created_at": "2025-02-28T08:06:58", "owner": "solsken_8891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033952202617966, "text": "最後一句呢？？？？？", "created_at": "2025-02-25T14:55:36", "owner": "da._.10.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18262558663286894, "text": "為什麼一定要走來走去", "created_at": "2025-02-23T10:32:51", "owner": "tony_429_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964605849853060, "text": "你怎么吹我都不理，你吹海贼王还吹错那就说不过去了", "created_at": "2025-02-23T09:45:10", "owner": "babydinosoo12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301937377225374, "text": "好扎心😢", "created_at": "2025-02-22T15:08:29", "owner": "cl_14._cy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038642675389232, "text": "他如果還活著呢🤫", "created_at": "2025-02-22T07:37:40", "owner": "byy._.0601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001616699738437, "text": "我想復活我的爺爺，我從出生到現在都沒看過他，我的家人說，他在我出生沒多久就去世了，他們都說爺爺有多麼得好…😢😢", "created_at": "2025-02-22T07:09:21", "owner": "xinya._.0531", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064721704904362, "text": "不是哥 別走了我頭暈", "created_at": "2025-02-22T05:43:07", "owner": "ic._.yy2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020888948651529, "text": "复活啊，毕竟这可能是我一生的遗憾（曾祖母）", "created_at": "2025-02-21T15:47:53", "owner": "yanqi0131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380494507117113, "text": "会", "created_at": "2025-02-21T13:49:55", "owner": "lee.h.yi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108473956426115, "text": "@linyu_0305", "created_at": "2025-02-21T09:37:16", "owner": "yutong.0917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049750001333006, "text": "如果能復活我爷爷的话我会很开心但是。", "created_at": "2025-02-21T05:36:04", "owner": "lindong6496", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063427870929821, "text": "会", "created_at": "2025-02-20T13:34:02", "owner": "jiao_.0213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058592368830442, "text": "死亡只是另一場偉大的冒險，如同哈利波特裡的重生石，他復活的只是持有者懦弱與妄想的幻影而已", "created_at": "2025-02-19T19:27:53", "owner": "youtonglu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005705138538166, "text": "我的阿祖", "created_at": "2025-02-19T11:26:07", "owner": "gear89y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052093556163749, "text": "科比", "created_at": "2025-02-17T14:39:08", "owner": "lipet8789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866857336319934, "text": "希特勒", "created_at": "2025-02-17T11:16:05", "owner": "lucas._.0706_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960620094860377, "text": "反你妹 我會按但是我也會想對方的狀態是什麼\n但是不在就是不在\n想摸他的手想親他抱他對他更好都是真的\n沒有人能夠接受最愛的人離開\n只有時間能淡化他 只是淡化而已 有的是無盡的思念 無盡的想再抱他的念頭 \n以後真的有這種復活人的機器\n你就看他會不會賣爆然後超越馬斯克吧 這就是普世價值", "created_at": "2025-02-16T19:54:22", "owner": "sealtimb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033063410620859, "text": "现在就有一个诱惑我的选择😢😢", "created_at": "2025-02-16T14:35:25", "owner": "rou082625", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078397918716252, "text": "按了回來了可是她卻又深深的傷了我一次", "created_at": "2025-02-16T04:05:48", "owner": "jim101.08.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883721770230232, "text": "復活艾連\n有巨人之力可自行修復\n復活殺老師\n有特殊章魚基因可自行修復😂", "created_at": "2025-02-15T18:06:28", "owner": "quinn._.1018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877808350164740, "text": "如果你選擇復活 那回來的就已經不再是你的最愛 因為她永遠活在你的心裡", "created_at": "2025-02-15T13:56:18", "owner": "qbe_zhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080667367618901, "text": "會按❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-15T11:30:24", "owner": "miya1.011231", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079839295621422, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-15T02:39:49", "owner": "lambo_.823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940183119844321, "text": "但他不愛我", "created_at": "2025-02-14T17:16:05", "owner": "zhou._.06.05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064785607908128, "text": "Bgm是啥？好配", "created_at": "2025-02-14T15:14:28", "owner": "wing.0912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269992852267532, "text": "🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-02-14T13:07:42", "owner": "huffy_hug_cuff_cocos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045698621260665, "text": "芙芙&那維萊特（按爆）", "created_at": "2025-02-12T11:27:51", "owner": "qwq0212jiaxin", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17862225684343184, "text": "按 一切代價我承受她的不適症狀也我承受", "created_at": "2025-02-09T18:06:40", "owner": "lwy._.725", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18072148183780581, "text": "如果換位思考 我也不希望愛我的人按下去 他不知道我是否願意回來 萬一回來後的我很痛苦 他也不會開心吧…", "created_at": "2025-02-09T16:50:19", "owner": "zz_inuheart", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17842856664413451, "text": "按🌚", "created_at": "2025-02-08T15:12:43", "owner": "ling1207_0425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040123475111434, "text": "哥你講就講，可以不要一直走嗎", "created_at": "2025-02-08T14:13:52", "owner": "cys._.4x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048153194192436, "text": "那如果ta回来了 你开心了ta却不开心 痛苦呢", "created_at": "2025-02-06T16:24:55", "owner": "miyokiyau", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18024085529357347, "text": "我会", "created_at": "2025-02-06T09:32:44", "owner": "wobushi.angie0820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949648764794578, "text": "那如果我最愛的人在2次元 那麼？？？", "created_at": "2025-02-05T13:02:14", "owner": "duck_.0603", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18082332559610700, "text": "媽媽", "created_at": "2025-02-03T15:29:33", "owner": "zata_1125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964333404847914, "text": "統一就沒這回事了", "created_at": "2025-02-03T07:43:28", "owner": "0xiexuan00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145750486371156, "text": "說不定他還活著", "created_at": "2025-02-02T15:57:24", "owner": "fukexinfu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100172383500652, "text": "動漫迷😂", "created_at": "2025-02-02T04:29:23", "owner": "as423520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055558691105022, "text": "每个人最爱的人不应该是自己吗", "created_at": "2025-02-01T14:02:50", "owner": "yuqian._.0531", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["情感", "情感語錄", "自律", "自我成長", "自我提升", "語錄", "語錄點滴", "語錄分享", "語錄系列", "愛情", "愛情故事", "愛情語錄", "人生", "人生語錄", "傷感", "傷感文案", "復活", "科技", "感情觀點", "觀念", "認知", "最愛"]},
{"media_id": 3487466524884249099, "shortcode": "DBl-FO1yqoL", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBl-FO1yqoL/", "taken_at": "2024-10-26T16:00:46", "caption": "", "owner_username": "hshals_kai", "owner_id": "47597448182", "likes": 261556, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0334_DBl-FO1yqoL\\DBl-FO1yqoL_20241026_160046.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18069392281743838, "text": "Certified lover boy?", "created_at": "2025-04-24T08:58:18", "owner": "jameswen790", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851294464439211, "text": "brainrot☠️☠️", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:03:32", "owner": "kaiym99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091415545584562, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-16T15:55:14", "owner": "zhranran_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327332752167035, "text": "6", "created_at": "2025-04-15T12:48:18", "owner": "marcusz301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059756948097481, "text": "ㄚˊ蛤～非常好", "created_at": "2025-04-12T14:50:55", "owner": "iwd.uuu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876731338294515, "text": "只有我按到抖音的愛心嗎？", "created_at": "2025-04-04T14:32:59", "owner": "xdmy.ty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053240672232622, "text": "我在按讚的時候,直接按到別的😮", "created_at": "2025-03-31T09:32:45", "owner": "ivy1001204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096752920529441, "text": "陈峰宁", "created_at": "2025-03-29T03:04:43", "owner": "phantom_2034", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077992732737546, "text": "哇😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-28T04:54:49", "owner": "siajiaquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110591521488951, "text": "超好笑🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:02:38", "owner": "lynn._.2706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896829808176248, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-23T14:59:25", "owner": "limb_in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937117669003960, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-22T11:10:42", "owner": "peterwan816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945141231988635, "text": "不約兒童", "created_at": "2025-03-16T09:06:40", "owner": "about.gary.lll.ai.zip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075060349708169, "text": "老師：哪個公園", "created_at": "2025-02-17T12:51:25", "owner": "slee.p8761", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024849008368813, "text": "我壘個\n哪個公園啊", "created_at": "2025-02-16T12:33:01", "owner": "xan_0329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083019256608815, "text": "如果第一個妹妹跟弟弟是想著同個東西...", "created_at": "2025-02-15T06:01:53", "owner": "moxi201110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021323969437027, "text": "whatttt", "created_at": "2025-02-09T15:34:17", "owner": "xpeiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871483912279542, "text": "我好不容易翻墙出来你就给我看这个", "created_at": "2025-02-07T09:39:10", "owner": "mwlk.sun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051871121321075, "text": "@slept_jared 原来你喜欢看这种", "created_at": "2025-02-06T14:25:17", "owner": "yujieee0831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261727939259706, "text": "@janet10127 不约儿童", "created_at": "2025-02-03T23:41:46", "owner": "celine.10621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926314744008551, "text": "這小孩肯定是台灣人", "created_at": "2025-02-01T14:57:17", "owner": "yakk_0929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852672121383809, "text": "yooo this kiddo ison 🔥😂", "created_at": "2025-02-01T11:39:23", "owner": "jackylei11017911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051056044917651, "text": "國語天才", "created_at": "2025-02-01T06:29:24", "owner": "wrouy15678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079389313627095, "text": "@y__c.123", "created_at": "2025-01-26T06:57:00", "owner": "ryan_wsy517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939339261956091, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-24T11:04:20", "owner": "lambo_.823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18444286696074321, "text": "噗... 不約\"兒童\"", "created_at": "2025-01-23T12:24:54", "owner": "moyuan_qnq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048927077241219, "text": "不是，我翻墙上来是为了看这些陈年老梗的", "created_at": "2025-01-20T15:47:21", "owner": "lu326159lu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877444069241680, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-01-19T15:03:09", "owner": "_imyourvin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077753314627573, "text": "@x1qi7k", "created_at": "2025-01-19T12:07:25", "owner": "2min._872", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044849099245255, "text": "頂級理解把老師看蒙了😍", "created_at": "2025-01-19T11:15:49", "owner": "_1ruanz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064086172885669, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-01-17T18:03:53", "owner": "leeeeee_liz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863084191245324, "text": "几百年的老梗", "created_at": "2025-01-11T16:34:05", "owner": "wvwvw77777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069733117624237, "text": "只有老師聽懂了", "created_at": "2025-01-10T10:32:09", "owner": "charles_chen_1006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004939976694885, "text": "這話應該教給吳亦凡😂", "created_at": "2025-01-04T01:37:04", "owner": "baozhe61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056745145805035, "text": "約青少年❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-02T13:30:08", "owner": "xunxian.zheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073492213724084, "text": "我的天啊", "created_at": "2025-01-02T10:48:48", "owner": "kass_30251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032586227178414, "text": "凭感觉找到评论区", "created_at": "2025-01-01T11:34:50", "owner": "ysong_1741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480268507063940, "text": "@ivan_ymh_1127", "created_at": "2024-12-28T17:49:20", "owner": "leo2_17c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050090912487315, "text": "那個女同學為什麼在啃手", "created_at": "2024-12-28T16:07:29", "owner": "_yyu41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083567776565187, "text": "老師馬上問哪個公園", "created_at": "2024-12-28T13:49:15", "owner": "timandtony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351231673133867, "text": "這一定是台灣人👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-26T17:03:14", "owner": "jun_cheng0613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928014651881483, "text": "@jianyuai2 @09iuiny._", "created_at": "2024-12-25T13:49:54", "owner": "vv._0314", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18325984201085292, "text": "小孩：你也沒說是哪個兒童啊", "created_at": "2024-12-24T12:09:04", "owner": "qyj_.417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883086550101093, "text": "我們不約而同的在這裡用不約而同造句", "created_at": "2024-12-23T12:27:01", "owner": "werty._.56789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028814390245075, "text": "未来可期", "created_at": "2024-12-23T09:07:08", "owner": "zzq_71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907720564068485, "text": "好一个不约儿童", "created_at": "2024-12-23T02:53:11", "owner": "10shawna_31wu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265547461255643, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-22T15:16:33", "owner": "gracec1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056698864752379, "text": "damn", "created_at": "2024-12-21T08:07:40", "owner": "xxt9016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019964690346827, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-12-20T12:11:35", "owner": "chitiannaizi715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079339621595411, "text": "我来ins不是刷抖音的", "created_at": "2024-12-19T01:14:18", "owner": "zhangchengyi539", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078882058605934, "text": "@ailicunyang8", "created_at": "2024-12-16T22:56:47", "owner": "2on1nabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087885883521604, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:59:40", "owner": "qwq._.02868", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049476071103468, "text": "《不約兒童》", "created_at": "2024-12-15T23:12:59", "owner": "bailey._.2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029645444210418, "text": "這兒童一定是台灣人", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:54:29", "owner": "royy_0114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863406916282544, "text": "這小孩是蠟筆小新嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-15T11:31:06", "owner": "bonion85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936289761832737, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-14T13:23:10", "owner": "0731._.0325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476660287010416, "text": "笑死我了这小孩儿💀", "created_at": "2024-12-14T06:46:16", "owner": "aixn_co2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962432016707508, "text": "一个字", "created_at": "2024-12-12T13:07:43", "owner": "qiacheng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111575059442571, "text": "居然是陈峰宁，15年左右看他用南京话讲段子来着哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-12-10T16:17:31", "owner": "rainiverse114514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038960438206588, "text": "靠腰", "created_at": "2024-12-10T13:45:21", "owner": "16n_yu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030557549453057, "text": "孩子，少看点抖音吧", "created_at": "2024-12-10T13:34:23", "owner": "wenkai5758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019083461354374, "text": "@realjasonqian 💀", "created_at": "2024-12-09T23:54:28", "owner": "alansunctz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084140251549541, "text": "弟弟前途大有可為", "created_at": "2024-12-08T15:25:16", "owner": "meroko0712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989895945741054, "text": "國小笑話 笑死", "created_at": "2024-12-08T07:49:58", "owner": "chantai1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164287603319907, "text": "这小孩也太早熟了😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T01:23:42", "owner": "nicolebong03270", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048035543503427, "text": "準備翻牆的時候，我不約而同的和已經在外面的同學對上眼", "created_at": "2024-12-07T09:37:06", "owner": "hsl_0323_0725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058376539882932, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T12:03:07", "owner": "jaden_zheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078761854584687, "text": "震驚🤯", "created_at": "2024-12-06T09:29:54", "owner": "990926tin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060668737887108, "text": "前面挺正常，後面更正常了", "created_at": "2024-12-04T11:35:56", "owner": "renee._.0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879298009194736, "text": "老師：我要約你家長", "created_at": "2024-12-03T12:39:13", "owner": "96_0116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955424115849514, "text": "老師叫我造不約而同這個造句", "created_at": "2024-12-01T10:32:11", "owner": "cind_322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847856254332940, "text": "😂笑死", "created_at": "2024-12-01T06:58:57", "owner": "gathkong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305537395207201, "text": "这孩子绝对有未来", "created_at": "2024-12-01T01:20:46", "owner": "un7r4mm313d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332414152153147, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-30T22:49:46", "owner": "y.alice_hu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062229655837287, "text": "未來一定有出息", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:05:25", "owner": "rdfftkkeebboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047640137108209, "text": "@wowas520 這個一定要找你", "created_at": "2024-11-30T11:34:14", "owner": "jxy980429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094314229494381, "text": "@leehao_0829", "created_at": "2024-11-30T05:11:52", "owner": "198_benny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027081830240425, "text": "好像沒錯", "created_at": "2024-11-30T04:04:33", "owner": "lqh._.0505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047722295088938, "text": "怎么哪里都有二手视频😢", "created_at": "2024-11-30T02:16:09", "owner": "st_liangqwq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051426565960076, "text": "@zh_01.29 欸這個小孩有潛力", "created_at": "2024-11-30T01:49:46", "owner": "monkey._.0801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049065109871781, "text": "真不约而同啊", "created_at": "2024-11-29T23:01:42", "owner": "obanai119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033370436114219, "text": "我糙 这……", "created_at": "2024-11-29T00:36:23", "owner": "wong_vison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029444996427961, "text": "合理", "created_at": "2024-11-28T12:42:14", "owner": "hongshengbo94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086098189526267, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-11-27T11:35:28", "owner": "0328edwards.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922276992978519, "text": "有前途", "created_at": "2024-11-27T00:48:27", "owner": "kokjohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061746031804469, "text": "後面的妹妹手指好吃嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-25T17:29:56", "owner": "crystal_hayakuro", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18018044681636749, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2024-11-25T15:28:50", "owner": "cyhan_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059928616862114, "text": "以前老是说，不约儿童约老人，md度小学就懂这些，罪过", "created_at": "2024-11-25T14:34:16", "owner": "suah1th", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921064905898942, "text": "老師cpu燒了", "created_at": "2024-11-25T14:34:11", "owner": "cyl._.0429", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18257761198264928, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-11-25T13:22:21", "owner": "ziyi._.0815", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059701207715465, "text": "老師：你站起來再說一次那個姐姐在哪個公園", "created_at": "2024-11-25T12:10:59", "owner": "jun.ying999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18255732562280211, "text": "爸媽每個晚上都不約兒童", "created_at": "2024-11-24T13:18:41", "owner": "wealthy.mindset.dealer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169806778315865, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-11-24T10:00:34", "owner": "lingyu27149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048841139005156, "text": "@jia___2002", "created_at": "2024-11-24T08:25:19", "owner": "cjt1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049579999993265, "text": "想按讚 結果找不到讚在哪裡", "created_at": "2024-11-24T05:46:40", "owner": "qcnx1_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074817025550888, "text": "世界不约大同？", "created_at": "2024-11-23T18:03:39", "owner": "deanin_sin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068080999659154, "text": "😮