ght", "created_at": "2024-12-09T08:29:59", "owner": "bouzitor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051176345051716, "text": "@okiyanam", "created_at": "2024-12-09T06:22:09", "owner": "wrtm_yudha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127569484386134, "text": "Hell yeah", "created_at": "2024-12-09T06:17:00", "owner": "luiscastillo_aap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863081935220936, "text": "@monalita.xo", "created_at": "2024-12-09T00:41:45", "owner": "photos.bev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125013757401124, "text": "Lets get beer together quickly", "created_at": "2024-12-08T20:00:24", "owner": "_ricardo_b._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322038667081162, "text": "Love how Panama is the track 😂😂😂 pure testosterone", "created_at": "2024-12-08T18:29:08", "owner": "the_slush_pup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017609399372290, "text": "Sorted", "created_at": "2024-12-08T17:29:19", "owner": "aka_yvngpetrov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043958065957308, "text": "Quick", "created_at": "2024-12-08T15:15:40", "owner": "laszlo3744", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109871875435502, "text": "@lego_rmd yesirrrr", "created_at": "2024-12-07T23:20:12", "owner": "magnusisme_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843159469379328, "text": "@frank.beek", "created_at": "2024-12-07T16:49:55", "owner": "beekjeroen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051373610478421, "text": "My too,love,guns beer, monster truck 🍻", "created_at": "2024-12-07T14:49:45", "owner": "kaskadermik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862287988282772, "text": "Sorted", "created_at": "2024-12-07T09:44:33", "owner": "ibrahim__sikandar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962124909837393, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:38:56", "owner": "mist.allmyshots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008873015676627, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-06T18:59:27", "owner": "roseledandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948413943875130, "text": "Lockheed Martin \nGeneral Dynamics \nBoeing \nTexas Instruments", "created_at": "2024-12-06T16:56:23", "owner": "boeing.777_300er", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17992227251735946, "text": "@wuann102", "created_at": "2024-12-0