4-12-05T04:16:54", "owner": "lenardpo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920323588001577, "text": "@slanza94", "created_at": "2024-12-04T17:32:48", "owner": "scudo84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488229643001887, "text": "The most supportive video, liked and followed🍻👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-04T17:07:47", "owner": "sqh_marcus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060287572860513, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-04T17:06:05", "owner": "adrien.2a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885616624167439, "text": "@solprode @_psungjin @jyu_ung real man bro", "created_at": "2024-12-04T15:41:46", "owner": "dashistart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362124085188970, "text": "👌👌", "created_at": "2024-12-04T14:31:56", "owner": "realestate_and_cars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926435733987962, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-04T07:54:54", "owner": "cam3r0n.3x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038195876353360, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T00:06:39", "owner": "thejoshyjoshrep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307653676205198, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-03T23:38:39", "owner": "fabiusssssss05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053283031812149, "text": "@mikedj666 🍻🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-03T22:12:31", "owner": "gerritrustigaan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988538415602914, "text": "Hell yeah", "created_at": "2024-12-03T20:37:12", "owner": "noise_airsoft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928130892986196, "text": "me too🍻", "created_at": "2024-12-03T13:42:14", "owner": "pau.carbo_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["onlyonedan", "ladsholiday", "summer2024", "beer", "guinness"]},
{"media_id": 3513475597139881364, "shortcode": "DDCX3C-hq2U", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDCX3C-hq2U/", "taken_at": "2024-12-01T13:23:59", "caption": "#720隻蛋 #身體報告\n大家以後唔好再咁傻豬\n認為食雞蛋黃係冇益啦\n其實雞蛋成隻食先至係最有益呀\n我食咗720隻啊！！！身體好咗🫡\n仲有！飲橄欖油都係好有益㗎！\n橄欖油，我日日飲！雞蛋，我日日食！", "owner_username": "harrisoncheung", "owner_id": "241111750", "likes": 49983, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0336_DDCX3C-hq2U\\DDCX3C-hq2U_20241201_132359.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18359864347206821, "text": "我好鍾意食蛋，睇嚟唔使限制自己yeah👍🏻✨", "created_at": "2026-02-02T13:10:54", "owner": "bonnieko28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960829321004239, "text": "咁呢三十日 飲咩 有冇飲手搖 定無飲", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:52:50", "owner": "rachelyang2002", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17856504177494495, "text": "平均每日24隻，恭喜你！膽固醇低了⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-08-18T08:20:30", "owner": "manlau4", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18042190727640400, "text": "May be you should show the actual report reading in your video by zooming into it and not just a snippet, snippet can be edited.", "created_at": "2025-07-18T03:39:39", "owner": "yaserilmu", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18055887649988001, "text": "是否飲初榨橄欖油？邊隻牌子好？", "created_at": "2025-04-30T18:09:29", "owner": "manwong613", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062950241048443, "text": "为什么要喝油？", "created_at": "2025-04-16T03:51:08", "owner": "claireskx.underwater", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18278530426265436, "text": "@jacklyngokaiying 😱😱😱", "created_at": "2025-04-12T17:41:43", "owner": "p.yin_996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149279563369264, "text": "年青人", "created_at": "2025-03-08T03:27:48", "owner": "paulostoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960184416880744, "text": "耶，总于可以放心吃啦👏👏", "created_at": "2025-02-27T16:36:15", "owner": "zackielove123", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18004269542719681, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-25T11:56:12", "owner": "hohin0811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072173905771759, "text": "I hope I can never skip egg even I no gym because my body can feel it, and I love it.day but egg are just getting more expensive 😢", "created_at": "2025-02-24T15:01:39", "owner": "abcdeasycome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079161943624456, "text": "初黎報導，請問你係飲邊隻油，同埋 食邊隻 牛油？", "created_at": "2025-01-30T21:40:18", "owner": "kennedy_cheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079895830611414, "text": "Egg and oil do you good ❤️🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-01-23T13:27:46", "owner": "juli_anamnesis_of_life", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040690262338868, "text": "份報告冇，俾人睇到………好難有說服力……", "created_at": "2025-01-09T18:38:57", "owner": "andy_king1015", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947118114793677, "text": "我一日最盡都係食四隻蛋啫但我亦都有飲extra virgin Oliver oil嘅習慣", "created_at": "2025-01-06T12:42:14", "owner": "alexlo0515", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152063758355191, "text": "Appreciation from Karina", "created_at": "2025-01-04T20:39:18", "owner": "hden.329", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916878976021667, "text": "一次食到3粒蛋一餐已经好饱，3餐可以9粒蛋一日。哇 加油", "created_at": "2024-12-28T12:23:23", "owner": "99sharrone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080635072596050, "text": "Is it with daily aerobic exercise or not?", "created_at": "2024-12-26T13:51:09", "owner": "chijewelry_creation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883939213190399, "text": "其實你點樣肯令到你嘅變化淨係由蛋引起？", "created_at": "2024-12-23T04:38:29", "owner": "kyyk_0309", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094256212450795, "text": "可以问下食多粒蛋係要加埋运动吗？少运动可以食30粒？", "created_at": "2024-12-19T05:18:16", "owner": "kingsleywong0819", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959716698836057, "text": "祝你身體健康🧈萬事如意", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:24:30", "owner": "bmkmz02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013244132662481, "text": "日本有條友 6年黎每日訓45分鐘 ，咁你話訓得少身體會發炎 根本唔成立", "created_at": "2024-12-17T06:49:39", "owner": "quentinkonga", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18148486591351265, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-16T20:01:29", "owner": "amygosling1993", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865172497275901, "text": "好勁\n食一個月蛋", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:06:34", "owner": "cheungdanny_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18009555047499824, "text": "Hi Harrison, 請問有冇個人研究，長期只大量飲蒸餾水的心德？", "created_at": "2024-12-12T13:19:17", "owner": "marialown", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17952306323895381, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-12-08T16:33:41", "owner": "nnicky_wu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18338330317198142, "text": "食蛋video在哪裡", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:54:17", "owner": "bellaloi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080213719561895, "text": "請問 低密度膽固醇 是 壞膽固醇 嗎？！", "created_at": "2024-12-06T14:22:45", "owner": "ykkwan.ykkwan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047397962278717, "text": "飲橄欖油唔怕肥嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-05T13:46:17", "owner": "soda_ban", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18065028067693678, "text": "720 eggs a month, so 24 eggs a day??? 😮", "created_at": "2024-12-05T10:36:42", "owner": "jennielailalala", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989128215745967, "text": "你知唔知我媽今日睇依條片 特登拎左部計數機出嚟除 一日到底食幾多隻呢！係24隻！\n然後開始碌冰水佬啲片", "created_at": "2024-12-04T13:52:02", "owner": "poorguy.psd", "likes": 220}, {"id": 18060306112698702, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-04T10:00:24", "owner": "sandywong0822", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18123264283397082, "text": "👏👏👏amazing", "created_at": "2024-12-04T02:35:31", "owner": "marianatung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060045412806978, "text": "有冇諗過指數好左唔一定關食左幾多隻蛋事？而係因為冇食其他有害既食物，即係冇食肉，其實條片拍錯左，應該一開始就照食肉同時食蛋", "created_at": "2024-12-03T15:56:47", "owner": "kim43mix", "likes": 116}, {"id": 18059749618866686, "text": "咁如果食鵪鶉蛋，健唔健康？", "created_at": "2024-12-03T15:38:47", "owner": "nacongan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18015499385406104, "text": "想問關於高密度膽固醇，我高密度1.93，標準係1.55內，我低密度係2.48，甘油三脂都係正常，我想問如何減少高密度膽固醇？", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:20:01", "owner": "emma.artworld_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857060341319610, "text": "请问你是早上空腹饮油，还是任何时段？一天饮油量是多少？eg, ml or in grams .", "created_at": "2024-12-03T03:56:50", "owner": "noelle.lyg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17931116399852713, "text": "橄榄油是 extra virgin?", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:11:50", "owner": "outdoorgate_solutions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276160414219973, "text": "淨食蛋個口有種好「鞋」既感覺仲要keep好耐 飲水都沖唔走 有冇解決方法😂好唔舒服", "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:31:11", "owner": "mmmgtsang", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18111056458425522, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-02T15:12:23", "owner": "keithtse0911", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18473458351037902, "text": "@emiho", "created_at": "2024-12-02T15:07:24", "owner": "jackyjyjyjy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014405471427658, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-02T13:35:55", "owner": "candy_1317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477418354007896, "text": "我真係好期待你比我地睇你吞既一刻😭😭", "created_at": "2024-12-02T13:03:27", "owner": "g.z.l.o_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082149073500308, "text": "每日浸住冰水食24隻蛋", "created_at": "2024-12-02T12:12:24", "owner": "monkey_chung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041361424993090, "text": "我係第16k個人咁like，好爽", "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:25:56", "owner": "jackynjdttt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17955261524845873, "text": "@chill_ml", "created_at": "2024-12-02T10:57:13", "owner": "isaacfok_kof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985890444766042, "text": "比較想知埋肌肉有冇增加😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:39:01", "owner": "hangyuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928574454976128, "text": "提番你~字幕嗰度寫做運動會令到ldl氧化，同你口講嘅唔一樣呀🙈有朋友唔識聽廣東話就係大件事啦，個意思相反咗🥲", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:33:19", "owner": "fanfan__kai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038612759214320, "text": "每日飲幾多？@", "created_at": "2024-12-02T05:38:51", "owner": "yenpo66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145326301359313, "text": "👏👏👏你又見證多一樣事，我們都得益👍", "created_at": "2024-12-02T04:47:27", "owner": "honeyjass", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18027261563614162, "text": "我的HDL 2.31, LDL 2.57, Tri 0.60 我都唔知道好唔好？ 我61歲了。", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:05:48", "owner": "ronaldxxoo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18045611269921591, "text": "有冇研究食什麼蛋？ 有些又話沒有激素！ 有些又有什麼什麼？有啲蛋買到很貴，有啲單買到很平", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:01:04", "owner": "ronaldxxoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061699519828891, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:00:18", "owner": "scotttlaw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067711222676377, "text": "啲指數同你一樣仲靚仔左👏我屋企啲老人家講極都係對蛋黃有戒心，就算俾佢睇你d影片，佢哋都係唔係咁信😢", "created_at": "2024-12-02T02:13:27", "owner": "joyce1tse", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18017065400380584, "text": "請問飲油好處", "created_at": "2024-12-02T02:02:23", "owner": "yoko_lamlamlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322782547086388, "text": "介紹下你飲邊隻？見到好多都果渣油", "created_at": "2024-12-02T01:30:25", "owner": "heidia.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027696845604859, "text": "恭喜晒！多謝你的毅力證明俾大家知道！🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:51:03", "owner": "iyht", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17948157083867596, "text": "勁。。。。🙌🙌🙌👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:47:22", "owner": "vivianrestworld2024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065710024689383, "text": "著衫反而仲好睇😍", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:42:45", "owner": "rosie_lamhau2", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067319506734479, "text": "我之前 抽血驗 三酸甘油脂 0.8😢 可以點改善", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:28:46", "owner": "maka.ming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061930891831730, "text": "問題係你食咩旦，煎，灼，蒸 都有影響", "created_at": "2024-12-01T23:51:45", "owner": "fatjack2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887439400068558, "text": "要睇返你點樣食eggs 🥚", "created_at": "2024-12-01T23:48:59", "owner": "chuensamsam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043378235125215, "text": "所以氧化才是最可怕嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-01T22:37:04", "owner": "benyim33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028975928407785, "text": "Wonderful results!! 👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼💖", "created_at": "2024-12-01T22:29:51", "owner": "chapchapjoyce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040793744018140, "text": "一定要係做運動同瞓得够先至健康！如果無覺好瞓，又無勤做運動嘅，唔好放縱飲食！同意嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-01T21:23:35", "owner": "stellangling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014845769426499, "text": "U looks great today👏❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-01T19:33:58", "owner": "wendi.teo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036079235351633, "text": "想問下你食邊牌子蛋？", "created_at": "2024-12-01T19:21:48", "owner": "film_1943", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137740228368881, "text": "If a chicken sees you on the road it will turn around and run 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T18:37:39", "owner": "francisip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470060419039727, "text": "谢谢你的video 我现在就去睡觉😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T18:01:42", "owner": "_.0.1.8._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861685738288468, "text": "真心問 蒸水蛋得唔得", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:46:36", "owner": "luuuukonononon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056470741934542, "text": "我估系因为你运动量足够，所以影响吾大", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:21:28", "owner": "magic666bird", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18115832257413530, "text": "我無試過食咁多。不過，試過連續三四日，每日吃2-4隻。When I fart, the smell quite strong 😓 所以唔敢食咁多。", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:06:38", "owner": "nics_by_nicky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933901953958373, "text": "Did you fast before the test?", "created_at": "2024-12-01T17:06:38", "owner": "ansonmaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042967675949471, "text": "i never exercise or sleep. so im cooked bro", "created_at": "2024-12-01T16:59:50", "owner": "jackieissochill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939865392928526, "text": "不如出個雞蛋食譜365日😁", "created_at": "2024-12-01T16:49:24", "owner": "bokbok1206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030162554183913, "text": "多謝你親身實驗🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-01T16:45:02", "owner": "mr_holmes8", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17969434448816142, "text": "D雞好慘要催生生蛋…………. 我需要挑戰了", "created_at": "2024-12-01T16:33:51", "owner": "lyonskwok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044910071116050, "text": "🔥🔥🔥多謝以生命影響生命", "created_at": "2024-12-01T16:33:22", "owner": "_manpo", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18293319214234725, "text": "我超鍾意食蛋 而家睇完呢條片之後可以更安心食多啲蛋啦😍😆", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:55:04", "owner": "cacakakacas", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17947726052873958, "text": "Thank you for conducting this experiment to debunk what most heart specialists would advise their patients - no more than 1 egg a day. I'm an egg lover and I take more than 1 egg a day despite being told to keep to only 1. 😂😍❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:42:14", "owner": "tequilapops", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073142926620525, "text": "皮膚好似都變好", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:38:36", "owner": "sergioal10285", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17988414428604658, "text": "Will u keep sharing ur thoughts daily like 365 days ice challenge ? Kinda miss that", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:32:59", "owner": "yuki_yuki_1368", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383774713099494, "text": "考試食蛋呢？🥲", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:30:13", "owner": "junheiri", "likes": 274}, {"id": 18072144874619744, "text": "可唔可以分享下邊隻牌子嘅橄欖油？🙏", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:28:37", "owner": "evitajessica0919", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108599737440130, "text": "油係咩時候飲？", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:23:13", "owner": "khhm", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17972060921670544, "text": "我想問問有無咩橄欖油牌子推介？😛", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:19:54", "owner": "amos_archi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18122443846397718, "text": "咁嘅話成世可以食蛋👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:19:30", "owner": "_.11._.25.__", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17908719347962218, "text": "雞蛋最重要係蛋白定係蛋黃？", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:11:23", "owner": "worst_mortis506", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030809669175020, "text": "我都知道飲橄欖油對身體有益，但我好多年前飲左幾個月之後，就真係再飲唔落啦， 聞到陣味都再吞唔落啦， 所以好佩服你飲得咁享受👍👍👍", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:05:48", "owner": "iw23488", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18169617670315447, "text": "同埋要增加好的omega 3 💝", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:03:33", "owner": "cary_lochunyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050970797055286, "text": "其实我挺好奇，过去的一年你有否生过病呢？大病或小病之类的。。 还是在进行icebath+食蛋挑战时有明显的身体抵抗都变好所以不容易生病呢？纯粹好奇😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:56:42", "owner": "eve_shia", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18074975386610358, "text": "請問飲初榨冷壓椰子油有冇益？", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:53:56", "owner": "windy.fung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18012131891468126, "text": "完美的示範👏🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:51:49", "owner": "echoslwong", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18443366263068662, "text": "所以維持身體健康最緊要係訓教同做運動😮", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:49:31", "owner": "sakura_fiona.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052611907798615, "text": "👏🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:49:19", "owner": "jayden.nch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085097881548710, "text": "720隻蛋食左幾錢😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:48:18", "owner": "brian8129", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18024930401281365, "text": "真係好健康", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:38:09", "owner": "lie_stevani", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17963792651822599, "text": "關我蛋治", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:24:22", "owner": "pan.0331", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17910935034046016, "text": "好野bro🙌🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:23:01", "owner": "zoezoeinstagram", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045556937323018, "text": "感謝你的測試結果👏", "created_at": "2024-12-01T14:22:02", "owner": "hivan.c", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["720隻蛋", "身體報告"]},
{"media_id": 3470016113235699870, "shortcode": "DAn-UUiS6ie", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAn-UUiS6ie/", "taken_at": "2024-10-02T14:10:16", "caption": "港星推薦老字號😎3個香港必買伴手禮🇭🇰 #收藏分享\n\n不要只會買小熊餅乾了🐻\n這幾個伴手禮連港星都推薦的伴手禮！\n必須收藏+分享‼️\n快TAG要去香港的朋友買給你🤩\n\n🙋你最想要哪個呢？留言告訴我！\n\n#香港 #🇭🇰 #伴手禮 #hongkong #hk", "owner_username": "bgirl_anlei", "owner_id": "4038084194", "likes": 47032, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0337_DAn-UUiS6ie\\DAn-UUiS6ie_20241002_141016.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18158068927318448, "text": "留言跟我說你最想要哪個！抽你最想要的😍\n有洲際和尖沙咀香薰油、陳意齋甘草檸檬、帝苑蝴蝶酥一整盒的！\n除了燕窩糕效期真的太短，需要大家自己去香港吃🥹其他都送給大家🫰🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-02T15:07:08", "owner": "pieces_anlei", "likes": 139}, {"id": 18065815280634044, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:15:42", "owner": "chenqian.88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986901285869494, "text": "燕窩糕可以帶回來 ？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:32:35", "owner": "bliss0629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843923329631459, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:28:43", "owner": "shawn_qazp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091683974500108, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:21:46", "owner": "jgan_lili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106135807642777, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:00:34", "owner": "chen_kevinxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029716019538392, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:01:51", "owner": "sara123.aa804", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083011252998857, "text": "wow", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:55:34", "owner": "rvmakeuponline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374368189156063, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-27T06:25:49", "owner": "_tajamul_butt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915045847213381, "text": "nice", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:02:10", "owner": "ffafwghshsbsvsgswji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072904334246433, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-10-26T05:09:35", "owner": "kaviani.h61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900029656272140, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:08:46", "owner": "vbagflfbljk563", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060427514456890, "text": "你眼角的那颗痣好美", "created_at": "2025-09-25T06:05:19", "owner": "hdgyjdugfsygdfgjgkh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942716089059093, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:35:36", "owner": "lv280203031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480312925078471, "text": "骗我去香港旅游系列😂", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:44:31", "owner": "thetracksisters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079871815788451, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:30:46", "owner": "kjvvvjvv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917812657036227, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-02T04:06:57", "owner": "felizconsulting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109846480533341, "text": "香港最值得去游玩的地方是哪里呀？", "created_at": "2025-08-09T13:16:44", "owner": "xue_1009_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364770253199775, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-05T14:11:46", "owner": "_icfc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894258625169288, "text": "我喜歡香薰精油😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-02-25T05:11:55", "owner": "_danibabe__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354005854177317, "text": "都想要～～😍😍", "created_at": "2025-02-24T19:39:51", "owner": "____2u93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073177600723257, "text": "都是好產品👍", "created_at": "2024-12-18T03:44:59", "owner": "keithtse0911", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061613926874676, "text": "@jack97535353_tw 甘草檸檬！！！！", "created_at": "2024-12-16T13:40:34", "owner": "eunice162412", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17886325578166083, "text": "兆成行😍\n每次去都很多人", "created_at": "2024-12-08T23:33:12", "owner": "hsinyun.lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903815389058754, "text": "超想去香港🇭🇰\n想吃蝴碟酥、香薰油", "created_at": "2024-11-01T15:02:39", "owner": "aabbccddee_12345678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007387199485832, "text": "蝴蝶酥酥酥🤤🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-25T00:52:03", "owner": "tonyleecc79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059548303805540, "text": "好想要精油", "created_at": "2024-10-20T15:05:49", "owner": "chinyao.liao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860638864205979, "text": "精油最想", "created_at": "2024-10-16T23:06:12", "owner": "simontsailife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055150396855979, "text": "陳薏齋 🙋‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-10-14T13:14:28", "owner": "shirleyhsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910268202935730, "text": "香港出那麼多，帝苑真的是No.1，還買到有飯店VIP會員卡😆", "created_at": "2024-10-13T06:01:23", "owner": "clairechen1979", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040461440131769, "text": "好想吃蝴蝶酥❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-12T03:52:02", "owner": "minana_tsai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865402984232041, "text": "洲際香薰油", "created_at": "2024-10-12T01:12:17", "owner": "liyongqi639", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110684173411642, "text": "蝴蝶酥真的是世界上最頂👍好好味啊", "created_at": "2024-10-11T16:09:18", "owner": "trisha7037", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026238707155277, "text": "精油好棒😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-11T00:58:28", "owner": "march0323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848279566282638, "text": "@lotus_112586 想要香薰油🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-10T03:32:20", "owner": "yusyuanwang86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18256256770251446, "text": "我想要蝴蝶酥…好想吃🤤🤤🤤🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-09T10:47:24", "owner": "maydayl03y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074376679519313, "text": "你真的很漂亮！想要蝴蝶酥🥹", "created_at": "2024-10-09T10:33:44", "owner": "caiyilin394", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18436950148069284, "text": "洲際的香薰油也太酷🥹", "created_at": "2024-10-09T09:58:07", "owner": "wiwi4025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942624741902919, "text": "好好奇精油🥰", "created_at": "2024-10-09T06:28:56", "owner": "jing_han007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990581202558283, "text": "@weider0207 好想吃😭", "created_at": "2024-10-08T10:44:07", "owner": "jouweee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843102565335262, "text": "甘草檸檬~~", "created_at": "2024-10-07T13:57:37", "owner": "jia_en_c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104745646434874, "text": "蝴蝶酥", "created_at": "2024-10-07T12:00:54", "owner": "jimmy890929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989153031572538, "text": "香薰油😍 @huiru1028", "created_at": "2024-10-07T11:50:19", "owner": "ellicetan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042532979028666, "text": "陳意齋甘草檸檬😍", "created_at": "2024-10-07T11:27:37", "owner": "lunlunlun____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876254920169275, "text": "帝苑蝴蝶酥", "created_at": "2024-10-07T11:24:40", "owner": "eastone2660", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122063110381000, "text": "好想要嚐嚐看地表最強蝴蝶酥", "created_at": "2024-10-07T10:24:21", "owner": "1997hela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008204618446458, "text": "蝴蝶酥🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-07T07:57:41", "owner": "yuyu8118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885218470106538, "text": "蝴蝶酥", "created_at": "2024-10-07T01:30:31", "owner": "ilykangta1219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896595487070359, "text": "蝴蝶酥", "created_at": "2024-10-06T23:18:24", "owner": "sabrin_nana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880922575120359, "text": "最想要香薰油🙌🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-06T18:12:58", "owner": "hua___12899", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040550332899114, "text": "@berjii_2926 蝴蝶酥抽抽！萬一沒抽到要陪我去香港吃🥹", "created_at": "2024-10-06T17:04:33", "owner": "joyce_joie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18223300015305075, "text": "@joyce_joie 抽到蝴蝶酥一起吃！萬一沒抽到之後一起去香港買", "created_at": "2024-10-06T16:58:38", "owner": "berjii_2926", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023320508414791, "text": "香薰油、甘草檸檬（被你介紹得太讚了）跟蝴蝶酥（真的好好吃喔🤤）都超想要❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-06T16:45:02", "owner": "lauren12166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057666076811530, "text": "想要精油😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-06T15:26:26", "owner": "kaokaoo_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887860666099015, "text": "想要燕窩糕🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-06T15:19:36", "owner": "wennn724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056965327805595, "text": "想要蝴蝶酥沒有買到可惜", "created_at": "2024-10-06T14:47:18", "owner": "candyjao0828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038147615156209, "text": "蝴蝶酥😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-06T14:46:54", "owner": "0705_xiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008255279456993, "text": "想要吃蝴蝶酥", "created_at": "2024-10-06T14:01:48", "owner": "q0980118700", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990002517560745, "text": "想要香薰油～", "created_at": "2024-10-06T13:48:10", "owner": "bg48593", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965366142674600, "text": "可以給地址", "created_at": "2024-10-06T13:14:14", "owner": "cat_girl2512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031452848071879, "text": "蝴蝶酥感覺很棒，謝謝你的分享！！", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:33:22", "owner": "jerry.lee.16144", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845212468310604, "text": "香薰++", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:26:44", "owner": "eri_ca.aqua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066940030720652, "text": "想要精油，感覺很特別，味道一定很好聞！聽你的介紹，感覺很讚👍", "created_at": "2024-10-06T12:20:20", "owner": "jialing1692", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057692593802715, "text": "喜歡蝴蝶酥", "created_at": "2024-10-06T11:43:16", "owner": "kellyyang918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930436011830872, "text": "最想要蝴蝶酥🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-06T11:42:26", "owner": "cathy9906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025699898161003, "text": "蝴蝶酥超好吃🤤最想要帝苑蝴蝶酥😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-06T11:09:03", "owner": "cutemuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927682995843360, "text": "蝴蝶酥🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-06T10:35:12", "owner": "arielxoreo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025771256159826, "text": "香薰油😍～～\n台灣creammm.t的蝴蝶酥比香港那間好吃！！我是說真的沒騙人🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-06T10:12:08", "owner": "rhythm.hsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057307594786303, "text": "想買醃漬檸檬🍋🤤🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-06T09:58:25", "owner": "pyq_daily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036554603184461, "text": "蝴蝶酥～", "created_at": "2024-10-06T09:38:05", "owner": "fly333920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012931898358940, "text": "帝苑蝴蝶酥真的好吃😋好香❤️❤️精油跟燕窩糕要筆記起來，下次一定要去買👍👍", "created_at": "2024-10-06T09:27:11", "owner": "hello_hello_la", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984666432728440, "text": "作為香港人 全部都無去過", "created_at": "2024-10-06T06:31:04", "owner": "yo_gettodaze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873350107189320, "text": "精油🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-06T02:04:02", "owner": "oxobear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081165145525535, "text": "好想要精油😍😍上次沒有買到", "created_at": "2024-10-06T00:58:09", "owner": "hitingli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934618533926693, "text": "精油讓人心動💓", "created_at": "2024-10-05T21:16:18", "owner": "applemama124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066641311719935, "text": "好想吃吃看燕窩糕", "created_at": "2024-10-05T13:00:50", "owner": "vicky_1070210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008061608458930, "text": "好想吃燕窩糕！香港蝴蝶酥真的很讚！", "created_at": "2024-10-05T12:53:45", "owner": "vvn_160cm_for_real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039192731478763, "text": "我想要蒂苑蝴碟酥，這家早上11點開，10點半就排一堆人，12點多就賣完了", "created_at": "2024-10-05T08:47:01", "owner": "gaga9693", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864613663231088, "text": "帝苑蝴蝶酥真心超好吃🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-05T06:02:19", "owner": "maggieafi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940619097864575, "text": "我也要去香港", "created_at": "2024-10-05T05:27:47", "owner": "rita58843", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198316996292585, "text": "蝴蝶酥好吃破表", "created_at": "2024-10-05T05:06:21", "owner": "may585415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374541367100211, "text": "帝苑蝴蝶酥💕", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:41:03", "owner": "taiwaneric1007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18358056916140577, "text": "蝴蝶酥看起來不便宜🙂‍↕️🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:39:56", "owner": "dlca28_r_liu.6_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942007752863738, "text": "燕窩糕跟甘草檸檬！🙌感覺超好吃", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:39:44", "owner": "caicaicai45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930827322933792, "text": "三樣 土生土長的香港人🇭🇰\n都沒聽過的伴手禮", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:17:13", "owner": "kylellch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18003118910666911, "text": "曲奇四重奏的蝴蝶酥都唔錯", "created_at": "2024-10-05T04:01:11", "owner": "rubyyyyy1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377219008099184, "text": "蝴蝶酥 酥的很厲害好想要", "created_at": "2024-10-05T03:59:49", "owner": "toro84265", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037558781512030, "text": "那就對了，快點買完，快點離開", "created_at": "2024-10-05T03:38:28", "owner": "kxrie.kw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368941429105629, "text": "想要蝴蝶酥❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-05T03:16:04", "owner": "jinmei928", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098559298411408, "text": "好喜歡酥酥脆脆的蝴蝶酥！😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-05T03:09:24", "owner": "a0926818131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895812991080738, "text": "蝴蝶酥🤤", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:42:00", "owner": "pei_huang25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245833300279662, "text": "😍蝴蝶酥看起乃好讚🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:24:36", "owner": "the_xuan_0727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901935340049457, "text": "世界上最好的蝴蝶酥❤️感覺很厲害", "created_at": "2024-10-05T02:0