}, {"id": 18262447978249925, "text": "Big fan of Pepsi, tastier than Coca cola", "created_at": "2024-12-26T21:29:17", "owner": "ch4rles.q.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070451542673805, "text": "Personally, I like both pepsi and coke but it depends on the day, i like how coke is more fizzy but pepsi has a bit more flavour to me", "created_at": "2024-12-26T06:28:42", "owner": "oscar_schirmann", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18004184822700795, "text": "Prefer not supporting Russia", "created_at": "2024-12-25T22:56:11", "owner": "arvid040z", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3512618727587286236, "shortcode": "DC_VB9BOYzc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC_VB9BOYzc/", "taken_at": "2024-11-30T08:54:13", "caption": "How to sell anything to anyone… 💡", "owner_username": "marktilbury", "owner_id": "9308261107", "likes": 267976, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0339_DC_VB9BOYzc\\DC_VB9BOYzc_20241130_085413.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18052045787405617, "text": "This is such a clean reminder that people don’t buy products, they buy meaning. When you understand that, selling stops being about persuasion & starts being about resonance. That’s when brands last.🔥🔥", "created_at": "2026-01-08T17:51:48", "owner": "digitallyzzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988493631877428, "text": "It is the classic case of selling the feeling and not the product", "created_at": "2025-12-20T14:11:41", "owner": "connectioncrafters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949376628924760, "text": "This hits right. The core struggle is real. We gotta talk brass tacks: Does true wealth come from chasing the ALPHA EDGE (hyper-aggressive strategies) or is FISCAL DISCIPLINE the only reliable blueprint?🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:16:54", "owner": "frankhamilton.usa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125431852492184, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T20:00:25", "owner": "next.ai.2050", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898910614296291, "text": "Marketing", "created_at": "2025-10-17T20:00:21", "owner": "next.ai.2050", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144994393410285, "text": "Now I don't even know what to say. You are just amazing", "created_at": "2025-09-07T16:05:07", "owner": "jegamanir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973189788915144, "text": "Great message and lesson in marketing . It’s about connecting with the emotion! That’s where true value lies 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-01T20:57:50", "owner": "your.ecom.compass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064383394886209, "text": "Apple also sells status not innovation anymore", "created_at": "2025-05-28T08:17:04", "owner": "amarendra5521", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029759630455440, "text": "Apple & innovation😂😂 what a joke", "created_at": "2025-05-27T01:58:49", "owner": "shaanbitzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080745211758450, "text": "Tesla sells gay, not cars😂", "created_at": "2025-05-26T14:31:48", "owner": "car_cult.india", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18532223734051128, "text": "At the end they sell their products", "created_at": "2025-05-25T13:51:53", "owner": "ramesh.kumar2121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886812511272220, "text": "Tesla sells shit", "created_at": "2025-05-25T09:05:25", "owner": "dominator7.aep", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055003700463435, "text": "True...", "created_at": "2025-05-25T04:57:44", "owner": "ecliptor_114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393767068116176, "text": "Hey Teens! Ready to do something different with your life? Welcome to Teenventory – where creativity meets courage. This is your space to: • Speak your mind • Share bold ideas • Set real goals • Meet like-minded teens • Build a life that actually excites you  We’re starting a movement – and you’re invited. Let’s grow, explore, and challenge the ordinary together.  Join the Teenventory community now. Because this generation has something to say – and we’re saying it LOUD.  DM us to verify yourself,if you're eligible you are in.", "created_at": "2025-05-25T03:36:04", "owner": "arnavsashank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307553578246293, "text": "Sure. 😮", "created_at": "2025-05-24T15:28:19", "owner": "silvestreoliveirajr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295006375223515, "text": "correction: tesla sells trash not cars. (Kidding)", "created_at": "2025-05-24T07:39:00", "owner": "designerdevv11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056125613218987, "text": "\"Apple sells innovation\" is the biggest joke I have heard today 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-23T16:28:45", "owner": "meow_idk_meow3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072267076898634, "text": "Boycotting not in 2025? That's literally not cute😑", "created_at": "2025-05-22T17:21:19", "owner": "obvnamirah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014075123539985, "text": "Appreciate this post! We’re helping local brands scale digitally at Click 72 always love connecting with aligned minds.", "created_at": "2025-05-22T16:00:40", "owner": "click__72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029333417667328, "text": "Yes sir absolutely correct ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-05-22T11:10:03", "owner": "rakesh_lpk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928295512051058, "text": "They all sell products that just turned out so good that people became a fan! It's the product selling itself and the rest is just a fancy costume post that 🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-05-22T02:05:25", "owner": "wybi_community", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005385950770536, "text": "You sell smarts not tips🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-05-22T01:12:32", "owner": "darkchocolateguy_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18502997920049616, "text": "That is pure nonsense 😂😂😂😂 believe 😂😂 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-21T22:25:43", "owner": "pushbizonline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033733070360022, "text": "You really teaches us great thing 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-05-20T06:10:33", "owner": "e_autotekk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039333695306223, "text": "advertising regression! advertising regression 🙌 stop", "created_at": "2025-05-19T06:31:39", "owner": "3ddyfaber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901461544188623, "text": "Bmw sells wisdom", "created_at": "2025-05-18T13:10:22", "owner": "shukhrat.be__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18502723477045206, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-16T12:13:52", "owner": "talhaalamig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947506974977256, "text": "These brands have strategically positioned themselves in the minds of consumers, making them instantly recognizable for certain qualities, values, or experiences they represent.", "created_at": "2025-05-16T12:13:14", "owner": "talhaalamig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041866061443413, "text": "Apple never sells innovation 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-16T07:33:57", "owner": "sudheesh_sr4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940920207881605, "text": "Wow! Nunca vi un hombre que se faltara tanto el respeto con tanta falta  de estilo", "created_at": "2025-05-14T22:18:07", "owner": "_mango_2047", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345182659153856, "text": "Apple does not sell innovation 👎🏿👎🏻 they sell yummy apples 🍎 😋", "created_at": "2025-05-13T05:49:17", "owner": "the.terry.russell", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18124592146432613, "text": "You're a wise, wise man! 👏", "created_at": "2025-05-12T21:18:21", "owner": "j.linetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871196296264780, "text": "Bro just said Apple and Innovation. He must be a kid who was born yesterday.", "created_at": "2025-05-12T17:15:02", "owner": "punlokomovic.vinho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093548764601523, "text": "mcd selling human body", "created_at": "2025-05-12T10:17:13", "owner": "its._riskyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059028505908679, "text": "@Ара Маргарян \nWe should ask Qatar 🇶🇦 MOPH and Iran 🇮🇷 MOPH\nWhat's their problem\n😂😂😂\nThank God For All These Blessings ❤️❤️❤️🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-05-07T17:54:30", "owner": "dr.shadi_tabibzadeh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054858461258102, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🌈❤️❤️❤️🌈💎💎💎", "created_at": "2025-05-07T17:54:17", "owner": "dr.shadi_tabibzadeh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18274779502258590, "text": "@Ара Маргарян \nWe should ask Qatar 🇶🇦 MOPH and Iran 🇮🇷 MOPH\nWhat's their problem\n😂😂😂\nThank God For All These Blessings ❤️❤️❤️🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-05-07T17:53:58", "owner": "dr.shadi_tabibzadeh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043184714435931, "text": "we sell a great service", "created_at": "2025-05-07T04:24:40", "owner": "exim.id", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070120369743745, "text": "And that’s the mental association of a brand", "created_at": "2025-05-06T22:50:47", "owner": "amine._travoulta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962801823774368, "text": "Apple used to sell innovation—now its product launches feel boring and uninspired.", "created_at": "2025-05-05T18:40:26", "owner": "mov43645", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033024191647223, "text": "Redbull 🤔☠️", "created_at": "2025-05-05T10:23:25", 