{"media_id": 3510356273126849562, "shortcode": "DC3Sm6Gyjwa", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC3Sm6Gyjwa/", "taken_at": "2024-11-27T06:02:07", "caption": "米紙版KFC奶香蛋撻❤️\n\n✅️內餡材料\n雞蛋3顆(可1全蛋2蛋黃)\n砂糖30g\n煉乳10g\n\n牛奶70ml\n鮮奶油150g\n(攪拌均勻)\n\n✅️塔皮內放巧克力倒入內餡\n✅️烤箱180度20分鐘\n\n出爐後撒可可粉～完成❤️\n\n#零廚藝 #甜點 #diy #米紙 #kfc #蛋塔 #低卡", "owner_username": "iamcc1222", "owner_id": "316288472", "likes": 29250, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0341_DC3Sm6Gyjwa\\DC3Sm6Gyjwa_20241127_060207.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17906351376272255, "text": "這個感覺你做的好簡單啊，想學習可以教一下嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:17:47", "owner": "yuhua4707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061100558528279, "text": "看起來不錯ㄟ，好吃嗎", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:14:45", "owner": "andreadavidson11mgh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18327660544165840, "text": "我要來做巨大蛋撻", "created_at": "2025-04-25T16:29:49", "owner": "she1118875", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068492149766423, "text": "馅料的比例呢？", "created_at": "2025-04-22T11:22:32", "owner": "wang_yingnan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039679310241642, "text": "來試試看 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-04-10T01:09:27", "owner": "ann.8746721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045195278094999, "text": "好有才華ㄝ", "created_at": "2025-03-25T09:24:27", "owner": "sarara1019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113356054467479, "text": "請問氣炸鍋可以嗎👏", "created_at": "2025-03-24T04:35:57", "owner": "apple.kuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932041254900870, "text": "讚讚讚", "created_at": "2025-03-20T12:34:43", "owner": "heyiamrita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918196209965453, "text": "這年頭米紙是什麼東西都能做了是嗎？🙃🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-20T10:16:58", "owner": "xin._.0316_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18497411806033888, "text": "烤箱大概幾度呢？", "created_at": "2025-03-11T16:11:17", "owner": "yihsiensun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17968335728708423, "text": "不會有米的味道嗎", "created_at": "2025-02-22T07:22:10", "owner": "ladysasa122600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021445526444632, "text": "賀喔～我也要來試試米紙甜點😍", "created_at": "2025-02-21T10:26:55", "owner": "hangoods", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17965212569731072, "text": "想問氣炸鍋可以嗎?", "created_at": "2025-02-16T12:43:02", "owner": "huidesign1118", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865963039243070, "text": "米紙中間不會濕濕軟軟的嗎？我忘次用米紙烤馬鈴薯玫瑰卷 結果沒有脆脆的好失望🥺", "created_at": "2025-02-07T03:32:20", "owner": "evonnejill0618", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049581925968213, "text": "是越南那款米紙嗎", "created_at": "2025-02-06T15:49:21", "owner": "ohgoodbuyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998515920741084, "text": "用煎的很像雞皮，吃不完的雞皮哈哈", "created_at": "2025-01-18T14:07:02", "owner": "jiey_1127", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050894507325820, "text": "不可能越南在台灣最暢銷的東西是米紙吧🤣 不過還是愛媽媽做的春捲 百吃不膩😍", "created_at": "2025-01-13T14:42:38", "owner": "qiaoyun_vn.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054528625982469, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-08T12:14:17", "owner": "levsik_039", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070830838671927, "text": "最後那一口 我想到了髒髒包😮", "created_at": "2025-01-07T05:47:45", "owner": "jactivek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18387610165103657, "text": "有人成功嗎？", "created_at": "2025-01-06T10:24:27", "owner": "fall3344", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093475435457375, "text": "@kenshiao @renee0620", "created_at": "2025-01-02T15:28:24", "owner": "chingching0417", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893814559105168, "text": "可是米紙碰到水 又會變得軟爛🤣", "created_at": "2025-01-01T09:41:32", "owner": "msk156699a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160308247329411, "text": "詳食譜", "created_at": "2024-12-31T11:36:44", "owner": "ho_young_chih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120786499410793, "text": "溫度?", "created_at": "2024-12-26T20:00:43", "owner": "grace.wdr9981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051870494046250, "text": "加元ㄒㄧㄠ", "created_at": "2024-12-22T13:06:46", "owner": "a0912031985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962467209714682, "text": "突然覺得可以包湯圓", "created_at": "2024-12-21T10:56:25", "owner": "kelly9949199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362138185138868, "text": "@claire_921 這種米紙根本萬能哈哈哈", "created_at": "2024-12-19T05:35:06", "owner": "xjuyiiano111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880603552192798, "text": "微波可以嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-15T08:45:31", "owner": "yiting7689", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857821843259574, "text": "水果草莓奇異果芒果", "created_at": "2024-12-14T15:22:35", "owner": "linbobo67", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18292076812213897, "text": "超讚👍", "created_at": "2024-12-12T01:23:08", "owner": "q11.22day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068258194665732, "text": "現在有好多米紙料理😳", "created_at": "2024-12-11T15:59:33", "owner": "j_13613", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18009190667663326, "text": "請問剪完米餅被我越南媽媽追著扁怎麼辦", "created_at": "2024-12-10T03:34:18", "owner": "luo.liangyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347917990176803, "text": "@qaq.m.m 是不是溫度過高烤過頭了(每台烤箱都會有點不同)或者雞蛋比較大顆，可以減少一顆看看❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-09T10:48:11", "owner": "iamcc1222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898281727016758, "text": "請問你的食譜是做幾個蛋塔？\n謝謝", "created_at": "2024-12-09T10:30:29", "owner": "suby__1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335637811154683, "text": "Oh my such a good idea!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-09T08:54:28", "owner": "chen.sheng.37454", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014768354435226, "text": "做出來真的變蒸蛋做了六個吃一個全部丟掉😭", "created_at": "2024-12-08T16:35:33", "owner": "qaq.m.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994337352575926, "text": "變成甜蒸蛋..", "created_at": "2024-12-08T11:37:05", "owner": "qaq.m.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073816093615844, "text": "最近米紙應該賣到缺貨", "created_at": "2024-12-08T05:28:59", "owner": "4llllc_c", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064409722698272, "text": "昨天剛用完米紙 看到這個又想衝動去買一包了😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T18:17:27", "owner": "ching031800", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18473360599058148, "text": "@nana710108 酷斃了", "created_at": "2024-12-06T02:31:26", "owner": "dunhill.tasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991114272596803, "text": "米紙是什麼多啦A夢的道具嗎！也太好用", "created_at": "2024-12-05T14:29:03", "owner": "eileen._.do", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18014857337426165, "text": "請問有推薦哪一款米紙嗎💗", "created_at": "2024-12-05T13:03:58", "owner": "winnie_0807", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996212508562809, "text": "謝謝你造福無麩質飲食的人類🥹🥹❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-05T10:27:59", "owner": "xligerlu95_06_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959909955838140, "text": "又來一個米紙殺手，追！", "created_at": "2024-12-04T15:15:43", "owner": "ivy7658", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025645895614801, "text": "感覺不太好吃", "created_at": "2024-12-04T12:16:43", "owner": "913bunnyleo4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339096880196444, "text": "珍珠", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:07:41", "owner": "luck._.049", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122728549393629, "text": "加durian", "created_at": "2024-12-03T05:45:12", "owner": "arisa.chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034025873592272, "text": "胡椒絞肉....", "created_at": "2024-12-02T12:31:06", "owner": "daniel2710_888", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077459422598707, "text": "抹茶粉", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:09:00", "owner": "yazu1499", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066626872735735, "text": "這個我一定會挑戰👏\n比起正統塔皮健康又低熱量太多了❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-30T14:57:25", "owner": "peichen182736", "likes": 25}, {"id": 17848339842357129, "text": "加卡士達醬 絕配", "created_at": "2024-11-30T09:52:35", "owner": "170.lzy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036964502200308, "text": "你會做😢", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:53:37", "owner": "yuan0806y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039103406515383, "text": "用空氣炸鍋可以嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-30T05:10:37", "owner": "wingki_cheng", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18024670091282995, "text": "加棉花糖", "created_at": "2024-11-30T02:28:49", "owner": "lllo912lll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082570594495683, "text": "草莓醬？", "created_at": "2024-11-29T10:31:37", "owner": "stay._.1939", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028506980428629, "text": "我也要來做", "created_at": "2024-11-29T07:11:15", "owner": "over0109.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274890712218928, "text": "好喔！因為妳我又要去買一包米紙了！😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T04:32:03", "owner": "cartier72227", "likes": 171}, {"id": 17901348768082708, "text": "用酥皮加上氣炸鍋呢😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T04:03:05", "owner": "yongqi_1121", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18017356778634175, "text": "偷偷實在很不好", "created_at": "2024-11-29T01:36:03", "owner": "linweitsung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171848083311343, "text": "芋頭麻糬", "created_at": "2024-11-28T14:40:46", "owner": "yuxuan2195", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901484074082325, "text": "太扯了吧🤣蛋塔也行喔", "created_at": "2024-11-28T12:06:35", "owner": "shelley__1204", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17870432922162670, "text": "沒烤箱怎麼辦", "created_at": "2024-11-28T11:35:18", "owner": "_____.ll9453", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059074804870304, "text": "@energydessert2019", "created_at": "2024-11-28T08:55:43", "owner": "flexy_jessie_jie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051629542819140, "text": "超厲害", "created_at": "2024-11-28T08:41:17", "owner": "momou1017", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137157604369200, "text": "加麻糬", "created_at": "2024-11-28T04:44:16", "owner": "yoyo.12_13", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18014617676656439, "text": "肉桂粉", "created_at": "2024-11-28T01:42:06", "owner": "amiusherry", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17883294711172367, "text": "請問氣炸鍋也一樣溫度跟時間嗎", "created_at": "2024-11-28T00:22:51", "owner": "qian_11.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469723657021990, "text": "超強的低卡做法👏👍", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:57:53", "owner": "joyce15932", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987377772607736, "text": "天冷真的很適合看甜點欸😍", "created_at": "2024-11-27T12:08:20", "owner": "ching_lovecooking", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17859299340242850, "text": "麻糬", "created_at": "2024-11-27T11:32:56", "owner": "fish.107", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17964473309816051, "text": "可惡我剩兩張米紙", "created_at": "2024-11-27T10:47:49", "owner": "tinnie.lee89", "likes": 218}, {"id": 18074713012610537, "text": "我一定要買到米紙😂", "created_at": "2024-11-27T09:49:28", "owner": "gui_0408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148448812342711, "text": "米紙達人😍", "created_at": "2024-11-27T09:00:47", "owner": "dozai.babyface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062948878629989, "text": "愛了", "created_at": "2024-11-27T07:54:52", "owner": "dube1202", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851057068342923, "text": "流口水中", "created_at": "2024-11-27T07:30:58", "owner": "yayun1210", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908346663960788, "text": "好愛❤️", "created_at": "2024-11-27T07:19:56", "owner": "lisahung0327", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18291770167237887, "text": "甜點達人😍", "created_at": "2024-11-27T07:10:06", "owner": "stacey.0