{"media_id": 3504237019470191537, "shortcode": "DChjQDCS1ux", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DChjQDCS1ux/", "taken_at": "2024-11-18T19:22:12", "caption": "SO GOOOOD #nyceats #nycchristmas #unionsquareholidaymarket", "owner_username": "kay.shaps", "owner_id": "46510209638", "likes": 207939, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0342_DChjQDCS1ux\\DChjQDCS1ux_20241118_192212.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18135633946407860, "text": "Location please what part of nyc", "created_at": "2025-05-10T23:20:03", "owner": "alexisbabbby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952498713940032, "text": "É horrível, eu peguei o do central park, muito muito muito enjoativo", "created_at": "2025-03-26T00:01:33", "owner": "pvd.frisso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312916009202432, "text": "This looks epic", "created_at": "2025-02-12T14:44:13", "owner": "yolklondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904138534015044, "text": "Butane.com", "created_at": "2025-02-09T00:41:20", "owner": "ernestoscrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881490952232844, "text": "@jokerspuddin20", "created_at": "2025-02-08T19:56:34", "owner": "williamsyakira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977668317804962, "text": "wtf brooo???", "created_at": "2025-02-03T00:47:27", "owner": "photonvision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155460043344394, "text": "Ugh please can I teleport here", "created_at": "2025-02-02T19:49:33", "owner": "__mercedesisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907942072088941, "text": "That looks really good!", "created_at": "2025-02-01T21:28:02", "owner": "seamoss_oasis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134013376376088, "text": "👎", "created_at": "2025-01-26T17:24:43", "owner": "paotrillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065089261716390, "text": "YUMMMMMY", "created_at": "2025-01-26T15:57:55", "owner": "nickedbythetism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864524281320714, "text": "How much is it?", "created_at": "2025-01-22T20:18:16", "owner": "waysh3goes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897984358130165, "text": "BOOOOOOOOOOO", "created_at": "2025-01-20T04:32:18", "owner": "outtas1ghtouttamind_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874988764249230, "text": "doesn't that hurt the cup", "created_at": "2025-01-12T22:30:04", "owner": "brayan_biggie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073803676652488, "text": "👌", "created_at": "2025-01-09T10:10:55", "owner": "cafe_bam_shiraz2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173891668312749, "text": "@katiebug121809", "created_at": "2025-01-08T23:51:52", "owner": "kay.may09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059308315928178, "text": "Goddamn they gentrified the cups!!", "created_at": "2025-01-07T02:33:50", "owner": "kayshenry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483751900004400, "text": "It’s not that good sadly and it’s overpriced", "created_at": "2025-01-05T22:08:54", "owner": "oliviastellarossa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063967624889924, "text": "So uh hot chocolate ?", "created_at": "2025-01-03T18:33:19", "owner": "presley__toth", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17960322611845610, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-03T00:27:11", "owner": "official_t.barrett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043227473210906, "text": "Have you seen my son", "created_at": "2025-01-02T20:25:54", "owner": "marlintheclownfish1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119123389420162, "text": "This looks amazing", "created_at": "2024-12-31T18:59:25", "owner": "lckitchendesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945392832925775, "text": "Hot cocoa..", "created_at": "2024-12-30T08:56:24", "owner": "elite.sample", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037594322093076, "text": "I’m gay", "created_at": "2024-12-27T19:09:54", "owner": "aari0na", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041926220194114, "text": "Would this not be hot chocolate?", "created_at": "2024-12-23T18:18:47", "owner": "aris.sweet.treats_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041394527031048, "text": "@jeduchene", "created_at": "2024-12-22T13:17:50", "owner": "xtremejuice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286829311172419, "text": "Is this not just got chocolate with some gram crackers?", "created_at": "2024-12-21T22:02:40", "owner": "stars88754", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061712977889863, "text": "You should try vietnamese egg coffee...smores smoke to the side nervously 🙃", "created_at": "2024-12-18T05:34:29", "owner": "mak7_lxix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109645636448751, "text": "How much a cup??", "created_at": "2024-12-17T23:29:00", "owner": "sowhatsupsaif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074405938717852, "text": "In the most NYC cup possible too", "created_at": "2024-12-16T20:22:23", "owner": "thekodywilson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336694393195118, "text": "@nikkimcghee", "created_at": "2024-12-16T07:04:53", "owner": "jonbolding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044488199332769, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-16T03:59:18", "owner": "kazi.yetu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350559865133173, "text": "That’s the cup from the spider man movie👍", "created_at": "2024-12-16T03:16:44", "owner": "charlie_payne347", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910347201962575, "text": "unhealthy relationship with food", "created_at": "2024-12-16T01:32:30", "owner": "biggest_g_of_all_time", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045256661321151, "text": "You had me at the blue cup", "created_at": "2024-12-16T00:27:53", "owner": "brycejcollier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029124494234690, "text": "@fazerug", "created_at": "2024-12-16T00:21:59", "owner": "reputation269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058309606912213, "text": "@tboi_creates I expect this on Thursday!", "created_at": "2024-12-15T22:47:46", "owner": "jo_yeo75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930749772975928, "text": "@nevianavd 😋", "created_at": "2024-12-15T21:34:16", "owner": "yvonnekruithofsnel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022479854628439, "text": "@kristinperra", "created_at": "2024-12-15T21:15:12", "owner": "maureenkcart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933751008848507, "text": "Drinking this with facial hair seems terrible", "created_at": "2024-12-15T19:18:06", "owner": "crustchunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887775508160572, "text": "that’ll be $12", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:30:32", "owner": "danny.schoeppner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119522842416812, "text": "Had it last night. \n\nAnd also the tomato soup with grilled cheese.. Omgg delicious", "created_at": "2024-12-15T11:10:35", "owner": "hearts_pure2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046901219134793, "text": "Mmmmh burned cup plastic coating", "created_at": "2024-12-15T11:01:48", "owner": "smilaeon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472844236047673, "text": "Isn’t it the coffee shop MJ works at in Spider-man no way home?", "created_at": "2024-12-15T07:36:37", "owner": "rodelinebm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055660444778009, "text": "Mmmmm burnt carcinogens", "created_at": "2024-12-15T07:21:42", "owner": "tentoncock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996904587721248, "text": "Why rotate the cup?? 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T05:03:11", "owner": "crossproduct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956180250850053, "text": "Tried and was not a fan. The marshmallow and graham cracker tasted great but the hot chocolate was not good. No Chewing Allowed is sooooo much better.", "created_at": "2024-12-15T04:16:00", "owner": "ecoombs88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148632049348642, "text": "I never trust anything that people call yummy", "created_at": "2024-12-15T03:33:20", "owner": "vip_jordanb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080425831576235, "text": "😮😮 I need one 😮", "created_at": "2024-12-15T03:18:03", "owner": "veyonlux_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946889208914072, "text": "@morganthomp106", "created_at": "2024-12-15T01:14:20", "owner": "aqvpoore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925977525990042, "text": "@kaitlincaye", "created_at": "2024-12-15T01:11:31", "owner": "ryleebarreltits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969670893817182, "text": "The cups!!!! I love 💗", "created_at": "2024-12-15T00:00:41", "owner": "ayyysammii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474484504014563, "text": "It’s way to watery", "created_at": "2024-12-14T22:13:35", "owner": "aj_hoss_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086214982556289, "text": "Yo this the coffee they be drinking on Grey anatomy. I recognize the cups", "created_at": "2024-12-14T21:50:26", "owner": "harleycarolc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950247750879971, "text": "Id burn the roof of my mouth chuggin that.", "created_at": "2024-12-14T20:29:52", "owner": "kent45jones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930443943859529, "text": "Damn haven’t seen a nyc to go cup like that in a hot minute", "created_at": "2024-12-14T19:45:09", "owner": "lovingmyhappiness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048754099888198, "text": "So it for waking around and looking cool and not for drinking", "created_at": "2024-12-14T19:29:16", "owner": "jaco_stang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051284096059448, "text": "Isn't that just a hot chocolate?", "created_at": "2024-12-14T19:09:27", "owner": "sodakaubs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252469990276468, "text": "Melted plastic...yummy...😜😋", "created_at": "2024-12-14T18:30:16", "owner": "angelikapausz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349561810121038, "text": "The consistency is to thick i like hot chocolate but i felt like i was drinking a bunch of melted milk chocolate", "created_at": "2024-12-14T18:21:29", "owner": "stephanie93n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048590666122368, "text": "@mobilegroomingwithcarly", "created_at": "2024-12-14T18:11:34", "owner": "anastasia7547", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337818742148184, "text": "Duh", "created_at": "2024-12-14T17:39:30", "owner": "alexisjade600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18260699365250472, "text": "This is the first video I've ever see of someone torching the smores filling and NOT burning it!!! Amazing job! It looks beautiful 🤩", "created_at": "2024-12-14T17:21:46", "owner": "antonrogue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042022532184946, "text": "The chocolate to marshmallow ratio is off", "created_at": "2024-12-14T11:34:03", "owner": "alessandra_elyzabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132699520375993, "text": "You know it’s bad when you read “Luigi S’mores” 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-14T08:35:06", "owner": "awstynjasper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938770389944471, "text": "Can't fool me into going there", "created_at": "2024-12-14T07:27:01", "owner": "xxkgoldxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044496227148390, "text": "I can hear Mariah", "created_at": "2024-12-14T07:15:13", "owner": "heislex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034439972375448, "text": "Liquid smoke 🔥👌🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:49:52", "owner": "whitney.mcintyre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951487818896595, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:17:53", "owner": "cameron__hassan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948925314909882, "text": "no i dont", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:09:56", "owner": "benjii.bw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843012166379034, "text": "I need my mallow to be a lil bit thicker 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-13T23:47:56", "owner": "cfrancis38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084682762553864, "text": "This cup", "created_at": "2024-12-13T20:42:10", "owner": "jamiekimgallery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18473720476053202, "text": "@kelseyrenem", "created_at": "2024-12-13T19:47:31", "owner": "bro0keb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934746588953453, "text": "@_lisaflores_", "created_at": "2024-12-13T17:45:29", "owner": "b1gl3x87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893248438079815, "text": "Anyone else worried the cup is gonna catch on fire or something? Mmmmmmm burnt cardboard 😋", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:09:34", "owner": "johnjvogt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070476007591071, "text": "The ol stick in the brown hole", "created_at": "2024-12-13T14:54:43", "owner": "rodney_dynamite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043563479236104, "text": "Yummmmm!!!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-13T14:47:58", "owner": "marissawhitevolleyball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338425921148216, "text": "Water hot chocolate with whipped cream and a cracker on top…”that will be $46.50", "created_at": "2024-12-13T12:39:25", "owner": "bcortazar22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100515157464891, "text": "🤮", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:25:07", "owner": "ollie4527003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962158044719460, "text": "Ned Flanders did it better", "created_at": "2024-12-13T08:22:26", "owner": "m_ay_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854694958340554, "text": "@kirrileemissen 😳", "created_at": "2024-12-13T08:12:13", "owner": "southwestprovisions", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041612570333529, "text": "Please go get one of these when you are there lol @lottmorgan", "created_at": "2024-12-13T05:33:18", "owner": "lucydanielle_illustration", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084914140483498, "text": "Is this the same cup I see in the early episodes of law & order svu?", "created_at": "2024-12-13T02:53:14", "owner": "kurai.yuutsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042247897992460, "text": "Is this the same cup detective benson drinks from?!!", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:18:13", "owner": "relleey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008910359498831, "text": "Horrible drink. Don’t waste your money", "created_at": "2024-12-13T00:13:02", "owner": "joewdunn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998281875547273, "text": "They don’t be having shit in VA", "created_at": "2024-12-12T22:14:10", "owner": "stinecortez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108034753449289, "text": "@hayley.levinson", "created_at": "2024-12-12T18:37:02", "owner": "bkpastroff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017611721382358, "text": "The Greek cup 😍", "created_at": "2024-12-12T16:36:09", "owner": "the.papadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879127705198341, "text": "Needs more marshmallow", "created_at": "2024-12-12T06:46:23", "owner": "kevhubby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064740697776164, "text": "So... hot chocolate?", "created_at": "2024-12-12T03:43:58", "owner": "angelusrizza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080846314504259, "text": "you guys could use a real cup so we don't drink whatever is in that toasted paper wax plastic thing", "created_at": "2024-12-12T02:20:05", "owner": "paceofperfection", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18468224902053265, "text": "Thank you. And that will be 15.99 please.", "created_at": "2024-12-12T00:04:53", "owner": "_yurri42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053335858984321, "text": "@albyshkopu", "created_at": "2024-12-11T22:06:23", "owner": "mrs.sidorov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090439855514476, "text": "So a messy hot chocolate?", "created_at": "2024-12-11T17:27:04", "owner": "alexisnielsenxx", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18040352717518047, "text": "what if the cup burn", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:51:09", "owner": "l.hng4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960691134833886, "text": "... diabetes to go", "created_at": "2024-12-11T08:23:50", "owner": "eric_radio_1xtra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054036568802493, "text": "Sounds yummy", "created_at": "2024-12-11T06:41:34", "owner": "klbpsb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028628048217496, "text": "Wait, so it’s hot cocoa?", "created_at": "2024-12-11T04:54:47", "owner": "llynosio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908945055964354, "text": "@ashhole1203 bruh", "created_at": "2024-12-11T03:39:12", "owner": "talmalbrough", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18217016473288023, "text": "I wish I was a white whimsical woman so bad life was be so good", "created_at": "2024-12-11T02:14:47", "owner": "kurt_pea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918625200918208, "text": "@dest_m04", "created_at": "2024-12-11T02:06:41", "owner": "a9365.7_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["nyceats", "nycchristmas", "unionsquareholidaymarket"]},
{"media_id": 3515340363706180467, "shortcode": "DDI_2-LTKNz", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDI_2-LTKNz/", "taken_at": "2024-12-04T03:00:00", "caption": "已製作，小孩很喜歡XD\n發現兒子很喜歡吉伊卡哇，用Blender做了一些小動畫給他🥰\n\n#3d建模 #學3d #blender #blender3d #吉伊卡哇 #chikawa #3d動畫 #遊戲美術 #小孩喜歡  #已購買小孩愛吃", "owner_username": "kojin3d", "owner_id": "40839494130", "likes": 7469, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0343_DDI_2-LTKNz\\DDI_2-LTKNz_20241204_030000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18052766185860296", "text": "厲害誒 超可愛 這是blender 嗎？", "created_at": "2025-01-05T06:55:39", "owner": "adlers986461", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17945464397920430", "text": "想學習", "created_at": "2025-01-01T01:25:12", "owner": "n.ala.115", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18065295397762293", "text": "嗚哇哇嗚哇", "created_at": "2024-12-16T11:29:23", "owner": "nekokun7894", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17901810978085614", "text": "我那天拿給我阿嬤看\n阿嬤：這不是那個雞掰卡哇嗎？\n我：？", "created_at": "2024-12-10T12:24:46", "owner": "dobby_manta2367", "likes": 6}, {"id": "18044845412137473", "text": "好可愛😍", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:43:58", "owner": "kiraya2604", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18051587074989157", "text": "太太太太太可愛了，尖叫！\n可以給大家當桌布嗎🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-08T08:20:02", "owner": "chuyuannn", "likes": 4}, {"id": "18079821226574858", "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-12-08T02:44:32", "owner": "asd17280", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17881897131187072", "text": "好可愛", "created_at": "2024-12-07T17:26:02", "owner": "himakoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17957551310847842", "text": "我已經咬好奶嘴了，請問這樣的爸爸麻麻哪裡發", "created_at": "2024-12-07T14:21:31", "owner": "ricethree_gene46.txt.tw", "likes": 213}, {"id": "18049439561085194", "text": "好有才華", "created_at": "2024-12-07T11:07:46", "owner": "weileebear", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17990870738599107", "text": "我也想當你的女兒🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-07T07:06:36", "owner": "usagichokawaii", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18040195415467749", "text": "好可愛❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-06T15:06:50", "owner": "ivy150054", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18050828741066308", "text": "喇叭跟我的一樣欸😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T13:34:05", "owner": "orio_031", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18054484003769541", "text": "網友也喜歡😍", "created_at": "2024-12-06T05:03:32", "owner": "ryanisdoublea", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18473461969057443", "text": "你做得好厲害唷！", "created_at": "2024-12-05T15:48:28", "owner": "eileenliou0615", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18103312735455734", "text": "跟兒子講話一整個特別溫柔~", "created_at": "2024-12-05T11:58:33", "owner": "yulun2682", "likes": 7}, {"id": "18098755300433807", "text": "你兒子沒有喜歡烏薩奇嗎😢", "created_at": "2024-12-05T07:17:52", "owner": "cheng___wu", "likes": 9}, {"id": "18013627460460583", "text": "很利害說話好清楚啊", "created_at": "2024-12-04T10:59:04", "owner": "w.wang.021849", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18365899447186638", "text": "小孩這麼大了嗎！！", "created_at": "2024-12-04T06:14:35", "owner": "gsn8382", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17882903136177814", "text": "我學會了，但兒子要在那找？", "created_at": "2024-12-04T04:40:29", "owner": "aoka_meng", "likes": 23}, {"id": "18293707651234062", "text": "阿荒老師的鵝子好聰明，可以說出完整的句子👏", "created_at": "2024-12-04T03:31:41", "owner": "linjye2020", "likes": 74}, {"id": "18047278052288331", "text": "缺女兒嗎👀👀👀", "created_at": "2024-12-04T03:14:41", "owner": "su_ic.id_e", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["3d建模", "學3d", "blender", "blender3d", "吉伊卡哇", "chikawa", "3d動畫", "遊戲美術", "小孩喜歡", "已購買小孩愛吃"]},
{"media_id": 3514413644702988464, "shortcode": "DDFtJb2Triw", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDFtJb2Triw/", "taken_at": "2024-12-02T20:20:46", "caption": "What would you do💀\n\nMichael Schumacher’s gas station pit crew commercial is a classic blend of humor and racing nostalgia. Filmed for Shell in the early 2000s, the ad features Schumacher and his Ferrari Formula 1 pit crew transforming an ordinary gas station stop into a full-blown F1 pit stop. As a surprised customer pulls up to refuel, the team leaps into action, swapping tires, checking the engine, and refueling the car in record time—complete with the precision and speed expected from a Ferrari pit crew.\n\nThe commercial was a clever way to highlight Shell’s partnership with Ferrari, showcasing the technical expertise and efficiency that define F1, while connecting it to the everyday experience of refueling. It also reflected Schumacher’s status as a global icon, capable of bringing the world of high-performance motorsport into a relatable and lighthearted context.\n\nThis ad remains one of the most memorable examples of how Formula 1’s precision and drama can be translated into creative marketing, cementing Schumacher’s legacy not just as a driver, but as a cultural ambassador for the sport.\n\n#schumacher #ferrari #f1 #racing #motorsports", "owner_username": "f1archived", "owner_id": "55795852270", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0344_DDFtJb2Triw\\DDFtJb2Triw_20241202_202046.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18448146247065989, "text": "I post vintage F1 every day 🔥🫶", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:04:50", "owner": "f1archived", "likes": 2654}, {"id": 18058346356857814, "text": "I’m Surprised his car is still running good after a Ferrari pit stop", "created_at": "2024-12-02T23:07:31", "owner": "dan_bullock_car_meets", "likes": 19295}, {"id": 18067398067915340, "text": "The car networth sky rockets after this👏", "created_at": "2025-03-24T07:15:28", "owner": "stamaths_endiar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057390002111716, "text": "Ofc they would believe him bc it is on a video that i see", "created_at": "2025-03-23T23:08:49", "owner": "viktorgra_167", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886597207229522, "text": "Michael doing community service before FIA started forcing them", "created_at": "2025-03-19T17:17:11", "owner": "bloreo94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317834554203852, "text": "If i were there i would've stalled at the restart", "created_at": "2025-02-17T19:44:54", "owner": "andmore8065", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060283516811476, "text": "bro definitely got TUV from them", "created_at": "2025-02-11T12:09:17", "owner": "ionutt._.lpz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079983661626717, "text": "If i would there i would defineitly make a video that look my 10 lakhs car is serviced at 11 lakhs lmao 🤣", "created_at": "2025-02-03T18:15:15", "owner": "caligo__xi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388125973110223, "text": "I will buy that car even if it's for a million dollars*touched by Schumacher*", "created_at": "2025-02-02T17:23:35", "owner": "top_gun_squadron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019911209450173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-31T17:18:42", "owner": "_danovy.podvodnik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861477721338667, "text": "He forgot to pay the gas", "created_at": "2025-01-21T06:54:28", "owner": "turbolag.ben", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869441428201353, "text": "🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-16T19:31:20", "owner": "senna_fanpage1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964798833837990, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-01-14T16:27:45", "owner": "holikmira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087547066556965, "text": "'a little maintenance'", "created_at": "2025-01-12T06:32:05", "owner": "ixelaria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982492530794539, "text": "\"It's gonna cost you 10 000 dollars, thank you sir to have asked for our service\"", "created_at": "2025-01-02T23:35:10", "owner": "pinpin.ababou", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18033506540436949, "text": "Its all staged so i think his friends are going to beleve him", "created_at": "2025-01-02T16:56:38", "owner": "quinten_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054929675299470, "text": "Wo er noch nicht gegen einen Felsen gefahren ist", "created_at": "2025-01-02T15:11:04", "owner": "mal.micha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102290419480075, "text": "Burn out", "created_at": "2025-01-01T08:22:24", "owner": "kstormblessed16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964034142714404, "text": "I've never noticed the Swiss highway sticker on the windshield 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T21:32:35", "owner": "taziobergometti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051693772868571, "text": "Now his car is overfilled with oil", "created_at": "2024-12-31T12:09:44", "owner": "nathanshuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048095677922802, "text": "I remember this video when I was a kid, and wondering if his fill was free.", "created_at": "2024-12-31T08:43:18", "owner": "halphetamine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995618970581481, "text": "Hey. He didn’t pay. Lololol🤨", "created_at": "2024-12-31T00:31:37", "owner": "wilson.tsuiws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127186570401066, "text": "So cool!👏", "created_at": "2024-12-30T04:25:38", "owner": "ioana.oconnor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969155577693016, "text": "Michael 😎😎", "created_at": "2024-12-30T02:42:35", "owner": "vagnerluizdeabreu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067344682758500, "text": "This is what I want when I go to the gas station pls.", "created_at": "2024-12-29T22:14:37", "owner": "andreabierhals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046949162513788, "text": "In some countries (South Africa) you don't do your own petrol, there's attendants to do it for you", "created_at": "2024-12-29T21:03:30", "owner": "sim_on_a_whim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988837803765292, "text": "Do me do me do me !!", "created_at": "2024-12-29T19:43:29", "owner": "epa_lol1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016310273443939, "text": "🇨🇭🇨🇭🇨🇭", "created_at": "2024-12-29T18:15:47", "owner": "36chess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070609150677633, "text": "I’d get Schumacher in the driver’s seat pronto.", "created_at": "2024-12-29T13:45:26", "owner": "sunil_3569", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062454109694623, "text": "Did he pay or not ??", "created_at": "2024-12-29T13:38:09", "owner": "akshankumar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051310904107094, "text": "Dude just went away 💀", "created_at": "2024-12-29T12:52:59", "owner": "_hidemitsu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915243043024870, "text": "Couldn't do the same prank in this economy...", "created_at": "2024-12-29T10:02:09", "owner": "michal_kubina1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067370626699767, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-29T09:17:30", "owner": "markokurniawan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114772957428140, "text": "Yo dude i Just got pit stopped by ferrari", "created_at": "2024-12-29T08:48:49", "owner": "error42279", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908960407068905, "text": "Legand F1 👏", "created_at": "2024-12-29T05:39:04", "owner": "dytamella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126537277401241, "text": "❤️ genial", "created_at": "2024-12-29T03:12:25", "owner": "anghelodiazrodriguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081549010574163, "text": "@lourdesguilleni", "created_at": "2024-12-29T01:22:11", "owner": "martinguillen.py", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261410128258399, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-28T23:17:17", "owner": "o.kan_ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018696809399490, "text": "Definitely not pay", "created_at": "2024-12-28T19:43:59", "owner": "sakhile_ngwekazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879129403226593, "text": "That would make my day ❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-28T18:20:41", "owner": "gama.crow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063248167843121, "text": "How can u put oil in someone car when it's on and hot??", "created_at": "2024-12-28T15:45:52", "owner": "tomwhitting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992880222596890, "text": "❤❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-28T12:27:20", "owner": "danielaoarga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033243500174567, "text": "Nell'epoca dei prank belli", "created_at": "2024-12-28T11:04:45", "owner": "paride_gba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062104642872043, "text": "Is he Michael Schumacher?? 😮", "created_at": "2024-12-28T08:28:06", "owner": "giovanoti10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031034201577946, "text": "Young Michael was such a cutie 😍", "created_at": "2024-12-28T01:24:19", "owner": "buttercupcarolina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114877501427658, "text": "Ima feel like a kid on Christmas", "created_at": "2024-12-27T20:32:54", "owner": "kebapsk1y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910733947058902, "text": "It's Ferrari so his wheel is probably gonna fall off leaving the lot", "created_at": "2024-12-27T17:09:02", "owner": "matyon267", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025766651624274, "text": "He probably paid 3x the anount he should've.", "created_at": "2024-12-27T16:53:35", "owner": "danielzigyarev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952560987879943, "text": "I’m understanding the assignment 😂😂🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-27T13:18:24", "owner": "kickupmir9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917224297040814, "text": "He didn't pay for it , did he?", "created_at": "2024-12-26T20:38:26", "owner": "ibrahim_ghad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474410371048798, "text": "Bro didn't even pay for the gas", "created_at": "2024-12-26T08:10:37", "owner": "bear_hansvega", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103662154462398, "text": "Isn’t he the comic book owner from big bang theory ?", "created_at": "2024-12-25T21:23:08", "owner": "danfaulknerinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018747485385034, "text": "Yo didn’t see the guys open the door send the card to another guy 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T18:19:24", "owner": "____dayway____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477147997012080, "text": "Did he drive into a tree after that tho", "created_at": "2024-12-25T14:25:06", "owner": "lolothereal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337167715148068, "text": "@mpirlo3000 would you believe me", "created_at": "2024-12-25T06:03:25", "owner": "_thakhani_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066316192784638, "text": "Dude just stole my keys lol", "created_at": "2024-12-25T00:51:00", "owner": "thefreshasian_john", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051505832487221, "text": "He was arrested 2 km later because he didn't pay", "created_at": "2024-12-24T21:54:20", "owner": "sideshowback", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872933815165915, "text": "Potřebuji tento tým 😮😂", "created_at": "2024-12-24T15:37:43", "owner": "_rich_bi3ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325886710081540, "text": "Who would pay for him?", "created_at": "2024-12-24T13:44:58", "owner": "usman_syed75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017299736418207, "text": "imagine they dont know what fuel this car needs and they put in the wrong fuel😂", "created_at": "2024-12-24T10:07:07", "owner": "hft.natee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928480723000493, "text": "😂😂😂 I like the way he zoomed off😂", "created_at": "2024-12-23T21:54:16", "owner": "bartbauhofer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063623599680823, "text": "@totalenergies", "created_at": "2024-12-23T19:33:50", "owner": "m.u.t.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051408503091976, "text": "@shell", "created_at": "2024-12-23T19:32:31", "owner": "m.u.t.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005554547695235, "text": "Would be so fun if it's just a carjack well prepared 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-23T13:00:33", "owner": "tietienne_rbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935722500839752, "text": "If senna hadn't died, nobody would care about schumy", "created_at": "2024-12-21T17:19:58", "owner": "kj271kah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029259746607256, "text": "No one's gonna believe him 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T17:14:13", "owner": "kheng.bobby.boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027106406273882, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-20T22:27:44", "owner": "tomas.kerosevic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015179741440754, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-19T12:36:47", "owner": "_iustin.ptr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060967231858492, "text": "I miss em B(", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:51:46", "owner": "tristanyzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048494762032036, "text": "@lorelai.circus", "created_at": "2024-12-16T14:55:34", "owner": "l._eliza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070117825660070, "text": "😭I'm just think about the engine since the put oil in it while it's hot., 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T21:22:16", "owner": "bz_samuel_504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030773588392947, "text": "and they say:1000 dollars", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:44:35", "owner": "eugsup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051918107295962, "text": "Now way a real Ferrari the Legend Michael 🔥🔥🔥🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:08:07", "owner": "nef_esparza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994435140784601, "text": "I love she’ll literally the only gas i get", "created_at": "2024-12-14T17:56:24", "owner": "markcalvillo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026038883296107, "text": "I’m his friend, I believe him", "created_at": "2024-12-14T14:53:51", "owner": "no4h___ph1l1ppe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874710463147108, "text": "I miss Michael Schumacher", "created_at": "2024-12-14T14:00:25", "owner": "oss.foto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884249869177477, "text": "Imagen he stalled it", "created_at": "2024-12-14T13:57:12", "owner": "tap_to_add_name._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044460896471392, "text": "he met the goat", "created_at": "2024-12-14T13:52:49", "owner": "muadz4typesh1t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030353351399266, "text": "thought the guy was going to throw him out of the car, jesus", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:12:13", "owner": "nick_perry_73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071373934579361, "text": "Refill oil into hot engine ? 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:10:57", "owner": "fabulous____fab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252437809278548, "text": "I would’ve been peeling out leaving that", "created_at": "2024-12-13T07:14:27", "owner": "thatredbullr6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084853021549568, "text": "Imagine getting your oil topped off by Micheal Schumacher", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:16:20", "owner": "kingducky211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903773875065628, "text": "Nothing like fiat Punto 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T22:22:16", "owner": "santinovarsovia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047859380479843, "text": "Rip Michael🪻🌺🏎️", "created_at": "2024-12-12T21:28:21", "owner": "marcello._battaglia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990197922754509, "text": "\"Boys you can't understand\"", "created_at": "2024-12-12T21:26:02", "owner": "_leosarti_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953442930854290, "text": "Burnout and pull out between them", "created_at": "2024-12-12T12:21:04", "owner": "rafay_.faisal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477083878032900, "text": "Zlatan", "created_at": "2024-12-12T09:29:51", "owner": "c.puntowibisono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983026989785114, "text": "That would be 5k dollars ,Sir . Card or Cash , Sir ??", "created_at": "2024-12-12T06:54:35", "owner": "unknown.wrote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069060742662815, "text": "I need to find them@", "created_at": "2024-12-12T06:26:57", "owner": "etnomal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084504736541447, "text": "You like it? It's french", "created_at": "2024-12-11T22:32:40", "owner": "wyatt.duc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915546553033071, "text": "And then He gets a Ticket for the gas", "created_at": "2024-12-10T20:47:02", "owner": "jufor__", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18030637787431128, "text": "Bro had winter tires and they put on racers. I would sue", "created_at": "2024-12-10T12:52:16", "owner": "sultkam", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18037538267198259, "text": "“yeah bro i got pit-stopped at a gas station today by michael schumacher and a pit crew”", "created_at": "2024-12-10T12:43:17", "owner": "arx.m1lfret", "likes": 2171}, {"id": 17843162712382076, "text": "I wish gas stations were like this!", "created_at": "2024-12-10T11:02:03", "owner": "beatrixpamdemic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122500237397263, "text": "In the u.s. they'd take the keys,,, and the wheels,,, and just about everything but the seat assuming he was still sitting on it!! 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-10T07:22:16", "owner": "3ustaci0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948892935909550, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-10T03:54:08", "owner": "jonathangarcia2208", "likes": 138}, {"id": 18034181471112780, "text": "Awww Michael", "created_at": "2024-12-10T03:13:38", "owner": "viri.dee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036453656080679, "text": "*explodes*", "created_at": "2024-12-09T20:31:16", "owner": "squeakybeans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871391671166923, "text": "He was SHOCKED", "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:36:42", "owner": "x_jvw_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863159557221813, "text": "he forgot to pay", "created_at": "2024-12-09T14:56:10", "owner": "_.georgee_1704._", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["schumacher", "ferrari", "f1", "racing", "motorsports"]},
{"media_id": 3515388370132826968, "shortcode": "DDJKxjpTntY", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDJKxjpTntY/", "taken_at": "2024-12-04T04:36:41", "caption": "👉🏻 為了保溫效果只好再打一下了🎮\n@ 喜歡邊打邊吃的朋友\n​\n👉🏻 這是什麼？\n​\n你也是一玩遊戲就停不下來\n\n常常玩到食物都冷掉了嗎？\n\n加拿大的必勝客（Pizza Hut）\n\n非常懂玩家的這種心情\n\n特地為 PS5 主機量身打造出一台「披薩保溫器」\n\n不要以為這是在開玩笑\n\n必勝客直接在官網公開 3D 列印檔\n\n讓玩家免費下載並自行列印組裝\n\n能夠直接貼合在主機上的「披薩保溫器」\n\n只要將披薩放進盒子裡\n\n就能利用 PS5 機身背面發出的熱氣\n\n不需額外的電源就能替食物保溫\n\n貼心建議記得放張鋁箔紙當托盤\n\n免得餅皮碎屑掉進寶貝主機裡\n\n有誰也需要這個酷東東呢？\n\n🎥： YouTube pizzahutca\n\n👉🏻 你玩遊戲時最喜歡吃什麼食物呢？\n歡迎在下面留言告訴我們喔！\n​\n更多時尚精選，請追蹤 @heavenravenofficial\n\n#PizzaWRMR #pizza #pizzahut #ps5 #playstation #玩家 #遊戲 #主機 #game #3D列印 #3dprint #design #設計 #創意 #保溫", "owner_username": "heavenravenofficial", "owner_id": "1160066", "likes": 19523, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0345_DDJKxjpTntY\\DDJKxjpTntY_20241204_043641.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17969674259816236, "text": "爸 我想要這個可以保溫披薩的東東\n所以能買一台PS5給我嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:32:29", "owner": "re_pt_x", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17968345142814909, "text": "@h.yinyu", "created_at": "2024-12-10T01:50:47", "owner": "hi_hi_anderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041719517005285, "text": "@brianltll", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:57:54", "owner": "iamirandajane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983427111782714, "text": "以後出現PS5火鍋我也不意外了", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:22:01", "owner": "txt_m4k1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053212318823976, "text": "好環保", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:13:07", "owner": "manaqqqq", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18002481935518219, "text": "我沒ps5🥹", "created_at": "2024-12-06T00:27:36", "owner": "bill10219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853651579288127, "text": "太酷了吧", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:11:21", "owner": "yan.fantasy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935415600949412, "text": "@wooden_storyu36", "created_at": "2024-12-05T03:31:53", "owner": "mochiiiii_0111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068326198677568, "text": "@gooooooooooooooodbye_chu 來吃披薩", "created_at": "2024-12-05T02:57:27", "owner": "shihao_42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034980509098091, "text": "@dbmercury", "created_at": "2024-12-05T01:52:34", "owner": "wwsshui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873824203144682, "text": "@ms0746112", "created_at": "2024-12-05T01:50:09", "owner": "danny_h.dng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868034392184590, "text": "@tin_g_06_25", "created_at": "2024-12-04T22:11:48", "owner": "misaka_1227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045588511909120, "text": "iPizza Pro", "created_at": "2024-12-04T13:27:10", "owner": "tyg_unclewilly", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18041629616005273, "text": "@yuan._zhi._1228 我需要這酷酷的東西", "created_at": "2024-12-04T12:07:12", "owner": "shengwei835", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991727025731347, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-04T10:08:44", "owner": "hejialing2012", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075223417528621, "text": "@neodan51204 @marvin.xu__", "created_at": "2024-12-04T09:56:10", "owner": "lru666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112642234429575, "text": "I love cold pizza 🍕✨", "created_at": "2024-12-04T09:03:31", "owner": "eloise_yangshuai", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18084658945536998, "text": "真的想讓你的披薩吹這些廢氣嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-04T08:53:01", "owner": "le.haka", "likes": 72}, {"id": 18051142651965473, "text": "可是我的PS5是放直的，我的披薩是不是就掉在一起了？", "created_at": "2024-12-04T08:52:17", "owner": "nanako.azusa", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17942046164925479, "text": "好的，所以哪裡可以下單🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-04T07:08:53", "owner": "emilyywliu", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18031366826155429, "text": "不是說不要把主機蓋著？ 散熱不良。。，", "created_at": "2024-12-04T06:51:20", "owner": "kakasite2", "likes": 380}, {"id": 18049252868304547, "text": "我的筆電也需要這個酷東西", "created_at": "2024-12-04T06:49:08", "owner": "real_elite_2", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17890824324132501, "text": "@qwe65423 好適合你", "created_at": "2024-12-04T05:24:43", "owner": "nini8436", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18047919527497653, "text": "@kuan_ru___", "created_at": "2024-12-04T05:24:02", "owner": "linjianan1104", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18333275233196816, "text": "@a46080704", "created_at": "2024-12-04T04:50:00", "owner": "hsiehkiki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870936649166799, "text": "以前在多倫多求學在加拿大一年有冰天雪地6個月以的時間，的確養成了「冷披薩好過癮」的怪癖🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-04T04:48:44", "owner": "jilwujil", "likes": 213}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["pizzawrmr", "pizza", "pizzahut", "ps5", "playstation", "玩家", "遊戲", "主機", "game", "3d列印", "3dprint", "design", "設計", "創意", "保溫"]},
{"media_id": 3455071757651220481, "shortcode": "C_y4XU0SRgB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_y4XU0SRgB/", "taken_at": "2024-09-11T23:17:58", "caption": "Follow me @toilettaleland for content \n\nThe A-10 Thunderbolt II, commonly known as the “Warthog,” is a close air support aircraft renowned for its durability, firepower, and effectiveness in supporting ground troops. Here are its key features:\n\nDesign and Durability:\n- Airframe: Rugged and straightforward design optimized for survivability. The airframe is built to withstand significant damage and continue flying.\n- Armor: Titanium armor encases the cockpit and critical flight systems, providing substantial protection against ground fire.\n\nArmament:\n- GAU-8/A Avenger: A 30mm hydraulically driven seven-barrel Gatling-type autocannon, the aircraft’s primary weapon, capable of firing depleted uranium armor-piercing rounds at a high rate.\n-Hardpoints: Eleven hardpoints (eight under the wings and three under the fuselage) can carry a mix of rockets, missiles (such as AGM-65 Maverick), bombs (including laser-guided and GPS-guided), and additional fuel tanks.\n\n#fypage #explore #foryou #viralvídeos #brainrot #brainrotcore", "owner_username": "toilettaleland", "owner_id": "64928415782", "likes": 627700, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0346_C_y4XU0SRgB\\C_y4XU0SRgB_20240911_231758.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18072023281705586, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-02-11T20:02:57", "owner": "el_fascio", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071624029702115, "text": "Me😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-05T20:51:40", "owner": "jeremiah_sullivan365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307408510207356, "text": "-Nimrod", "created_at": "2024-12-23T03:51:26", "owner": "y.k.w.g.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055656580943525, "text": "-Goym", "created_at": "2024-12-23T03:50:49", "owner": "y.k.w.g.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044278700271501, "text": "-Cabbage Patch", "created_at": "2024-12-23T03:50:45", "owner": "y.k.w.g.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063495280830269, "text": "I only study history to be funnier", "created_at": "2024-12-06T07:00:16", "owner": "mj_bond2009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18337158769196952, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-05T21:34:59", "owner": "ultimate_artist_z", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915199683935232, "text": "@kirk_land23 ofc u liked this 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:12:25", "owner": "politxota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045143045158940, "text": "Historu", "created_at": "2024-12-05T12:14:12", "owner": "lisa_cosc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363759547141282, "text": "@noahjurcevic this you bro", "created_at": "2024-12-04T20:55:44", "owner": "kamakazi176", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059525809872317, "text": "That’s me", "created_at": "2024-12-04T20:41:38", "owner": "panchigsantiago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064936657695317, "text": "@ccpsathletics am I right?", "created_at": "2024-12-04T18:17:02", "owner": "realnicholasconrad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021769277324292, "text": "Remind me to send this to him when I’m not mad at him anymore🙄", "created_at": "2024-12-03T23:08:24", "owner": "uhleenhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073195084717536, "text": "@kannadhasan910", "created_at": "2024-12-03T16:24:46", "owner": "imnirmal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123393676396288, "text": "N justified", "created_at": "2024-12-03T16:23:18", "owner": "_jlpacheco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031261172416069, "text": "So that's what DJ Peachcobbler does all day", "created_at": "2024-12-03T14:36:17", "owner": "ballanzeddu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059885890871400, "text": "It's not racism, mom, its historical entusiasm", "created_at": "2024-12-03T11:05:44", "owner": "carmo_ivan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036402455523670, "text": "Brick by brick , putting blood sweat and tears 😔🗣️", "created_at": "2024-12-03T04:00:44", "owner": "_alchemist710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052480207810942, "text": "Thus is devious🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-02T04:54:57", "owner": "whotiis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067624372735105, "text": "Thus is devious🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:27:12", "owner": "whotiis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949801779863958, "text": "Thus is devious🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:27:02", "owner": "whotiis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032320541133691, "text": "That one guy looking for the N word origins story", "created_at": "2024-12-01T20:21:50", "owner": "altingglenn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17940423536928454, "text": "It's even too easy man. It is always the same thing at base, no need to stress", "created_at": "2024-12-01T12:06:37", "owner": "owiz0ochai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056623417920168, "text": "Litteraly me in history uni", "created_at": "2024-12-01T09:57:17", "owner": "_noah_lau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050713544014586, "text": "there's a wikipedia page for all the racial slurs, very helpful", "created_at": "2024-12-01T05:35:01", "owner": "aarinx007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145528105347479, "text": "connan obrian be like:", "created_at": "2024-12-01T03:50:23", "owner": "goodfnd2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064368895765673, "text": "Battle pass", "created_at": "2024-12-01T01:39:02", "owner": "iryzbas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330411808154909, "text": "The American education system in 2025", "created_at": "2024-11-30T14:14:15", "owner": "flexyjoey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058742797724595, "text": "Literally Me", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:23:12", "owner": "andiraja245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365923585118947, "text": "The only reason why I majored in history", "created_at": "2024-11-30T05:58:42", "owner": "maxordo22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042422564178184, "text": "evropa: the last battle", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:53:10", "owner": "a.k_irving", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904149684984430, "text": "Can everyone share a little bit with me here?", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:04:00", "owner": "_groovyfeelin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924649956888966, "text": "Ohh, I am not alone then 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-29T22:15:01", "owner": "absolutely_abinash", "likes": 0},