{"media_id": 3481698628223565916, "shortcode": "DBRenSeOwBc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBRenSeOwBc/", "taken_at": "2024-10-18T17:00:00", "caption": "JOSEPHINE BAKER - Part 3\n\nJosephine Baker’s personal seal is going to auction next week having been in our family’s collection for many years. \n\nIn part 2 of this mini series we explored the life of the iconic owner of this seal, the impact she made on cultural issues during her lifetime and the cult symbol she’s become after death. In Part 3, we discuss her legacy, and why someone might be drawn to an object like this. \n\nThe craftsmanship of this piece is exceptional and we are delighted to offer this piece with @lyonandturnbull , as part of their upcoming Jewellery sale on 23rd October @sarah_j_duncan \n\nHead to their website to browse and bid. \n\n#josephinebaker #onlineauction #lyonandturnbull #antiqueseal #antiquejewellery #socialhistory", "owner_username": "sigillumseals", "owner_id": "3171947779", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0349_DBRenSeOwBc\\DBRenSeOwBc_20241018_170000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17854797978493139, "text": "i want ! ❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-08-04T19:53:02", "owner": "josephine_baker_e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986673627821370, "text": "My hubby sent me this video 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-23T12:47:13", "owner": "kawenagarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098571160500903, "text": "@laurenkimripley", "created_at": "2025-05-28T13:43:53", "owner": "rakshithreddyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863345017402508, "text": "She sealed the back entrance", "created_at": "2025-05-21T01:13:28", "owner": "eljali4nian", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078220612689369, "text": "Brother", "created_at": "2025-04-16T16:10:45", "owner": "abcd243j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888669577236605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-16T06:39:27", "owner": "beppi5737", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078172300785016, "text": "Brick by brick 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-04-15T14:18:08", "owner": "w_____out", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044175230388611, "text": "Oooooh so that‘s for sealing envelopes and not…?! Ok got it…", "created_at": "2025-04-15T12:52:03", "owner": "lil_woody.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051348941034769, "text": "i like it for a different reason but i respect yours", "created_at": "2025-04-15T10:30:01", "owner": "joebidenhater69420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063915707489007, "text": "My mind is far too tainted for this😂. I bet it did seal things quite well😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-15T10:15:39", "owner": "1the_lost_one1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072340024807709, "text": "i am not dirty minded i am not dirty minded i am not dirty minded i am not dirty minded i am not dirty minded", "created_at": "2025-04-15T02:26:09", "owner": "francinecooley19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843564007454110, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-14T20:42:47", "owner": "icesick90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877361488200564, "text": "She was quite the Force STAMPING and writing ALL night some times. Very intimate nature of the VERY PERSONAL item her personal stamp. Found in her sock drawer...Never Washed.", "created_at": "2025-04-14T20:41:53", "owner": "icesick90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061192973054426, "text": "I like the intimate nature of it too", "created_at": "2025-04-14T11:47:44", "owner": "deanbimm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997575021788019, "text": "Uhuh", "created_at": "2025-04-14T00:17:11", "owner": "skulbrekr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164225767338082, "text": "She did know everybody didn't she 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-14T00:10:01", "owner": "adamjl204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845433706454970, "text": "The ambulance guy says yes", "created_at": "2025-04-13T23:50:38", "owner": "5582andrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947601975832742, "text": "Is this a  joke? 🍑", "created_at": "2025-04-13T03:27:34", "owner": "patrollerdan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881233537274906, "text": "Ladies, gentlemen. Hear me out. Get you one with either your name or HIS name in it. So you can claim what’s yours😂", "created_at": "2025-04-12T13:33:45", "owner": "tiffanygoglin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113586733476395, "text": "👀", "created_at": "2025-04-12T13:32:45", "owner": "tiffanygoglin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103290598506848, "text": "they know damn well what they’re doing😂", "created_at": "2025-04-12T06:41:35", "owner": "02_t.roy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491621122047727, "text": "What the plug!?", "created_at": "2025-04-12T06:28:24", "owner": "ewosauce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114757366461160, "text": "I think she carried it with(in) her all the time. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-11T23:22:08", "owner": "x17eep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894512257198005, "text": "A very interesting \"seal\"", "created_at": "2025-04-11T22:19:40", "owner": "jeffwo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890894809214815, "text": "She probably squatted to seal her letters", "created_at": "2025-04-11T18:53:20", "owner": "noah120511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887863564238948, "text": "sigh...open the comments", "created_at": "2025-04-11T15:36:09", "owner": "_lilldonut_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061033043115032, "text": "She just sits on the letter to seal it", "created_at": "2025-04-11T00:40:32", "owner": "unworthylife0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355533214178204, "text": "What exactly was she sealing 🙈", "created_at": "2025-04-10T23:07:47", "owner": "idabadre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844960027453949, "text": "Oh", "created_at": "2025-04-10T18:32:47", "owner": "mattewlevario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077645224624542, "text": "Very intimate", "created_at": "2025-04-10T17:55:52", "owner": "hardestouttherenodoubt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160112509346230, "text": "This reached the wrong audience", "created_at": "2025-04-10T15:20:00", "owner": "milothedog6741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059541344106325, "text": "I don't think you want to touch that", "created_at": "2025-04-10T13:07:53", "owner": "cedricshort_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129660796414843, "text": "The EMT guy is on his way to shame all of us again....