he comments wouldn't disappoint 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-04-08T17:00:18", "owner": "dr3add_ang3l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012041168708448, "text": "@arnav_anand21110", "created_at": "2025-04-08T16:24:23", "owner": "arnavsikka1234567890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966555336889383, "text": "AYYYYOOO THATS A BUTT PLUG", "created_at": "2025-04-08T09:09:22", "owner": "legendarylavy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874043296318236, "text": "Thought they were gonna show someone sitting on the letter to seal it", "created_at": "2025-04-08T07:18:36", "owner": "jerryfinglefom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089784757595532, "text": "34k in comments hahaha", "created_at": "2025-04-08T05:28:06", "owner": "darrendean640", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520751902030488, "text": "They know what there doing", "created_at": "2025-04-08T00:45:57", "owner": "e123134455544", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029798771355620, "text": "I know,You know,we all know👀😂", "created_at": "2025-04-07T19:12:39", "owner": "rares2.0_beleaua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295803985168814, "text": "Yes of course I did not see a bu*t plug", "created_at": "2025-04-07T17:49:03", "owner": "bigredred2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346628998159090, "text": "Ho no, i forgot the seal on my chair again!", "created_at": "2025-04-07T17:40:48", "owner": "littleloki665", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053702582180033, "text": "Why do women love anal 😭", "created_at": "2025-04-07T01:38:48", "owner": "john____turner____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849713680435899, "text": "Sending it turd class post", "created_at": "2025-04-06T19:20:11", "owner": "ongarhoney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113187289461729, "text": "@emtbadge502  you gotta get eyes on this one", "created_at": "2025-04-06T17:28:09", "owner": "dundee_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149874844369154, "text": "Butt plug.", "created_at": "2025-04-06T15:53:45", "owner": "the_new_wabi_sabi_san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053837285216553, "text": "Is that not a butt plug?", "created_at": "2025-04-06T15:13:56", "owner": "_oni", "likes": 0}