19109321588, "text": "Bet she found away to carry it around discreetly", "created_at": "2025-04-01T20:37:08", "owner": "almost_missed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918570520064932, "text": "Oh howd that get there 😮  lol she did know everyone 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-01T18:22:00", "owner": "emanon_1833_1931_1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137872702387625, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-01T16:16:55", "owner": "ahmed.taaim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862536205373991, "text": "Ya, it definitely sealed something alright", "created_at": "2025-04-01T10:58:42", "owner": "mcmoisty_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109202428489075, "text": "ohhhh letters 😳 i thoug.. nvm", "created_at": "2025-04-01T05:07:17", "owner": "wic_boyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059097725095430, "text": "So she just sat on it", "created_at": "2025-04-01T01:02:19", "owner": "blvkvvool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094617511539664, "text": "Where is @emtbadge502 where we need him?", "created_at": "2025-03-31T20:56:20", "owner": "sammy_torc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059246146897063, "text": "Hol up, wait a minute...", "created_at": "2025-03-31T20:19:53", "owner": "frankalexscott_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046601672522635, "text": "They don't know lol", "created_at": "2025-03-31T16:39:04", "owner": "real_hanzo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088537165606173, "text": "Ummm 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-31T16:38:53", "owner": "real_hanzo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935043997006249, "text": "Yeah man.. She took it everywhere.", "created_at": "2025-03-31T15:13:57", "owner": "lewbob__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867839113346158, "text": "Can I smell it", "created_at": "2025-03-31T07:50:33", "owner": "antoniotrappan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858887074329553, "text": "When they said \"seal\" i thought what a savy word for plug button--->", "created_at": "2025-03-31T06:59:37", "owner": "dodamage2018", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026604146414171, "text": "On her desk eh? Something was sealed alright...", "created_at": "2025-03-31T05:09:35", "owner": "davidkolinski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026103569407397, "text": "I ran, sprinted, and raced to the comments 😭", "created_at": "2025-03-31T04:46:53", "owner": "ale.x_drei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382250134137563, "text": "Safe to say i was not the correct audience for this post lol", "created_at": "2025-03-31T03:15:00", "owner": "ck.thom2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045527765590629, "text": "She puts the junk on junk mail lol 🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-31T03:14:41", "owner": "wyteboidave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030936770646012, "text": "Underrated reel", "created_at": "2025-03-31T02:53:03", "owner": "gerbigulous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988421478797451, "text": "That’s a toy", "created_at": "2025-03-31T01:35:48", "owner": "letmechagemyuser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18503010721056010, "text": "If she didn’t feel like taking it out would she just sit on the letter???", "created_at": "2025-03-31T00:28:49", "owner": "liam.hendrie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902983501110642, "text": "You sure u want to be holding that... was it at least washed", "created_at": "2025-03-30T23:32:02", "owner": "erix_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166136662336726, "text": "🔌👀", "created_at": "2025-03-30T23:24:06", "owner": "brendansmith475", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042958637147849, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-30T19:47:35", "owner": "motownzig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031490036644316, "text": "🤨", "created_at": "2025-03-30T18:17:18", "owner": "zeitgeist.7.7553608", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078380959662973, "text": "Multi-use.", "created_at": "2025-03-30T16:10:19", "owner": "unwantednews", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097214902535441, "text": "Intimate nature you say?", "created_at": "2025-03-30T16:04:15", "owner": "admiral.snakbar", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["josephinebaker", "onlineauction", "lyonandturnbull", "antiqueseal", "antiquejewellery", "socialhistory"]},
{"media_id": 3513771101094493159, "shortcode": "DDDbDMexTvn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDDbDMexTvn/", "taken_at": "2024-12-01T23:03:00", "caption": "😅", "owner_username": "buzzplusofficial", "owner_id": "3978573136", "likes": 69265, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0350_DDDbDMexTvn\\DDDbDMexTvn_20241201_230300.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17877222885250834, "text": "the", "created_at": "2025-02-04T23:35:49", "owner": "joejosie92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059591164746059, "text": ":>", "created_at": "2025-01-06T02:24:13", "owner": "c80_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961635654722567, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T11:35:25", "owner": "_reese.xx._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032201192582785, "text": "despacito spider", "created_at": "2024-12-14T17:27:55", "owner": "literally.n0t.here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076210411530794, "text": "I thought it was highlighters 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-11T00:14:22", "owner": "charlottie_pie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18469488121033495, "text": "Where’s the music people at to get the joke?", "created_at": "2024-12-09T18:57:36", "owner": "mads.cockrum", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18040974653214608, "text": "Pack it up guys _dreapink_ doesn’t think it’s funny", "created_at": "2024-12-09T12:20:55", "owner": "leena_or_something", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025199360568917, "text": "Notice how it’s the face from the ROLBOX despacito spider", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:43:49", "owner": "horseless.headless.headtaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076045480550046, "text": "It works lol", "created_at": "2024-12-08T21:39:18", "owner": "kingfrogs_revenge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894434995078153, "text": "this isnt..funny?", "created_at": "2024-12-08T20:13:32", "owner": "myriepoohh", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18043848203140370, "text": "This made me so happy. Top tier humor", "created_at": "2024-12-08T20:03:41", "owner": "tiff_is_a_weirdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998481558541005, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T14:30:22", "owner": "mc.kenzie7265", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054656476780441, "text": "i don’t get it. can someone explain?", "created_at": "2024-12-07T21:31:56", "owner": "_eviecatalano", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18031039730582224, "text": "Lmao who wants to be grumpy", "created_at": "2024-12-07T18:21:47", "owner": "lora_coggins1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068607367680564, "text": "That's the face from Roblox", "created_at": "2024-12-07T17:33:45", "owner": "siralex_milk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366716212136750, "text": "Ah yes I’m feeling a little Despacito today I guess", "created_at": "2024-12-07T17:33:37", "owner": "jaidenmckinleyy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17871241224252231, "text": "This meme is so 2018-2019 it makes me nostalgic", "created_at": "2024-12-07T15:39:18", "owner": "looney.lei", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17848501416359907, "text": "Well i never knew that the Song got updated😂🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-07T12:06:02", "owner": "blxcksoul.hh187", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17873981148147850, "text": "Jeff Buckley reference", "created_at": "2024-12-07T10:50:53", "owner": "l0stinthepurplehaze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037384301340364, "text": "@meridyth.d", "created_at": "2024-12-07T02:25:22", "owner": "e.mmamacdonald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887148766151679, "text": "Now this just pissed me off because how does it make any sense at all", "created_at": "2024-12-07T01:04:11", "owner": "_lennykkravitz_", "likes": 255}, {"id": 18052191487831990, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-07T00:05:49", "owner": "samcpat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077011216596032, "text": "Is this supposed to sound like \"the baffled king composing hallelujah\"???? 🤔 No", "created_at": "2024-12-06T22:44:56", "owner": "andysininsta", "likes": 55}, {"id": 17845644102348832, "text": "It's a cold and it's a broken despacito", "created_at": "2024-12-06T20:51:17", "owner": "frenchbagguete", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18149044087354190, "text": "“I am a shape!“", "created_at": "2024-12-06T14:32:43", "owner": "julia.me07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080025526561197, "text": "I see the Figures from the TV Show \"Mister maker\"", "created_at": "2024-12-05T23:57:35", "owner": "knocked.gooose", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18021258233337135, "text": "J", "created_at": "2024-12-05T22:00:21", "owner": "huli__juli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018321164345315, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-05T20:16:33", "owner": "hihowru_imalba_hehe", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18008393669503699, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-05T20:13:45", "owner": "aether_tenebris", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17914851476995909, "text": "Don’t ruin a good song with an npc post", "created_at": "2024-12-05T14:46:25", "owner": "adamperssn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18060052894850376, "text": "Enseguida se lo mandamos…", "created_at": "2024-12-05T12:42:49", "owner": "r0drig0_martin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18044855942281515, "text": "I'd like one despacito pls", "created_at": "2024-12-05T12:27:34", "owner": "waitwhossarah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067833241673294, "text": "I don't get the \"joke\". I get uou're supposed to sing the Hallellujah tune, but... It's not funny?", "created_at": "2024-12-05T10:04:45", "owner": "_dreapink_", "likes": 467}, {"id": 18206416321294100, "text": "Wait, what flavor is Despacito?", "created_at": "2024-12-05T06:04:56", "owner": "keven_carranza1234", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18083092366559476, "text": "keroppi??", "created_at": "2024-12-05T05:39:41", "owner": "chaotically_courtney", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18050951701989923, "text": "@sam_dudley4 hahahh this is you 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-05T02:57:17", "owner": "allison_wagoner03", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107240386450521, "text": "Leftygun plays verse on kendricks new shit", "created_at": "2024-12-05T01:25:58", "owner": "suburbanwaste", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17882054517183744, "text": "i don't get it", "created_at": "2024-12-05T00:01:49", "owner": "beth.419", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040279289469543, "text": "@__.tamanna", "created_at": "2024-12-04T22:46:19", "owner": "fardinahmed313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051739084988650, "text": "Yes I am desperado", "created_at": "2024-12-04T21:02:56", "owner": "canberkmursalli", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059239045882637, "text": "Not funny button ——>", "created_at": "2024-12-04T20:14:06", "owner": "cathair.everywhere", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18004094297695921, "text": "I read despacito as decapicito😭", "created_at": "2024-12-04T19:25:36", "owner": "le_plague_69", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18149695945344400, "text": "I’m lost", "created_at": "2024-12-04T17:23:55", "owner": "da_frison", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18071743003566058, "text": "Why did I start reading this as if it were a rap I was like \"I know this rap why can't I place it\" them realized", "created_at": "2024-12-04T14:33:10", "owner": "midoriyables", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18078825538584641, "text": "Slowly?", "created_at": "2024-12-04T03:43:56", "owner": "kyla_2665", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18066523837687225, "text": "Tired, happy, grumpy, and... Slowly?", "created_at": "2024-12-03T23:49:19", "owner": "angry_depressed_potato", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18051483670960802, "text": "What are these things", "created_at": "2024-12-03T22:29:01", "owner": "goodnoodle.co", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17881218357186822, "text": "i think it's criminal that we forgot about this banger so quickly", "created_at": "2024-12-03T22:25:04", "owner": "smolufairy", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18041400542225300, "text": "THESE ARE ACTUALLY SO GOOD THOUGH", "created_at": "2024-12-03T22:07:05", "owner": "smashworthed", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18051942685988357, "text": "I thought this was Hallelujah😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T19:34:07", "owner": "j.a.m.i.e_", "likes": 1430}, {"id": 18053604502986008, "text": "Those chocolate bars are really good, by the way", "created_at": "2024-12-03T18:34:25", "owner": "404_unknown_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17925844232994978, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T15:05:07", "owner": "shesumpimpin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083726512554510, "text": "2017 ahh meme", "created_at": "2024-12-03T08:56:23", "owner": "lauritalvi", "likes": 77}, {"id": 17928351854978798, "text": "it’s despacito spider right…?", "created_at": "2024-12-03T07:58:54", "owner": "little.man.9664", "likes": 278}, {"id": 18360307177143889, "text": "😂 now thats some good marketing 👌", "created_at": "2024-12-03T06:49:43", "owner": "_may_m1", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18067988245663295, "text": "I hate that this does it for me. This is my humor 😭😭😂", "created_at": "2024-12-03T01:55:25", "owner": "camu.palma", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17929171115867435, "text": "Ah yes, the seven dwarfs, happy, tired, grumpy, slowly,", "created_at": "2024-12-02T21:49:08", "owner": "_berrypatch_", "likes": 558}, {"id": 18351587203127792, "text": "Hahahahaha HOW do people come up with this stuff 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:01:09", "owner": "mirthezien", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18207581506290360, "text": "Despacito.... Despacito....", "created_at": "2024-12-02T03:11:58", "owner": "vi_the_almost_artist", "likes": 1947}, {"id": 18031018745381979, "text": "No", "created_at": "2024-12-01T23:35:48", "owner": "charlie_k16", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18073987768627041, "text": "@_wozwald grumpy", "created_at": "2024-12-08T04:10:44", "owner": "8y.yi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062701561817706, "text": "THAT FUCKIN SPIDER THAT I LOVE", "created_at": "2024-12-06T22:16:58", "owner": "rottenr0tten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889627498135987, "text": "Despacito face looks like a roblox face", "created_at": "2024-12-06T11:43:56", "owner": "all_usernames_were_took", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18276152905220395, "text": "the four genders", "created_at": "2024-12-05T23:22:27", "owner": "sailrpluto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994729311565659, "text": "between the last time I thought of despacito spider and now, an entire generation of children was born and now knows how to read and write, fuck my life", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:49:29", "owner": "jackson.conwayy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17943566885919085, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-04T23:37:31", "owner": "jeremych00", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861469834295518, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-03T20:03:18", "owner": "mnt_lion", "likes": 57}, {"id": 18473755084059527, "text": "Depecato", "created_at": "2024-12-03T03:22:03", "owner": "miggi.jpeg", "likes": 5}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3516487598843722994, "shortcode": "DDNEtcKJXzy", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDNEtcKJXzy/", "taken_at": "2024-12-05T17:00:59", "caption": "Final exam season tip: blame the furniture for my F\n\n#engineering #physics #math  #thepotentialdropout  #mathematics  #engineeringmemes #physicsmemes #mathmemes #mechanicalengineering #aerospaceengineering #fluiddynamics #thermodynamics #dynamics #quantumphysics #civilengineering #chemicalengineering #electricalengineering #mcgill #memes #student #engineeringstudent #university #uni #college #3dprinting #engineeringprojects #cheatsheet #cribsheet", "owner_username": "the.potential.dropout", "owner_id": "39517546160", "likes": 162692, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0351_DDNEtcKJXzy\\DDNEtcKJXzy_20241205_170059.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18023705186622176, "text": "Losing my heavens mandate because my shitass roomate moved the chair to the North side", "created_at": "2024-12-06T06:46:17", "owner": "niggrajtopiman", "likes": 2938}, {"id": 18074357342327099, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:06:02", "owner": "mr._.trashboat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081217732515894, "text": "I'm sorry is that mazo", "created_at": "2024-12-23T18:17:58", "owner": "elenaaator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100324213429809, "text": "Not him ..", "created_at": "2024-12-21T15:13:53", "owner": "john_golis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869742046183013, "text": "\"Be a man\"", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:52:24", "owner": "beevilxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046215280940946, "text": "I blame the beasts", "created_at": "2024-12-18T22:10:33", "owner": "s30plz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020934791635566, "text": "Not quite feng shui but this was literally me last week when I wondered if the upside down lock on our front door that’s been that way since before I was born is the reason my family is so batshit crazy", "created_at": "2024-12-17T17:54:24", "owner": "meleishaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336187756150967, "text": "\"This room has bad feng shui, the electric chair clearly needs to be facing west.\"", "created_at": "2024-12-17T16:31:55", "owner": "romankas_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17953636385891294, "text": "How to learn,", "created_at": "2024-12-17T12:12:13", "owner": "kavanuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364994992189826, "text": "🗣️🗣️🗣️ΕΞΆΓΟΥΜΕ ΠΟΛΙΤΙΣΜΌ ΜΑΖΩΧΑΚΗΣ ΙΝΤΕΡΝΑΣΙΟΝΑΛ ΜΙΜ 🤼‍♂️🇬🇷🇬🇷🇬🇷🏺🏺🏺🏺 ΜΑ ΕΧΩΩΩΩ ΑΔΙΑΒΡΟΧΗΗΗ ΚΑΡΔΙΑΑΑΑ ΠΟΥ Μ ΑΝΕΒΑΑΑΖΕΙΙΙΙ", "created_at": "2024-12-16T22:23:21", "owner": "mpyraths", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18289702540215080, "text": "I literally just made a joke about this and now it comes on my Instagram..", "created_at": "2024-12-16T22:08:43", "owner": "sana._.mp3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843403804384117, "text": "Does this mean I get a chance to rearrange", "created_at": "2024-12-16T20:49:49", "owner": "shifadish", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17914296597043808, "text": "you know what… at this point, it might be", "created_at": "2024-12-15T22:31:10", "owner": "gabrielle__j", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17912833452025610, "text": "Why is Giorgos Mazonakis here😭😭", "created_at": "2024-12-15T20:01:39", "owner": "vahe.t26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070484314655818, "text": "Learn astrology and blame the planets", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:12:23", "owner": "leevinajini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292171237215617, "text": "OMG NOT THE PHOTO BEING A GREEK SINGER CALLED Giwrgos Mazonakis 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T11:57:02", "owner": "nicky93__", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17874718518146634, "text": "Literally my Vietnamese mom", "created_at": "2024-12-15T01:47:28", "owner": "thy.only", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059541850881370, "text": "ο μαζωνακης τι κάνει εκεί?", "created_at": "2024-12-14T18:32:37", "owner": "button.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028945004615437, "text": "Cup of Solid Gold 🫅", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:44:24", "owner": "gibran_pref", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033041297158422, "text": "@dearmodern", "created_at": "2024-12-13T09:56:04", "owner": "onetruebabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071906269650366, "text": "but i cant mate it with it can it", "created_at": "2024-12-13T06:15:43", "owner": "darthfalka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015847829418671, "text": "Nah what is mazonakis doing here", "created_at": "2024-12-12T20:50:24", "owner": "justeliza101", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18174244093311907, "text": "Study architecture and blame the architects", "created_at": "2024-12-12T16:00:20", "owner": "m._nusp._m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029013242416195, "text": "Mister Mazonakis what are you doing on my feed", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:54:10", "owner": "kiwinilla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986125701765365, "text": "Whenever I hear feng shui that's asian man with interior design pops in my head from yt shorts", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:26:27", "owner": "1gauravbhosale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051640469071545, "text": "The hell is mazonakis doing here", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:36:11", "owner": "tasos_trig", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18046057408907437, "text": "Someone tag that feng shui guy", "created_at": "2024-12-11T14:38:03", "owner": "audrey_avec_un_y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084985450544273, "text": "O mazwnakis", "created_at": "2024-12-09T21:21:56", "owner": "michail.sapkas", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18028229513577010, "text": "Τι κάνει ο Μαζωνάκης 💀💀🇬🇷🇬🇷🇬🇷🔊🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️‼️‼️‼️☦️☦️", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:00:00", "owner": "_malachias_", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18006684857509882, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-08T22:23:02", "owner": "heyiaokay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051941158950059, "text": "Learn the astrology so you know which planet season to blame", "created_at": "2024-12-08T10:52:40", "owner": "yimongomel", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17975290799657046, "text": "*Me breaks a leg*: \"Ahhh its because my bed is not rightly positioned", "created_at": "2024-12-08T08:08:22", "owner": "sim.salzmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18478560772045777, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-08T07:31:53", "owner": "amordedaisy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018554996345915, "text": "in india thats called vastu and i blame everything on vastu all the time🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-08T06:10:42", "owner": "w0rmfor3stry", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17929739294974674, "text": "Learn astrology and blame the furry a metro made 🤬🥲😩💦", "created_at": "2024-12-08T01:09:55", "owner": "just4_you_babes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061600786884853, "text": "i thought this was dan marino", "created_at": "2024-12-07T21:52:08", "owner": "frank.alexander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034644071104911, "text": "Why did I get Mazonakis jumpscare on an international meme", "created_at": "2024-12-07T20:01:10", "owner": "jimmy.tsaparas", "likes": 136}, {"id": 17853784746341860, "text": "bro could not find the crop 😭😭", "created_at": "2024-12-07T20:00:23", "owner": "talha_aden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999771708533460, "text": "Im ready", "created_at": "2024-12-07T19:13:24", "owner": "ulisesbernalv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866982178265469, "text": "A girl refused to sleep in my house because my bed faced the door", "created_at": "2024-12-07T19:00:34", "owner": "popa_raccoon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030349859525501, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-07T18:57:50", "owner": "ah.killah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149207404354666, "text": "Feng Shui is such hilarious bs. It is litterally the art of BLAMING furniture. Anything but accountability huh?", "created_at": "2024-12-07T18:44:09", "owner": "shardpophisdarkrot9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076531390609911, "text": "When her head is so fire she’s giving me 100 schools of thought", "created_at": "2024-12-07T16:24:06", "owner": "augustwhite787", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18008384750673690, "text": "@bbreadyy @phongwanlingg", "created_at": "2024-12-07T15:29:58", "owner": "damm_damian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884357893175358, "text": "Is that Mazonakis?", "created_at": "2024-12-07T14:47:06", "owner": "giorgos_latos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940651557808314, "text": "🎅", "created_at": "2024-12-07T13:50:57", "owner": "ozza.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472846282020316, "text": "ΜΑΖΟΝΑΚΗΣ", "created_at": "2024-12-07T11:34:25", "owner": "aggelos.tdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098598088489758, "text": "You guys, my professor on humanities/philosophy was like \"yeah being a professor doesn't earn you as much as you think, so... If you guys need a feng shui rearrangement *pulls out Chinese compass* you know who to get\" 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-07T06:42:53", "owner": "drunk.black.kitten", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084689041547935, "text": "That’s how you spell fungshwa??", "created_at": "2024-12-07T03:36:45", "owner": "nate.soup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039817460337983, "text": "✍️✍️✍️✍️", "created_at": "2024-12-07T00:27:31", "owner": "g33drah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049083592890921, "text": "Makes sense", "created_at": "2024-12-07T00:08:34", "owner": "strangefbdatingfinds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032815196373481, "text": "Learn astrology blame the planets", "created_at": "2024-12-06T23:43:29", "owner": "mequizte500", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948158001904898, "text": "Feng shui is actually the only universal constant.", "created_at": "2024-12-06T21:50:34", "owner": "zachdfishman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18050032886069539, "text": "Γιατι ειναι εδω ο μαζωνακης", "created_at": "2024-12-06T21:20:44", "owner": "rhysboflavin", "likes": 290}, {"id": 17914731321033659, "text": "Mazonakis moment", "created_at": "2024-12-06T21:20:40", "owner": "paminos.sym", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18049444580482693, "text": "Maybe the random piles of crap in my room is whats giving me depression. It really kills the vibes", "created_at": "2024-12-06T21:14:52", "owner": "norseprivate", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18050491060841244, "text": "Μαζωνάκης core", "created_at": "2024-12-06T20:39:39", "owner": "sivridisgeorge", "likes": 149}, {"id": 18087774712468354, "text": "💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2024-12-06T20:32:30", "owner": "dekriesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868691956254328, "text": "Sometimes it DO BE the furniture though like every time I set a guest up in my bedroom and their head is too close to the door they report nightmares in the morning and I have to apologise for the bad Feng Shui, I've started warning people", "created_at": "2024-12-06T19:47:37", "owner": "a4ndyi", "likes": 78}, {"id": 17934552422838604, "text": "yeah", "created_at": "2024-12-06T17:19:18", "owner": "shwrkbites", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051620801054100, "text": "Can someone explain this meme to me?", "created_at": "2024-12-06T17:01:06", "owner": "whistleblower.edits", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043518632325189, "text": "Wtf is Mazonakis doing here????", "created_at": "2024-12-06T16:09:39", "owner": "markouknst", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18277485532216639, "text": "I stumbled into class 10 minutes late, didn’t know final was this week, panic attack, locked in, finished in 8 minutes and got an 82 😎", "created_at": "2024-12-06T14:45:49", "owner": "niyonjuushi", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17986374320767441, "text": "Word.", "created_at": "2024-12-06T13:08:45", "owner": "qiemco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852434044345105, "text": "@llama_llama_sans", "created_at": "2024-12-06T09:30:35", "owner": "delicious.kale.salad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18491847511015243, "text": "Imagine having a meeting in the dining room with a bunch of people and someone gets a chair from the kitchen. 😳", "created_at": "2024-12-06T07:10:39", "owner": "mechanix_nate", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080442871562440, "text": "MAZONAKIS MENTIONED 🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-06T06:27:05", "owner": "nicklaskaridis", "likes": 262}, {"id": 18043873547272913, "text": "there's actually a zack & cody's episode about this 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-06T05:19:07", "owner": "nlyttobioz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173442097313799, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2024-12-06T04:44:24", "owner": "pureyeoja", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009524294668116, "text": "Remember guys, they wouldn't do it for hundreds of years if it didn't work. Anyway do you mind drilling into my skull? I've got the flu", "created_at": "2024-12-06T02:15:15", "owner": "jamdp17", "likes": 109}, {"id": 18048598397317856, "text": "Its the god dam alignment of my rent", "created_at": "2024-12-06T01:37:48", "owner": "irlwerwolf", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18061714957865962, "text": "Greek Till Lindemann RAHHHHHH 🇬🇷🏺🦉🏛️", "created_at": "2024-12-05T23:31:08", "owner": "il_spath", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18060486979704385, "text": "Feng shui son or astrology daughter", "created_at": "2024-12-05T22:47:07", "owner": "calebsheets_s13", "likes": 1220}, {"id": 18246696829302597, "text": "I thought this said \"learn feng shui and become furniture\" and I agreed", "created_at": "2024-12-05T22:35:24", "owner": "mic_vigil", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18053210761811432, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-05T22:08:30", "owner": "greg.flores10", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17867059629257062, "text": "Mazonakis mentioned 🗣️🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-05T19:32:31", "owner": "giannakaki_", "likes": 188}, {"id": 18015368087423808, "text": "mazonakis jumpscare", "created_at": "2024-12-05T19:16:51", "owner": "silly_evdokia", "likes": 231}, {"id": 17879423838192944, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-05T18:28:15", "owner": "raphix2", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18060953698870750, "text": "Wtf is mazonakis doing in this post", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:53:41", "owner": "_penelope_pls", "likes": 117}, {"id": 18171733117313022, "text": "No western facing door, room is now ominous", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:20:06", "owner": "hamza.tau", "likes": 311}, {"id": 17874728247226485, "text": "This is so true", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:11:47", "owner": "harithnidal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066418168706712, "text": "you can see the feng shui if you hot box the room", "created_at": "2024-12-05T17:08:49", "owner": "san.chay", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18040774076204736, "text": "This is the best song ever spited out by hairless monkeys high on shrooms ever", "created_at": "2025-01-02T05:26:47", "owner": "yhuresobreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860475112316244, "text": "You telling me that this whole time niggas weren’t talking about funk sway (but pronounced goofy like “Schway?”)", "created_at": "2024-12-23T18:08:49", "owner": "squidallydoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053315638983136, "text": "Banish him ass to the infinite ikea", "created_at": "2024-12-17T22:55:36", "owner": "zkie2238584939", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338421991147320, "text": "@nandika_chadha fenggg shuiiiiiii 😋😋", "created_at": "2024-12-16T04:56:08", "owner": "adrika.saha_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078014671598808, "text": "me asf", "created_at": "2024-12-13T22:40:12", "owner": "fexgli_yin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047954288283599, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-13T14:03:43", "owner": "eratadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079390756524223, "text": "I am telling you the Chinese Had everything figured Out \"Art of War\" while \"Basic\" was litteraly Just a step by step Instruction for Nobles that never saw a horse how to do the basics of war, have good resource Connections, Feed men an horse blablabla, you Take three Kingdoms and what was an important lesson for Lu Bu \"Even Heroes have a weakness for the Charms of a beautiful woman\" Imagine telling a foolish Chinese noble to Not Take any pretty Woman With him insanity", "created_at": "2024-12-13T06:32:56", "owner": "biiennkaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996974475710125, "text": "I cant believe ī literally made scenarios like im im sleeping on the right side of the bed it’s gonna be a bad day and shits like this. I had that quite for a while when i was a kid and nobody even told me about this", "created_at": "2024-12-12T17:26:05", "owner": "_brosk.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036398336353394, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-07T22:25:56", "owner": "ultra.son.vegito", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18369388495116459, "text": "Obtain schizophrenia and blame the gangstalkers", "created_at": "2024-12-06T17:22:13", "owner": "elliar.co.uk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18039524129032289, "text": "I’m shitting fire right now", "created_at": "2024-12-06T15:14:20", "owner": "bouty_