een", "created_at": "2025-06-02T21:45:28", "owner": "husamalali1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914166319014133, "text": "is this a car or a plane 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-02T06:17:48", "owner": "pranav.jayaraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985196313680908, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-31T15:45:33", "owner": "jjjjabran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383119534191946, "text": "This happens when upper management is pushing features only to meet the deadline", "created_at": "2025-05-27T22:34:32", "owner": "jotoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314100820235074, "text": "If product was physical", "created_at": "2025-05-26T20:16:44", "owner": "amin.ab.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035540132647346, "text": "Technology", "created_at": "2025-05-26T17:32:36", "owner": "wc_wlc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906007717171692, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-24T17:22:29", "owner": "den.ften", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061919456322916, "text": "So many bugs (features)", "created_at": "2025-05-23T15:27:18", "owner": "sharan.31_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047890931383339, "text": "Well, it seems road worthy 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-23T15:01:15", "owner": "cheebuilds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277525435248946, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-05-23T15:00:57", "owner": "cheebuilds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078122449871934, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-23T13:07:14", "owner": "ookli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094766527517136, "text": "This looks too weirdly  familiar,", "created_at": "2025-05-22T15:34:58", "owner": "justinecodez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055450895259823, "text": "🙄🤣scrty driver", "created_at": "2025-05-22T06:32:53", "owner": "niong88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951944784826569, "text": "拼好车", "created_at": "2025-05-22T06:02:59", "owner": "sky_devourer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118919620414651, "text": "And the dash lit up", "created_at": "2025-05-21T11:39:53", "owner": "suvwe_dev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086568337652600, "text": "Technologia 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-21T04:32:18", "owner": "victor_mazeli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931916632044632, "text": "Just need an architect to make it “modern”", "created_at": "2025-05-20T22:07:08", "owner": "tolisgoodys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871935481264883, "text": "Si vende la cerradura electronica.. se compra uno nuevo 0km😂", "created_at": "2025-05-20T21:34:18", "owner": "favioleyva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158785381362798, "text": "To steal this, one  needs a mechanic, an exorcist, and a tech support team.", "created_at": "2025-05-20T15:51:24", "owner": "jyothiswardodda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004916666768771, "text": "The wipers killed me at the end 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-05-17T13:53:06", "owner": "ronyguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030083297412543, "text": "When you love your car too much and customize it accordingly 😂", "created_at": "2025-05-17T02:16:37", "owner": "melophile04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892002316237283, "text": "Thats some high tech there", "created_at": "2025-05-17T01:50:07", "owner": "kforkarim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002337548775593, "text": "If it works, let it be. Functionality over form😂", "created_at": "2025-05-16T16:21:10", "owner": "megaone_webservices", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084532030649392, "text": "Technologia 😅", "created_at": "2025-05-16T09:21:40", "owner": "emdesigns41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920330815085487, "text": "Techinologiaaaa", "created_at": "2025-05-15T13:58:40", "owner": "narcisseobadiah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043953113529643, "text": "But it works 😂😂😂... Got so many features in his project even many Products didn't have", "created_at": "2025-05-15T09:56:24", "owner": "isakkithangamkennedyraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965316858768959, "text": "Bro knows he needs an helmet ⛑️😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-14T19:33:37", "owner": "hafeez.dev1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040315871632202, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-05-14T13:17:50", "owner": "7569_jawed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160540048358175, "text": "Hii ukiiba unamrudishia tu", "created_at": "2025-05-12T20:46:30", "owner": 