{"media_id": 3519109835604493652, "shortcode": "DDWY8AcygVU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDWY8AcygVU/", "taken_at": "2024-12-09T07:50:05", "caption": "【@businessfocus.io】Chill Guy是什麼？佛系迷因狗爆紅！捕獲GEN Z歡心：I’m just a chill guy 踏足加密幣市值暴升至37億\n\n「I’m just a chill guy」，一隻小狗雙手插袋，身穿灰色休閑毛衣，下身配上牛仔褲和紅白布鞋，凝望著你，同時帶著一絲微笑。這是近日在IG、Threads、TikTok等社交平台上，最受歡迎的迷因狗。它看淡世間一切的眼神，風靡一眾年輕人，更有人將它變成加密貨幣，短短幾日市值急升至37億港元，一度超越Dogecoin、Shiba Inu等迷因幣。那Chill Guy究竟在紅什麼，又是由誰創作？背後又有什麼故事？\n\nChill Guy去年已出現  佛系形象得民心\n\n其實Chill Guy一角色是由美國插畫家Phillip Bankss創作，最早一次出現是在2023年10月4日。當時Phillip Banks在社交平台上分享道，「他的特點是，他是一個冷靜的人，低調且什麼也不在乎（His whole deal is he’s a chill guy that lowkey doesn’t give a f**k）」。Chill Guy的形象輕鬆自如、與世無爭，引起不少Gen Z網民的共鳴，與新一代躺平、佛系等流行精神吻合。\n\n而說到創作者Phillip Bankss，他是一名數位藝術家，來自美國北卡羅來納州，不時在網上分享原創插畫角色。而Chill Guy一出，受到各方喜歡，被外媒形容為以「病毒式」速度在網上傳播。另外，Phillip Bankss作風神秘，沒有在社交平台上透露太多個人資訊。據Times of India報道，Phillip Bankss出生於4月8日，並在自我介紹中寫到「正在與另一個男人戀愛」。\n\n惡搞片段爆紅 連名人也愛\n\n不過，要說到Chill Guy的爆紅，不得不說到惡搞片段。這個神秘又有趣的角色在今年，成為不少平台的惡搞對象，例如在TikTok上除了有不少Chill Guy在海灘、會議室及太空中漂浮的影片，亦有用戶以Chill Guy配上不同動畫劇集、場景，更用人用《Family Guy》中小狗Brian Griffin的聲線，為Chill Guy作AI配音，令角色更活靈活現，突顯不理世事的人生態度。而名人亦對它寵愛有加，就連薩爾瓦多總統Nayib Bukele也曾在X上分享其圖片。\n\n現時在社交平台上，有不少新一代用戶都活用Chill Guy及其伴隨而來的名言，完美表達出不管社會多荒誕也不想理的生活態度，因為「我只是一個Chill Guy（I’m just a chill guy）」。例如當遇上生死難關，有人會說「I manage to survive, because I am just a chill guy」；沒有聽到喜歡的樂團會說：「沒聽到福夢高雄場沒關係，因為我是個chill guy」。\n\n由精神象徵變加密貨幣 市值一度升至37億\n\nChill Guy除了是一種精神象徵、新一代的無聲表態，它目前跨界踏足加密幣圈，搖身一變成為加密貨幣代幣「CHILLGUY」。翻查資料，「CHILLGUY」在今年9月推出，當時外界反應一般，但在薩爾瓦總統分享Chill Guy圖後，該幣市值飆升。至11月26日，該幣市值飆升至約37億港元，超越多個知名「迷因幣」，如Dogecoin。\n\n不過，近日角色創作者Phillip Bankss卻在社交平台上，明確指出未有授權任何人開發Chill Guy成為商品或加密貨幣，表明將採取法律行動。在聲明中，他指出對借用角色進行創作一舉沒有所謂，認為只要標註來源即可，但不認同任何未經授權的牟利行為。他又表示，已為Chill Guy角色申請版權保護，打擊非法行為。\n\n—————————————————————————\n\n📣 請即 follow @businessfocus.io 發掘更多商業智慧 投資靈感 及 創業故事！\n\n#BusinessFocus #BF #Insight #ChillGuy #JustAChillGuy #迷因 #加密貨幣 #加密幣 #TikTok #Threads", "owner_username": "businessfocus.io", "owner_id": "4840127002", "likes": 3928, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0355_DDWY8AcygVU\\DDWY8AcygVU_20241209_075005_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0355_DDWY8AcygVU\\DDWY8AcygVU_20241209_075005_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0355_DDWY8AcygVU\\DDWY8AcygVU_20241209_075005_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0355_DDWY8AcygVU\\DDWY8AcygVU_20241209_075005_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0355_DDWY8AcygVU\\DDWY8AcygVU_20241209_075005_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0355_DDWY8AcygVU\\DDWY8AcygVU_20241209_075005_6.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17957785052848269", "text": "市值高過doge coin 係咪GenAI 寫出嚟？", "created_at": "2024-12-12T12:54:24", "owner": "chunlch", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18036528596362871", "text": "睇好你😆", "created_at": "2024-12-10T13:28:48", "owner": "zoebbinuk", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18055343287760598", "text": "你個X（twitter）水印好別有用心，$CHILLGUY係Solana鏈，official X係@chillguycto. 麻煩做好d功課先出po。", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:08:01", "owner": "cigar.bett", "likes": 4}, {"id": "18053393951058502", "text": "Doge market cap大佢成倍😅😅宜家計", "created_at": "2024-12-09T08:19:39", "owner": "thehugolyc", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["businessfocus", "bf", "insight", "chillguy", "justachillguy", "迷因", "加密貨幣", "加密幣", "tiktok", "threads"]},
{"media_id": 3513022169217993827, "shortcode": "DDAwwzUT4xj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDAwwzUT4xj/", "taken_at": "2024-11-30T22:17:54", "caption": "“时尚圈”失误”名场面！名利双收？or笑话？\n盘点4个时尚圈因“失误”造就的神级瞬间有的成了经典，有的却成了笑话⋯.”", "owner_username": "ultimategloriabraidshk", "owner_id": "1420144445", "likes": 30272, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0356_DDAwwzUT4xj\\DDAwwzUT4xj_20241130_221754.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18039611093445831, "text": "潑酒是故意的", "created_at": "2025-03-29T17:06:10", "owner": "cool918726", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17995450295621979, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-03-25T09:36:37", "owner": "yun155320", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047830583116176, "text": "吸血鬼那幕是特意打翻的...", "created_at": "2024-12-19T02:37:48", "owner": "fred_fred_n", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18054106540820428, "text": "吸血鬼是真的嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-17T17:22:08", "owner": "asphyxia.1106", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17961370673835651, "text": "烙跑新娘那個太美了😍", "created_at": "2024-12-07T01:01:22", "owner": "orjean_swt.ptt", "likes": 238}, {"id": 17887786011083525, "text": "打翻紅酒那個很作", "created_at": "2024-12-06T19:45:58", "owner": "aurorina_butterfly", "likes": 258}, {"id": 18430523644074293, "text": "If you fall , fall in Dior\n意思係如果你要跌倒，至少穿上Dior才不丟臉 。\n\n花落誰家意思完全不同，還不如直譯。", "created_at": "2024-12-06T01:23:07", "owner": "lty.tracy", "likes": 1269}, {"id": 18051107006081232, "text": "我喜欢第四个❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-05T08:03:55", "owner": "margaret060514", "likes": 12}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3485663624302154346, "shortcode": "DBfkJk1B9Jq", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBfkJk1B9Jq/", "taken_at": "2024-10-24T04:19:14", "caption": "吃冰還是喝酒？小孩子才做選擇！\n\n來好正商行直接一次滿足啦～多種口味全都任你試吃！\n如果不知道怎麼挑，首先大推18天生啤酒冰淇淋，製作過程完全不加一滴水，真的超像在喝啤酒耶🍺\n還有貝禮詩奶酒冰淇淋和巨峰紫葡萄冰淇淋也都是我的愛～酒感讓冰淇淋的口味更有層次，完全是大人味的冰淇淋🍦\n而且店家也一直努力更新酒單：啤酒、高粱、威士忌、荔枝酒、柚子酒、瑪格麗特⋯不知道下次去會有什麼新的酒～好期待啊🤤\n\n好正商行 HAO ZHENG\n台北市大安區市民大道四段48巷3號之2\n每日14:30-20:30\n\n#台北美食\n#大安區美食\n#東區美食\n#忠孝復興美食\n#義式冰淇淋\n#gelato\n#台北gelato\n#台北冰店\n#好正商行\n#美食推薦\n#冰品推薦", "owner_username": "hank920625", "owner_id": "1292583050", "likes": 116796, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0357_DBfkJk1B9Jq\\DBfkJk1B9Jq_20241024_041914.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17878940322376839, "text": "👍❤️", "created_at": "2026-01-24T14:20:12", "owner": "09127956.80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070566077386851, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2026-01-24T14:20:05", "owner": "09127956.80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880756648301879, "text": "我超愛這家", "created_at": "2025-05-20T13:27:37", "owner": "j78088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992816751684340, "text": "@god0613", "created_at": "2025-05-04T05:49:58", "owner": "sa10960111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089900236521779, "text": "@_xia_xi @lynnnnnn_00 有18天！", "created_at": "2025-04-10T15:07:52", "owner": "liangbubble", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18377688892138741, "text": "@athena.c__", "created_at": "2025-04-08T17:28:51", "owner": "xenqh_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078558292739887, "text": "@gogolfency", "created_at": "2025-04-06T20:21:02", "owner": "lan_andy0428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18222023998290799, "text": "@nnaachen  hurry up！", "created_at": "2025-04-06T12:27:39", "owner": "tracypan_830", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849907687394533, "text": "@gucci5441", "created_at": "2025-04-03T23:11:19", "owner": "admlocksley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047153267093189, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-04-02T09:11:37", "owner": "chicasue29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041925866171017, "text": "@jqnle.e", "creat