{"media_id": 3478998679365716898, "shortcode": "DBH4t3JpYui", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBH4t3JpYui/", "taken_at": "2024-10-14T23:37:28", "caption": "Turning prime into wine\n\n#mead #wine #prime #drinkprime #experiment #homebrew #homebrewing", "owner_username": "goldenhivemead", "owner_id": "55842210061", "likes": 168880, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0358_DBH4t3JpYui\\DBH4t3JpYui_20241014_233728.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17985305906659498, "text": "Next do water", "created_at": "2025-04-07T17:02:56", "owner": "stepinsidesee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848245435442720, "text": "why did this show up on my fyp 24 weeks after posting and more importantly how is there no p2 by now", "created_at": "2025-04-06T04:07:10", "owner": "anthony.karol1210", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18076517695775304, "text": "So no update huh?", "created_at": "2025-04-05T11:50:55", "owner": "rishi_819090", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17899152981195214, "text": "Sorry for being late but is there any update on this?", "created_at": "2025-04-04T22:04:11", "owner": "noamilles2", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17953968512957977, "text": "So Pt 2?", "created_at": "2025-04-04T12:43:39", "owner": "2kmarskiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921949501062562, "text": "ش", "created_at": "2025-04-04T00:05:57", "owner": "omartohamy07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904840711120923, "text": "I didn’t even know you could turn plastic into mead", "created_at": "2025-04-03T09:52:52", "owner": "wasnt_here_prove_it", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022789697673725, "text": "I like my prime buzzed bru", "created_at": "2025-04-03T03:59:08", "owner": "gabriel_waggoner07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050902037465355, "text": "Part 2?", "created_at": "2025-04-03T00:00:26", "owner": "c4556666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959652633771368, "text": "Yeah bet u thought u were the first..did that back in ‘08", "created_at": "2025-03-31T09:32:25", "owner": "fr1day.night.lights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075362023826663, "text": "Could make a lemon lime prime margarita", "created_at": "2025-03-27T04:20:05", "owner": "aj_g8311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071000800886110, "text": "I mean. Sucralose, an artificial sugar, cannot be made into alcohol?", "created_at": "2025-03-25T00:31:48", "owner": "_ljgarcia12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865192513358319, "text": "Bro IS the next NileRed", "created_at": "2025-03-23T14:39:25", "owner": "x2b.dedav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019505837674023, "text": "Sooo it's been like 3 months. Is it not done yet or wss it that bad that you trew it away?😂", "created_at": "2025-03-16T16:23:10", "owner": "m1_ha1_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038876732391407, "text": "Need an update", "created_at": "2025-03-12T05:38:49", "owner": "mcgfisher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937773594972418, "text": "Too late bro prime alr serves the same purpose as alcohol (it ruins ur liver)", "created_at": "2025-02-14T18:15:05", "owner": "3c_pz11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036767063178430, "text": "Did bro forget about it?", "created_at": "2025-02-12T22:29:06", "owner": "judah.hochman", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18050906324329006, "text": "Prime is a crime", "created_at": "2025-02-11T06:54:53", "owner": "alx.flxming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967874136717252, "text": "We can all agree prime is over priced and sucks right", "created_at": "2025-02-08T16:20:11", "owner": "mathewclark173", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080439211617922, "text": "@ksi", "created_at": "2025-02-06T09:18:11", "owner": "b_be_143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964843851848697, "text": "Roses are red violets are blue I checked there is no part to 😢", "created_at": "2025-02-03T18:16:22", "owner": "jasperchammond", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054116009293427, "text": "Can u turn cheer wine into wine?", "created_at": "2025-01-25T03:35:42", "owner": "dahhh.waffle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019409672423947, "text": "Update", "created_at": "2025-01-23T23:52:12", "owner": "626.anakin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895024678110603, "text": "You need to do red Bull next", "created_at": "2025-01-20T08:20:25", "owner": "marcellonhannah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053252591101277, "text": "Eww prime. I mean don’t get me wrong. I love your videos, but why, prime?", "created_at": "2025-01-19T04:40:23", "owner": "ryan.ordway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030635243264804, "text": "Update?", "created_at": "2025-01-19T02:38:17", "owner": "maxb4058", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035599835605914, "text": "Saying there's no suger in prime is diabolical", "created_at": "2025-01-16T21:31:53", "owner": "borgfordgavin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893137951149150, "text": "Try slime", "created_at": "2025-01-16T06:38:47", "owner": "909.zoom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013998116670110, "text": "Lead alcohol when?", "created_at": "2025-01-13T20:08:12", "owner": "ethan_varga0921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366990922184283, "text": "I already did that", "created_at": "2025-01-12T01:03:13", "owner": "skvrz_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039008273092971, "text": "wheres the logan paul forest gif", "created_at": "2025-01-10T02:51:04", "owner": "tylerchadd07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999458973563307, "text": "👏😍", "created_at": "2025-01-09T14:37:52", "owner": "julian_bootymaster_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081905491574868, "text": "100 dollars worth of prime he js used 😭", "created_at": "2025-01-06T06:01:08", "owner": "cxshn0tfound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046303408976022, "text": "Where’s part 2", "created_at": "2025-01-05T17:36:48", "owner": "mrfinn_10", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18158844841334661, "text": "Where is part 2", "created_at": "2025-01-04T20:32:32", "owner": "vonta._.wrld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053399879072807, "text": "Is there a part 2?", "created_at": "2025-01-04T19:37:22", "owner": "lomas_riego", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347341939180047, "text": "@slavic_dan_s 7 year old me doing shampoo potions in the bathroom be like", "created_at": "2025-01-04T10:44:57", "owner": "super.niga1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873914344166495, "text": "part 2", "created_at": "2025-01-03T14:26:28", "owner": "calebjjenkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050832473080638, "text": "\"Fine prime wine\"", "created_at": "2025-01-02T20:00:30", "owner": "valternilssonen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074980978571149, "text": "🤢🤮 that shit is bad.", "created_at": "2025-01-02T12:35:58", "owner": "rustedelk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977472606654359, "text": "@prabhu_ajay_", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:52:31", "owner": "anup_in_8k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924289614906152, "text": "Where’d part two?", "created_at": "2024-12-31T10:16:02", "owner": "josee1.mocoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889341532071560, "text": "i didnt really thought the concept of \"how to make prime unhealthier then it already is\" could be possible but here it is", "created_at": "2024-12-29T18:08:14", "owner": "fuebell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380630689106715, "text": "is there an update posted😏😏", "created_at": "2024-12-27T11:35:25", "owner": "jasmineltw_private", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013458419656715, "text": "Wow turning poison into wine", "created_at": "2024-12-23T08:50:11", "owner": "clashroyaleconent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011880680658538, "text": "soda would honestly be more healthier than prime. no way you have a drink with 2 grams of sugar and is sweet as hell. makes no sense.", "created_at": "2024-12-23T06:15:52", "owner": "reasonsforkarma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032977082148188, "text": "have you made prime wine and put it in a fine line while a girl whines", "created_at": "2024-12-20T15:15:23", "owner": "nazbals", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017321099391120, "text": "There is no part 2 😢", "created_at": "2024-12-17T23:51:09", "owner": "lucca8soares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069726355671228, "text": "Cool! Now give it to children under the age of 10.", "created_at": "2024-12-16T13:45:57", "owner": "madymanlapaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149588077346949, "text": "There was never a part 2", "created_at": "2024-12-16T12:09:29", "owner": "1326cj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050460596046279, "text": "What happened?", "created_at": "2024-12-16T00:50:22", "owner": "paraccettamol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011645009485209, "text": "This guy must be the alcohol alchemist", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:17:18", "owner": "mysterious_stranger4521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100815616469005, "text": "What happen to the prime mead? Did it work?", "created_at": "2024-12-13T05:03:10", "owner": "gabnahas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118548100411902, "text": "You forgot about it 😔", "created_at": "2024-12-12T20:25:29", "owner": "popi.kajinka.popeskova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993489732724992, "text": "I wouldent even drink it if it was alcohol", "created_at": "2024-12-12T13:46:14", "owner": "emils838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050904967859410, "text": "he had to dumb it down for primes target audience", "created_at": "2024-12-09T20:55:07", "owner": "deaddpetals", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880489681193367, "text": "Try Gatorade next", "created_at": "2024-12-07T08:28:20", "owner": "760.giovanni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091559380507256, "text": "@ksi", "created_at": "2024-12-07T05:42:19", "owner": "abe_aragon98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050314216854302, "text": "WE NEED A UPDATE!!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-06T23:23:46", "owner": "juiceman._.jey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038148815349870, "text": "that aint gonna give u alcohol, its gonna give ya rocket fuel", "created_at": "2024-12-02T21:01:32", "owner": "im.martin_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933245862842651, "text": "Do Oros", "created_at": "2024-12-02T00:41:41", "owner": "senhor_mj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040872649996155, "text": "Its going to be dry and sweet less", "created_at": "2024-11-29T21:42:59", "owner": "hamza_harma_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984292800755468, "text": "This is just going to end up the worst tasting mead ever", "created_at": "2024-11-27T19:39:02", "owner": "654321alphagetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066727960665319, "text": "Is it me or prime taste like shit😢", "created_at": "2024-11-27T05:17:58", "owner": "bibbydan.512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053538241788247, "text": "I mean The whole purpose of a sports drinks is to have sugar and carbs", "created_at": "2024-11-26T07:53:25", "owner": "wachintussi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013987322425423, "text": "Oh shit that's just call bug spray", "created_at": "2024-11-26T04:28:15", "owner": "ctb_tay69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247226962302892, "text": "Curious how this is getting on.", "created_at": "2024-11-25T17:49:32", "owner": "not_ur_dhaidi_cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847198807330369, "text": "Why is it jizz white", "created_at": "2024-11-24T09:31:37", "owner": "wil_thomp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025781183611799, "text": "Should make wine outta 5 hour energy’s", "created_at": "2024-11-24T01:16:07", "owner": "tsbuckchoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059094403856675, "text": "Dont promote this trash of a drink", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:27:30", "owner": "joaovaz97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054180166753099, "text": "As not knowing much about prime (I know nothing) but if it's actually an energy Drink which makes it a stimulant and turning it into alcohol which is actually a depressant maybe can alter with brain function or perception badly... 🙅‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-11-21T18:19:23", "owner": "harrynegative", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871474636229924, "text": "we got prime wine before prime became good?", "created_at": "2024-11-21T12:18:36", "owner": "su_d_p.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896725948016757, "text": "Is that wrine", "created_at": "2024-11-21T09:16:27", "owner": "crackerlol_101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028932929582801, "text": "What is Prime?", "created_at": "2024-11-21T01:19:16", "owner": "daniel.s.travel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360506752184135, "text": "Yeah, it barely has sugar, but it has fake sugar… a lot", "created_at": "2024-11-20T21:27:06", "owner": "r.bakrjyan12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029162111599559, "text": "Where is the update!", "created_at": "2024-11-20T15:36:38", "owner": "itsjonnywyck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866670412185626, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-20T15:22:43", "owner": "ucukalo.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032277758586204, "text": "@ksi", "created_at": "2024-11-20T15:22:24", "owner": "mal.holland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062610958765460, "text": "ㅤ", "created_at": "2024-11-20T09:41:09", "owner": "sh_e_n_zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043573295483761, "text": "Im Proud to say that I never had prime and feastables", "created_at": "2024-11-20T07:02:22", "owner": "xhevat_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068960290634553, "text": "The fermentation took place before you started this video", "created_at": "2024-11-20T04:34:27", "owner": "beeg_schnif", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17954518073848378, "text": "@jakepaul", "created_at": "2024-11-20T02:00:17", "owner": "zabi__mateen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027868970429321, "text": "Any update?", "created_at": "2024-11-19T23:41:47", "owner": "tropby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999784707523729, "text": "Does light affect the fermentation process?", "created_at": "2024-11-19T09:32:04", "owner": "nfausto9694", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123643732400990, "text": "Ew bro I wouldn’t do that if that’s the last thing we had to use to make hooch in prison ew cancer in a bottle", "created_at": "2024-11-18T07:18:25", "owner": "dougie_rozz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054393724935380, "text": "You're not i tried last year and it failed horribly", "created_at": "2024-11-17T23:58:14", "owner": "gab_mailloche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046138721024963, "text": "Any update??", "created_at": "2024-11-16T10:55:16", "owner": "lalajester", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17937910700814310, "text": "The sugar is what makes products ‘SPORTS DRINK’, because it gives fast ENERGY", "created_at": "2024-11-16T08:10:49", "owner": "luqmannxzri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249636505286647, "text": "Lead poisoning incoming", "created_at": "2024-11-15T22:52:49", "owner": "pollen_aka_jackie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913987752931251, "text": "funny of you to think people who drink prime are even over the age of 12", "created_at": "2024-11-15T19:49:10", "owner": "ohmyzumanga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078374611512254, "text": "I'll stick to fentanyl", "created_at": "2024-11-15T19:22:31", "owner": "nikxill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990079404590756, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-15T05:12:33", "owner": "suli.121x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936825249938917, "text": "Prime is 💩 💩 💩", "created_at": "2024-11-15T00:09:24", "owner": "tf_ktz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063575239681986, "text": "Prime's whack", "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:00:59", "owner": "jozhezytho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858766336293844, "text": "My friends can turn any alcohol into prime.", "created_at": "2024-11-14T09:16:51", "owner": "negi_kartik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955685106840839, "text": "Nuh uh I did it last week", "created_at": "2024-11-14T06:19:35", "owner": "moonskull127", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18012950990418249, "text": "Is this almost done? I want to see what happens", "created_at": "2024-11-11T22:05:04", "owner": "coolchris366", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038742596266247, "text": "It’s not actually good for a hydration drink to have very little sugar in it, you do sort of need easy access sugars", "created_at": "2024-11-10T12:10:42", "owner": "george.c.priv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042606536473695, "text": "The sponsor of this video is the government of France 🇫🇷", "created_at": "2024-11-10T09:26:45", "owner": "yashra.g", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025012817614473, "text": "Try using body amour", "created_at": "2024-11-10T08:04:54", "owner": "bennn.lm", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["mead", "wine", "prime", "drinkprime", "experiment", "homebrew", "homebrewing"]},
{"media_id": 3494491098582722361, "shortcode": "DB-7SO5yac5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB-7SO5yac5/", "taken_at": "2024-11-05T08:37:51", "caption": "Now say my name \n\n🧊每日幹片 @seriesothetime \n\n#迷因 #memeallthetime #開心 #有趣 #搞笑 #好笑 #歡樂 #萬聖節 #翻譯 #台灣 #中文 #絕命毒師", "owner_username": "seriesothetime", "owner_id": "62588234384", "likes": 206634, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0359_DB-7SO5yac5\\DB-7SO5yac5_20241105_083751.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18055478576355781, "text": "Say my name", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:31:28", "owner": "joshjackson1975", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053281295251269, "text": "Waltuh, wheres the crystal waltuh?", "created_at": "2025-05-02T00:49:27", "owner": "randolph_dolpenal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967455825884999, "text": "Is that Bryan Cranston", "created_at": "2025-04-30T16:46:51", "owner": "ali_m_ps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064585454493021, "text": "Heisenberg on the outside, hal in the inside 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-19T06:53:02", "owner": "sosolichahyeah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941982072857600, "text": "Heisenberg Halloween", "created_at": "2025-04-18T06:37:31", "owner": "angel.or.bee.123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952115100948493, "text": "Fun fact : they were actually candy's 😂", "created_at": "2025-04-14T10:50:28", "owner": "ahmad.spendar1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873558058281079, "text": "Tight tight tight", "created_at": "2025-02-25T07:14:39", "owner": "imam_ramadhan10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18385964068107584, "text": "AI ist soo nice", "created_at": "2025-02-24T19:33:09", "owner": "pray_jah420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052252108908461, "text": "к", "created_at": "2025-02-18T08:58:19", "owner": "istmxll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067364080873530, "text": "Tight tight tight", "created_at": "2025-02-15T18:11:41", "owner": "monkey.d.luffy.1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063669190907351, "text": "THANK YOU BRYAN CRANSTON!", "created_at": "2025-02-13T17:26:13", "owner": "st4r.b0y06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051944516146046, "text": "That looks like my cat litter. 😂", "created_at": "2025-02-13T05:20:00", "owner": "bansheequeen.exe", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18282968686219922, "text": "No Heisenberg😭", "created_at": "2025-02-12T18:53:49", "owner": "damsdoozy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17866319541243416, "text": "Uhh .. tight tight tight!!!!💎🥵", "created_at": "2025-02-10T10:47:40", "owner": "kv_eexx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870874978291676, "text": "☝️☝️☝️", "created_at": "2025-02-08T18:16:48", "owner": "_heiisenberg__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055319192089898, "text": "🤣 naughty !", "created_at": "2025-02-08T08:12:54", "owner": "rgl2907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851854999392091, "text": "Block", "created_at": "2025-02-08T06:17:34", "owner": "we1b1n_0616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015323516676118, "text": "@m0rr15_zzz", "created_at": "2025-02-08T06:16:16", "owner": "we1b1n_0616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031027100554278, "text": "99% purity", "created_at": "2025-02-03T12:48:46", "owner": "uhhh_yeayea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911791735064460, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-02-01T14:57:34", "owner": "naveenprasad__11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956202213873366, "text": "Why is Walter White handing meth", "created_at": "2025-01-30T16:15:24", "owner": "cooingpuppy7060", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17850963960389721, "text": "Bro is creating is own customers", "created_at": "2025-01-29T09:37:28", "owner": "not.a_aizen_fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043231382255670, "text": "小孩吃了會太太太😂", "created_at": "2025-01-29T08:54:59", "owner": "shen811011", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977700540798650, "text": "Say my name", "created_at": "2025-01-28T09:30:44", "owner": "omiss__perry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972200988821401, "text": "What is that?", "created_at": "2025-01-28T07:04:59", "owner": "00100oma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089478301551339, "text": "Is that ecstasy?", "created_at": "2025-01-28T03:10:34", "owner": "nana_love1209", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18034177943599973, "text": "💀💀", "created_at": "2025-01-27T19:44:03", "owner": "szilardhaasz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852047386384679, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-26T11:29:36", "owner": "_bones_g59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055702688077333, "text": "say my name", "created_at": "2025-01-26T10:32:25", "owner": "ponpupu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122112901417593, "text": "Hiesenberg", "created_at": "2025-01-25T12:34:35", "owner": "samcr_xox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113281186445821, "text": "Last chance to look at my hector", "created_at": "2025-01-22T23:08:04", "owner": "callsign.dust", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917459992026440, "text": "a free sample", "created_at": "2025-01-22T17:34:23", "owner": "mr_kennedy209", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933538770982345, "text": "@ahmedcantadult", "created_at": "2025-01-22T14:53:00", "owner": "umair_walayat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119224168424418, "text": "Say my name 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-22T06:08:59", "owner": "ankit_baral", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914712760062533, "text": "太！太！太！", "created_at": "2025-01-22T03:45:03", "owner": "a.c.jl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027379598628699, "text": "Breaking bad: Halloween special", "created_at": "2025-01-19T18:19:31", "owner": "himeno_simp2", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18064140424883542, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-18T20:00:24", "owner": "real_marcushavet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926146974898628, "text": "tight tight tight", "created_at": "2025-01-18T03:38:16", "owner": "marcus.320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011578478680445, "text": "TIGHT TIGHT TIGHT", "created_at": "2025-01-18T01:25:28", "owner": "jayaaaa.666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944240034930598, "text": "This was the moment Walter White became a trick or treater", "created_at": "2025-01-17T18:58:22", "owner": "7omxz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961888890846195, "text": "How many kilo do you have", "created_at": "2025-01-17T11:01:32", "owner": "vigialouis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852594190371113, "text": "That's.... Perfect😍", "created_at": "2025-01-15T16:18:28", "owner": "sor1nn__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992788995603194, "text": "Candy cotton taste he said", "created_at": "2025-01-15T11:05:12", "owner": "der.d4pp3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483922870009873, "text": "不拿他會拿鋁熱劑炸我家門嗎…", "created_at": "2025-01-15T08:43:13", "owner": "ninierrr_0322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969486312700256, "text": "What is that?", "created_at": "2025-01-14T04:33:48", "owner": "sativayuks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068878369809586, "text": "Wrap it up guys mari_dokkan says it's not funny 🕊️🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-01-14T00:31:01", "owner": "prod.zinfinity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062632445485363, "text": "We don't consume the product 😠", "created_at": "2025-01-13T07:51:18", "owner": "eddiespagnoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898092091032494, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-13T02:19:45", "owner": "quikkflexr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212139451295939, "text": "This is something Hal would do in Malcolm in the Middle", "created_at": "2025-01-12T14:13:54", "owner": "bruhmomentbruhmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871542580263817, "text": "eric ten hag?", "created_at": "2025-01-12T03:57:46", "owner": "twowill__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910033309075062, "text": "You're goddamned right", "created_at": "2025-01-12T00:23:49", "owner": "fujin.001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043751177264030, "text": "Teaching kids young", "created_at": "2025-01-11T11:18:32", "owner": "aurelio.mif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913382230048985, "text": "Kids be like TIGHT TIGHT TIGHT what ever man blue yellow pink", "created_at": "2025-01-10T14:22:58", "owner": "bsivabalu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102426019469581, "text": "Say. My. Name.", "created_at": "2025-01-09T18:21:13", "owner": "_slam_media_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063155563850840, "text": "什麼顏色的都有😂", "created_at": "2025-01-09T11:11:50", "owner": "sean19970217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018554144431462, "text": "Oh, ill do that 100 percent ngl", "created_at": "2025-01-08T10:41:21", "owner": "hanz_1944", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891725491156742, "text": "Heisenberg 🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-05T19:56:51", "owner": "titan001_mk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915071293047727, "text": "海森堡", "created_at": "2025-01-05T11:55:33", "owner": "king_dragon0609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039059528348852, "text": "Were gonna make a lot of eves together", "created_at": "2025-01-01T22:05:12", "owner": "_shubham66_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18056830918811007, "text": "This isn't a math", "created_at": "2024-12-31T04:08:30", "owner": "amrealz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982647564636413, "text": "高成本糖果", "created_at": "2024-12-30T16:38:13", "owner": "chris12345622", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992270883746389, "text": "給完糖之後還要說一句：say my name!", "created_at": "2024-12-29T07:09:17", "owner": "yoyo153222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106624948415448, "text": "Are those mints?", "created_at": "2024-12-29T04:55:48", "owner": "rvddcherr1es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029837246215236, "text": "Ay yo Mr. White", "created_at": "2024-12-28T05:13:02", "owner": "nihility1312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053556185051408, "text": "@tonio_sz el walter blanco de frisby pai", "created_at": "2024-12-28T03:28:50", "owner": "omar.and.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130811323381351, "text": "太太太太太太太太太太", "created_at": "2024-12-26T07:45:58", "owner": "lslander_tsai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131231824378640, "text": "Aku jg mw😋😋", "created_at": "2024-12-26T00:41:19", "owner": "_mahdianr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040599731201663, "text": "You’re god damn right", "created_at": "2024-12-25T22:51:34", "owner": "lee810126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105507973413956, "text": "Heisenberg ☠️", "created_at": "2024-12-25T13:10:42", "owner": "adityarisky322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073069123573849, "text": "@thevishnuexperience", "created_at": "2024-12-25T12:27:42", "owner": "me_edwi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009500576505799, "text": "@hudazazel Fly to the moon 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T09:10:47", "owner": "fansszoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052140919863946, "text": "派的是錢", "created_at": "2024-12-25T03:22:58", "owner": "1ncubu2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291205339210783, "text": "Euphoria is about to experience them 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-24T15:18:22", "owner": "just__.craig", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030744167426351, "text": "The famous blue candy 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-24T11:10:29", "owner": "dig_martinm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079933513520599, "text": "😂🙌❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-24T10:35:02", "owner": "joji._420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055205995811811, "text": "@just_a_handsome_pineapple", "created_at": "2024-12-24T09:53:41", "owner": "dr.frog_1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058678615740477, "text": "Taste test😋😋😋", "created_at": "2024-12-24T03:42:32", "owner": "not_vemberp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025647488306019, "text": "@heisse_ofenkartoffel", "created_at": "2024-12-24T02:43:42", "owner": "tkbxx57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032054183575310, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-23T15:33:40", "owner": "siddig9833", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051177356069232, "text": "已購買，我愛吃", "created_at": "2024-12-23T12:47:00", "owner": "kd_yo_lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988153479612408, "text": "我們需要煮，白色先生", "created_at": "2024-12-22T15:10:03", "owner": "frankliao911123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029492228571893, "text": "@changyueyang  tight tight tight", "created_at": "2024-12-22T06:40:07", "owner": "yanchan0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046942166143164, "text": "@tajwar_ayman only when Jesse tries to use it Walter pissed off", "created_at": "2024-12-22T01:53:44", "owner": "just_talha_for_now", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932433684970208, "text": "Heisenberg", "created_at": "2024-12-21T23:57:16", "owner": "invictus_1307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481555198051298, "text": "Not me thinking it was melting salt", "created_at": "2024-12-21T16:00:27", "owner": "screechingt0ad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148658710356874, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T14:40:59", "owner": "olsern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885649165176050, "text": ". No chili powder?", "created_at": "2024-12-21T13:55:47", "owner": "bibi_btch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100007302486892, "text": "Erik Ten Hard??", "created_at": "2024-12-21T12:17:52", "owner": "jungx_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053485133056147, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-21T10:55:08", "owner": "sx0q_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964655160831474, "text": "这是本人吗哈哈哈哈太搞了吧", "created_at": "2024-12-21T08:09:39", "owner": "ssheng_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870909715252100, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-21T01:09:40", "owner": "lizrodriguez62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991760757742220, "text": "我的名字是沃爾特懷特 yo!, 我妻子的名字叫斯凱勒·懷特 yo!", "created_at": "2024-12-20T11:02:24", "owner": "ndak_adodo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070252756660745, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-20T09:51:00", "owner": "the_velaga", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069868876678490, "text": "Go ahead, say my name", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:34:25", "owner": "mon405060", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056166283938796, "text": "🥴🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-19T19:52:12", "owner": "marcbitsi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18455118019067643, "text": "Wait wait wait is that meth!!!", "created_at": "2024-12-19T01:38:42", "owner": "punkpupkiba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923535465898915, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-19T01:09:12", "owner": "kyleliu01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025406159547743, "text": "He don't need costume", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:12:11", "owner": "kamesh_maurya_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18045286037324980, "text": "Say my name", "created_at": "2024-12-17T23:27:41", "owner": "liu.__.xiang.yu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030605417613170, "text": "Can't wait for next Halloween 💀", "created_at": "2024-12-17T15:31:53", "owner": "bangzznn", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["迷因", "memeallthetime", "開心", "有趣", "搞笑", "好笑", "歡樂", "萬聖節", "翻譯", "台灣", "中文", "絕命毒師"]},
{"media_id": 3512836046511829178, "shortcode": "DDAGcXChnC6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDAGcXChnC6/", "taken_at": "2024-11-30T16:05:39", "caption": "Interlock the 4 puzzle pieces to pack them into the tray. #puzzlesolving #puzzles #puzzle #puzzlegame", "owner_username": "puzzlemasterca", "owner_id": "51867566540", "likes": 11712, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0360_DDAGcXChnC6\\DDAGcXChnC6_20241130_160539.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18056623721097981, "text": "See the e", "created_at": "2025-02-22T14:46:38", "owner": "s.2.r_ff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104580280484278, "text": "Which name has this puzzle?", "created_at": "2025-01-28T06:18:45", "owner": "docdodge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965735784708554, "text": "“How does it feel to be interlocked?”\n\n“interlocked…”", "created_at": "2025-01-18T22:32:45", "owner": "imnotgrumpyanymore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017995652442421, "text": "Watching do that was painful", "created_at": "2025-01-17T10:16:16", "owner": "kl_denton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942685146814313, "text": "卐", "created_at": "2025-01-12T13:48:18", "owner": "_evgeni78_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033650939525612, "text": "The most I’ve ever heard someone say interlock", "created_at": "2025-01-12T07:21:35", "owner": "alio6993", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18040671389351598, "text": "Those are identical peaces.", "created_at": "2025-01-11T17:30:54", "owner": "brian_johnson86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112085758435096, "text": "最初ゲオのロゴかと思った😂", "created_at": "2025-01-02T08:19:36", "owner": "yuto11039", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252725923276843, "text": "Reminded me of a certain flag", "created_at": "2024-12-28T15:51:27", "owner": "shuhan.13", "likes": 93}, {"id": 18024386174329913, "text": "Some one from China is very angry", "created_at": "2024-12-28T05:08:07", "owner": "z3npeanut", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17931669323865721, "text": "No one gonna say how that's not a backwards facing F?", "created_at": "2024-12-27T13:06:41", "owner": "hishissyfitsy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18124964227396977, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-27T05:31:39", "owner": "the_real_m0n3y", "likes": 57}, {"id": 18032830559415683, "text": "So good mad in china", "created_at": "2024-12-27T04:48:49", "owner": "toml0l3", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17922457049903601, "text": "somehow managed not to provoke the entire one piece fandom, impressive, was waiting the whole video for them to say it", "created_at": "2024-12-09T05:59:50", "owner": "ashe.oftheday", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17863015215226044, "text": "“If we try to pack tuah them into the tray”", "created_at": "2024-12-08T04:30:44", "owner": "crippled_one", "likes": 160}, {"id": 17897278293113899, "text": "Ah yes the famous Mad in China puzzles", "created_at": "2025-02-24T15:19:40", "owner": "armenakag", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080682157625379, "text": "Made in chaina ❌ mad in chaina😂✔️", "created_at": "2025-02-22T14:47:17", "owner": "s.2.r_ff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069568615694413, "text": "mad in china would be a pretty sick band name tbh🫡", "created_at": "2025-01-12T11:12:57", "owner": "hener.wy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030878885532184, "text": "Mad in china? 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-10T09:30:38", "owner": "s1u._lw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046914068326719, "text": "Mad in China😂", "created_at": "2025-01-09T10:06:47", "owner": "cons46tang17ce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058350703777194, "text": "Mad in China 😠", "created_at": "2025-01-09T00:08:00", "owner": "wrxluvsjapan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027561830537824, "text": "what caught my attention was : mad in china😂", "created_at": "2025-01-08T08:23:54", "owner": "softt.274", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055971965307189, "text": "I hear its mad in China rn", "created_at": "2024-12-28T00:16:06", "owner": "zacbergin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954054051895627, "text": "“Mad in China” 🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-27T15:40:07", "owner": "wiluhl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914423416043438, "text": "Mad in china", "created_at": "2024-12-27T02:25:38", "owner": "daandevries.040", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070293439734916, "text": "この人って頭悪いね", "created_at": "2024-12-26T06:21:37", "owner": "chihiro110634", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338388130151848, "text": "Who’s upsetting china! It’s rude", "created_at": "2024-12-26T04:21:09", "owner": "sethf63", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18009142979679935, "text": "Made in China? Nah mad in China", "created_at": "2024-12-23T21:09:25", "owner": "that_1_poptart", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17877338292216260, "text": "Made in China: ❌\nMad in China: ✅\n\nChina: 😡😡😡", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:47:35", "owner": "aerotheepic", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18084318556557945, "text": "Mad in china", "created_at": "2024-12-10T12:14:39", "owner": "thousand_nights2151", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18144064726358290, "text": "Mad in china : HAIYAHHHH", "created_at": "2024-12-06T13:56:57", "owner": "dhykrd", "likes": 213}, {"id": 18034023659373877, "text": "Mad in China 🤬😡🇨🇳🥠🧧🥮🥢", "created_at": "2024-12-06T12:27:47", "owner": "chalkolett", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18108481225448139, "text": "Mad in china 🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-06T08:11:35", "owner": "ermis_stav_", "likes": 14}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["puzzlesolving", "puzzles", "puzzle", "puzzlegame"]},
{"media_id": 3518318082777840584, "shortcode": "DDTk6fKznvI", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDTk6fKznvI/", "taken_at": "2024-12-08T05:37:00", "caption": "[PART 4] Okay, here’s the different types of market failure in Minecraft terms. Does it make sense now?\n\nIf you wanna ace your next Econ test just review this topic with free videos, study notes, practice questions and AI study buddy to grade your answers made just for the IB on revisiondojo.com!\n\n#meme #economics #ibeconomics #minecraft #economy #ibdp #internationalbaccalaureate #economicstudent #economicsmemes #revisiondojo", "owner_username": "economics.ib", "owner_id": "67141248780", "likes": 15366, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0361_DDTk6fKznvI\\DDTk6fKznvI_20241208_053700_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0361_DDTk6fKznvI\\DDTk6fKznvI_20241208_053700_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0361_DDTk6fKznvI\\DDTk6fKznvI_20241208_053700_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0361_DDTk6fKznvI\\DDTk6fKznvI_20241208_053700_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0361_DDTk6fKznvI\\DDTk6fKznvI_20241208_053700_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0361_DDTk6fKznvI\\DDTk6fKznvI_20241208_053700_6.jpg"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0361_DDTk6fKznvI\\DDTk6fKznvI_20241208_053700_7.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18046117624932719, "text": "What are some examples of public goods IRL?", "created_at": "2024-12-12T22:44:05", "owner": "roundearthslovenia", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094805881498785, "text": "The essentially infinite land confounds the foundation for Georgism, which is the real life fixed limit to land/nature", "created_at": "2024-12-11T17:05:52", "owner": "handsome_tyrant", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17888610636152696, "text": "I find electronics are easier to understand than this micro-economic", "created_at": "2024-12-10T17:09:04", "owner": "ikantolol666", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17907831768059168, "text": "How does building a minecraft track harms environment?", "created_at": "2024-12-09T06:48:50", "owner": "tf._.tayyab", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18061985125687422, "text": "Peak education", "created_at": "2024-12-09T00:08:01", "owner": "2vlvz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18050724659501572, "text": "If I had found this account earlier wouldn’t had failed it in my high school 😨", "created_at": "2024-12-08T21:29:55", "owner": "srchan05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037726748363394, "text": "I actually understand this 🙏", "created_at": "2024-12-08T13:59:59", "owner": "rizah_man", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17859180210303056, "text": "A* in econ predicted", "created_at": "2024-12-08T08:46:07", "owner": "jettison_s", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18065309173812284, "text": "i needed this last week", "created_at": "2024-12-08T07:17:00", "owner": "raaghavanand", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18257585872248764, "text": "It'd be fucking amazing if somehow more strategy games incorporated economic elements instead of just \"Factories make money\" ahh hoi4 take", "created_at": "2024-12-08T06:26:21", "owner": "ddls454", "likes": 116}, {"id": 18059468299897215, "text": "11/14 on the Macro IA 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-08T06:24:08", "owner": "clems_nl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044962883141847, "text": "I just got an 7 on my Econ exam bro", "created_at": "2024-12-08T06:23:58", "owner": "clems_nl", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18078030133594563, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-08T05:40:44", "owner": "hross197", "likes": 131}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["meme", "economics", "ibeconomics", "minecraft", "economy", "ibdp", "internationalbaccalaureate", "economicstudent", "economicsmemes", "revisiondojo"]},
{"media_id": 3522137898091017599, "shortcode": "DDhJcHZp_V_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDhJcHZp_V_/", "taken_at": "2024-12-13T12:07:37", "caption": "這太酷了！\n\n近期，為了迎接聖誕節的到來，肯德基發揮創意，將經典的炸雞桶蓋變成了可以播放的黑膠唱片。炸雞桶蓋不僅印有聖誕歌曲，還加入了肯德基特有的烹飪聲音，讓美食與音樂巧妙結合，為節日增添了不少趣味與驚喜！\n\n不過，這項活動是肯德基加拿大聖誕節宣傳的一部分，僅限透過加拿大地區的社交媒體活動限量贈送。\n\n肯德基結合聖誕節的創意行銷，讓人們在這個特別的節日中，除了品嚐美食，還能感受到更多新奇有趣的節日氣氛。\n\n#聖誕節 #kfc", "owner_username": "coolsis_taiwan", "owner_id": "2058468952", "likes": 59947, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0362_DDhJcHZp_V_\\DDhJcHZp_V__20241213_120737.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18013943807697761, "text": "你媽這才是文創👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-03-10T23:10:35", "owner": "yuzunli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057414746086265, "text": "這超酷的😍", "created_at": "2025-02-23T15:44:54", "owner": "faye_810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845287828404968, "text": "帥慘🙌", "created_at": "2025-02-18T15:45:36", "owner": "smot_o7o4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371469634141942, "text": "@pissayang", "created_at": "2025-02-17T15:01:19", "owner": "tomsirdiary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968436912834276, "text": "這創意好猛❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-09T00:41:18", "owner": "yen0008964", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18000222812724557, "text": "音樂加炸雞。。。。。。", "created_at": "2025-02-08T07:07:26", "owner": "enter_my_name__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047292965245656, "text": "哇～～～～～～～～", "created_at": "2025-02-07T09:37:11", "owner": "zzhangluofei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992712414771381, "text": "我之前一直很羨慕加拿大感覺真的是很宜居的地方，結果後來聽說加拿大是中國人移民最多的國家，到處都是中國人，我瞬間就沒有那麼羨慕了😂", "created_at": "2025-02-05T20:55:13", "owner": "silversalt__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18036321614168254, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-02-04T02:34:13", "owner": "sonay_0.39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843009829399304, "text": "台灣有嗎？", "created_at": "2025-01-18T00:42:11", "owner": "true821205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18256075138275619, "text": "香港有嗎？", "created_at": "2025-01-02T13:37:09", "owner": "alan_ho_siu_lun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125458051366824, "text": "香港？", "created_at": "2024-12-30T16:17:56", "owner": "ks_.0627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080758591594847, "text": "🤗", "created_at": "2024-12-29T00:37:15", "owner": "patrickauyiuleung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870007045183636, "text": "我今天在美國🇺🇸。", "created_at": "2024-12-26T04:51:16", "owner": "greentea3678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332704927159972, "text": "我沒有見過，確定在加拿大嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-26T04:51:04", "owner": "greentea3678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952910559887147, "text": "想收藏，剛好我有在聽黑膠", "created_at": "2024-12-23T15:20:37", "owner": "raimi.0083", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336884041199524, "text": "真無聊", "created_at": "2024-12-23T13:51:35", "owner": "haha_xzq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042539846267619, "text": "我比較擔心有沒有毒的問題", "created_at": "2024-12-23T13:28:28", "owner": "ma.o_chimchim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265461424254270, "text": "台灣沒有 你還害我看完全部 真的頭痛🤦", "created_at": "2024-12-23T10:01:37", "owner": "ken8522885", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308385871200921, "text": "@_qinnn", "created_at": "2024-12-22T16:31:36", "owner": "5225_jw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051117530091345, "text": "@l_th_2001 超級酷", "created_at": "2024-12-22T15:43:29", "owner": "amy331amy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007746467693087, "text": "我有唱片机", "created_at": "2024-12-22T08:20:25", "owner": "leonleong830", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078454885607296, "text": "隱藏款：進前看其，上寫著，秦香蓮年32", "created_at": "2024-12-22T07:47:22", "owner": "leoooo5502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864269680224872, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-21T16:19:32", "owner": "zhiying.beauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018506843636121, "text": "台灣沒有為何還要發", "created_at": "2024-12-21T10:35:51", "owner": "l22000_1101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355434748132011, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-21T09:46:16", "owner": "sarah.ttlc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085782697539536, "text": "媽媽問我怎麼一直在擦黑膠機", "created_at": "2024-12-21T07:00:52", "owner": "izzy1616", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18469743274052695, "text": "超酷的", "created_at": "2024-12-21T01:02:45", "owner": "myfchou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071410735727009, "text": "很酷，但是我家沒有黑膠唱片機XD", "created_at": "2024-12-20T11:33:20", "owner": "liao.ziyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869142619256233, "text": "現在的年代找一台唱片機更花錢吧！😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T11:30:45", "owner": "mengshu_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329945971159058, "text": "齁", "created_at": "2024-12-20T10:55:31", "owner": "tom306816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18472510894037935, "text": "這個包裝成本會不會太高😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T05:11:20", "owner": "muri_su", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888440068157963, "text": "\"KFC had launched a giveaway for a chance to win one of the coveted records on the brand's social media. The contest was open to residents in Canada but is now closed. The chain has yet to reveal if the vinyl lids will be arriving in other countries ahead of the holidays.\"", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:17:33", "owner": "chris_din_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361874416137950, "text": "最後一句是重點：台灣沒有不要亂試🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:07:02", "owner": "mize_chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063395371834414, "text": "哭啊😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T00:12:38", "owner": "jerry_0987887887", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996263352570596, "text": "現在應該也沒多少人有留聲機", "created_at": "2024-12-19T19:15:34", "owner": "samo_sgm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987542913757660, "text": "那個油不會傷到唱片嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-19T09:45:41", "owner": "dtac33_ato0725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891563446135183, "text": "这首音乐很油", "created_at": "2024-12-18T16:52:04", "owner": "thomasloo0308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320200108094700, "text": "这盖子，很贵吧？", "created_at": "2024-12-18T10:45:16", "owner": "wangshumin1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868628587257101, "text": "大家覺得哪間的炸雞最好吃🤔", "created_at": "2024-12-18T02:57:53", "owner": "jeff4wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480927136041789, "text": "但是會弄髒唱片機", "created_at": "2024-12-18T02:37:20", "owner": "htmsk6025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056838151749858, "text": "估計以後就多一個保值的東西了", "created_at": "2024-12-18T00:02:53", "owner": "hkz._.0628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971858025807619, "text": "可惡 台灣沒有 台灣沒有 台灣沒有 台灣沒有 台灣沒有 台灣沒有 ...................................", "created_at": "2024-12-17T17:38:16", "owner": "aandylouis", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18029258036232821, "text": "先推我一台黑膠播放機", "created_at": "2024-12-17T17:32:30", "owner": "jiazhen_l1121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383122600107705, "text": "Awwwwwwwwwww❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-17T16:28:38", "owner": "kitsita107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983924430783939, "text": "台灣沒有，那就掃QR Code線上聽吧", "created_at": "2024-12-17T14:21:32", "owner": "ianyeh75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188661163307734, "text": "靠腰...看到最後一句 都涼了", "created_at": "2024-12-17T13:03:15", "owner": "dylanshen1210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057136747819989, "text": "都準備訂了結果跟我說台灣沒有😢", "created_at": "2024-12-17T12:29:00", "owner": "ljyeh2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104982703459718, "text": "太讚了ㄅ 算下重本嗎😍", "created_at": "2024-12-17T11:46:38", "owner": "0___oy.kolien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054221734820478, "text": "覺得唱片會很油", "created_at": "2024-12-17T11:44:50", "owner": "lovemusicbear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069370762706425, "text": "我需要這種酷東西", "created_at": "2024-12-17T11:06:19", "owner": "vinceh1615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080906350569144, "text": "@saviors8198 😮😮", "created_at": "2024-12-17T10:10:56", "owner": "miraaooo__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18473216974012613, "text": "台灣沒有😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-12-17T10:05:06", "owner": "bestsweet5253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033371963148530, "text": "就知道台灣不會有", "created_at": "2024-12-17T10:02:06", "owner": "pi_nok_sawmah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972786423746569, "text": "但會好油😮", "created_at": "2024-12-17T07:14:37", "owner": "dicksonlee26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054276904814160, "text": "@kfchk 公關識做啦😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-17T04:27:56", "owner": "chungtszkeung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990796257742896, "text": "之前肯德基還出一個能保溫炸雞的電腦主機冷卻雞", "created_at": "2024-12-17T02:47:44", "owner": "chandliuliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097676020484829, "text": "你幹嘛～～唉唷～～", "created_at": "2024-12-17T01:43:31", "owner": "hy_lam_vincent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041956409238835, "text": "Wow!", "created_at": "2024-12-16T22:57:06", "owner": "hsiangtinghsiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065047708771409, "text": "太帥了😂❤️👏", "created_at": "2024-12-16T19:15:32", "owner": "vince47.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883072444097893, "text": "@yoyojimmywang", "created_at": "2024-12-16T17:11:59", "owner": "aaron_12392", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865646494273467, "text": "加拿大有 发给你姐", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:42:39", "owner": "shuting.yst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040973762030859, "text": "可以請店員直接AirDrop歌曲給我嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:00:42", "owner": "me26cc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891930901110606, "text": "你各位臺灣人放心好了 這東西你用熊貓叫就沒用處了", "created_at": "2024-12-16T15:39:12", "owner": "lamborghini_jeff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18263440888269280, "text": "❤️❤️❤️好想收藏", "created_at": "2024-12-16T15:36:23", "owner": "rosechiu101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034729232123080, "text": "@judychu1218 🍗", "created_at": "2024-12-16T15:17:19", "owner": "ying_qqwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856839925335994, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2024-12-16T14:36:00", "owner": "peachwenwen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18474854851062537, "text": "讓唱片機油油的😢", "created_at": "2024-12-16T14:23:39", "owner": "s0_oktat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378375724105153, "text": "台灣沒有啦😂齁", "created_at": "2024-12-16T12:36:37", "owner": "shirly515realylove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854667394287566, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-16T12:11:13", "owner": "jaclinengei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332369020155219, "text": "很酷但是 \n我有播放器的話絕對不會放油油的蓋子…", "created_at": "2024-12-16T11:57:42", "owner": "dc_w0908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060612274849827, "text": "你確定不是愚人節限定😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T10:59:49", "owner": "macapline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068944066707905, "text": "我想要這個酷東西！", "created_at": "2024-12-16T09:57:01", "owner": "march_sun2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064492093816509, "text": "感覺很油", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:52:24", "owner": "max45666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058412011918362, "text": "好有創意", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:14:37", "owner": "_dragon__h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887491162119374, "text": "還以為是奧術開頭", "created_at": "2024-12-16T06:40:59", "owner": "baiya720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992392884734900, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-12-16T05:36:26", "owner": "rockyandape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037052051462913, "text": "@flora.hung 就在你們隔壁耶～", "created_at": "2024-12-16T04:21:33", "owner": "_iamvvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033586640522149, "text": "。・゜・(ノД`)・゜・。香港有嗎😢", "created_at": "2024-12-16T03:55:44", "owner": "_yapoevia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957359571848965, "text": "好聽到口水都流出來了", "created_at": "2024-12-16T03:44:00", "owner": "h1r0._5", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18306236290203835, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥 太屌了吧 這企劃好厲害❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-16T02:55:47", "owner": "damn21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016189124646153, "text": "確定不先吸一下油？", "created_at": "2024-12-16T01:28:37", "owner": "nicknicholas0311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904854001074668, "text": "聽到留言一堆說台灣沒有，因為這個貼文沒有註明國家😂會害人白高興哈哈", "created_at": "2024-12-15T21:16:07", "owner": "juny.style", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18083180452565869, "text": "這也太酷了吧！", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:49:24", "owner": "littlepillowmu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872021875166446, "text": "”社交媒體上的限定贈送“ 不知道是不是只給網紅", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:29:31", "owner": "zskrt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039116699065029, "text": "only available in Taiwan?", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:09:16", "owner": "kchye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899756368011603, "text": "好撚油啊", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:46:34", "owner": "francoyhk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097581487442477, "text": "@racsonleung", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:39:44", "owner": "titankthui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018520769638786, "text": "油膩的歌曲", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:29:11", "owner": "md_pflame0326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032196584604986, "text": "這影片為什麼有味道？", "created_at": "2024-12-15T13:26:01", "owner": "sundaylittledeath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070530679732785, "text": "全球發售嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-15T13:17:29", "owner": "regina801129", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996420879720146, "text": "台灣沒有又要翻成中文幹什麼？", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:50:06", "owner": "fl.8388", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951360786879800, "text": "香港也沒有", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:37:18", "owner": "louis_arsenal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030434246434211, "text": "太酷", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:29:11", "owner": "easen_tu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930456591861990, "text": "首先你要有個黑膠唱盤喎😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T11:34:26", "owner": "wildgrasswithidleflowers", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056649778767507, "text": "可以在附贈我一臺黑膠唱片播放器嗎😢", "created_at": "2024-12-15T11:27:38", "owner": "fuchoushike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062752393867726, "text": "會油油的嗎？？\n還是請店員不要蓋😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T10:48:30", "owner": "shino8210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209835535289971, "text": "那裏？", "created_at": "2024-12-15T10:20:03", "owner": "niska_swiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998425233710118, "text": "超酷", "created_at": "2024-12-15T09:44:33", "owner": "hankkingmanx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951900690863519, "text": "So cool", "created_at": "2024-12-15T09:26:11", "owner": "d0j9", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["聖誕節", "kfc"]},
{"media_id": 3521349655310691495, "shortcode": "DDeWNrGvOyn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDeWNrGvOyn/", "taken_at": "2024-12-12T10:00:00", "caption": "【#SSW世代Z】《魔髮奇緣》真人版電影確定開拍 網民集氣Anya Taylor-Joy做女主角\n\n迪士尼確定開拍《魔髮奇緣》真人版電影！根據外媒《Deadline》獨家報導，劇本將由《雷神奇俠4：愛與雷霆》編劇Jennifer Kaytin Robinson撰寫，導演人選目前與《大娛樂家 The Greatest Showman》導演Michael Gracey洽談中。至於觀眾最關心由誰演出女主角長髮公主「樂佩Rapunzel」及男主角「費華特Flynn」則尚未有消息。\n\n網民紛紛討論誰是適合演員人選，不少人許願主角由Anya Taylor-Joy @anyataylorjoy 及甜茶Timothée Chalamet @tchalamet 演出，認為他們的氣質和外型契合。Anya Taylor-Joy的金色長髮和一雙大眼也確實與樂佩相似。近年關於《魔髮奇緣》的選角傳聞不斷，當中Florence Pugh @florencepugh 、Sabrina Carpenter @sabrinacarpenter 等名字也一直被提及，大家覺得誰是最適合的人選呢？\n\n不過事實上，Anya Taylor-Joy多次喊話想演出《Frozen 魔雪奇緣》的Elsa女王真人版，認為一定會成為小孩的最愛：「我的兄弟姐妹全部都已有小孩了，很想他們能說出『我的阿姨是Elsa！』那一定會很棒！」\n\n圖片來源：IG @anyataylorjoy、IG @tchalamet、《魔髮奇緣》圖片、《魔雪奇緣》圖片\n\n#SSwagger #小編S #迪士尼 #魔髮奇緣 #真人版 #Disney #Tangled #Rapunzel #AnyaTaylorJoy #Frozen #Elsa #魔雪奇緣 #冰雪奇緣 #genz #movie\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n▼追蹤 @SSwagger.hk IG緊貼動態潮流、生活資訊", "owner_username": "sswagger.hk", "owner_id": "8397362", "likes": 20231, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0363_DDeWNrGvOyn\\DDeWNrGvOyn_20241212_100000_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0363_DDeWNrGvOyn\\DDeWNrGvOyn_20241212_100000_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0363_DDeWNrGvOyn\\DDeWNrGvOyn_20241212_100000_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0363_DDeWNrGvOyn\\DDeWNrGvOyn_20241212_100000_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0363_DDeWNrGvOyn\\DDeWNrGvOyn_20241212_100000_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0363_DDeWNrGvOyn\\DDeWNrGvOyn_20241212_100000_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0363_DDeWNrGvOyn\\DDeWNrGvOyn_20241212_100000_7.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18042205868218359, "text": "終於沒有政治正確", "created_at": "2025-01-04T04:37:54", "owner": "darkboyclaire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042485198027438, "text": "我覺得鐘點戰的女主角比較適合樂佩的感覺", "created_at": "2025-01-01T13:10:11", "owner": "melissa13714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048219737123001, "text": "她適合演Elsa…", "created_at": "2024-12-31T06:31:04", "owner": "fkufaklove.0106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953965698762775, "text": "看开了 好过白雪公主和美人鱼🙂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T02:44:25", "owner": "k_yl0918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847746640354473, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-30T21:15:11", "owner": "5_matail_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908821879070187, "text": "希望她的演技能夠演出一個不一樣的自己。", "created_at": "2024-12-29T12:14:17", "owner": "kitlailaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000494363534570, "text": "黑的，我猜是黑的", "created_at": "2024-12-27T16:38:25", "owner": "ifavoritez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867320890274712, "text": "只適合冰雪奇緣愛莎的感覺", "created_at": "2024-12-27T08:39:04", "owner": "lo.93_moana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902581291000173, "text": "不不不 還是喜歡黑黑的小美肺魚跟黃雪公主", "created_at": "2024-12-27T06:43:13", "owner": "skz_02_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072659320630344, "text": "Jenna Ortega 😍", "created_at": "2024-12-25T16:48:19", "owner": "fatboy7768", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130839775375954, "text": "Too old😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T16:47:35", "owner": "fatboy7768", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862126291299668, "text": "吉娃娃", "created_at": "2024-12-25T12:39:01", "owner": "bud._.02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056248756777106, "text": "Dune cast wtf", "created_at": "2024-12-24T10:45:47", "owner": "fulcrum.wkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072347872652103, "text": "好啦，這次至少是黃髮白人", "created_at": "2024-12-23T23:12:55", "owner": "yc_yang_gaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882987775193618, "text": "哇呜。。。终于不是黑人的😂", "created_at": "2024-12-23T20:21:41", "owner": "angelifulworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062952055832421, "text": "checkmate", "created_at": "2024-12-22T12:43:56", "owner": "cyc.0808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379724542104197, "text": "不能啦 要夠黑才可以唷～", "created_at": "2024-12-22T10:01:08", "owner": "litt1e_pu5h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858484123264035, "text": "我唔想呢個做，我要Rose 做😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-22T03:57:13", "owner": "ahyeonnnn_jung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884032285189947, "text": "Ariana Grande更適合吧", "created_at": "2024-12-22T02:53:06", "owner": "fish0224000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030928601613071, "text": "要求不高 不黑就好🙏🏿🙏🏿🙏🏿", "created_at": "2024-12-21T19:20:45", "owner": "iamnotkalu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072719857647215, "text": "Flower gleam and glow . Make your peer show. Make the clock reverse. Bring back what once was mine….", "created_at": "2024-12-21T17:30:46", "owner": "stone0825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18487366159009596, "text": "提摩西夏勒梅😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-21T15:03:10", "owner": "winnie__jazzlover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091191883503852, "text": "是冰雪奇緣", "created_at": "2024-12-21T10:35:27", "owner": "nala108218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065199676829995, "text": "我不喜歡這個女生", "created_at": "2024-12-21T09:39:05", "owner": "naomikung0619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323903023083767, "text": "至少沒有新版史內卜這麼違和😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T07:40:47", "owner": "debbyhsu00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981805389788405, "text": "喊話 @sabrinacarpenter 也很適合😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-19T23:09:49", "owner": "mebao_0727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025225862304163, "text": "我覺得Sabrina Carpenter比較適合", "created_at": "2024-12-19T14:57:02", "owner": "py_04228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069322414731493, "text": "最近公主都用兩眼間的距離來選了嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T19:21:59", "owner": "maxineling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065045710813674, "text": "??唔好la", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:16:28", "owner": "css_0906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113247427437368, "text": "这不正确", "created_at": "2024-12-18T10:47:49", "owner": "eren_ahlun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148476361352122, "text": "又是一部不想看的真人版🙂", "created_at": "2024-12-18T08:01:18", "owner": "joe_osh94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053427439960235, "text": "不是黑的迪士尼不要", "created_at": "2024-12-18T07:51:12", "owner": "ava._.117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080797867605616, "text": "這麼好的選角 太不政確了 🤡", "created_at": "2024-12-18T00:03:49", "owner": "recca1224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108211696453271, "text": "不要不要🙅🏻‍♀️🙅🏻‍♀️🙅🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-12-17T19:05:04", "owner": "fyl_lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860675875245547, "text": "樂佩比較適合給rosé演啦💗💗超級無敵漂亮可愛", "created_at": "2024-12-17T10:08:59", "owner": "xinjing_.4405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935919537956979, "text": "都好過白雪公主", "created_at": "2024-12-17T07:22:05", "owner": "alanmak1015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044777480163780, "text": "超適合", "created_at": "2024-12-17T04:43:59", "owner": "adela.1005.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952552788761579, "text": "怎沒選黑人，不怕被冲嗎😂", "created_at": "2024-12-17T02:45:36", "owner": "kennan_0142", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867572992194056, "text": "迪士尼學乖了？", "created_at": "2024-12-16T05:34:06", "owner": "laiweiwei0216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846353809352615, "text": "唔啱feel", "created_at": "2024-12-16T04:03:57", "owner": "jasonlau.0516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049699568094728, "text": "Anya Taylor-Joy長得太成熟了 樂佩是可愛類型的耶….艾莎真的才比較適合她演出👏✨", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:01:20", "owner": "39.saya__", "likes": 93}, {"id": 18329640502152925, "text": "黑人跨性別短髮公主準備出場🥲", "created_at": "2024-12-15T16:20:11", "owner": "alisa.soul1219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049507541492260, "text": "我覺得星期三的狼人會挺適合的", "created_at": "2024-12-15T14:33:44", "owner": "yixuan.817", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17860920129239661, "text": "Sabrina carpenter 更適合吧", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:17:13", "owner": "gemini._0617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964939761821766, "text": "真人版的小美人魚已經打破了我的童年了😭", "created_at": "2024-12-15T08:48:57", "owner": "tina_c1119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352451758133587, "text": "不適合 真的不適合", "created_at": "2024-12-15T08:27:37", "owner": "lc_.1222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138494716370037, "text": "……迪士尼到底要毀掉多少童年……", "created_at": "2024-12-15T07:44:06", "owner": "luyiyunnntt091415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069531343661922, "text": "諗多左，公主一定係黑人，女巫就應該有份", "created_at": "2024-12-15T06:22:42", "owner": "dannyaikawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052625912503318, "text": "《这么美怎么能做公主呢》", "created_at": "2024-12-15T05:31:23", "owner": "jmyjiang057", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950580198869605, "text": "最後一定揾黑人拍", "created_at": "2024-12-15T03:45:53", "owner": "cy168hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974537700797406, "text": "她看起來比較成熟，不適合樂佩，我覺得Ariana Grande更適合欸", "created_at": "2024-12-14T16:55:29", "owner": "itz_yui.420", "likes": 503}, {"id": 17901592916997496, "text": "我只希望能和樂佩一樣頭髮很長很活潑皮膚白白", "created_at": "2024-12-14T13:37:07", "owner": "ting_word", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078744082580478, "text": "放心...等等就會出現黑人演的...", "created_at": "2024-12-14T12:56:40", "owner": "orangebaby1111", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051171466855508, "text": "别拍", "created_at": "2024-12-14T11:27:06", "owner": "prmty1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123744214397085, "text": "拜託不要…😢", "created_at": "2024-12-14T11:06:00", "owner": "wg_yuqi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016070498638355, "text": "拜托不要黑人😢", "created_at": "2024-12-14T10:06:16", "owner": "wailam.f", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860838676242056, "text": "我覺得很棒耶", "created_at": "2024-12-14T09:28:41", "owner": "b.h.m_926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955716165747834, "text": "我比較好奇變色龍是怎麼安排", "created_at": "2024-12-14T08:36:31", "owner": "wushiblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014985509456583, "text": "完全不適合", "created_at": "2024-12-14T08:18:46", "owner": "ajajaj._.6666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344139637180277, "text": "Anya Taylor joy想做Elsa，俾佢做Elsa啦😢\n同埋佢有個女王高貴氣質\n呢個長髮公主有啲唔啱", "created_at": "2024-12-14T06:38:35", "owner": "llh.cindy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076690816549724, "text": "艾莎比較像❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-14T05:39:59", "owner": "aop1215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337176394195239, "text": "Elsa 更好😢", "created_at": "2024-12-14T05:26:06", "owner": "jc.sty_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863597500222756, "text": "個性也比較像Elsa", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:46:35", "owner": "ra._.77e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018119330380215, "text": "我覺得她比較適合Elsa😢", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:45:34", "owner": "ra._.77e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059936227882925, "text": "長髮公主應該活潑D陽光D，Anya 感覺係氣質女王。", "created_at": "2024-12-14T03:45:13", "owner": "aris_aris_aris_aris_aris", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18010972085492131, "text": "我推Sabrina Carpenter", "created_at": "2024-12-14T03:27:44", "owner": "its.meee.sean.13", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18138109399329910, "text": "我想看琳賽蘿涵，好久沒看到她了", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:50:03", "owner": "kiyo_bubble", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048481616488811, "text": "樂佩的活潑 我在她身上看不到", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:20:50", "owner": "hunter_haching5487", "likes": 1066}, {"id": 18336803722198042, "text": "如果搵黑人做就變成駁髮公主啦", "created_at": "2024-12-13T23:44:43", "owner": "makynnad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480285421037157, "text": "雖然我不討厭這個演員\n但希望不要找她，希望是更有公主感的人飾演", "created_at": "2024-12-13T23:17:37", "owner": "du.zi.513", "likes": 744}, {"id": 18050877169854504, "text": "咪玩啦，一定係搵黑人做", "created_at": "2024-12-13T17:45:20", "owner": "ch_ng_ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992169066740047, "text": "為什麼要一直出真人版？？？？", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:38:33", "owner": "klps1010118", "likes": 53}, {"id": 17937370913949942, "text": "唔黑點拍😂", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:33:02", "owner": "benlkssoul", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863018698289284, "text": "我希望男主是甜茶！！！（他很適合❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:05:34", "owner": "subaru__anon0114", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18067054936743122, "text": "唔諗係掛🫥", "created_at": "2024-12-13T14:22:07", "owner": "lwsnathan21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066258262701968, "text": "沒有懸念，將會是黑人", "created_at": "2024-12-13T13:28:56", "owner": "andyguren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053990812956764, "text": "可能又會搵個黑人做\nPS:雖然我唔想！唔好又毁童年！", "created_at": "2024-12-13T13:21:17", "owner": "yanbe0329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058698412893665, "text": "有可能是黑人", "created_at": "2024-12-13T12:55:05", "owner": "rona_6_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042283793186769, "text": "不要甜茶吧 這角色不太適合", "created_at": "2024-12-13T12:06:55", "owner": "ruby_1218_", "likes": 143}, {"id": 18108578455448687, "text": "@roses_are_rosie 我覺得她比較適合😭", "created_at": "2024-12-13T11:50:02", "owner": "ue_xzy", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18083381848499141, "text": "太成熟了 適合演女王", "created_at": "2024-12-13T11:32:03", "owner": "anila_0221", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086010901550528, "text": "🔥Emma Myers", "created_at": "2024-12-13T11:24:10", "owner": "meril_073112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867532606260632, "text": "別想了，會是黑人", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:48:12", "owner": "vergillam112", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17912016132047541, "text": "不要😢😢😢不適合", "created_at": "2024-12-13T08:23:17", "owner": "1027_selina", "likes": 259}, {"id": 18052853782994675, "text": "不用說了，黑人和拉丁人已準備好", "created_at": "2024-12-13T08:19:13", "owner": "vaderwai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103241941461117, "text": "But I want Emma😆", "created_at": "2024-12-13T07:50:14", "owner": "kavrilsuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912482698027105, "text": "怎麼可以不找黑人，我要抗議(反串)", "created_at": "2024-12-13T07:34:24", "owner": "jiunn_hsiang_shiah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063894832772874, "text": "要黑皮 才會有人happy", "created_at": "2024-12-13T02:44:35", "owner": "hydrasan_831211", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18102063745474968, "text": "他比較像Elsa", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:32:23", "owner": "zenso_spirit", "likes": 718}, {"id": 18033454418586127, "text": "呢個咪正正常常lor!唔好遲點推黑人版呀！🧑🏿‍🦲", "created_at": "2024-12-12T19:38:21", "owner": "cosmowong313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475639459037982, "text": "why dont you go @hueneuh", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:59:57", "owner": "hauyin.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027748136605793, "text": "結果是黑人😆", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:49:47", "owner": "malin2004520", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18030443990436595, "text": "終於正常返附合返動畫外型", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:46:09", "owner": "gorfiti_samedi", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18071762998630173, "text": "金長髮白人憑什麽做公主？", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:02:29", "owner": "jerry_the_great", "likes": 500}, {"id": 17964980405821442, "text": "要求唔高 唔黑已經好好", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:34:43", "owner": "kyle.lo.1297", "likes": 664}, {"id": 18055357567796232, "text": "終於唔係崩壞系列", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:34:27", "owner": "leekasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031445492605729, "text": "不要呀，會變成黑公主的😢", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:24:03", "owner": "michelle_07170", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17936299871951064, "text": "搵個少女啲啦好唔好😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:22:37", "owner": "sze_pak_yan", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18017352959644982, "text": "期待🤩🤩", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:13:33", "owner": "guoliang_916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920809803915983, "text": "怎麼不是nigger", "created_at": "2025-01-05T15:58:42", "owner": "jonnyart812338", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["ssw世代z", "sswagger", "小編s", "迪士尼", "魔髮奇緣", "真人版", "disney", "tangled", "rapunzel", "anyataylorjoy", "frozen", "elsa", "魔雪奇緣", "冰雪奇緣", "genz", "movie"]},
