{"media_id": 3518173721737583950, "shortcode": "DDTEFweSF1O", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDTEFweSF1O/", "taken_at": "2024-12-08T00:51:53", "caption": "no bullshit let’s go", "owner_username": "akatkomi.ateeeeekoki", "owner_id": "38472653398", "likes": 39051, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0365_DDTEFweSF1O\\DDTEFweSF1O_20241208_005153.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17939469392930608, "text": "畀著係我我屌咗你老母喇", "created_at": "2024-12-12T05:45:36", "owner": "chukinglun42", "likes": 1305}, {"id": 17949536069904421, "text": "自以為好正義", "created_at": "2024-12-09T01:41:20", "owner": "lkwong2683", "likes": 999}, {"id": 18027273728251907, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T22:19:44", "owner": "xegx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018631121375888, "text": "你當你搭緊uber?", "created_at": "2024-12-15T20:14:12", "owner": "ckonoha0720", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889761628140506, "text": "cls 咁多comment撐個喇叭L", "created_at": "2024-12-15T19:45:35", "owner": "thyau_jy", "likes": 76}, {"id": 18014822225447908, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:22:23", "owner": "n1netyy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889231438148802, "text": "👏🔥👍", "created_at": "2024-12-15T13:11:01", "owner": "ar_lamon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920339374008887, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T05:23:34", "owner": "chungchung2603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096795925490471, "text": "Hahahahahahhah", "created_at": "2024-12-15T02:16:22", "owner": "sean.an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070765234594925, "text": "播大聲都算，仲要係抖陰，抵diu啦", "created_at": "2024-12-15T00:57:22", "owner": "ratkyouse", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060906457876487, "text": "😂 高 👍🏼", "created_at": "2024-12-14T22:45:54", "owner": "ud0w0ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018439733378023, "text": "想知如果佢唔配合你會點😂", "created_at": "2024-12-14T13:41:03", "owner": "_pepeken_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973600608803387, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌👏👏👏👏正", "created_at": "2024-12-14T13:06:19", "owner": "noellee_miro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052058426503730, "text": "下次直接叫人講細聲啲得啦 唔係po上網", "created_at": "2024-12-14T12:26:21", "owner": "andy.cks_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957684561846677, "text": "good job", "created_at": "2024-12-14T11:53:42", "owner": "leoyhf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982462467786842, "text": "播大悲咒同佢鬥大聲🙌🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-14T09:59:01", "owner": "wmngan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070580545638877, "text": "邊有咁禮貌 \n我同事係直接屌", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:07:48", "owner": "wingho_325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037895747351546, "text": "下次送air pod👏包保雙方和平", "created_at": "2024-12-14T03:37:12", "owner": "casper_ortsac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923052372905804, "text": "Men☕☕☕", "created_at": "2024-12-14T03:32:25", "owner": "yyywwno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030605006605342, "text": "所以跌左乜", "created_at": "2024-12-14T03:03:58", "owner": "jackyaujacky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18257121142280471, "text": "終於明白香港人包括我自己，呢類行為叫乜野。叫做小氣", "created_at": "2024-12-14T02:38:46", "owner": "johnsince07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890447938134950, "text": "下次同呀sir講 你跌咗野 跌咗良心", "created_at": "2024-12-14T01:54:28", "owner": "andrew.p_game", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863523892225968, "text": "點解叫佢細聲D而唔係戴耳機？", "created_at": "2024-12-13T20:10:11", "owner": "winiwhoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053870245978080, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:08:15", "owner": "hks._.and_y", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18021660290630616, "text": "下次我教大聲d添呀 人地睇緊女俾你嚇一嚇都未撚回到魂 心唸跌乜撚野", "created_at": "2024-12-13T13:31:58", "owner": "siukinqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014243042460576, "text": "KAML", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:54:22", "owner": "tommychan13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053312746956798, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-13T09:45:00", "owner": "pochi__0401etv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053280965306348, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-13T04:54:20", "owner": "syedpares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955930305850860, "text": "好波", "created_at": "2024-12-12T18:27:45", "owner": "charlie._.wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288981481214627, "text": "以為只有亞伯至係咁", "created_at": "2024-12-12T18:12:42", "owner": "tou4710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951721974764024, "text": "香港人咁高質素，點會係香港人呢，實係大陸人啦", "created_at": "2024-12-12T17:31:02", "owner": "yukomax1017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059870488807633, "text": "下次試下 大悲咒", "created_at": "2024-12-12T16:32:35", "owner": "i_m_a_l_o_n_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282478420244474, "text": "@tommylichun", "created_at": "2024-12-12T15:04:08", "owner": "joyinkidspartyroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041938141995173, "text": "手機開得太大聲的確係影響到人 ，但係好似片主咁有挑逗性嘅說話， 通常就係打交嘅起因......", "created_at": "2024-12-12T12:08:11", "owner": "ipwinglun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065286106693617, "text": "通常你講越細聲啲，我就越大聲😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:33:34", "owner": "ianliu_0520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044751296278816, "text": "正正常常講嘢咪算 人哋唔聽再屌都未遲", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:31:51", "owner": "my_newlife_vision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988572666774495, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:26:39", "owner": "keitmk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887063782157444, "text": "公德心跌左？", "created_at": "2024-12-12T11:04:30", "owner": "yip_max", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918207237922761, "text": "😂👏🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:32:14", "owner": "k24nothing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934320954842549, "text": "做得好", "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:12:06", "owner": "luk1083123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052772746964398, "text": "👏做得好", "created_at": "2024-12-12T07:14:24", "owner": "badapplexlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039326684198063, "text": "@olded_chan 同伴😃💪👍", "created_at": "2024-12-12T07:12:02", "owner": "freddyli0824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120131062409173, "text": "三振聲", "created_at": "2024-12-12T05:02:28", "owner": "k.w.wing_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054622342787847, "text": "屌得好", "created_at": "2024-12-12T03:40:56", "owner": "_nlkman_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070028857660472, "text": "自由同公德兩様在面前", "created_at": "2024-12-12T01:38:22", "owner": "tingpong.leung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18475295842056390, "text": "其實人地都照做又冇發脾氣啦\n仲要擺人上網，比著下次到你自己\n唔為意就俾人擺左上網公審\n真係幼稚", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:40:26", "owner": "wtf_wtfgggggggg", "likes": 208}, {"id": 18031511567599611, "text": "公共場合禁止喇叭外放建議寫進教科書", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:16:51", "owner": "cn_coca", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18259214374269879, "text": "都唔係要細聲啲 直頭應該靜音", "created_at": "2024-12-11T10:56:37", "owner": "pangwsss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026116976564409, "text": "喺佢後面大聲播pornhub 等人以為係佢睇😂", "created_at": "2024-12-11T10:01:51", "owner": "keiy188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861967726296444, "text": "我以為講跌撚左個喇叭", "created_at": "2024-12-11T09:25:50", "owner": "winggg.mac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032372327586503, "text": "叫佢細聲D已經好仁慈，應該要熄左個聲", "created_at": "2024-12-11T06:43:06", "owner": "sic_jo_mud_9", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17883098682188972, "text": "撐你呀 做得好呀", "created_at": "2024-12-11T06:40:26", "owner": "kayfong182", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17931845066964891, "text": "如果佢答你：下，我無架啵？", "created_at": "2024-12-11T03:34:11", "owner": "mandy.lingling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071360704635095, "text": "拍埋MTR 版丫，見一個拍一個就個collection ，消滅呢啲抖音喇叭！", "created_at": "2024-12-11T02:04:22", "owner": "mimichelle815", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18055804528925121, "text": "直接叫佢細聲唔得？", "created_at": "2024-12-10T19:42:08", "owner": "kin1201hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993852789721087, "text": "我覺得型喎，起碼夠薑講，唔係淨係偷拍完放上網屌嗰啲", "created_at": "2024-12-10T19:25:30", "owner": "__allencheung__", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17989893518604680, "text": "欣賞你條片冇影到人哋個樣", "created_at": "2024-12-10T19:03:29", "owner": "fafaafa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18479351440026564, "text": "Kam撚", "created_at": "2024-12-10T17:34:38", "owner": "mark_swy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18306676591204352, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-10T16:36:09", "owner": "mr_tristanl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052694944831750, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-10T16:09:58", "owner": "joyjoyjoyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037577411070713, "text": "做得好👍🏼", "created_at": "2024-12-10T15:35:42", "owner": "tonymrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085738954530884, "text": "好老實，如條友係大隻佬，仲