2-10T00:32:11", "owner": "hjc925", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17994138998580928, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2024-12-10T00:08:41", "owner": "kookoo88988", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039710327036592, "text": "得兩個人先夠膽拍😏", "created_at": "2024-12-09T21:31:34", "owner": "michaelbowen8999", "likes": 158}, {"id": 18050872997007475, "text": "其實有時唔敢出聲係驚啲人係白卡 打7你都唔犯法🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:40:42", "owner": "hycjennyy11", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18062330860677123, "text": "跟住就玩街霸，round 1. Fight 🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:23:59", "owner": "notyoubusines", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049453904087409, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:01:09", "owner": "c.maan.l_with2meow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18261244642266891, "text": "咁樣講嘢嘅語氣 仲難聽過粗口", "created_at": "2024-12-09T16:28:42", "owner": "kenng810", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17998135421715341, "text": "笑到鬆唔到阿 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T16:14:00", "owner": "alien.arha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18158435191331608, "text": "呢位少俠，請受老夫一拜\n實在太大快人心喇", "created_at": "2024-12-09T15:33:28", "owner": "sjv.88", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18129035668376987, "text": "機會 50/50", "created_at": "2024-12-09T15:04:23", "owner": "cgrindrig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040981313242733, "text": "同跌左個優惠一樣無賴…", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:52:59", "owner": "allenlaw428", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18123585457398081, "text": "吊得好！", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:48:00", "owner": "tungtsui_14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082538626560185, "text": "做得好呀", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:14:06", "owner": "apm1134", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025346252302088, "text": "正！👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:04:44", "owner": "quentess", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038145131198139, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-09T13:00:14", "owner": "samuel_101567", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031262333177907, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:26:15", "owner": "_dav_chu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130793716380632, "text": "😂🔥👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-09T11:10:55", "owner": "mmyellow_wong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18257264560258611, "text": "好撚嘈咩,定係佢有千里耳？", "created_at": "2024-12-09T10:11:02", "owner": "wayne.yip.54", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844297258373549, "text": "屌得好🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-09T09:45:21", "owner": "onmanman", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18174000436312510, "text": "好有禮貌，邊忽衝擊？😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T09:29:31", "owner": "username_censored", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18097805041436626, "text": "如果係黑社會呢？咪一樣笠水😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T09:26:25", "owner": "fung_siu_ting", "likes": 224}, {"id": 18045033952945594, "text": "勇氣可嘉👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-09T08:13:14", "owner": "_llewellynleung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974786463659346, "text": "你sure 會work?😂人地會彩你？ 多數都喺播抖音嘅喎😂", "created_at": "2024-12-09T07:23:25", "owner": "l1onel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051447376979494, "text": "最簡單，播經文比佢睇就搞掂啦", "created_at": "2024-12-09T07:15:47", "owner": "rilakkuma201314", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3475000147877968141, "shortcode": "DA5rjkgsjkN", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DA5rjkgsjkN/", "taken_at": "2024-10-09T11:12:21", "caption": "🍭 More than 600 items for sale at an Oxford Street candy shop have been incinerated after a Trading Standards raid.\n\nThe central London store had American cereal, crisps and fizzy drinks seized by Westminster City Council’s Environmental Health team.\n\nThe products, valued at more than £2,800, contained additives, colourings and e-numbers that were either banned in the UK or above the legal limit.\n\nAdam Hug, leader of Westminster City Council, said: \"We are continuing to make the lives of unscrupulous traders a nightmare through regular enforcement action.\"\n\n#americancandy #sweets #chocolate #oxfordstreet #london #crime #bbcnews", "owner_username": "bbclondon", "owner_id": "2226615827", "likes": 12242, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0366_DA5rjkgsjkN\\DA5rjkgsjkN_20241009_111221.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18379057657138507, "text": "Then why they were passed by the customs in the first place, and they can attach an English ingredients description to each product", "created_at": "2025-04-06T21:31:54", "owner": "talal_aw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077871760690545, "text": "Shame on Sir Sadiq Khan", "created_at": "2025-04-06T20:06:00", "owner": "gwenjbrewer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494670826015686, "text": "This garbage is not food.", "created_at": "2025-04-06T19:58:00", "owner": "ritchie.rosson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078804847736506, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-04-06T16:14:35", "owner": "jumsy60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932272480009919, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-04-06T10:38:01", "owner": "fatz9530", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048773972064997, "text": "How are these shops affording rent and all the Oxford street bills. I hardly see anyone buying their sweets", "created_at": "2025-04-06T07:09:48", "owner": "veenessstylz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009619124539287, "text": "All ways check and put the uk standards sticker with ingredients on.", "created_at": "2025-04-05T16:28:57", "owner": "mesh.86.parekh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970039842845593, "text": "When you went to see the one shop did you see the other 100?", "created_at": "2025-04-05T08:43:53", "owner": "the.meat.beer.boss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061693450866553, "text": "Can’t wait for this UK-USA trade deal.. 💀", "created_at": "2025-04-04T17:18:43", "owner": "niceliquidice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945736281968785, "text": "Should be closed down to stop this.", "created_at": "2025-04-03T20:58:57", "owner": "linda8999martin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331543093089628, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-03-16T17:17:24", "owner": "abdul_b.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18486493015052327, "text": "Really ridiculous that the news features the raids of small shops whilst I've seen the same products with ingredients in foreign languages in Tesco Asda and Home bargains but these big supermarkets are not held accountable", "created_at": "2025-03-09T01:23:38", "owner": "chocchip789", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045954389223185, "text": "How many years getting away with it?!", "created_at": "2025-02-12T20:45:32", "owner": "caleb.insitu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268009855265231, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-02T23:06:01", "owner": "kadir.78611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176070781313301, "text": "Everyone knows these shops are straight up money laundering", "created_at": "2025-01-30T21:29:09", "owner": "drewzy92.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071453248688645, "text": "And they still do not shut them down😂", "created_at": "2025-01-26T00:48:43", "owner": "_alexa_i_am_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029055437535595, "text": "Close them down!", "created_at": "2025-01-20T21:39:07", "owner": "athnyrsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010183097651010, "text": "Since when have additives been dangerous? Wtf, and then these same people wonder why homelessness exists", "created_at": "2025-01-19T14:28:53", "owner": "iwonderifheavenhasagym", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031341809240868, "text": "DO NOT SEND ME THESE VIDEOS.\nI AM NOT GOING TO TELL YOU AGAIN.", "created_at": "2025-01-16T16:30:05", "owner": "sunnydecemberdays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092650693511740, "text": "How about going after the guys stealing phones rather than going after sweatshops", "created_at": "2024-12-29T11:35:51", "owner": "lifeofblake_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018927068385393, "text": "Now check the off license shops", "created_at": "2024-12-23T17:49:43", "owner": "grssmtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119011582415492, "text": "Please check more shop please thanks🙏", "created_at": "2024-12-19T16:47:49", "owner": "adeolalawal0011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065703694757935, "text": "Wait till they find out that they are avoiding taxes too", "created_at": "2024-12-19T13:38:19", "owner": "deepercomplexion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065194228647337, "text": "Surely the shop should instantly be forced to close...", "created_at": "2024-12-19T08:16:15", "owner": "clevelanddan_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086151637554416, "text": "Evert year they raid them and find drugs, illegal products etc but they still end up staying open or reopening as a “new candy store”.", "created_at": "2024-12-18T10:53:04", "owner": "suzanwp27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039262628349530, "text": "Seal them up", "created_at": "2024-12-18T08:20:14", "owner": "mukesh.gohil.773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843816856384264, "text": "Them matcha kitkats though 😮😍", "created_at": "2024-12-17T21:04:27", "owner": "hazzajoseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938527362944594, "text": "Money laundering anyway", "created_at": "2024-12-17T16:48:26", "owner": "bumblebeecody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067281178740785, "text": "Fake food: These chemical preservative additive filler ARTIFICIAL addictive poisons never ever expire ☠️☠️☠️", "created_at": "2024-12-17T15:12:32", "owner": "feline_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039436622518378, "text": "Good. American food is pure toxic trash.", "created_at": "2024-12-17T05:02:27", "owner": "grumpwaffle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18451044760068924, "text": "£2k is a small price to pay for the amount of money they’re laundering", "created_at": "2024-12-17T01:16:00", "owner": "steven__rex__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099220297487268, "text": "saves you lot from “waiting too long” at the hospital for your tummy ache 🤡", "created_at": "2024-12-17T00:31:09", "owner": "yashib1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057442657933049, "text": "Shame on the council to let these shops open . Close them down . There is no way they are making money to pay those rents selling sweets … think", "created_at": "2024-12-16T21:57:05", "owner": "mattkil14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050955860094968, "text": "Not the Kitkats! 😭", "created_at": "2024-12-16T21:33:25", "owner": "catherine_nickford_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18485169385031516, "text": "One there is such a thing as CUSTOMER SERVICES TELEPHONE there is also the product testing of the products head office and then there are trading standards such as these who read online NOT fact checked materials and make these foolish decisions, if the company's thought it was unsafe then it couldn't be exported to here, therefore I dont understand this process as the manufacturer and wholesalers are were to target not the shop", "created_at": "2024-12-16T20:57:17", "owner": "st.evenadams2584", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337834075146169, "text": "I love how they make sure to mention, several times, the American sweets while showing tonnes of Japanese candies ...", "created_at": "2024-12-16T19:32:19", "owner": "renegademetalsmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069263956670361, "text": "Cancer products", "created_at": "2024-12-16T17:45:15", "owner": "stayaliveorbekilled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009753080496990, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-16T15:08:17", "owner": "d_smooth_djm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992743386739533, "text": "But they will happily put bovaer in milk 🤢", "created_at": "2024-12-16T09:46:00", "owner": "ngangued1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080080651569911, "text": "Oxford Street is just all money laundering shops now. I never go there anymore. Such a shame as I used to love it, especially at Christmas. It's rubbish now.", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:58:54", "owner": "redheadhomesed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033706835377940, "text": "@laurenoneill95x", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:32:37", "owner": "joelgriff1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905741899075750, "text": "👏🏾👏🏾👏🏾👏🏾👏🏾👏🏾", "created_at": "2024-12-16T08:28:32", "owner": "3b0ny24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062373694850327, "text": "This is a victory for them when all now these places are shop fronts, they don’t care about no damn 3k 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-16T02:21:55", "owner": "jamescatalanohair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978573063643250, "text": "Hurrah!! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-15T22:29:48", "owner": "epaggea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031802513167789, "text": "When is Westnoneter going to shut these shops down since they are money laundering as well as selling illegal stuff 🤔", "created_at": "2024-12-15T21:50:11", "owner": "ollie.newell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097771339491162, "text": "They haven't caught the SAM marts yet ... Literally one every half mile  and they blind me with their lights  the whole building is literally up", "created_at": "2024-12-15T21:46:28", "owner": "fatheha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893231515102800, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-12-15T20:14:00", "owner": "woertmancandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053502280826909, "text": "Everyone knows it's money laundering", "created_at": "2024-12-15T19:47:04", "owner": "resellergeorge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053731693950867, "text": "I've noticed these Harry Potter stores cropping up too. Replacing those \"sweet shops\" I guess", "created_at": "2024-12-15T19:33:15", "owner": "jojaca89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030603839442164, "text": "@thefoodbabe", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:50:59", "owner": "starrynite23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339551230146273, "text": "Good its dangerous", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:48:21", "owner": "ghostbshadow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040920305209028, "text": "🇺🇸 crap 🇬🇧 made sweet are 👍❤️🇨🇦", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:39:12", "owner": "wright10lulu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104386447460681, "text": "American lucky charms are sold in the UK at Tesco and Sainsbury’s. They are not banned here", "created_at": "2024-12-15T11:00:59", "owner": "ukmassy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856282024337803, "text": "Surely our police should be focusing on real crimes - hahaha", "created_at": "2024-12-15T05:06:00", "owner": "pablothewasp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899285752072142, "text": "Takis", "created_at": "2024-12-15T03:36:06", "owner": "catalzmarques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044357294275113, "text": "But the shops never get permanently closed down? Hmm.", "created_at": "2024-12-14T20:04:06", "owner": "niraj_ologist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853446883345172, "text": "Why don’t they aim for wholesalers???? Which government body is giving authorization to import these??? It seems like UK has started the show business like some third world countries, do they really want to solve the problem?", "created_at": "2024-12-14T06:39:54", "owner": "fezan.senai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952195509763156, "text": "Safe in the USA, dangerous in the UK 🙄", "created_at": "2024-12-13T19:54:36", "owner": "tariqatchia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086813785528259, "text": "I went to a shop and all the chocolate was out of date I was shocked 😳", "created_at": "2024-12-13T10:45:47", "owner": "tiffsso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949408068869921, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-13T00:07:41", "owner": "shes_houda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064521319801766, "text": "Turn a blind eye to people getting shanked on the roads but all over the Japanese Kit Kats. 🤔", "created_at": "2024-12-12T21:34:54", "owner": "rapha_benitez_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086478808480952, "text": "While its welcome to tackle those money laundering fronts, destroying perfectly edible foods is pure white privilege.", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:24:20", "owner": "firaskay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956758932846295, "text": "@jacobchapman484 👀", "created_at": "2024-12-12T08:18:12", "owner": "mrsdebchapman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033564575130673, "text": "Yet you can still sell cigarettes?", "created_at": "2024-12-11T11:15:40", "owner": "people.i.admire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050251462841182, "text": "The money laundering shops", "created_at": "2024-12-11T07:08:29", "owner": "daverichards008", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026016233541238, "text": "@lucymoff3", "created_at": "2024-12-10T23:24:56", "owner": "angelina_townsend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909936340051175, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-10T21:55:09", "owner": "tre.gio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915977029034518, "text": "Seriously? Nothing else going on?", "created_at": "2024-12-10T15:35:29", "owner": "skatincayton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015954524405061, "text": "Makes no sense as you can order all of this food online if it's alright for Amazon and others to sell it then why is it a problem in these shops ??", "created_at": "2024-12-09T08:34:06", "owner": "aasawmilllaux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860383252241448, "text": "No my sweeeeeets", "created_at": "2024-12-08T16:02:56", "owner": "girllondoning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160862098322870, "text": "Tbh more actual Londonees should make their feelings known to these shops. Shocking trading standards hadn't cone down harder.", "created_at": "2024-12-04T00:54:43", "owner": "alecatma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150666913339393, "text": "Raids? CHARGE THEM ALREADY", "created_at": "2024-12-04T00:53:07", "owner": "alecatma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969130518681407, "text": "I hope these shops are shut down, they’re naff, over priced unhealthy tat used as fronts to hold on to leases. Why would tourists ever come to London to buy American Candy??", "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:36:26", "owner": "russowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912198724040218, "text": "True 👍", "created_at": "2024-12-01T15:54:08", "owner": "farahlatifmontgomery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055378438932884, "text": "Who on earth buys this revolting stuff?", "created_at": "2024-11-28T17:17:10", "owner": "defagojulie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984305280773975, "text": "\"Labels in English\" ... eh, Google Lens is a thing.", "created_at": "2024-11-28T13:53:27", "owner": "karenjkwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033172388522259, "text": "Can they destroy LINDT DARK CHOCOLATE  as its full of LEAD AND CADMIUM", "created_at": "2024-11-27T18:52:38", "owner": "psychedelickitty82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040877147333171, "text": "American sweet shops and Turkish barbers.", "created_at": "2024-11-27T14:19:33", "owner": "ben_web_1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061128544827502, "text": "So are we saying yanks will eat anything?", "created_at": "2024-11-27T00:05:21", "owner": "mrowlrocks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320137186084809, "text": "It’s gives South African spaza shops", "created_at": "2024-11-26T14:35:00", "owner": "joshmiller_101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18293070190224811, "text": "@siennakendo 😮 i think weve been in this shop 🤦🏼‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-11-26T12:38:34", "owner": "nikikenwright", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979466772636398, "text": "Close them all", "created_at": "2024-11-26T07:54:01", "owner": "crarich89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049470908005375, "text": "Finally all these money laundering candy shops are being dealt with", "created_at": "2024-11-26T05:35:19", "owner": "mblackuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047542589102807, "text": "Makes u think lol Americans eat these cereals or sweets every day 🤦🏽‍♀️", "created_at": "2024-11-25T22:14:17", "owner": "____lamyah____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852791140338194, "text": "Crying over those Japanese KitKats. What a waste", "created_at": "2024-11-25T12:42:52", "owner": "twilightsiren85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861848344221994, "text": "There is Google Translate and you can Translate everything", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:15:41", "owner": "katrin_shek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292170349224325, "text": "They ate boreeed", "created_at": "2024-11-25T09:06:18", "owner": "ab.24zzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041629415237155, "text": "Only a front I’m sure they’ll survive", "created_at": "2024-11-24T02:34:37", "owner": "prokaryotic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038195774217348, "text": "When will the government control those tacky colourful tuk-tuk bike thingy that blasts tacky music loudly? It’s making London looking like India.", "created_at": "2024-11-23T23:38:17", "owner": "animaloversunite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957885066730654, "text": "@thefoodbabe", "created_at": "2024-11-23T22:00:11", "owner": "trixysam05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955619235740352, "text": "It’s unfit for human consumption, so no!", "created_at": "2024-11-23T17:41:12", "owner": "milos_themilos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287415466242700, "text": "That’s going to be one hell of an office party at Christmas 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:37:04", "owner": "nazbanou.kazemi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023294237547508, "text": "How is this allowed? They've been around decades now", "created_at": "2024-11-23T13:15:50", "owner": "fufubooboo2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046579769286774, "text": "Wtf why Takis and Cheetos??", "created_at": "2024-11-23T06:08:57", "owner": "sh4un_doc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469470682021847, "text": "Imagine the police turning up to a money laundering usa sweet shop and acting like 2000£ worth of slop is a good bust 😂", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:40:37", "owner": "hillsof1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057818029809822, "text": "I passed by there the other day. Just looks gross", "created_at": "2024-11-23T00:08:06", "owner": "themisgayha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126587842391812, "text": "I say we let nature take its course. If you want to buy food you can’t read or understand what it contains, caveat emptor.", "created_at": "2024-11-22T18:57:36", "owner": "caves_teapots_toffees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044391857126970, "text": "@heatherbakerr", "created_at": "2024-11-22T07:32:34", "owner": "thepennypincheruk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979663179784190, "text": "👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽", "created_at": "2024-11-20T17:21:11", "owner": "julieshaw_pureelitepro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953731797749153, "text": "We consume carcinogens on a daily basis. There’s no escaping them", "created_at": "2024-11-20T12:24:01", "owner": "_riderzayn", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["americancandy", "sweets", "chocolate", "oxfordstreet", "london", "crime", "bbcnews"]},
{"media_id": 3525787486800269954, "shortcode": "DDuHQnwP1KC", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDuHQnwP1KC/", "taken_at": "2024-12-18T12:57:23", "caption": "【失落地圖2024：回顧十大香港面臨的城市危機】\n\n2024年將盡，過去12個月，我們的城市經歷了很多改變，在規劃上我們經歷了在制度上被大改造的一年，這將在未來數十年影響香港的面貌。遺憾的是，不少事件顯示了我們的城市發展方向，似乎變得更為掠奪性：\n\n▍吞食濕地：史無前例填塘大開發？\n\n政府計劃發展新田科技城，年初於城規會衝關，擬議修例剔除共247公頃的濕地保育區、緩衝區，並將其納入發展範圍，為香港史無前例的濕地填塘規劃申請，其面積遠多於城規會過去10年拒絕過約32公頃填塘申請，形同將過去數十年守護濕地的努力一筆勾銷。在補償方面，當局甚至放棄具科學根據的以面積計算，改為充滿爭議、效果不明的「環境容量」方法計算，扭曲了「濕地零淨損失」的原則。\n\n面對民間環團的質疑，政府在環諮會提交的相關環評，極多處違反環評法定要求，以及技術評估和數據錯漏，被形容為史上最差的環評。計劃即使已遭到司法覆核，立法會依然通過其撥款。若然新田濕地被犧牲，整片濕地系統的健康將大受打擊，旁邊的國際級米埔濕地的地位亦可能受威脅。\n\n▍流浮山滴眼水：由文化鄉鎮變數碼海岸？\n\n同樣鄰近米埔濕地，擁有重要紅樹林生態的流浮山亦將被發展。政府於2月公布流浮山發展藍圖，一改十多年前以鄉鎮/生態為本的公眾諮詢結果，擬把該區發展成為數碼科技樞紐及生態旅遊勝地，甚至乎加入酒店、餐廳及創科用地入主海岸濕地，將濕地轉變為旅遊資源。\n\n流浮山本身有很多具生態價值的土地區域，惟該藍圖大幅度改變原訂有保育價值的土地用途類別，包括具特殊科學價值地點、海岸保護區、自然保育區、綠化帶及農地，但各土地用途，在發展建議中並未完全按照原有意圖進行規劃，反被不同項目的發展用途侵蝕，可預視這片過去受人追捧的觀賞日落熱點，亦即將變得面目全非。\n\n▍凌虐大嶼：政府未動 私人開發先行？\n\n繼夏寶龍提出「無處不旅遊」後，政府在立刻重提醞釀多年的「南大嶼生態康樂走廊」項目，將針對長沙、水口、石壁及貝澳各點進行相應旅遊發展規劃，相關配套甚至包括在大嶼山起碼頭、鑿隧道、擴公路、起豪宅等。即使是「無處不旅遊」，亦不代表可「四處皆可旅遊」，還要考慮其可行性及代價。政府急急推出加強版的「南大嶼生態康樂走廊」，似乎無考慮到本來南大嶼的特性－就是因難以抵達、人煙稀少才能保存其鄉郊特色。\n\n事實上，政府在數年將南大嶼明確定位為康樂用途後，未等到其正式大興土木，已吸引私人投資者進行開發活動，造成貝澳水牛田出現倒泥、迷你倉，拾塱出現填平濕地再放露營車，以及當地樹林被夷平變成「士多啤梨園」等。種種跡象均指向南大嶼正面臨人為的生態災難，尤其是當地居民也直言感到承載力出現問題時，加速開發或令南大嶼這片香港少有的自然淨土蕩然無存。\n\n▍花墟「公地悲劇」：今日食9成 明日食10成？\n\n返回市區，在3月，市區重建局公布花墟重建計劃，其重建手法引起公眾嘩然，公眾除擔心花墟會步無數市建局重建計劃的後塵，社區特色慢慢被凌遲處死外，其發展方案竟史無前例地包含9成公家地，透過掠奪遊樂場、體育館、苗圃、公家道路等，獲得更多樓面面積。市建局更進一步計劃以地積比轉移的手段，將現有公共空間和社區設施的可建樓面面積，兌換成樓高逾40層的私人住宅，令本來密度已過高的鬧市密上加密。\n\n動用公權力奪取一大塊鬧市中的公園地，將公家設施連根拔起，再興建「多用途綜合大樓」安置設施，無疑是改變公眾原來可享用的公共休憩空間性質，可達性也降低，重建中再提供的公用設施亦很有可能由公帑主力出資興建，讓市民為空間掠奪埋單。市建局一而再，再而三圈公家地，可預視未來或會有更多食公園起樓的狀況。\n\n▍古跡被拆先例：大館都被慘遭拆牆？\n\n馬會9月在古諮會上公布大館（前中區警署建築群）第四座的保育方案，表示只保留兩幅擋土牆和兩幅外牆。然而，早在4月該建築已被發現開始圍封拆卸，成爲本港法定古跡被拆首例。\n\n雖然建築物8年前因工程失誤導致部分坍塌後，剩餘結構脆弱，完整保育有一定難度，本來公眾期望馬會會將其修復，怎料竟是「將錯就錯」，不考慮按建築群的完整性以原有風格重建之餘，甚至突兀地將其改造成與原有建築群不甚匹配的公共空間。一棟百年法定古跡的去留，由始至終未曾諮詢公眾，令市民無法參與討論。馬會和局方亦從未以記者會等方式公布清拆範圍和保育方式，在私自開展拆卸工程的半年後，才交代拆卸規模和補償方案，開創此壞先例，反映縱然是法定古蹟，亦難有周全保障。\n\n▍大幅放寬強拍：戰前唐樓仲有幾多得剩？\n\n立法會通過「降低強拍申請門檻」修例，將強拍門檻從80%降至最低65%，近乎亞洲最低，為發展商在舊區收地大開綠燈。降低強拍門檻不單削弱小業主議價能力，更勢必引發更多投機收樓活動，令更多自住舊區居民失卻穩定居所。舊區業主也因不知何時會被强拍而更傾向不做維修，反而令舊區樓宇質素加速惡化，成為地產商／市建局介入搞地產的借口。\n\n而最首當其衝者，或許是僅餘100橦、通常只有3-4層高的戰前唐樓，其層數較少，所以業權份數亦一般較少，降低強拍門檻後，無疑將更容易被發展商重建。隨著市區重建席捲深水埗和油尖旺區，缺乏有效保育政策下這些戰前唐樓恐怕消失得更快。\n\n［全文見留言］", "owner_username": "liberresearch", "owner_id": "1822193129", "likes": 5462, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0367_DDuHQnwP1KC\\DDuHQnwP1KC_20241218_125723.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17850347115367077, "text": "冇工返，黎生先至會關心", "created_at": "2024-12-27T23:59:42", "owner": "ike447", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045402340965165, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-12-25T15:00:22", "owner": "lamdeejee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065521786837764, "text": "楼价要跌。炒楼的都去跳楼。好", "created_at": "2024-12-25T12:38:23", "owner": "nyclonhai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031386293575824, "text": "唔使驚，冇人買地起樓，政府亦冇錢去起", "created_at": "2024-12-22T23:09:32", "owner": "yusoon99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990435891604064, "text": "北面個領導人同香港有仇，恨不得香港沈淪，佢話之你！", "created_at": "2024-12-20T22:08:38", "owner": "ioio.you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050179919477239, "text": "由班人挽爛，反正都唔關我事，我繼續躺平算", "created_at": "2024-12-20T04:38:43", "owner": "josiah_lcy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031007360595512, "text": "大館要拆？", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:10:12", "owner": "kevinlau_real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065523553631046, "text": "冇咗人民代表嘅暴政地方。靈魂沒有了，現在連肉身都沒有了", "created_at": "2024-12-20T00:10:50", "owner": "terryhongkonger", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080971501600568, "text": "呢d野...唐超知都冇能力去改變喇", "created_at": "2024-12-19T23:17:56", "owner": "johnjohn8833", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026477753564043, "text": "CLS 唔需要咁樣 過度發展", "created_at": "2024-12-19T19:55:04", "owner": "caasi520", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057401200755828, "text": "公民空間縮細都嚴重", "created_at": "2024-12-19T07:37:00", "owner": "terr9343", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074711062717307, "text": "「片區」中文有呢啲文法嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-19T06:05:30", "owner": "stockgogo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029471246239001, "text": "大館拆既係已經塌左一半既危樓，唔好又入埋數，撈埋一齊講", "created_at": "2024-12-19T05:30:52", "owner": "doudou.lamlaml", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18038433950071701, "text": "幾多千憶儲備也沒用", "created_at": "2024-12-19T04:55:04", "owner": "vovo388", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18027003545277005, "text": "再見唐樓", "created_at": "2024-12-19T03:56:51", "owner": "yucwaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031659635166723, "text": "都無人買地，唔駛驚", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:49:01", "owner": "kennymauman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18262073596250336, "text": "土地供應增加同時需求減少\n咁政策咪想推冧樓市\n🤔🤔", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:13:53", "owner": "852love44", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18157131763334683, "text": "大館要拆？！！？", "created_at": "2024-12-18T21:18:40", "owner": "land_of.steph", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18008602949689242, "text": "😢香港 玩完", "created_at": "2024-12-18T17:41:44", "owner": "belindawahbel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061644592861614, "text": "其實個香港就係得咁大，你填極海填極啲魚塘，甚至將原本生態環境城市化，你攞到返嚟嘅土地都係得嗰少少，始終好有限，但代價係破壞咗成個生態環境，而呢樣嘢係不可逆轉，無論你之後做幾多保育補償方案都冇可能返回原狀。其實香港係咪要做好長遠人口規劃？你每年都喺上面運咁多人落嚟，香港容得下？除非大陸送一大片新嘅土地比香港發展，否則你每次咁樣填少少填少少可以攞到幾多新土地？", "created_at": "2024-12-18T17:16:47", "owner": "phobe0813", "likes": 149}, {"id": 17932073282972316, "text": "💔 😢", "created_at": "2024-12-18T16:30:29", "owner": "momozaza_jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314047825164283, "text": "唔好搞花墟啦", "created_at": "2024-12-18T15:06:43", "owner": "cgrindrig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046443323144837, "text": "香港真係慘", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:28:57", "owner": "ginginjamie", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18062543401885891, "text": "一片亂像", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:09:01", "owner": "lautszwaii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18024827288563021, "text": "咩叫片區😵‍💫😵‍💫😵‍💫", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:35:47", "owner": "99macy", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18064353319667116, "text": "🙏🏼拜託大家傳播比一啲覺得政治同自己無關嘅人⋯⋯🙇🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:33:50", "owner": "sambutnotsam", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18050251046475342, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:31:34", "owner": "itsmememe5170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015294302448795, "text": "▍西九賣地：文化都被包裝成地產項目？\n\n7月，政府為打救陷入財困的西九管理局，開先例允許管理局出售住宅項目，打破當初西九規劃「只租不賣」的共識。本來「只租不賣」的安排，是為了確保西九管理局能有「細水長流」的收入，以及避免私有化，維持西九的公共性和開放性，西九賣地的決定如殺雞取卵，及涉違反當年向西九近乎免費撥地的條件。\n\n這亦無法保證西九管理局不會「今日割五城，明日割十城」：在2024年及以後的香港，土地已非再是懂生金蛋的鵝，賣地收入是否足夠支撐不斷飆升的建築成本？西九超過一半的擬議發展還未動工，若干年後再陷入財困而且沒有Plan B的話，割售餘下土地和文化娛樂場地不是不可能，令當初銳意培養香港文化軟實力的旗艦計劃，退化成以文化包裝的地產項目，變成另一個數碼港和科學園。\n\n▍再估唔島：明日大嶼唔再公布造價？\n\n甯漢豪8月宣布，政府沒有放棄填海，但關鍵的最新總造價，則指「無最新估算，亦不敢再估算」，以免公眾對填海開支感到「緊張」，意味原來規模如此龐大的發展計劃，亦可以不必宣之於公眾。\n\n當明日大嶼都可以拒絕公布成本估算，原本估算需斥資3萬億、比明日大嶼規模大得多的北都，似乎亦會面對類似處境。基建債認購不足、本地發展商又財困，可靠資金來源成疑問，繼續拒絕公佈工程造價估算，更令公眾憂心公共財政黑洞的真實規模。\n\n▍片地開花：送住宅地鼓勵地產商發展？\n\n政府與立法會在上半年已多番「內訪」，考察內地有關「片區」的開發模式，而政府亦於11月正式公布「片區開發」的三個試點，共涉及47公頃的土地開發，但具體方案卻明顯與內地模式不同，例如未有完整地劃出一片區域，而是斬件式將一系統相鄰但分散各處的土地，預先分配用途（包括多塊私人住宅用地），再打包予發展商作土地平整，方案中發展商無需管理經營片區運作。\n\n這亦只是大致沿用過往在新發展區公私營合作模式的「舊酒新瓶」，只是以「片區模式」作包裝，好讓政府能有名目再送住宅用地，配合去年政府放寬原址換地要求，協助已有9成土地的發展商收回餘下1成土地，吸引地產商投資，背後牽涉公帑運用及公平性問題。\n\n▍修理海港： 美麗維港不再水深港闊？\n\n去年政府討論修訂《保護海港條例》，到今年12月正式刊憲，豁免部分小規模填海工程不受規限。而條例原意，在於保障維港免因填海工程而令景觀受損。法院其後亦確立限制，要求政府至少要能證明填海具「凌駕性公眾需要」，方能填海。\n\n而修例後，填海工程是否有「凌駕性的公眾需要」，亦將由政府自行確定，填海工程亦毋須向市民交代，市民對於海港發展的發言權將進一步收窄。雖然政府稱會引入機制，在考慮評估資料和公眾意見後才決定是否信納「凌駕性的公眾需要」的推定，但條例的修訂，已經打開了維港內可（更容易）填海的缺口，尤其是由私人發展商、鄰近海濱土儲相關的填海，違背了當初《保護海港條例》立例時公認的「還港於民」精神。\n\n2024年有眾多規劃亂象，對香港來說可謂充滿危機的一年。不過「有危亦有機」，隨著經濟持續不景，庫房乾塘和傳統依靠榨取土地價值的經濟模式失效，相信不少以上發展計劃均會遇到阻滯，或會有大幅度改變，民間是時候做好準備，提出更為可持續的發展（或不發展）方案。", "created_at": "2024-12-18T12:57:54", "owner": "liberresearch", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18123264013396482, "text": "滅港行動", "created_at": "2024-12-22T08:35:46", "owner": "taikokman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068059582687188, "text": "比擔200斤屎擔屎唔轉膊個傻仔盡情破壞", "created_at": "2024-12-20T01:35:47", "owner": "ccpcpced", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931909944974432, "text": "班官無規劃，唔做研究就急住推，急功求成，有破壞無建設，依家變死城自食惡果。", "created_at": "2024-12-19T01:55:08", "owner": "yy2posylvia", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18289903483208903, "text": "玩撚🐒", "created_at": "2024-12-18T15:29:06", "owner": "bubu_is_angry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322882768089955, "text": "政府濫用公帑，唯有減少消費自補", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:22:09", "owner": "kodakdaniel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034826993372595, "text": "最大危機喺個政府度\n冗員把持", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:16:34", "owner": "mcoman", "likes": 14}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3520684756481886182, "shortcode": "DDb_CH0PEfm", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDb_CH0PEfm/", "taken_at": "2024-12-11T11:59:10", "caption": "【一鑊熟】消失中的食環熟食小販市場\n\n各區的熟食小販市場是日常市民尋找廉價美食的好去處，是香港飲食文化之一，但近年一個又一個食環署轄下的熟食中心市場被關閉，亦有新聞報道過檔主不願搬遷【註1】，似乎他們並非無生意，倒閉似是由其他因素造成。研究員翻查文件，發現食環署近年加速關閉各區熟食中心，過去10年至少有13個：\n\n葵青區（3個）：\n\n➤大連排道熟食小販市場 （關閉年份：2015年）\n➤大圓街熟食市場 （關閉年份：2019年）\n➤葵榮路熟食小販市場 （關閉年份：2023年）\n\n觀塘區（3個）\n➤彩虹道街市及熟食中心（關閉年份：2022年）\n➤觀塘碼頭熟食市場（關閉年份：2023年）\n➤勵業街熟食小販市場 （關閉年份：2023年）\n\n荃灣 （2個）\n➤聯仁街熟食小販市場（關閉年份：2019年）\n➤馬角街熟食小販市場（關閉年份：2016年）\n\n沙田區 （2個）\n➤火炭東熟食市場（原擬定關閉年份：2024年）\n➤火炭西熟食市場（原擬定關閉年份：2024年）\n\n深水埗區（2個）\n➤汝州西街熟食小販市場（關閉年份：2016年）\n➤長沙灣熟食市場（關閉年份：2019年）\n\n油尖旺區（1個）\n➤新填地街熟食小販市場（關閉年份：2022年）\n\n熟食小販市場經營多年，近年突然迅速衰落，究竟是餐廳難吃少人光顧之故，還是業主管理不善之禍？部分熟食小販市場位置優越，鄰近民居或上班地點，不愁顧客，亦是明星食店的搖籃，似乎他們競爭力並不低，但政府卻有另一番看法。\n\n▍表面理由：使用率偏低、虛耗公眾資源、不符合經濟效益？\n\n根據文件，食環署連環關閉熟食小販市場的理由通常是「使用率偏低」【註2】、「虛耗公眾資源」【註3】或「不符合經濟效益」【註4】，不過文件話鋒一轉，提及到關閉的決定能「釋放土地資源」，「達到地盡其用」，意味背後尚有其他決定性因素。透過整合關閉熟食小販市場的例子，我們能夠透視政府關閉熟食市場的思維。\n\n▍「超前部署」：改劃商業用途 \n\n已關閉的熟食市場|擬定/現有用途\n\n➤大連排道熟食小販市場|K83商廈 （關閉年份：2015年）\n➤汝州西街熟食小販市場|新世界地產甲級寫字樓項目（關閉年份：2016年）\n➤馬角街熟食小販市場 | 新意網數據中心（關閉年份：2016年）\n➤勵業街熟食小販市場 | 擬改建23層商廈 （關閉年份：2023年）\n\n我們留意到情況在2015年審計署批評食環署對熟食小販市場管理不善後，有惡化跡象，不過食環署的對策並非改革管理，而是加速關閉它們。與此同時，不少熟食市場位處工業區，同期政府採取活化工廈政策，將前工業區轉型為商貿區，兩者共同作用下，令大量熟食小販市場關門大吉。工廈被「活化」後，亦多了上班族在區內活動，少了熟食小販市場亦代表少了價格相宜午飯的選擇，規劃上亦不是一件好事。\n\n或許有人會爭辯，熟食小販市場設施「缺乏競爭力」，但這可能不是檔主不願妥善經營：大連排道熟食小販市場經營的檔販曾向食環請求，希望可加設冷氣機卻被拒絕，更設下限制不能放置更多食桌，狠批政府「陰乾」熟食小販市場【註5】。不禁令人懷疑，即使有需求，店主有意經營，食環署是否仍有計劃地製造既定事實，令這些熟食市場空置率高企，然後藉此將其關閉，轉為商廈或其他用途。\n\n//留言待續", "owner_username": "liberresearch", "owner_id": "1822193129", "likes": 4049, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0368_DDb_CH0PEfm\\DDb_CH0PEfm_20241211_115910_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0368_DDb_CH0PEfm\\DDb_CH0PEfm_20241211_115910_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0368_DDb_CH0PEfm\\DDb_CH0PEfm_20241211_115910_3.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18049417127501368, "text": "▍被「一地多用」殺死：全場爆滿都要被強行清場\n\n生意好的熟食中心也難以倖免。\n\n已關閉的熟食市場|擬定的社區用途\n➤火炭東及西熟食市場 | 政府聯用大廈\n➤彩虹道熟食中心|納入四美街休憩用地重建項目\n➤觀塘碼頭熟食市場|與海濱長廊結合\n\n火炭東西熟食市場經營超過40年，以雞粥聞名，其出租率更是100%，但政府計劃以「一地多用模式」將其改為政府聯用大廈。檔販曾向食環署請願，希望可以預留一層作熟食市場，既可以改善經營環境，亦可以保留區內特色飲食文化。但卻被當局拒絕，表示社區對地區服務需求殷切，而火炭一帶已經有食肆供應，不會提供安置【註6】。\n\n同樣情況發生在觀塘碼頭熟食市場，營近40年，全場出租率達90%，卻因為「起動九龍東」中的海濱規劃而關閉。政府曾經在「起動九龍東」計劃中提出毋需拆除觀塘碼頭熟食市場【註7】，但最終卻為了「整合休憩空間」而決定把其關閉；研究員曾在熟食市場關閉前到訪，有租用三個檔位的檔販表示，只獲政府分配一個安置檔位，面積更比原有的更細，無法恢復同等規模的生意，由此可見政府將熟食中心的位置確實放得很低。\n\n熟食市場的出現，與多年須安置街上熟食檔販有關，政府透過廉價租金協助草根階層創業，亦讓附近市民能夠尋找親民價「隱世美食」。在政府活化工廈、起動九龍東等為舊工業區轉型的政策下，政府或會覺得這些歷史遺留下來的問題與新規劃格格不入，起了慢性殺死熟食市場的動機。\n\n▍熟食市場也以可申遺：港府當係草 新加坡當係寶\n\n這邊廂香港將熟食市場當是「草」，那邊廂新加坡則當熟食市場(hawker centre) 是「寶」。新加坡政府在2011年重新啟動新熟食小販中心計劃，目的是提供可負擔的社交空間及多種類的平價美食【註8】，2015年分別提出會新增興建10個新熟食小販中心【註9】，顯示新加坡更有意將熟食小販成為其國家特色和地區經濟的重要一環，小販除維護了新加坡飲食傳統，更被視為「小販企業家」(hawkerpreneurs)，獲國家重視。\n\n時至今日，除了為國民提供廉價美食外，新加坡熟食小販中心更晉身成為旅遊景點，例如麥士威熟食中心 (Maxwell Food Centre)、牛車水大廈巴剎和熟食中心 (Chinatown Complex Market & Food Centre)等等，屬真正的「無處不旅遊」。\n\n2020年，新加坡政府成功將小販熟食文化登上入《人類非物質文化遺產代表名錄》【註10】，及後有人疑惑為何香港不能【註11】。不過香港政府對熟食市場的態度截然不同，並無將這些地區瑰寶視為資產好好保育，甚至將其視為「商業轉型」的障礙。\n\n上月陳茂波趁「AI 教父」、英偉達(NVIDIA) 創辦人黃仁勳來港，立刻抓緊機會，帶黃仁勳到深水埗的街邊大排檔吃小炒，洗塵兼體驗「港味」，順道介紹香港的「機遇」。有趣的是，陳茂波不是帶他到傳統上大排檔較為集中和更有氣氛的熟食中心（後者保安也較街鋪更嚴密，是較合理的選擇），未知是否因為經過食環署多年的淘汰後，陳茂波已經找不到一間能代表香港特色的熟食中心，向黃仁勳展示香港僅餘的特色和活力？", "created_at": "2024-12-11T11:59:29", "owner": "liberresearch", "likes": 61}, {"id": 18144264280360673, "text": "【註1】獨立媒體.2022年1月5日. 新填地街熟食小販市場今年底關閉 有檔主稱不願搬遷. https://www.inmediahk.net/node/%E7%A4%BE%E5%8D%80/%E6%96%B0%E5%A1%AB%E5%9C%B0%E8%A1%97%E7%86%9F%E9%A3%9F%E5%B0%8F%E8%B2%A9%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%95%E9%97%9C%E9%96%89-%E6%9C%89%E6%AA%94%E4%B8%BB%E7%A8%B1%E4%B8%8D%E9%A1%98%E6%90%AC%E9%81%B7 \n\n【註2】深水埗區議會文件第17/16號. 2016年2月1日. 關閉汝州西街熟食小販市場的安排\nhttps://www.districtcouncils.gov.hk/ssp/doc/2016_2019/tc/dc_meetings_doc/10418/SSP_DC_2016_17_tc.pdf \n【註3】荃灣區議會第6/18-19號文件. 2018年5月. 關閉聯仁街熟食小販市場的安排\nhttps://www.districtcouncils.gov.hk/tw/doc/2016_2019/en/dc_meetings_doc/14786/TWDC_Paper_No_6_1819.pdf \n【註4】葵青區議會社會事務文件第2/D/2023號. 2023年2月. 食物環境衛生署 關閉葵涌葵榮路熟食小販市場\nhttps://www.districtcouncils.gov.hk/kwt/doc/2020_2023/en/committee_meetings_doc/CAC/23131/2_D_2023.pdf \n【註5】香港01. 2019年1月23日.【熟食小販市場】空置率高　檔主批政府陰乾：一間舖位只放四張枱\nhttps://www.hk01.com/article/285536?utm_source=01articlecopy&utm_medium=referral \n【註6】獨立媒體. 2021年10月29日. 火炭大排檔「清零」 新建綜合大樓不設熟食中心https://www.inmediahk.net/node/社區/火炭大排檔「清零」-新建綜合大樓不設熟食中心 \n\n【註7】東方日報. 2017年7月27日. 打造綠悠海濱及互聯空間　兩方案起動九龍東https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20170727/bkn-20170727181558525-0727_00822_001.html \n \n【註8】Centre for Liveable Cities Singapore. Hawkers Centres. Levelling the Playing with Food.  https://www.clc.gov.sg/docs/default-source/urban-solutions/urb-sol-iss-4-pdfs/case-study-singapore-hawker-centres.pdf \n\n【註9】todayonline.com. 11 March 2015. Ten more hawker centres to be built in the next 12 years. https://www.todayonline.com/singapore/10-more-hawker-centres-be-built-within-12-years-grace-fu \n\n【註10】拾方視角. 2020年12月21日.新加坡「小販熟食文化」（hawker Culture）列入非物質世界遺產，這些廉價飲食檔守護著傳統，也育成了小販企業家（hawkerpreneurs）⋯⋯ https://www.villagedoor.org/%E6%96%B0%E5%8A%A0%E5%9D%A1%E3%80%8C%E5%B0%8F%E8%B2%A9%E7%86%9F%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E3%80%8D%EF%BC%88hawker-culture%EF%BC%89%E5%88%97%E5%85%A5%E9%9D%9E%E7%89%A9%E8%B3%AA%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C/ \n\n【註11】灼見名家. 2020年12月21日. 新加坡小販文化申遺成功，香港為什麼不能？ https://www.master-insight.com/%E6%96%B0%E5%8A%A0%E5%9D%A1%E5%B0%8F%E8%B2%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E7%94%B3%E9%81%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%EF%BC%8C%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9F/", "created_at": "2024-12-11T11:59:36", "owner": "liberresearch", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18031762058591581, "text": "迫窮人食貴飯！😢", "created_at": "2024-12-23T08:44:24", "owner": "rickyng365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034590692597934, "text": "因為租平要係死", "created_at": "2024-12-22T02:37:44", "owner": "soman_rui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070095280662232, "text": "隔離澳門既熟食中心都做得好過香港...", "created_at": "2024-12-19T08:13:23", "owner": "sunnywls.46", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042391295001528, "text": "都系個句，怕唔怕死，唔怕咪有機會做得好，做到成績。", "created_at": "2024-12-16T09:20:17", "owner": "ruky0w0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051707159006852, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-14T14:41:24", "owner": "patrickauyiuleung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104062900459574, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-14T14:41:07", "owner": "patrickauyiuleung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950680623874658, "text": "平租俾租戶，但租戶唔會平賣俾市民（例子：海防道熟食）", "created_at": "2024-12-13T14:52:32", "owner": "lilyszeling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994130901584853, "text": "到有需要時又整D“臨時美食檔”充撐場面", "created_at": "2024-12-13T03:56:04", "owner": "george_._fish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351145549127679, "text": "執一間，開番16間👏", "created_at": "2024-12-13T01:32:03", "owner": "ycfok2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050802344043056, "text": "是人治及興", "created_at": "2024-12-12T23:50:42", "owner": "lady_of_the_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888485164152839, "text": "真係好可惜，明明熟食中心入面個d食肆先真係貼地又好食", "created_at": "2024-12-12T19:53:36", "owner": "midwin_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865518880273132, "text": "其實熟食中心係一個好好推介香港既卡片 \n即使熟食中心可能係舊但如果政府肯改變一下就已經可以吸引到人\n好過做夜繽紛啊 \n政府唔想做熟食中心無非都係想去現金化 的錢入晒去政府個袋\n其實咁樣反而仲令到經濟更難好 所有野都傾向大財團 \n同埋都無比人向上流動 雖然宜家人唔同以前 \n但唔係可以呃殺所有有機會既野lol\n就如一個例子有人可能佢去咗讀廚藝但佢想創業 但佢連租都已經被壓死\n到頭黎就只可以同人打工 咁佢有幾創意都無用啦😪", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:06:40", "owner": "kelvenkkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923878102005835, "text": "佢哋唔執 啲商家財團點cap市民水？民生嘢最容易斂財", "created_at": "2024-12-12T05:25:58", "owner": "narrrrrdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288150592241978, "text": "對於社區好重要㗎喎，保安道嗰座時常去。", "created_at": "2024-12-12T05:10:22", "owner": "sometimes_in_utrecht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053723626954229, "text": "以前中學時代出街食飯一定係去熟食市場，款式多，平靚正，阿叔阿姐又有人情味，而家呢啲優點已接近滅絕。", "created_at": "2024-12-12T04:39:55", "owner": "yuicrafts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013798733659371, "text": "其實個街市大樓沒有管理😢如何吸引人上去，只係覺得你唔做有別人做，你睇地產商food 閣做到效果，香港應該做多啲特色吸引顧客", "created_at": "2024-12-12T02:41:23", "owner": "ftterry", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18128864341384695, "text": "由治及興", "created_at": "2024-12-12T02:07:36", "owner": "vovo388", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967891407811174, "text": "劣質文化", "created_at": "2024-12-12T01:56:48", "owner": "andy.leung.792", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038651426463208, "text": "平價條毛；咪又係咁貴；政府街市平租嗰啲咪俾啲商戶賺多啲；又唔係新加坡嗰啲，新加坡點解做到食嘢平，因為政府有規定價錢唔可以高於幾多；香港做唔做到？ 政府啲舖位平有咩用？ 俾啲商戶賺更加多？", "created_at": "2024-12-12T01:41:25", "owner": "hk_omg_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073015720719605, "text": "只有一層，用地成本太高是死因。\n（棕地偏遠又有背景，不同）\n尋求多層用地是出路，\n是否能在工廈、政府設施內，\n預留熟食中心用地作為地契條款？", "created_at": "2024-12-11T23:55:37", "owner": "li_ka_shing_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17888739138114887, "text": "😢 好sad, 以後返香港想同屋企人去懷念細個成日去嘅火炭大排檔都消失中💔", "created_at": "2024-12-11T23:47:21", "owner": "momozaza_jp", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18051353089991698, "text": "擺明係故意減少平價選擇逼人幫襯大集團", "created_at": "2024-12-11T19:51:01", "owner": "wpk2047", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305395198206510, "text": "熟食中心係全香港交最少智商税嘅地方❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:07:51", "owner": "terr9343", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17911998597025349, "text": "有心人想減少無閉路電視嘅地方", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:01:07", "owner": "terr9343", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032902331586250, "text": "因為好多熟食中心都係小店😏\n無稅收\n咪賣比大集團 🫣", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:00:59", "owner": "maggiewongwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051342017062844, "text": "政府是想迫商家去繳貴租，從而賺取更多利潤", "created_at": "2024-12-11T14:54:19", "owner": "ilminist_ball", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18053568217822631, "text": "摺完之後又好似廟街咁擺啲露天檔夜市 完全係本末倒置", "created_at": "2024-12-11T14:33:38", "owner": "zgt_tkt", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17924439990005495, "text": "明明可以減下物價都要取消", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:59:31", "owner": "852love44", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17961857789720229, "text": "新加坡既小販煮食中心係不少職場新鮮人既午餐福音（平、靚、正）", "created_at": "2024-12-11T13:08:51", "owner": "keith_l0", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18049257149020814, "text": "可能為預製菜打下良好基礎", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:39:36", "owner": "alfielowbjai", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18023736638556749, "text": "食環：難做咪唔做囉", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:35:51", "owner": "piuschan92", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18038450891517370, "text": "平心而論，街市好多隱世美食😢地道又平；希望唔好執哂", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:34:57", "owner": "land_of.steph", "likes": 66}, {"id": 18048135851120342, "text": "係疣痔及馨嘅結果！", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:24:24", "owner": "denny_studio_photography", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051348161079469, "text": "熟食中心搞得好本可有助旅遊業，而香港政府官員睇唔起呢啲平民嘢", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:09:10", "owner": "eddiexkong", "likes": 144}, {"id": 18052131245315342, "text": "老鼠熟食場，請我食都唔7去。😂😂😂on9 ［本土］先當係寶，一個廢場，一個野豬😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T03:52:01", "owner": "babybryanbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051563570486156, "text": "明顯係政府管理能力嘅問題，政府可唔可以解釋下到底比左管理人員咩類型培訓？個個請返去嘅係咪真係適合人選？一話一個成世都係讀applied science 嘅人就叫佢去管理啲街市同熟食中心呢？Appraisal 嘅系統又係咪已經崩壞呢？我聽過嘅係，想一個廢柴公務員離開係要寫好佢appraisal, 咁就有其他部門要佢，反之表現差反映現實就反而冇人要，又唔會炒，長期留係個個崗位嘥米飯。", "created_at": "2024-12-19T01:45:02", "owner": "laminensam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037292705520621, "text": "That is why Hong Kong is dead", "created_at": "2024-12-15T17:25:59", "owner": "yvonne_i19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929641800985510, "text": "推動香港經濟梗係整死一班人，然後起商場搞濕9嘉年華，要貴租、重成本，一份燒賣賣幾十蚊，然後個場係死場，政府蝕唔緊要，最緊要拉埋香港基層落水", "created_at": "2024-12-12T04:09:39", "owner": "ernhoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066414790705526, "text": "食環死全家", "created_at": "2024-12-12T04:06:59", "owner": "chanchilap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349021018135398, "text": "垃圾", "created_at": "2024-12-12T01:56:41", "owner": "andy.leung.792", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926972019878006, "text": "殺完然後搞熟市中心經濟", "created_at": "2024-12-11T15:03:29", "owner": "hilcheng", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18028076186449596, "text": "@garrychuky 哭撚", "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:04:04", "owner": "iamosxd", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3512021438977531208, "shortcode": "DC9NOQpz91I", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC9NOQpz91I/", "taken_at": "2024-11-29T13:08:45", "caption": "[PART 2] Okay, here are some barriers to economic development in Minecraft terms. Does it make sense now?\n\nIf you wanna review this topic or other IB subjects, click the link in bio for free study notes, lessons and practice quizzes made just for the IB on revisiondojo.com\n\nComment if you wanna see more videos like this 😊\n\n#meme #economics #ibeconomics #economy #ibdp #economicstudent #economistsofinstagram #macroeconomics #revisiondojo", "owner_username": "economics.ib", "owner_id": "67141248780", "likes": 81124, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0369_DC9NOQpz91I\\DC9NOQpz91I_20241129_130845.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18311616799228406, "text": "I needed this last Thursday and it pops up days after the ap", "created_at": "2025-05-13T11:50:17", "owner": "ian_technical", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065244302001222, "text": "All true", "created_at": "2025-05-01T04:22:27", "owner": "kevin_kamto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019334408442220, "text": "eco ft. minecraft🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-02T06:21:01", "owner": "harshitybisht", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858147754342875, "text": "Thanks bro need more of this", "created_at": "2025-01-04T16:47:07", "owner": "kai4showrt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068380843673892, "text": "We have Minecrfat Economic Development before GTA 6 🗣", "created_at": "2024-12-21T15:09:03", "owner": "fafrom1993", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859520734315614, "text": "I fw this heavy, nice way of teaching stuff and make it interesting!", "created_at": "2024-12-16T18:51:08", "owner": "prod.bau", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18046901404914510, "text": "Now with SDGs", "created_at": "2024-12-16T09:26:18", "owner": "salty_ahan369", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028824434212665, "text": "The only thing stopping you from doing whatever you want, is other people", "created_at": "2024-12-12T14:46:06", "owner": "crusader.matt99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898543825015028, "text": "Now I'm learning", "created_at": "2024-12-12T07:22:25", "owner": "just_s_htrd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063627736804597, "text": "Should've use this for my uni project 😂😂", "created_at": "2024-12-11T17:14:10", "owner": "colnagoy1rs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026516840573657, "text": "It was never about minecraft", "created_at": "2024-12-11T16:52:28", "owner": "untiedshoelace_90210", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053480074826148, "text": "I understand it now🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-11T01:10:55", "owner": "confsdmonstr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924256543004704, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-10T20:21:26", "owner": "burnerjohndoe6006135", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014218343667889, "text": "goat", "created_at": "2024-12-10T01:35:22", "owner": "malakasareus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049543010009616, "text": "Another reel I needed before exam", "created_at": "2024-12-08T15:34:21", "owner": "d33p_roy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17914343235024067, "text": "Another reel I needed before exam", "created_at": "2024-12-08T15:30:05", "owner": "d33p_roy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909328992960343, "text": "Creative mode can be used for good too", "created_at": "2024-12-07T16:45:40", "owner": "karlbrown2001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015259769425416, "text": "We got Minecraft economic before GTA VI", "created_at": "2024-12-07T09:57:08", "owner": "_nuradeal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366631432137868, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-07T08:28:43", "owner": "arhaan.k1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068855749668628, "text": "Barrier to economic development: GOVERNMENT INTERVENTION IN THE ECONOMY. That is also the birth of corruption", "created_at": "2024-12-07T08:21:47", "owner": "axellam6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990479541597973, "text": "Honestly school should just use Minecraft to teach us. Minecraft Education Edition exists, so why don’t we use it in school?", "created_at": "2024-12-05T02:35:24", "owner": "jakepuebla72", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18067940845670987, "text": "genuinely would ask to post a video about keensian economics i think the world would be a better place if more people understood it", "created_at": "2024-12-04T22:34:09", "owner": "me0iseepy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024012197560992, "text": "Another thing is the admins spawning in things creating an inflation effect to all and any goods, making work meaningless. Sort of like the U.S. economy and removal of the gold standard.", "created_at": "2024-12-04T00:30:33", "owner": "kazz0k", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18045666227113295, "text": "wait tell me why this is literally what I have to memorize for my International Relations exam???", "created_at": "2024-12-02T20:06:05", "owner": "supitsskye", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936188532830358, "text": "Honestly so helpful for homeschooling", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:42:01", "owner": "alex_in_orbit", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18019854497631444, "text": "Now I finally know how to keep my villagers poor", "created_at": "2024-12-02T16:10:12", "owner": "kledy_lover567", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065493388750511, "text": "UNITED NATIONS MENTIONED RAHHHH‼️‼️ 🦅🦅🦅 WTF IS A SUCCESSFUL PEACEKEEPING OPERATION 🇺🇳🇺🇳🇺🇳🇺🇳🇺🇳🇺🇳", "created_at": "2024-12-02T14:54:16", "owner": "jayseaandfriends", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063730255771246, "text": "Can you put subway surfer gameplay at the bottom?", "created_at": "2024-12-02T14:35:15", "owner": "w.reallll", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18447835954068294, "text": "I have never learned more about accounting/economics", "created_at": "2024-12-02T13:35:06", "owner": "valentimmoura_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016222730401878, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2024-12-02T12:40:44", "owner": "sethplaysbadly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023993081610098, "text": "letsgooo sdg goals mentioned", "created_at": "2024-12-02T08:02:10", "owner": "mirzicuul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940484469798169, "text": "NO YOU WILL NOT INCREASE MY ATTENTION SPAN", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:55:17", "owner": "boweradg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077713177582766, "text": "Villagers 1-0 africa", "created_at": "2024-12-02T07:19:42", "owner": "jageroo_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18321981160092886, "text": "This is insane that I get this post, the moment I go on Instagram during my own economics class", "created_at": "2024-12-02T02:19:35", "owner": "chunkydandy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051899089953907, "text": "Mending 32767 is wild💀💀", "created_at": "2024-12-01T08:46:44", "owner": "danieldiassk243", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17920338915006200, "text": "as an economics student, this is actually legit info", "created_at": "2024-12-01T08:37:04", "owner": "nohn.bohn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18005598875675724, "text": "Seed Development Goals", "created_at": "2024-12-01T03:10:44", "owner": "valenctius", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079296034577383, "text": "The SDGs are in IB⁉️💀", "created_at": "2024-12-01T03:09:39", "owner": "kn1eto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095307553493624, "text": "Can you do internarional trade in nba terms next my og adam smith", "created_at": "2024-12-01T03:08:10", "owner": "kisahbebekdarisolo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18349779022124379, "text": "The have the ability to construct iron golems, one of the strongest mobs in the game, yet use them only to wage war against hostile parties. Their inefficient use of resource must be studied.", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:54:50", "owner": "fellowlauncestonian", "likes": 48}, {"id": 17842302801375166, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:50:40", "owner": "noah.brown_33", "likes": 86}, {"id": 17864770428270687, "text": "@gzebini", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:49:17", "owner": "klvdio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034729667107913, "text": "we got SDG in minecraft before gta6", "created_at": "2024-12-01T02:34:41", "owner": "unprecedented_qibli", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17844927858355693, "text": "@rohanambastha", "created_at": "2024-12-01T01:41:16", "owner": "goose_jinmo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847838899332553, "text": "Calling it now this fucking song is finna get burned on ttk 2-3 weeks from now 😔", "created_at": "2024-12-01T00:55:21", "owner": "josemirelesf", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18024938879619854, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2024-12-01T00:48:15", "owner": "s.mend.ol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18381577414103975, "text": "the fact that I’ve been learning about the sustainable goals in my college sociology course while this sums it up in a video", "created_at": "2024-11-30T23:46:59", "owner": "kat4ttack_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977446248643693, "text": "Do an edgeworth box with Minecraft terms please", "created_at": "2024-11-30T23:44:25", "owner": "spangler.ryan84", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858476029302633, "text": "they teach same thing in IB geography", "created_at": "2024-11-30T22:23:06", "owner": "druscus", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18029494055192392, "text": "Is there a minecraft mod to play something like that. That look nice to play", "created_at": "2024-11-30T20:26:41", "owner": "felix_lemelin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17924749625995893, "text": "I LOVE THIS", "created_at": "2024-11-30T18:15:42", "owner": "dreamer_sarah_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918637498008419, "text": "iba brainrot", "created_at": "2024-11-30T17:04:43", "owner": "nnwostjg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859559473240582, "text": "we got minecraft economy education before GTA 6", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:57:36", "owner": "levraigabbl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898153690095109, "text": "This was MUN topic 3 weeks ago", "created_at": "2024-11-30T14:34:38", "owner": "ahmad_atrash2007", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18110339677438801, "text": "How the hell is bro expmaining endogenic growth in minecraft terms", "created_at": "2024-11-30T14:01:28", "owner": "v.mnnt", "likes": 73}, {"id": 18091984978500726, "text": "education is sadge\nas its either inadequate or teaches woeful dependence on subservience in the minecraft factories", "created_at": "2024-11-30T13:33:28", "owner": "aidanthird", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948860478900483, "text": "I am a business major studying sustainable enterprise development and this is legit one of my courses basically LMAOOO", "created_at": "2024-11-30T12:37:13", "owner": "gonzaruizruiz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865908334266540, "text": "Why is this so well done", "created_at": "2024-11-30T11:59:16", "owner": "enchanted_bomb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037159520520467, "text": "Bro is speaking my language now", "created_at": "2024-11-30T11:16:06", "owner": "daniellito667", "likes": 253}, {"id": 17868075270181834, "text": "geography is amazing", "created_at": "2024-11-30T11:01:16", "owner": "lumii999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960032775722133, "text": "Realistically it’s inviting too many pillagers", "created_at": "2024-11-30T10:43:36", "owner": "orsonsteel12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069569761655746, "text": "CAPITALISM ALL THE WAY 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-30T09:52:54", "owner": "hibernalz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18290212084241199, "text": "SONG PLSS", "created_at": "2024-11-30T09:40:32", "owner": "justayellowbear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859385749299193, "text": "Bro summed up Developmental economics in Minecraft terms", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:52:19", "owner": "ahmedinnit_", "likes": 2433}, {"id": 18047533481501984, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-30T08:16:14", "owner": "charlesadougan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045838586157256, "text": "If only school taught us like this", "created_at": "2024-11-30T07:46:03", "owner": "darma._.x", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17850426189311105, "text": "As an IB student, thank you very much", "created_at": "2024-11-30T07:23:00", "owner": "i_nafis_adhyaksa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870717766162103, "text": "Ib economics moment", "created_at": "2024-11-30T06:31:56", "owner": "ryanitoss", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18116198188418758, "text": "I have an accounting finals tommorow 💀", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:50:50", "owner": "defnotpagz", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18038414642042511, "text": "Can you make these in slide form", "created_at": "2024-11-30T03:46:24", "owner": "blackveilmale", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065791339688037, "text": "Pls do economies of scale 🙏", "created_at": "2024-11-30T02:05:46", "owner": "vincent.bergkvist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029873804172340, "text": "Some people are born to be teachers Fr. they’ll always find a way to explain things to people👏", "created_at": "2024-11-30T00:41:39", "owner": "rileys.04", "likes": 995}, {"id": 18322708927200003, "text": "We got sdgs on minecraft now", "created_at": "2024-11-30T00:35:37", "owner": "nearrelll", "likes": 286}, {"id": 18053556406797845, "text": "This is so good please dont stop making them.", "created_at": "2024-11-29T18:46:09", "owner": "mario.marin27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033242465112358, "text": "now explain inflation vs minimum wage in roblox language pls so my rotten brain can absorb i have a macro exam next week pls", "created_at": "2024-11-29T18:37:42", "owner": "lex.sadd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18109673872437405, "text": "please keep making these", "created_at": "2024-11-29T17:37:11", "owner": "reddblue.mp4", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18020411945625910, "text": "This is peak", "created_at": "2024-11-29T16:37:15", "owner": "26winston", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18248979163285555, "text": "Bro this is so goooooood. I really love how you explain econ via minecraft terms😍. Absolute explanation👏", "created_at": "2024-11-29T16:30:56", "owner": "_.ethanasia._", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18058143988867458, "text": "bit too fast, pls make slower or slideshows next time !!", "created_at": "2024-11-29T16:25:11", "owner": "frnaky._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136746331372054, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-29T15:16:45", "owner": "hross197", "likes": 1458}, {"id": 17908786374057189, "text": "Why is it so good tho", "created_at": "2024-11-29T15:16:41", "owner": "eriksvenskberg", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18051579952950820, "text": "When I grow up I wanna be the biggest corruption leader in the world!", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:51:55", "owner": "shahzad5khan", "likes": 1673}, {"id": 18029907005164078, "text": "So cool", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:39:44", "owner": "soseconomics", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18167786377315975, "text": "We need more of this ongggg", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:25:24", "owner": "saur_saws", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17844731532365117, "text": "do slides so we can read next time pls", "created_at": "2024-11-29T14:13:19", "owner": "jonathann.ki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078836932516791, "text": "on a generational run 🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:27:08", "owner": "salasalasamkalo", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18048397064089903, "text": "economics.ib can you make a reel using a creed song it would really help me absorb the knowledge more effectively", "created_at": "2024-11-29T13:26:31", "owner": "josh.terec", "likes": 120}, {"id": 18368771134141975, "text": "Free the Minecraft markets", "created_at": "2025-01-12T17:49:01", "owner": "jaylenxgreaves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078678475603697, "text": "Unironically more helpful than my econ prof what the fuck", "created_at": "2024-12-14T04:37:39", "owner": "anik_ghouse", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933418170846555, "text": "Why Nations Fail in minecraft terms", "created_at": "2024-12-07T18:52:45", "owner": "beingmoreattractive", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17884464756163858, "text": "@economics.ib this series shouldn't stop 🙎🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-03T04:06:18", "owner": "adisurve86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068338978678288, "text": "We have to kick out new town population in favor of our own, they take the working tables and food", "created_at": "2024-12-02T12:48:18", "owner": "lioneleholland", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017735453637649, "text": "please do this for exchange rates", "created_at": "2024-12-01T21:49:50", "owner": "murdock_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286627909211057, "text": "what happens when America TNTs your house", "created_at": "2024-11-30T23:00:51", "owner": "revolutionaryamyy", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["meme", "economics", "ibeconomics", "economy", "ibdp", "economicstudent", "economistsofinstagram", "macroeconomics", "revisiondojo"]},
{"media_id": 3525929511092375051, "shortcode": "DDunjWLuk4L", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDunjWLuk4L/", "taken_at": "2024-12-18T17:41:38", "caption": "Look out for these codes at TKMaxx 👀👇🏻\n\nWhen shopping there, always check the labels for a number ‘1’, ‘2’ or ‘7’.\n\nA number 1 means that product was made specifically for TKMaxx, and may not be the same quality as the brand it says it is.\n\nA number 2 is what you’re looking for! These items are made by the brand, and were sold by the brand (but are just cheaper being sold at TKMaxx). This is what you’re looking for.\n\nThere’s also a number 7, which means it’s last year’s stock (but still a branded item and genuine).\n\nPlease do have a check before you buy something. It may seem like a bargain looking at the price, but it may wear out sooner than you think if it’s not the real deal.\n\nI post money saving tricks and hacks like this every week - check out my feed for other secret codes, and follow for more tips!\n\n#tkmaxx #tjmaxx #shoppinghacks #moneysavingtips #couponking #loudbudgeting #tkmaxxfinds", "owner_username": "couponkiduk", "owner_id": "1636722302", "likes": 106914, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0370_DDunjWLuk4L\\DDunjWLuk4L_20241218_174138.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18061556386841704, "text": "If you snickered at “the quality of the number twos”…\n\nYou are my people 😆👏🏻\n\nFollow for more deals and tips each week! 😊☝🏻", "created_at": "2024-12-18T17:42:52", "owner": "couponkiduk", "likes": 917}, {"id": 17907862806165369, "text": "What does No 5 mean I can't find any reference  to this number Please help me decide to buy or not", "created_at": "2026-01-27T15:00:15", "owner": "hanley.aileen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152098720442651, "text": "Ooo love this🙌", "created_at": "2026-01-26T19:21:51", "owner": "familylife.rebalanced", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010591265656560, "text": "Is there is any sale after Christmas", "created_at": "2025-12-31T10:01:52", "owner": "nada.a.alrawi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046941428460826, "text": "Love this! Thanks for sharing", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:03:31", "owner": "eberenuduke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18191981266334998, "text": "Never thought I would hear a grown man saying \"The quality of number 2 is so much better!\"", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:23:15", "owner": "rva0960", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919273939206816, "text": "I saw a TV programme about it a few years ago. Made a note of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:42", "owner": "j.chneour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090958921901562, "text": "@vb_xoxo_", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:42:08", "owner": "raccccchhh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060275285130422, "text": "What about shopping online?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:57:51", "owner": "jennbrox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005458601788014, "text": "What it shows a 9. Ive have seen a lot of this??? Help", "created_at": "2025-08-08T02:55:41", "owner": "tfauth24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092230867636521, "text": "what about the number 5?", "created_at": "2025-08-07T17:20:07", "owner": "_ro7an", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070971901828490, "text": "Shannie fm", "created_at": "2025-03-05T14:27:22", "owner": "margaret.hewitt.549", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115588303455859, "text": "@tash_stott", "created_at": "2025-03-03T11:00:06", "owner": "maxheatufh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065660977898705, "text": "Love TKMax, but it is hit and miss. I wonder where things are stored sometimes and for how long, as l’ve bought shoes in the past that have literally fallen apart. Was told by staff that I should have brought it back and I said I no longer had the receipt. It was not due to wear and tear. The response suggested to me it was not the first time she heard that story. Now I know to hold on to my receipts for a decent period.", "created_at": "2025-03-02T20:19:15", "owner": "shazzreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052927283330062, "text": "@angelachannon22", "created_at": "2025-02-27T15:08:37", "owner": "james_and_his_335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059013680296371, "text": "How did you figure this out?", "created_at": "2025-02-26T06:48:03", "owner": "camisolarewicz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030234902541628, "text": "Like a rumage sale in there  hate it", "created_at": "2025-02-25T12:36:40", "owner": "chrisfreer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007139501717688, "text": "Is that only in UK?…", "created_at": "2025-02-24T23:35:36", "owner": "ambrocado07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941099946977925, "text": "@beee__teee", "created_at": "2025-02-22T22:19:14", "owner": "flynny85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881840839239634, "text": "But what does number 7 means?", "created_at": "2025-02-22T14:10:25", "owner": "fatimamohamed1938", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057338414044436, "text": "@pampiera  I know how much you love TKMaxx. This is interesting!", "created_at": "2025-02-20T23:41:45", "owner": "mazrapek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901064374037121, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-02-19T21:00:35", "owner": "a.n.creator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052286476935171, "text": "I’m glad you said I not “we”", "created_at": "2025-02-19T15:52:28", "owner": "joel_prince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101067625499876, "text": "Love a good number 2", "created_at": "2025-02-17T15:04:20", "owner": "philblowe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266016247283301, "text": "Ohh! Never knew! @chris.hirst", "created_at": "2025-02-14T19:36:41", "owner": "hibiscus_sunrise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851913706353356, "text": "@livbarnsley", "created_at": "2025-02-14T14:17:51", "owner": "debrab1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293255806241618, "text": "@abby.willsss", "created_at": "2025-02-13T20:12:59", "owner": "lau1094", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957318348910820, "text": "@rachel.cherry @nataliegerrishh", "created_at": "2025-02-13T09:16:40", "owner": "helengerrishh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064240153924009, "text": "@jisan_rebeiro", "created_at": "2025-02-12T11:03:09", "owner": "deborah_rebeiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059371984810842, "text": "Going there right now 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-10T04:24:24", "owner": "marilialbuquerque7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055403416869177, "text": "What about code 6??? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-02-07T13:16:55", "owner": "kelci.first", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18462413515068551, "text": "@danny_fandango", "created_at": "2025-02-03T14:49:38", "owner": "ciao_biscottino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18255080839263859, "text": "Oh common use the common sense and check real stuff in brand shops educate yourself, check eBay ect and only then make a decision if it’s worth it. Often you’ll be able to find stuff in charity shops too. Real things. Lately I find Tim’s cheaper than some charity shops and still a great price.", "created_at": "2025-02-01T18:28:43", "owner": "visualsbyi5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275758180247884, "text": "@nidal_elhebshi", "created_at": "2025-01-28T11:50:20", "owner": "hudi_alakari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045309686200015, "text": "@rolasescapades819 🤔", "created_at": "2025-01-25T17:13:30", "owner": "husseinrk1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955117905864093, "text": "Ah, you’ve cracked the code!", "created_at": "2025-01-24T18:50:21", "owner": "gypsyfootwear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003345437711010, "text": "@chloe.allisonx", "created_at": "2025-01-23T08:30:28", "owner": "jodiallison03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047173358263703, "text": "@chelsea_closet_co", "created_at": "2025-01-21T11:58:25", "owner": "mscurious11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481062148020025, "text": "TJ MAXX in freedom units.", "created_at": "2025-01-20T04:40:41", "owner": "michelmansourati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030477866618140, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-01-20T01:28:54", "owner": "viralwavesshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049311844933385, "text": "Be carfull with bit and accept the credit Card then you Will be charged and that don’t have email", "created_at": "2025-01-19T21:40:35", "owner": "gar.miguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999393273573877, "text": "Do not work in Poland", "created_at": "2025-01-19T16:23:13", "owner": "aliaksei_skrypnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094172932510262, "text": "It’s the best place for me to buy knickers", "created_at": "2025-01-19T15:36:42", "owner": "zawiesta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031434650563018, "text": "@cabra_nails", "created_at": "2025-01-19T09:15:16", "owner": "amandajackson21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054384079863103, "text": "Which better Tkmaxx or Ross", "created_at": "2025-01-19T03:07:25", "owner": "ohh.itz_lowel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033788489597485, "text": "@dok_1982", "created_at": "2025-01-18T18:06:22", "owner": "v_okeeffe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866361109294346, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-17T06:03:18", "owner": "sobhanmahsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077471257721186, "text": "Why people keep on making non sense video which isn’t even true… the", "created_at": "2025-01-17T00:03:39", "owner": "gosaligo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095056390502677, "text": "In the U.K. a warehouse in Kent supply tk friends work there they got Levi jeans £5. All the stuff is seconds. So you pay to much at the store", "created_at": "2025-01-16T13:49:17", "owner": "johnfrances9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876662797239209, "text": "And?", "created_at": "2025-01-15T09:13:18", "owner": "slavio_pole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480790150010886, "text": "Makes sense…", "created_at": "2025-01-14T21:31:45", "owner": "cammyp13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874935028165608, "text": "👏🏾", "created_at": "2025-01-14T14:57:43", "owner": "fabulousmydarling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083502976583050, "text": "Wtf is TK Maxx? I thought it was TJ Maxx", "created_at": "2025-01-13T21:34:48", "owner": "buddzlitehere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085355719499461, "text": "TKMAXX is actually a lot dearer than you can find the same item on Amazon. I've bought so much stuff that's cheaper than it is in tkmaxx", "created_at": "2025-01-13T19:19:53", "owner": "jibber553", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074709400650121, "text": "@hangerpantsintheair", "created_at": "2025-01-13T16:50:55", "owner": "pavey.kim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029092703271666, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-13T12:52:59", "owner": "ahsam6670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121662415411569, "text": "@malarievdw", "created_at": "2025-01-13T10:45:08", "owner": "justina.tina.ina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862457857321100, "text": "@sueburgess2002", "created_at": "2025-01-13T09:57:52", "owner": "janvail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124299985404600, "text": "Mine is 8. What does it mean", "created_at": "2025-01-12T20:46:33", "owner": "1980_ley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878554996234313, "text": "I like going for a number 2 every day", "created_at": "2025-01-11T22:47:34", "owner": "markmarkdavidson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016420802669820, "text": "Yes, it’s lovely my favourite shop, but nowadays, it isn’t a bargain like it used to be.", "created_at": "2025-01-11T14:03:18", "owner": "marimendes1142", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044808523994324, "text": "@angel__la_b", "created_at": "2025-01-10T09:04:40", "owner": "milamfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877372678234003, "text": "Keep Palestine in your heart 🇵🇸 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-09T04:29:49", "owner": "goodnudgeagency", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056159809818702, "text": "Never knew this! Thanks so much for sharing! Xx", "created_at": "2025-01-08T21:43:07", "owner": "eliviajames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052540898001310, "text": "@poppygeldart_", "created_at": "2025-01-08T17:43:15", "owner": "hayleyjay74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083143552510304, "text": "@wendyagray Y’know what, I’ve said this, they stock products that were never released by the company.", "created_at": "2025-01-07T13:10:24", "owner": "wesdanceillustration", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141572077369282, "text": "@lottekelly87 👀", "created_at": "2025-01-06T20:30:19", "owner": "isobel_loves_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966161913832796, "text": "Good to know, thank you 😊", "created_at": "2025-01-06T19:04:37", "owner": "darkamasters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043874249191172, "text": "@capricetoddgreen", "created_at": "2025-01-06T18:51:48", "owner": "sarahetodd87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351013603123520, "text": "That’s my local TK Maxx 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-06T01:34:24", "owner": "3sge_celicagt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068774773682379, "text": "@tinlizardo  o alam mo na lab hehehe", "created_at": "2025-01-05T09:23:25", "owner": "alexmacatao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032173073576884, "text": "@fidelmaconboy 😮", "created_at": "2025-01-04T21:47:56", "owner": "maria.conboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048057287473677, "text": "I’ve seen some with number 8, what category are those please?", "created_at": "2025-01-04T09:36:18", "owner": "mzs__asamoah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943050453939032, "text": "@helen_225", "created_at": "2025-01-04T00:56:44", "owner": "russcowlingphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18259453780262593, "text": "Nothing is made especially for TK Maxx, items are supplied especially fot the shop", "created_at": "2025-01-02T23:29:13", "owner": "taramparami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048385897930559, "text": "🤯", "created_at": "2025-01-02T18:37:21", "owner": "abeislegend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297755983227083, "text": "Good to know 👏", "created_at": "2025-01-02T17:43:19", "owner": "pmu_by_asta_ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287532802174343, "text": "@emsoutofoffice 👀👀👀", "created_at": "2025-01-02T10:42:39", "owner": "iamalexmackie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17934641978970004, "text": "Thanks mister!!!👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-02T10:40:12", "owner": "fabiano.garcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082760062510420, "text": "I think most ‘outlet’ stores make their own stuff", "created_at": "2025-01-02T09:39:30", "owner": "ferris206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027119270292887, "text": "@billy.lander.9", "created_at": "2025-01-01T21:53:50", "owner": "michaela.lander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002637131705946, "text": "@leighleighbee @pbon1947", "created_at": "2025-01-01T14:16:41", "owner": "ella.rev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047377043324353, "text": "@ornellaspringhetti", "created_at": "2025-01-01T11:20:23", "owner": "kaddiee97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851867815364214, "text": "Only a bargain if you were going to buy it anyway.", "created_at": "2024-12-31T20:41:26", "owner": "maria.hewitt.351", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041346581364079, "text": "@bindarrani", "created_at": "2024-12-31T16:43:48", "owner": "estidwipratiwi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889052857165092, "text": "@mrs_k_russell", "created_at": "2024-12-31T09:23:00", "owner": "ameliaruss44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067420009742378, "text": "@emma.m.smyth @kev.smith1983", "created_at": "2024-12-31T06:03:12", "owner": "jennifer_smith_232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18260544484259087, "text": "@meetmarilyn", "created_at": "2024-12-30T19:57:28", "owner": "juliehorbus2lewis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924444231900404, "text": "what about an 8", "created_at": "2024-12-30T13:35:35", "owner": "urtedeltuvaite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062492965894104, "text": "@julieju82 @chess_harris", "created_at": "2024-12-30T11:34:39", "owner": "rsuze58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088573462532230, "text": "What if it's an 8?", "created_at": "2024-12-30T09:50:24", "owner": "thecraskes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250733806272134, "text": "Can't bear TK Maxx, it always looks like a jumble sale in the store.", "created_at": "2024-12-30T09:40:10", "owner": "gail44evans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984581028632242, "text": "@charlottterowe @elllierowe", "created_at": "2024-12-30T09:39:57", "owner": "shelleyrowe99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056770426786132, "text": "@mattjgilbey", "created_at": "2024-12-30T09:28:14", "owner": "kerryemmaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042621365197895, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2024-12-30T07:36:04", "owner": "lesleymoonfox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18483754987013603, "text": "Some reason why some items are cheap", "created_at": "2024-12-30T05:02:01", "owner": "orange_karma", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029903996439368, "text": "But why would MK make products for TK Max", "created_at": "2024-12-29T12:29:17", "owner": "npjc1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469796767002449, "text": "Very useful information, thank you!", "created_at": "2024-12-29T11:44:05", "owner": "maggie.d_111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095598394450544, "text": "The overall quality and variety of goods has dropped dramatically over the past few years. The “labels” are few and far between. My partner has always been able to find quality known brands in the men’s dept, knowing the trick with the codes and has some great bargains, cashmere, cools jeans and jackets etc, whereas I’ve always found the women’s to be a load of weird and kookie badly cut, hideously patterned monstrous left overs from my Nans local jumble sale. Makes me shudder juts thinking about it!", "created_at": "2024-12-29T10:24:22", "owner": "louiserea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055941475791272, "text": "I can barely cope with the hunter-gatherer mode I have to go into to survive a session at tx max without also having to decipher tag codes. My shoppaphobic brethren will support me here", "created_at": "2024-12-29T08:18:29", "owner": "peternsanze", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["tkmaxx", "tjmaxx", "shoppinghacks", "moneysavingtips", "couponking", "loudbudgeting", "tkmaxxfinds"]},
{"media_id": 3484568482830708699, "shortcode": "DBbrJK2pW_b", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBbrJK2pW_b/", "taken_at": "2024-10-22T16:03:13", "caption": "It rained while I was shopping last night \n\n#linguistics #language #hongkong #etymology #china #cantonese #censorship", "owner_username": "etymologynerd", "owner_id": "6147216882", "likes": 35309, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0371_DBbrJK2pW_b\\DBbrJK2pW_b_20241022_160313.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18055271377971160, "text": "this gave me a lethal dose of reddit", "created_at": "2025-01-14T21:20:49", "owner": "kaimtsn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082914379571859, "text": "Fr le d language is rlly Ho Jeng once u understand them sls", "created_at": "2025-01-03T16:49:07", "owner": "lcw_aka_lilsam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052953154990347, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-19T19:22:57", "owner": "chaotichkcassi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430142632073128, "text": "I can’t believe there are papers on this 😂 as a hker even I struggle to read konglish", "created_at": "2024-12-15T10:50:25", "owner": "jan.cheung_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030464645420292, "text": "When people say 裝修 zhongsaau giving a renovation it means damaging certain government property or spraying slogans over it", "created_at": "2024-12-13T14:42:06", "owner": "___t.lo___", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18023800718291545, "text": "They're all in jail now 😢", "created_at": "2024-11-24T17:44:15", "owner": "charlietolamo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18475656748013247, "text": "It clearly didnt work. 12,000 + rioters were arrested", "created_at": "2024-11-24T09:51:02", "owner": "daniel.not.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029869691169039, "text": "Heung Gong yan ga yao🔥🙌", "created_at": "2024-11-23T05:22:40", "owner": "cindyhui0624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914051979935083, "text": "Oh my god I actually understood this. It took me a minute but I can read it 👏", "created_at": "2024-11-20T15:54:32", "owner": "gracefont", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053928640935238, "text": "people when america colonizes: 😨😱😱 people when china colonizes: 😃👍🤝", "created_at": "2024-11-20T12:56:21", "owner": "young_shreeda1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064135534741514, "text": "There is a severe lack of Diu lei lo mo pok gai in this comment section 🇭🇰🇭🇰", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:26:06", "owner": "nicole.__.w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281298313242457, "text": "Heung gong ga yau", "created_at": "2024-11-16T01:37:26", "owner": "colette.hy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018596504540749, "text": "not this reminding me of avoiding the neopets board filters 💀 you should do a video on that", "created_at": "2024-10-26T15:52:11", "owner": "ashfrdgshfrmsm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014393816345230, "text": "Based", "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:36:14", "owner": "d1omonn1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964946076683057, "text": "thank you for covering Hong Kong. Something equally interesting is we also make use of our tone system. Using numbers with the same tone of certain words, 5201314 or 3219 0246 has a new different meaning to many Hongkongers", "created_at": "2024-10-25T03:43:47", "owner": "gwone_holl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052273528763039, "text": "hong kong mentioned by etymologynerd 🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-10-25T01:59:18", "owner": "jaz.xfx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144312631352850, "text": "big fan of all these hk-ers yall so cool", "created_at": "2024-10-24T19:02:02", "owner": "khaamkeaw", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17856064908244512, "text": "konglish existed way before the 2019 protests tho 🤷🏻 i personally have been using at least since 2006", "created_at": "2024-10-24T12:08:07", "owner": "herbzi.leaf", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17904747906050318, "text": "Thank you for covering this!", "created_at": "2024-10-24T10:36:03", "owner": "einsteigenbitte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877844323177996, "text": "My favorite part was being vindicated when I said it was another failed CIA color revolution", "created_at": "2024-10-24T00:18:11", "owner": "redskwurl", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17944803851880504, "text": "The world class wonder is the indifference of the Hong Kong / Chinese governments in face of 2 million protestors taking to the street.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T22:50:56", "owner": "birinta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954578871728407, "text": "HK 🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰 MENTIONED 🔥🔥🔥🔥🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️ WTF IS FREEDOM⁉️⁉️⁉️🗣️🗣️🗣️🔥🔥🔥😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-10-23T19:55:40", "owner": "axmhc._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18141247027355135, "text": "Ig-pay, atin-lay.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T18:59:13", "owner": "kotoku_denjiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881835241149233, "text": "my biggest conspiracy theory of all time is that they released covid virus to stop protests. cause if i remember- there were protests happening everywhere around that time. and then covid happened. BAM. no protests.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T16:18:33", "owner": "shrimpycolon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868693291218578, "text": "I came here for the fun facts, and now im staying for the amazing insight of the connection of rebellion and the power of language. More pls.🔥🔥🔥 :3", "created_at": "2024-10-23T16:05:02", "owner": "ace12345666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889869703038598, "text": "this is also how some of us text when we're too lazy to type characters", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:34:55", "owner": "sozo_zoee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051284983765622, "text": "I don't think the protests were very cool at all (the period of time, im not condemning the protestors)", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:33:16", "owner": "sozo_zoee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307586458164461, "text": "Dor tse nei gei coverage and explanation on NGO dei ge lingo 🙏 reli appreciate nei", "created_at": "2024-10-23T14:36:34", "owner": "squidward__scissorhands", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18010007552646696, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-23T13:00:34", "owner": "_ting.lik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108215884430653, "text": "idk if youve done this before but i would love to see something on why different nationalities have different suffixes! (like chinese and japanese, then american and australian, and english and spanish etc)", "created_at": "2024-10-23T12:16:38", "owner": "snoopyknoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852839026260086, "text": "I love your content and amused by it, but there was no censorship on the words. We can see CNN and NYT live broadcasting through our phones. These code names are common slang that evolved based on context for a long time. “Ghost” means police to the protestors. In the context of triad groups, “ghost” means there is mole in the group. “Walking” means protest, but it had long been a slang of “police patrol” in the UK colonial days. The examples are endless and it did not start in 2019 and have not ended in 2024.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T11:46:22", "owner": "leo.y.chiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060798340804614, "text": "arm ahh", "created_at": "2024-10-23T11:12:30", "owner": "sharoncho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041091496917434, "text": "It's really just romanized Cantonese???", "created_at": "2024-10-23T10:42:41", "owner": "kdenseeeyyyyyyyyyy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17844164403332955, "text": "thanks for sharinggggg🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:50:34", "owner": "hello.jasminelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18257528038271746, "text": "HONG KONG MENTIONED🤩🤩🤩🤩", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:43:19", "owner": "_p3gasus.00180_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018762233624308, "text": "I remember a brief period in Beijing when there posters saying it’s bad to screenshot your phone. I think there are a million stories out there on this topic.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T06:42:46", "owner": "minhthangwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008108294654016, "text": "Can you explain to me why so many online chefs say the word \"off\" so often, as in, \"Just going to fry these off,\" or, \"Sear that off\" etc?", "created_at": "2024-10-23T05:59:24", "owner": "sarahmorg.haley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018040619632946, "text": "Nah i dont reckon the new language thing was the coolest bit", "created_at": "2024-10-23T05:24:13", "owner": "philosophica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038732095981423, "text": "My favorite part was how they beat up old people and were funded by the CIA! But your thing is cool too", "created_at": "2024-10-23T04:35:01", "owner": "jerinjail", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18039003787966891, "text": "🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰💛💛💛💛", "created_at": "2024-10-23T04:08:05", "owner": "tinyannggg", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18228653242303081, "text": "Try Singlish next", "created_at": "2024-10-23T03:57:09", "owner": "ultikiwi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115318270406733, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-23T01:27:17", "owner": "honeygurl650", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035497862464290, "text": "Hasn’t the term ghost always been a way to refer to undercover/spys", "created_at": "2024-10-23T01:06:34", "owner": "charlene_3109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049070383816026, "text": "If you're confused it's like an entire language similar to when people in Texas and other southern states \"went camping\" after roe v Wade was overturned", "created_at": "2024-10-22T21:35:11", "owner": "iamastegosauruss", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18019306178313391, "text": "光復香港", "created_at": "2024-10-22T20:45:41", "owner": "dhdarren", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18011015915427458, "text": "懷疑有鬼", "created_at": "2024-10-22T20:07:56", "owner": "valerieremark", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18240833611302871, "text": "The coolest thing about the 2019 Hong Kong protests for me that protestors from every age group was very well informed. Even older uncles and aunties adopted the latest slang words to better communicate with young student protestors. The hope for change is so strong and it crosses generations.", "created_at": "2024-10-22T20:06:21", "owner": "vinvininde", "likes": 481}, {"id": 18056062930878567, "text": "@xiranjayzhao Commentary requested", "created_at": "2024-10-22T19:49:43", "owner": "writer_monkey29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040238591172050, "text": "Ho chi yau siu siu late 🥲", "created_at": "2024-10-22T19:33:43", "owner": "lunalunakoon", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17869836534215014, "text": "35th of May is a way to refer to what is known in china as the \"June 4th Incident\" and what we know as the Tiananmen Square Massacre", "created_at": "2024-10-22T19:25:58", "owner": "soggysian", "likes": 97}, {"id": 18113022139413117, "text": "2019 was a heartbreaking but empowering period for us Hong Kongers ❤️🇭🇰 We knew how fragile our system was, and I really fucking miss the solidarity we had as a city 🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰🤘🤘❤️❤️❤️💘💘💘", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:57:34", "owner": "itsicy_01", "likes": 260}, {"id": 17949070868853647, "text": "Yay finally sb talking about konglish, btw I’m doing a dissertation on it aiming to further study and promote the use of HK style Cantonese, if any native cantonese user is willing/interested in contributing as a participant in my research (would be a quick test and survey conducted online), you’re more than welcome to give me a message :)", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:52:21", "owner": "yukari_q_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18017010083337144, "text": "Can you please do a video on the Polari language?", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:41:00", "owner": "typicalsituation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010803467422762, "text": "I grew up in Guangzhou in the early 2000s and I can kind of understand it", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:35:28", "owner": "gxslosberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064138531662243, "text": "hong kong mentioned wtf is freedom of speech 🔥🔥🔥🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:09:00", "owner": "sacredlettuce", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18096845221427250, "text": "the resistance was truly memorable. clever and resourceful.", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:35:44", "owner": "firdusii", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18059799994790832, "text": "Ahh, this is so cool! I wrote a paper about these protests when I was in grad school and now I teach it as an example to my grad students. 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:35:04", "owner": "dr.jurassic.jules", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18143003689356338, "text": "As a Hong Kong person I struggle a lot with understanding our slang (I grew up in mostly English speaking communities)", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:34:56", "owner": "lyrxchn", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18046393297959957, "text": "same; except for when I speak no one understands", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:26:28", "owner": "victor_vieux", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945670902857220, "text": "bro outed us😭", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:24:53", "owner": "cedrictseng", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17902659018059722, "text": "They also used to have an app to alert people about police presence. The word they used for police cars was 狗車 which means “dog vehicle”", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:22:18", "owner": "m.umerabdullah", "likes": 117}, {"id": 17979210203773121, "text": "I must hasten to add that, the currency of Cantonese will soon be gone, thanks to a series of measures to erase it. There's a mandatory change of the teaching language to Mandarin (2008), and removal of Cantonese speaking exams (2024). With Tiktok China in booms you can expect less and less influence coming from Cantonese culture. The reality is, few kids in town speak Cantonese to each other. They'd rather speak Mandarin unless it's the \"boring, old-fashioned, brainwashed 90s\" or earlier they're speaking to. 🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:47:58", "owner": "arnoldescartes", "likes": 125}, {"id": 18467535970009238, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:39:30", "owner": "anyizl_", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18011965292642279, "text": "It doesn't matter. In Canton (as in Cantonese) ppl got arrested just for holding up blank paper (in front of my own doorstep)", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:39:23", "owner": "marigold.heoi", "likes": 40}, {"id": 17843171154343734, "text": "Hearing him say “Wa yi yau ghost” is unreal", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:38:36", "owner": "dickyau_", "likes": 733}, {"id": 18307994860161021, "text": "I love it when you combine political movements with linguistics ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:34:20", "owner": "xxbellame0wxy", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17982735173751039, "text": "HONG KONG MENTIONED 🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️IN TEARS RN 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:33:38", "owner": "arnoldescartes", "likes": 181}, {"id": 18367163410129918, "text": "am I allowed to like this post???", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:28:46", "owner": "ver6andi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17940313367790709, "text": "Also, when they cleaned up the graffiti, the shape of the words remained and so they just created a new font 😹😹", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:27:37", "owner": "owl_writes", "likes": 39}, {"id": 17998600709694861, "text": "HK MENTIONEDDD 🔥🔥🔥🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🙏🏻🔥🔥🔥 WTF IS A JUSTICE SYSTEMMMMM🔥🔥🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🙏🏻🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:27:03", "owner": "nomoskwan", "likes": 689}, {"id": 18055739464843707, "text": "hong kong mentioned 🗣️🗣️🔥🔥‼️‼️", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:25:00", "owner": "jerlee333", "likes": 83}, {"id": 18309010195166312, "text": "Picnic for protest :)", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:23:22", "owner": "owl_writes", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062511721738134, "text": "hong kong mentionedddd 🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:19:50", "owner": "shreya.png", "likes": 37}, {"id": 17856911499279590, "text": "Thank you! Love from a Hongkonger 💕", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:18:10", "owner": "pamyyt", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18006500282654125, "text": "I am a Hongkonger and I cannot decode their encrypted messages😂", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:15:11", "owner": "jeff0596_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18317311933082497, "text": "I just got stood-up and it got me wondering, could you do a video on where that phrase comes from. It doesn't make much sense, I would love to learn why we use it", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:12:50", "owner": "princess_vermillion_mj", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18329914792150139, "text": "It's why Cantonese is superior and the CCP's pressure to erase it is a form of ethnic cleansing", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:11:59", "owner": "zscpicharrrs", "likes": 784}, {"id": 18041916632125974, "text": "Shopping at the plaza raining on the ghosts", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:11:31", "owner": "jsampthachamp", "likes": 72}, {"id": 17900749274979952, "text": "The maps they created to categorize which businesses were pro-umbrella, pro-police, or straight up CCP was ingenious. \n\n“That restaurant has an umbrella sticker, let’s ‘punish’ them with money.”", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:10:42", "owner": "ubeda", "likes": 795}, {"id": 17900445480068230, "text": "need him", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:08:16", "owner": "audrey.so.whimsical", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18023717135222669, "text": "Peak", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:07:29", "owner": "_embolli_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338216224181543, "text": "Boycott the NBA", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:06:52", "owner": "k1z1to", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18074232808525008, "text": "Thats cool as fuck", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:05:38", "owner": "tazero.i.guess", "likes": 104}, {"id": 18277205710216440, "text": "Yeah we will execute all traitors and ccp collaborators at the day of liberation", "created_at": "2024-12-21T22:47:04", "owner": "hkcvq_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936129339959939, "text": "WLTF HEUNG GONG MENTIONED YOOOOOOOO🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-21T04:09:40", "owner": "chy.allison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852099991284516, "text": "Are you suggesting that Gen Z has been plotting our demise this whole time?  no cap, frfr giving skibidi rizz😂", "created_at": "2024-11-19T07:39:22", "owner": "kcostales42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329436235195495, "text": "Fake empire propaganda for losers, get lost", "created_at": "2024-11-02T00:20:26", "owner": "marcus_cb95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942833253783959, "text": "on9", "created_at": "2024-10-24T22:05:54", "owner": "runboh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062558857684038, "text": "HONG KONG MENTIONED WHAT IS A CHEAP HOUSING 🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰‼️🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:33:31", "owner": "sozo_zoee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081444577548828, "text": "ETYMOLOGY NERD HK MENTIONRD???", "created_at": "2024-10-23T15:32:47", "owner": "sozo_zoee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037257004998029, "text": "No it wasn’t. Hong Kong is full of a bunch of brainwashed fools more loyal to the country that stole Hong Kong from China than its rightful owner", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:28:25", "owner": "its_rebag", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103804792449015, "text": "This is linguistically pretty cool, although to inform those of you who are not in Hong Kong and may not have heard of the full scope of the situation because non local news sources seem to refuse to report these things, those people claimed they were protesting, but really they were rioting. They said their approach was peaceful and logical but then they proceeded to damage so much public property. They vandalised train stations, smashed the glass railings in multiple shopping malls, burnt down a big Christmas tree in the middle of a mall, graffitied all over bridges and roads, etc. They’re rebelling to a logically false cause. Just because you see US police being corrupt in news does not mean you can extrapolate and claim every other region’s police is also corrupt. And yet somehow they don’t realise that if we really split off from mainland, not only would HK’s main water source, which comes from mainland, be cut off, but you’re rejecting 5000 years of cultural heritage in favour of a mere 27 years. We already had plenty of freedom to begin with and their actions, instead of bringing more freedom like they claim, has scared away tourists and caused restrictions to be put in place instead. So thank you for ruining the economy.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T02:49:08", "owner": "magentapink_art", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18095205514467993, "text": "The coolest thing was how they were about helping a literal murderer avoid trial while upholding the worst imperialist powers on Earth as models. 🤡🪳", "created_at": "2024-10-23T01:10:19", "owner": "krausermartin", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18340320028121578, "text": "Worth mentioning that it is not an “entirely new linguistics system” because back in the 2000s it was very much a text speech like “r u 4 real” in the western world. I still remember getting nagged by my dad for not “using english/chinese properly”.", "created_at": "2024-10-22T22:45:53", "owner": "nochillbunny", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986841408742227, "text": "Growing up in HK (after 2000s) i can say although this ended terribly even until now is was the first time it felt like we were actually going to war and the tense environment was so insane", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:24:43", "owner": "prime.anson.ngwh", "likes": 160}, {"id": 18048938377819103, "text": "…..and still Hong Kong failed. The movement ended in crackdowns now CCP has full control.", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:15:23", "owner": "micxmic", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17991109103710226, "text": "shit is probably hilarious if i understand cantonese", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:57:59", "owner": "ssunua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326209171153806, "text": "Chinese probaganda", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:40:09", "owner": "mhrqaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014487113355095, "text": "GWONG FOOK HEUNG GONG SI DOI GAK MING\nHEUNG GONG DOOK LUP WAI YAT CHUT LO", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:33:12", "owner": "freehkgreentyph", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18168682048310364, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:31:40", "owner": "freehkgreentyph", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["linguistics", "language", "hongkong", "etymology", "china", "cantonese", "censorship"]},
{"media_id": 3506197232526335015, "shortcode": "DCog85tMJwn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCog85tMJwn/", "taken_at": "2024-11-21T12:15:41", "caption": "🇭🇰CityU有自己的馬拉松🏃‍♀️\n大學生忙碌且無用的一天😩😩\n#cityu #cityuniversity #cityuniversityofhongkong #城大 #香港城市大學 #cityuinsider#百米衝刺 #接力跑 #火箭發射#100meters #遲到 #belate #dse #招生 #collegelife #universitylife #university #hongkong #collegestudent", "owner_username": "cityuinsider", "owner_id": "65955840199", "likes": 3176, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0372_DCog85tMJwn\\DCog85tMJwn_20241121_121541.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18038013389338142", "text": "true!😢", "created_at": "2024-11-29T10:34:35", "owner": "hqw9419", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17928252404974985", "text": "my fucking uni life", "created_at": "2024-11-21T15:00:54", "owner": "llinorak_", "likes": 14}, {"id": "18068123941646281", "text": "look so busy😂", "created_at": "2024-11-21T14:45:59", "owner": "shialley_x_316", "likes": 26}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["cityu", "cityuniversity", "cityuniversityofhongkong", "城大", "香港城市大學", "cityuinsider", "百米衝刺", "接力跑", "火箭發射", "100meters", "遲到", "belate", "dse", "招生", "collegelife", "universitylife", "university", "hongkong", "collegestudent"]},
{"media_id": 3502655660821661890, "shortcode": "DCb7sQByUjC", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCb7sQByUjC/", "taken_at": "2024-11-16T15:01:36", "caption": ": 呢個書架嘅牌子叫”HERE“係日本Detail出嘅，印度製造，有兩個版本，呢個係芒果木襯銀色架，另一個係染色芒果木襯金色架，一個簡單而優雅嘅設計。每攞一本書個木球就會填返本書嘅空位，就好似有人靜靜地幫你扶住架上面嘅書咁。金屬支架同時作為木球嘅路軌同埋放書嘅位置，因為D書係架空離地嘅關係所以睇落去都另到D書嘅重量都輕左咁。係一個好靚亦好低調，能為空間增加特色嘅書架。\n\n🙂‍↕️Share - Like - Comment 🙂‍↕️\n\nThis slope bookend by ”HERE“ was produced by Detail Japan and made in India. It has two versions available: mango wood with a iron rack and stained mango wood with a cropper coating rack—a simple and elegant design. Every time you pick up a book, the wooden ball will fill the space of that book, just like someone gently helping you hold the book on the shelf. The metal rack serves as the track of the wooden ball and where the books are held. Since the books are elevated off the ground, the weight of the book looks way lighter than it is. It is a beautiful and low-key bookshelf that can add character to the space.\n\nこのスロープブックエンドは、ディテールジャパンがプロデュースし、インドで製造された「HERE」の製品です。マンゴーウッドとアイアンラック、ステインマンゴーウッドとクロッパーコーティングラックの2種類があり、シンプルで上品なデザインです。本を手に取るたびに、木製のボールがその本のスペースを埋め、まるで誰かが棚の上で本をそっと支えているようです。金属製のラックは、木製のボールの軌道と本を固定する場所の役割を果たします。本が地面から浮いているため、本の重量は実際よりもはるかに軽く見えます。空間に個性を添えることができる、美しく控えめな本棚です。\n\n#Detail\n#slopebookend\n#bookend\n#stationary\n#ブックエンド", "owner_username": "chanhector", "owner_id": "242639883", "likes": 5086, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0373_DCb7sQByUjC\\DCb7sQByUjC_20241116_150136.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18405767395187340, "text": "你有邊樣嘢唔覺得正？", "created_at": "2025-10-12T04:58:22", "owner": "law.tin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066371318514274, "text": "點解咁似碌齡擺波個條軌，靈感會唔會係黎自碌齡😆", "created_at": "2025-06-30T09:21:02", "owner": "oliviawys", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18050404756989703, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-20T02:13:16", "owner": "loop.interior.design", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18473582413054416, "text": "其實係咪唔要舊木都可以放到啲書 點解要整多嚿木", "created_at": "2024-11-19T01:30:09", "owner": "jaxonyauuuu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18159702931324116, "text": "For anyone that doesn’t speak Cantonese, it is a bookshelf.", "created_at": "2024-11-18T12:45:43", "owner": "cr_v_ko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114687160420162, "text": "十分敬佩您，所以用您字稱呼您☺️ 你啲reels太好睇了。配嘅音樂又好，光線/燈光又好，說話聲線又舒服，鏡頭攞得好，剪接又好，揀嘅typography我都覺好，資訊性又夠，簡單易睇又吸引🙏🏻多謝您嘅所有介紹(我唔捨得一次過睇晒，我分開慢慢慢慢睇😊)", "created_at": "2024-11-18T10:46:12", "owner": "uu927", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874352590212301, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-11-17T22:15:36", "owner": "rainarrow41", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17900220261066249, "text": "今次差評，會整爛啲書，會整爛CD，會整爛黑膠，呢個設計牽強", "created_at": "2024-11-17T11:05:22", "owner": "sleep_shit_eat", "likes": 234}, {"id": 18283442359175568, "text": "首先，你要有空間", "created_at": "2024-11-17T09:13:01", "owner": "jamesgjt", "likes": 79}, {"id": 18153774604332510, "text": "我書都平放着，就看到了，想拿那本就那本", "created_at": "2024-11-17T04:06:16", "owner": "aaron_ks_cheng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073677379614902, "text": "本書會唔會有條痕", "created_at": "2024-11-17T04:05:16", "owner": "the_sourest_lemon", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18037641896040032, "text": "啲書太大本 應該用吾到", "created_at": "2024-11-17T02:47:52", "owner": "kaichy1994", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18328468486153818, "text": "你分享生活既喜悅真係好有感染力", "created_at": "2024-11-16T17:34:51", "owner": "hanselhwf", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18051332191951994, "text": "Rest Energy 您喺邊度買呀？🥹", "created_at": "2024-11-16T16:13:33", "owner": "uu927", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18128635369388037, "text": "太正了❤️ 點算，又要買喎🙈🫶🏻 (一行禪師☺️🍀🙏🏻無限like)", "created_at": "2024-11-16T16:05:14", "owner": "uu927", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18359149021184051, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:29:09", "owner": "sukycheng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026596379453528, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:23:05", "owner": "marcusngng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989688252592150, "text": "到底你屋企有幾大", "created_at": "2024-11-16T15:10:40", "owner": "lkwolfff", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["detail", "slopebookend", "bookend", "stationary", "ブックエンド"]},
{"media_id": 3527208274406141118, "shortcode": "DDzKTzUy-y-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDzKTzUy-y-/", "taken_at": "2024-12-20T12:00:14", "caption": "挪威歌手 AURORA 之前錯過香港，很多人都喊很可惜，幸好她決定在2025年來開演唱會！以她現場高水準演出，絕對是音樂人不能錯過的盛事，門票已經進行公售了～🧚🏻‍♂️\n\nAURORA “What Happened To The Earth? Part 4” 香港演唱會\n🔸日期：2025年2月24日(一)\n🔸地點： 亞洲國際博覽館 Hall 5\n🔸票價：$880(優先進場+海報+企位)/$680(企位)\n#ndmusicnews", "owner_username": "newsdailyasia", "owner_id": "41905950983", "likes": 21007, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_1.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_2.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_3.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_4.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_5.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_6.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_7.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0374_DDzKTzUy-y-\\DDzKTzUy-y-_20241220_120014_8.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18028857971286480", "text": "😍！", "created_at": "2025-01-12T02:08:25", "owner": "tim.shin1101", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18483749437058540", "text": "@yuki._.0902_ 哇啊啊啊啊啊 是她耶！！！！", "created_at": "2025-01-04T16:28:31", "owner": "happy.__.0425", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18040333112075021", "text": "想聽聽她在台上說笑話🔞", "created_at": "2025-01-02T04:01:50", "owner": "tess_fan99", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18387659242101942", "text": "@y.xq.y 這是唱光遇背景音樂的！！！💀💀", "created_at": "2025-01-01T01:28:14", "owner": "emma336229", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18353429485192333", "text": "會來台灣嗎😢", "created_at": "2024-12-28T15:38:15", "owner": "ya_p_jang", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18286240201244217", "text": "希望能來台灣😍😍", "created_at": "2024-12-27T23:30:58", "owner": "7teana", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17845955361383091", "text": "@yi_jungggg", "created_at": "2024-12-27T06:22:20", "owner": "mercy._0612", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18029755736578566", "text": "Runaway🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-27T05:28:59", "owner": "joshuateoh2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18127597528361203", "text": "@wpyjoyce", "created_at": "2024-12-25T20:18:22", "owner": "haytham_cross", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18475378183033754", "text": "最鐘意佢首conquer", "created_at": "2024-12-25T17:58:16", "owner": "k.a.m.e.s", "likes": 5}, {"id": "18055993762791218", "text": "青峰有跟她合作", "created_at": "2024-12-25T14:31:12", "owner": "saylai_teoh", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18254244778277035", "text": "搶票", "created_at": "2024-12-23T09:35:41", "owner": "sugka___qwy", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18057032551939772", "text": "🙌支持", "created_at": "2024-12-22T10:02:59", "owner": "uuderbear", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18048773954117944", "text": "買咗飛啦！😍", "created_at": "2024-12-22T08:58:33", "owner": "jacky.tong.1004", "likes": 4}, {"id": "18001946231704186", "text": "😍來台灣", "created_at": "2024-12-22T05:44:18", "owner": "demonic_ru_rong", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18068535550680110", "text": "@hiunam_cheung  2.24", "created_at": "2024-12-21T14:23:36", "owner": "pchang_autumn", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18046363856125935", "text": "求AURORA來台灣🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-21T10:56:57", "owner": "0.0shawty", "likes": 66}, {"id": "18285656662170964", "text": "@catmix_13 我超喜歡Ta 🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-21T04:54:16", "owner": "pipi16888", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18070117714731792", "text": "You can not eat money yo~", "created_at": "2024-12-20T20:20:50", "owner": "junlin_0312", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17869032207271861", "text": "幾時開買？", "created_at": "2024-12-20T13:14:57", "owner": "hin_yee__", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18051769688096855", "text": "@johnson0125", "created_at": "2024-12-20T13:12:15", "owner": "octopus_shane", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18033195131159812", "text": "AURORA 🌞 !! the fairy 🧚 🧚", "created_at": "2024-12-20T12:21:12", "owner": "kate_chu113", "likes": 4}, {"id": "18061166734770778", "text": "係光遇睇佢演唱會😌👍", "created_at": "2025-02-12T15:56:58", "owner": "chocolove_draws", "likes": 18}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["ndmusicnews"]},
{"media_id": 3524309151791868990, "shortcode": "DDo3IA_Nmw-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDo3IA_Nmw-/", "taken_at": "2024-12-16T12:00:12", "caption": "應用題\n\n@hahahaleopard\n@hahahablurry\n\n#迷因 #梗圖 #迷因梗 #迷因梗圖 #meme", "owner_username": "crazylifememes", "owner_id": "53072379225", "likes": 3237, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0375_DDo3IA_Nmw-\\DDo3IA_Nmw-_20241216_120012.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18471330256002935", "text": "應該是回 :我全力以赴", "created_at": "2024-12-17T07:03:32", "owner": "wasa.nebula_332", "likes": 15}, {"id": "18024179948550415", "text": "我很好學！", "created_at": "2024-12-16T12:11:32", "owner": "gygygpkpkp123", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["迷因", "梗圖", "迷因梗", "迷因梗圖", "meme"]},
{"media_id": 3531320274993986537, "shortcode": "DEBxRSTJrvp", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DEBxRSTJrvp/", "taken_at": "2024-12-26T04:10:30", "caption": "如果覺得這款地毯似曾相識，是你的錯覺。\n\n接觸良好、良率高、品質穩定\nIKEA官網🔎BRÄNNBOLL\n\n#IKEA #IKEATW #IKEATaiwan\n#BRANNBOLL #地毯 #電競", "owner_username": "ikea_taiwan", "owner_id": "302805759", "likes": 8112, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0376_DEBxRSTJrvp\\DEBxRSTJrvp_20241226_041030.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18046953740179253, "text": "No way I got on the Taiwanese side of shopping on ig", "created_at": "2025-06-05T12:46:49", "owner": "iknow.yunho.minho.leeknow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907416160109439, "text": "@mmmqqo789 😘", "created_at": "2025-04-17T17:28:00", "owner": "ck10124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268359958262252, "text": "踩爆", "created_at": "2025-03-08T01:17:22", "owner": "hijacker4163", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047494529196711, "text": "@kuaik1d", "created_at": "2025-03-03T11:53:44", "owner": "z_jie55688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057978929475755, "text": "@yenderrr.de", "created_at": "2025-03-02T10:12:50", "owner": "wen_liu951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858384958303835, "text": "Bad bin 也太多了吧\n這樣還賣2499\n不怕被highlight 嗎？🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-02-23T07:09:57", "owner": "yiyu_870214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039062075163437, "text": "這應該是不能出貨給客戶，會死人", "created_at": "2025-02-22T01:03:04", "owner": "baronwood5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020965757434581, "text": "@nicole_shiuan0729 我反而會想買第一張良率好的", "created_at": "2025-02-09T12:35:11", "owner": "aslitfivb", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091038181555946, "text": "前面那張比較好看", "created_at": "2025-02-09T03:18:49", "owner": "rank.10.hw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088772359492353, "text": "76.8寸\n由65,000奈米製程的人造纖維組成", "created_at": "2025-02-05T17:26:16", "owner": "chengweide4", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896906233105215, "text": "我還以為是甚麼apple", "created_at": "2025-02-05T08:02:54", "owner": "gg5487548778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031724162534857, "text": "這良率還敢賣2000", "created_at": "2025-02-05T07:06:52", "owner": "n.d_phodography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097551061502802, "text": "對不起我以為要搞台積電😂", "created_at": "2025-02-04T09:24:34", "owner": "zyoyan340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030829283284345, "text": "呦，special map", "created_at": "2025-02-04T04:10:37", "owner": "liudavie629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040464233363541, "text": "我以為他要開始bad apple!!", "created_at": "2025-02-01T08:50:07", "owner": "lu_chan.0927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392975083102182, "text": "那天逛到這張 \n男友直接叫我敢快走不要再看了", "created_at": "2025-01-28T22:22:15", "owner": "mswang0226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18266075260270459, "text": "核反應堆", "created_at": "2025-01-28T11:36:50", "owner": "william_sssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020693297404959, "text": "@johnny19960708 快來買", "created_at": "2025-01-26T11:27:38", "owner": "j85034g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057896458803345, "text": "開勿擾看這影片\n怎會有熟悉的鈴聲出現", "created_at": "2025-01-24T14:29:14", "owner": "zky_0109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912744201963131, "text": "良率太低了吧", "created_at": "2025-01-21T12:28:49", "owner": "weiweiwei0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295898167236325, "text": "祈求良率與機況，萬世都不朽，我願榮光歸台積", "created_at": "2025-01-18T13:15:25", "owner": "lonelyislandicedtea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855048508310435, "text": "IKEA的行銷果然是文組，想做晶圓梗還搞錯die的大小", "created_at": "2025-01-18T08:30:42", "owner": "quarkskang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081739534593836, "text": "石墨柱要噴出來了嗎？", "created_at": "2025-01-15T16:16:10", "owner": "mimicateric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113114626439537, "text": "強國手搓良率", "created_at": "2025-01-07T16:25:37", "owner": "whisper_nah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18013609448669174, "text": "台積墊😅", "created_at": "2025-01-04T14:18:13", "owner": "linyongche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041684630465668, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-01T06:39:04", "owner": "hly._.sky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051852716076778, "text": "Yield那麼爛還要賣我2499", "created_at": "2024-12-31T16:34:46", "owner": "wsz_1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046056917276162, "text": "這什麼良率 涼率喔", "created_at": "2024-12-28T16:29:03", "owner": "normal._.ssd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042802829266592, "text": "良率太低了吧", "created_at": "2024-12-28T15:16:57", "owner": "daniel__0710", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050822477043063, "text": "@leeee_home", "created_at": "2024-12-28T13:54:42", "owner": "ko_evan0101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101422756474965, "text": "前面那個一張還挺貴", "created_at": "2024-12-28T10:54:33", "owner": "eason_0612._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18025452422568442, "text": "應該要加上司的名字這樣踩起來比較開心😆", "created_at": "2024-12-28T10:46:48", "owner": "iilliiwelk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011895785493358, "text": "@p___lin", "created_at": "2024-12-28T09:26:56", "owner": "nicki_218_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029866508608042, "text": "買回來要自己組嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-28T03:09:48", "owner": "liuyouyun22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914081278047973, "text": "加個tsmc就是我們熟悉的了", "created_at": "2024-12-27T15:21:58", "owner": "busfan_mya", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18054117673981254, "text": "前面那個多補一點，賣給台積電的工程師，滑鼠墊、地毯、桌布都可以，一定賣爆，直接跟乖乖搶市場", "created_at": "2024-12-27T11:27:20", "owner": "ridwan_in_ksa", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18130812868377104, "text": "買這回家說不定電腦會乖點", "created_at": "2024-12-27T07:58:39", "owner": "louisvirgo891205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030229079234047, "text": "這是一張三奈米的地毯", "created_at": "2024-12-27T05:46:12", "owner": "thisischris1121", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18064553647799847, "text": "我只覺得這張地毯很貴", "created_at": "2024-12-27T05:45:45", "owner": "thisischris1121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032888006166197, "text": "刪了吧 看了蠻不舒服的", "created_at": "2024-12-27T05:27:58", "owner": "idfc1019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039602324064350, "text": "後面那張感覺會爆炸", "created_at": "2024-12-27T01:37:34", "owner": "cocoyht33886", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17963232065835663, "text": "這Samsung 的地毯吧", "created_at": "2024-12-27T01:36:50", "owner": "yenshiang2013", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18120098422410590, "text": "台積墊 ！？", "created_at": "2024-12-27T01:30:51", "owner": "hi810316", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18035010986134748, "text": "真有才", "created_at": "2024-12-27T01:06:10", "owner": "yushu910194", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138992761370124, "text": "太鬧了", "created_at": "2024-12-27T00:46:12", "owner": "aaron10035", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028317953268491, "text": "這是要自己切割嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-26T14:54:43", "owner": "xq._.901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890922025149813, "text": "這是一張 台積墊", "created_at": "2024-12-26T11:40:53", "owner": "3n4_77", "likes": 1557}, {"id": 17938910918825618, "text": "天才", "created_at": "2024-12-26T09:27:54", "owner": "happy.finale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072994216634674, "text": "小編很棒", "created_at": "2024-12-26T09:26:40", "owner": "a.for.audrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943050927809036, "text": "3.6, Not Great Not Terrible", "created_at": "2024-12-26T08:43:55", "owner": "linus.klh.0905", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17993033609741453, "text": "良率提高就不只2499了", "created_at": "2024-12-26T07:36:21", "owner": "tk_0516", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17997093803567304, "text": "不知道為什麼 但是 yue🤢🤮", "created_at": "2024-12-26T06:54:01", "owner": "wuyan4ni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869915191258630, "text": "好不容易從工廠下班看到這個會不會崩潰", "created_at": "2024-12-26T06:33:01", "owner": "tsenghsinwen1219", "likes": 203}, {"id": 18037029053099136, "text": "Wwww", "created_at": "2024-12-26T05:55:32", "owner": "doeshing_owo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130347865381445, "text": "馬的\n良率這麼低還敢賣", "created_at": "2024-12-26T05:37:57", "owner": "adam32338489", "likes": 1174}, {"id": 18074802931620513, "text": "PTSD發作www", "created_at": "2024-12-26T05:21:59", "owner": "ssu_tone", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18342317443180363, "text": "前面那張才會賣吧", "created_at": "2024-12-26T05:20:51", "owner": "liuocw", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18441092782073981, "text": "良率太低了吧，還要2499", "created_at": "2024-12-26T05:20:35", "owner": "od_chen", "likes": 522}, {"id": 18139480570334618, "text": "X die太多了啦，而且沒標bin種，我們封裝廠怎麼作？客戶給過？", "created_at": "2024-12-26T05:18:53", "owner": "unclebigrun", "likes": 103}, {"id": 17890865439120565, "text": "好地獄的感覺", "created_at": "2024-12-26T05: