{"media_id": 3529307297760285456, "shortcode": "DD6nknKMhMQ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DD6nknKMhMQ/", "taken_at": "2024-12-23T09:31:05", "caption": "顛覆式物理引擎 Genesis 發布 ! 能生成 4D 動態世界 !\n\n#ai #genesis #人工智能 #ai生成 #4D #科技", "owner_username": "labie.io", "owner_id": "45383099498", "likes": 7159, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0377_DD6nknKMhMQ\\DD6nknKMhMQ_20241223_093105.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17864620053241718, "text": "無咩用 每次計算太慢 你RL 講緊上億次simulation 你計到下世", "created_at": "2025-01-23T09:49:28", "owner": "lessing.chou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073851067660162, "text": "這世界快要變成虛擬世界中的虛擬世界了", "created_at": "2025-01-18T06:21:32", "owner": "k.h.r_209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053332481492034, "text": "未來AI開發者的福音 AI會變得多元化很多 希望這個框架沒有太大的缺陷", "created_at": "2025-01-09T18:07:32", "owner": "hiblue_1101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874089988165743, "text": "顯卡H100就好了划算得很😂", "created_at": "2025-01-05T15:16:28", "owner": "nacl2018", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18033674870454371, "text": "只有懂得才知道這有多屌", "created_at": "2025-01-04T11:46:07", "owner": "xbn_xnm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933497355989602, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-01-04T06:24:42", "owner": "xiliang.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385856593099751, "text": "所以，魔物獵人的海龍可以回歸了？", "created_at": "2024-12-26T16:28:46", "owner": "jengweingll1_03_04", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18119140141416525, "text": "好了，母體什麼時候做好，移居時間決定了嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-25T09:24:17", "owner": "joe_darklight", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17988468599767589, "text": "魔鬼終結者也快發生了😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T00:17:55", "owner": "mrg3004.tw", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17957178935745844, "text": "我还以为是四维世界", "created_at": "2024-12-24T18:28:09", "owner": "hhqrhh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072342373650044, "text": "@guo_jin_cheng", "created_at": "2024-12-24T17:37:05", "owner": "tim851028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022352804631448, "text": "哥們python 極度不適合跑大量運算 用C#吧", "created_at": "2024-12-23T18:16:03", "owner": "mou88178", "likes": 8