{"media_id": 3531992977080117310, "shortcode": "DEEKOY8COg-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DEEKOY8COg-/", "taken_at": "2024-12-27T02:31:07", "caption": "From Binary to Decimal: Unlocking the Magic of Conversion! \n#learncoding  #techexplained", "owner_username": "itschina.baby2", "owner_id": "66052675515", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0378_DEEKOY8COg-\\DEEKOY8COg-_20241227_023107.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17913848535230227, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-02T19:13:19", "owner": "m.akhanzada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045141698338787, "text": "😮😮😮😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-16T08:41:03", "owner": "oltean727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108015811514641, "text": "Eso sucede en la cabeza de los chinos cuando piensan demasiado...😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T01:18:59", "owner": "zuloagaartesanal", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18072771112943549, "text": "@ayana.bradley.16", "created_at": "2025-06-20T00:58:55", "owner": "newelroyjetson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978996345842581, "text": "but electricity doesnt travel like that ..", "created_at": "2025-06-12T10:48:47", "owner": "baha_zlitni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050280617130631, "text": "I needed this when I was a university student — it would’ve saved me countless hours of studying 😸", "created_at": "2025-06-12T00:06:08", "owner": "tlaloxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115932085434602, "text": "In diagram 😍❤️🙌😚 in real life connections 🤔💀💀💀🤨🥃", "created_at": "2025-06-11T23:23:44", "owner": "music_n_chess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973522524900487, "text": "Im faster than a computer 🙌", "created_at": "2025-06-09T04:41:27", "owner": "jake.8310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086960899731919, "text": "I made that in minecraft once", "created_at": "2025-05-31T20:37:42", "owner": "jakubkstelmach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057586013227745, "text": "這個只是加法器，還有減法乘除法跟微分器⋯😢", "created_at": "2025-05-23T11:39:13", "owner": "jimwang0221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172152484333540, "text": "@john.geleta 8|4|2|1 trick 🥱", "created_at": "2025-05-22T01:55:27", "owner": "gzabe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056330162190839, "text": "Logical Gates 🔥", "created_at": "2025-05-21T09:11:58", "owner": "zio.xt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964346814875536, "text": "This is a museum or educational exhibit that lets you visually and interactively explore how binary addition works at the circuit level using logic gates and how binary results are translated into decimal numbers 😊", "created_at": "2025-05-20T22:36:03", "owner": "mrabti_yahya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924745348064813, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-05-20T00:14:49", "owner": "iio87ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350889439157301, "text": "Ki ntfkr bli hado w qrithom 😭", "created_at": "2025-05-18T15:58:10", "owner": "ikram.merrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166961458342006, "text": "RTL Synthesis Visualised", "created_at": "2025-05-15T14:50:57", "owner": "devwadhvani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340151554094186, "text": "amazing 😭😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-05-15T07:51:51", "owner": "oumaima_messaii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032278070372510, "text": "Puras compuertas, que bonito el sistema lógico binario", "created_at": "2025-05-09T20:05:54", "owner": "brisiafierro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937671813895757, "text": "لو الدكتور خالد حسين يشوف الفيديوا هذا باتوقع فيه جلطه", "created_at": "2025-05-08T20:20:32", "owner": "yes.11.22", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041558048563223, "text": "In morocco we use degiboard2 hhhhh", "created_at": "2025-05-08T16:47:32", "owner": "mehdiiiiiii_2o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065329372995969, "text": "I built one of these out of redstone once, that one was faster", "created_at": "2025-05-07T21:13:04", "owner": "jonas_muenz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889297213249134, "text": "Wow✨", "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:10:50", "owner": "habibafawzy__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051227216075984, "text": "Slow Down fast events, and you will see the Beauty 🥹👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-05-06T15:53:04", "owner": "carlos.herrera85", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918748296979381, "text": "ولا فاهم اشي بس And و or و Not", "created_at": "2025-05-05T19:44:32", "owner": "ameer_khzaimiah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009119345737822, "text": "On another angle, we see the world not in boring systematic ways. That is the revolution of infinite technology.🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-05-05T17:31:46", "owner": "afnan_alkasbah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928962418051472, "text": "Mannn. Logic gate", "created_at": "2025-05-05T13:14:51", "owner": "shakeswang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362501389176792, "text": "0.1", "created_at": "2025-05-05T07:50:12", "owner": "hs_._100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064316819075117, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-05-03T20:34:03", "owner": "shaghaf__98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107188204444989, "text": "انظمه رقميه هاي الماده عشق ❤️", "created_at": "2025-05-02T11:52:10", "owner": "saif._.salman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077150401649626, "text": "@mco__17  شوف هاي البوابات الي عذبتنا هنا شكد سهله🤕", "created_at": "2025-05-02T11:29:25", "owner": "le99you_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058561915935629, "text": "نعم انها بنية التنظيم والدارات المادة اللي معقداني نظري ومفرفشاني عمليي💆🏻‍♀️💙", "created_at": "2025-04-30T19:42:13", "owner": "bayan_ma16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117674482454330, "text": "WHY DO I UNDERSTAND THIS", "created_at": "2025-04-30T16:52:19", "owner": "karim_najjar44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966372486883419, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-04-30T15:28:50", "owner": "yazan_alhawari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974929230719971, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-04-29T21:43:46", "owner": "emanreda536", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067898122770741, "text": "الحمد الله ان تليفون دكتور اسامه مبيشغلش انستجرام", "created_at": "2025-04-29T03:49:50", "owner": "imustafa__1", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18087361753621554, "text": "logic gates😍", "created_at": "2025-04-28T11:41:58", "owner": "adham_hatem0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080153959738433, "text": "جاي اتخيل هذا الكت عدنا 😢", "created_at": "2025-04-27T21:24:50", "owne