"created_at": "2025-04-18T10:00:44", "owner": "simon_klco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962809305866998, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-04-16T15:41:41", "owner": "claudiogrmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966179034897307, "text": "理工文盲是文組還是理組🤔", "created_at": "2025-04-09T13:38:19", "owner": "boray.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887900071231837, "text": "Meanwhile I had to stare at the worn-out ink lines for 2 hours to comprehend ALUs", "created_at": "2025-04-05T20:16:43", "owner": "raed_bourwis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089760913588587, "text": "логическая схема с вентилями WW", "created_at": "2025-04-01T21:17:03", "owner": "matveev.mitia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060507650483365, "text": "Where is that??which city in china??", "created_at": "2025-03-30T15:47:37", "owner": "dannykh44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028555700647190, "text": "Logic gates😍", "created_at": "2025-03-25T11:40:10", "owner": "bakhulweebs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034470392294855, "text": "😮👏😮", "created_at": "2025-03-18T05:18:37", "owner": "wiwi20520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079024006633328, "text": "Necesitaba esto en los parciales 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-09T19:18:45", "owner": "janethpenaranda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892226962190487, "text": "I mean without Grace Hopper,,,,,", "created_at": "2025-03-02T12:56:49", "owner": "deverickhq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347126107199297, "text": "Why is she moaning", "created_at": "2025-02-28T12:21:46", "owner": "valeriomcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895473550174537, "text": "Masterpiece", "created_at": "2025-02-21T11:24:07", "owner": "yossefalbuni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074043280668261, "text": "This is a demonstration of a binary adder", "created_at": "2025-02-18T08:19:09", "owner": "299_bc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052051472167265, "text": "@indra_prawinardana  ndek indo arek cilik sek seneng dulinan wewe gombel", "created_at": "2025-02-16T18:40:16", "owner": "kacang.bakar1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050555051275145, "text": "Halitin bitirmeye istediği proje", "created_at": "2025-02-06T20:21:38", "owner": "laxolit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481495111028046, "text": "邏輯閘🤣", "created_at": "2025-02-06T13:47:04", "owner": "frankevo8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087094519565125, "text": "感覺波行進位的動畫要快一點 進位延遲太大了", "created_at": "2025-02-02T02:30:50", "owner": "lyouxiang_0928", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18348828751182080, "text": "@juanjogdn", "created_at": "2025-02-01T22:11:04", "owner": "marugaledina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128256181397743, "text": "where？", "created_at": "2025-02-01T15:47:48", "owner": "xiamin7177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036405101168809, "text": "ALU", "created_at": "2025-02-01T06:54:44", "owner": "be4sohel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055329305297503, "text": "where is the 7-segment display converter ?", "created_at": "2025-01-31T20:34:52", "owner": "ismailcosandal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953611122914327, "text": "Hmm so truth table and transistors application in coding", "created_at": "2025-01-30T16:54:15", "owner": "the_quiet_talker_kid_2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845589019405032, "text": "I made this on a breadboard in 12th grade lmao", "created_at": "2025-01-30T14:54:29", "owner": "_the_real_farzan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120747025424646, "text": "靠北，最后一句话，直接划走。", "created_at": "2025-01-30T04:09:55", "owner": "soupmystery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954679170911100, "text": "I think they are gates like end nor nand and or", "created_at": "2025-01-29T21:57:48", "owner": "dia60li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075487978647609, "text": "It's 16, next time ask me , I will reply faster than the machine", "created_at": "2025-01-29T19:07:01", "owner": "sreyash.reddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057377476839950, "text": "Seeing the carry propagate is real cool", "created_at": "2025-01-29T04:21:38", "owner": "daniel.beecham", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18148103959361503, "text": "People : WOWWW  Electrical engineering : LORD HAVE MERCY ON ME", "created_at": "2025-01-27T07:36:46", "owner": "joe.luther1311", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077002276570748, "text": "Fantastic. Particularly useful for those who prefer visual learning.", "created_at": "2025-01-26T20:11:09", "owner": "ahqirbit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054444146036466, "text": "This is binary adders, it shows you how you can add numbers using only NOT, AND.", "created_at": "2025-01-26T19:13:29", "owner": "badreddarif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020333066417371, "text": "And I had to do that in my head for the exam.", "created_at": "2025-01-25T14:58:21", "owner": "askmaryamofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105884227467750, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-24T13:57:15", "owner": "davidlr__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121855402414518, "text": "I LOVE THIS", "created_at": "2025-01-23T13:58:30", "owner": "thatarcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860047672342584, "text": "Binary sum is beautiful 😍 as long as you don't have to do exam on it 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-23T06:01:39", "owner": "m.mahdi.t0154", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054160115064044, "text": "50+50", "created_at": "2025-01-23T01:18:08", "owner": "timtseng1017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951525690783103, "text": "Logique combinatoire et squensille", "created_at": "2025-01-22T18:56:36", "owner": "mtyass_oghlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000929507557272, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-01-22T07:22:34", "owner": "armin_khajehvand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851152633383673, "text": "😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-01-21T14:05:35", "owner": "mb.rd.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105426595477925, "text": "تعبتي الجهاز على الفاضي", "created_at": "2025-01-20T22:12:58", "owner": "mido_bam_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311090692206817, "text": "It just feels so great that I understand what is going on, what each gate is doing!", "created_at": "2025-01-19T18:13:32", "owner": "arsalanmarkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904912185997608, "text": "Very very cool project!!", "created_at": "2025-01-19T17:39:28", "owner": "danny_black97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088652260489989, "text": "Solving an easy problem using a difficult solution", "created_at": "2025-01-18T15:36:43", "owner": "23r0th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889261459162942, "text": "What black magic is this?", "created_at": "2025-01-17T20:17:10", "owner": "cagricihamza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904921395997471, "text": "All that just to watch hentai", "created_at": "2025-01-16T19:45:53", "owner": "mixel20.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929089230889190, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-16T04:18:05", "owner": "rushabh_d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060899611928477, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-01-16T03:24:37", "owner": "beingtrangg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033453947597485, "text": "Why so many steps????", "created_at": "2025-01-15T17:10:17", "owner": "dovah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951832626778146, "text": "Calculadora lenta pra carai", "created_at": "2025-01-14T19:12:46", "owner": "djambavemcida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999399750721352, "text": "@mitadtuniversity", "created_at": "2025-01-14T11:39:37", "owner": "khoyainsaann", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["learncoding", "techexplained"]},
