{"media_id": 3319323766925971048, "shortcode": "C4Qm2EmIk5o", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C4Qm2EmIk5o/", "taken_at": "2024-03-08T16:11:31", "caption": "Tag someone who needs this Garlic Honey Crispy Chicken Rice Bowl 🤌🤌 \n\nSave this recipe for later 🙏🙏\n\nThe best way to eat chicken and rice for dinner, super simple but so tasty! \n\nHere’s your shopping list:\n1 chicken breast.\n30g cornflakes. \n1 egg (but I’ve only accounted for half in calorie breakdown).\n65g jasmine rice uncooked.\n1 spring onion, thinly sliced. \nSesame seeds, to garnish.\nSriracha mayonnaise, to garnish. \n1 & 1/2 tablespoon runny honey.\nTablespoon light soy sauce.\nTablespoon rice wine vinegar.\n2 cloves  garlic - finely chopped.\nTsp cornflour mixed with tablespoon water.\n\n#TheGoodBite #GarlicHoney #Chicken #Rice #Bowl #MealPrep #HighProtein", "owner_username": "thegoodbite", "owner_id": "309453657", "likes": 444145, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0381_C4Qm2EmIk5o\\C4Qm2EmIk5o_20240308_161131.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086446061512769, "text": "how long do u cook tbe chicken in oven?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:19:43", "owner": "m10noj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866091538373532, "text": "Recipe was too bland. Don’t think it’s worth making if ur used to having spicy food.", "created_at": "2025-08-23T15:38:14", "owner": "hadibaseer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18221687380289644, "text": "@aideencoogan", "created_at": "2025-04-23T16:56:33", "owner": "gemcol2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496081165012967, "text": "Air fryer?", "created_at": "2025-03-25T01:15:02", "owner": "1oldvold", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055869679987366, "text": "@89biga", "created_at": "2025-01-11T13:43:05", "owner": "clare8383", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053101723855907, "text": "Couldn’t find cornflour or rice flour anywhere. Can I sub with all purpose flour?", "created_at": "2025-01-06T00:05:33", "owner": "fitdietitianfoodie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048353111301777, "text": "Air fryer??", "created_at": "2024-11-16T05:28:38", "owner": "staceysmithmarie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18376593898103476, "text": "I added grated ginger & pepper flakes to the sauce.  I’d recommend using 1/2 amount rice wine vinegar. I dredged chicken in flour first, egg wash then corn flakes.", "created_at": "2024-11-12T01:14:28", "owner": "luvbevo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056769412857568, "text": "I tried this but my cornflakes fell.off the chicken. I suck at cooking 😢", "created_at": "2024-11-08T04:06:14", "owner": "yuuyori", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846650386342764, "text": "@daves.mick", "created_at": "2024-11-06T20:21:02", "owner": "jayne_w25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026840204410692, "text": "On the online recipe it doesn’t say when to use the egg, plz write that into the recipe. I didn’t have the video handy so I totally forgot about it but I wouldn’t have if was included in the steps :(", "created_at": "2024-11-01T22:05:46", "owner": "skfanna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913894606007203, "text": "@vickireilly47 tonight?", "created_at": "2024-10-21T09:12:54", "owner": "__laurenmcneil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918996501881302, "text": "My sauce did not end up looking like this at all. I double the ingredients and it started going funny on the pan", "created_at": "2024-09-22T04:55:29", "owner": "ania__aina", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18266886628222401, "text": "@craigheighway", "created_at": "2024-09-14T07:35:02", "owner": "heighwaymonique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855278635254290, "text": "Its so shit you dosent say how long it goes in the ofen", "created_at": "2024-09-07T16:29:34", "owner": "lennox.lo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17994339410691118, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-09-02T05:01:03", "owner": "belleisabe1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250817956271375, "text": "MAKE THIS IMMEDIATELY, IT'S CRAZY GOOD 🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯", "created_at": "2024-08-22T20:51:04", "owner": "cmb7476", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046576735739241, "text": "I’ve seen in another video you dip, chicken in egg and then cornflakes and didn’t use flour. Can that also be done as well for this?", "created_at": "2024-08-21T17:26:20", "owner": "geared4success", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044490043749846, "text": "How many calories and protein is in This meal?", "created_at": "2024-08-13T23:41:15", "owner": "underrated._g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007227986619290, "text": "ohhh godooo", "created_at": "2024-08-10T20:27:02", "owner": "xs_boxing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042631249785527, "text": "@fultonkerry1", "created_at": "2024-08-09T08:03:07", "owner": "charlottesinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897652405024632, "text": "Thec řízek in Czech republick", "created_at": "2024-08-08T19:23:47", "owner": "love.in.neurol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412838161079754, "text": "@claudettewrightt", "created_at": "2024-08-07T17:23:42", "owner": "charlottesinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014225870279017, "text": "@cmb7476", "created_at": "2024-08-07T14:37:48", "owner": "kmwalton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057188209728615, "text": "@ashleighandersonx_", "created_at": "2024-08-04T07:17:13", "owner": "charlottesinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18445272991058719, "text": "I. Love. It", "created_at": "2024-07-30T18:02:32", "owner": "xethanx__1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070181956552124, "text": "Every recipe is 10/10😍🔥", "created_at": "2024-07-10T08:02:44", "owner": "healthyeating.guide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044052349853206, "text": "@jaxon.beaucage @camaralucas98", "created_at": "2024-07-03T04:37:08", "owner": "tarysia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011220230587621, "text": "@mikebarnie", "created_at": "2024-07-02T16:30:45", "owner": "mrs_b2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293863366167853, "text": "Can I cook this in a air fryer", "created_at": "2024-06-30T20:49:20", "owner": "timenabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043763674876608, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2024-06-24T16:25:05", "owner": "eatsenchantment", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972798195723625, "text": "@ddaniel_giardina", "created_at": "2024-06-24T06:41:19", "owner": "leannegiardina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872935789102998, "text": "@keironsimpson", "created_at": "2024-06-17T16:17:30", "owner": "lauragracesimpson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031336520297072, "text": "Being a home chef must be so great 🫠", "created_at": "2024-06-15T03:40:35", "owner": "masbr_wn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892706065033509, "text": "hi how many celsius needed in the owen ? and how many times 🔥", "created_at": "2024-06-14T15:11:35", "owner": "kash_dvld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937535853837377, "text": "We're having this for dinner tonight!", "created_at": "2024-06-12T02:54:54", "owner": "helloteresa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015181295518661, "text": "I am making it right now thanks", "created_at": "2024-06-09T18:29:19", "owner": "tia_xcoops", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013600886169312, "text": "@roger_clifford81 can we have this for dinner?", "created_at": "2024-06-09T07:57:28", "owner": "mishy_sharkey__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103424824406356, "text": "Yummy recepie, I cooked it tonight thanks", "created_at": "2024-06-07T10:19:37", "owner": "75mc.donna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977862270565495, "text": "@oliver___l", "created_at": "2024-06-06T09:22:13", "owner": "mette.jensen_privat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928743909894428, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-06-06T08:18:02", "owner": "sebmatys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021821552190420, "text": "u could marinate it in the same mix and it would taste even better", "created_at": "2024-06-06T07:27:16", "owner": "_niki_tarikata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946968024704384, "text": "@coates003 definitely doing this 😋", "created_at": "2024-06-06T07:13:58", "owner": "lescoates39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022870925187341, "text": "@sammehrocks", "created_at": "2024-06-06T01:24:18", "owner": "scottbot64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102307273404135, "text": "Mmmm @viki.batch", "created_at": "2024-06-05T18:27:33", "owner": "mrsminto25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049524139672649, "text": "@leebaldwin87", "created_at": "2024-06-05T17:52:54", "owner": "sianlou89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030009356040382, "text": "@jobderaad", "created_at": "2024-06-05T13:20:09", "owner": "roosoechies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926951169897393, "text": "@reaburton4876", "created_at": "2024-06-05T08:24:02", "owner": "robalibec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186967426290640, "text": "epic fail don’t make this 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2024-06-05T01:38:46", "owner": "angelictuti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928507434890010, "text": "@billie_anderson31", "created_at": "2024-06-04T09:29:50", "owner": "julie.b.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009162131586280, "text": "He’s here he’s there he’s every fuckin where ROY KENT!!!! ROY KENT!!!!!", "created_at": "2024-06-03T18:24:54", "owner": "meesothrpy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065703292495607, "text": "@chiefproudfoot", "created_at": "2024-06-03T18:17:38", "owner": "trey0228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041347243888078, "text": "⚡⚡⚡", "created_at": "2024-06-03T10:47:16", "owner": "akajessiah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051839203711748, "text": "@charlotteansell_", "created_at": "2024-06-03T04:08:07", "owner": "fansell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958053558684828, "text": "@b__ethany", "created_at": "2024-06-03T01:52:54", "owner": "billie__d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437822713053500, "text": "@jessie_jackson", "created_at": "2024-06-03T00:39:19", "owner": "tarazinetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051225034727793, "text": "Dios! 🤤", "created_at": "2024-06-03T00:25:57", "owner": "bri_munday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18241320778252274, "text": "@jesseplette", "created_at": "2024-06-02T18:39:00", "owner": "marielleribbers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040407133889324, "text": "❤️❤️🔥", "created_at": "2024-06-02T16:18:56", "owner": "wealth_n_welness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009417299428150, "text": "Please do not heat up honey, it creates compounds that are bad for your health", "created_at": "2024-06-02T13:34:17", "owner": "g.rabbit_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052186744596472, "text": "@thejayjay1191", "created_at": "2024-06-02T11:32:19", "owner": "shelldanielle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856125367190161, "text": "@gorgonzolla", "created_at": "2024-06-02T05:39:04", "owner": "mumma.gee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059174335589060, "text": "I completely fucked this up, half the cornflakes fell off, the sauce was nearly burnt, forgot about the asparagus until I was serving up, but it was STILL AMAZING. 10/10 would recommend, especially to a better cook than me 👍", "created_at": "2024-06-01T19:35:41", "owner": "caoimhcaoimh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045719782762295, "text": "@grahamgolbourn", "created_at": "2024-06-01T08:32:53", "owner": "userrnamee_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030099860089761, "text": "Looks wonderful", "created_at": "2024-06-01T01:14:35", "owner": "cooking_with_yousef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044266231800355, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2024-05-31T19:08:42", "owner": "pocketclassix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432620596043331, "text": "@michaylaneville", "created_at": "2024-05-31T18:05:10", "owner": "mattclarkson10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024074198324330, "text": "@bexrichards is everywhere now....", "created_at": "2024-05-31T17:05:26", "owner": "ashleycolven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956272179660175, "text": "So yummy😋", "created_at": "2024-05-31T12:34:54", "owner": "yummy_cooking_by_eva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018901775201283, "text": "@maba1905", "created_at": "2024-05-31T11:58:38", "owner": "isi_bella00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032830606971072, "text": "@kirstyaddie", "created_at": "2024-05-31T00:20:57", "owner": "chris.m.46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951047910795334, "text": "@freddie578893", "created_at": "2024-05-30T20:51:08", "owner": "jadey123x_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985890804662135, "text": "@harveywootton", "created_at": "2024-05-30T17:44:48", "owner": "hayleywarwickx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013884338138805, "text": "@seasideangie x", "created_at": "2024-05-30T16:37:07", "owner": "fuzzyfelthead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036262567777835, "text": "@rhys_warren3 option 1", "created_at": "2024-05-30T15:49:01", "owner": "_torie_warren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324284572192575, "text": "Has anyone done in the AF? If so how long pls", "created_at": "2024-05-30T11:39:27", "owner": "sarsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005678633588348, "text": "Corn flakes give you cancer", "created_at": "2024-05-30T04:29:57", "owner": "samedaypressurewash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020135240212156, "text": "Delicious 😍", "created_at": "2024-05-29T19:06:24", "owner": "thechiccooking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044606581773893, "text": "@joeytoas91", "created_at": "2024-05-29T16:23:39", "owner": "laurentoas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007225208281626, "text": "@ash_clayton_", "created_at": "2024-05-29T14:11:09", "owner": "kellyannclayton1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004587530314717, "text": "Did somebody say cornflake chicken", "created_at": "2024-05-29T11:59:16", "owner": "white.people.cooking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048974791671086, "text": "@ave_christo", "created_at": "2024-05-29T10:35:39", "owner": "deelliissh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899182486004061, "text": "OMG this looks soo good 😍", "created_at": "2024-05-29T09:27:22", "owner": "dubaimarinaofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847311325203564, "text": "Wowww", "created_at": "2024-05-29T04:12:19", "owner": "emily_p_jones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346271089111479, "text": "@megann_michelle96", "created_at": "2024-05-28T16:11:57", "owner": "k_town.618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071138371511563, "text": "@__laurenmcneil  @aaronmc2105", "created_at": "2024-05-28T13:00:50", "owner": "vickireilly47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023187641325876, "text": "Omg can’t wait to make this!!!", "created_at": "2024-05-28T12:03:48", "owner": "nusratcooks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016436615352732, "text": "Is chicken coated in cornflour or regular flour", "created_at": "2024-05-28T07:32:24", "owner": "elias_joanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007304831279862, "text": "@senu_9937", "created_at": "2024-05-28T07:10:20", "owner": "dishaa_99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18228930697285144, "text": "@fionabeth88", "created_at": "2024-05-27T20:26:07"