{"media_id": 3520823490183131536, "shortcode": "DDcek9pN3GQ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDcek9pN3GQ/", "taken_at": "2024-12-11T16:46:33", "caption": "Un timelapse della fase di mappatura architetturale, il primo passo per trasformare il Municipio di Locarno nella \"tela digitale\" che in questi giorni sta ospitando \"I pescatori di stelle\", bellissimo racconto audiovisivo ideato, in occasione di @winterlandlocarno da Davide Grampa, responsabile di CISA lab al @cisa_locarno. Abbiamo avuto il piacere di \"cucire\" lo spettacolo sulla facciata del municipio,  grazie anche alle attrezzature tecniche di @angelini_service .", "owner_username": "immersive.media.studio", "owner_id": "9046454137", "likes": 23917, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0383_DDcek9pN3GQ\\DDcek9pN3GQ_20241211_164633.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18016857740655572, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-13T03:38:59", "owner": "aidenwisch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063557359878835, "text": "Dude are you using a big projector ? 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:47:05", "owner": "sppb.planetmars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030033788222418, "text": "MMMMMAAAAAAAPPPİİİİİİİNGGGGGGGGGGG", "created_at": "2024-12-30T14:39:30", "owner": "kovaliyoruzbirseyler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890072182068298, "text": "Resolume Ar ?", "created_at": "2024-12-30T04:39:34", "owner": "wessrlopes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376707316115750, "text": "@vinniciusabreu", "created_at": "2024-12-29T01:10:16", "owner": "paulella._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032753948415900, "text": "@nawab_1255 in this case @mad_mapper", "created_at": "2024-12-28T16:55:12", "owner": "immersive.media.studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062677018807334, "text": "Witch soft uses", "created_at": "2024-12-28T16:12:15", "owner": "shumaim_1255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035092055123936, "text": "This not resolume", "created_at": "2024-12-28T16:11:35", "owner": "shumaim_1255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873752833247123, "text": "", "created_at": "2024-12-27T19:14:54", "owner": "rickvanosta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959271669845132, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-26T08:40:19", "owner": "gon.mendes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053254042991140, "text": "Resolume arena?", "created_at": "2024-12-25T17:20:37", "owner": "kleber_djks", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17950254815874046, "text": "why taking so long to calibrate it? Just hire me", "created_at": "2024-12-25T03:00:42", "owner": "imchristheo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017575412413902, "text": "Fasted paintjob ever😂", "created_at": "2024-12-24T21:24:40", "owner": "mcblock_y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054080326959921, "text": "Nice integration!", "created_at": "2024-12-24T16:14:14", "owner": "evmrc_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18474475156002776, "text": "It would be better to Match the Pixel First 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2024-12-23T09:34:57", "owner": "klaus_spitzbart_kleewein", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17906548790980748, "text": "How many ANSI lumens?", "created_at": "2024-12-23T00:51:48", "owner": "iandeegrees", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18254765329272329, "text": "Wow bellissimo 😍", "created_at": "2024-12-20T13:45:28", "owner": "unboxxplorer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043262405187353, "text": "Che bello 😍\nMi sono sempre chiesto come si impostano le luci 👏", "created_at": "2024-12-19T19:05:31", "owner": "timelapsefrg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053769466969409, "text": "👏👏💘💘👏👏💘💘", "created_at": "2024-12-18T02:59:25", "owner": "the_women_strength_games", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066166603813742, "text": "@_lawrenttt resolume arena🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-17T22:32:31", "owner": "andregraf.id", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906060192983124, "text": "UV editing be like:", "created_at": "2024-12-17T18:16:28", "owner": "_mis1ek", "likes": 109}, {"id": 18030956732409128, "text": "Blend it baby", "created_at": "2024-12-15T22:57:35", "owner": "bart_vuijk", "likes": 136}, {"id": 18036552122091319, "text": "Program name ?", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:56:17", "owner": "mertozsoy137", "likes": 2