{"media_id": 3481713114314434786, "shortcode": "DBRh6Fsh-ji", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DBRh6Fsh-ji/", "taken_at": "2024-10-18T17:33:27", "caption": "這個叫做clip cafe，怕你忘記可以先存精選", "owner_username": "kus.mp4", "owner_id": "16461362699", "likes": 20165, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0384_DBRh6Fsh-ji\\DBRh6Fsh-ji_20241018_173327.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18390881752184504, "text": "謝謝你，我知道怎麼使用了", "created_at": "2025-07-18T04:23:54", "owner": "sc.director", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018106499454325, "text": "Thank you!", "created_at": "2025-01-15T14:25:04", "owner": "finallylaur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064893982823446, "text": "太讚！還是要謝👏", "created_at": "2024-12-27T05:27:14", "owner": "pasont_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068740882732464, "text": "有人說過你長得很像李毅誠嗎？", "created_at": "2024-12-21T03:19:06", "owner": "milo803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846323098355157, "text": "讚喔", "created_at": "2024-12-16T02:01:10", "owner": "attfxhong.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000395579533777, "text": "就是侵權人家不告你而已還合理使用==", "created_at": "2024-12-15T15:42:19", "owner": "yutingchouart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893895835130669, "text": "❤️不错", "created_at": "2024-12-15T12:23:29", "owner": "sel000222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028295273402349, "text": "好像很讚", "created_at": "2024-11-30T05:02:18", "owner": "death_lord2333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338546458182937, "text": "慎用，因為外商都很在乎版權😢", "created_at": "2024-11-28T18:24:18", "owner": "araiagv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049398710506694, "text": "😍太愛你了吧！\n這應該跟放MEME一樣沒關係", "created_at": "2024-11-23T08:39:21", "owner": "mittynomad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878377591194516, "text": "建志？", "created_at": "2024-11-22T03:17:32", "owner": "reor9aninz__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039517811183797, "text": "好奇帽子上的是什麼", "created_at": "2024-11-19T00:18:48", "owner": "chiu0124snoopy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023624555547679, "text": "太讚了😍😍😍", "created_at": "2024-11-18T14:48:22", "owner": "whatalidraws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941965230792970, "text": "看預算啦其實\n預算夠高\n你要我做3D原創動畫素材也做給你🤣", "created_at": "2024-11-16T08:24:19", "owner": "eric_papillon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854993026314163, "text": "之前在語言學習的時候就有用過類似的平台 這個感覺跟那些差不多", "created_at": "2024-11-12T16:43:42", "owner": "joehanwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937298790812460, "text": "吃一次版權砲就可以再拍破產日記了", "created_at": "2024-11-10T03:40:47", "owner": "p.p_photo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047895674003176, "text": "建志不唱歌了嗎改拍影片呢", "created_at": "2024-11-05T14:21:29", "owner": "madden_0406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921417972992904, "text": "你的聲音也太好聽了吧", "created_at": "2024-10-31T04:23:44", "owner": "xuan_yan_520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036642014270487, "text": "先謝謝你了", "created_at": "2024-10-29T05:11:48", "owner": "ziherlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055344685848965, "text": "華特迪士尼公司、華納兄弟影業、環球影業、派拉蒙影業和索尼影業 法務部感謝你", "created_at": "2024-10-27T14:53:52", "owner": "balimanhahapoint", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17947566143764911, "text": "很感恩分享🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2024-10-26T23:30:24", "owner": "h.mo.er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885512236130937, "text": "謝謝", "created_at": "2024-10-24T13:45:43", "owner": "whatdouwant_2do", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062537566702818, "text": "然後老闆以為我上班在看電影🚬", "created_at": "2024-10-24T12:57:31", "owner": "ooosen77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043079630318871, "text": "不知道能不能搜中文的？😳😳", "created_at": "2024-10-24T03:59:17", "owner": "baka_shiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861079753256375, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-23T17:40:43", "owner": "c_yclin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919514916895349, "text": "存", "created_at": "2024-10-22T19:44:14", "owner": "tienboy.ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024375914416866, "text": "我覺得現在自媒體在影片中加這種素材的方式已經太浮濫，有時候看一部影片沒什麼重點，插入一大堆這種片段看了會很煩", "created_at": "2024-10-22T09:48:17", "owner": "sicsicsic666", "likes": 36}, {"id": 17989526486724813, "text": "公司企業這種營利單位最好不要用\n個人自媒體根據需要謹慎使用吧", "created_at": "2024-10-21T22:39:10", "owner": "a200991110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110977534411797, "text": "這是可以免費看的嗎😍", "created_at": "2024-10-21T16:27:25", "owner": "ten_dollar_coin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989991483707364, "text": "厲害👍🏻", "created_at": "2024-10-20T15:09:54", "owner": "jeff.c_0101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985796970726498, "text": "想領取🙏", "created_at": "2024-10-20T04:44:45", "owner": "dc__magic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895955773067089, "text": "越冷門 越要記得標出處 不然很慘😂", "created_at": "2024-10-20T04:32:52", "owner": "steven6656", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18354657556139086, "text": "感謝分享🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-20T02:46:41", "owner": "kenhsinli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030418313106672, "text": "謝謝分享！其他人#通常都要留言先會分享出黎，重要唔公開", "created_at": "2024-10-19T16:52:16", "owner": "mollylovebobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047923696961117, "text": "❤️🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-19T13:32:26", "owner": "ko___ko___ting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062624464709085, "text": "謝謝分享😍", "created_at": "2024-10-19T11:18:00", "owner": "funfunlala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18445325236064148, "text": "好讚", "created_at": "2024-10-19T09:49:25", "owner": "baboow02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855598966244957, "text": "超讚😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-19T08:47:31", "owner": "bettywu_o11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893704861014723, "text": "歐買尬😍😍", "created_at": "2024-10-19T07:28:47", "owner": "hana.time_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373927720100665, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2024-10-19T06:51:17", "owner": "fightforu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048341176817179, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-19T04:02:48", "owner": "ranger__188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106333180434769, "text": "最後超好笑 喜歡", "created_at": "2024-10-19T03:02:45", "owner": "wu_e_bo_e", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18013747598355685, "text": "好讚喔🤩", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:38:08", "owner": "yikaichen_film", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874180975192460, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:31:50", "owner": "kasey__travel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878269993090699, "text": "哇靠 真的是我們的救星欸", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:31:41", "owner": "kasey__travel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048834409811328, "text": "好棒喔", "created_at": "2024-10-19T02:02:12", "owner": "not_doing_gi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020288837530580, "text": "謝謝🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-19T00:47:41", "owner": "oh_____yu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18461105272057734, "text": "謝謝你跟製作電影的人😂", "created_at": "2024-10-19T00:34:33", "owner": "ninawayliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040870826121995, "text": "沒有什麼留言***我私訊連結給你就已經領先一大步了", "created_at": "2024-10-19T00:29:31", "owner": "yonghui_97", "likes": 24}, {"id": 17907369357024239, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-10-19T00:14:27", "owner": "_center.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077333041565804, "text": "@s.rong_o", "created_at": "2024-10-18T23:43:05", "owner": "nuri_0831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250109131262724, "text": "謝謝小貓", "created_at": "2024-10-18T21:42:42", "owner": "r0o0r___q0o0q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066217396634241, "text": "這個也太實用！破產日記有夠滑！", "created_at": "2024-10-18T20:27:19", "owner": "raes1007susana", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17924153513969377, "text": "哇 感溫😍", "created_at": "2024-10-18T19:47:04", "owner": "josiee4life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021637868445066, "text": "終於有人懂看Scott pilgrim ㄌ", "created_at": "2024-10-18T18:39:41", "owner": "navarro.fazra", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18002028578669510, "text": "感謝", "created_at": "2024-10-18T18:12:33", "owner": "coachtien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461665255013893, "text": "你他媽的襪子給我換掉", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:50:52", "owner": "artist_hynobius_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151580227333316, "text": "❤️了", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:47:08", "owner": "samuel_1207_yo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370209910107189, "text": "Thanks bro 🙏", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:46:58", "owner": "vivekwuphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088835434494314, "text": "沒有版權問題嗎？", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:46:09", "owner": "videodaddygo", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18043713943892032, "text": "太棒啦！！！ 有素材啦 根本自媒體剪輯救星", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:42:45", "owner": "_o_o_0405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962348055815229, "text": "結尾超好笑", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:40:50", "owner": "_su.yi_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18041859611089651, "text": "最後那個也太酷了吧😭😭😍", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:40:26", "owner": "gotnoadvantage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047879101978237, "text": "太棒了🙌🙌", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:38:31", "owner": "the5michi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858228502223960, "text": "好珍貴🔥😍", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:37:59", "owner": "nia_eee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18459491209025710, "text": "這種秘技竟然可以免費得到", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:35:53", "owner": "ram2isflat", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18108615715376682, "text": "你看起來很熱哦", "created_at": "2024-10-18T17:35:46", "owner": "69_wayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933986070948583, "text": "我打了happy couple， 出来 Revolutionary Road 片段 😭😭我不要", "created_at": "2024-11-14T06:35:27", "owner": "iammikachi41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842986558345149, "text": "Bro這超爛", "created_at": "2024-10-26T09:50:46", "owner": "916x824", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3530690644152744187, "shortcode": "DD_iG84hPj7", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DD_iG84hPj7/", "taken_at": "2024-12-25T07:22:10", "caption": "我的2024 旅行足跡…✈️😀😀😀\n即將把台灣跟韓國兩大陸美美縫合…\n한국 그만 가고싶다…….\n明年希望可以去更多不同的國家🤣", "owner_username": "sherryluerr", "owner_id": "229274521", "likes": 23554, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0385_DD_iG84hPj7\\DD_iG84hPj7_20241225_072210.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18084431512690705, "text": "lol", "created_at": "2025-06-22T12:23:11", "owner": "ananspov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067446389028557, "text": "飛台灣是專門取趟錢嗎🌚🌚", "created_at": "2025-06-20T16:02:36", "owner": "lcuniiung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907365145173611, "text": "🇹🇼<->🇰🇷?", "created_at": "2025-06-16T07:31:13", "owner": "inseong0615_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081508582811183, "text": "이분 한국 남자분과 부부여서 이런득", "created_at": "2025-06-14T04:12:52", "owner": "xe1nax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066615079999823, "text": "Welcome to South Korea ~", "created_at": "2025-05-16T17:39:00", "owner": "xx_dmsdk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043461443624184, "text": "ラッコゥ", "created_at": "2025-05-13T12:26:47", "owner": "kowey_0206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932494366040827, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🖤🖤🖤🖤🖤🖤", "created_at": "2025-05-05T16:49:40", "owner": "gimein592", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096481105592869, "text": "Taiwan ❤️", "created_at": "2025-05-04T03:28:51", "owner": "2nows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348004945154058, "text": "Taiwan Province of China", "created_at": "2025-04-22T02:06:52", "owner": "yujing_houuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049303439065931, "text": "loco後面那首歌叫甚麽😢🔥", "created_at": "2025-04-14T16:45:15", "owner": "shira_ibisca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024882191658959, "text": "girl just move to Korea like", "created_at": "2025-04-11T01:01:24", "owner": "ceochloe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039041048178368, "text": "오.... 한국인인 나도 서울 4번밖에 못가봤는데...", "created_at": "2025-03-09T07:51:14", "owner": "seongmi1356", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905790991135665, "text": "한국인 이세요?", "created_at": "2025-03-05T08:31:27", "owner": "ahnwooyong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977083779684575, "text": "아하 국제결혼 부부시구낭", "created_at": "2025-02-28T15:33:34", "owner": "gkxor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060581413966949, "text": "在韓國開個台灣大使館吧😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-28T14:24:03", "owner": "tetejiaaa007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947523654798208, "text": "you didn't go to Jeju? Unexpectedly, someone went to South KOR 🇰🇷 so many times but didn't go to Jeju🍊", "created_at": "2025-02-14T23:45:23", "owner": "tuna_1210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055480459871063, "text": "절반을 대만과 한국만 왔다갔다 하네", "created_at": "2025-02-08T17:49:13", "owner": "a6._.exa", "likes": 99}, {"id": 18073397305674502, "text": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ", "created_at": "2025-02-05T14:26:56", "owner": "isaack_im", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000355364565455, "text": "👏👏👏🇰🇷", "created_at": "2025-01-30T14:37:22", "owner": "jiheak_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093070909526282, "text": "거의 한국만 가네 대한민국 만세", "created_at": "2025-01-25T23:00:13", "owner": "ryu_hw._.46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050056507899447, "text": "到高雄的不会是去迷孩的吧💩", "created_at": "2025-01-20T04:47:34", "owner": "7ink_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296852875232976, "text": "2024飛了九次韓國🤣", "created_at": "2025-01-09T12:52:16", "owner": "cheer_anchen0314", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049717094114833, "text": "@sen_irezumi1", "created_at": "2025-01-09T07:01:23", "owner": "sfardusf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955248840887367, "text": "看得出来你很喜欢韩国🇰🇷", "created_at": "2025-01-08T16:42:55", "owner": "damonsi2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853745701309078, "text": "一眼K-pop人🥳", "created_at": "2025-01-04T12:14:54", "owner": "suzydong_320", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17955147248905465, "text": "我專門縫合大台北地區與大首爾地區😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-01T03:32:55", "owner": "wow________joyce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990503193753668, "text": "韓國飛機,😢小心", "created_at": "2024-12-29T19:20:01", "owner": "nw544127115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043792849997583, "text": "光是坐飛機應該就花了不少\n還有票錢跟吃飯住宿\n好可怕但感覺很爽", "created_at": "2024-12-29T13:47:05", "owner": "chenpinyuan_", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18278665201220107, "text": "BGM比我朋友的私生活還亂(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2024-12-29T13:44:00", "owner": "rock_0224_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037774499345804, "text": "回針縫", "created_at": "2024-12-29T13:07:12", "owner": "8gabvnono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087221959551074, "text": "@iiichn 你", "created_at": "2024-12-29T11:27:30", "owner": "_2002__w", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18175147102312699, "text": "eta下一首是什麼", "created_at": "2024-12-29T02:22:26", "owner": "rezzzzzly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033602114178084, "text": "我跟妳一樣欸", "created_at": "2024-12-28T23:03:23", "owner": "ammo.li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051063800011643, "text": "byd回台湾取钱是吧😭", "created_at": "2024-12-28T15:54:08", "owner": "li_ying_zhe418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897863221077602, "text": "你好有錢喔💸🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-28T11:07:29", "owner": "fz_rumbullion_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037332704101080, "text": "啊替替替那首是什麼", "created_at": "2024-12-28T05:21:57", "owner": "yeh20130119", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18014831327476955, "text": "第5首是什麼", "created_at": "2024-12-28T00:54:18", "owner": "_yawnnnn.913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061689415884160, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2024-12-27T05:15:36", "owner": "pei_yu_uuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102104272463362, "text": "去泰國下一首跟antifraigile前一首是什麼", "created_at": "2024-12-26T09:07:59", "owner": "kax1maki_", "likes": 589}, {"id": 18080800081575253, "text": "有Nuabo", "created_at": "2024-12-26T08:25:45", "owner": "_nyhkt_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102556339482447, "text": "要付費嗎", "created_at": "2024-12-26T07:54:42", "owner": "maomaouo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18480957328020528, "text": "現在北高不是沒有飛了？", "created_at": "2024-12-25T15:46:19", "owner": "tiyu_xia", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18055760491977873, "text": "第二首是什麼？", "created_at": "2024-12-25T14:35:57", "owner": "burger._.0328", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042749033187034, "text": "竟然有閃尼的歌", "created_at": "2024-12-25T13:03:30", "owner": "09_lin23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1804760087