}, {"id": 18041314649455745, "text": "coderot", "created_at": "2025-03-02T05:14:03", "owner": "jynnjay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855046327391827, "text": "The real power of shi coding", "created_at": "2025-03-01T11:09:15", "owner": "bibi_ponk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915595915067777, "text": "Bro code in brainrot", "created_at": "2025-03-01T03:41:23", "owner": "stephanie_huanghxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849912232408958, "text": "What is this shit a new programming language from gen alpha ? Ah hell no", "created_at": "2025-02-25T19:16:15", "owner": "silve_reignn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057959639505142, "text": "...we deserve extinction💀", "created_at": "2025-02-23T20:34:52", "owner": "blueberryalgo555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038996786420116, "text": "Machine learning ❌\nMachine brainrot ✅", "created_at": "2025-02-19T23:15:45", "owner": "gs_scbx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080702530618809, "text": "Ok good cofe", "created_at": "2025-02-18T16:39:53", "owner": "ohiobrine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106512547482071, "text": "python❌ brainrot✅", "created_at": "2025-02-18T11:52:37", "owner": "luke.warmsoup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057717382864604, "text": "AhhScript", "created_at": "2025-02-18T09:28:54", "owner": "itsmura", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062383486936937, "text": "Imagine how cs 4 years communication would look like between those students 💀", "created_at": "2025-02-18T06:15:36", "owner": "_akcore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068398222839440, "text": "Chad (float) Gigachad( Double)", "created_at": "2025-02-16T15:53:09", "owner": "buraksonkuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082223755544976, "text": "I would go", "created_at": "2025-02-13T09:29:14", "owner": "salbyoofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084279136593647, "text": "0:03", "created_at": "2025-02-12T03:12:47", "owner": "ronyxj.kenny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388047736106845, "text": "Only in ohio🙌", "created_at": "2025-02-10T05:41:06", "owner": "ice.00_0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17873315508271980, "text": "Oh no it’s Pygyat", "created_at": "2