{"media_id": 3519842437470052359, "shortcode": "DDY_gxGv2AH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDY_gxGv2AH/", "taken_at": "2024-12-10T08:09:44", "caption": "정확히 찍는다  미끄러운 작업 재활용 걱정마\n바른인패키지 barunin.co.kr =It’s accurate. Don’t worry about recycling slippery work  #박스주문제작", "owner_username": "barunin.co.kr", "owner_id": "5823835386", "likes": 34047, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0388_DDY_gxGv2AH\\DDY_gxGv2AH_20241210_080944.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18300397105236087, "text": "И вот на это вы тратите свою жизнь??? Сначала уничтожаете деревья на планете,  создавая бесполезные вещи, которыми засоряете планету, дающую возможность жизни?!", "created_at": "2025-03-01T13:25:24", "owner": "margo.rich.570", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056643230018921, "text": "Arkay Packageing 4 life ........merrica heck yea!", "created_at": "2025-02-27T18:50:29", "owner": "jason_k_shull", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950306034927003, "text": "Been there done that, a skilled hand and a air hammer is more efficient.  I miss the CER 102 bobst Blanker!", "created_at": "2025-02-27T18:48:23", "owner": "jason_k_shull", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874408033268860, "text": "What ?", "created_at": "2025-02-17T14:33:20", "owner": "butterfly_arpa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084129415605820, "text": "Nima bu", "created_at": "2025-02-16T06:50:04", "owner": "mexanik__20_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951786360791939, "text": "You need an Edale FDC", "created_at": "2025-02-15T22:23:19", "owner": "simon.coffin.9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060505717814360, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-02-15T01:09:12", "owner": "distribuidora_jr1000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052025470909298, "text": "To think there have been die cutters with blanking sections for decades and there are still lots  plants that hand scrap today. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-02-13T13:47:16", "owner": "patroclus84", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866456848244487, "text": "Są maszyny do wyrywania. Nie ma potrzeby męczenia się ręcznie całą paletę 150cm wysokości robiłem w mniej niż minutę", "created_at": "2025-02-12T18:29:20", "owner": "_hagit_13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939130233846109, "text": "chỉ cần thêm 1 bước, đục lỗ tại góc của phần bỏ đi, thao tác tách rời sẽ trở nên dễ dàng hơn", "created_at": "2025-02-07T04:10:35", "owner": "hieusugar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053799488044703, "text": "Что это ?", "created_at": "2025-01-30T19:24:25", "owner": "gmlog.pro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073070278778593, "text": "I would have damaged 85percent of those", "created_at": "2025-01-30T17:46:11", "owner": "demonicpotatoking", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868851421290743, "text": "Cool ❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-30T04:33:57", "owner": "dan.secret.marquez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047234588230504, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-01-29T03:37:31", "owner": "damn__buddy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18388293460100753, "text": "@alsxo_k @ki_nyong7 @jinho.0924", "created_at": "2025-01-28T00:49:10", "owner": "shusu9422", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017458205669090, "text": "톰슨작업하고 가생이 벗겨내는 작업이군요...", "created_at": "2025-01-27T22:07:58", "owner": "ddr3355", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18027709127548536, "text": "Best temu worker", "created_at": "2025-01-27T21:37:01", "owner": "mega_zen.ci", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18125041798408928, "text": "И чё?", "created_at": "2025-01-27T13:32:42", "owner": "vpn_m8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864879538244402, "text": "Как легко тут запороть партию", "created_at": "2025-01-25T19:55:06", "owner": "alexcheeses", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905554711000236, "text": "What's the type of paper and printing method", "created_at": "2025-01-23T12:23:42", "owner": "mohammadreda773", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089028850554440, "text": "オフセット印刷してるところ見せてください", "created_at": "2025-01-22T15:01:05", "owner": "tama_ni0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886337041192156, "text": "What is this", "created_at": "2025-01-16T17:33:36", "owner": "ninomanrhyme", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876410263251496, "text": "Ez van ha teljesitménybe fizetnek és nem órabérbe😀", "created_at": "2025-01-16T13:44:06", "owner": "kisspeter2000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916499998028735, "text": "Мы без молотком руками хуярилии. Когда ты", "created_at": "2025-01-12T14:18:52", "owner": "sardor_153aka", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17920770474011158, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-10T06:02:52", "owner": "nima145236", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18341894707198213, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-01-06T14:28:26", "owner": "copykaj1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17961918749842892, "text": "What is it?", "created_at": "2025-01-01T09:24:06", "owner": "eugenii.art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014544644478532, "text": "Why are you still stripping by hand and not a cut and crease machine .", "created_at": "2025-01-01T01:13:18", "owner": "kaefortuna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055500529986768, "text": "진짜저러다가 메인부분찍으면어쩌?", "created_at": "2024-12-31T06:31:49", "owner": "smcj8887", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18477074887041705, "text": "Blanker", "created_at": "2024-12-30T09:17:56", "owner": "archie.robinson.33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024446531623222, "text": "剔边打磨", "created_at": "2024-12-30T02:57:23", "owner": "anjjang850", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18015786734654185, "text": "Kaynatmayın lan", "created_at": "2024-12-28T14:52:27", "owner": "furkanekeerr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067991284781629, "text": "Use a bobst machine 😂🙌", "created_at": "2024-12-27T19:36:42", "owner": "marvupilami", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17957169455748804, "text": "Why not use the chisel/air hammer and get them out? I worked at a box company before, and it was much faster.", "created_at": "2024-12-27T01:39:03", "owner": "mr_vu_tran", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18193490350306493, "text": "Nice, normally you strip the scrap pieces right after the die cutting with stripping tools. Also, blanking units have been invented to help keep up the speed of the whole process from cutting to side gluing 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-25T18:31:12", "owner": "sasja86", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18339425032196035, "text": "Your shop needs a blanking dye cutter. It will save you this extra step of hand stripping all this . It’s a huge time saver on big runs and it can go from the dye cutter right to the gluer.", "created_at": "2024-12-25T14:21:13", "owner": "ponchilliaii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031769336429340, "text": "리들샷..?", "created_at": "2024-12-25T09:33:32", "owner": "sooojigg", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18050346587300091, "text": "pt tempat PKL gua dulu ngerjain kayak ginii☝️", "created_at": "2024-12-25T07:28:14", "owner": "fiansyah.08", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18087669757530150, "text": "Q desorden", "created_at": "2024-12-25T03:55:06", "owner": "mccrissoficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967300485698544, "text": "Как то неумело и ужасно...", "created_at": "2024-12-24T19:27:35", "owner": "andriiandreienkov", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17949325889876021, "text": "Клёвая работа", "created_at": "2024-12-24T13:29:57", "owner": "clepsidra.md", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17946264890918990, "text": "we do this before barehands good ol days", "created_at": "2024-12-24T12:11:12", "owner": "cyrpjay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087628336534113, "text": "Wie wäre es einfach wenn man die 300€ für eine Ausstechform ausgegeben hätte und einen Nutzentrenner gebaut? Die Kollegen hätte es an der FKM gedankt. @_klaus_herbst", "created_at": "2024-12-23T19:02:33", "owner": "rene.jaeger.87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049253780031932, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2024-12-23T18:49:13", "owner": "cnc_hasani", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18253057084287518, "text": "Я тоже на такой работе работал", "created_at": "2024-12-23T12:31:40", "owner": "malik_aesthetic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067204726692674, "text": "A machine should be doing this. They deserve better.", "created_at": "2024-12-22T22:03:34", "owner": "metalpig_metalworks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880498240198602, "text": "I would be bad at this job", "created_at": "2024-12-22T21:31:06", "owner": "goopybear_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937563858961287, "text": "Paper GSM?", "created_at": "2024-12-22T18:00:13", "owner": "rohit.2.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866182066277445, "text": "Used to do similar work to this. My goodness was it amazing for anger management!", "created_at": "2024-12-22T10:14:50", "owner": "witchofwood", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17942294834927639, "text": "There are machines that punch this out right away without having to do so afterwards; and these machines soon exist for over 100 years. Heidelberg sends greetings", "created_at": "2024-12-22T01:36:15", "owner": "g4bbergandalf", "likes": 100}, {"id": 18032551898605841, "text": "Só quem já trabalhou em Gráfica sabe sobre esse procedimento 😊", "created_at": "2024-12-22T00:30:33", "owner": "fabiogoncalvesseveri", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17875906332227313, "text": "Swear to god there was a child’s board game that had pieces laminated like this and I can’t remember for the life of me", "created_at": "2024-12-22T00:30:03", "owner": "anferny_ears", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289883785214027, "text": "Therapeutic job", "created_at": "2024-12-21T22:21:09", "owner": "mesonja", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18027314282629223, "text": "Looks like packaging, silver card I reckon", "created_at": "2024-12-21T21:26:51", "owner": "digitallee2016", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17882046987194761, "text": "Go buy a stripper unit and blanker unit and never hand stripper again 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-21T14:41:49", "owner": "yakuza_loop", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18470791654056445, "text": "I want That", "created_at": "2024-12-19T22:08:39", "owner": "xservayge", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18031345274415177, "text": "Novvi narsa akan bi", "created_at": "2024-12-19T15:34:50", "owner": "boxodirivich06", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17993248235729544, "text": "Busted to this", "created_at": "2024-12-18T23:42:23", "owner": "toke_the_joke", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18061940761874691, "text": "Holy wast", "created_at": "2024-12-18T06:29:17", "owner": "directoricy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18043978001169818, "text": "Does this hurt the horse?", "created_at": "2024-12-16T16:43:43", "owner": "parkerjsackett", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18157512013345429, "text": "Shitty cuting!", "created_at": "2025-03-05T13:20:44", "owner": "sevanoidkalenda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021378983459371, "text": "این چیه اون چیه سوال دارم جواب چیه ؟؟؟", "created_at": "2025-02-21T14:39:42", "owner": "sattarparvizi1376", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17914703451054746, "text": "آهن آلات . آهن ضایعات. آبگرمکن کهنه . بخاری پاره خریداریم .", "created_at": "2025-01-26T17:04:49", "owner": "nasriiiiiiiin7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919433118934805, "text": "siyagi bos😂", "created_at": "2025-01-15T12:29:59", "owner": "yudsus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875093383240542, "text": "Boxes for cum samples of aids victims to be spread through out the pentagon later in 2025", "created_at": "2025-01-01T15:09:21", "owner": "ryezat_94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285757564172322, "text": "اینکه تماما به ضایعات رفت 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2024-12-31T21:28:25", "owner": "eng.shafi_rad", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17991039812743983, "text": "Don’t buy cheap shit people.", "created_at": "2024-12-21T22:47:56", "owner": "arnandcounder", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["박스주문제작"]},
