{"media_id": 3515602504384237239, "shortcode": "DDJ7dntS863", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDJ7dntS863/", "taken_at": "2024-12-04T11:42:39", "caption": "一个盘传8代，人走盘还在。 #Intel #固态硬盘", "owner_username": "rememberyouenterprise", "owner_id": "63652611713", "likes": 5923, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0390_DDJ7dntS863\\DDJ7dntS863_20241204_114239.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18107838250450405", "text": "這就是東西越來越不耐用的原因？", "created_at": "2024-12-08T11:04:07", "owner": "dai_19930520", "likes": 69}, {"id": "18046682756476811", "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2024-12-07T01:54:11", "owner": "sablonakuang", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["intel", "固态硬盘"]},
{"media_id": 3525800803783527880, "shortcode": "DDuKSaKTc3I", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDuKSaKTc3I/", "taken_at": "2024-12-18T13:24:03", "caption": "原來這句話是真的👇🏻\n-\n難怪很多人說在國外生活會是另一種人格🤭\nMake sense lol 😝 \n\n你喜歡哪種生活呢😆？\n\n#文化差異", "owner_username": "_destinychen", "owner_id": "412655221", "likes": 11234, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0391_DDuKSaKTc3I\\DDuKSaKTc3I_20241218_132403.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18021955361711514, "text": "太籠統了，沒可能所有東方人和所有西方人都這樣，還是看自身", "created_at": "2025-07-06T09:46:12", "owner": "karinaaa1208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075702826776508, "text": "所以东亚崛起,包括韩国,新加坡,台湾,大陆;西方开始坠落。这个世界就像比赛,不努力就要落后。", "created_at": "2025-03-27T12:49:26", "owner": "jiuwca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058489952021668, "text": "西方做外包 人家当然工作八小时就要交班费了。 整个东方加班到半夜一点。", "created_at": "2025-03-04T19:59:22", "owner": "whatarewewhyareweherewhendidwe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893872795069453, "text": "想提升知識就閱讀\n想提升認知就思考\n想提升維度就進化\n分子語言歡迎學習", "created_at": "2025-02-15T12:15:46", "owner": "psier7338", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028381016321652, "text": "我：缝合怪", "created_at": "2025-02-09T12:20:40", "owner": "grigio167", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080151382623165, "text": "時代變了人不願意變", "created_at": "2025-02-09T04:56:51", "owner": "lez._.cga", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046208084023400, "text": "感覺有些不對，西方人 很多很早婚，生小孩。 在外國住過 就會發現 亞洲地區很多都不太差😂⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-02-08T13:25:20", "owner": "bradcto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076089889629509, "text": "这就是欧洲衰落的原因么？", "created_at": "2025-02-08T02:11:10", "owner": "yg.233233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044838470464609, "text": "什麼是責任制？美化的賣身制", "created_at": "2025-02-07T08:51:44", "owner": "dpz.28", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979390095796117, "text": "又白又瘦。東方一元制審美🤡", "created_at": "2025-02-07T08:51:06", "owner": "dpz.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18461699629067911, "text": "不打不相識啊，東方、西方！\n我在中間！", "created_at": "2025-02-06T18:51:21", "owner": "c0903685648", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054297185085245, "text": "别骗自己了，明明是竞争力下降，都快嘎了", "created_at": "2025-02-05T13:20:20", "owner": "chenqinglin68", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338661022154998, "text": "我西方價值觀😂", "created_at": "2025-02-05T11:58:53", "owner": "nicki_say87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027284225330167, "text": "我現在是加拿大留學生 這裡老師的口頭禪真的就都是「good job!」\n「awesome!」", "created_at": "2025-02-05T04:02:37", "owner": "kevin414_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034234820447238, "text": "西方人「有酒水的派對就是最好的派對」「無論是什麼節日，假期，紀念日，祝賀，哀悼-一定要喝酒。（拼命找藉口喝酒）」「結婚次數高低不重要，第一眼看到想要就來」「高端行業可能不會排斥外人，但一定提拔自己人」", "created_at": "2025-02-05T00:31:20", "owner": "poppynchloe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049535650957071, "text": "第二條什麼意思", "created_at": "2025-02-04T11:53:57", "owner": "gary_c.xh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069520642819445, "text": "我好像其實是西方人", "created_at": "2025-02-04T08:34:20", "owner": "david841027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874279180259435, "text": "不如說會滑到這種文章的大多數是亞洲人😆", "created_at": "2025-02-04T08:01:32", "owner": "ycnanwt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038773673593734, "text": "人家有殖民地，你有嗎？", "created_at": "2025-02-03T06:29:31", "owner": "huanghuang1029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096293308511252, "text": "原來我是西人😂😂", "created_at": "2025-02-02T05:30:19", "owner": "kikichuki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106884409421433, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-01T08:11:13", "owner": "aimmaro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18299560807231325, "text": "東方人真的難當", "created_at": "2025-02-01T04:30:53", "owner": "reiss_3160", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873188680183493, "text": "2025年了 台湾人还在pua自己 能不能把腰杆挺直一点😿", "created_at": "2025-01-28T08:45:25", "owner": "siberianprole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868598716288531, "text": "一群人假設自己所在群體的缺點，又幻想一個不存在的群體有多美好，在這互相取暖", "created_at": "2025-01-27T02:52:41", "owner": "dave54dave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041038811078186, "text": "四十歲結婚算早！？女人最好的生育年齡是到28耶！", "created_at": "2025-01-26T03:59:23", "owner": "nina.lin1688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037061987152935, "text": "有一半的感覺不太對，不知道是那裏的西方人😂", "created_at": "2025-01-21T21:33:14", "owner": "nekomimikamisama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920883928013669, "text": "有利有弊，沒有必要只挑好的來看。國外一堆過了 三四十的， 銀行儲蓄都沒有", "created_at": "2025-01-17T15:06:25", "owner": "nba29752001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162090661332808, "text": "亞洲伺服器 被拿捏🗿", "created_at": "2025-01-15T16:11:39", "owner": "lyn._x19__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032631248212836, "text": "要不是我再去国外生活了好多年我差点就信了😂", "created_at": "2025-01-15T08:29:54", "owner": "seanyu0301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019247591406859, "text": "美國 西方人@超過一半人口未曾出國😂", "created_at": "2025-01-14T13:03:44", "owner": "vincent6757", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957984246854746, "text": "投胎錯了 下輩子一定選西方人😢", "created_at": "2025-01-11T03:09:16", "owner": "terry.ksk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054997120832841, "text": "對別人喜歡左邊，對自己喜歡右邊 😊", "created_at": "2025-01-10T00:10:31", "owner": "recitdevie_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052871402102233, "text": "如果可以的话，可以拿 华人 和以色列人 比吗？来看看一下，华人和以色列人的区别，以色列人比西方教育更好很多", "created_at": "2025-01-08T15:19:06", "owner": "kohen_shemuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038340887459051, "text": "Asian culture isn't the best for raising kids.", "created_at": "2025-01-07T21:00:13", "owner": "_widowson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869832619269270, "text": "不過說真的 對儒家思想真的不是很喜歡", "created_at": "2025-01-07T16:44:44", "owner": "bryanyzhe0224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296840623231419, "text": "無論東西方 都是真理的欠缺", "created_at": "2025-01-07T16:35:19", "owner": "bryanyzhe0224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918692143028819, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-01-06T07:34:14", "owner": "ly.nne2816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366653881187176, "text": "我覺得QnA是倒轉的,反而外國人超多問題問😂", "created_at": "2025-01-05T18:43:48", "owner": "jjjjenho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030094340571515, "text": "如果真有外星人，世界需要進步，需要強者，需要逆境殺出來的人。", "created_at": "2025-01-05T16:00:44", "owner": "justice_fai2008", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028134245269796, "text": "东方只剩下中国了吗", "created_at": "2025-01-05T09:50:54", "owner": "chang_hao_xuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076830481615650, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-01-05T00:31:40", "owner": "chichi_c915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911930518062337, "text": "我東方人但沒有那麼奴😌\n至少底線是六日絕對不進公司", "created_at": "2025-01-04T11:18:51", "owner": "jeremydesu_1999", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18051571958020799, "text": "東方", "created_at": "2025-01-04T08:20:27", "owner": "tifmandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059816590906826, "text": "完全明白你的體會！沒有在西方社會生活過、工作過的人是完全明白的！什麼“一隻手指指着人四隻手指指向自己”，\"inconsiderate\", \"selfish\", \"rude\", \"impolite\"....", "created_at": "2025-01-04T06:11:05", "owner": "ioio.you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029925926532632, "text": "@dio__w isn’t it 😂", "created_at": "2025-01-03T18:33:22", "owner": "amy_pandana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998128965574107, "text": "東方人以為西方人是這樣😂事實不是", "created_at": "2025-01-03T12:51:57", "owner": "yuenfrankie2068", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074252188565365, "text": "来世绝对不再做东亚人。", "created_at": "2025-01-03T02:44:52", "owner": "jack_astronaut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372952720118274, "text": "😮‍💨😮‍💨😮‍💨😮‍💨😮‍💨😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-01-03T02:14:35", "owner": "shiiiwen__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051379841112531, "text": "所以一个蒸蒸日上，一个每况愈下。", "created_at": "2025-01-02T23:48:47", "owner": "jiaxuanphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017943764436106, "text": "钱都是省出来的", "created_at": "2025-01-02T22:36:01", "owner": "ro_01.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030665900222071, "text": "不是這樣啊,起碼英國人不是", "created_at": "2025-01-02T09:42:40", "owner": "jackso.art", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17853581031309541, "text": "这不是西方人，这是白左。美国保守派的观念你信不信比儒家还封建", "created_at": "2025-01-02T09:34:47", "owner": "shirleyjia8", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056795482987194, "text": "看來作者沒有去過美國，工作到自殺和槍殺都有。", "created_at": "2025-01-02T05:29:46", "owner": "kctsang.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030034673241537, "text": "唔好問就最好", "created_at": "2025-01-02T04:36:00", "owner": "ben_lspiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082351363509663, "text": "生在亞洲可能是上輩子做了壞事", "created_at": "2025-01-02T04:12:06", "owner": "akindofhush1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101205610481491, "text": "東方人不管你做多少努力，都得不到稱讚", "created_at": "2025-01-02T03:35:09", "owner": "st890227", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17905874550083263, "text": "为什么呢，因为他善", "created_at": "2025-01-02T01:08:51", "owner": "latte_robertking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048062158933592, "text": "120分問為何不是150", "created_at": "2025-01-01T19:45:17", "owner": "veronica_libra926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016100174439729, "text": "最後一點錯，外國30歲已經婚也離了", "created_at": "2025-01-01T18:16:23", "owner": "alhk92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924859863901937, "text": "他们已经翻身了，不需要再翻身了，只需要享受人生就可以了", "created_at": "2025-01-01T17:02:39", "owner": "shuyingthedreamer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030991055198829, "text": "美國人工作壓力應該也蠻大的", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:44:47", "owner": "godandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18477080284031881, "text": "出國要去哪？來亞洲嗎😆", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:44:39", "owner": "ballewuwu888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18265742083251745, "text": "繼續盲吹西方萬能", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:21:42", "owner": "pakhanglei", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17847331131383203, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-01-01T01:00:21", "owner": "bellamy_daily", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127694851392024, "text": "但是西方經濟依然領先", "created_at": "2025-01-01T00:53:01", "owner": "gorgeous_queen_0419", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18152328352340404, "text": "個人覺得在香港長大倫敦工作的自己現在是兩者的混合體，東西人 😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T21:18:17", "owner": "ath3xa", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18101870182430449, "text": "有部份不太對，不過整體感覺的確差不多，所以我在亞洲社會蠻奇葩的😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T16:51:03", "owner": "snolfaery", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052135211023101, "text": "所以他們未來肯定會輸亞洲人的", "created_at": "2024-12-31T16:48:56", "owner": "gongzyren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993230676730999, "text": "看完覺得東方比較好也不是不可能", "created_at": "2024-12-31T16:35:54", "owner": "s104021206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047757896129066, "text": "反而覺得西方人比較早生孩子\n但比較隨性，不像東方要有充足的準備😂\n英國是這樣，其他不知了😂", "created_at": "2024-12-31T14:42:19", "owner": "kekkk2014", "likes": 113}, {"id": 18028943282252268, "text": "西方最後一個就不對了 他們很多很早婚生小孩的", "created_at": "2024-12-31T14:16:00", "owner": "destinychiang", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18031754258406417, "text": "你可以來矽谷體驗一下職場就會改觀", "created_at": "2024-12-31T06:41:07", "owner": "zhwang31", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18051045740029027, "text": "外國不是像這篇文章這樣，亂寫", "created_at": "2024-12-31T06:11:36", "owner": "yenwenl", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17955067352883362, "text": "西人不是這樣的", "created_at": "2024-12-31T05:45:09", "owner": "ledreaminator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042804953257090, "text": "他們祖上為了拼翻身掠奪全世界資源幾年了，你現在才拼翻身很合理啊", "created_at": "2024-12-31T02:26:28", "owner": "kingdavid7728", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18293131165213176, "text": "根本原因没写，西方人尚武，东方人已被驯化", "created_at": "2024-12-30T21:44:52", "owner": "omega.and.9527.others", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18057641527767581, "text": "因為他們都把不想做的事丟給亞洲人啊", "created_at": "2024-12-30T19:15:21", "owner": "coffeecatmeowmeow", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17936848862953440, "text": "PUA吃了不少", "created_at": "2024-12-30T15:31:31", "owner": "crazydw666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052161700841434, "text": "儒家思想，本來就是幫助皇室、貴族統治社會的手段，不然孔子也不會期待受到重用，還周遊列國", "created_at": "2024-12-30T13:05:47", "owner": "raymond_geton", "likes": 740}, {"id": 17917941984034456, "text": "大概今世作亞洲人是還上輩子的罪孽，就盼下輩子做回人的福份吧～", "created_at": "2024-12-30T11:29:37", "owner": "jo24art", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17859789903336194, "text": "我覺qa係調轉的", "created_at": "2024-12-30T10:12:39", "owner": "lawromin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045008642473200, "text": "东方人明明是，做得好全都是父母、老师、领导的功劳，做得不好就全都是自己的问题🌚", "created_at": "2024-12-29T15:19:41", "owner": "kakalok_", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18363830029187362, "text": "差别在于骨子里的自卑", "created_at": "2024-12-18T22:01:25", "owner": "maggiengu_", "likes": 119}, {"id": 18019519430631957, "text": "遇過一位在巴黎工作、回台過2個月年假的台灣人：不知道如何渡過2個月的休假😳", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:42:58", "owner": "leemaru", "likes": 102}, {"id": 18054662482942401, "text": "真的是做80分得到120分的稱讚😍", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:32:54", "owner": "chunyao_shih", "likes": 220}, {"id": 17894805936105641, "text": "由此可知儒家思想到底有多恐怖🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2024-12-18T13:28:37", "owner": "alonecat0409", "likes": 794}, {"id": 18331030195082380, "text": "就是有可憐蟲為了多那些錢 假日上班😂", "created_at": "2025-02-16T02:47:54", "owner": "bibi0911bi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925069843010800, "text": "西方崇尚生活還主宰地球🌍東方人笑黑人奴，自己儒家思想😂從小在家就奴上加奴", "created_at": "2025-02-12T04:29:43", "owner": "alloy_microstructure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924208648033644, "text": "西方效率低 人懒！", "created_at": "2025-02-08T12:54:22", "owner": "tiffytiffania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090298618554165, "text": "也不完全是，西方也有工作到很晚的，美國人（如果所謂西方是指老美的話）有做到以公司為家的，歐洲人也有見過，美國中西部也有那種想法不結婚你就是罪大惡極的老人（好萊塢是加州，比較偏左，拍出來的影視難免跟中西部不一樣），不愛存錢是老美（因為美金是世界貨幣，所以可以一直借錢還利息，不存錢反而好），喜歡住郊外也是老美⋯⋯我有同事瑞士人喜歡住市中心（跟台北人很像⋯），瑞士算西方吧🤣？ 純粹是個人經驗，不能代表一定就是我說的這樣", "created_at": "2025-02-05T20:44:49", "owner": "barrytaiwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878917747239080, "text": "每個人有自己的美導致很多胖子在西方。比例太高。他們三高有名。", "created_at": "2025-02-02T21:19:39", "owner": "taichienergy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930561771988067, "text": "所以就知道在乎環保的亞洲人是多麼可悲的弱智生物，他們燒煤造船掠取財富，現在要享受了就禁止我們走他們老路前進", "created_at": "2025-01-05T09:22:26", "owner": "minervamuse0307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856449607345232, "text": "西方那个很多点都错的离谱，很多职位仍然很push，很多人放假跑去其他国家比如东南亚或者日本或者其他，也有很多欧洲人圣诞来澳洲。 结婚早的一大把。 虽然白人不太追求白，但会追求瘦，也会注意防晒。 总的来说这图就是没在国外生活过的人自己yy出来无脑舔国外的", "created_at": "2025-01-02T23:36:55", "owner": "zhj_ad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18374826340117979, "text": "西方才是垃圾", "created_at": "2025-01-01T12:54:31", "owner": "sailopuipui_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323448397084670, "text": "富二代跟窮二代😢", "created_at": "2024-12-21T19:49:12", "owner": "if_ce", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18052919789066694, "text": "奴才跟人的差別", "created_at": "2024-12-18T14:59:57", "owner": "newpitt1996", "likes": 14}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["文化差異"]},
{"media_id": 3526979806153061077, "shortcode": "DDyWXJrurLV", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DDyWXJrurLV/", "taken_at": "2024-12-20T04:34:00", "caption": "Gen Z bible as Christmas gift but in Mandarin\n聖誕禮物抽到了一本Z世代國語版聖經 ✝️上帝硬著走！\n#genz #slang #asian #mandarin #chinese #christmas #bible #comedy #language #culture", "owner_username": "dr.holic_", "owner_id": "634672108", "likes": 2297, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0392_DDyWXJrurLV\\DDyWXJrurLV_20241220_043400.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17894521245157163", "text": "", "created_at": "2025-01-23T00:26:09", "owner": "277353.lol", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17850998031330673", "text": "硬着走按鈕—— ＞", "created_at": "2025-01-03T12:47:52", "owner": "femtanyl_dealer", "likes": 18}, {"id": "18056666920764310", "text": "Waiting for Gen A Bible to be released", "created_at": "2024-12-25T00:40:56", "owner": "constantine_second", "likes": 4}, {"id": "17915172930030242", "text": "Amen❌Gman✅✅😎", "created_at": "2024-12-21T05:10:22", "owner": "kosir_no1", "likes": 12}, {"id": "18114582298381532", "text": "Let Him cook 讓祂煮 🗣🗣🗣🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-20T12:37:35", "owner": "4prillllllllllllllllllllllllll", "likes": 132}, {"id": "17903325069086500", "text": "Repent", "created_at": "2024-12-20T10:36:11", "owner": "__1h._.hu9", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18017137172404360", "text": "很好的嘗試diddy", "created_at": "2024-12-20T09:29:19", "owner": "whs0214", "likes": 71}, {"id": "18045105979951719", "text": "That’s why我信耶穌😂", "created_at": "2024-12-20T06:03:48", "owner": "him_0825", "likes": 28}, {"id": "18172985311314248", "text": "迪迪pull up🗣️🔥", "created_at": "2024-12-20T05:10:00", "owner": "mytownisasaladbowl", "likes": 8}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["genz", "slang", "asian", "mandarin", "chinese", "christmas", "bible", "comedy", "language", "culture"]},
{"media_id": 3535241257683529219, "shortcode": "DEPszF_iC4D", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DEPszF_iC4D/", "taken_at": "2024-12-31T14:00:21", "caption": "【送給努力過的自己】\n\n人生就像一場漫長的冒險，有時我們會為未達到的目標而自責，為錯過的機會而遺憾。在這一年，有未能如願的結果，又有想放棄的時刻，但不論結果如何，每一次嘗試、跌倒後重新站起，因為你的堅持，已經足夠了不起。\n\n日本動畫《葬送的芙莉蓮》其中的一句話：「努力過的人都是戰士。」人類不會魔法，也沒有千年壽命，但我們擁有精靈和魔族也難以理解的情感和意志，而這都是有機會令奇蹟出現的觸發點。所以，或許結果並非盡如人意，但努力本身已是勇氣的證明。\n\n在2024年最後一天，讓我們一起舉杯，為每個奮鬥的靈魂乾杯。新的一年，繼續堅持、守護自己的目標，每一步都是成長，每個經歷都是寶貴的收穫。\n\n--------------------\nACOO公道伯：聽君一席話，如聽一席話。\nIn ACOO, you can get ignited by #ACOOThoughts.\n\n#葬送的芙莉蓮 #日本 #動畫 #葬送のフリーレン #芙莉蓮 #欣梅爾", "owner_username": "acoo.hk", "owner_id": "44971694510", "likes": 2779, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0393_DEPszF_iC4D\\DEPszF_iC4D_20241231_140021.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17999059712554388", "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-01-01T01:14:27", "owner": "jaggerleung", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18158267341327520", "text": "我會變成戰士，我會努力 @step829", "created_at": "2025-01-03T05:58:24", "owner": "loungphi", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["acoothoughts", "葬送的芙莉蓮", "日本", "動畫", "葬送のフリーレン", "芙莉蓮", "欣梅爾"]},
{"media_id": 3504851358530767137, "shortcode": "DCju723xYkh", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCju723xYkh/", "taken_at": "2024-11-19T15:43:26", "caption": "and just like that short n sweet tour US leg is over … i am so proud of you @sabrinacarpenter 🥹\n\ndisclaimer: All rights go to the owner “Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for “fair use” for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use. \n\ntags:\n\n#sabrinacarpenter #sabrinacarpenteredit #sabrinacarpenterfan #emailsicantsend #sabrinacarpenterfanpage #emailsicantsendtour #feather #sabrina #edit #fanpage #carpenter #music #nonsense #sabrinacarpenteredits", "owner_username": "sabrina_video", "owner_id": "1578134522", "likes": 151711, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0394_DCju723xYkh\\DCju723xYkh_20241119_154326.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["sabrinacarpenter", "sabrinacarpenteredit", "sabrinacarpenterfan", "emailsicantsend", "sabrinacarpenterfanpage", "emailsicantsendtour", "feather", "sabrina", "edit", "fanpage", "carpenter", "music", "nonsense", "sabrinacarpenteredits"]},
{"media_id": 3512716269583114826, "shortcode": "DC_rNYFPKJK", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DC_rNYFPKJK/", "taken_at": "2024-11-30T12:07:12", "caption": "從現在開始好好愛護你的身體❤️\n\n🌟留言「好循環」，給你健康養生秘笈\n\n#健康 #養生 #活絡循環 #健康身體 #肩膀僵硬 #身體按摩 #healthylifestyle", "owner_username": "yyuki_ting", "owner_id": "1537562343", "likes": -1, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0395_DC_rNYFPKJK\\DC_rNYFPKJK_20241130_120712_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0395_DC_rNYFPKJK\\DC_rNYFPKJK_20241130_120712_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0395_DC_rNYFPKJK\\DC_rNYFPKJK_20241130_120712_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0395_DC_rNYFPKJK\\DC_rNYFPKJK_20241130_120712_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0395_DC_rNYFPKJK\\DC_rNYFPKJK_20241130_120712_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0395_DC_rNYFPKJK\\DC_rNYFPKJK_20241130_120712_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0395_DC_rNYFPKJK\\DC_rNYFPKJK_20241130_120712_7.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18046142585582676, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-04-23T04:47:22", "owner": "iamwind1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846264454459610, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-04-21T15:40:50", "owner": "qqbabe118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882913714164178, "text": "❤", "created_at": "2025-04-13T09:12:00", "owner": "sun.xiulan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061866008014129, "text": "@sun.xiulan", "created_at": "2025-04-13T07:54:18", "owner": "lanlan.chu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064460695955917, "text": "這有一首口訣：肺寅大卯胃辰宮，脾巳心午小未中，申胱酉腎心包戌，亥焦子膽丑肝通。", "created_at": "2025-04-12T00:38:54", "owner": "m6zj0902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036365522294038, "text": "腎不是早上5點至7點嗎？😮", "created_at": "2025-04-08T00:07:09", "owner": "rabbitwg12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068578750913609, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-04-05T03:18:40", "owner": "lucky_hui_yu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003372899737899, "text": "@eve.chen.98031", "created_at": "2025-03-29T18:05:39", "owner": "wang_shiung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051300833226565, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-03-28T13:37:10", "owner": "shihpingshih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067018690927667, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-03-20T13:51:52", "owner": "gin2828c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957418212866470, "text": "腎臟？", "created_at": "2025-03-09T17:56:01", "owner": "sheenbeauty__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096576859517333, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-03-03T13:24:39", "owner": "s.___________i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360473191123116, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-27T13:22:00", "owner": "dear._.1130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137009362391130, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-27T08:00:02", "owner": "li_chieh_yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509848999051036, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-26T08:40:10", "owner": "kensuenhin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133850233361190, "text": "好循環。\n謝謝分享", "created_at": "2025-02-24T16:44:40", "owner": "harriet_the_spy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042985313345177, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-23T21:47:25", "owner": "jtting.238_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059626624979515, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-23T02:20:25", "owner": "chenyi.smile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954363990919318, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-22T18:39:44", "owner": "a99073680", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868700098301265, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-22T02:58:50", "owner": "allychang37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886156672216963, "text": "沒有排毒時間這種事吧😨", "created_at": "2025-02-21T23:16:08", "owner": "sweettrance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002611298567996, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-18T13:04:33", "owner": "shanfed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038679191523675, "text": "好循環", "created_at": "2025-02-18T02:28:50", "owner": "s8125342000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022342364412215, "text": "人類為何身體這麼會生毒素？？？不懂", "created_at": "2025-02-17T05:42:48", "owner": "stacylove20010101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044101583462956, "text": "膽囊不是膽藏... 還是是指胰臟？", "created_at": "2025-02-15T09:11:44", "owner": "liyenzeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947515494797257, "text": "我值夜班 這樣我是