{"media_id": 3457606417331162369, "shortcode": "C_74remIo0B", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_74remIo0B/", "taken_at": "2024-09-15T11:18:30", "caption": "Every year, millions of riders suffer from leg, hip, and knee injuries, leading to costly medical treatments and long recovery periods. \n\nWe’re determined to change that with our revolutionary Airbag Jeans. These cutting-edge jeans deploy upon impact, reducing the risk of severe impact & abrasion injuries, and ultimately cutting down on medical expenses across the globe. \n\n🏁 Our vision is clear: better protection, fewer injuries, and a future where safety and innovation go hand in hand.", "owner_username": "airbagjeans", "owner_id": "9290299332", "likes": 1722769, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0407_C_74remIo0B\\C_74remIo0B_20240915_111830.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17852895639274841, "text": "What if I forget when I get off that I'm hooked up? Does it activate the same way?", "created_at": "2024-09-15T13:10:48", "owner": "ezequiel_arguelles01", "likes": 18509}, {"id": 18155904601319560, "text": "Sizes are the same as everyday pants or is it better to buy a size up?", "created_at": "2024-09-15T16:09:11", "owner": "ioannoui", "likes": 6314}, {"id": 17977821776759666, "text": "All Airbag Jeans Are Available Via Link In Bio!🌎👖🏍️", "created_at": "2024-09-15T11:30:55", "owner": "airbagjeans", "likes": 1489}, {"id": 18077257628050190, "text": "Good on the long rides", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:17:04", "owner": "jwtusmce8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963057447793402, "text": "Espetacular 👏👏👏👏👏 Precisa ver para o Brasil URGENTE ! 👏👏👏👏👏🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-07-01T13:59:49", "owner": "flaviocruzvisao360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032782448410339, "text": "💸💸💸💸💸??????", "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:38:00", "owner": "med_karam_ait", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946924773978314, "text": "Donde se puede comprar en España?", "created_at": "2025-05-02T10:57:13", "owner": "lolarpm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855342307353581, "text": "Where I can buy it bro", "created_at": "2025-03-23T13:01:26", "owner": "phamtungvan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294118996174262, "text": "@raven_bikergirl234 @demise_r6 @glowstick82", "created_at": "2025-03-22T02:23:36", "owner": "1tbud_7be", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939993273987017, "text": "So now they are making BBL’s for motorcycle riders now….", "created_at": "2025-03-14T14:34:41", "owner": "rayraytazsr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066143257904461, "text": "Would have saved my dad's life", "created_at": "2025-03-14T10:45:34", "owner": "pinkbeautyorganicskincare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069182104854829, "text": "Poser", "created_at": "2025-03-13T23:16:18", "owner": "jurajbartunek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877833550181884, "text": "SO cool they can recharge!!! Aside from being life saving that’s my favorite feature 100%", "created_at": "2025-03-13T22:43:52", "owner": "aarttown", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980474220814439, "text": "Instant BBL", "created_at": "2025-03-13T22:24:27", "owner": "californiagoldenretrievers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123121129442280, "text": "Adorei seu vídeo muito criativo parabéns pelo seu trabalho, eu gostaria de saber se você me autoriza a fazer um remix? 🙌😊", "created_at": "2025-03-13T21:33:24", "owner": "naldoexpo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843386773436675, "text": "How about the spine duh!?", "created_at": "2025-03-13T09:53:49", "owner": "orlinamyril", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054555104326933, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-03-13T05:59:07", "owner": "leonard.toma.509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851878807371838, "text": "Good idea", "created_at": "2025-03-13T05:19:55", "owner": "som_rudei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287072677217862, "text": "@kitesurf_milly", "created_at": "2025-03-12T10:31:50", "owner": "gillyatkinson70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018276866680813, "text": "What a great invention!!! Safety first is always the rule, and makes the ride more enjoyable. Amazing 🙌👌", "created_at": "2025-03-12T06:46:05", "owner": "sparkkenya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044247284086417, "text": "Absolutely brilliant", "created_at": "2025-03-11T21:32:31", "owner": "lianemcfarlane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048491963211904, "text": "Is this reusable or one time only 😮🤷🏼", "created_at": "2025-03-11T21:08:24", "owner": "hoorash97d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001018193592171, "text": "Do you sell those in Mexico??", "created_at": "2025-03-11T17:59:54", "owner": "elartedeltio_bernie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041657099454368, "text": "The toughness of the suits is not the problem. You spine and neck’s vulnerability is. I speak from experience, unfortunately.", "created_at": "2025-03-11T13:23:55", "owner": "laptopleon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095054479551232, "text": "Whyyyy???? Just dont ride..... and ull have ur legs and hands....", "created_at": "2025-03-11T10:02:00", "owner": "marija_revit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922518655028096, "text": "❤️🙌👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-03-11T01:02:23", "owner": "aliciaruiz5726", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912859951088683, "text": "@rurtis_ceed", "created_at": "2025-03-10T16:18:27", "owner": "t_reed13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106232596438336, "text": "Hips and “Thīghts” … have mercy 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-10T12:26:07", "owner": "taramorgandalton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903300406109616, "text": "@frankied825", "created_at": "2025-03-10T09:55:17", "owner": "mel_d_73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030833660324117, "text": "🔥great idea good job 🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-09T19:49:02", "owner": "kavbarr99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998246430603051, "text": "Might take time but I’m definitely ❤️❤️❤️buying", "created_at": "2025-03-09T19:08:46", "owner": "mercymerry_onah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055731992115731, "text": "Absolute game changer 🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-09T13:28:45", "owner": "instasteeeb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049381811210874, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-09T13:06:17", "owner": "lalasdreamhomes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078919345711663, "text": "This is amazing 🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-09T09:01:33", "owner": "the_honest_mum_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046854569518296, "text": "@jonnybellski", "created_at": "2025-03-09T07:45:00", "owner": "wendywooknight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949545357805919, "text": "It is affordable for normal working class people?", "created_at": "2025-03-09T06:45:44", "owner": "pygmy.pipistrelle13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073935979808607, "text": "@444lele", "created_at": "2025-03-08T21:41:55", "owner": "iluvky333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062228113811077, "text": "My friend just died in a motorcycle accident,smh😢", "created_at": "2025-03-08T17:29:25", "owner": "millieflower73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016786202680027, "text": "Hubiera querido que existiera para junio 12 2009 😢 @darnyc_", "created_at": "2025-03-07T21:40:00", "owner": "nitzaestrada1976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856909822330839, "text": "But is it bulletproof?", "created_at": "2025-03-07T21:32:14", "owner": "gifted2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043556657367010, "text": "Would they be good just for regular mountain biking?", "created_at": "2025-03-06T21:08:44", "owner": "baxter_purves_baxter_purves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042938048588645, "text": "@rose_k_joy", "created_at": "2025-03-06T08:55:04", "owner": "emilymuscolino03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903276013030102, "text": "Alright", "created_at": "2025-03-06T04:01:25", "owner": "zamline0905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971404461831289, "text": "Last Christmas season 12-22/24 accident:  was in Coma died 12/31/24 brain dead. Been living in a disbelief night mare ever since.  Please for your loved ones don’t ride those death rockets! 🚀 he was only 19.", "created_at": "2025-03-06T03:22:03", "owner": "kingarthurscrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18489771946063972, "text": "@cdoggydog17", "created_at": "2025-03-05T23:43:57", "owner": "ty__cat7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060206816482800, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-03-05T18:47:01", "owner": "kindacvban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053596850178028, "text": "Can yall create something for snowboarding?  Need it as I’m aging 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-05T18:35:50", "owner": "nutritionatlanta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082776685632818, "text": "😮😮😮 ahora si a volar en 🏍️ 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-03-05T16:42:07", "owner": "marthaortega6668", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849480952417365, "text": "@jaapveldhorst , dit is wel een prettig idee..😊", "created_at": "2025-03-05T16:34:28", "owner": "angelique.gielians", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049179245193158, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-03-05T14:34:12", "owner": "swarada414", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898348264149419, "text": "I got a jacket i want one of these", "created_at": "2025-03-05T04:33:04", "owner": "kazuma__33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18490667974059407, "text": "What happens if you get pinned and don't seperate from your bike when it skids?", "created_at": "2025-03-04T22:59:48", "owner": "zflammenwerfer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043409447101008, "text": "I don't think people can afford that", "created_at": "2025-03-04T22:50:12", "owner": "theylovematteoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036333926238127, "text": "I think it's awesome. I wrote a thesis in college about motorcycle wrecks & deaths so kudos ❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-04T22:49:23", "owner": "speclkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987862263792632, "text": "Acá no usan ni casco y se van a poner un traje.. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-04T14:47:20", "owner": "ay_cri86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059721155298571, "text": "Is there a delivery to Palestine?", "created_at": "2025-03-04T11:57:23", "owner": "nana_dwik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045978956072679, "text": "NYC Trauma nurse here, how does this help you from breaking your neck? How does this help you from breaking your back? motorcycle drivers are or donors.", "created_at": "2025-03-04T06:43:03", "owner": "mickypassik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18268329406261148, "text": "Still a death trap.", "created_at": "2025-03-04T02:09:33", "owner": "leeanderson007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058003076044777, "text": "Oh this is wonderful", "created_at": "2025-03-04T01:22:56", "owner": "christysings4u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947881065945638, "text": "That stuff works been proven, guys have crashed on purpose to test them.", "created_at": "2025-03-03T22:05:02", "owner": "phiratiomarvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857402083383076, "text": "Awesome idea love it ❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-03T14:22:44", "owner": "kell.211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892281736086737, "text": "How much will it be for", "created_at": "2025-03-03T10:11:18", "owner": "harley_quin1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053823383176621, "text": "My son had just asked me to help him buy the chest protector when he was thrown from his bike and tore all of the ligaments in his right shoulder.  Wish he would’ve gotten sooner", "created_at": "2025-03-03T01:40:39", "owner": "ms_andi28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850736224409102, "text": "Looking at hundreds of lives saved.", "created_at": "2025-03-03T00:38:27", "owner": "pjewell1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094316233534916, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-03T00:33:01", "owner": "natrilous25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897026890157727, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-02T23:53:57", "owner": "remembertobreathe2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353646946181153, "text": "Tous les motards devraient avoir ça", "created_at": "2025-03-02T23:39:28", "owner": "boucheisabella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068932726867214, "text": "Omg. What an incredible idea", "created_at": "2025-03-02T22:16:51", "owner": "bluelighttodreams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269004649253310, "text": "I love this", "created_at": "2025-03-02T20:23:39", "owner": "stanislaysss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879287242167702, "text": "That’s something to save for later", "created_at": "2025-03-02T19:37:41", "owner": "savage_executer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18489391846048579, "text": "It’s 1300 with the vest, jeans 900. Idk I feel like safety should be more assessable :(", "created_at": "2025-03-02T19:34:23", "owner": "iluvyourosee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106732231473532, "text": "We got Airbag jeans before GTA 6.😢", "created_at": "2025-03-02T19:31:01", "owner": "braddkw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082053916628284, "text": "Tights", "created_at": "2025-03-02T19:07:47", "owner": "meg_211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053220449275238, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-02T19:03:42", "owner": "edelcartym", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058199324081636, "text": "What about a parachute 🪂 and you’ll just fly away from the scene", "created_at": "2025-03-02T17:49:28", "owner": "hey_itscharlie82_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081473287721513, "text": "Does this mean If hit by an another motorist, I have a chance of being airborne and literally bouncing on the ground instead of being scrapped? If so, I’m in!", "created_at": "2025-03-02T15:02:10", "owner": "kaythemobilemua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897020578153175, "text": "Come tropical countries you'll love winter days 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-02T08:36:05", "owner": "leo_aviv_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845744026426554, "text": "Yeah, so that's an old system, we already have ones with moving sensors and sattelites", "created_at": "2025-03-02T07:26:05", "owner": "mini_daro_36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868193431242029, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-03-02T05:07:54", "owner": "cristina.cavanaugh.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092609173539785, "text": "👏👏👏👏amen this is truly the best", "created_at": "2025-03-02T01:45:23", "owner": "darlene.potocnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080018005629779, "text": "Do they inflate when you crash or when you start each ride?", "created_at": "2025-03-01T19:00:04", "owner": "rugsncuddles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077078395669445, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-03-01T11:38:10", "owner": "luxeallureallure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853419916351765, "text": "Combien ?", "created_at": "2025-03-01T11:35:25", "owner": "patriciabazill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034226387268461, "text": "In Florida, you can’t even get people to wear a helmet", "created_at": "2025-03-01T03:00:39", "owner": "wickedred33175", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879099118163089, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-01T00:57:55", "owner": "ylan.albby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040594337457521, "text": "Las de Angela águilar we", "created_at": "2025-03-01T00:00:13", "owner": "jhonleox.00_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020140409475153, "text": "So it only activates once your off the bike?", "created_at": "2025-02-28T23:35:56", "owner": "zbc.250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873447406202552, "text": "Hm", "created_at": "2025-02-28T22:16:10", "owner": "lacson547", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861519250361034, "text": "Incredible, that's a priority", "created_at": "2025-02-28T18:43:08", "owner": "hazelpedersen25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957389850913421, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-28T17:16:08", "owner": "goat.584809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059626316494223, "text": "هدو هوما الحوايج اللي خسك تلبس الا كنو ولديك عيسلخوك😂", "created_at": "2025-02-28T16:55:56", "owner": "alae_zhare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005447696721176, "text": "@king_olli__21", "created_at": "2025-02-28T16:35:20", "owner": "latifa_warrelmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975150651817543, "text": "hahaha is this for water", "created_at": "2025-02-28T15:43:53", "owner": "_yesy_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077755168596465, "text": "@derba_jr", "created_at": "2025-02-28T14:49:03", "owner": "renatagonzagagiardini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864936025263027, "text": "hoffentlich kommt das auch an", "created_at": "2025-02-28T14:01:58", "owner": "77dorsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060993250987333, "text": "Or just wear gear already made for stuff like that 😮", "created_at": "2025-02-28T13:10:32", "owner": "marsleyland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961044936904671, "text": "Same system than a horse rider ... 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-02-28T11:04:29", "owner": "redfox147", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929863003001658, "text": "This is a lovely innovation 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-02-28T09:44:40", "owner": "olapejucooks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917342029066002, "text": "Price?", "created_at": "2025-02-28T07:25:40", "owner": "dieseldanemann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060180077298214, "text": "dont let Balenciaga see this", "created_at": "2025-02-28T05:03:51", "owner": "mzfiiyne_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3451312281785894719, "shortcode": "C_lhjwEyoc_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_lhjwEyoc_/", "taken_at": "2024-09-06T18:51:23", "caption": "A few FAQs about convertible heels 🤌🏼 What other Qs do you have? Time to make a whole series of answering your burning questions about Pashions…\n\n#convertibleheels #fashionhack #footwearinnovation #invention #lifehack #highheelslover #comfystyle", "owner_username": "pashionfootwear", "owner_id": "4545784731", "likes": 470784, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0408_C_lhjwEyoc_\\C_lhjwEyoc__20240906_185123.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18040177838116323, "text": "genuis", "created_at": "2024-09-30T01:37:50", "owner": "lilyachty", "likes": 29800}, {"id": 18060810971552073, "text": "Do you ship to South Africa? I need these in my life. Love heels, but the body and feet want more of flats now, especially after an hour 🫠🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:14:58", "owner": "hlengz_hms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496503961074150, "text": "Pp", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:12:28", "owner": "kunjalraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863678524484860, "text": "I can’t find your bio.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:20:47", "owner": "drtstudio56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077860769115606, "text": "Where can I buy them?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:36:55", "owner": "drtstudio56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876133372325682, "text": "Now I want em all", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:49:13", "owner": "aninditakhairunnisaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107132017562587, "text": "I think there is a gap in between when you turn it to flat.... May be uncomfortable wearing", "created_at": "2025-08-25T20:28:15", "owner": "kajal_joshi2610", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949452144972421, "text": "This idea and shoe was available post WWII. They were marketed as coupon busting shoes. 2 pairs for the price of 1.", "created_at": "2025-07-16T00:53:17", "owner": "txstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065401214175214, "text": "Costs as much as designer shoes btw", "created_at": "2025-07-06T18:32:50", "owner": "pretty_sister886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849311689473502, "text": "Why is it so expensive to buy from South Africa, I rather buy 4 pairs of shoes for the price of the base alone and have change 👀", "created_at": "2025-06-04T11:03:42", "owner": "johandri___x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071676073744105, "text": "❤️🙌👏 they are all so beautiful my wishlist is huge😂", "created_at": "2025-05-25T04:26:23", "owner": "omgshoes1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058730911842975, "text": "i just thought about gun", "created_at": "2025-03-05T20:24:08", "owner": "_only_taj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937998285859560, "text": "Love it ❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-03-05T19:08:20", "owner": "na.kusch.ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058889923844644, "text": "this was genius marketing. taking notes 🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-05T15:50:20", "owner": "luxdetailingwpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037116125421888, "text": "Male 21 : damn this idea it's fire", "created_at": "2025-03-05T13:36:34", "owner": "ferraripit04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065022298901248, "text": "So cool 😮", "created_at": "2025-03-05T12:28:48", "owner": "mikachan77777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856519477389319, "text": "i swear to god, thank you for bringing this into the market. I really appreciate when my SO don't suffer after full day wearing heels🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-05T11:51:36", "owner": "valent_gf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876914422180340, "text": "This is cool", "created_at": "2025-03-05T09:39:58", "owner": "weird_aquarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491177914007471, "text": "It’s like pack out for women", "created_at": "2025-03-04T23:05:47", "owner": "ryan_amaral01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330211153089703, "text": "Literally going to the comments to find out I wasn’t the only guy to watch this all the way through, cool idea", "created_at": "2025-03-04T21:00:49", "owner": "benj_carbray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890577619194191, "text": "@mullerbiancs dan kan jou addiction rustiger raak, want jyt dan tegnies soos 100 pare in een", "created_at": "2025-03-04T18:41:43", "owner": "jaydee0147", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057817955010919, "text": "Seriously! I watched the whole thing grinning 😀 Just sent to wifie.", "created_at": "2025-03-04T18:17:26", "owner": "aljodeen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063725074754468, "text": "This is actually pretty genius, how has it not been done earlier? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-03-04T18:11:55", "owner": "noel_andren05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362002360131561, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-03-04T17:15:40", "owner": "biegne_w_podroz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861210211361470, "text": "@s4m4v4 dit is iets voor jouw 😍 hoef je niet steeds te wisselen 😂 had voor mij die ene dag ook een hoop ellende gescheeld 😂 had ik niet op mijn sloffen naar huis gehoeven 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-04T09:20:11", "owner": "iloontjuh1981", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027095372357846, "text": "WHERE HAVE YOU BEEN ALL MY LIFE OMG", "created_at": "2025-03-04T08:16:54", "owner": "glittergoth__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077144182670137, "text": "Genius!", "created_at": "2025-03-04T05:52:15", "owner": "warrodjoodhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061074323062911, "text": "Not gay and I'm a guy but that's kind of cool just how customizable it is thought", "created_at": "2025-03-04T05:24:39", "owner": "idkjust_xavi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18270426823280012, "text": "Us men are just amused by tech, the comments are proof 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-04T04:08:05", "owner": "imnek_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073608493702103, "text": "I hope you are a great success", "created_at": "2025-03-04T03:39:55", "owner": "kellygirlhasparks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046712627196624, "text": "If I had money money I would do invest in these and have Taylor swift wear em and detach them during a performance …. Just tell Taylor to sign me a as  a artist lol", "created_at": "2025-03-03T23:13:26", "owner": "flyemisfitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100668232501638, "text": "i love women", "created_at": "2025-03-03T23:03:06", "owner": "splatmiku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048011243220934, "text": "I want them all", "created_at": "2025-03-03T21:11:14", "owner": "raez_world08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095547226475380, "text": "I’m convinced  only men have seen this video, same though", "created_at": "2025-03-03T20:46:23", "owner": "angel.cle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975233469822347, "text": "Comments validating that I’m not alone 🙏🏼🤣", "created_at": "2025-03-03T20:08:11", "owner": "leec329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373479403140601, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-03-03T19:22:54", "owner": "klasolsson40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960475671862888, "text": "As a small business we fully support your idea! Good luck with your product, I’d definitely buy my lady a pair!", "created_at": "2025-03-03T19:08:16", "owner": "katycustomtrucksolutions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059128202508550, "text": "FCCLA people could really use this. 😭", "created_at": "2025-03-03T18:21:51", "owner": "maikairisaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145769794329331, "text": "This is such a good idea. Why is it mainly men saying this though? 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-03T16:30:56", "owner": "_b_liam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856461520333709, "text": "This is actually a great idea . I walk around Manhattan a lot so I could use this . Can this be done with higher pencil heels?", "created_at": "2025-03-03T15:32:47", "owner": "persia91__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065556748900345, "text": "do you test on animals?", "created_at": "2025-03-03T15:11:45", "owner": "rafeycn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865148545263275, "text": "Just one word. Genuis🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-03-03T14:46:07", "owner": "shadow_human", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494657962009636, "text": "I THOUGHT YOUR SHOE WAS GONNA TURN INTO A PHONE 😂", "created_at": "2025-03-03T13:27:24", "owner": "agravelymistake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272971519249404, "text": "Down to comments full with guys😳", "created_at": "2025-03-03T12:02:24", "owner": "ranichiaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357911560120205, "text": "She’s about to be a millionaire", "created_at": "2025-03-03T08:46:39", "owner": "dirtdevilgabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086848018585661, "text": "Wow!", "created_at": "2025-03-03T08:42:24", "owner": "softadeyanju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372112837140119, "text": "@trudes1985", "created_at": "2025-03-03T08:16:44", "owner": "robbo________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035203586533687, "text": "This should be in an episode of shark tank.", "created_at": "2025-03-03T07:36:45", "owner": "superarar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18259709539302562, "text": "Bro this is actually good..and its practical 🙌", "created_at": "2025-03-03T06:27:47", "owner": "zzzkarlzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065265202912278, "text": "Jaw dropped.", "created_at": "2025-03-03T05:42:57", "owner": "d1ss1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936913425994472, "text": "I need 20", "created_at": "2025-03-03T03:51:02", "owner": "realforeignbae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884076679229618, "text": "It’s so genius that one would be mad that they didn’t think of it themselves 👏👏👏😂", "created_at": "2025-03-03T02:43:05", "owner": "kingshyt_x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057601856010516, "text": "This is multi billion.", "created_at": "2025-03-03T02:35:36", "owner": "samhenningsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987684933640228, "text": "Absolutely Genius!!! Yall gon head!🔥", "created_at": "2025-03-03T02:00:26", "owner": "truckdc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900785623120965, "text": "🤯", "created_at": "2025-03-03T01:21:03", "owner": "cowboifrog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057354725089807, "text": "Genius! I’m not your target audience but genius", "created_at": "2025-03-03T00:07:51", "owner": "ej_wall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118856434432672, "text": "It’s ridiculous this showed up on my feed. Women have all the best fashion stuff. This is better than my reversible belt, which now seems silly to have been excited about once  I realized that’s what I’d actually bought.", "created_at": "2025-03-02T23:56:10", "owner": "literary_phantom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18267124954283804, "text": "I'm a dude but I'd buy my gf these asap", "created_at": "2025-03-02T23:23:28", "owner": "nicks_got_tricks11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059446664013513, "text": "I've always had a \"contriversial\" look on heels... a, women always looks uncomfortable, b, yes I'm short😂.. this is an amazing idea!!!", "created_at": "2025-03-02T21:38:44", "owner": "karlbrowder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136951861388631, "text": "@foster_rosie", "created_at": "2025-03-02T20:45:11", "owner": "sallyfoster88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006803210708478, "text": "Honestly this was made for a girl like me!! Im so tired of trying to carry two pairs of shoes. This is GENIUS", "created_at": "2025-03-02T20:41:59", "owner": "miamramusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959274627763573, "text": "Clip-on heels lll", "created_at": "2025-03-02T20:02:08", "owner": "crescentlocus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021308324469360, "text": "Why did you call it a Stello?? May I ask 😍", "created_at": "2025-03-02T18:33:43", "owner": "bertienfk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092513788536799, "text": "I want it for her, this is tight!", "created_at": "2025-03-02T17:05:43", "owner": "_garrettlaurel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915668986069659, "text": "Target audience👸 Actual audience🧒", "created_at": "2025-03-02T16:08:16", "owner": "ahtisham.talat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117344488446017, "text": "I am also one of the men that watched this whole and finished it by audibly saying \"genius!\" How has no one does this before? Wishing you huge success 💪🏻", "created_at": "2025-03-02T15:43:50", "owner": "phillips.ash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020929565476605, "text": "One of the smartest and thought through inventions ive ever seen", "created_at": "2025-03-02T15:13:27", "owner": "emil_bng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035412536613565, "text": "🤩 wow!! 👏🏽👏🏽", "created_at": "2025-03-02T13:30:58", "owner": "monicac_smith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079758232715570, "text": "no example walking when they are flat 🤔", "created_at": "2025-03-02T13:15:15", "owner": "user74857348", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049247681220554, "text": "I watched the entire video. Genius idea. Sent the video to my wife.", "created_at": "2025-03-02T13:04:44", "owner": "bx2vegas_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994323216772134, "text": "That's what I call innovation in fashion industry rather than regular generic.", "created_at": "2025-03-02T10:19:21", "owner": "tripathimanish8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18481960594049869, "text": "What a brilliant idea. 🙌 Love it 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿", "created_at": "2025-03-02T08:42:49", "owner": "paulinegrant792", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921732406046432, "text": "Actually great product 👏", "created_at": "2025-03-02T08:19:52", "owner": "kshwa_udana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373649668191886, "text": "Bro I’m as far away from the target audience as possible but watched the whole thing 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-03-02T06:49:21", "owner": "onairwithathul", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080769691716320, "text": "This product was from alibaba years ago", "created_at": "2025-03-02T04:39:12", "owner": "nevernguyen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053671315900275, "text": "Do the caps come with every pair? These are great!", "created_at": "2025-03-02T04:32:10", "owner": "juni.moony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180530374309720, "text": "as a man, wow", "created_at": "2025-03-02T03:53:18", "owner": "satx_fallen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975962817691033, "text": "I don’t wear heels as imma dude but this was the most genius invention I’ve seen in a long time", "created_at": "2025-03-02T03:38:05", "owner": "joe._.steen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052873529176603, "text": "Absolutely genius!!!", "created_at": "2025-03-02T02:42:31", "owner": "kat3lyn_ros3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941419038971488, "text": "Why did I watch this whole thing", "created_at": "2025-03-02T01:39:42", "owner": "jiminy_spigot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941922279843081, "text": "I don't wear heels but that's actually genius because most people can't run in heels and if you need to run then you could switch it. Amazing", "created_at": "2025-03-02T00:37:42", "owner": "dirtyrottencommie01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083601604548135, "text": "Congratulations, great business model", "created_at": "2025-03-01T22:23:35", "owner": "mbrancorsini80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883483132230678, "text": "This is very neat and very creative. You're gonna create a generational wealth! Keep creating!", "created_at": "2025-03-01T21:59:43", "owner": "alienboitattoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033759770625486, "text": "Super cool idea! Is there a weight limit?", "created_at": "2025-03-01T20:49:44", "owner": "nick.koeppel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024474869393857, "text": "I don’t ever wear heels but did I watch the whole video - YES. 😂 This is actually interesting. I have to show this to my sister.", "created_at": "2025-03-01T19:16:51", "owner": "be_kind_to_others2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024884696401008, "text": "I'm not a female n I gotta say this is wild", "created_at": "2025-03-01T17:06:30", "owner": "eyez_on_you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942485715967196, "text": "Shark tank would foam at the mouth over this!!!", "created_at": "2025-03-01T03:57:52", "owner": "arricbc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917595225961509, "text": "Do they come in wide width?", "created_at": "2025-03-01T03:52:18", "owner": "dqlamar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074395105692177, "text": "They got croc’s sports mode for women bruh 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-03-01T03:50:18", "owner": "t3_m.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997705515765176, "text": "i love how u can tell a woman thought of this", "created_at": "2025-03-01T00:53:24", "owner": "iizxa.a", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917549416060915, "text": "❤️❤️❤️ all women want this. Love it what an incredible design", "created_at": "2025-02-28T22:27:20", "owner": "shacklockdanielle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872868760291732, "text": "If men wore high heels this problem would have been solved a hundred years ago.", "created_at": "2025-02-28T22:11:41", "owner": "realnathanwolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096089926516190, "text": "I watched the entire thing, not because I care or I’m interested, it’s the pitch, this women could sell me something that is literally mine and I would purchase it.\n\nI have the urge to buy every single style, yet I have absolutely no use for the heels, and I don’t wear them haha.", "created_at": "2025-02-28T21:46:27", "owner": "joshy_racka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900119866111889, "text": "Lmao are us guys the only ones who watched this?", "created_at": "2025-02-28T21:29:38", "owner": "therealjsaun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060866846496707, "text": "This is too cool 🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-02-28T20:02:56", "owner": "_ayubakuro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339360361159429, "text": "Great idea!", "created_at": "2025-02-28T19:57:40", "owner": "ainslieimages", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020019161478526, "text": "Ok I need one", "created_at": "2025-02-28T19:57:30", "owner": "janniferagenord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051431683977393, "text": "Holy crap this idea is GENIUS!!!", "created_at": "2025-02-28T18:59:03", "owner": "mooselegs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388909939106852, "text": "I’m not sure how I ended up here, but wow! These are awesome!", "created_at": "2025-02-28T18:49:56", "owner": "harrywalls4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061292485964300, "text": "Your going to be vary successful", "created_at": "2025-02-28T16:24:53", "owner": "_00bloodylif3", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["convertibleheels", "fashionhack", "footwearinnovation", "invention", "lifehack", "highheelslover", "comfystyle"]}